R {7}{0}{}{Town Bank (d,s)}{<128>B<088>}{ You have entered the lobby of the austere and conservative Bank of Pinnacle.  Its owners are a shadowy consortium of whom little is known; however, they have a reputation of never taking advantage of their customers.  They also do their best to find the heirs of the MANY who never return to get their savings.  There is an automatic teller machine here, and a small staircase which leads up to the second floor of the bank.  There seems to be construction blocking the staircase. There's a second machine here selling money bags.  No, not bags with money in them, but bags you can put money in. }{Pinnacle}{bank}{}{}{1.000}{1}
