R {8}{0}{}{Town Bank Basement (u)}{ }{ You have descended into the Bank of Pinnacle's basement.  The monolithic marble pillars bestow a sense of dignity and solidarity.  While there are no bank owners or employees to be seen here, it is without question that any actions taking place are done so under the most discerning of scrutinous eyes.  A mysterious chute is the only thing setting apart the far wall from the others in this cold, barren room, providing more than just a sleek marble facade.  }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
