R {17}{0}{<138>}{Home of the Gypsy}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{			Lair of the Gypsy You have entered the mystical dwelling of The Gypsy.  For years, she has used her mysterious powers to benefit the citizens of Pinnacle. Of course, her services are accompanied by a substantial fee.  To see a list of the services provided by The Gypsy, just read the sign found within the shop.  Looking closely, you can see a small staircase leading down into the basement. }{Pinnacle}{gypsy}{}{}{1.000}{1}
