R {18}{0}{}{Pinnacle Oracle}{ }{Not quite the dingy basement you were expecting, the chamber is quite clean and smells sweetly of wildflowers.  Although quite bare of any decoration or furnishings, the room is brightly lit, sparkling from the magical light that pours forth from the ceiling.  Within the wondrous light, you can see all sorts of visions depicting countless battles all across the realms.  Even as you stand here, glowing effigies continually appear before you initially as bright snapshots, only to fade softly into the background, joining the vast ocean of memories the room itself appears to welcome. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
