R {30}{0}{}{Crafter's Lane (nw,se,sw)}{ }{A long white picket fence stretches away from either side of the gate leading to the sunny farm.  Tractor tracks are visible here, and the smell of fertilizer fills your nostrils.  From here you can visit the various farms. =X=    There are six obvious exits: southeast, northeast, northwest, north,                                  east, mixing                            =X= =M= Paul - The Aged Farmer. The Crafting Farmer Board containing 21 messages (12 unread messages). >  =S=Crafter's Lane The enticing aroma that fills the northeastern part of Crafter's Lane seems to be coming from the southwestern squat building, which hangs a sign outside that reads "Cooking".  To the northwest is an identical brown building with the sign "Farming".  The brown brick road leads off to the southwest, where you can dimly hear the sound of metal striking metal. }{Crafting}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
