R {33}{0}{}{The farm store. (w)}{ }{A long white picket fence stretches away from either side of the gate leading to the sunny farm.  Tractor tracks are visible here, and the smell of fertilizer fills your nostrils.  From here you can visit the various farms. =X=    There are six obvious exits: southeast, northeast, northwest, north,                                  east, mixing                            =X= =M= Paul - The Aged Farmer. The Crafting Farmer Board containing 21 messages (12 unread messages). >  =S=The farm store. The red cherry stained wood planks lining this room bring to mind a perhaps higher class establishment and remind you more specifically of one of the smoke filled private clubs with red leather chairs and shelves of rare first edition books from the 18th century.  None of those things are here, of course.  In fact there's nobody here at all, as the farmers rely on the honour system to do business.  If your word is not as good as gold, then maybe you should keep your mouth shut.  To list the things you can buy here, type "list".  To buy something, type buy <id>.  This shop supports string parsing. }{Crafting}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
