R {35}{0}{}{The Wrangler Room (s)}{<118>W<088>}{This wing of the crafting guild belongs to the chaos wranglers.  Giant high-backed chairs and elaborate furnishings are scattered throughout the room.  Within the chairs, or more commonly, standing up, or even more commonly, standing up on the furnishings and shouting, are the chaos wranglers.  They are discussing (at very high volume) various topics of interest such as gem capacities and efficient ways of gathering chaotic energy. }{Crafting}{wrangler}{}{}{1.000}{1}
