R {37}{0}{}{The Enchanter Recipe Shop}{ }{Various pots and jars line the whitewashed walls, but these are clearly for show.  Your keen eye spots the real prize hidden among the jars: the mouldings.  These are the key to the whole enchanting process!  There is no shopkeeper here, but a bobbing ball of light sits at the one end of the sterile room, repeating: 'You can 'list' or 'buy' items here.' You can also 'showitem' to see a specific recipe, or you can 'list nontrivial' if you want to see only those recipes that will provide you with skillups. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
