R {42}{0}{}{The Blacksmith Recipe Shop (w)}{ }{Various mouldings can be seen lining the wooden walls, though it is clear from even a cursory glance that the most valuable mouldings must be kept in the back.  Oddly enough, there is no storekeeper, since no blacksmith wanted to take time away from the forge.  Instead they rely on the honour system -- nobody wants to upset the strongest people in the guild.  you can 'list' or 'buy' something here.  You can also 'showitem' to see a specific recipe, or you can 'list nontrivial' if you want to see only those recipes that will provide you with skillups. }{Crafting}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
