R {43}{0}{<238>}{Rivers of protoplasm}{<138>~ ~<088>}{The massive, nightmarish vortex to the east can still be seen clearly from here, but another chaotic impossibility begins to dominate your senses.  Rivers of protoplasm flow in all directions with varying speeds and sizes, defying gravity and logic as they flow upwards, or even in several directions at once.  Objects that seem far away when seen from the corner of your eye, seemingly leap forward when you turn to focus on them, making distances all but impossible to judge.  Amongst all this chaos there is one constant, a cave formed by spiralling flows of protoplasm, large enough to enter with ease. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
