R {63}{0}{}{Vault of Ancient Fables (u,d)}{ }{The room before you lies in hushed silence.  Sunlight filters in through many skylights in the ceiling, illuminating thousands of books, scrolls, tomes and other venerable materials of knowledge that line the walls of the room.  A feeling of great peace drapes itself around you here.  Other than a circular staircase that winds to a lower area, the only remarkable item in the room is a large wooden desk that sits at an angle near the rear of the chamber.  It is here, in this room, where you 'select' VAF perks to enhance your character. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
