R {64}{0}{}{Star Chamber (d,u)}{ }{You find yourself in a great chamber darkened to appear like that of the night sky.  All around you, the polished walls, floor and ceiling reflect points of light like stars in the heavens.  It's quite breathtaking, in that you really can't tell where the walls end and the ceiling begins.  It's almost as if you were floating in the vacuum of space, surrounded by peace and tranquility.  Other than the staircase leading back up to the Vault of Ancient Fables and further downward into a rainbow colored room, you see quite clearly a glowing pedestal in the center of the room.  Great power surrounds you here. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
