R {65}{0}{}{Your Private Rainbow Room (u,login,cot)}{ }{This is your private dressing room.  You can leave anytime, but make SURE you pick everything up first, as this room is purged when you leave.  Here you can 'gswap <newguild>' to switch to another guild.  If you haven't joined another yet, you should be able to swap to adventurer and then go join one.  Also, here you can 'raise' your stats for one of your other guilds.  There is a 15 minute cooldown when you swap a guild before you can swap again. }{Pinnacle}{gswap}{}{}{1.000}{1}
