R {97}{0}{<138>}{Brian's House of Marvels}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{This tent was obviously once brightly striped in red and white, although the canvas is now stained and very faded. Crudely stitched patches cover a multitude of tears and burns in the tent fabric. A collection of rickety tables stand around the sides of the tent, surrounding a circle of bare earth. The benches are cluttered with all manner of strange ephemera. Amongst the junk you spot a small sabre glowing bright red, an ostrich feather fan nailed to a tent pole and a battered trumpet in a glass case. In the centre of the tent a thick black iron chain is hanging down from the tent poles above, suspending a battered copper bucket over the angry red coals of a dying fire. Beside the entrance to the tent a large slate blackboard displays a list of the marvels on offer. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
