R {98}{0}{<228>}{Entrance (ne)}{<228>( *<088>}{Before you lies the entrance to a mystical and magical forest. A pair of majestic trees stand sentinel, guarding what lies beyond. Through the shimmering air you see that bright green moss blankets the forest floor. Shade cast from the canopy above gently shades you from the sunlight as you curiously wander forward. Your senses are lulled by the sounds of nature in balance. The aura of peace emanating from the forest bids you enter.  For some, the compulsion to understand the forest and study the elements of nature cannot be denied. If you wish to be apprenticed simply <announce> yourself and a member of the witches guild will escort you into the forest.  Type "abandon" to leave the witches. To get a new guild object, type 'bookmenow'. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
