R {100}{0}{<138>}{Mario's Bistro (se,w)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{Mario's Bistro The delicious smells of Italian cooking hang heavy in the air.  The floor is covered with faded red brick, as are the walls. Each table is identical in appearance, bearing a red and white checkered tablecloth, a white candle stuck in an empty bottle of wine, and a small white flower in a glass vase.  Towards the back of the restaurant, is the kitchen.  Two large brick ovens can be seen as well as the large stainless steel stove. Beautiful music is playing from the speakers, which are strategically placed behind gorgeous hanging plants. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
