R {122}{0}{}{-= Monastery Vestibule =-}{ }{-= Monastery Vestibule =- Cloud-like carvings, symbolizing stepping up to Heaven, have been etched into the monastery walls. A 30 foot tall bronze incense burner slowly puffs out smoke that is tinged with citrus. A green and gold glazed ceramic lion guards the inner sanctum of the Great Hall. The Monks are always looking for others to 'join' them. If you would like to learn about the monks, type 'help monk'. You can also be recruited into the guild by another monk. This is the best course of action because you get 2 free Power Levels for being recruited. You won't start out helpless. And, if for some unknown reason you wanted to, you could 'leave the monks'. }{Monks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
