R {196}{0}{}{The center of Chaos (n,s,w,e,vortex)}{<110>C<088>}{This is the dead center of the Realm of Chaos.  All around you lies a bleak and desolate land tormented by the wrath of unknown forces. You are standing at the edge of a raging vortex that seems to fall into infinity.  There are paths leading away from the vortex in several directions.  What you might find there is so changeable that you aren't certain how to proceed.  Some hard-won experience is related on the plaque.  But don't trust it.  This is CHAOS!}{Chaos}{coc}{}{}{1.000}{1}
