R {199}{0}{}{<-> Mountain path <->}{ }{Following the comet's trail westward, you stumble upon a path leading up a snow-capped mountainside.  The mere sight it towering overhead leaves you in awe.  You wonder why you had not seen it a little earlier, but then in this chaotic realm, who knows if it is god playing tricks or it is by some other demonic hands.  Something about the large mountainous scenery makes you feel at peace here under the stars.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
