R {200}{0}{}{<-> Mountain plateau <->}{<168>E<088>}{The ground underfoot is hard-packed dirt and a multitude of strange trees surrounds you. You recognize a few varieties such as bamboo and palm, but what are these others? Some of the wood is bright red, others are purple, and some of these 'trees' actually appear to be giant Q-tips! }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
