R {201}{0}{<238>}{<-> Observatory entrance <->}{<238>|@|<088>}{The size of the observatory takes your breath away.  The ceiling to this enormous complex is nearly one hundred feet above your head, with a large opening in the center.  You notice quite a few people wandering about flashing their cameras and hollering at their siblings.  This must be one of the largest tourist attractions around.  }{Carina's Observatory}{carina}{}{}{1.000}{1}
