R {202}{0}{}{<-> Observatory lobby <->}{ }{Working your way further into the observatory you have wandered into the main lobby.  A few desks clutter the center of the room, and many people rush by you busy in their endeavors.  As you glance down to make sure you are not stepping on anyone's shoes, the tiles on the floor grab your attention.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
