R {205}{0}{}{<-> Observatory lobby <->}{ }{The whole observatory is flowing with tourists, and you feel a small sense of relief having found a small section where they have not yet infected.  A small cubicle lies to the north with a sliding glass door enclosing it from the lobby.  The office room does not seem to have a ceiling but it really does not need one.  You could easily peek through the glass if you felt a little curious.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {204}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
