R {206}{0}{}{<-> Neptune Exhibit <->}{ }{The moons of Neptune act differently in this display than the others you have see thus far.  The moon rotation is opposite the natural rotation of the planet on its axis.  The planet is surrounded by four dark rings that can barely be seen.  You wonder what it would be like to dwell upon this eighth planet from the sun.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
