R {210}{0}{}{<-> Uranus Exhibit <->}{ }{The seventh planet from the sun is displayed here in a rather large glass case.  The planet turns and rotates and you notice that the rotation is unlike any of the other planets.  It turns in an extremely tilted fashion with its sixteen satellites that turn around it.  The greenish display is the largest of all the others that you have passed by.  Truly an impressive sight to behold.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {209}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
