R {213}{0}{}{<-> Jupiter Exhibit <->}{ }{The largest planet known in the nine planet solar system lies before you in the glass casing surrounding the display.  Its known diameter is roughly eleven diameters bigger than the size of Earth.  Off to the east, the stairwell that has circled the ceiling connects with the floor of the Observatory lobby.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
