R {214}{0}{}{<-> Observatory Stairwell <->}{<168>S<088>}{Walking into a small quartered-off section in the Observatory, you notice the stairwell that leads up and around the ceiling above.  As to where it leads is anyone's guess.  You should probably stay clear in case anyone wanders in and catches you going up.  The sounds of the tourists erupt from the west.  It looks as if yet another one of them had set off an alarm.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
