R {215}{0}{}{<-> Carina's office <-> (out)}{<138>C<088>}{Along the walls of the workspace, you notice a few sketches and diagrams hanging upon them.  A large oak desk sits along the eastern wall, with a small chair behind it.  Wonder who works in this office?  The ceiling still looms high above with the opening in the center, only difference being a small box, high up on top of one of the rafters.  What purpose would that serve? }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
