R {216}{0}{}{<-> Upon the walkway <->}{<168>S<088>}{The stairwell leads back down to the Observatory lobby here.  A small walkway leads further south along the ceiling as thin as twelve inch beams.  To make it any further down the path, you are going to need to hop on the beams one by one.  You look across the lobby and see the telescope that stretches up and out of the ceiling.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
