R {217}{0}{}{<-> Upon the walkway <->}{ }{Steadying yourself on the thin metal walkway from beam to beam, you warily make your way across.  A small metal platform to the west appears to have much better footing way up here at the roof of the Observatory.  Looking down only sends chills up your spine at the thought of tumbling down.  }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
