R {222}{0}{}{-=  Old MacDonald's Farm  =- (out,e,nw)}{O}{-=  Old MacDonald's Farm  =- You step onto the farm owned by Old MacDonald.  The land is lush and green.  In the distance, you can see acres of crops flourishing.  To the east is the farmer's house and to the northwest, you see a barn. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{old_macdonalds}{}{}{1.000}{1}
