R {223}{0}{}{-=  Path to the farmhouse  =- (e,w)}{ }{-=  Path to the farmhouse  =- Behind you is the entrance to the farm.  To your east is the farmhouse.  You can make out the yellow siding and white paned windows.  The smell of fresh baked cherry pies drifts down towards you.  The path is lined with hip-high rose and azalea bushes in a variety of colors. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {222}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
