R {224}{0}{}{-=  Farmhouse yard  =- (in,w)}{<138>I<088>}{-=  Farmhouse yard  =- You are standing in the yard of Old MacDonald's farmhouse.  The farmhouse is a beautiful two-story home made of wood. The sides are painted a radiant yellow and sparkling white panes finish off the windows.  Pale blue curtains with little yellow buttercups on them flap effortlessly out the open windows.  On the railed wrap-around porch, an old-fashion loveseat swing sways lazily in the wind.  On the front door hangs a sign welcoming all guests into the home. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
