R {225}{0}{}{-=  In a barn  =- (se,nw)}{ }{-=  In a barn  =- You walk into the main barn of the farm.  There is a lot of hay in here.  A ladder leading up to a hayloft is to the right of the barn door.  A few stalls are against the east side of the barn.  Farm equipment and tools stand against the opposite wall. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
