R {226}{0}{}{-=  On the farm  =- (se,nw)}{ }{-=  On the farm  =- You find yourself between the barn and the sheep pen.  Several large bales of hay are stacked here.  You can see the top of the barn to the south and far in the distance you can see rolling mountains. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {225}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {227}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {227}{0}{}{-=  Sheep pen  =- (se,w)}{ }{-=  Sheep pen  =- You walk into the sheep pen.  It is an enclosed piece of land surrounded by a wood fence.  The ground is covered with hay and there is a water trough by the west side of the pen.  There is some wool mixed in with the hay. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {226}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
