R {228}{0}{}{-=  On the farm  =- (e,w)}{<128>F<088>}{-=  On the farm  =- This part of the farm is fairly lush too.  The sun is bright and warm. A puppy and kitty rush past you as they enjoy a game of chase.  Large fluffy clouds lazily float in the sky leaving shadows on the ground. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
