R {229}{0}{}{-=  Green pasture  =- (e,w)}{ }{-=  Green pasture  =- For as far as your eye can see is a green pasture.  Lush green grass stretches the horizon.  The cows, sheep and goats like to graze here.  This land is well tended to, so the animals can produce the best milk and meat possible. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
