R {231}{0}{}{-=  On a pond  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  On a pond  =- This part of the pond is covered with lily pads.  Small waterbugs gracefully float atop of the pond's surface.  The sun is very warm here.  You hear a moo off to the southeast. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
