R {232}{0}{}{-=  On a pond  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  On a pond  =- Along the outer bank of the pond are some pussy willows and cat-o-nine tails.  The ground is very soggy and it is hard to walk around the bank.  A few lily pads float in the pond and a spider web hangs on a small tree that's growing along the side of the pond. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {231}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
