R {233}{0}{}{-=  On the farm  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  On the farm  =- The flowing stream grows a bit larger here.  It appears to flow into a pond further to the south. In the distance, croaking and quacking can be heard. The ground is a bit soggy here as some of the stream seeps into it. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {232}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
