R {234}{0}{}{-=  In the garden  =- (s,e)}{<128>F<088>}{-=  In the garden  =- You stumble upon the farm's garden.  There are rows of corn stalks, tomatoes, carrots, cabbage, and squash.  The soil is very rich and moist.  Several holes have been dug in the soil by some of the pesky farm animals. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
