R {235}{0}{}{-=  On the farm  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  On the farm  =- You pass a small stream on the south side of the farm.  There are a couple oak trees behind the white picket fence that surrounds the farm.  A giant red silo can be seen in the distance. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
