R {236}{0}{}{-=  Chicken coop =- (s,w)}{ }{-=  Chicken coop =- You enter a small wooden shack.  There are little hay nests stacked on top of each other about five feet high and about ten feet deep.  At the foot of each of the nests are little metal ramps and a basket to catch the eggs the chickens lay each morning.  The floor of the shack is covered with chicken feed and chicken poop. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {235}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {237}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {237}{0}{}{-=  On the farm  =- (n,e)}{ }{-=  On the farm  =- A large stack of hay looms above you.  There is a red wooden wheelbarrow on your right.  A small spider dangles from a thin silk thread from a nearby tree limb.  The small stream flows past you on the left. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {236}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
