R {238}{0}{}{-=  Pig pen  =- (w,s)}{ }{-=  Pig pen  =- You immediately fall thigh-high into mud and hay.  Squish, squish, squish.  Every once in awhile you step on a half- eaten apple or corn cob.  A couple food troughs for the morning and evening slop are sitting on the ground near the pen gate.  Another trough for water sits on the opposite side of the pen. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
