R {239}{0}{}{-=  On the farm  =- (n,se)}{ }{-=  On the farm  =- You continue through the farm.  To the south is the horse stable and to the north is the pig pen.  The grass is very green and lush here.  A patch of yellow wildflowers flourishes here as well.  The sun is warm and comforting.  A small stream runs by on your left. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {238}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
