R {244}{0}{}{-=  Inside the farmhouse  =- (e,out,kitchen)}{ }{-=  Inside the farmhouse  =- You walk into the farmhouse and you are suddenly reminded of all those summers at your grandma's.  All the furniture, while a little old, is in great condition.  Family pictures and embroidery hang beautifully on the freshly painted walls.  To your left is the kitchen, to your right is the living room.  A set of stairs leading to the second story is in front of you. }{Old MacDonald's Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
