R {283}{0}{}{Barbie and Ken's Place (n,s)}{ }{You are overwhelmed by the amount of pink and lace in this area!  As far as you were aware, such a quantity just wasn't POSSIBLE in one room without damaging the fabric of the universe!  Scantily-clad Barbie and Ken dolls are strewn across the floor.  Thousands of fashion accessories hang from pegs on the walls. It's really quite sickening - you can't wait to escape. }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
