R {293}{0}{}{The War-Zone (w,e,n)}{ }{You feel like you've just stepped into a war zone!  Boxes of plastic tanks and armoured trucks are stacked precariously on the shelves, and model fighter jets hang above your head, pointing their tiny plastic guns at your face.  Two small wind-up tanks guard the far end of the aisle. }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
