R {294}{0}{}{Power Ranger Purgatory (n,s)}{ }{Dozens of obnoxious young children are here, ruthlessly tearing open the newest of the Mighty Morphin Power Rangers sets.  You can't quite work out which is more annoying.  Do the world a favour and kill 'em all :) If you do, maybe you can plunder a Power Rangers bath set! Or a backpack! Or a lunchbox! Or some roller-skates!! Or... A MIGHTY MORPHIN POWER RANGERS 'JUST SAY NO' PIN!!!! }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
