R {295}{0}{}{Dolly Hell (w)}{ }{You find yourself in Dolly Hell,  with hundreds of baby dolls lying around the place.  The chattering of the dolls is enough to drive anyone stark raving mad - although of course, in your case, they had a head start.  One little doll crawls across the floor towards a door and, having reached it, continues to attempt her forward progress until her batteries mercifully wear down. }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
