R {296}{0}{}{Jungle Aisle (w)}{ }{You enter the Eastern part of the aisle, and are suprised to find that you are in a fairly accurate representation of a tropical jungle.  Action Men dressed in tiny fabric camouflage suits stand at attention all around you, and the wall at the far end of the aisle is liberally plastered with G.I. Joe posters. }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1000.000}{1}
