R {297}{0}{}{At the base of a hill (n,w)}{ }{Before you lies a well worn path leading up a gently rolling hill. Drifting in on the gentle summer breeze is the sound of fiddle,  faintly playing some kind of reel or jig.  Overhead starlings  and swallows dart about on the summer breeze.  Everything here is peaceful and quiet, sighing contentedly you feel at one with  nature, heck even the grass seems greener than usual.  }{Leprechaun Village}{leprechaun_village}{}{}{1.000}{1}
