R {298}{0}{}{Halfway up a hill (ne,s)}{ }{From halfway up the hill the view of the surrounding countryside is truly beautiful, for miles around you can see lush green rolling fields leading to in the distance, mist shrouded mountains.  Even the air seems cleaner and fresher!  Inhaling deeply you relax and think surely this must be paradise.  After a few moments you return to the task at hand ... the path and source of the music drifting down the hill on the breeze. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
