R {299}{0}{}{Atop a hill (sw)}{<148>S<088>}{At last you have finally reached the top of the hill. Well to put it simply the view is simply majestic and leaves you slightly breathless. The grass here is even more lush than the slopes, and although at first glance the grass appears normal, there's something not quite right lurking in the back of your mind. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
