R {327}{0}{}{Canned Foods (s,n,w)}{ }{You are in the middle of the canned food aisle.  The pungent aroma of great spaghetti wafts toward you.  You lick your lips because you have begun to salivate.  There is a little old man standing in front of a big black pot and stirring what you assume to be that great spaghetti.  There are more canned foods to the north and south, but since it smells so great right here, you think you might stay awhile longer. }{Grocery Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {326}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {328}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {329}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {328}{0}{}{Canned Foods (n,e)}{ }{This end of the canned foods aisle has quite a tall ceiling. Perhaps someone very tall comes here often.  That would explain it. The air smells of green beans and you can see that there are other canned foods to the north.  More of the store lies to the east. }{Grocery Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {327}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {323}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {329}{0}{}{Check-Out Lane (e)}{ }{This is the check-out lane.  All around you are tabloids and gum.  You want to get out of here in a hurry because your day at the store has not exactly been relaxing.  You take one look at the cashier and decide that this is not going to be the fastest checker in the west.  You can go back into the store to the east. }{Grocery Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {327}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {330}{0}{}{Cereal Aisle (w,s)}{ }{You are at one end of the cereal aisle.  There is a sense of magic in the air that you cannot seem to place.  You look at the shelves and see boxes of cereal and the Lucky Charms continually catch your eye.  You find yourself craving little marshmallows. There is more cereal to the south and other items to the west. }{Grocery Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {303}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {307}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {331}{0}{}{The Freezer (out)}{ }{You are in the freezer.  What you are after should be here. I advise you not to stay long.  Hypothermia kills you know. The only place to go from here is out. }{Grocery Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {323}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {332}{0}{}{Gateway of the Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (sw,enter)}{<168>E<088>}{You are taken aback by the bleakness of your surroundings: shades of grey, white, taupe, dun, and khaki dominate the landscape, providing a depressingly limited chromatic variety in your environs.  The ground beneath your feet seems somewhat spongy and gelatinous, yet firm.  There is a very strong and salty smell of protein in the air that permeates everything.  A vast stretch of rolling hills of tofu extends to the southwest as far as you can see.  There is a gigantic open box of tofu here, lying on its side. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{para-elemental_plane_of_soy}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {318}{enter box}{enter box}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {318}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {333}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {333}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (ne,se,sw)}{ }{A vast wasteland of soy stretches before you.  A cruel, biting wind whips across the rolling hills of tofu, bringing with it the salty scent of fermented soy.  You think you hear a burbling sound far to the south. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {332}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {334}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {344}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {334}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (nw,se,sw)}{ }{A vast expanse of tofu extends to the horizon.  The monotony of the plane is broken by a large cube of tofu.  It sits here, jiggling slightly in the wind.  You can hear a gurgling, flowing sound to the southwest.  Desolate and windblown, the landscape is quite inhospitable. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {333}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {335}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {345}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {335}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (sw,nw)}{ }{The ground bends in a continuous curve to form a wall here, impeding travel in all but westerly directions.  Small, crumbly bits of tofu are disseminated all about the ground.  A cold, stale wind whips around you, making the dull landscape just that much more inhospitable.  There is a wet, liquid sound emanating from the southwest. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {334}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {336}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {336}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (nw,ne,sw,se)}{ }{A small river of soy milk flows in from the northwest, and disappears into the ground at the base of a towering wall to the east.  A moderately large hill of tofu to the southwest breaks the monotony of the landscape.  A loud gurgling sound emanates from the point where the river of soy flows into the ground. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {335}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {337}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {345}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {346}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {337}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (sw,nw)}{ }{An extremely tall wall curves up from the ground to the east, blocking any sort of movement in that general direction.  The vast plane of tofu extends out to the west, where a large hill juts out from the plane, as though it had been placed there.  Far to the southwest, you see an atypically flat vertical face, which looks like some sort of building.  The wet, sloppy sound of a thick flowing liquid wafts in from the northwest. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {336}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {338}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {338}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (nw,ne,sw)}{ }{The wide expanse of tofu continues as far as you can see, interrupted only by a large hill to the northwest.  A steep cliff rises to the southeast, making travel in that direction impossible.  To the southwest, there is a curious wall which appears to be part of some sort of fortress. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {337}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
