R {339}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (nw,ne,s)}{ }{The plane narrows considerably here, as two walls of the basin meet to the south.  The corner of that intersection is occupied by an immense fortress embedded into the wall.  The fortress, like most other things in the Para-Elemental Plane of Soy, is made from tofu.  A vast and seemingly interminable plane of tofu extends to the north, interrupted only by a hill. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {338}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {340}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
