R {340}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (nw,ne,se)}{ }{The expansive plane of tofu continues, but the ground slopes upward towards the southwest, forming a steep wall.  A hill of tofu juts up from its surroundings to the northeast.  The ever-present wind whips by, stripping the warmth from you as it howls by.  To the southeast, there is some sort of fortress built into the wall.  The salty smell of musty tofu fills the air, making your nose wrinkle. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {339}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
