R {345}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (nw,ne,sw,se)}{ }{A small river of what looks like soy milk wanders along the ground here, coming from the southwest, and flowing towards the southeast.  It makes a very loud and wet sound, given the high viscosity of the fluid.  Apart from a large hill to the south, the landscape of the Plane extends all around you, with its characteristically dull and featureless form. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
