R {346}{0}{}{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy (nw,ne,sw,se)}{ }{You stand atop a hill of moderate size, which gives you an extensive view of the Para-Elemental Plane of Soy.  All around you, the vast plane of tofu extends to the edges of a high-walled basin.  Given your relative elevation above the surrounding terrain, the harsh, cold wind whips past you, chilling you to the very core.  To the north, you can see what looks like a river of some sort of thick soy liquid.  To the south, there is a fortress embedded into the wall of the basin. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
