R {347}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (s,n)}{ }{The howling wind outside does not reach the interior of the fortress, making it seem eerily quiet in contrast.  A hallway extends to the south, and an open doorway to the north leads out towards the vast wastelands of soy.  The walls are made from very firm tofu, cut in harsh right angles, giving the corridor a distinctively Bauhaus feel. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
