R {348}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (e,n,w)}{ }{The stark hallway branches at this point, with a wide hallway leading to the north, and a narrower hallway leading to the east and west.  The rectilinear walls of tofu glisten with some sort of moisture. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
