R {349}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (s,w)}{ }{Made of firm tofu cut at right angles, the walls glisten with some sort of moisture.  The hallway leads to the west, towards the entrance of the fortress, while the other branch leads to the south, further into the fortress.  Some large cubes of tofu have been stacked into some sort of barricade to the south. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
