R {350}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (s,n)}{ }{A barricade made of large blocks of tofu bars the passage to the south.  The cubes making up the barricade have started to dry out and shrivel somewhat, while the walls are continually kept moist by some kind of secretion. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
