R {352}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (s,n)}{ }{Large blocks of tofu have been piled up to form a barricade in the hallway, narrowing the passage to the south.  You can't see past the barricade, but you could move it somehow.  While the walls are continually kept moist by some kind of secretion, the cubes that make up the barricade have begun to dry out and shrivel somewhat. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
