R {353}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (n,e)}{ }{Taking a turn here, the passage leads to the north, towards some tofu debris, and to the east, where the hallway continues.  The walls are covered with a thin liquid, which trickles down their surfaces continuously. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
