R {354}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (n,w)}{ }{The hallway takes a turn here, with the passage leading towards the west, further into the fortress.  Down the passage to the north, there is a large pile of debris.  A liquid secretion flows down the walls, moistening them continuously. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
