R {355}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (e,n,w)}{ }{You hear a pulsing sound, almost throbbing in your ears.  The space about you is quite warm, and the reek of salty soy proteins is thick in the air.  The entire room seems to vibrate with some sort of sinister and evil power. The walls are dripping with a liquid of some sort.  A barricade made from large blocks of tofu bars the way north.                                   }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
