R {356}{0}{}{Fortress of Soy (s)}{ }{Deep within the very heart of the Para-Elemental Plane of Soy, you find yourself in the throne room of the Tofurky of Death.  The entire room pulses and throbs audibly with evil.  The walls produce a copious flow of soy whey which pools on the floor.  Large vats line the walls where ineffably twisted experiments must take place.  Thick fumes of baneful soy byproducts fill the air, making it difficult to breathe.  A large throne stands in the middle of the room. }{The Para-Elemental Plane of Soy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
