R {357}{0}{}{Pinnacle/Sci-Fi Junction}{ }{You are standing in swirling blue green mists. Brilliant discharges of laser light make you feel like you're somewhere between a land of pure science and the rest of the world. A shiny metallic escalator leads up from this point. There is a sign here. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
