R {360}{0}{<238>}{Mega-Tokyo Train Platform}{<238>|||<088>}{A clean sparkle shines off the tiled floor of this large loading platform.  The walls of this underground station are freshly painted with the famous skyline of Mega-Tokyo.  At the edge of the platform are rails upon which the famous bullet trains speed passengers across the globe.  The southern end of the platform exits into a deep tunnel through which the bullet trains enter and exit. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
