R {405}{0}{}{A small oasis (w,n)}{ }{The blazing sun fries your skin and dries your throat. A small lizard runs around in the hot sand and you can't help but to think how anything can survive out here. North of you are some small palm trees. The sand dunes all around you remind of the surface to a dead planet. }{Sandman's Oasis}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
