R {693}{0}{}{Beside a fence}{ }{The fence stretches north and south. behind the fence to the west, is a small red building. Weird creatures live in this swamp and you try not to think what might be lurking around here. }{Swede Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {692}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {687}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {694}{0}{}{Circular chamber}{ }{You stand in a circular room approximately 40 feet in diameter.  The walls and floor are both made of dark marble inlaid with what appears to be ruby.  In the exact center of the room is an etched symbol of some kind.  Set into the north wall is a door\; protective sigils are just visible in the dim red light of the floor veins.  One particularly interesting rune is emblazoned on the far side of the room. }{Zith-el}{zithel}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20090}{n}{open door;n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19915}{trace tree}{trace tree}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {695}{0}{}{Outside a small building}{ }{You stand outside a small building made of wood. The ground beneath your feet is made of a shining material and you feel  relieved to leave the swamp behind. You see the fence to your north and you wonder why someone would want to put a fence around this building anyway. A door to your south seems to be the only  way to get inside the building.  }{Swede Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {691}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42495}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {696}{0}{<178>}{Coastal Wastelands (s,w,ruins)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{Coastal Wastelands You wonder if you'll ever find the end of this rolling expanse.  A foul wind whips by you as you survey this desolate landscape.  You see a bright flash of light far in the distance. It takes a very long time for the sound of the explosion to reach you.  The green-blue waters of the Atlantic stretch out from the shoreline. Some very large ruins rise up here over the landscape. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
