R {719}{0}{}{Basement}{L}{You have entered the Underwood Disease Testing Center basement. You stand in a long, sterile hallway.  The floor is gleaming white and very slippery.  The walls are just as white and clean.  It reeks of disinfectant and makes you gag as you make your way down the hallway.  To your east is the employee cafeteria and farther north is where the files for all the research are kept. }{Underwood Disease Testing Center}{underwood_disease_testing_center}{}{}{1.000}{1}
