R {722}{0}{}{Cafeteria}{ }{You enter the employee cafeteria cautiously.  You get a sense that something is very wrong here.  There are several people who have fallen face first into their bowls of soup.  And still others that are slumped over the chairs and tables.  A large loud-speaker hangs in the corner playing some awful muzak.  It is very far from pleasant in here.  To the south of the cafeteria, looks like the kitchen. }{Underwood Disease Testing Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {719}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {723}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {723}{0}{}{Kitchen}{ }{After choking back what was sure to be a massive throw-up session, you move slowly to the kitchen.  A swinging door closes off the kitchen from the main dining area.  All kinds of strange smells are attacking your senses.  You find a large pot of the Cream of Broccoli soup slowly bubbling away.  But other than that, the kitchen is hauntingly empty. }{Underwood Disease Testing Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
