R {733}{0}{}{A lab}{ }{You stumble across one of the testing labs.  You don't find anything really out of the ordinary.  A few tables and petri dishes filled with various microorganisms is all.  You wonder how anything gets done around here, it doesn't appear that much testing is going on. }{Underwood Disease Testing Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
