R {734}{0}{}{A lab}{ }{You stumble upon one of the testing labs.  Although you are unclear as to what type of disease testing they do here.  Large tables covered with microscopes and test tubes cover the room.  You never cared too much for science anyways, and find this to be rather boring.  You do see a little mixing machine, shaking up some other test tubes, on a table.  It's humming quietly.  That must be the noise you heard.  You can see a portable chalkboard at the back of the lab. }{Underwood Disease Testing Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
