R {842}{0}{}{A small shed. (e,out)}{<128>O<088>}{Dirt is tracked all over the rough wooden floor, tracking in from both outside and from the east.  The pale grey worn wood shelving contains tools of various kinds. You'd not be well served to just grab one, though!  That's against the farmer code.  You'd better fork over some cash if you want to take any of these tools.  To list the things you can buy here, type "list".  To buy something, type buy <id>.  This shop supports string parsing. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
