R {843}{0}{}{A small shed (w)}{ }{Mud and dirt cake the walls, floors, and you suspect even the ceiling, should you dare to look up.  Rusty bent nails can be spotted everywhere.  Best hurry up and do what you came for, and then get on out. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
