R {844}{0}{<238>}{Desolate plains (n,s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Desolate plains A gigantic crater lies before you. It's hard to imagine what could have exploded and caused something as impressive as this.  A foul wind whips by you as you survey this desolate landscape.  You've got to wonder how anything could survive way out here.  To the east you detect the continuation of the plains.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
