R {846}{0}{<238>}{The Rocky Mountains (e,s,n)}{<238>.^.<088>}{The Rocky Mountains Huge boulders have been pounded to rubble leaving only small pebbles strewn about you.  Some great force has ravaged the landscape.  You've got to wonder how anything could survive way out here in these harsh mountains.  The mountains around you rise and fall in a never ending pattern.  To the north you detect the continuation of the Rockies.  Snow choked passes block any travel to the west. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
