R {926}{0}{<238>}{The Rocky Mountains (n,s,w,e)}{<238>.^.<088>}{The Rocky Mountains The mountains rise up around you and cast huge shadows over the valleys and cliffs that make up this incredible mountain range.  The mountains around you rise and fall in a never ending pattern.  Storm clouds hang high on the mountain peaks, dark with rain or snow.  To the north you see the continuation of the Rockies.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
