R {939}{0}{<238>}{A small camp (e,leave)}{<238>[<228>L<238>]<088>}{This is the west side of a rather large tent. A large monitor stands on a table and some chairs are spread around the tent. A power supply unit has been placed in a corner and you can hear a strange humming sound coming from it. A pair of infravision binoculars lies on the table as well as some papers. An opening in the tent leads back outside. }{Mercenary Tent}{mercenary_tent}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {940}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {938}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {940}{0}{<238>}{A small camp (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the far side of the tent. A large map has been placed on a small blackboard. Pictures of aliens and other weird-looking creatures cover the other wall of the tent and you get a feeling someone around here doesn't like these creatures for some strange reason. }{Mercenary Tent}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
