R {950}{0}{}{At a giant structure (se,n)}{ }{You stand before a gigantic metal structure. This building can be none other then the Juggernauts compound. The thick metal walls are topped with guard towers and automated weaponry. Soldiers walk by on patrol and a pair stand guard at the main entrance. }{Juggernauts}{juggs}{}{}{1.000}{1}
