R {953}{0}{<238>}{The Rocky Mountains (e,w,s)}{<238>.^.<088>}{The Rocky Mountains The rugged peaks of the Rockies rise up all around you.  Naked soil shifts beneath your feet, a true sign of the desolation wrought here.  The trees here are tall and sparsely foliated, the effects of radiation and pollution taking their toll.  You wonder if they will ever grow into the lush, verdant forest that once stood here.  To the south you vaguely detect the continuation of the Rockies.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
