R {954}{0}{}{Mountain pass (se,w)}{ }{You are on a high, rock-strewn pass in the mountains. The pass is bounded by high limestone walls and its narrow entrance would be extremely easy to miss. The air is fresher here and you catch a glimpse of greenery to the west. Something is deeply weird because there is a *| NOTICE BOARD |* riveted into the rock wall!  USE IT!! }{Valley of the Tribes}{valley_of_the_tribes}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {952}{se}{se}{6}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {955}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {955}{0}{}{Valley bottom (e,w,s)}{ }{You find yourself at the bottom of a humid valley. The valley is bounded by high limestone cliffs in the north and east. The ground slopes gradually upwards to the south and west. You can smell the muddy odour of a river nearby. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {954}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {956}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
