R {956}{0}{}{Riverbank (sw,w,n)}{ }{The river twists back upon itself as it makes a detour around an outcropping of basalt. This meander forces the water to slow down and the silt builds up around the outcrop. Clumps of reeds carried here from upstream have reestablished themselves and have grown to above head height. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {955}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {957}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {959}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {957}{0}{}{Riverbank (se,ne)}{ }{The river picks up momentum after passing the outcrop upstream. By keeping to the western riverbank you can still follow the river downstream. A plain of reeds lies to the north and west. A dull roar can be heard emanating from the southeast. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {956}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {958}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {958}{0}{}{Lava tube (nw)}{ }{Basaltic melts have solidified against the limestone cliff. Taking the path of least resistance, the river hurtles down a huge lava tube. The roar of its passage reverberates in your eardrums. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {957}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {959}{0}{}{Riverbank (w,e,n)}{ }{The velocity of the river starts to increase and the riverbed becomes more sandy and less alluvial. The riverbanks are steeper now and it takes some effort to get from one side to the other. Clumps of reeds and other water plants float east past you. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {956}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {960}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {971}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {960}{0}{}{Riverbank (nw,e,n)}{ }{No sandbanks can be observed on this part of the river, but blocks of basalt are embedded in midstream. The muddy waters have picked up momentum and occasionally, clumps of reeds are torn off from the riverbanks and carried downstream. You see a treeline running at bearing of 150 degrees, following the contours of the land. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {959}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {961}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
