R {967}{0}{}{Reeds (e,nw,s)}{ }{The base of the northeastern cliffs meet the plain of reeds here. The recent rains have torn large chunks off the cliff face and lenses of limestone lie embedded among the reeds. You can smell the muddy odour of a river nearby. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
