R {971}{0}{}{Reeds (e,ne,s)}{ }{The valley spreads out into a plain of reeds which undergoes submersion when the river floods during the monsoon rains. Tall stands of flood-resistant bamboo dot the plains. You see high limestone cliffs in the north and east. The ground slopes gradually upwards to the south and west. You can smell the muddy odour of a river nearby. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {970}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
