R {975}{0}{}{Bamboo Thicket (sw,se)}{ }{You are standing on a knoll with a thicket of bamboo growing on it. The ground is not as wet as that of the surrounding reedbeds.  The stems in the thicket perimeter have a tough, smooth outer layer that defy the keenest blades. The bamboo stalks strain and creak in the wind. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
