R {976}{0}{}{Riverbanks (sw,nw,e,n)}{ }{The depth of the river has shrunk greatly after the rains, exposing dark red sandbanks and black rocks. The reeds have grown rapidly in the fertile volcanic mud and stop right at the edge of the waist deep river. Something large has churned up the ground and crushed large patches of reed. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
