R {978}{0}{}{Riverbank (se,sw,n)}{ }{The river is slightly kinked here as it weaves past a mass of decaying logs and stumps. The ubiquitious reeds now face competition from giant grasses. The walls of vegetation stretch unbroken along the riverbank, punctuated only by game paths bebouching at the water's edge. Grasshoppers and frogs sing stridulently in their paradise. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
