R {979}{0}{}{Riverbank (ne,n)}{ }{Large lava blocks and bamboo stems have been strategically wedged together to impede and channel the river, forcing it to meander. Silt dumped by the slowing water fuels the growth of reeds and other aquatic plants. A million insect mouths munch invisibly on their vegetarian lunches. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
