R {996}{0}{}{A small shed. (e,out)}{<128>O<088>}{Dirt is tracked all over the rough wooden floor, tracking in from both outside and from the east.  The pale grey worn wood shelving contains tools of various kinds. You'd not be well served to just grab one, though!  That's against the farmer code.  You'd better fork over some cash if you want to take any of these tools.  To list the things you can buy here, type "list".  To buy something, type buy <id>.  This shop supports string parsing. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {980}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {997}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {997}{0}{}{A small shed (w)}{ }{Mud and dirt cake the walls, floors, and you suspect even the ceiling, should you dare to look up.  Rusty bent nails can be spotted everywhere.  Best hurry up and do what you came for, and then get on out. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {996}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {998}{0}{}{Ground base-Recruitment Office (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The recruitment office is dominated by a large, central desk. The desk is resting atop a slightly raised platform towards the back of the room. You can leave the guild here by typing leave the juggernauts. You can extend an invitation to another non juggernaut using the recruit command. A doorway to the east leads outside the compound and up a winding mountain road. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {950}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {999}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1001}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1003}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {999}{0}{}{Ground base-Application Room (s,e)}{ }{This room is where future Juggernauts fill out an application to join the guild. Simply type apply to begin the process. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {998}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1000}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1000}{0}{}{In a metal hallway (n)}{ }{This hall was built in honor of those Juggernauts that achieved greatness. Above each wall is the Clan's Crest along with three banners hanging on each wall. The east wall represents the Wolf Clan, the west wall represents the Falcon Clan and the south wall represents the Bear Clan. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {999}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1001}{0}{}{At a landing pad. (w,s)}{ }{The road up the mountain comes to a halt at a giant platform. The mountain walls cut off all travel past this point, and the only way out is back down the road. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {998}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1002}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1002}{0}{}{Survival Trial (n)}{ }{This is the hall where trial by survival is initiated. Only one juggernaut can participate at a time. Rounds of increasingly difficult enemies will attack you inside the arena. Type start to begin your survival trial. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1001}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1003}{0}{}{In a metal hallway (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are inside the giant metal structure that houses the Juggernaut's ground facilities. The metal hallways are spotless, the ceiling featureless, and the floors smudgeless. The cleaning robots have really outdone themselves. Many engineers and warriors are seen entering and leaving this area of the guild. This hallway is lined with the same titanium plating that is throughout this level. All the action seems to be north of here. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {998}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1004}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1017}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1022}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1004}{0}{}{At the base of a structure (sw,nw,e)}{ }{The antiseptic, polished hallways and floors of the guild yield to rough hewn stone at the entrance of the Clan Wolf den.  A pair of plasma powered torches gives the room an earthy feel; their eternal glow a stark contrast to the sterile lighting in the rest of the ground base.  Two massive columns support the monstrous weight of the overhead slab of rock, silent sentinels holding their post.  Carved into the walls are various depictions of the Clan icon.  Some show the tenacity and ferocity of the wolf, one a pack of wolves taking down a smoke jaguar, another of a lone wolf howling. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1003}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1005}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1018}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1005}{0}{}{In a metal hallway (e,se,n)}{ }{Regiments of troops and vehicles can be seen through the door to the east. Looking north and southeast, there are many engineers and warriors coming and going. The noises are now discernable as there is much banging and hum of equipment in use. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1004}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1006}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1007}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1006}{0}{}{Ground base-Ammo room (w)}{<118>A<088>}{You have entered the ammo depot for the Juggernaut guild.  The walls are mounted with glass cases with very peculiar looking ammo inside.  A long counter runs along the east side of the shop with steel bars preventing anyone from hopping over the counter.  Behind this counter is a opened door which leads back into a storage room with an endless numbers of shelves. }{Juggernauts}{ammo}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1005}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1007}{0}{}{In a long metal hallway (ne,nw,s)}{ }{The whole length of the corridor is wider than most in the rest of the guild. Several of the Ghost Bear clan mechs and vehicles use this hallway to access their dropship hangar. There are lines designating where it is safe to walk for normal traffic like solitary warriors and workers. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1005}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1008}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1019}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1008}{0}{}{In a long metal hallway (sw,e)}{ }{The stainless steel doors close softly behind you. To the east and southwest are hallways. You are amazed to how clean this level of the building is kept. The overhead lights are bright. Instantly you smell a antiseptic scent that reminds you of a hospital. With all this cleanliness,there must be vital information on this level of the building. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1007}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1009}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1009}{0}{}{In a long metal hallway (e,w,s)}{ }{A patrol randomly stops people and asks for ID and clearance. You brush by the patrol and notice that several people are headed off to the west.To the south a young untested jugger is follwing an older wiser battle worn one. This hallway is kept pristine and the lights seem brighter here. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1008}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1010}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1014}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1010}{0}{}{Ground base-At a lift (u,n)}{ }{You are at a giant metal lift. You can be easily transported to another level in the base by the quickly moving elevators. Giant cables support the lift so that it can hold even the largest of elemental power armour. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1009}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1011}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1011}{0}{}{At a lift (d,s)}{ }{Standing at the top of the lift you have only two directions from which to choose. Down will take you back to the main halls of the guild. To the south lies the Bloodname Hall, where Juggernaut Bloodnames earn their titles and spend their days posting notes to one another. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1010}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1012}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1012}{0}{}{Bloodname room (n,s)}{ }{This is the room where the bloodname trial is initiated. Once you have sucessfully passed a bloodname trial you are qualified to recruit new members into your clan. Not any members can partake on this mission, only those who have been approved by the clan's SaKhan and loremasters. Once you have been assigned a mission, proceed to the dropship bay and head for the arena. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1011}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1013}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1013}{0}{}{Ground base-Recruiters room (n)}{ }{This is the recruiters room. There is a board here to discuss prospective members, and you can read their applications. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1012}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1014}{0}{}{In a long metal hallway (w,se)}{ }{The stainless steel doors close softly behind you. To the west and southwest are hallways. You are amazed to how clean this level of the building is kept. The overhead lights are bright. Instantly you smell a antiseptic scent that reminds you of a hospital. With all this cleanliness. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1009}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1015}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1015}{0}{}{In a metal hallway (ne,nw,s)}{ }{The whole length of the corridor is wider than most in the rest of the guild. Several clan Jade Falcon mechs and vehicles use this hallway to get to their dropship hangar. There are lines designating where it is safe to walk for normal traffic like solitary warriors and workers. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1014}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
