R {1022}{0}{}{Ground base-Depot (s,storage)}{<128>D<088>}{As you enter into this room, you know you have meandered into the the Guild Shop. The first thing that strikes you besides the tons of armour hanging off the walls, is an odd little man standing behind the counter. He seems rather anxious to help you. There is a list hanging off the wall, with a listing of what is for sale. For a listing, perhaps you should type 'items'. Just as you are about to turn away, you notice one more little thing, there is a small little plaque hanging off the northern wall, perhaps you should take a moment or two and READ it. }{Juggernauts}{depot}{}{}{1.000}{1}
