R {1030}{0}{}{[Sub-1] Level Sub 1-Battle armour storage room (w,e,n)}{<138>I<088>}{This room is a gigantic store house of battle armour. As far as the eye can see, massive suits of power armour line the walls. People are hard at work filling out the requisitions of various warriors. Commands:          change <suit name>-Switch suits(read the sign)          store - Stores your current suit (Mounts & Reinforces)          pickup - Changes you to your stored suit type with the stored                    Mounts/Reinforces          swap - Swap your current suit and your stored suit, storing your                  current suit          empty - Clear your suit storage          check - Check what you have stored          DITCHIT-Clear a suit with glevel<50 (no gxp refunded) }{Juggernauts}{isac}{}{}{1.000}{1}
