R {1033}{0}{}{[Sub-1] In a power armour storage facility (e,s,n)}{ }{The Undine suit, the most powerful of all suits, is perfected here in these rooms as technicians of the clans constantly vie with each other to see which of them has the honor of working on the Undine. Undines have a huge amount of defensive capability, while still packing enough of a punch they need not rely on others to do their killing for them. The Undine suit still requires some patience by the pilot, but gets the job done. Prepare for greatness! }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
