R {1034}{0}{}{[Sub-1] In a power armour storage facility (w)}{ }{The Undine suit, the most powerful of all suits, is perfected here in these rooms as technicians of the clans constantly vie with each other to see which of them has the honor of working on the Undine. Undines have a huge amount of defensive capability, while still packing enough of a punch they need not rely on others to do their killing for them. The Undine suit still requires some patience by the pilot, but gets the job done. Prepare for greatness! }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1033}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1035}{0}{}{[Sub-1] In a power armour storage facility (e,s,n)}{ }{This room stores the Elemental suit. Entering this room you instantly feel a sense of balance overwhelm you. Everything here seems to be in balance and about balance. The technicians here appreciate balance, and they endlessly strive for it. The suits are in perfectly balanced order of storage; the technician�s equipment is in equal numbers, as are the technicians themselves. Although not able to withstand the beating the Gnome or Undine must take, the Elemental has just enough plating to survive as their double mounts deal a good amount of damage and lower the time required in battle to overwhelm their enemy. Mix this with the trusted companion of all suits and a mighty tank and you have a fairly dangerous situation for any foe. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1033}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1036}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1037}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1036}{0}{}{[Sub-1] In a power armour storage facility (w)}{ }{Although this is yet another room for the storage of the Elemental suit, the technicians seem to have gone out of their way to express their desire for balance in this room. There is quite simply two of every thing they use here, two sets of tools, two sets of suit storage racks, etc. There are also many Universal signs of balance such as the Chinese symbol Ying and Yang. As you glance around the room you see other symbols such as Fire and Water, Earth and Air, Male and Female, Chaos and Order. You truly feel at peace here, and get a great sense of the equal forces of defense and offence these technicians strive for and have perfected in their Elemental suit. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1035}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1037}{0}{}{[Sub-1] In a power armour storage facility (e,s,n)}{ }{Hung around the walls of this room are numerous sylph suits in various stages of repair and disrepair.  These mighty suits stand apart from the others worn by the guild, they are designed to handle three mounts and a slot for some reinforced armour. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
