R {1073}{0}{}{[Level 1] At a giant steel door (ne,sw,n,se)}{ }{A giant steel door blocks passage to the southwest. Beside the door is a large clan crest. Within those doors lies the home of clan Wolf. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
