R {1074}{0}{}{Blooding room (sw,ne)}{ }{This room shows more of the Wolf Clan history and legacy.   Large vid screens struggle to contain the images of clan Founder Nicholas Kerensky, the first Khan Jerome Winson, ilKhan Ulric Kerensky, SaKhan Tan Fetladral, and Khan Vapor Connors.  The polished walls are barely capable of holding their bravery aloft.  Their deeds and traditions have been an example for all Wolves to follow. This is where a blooding trial begins. The purpose of a blooding trial is to initiate someone into the Wolf clan. Blooding is another name for the Trial of Position that determines if a warrior cadet (Sibko) will qualify as a Wolf Clan warrior. Once you have been assigned a mission by your sponsor, proceed to the northern dropship bay on sub-level 2 and head for the Circle of Equals arena. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1073}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1075}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1075}{0}{}{Wolf board room (ne,n,sw)}{ }{Rest and relaxation is definitely called for after a long hard day (or night) of slaughtering monsters in the realms!  Here is where the Wolves kick back and let it all hang out! Music drifts over the room while server-bots continuously hover, seeing if any of the clan might need a drink or some other form of refreshment. There is a sunken hot tub in the center of the room with benches all around. No matter where you sit in the tub, the holographic message board seems to float nearby, so you don't have to strain to read the latest happenings in the clan. There are niches along the walls for storing battlesuits while their owners are having some downtime, and some shelves off to the side hold nice big fluffy towels and robes. There are several tables around the room with comfy chairs if Wolves would rather sink into one of them.  In the corner is a lift that will take you up to the Observation Lounge }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1074}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1076}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1077}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1076}{0}{}{The Wolf Clan vault room (s)}{ }{As you enter the room a trio of automated cannons hums quietly as they follow your every step like jungle predators.  A massive door dominates the room.  Its hinge alone dwarfs you.  Marble statues of wolves flank it, snarling at anyone foolish enough to attempt to remove a single coin from of the Clan's hard earned money.  Off to the side sits an ATM that you can use to remove coins and donate them to your Clan.  You can check the vault's balance with vcheck command. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1075}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1077}{0}{}{Wolf dropship bay (ne)}{ }{A large reinforced launch pad stretches out before you.  Choreographed pandemonium flows across the pad like a pitcher of water poured on a dinner plate.  The clamor of workers shouting back and forth pale next to the departing and arriving dropships.  The heat from the engine exhaust floods the area.  A shielded door protects the compound from the explosive blasts of the dropships' thunderous engines. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1075}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

