R {1087}{0}{}{Blooding room (n,s)}{ }{The blooding room is filled with Falcon related artwork, battlefield scenes, and pictures that show nearly a complete history of Clan Jade Falcon.  The centerpiece is a family tree detailing the history of the bloodnames, and the past and present Officers who have led the clan to glory. The room is arrayed with comfortable chairs for interviewing potential recruits.  It is here that blood trials are initiated.  The purpose of the bloodtrial is for a candidate to prove themself worthy of Clan Jade Falcon.  Once a recruit has been assigned a mission, they will proceed to the Circle of Equals, and enter the arena to prove their worth. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1064}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1088}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1088}{0}{}{Falcon board room (w,s,n)}{ }{This is the informational nerve center of the Clan Jade Falcon base. This is where intelligence is gathered and studied, combat missions are planned and assigned, and dropship flights are coordinated. It is also where messages are distributed to clan members out in the field. You may use this board to discuss Falcon topics, welcome new members to the clan, and congratulate those deemed worthy of promotion. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1087}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1089}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1090}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1089}{0}{}{The Falcon Clan vault room (e)}{ }{This vault holds all the stored assets of Clan Jade Falcon. You can check the vault balance with the 'vcheck' command. It also acts as the clan's bank. There are personnel on hand to help clan members with their finances. The guards standing at attention are not discreet. They carry very BIG guns and appear to be quite vigilant (so don't do anything that might upset them).  }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1088}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

