R {1101}{0}{}{[Level 1] At a giant steel door (nw,se,n,sw)}{ }{A giant steel door blocks passage to the north. Beside the door is a large clan crest. Within those doors lies the home of clan Ghost Bear. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
