R {1102}{0}{}{Blooding room (se,nw)}{ }{So you think you are ready to become part of the Bear Clan? Well this most certainly will put you to the test. A large panel on the wall reads:     Attention future Bear member here is the place better known    as the blooding room. Here you will begin a Blood Trial. The    purpose of this is to initiate you into the Bear Clan. Are    you prepared to have your future changed? Be sure this is what    you want as you will not be backing out once it is done!    Bears do not back down and they most certainly do not give up! The light seems to be coming from each corner of the room casting a deep red aura. Claw and teeth marks seem imbedded deeply into the cave-like walls. On the west wall a large tapestry depicts a young  juggernaut battling many foes in order to prove his worthiness to the glorious Bear Clan! }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1101}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1103}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1103}{0}{}{Bear board room (nw,s,n,se)}{ }{This room is slightly dim. The walls appear to have a cave-like appearance--they are warm to the touch, and have a rough stony texture. On the far wall a large tapestry of a Bear enhances the clan atmosphere. The floor is quite worn from all the activity over the years but definately inviting. A single row of lights casts an almost eerie glow with shadows reflected in the corners. A slight  aroma of oil is present. The ceilings are extremely high with bear claw prints covering every bit of colour. Off to one side there is a message board so members of the Bear Clan can post announcements, greetings, or whatever they choose. In the center of the room  you can see a very large table and numerous chairs. It is obvious a lot of gatherings go on here--probably just for chatting and  enjoying each other's company. In the far corner a large statue stands erect and threatening, of a large bear fierce and steady. It is a symbol of strength and passion. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1102}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1104}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1105}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1106}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1104}{0}{}{The Bear Clan vault room (s)}{ }{Walking forward into the glory of the Bear Clan vault room you notice a very large combination vault embedded in the wall. A large chart on the table shows the most recent transactions that have taken  place. To view your personal standing with the clan <vcheck> will  prove most helpful. On the floor in front of the vault door you notice a very unusual rug. At first glance you are sure it resembles the hide of a wolf! On the wall a tapestry displays elder Bear Clan members  working hard to keep the clan financially stable. A ledger hanging just  to the left of the vault shows the constant rise of the Bear Clan assets dating back many, many years. To know the true wealth of the clan is the business of the Sakhan. A small bear cub sits here encouraging you to support the future of the clan. How could you turn down such beautiful eyes? This little one represents the future of the clan and the bond between him and your duty to the guild. }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1103}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1105}{0}{}{Bears' Den (n)}{ }{The Bear Clan Den offers all the comforts for which one could ask. This well-lit room easily handles the extraordinary amounts of traffic that make its way through the room daily. A fun place to meet for a friendly exchange of ideas or casual everyday conversations, this lounge will serve every need of the clan. On the right side of the room a large couch with seating for six lines the immense cave-like wall. In the center of the room a unique rug adorns the floor. It almost appears to be made of falcon feathers! Two tables complete with paper and writing utensils sit at the back of the room. Games are often played here with the occasional number-crunching being done. In each  corner of the room a large spotlight hums quietly ready to turn on with the slightest movement. A large projection-screen television takes up the furthest wall on the left with numerous easy chairs for complete relaxation while enjoying a program or a recorded epic fight of one of the many Bear legends. Currently it is showing some smokin' hot dancers with skimpy outfits--woo Chippendales! }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1103}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1106}{0}{}{Bear dropship bay (nw)}{ }{spot to stand and wait for the dropship. Patience is a bear's greatest virtue! }{Juggernauts}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
