R {1165}{0}{}{A road leading north-south}{ }{You are on a road moving east-west.  Looking to the south you can see a huge range of mountains in the distance.  To the north the ground is all charred.  You can see an occasional geyser of fire shoot up from the ground.  The land to the east seems to phase in and out periodically.  You can't be sure but it just might be the remains of the old Kingdom capital now called, aptly enough, Kayos.}{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
