R {1168}{0}{}{The Carpentry Workshop (n,w,s)}{ }{You squint to see through the dust that fills the air in this small and cluttered workshop.  Pieces of wood lay scattered all over the room.  You wonder how anyone can find anything in this mess.  You can make out an artist studio to the south and the smell of fresh clay coming from the north. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
