R {1169}{0}{}{The Pottery Studio (s)}{ }{You are in the pottery studio.  Shelves full of half-dried pieces of pottery line the walls, with only the windows taking up wall space as well.  A potter's wheel sits in the far corner and large bags of wet clay lay beside it.  It looks as though someone is currently working on something. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1168}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1170}{0}{}{The Artist's Studio (n)}{ }{Here is the spacious artist's studio.  It consists of one large room, large skylights and windows.  The beaded doorway leading to Birch's workshop sways gently in the breeze from an open window.  An easel stands in the middle of the room, situated so the sun shines down upon it, giving perfect light. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1168}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1171}{0}{}{The Communal School (door,e)}{<238>D<088>}{This is the school house for the children of the commune. Old books lie on shelves and are scattered here and there on the tables.  The chalk board is full of confusing diagrams which most likely give the kids splitting headaches.  There is a door leading out to the playground. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1167}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1172}{door}{door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1172}{w}{door}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1172}{0}{}{The Playground (e)}{ }{You are standing in the playground behind the communal school.  There are swings to the north and a slide to the south. Little footprints lead in every direction in the dirt. A large tree grows to the west. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1171}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19705}{u}{climb tree}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19705}{climb tree}{climb tree}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1173}{0}{}{Deeper into the Commune (s,n,e)}{ }{You're one step deeper inside the commune.  The path is bordered by fruit trees on one side and another little path leads off to a small barn on the other side. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53137}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1174}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1176}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1174}{0}{<238>}{Entrance to the Barn (gate,w)}{<238>|@|<088>}{This is where the residents of the commune keep their livestock. Since they are obviously vegetarians, the only animals you see are chickens, cows, goats and a few sheep.  There's a gate to the north leading to the pasture where all the animals graze together. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1173}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1175}{gate}{gate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1175}{e}{gate}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1175}{0}{}{A Pasture (barn)}{<128>F<088>}{Whoa. You've never seen so many animals get along so nicely together.  The grass is very green... Must be that natural fertilizer the hippies use. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26145}{grasp rake}{grasp rake}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1174}{barn}{barn}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1174}{w}{barn}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1176}{0}{}{Courtyard (w,s,n)}{ }{As you look around you hear the chirping of the happy little birds sitting on the statue's head. To the north you see a big log cabin with huge windows and a small porch wrapping around the front of the building. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1173}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1177}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1178}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1177}{0}{}{The Outhouse (e)}{ }{This must be the cleanest and freshest smelling outhouse you have ever been in.  The seat is made of fine crafted wood and a stack of 'High Times' magazines sits on a little shelf above the toilet paper. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1176}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1178}{0}{}{The Porch (s,enter)}{<168>E<088>}{You step onto the porch and feel as if all your troubles have disappeared.  The rocking chairs gently sway with the breeze and they look quite inviting. The front door of the house is open with long strands of beads swaying in the doorway. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1176}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1179}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1179}{n}{enter}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1179}{0}{}{Entryway to the House (s,n,w,e)}{ }{As you enter the house, you feel as if you have been transported back in time.  The walls are covered with colourful tie-dyed material and mosaic pictures.  The wooden floors are covered with rag rugs and shelves of books line the hallway. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1178}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1180}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
