E {1192}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1180}{0}{}{The Communal Living Area (d,e)}{ }{This is a large and spacious room with lots of windows. There are several beanbags thrown about on the floor and a huge tapestry of a bright orange sun hanging on the wall. A large wooden framed couch with yellow cushions sits under the tapestry and an old trunk occupies a small corner.  The smell of weed is wafting up from the basement. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1179}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1181}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1181}{0}{}{The Basement (u)}{ }{You are in the basement of the hippies' house.  It is quite funky down here.  A bunch of lava lamps are scattered around the room, all with different coloured wax.  Candles are everywhere, adding a yellow glow to your surroundings.  Beanbags cover the floor, and most of them are indented where someone had been sitting.  A kite hangs from the ceiling and its tail is draped along behind it.  The smell of pot is almost suffocating. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1180}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1182}{0}{}{A Stairwell (u,w)}{ }{This is a little nook where there are stairs leading up to the second floor landing. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1179}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1183}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1183}{0}{}{At the Top of the Stairs (w,d,s,e)}{ }{You have reached the landing at the top of the stairs.  The distant sound of Bob Dylan floats in the air around you. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
