R {1184}{0}{}{The Children's Room (e)}{ }{This is a bright colourful room, obviously decorated for children. Two sets of bunkbeds line the walls and several toys lay scattered on the floor. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1183}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1185}{0}{}{A Nursery (w)}{ }{This is the nursery where the little baby sleeps.  There are several bright posters hanging on the walls.  There's a crib sitting against the west wall. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1183}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1186}{0}{}{The Upstairs Hall (s,n,w,e,u)}{ }{You are in the hallway upstairs.  You're surrounded by bedrooms and you are not really sure which way to go first.  There is a small set of stairs leading up to the attic. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1183}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
