R {1187}{0}{}{Moonbeam and Shadowstar's Bedroom (e)}{ }{Oops!!  It seems maybe you should knock before you enter bedrooms. You've caught these two with their pants down, literally! }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1186}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1188}{0}{}{Loam and Sunny's Bedroom (w)}{ }{Now here's a groovy room.  There's a lava lamp in the corner and a velvet Elvis painting on the wall.  A bunch of books on yoga are laying on the floor. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1186}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1189}{0}{}{Grampa's and Granny's Room (n)}{ }{All around you is stuff collected for about 50 years.  Everything is old  and dusty.  I guess Granny isn't that good of a housekeeper.  Even the bed is unmade. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1186}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1190}{0}{}{In the Attic (d,n)}{ }{You are in the small attic of the hippies' house.  There are no cobwebs here, because it has been converted into a room for the women of the commune to sew clothes for the rest of the hippies.  Large dormer windows let in plenty of light for the ladies to work with their needles. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1186}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1191}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1191}{0}{}{In the Attic (s)}{ }{You are in the well-lit attic of the commune. There are sewing baskets laying around, with thread and scraps of cloth scattered about the floor. Needles stuck in pin cushions sit on a small table, along with a gas lamp in case more light is needed. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1190}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1192}{0}{}{A Hallway (w,s,e)}{ }{The hallway comes to an end here but you can see a cheerful kitchen to the west.  You think someone is cooking from the nice smell coming from that direction.  As you peek to the east you see a small dining room. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
