R {1193}{0}{}{The Dining Hall (w)}{ }{Here's where everyone comes to eat their meals.  The room looks a bit small but there's room enough for everyone.  A huge table sits here. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1192}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1194}{0}{}{The Kitchen (door,e)}{<238>D<088>}{This is the kitchen of the commune.  It's a bit rustic, but at least there's running water.  If you're lucky you'll catch Sunny baking some of her famous magic brownies. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
