R {1196}{0}{}{A fork in the Path (ne,e)}{ }{This is a fork in the path.  There seems to be a mill to the northwest, but the path is too overgrown to travel.  The path to the garden is well kept, though. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
