R {1197}{0}{}{A Lovely Garden (e,sw)}{ }{Here is the start of the communal garden.  This is where all the vegetables are grown for food.  Although it's well cared for, the hippies don't seem to mind sharing their crop with the little animals that might happen to venture into the rows of plants. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
