R {1199}{0}{}{The Garden (w,s,e)}{ }{The lentils start growing here in nice straight rows.  The dirt looks nice and fertile, and the hippies always eat their lentils, just like their mentor, Leto. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
