R {1201}{0}{}{Among the Carrots (s,n)}{ }{Carrot tops are scattered everywhere from those pesky rabbits. If hippies weren't supposed to be nice, they'd probably hunt the bunnies for food. }{Hippie Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
