R {1411}{0}{<268>}{Front Aisle (leave,e,w)}{<268>[<238>L<268>]<088>}{When you enter the crashed plane, you see seats, torn away from the plane's floor, and the small windows along the side are all broken. Under the rubble, among corpses and severed bodyparts, the fire spreads everywhere around you. To the west, you figure you will find the cockpit and east is the rear part of this devastated aisle.  }{Crashed Plane}{crashed_plane}{}{}{1.000}{1}
