R {1412}{0}{<238>}{Cockpit (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered the cockpit of this crashed plane. Everything in here seems to be broken. A large iron pipe smashed into the control panels tells you that this plane didn't crash by accident. The radio, thrown down on the floor, is perfectly quiet, and the cables from it look like they've been cut off. In the pilot seat, you see the corpse of a man, with a large hole in his head. East is the way back to the aisles.  }{Crashed Plane}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1411}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1413}{0}{<268>}{Rear Aisle (w,e,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The rear part of the aisle looks pretty much the same as the front part. Even here, the seats are a mess, and corpses spread around the room. The stench here is awful, you didn't have any time to think about that before. When you finally notice it, you feel like you want to puke. To the west, you can go back to the front aisle. To the east you see a hatch with some text next to it, and to the north, you see something that must be a lavatory.  }{Crashed Plane}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
