R {1414}{0}{<238>}{Cargo Bay (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You walk through the hatch and end up in the cargo bay of the plane. A couple of boxes are placed around the floor, with their contents lying all over the floor. West is the way back to the aisle.  }{Crashed Plane}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1413}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1415}{0}{<238>}{Toilet (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{As you enter the lavatory, you see the ordinary stuff that you find on plane-lavatories. A sink, a toilet, and even a mirror. The mirror isn't really a mirror anymore though. South is the aisle.  }{Crashed Plane}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
