R {1429}{0}{<238>}{A dirt path (w,e,n,s)}{<238>, `<088>}{You are on a dry dirt path.  Dying weeds and stunted shrubs sap the last few nutrients out of the otherwise barren land.  Walking kicks up clouds of dust that make your eyes tear.  To the north and south are makeshift canvas tents with flaps covering the entrances.  Further to the east you can see a small building.  There are some spent bulletshells scattered on the ground here.  Maybe you shouldn't be snooping around. }{Bandit Camp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
