R {1430}{0}{<238>}{A dusty tent (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in an old dusty tent.  It seems to be primarily used for storing supplies - there are no sleeping accommodations.  Some crates are stacked against one side of the tent.  In the corner on the other side is a large toolbox.  On a table in the middle of the tent, engine parts rest in various stages of put-togetherness. }{Bandit Camp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
