R {1431}{0}{<238>}{A dusty tent (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in an dry, dusty tent.  There is a tattered sleeping bag here on a folding cot.  At the foot of the cot is a pile of books.  A radio and an open, half-eaten can of spanish olives sit on a small table. }{Bandit Camp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
