R {1434}{0}{<278>}{An aluminum shack (w)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{It is almost unbearably hot in here.  The aluminum walls and roof baking in the sun all day are enough to cause heatstroke (or perhaps more serious mental problems) to anyone spending too much time inside.  Yet this one-room building seems not only to be a sort of headquarters, but also the living accommodations for some unwise person.  A few blankets and a ratty pillow are spread out on top of some wooden crates.  There are also a few chairs here and a table with some folders and papers on it.  Near the door is a small metal case. }{Bandit Camp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
