R {1567}{0}{}{shuttle bay (turbolift)}{ }{You are standing in the main shuttle bay of the starship Enterprise.  Usually there are a couple of ensigns here to greet you.  If not, they are probably just milling around the ship looking for new ways to get yelled at by the officers.  Most often there is a shuttle docked in the bay.  Since there is some weird sort of electromagnetic radiation surrounding the planet below, the safest way to reach the surface is via shuttlecraft.  You also see the ship's turbolift here. }{USS Enterprise (TNG)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
