R {1655}{0}{}{A well-travelled road}{ }{A dusty dirt road leads deeper into the hills, to the west.  Hammered flat by the passing of hundreds of carts, the road bears a multitude of deep ruts, like scars that the wheels of the carts have left in their passing.  A faraway cloud of grey dust hangs low to the ground, loitering among the hills to the northwest, at the base of the mountains which begin to reach upwards there. }{Grindur}{grindur}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1654}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1656}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1656}{0}{}{A well-travelled road}{<160>E<088>}{The dusty track continues to wend its way through the hills.  There is a squat wooden building on the northern side of the track.  To the west, you can see several other buildings, where the track splits into a T-intersection.  One branch leads north towards the dust cloud hanging at the foot of the mountains, and the other towards the south. }{Grindur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1655}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1663}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
