R {1657}{0}{}{A dirt road}{<160>E<088>}{A road made of hard-packed earth runs north-south here.  A thick cloud of grey dust hangs around the base of a tall mountain to the north, where the road leads.  There is a large two-story building to the west, covered in scaffolding.  Large carts, pulled by ponies and driven by dwarves arrive from the north, and leave to the east.  There is a bustle of activity and construction in the air. }{Grindur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1656}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1658}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
