E {1664}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1658}{0}{}{A dirt road}{<160>E<088>}{A road made of hard-packed earth and scarred with many deep ruts runs north-south here.  A small, low-lying wooden building hugs the western side of the road.  The main intersection of the town's streets lies to the south, bustling with traffic and activity.  Empty carts, driven by stout dwarves lumber northward, towards the dust and clamor, and others return full of large blocks of stone, headed southward. }{Grindur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1657}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1659}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
