R {1662}{0}{}{A dirt road}{<160>*<088>}{The activity along this part of the road is considerably less than the portions that lie to the north.  There is a barracks-style building to the west, bearing the words 'Quarry Workers' above the door, and some stables to the east.  The town ends rather abruptly here, with the road trailing off a very short distance before fading into the hills to the south. }{Grindur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1661}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
