R {1670}{0}{<228>}{Hills}{<228>. ^<088>}{ Hills The ground gradually inclines here.  There is a piece of rock extending out of the ground.  You've entered some bumpy terrain which appears to increase further to the north.  Further to the east and south you note that the hills continue.  Beyond the hills to the north and west lie rugged mountains.  You notice a narrow pass to the northwest, leading through the jagged peaks.  In the side of a small hill, you notice the rubble of what appears to be a collapsed cave.  There is no way to enter, any more.  }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
