R {1671}{1024}{<228>}{Bleak forest}{<228>( *<088>}{You have entered a dense forest that appears to stretch on before you as far as the eye can see.  With nothing more than the leaf litter at your feet and trees on all sides, you really have no idea who or what could possibly be out there. The safety of the mountain pass is off to the southeast of you, and the dangers of the unknown lie further to the west.  }{Guiles Forest}{guiles_forest}{}{}{1.000}{1}
