R {1672}{0}{<228>}{Forest}{<228>( *<088>}{Moving further into the forest nothing seems to change too much.  There are still no gaps in the trees and the undergrowth seems to be getting thicker with every step.  It crosses your mind that what seemed like a good idea just a few minutes ago, might have been a mistake that could very well end your adventuring days.  }{Guiles Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
