R {1698}{0}{<238>}{kitchen}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This must be one of the largest food preparation areas you have ever had the pleasure to drool in.  With bone white marble floors and deep gray walls it gives off an almost homey feeling that is relaxing, almost erotic to stand around in for hours.  The hard steel counter matches the cookstove and icebox, almost shouting out the fact that function is better then beauty.  You can almost smell the last meal that was prepared in here.  The window ledge appears perfect for cooling pies and cakes on.  }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
