R {1699}{0}{<238>}{Bedroom}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Painted a light baby blue, with a velvet base, this room's walls are enough to relax even the most tense person.  The carpeting is a deep plush aqua blue, and feels almost as soft as any bed you have slept on.  There are a few paintings on the walls, and a huge window on the west wall.  The bed in this room is as dominating as any you have ever seen with one massive post at each corner, and a very large mirror acting as the headboard.  There is also a maple hope chest at the foot of the bed, you wonder what might be kept in such a large chest. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
