R {1700}{0}{<238>}{Closet}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The walk in closet is actually quite large for being attached to a guest room.  It has racks on both sides and a shoe tree at the end of it.  The walls are paneled in a light brown wood while the floor is carpeted in a light blue shag.  There is a small mural on the ceiling. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
