R {1701}{0}{<268>}{Hallway}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Moving farther along the hall you notice but one indisputable fact, and that is the owner of this mansion must be one heck of a bear to work for, considering you have yet to see any dust, dirt, or even a fallen hair.  The poor gnomes working in this mansion must work like dogs day and night to keep their master happy. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
