R {1702}{0}{<268>}{Common Room}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The room you have just entered has yellow flowered wallpaper and cream colored trim adorning the walls.  The floor is covered with a light gray blue carpet that although soft, is not thick and lush like one might expect in here.  There are a few chairs placed around the room for company to relax awhile in, and maybe swap a few tall tales while wasting the day away. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
