R {1706}{0}{<238>}{Music Hall}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room is huge, designed to allow the sounds to echo off all four walls.  In the northwest corner you see a baby grand piano while in the southeast corner sits an ivory white harp.  The hard wood flooring looks as if it has never been danced on, and there seems to be some kind of platform to the north, with a few tables and chairs scattered around the edge of the walls. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
