R {1707}{0}{<268>}{Hallway}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Creepy sounds reverberate off the walls of this intensely dark hall. Longer than most the others, with very little light to see, this passage has a smell of death and decay.  Leaves litter the floor, while further down the long corridor shadows dance wickedly about the walls and ceiling. Void of any special paintings or identifying features, this hallway seems to be haunted by tortured souls of the past. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
