R {1721}{0}{<238>}{bedroom}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered a sparsely decorated guest bedroom.  There is a good sized dressing table along the north wall with a small stool in front of it.  The bed is just large enough for two people to occupy, with a cream colored bedspread and two pillows.  There is also a hand woven throw rug placed at the end of the bed, to offset the look of the hard wood floors. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
