R {1733}{0}{<238>}{bedroom}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Styled after a Tapan native's hut, the room is quite cozy and warm to sit in.  The walls are all covered in long dry grasses.  Sitting in the middle of the room is a giant sized bed made from cherry wood.  The mattress looks a bit lumpy but could still be a nice spot to stretch out and let the day's pains wash away.  A large mirror made from a highly polished metal adorns the north wall and there is a small nightstand right beside the bed.  }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
