R {1735}{0}{<268>}{Hallway}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You have reached the southwestern-most point of the mansion's hallways which seemed to span in both directions forever.  The hallway is a bit barren with white walls and some trim lower down on the wall.  It's not exactly the most impressive looking place you have ever been inside. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
