R {1738}{0}{<238>}{Common Room}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room you have just entered has red flowered wallpaper and deep green colored trim adorning the walls.  The floor is covered with a dusty rose carpet that's soft, but not actually as thick and luxurious as one might expect given its appearance.  There are a few chairs scattered around the room for company to sit and relax in, perhaps even swapping a few tall tales while wasting the day away. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1737}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1739}{0}{<268>}{Hallway}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hall continues both to the east and west.  There isn't much to do and the repetition is starting to get as exciting and enjoyable as being skinned alive by the local orcs.  The best part about it all is that there could be something worthwhile hidden around here, but most likely not. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
