R {1740}{0}{<268>}{Hallway}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You can hear the faint cries of someone being severely tortured coming from just west of here.  It may be safer to head east and forget all about those screams of anguish.  With the sounds of hell around you, the white walls really seem out of place now. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1739}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1741}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1741}{0}{<268>}{Hallway}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Wandering around, you have found the entrance to a closet north of you.  It's not much of a find but it's better then nothing really.  With white walls and oak trim, the hall hasn't changed in one hundred years.  The gnomes must work like dogs to keep it as clean and new looking as it is, or maybe it's a spell cast by Guile to keep it in this condition. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
