R {1742}{0}{<238>}{closet}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered a broom closet.  There are various cleaning supplies located in here, everything from a mop and bucket to brooms and a duster.  The north wall has a single sink that is deep enough to easily put a good sized bucket in to fill up for cleaning.  The hand pump on the edge of the sink isn't all that fancy, just something to bring water up from the well down below the house. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
