R {1743}{0}{<268>}{Hallway}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The light in this section of hallway seems a bit dim compared to the rest you have walked through.  It is almost as if some presence is forcing the lights to be weaker.  It's not like an actual person has dimmed them but more like an unseen force has done it.  Even with the dimmed lights it is easy to see that there isn't much going on here. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
