R {1817}{0}{}{The entrance to ***CLUB CHAOS***}{ }{The outside of Club Chaos is fairly plain. It is a large red-brick building with no windows and a small steel-reinforced door. Through the open door, you see the glowing light and moving bodies of a kicking nightclub. The sounds emanating from within are fairly muffled; no doubt the inside is heavily acoustically shielded to protect the ears of the neighbors. Next to the door, is a poster you could check to see who is playing tonight. }{Club Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
