E {1818}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {1818}{0}{<238>}{Entryway of ***Club Chaos***}{<238>|@|<088>}{This narrow hallway is the entry way to ***Club Chaos***. The loud sounds of rock and roll music can be heard coming from deep inside the club. East of here, the club opens up to the main floor.  }{Club Chaos}{club_chaos}{}{}{1.000}{1}
