R {1837}{0}{}{Theatre Lobby and Concession Stand}{ }{You have entered the theatre lobby. It is a large octagonal room at the center of which is a sizeable concession stand. The floor is covered with a bright red carpet. The air is a bit cool and the smell of butter wavers everywhere. Lit signs adorn the top of the north and west exits and a spiral stairway winds up to the 2nd floor. To the southwest are the doors leading to the restrooms. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
