R {1900}{0}{<178>}{## Mahjongg ## (n,exit)}{<278>#<158>Q<278>#<088>}{         Mahjongg (castle) This interior courtyard serves as the entrance to the Castle of Mahjongg. Bas relief sculptures decorate the stone walls, depicting all manner of exotic creatures and fierce-looking warriors. A curved staircase leads around the courtyard and up to an arched doorway that stands open to visitors to the north. A decorative iron fence surrounds the garden in the middle of the courtyard, preventing you from accidently stepping on any of the lovely flora that grows beneath the bright sunshine shining down from the open ceiling above. }{Mahjongg}{mahjongg}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1898}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1901}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

