R {1902}{0}{<228>}{## Mahjongg ## (n,w,e,portal)}{<228>(<168>P<228>*<088>}{         Mahjongg (forest) Light seems to dapple the leaf-strewn ground beneath your feet while lush maple and birch trees stretch into the clear blue sky overhead. This tile depicts a forest in the midst of a fall day, the paint so lifelike, you can almost smell the fresh aroma of the healthy flora and gentle breeze. Tiny animal tracks dot the bottom of the tile, as if small forest creatures had recently scampered across the path. }{Mahjongg}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
