R {1982}{0}{}{The Castle Inn (e,n)}{ }{  This is the Knight's Inn.   This is where the knights and guards come to rest and heal.  A large fireplace is kept burning at all hours of the day, to warm knights as they arrive here to rest from their adventures.  A passage to the east leads to the knight's pub.  Very few people can afford to eat and drink here.  But if you feel rich, type 'list' to see what you can buy.  }{Knights}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
