R {1989}{0}{}{The Old Dungeons (e)}{ }{                                                                       | | |     This is a former dungeon cell once specialized for traitors to the guild.  Since then, the guild has adopted a much more lenient and progressive stance to wrongdoers, and hence this cell has become obsolete.  Now, it has been remodeled into an informal and carefree chat room where knights can discuss matters not related to guild code or skills, i.e. matters on a more personal level.  The room shows no evidence of having been a former prison cell, except for the fact that two sets of chains remain embedded in the stone wall and the room lacks any kind of ornamentation.  }{Knights}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
