R {2159}{0}{}{Ancient Greece}{ }{You seem to be in a clearing.  This room is clouded in mist. The ground beneath your feet is solid but you feel as if you were walking around in the clouds.  The ground begins to climb in places and descend in others just outside the clearing giving you the impression that this region is very mountainous.  There are five paths leading away from this place but, because of the dense fog, you cannot see where they lead.  A majestic statue stands in the center of the clearing. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
