R {2476}{0}{<268>}{Aegis Global - Level 1}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The fact that you were able to enter this building unimpeded is a sure sign of trouble.  The broken glass that litters the tiled floor and the blood streaked across the flatscreen monitors that line the inner wall of this entrance confirm that something is most definitely amiss. This is the entry to Aegis Global, a defense contractor that is publically known to produce military armor and vehicles.  Privately, it's rumored that this megacorp produces some much more diabolical weapons. }{Aegis Global}{aegis}{}{}{1.000}{1}
