R {2566}{0}{<138>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (n)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{Not much is left of this bathroom.  Fire has almost entirely gutted the place.  The toilet is lying on its side in the corner, blackened and broken.  The tub is in pieces, large chunks of the porcelain are completely missing.  The mirror is shattered, glass lies all over the tiled floor which is stained by smoke and debris.  Only the oak vanity remains intact, but it is charred to the point of uselessness. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2565}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2567}{0}{<268>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Smoke rises from the scorched carpet in this hallway, its acrid stench burning your throat and lungs.  Fire has eaten away most of the walls in this corridor, exposing the strong steel and cement foundations that keep this underground office building from crashing in around you.  It's dark in here, the ruined fluorescent lights overhead now nothing more than charred pieces of glass and wire. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2565}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2568}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2568}{0}{<268>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (n,s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Smoking hunks of plaster and glass litter the charred carpet in this corridor, having fallen from the ceiling due to fire damage.  Black streaks mar the walls, remnants of the smoke that filled this hallway in a blanket of death until the building's air filtration system managed to clear the atmosphere enough to allow you to breathe. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2567}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2569}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
