R {2571}{0}{<268>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This blackened hallway looks like it took even more damage than those around it.  The walls and ceiling are scorched completely black and the carpet is so ruined it isn't even recognizable any longer.  A wall of burnt wood and metal lies piled high to the south.  It might have been a last ditch effort at a protective barrier at some point, but judging from its appearance, it's nothing more than the edge of a ravaged burial ground now. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2570}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2572}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (w,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Charred furniture lies scattered around the room, a blackened sofa, a burnt-up table and set of chairs, all of it utterly ruined.  Wires hang from the ceiling, dangling from the fluorescent lights that exploded in the heat of the blaze.  The smell of fried circuits and burnt fabric lingers in the air, assaulting your nostrils with a stench that makes your eyes water. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2570}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2573}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2573}{0}{<138>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (e)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{The stench of a recent fire still lingers in this bathroom.  Glass litters the floor from the broken mirror hanging on the wall over a ruined pine vanity.  Beside the vanity is what remains of the toilet.  The bowl and tank of the toilet are cracked and the tile has been torn up around its base.  The garden tub that takes up the majority of the room is still intact, but it is almost entirely black from the heat and smoke. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2572}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2574}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (w,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This burnt-out husk of a room contains little more than blackened remnants of what must have once been furniture.  A charred lump off to the right looks like it used to be a bed and a taller hunk of scorched wood just past the bed appears to be the remains of a chest of drawers.  Other than these two pieces, the rest of the ruins in this residence are beyond recognition. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
