R {2610}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (w,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This burnt-out husk of a room contains little more than blackened remnants of what must have once been furniture.  A charred lump off to the right looks like it used to be a bed and a taller hunk of scorched wood just past the bed appears to be the remains of a chest of drawers.  Other than these two pieces, the rest of the ruins in this residence are beyond recognition. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
