R {2617}{0}{<138>}{Aegis Global - Level 3 (w)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{The stench of a recent fire still lingers in this bathroom.  Glass litters the floor from the broken mirror hanging on the wall over a ruined pine vanity.  Beside the vanity is what remains of the toilet.  The bowl and tank of the toilet are cracked and the tile has been torn up around its base.  The garden tub that takes up the majority of the room is still intact, but it is almost entirely black from the heat and smoke. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
