R {2926}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're now hovering more than 60 feet above the floor of the loading platform.  Nothing but darkness can be seen in the heights overhead.  Rounded steel walls surround you on all sides and it's almost deathly quiet.  As long as you remain in place, it seems like you might be safe enough in here.  However, moving higher or lower in the shaft might be dangerous. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
