R {2927}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{Hanging 80 feet above the surface of the loading platform, you're now close enough to the top of this underground shaft to make out a bit of detail above you.  It looks like it ends in a plain steel ceiling, but you'll need to get a little closer to be sure.  The sheer metal walls of this chamber offer nothing in the way of leverage so you'd better double-check that your means of flight is secure. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2926}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2928}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2928}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d)}{<238>] [<088>}{You've finally reached the top of the chamber.  Above you is a cylindrical ceiling and below you is at least 100 feet of empty space. You might want to keep your eyes focused on your surroundings.  It's a very long way down.  It's utterly silent up here.  The steel walls seem to dampen any sound.  The lights set into the eastern wall are turned off, leaving you cloaked in darkness. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2927}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2929}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{Darkened landing lights are set within the eastern wall of the shaft which continues high up into the darkness overhead.  You're floating about 40 feet above the floor of one of the building's loading platforms.  It's quiet in here, little more than the sound of circulating air to keep you company.  You'd be wise to just lower yourself back to the relative safety of the ground below but if you chose to, you might risk going even higher. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2885}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2930}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2930}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're floating more than 60 feet above the floor of the loading platform.  Above you is nothing but sheer darkness.  Not even a glimpse can be seen of what might lie in wait in the far upper reaches of this vertical chamber.  Around you are smooth walls of steel that encase the silence like a metallic tomb.  You could remain here where it's seemingly safe or you could take your chances and move higher or lower in the shaft. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2929}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2931}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2931}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{Hovering 80 feet above the loading platform, the ceiling is now partially visible in the darkness overhead.  Sheer metal walls surround you on all sides, preventing you from gaining a handhold to steady yourself.  It appears that you could move closer still to the top of this chamber or you could make your way back down to the floor far below. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2930}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2932}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2932}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d)}{<238>] [<088>}{You've come to the very top of this underground shaft. A convex ceiling prevents you from moving any higher and the rounded steel walls are as blank as ever.  Looking down is likely to induce a strong case of vertigo.  You're suspended at least 100 feet up in the air with nothing but your power of flight to prevent a potentially lethal fall.  You can make out the seam of a large door in the ceiling, but there doesn't appear any way to activate the mechanism. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2931}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2933}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're floating about 40 feet above the floor of the loading platform. It's quiet in here, little more than the sound of circulating air to keep you company.  Dim landing lights line the eastern wall of the shaft which continues high up into the darkness overhead.  You'd be wise to just lower yourself back to the relative safety of the ground below but if you chose to, you might risk going even higher. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2883}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2934}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2934}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{Hovering more than 60 feet above the floor of the loading platform, there's still nothing to be seen overhead except utter darkness.  The surrounding steel walls seal you in a cocoon of deathly quiet.  Remaining here seems safe enough, however moving higher or lower in the shaft might prove dangerous. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2933}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2935}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2935}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're now 80 feet above the floor of the loading platform and close enough to discern that there's some sort of metal ceiling not much further overhead.  The steel walls are too sheer to allow for any handholds so it's a good thing you have a means of flight.  Anything less would likely end in a very nasty fall.  Be careful moving forward, there seems to be a wind picking up in this chamber. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2934}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2936}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2936}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (d)}{<238>] [<088>}{There's nothing below you but 100 feet of nothingness.  A fall from this height would probably kill you.  You should be extremely careful. A loud hum vibrates the steel walls and a man-made wind buffets you as you try to maintain your equilibrium.  Set into one of the steel walls just beneath a rounded metal ceiling is a giant air vent.  This vent seems to be the source of the wind and likely leads to one of the generators that circulate air through this building. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2935}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2937}{pull lever}{pull lever}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2937}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The noise in here is nearly unbearable.  A massive fan takes up the entire south side of the passage and its blades churn relentlessly, generating a current that almost blows you off your feet.  The surrounding walls are made of steel and gleam dully in the illumination provided by your light source.  The metal floor underfoot vibrates from the energy of the fan, forcing you to brace your knees just to keep your balance. }{Aegis Global}{faceplate}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2936}{pull lever}{pull lever}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2938}{0}{<278>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (u,s)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This plush executive waiting room is far different than the majority of rooms you've seen in this building.  For one thing, you don't see any blood or bullet holes.  Chances are, you wouldn't be in here if the elevator and its security protocols were working correctly.  A long desk takes up one corner of the room and two couches are set across from it.  The open elevator shaft yawns to the north while a hallway delves deeper into this level to the south. }{Aegis Global}{aegis7}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2822}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2939}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2939}{0}{<268>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (s,n,e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Bullet holes riddle the walls of this hallway and a large blood stain mars the carpet.  It looks like a fire fight took place here and someone didn't fare very well.  The blood is still a bit tacky, causing your feet to stick with every step.  Open doorways lead to other rooms both to the east and west while the hallway continues north and south. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
