R {2940}{0}{<268>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (sw,n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The walls of this hallway are littered with bullet holes and blood is splattered on the carpet.  The hall continues to the north while leading to open doorways to the east, west, and southwest.  A closed door blocks progress to the southeast.  Bloody handprints are streaked down the closed door, lending the impression that someone might have died trying to get in at some earlier time. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
