R {2941}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the office of Andrea Eggelstein if you can trust that the moniker on the desk nameplate is accurate.  Most of the books that line the shelves on the walls concern marketing which probably alludes to her job responsibilities for Aegis Global.  Her teak desk is neat and orderly and two comfortable-looking chairs sit in the corners of the room.  A few framed photographs decorate the walls. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2939}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2942}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Based on the nameplate sitting on the desk, this office apparently belongs to someone named James Davidson.  There's no sign of him at present.  His chair sits empty behind the desk and his computer monitor is blank.  The tall bookshelf on one wall mostly features accounting titles.  Everything is neat and orderly.  Hardly what you'd expect given the signs of carnage outside in the hall. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2939}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2943}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the COO's office.  As Chief Operating Officer, Mr. Sizemore must be quite upset about the disaster that's fallen upon this building.  That is, assuming he's not already dead.  His office is still in order, no signs of chaos here.  A desk takes up most of the opposite wall, a leather-bound chair behind it.  The other walls are covered in bookshelves and a small couch sits in one corner. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2940}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2944}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're inside the office of Aegis Global's CIO, Zachary Baumgardner.  There's an expensive-looking leather sofa on one wall and tall bookshelves on the wall behind his desk.  The desk itself is impressive at nearly eight feet in length and finished in a dark cherry that gleams in the soft light coming from the overhead fluorescents.  A company screensaver blinks on the flat-screen monitor that sits atop the desk, casting odd patterns of colored light around the room. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2940}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2945}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 7 (ne)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is Aegis Global's executive boardroom.  A massive mahogany table dominates the room, stretching from one end to the other.  A dozen chairs sit around the table, spaced evenly, three feet between each one.  An overhead projector hangs from the ceiling and a white screen covers one wall.  Violence has disrupted the otherwise austere surroundings.  There are at least a dozen bullet holes in the screen and even more disturbing, the table is marred by a large pool of blood on its surface. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2940}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2946}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (n,exit)}{<238>. .<088>}{Metal pipes line the low ceiling and walls of this maintenance hall.  Rubber tubing stems from several of the pipes, running along the pipes in colors of blue and green.  Steam billows from one of the joints between the pipes and the ceiling, clouding your vision and obscuring what lies further ahead.  The floor consists of steel grating and it clangs with every step you take.  A set of metal stairs lies at one end of the hall, leading up to a steel door that provides an exit from this place. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2813}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2947}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2813}{e}{exit}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2947}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{Small streams of water trickle down the drain lines that run beneath the metal grating of the floor.  Pipes snake along the walls, connecting to various blue and green tubing that disappears into small apertures drilled into the walls just below where they meet the ceiling.  A dim light bulb illuminates the room, shining from the spot where it's mounted on the wall just below the thickest of the metal pipes.  A hissing noise emanates from somewhere further to the north. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2946}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2948}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2948}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{The humidity in this room is cloyingly thick.  Water drips from metal pipes running along the ceiling and walls, the surface of the pipes hot enough to burn you if you touch them.  A gurgling noise comes from the pipes, barely heard over the loud hissing that emanates from the north.  The metal grating beneath your feet is slick with condensation.  You should be careful to watch where you step.  You wouldn't want to slip and fall. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2947}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2949}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2949}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (s)}{<238>. .<088>}{This is the building's boiler room.  A massive black boiler pump takes up the majority of space while pipes lead to and from it in all directions.  The noise in here is so loud that it's hard to hear yourself think.  The pump churns away, heating and circulating water while steam hisses from fittings that connect the pipes to the sides of the pump.  Dim lights hang from the ceiling overhead, offering enough illumination that you can just make your way around. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2948}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {2950}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Level 7}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're inside the office of one of the most powerful men in the world. As CEO of Aegis Global, Calvin Mechler is the Earth's largest supplier of arms and robotics.  The wood paneling on the walls has been polished to a deep shine, matching the rich color of the massive mahogany desk that takes up most of the room.  A floor-to-ceiling bookcase takes up one of these walls while opposite the steel door leading out of this place stands a large steel vault. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
