R {3013}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (e,w,s,n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Blades of grass sway gently in the wind, struggling to survive in the dusty and dry heartland of North America.  Gently rolling hills stretch out towards the horizon.  The soft ground is a comfort beneath your feet, a sure sign that life will continue to flourish here, even if it is only scrubgrass.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
