R {3014}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (d,n,s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Tufts of grass sprout from the gently rolling hills.  Each looks as though it would be considered a weed elsewhere, but out here where water is scarce and the sun bakes the earth, they are a sight for sore eyes.  Small, rolling hills covered in scraggly grass and weeds march towards the horizon in every direction.  Clouds roll across the sky, carrying with them the faint promise of much needed rain.  To the east you barely sense the continuation of the hills.  There is an old leaf-strewn staircase that leads down here. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
