R {3115}{0}{}{Entrance to a swamp (e,leave)}{1}{You stand at the beginning of a dusty old track. Gazing to the east you see the track continues and begins to weave through the thick and wet marshland of the swamp. A billboard rests here and if you choose to you could leave the swamp area. }{Dundee Poachers}{dundee1}{}{}{1.000}{1}
