R {3116}{0}{<238>}{A jeep track (ne,se,w,e,s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are standing on a dry and rocky track that weaves through the swamp. It is quite a simple track but has pools of engine oil splattered all over the track. Hunting season has created a high traffic volume leaving the track resembling the crater covered surface of the moon. The occasional glimpse of a flowing creek can be seen as you peer into the swamp. A flock of egrets fly across the front windscreen while a bask of crocodiles scurry across the track into the opposing swamp. A jeep filled with hunters rockets past you at unnecessary speed leaving you covered in dirt and disgusting swamp residue. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
