R {3117}{0}{<228>}{Edge of the swamp (ne,se,e,n,s)}{<228>* *<088>}{This dark and dank swamp is quite disgusting. It stinks like a pickled herring and penetrates your nostrils with violent energy. The air is foggy and makes it difficult to breathe. There is evidence of hunting season with gunshot residue scattered over the swamp floor. The sound of native birds swish through the swamp completely shattering your confidence. Every direction you take could potentially land you in a creek, on a track or trampling through more swamp. The swamp is enclosed by an extremely tall rocky cliff face, it is far too tall to climb. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
