R {3204}{0}{<238>}{A hunters camp (se,e,w,n,s)}{<238>, .<088>}{You are standing at the entrance to quite a large camp ground. The place you stand is a large open area that has an exit to the east leading you into the swamp. To the east, south and southeast the large open area of the camp continues. There is an entrance to the north into a tent but you are not able to determine the nature of this tent from here. There are some large logs in the center of the open area that can be used as a place to sit, there is nothing else of interest in this section of the camp. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
