R {3205}{0}{<238>}{Hunters tent (s)}{H}{This tent is quite disgusting. There are rotting carcases laid all over the floor with only their heads removed. Blood stains coat the floor around the carcasses. A large table with some seat benches rests in the center of the tent and it also is coated in blood stains. The outskirts of the tent contain racks and racks of weapons, ammunition and a collection of other hunting requirements. There is an exit to the south leading back into the camp grounds. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3204}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {3206}{0}{<238>}{A hunters camp (e,ne,s,n)}{<238>, `<088>}{This is the most southeastern section of the camps open area positioned in the center of the camp. The open area extends to the north, east and northeast. Some logs to sit and rest on are available in the center of the camp. There is an entrance into a large tent to the south but you cannot make out the significance of this tent from here. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3204}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
