R {3207}{0}{<138>}{Dundee shop (n)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{This tent is the camps local shop or convenience store. A large wooden bench is just inside the entrance and a large curtain has been erected to hide the contents of the store. A few display items are present on the counter in an attempt to persuade you to buy them. You can venture back to the central camp grounds by heading north out of this tent. }{Dundee Poachers}{dundee_shop}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3206}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {3208}{0}{<238>}{A hunters camp (nw,se,e,w,s,n)}{<238>, `<088>}{The most southeastern section of the camps open area is quite vacant. There is nothing here apart from a few logs that have been slightly carved out to resemble a chair and placed towards the middle of the camp. To the east you can make out a large wooden platform that appears to be a ferry terminal. The south and southeast offer entrances to some large tents with unknown contents. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3206}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {3209}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
