E {3212}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {3209}{0}{<238>}{Camp triage (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This tent is where medical patients are brought to initially for treatment from the camps medics, from here they are transported to the medical center. Medical staff are working away on the victims of the wild beasts present in the swamp and the occasional motor vehicle accident. The odd scream can be heard as new patients are rushed to a bed and provided with some pain relief. You can exit this tent to the north. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3208}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {3210}{0}{<238>}{Mechanical workshop (nw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The smell of oil and gasoline in this tent is intoxicating. A couple of jeeps are up on stands to be worked on by the camps mechanics. The outskirts of the tent are lined with spare parts and large tool cabinets used to repair the beaten up jeeps. An exit presents itself to the northwest. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3208}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {3211}{0}{<238>}{Dusty path (e,w)}{4}{To the west you can make out the campgrounds. There is a large fireplace in the center of the grounds and some benches for weary hunters to rest up. The ground is a dusty gravel path and it continues to the east. You will need to venture further along the path to gain access to the thick swamp. }{Dundee Poachers}{dundee4}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3208}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {3216}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {3212}{0}{<238>}{A hunters camp (ne,sw,w,e,n,s)}{<238>. ^<088>}{You stand in the most northeastern section of the camps centralized open area. To the west, south and southwest the open area extends further. Toward the center of the camp are some large logs that have been carved into seats for tired hunters to take a load off. To the east and northeast are entrances into some large tents and to the north is a dust path. What is available inside is not able to be determined from here. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
