R {3218}{0}{<238>}{Medical tent (sw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the medical camps medical centre where recently treated patient come to rest and be monitored by the camps nursing staff. You approximate forty to fifty beds in this tent. Nurses run around frantically and screams of agony echo throughout the tent. There are buckets filled with blood-soaked hospital gowns in the corner of the tent. You can exit to the southwest back into the camp grounds. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
