R {3401}{0}{<238>}{A jeep track (se,ne,n,s,w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are standing on a dry and rocky track that weaves through the swamp. It is quite a simple track but has shredded tire rubber scattered all over it. Hunting season has created a high traffic volume leaving the track with more potholes than an acne infested teenager. The occasional rusty shell of a jeep can be seen as you peer into the swamp. A flock of hawks fly across the front windscreen while a knot of toads leap across the track into the opposing swamp. A jeep filled with hunters hurtles past you at insane speed leaving you covered in dirt and disgusting swamp residue. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
