R {3526}{0}{<148>}{A flowing creek (nw,ne,w,e,n)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{This part of the creek is slim and narrow. Looking downstream you can see reptiles crossing the creek and the occasional osprey dives into the water for a chance at catching a fish. At first glance the creek is quite shallow but visibility deteriorates towards the middle. The odd carcass can be seen floating downstream as it bobs up and down on the waters surface. Through the corner of your eye you see a large snake slither into the water. An ear piercing noise from a powerful boat engine can be heard in the distance as a boat speeds down the creek. }{Dundee Poachers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
