R {3567}{0}{}{Front room of a Trailer Home (n)}{ }{You find yourself in what looks like it might have once been the front room of a small trailer home.  It is full of dust and debris, but for the most part, it is intact.  Up above you can see the hole you came through to get down here.  The edges of the hole are so rotted that you don't think it is feasible to try to climb back out.  There seems to be some rotted furniture in here and a door on the south wall. }{Buried Trailer}{buried_trailer}{}{}{1.000}{1}
