R {3568}{0}{}{Front room of a Trailer Home (s)}{ }{The north end of this room is dark, you see what might have once been a glass display case which is shattered.  A fine dining table is missing a leg in the center of the room.  There's a door on the west wall and an intact mirror on the north wall.  You also see a few windows. }{Buried Trailer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
