R {3569}{0}{}{Kitchen of a Trailer Home (w,e)}{ }{You enter what you recognize to be the kitchen to the house.  Beetles scurry for cover at your presence.  There's a door to your east and one to the north.  A counter separates the kitchen from the living room west of here.  The sight of the kitchen makes you feel ill.  The sink is enough to turn your stomach on its own before you notice the rusted refrigerator against the east wall. }{Buried Trailer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
