R {3570}{0}{}{Living Room of a Trailer Home (n,w,e)}{ }{At the west end of the room, you find the remains of various kinds of electronic equipment and more deteriorated furniture.  A door to the west is open, but you can see that the ceiling in that room is collapsed and that there is no way for you to enter it.  There is  also a door to the northwest.  North is another open doorway; it looks like it leads to the bathroom. }{Buried Trailer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
