R {3571}{0}{}{Storeroom of a Trailer Home (s)}{ }{You see a small storage room.  The rusted metal remains of what were a clothes washer and dryer sit nuzzled into a niche in the wall.  There is a great deal of debris on the floor. }{Buried Trailer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
