R {3572}{0}{}{Beetle Den (climb)}{ }{You are in the musty storage area beneath the trailer house.  This place is crawling with bugs.  It must be beetle-bug grand central station!  You have to keep yourself moving just to keep them off of you.  You cannot see anything but dirt and bugs down here.  Squinting through the darkness you see the hole up above that you fell from. }{Buried Trailer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
