R {3577}{0}{}{Pond Street (n,s,hole)}{<108>H<088>}{This is a quiet place.  There is a serene little pond with a tiny waterfall flowing down from some piled granite rocks.  A few tortoises lounge about in the warm sun, keeping their minds open and free of worries.  Oddly, there is a manhole here.  Odder yet, it seems to be lacking its cover.  Oddest yet, it bobs up and down on waves of the the pond like a water lily.  How odd! }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
