R {3581}{0}{}{A Room in the Void! (portal)}{ }{This is a warning for newbies.  Go back.  The entry area is designed for level 15-25 players, and it gets much more dangerous beyond.  Also, this is the non-quest entry to the Land.  Since the quest isn't likely to be finished, the other entries, while active, are only worth going to for the THRILL that you get by playing those particular rooms.  HeHe.  As things stand, Tiro's plans were about 2/3rds complete but several of the main quest areas were still unfinished.  Since the area had swollen to nearly 800 rooms, Tiro decided to throw it open.  Its monsters are unusual and provide unique and valuable items.  Well, have fun!  Look at the portal for more information.  And use the portal to return to Chaos if you are under 15, though of course there are no guarantees even if you are over 15. To continue: say land If you're high level, you can 'say land2' }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
