R {3953}{0}{<178>}{-= North Gate =- (s,leave)}{<278>#<138>L<278>#<088>}{You stand at the northern entrance to the City of Wayhaven. The gateway passes through a huge stone wall between two tall towers. Far to the north you see the icecapped peaks of the northern mountains, and within the city to the south you see and hear the thousands of people from across the realm that live and work within these stone walls. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3952}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
