R {3954}{0}{<238>}{Plains (n,s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Plains The plains seem to stretch on as far as your eyes can see.  The grass sways in the breeze and wavy patterns appear all over the place.  You notice some light tracks but you have no idea where they lead.  The cloudless skies stretch in all directions without fault.  Further to the west you see that the plains continue.  To the southeast stand the walls of the colossal city of Wayhaven.  There is no way to enter at this point, however you think you can see gates both further south and further east. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
