R {3957}{0}{<278>}{-= Garden Way =- (n,s,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{You are on Gardenway road, which leads towards Everlynd Park, and south towards Arcadia Boulevard.  This section of town is remarkably clean, and the buildings you see tell you very few paupers live in this area.  There is a small stone path leading to the west. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3938}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
