R {3982}{0}{<278>}{-= Roseway Road =- (enter,e)}{<278>[<238>E<278>-<088>}{Roseway Road leads east here through the Garden District of the fine City of Wayhaven. This section of town seems to be populated by the richer citizens, as the streets are free of trash and the buildings are all clean. There is an open archway to the south leading to a huge estate on the south side of the street.  The road dead-ends here at the western wall of the city. }{Bell Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3981}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
