R {4004}{0}{<148>}{-<*>- A Shimmering pond -<*>- (sw,n,e)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{-<*>- A Shimmering pond -<*>- As you venture along the path, a break in the trees reveals a pond you hadn't noticed before.  You can't help but take a few moments to admire it.  Rays of sunshine dance effortlessly around a cluster of white waterlilies.  A family of Great Purple Hairstreak butterflies gather to bathe in the cool water.  At the north end of the pond there appears to be a small well. }{Great Well of Crenda}{great_well_of_crenda}{}{}{1.000}{1}
