R {4005}{0}{<238>}{-<*>- A Small well -<*>- (s)}{<238>(<148>~<238>)<088>}{-<*>- A Small well -<*>- A small stone well stands here.  Unfortunately, Father Time has not seen it in his heart to protect this former majestic being. Years of wind and rain have destroyed the fragile foundation of what was once considered the 'Great Well of Crenda'.  You weep tearfully at the sight of this once mighty well, now all but forgotten. It looks like you could climb down it. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
