R {4068}{0}{<278>}{-= Park Avenue =- (n,s,enter)}{<238> E <088>}{This is the end of Park Avenue, in the heart of the richest section of town. The Avenue leads north from here.  To the south a towering bell tower looms into the sky.  A lovely fountain graces the small courtyard here, surrounded by fine houses.  One particularly large house, a mansion actually, stands to the east.  Money was not used sparingly in its construction. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
