R {4069}{0}{<238>}{Campanile (n,door)}{<238>]<138>D<238>[<088>}{A tall, sleek building stands apart from the other buildings. Noted as Wayhaven's only bell tower, it is one of the most beautiful structures here.  Its exquisite design and construction is only slightly overpowered by the euphoric cloud that wafts over the city when the bell tolls.  A small metal door is in the side. }{Bell Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
