R {4071}{0}{<278>}{-= Clean Alley =- (w)}{<278>- -<088>}{As your eyes strain against the gloom, you find yourself in a clean but featureless passageway.  A lattice looms to the east.  The gap back to Iceview Avenue is vaguely lit by the light spilling down that wide but soulless boulevard.  For some reason you feel totally at peace in this small space. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3947}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4072}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4072}{0}{<278>}{-= A Fountain Square =- (e,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You find yourself in a beautiful, sun-swept square, a lovely fountain in the center of the cobblestoned expanse, its pure blue, bubbling, chilled waters spraying upward, wafting a fine mist over the roses clawing their way up the lattices to east and west.  Lime-white walls are to north and south.  You wonder who would have spent the money and time to create such a beautiful oasis in this sea of commerce!  A lovely balcony is overhead. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4071}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
