R {4081}{0}{<278>}{-= Trade Way =- (n,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{Trade Way bends north to Unicorn Way and east towards the river and the Toll Path here.  While the building to the south clearly houses another of the Trade District's stolid and successful businesses, the buildings to the east seem slightly more dilapidated.  To the west you can see a tall, white, criss-cross lattice covered with blooming flowers.  Their smell fills the road with a powerful and lovely fragrance.  Or is that smell the smell of money!? }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
