R {4082}{0}{<278>}{-= Trade Way =- (n,s)}{<278> | <088>}{You are on the southern portion of the Trade Way, the most important street in the Trade District.  Solid and respectable buildings loom to east and west.  The street continues on to the south while the intersection with Unicorn Way is just to the north. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
