R {4084}{0}{<278>}{A Neat Pathway (n,s)}{<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>}{A neat pathway is paved with colored stones.  Its surface glimmers when the sun hits it, sending glints of light dancing off into the surrounding trees.  There is a border of flowering shrubs on either side, their fragrance filling the air with a pleasant scent.  The flowers are a flamboyant purple with blue centers.  A bit to the north is a garden gate which has been painted white.  Tall silver oak trees surround the fence which contains the whole garden.  A small silver plaque is set on the left side of the path. }{The Angel Garden}{angel_garden}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4070}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4085}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4085}{1024}{<278>}{A Neat Pathway (n,s)}{<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>}{The pathway goes to the north and south.  North, there is a neat, white garden gate.  The posts on either side rise up to form an arch overhead.  The posts are carved interestingly and each has an angel perched atop near the beginning of the arch.  The pathway is paved with brightly colored stones which provide a contrast to the white of the fence.  Glints of light sparkle off the paving stones whenever a source is provided, sending them dancing about merrily upon the surrounding shrubberies.  Tall silver oak trees stand outside the fence. }{The Angel Garden}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4084}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4086}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4086}{0}{<278>}{Inside the Gate (n,s)}{<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>}{Inside the gate of the Angel Garden, the path is paved with small, colorful stones which glint when light hits them.  The white painted gate with its angels is to the south.  Each side of the path is bordered by low growing shrubs, their flowers a flamboyant purple with blue centers.  Not too far away, in any direction, tall silver oak trees stand silent watch. }{The Angel Garden}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
