R {4100}{0}{<238>}{Lally's Pub (n)}{<238>[P]<088>}{The collective aura of despair in this room tells you that you're in a seedy pub almost before you walk through the door. The floor and counter are dirty, as are the drinking glasses, waitresses, and most of the clientele. The walls are crammed with gaudy knickknacks: rusted farming implements, old bottles, stuffed game animal heads enchanted to grin stupidly at customers and occasionally break into song, even a magic portrait. The menu is brightly painted above the bar: @*@*@*@*@*@*@*@ Welcome to Lally's Pub! @*@*@*@*@*@*@*@ @   Fruit Juice                 :      20 coins       @ @   Grog                        :      50 coins       @ @   Coffee                      :      250 coins      @ @   Wayhaven Whiskey            :      300 coins      @ @   Grain Alcohol               :      1000 coins     @ @*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@*@ }{Lally's Pub}{lallys_pub}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
