R {4181}{0}{}{Fountain of Body mansion (w)}{ }{Fountain Exiting just off the courtyard, you have come to a large fountain made of white marble.  The fountain has a large base which holds water.  The water seems to siphon through a statue of a little boy, and the little boy spits the water out.  The water falls safely back into the base to start the cycle again. }{Body Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
