R {4182}{0}{}{A Courtyard (w,n)}{ }{A Courtyard Your feet sink into the plush grass of the courtyard.  To the west a white gazebo shines in the sun.  It looks like a nice place to rest and enjoy the estate.  Sounds of birds chirping can be heard from all around you.  Looking up in the sky you see a couple flying overhead.   }{Body Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
