R {4183}{0}{}{Front door of Body mansion (e,w,s,n)}{ }{You stand at the front door of the Body mansion.  The door is quite large and closed.  Stained glass windows are on either side of the doorframe.  The sounds of birds are off in the distance, and squirrels play in the courtyard to the north.  At the foot of the door is a small doormat. }{Body Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
