R {4184}{0}{}{On a ramp (d,u)}{ }{You are standing on a ramp that rises from the swirling anger of Chaos toward a platform of some sort.  You might be mistaken, but it looks like the kind of platform used for elevated trains. }{Disney World}{disney_world}{}{}{1.000}{1}
