R {4185}{0}{}{Monorail station (d)}{ }{Somehow you aren't surprised to find yourself standing on what appears to be a monorail platform.  You can see the gates where tourists wait to board the monorails that frequent this station.  You can see the monorail track in front of the gates.  There is a sign hanging down from the ceiling here and you can hear some kind of irritating music playing over the public address system.  An exit ramp leads back to Chaos from here. }{Disney World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
