R {4186}{1026}{}{FuNkYtOwN (n,e)}{ }{This is one funky town!  You stand in the middle of the main street surrounded by some of the weirdest things you've ever come across.  To the north is a large building which music emanates from.  Farther ahead in the distance you notice a large track of some sort.  All of the buildings that surround you are painted in some of the ugliest colors you have ever seen. }{Funkytown}{funky_town}{}{}{1.000}{1}
