R {4189}{0}{}{FuNkYtOwN (s,e)}{<238>R<088>}{You have come to what seems to be a large river that flows along the western edge of FuNkYtOwN.  Resting on the river is what appears to be some sort of large rowboat.  Further to the east is a long track that extends high into the air, through the clouds.  The road bends to the south. }{Funkytown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
