R {4190}{0}{}{FuNkYtOwN (e,s,n)}{ }{You have come to the end of the road that runs through FuNkYtOwN.  Back north a track extends high into the air.  To the west a river flows in a northerly direction.  Directly south a rather strange building stands alone.  It looks almost as if it should be some type of palace, but it seems incredibly small to be one.  To the east lies yet another building.  It seems to be some type of Kung Fu Dojo. }{Funkytown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
