R {4192}{0}{}{FuNkY dOjO (w)}{ }{You are inside some sort of Kung Fu Dojo.  The whole floor is covered in blue mats except for the outer edges.  There are various punching bags and other training devices placed throughout the room.  On a stand, in the corner of the room, is a stereo playing some Carl Douglas songs. }{Funkytown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
