R {4193}{0}{}{FuNkY YmCa (out,n)}{<168>O<088>}{Whoa! This whole YMCA has been converted into one big happening dance club! The disco ball is spinning and the lights are flashing.  You are getting a serious urge to bust a move!  Right now you are standing on the dance floor but farther ahead there is a large stage for the bands that are performing. }{Funkytown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
