R {4194}{0}{}{FuNkY YmCa (stage,s)}{<108>S<088>}{You are standing right next to a couple of extremely LARGE speakers that are currently pumping out some real cool disco music.  The disco ball and lights are providing the special effects to go with the music.  There is also a fog machine spewing out fog to the point that you can hardly make out where the stage is anymore. }{Funkytown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
