R {4196}{0}{}{FuNkY bAcKsTaGe (stage)}{ }{You've managed to find yourself backstage, probably through illegal means. This room could barely pass for a backstage in most places, but then you realize this is just a converted YMCA.  Smack dab in the middle of the room is a stand with a mirror atop it.  There are also some various ropes and lights hanging about, but not much else. }{Funkytown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
