R {4198}{0}{}{abandoned armoury (n)}{ }{You are in the remains of an old, abandoned armoury.  The place is completely covered in dust.  The only thing that has been left behind is the building itself. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
