R {4201}{0}{}{Hallway (se,n)}{ }{You are standing in a hallway.  There are sconces lighting the way.  Your feet seem to sink into the carpet as you linger here.  If the carpet is so soft in the hallway, I bet the room accomodations are even more enjoyable.  You hear faint sounds coming from further down the hallway. }{Hotel Transylvania}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
