R {4203}{0}{}{Murray's bedroom. (w)}{ }{You are standing in a temple.  Murray must have paid some big bucks to have this room personalized!  The walls are decorated with egyptian symbols.  The bed looks more like an altar pushed against the wall.  A window on the outside wall is dressed in gold tapestries. }{Hotel Transylvania}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
