R {4204}{0}{}{A dim hallway (w,e)}{ }{This dim and narrow hallway leads from the cineplex lobby to the theater itself. The walls are high enough that they block your view of the seats and screen, but if you just go further west, you shouldn't have any trouble finding a seat. Just be quick about it. You don't want to miss the beginning! }{Anchorman}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
