R {4205}{0}{}{Anchorman Movie Theater (watch,e)}{<178>W<088>}{You're inside a beautiful movie theater with a huge screen and well over two hundred seats.  A large neon sign hangs just above the screen. Oddly enough, all of the seats are empty at the moment, so feel free to grab the best one you can find and enjoy the classic Will Ferrell comedy, Anchorman. }{Anchorman}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4204}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
