R {4335}{0}{}{Misty forest (s,e)}{M}{The silence of the woods reflect your thoughts of the place. To the north a dense mist is beginning to rise swallowing up the trees of forest like some ravenous beast.  Sadness and despair wash over you once more, leaving you tired and weary of this accursed land. Someone or something has impaled a corpse on a broken lance here, leaving him to die a slow and tortured death.  A grisly warning that these woods are far from safe. }{Abbey}{ravenloft_abbey}{}{}{1.000}{1}
