R {4336}{0}{<238>}{A small forest clearing. (w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{Someone or something seems to have been cutting the trees down here, leaving a number of tree stumps. It looks as though whoever cut down the trees has discovered a dark and gloomy path leading deeper into the dark forest. Whatever befell the woodcutters is impossible to tell but you find yourself hoping they didn't go down that path. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
