R {4337}{0}{<238>}{A silent forest path (se,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{Large and ominous trees tower menacingly above this overgrown path that you tread so warily. As a gentle wind rustles the trees' dying and decaying leaves, you catch glimpses of tiny woodland creatures watching your every step through bloodred, hate-filled eyes. All around is the aura of death and despair mixed with some dark malevolent force that leaves your throat dry with fear. Further to the southeast a single light shines out, the sole beacon of hope in this accursed place. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4336}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4338}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4338}{0}{<238>}{A silent forest path (nw,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The path here turns northwest deeper into the forest and to the east towards what looks like some kind of clearing.  Dark and twisted trees gather by the path and join overhead to form a living tunnel of damp and decaying branches. The stench of rot and death hang heavy in the air here, leaving a lingering bitter taste on your tongue. It almost seems as if the light shining brightly from the clearing has driven these evil and dark trees back from the path, allowing you to pass safely. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4337}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
