R {4339}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (n,s,w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The evil presence of the trees seem to have been pushed back, by the golden light shining out from a large ruined temple, forming a small clearing in this dark and evil forest. Standing here, you feel waves of goodness and hope wash over you as you bask in the light's golden glow. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
