R {4340}{0}{<278>}{The steps of a large temple (enter,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{A wide set of ancient cracked stone steps lead up to a massive iron-bound oaken door.  The door stands ajar, inviting you inside. A carved stone lintel bearing a set of balanced scales rests proudly over the door, proclaiming the deity worshipped inside. From within, a warm golden light spills out through the doorway, offering shelter to weary travellers in this cursed land. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
