R {4341}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (ne,nw,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{The trees seem to have been pushed back by the aura of goodness coming from the ruined temple, forming a circular clearing around the old building. Although the dark mood and feeling of oppression seems to have lifted somewhat, there is still that feeling, lurking in the shadows of your mind, that something truly evil is here. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
