R {4342}{0}{<238>}{A disused forest path (se,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{A bitter breeze whips through the ancient trees clustered by the trackside, causing them to creak and groan in an eerie almost lifelike manner. The reek of decay and mildew is everywhere. To the southeast you can make out a large clearing, inset into which you can clearly see a large temple, from which emanates a bright light. Your only beacon of hope in this accursed place. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4341}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
