R {4343}{0}{<238>}{A disused forest path (se,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{The twisted and rotting trees close in all around here, narrowing this track to a path to little more than 10 feet across. Gnarly branches have knotted and tangled together to form a dark sinewy mass of tangled branches high above your head blotting out the darkened sky above. The creaks and groans of the branches in the breeze echo and reverberate all around you, doing little to lower your ever growing paranoia. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4342}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
