R {4348}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (se,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{This is the northeastern edge of the clearing. It seems strange, although this area is quite close to the temple, the darkness  and feeling of evil cast by the trees seem the strongest here.  Perhaps a great evil was committed here... or perhaps something of great evil was here recently. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
