R {4349}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (s,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{A little to the south you can clearly see the eastern side of the temple. Although time and the elements have not been kind to the the large ruined bell tower, it still serves as a reminder to the dark powers of this domain. Jutting up into the dark sky, it proclaims that there are still small patches of goodness that their darkness cannot overcome. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
