R {4350}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{The eastern wall of the temple looms over you here, dominating the eastern edge of the clearing.  Through the large stained glass windows you can see flicking lights flit across the glass in a mesmeric dance drawing you closer, inviting you to enter the temple.  The feeling of protection and goodness is strongest here and seems to be coming from behind the windows.  Unable to sustain this holy influence, the trees seem to be further away than usual.  }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
