R {4351}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (sw,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{The trees seem to be further back than usual here, creating a small forest meadow. Just in the shadow of the temple is a simple grave  marked by a solitary headstone. Time and the elements have covered the grave with decaying leaves, creating a musty rotting smell.  Pausing for a moment, you utter a silent prayer for this fallen warrior. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
