R {4352}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (w,ne)}{<238>. .<088>}{You find yourself standing at the southeast corner of this clearing. All around you loom dark and menacing trees, swaying and rustling on the breeze. Lying nearby in one of the deep pools of shadow cast by the temple's walls is a gravedigger's shovel, left rusting and forlorn in this nightmarish place. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
