R {4353}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (e,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{Passing along the southern wall of the temple you notice that this section doesn't seem as ruined as you once suspected.  As with the rest of this temple a shimmering golden light spills out, enveloping you in warmth and goodness, waging an eternal war with the darkness of the nearby treeline. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4352}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45424}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4354}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (e,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{Standing midway between the temple and the dark forest, you can't help but awe at the sight of the temple.  Its golden light spills, seeming to push back the dark tide of evil that is this forest. Your mind races at the thought of the power contained within the temple walls, why with this power you feel as if you might heal the evil that infests this land. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45424}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
