R {4355}{0}{<238>}{The edge of a clearing (se,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{From the edge of the clearing, the dark trees seem to tower menancingly over you, forcing you to cautiously walk close to the ancient walls of the temple.  Through the temple's broken windows, a shimmering golden light pours out, illuminating the area and seemingly driving the trees back. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4354}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
