R {4356}{0}{<268>}{The central aisle of the temple (out,e,n,s)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{Your footsteps echo off the hard stone floor of the temple, causing you to whirl around in apprehension as the echos bounce off a pair of massive carved stone columns supporting the roof. Dancing shadows created by the torches fixed to the nearby wall force you to stay constantly alert. To the left and right, ancient wooden pews fill the temple, a sign that once perhaps this temple had a large congregation. Borne on the air is the feeling of reverence and peace, quite at odds with the darker emotions often felt outside this haven.  }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4357}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
