R {4357}{0}{<268>}{The northwestern corner of the temple (e,s)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{Standing amongst the pews in the northwestern corner of the temple, the hair on the back of your neck stands on end as the icy grip of fear clutches at your throat. Maybe it's just your imagination but isn't the air colder here? The shadows created by the torches seem to follow you. It's as though they are not quite strong enough to face the goodness of this place, yet not quite weak enough to be dispelled by it. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4356}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4358}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4358}{0}{<268>}{The northeastern corner of the temple (w,s)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{The glow coming from the altar has lit this whole area, filling it with a soft comforting welcoming glow.  Standing amongst the silent rows of pews, you find your eyes drawn to the wall of the temple and the banners and standards hanging from there.  Relics of a happier time long ago? Or perhaps just futile symbols of the worshippers doomed struggle against the evil and darkness of this land. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4357}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4359}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4359}{0}{<268>}{The central aisle of the temple (e,w,n,s)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{The air here is thick with the sweet smell of burning incense mixed with the acrid smell of smoke from the torches hanging along the temple walls. The source of all this golden light seems to be coming from some mysterious object lying on a black altar in a large transept further to the east. Partially obscuring your view of altar and its contents, are two vast stone columns that rise up into darkness.  Stretching off on either side of the aisle are empty pews that lead off into the gloom, a solemn reminder of the temple's more active past. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4358}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4360}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
