R {4360}{0}{<268>}{The southeastern corner of the temple (w,n)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{The light coming from the altar seems to have warmed this area of the temple driving away the shadows and gloom that is so prevalent in this land. Pausing for a moment you sit down on one of the nearby pews and bask in its warm golden light. Contented and secure, you even manage a contented yawn before standing once more to face whatever perils lurk in this cursed land. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4359}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4361}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4361}{0}{<268>}{The southwestern corner of the temple (e,n)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{Standing amongst the pews in the southwestern corner of the temple, you find youself staring up at the great timber supports that hold the roof some 100 feet above you. How many years must it have taken to create this place, you wonder, and where have all the people gone that so lovingly built this fine building? Perhaps these questions  will be answered further into the temple.  }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4360}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4356}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4362}{0}{<268>}{Before an altar (w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{Illuminating the transept with a warm golden glow is a set of golden scales, resting upon an obsidian altar. There is a strange feeling of calm and peace here, as if this were the eye of some monstrous storm. As you gaze around the room, your eyes fix on the large stained glass window dominating the eastern wall and how the glow from the scales ripples gently across it. After a few moments you manage to tear your eyes away and shake your head to clear it of the aroma of incense that seems to be making you drowsy.  }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4359}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4363}{d}{push altar;d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4363}{0}{}{Stone stairs (d,u)}{ }{Only a small amount of light from the altar above manages to filter down into this dark stone stairway. Particles of dust stirred up by your entry twinkle in the golden light, like little bright flecks. Below you, sturdy stone steps lead down into the darkness, waiting to engulf you. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4362}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4364}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4364}{0}{}{In the crypt (e,s,u,n)}{ }{The light seems inadequate down here, the ever present darkness surrounding you like some fell beast waiting to pounce and devour your soul. The steady drip of water breaks the silence of this tomb and helps to cover the noise of your nervous, heavy breathing. You feel your palms sweat in the certain knowledge that there is something down here and it's watching you with great interest. Within your circle of light, a stone sarcophagus bearing a stone  carving of a knight at repose sits patiently, tempting you to push  it open.  }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4363}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
