R {4365}{0}{}{In the crypt (e,n)}{ }{The steady drip of water on the stone walls and floor in the southwest corner of the crypt serves as a constant reminder of your approaching doom.  The sound seems to bore into you, at first irritating you. It now makes you positively nervous. In your weak light, everything seems much larger and menancing than it did in brighter light. Within your circle of light, a single stone sarcophagus bearing a stone carving of a knight at repose sits patiently, tempting you to push it open. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4364}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4366}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4366}{0}{}{In the crypt (n,w)}{ }{The air here in the in the southeast corner of the crypts is damp and carries the smell of rotting cloth, mixed with various other aromas you don't want to qualify. Much to your relief, you decide the rotting smell must be coming from the tapestry on the southern wall and not from some cursed undead. Now if only you could convince yourself that the waves of fear coming from the north are all in your worried mind. Within your circle of light, a single stone sarcophagus, bearing a stone carving of a knight at repose, sits patiently, tempting you to push it open. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4365}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4367}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4367}{0}{}{In the crypt (e,w,n,s)}{ }{The feeling of fear and danger seems to bear down on you here. Barely able to control your emotions, you just manage to keep them in check. Even your light seems to be making little impression on the darkness that envelops you. Waves of fear emanate from some kind of chamber to the east. Within your circle of light is a stone sarcophagus bearing a stone carving of a knight that is patiently tempting you to push it open.  }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4366}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
