R {4368}{0}{}{In the crypt (s,w)}{ }{A tattered rotting tapestry covers most of the north wall of the crypt here. Images of fabulous beasts almost seem to leap out  at you in your flickering torchlight, causing you to draw back from the wall in fear. The ever present feeling of oppression and fear seems to be emanating from an area south of here. Within your circle of light, a single stone sarcophagus bearing a stone carving of a knight at repose tempts you to push it open.  }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4367}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4369}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4369}{0}{}{In the crypt (e,s)}{ }{Cheered a little by your light reflecting dully off the damp stone walls that form the northwest corner of the crypt, you take time to catch your breath.  The faint feeling that something is nearby, watching you, still lingers, causing you a mild moment of panic in which you spin around to check that there's nothing else here. Within your circle of light, a sarcophagus bearing a stone carving of a knight at repose sits patiently, tempting you to push it open. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4368}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4364}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4370}{0}{}{An earthen chamber (u)}{ }{The scent of rotting and decaying flesh fills the stale air here, nearly forcing you to retch. Recovering your senses you look around to see that you are in some sort of small earthen chamber.  Fresh rents and scratches  too numerous to count scour the walls, almost as if something has been  trying to dig its way out.  Tattered pieces of cloth lie scattered on the earthen floor. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4351}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4371}{0}{}{A silent bell chamber (d)}{ }{The great bell of the temple has been cracked and sundered from its supports, felling it to its current resting place on the stone floor of this tower. An eerie moan rises and falls as the wind whips through the cracks in the bell and does little to calm your already bad nerves. A skeleton, dressed in tattered rags, lies trapped by one leg under the rim of the bell. You pause a moment and wince at how long this poor soul must have taken to die, trapped up here. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4349}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4372}{0}{}{Before a bone throne (w)}{ }{The dank smell of death hangs like a shroud here, smothering anything alive in an embrace of hopelessness. In fear, you find yourself glancing around the room. Your eyes, darting from the rows of graves set into the walls, to the large mounds of bone resting in the corners of this room, finally coming to rest on the bone throne resting atop a large dais, where a shattered stone coffin once rested. The sense that something truly evil resides here is overpowering.  Perhaps now might be a good time to run. }{Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4367}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

