R {4396}{0}{<238>}{Lonely path (e,sw)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are lost on a path somewhere east of Barovia.  You can see that the hills rise to the east, terminating in an abrupt cliff and the choppy, cold sea. The wind flares around you, and you can hear the loud crescendos of thunder coming nearer every few minutes. Heavy black clouds cover the sun, blocking what scarce light filters through the thick forest canopy.  The path starts to climb up the back of the sea cliffs here, and you can see up ahead a dark manor house precariously perched on the edge of the cliff. }{Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
