R {4398}{0}{}{Courtyard (e,w,n,s)}{ }{Worn stone steps lead from the rusted wrought-iron gate hanging by one hinge into the courtyard. The area is thick with weeds and wind-blown debris. A small fountain at the center of the courtyard is filled with brackish water and decaying leaves. The main wing of Schloss Mordenheim is north, while the guest and servant wings are west and east, respectively. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{ravenloft_mordenheim}{}{}{1.000}{1}
