R {4401}{0}{}{Schloss Mordenheim Reception Hall (rightstairs,leftstairs,e,}{ }{The hardwood floor of this room is thick with dust, yet it is well-traveled. Several sets of footprints lead from the main entrance to the twin staircases that are set against the back wall, leading up to the right and to the left. There is also a room to either side, right and left. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
