R {4408}{0}{}{Sitting Room (e,nw)}{ }{An arched entrance opens into this room. The room itself is dominated by a massive fireplace that is thick with cobwebs. The mantle is covered with dust. On the mantle are several silver candlesticks and a large portrait of a young man and woman in formal dress. The man has a serious, aristocratic look and is distinguished by a scar over his left eye. The lower half of his left ear is missing. The woman is a dark-haired beauty with a small birthmark on her upper lip. She wears a flowing white dress and carries a bouquet. Beside it is a smaller portrait of a young girl with blonde hair and wide, dark eyes. The walls of the room are hung with heavy tapestries whose designs are obscured by dust and cobwebs. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45158}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45153}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4409}{0}{}{Hallway (s,d)}{ }{This hallway is split into two separate landings. Crossing from the kitchen to the dining room requires descending one of the two staircases and mounting the other one. The walls are hung with portraits of the famous scientists Victor once idolized. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4410}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4401}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4410}{0}{}{Kitchen (w,n)}{ }{Filthy, fine china dishes and dirty silver cutlery, pots and pans encrusted with the remains of half-eaten meals, and smudged glasses are haphazardly piled on the shelves and in the stained sink. There is a water pump sitting right beside the sink. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4409}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4411}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4411}{0}{}{Dining Room (u,n,e)}{ }{Dingy white tablecloths, stained with reddish brown blotches, cover tables that have been moved at right angles to one another. Thus placed, the tables create a cross-shaped workspace bisecting the room into four equal quadrants. Glowing coals in the fireplace ward off the chill that seeps through the mansion. There is a strange burnt fragrance in the air that does not seem to come from the fireplace. There is a staircase at the back of the room. On the tables are gleaming surgical instruments and the half-dissected body of a young woman, a large slice carved out of her right thigh and hindquarter.  Dominating one corner of the room are several high- backed wooden dining chairs, and a device connecting them to each other. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4410}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4412}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
