R {4413}{0}{<248>}{Laboratory (e,s,d)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The room is brightly lit by glowing glass globes and warmed by the coals burning in the fireplace. It appears to be a laboratory. French glass doors in one wall lead to a tiny balcony overlooking the lower courtyard. Several laboratory tables are lined up along the middle of the room. Along the wall, two windows provide a view of the Sea of Sorrows. Six brass bathtubs, each covered with a glass lid and filled with a pale green liquid, sit beneath the windows. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
