R {4415}{0}{<238>}{Library (w,e)}{<238>"""<088>}{A long table and chair sit in front of the large fireplace whose light glows upon the bookshelves. Scattered across the table are handwritten notes. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
