R {4416}{0}{<278>}{A Circular Staircase (w,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This staircase leads up from the library, and it follows the inner wall of the mansion's tower. As it rises, it circles past the locked doors of tiny cells. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
