E {4417}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4417}{0}{}{Circular Staircase (u,d,s)}{ }{This staircase leads up and down as it follows the inner wall of the mansion's tower. You see a cell here, which appears to be the prison home of a young woman. Straw covers the floor of her cell and a bowl sits in one corner. The door to the  cell is slightly ajar. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
