R {4418}{0}{}{Bedroom Chambers (n,w)}{K}{Furnished with a double bed, couch, wardrobe, commode and writing desk, this room is certainly well lived in. Dust recently disturbed floats in the air.  You see a small cell to the north. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
