R {4419}{0}{}{Upper Courtyard (e)}{ }{This courtyard looks out upon the Schloss Mordenheim. Winds continuously sweep the area. To your west are  three stairs leading to a door. To the east is the bedroom chamber of Victor Mordenheim. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
