R {4421}{0}{}{Attic (n)}{ }{This room is divided for most of its length by a one-way, glass wall. Toys are scattered about, thick with dust. A blackboard is propped up against a window. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4420}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4422}{0}{}{Lightning Tower (d)}{ }{This room is dominated by an oversized lab table below a rod in the center of the room.  Black cords snake from the rod to a battery of panels on the walls. Other lines run from the same machines to the table. A hissing sound and a strange smell fills the air. Sparks crackle and leap from the machinery. Vials of chemicals and oversized syringes line the benches. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4420}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4423}{0}{<238>}{path (w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are on a deserted road.  Your nervous senses notice strange noises and shadows in the trees around you.  The place here is quite evil and very intimidating.  You continue along the path hoping to find a friendlier place. }{Ravenloft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45162}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4424}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4424}{0}{<238>}{path (w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The road is very silent here.  You can make out lights to the west along with a faint sobbing.  It looks like a small village.  Eastward, the road winds into a forboding forest with large trees and dark shadows. }{Ravenloft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4423}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4425}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4425}{0}{<278>}{town road (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road winds its way into a small town to the west.  You can see that it can only hold a small population, maybe about 30 people.  The fear is very thick here and it hangs about you like a fog.  The road also leads into a dark forest to the east.  On the side of the road you notice a small sign that looks as if it has been clawed by animals. }{Barovia}{ravenloft_barovia}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4424}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4426}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4426}{0}{<278>}{road (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are at the entrance to the village of Barovia.  The first thing you notice is that there are no people.  The lamp posts shine brightly on the cobblestone street, but not a soul is to be seen.  The wind wisps by in soft bursts blowing leaves across your path.  In the very, very far reaches of your vision, you can make out a large and imposing castle high on a cliff to the northwest.  The castle itself chills you as the night grows darker and colder. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4425}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4427}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4427}{0}{<278>}{road (n,s,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are at an intersection of the road with paths going north, east and west.  The lamp on the corner burns brightly, though coldly. To the north and west you see the cobblestone street go farther into the town.  To the south is a small house with the front door swinging off its hinges in the wind.  You hope to find somebody in this town soon. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4426}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
