R {4428}{0}{<238>}{house (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand in a deserted house.  It seems quite odd that a house so near the main street is abandoned, yet here it is.  The room is very dark, and you can see that the walls and roof are rotted.  There is broken wood covering the floor along with broken glass. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4427}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4429}{0}{<278>}{street (n,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are on a cobblestone street north of an intersection.  You see the road continue to the north with a few houses on either side.  It gets very dark to the north while to the south, you see it's a little brighter.  A cold wind continues to blow around, chilling you slightly. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4427}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4430}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4430}{0}{<278>}{street (n,s,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{This street seems very lonely, you don't see anyone around.  There are houses to the east and west, though they don't look welcoming at all.  The road stretches to the south and also leads north.  You can faintly hear someone sobbing to the east. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4429}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
