R {4431}{0}{<238>}{house (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This was once a home to a kind and loving family.  No one knows what happened to them, one day they simply disappeared.  Now the house is beaten, torn, and dark.  There are holes chewed in the walls and the smell here is awful. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4430}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4432}{0}{<238>}{house (u,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This house is well lit, though what is illuminated is hardly spectacular. Most of the windows are boarded up and there are broken pieces of furniture scattered about.  You see a small wooden staircase that leads to the upper level.  You hear crying emanating from the upstairs. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4430}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4433}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4433}{0}{<238>}{upstairs (d)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a small room, more like an attic.  It is very musty and damp, and it is obvious that nobody has cared for this place in a long time. Through the hazy darkness, you see a woman sitting in a rocking chair, crying. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4432}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4434}{0}{<278>}{street end (n,s,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are at the end of the street, stopping at a dark and evil forest. You see a mist hanging over the ground here, seeping in from the forest.  You stand very alert here because there is no sound to be heard and it is rather dark.  To the east and west of the road stand two houses, if you can consider them houses at all. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
