R {4435}{0}{<238>}{house (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a small house that is very run-down, almost to the point of collapsing.  It is lit by a small fire in the fireplace, and you can see only a small table and chair.  An older couple lives in this home from the look of things. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4434}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4436}{0}{<238>}{house (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This house is very small, being that it's on the outskirts of town.  The inside is rather nice, compared to the run-down outside appearance.  The place is lit by a small fireplace and smells musty and damp.  There is only a small bed here, shoved against the far wall, near the fireplace. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
