R {4580}{0}{<238>}{sidestreet (n,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The sidestreet makes a sharp turn to the west.  It ends at a building that seems boarded up.  There is a sign creaking above the doorway, blowing in the wind.  Litter covers the walk and you see an armoury to the south. The main road is to the north. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
