R {4581}{0}{<238>}{armoury (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in Barovia's armoury.  The walls are bare and there is nothing for sale.  There is only one man here and he greets you with a warm smile.  He seems rather forgetful as his attention is quickly averted from you.  Perhaps you should do something to get his attention. }{Barovia}{ismark}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4580}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4582}{0}{<278>}{road (n,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are in the middle of town now.  A single shaft of light thrusts out into the street from the doorway to the north.  There is a sign hanging above the entrance.  You hear voices coming from inside.  Quite a contrast to the side of the building you can see to the south.  The  street continues on to the east and west. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
