R {4586}{0}{<238>}{house (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This house is in a shambles.  The walls are rotten and exhibit gaping holes.  The roof is leaky and looks about to fall.  There is wood scattered about the place and you smell a stench of animal refuse.  It is very cold in here and you can see your breath. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4585}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4587}{0}{<238>}{stables (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the stables of Barovia.  The smell here is very overpowering as you would expect.  There are stalls for about ten horses but they all seem to be empty.  There is hay and straw covering the floor, and various horse equipment scattered about. The room is not very dark, but quite musty. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4585}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4588}{0}{<278>}{street (n,s,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You stand on the outskirts of the town now.  You still are amazed by the utter silence of the place, like the whole village was in a vacuum. Up in the night sky, the moon shines weakly, looking rather ominous. To the south is a large house with a small courtyard in front.  You can see the main part of the town to the east and a church to the west.  To the north stands a two story building that seems to be in much better repair than the surrounding structures.  You see no people walking the streets as you would expect in a village like this. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4585}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
