R {4590}{0}{<238>}{foyer (n,w,e,exit)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The antechamber of the theatre is ornate, spotless and above all, immense.  Magnificent mahogany double doors to the north lie at the end of a crimson carpet and lead into the stalls.  Two sculptures rest on marble pedestals either side of the carpet in the center of the room.  A grandiose crystal chandelier containing dozens of flickering candles hangs suspended from the ceiling above you.  The foyer continues to the east and west. }{Theatre of Souls}{ravenloft_theatre_of_souls}{}{}{1.000}{1}
