R {4591}{0}{<278>}{foyer (stairs,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The antechamber of the theatre is ornate, spotless and above all, immense.  A wide marble staircase winds up and around to the second level of the theatre and the balcony.  Beside the staircase on the western wall rests a collection of ancient paintings, each cordoned off by red velvet rope that hangs in stark contrast to the alabaster marble wall.  The foyer continues to the east. }{Theatre of Souls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
