R {4596}{0}{}{balcony (s)}{ }{The aisle ends here at the balcony railing.  Rows of seats stretch out to either side of you but as in the stalls below, they are empty.  The vaulted ceiling rises above you and exhibits an enormous mural that stretches from wall to wall.  Several boxes run along the walls at the same level as the balcony, providing an even better view of the stage than that which you currently enjoy. }{Theatre of Souls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
