R {4599}{0}{<278>}{street intersection (s,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{This is the outskirts of the village.  The town itself lies to the east, while the town church is to the west.  Winding its way south, the road moves into a shadowed forest, quickly turning southwest out of view. A misty fog covers the ground here.  It looks like it's coming from the forest itself to the south.  In any event, the streets are still deserted. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4588}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4600}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
