R {4615}{0}{<228>}{-=( Hidden path )=- (n,sw)}{<228>( *<088>}{Large ancient willow trees break away revealing a small hidden path leading further south into the wilderness.  Bursts of wind blow through the trees shaking their foliage back and forth, and morning dew spreads across the leaves and ground of the forest.  With each breath you take, your lungs seemed replenished by the cool crisp air. }{Masque}{ravenloft_masque}{}{}{1.000}{1}
