R {4622}{0}{<238>}{gypsy camp (w,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the middle of a gypsy camp.  The clearing is brightly lighted by a large campfire in the center of the camp.  At the outer edge of the light, you can still see the forest.  You feel like you are being watched by something and you feel a sudden chill in the air. There are a few gypsies usually here.  They are a merry people and very much enjoy dancing and singing.  You see a smaller clearing  west of here. }{Ravenloft - Svalich Woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
