R {4623}{0}{<228>}{forest (e)}{<228>( *<088>}{You are at the end of a small trail. The trees are very intimidating here, but the gypsies lighten the mood with their dancing and singing.  Going to the west will land you in a small gypsy wagon.  You see light coming from the wagon and know someone must be home. }{Ravenloft - Svalich Woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
