R {4646}{0}{<248>}{The manor den (n,nw)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This working area was used for the business affairs of the manor.  All matters of business were recorded or considered here.  The room was once very proper with a small table and a few couches. But now it is in despair. A doorway leads northwest. }{Ebonbane}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
