R {4706}{0}{<238>}{Mountain trail (nw,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The forest grows much denser along this path as it inclines farther northwest.  To the east, the path is much more level where the edge of the great mountain range ends.  The forest is extremely thick along the trail making it impossible to travel haphazardly through the trees. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4705}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
