R {4707}{0}{<238>}{Mountain trail (se,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{A brisk breeze blows down from the snow peaked mountains and runs along this trail.  A thick mountain forest grows at the base of the range, through which this small trail travels.  The trail continues to the west and takes a steep decline to the southeast. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
