R {4708}{0}{<238>}{Mountain trail (nw,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{Sounds of birds, crickets and other wildlife come from all directions in this mountain forest.  The tall snow peaked mountains appear quite majestic, and extend as far as the eye can see.  Far to the northwest, the fabled Mount Perplexus stands higher than most within the range, with its twin peaks extending high in the air.  The trail extends to the northwest and east. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
