R {4709}{0}{<238>}{Mountain trail (se,n,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{This small open area is not large enough for camping, but does allow for a place of rest while traversing through the mountain forest.  The canopy of trees open slightly, allowing for a beautiful view of the mountains above.  The canopy grows much thicker as the trail extends to the west.  The trail takes a slight decline to the southeast, while a branch also continues to the north. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
