R {4712}{0}{<238>}{Forest trail (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{The forest trail grows dark along this thin section.  The trees are too thick along the trail sides, but the trail does continue to the north and south.  The canopy high above blocks out all but tiny rays of sunlight.  Through a small break to the northwest you see the snowcapped peak of a tall mountain.  A large log lies against the western side of the path. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
