R {4713}{0}{<238>}{Forest Path (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{The dark trail grows slightly wider as it continues southward.  Sounds of busy market place can be heard coming through the forest, although the trees are far too dense to detect their source.  The dirt along the trail is hard packed, giving the trail a well traveled appearance. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4712}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
