R {4714}{0}{<238>}{Forest Path (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{You hear the sounds of birds and other wildlife as you walk along this forest path.  The forest on each side of the trail is very thick, and won't allow you to pass into the woods.  Further to the south, you see what appears to be a town gate. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4713}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
