R {4715}{0}{<238>}{Town entrance of Angelo (n,s)}{<238>|@|<088>}{Stepping through the forest, you have come to a large gate leading into a small town.  The gate stands open, but swings with an eerie squeal as the wind blows it gently.  From each side of the gate, a large brick wall appears to extend across the northern border of the town.  Taking a glance southward down the cobblestone road, it would appear that this town is going through hard times.  The buildings are in disrepair, and stray bits of debris fly across the road as they are blown in the gentle breeze.  One can only wonder what has caused such grief upon this small town. }{Angelo}{angelo}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4714}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
