R {4716}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (n,s,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{The wind howls as it travels along the cobblestone streets of Angelo. An eerie squeak can be heard from the gate just north as it echoes off the brick walls.  A bit of debris floats in the wind, occasionally bouncing off the cobblestones.  Looking down the street, you see an occasional citizen traveling in and out of buildings, but they scurry away as you look their direction.  Just to the west is a run-down shack that appears to be a guard post.  The road continues south into the heart of Angelo. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
