R {4717}{0}{<238>}{Town of Angelo (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This small wooden shack appears to be where guards relax while still at the ready to guard the city gate.  The padded benches along the walls are used for sitting.  The boards that make up the walls are in bad repair and there are no windows within the walls.  A strange-looking table sits in the middle of the room where guards appear to be playing some kind of game.  The doorway leads east back out to the main street. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4716}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4718}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (n,s,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The cobblestone roads intersect as you approach the center of the city.  Glancing in each direction you see that the streets are fairly deserted.  An occasional citizen can be found along the road, but they quickly turn away as you look in their direction.  A strong breeze blows towards the south, causing pieces of debris to blow around and bounce off the stones.  To the southeast appears to be some kind of town center with a statue. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
