R {4719}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (e,w,sw,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{The cobblestone road comes to an end at the town horse stables.  A horrid odor comes from the stables to the west and bits of stray straw litter the entrance.  Dust and dirt blow across the cobblestones from a pair of dirt paths that lead around both sides of the stables.  Directly to the north is the side of the guard station, while the entrance of the town inn is to the south.  The cobblestone road leads east into the heart of the city. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
