R {4720}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (e)}{<278>. .<088>}{As you step into the horse stable, the stench of manure assaults your nose.  The hay that litters the ground is old and brown, obviously not changed in quite some time.  The wooden boards that make up the stalls are falling apart, and there are no horses being boarded currently. Looking into the loft above, you see several holes in the roof as sunlight shines down through them.  The main entrance to the stables leads back out east to the streets of Angelo. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4719}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4721}{0}{<118>}{Town of Angelo (n)}{<118>` ^<088>}{You have entered what appears to be a deserted inn.  This once fine establishment is now just a broken-down old building.  Dust and dirt collect along the bar across the back wall.  Chairs and tables are all overturned and are in disarray across the floor.  On the east side of the room is a staircase that has fallen, making it impossible to reach the second floor of the inn.  The doorway is made of swinging double doors, now falling off their hinges.  It leads back out into the streets. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
