R {4722}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (s,ne)}{<278>. .<088>}{Garbage and debris clutter this dirt field that many of the citizens call home.  Peasants scurry in and out of makeshift tents that are prevalent throughout the field.  The only building in this section of town is a small shack up against the west wall.  The east side of the field continues until it reaches the side of the town inn.  To the south, the field leads to a road at the southwest corner of town.  A dirt path leads in between the stables and inn to the northeast. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
