R {4726}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (e,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{The cobblestone street fades into a large dirt field as you travel towards the east.  Looking across the field, you see a large amount of training equipment for practicing the art of combat.  To the west, the cobblestone road leads into a deserted part of town and just to the north appears to be the town square, where a large statue stands.  The southern end of the field ends abruptly at the town's brick wall and a large wooden shack is just off to the east. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
