R {4727}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (w)}{<278>. .<088>}{Stepping off the dirt field, you have entered what appears to be the commander's quarters.  This wooden shack is in fair condition, but it looks as if the soldiers try to keep it up.  Several of the floorboards have obviously been re-nailed down and the commander uses a makeshift desk made from a large piece of wood and a couple of barrels.  A gentle breeze blows in dust and dirt from the front windows and doorway,  causing the place to be very difficult to keep clean. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
