R {4728}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (n,s,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{A gentle northern wind blows the loose dirt and debris along the cobblestone streets.  Looking towards the south, you see the large brick wall that surrounds the town at the end of the road.  The road also leads north out of town.   Just to the east appears to be some kind of shrine or statue within the town square.  It's covered in weeds and moss and doesn't appear to be well-kept. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
