R {4731}{0}{<248>}{Bob Blackburn's Smith Shop (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This small shack belongs to the town smith.  Bits of metal and scraps of leather litter the dirt floor.  The shack is made of wood, with many items simply nailed into the wall for decoration.  The rear of the building is bucked up against the town wall.  The heat in the shack is near intolerable as the fire pit in the back of the shack heats several bars of iron.  Near the center of the room is a large anvil.  The front of the building is completely open, leading back to the road south. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
