R {4732}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (n,s,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{Flies and other various insects appear to infest this section of the town.  They seem attracted to the meat market directly to the north.  Several of the cobblestones within the road are cracked and the gaps are filled with packed dirt.  To the east appears to be a large barricade of some sort, while the road extends far to the west.  On the south side of the road appears to be some kind of general store. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
