R {4733}{0}{<148>}{Meat Market (s)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{As you enter this wooden building, the stench nearly knocks you on your behind.  You appear to have entered the town meat market.  The market is made of wooden walls and a wood plank floor.  The floor is stained red with blood dripping from various strips of discarded beef that litter the floor.  A large counter lines the back of the room and a doorway, which apparently leads to some kind of storeroom.  Across the back wall is a large placard showing you what is for sale. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4732}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4734}{0}{<138>}{Roland's Shop (n,e)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{Stepping into one of the few nice buildings of Angelo, you have entered Roland's general store.  The floor is made of sturdy wooden planks, and the room is filled with tables containing various trinkets for sale.  Roland stands behind a counter ready to sell you an item at a good price.  Rays of sunshine extend through the northern windows and they are followed by a gentle breeze.  An open doorway to the east appears to lead into a second shop.  Behind the counter is a large placard.   }{Angelo}{}{}{shop}{1.000}{1}
E {4732}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
