R {4735}{0}{<138>}{Willow's House of Wonders (w)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{Stepping through the doorway, you have entered Willow's House of Wonders!  This small shop is unlike anything you would expect.  The walls are painted a bright orange color and along them are mounted various wands and other instruments that Willow has for sale.  The floor is made of wood, but is painted with large colorful dots of various rainbow colors.  The entire floor area is kept clear and the room has no windows.  Willow happily moves about the room, dusting his various wonders.  The only exit is through the doorway back into the general store.  }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4734}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4736}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (n,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{You have come to the end of the road.  A large barricade blocks any further travel to the east.  Looking beyond the barricade, all you see is burned-out buildings and destruction in the old ruins of Angelo. The shop to the north appears to have fallen victim as well as it is now just a burned out shell.  The brick wall surrounding Angelo extends from the barricade and travels along the perimeter of the city.  To the south appears to be the side of a large store and the road travels west back into the city. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4732}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4737}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4737}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (s)}{<278>. .<088>}{Black soot covers everything within this burned-out remains of a trading post.  The once wooden floor is now just a line of cinder-burned planks that are supported by the dirt floor below.  Glancing towards the rafters, the building leans heavily to the east, apparently up against the heavy brick wall outside.  As you survey the room, the building begins to creak and groan, as if it could collapse upon you at any moment. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4736}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {4738}{0}{<238>}{A forgotten forest trail (se,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{You stumble into the forest following a long lost trail. Wild growth of grass and bushes covers the trail and you wonder why all this has been abandoned. Peering ahead, you can see the trail splits up in two directions. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
