R {4739}{0}{<238>}{A fork in the path (ne,nw,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{Following the trail, you come upon a fork in the path. From here  the long forgotten trail leads to the northeast, northwest and to the south. Between the two northern trails lies a small stone pyramid. Around it there is some kind of painted circle. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
