R {4740}{0}{<228>}{A green hazed glade (sw)}{<228>, `<088>}{Pressing through wild bushes and high grass, you are startled as you reach a glade in the forest. Thick forest covers every exit except to the southwest from which you came. Glancing towards the sky, you become puzzled as you notice the treetops form a dome over a strange-looking building. Neither the sun nor the sky can penetrate it and the whole area is bathed in a dark green haze. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
