R {4741}{0}{<178>}{A beautiful garden (se)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The old trail stops at a weird-looking house. Everything around it looks new and fresh and even the lawn looks freshly cut. Fresh flowers bloom in the garden and you can hear the sound from a small fountain to the left of the trail. Around the house are tall green trees growing and looking up you can see the blue sky between the treetops. Something is very wrong though. You cannot hear any wildlife around you and the sky hasn't been this clear in months. You get a very eerie  feeling as you walk up the trail towards the house. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
