R {4742}{0}{<238>}{West of the old house. (w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{Standing just to the west of an old house you can see the path leading off both to the east and west. Glancing to the west you can see the vegetation growing more and more impenetrable. A traveler would be wise to remain on the path while journeying deeper into the woods. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
