R {4743}{0}{<238>}{On a small path. (sw,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are traveling along a small forest path. Looking towards the east you can see an old wooden house. The path continues to the southwest. Surrounding you on all sides is a thick, dense forest. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
