R {4744}{0}{<238>}{Along a well used path. (se,ne,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{The path splits up into three different directions; one trailing off to the southeast, another trailing back to the house towards the northeast, and finally one winding its way to the west. The dense forest covers everything else in the area. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
