R {4746}{0}{<238>}{In a small clearing. (e,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{You've reached some kind of campsite. It seems to have been abandoned recently; there is still smoke coming from the put-out fire and freshly made tracks are leading off to the west. The trees around you are slightly less dense, as if the clearing has been somehow widened to accommodate the camp. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
