R {4830}{0}{}{On the western hill. (d)}{ }{You've finally reached the top of the western pile. Only the strongest and most worthy fighters ever make it this far. From here, you have a good view over the battlefield. The tremendous heat from the sun gazes down upon you and its starting to take its toll. You desperately long for shade. }{Encampment}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
