R {4832}{0}{}{At the second floor of a wooden tower. (d,u)}{ }{Reaching the second level of the tower you see that the opponents are beginning to become more and more skillful. Loud screams echo from all around you. Glancing outside you see that you are a several meters up in the air. You'd better watch it so you don't fall. The ladder you took to get here continues up and down. }{Encampment}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
