R {4833}{0}{}{At the third floor of a wooden tower. (d)}{ }{You are getting nearer the top of the tower. Only the wooden platform remains above you. Trashed weapons and pieces of broken armour litter the room. As you study the room something falls down from above. A shattered scream followed by a bone crushing crunch makes you cringe in expectation of what lies above you. The ladder stops dead here and there are no visible means of getting any higher. }{Encampment}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
