R {5207}{0}{<248>}{Small Cave (e)}{<248>% %<088>}{This small cave appears to be the home of some creature.  There are bones stacked neatly in the corner, apparently remnants of a meal or two, as well as a large depression in the dirt that appears to be some sort of bed. }{fe dar Shad}{bigugly}{}{}{1.000}{1}
