R {5208}{0}{}{Bedroom (n,closet)}{A}{You have entered someone's bedroom, that isn't very polite of you. This is a well kept bedroom, clean and tidy.  There is a bed in one corner and a night table next to it.  On the table is a lamp.  There is a closet on the far side of the room. }{Mage Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
