R {5209}{0}{}{A portal chamber (ne,nw,portal,sw,se)}{<158>P<088>}{A huge swirling vortex exists here.  Through the vortex is the world which you are familiar with.  But this one is a plane of four elements, fire, earth, air and water.  The surroundings suit this plane well.  The area to the southeast of here, it almost looks like the chamber is a cave made from earth, while the northeast part of the chamber is missing completely for some strange reason.  The chamber is completely engulfed in flames to the northwest while the southwestern corner of the chamber is a huge puddle of water.  This place looks like it could be kind of dangerous. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5210}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5212}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5214}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5216}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5222}{winds}{winds}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1549}{d}{portal}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1549}{portal}{portal}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5210}{0}{}{An intersection (nw,ne,se,sw)}{ }{This chamber is full of water, steam, and mud.  Steam from the northwest hangs in the air giving the chamber a stuffy feeling.  The ceiling, which is purely steam, meets the walls at the top.  The steam gradually turns into water as it nears the floor.  Mud lies on the floor as a mixture of the water from the southwest, and the dirt from the southeast. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5209}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5211}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5218}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5221}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5211}{0}{}{A chamber of water (ne)}{<148>W<088>}{This chamber is entirely made of water.  If it wasn't for the fact that you can move around freely, and breath, you could swear you were underwater.  The floors, walls, and ceiling are all one, all made of water.  There are no fish or anything like that here.  No water drips from the ceiling, and you don't sink into the water below.  This is an extraordinary chamber indeed. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5210}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5212}{0}{}{An intersection (nw,ne,se,sw)}{ }{This chamber intersects dust, earth, and mud.  Small clouds of dust wander in from the northeast.  The floor is mostly packed dirt, but the southwest part of the chamber is somewhat muddy.  The walls are made of earth and mud, as are the floor and ceiling. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5209}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5213}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5220}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5221}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5213}{0}{}{A chamber of earth (nw)}{<038>E<088>}{A chamber of earth This chamber resembles a cave.  The walls, floor and ceiling are all made from dirt, rock, stone, and other earth-like materials.  A few small patches of grass grow on the floor and near the base of the walls. This chamber is in the shape of a sphere. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5212}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5214}{0}{}{An intersection (nw,ne,se,sw)}{ }{This chamber is cluttered with clouds of smoke, and waves of dust.  The floor disappears as the clouds move around the chamber.  It almost looks like there is no floor at all.  Thick plumes of smoke and dust make breathing a challenge.  A large vortex is visible in the chamber to the southwest. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5209}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5215}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5219}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5220}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5215}{0}{}{A chamber in the air (sw)}{<168>A<088>}{This chamber, well actually there is nothing here.  No floor, walls, or ceiling.  It is just air.  You look down and see small white clouds floating in the air.  You can't feel anything under your feet.  You should be falling, but you're not. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5214}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5216}{0}{}{An intersection (nw,ne,se,sw)}{ }{The intersection here is almost unbearable.  Clouds of smoke, mixed with an intense heat and a haze of steam meet here from surrounding chambers. The light in this chamber comes from the northwest, while the chamber northeast of here is full of smoke, and the chamber to the southwest is full of steam.  A swirling portal is in the chamber southeast of here which is probably the exit out of this unusual area. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5209}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5217}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5218}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5219}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5217}{0}{}{A chamber of fire (se)}{<118>F<088>}{A chamber of fire This chamber is completely engulfed in flames, including the walls, floor, and ceiling.  The magical forces on this plane will not harm human adventurers.  The heat, however, will.  The chamber opening is nearly invisible as the flames leap and flicker. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5216}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5218}{0}{}{A chamber of steam (se,ne)}{ }{This chamber is a sauna.  Intense heat and clouds of steam fill the air. The floor here is a pool of water which is surprisingly solid.  Steam rises from the water to form the walls and ceiling.  The water flows in from the southeast, and the heat seems to come from the chamber to the northeast. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5210}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5216}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5219}{0}{}{A chamber of smoke. (se,sw)}{ }{This chamber is completely engulfed in smoke.  Thick pillows of grey smoke float aimlessly around the chamber.  As the smoke moves about, the exits appear and disappear from view briefly.  The floor, walls, and ceiling look like they have been created using only smoke. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5216}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5214}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5220}{0}{}{A chamber of dust (sw,nw)}{ }{Clouds of dust float around the chamber.  The air is saturated with dust making breathing exceptionally hard.  The walls and ceiling are covered in a thick layer is dust, while the floor is made of hard packed dirt and stones. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5214}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5212}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5221}{0}{}{A chamber of mud (ne,nw)}{ }{A chamber of mud This chamber is one gigantic mess.  A one foot thick layer of messy brown mud clings to the walls, and the ceiling, and completely covers the floor.  A small stream which enters the chamber from the southwest feeds the dirt with water which is where all this mud comes from. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5212}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5210}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5222}{0}{}{A chamber of elements (out)}{ }{A huge swirling vortex exists here.  Through the vortex is the world which you are familiar with.  But this one is a plane of four elements, fire, earth, air and water.  The surroundings suit this plane well.  The area to the southeast of here, it almost looks like the chamber is a cave made from earth, while the northeast part of the chamber is missing completely for some strange reason.  The chamber is completely engulfed in flames to the northwest while the southwestern corner of the chamber is a huge puddle of water.  This place looks like it could be kind of dangerous. }{Elemental Planes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5209}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5223}{0}{}{Entrance to showroom (n,leave)}{ }{You are standing inside the entrance to the Android Showrooms. Developers of the android software platform have been granted funding to build this unique building and attempt to "show off" their robotics skills. A large glass door separates you with the outside world. To room to the north appears to be a corridor running east-west and has an elevator door on the northern wall. Red carpet has been laid from the double glass doors to the elevator in the northern room. }{Android Showroom}{android}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3577}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5224}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5224}{0}{}{In a corridor (stairs,e,w,s)}{ }{This isn't a spectacularly long corridor but it is long enough to fit the classification. Both east and west exits from the corridor lead into the android showrooms. The northern wall has an elevator door and a single button to call the elevator. The south exit will take you to the entrance to the building, two large glass doors can be seen from here. This section of the corridor is quite nice with red carpet centered on the floor leading to the buildings entrance room. The ceiling in this area has old fashioned chandeliers fitted that flicker ambient around the room. There is also a staircase here that leads downwards. }{Android Showroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5223}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5225}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5234}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5243}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22680}{enter elevator}{enter elevator}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5225}{0}{}{Display room (w,e,n)}{<FEBEBDE>G<088>}{The walls in this room have been made to compliment the theme of the android on display. You feel as though you are standing in the middle of a gingerbread house. The walls are made of a hard plastic that has been colored and shaped to resemble gingerbread. Assorted candies area places all over the walls for decoration. In the centre of the room is a platform that is also presented as a piece of gingerbread. To your east takes you back into the corridor and west will take you further into the showroom. }{Android Showroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5224}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5226}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5230}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5226}{0}{}{Showroom intersection (w,e,n)}{ }{This room is quite plain with simple white walls and a tiled ceiling often found in your traditional office block. All exits from this room take you into a unique android showroom displaying bizarre yet somewhat wonderfully crafted robotic inventions. }{Android Showroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5225}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5227}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5228}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5227}{0}{}{Display room (w,e,s,n)}{<FFF7600>E<088>}{The individual responsible for the design of this room wasn't very creative. The walls are painted completely black with the center of the room containing a gold circular platform. There is a small collection of spotlights positioned around the ceiling angled directly at the center of the room. All exits from this room lead to an intersection that allow you to venture further into the showrooms. }{Android Showroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5226}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5229}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
