R {5248}{0}{<278>}{grim remains of an elven home (e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You stand before the remains of an elven housetree.  This great tree was the home of an elven resident.  Now burnt and charred to death, the sentinel of the forest wails in silent agony.  In the dark sky above you, the pale moon shines down upon your death.  An overgrown path leads through the woods east of here. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
