R {5249}{0}{<238>}{forgotten path (sw,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{Chill winds blow about you, filling your soul with dread.  This appears to be a path through the forest used long ago.  Dark vines and sinewy saplings now choke the trail.  An eerie moaning can be heard somewhere in the far distance of this dark and evil wood.  Twisting into the sky like a shadowed serpent, an abandoned elven housetree slithers toward the silver moon northwest of here.  Leading north and southwest, the overgrown trail cuts through the forest like a dark artery. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
