R {5250}{0}{<238>}{shadowy path (ne,s,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{Evil resides here, spirits of the dead surround you.  Something brushes the side of your neck as you tread the dark path, caressing your flesh ever-so-slightly.  You feel a slight sting and reach back.  You find nothing there, but your hand returns with fresh blood on your fingers.  The silvery moon shines down upon the spirits of the elven dead.  Looking southwest you can see a massive tree, dark and foreboding.  The trail extends northeast and west from this section of the dark woods. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
