R {5274}{0}{}{in the dark treetops (sw,ne)}{ }{Rotted and frayed, the rope bridge beneath your feet sways back and forth in the chilling wind.  Dark shadows flutter amongst the treetops.  Your view of the forest floor is obscured by the unholy darkness surrounding you.  An eerie moaning can be heard somewhere in the far distance of this dark and evil wood.     There is a passage northeast into the elven housetree. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
