R {5347}{0}{<278>}{violated tree dwelling (n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This dark place is the residence of a deserted elven housetree.  This great tree was the home of an elven resident.  Now burnt and charred to death, the sentinel of the forest wails in silent agony.  The vile soil, damp with blood, glistens softly in the moonlight.  A dark path twists through the forest north of here. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
