R {5350}{0}{<238>}{shadowy path (w,n,s)}{<238>( *<088>}{Dark shadows of blasphemed goodness call this place home.  Your heart pounds within its chest as you tread through this unholy forest.  Nothing is so evil as that of tainted goodness.  The horror wells up inside of you.  You only hope that your mind will not succumb to the terrors that await you.  The vile soil, damp with blood, glistens softly in the moonlight.  Twisting into the sky like a shadowed serpent, an abandoned elven housetree slithers toward the silver moon south of here.  The trail extends north and west from this section of the dark woods. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
