R {5803}{0}{<238>}{Under the eastern gates of Westersea (n,s,w,out)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You're standing just below the city gates. As you look to the west you realize that Westersea truly is an alive and bustling city and not some backwater hamlet. People are going about their daily business and as you take a moment to observe, you notice several guards wandering the nearby area. The streets of Westersea are mostly made from stone. Comprised of small square stones, the cobbled road leads off in a western direction, further into the city. Situated directly above you are the city walls and there are two small openings to the north and south of you. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
