R {5804}{0}{<238>}{In an cramped guardhouse (s,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{This small room has been carved from the city wall. It serves as a guard room where the people on duty could go for a moment's rest. Small slits have been installed in the eastern wall and in the eastern part of the room is a metallic looking ladder. The only exit, besides the ladder, leads back to the street. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5803}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6015}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5805}{0}{<238>}{In an very small guardhouse (n,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You have to crouch down to fit through the narrow opening as you enter this small guard room. It's very sparsely decorated, with only a chair placed against the northern wall. You notice a ladder leading up through a small wooden hatch in the ceiling and you guess it leads to the city walls. In the eastern wall you see small slits carved in the stone. It is most likely so that the guards have a clear view of the outside. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_mayne}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5803}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6019}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5806}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{You're standing just inside the town gates. The roar of the city completely engulfs all your senses. People of every different age and race passes through the street and for a moment you feel like you're caught in a strong current that sweeps across the area. Pushing and shoving through the masses you catch a glimpse of your surroundings. To the east of you are the city gates. Its portcullis raises and lowers as people come and go. Looking to the west you think you can make out some kind of intersection. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5803}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5807}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5807}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{This large intersection is completely overflowing with people. The loud noise combined with the burning sun and the lack of clouds is starting to give you a pretty severe headache. You trip over some small children as you make it to the centre of the street. As you look around you notice that the street itself branches off in several directions and next to each are signposts. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5806}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5808}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5891}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5808}{0}{<278>}{Approaching a market (n,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{You're approaching some kind of market. Loud yells and screams on sales, deals, and the like can be heard from the north. Looking through the myriad of people, you think you can make out some market stalls. The steady stream of people seems to emanate from this area and you need to use your elbows even to move around. Surrounding you on the eastern and western side are tall buildings which offer no escape from all the people. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5807}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5809}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5809}{0}{<278>}{Somewhere in a large market (nw,n,s,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{A strong smell of food and spices seems to linger in this part of the marketplace. After a quick glance, you spot the many food stalls to the east. Several children are trying to catch their parents' attention and drag them there. You can't help but smile at the rather comical scene. The market appears to end here and the normal cobblestone covered streets branches off in a southern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5808}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
