R {5810}{0}{<148>}{By some food stalls (w)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{It appears that you are in a sea of food. The smell of freshly baked bread, roasted fish, and strange alien spices bombard you from every direction. This appears to be the busiest place in the whole market and you have to fight for every inch you want to move. People as well as screaming children are everywhere. When you finally make it to the food stalls you see several signs which display the offers. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_roots}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5809}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5811}{0}{<278>}{Somewhere in a large market (sw,nw,n,s,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{A whiff of something strange hits you as you walk in this part of the market. It reminds you of both soot and fish at the same time. Looking off in the northeastern and southeastern directions, you see both a stout looking building which sends out plumes of smoke as well as several stalls filled with foreign food. It must be the combination from these nearby areas that produces the interesting aroma. In the immediate area, you see nothing that really sparks your interest. Merchants continue to try to catch your attention but by now you've learned to single out the ones that actually have something of value. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5809}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5812}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
