R {5812}{0}{<148>}{Somewhere in a large market (sw,s,w,e)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{Several merchants wave to you in an attempt to catch your attention as you enter this area of the market. A multitute of stands and tables dot the area and it appears as if the majority of the merchants here deal with pottery, containers, and the like. Off to the east you see a smaller hut and large puffs of smoke emanate from its chimney. Like every other part of the market there are several signs which you can read for information about the merchants products in this particular area. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_flasks}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5811}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5813}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
