E {5817}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5813}{0}{<278>}{Before a smithy (in,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{Standing just outside an odd looking stone hut, you marvel at the throng of people pushing and shoving trying to get in. Large puffs of black smoke originate from the building's chimney and its soot settles around the area like a blanket of fine dust. This is probably the reason why you don't see any other merchants in the area. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5812}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
