R {5814}{0}{<238>}{In a crowded smithy (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The smithy is an extremely small building. It doesn't help that a multitude of people are pushing and shoving their way to see the latest goods. Also, the heat from the nearby forge is making an already bad situation worse. There is a small counter with several signs set up in the eastern part of the hut where an apprentice handles the more mundane purchases. }{The City of Westersea}{bern}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5813}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5813}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5815}{0}{<278>}{Somewhere in a large market (se,n,s,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{Walking around in the tightly packed market you frequently bump into people. You try to check your purse every so often but after a while you simply stop noticing it. The market street continues off to an eastern to southern direction while the city street branches off to the north. Here and there, guards wander the streets keeping a watchful eye for thieves and the like. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5812}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5816}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
