R {5816}{0}{<278>}{Approaching a market (e,w,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{Standing in the middle of an intersection you have a fairly good view of this part of town. Glancing to the east you notice a large guard tower while the area directly to the south seems to be mostly occupied by trading tents and merchant stalls. The street to the west continues off to other deeper parts of the town and you think you can see a large building towering on the western horizon. In the immediate area people rush past you with their usual eagerness. The area to the south seems to be even more crowded than here. There is a street sign here which might offer more information. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5815}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
