R {5817}{0}{<278>}{Somewhere in a large market (se,ne,n,s,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{Standing smack in the centre of the market square you are completely surrounded by a small army of people. Everywhere you look people are trying to peddle their wares. The roar of the city combined with the merchants yelling to catch your attention is starting to cause a slight headache. The relentless burning sun high above does nothing to improve the situation.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
