R {5819}{0}{<278>}{Somewhere in a large market (in,n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{You've reached the city market. This area is the western outskirts and there are no immediate stalls or merchants here. However, as you look in both an eastern to northern direction you see that the market continues. A small stone building is directly to the south and several guards are standing outside of it. It has barred windows and you'd guess it's either a jail or a treasury. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
