R {5820}{0}{<238>}{In a guard house (n)}{<238>] [<088>}{You are inside a very sparsely decorated room. A single wooden desk  sits against the southern wall and two chairs are on either end of it. Mounted in the western wall is a window of some sort. It has black metal bars on each side and the glass is hazy, almost as if it was reinforced. The entire eastern portion of the room is sealed off by thick metal bars. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
