R {5821}{0}{<148>}{Somewhere in a large market (s,e)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{The northwestern corner of the market is dedicated to clothes, linen, fabric, and the like. Stalls line the sides of the street, one more colorful than the other and several merchants are shouting their respective prices. Every now and then someone cries out a warning about thieves nearby and it's usually followed by a loud cry and the sound of responding guards. Westersea does not look lightly on crime. All the booths have small signs displaying their respective prices. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
