R {5822}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (n,s,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{Standing in a very large intersection of the town, you can't help but feel a bit intimidated of the myriad of people that pass before your eyes. It seems like most of the town had arrived here at the exact same moment. The intersection seems to serve as a meeting point as it branches off to some of the more central areas in the northeastern part of town. Off to the east stand several guards observing the area with interest. Apparently such a busy part needs extra protection in case something would happen. There is a large signpost in the center of the intersection. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
