R {5823}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (n,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{The street that you are following has been cramped in between two large buildings. Neither one of them look particularly interesting. Having spent a fair amount of time in Westersea most buildings start to look the same. Looking towards the south you see a big intersection and a large group of people appear to have gathered there. To the north is another one but not nearly as many people are going in that direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
