R {5824}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (ne,nw,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You've arrived at yet another intersection. The stony street branches off in northeastern, northwestern and southern directions. Further away to the northwest is the northern city wall and far to the west you can see a fairly large building towering over the skyline. You hear faint shouting coming from somewhere near and it distinctly sounds like a market. There is a tall sign post planted next to the city street. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
