R {5825}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (sw,e)}{<138>.*.<088>}{You kick a small stone across the cobblestone covered street as you journey onward deeper into the city. The warm sun shines down upon you and there is almost no breeze at all. North of you stands the northern city wall and it offers a bit of shade. Every now and then someone bumps into you. It happens so frequently you've almost stopped noticing. There is a large lamppost just next to the street. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_northlamp}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5824}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
