R {5826}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (ne,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{Entering the area, you immediately overhear loud shouting and excited cries coming from the south. You strain your neck, trying to get a look at the source, but the large buildings obscure your vision. All around you are people going about their daily lives and rather frequently someone bumps into you. The blazing sun combined with the crowded street is starting to get to you and every now and then your vision blurs with black spots. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5816}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
