R {5827}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (sw,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{You're walking in the northeastern part of Westersea. The road appears to end at a large guard tower to the northeast that rises up above the wall. It dwarfs the gigantic city wall which is just a stone's throw to the north. Houses and other buildings block your way to the south and southeast while the cobblestone covered street continues to the southwest. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5826}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
