R {5828}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (w,in)}{<278>. .<088>}{As you journey throughout the town, you are constantly reminded how extremely noisy it is. Children screaming, dogs barking, it's enough to drive anyone insane in no time. This particular area doesn't seem too bad though as it's mostly dominated by city guards. You see a small guard post next to the eastern wall. It's probably there to provide easy access to the northeastern guard tower should an attack on the city happen. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
