R {5829}{0}{<238>}{In an small guardhouse (u,out)}{<238>] [<088>}{The guard room is fairly barren. Against the eastern wall stands a wooden chair while while next to it is a plain looking desk. Mounted on the walls are several racks each stacked with deadly weapons. Attached to the northern wall is a metal ladder that leads up through a hatch in the ceiling. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
