R {5830}{0}{<278>}{Along a colourful brick wall (d,in,se,sw)}{<278>. .<088>}{Standing next to the northern city wall you feel very small. It towers several floors higher than the tallest nearby building. The road splits up here into an intersection and it branches off in several different directions. There is an entrance to the northwest which leads to a small and cramped looking building connected directly to the wall. Directly to the west is a large brick wall which prevents your view in that direction. Towering in the western skyline above the wall are several spires. Whatever lies beyond those walls are truly majestic. Hidden in the grass next to the wall is a rusty old manhole. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
