R {5831}{0}{<278>}{Along a colourful brick wall (ne,sw)}{<278>. .<088>}{You're following the outside of a very colorful brick wall. It stretches on in a northeastern to southwestern direction and almost completely blocks your view. Looking up, you see the top of green trees and behind those tall metallic looking spires. As you observe the surroundings you think you can hear laughter coming from the other side. }{The City of Westersea}{Unwelcome Visitor: say tom fablepott}{}{}{1.000}{1}
