R {5832}{0}{<238>}{In an small guardhouse (u,out)}{<238>] [<088>}{This small guard house is sparsely decorated. A single chair stands next to a ladder which leads the way up through a wooden hatch. The gray stone walls have no decorations at all and the only light in the room is coming from the outside. You see movement through the opening to the south as the city life continues outside. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
