R {5833}{0}{<278>}{Along a colourful brick wall (sw,ne)}{<278>. .<088>}{The street that you are walking on has fewer people on it than the usual city street. It feels empty and almost desolate. The cobblestone has been laid in a direct parallel to a beautiful brick wall. High above you shines the gazing sun and not a single cloud can be seen in the blue sky. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
