R {5834}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (w,ne,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You arrive at yet another intersection. The streets are as crowded as ever and you have to push and shove through the masses to get anywhere. The narrow road splits up into three different directions. Looking around you notice that the path that leads off in a northeastern direction appears to be less populated with people. There is a signpost here which can offer more information. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
