R {5835}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (e,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{The crowded cobblestone covered street leads on deep inside the northeastern part of Westersea. You catch a whiff of something that smells extremely good.  As you look around in an attempt to locate the source, someone bumps into you making you stumble. Buildings surround you on both sides of the road and they partially block your view of the immediate surroundings. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
