R {5836}{0}{<278>}{Before a bakery (w,e,in)}{<278>- -<088>}{Standing before you to the north is an odd looking building that seems to resemble a gigantic pastry. The walls of the building are the color of freshly baked bread and on the chimney on the roof dark and like a vanilla bean. There are several windows all of which are opened allowing the delectable aroma of fresh baked goods to drift out into the surrounding area. Several people crowd near the entrance, not heeding the line that is forming behind them. Above the door hangs a large wooden sign boasting the name 'The Sugared Biscuit'.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
