R {5837}{0}{<278>}{On the streets of Westersea (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You bump into several people as you half push, half walk along the crowded streets. There is a very pleasant smell coming from one of the nearby buildings. Glancing around you think you see a rather odd looking house to the west. The crowded streets mixed with the relentless sun above turns a normally pleasant day into a hellish nightmare.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
