R {5840}{0}{<278>}{In a large residential district (se,sw,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{The buildings in this part of town are all larger and in a better condition than the rest. Also, there are a lot less people walking the streets. These streets appear to be in a better shape and less run down than the others. Looking around, you see a large majestic looking church-like building in the southern direction. However, a large metal fence surrounds it and blocks the entrance from this direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
