R {5841}{0}{<278>}{In a large residential district (nw,e,sw)}{<278>. .<088>}{You're standing at the bottom of a fairly steep alley. It starts here and leads onward in an eastern direction. Several people are walking up and down and some are even pushing up carts. In this heat, it looks extremely tiresome. Parts of the immediate area is covered in shade. As you look around you see a very large dominating building standing directly to the west. It towers high into the sky and its main spire blocks out the sun. Surrounding it is an iron fence which wraps around it preventing immediate access. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
