R {5844}{0}{<268>}{Before a magnificent church (s,in)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You're standing right before an old and very large church. Glancing up, you see several marble statues adorning the slanted roof and tall spires shoot into the sky from its rooftops. A walkway consisting of fine black gravel has been laid between the residential streets and the church entrance. Surrounding the church is a pitch black iron fence and between it and the walkway are some patches of finely cut grass.   }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
