R {5847}{0}{<268>}{Standing in a church nave (n,e)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{Standing just a little bit to the west of the centre nave you are directly underneath the western window. Radiant colour shines through and the artwork of the window is beyond exquisite. A small passageway leads off in a northern direction and a row of lit candles separates it from the centre nave. The silence of the church is absolute. You think you can hear your own breath echo within its walls. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
