R {5851}{0}{<268>}{In a western church passageway (u,s)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{The passageway ends in a small maintenance room. There are several boxes and some chairs scattered around the room. Against the northern wall is a wooden ladder which leads up to the second floor of the church. Even though you are very close to the centre nave it feels like it's very far away. The only thing that gives it away is the row of candles which stretch on in a southern direction. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
