R {5865}{0}{<238>}{In a catacomb tunnel (n,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{The narrow catacomb tunnel continues off into the darkness. You notice markings on the wall as if something was at some time being constructed here but was aborted for some reason. Parts of the floor are also polished smooth while other parts are jagged and sharp. There are no sources of light here and you have to use your hands to fumble around. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5864}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5866}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5866}{0}{<238>}{In a tunnel intersection (w,n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're at a very narrow tunnel intersection. The floor is tilted rather heavily in a northern direction and you have to watch your footing so you don't fall on the jagged, uneven floor. Rough cut stone walls surround you and whatever made these tunnels didn't have time, or simply didn't want them to be as smooth and finely polished as the rest of the catacomb system. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5865}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5867}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
