R {5867}{0}{<238>}{In a catacomb tunnel (e,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{Thick cobwebs hang between the tight corridor walls. Either recently spun, or this part of the catacomb hasn't been used in ages. A sweet smell lingers in the air. It reminds you of decomposed leaves mixed with melted sugar. Feeling your way over the jagged walls you manage to make out that this tunnel turns in a very sharp angle and leads off in an eastern to northern direction.   }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5866}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5868}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5868}{0}{<248>}{In a sticky cavern (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{Thick sticky strands of new spun web coat this large chamber. They stretch throughout the whole chamber and coat the floor as well as the walls. Moving around on the sticky threads you frequently have to stop and pull your legs loose. There is a large pile of strange looking eggs in the northeastern corner of the room and the strange smell you felt earlier seem to emanate from it. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{cocoon}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5867}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5869}{0}{<248>}{Standing in a deep underground chamber (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{You've reached a larger chamber deep underground. It looks almost completely empty except for several odd looking holes in the northern part of the room. They look carved into the ground and you can see faint wisps of gray smoke puffing out from them. The rough stone walls are covered by some kind of coating which sticks to your clothes and body as you accidentally bump into it.  }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5866}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5870}{0}{<238>}{Following a large tunnel (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{The large tunnel continues straight in almost complete darkness. Only a faint shimmer of silver that appears to be coming from a northern direction acts as the sole light source. Surrounding you on the eastern and western side are the same chamber walls as you've seen earlier. With only the silver light as your beacon and the floor once more tilting in the northern direction it feels like you are descending into a pit of doom. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5864}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5871}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5871}{0}{<248>}{In a large chamber under the church (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{You're standing in a large spherical-shaped chamber. It stretches high above your head and its ceiling is shrouded in utter darkness. A silver sphere is floating in the middle of the chamber and shines an eerie white glow across the room. As you move around the chamber you feel as if you were engulfed in an invisible field of energy. It moves around you, with an intelligence not seen in immaterial objects. A small tremor runs down your spine. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5870}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50358}{touch sphere}{touch sphere}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
