R {5872}{0}{<238>}{In a small subsection (n,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{The smaller subsection is not nearly in as good condition as the main tunnel. Sharp jagged corners protrude from the dark rock and you have to be careful not to get stuck in the smaller portions of the tunnel. The narrow tunnel turns sharply and you almost walk straight into the wall. Turning around to examine both directions you notice a thin coating of moisture on the walls and it clings to your clothes as you graze against the stone. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5864}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5873}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5873}{0}{<238>}{At a small tunnel intersection (e,n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{Arriving at another smaller intersection, you try to look around to get a bearing on what's around you. The darkness, however, is absolute. You can barely see your hand in front of your face and you have no clue what is ahead of you. A weird clicking sound reverberates through out the cramped corridor and it seems to originate from the northern tunnel. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5872}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5874}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
