R {5874}{0}{<248>}{In a larger stone chamber (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{Stepping into a slightly larger chamber you look around in puzzlement. It's completely lit up, yet you didn't see anything until you actually entered. As you try to locate the source of light you notice that the interior of the chamber is vastly different compared to the chilly rocky tunnel. It's humid and strands of water run down the stone walls, forming shallow puddles on the floor. Water also drips down from the jagged ceiling. Looking around, you see no furniture at all, only an odd looking pile of straw in the northeastern corner. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5873}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5875}{0}{<238>}{In a narrow stone passageway (n,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{The narrow passageway continues off into the darkness. You have to squeeze your way through some of the tightest parts but you manage to finally get through. As you are frequently pushed up against the sharp rocky wall you try your best to avoid getting cut. You notice strands of lukewarm water dripping down the tunnel walls and you're starting to get rather wet.  }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5873}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5876}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5876}{0}{<248>}{In an empty chamber (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{You've arrived at an almost completely empty chamber. It is larger than the tunnels and you can actually move around a bit. You spot several odd looking holes in the northern part of the room and a faint gray smoke seems to be emanating from most of them. A faint humming sound can be heard through out the chamber but there is no way to determine the source. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5875}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5877}{0}{<278>}{Wandering along a quiet residential street (e,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{The nice residential street continues in a northern to western direction. Houses of every size and color imaginable surround you and it's very clear that the majority of the town's wealthier citizens live here. Every now and then you spot someone who confirms your suspicion as they go about their usual daily life. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5842}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5878}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5878}{0}{<278>}{Wandering along a quiet residential street (e,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{A faint song reaches your ears as you enter this part of town. Looking around, you notice several children playing on a patch of grass next to the street. Several benches have been placed directly opposite to the grass. Perhaps they're for watching parents. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5877}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5879}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5879}{0}{<278>}{Wandering along a quiet residential street (s,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{Walking through the many houses you marvel how quiet this part of town is. Seeing several guards walking by you quickly put two and two together and it's fairly clear that many of the town's important residents live here. The street directly to the north of you tilts heavily upwards, yet buildings and similar housings are seen there. Space is obviously a rare commodity here. }{The City of Westersea}{Unwelcome Visitor: say ivar cutters}{}{}{1.000}{1}
