R {5880}{0}{<278>}{Wandering along a quiet residential street (w,s,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{You're standing in a small intersection in the eastern part of the residential district. The eastern city wall towers high above you and looking up, you see several shapes walking back and forth. Residential houses of many different colors and sizes dot the immediate area. Looking around, you see that the area continues off in a northern to northwestern direction while the normal city street continues in a southern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
