R {5881}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (d,n,se)}{<278>.@.<088>}{As you are strolling down the nicely laid cobblestone covered streets you can't help but to relax in the warm sun. You notice that the further away from the city centre you are, the more you can appreciate the beautiful day. Looking around, you see a fairly large residential area off in a northern direction. The street that you're standing on continues off in a southeastern direction and up along a small hill. Just as you are above to leave you spot an old grate amid the grass right next to the road. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
