R {5882}{0}{<278>}{On a beautiful street (e,nw)}{<278>. .<088>}{The small city street continues up the hill. As you walk you realize that cobblestones might look nice and work well for flat surfaces but climbing a hill on them is not that much fun. You feel sweaty and slightly out of breath and the never-ending gazing sun does nothing to help. There is not much vegetation within the town; quite frankly there isn't any grass or tree in sight. Looking off in an eastern direction you see several guards standing around.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
