R {5883}{0}{<278>}{On a beautiful street (w,in)}{<278>. .<088>}{There seem to be a conglomeration of people here, all standing outside a small hut-like structure. Immediately as you enter the nearby area they all go quiet and watch you with suspicious eyes. This must be the southeastern guard post and the guard force of Westersea will not stand for any tomfoolery. The city wall surrounds you on all sides except for the small street leading off in a western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
