R {5884}{0}{<238>}{In an small guardhouse (u,out)}{<238>] [<088>}{For a guard post, this small building actually contains a fair amount of furniture. Two chairs stand along the western wall by the window, placed for an excellent view of the street outside. A closed, small chest sits next southern wall. Directly opposite is a metallic ladder which has been attached to the the inner walls. It leads up through a wooden hatch in the ceiling. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
