R {5885}{0}{<238>}{Along a hidden path. (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{Traveling through the thick forest, you can barely make out the trail leading north and south. Puddles of water are visible around the trail and the sound of wildlife surrounds you on all sides. The air is crisp and rather cold, like a chilly autumn day. Small drops of cold rain fall on your face. Looking northward you can see mountains tower over the forest. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
