R {5886}{0}{<148>}{Wandering along a quiet residential street (e,w)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{The broad street continues off in a direct eastern to western direction. Every now and then you encounter people going about their daily lives. They all appear to have relatively nice clothes and glancing at the many houses you quickly come to realize that this neighborhood houses the more wealthy ones. Shielding your eyes from the warm sun you move on. There is a small stall here which looks very out of place. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
