R {5888}{0}{<278>}{Wandering along a quiet residential street (w,e,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{Standing in the southern part of the residential district you take a moment and look around you. Looking northward you see a large intersection and beyond that, a large church towers on the horizon. Living houses surround the street and they all appear rather similar. No one in particular stands out from another. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
