R {5891}{0}{<238>}{At a cozy looking inn (in,w,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've reached one of the larger inns of Westersea. It's been crammed in with the southern row of buildings. The building itself is very square looking and there is a large sign hanging from its outer wall. You see several wooden poles next to the street and you'd guess it's for travellers who bring their mounts into the town. There is a large water basin directly next to them. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
