R {5892}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The main street of Westersea continues in an eastern to western direction. As you look down the street to the east you see the town gate standing far in the distance. You also see a rather colorful inn on the southern side of the street. As you turn to the west you see the white cobblestone street ending up at a very crowded and large intersection. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5891}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
