R {5893}{0}{<238>}{In a very cozy inn (w,out,u)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're inside a large inn. Music and the smell of fresh food surrounds all your senses. There are several rather comfortable looking chairs in the centre of the room all surrounding a large wooden table. In the southeastern corner is a black fireplace and smoke from a recently extinguished fire puffs gently from it. The western end of the main room consists of a large wooden bar and you notice several occupants sitting on small stools next to it. There is a large stairway leading up to the upper floor in the southwestern corner of the room. The northern wall consists of large glass windows, offering a clear view of the bustling city life outside. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_inn}{}{}{1.000}{1}
