R {5894}{0}{<238>}{Standing in a bustling kitchen (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're standing in the middle of the inn's kitchen. Bustling cooks and other helpers work around the area. There is a large counter along the southern wall where food is prepared. A smaller fireplace is in the northeastern corner. Along the southern and western walls are shelves upon shelves with cans, small bags of spices, and other cooking ingredients.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
