R {5895}{0}{}{In a cozy inn (d)}{ }{The top floor of the inn consists of a multitude of beds and bunks standing close together. This establishment doesn't seem to have any private rooms at all. There are windows in the northern and southern wall and each has almost pitch black curtains that are pulled down effectingly blocking any sunlight. In the southwestern corner of the room is a large stairway that leads down to the common room of the inn. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
