R {5896}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (in,d,w,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The small, fairly low stone bridge provides walking access from the eastern part of the town to the center area. Staring out from the bridge you marvel in beauty over the canal with its crystal clear water. The bridge, even though it's small, is extremely sturdy and there is a steady flow of people which are crossing it. You should be careful so you don't accidentally fall into the water. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
