R {5985}{0}{<238>}{Under the western gates of Westersea (e,out,s,n)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The cobblestone covered road of Westersea starts here, directly under the city gates. As you look off in the western direction you spot a harbor far away while in the eastern direction the busy city continues. The town of Westersea is fairly large, and it's probably one of the reasons for the immense amount of people on its street. You frequently see guards watching from a distance, always ready to jump in should the need arise. There are two small rooms embedded in the city wall, one to the north and one to the south. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5984}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5986}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
