E {6202}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5986}{0}{<238>}{In an cramped guardhouse (s,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{This is one of the most cramped guard houses that you've ever been in. There are no windows and the only furniture in the room is a wooden chair and a desk which has been pushed up against the western wall. There is a metallic ladder mounted on the eastern wall. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5985}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6058}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5987}{0}{<238>}{In a very small guardhouse (n,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{Standing completely inside the city wall is a bit strange at first but after a few minutes you begin to calm down and look around. This small room must serve as a guard room where the city guards can come and rest. There is a chest sitting next to the western wall and desk with chair pushed up against the eastern one. As your eyes adjust to the darkness in here you also notice a metal ladder mounted to the southern wall. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5985}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6061}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5988}{0}{<238>}{Under a stone bridge (u,e)}{<238>===<088>}{You are swimming in the city canal. Directly above is a fairly large stone bridge and you can hear the sound of thumping feet reverberate through the stone. Surrounding the canal are white stone walls. Several iron handles have been mounted directly to the stone allowing you to climb up from the water. In the western wall are several large drainage holes, each covered with thick steel grating preventing you from going off in that direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5983}{u}{u}{16}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22876}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5989}{0}{<228>}{Strolling in a grassy field (e,s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{Standing in a wide open field, you find it rather shocking to still be inside the town. The field lays all around you and there is a small dirt road that leads off in a northern to southern direction. To the north is a large festival and you can clearly hear the sounds of laughter and music coming from that direction. There is a small guard station here just slightly to the east and you can see several guards patrolling in the nearby vicinity.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5980}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5990}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5991}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5990}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively festival (ne,e,s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're at the southwestern corner of the large festival grounds. The sound here is different from the main city; however it's just as loud. Children are laughing and screaming, trumpets are blaring in the background, and on top of it all you spot several merchants calling out their respective goods. There are several colorful smaller tents dotting the festival grounds and you see fascinating things that are on display as well as odd artifacts that are for sale.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5989}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
