R {5991}{0}{<228>}{Strolling in a grassy field (in,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{The guard post is very small, not much bigger than your average hut. A few guards are engaged in a heated conversation. As you enter the room they all quiet down and turn their attention to you. The grassy fields surrounding the station makes you feel like you were out in the wilderness, but as you look around you see the tall stone walls of Westersea towering high above. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5989}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5992}{in}{in}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
