R {5992}{0}{<238>}{In a small guardhouse (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The small guard post is completely made from stone. With the warm sun gazing and the lack of open windows the temperature in here is beyond warm. It's sparsely furnished with only a metal chest against the eastern wall and a small chair to sit on. You can't wait to be out in the open air again. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5991}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5991}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5993}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively fair (ne,nw,w,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{As you enter this part of the fair you immediately spot an odd looking slender man standing on one leg while balancing on a tall wooden pole. There is a big crowd watching and laughing while cheering him on. The festival grounds appear to stretch on in the northern and western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5990}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
