R {5994}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively festival (w,se,sw)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're at the eastern part of the festival. Children are playing in the grass while their parents watch with bemused expressions. The golden sun shines with fury down on the whole event and you'd have a hard time picking a better day than this to spend at the marvelous fair. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
