R {5995}{0}{<228>}{Strolling in a grassy field (nw,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You're just before a large festival. Sounds and cries of joy echoe loudly throughout the area and you see people smiling, dancing, and generally enjoying themselves everywhere. Children run around playing and rolling in the green grass. You can't help but smile. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5994}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5996}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5996}{0}{<228>}{Strolling in a grassy field (w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Lush growing grass and odd looking flowers dot the fields and you find it hard to believe that you are actually still in a town. There are loud sounds and cries coming from the nearby festival and you see a steady stream of people going there. Here and there, you spot a guard who is doing their best to keep order. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5995}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5997}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5997}{0}{<228>}{Strolling in a grassy field (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The dirt road continues off into the large grassy field. It's like you stepped on a nice grassy meadow. However, looking around you spot the tall city walls towering above you in every direction. The sound of trumpets rings out from the festival which lies just a little bit off to the west. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5996}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5998}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5998}{0}{<278>}{On a muddy road in Westersea (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{This area is located in between the grassy fields and the main street. The nicely stone covered street as you've seen elsewhere in the city turn here into a dirt road. There is a large wall that appears to encircle some kind of majestic looking building directly to your north. Looking around, you spot some kind of large festival far off to the west. A small canal lazily flows through the area and its water glitters in the strong sunlight. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5997}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5926}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {5999}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively festival (nw,sw,e,w,s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{The large festival stretches out wide around you. Odd painted fire-eaters walk around the grounds impressing the many onlookers. You also frequently see jugglers and other artists doing their tricks in needed attempt to receive a few coins. The guards stand off to the sides of the fair keenfully alert to the crowd, surveying for criminals and rowdy patrons. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
