R {6000}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively festival (ne,se,w,e,s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{This is one of the most central areas of the whole fair. Dirt roads lead off in almost every direction and the sheer amount of people that are here is staggering. Several colorful tents surround the main area and there are a wide variety of merchants trying to catch your attention.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5999}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
