R {6001}{0}{<238>}{At a horse auction (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've reached an odd looking corner of the festival. Several horses are grazing on a pasture west of here and it appears there is some kind of auction going on. Several people are shouting bids and numbers in attempts to buy horses. The main festival area continues off in the eastern direction. There is a large sign planted next to the ongoing auction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6000}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6002}{0}{<228>}{In the middle of a lively fair (se,w,e,s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have reached one of the centre points of the fair. Dirt roads branch out in most directions and the once nice grass has been long since crushed beneath the citizens of Westersea's boot heels. Troubadors and other musicians walk the festival grounds singing, rhyming, or telling stories of heroic deeds. Despite the massive amount of people here you can't help but smile at all the festivities going on around you. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
