R {6003}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively festival (w,e,s,sw)}{<228>, `<088>}{The smell of horse manure lies fairly thick in this corner of the festival. People don't notice, or don't care and are as happy and joyful as ever. Like many other places here, several colourful tents dot the area. The sound of music mixes with the whinny sounds of horses and just past the road is a large signpost. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
