R {6004}{0}{<228>}{At a horse training ground (w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You've reached a fairly empty part of the fair. An empty pasture covers the eastern part and is fenced off by several wooden poles and logs. Some children sit and apparently are waiting for something next to the fence. The festivities continue off in a western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6003}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
