R {6005}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively festival (s,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{The clang of heavy metal echoes across the area. You look around expecting an immediate fight but instead you see several children bashing at each other using sticks and wooden rods. As you study the children you realize that they are trying to imitate the adults fighting just off to the east and the sound you heard as you entered must have came from that direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6002}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6006}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6006}{0}{<228>}{At a training ground (w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You're standing in the middle of a huge training field. Men are sparring with each other everywhere and there are several tracks set up for horse drills. The ground consists of a mixture between trampled grass and brown dried mud. Several children are watching from a distance with saucer sized eyes. A small dirt road leads back west to the main fair. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6005}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6007}{0}{<228>}{At a very lively festival (nw,w,e)}{<228>, .<088>}{There appear to be fewer people here than in the main festival area off to the east. The road that you're traveling on is mostly made out of grass but as you look around you see the familiar dirt road just off to the side. A smaller side road leads off towards the northwest and the northwestern guard tower. There is a large signpost rammed into the soft dirt here. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6002}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6008}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
