R {6008}{0}{<238>}{Close to a jousting arena (w,e)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{You are getting nearer to the main attraction of the fair. A large jousting arena has been assembled on the field to the south and the crowd around it is steaming with anticipation. Several guards patrol the area, as well making sure that no one does anything foolish. There are also several doctors standing by to tend the wounded. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6007}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6009}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6009}{0}{<238>}{At a jousting arena (e)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{You're just outside the wooden palisade of the jousting arena. You see knights dressed in shining armor engaging each other first on horse then with swords. There are wooden stands assembled next to the arena where the wealthier people sit. Next to the dirt road is a large wooden board. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6008}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53009}{joust}{joust}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
