R {6010}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (nw,d,se)}{<278>. .<088>}{You're at the northwestern outskirts of a very large festival. Music and cheers of joy and laughter drifts in and it lifts your spirits. Several guards patrol the area making sure that the festivities do not go overboard. As you look around you think you see one of the familiar guard posts far off in the northwestern direction. There is a small metal grate partially hidden in the grass. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6007}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6012}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
