R {6011}{0}{<228>}{A small forest. (e,w,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{A small forest. You begin walking into a seemingly pleasant forest.  The sunlight streams down from the treetops in little patches here and there.  There is a feeling that something is not quite right. }{Troll Forest}{troll_forest}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4709}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
