R {6012}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (w,se)}{<278>. .<088>}{The amount of guards in this area is more than plentiful and as you look around you spot one of the familiar guard huts nearby. Guarding both the northwestern guard tower as well as being in charge of the security of the festival clearly requires many men. Sweating slightly in the warm sunlight, you continue on your way. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6010}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6013}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6013}{0}{<278>}{Wandering somewhere in Westersea (in,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The small guard hut seems abandoned. There are guards standing nearby but no one is actually here. Maybe something happened that caused all the guards to rush out. High above you towers the city walls and patrolling guards are frequently seen. You are definitely not alone. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6012}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6014}{in}{in}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
