R {6014}{0}{<238>}{In an small guardhouse (u,out)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're in a very warm and rather cramped guard hut. The stone walls do nothing to protect you from the gazing sun, quite the opposite. The hut is completely void of people and the only furniture that you see is a small wooden chair next to the eastern window. You see a metallic ladder that has been mounted to one of the walls. It leads up through a small hatch in the ceiling. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6052}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6013}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6013}{e}{out}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6015}{0}{}{Somewhere in the eastern city wall (d,u)}{ }{Thick stone walls surround you on all sides and the rather small looking metallic ladder doesn't seem to offer you much comfort as you climb on it. You can hear the city noise from far away and the density of the stone distorts it, making it impossible to make out any details. As you scurry along the tight passage you frequently bump into the rough stone walls with your equipment. These passages were definitely not built for a larger person. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5804}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6016}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6016}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (d,n,s)}{ }{The large city wall continues off in a northern to southern direction. Directly to the south is the top of the city gate while far to the north is a rather large looking guard tower. The wall consists of white stone and the path you are following is partially covered by gravel. Outside the walls is lush green grassland. High above you the golden sun is shining, bathing the area in almost relentless heat. If it wasn't for the gentle breeze that every now and then sweeps in, the heat would be unbearable. There is a small opening in the western part of the wall. It appears to be leading down into the city wall itself. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6015}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6017}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6020}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6017}{0}{}{Above the city gates (n,s)}{ }{The warm sun gazes down upon you as you've reached the top of the gate. From here you have an amazing view over both the landscape that stretches off to the east as well as the activities that go on in the town. Two large wooden wheels with thick chains are mounted on the northern and southern part of the inner walls. You notice pulleys, winches and other mechanisms that are used to lower and raise the gate. On the eastern side of the wall are some fairly impressive battlements which provide excellent cover for defending soldiers should the town be attacked. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6016}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6018}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6018}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (d,n,s)}{ }{Walking along the eastern city wall you feel the breeze of the wind sweeping across the walls. The gazing sun hangs high above like a burning coin and its strong rays shower everything with fury. The wall itself consists mainly of white stone and looks in pretty good condition. Markings from long lost battles mar the stones but that's only natural being a battlement. There is a small opening into the western part of wall here, and peering southward you spot a similar one there. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_tower}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6017}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6019}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6099}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6019}{0}{}{Somewhere in the eastern city wall (u,d)}{ }{You're climbing a small metallic ladder. The thick city walls are all around you and the sound from the outside is muffled and distant. There are several small sconces holding candles which are lit and provide you with some illumination. You hear movements both above and below you, as if people were walking around. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6018}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5805}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6020}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (s,n)}{ }{As you walk along the eastern city wall you frequently bump into guards. They ignore you as you pose no immediate threat. Looking to the north you see a tall tower and you realize that it must be the northeastern guard tower. The sturdy battlements on the eastern side bring a sense of security as you walk along the wall. Lifting your eyes you see the grassy hills just outside of town.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6016}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6021}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6021}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (s,n)}{ }{A sudden whiff of something foul drifts in and looking around, you realize that it's coming from the town district just to the west of you. As you have an extremely good view over the city layout from here you quickly deduce that it must be the merchant area. The muffled sound of city life seems to also be stronger here. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6020}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6022}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6022}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (s,ne)}{ }{You're standing just to the south of a large guard tower. From here you can't see any way into it, but the city wall takes a sudden turn as if it was circling it. The solid battlements continue off to the northeast and onward to the south. Just outside the walls you see the green countryside and hills with colorful flowers dot the scenery. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6021}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6023}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6023}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (sw,n)}{ }{With the tall northeastern guard tower at your back you look out over the huge grassy field to the northeast. The field consists mostly of tall green grass with an occasional grassy hill but every now and then something seems to catch the sun's reflection. Perhaps hunters or other adventurers are exploring the nearby realms. As your eyes return to the nearby area you notice several wooden poles leaning up against the tower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6022}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6024}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6024}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (nw,d,s)}{ }{Here the normally narrow stone walls have been extended to make room for a small stone shack in the tower. Kneeling down and looking inside, you see a ladder leading down. The stone battlement that surrounds the city continues off to the south and to the northwest. You notice small metallic chests sitting next to the shack and as you glance around, you see that they seem to be dotted out around the whole tower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6023}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6025}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6026}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6025}{0}{}{Somewhere in the city wall (u,d)}{ }{Squeezed in between the thick dense city walls the feeling of claustrophobia begins to set in. A small, fairly scrawny looking ladder leads both up and down. Several sconces have been mounted to the stone wall, providing some illumination as you climb. You hear movement coming from both above and below you and you can't wait to be out in the open again. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6024}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5829}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6026}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (se,w)}{ }{Kicking a small pebble off the sidewalk you hear it bounce against the outside of the city walls. Leaning out between two merlons, you realize the sheer distance that you actually are from the ground. A fall would most definitely be fatal. Should an attack be made against the town, the best defence might simply be to push them off the wall.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6024}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6027}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6027}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (e,sw)}{ }{The northeastern corner of the city walls have been constructed around the guard tower. Here it turns in an eastern to southwestern direction. Directly next to you stands the actual tower and even though you can't find an entrance to it from here, it's most likely it does exist somewhere close. Examining the tower, you see several wooden poles leaned up against it. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6026}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6028}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6028}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (ne,w)}{ }{The northern wall seems to almost stop abruptly in front of a large tower. Turning around and examining the city, you realize that you've reached the northeastern guard tower. A smaller battlement leads off to the northeast and it appears as if the city walls encircle the tall tower. As you peer out through the city wall's merlons you feel a swift breeze pass through your hair and for a moment the warm sun doesn't seem so bad. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6027}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6029}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6029}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{As you walk across the city wall, the cool wind picks up and blows gently across the whole area. Looking down at the crowded streets of the town you are rather thankful that you are up here rather than down there. Several guards patrol the northern wall and a little bit off to the east you see a fairly large guard tower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6028}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6030}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6030}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{The tall northern city wall appears to stretch on almost forever. You see no end in sight. Several guards bustle about their daily business and they all ignore you as you pose no danger to yourself or others. Looking out over the town, you see a myriad of people going about their daily lives and from this distance they appear to be very far away. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6029}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6031}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6031}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{The fairly wide city walls stretch onward in front of you. Along the northern edge are waist high battlements which would offer protection in case of an attack. The stones on the wall are usually bright white, almost as if they've been bleached. Here, however, they are damaged and scorch marks can be seem all along the wall. Directly to the north of the wall are green grassy hills and fields.   }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6030}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6032}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6032}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (w,e,d)}{ }{You're standing outside a small stone shack. It's been constructed directly in line with the southern part of the wall. Kneeling down and looking inside, you see a wooden hatch and you guess that it leads down to the street. Standing up and glancing out over the battlements you notice that the grassy hills are continuing as usual and show no sign of changing. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6031}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6033}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6034}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6033}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{You come across an area of the wall that is more heavily guarded. Looking towards the east you see a small shack or something and it appear to be the reason for the extra men. As you continue on the wall you glance inside at the town. Far off to the southwest you see some kind of magnificent building. Tall metallic spires block the skyline.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6032}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6035}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6034}{0}{}{Somewhere in the northern city wall (u,d)}{ }{Scaling the scrawny ladder, you feel extremely vulnerable. These small corridors inside the city walls have a tendency to frequently collapse. Muffled steps echo through the stone surroundings and you hurry on, eager to be outside once more. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6032}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5832}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6035}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{The northern city wall seems to curve around a large grassy plaza to the south. As you look out over the town to the southwest you notice a large stone building blocking most of the skyline. Tall glittering spires fill the air and the whole building looks regal. Leaning up against the northern battlements you stare out over the building with wonder. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6033}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6036}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6036}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,nw)}{ }{This part of the wall is located just above and to the northeast of what appears to be a large and very impressive castle. Surrounded by a lush plaza the almost gigantic building takes up most of the southwestern view. The city wall itself is turning in a northwestern direction to circle around the green park.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6035}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6037}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6037}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (se,w)}{ }{As you are walking across the northern city wall, the hot sun gazes down on you with fury. Every now and then you feel a bead of sweat dripping down your forehead and if it wasn't for the small gusts of wind that occasionally sweep in over the wall the situation would be close to unbearable. Through the heavy stone battlement you see the green wilderness continue off in a northeastern to northwestern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6036}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6038}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6038}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{A sudden reflection coming from far to the northwest catches your eye. Something glitters, almost as if a sea of tiny diamonds sparkled in the bright sunlight. After a while you finally realize that it must be the western sea. Focusing on the nearby area again you notice that this part of the wall looks darker than the rest of the wall. Perhaps it was constructed at a different time than the rest. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6037}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6039}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6039}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,sw)}{ }{Several large metal cauldrons occupy this part of the wall. They have been mounted between crenels in the battlement. Several people are tending to the cauldrons as if they were expecting them to be put in use soon. You notice an increase of stone and pebbles on the walkway here, as if something had wore down this part of the wall more than others. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6038}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6040}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6040}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (ne,w)}{ }{Large scorch marks mar the majority of this part of the wall. Several crenels appears to be fairly damaged and large chunks of stone look completely ripped off from the wall. As you look towards the west you see similar marks all over the wall. Glancing out over the nearby grassy field you see no enemies or anything that could have done this. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6039}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6041}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6041}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{The northern wall stretches onward in an eastern to western direction. Looking around on the wall, you notice that large pieces of it are damaged and several black marks dot the stony structure. Glancing out over the battlements you scan the horizon and the nearby grassy field for any source that could have done this. Nothing looks unusual. Turning your attention to the city you see a large castle like structure to the southeast and it appears to be surrounded by a green plaza. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6040}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6042}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6042}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{This section of the wall is actually relatively undamaged. Whoever attacked the town must have been beaten back before they reached this part. The vast sea in the northwestern horizon glitters like a sparkling bed of rare gems. Within no time your eyes water up and you are forced to look away. With the gazing sun resting in the middle of the sky, the idea of a bath in the sea is a pleasant thought. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6041}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6043}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6043}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{Several guards are gathered in this area. They seem to be busy trying to repair parts of the wall. Trying not to disturb them, you squeeze your way past to continue on your way. Looking around you notice nothing special that stands off and the rather monotonous looking wall continues out far in an eastern to western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6042}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6044}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6044}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{Large parts of the northern battlement are completly missing here. Only a slim walkway allows you to keep on walking along the wall. Several guards are here, doing their best to repair the wall but it's so severely damaged they seem at a loss. The northwestern shoreline is visible as you stare off from the city walls and the sparkling water seems very inviting. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6043}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6045}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6045}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{Loud trumpets echo through the air with such a fury that you for a moment lose your balance. Looking around, you quickly identify the source as a large open field to the south. A jousting ring and several smaller tents are visible and it appears that some kind of event is taken place. The stony wall continues in an eastern to western direction and you are getting closer to the northwestern guard tower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6044}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6046}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6046}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,w)}{ }{Looking out over the scarred battlements you see the lush green grassland slowly merges with the northwestern shoreline. White birds circle over the water and looking closer you see several dots that bob up and down with the waves. Being too preoccupied with the beautiful scenery you stumble on a broken piece of stone. Grumbling, you look around in embarrassment and keep on walking. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6045}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6047}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6047}{0}{}{Along the northern wall of Westersea (e,nw)}{ }{You're standing just by the northwestern tower. It acts as the defence post should there be any attackers coming from this direction. Looking around the walls you notice clear marks and evidence of recent battles. The city wall encircles the tower as it turns in a northwestern to eastern direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6046}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6048}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6048}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (se,w)}{ }{The warm sun combined with the fresh salty winds sends warm shivers of delight down your spine. You can't help but gaze out over the beautiful western sea as well as the northeastern grasslands. Several guards chuckles to themselves as they pass. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6047}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6049}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6049}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (sw,e)}{ }{Several wooden poles lie strewn across the narrow walkway. A large man, obviously a captain, is barking to the other soldiers to clean up the mess or there will be hell to pay. Trying not to laugh at the comical scene you quickly continue on your way. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6048}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6050}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6050}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (ne,nw,d,s)}{ }{Half walking, half pushing, you try to move ahead on the crowded narrow fitted path. With the large battlements mounted on the western part of the wall and the many guards patrolling this are you frequently have to walk sideways to simply pass. There is a small pathway leading off in the northwestern direction to the small bartizan. There is also a rather odd looking stone structure which is situated right next to the actual tower. As you kneel down to examine you see a ladder leading down into the darkness of the wall. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6049}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6051}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6052}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6053}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6051}{0}{}{On a sturdy bartizan (se)}{ }{The small bartizan acts as an extension to the tower itself. Large cannons stand pointed out towards the sea and even though you don't see any danger several guards stand ready should anything happen. The bartizan does not have any roof or walls, only a similar type of battlements which you saw on the main city walls.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6050}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6052}{0}{}{Somewhere in the city wall (u,d)}{ }{The small tunnel allows passageway between the upper city wall and the small guard station below. As you are climbing the sturdy ladder you frequently bump into the hard stone wall and in no time you managed to scrub yourself quite badly. You hear the sound of movement coming from both above and below.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6050}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6014}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6053}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (n,se)}{ }{The relatively small wall path arcs around the tower. You frequently bump into guards performing drills or simply just doing their duty and more often than not you get told to 'get your civilian rear off the wall'. Several long wooden poles are leaned up against the top part of the tower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6050}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6054}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6054}{0}{}{Along the western wall of Westersea (s,nw)}{ }{You're standing just next to the northwestern guard tower. Heavy battlements shield you from any potential attacks coming from the sea outside. Large heavy cannons stand facing out against the water and guards patrol the area with an almost inhuman determination. The wall continues off in a direction northwestern to southern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6053}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6055}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6055}{0}{}{Along the western wall of Westersea (s,n)}{ }{The smell of manure lies like a blanket over this part of the wall. Looking around you spot horses, knights, and everything else that goes with a jousting arena just a short bit off in the eastern direction. A myriad of people seem to flock to the event. The stone wall continues in a northern to southern direction and you're getting fairly close to the northwestern guard tower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6054}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6056}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6056}{0}{}{Along the western wall of Westersea (s,n)}{ }{The western wall is dotted with cannons, mortars, and other useful weapons for fighting ships. It's very clear that the town has a strong waterfront and an attack from the sea would almost certainly prove useless. The faint sound of trumpets blaring echoes occasionally from somewhere close.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6055}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6057}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6057}{0}{}{Above the city gates (d,n,s)}{ }{You're just slightly to the north of the main western city gate. There is an increase of guards here as they try to make sure that no shady and dishonest people enter the town. Tall battlements line the western part of the wall and there is an odd looking shack constructed just next to it. The wall itself continues in a straight northern to southern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6056}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6058}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6059}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6058}{0}{}{Somewhere in the western city wall (d,u)}{ }{Trying to scale the small ladder looks easier than it actually is. You frantically try to hang on while getting all your equipment up through the narrow tunnel passage. Sounds from people walking around both above and below echoes distortedly through out the tunnel and you hurry onward to get out of here. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6057}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5986}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6059}{0}{}{Above the city gates (s,n)}{ }{This is the central western wall overlook. It's positioned directly above the actual wall and provides excellent view over the harbor as well as the people approaching the gate. There are several pulleys, wheels, and steel chains here and you can only guess that they operate the heavy iron portcullis. There are several guards posted here and they watch the passersby very carefully. As you enter the part of the wall, this includes you. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6057}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6060}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6060}{0}{}{Along the western wall of Westersea (d,n,s)}{ }{You're just south of the western city gate. A steady stream of people are coming and going through the gate. Just off in the western direction is the city harbor. You see a vast amount of ships and other smaller vessels that are docked and the smell of fish lies very strongly in the air. A small odd looking shack has been constructed directly adjacent to the western battlements.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6059}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6061}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6062}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6061}{0}{}{Somewhere in the western city wall (u,d)}{ }{You're climbing a small metallic ladder. The thick city walls are all around you and the sound from the outside is much muffled. Small sconces have been mounted on the walls to provide some light. Both above and below you are movements of people walking around trying to perform their duties. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6060}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5987}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6062}{0}{}{Along the western wall of Westersea (s,n)}{ }{As you walk across the tall battlements, you notice that it's very quiet up here. Only the occasional barking order of a guard captain breaks the silence. Birds stick to the nearby northwestern harbor where the food is plenty and that is probably the cause for the sudden silence.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6060}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6063}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6063}{0}{}{Along the western wall of Westersea (s,n)}{ }{The western city wall continues in a straight northern to southern direction. Directly to your south is the southwestern guard tower and it towers over this area with an almost regal supremacy. Cannons dot the western battlements and they are aimed directly towards the sea, creating a powerful waterfront. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6062}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6064}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6064}{0}{}{Along the western wall of Westersea (sw,n)}{ }{Having reached the southwestern guard tower you feel very small compared to its massive size. It's made out of the similar white stone block as the actual wall and can stand against most forces. If anyone wanted to invade Westersea they should bring an excessive amount of firepower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6063}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6065}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6065}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (s,ne)}{ }{The small walkway is crowded by guards. Someone is performing a rather complex drill and you have to continuously watch yourself so you don't run into a guard, or worse a captain. The walkway itself continues in a northeastern to southern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6064}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6066}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6066}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (d,n,se,sw)}{ }{You're standing next to a small stone shack constructed directly adjacent to the tower wall. Kneeling down you see a sturdy ladder leading down into the darkness of the city wall. There is a small stone pathway connecting this part of the wall to the bartizan that stretches onward in a southwestern direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6065}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6067}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6068}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6069}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6067}{0}{}{On a sturdy bartizan (ne)}{ }{This bartizan was built to provide a powerful waterfront for Westersea. Large metallic cannons stand pointed out towards the beautiful sea. There are several metallic chests which stand next to the armaments and a few guards patrol the area. As you gaze out towards the sea you see several ships as well as white birds circling the ships looking for scraps. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6066}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6068}{0}{}{Somewhere in the city wall (u,d)}{ }{You find yourself surrounded by cold hard stone. However, the passageway isn't nearly as cramped as you first thought and you can actually move around a bit. As you study your surroundings you realize that you can hear the sound of movement coming from both above and below. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6066}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5956}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6069}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (nw,e)}{ }{Looking out over the western sea you marvel at its beauty. Greenish-blue waves gently roll back and forth in harmony. Bobbing up and down on them are several small boats and above them you see strange white birds circling around looking for fishing scraps. You are completely caught up in the scene that you hardly notice the guards and people around you. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6066}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6070}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6070}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (w,ne)}{ }{The narrow walkway circles around the tall stone tower. With its sturdy battlements always facing the wilderness and the vast sea you feel very secure. Guards push and shove trying to move about their latest drill and you do your best to avoid clashing with them. You notice several wooden poles leaned up against the tall tower. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6069}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6071}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6071}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (sw,e)}{ }{You're standing just by the southwestern guard tower. The amount of guards has increased and there are several groups that are running drills and exercises. As you look out over the southwestern grassland. Several fishing boats and other vessels seem to occupy the bulging waves.   }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6070}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6072}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6072}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{The grayish-white stone wall continues in an eastern to western fashion. The big southwestern tower stands just a little bit off in the western direction and it appears as if the wall you are walking on is circling around it. You can't help but marvel at the amount of work the town of Westersea put down into constructing this magnificent wall. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6071}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6073}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6073}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{You're getting closer to the western wall of Westersea and you're starting to make out more and more details about the sea itself. It lies like a dark blue field in the bottom part of the southwestern horizon and it looks extremely inviting, especially in this relentless heat. Other people seem to share your thoughts as you see several guards staring off into the distance as well. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6072}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6074}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6074}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{A sweet scent of something decayed seems to linger across this part of the wall. As you look around, you spot the run down slum area and immediately understand that the smell must come from that part. The stone wall continues in a direct eastern to western direction and trying to not gag too badly you continue on your way. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6073}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6075}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6075}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{The monotonous stone walls continue with seemingly no end in sight. Outside the wall, the wilderness thrives with its flourishing green grass and many strange flowers. As you look out over the grasslands you spot something glimmering far off in the southwestern horizon and you realize that it must be the sea. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6074}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6076}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6076}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{The stone walls are kept in an impeccable condition. Not a single piece of bird droppings or other types of debris can be found. Whoever is maintaining this part of the wall is doing a very good job. Several guards patrol back and forth, keeping a close watch over everyone including you. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6075}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6077}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6077}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{As you're walking along the fortified rampart the burning sun is starting to make you really uncomfortably warm. Only the occasional gust of wind provides some relief. You pity the many guards that have to patrol these walls rain or shine, day in and day out. The wall itself continues in a eastern to western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6076}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6078}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6078}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,se)}{ }{The southwestern part of the wall runs directly next to the slum district. You see fallen and run down buildings and you stare in absolute wonder that anyone actually lives down there. Nevertheless you see several small people going about their business. The wall continues here in a southeastern to western direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6077}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6079}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6079}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (nw,e)}{ }{The southern wall provides Westersea with valuable protection. It has large battlements facing the southern wilderness and several guards constantly patrol it to make sure everything is in order. There are several wooden poles laid down next to the battlements and you are not sure what they are for. As you go closer to investigate several guards cold stare quickly changes your mind. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6078}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6080}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6080}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (e,w,d)}{ }{You're at the exact centre of the whole southern wall. Looking off into the distance you spot tall towers both in the eastern and in the western direction. An odd looking stone construction has been mounted on top of the northern part of the wall and as you kneel down to look inside you see a wooden hatch. You quickly realize that this is a way to quickly scale up and down the wall from the inside should an attack happen.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6079}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6081}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6083}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6081}{0}{}{Somewhere in the city wall (u,d)}{ }{You're scaling a very frail metallic ladder. Even though it's firmly mounted to the wall, it feels like it wobbles as you move on it. As you climb, you hear the sound of people walking both above and below you and you hurry to get out this cramped and very exposed position. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6080}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6082}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6082}{0}{<238>}{In an small guardhouse (u,out)}{<238>] [<088>}{The small building contains almost no furniture at all. A wooden weapon case is mounted to the southern wall and a rather uncomfortable looking chair has been placed in front of the only window. It at least allows whoever is on guard to sit while he watches the northern streets. As you look around you see a small scrawny looking metallic ladder leads up through a wooden hatch. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6081}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5913}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5913}{n}{out}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6083}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,ne)}{ }{This part of the wall is slippery. It's as if it was recently washed and the warm sun hasn't had time to dry it yet. Looking around, you find no traces of what occurred here and you shrug your shoulders, careful not to slip and fall down. A fall from this height would without question be fatal. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6080}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6084}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6084}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (sw,e)}{ }{The long city wall continues. It turns here in a rather sudden direction and since there are no handles or bars to hold on to, you have to watch your step. Luckily the southern battlement remains a few feet above the walkway otherwise the chance of accident would be fairly big. Cries from guards preforming drills echo from both below and from other parts of the wall.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6083}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6085}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6085}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{You're getting closer to the middle of the southern wall. It arcs outwards, as if surrounding a building. The only bizarre thing with this construction is that there is no building there at all. As you examine the wall structure closer, you see that several large blocks of stone look newer than the rest. It's as if they were replaced not that long ago. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6084}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6086}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6086}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{Looking out over the pale stone wall you realize that off in a western direction the wall arcs out. You've seen this behavior at other parts of the wall but then a building or a tower has always been the reason for the shifting of direction. Here you see nothing except the busy streets of Westersea. Looking out over the town you spot a grand house that stands out from the other buildings. It looks like a large mansion and lies just a little bit northward in the residential district. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6085}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6087}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6087}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{You're standing at the pretty much dead centre of the southeastern part of the city walls. It stretches onward far off in a straight eastern to western direction. Guards walk the wall with a determination that you've rarely seen in a man. Every now and then they glance in your direction but since you pose no immediate threat they ignore you. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6086}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6088}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6088}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{Several guards patrol this part of the tower. As you look around, you don't see anything special at all about it. Perhaps it poses a strategically strong point that you're not aware of. Shrugging your shoulders you continue onward, trying not to disturb the guards from their duties. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6087}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6089}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6089}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{Strolling across the city wall you have a grand view over the nearest region of the city. Located just next to this part of the wall appears to be the residential district. Large and spacious houses are built very close to each other forming a rather tight neighborhood. You see a large churchlike building being the centre point of the area. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6088}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6090}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6090}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,e)}{ }{The southern wall consists of the same kind of material as the rest of the wall. However, every now and then you come across a patch where the stones don't match. It looks newer, as if recently repaired or reconstructed. Feeling a bit worried about new attacks you look out over the horizon. You see nothing that would pose a threat to Westersea. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6089}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6091}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6091}{0}{}{Along the southern wall of Westersea (w,se)}{ }{You've reached the southeastern tower. It stands tall and high in the eastern direction. The city wall that you've been following circles around it. There are no visible entrances to the tower from this position. The white stone wall continues off into the western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6090}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6092}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6092}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (nw,e)}{ }{The wall circles around the stone tower. Several wooden poles are leaned up against the top of the tower. Looking out over the horizon you see smoke coming from far away in the southeastern direction. Strange, you don't recall there ever being a town there. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6091}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6093}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6093}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (w,ne)}{ }{You're following the city wall which appears to arc around the southeastern guard tower. With its strong and tall battlements facing the southeastern wilderness you feel safe walking up here. The strong sun shines down with relentless force and if it were not for the brief wind that occasionally sweeps in over the high walls it would be almost unbearable.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6092}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6094}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6094}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (d,n,sw)}{ }{Several guards are gathered here and they seem rather focused on something that is happening on the southeastern horizon. Interested, you try to get closer. However, as they notice you approaching they immediatly stop talking and fix their icy cold eyes upon you. As you hurry on your way you notice a small structure in the tower wall and within it you see a ladder leading down into the darkness of the wall itself. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6093}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6095}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6096}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6095}{0}{}{Somewhere in the city wall (u,d)}{ }{As you are scrambling up the ladder you frequently bump into the rocky stone surface. You push and shove to get through and you make progress, although this tight tunnel was not built to allow much wiggle room. You hear the sound of movement from guards patrolling above echoing through the wooden hatch above.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6094}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5884}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6096}{0}{}{Along one of the guard towers of Westersea (s,nw)}{ }{This portion of the wall continues off in a northwestern to southern direction and you are almost halfway around the actual tower. You see wooden pikes leaned up against the tower and several smaller chests have been periodically placed along the inside of the battlements. As you lean out between two merlons you realize how high above the ground you actually are. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6094}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6097}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6097}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (se,n)}{ }{You're near the southeastern guard tower. It spires high above you and looks extremely sturdy. Combined with the solid battlements, the city is very well protected. Guards still patrol the walls though, as if expecting an attack to happen any minute. Looking outside the walls to the green countryside you see nothing that would support that idea. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6096}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6098}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6098}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (n,s)}{ }{As you wander along the eastern city wall, you can't help basking in the warm sunlight. A gentle breeze flutters through the air every now and then, providing enough cooling to make this a very comfortable summer day. You spot a few guards wandering the walls as well but they pay you no heed as you pose no immediate threat.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6097}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6099}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6099}{0}{}{Along the eastern wall of Westersea (d,n,s)}{ }{The view from the city walls is magnificent. Taking a moment to look around, you gaze out over the city of Westersea. The area that lies directly below this portion of the wall is the residential area. It has a large tower structure in the centre and houses have been built surrounding it. The town stretches on far beyond but you'd have to move closer to make out any clear details. The wall itself continues in a straight northern to southern direction. Just as you are about to leave, you notice a small opening in the western portion of the wall. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6098}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6100}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6018}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6100}{0}{}{Somewhere in the city wall (u,d)}{ }{As you scale the ladder you frequently bump into the stony city walls. Annoyed, you swear to yourself in the darkness and try to maintain your calm. Falling off the ladder would most likely be very painful.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6099}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6101}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6101}{0}{<238>}{In an barren guardhouse (u,out)}{<238>] [<088>}{The guard house is very empty. Only a single chair standing in the middle of the room draws your attention. A large window has been mounted in the western wall, providing a good view towards the residential area of the town. A small ladder has been mounted to one of the inner walls. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6100}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
