E {6104}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6102}{0}{<278>}{In a large residential district (w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{Standing in the middle of the hill you realize that the paved road, especially when walking up or down hills, isn't making walking effortless. Sweat drips down from your forehead and onto your clothes. As you are taking a moment to rest you stare off towards your surroundings. In a direct westward direction stands a very grand building with several smaller ones standing next to it. As you turn around, someone bumps into you on his way down the hill. Dodging other people, you continue on your way. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5841}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6103}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6103}{0}{<278>}{In a large residential district (w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The hill that you're standing on offers a good view westward over the residential district. Buildings of every different size and color dot the horizon. A large church-like building just slightly westward of the hill draws your attention and it appears to be the centre point of this district. Looking eastward you see a strange stone hut next to the eastern city wall. Several men appear to be patrolling outside of it. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6102}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6104}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6104}{0}{<278>}{In a large residential district (in,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{This is one of many guard houses that dot the city of Westersea. They are mostly found either close to a city wall, or located in highly populated areas. Several guards are standing outside the hut talking to each other, and as you come close they focus their eyes upon you. The large city wall towers high behind the guard post and you see men patrolling the battlements above. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6103}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6101}{in}{in}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6101}{e}{in}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6105}{0}{<228>}{At a sewer entrance (u,w)}{<228>= =<088>}{You've reached one of the sewer entrances. Standing knee-deep in foul smelling murky water you try to get your bearings. The cramped passageway leads onward to the west and due to the darkness below it's impossible to see what's up ahead. A steel ladder mounted on the eastern stone wall leads up to the daylight. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{westersea_sewers}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4757}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6106}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6106}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{The smell of the sewer is enough to drive anyone insane. It makes you dizzy, causes your eyes to tear up and lately, your skin has started to itch something fierce. The dark tunnel section you're passing through continues off in an eastern to western direction and kneeling down in the murky water to peer ahead yields nothing but complete and utter darkness.  }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6105}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6107}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6107}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (e,w)}{<228>= =<088>}{Your mood worsens as you plod along knee-deep in the greenish water. Occasionally something under the water brushes up against your leg. As you try not to think about what sort of creature it may be your nose is assaulted with the sick heavy odor of this sewer. The dark brick walls surround you on all sides except to the east and west where the sewer continues. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6106}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6108}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6108}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{Something slimy falls on you as you journey through the sewer. Looking up you see large pipes ending right above you. Every now and then something falls from them and vanishes in the murky water below. The narrow walls surrounding you makes the sound of your travels distorted and the heavy putrid odor envelops you in a shroud of sickness and disease. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6107}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6109}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6109}{0}{<228>}{At a sewer tunnel fork (w,e,sw)}{<228>= =<088>}{You've reached a branch in the sewer system. It continues off in the eastward, westward, and southwestward directions. No direction looks particularly different than any other. There are no lights anywhere as lighting a match would be potentially hazardous due to the fumes emanating from all the waste. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6108}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6110}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
