R {6110}{0}{<228>}{At a sewer junction (w,ne,se)}{<228>= =<088>}{You're standing in the middle of another sewer junction. The cramped tunnels continue off in the northeastern, western, and southeastern directions. Above you are several pipes and they snake their way across the ceiling from this room to others. As you glance up, you bump into something under water and almost lose your balance. Grumbling, you continue onward. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6109}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6111}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
