R {6111}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (s,nw)}{<228>= =<088>}{As you enter this part of the sewer you are forced to duck your head. It appears as if the ceiling is running a lot lower here than in other areas. To make matters worse, the walls are also closer to each other than before and as you push through, you notice a green film of slime coating your whole side. As you stop to remove the slimy substance, you think you can hear muffled voices coming from above. Perhaps the outside isn't that far away. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6110}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6112}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6112}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (se,n)}{<228>= =<088>}{Knee deep in the green slimy watery goo, you stumble onward. The dark stone passage that surrounds you shows no signs of ever changing and your surroundings are starting to become monotonous. Pipes of different shapes have been mounted to the walls and to the ceiling and every now and then you can hear a faint hissing sound coming from them. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6111}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6113}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6113}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (nw,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{The narrow tunnel continues onward in a southern to northwestern direction. It looks exactly the same as every other place down here and you are beginning to lose your bearings. As you look to the south you think you can hear muffled sounds coming from that direction. Maybe an exit can be found in that direction? }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6112}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6114}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6114}{0}{<278>}{At a sewer entrance (w,u,n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You're standing in the southeastern exit of the sewer. Above you lies a metal grate which can be lifted from the inside. A metal ladder has been mounted to one of the walls allowing easy access to the grate. As you look up, you think you can see people and even some guards through the narrow cracks. The sewer itself consists of dark, almost pitch black walls and a few feet of murky water covers the bottom. Mounted on the ceiling as well as the walls are several pipes from which you can hear a faint gurgling sound. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6113}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6115}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5881}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6115}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{As you wade through out the sewer you suddenly sink down to your waist in gooey water. Apparently, the murky liquid has gathered here for some reason and is a lot deeper than other places. You grit your teeth and try to avoid the water with your head as much as possible. The dark sewer tunnel continues off to the east and west and there are no signs of what lies ahead. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6114}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6116}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6116}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{The darkness of the sewer is getting to you. Even though you should be able to see it feels like the depressing environment is getting to you and occasionally you find yourself feeling your way foward regardless. The water which reaches your ankles is so dark and murky here that you can't make out anything. Every now and then something bumps up against your feet and you try your best to avoid thinking of what it might be. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6115}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6117}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6117}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{A muffled scream followed by a large splash echoes throughout the dark tunnels. You try to locate the source but all sounds are heavily distorted making it an impossible task. The dark tunnel surrounding you continues off in an eastern to western direction. With no clear light you can't make out anything besides a few feet ahead of you. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6116}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6118}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6118}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (e,nw)}{<228>= =<088>}{The dark stony tunnel takes a sudden turn here and while knee deep in slimy water you almost run straight into the wall. All around you the splashing of your feet reverberate back to you in a distorted fashion. Glancing up towards the ceiling, you barely make out a series of pipes that leads in an eastern to northwestern direction. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6117}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6119}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6119}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,se)}{<228>= =<088>}{As you enter this room you can't help but think 'another room, another place to get even slimier'. These rooms are all starting to look the same to you. With no real visible landmarks, it's extremely easy to get lost. As you stop to get your bearings, you notice the cold murky water slowly shifting back and forth as if someone or something was moving about close by. Pipes coming from the southeast arc down and lead directly into the stone wall. As you stand still you can hear a faint hissing sound coming from somewhere deep inside. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6118}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6120}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6120}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{Moving around in the cramped tunnel you frequently bump into objects with your feet. As the light is close to nothing, there is no way for you to see what exactly you are bumping into. The thick and now familiar dark stone wall offers no hints about your whereabouts and not a single sound penetrates from the outside. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6119}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6121}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6121}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (nw,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{The dark sewer tunnel floor here is slightly angled towards the southwest, causing a small fall of water across the area. Rusty old pipes hang down from the ceiling and they continue off in a northwestern to eastern direction. Even though you are completely and utterly soaked in foul watery slime you are not at all cold. Of course, the warm temperature also does wonders for the odor down here. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
