R {6126}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,se)}{<228>= =<088>}{As you enter another part of the dark sewer, you suddenly realize that this part isn't dark at all. Glancing up you see several rays of light which are shining down into the murky darkness. Using the newfound light you manage to actually get a good look at one of these rooms. The rusty pipes in the ceiling seem to be connected to the many drainage holes above and snake their way from above to here below. The stone walls are long since colored black by all the waste that's been dumped. Glancing down you finally get a good look at the murky water. With a shock you realize that it doesn't even resemble water. Sticky gooey substance is more like it. Several unrecognizable things float around in the water. Swallowing hard you quickly decide that you prefer the darkness. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
