R {6166}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (e,w)}{<228>= =<088>}{Immediately as you enter this area you notice a steady stream of water coming from a large hole in the ceiling. As you move about, you notice that the water in this part isn't nearly as gritty and disgusting as the other areas. The smell is also a great deal better. No way near pleasant, but better never the less. The cramped corridor continues onward in an eastern to western direction. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6165}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6167}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6167}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (e,sw)}{<228>= =<088>}{This part of the sewer appears to have had a fairly recent cave-in. Stone bricks lie in the center of the tunnel and you have to step over them to pass. The only positive with this is that the fallen stone has actually caused a small island to form. Standing on the island of stone gives you a break from all the warm gooey water for a while. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6166}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6168}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6168}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (sw,ne)}{<228>= =<088>}{The narrow sewer tunnel continues in a northeast to southwestern direction. To the southwest you think it opens up into a wider area. The stony walls that surround you are black with both age and decay and the smell down here is truly horrible. Covering the stony floor is several feet of murky slimy water which does nothing to improve the setting. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6167}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6169}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6169}{0}{<228>}{At a sewer junction (ne,e,w)}{<228>= =<088>}{Stumbling on something squishy underwater, you almost lose your balance and fall into the murky goo. Feeling with your feet, whatever you stumbled on is now gone. The tunnel here branches off in several directions. The smallest branch seems to lead off to the northeast while the wider tunnel path continues in an eastern to western direction. Peering into each fork, you fail to see any hints on where they might lead. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6168}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6170}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6171}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6170}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w)}{<228>= =<088>}{As you follow the dark tunnel you suddenly find your self face to face with a stone wall. Rather surprisingly this sewer has turned into a dead end. The warm murky water surrounds your lower legs and you frequently bump into things underwater. Trying your best not to think about what it might be you focus on the area. Looking around, you see pipes moving above you and they seem to vanish somewhere to the east above the stone wall.  }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6169}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6171}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{The fairly wide sewer tunnel continues in an eastern to western fashion. Warm, slimy water covers the bottom and your feet and legs are soaked completely. As you wade through the gooey mess, you frequently bump into things underwater. Trying not to pay it any mind, its starting to trouble you, especially when some of the things move around. High above you are several pipes running across the dark ceiling and they seem to all lead out into other parts of the sewer. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6169}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6172}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6172}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (e,w)}{<228>= =<088>}{A large rusted pipe hangs down from the ceiling and looking up you see several other that are in similar condition. Originally, it looks as if they were hung tight to the ceiling of the sewer but rust and time has sagged them down and they hang like limp dead limbs. The large rust stains have colored the greasy water light orange. The dark tunnel system continues off in an eastern to western direction. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6171}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6173}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6173}{0}{<228>}{Somewhere in the sewer (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{Loud voices echo through the murky chamber. Because the sounds are all extremely distorted down here it's very hard, if not impossible, to locate the source. As you stop and listen for a while you think you can hear another low grating sound, almost if metal was rubbed against stone. Focusing on the current tunnel section you don't notice anything that catches your eye. The monotonous surroundings continue off into the darkness. }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6172}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6174}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6174}{0}{<278>}{At a sewer entrance (u,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You're standing beneath the western sewer entrance. Looking up, you see a silvery metal grate covering the snug entrance hole. A fairly sturdy, although very rusty, ladder has been mounted to the western wall. Some daylight appears to trickle down through the cracks in the grate. However, it does very little to light up the area. In fact it's quite the opposite as your eyes are constantly working to get used to the darkness down here.  }{The City of Westersea (Sewer)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6173}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6202}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6175}{0}{<278>}{Climbing some slippery stones (d,u)}{<278>*  <088>}{Trying to scale the slippery stones you find yourself hanging on for dear life. Your fingers are scraped raw from the sharp protruding rocks. The warm greenish gas coming from below introduces a whole new level of nausea and all of a sudden the sewer stench doesn't seem too bad. As you climb you detect movement from the corner of your eye. Something is scurrying away from the ground below. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6157}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
