R {6176}{0}{<248>}{In a strange cavern (w,e,u)}{<248>% %<088>}{You're standing in what appears to be a large tunnel system. A large hole is directly above and protruding rocks in the southern cave wall would make it possible to climb up. Large rocky tunnels lead away from here in an eastern to western direction. The whole area emits a green eerie glow and a faint gray mist seems to cover the whole ground. The green glow seems to pulse softly and as it pulses you hear a faint droning sound echoing throughout the cavern. After a few pulses you quickly determine that they are connected somehow. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{westersea_cubes}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6175}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
