R {6177}{0}{<248>}{In a strange cavern (e,w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{This part of the tunnel smells strongly of something acidic. You wonder if that has something to do with the gray mist which is a lot denser here, almost as if it was clinging to the cavern wall like a fine powder. The tunnel floor is covered by a thin layer of slime which reminds you of the water that you encountered up in the sewer system.  }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6176}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6178}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
