R {6178}{0}{<248>}{At a dead end (w)}{<248>% %<088>}{Large pieces of rock cover the whole tunnel. You have to check your footing several times before you attempt to move anywhere. The ceiling hangs dangerously low over your head and for a moment you fear it might cave in. The same acidic smell that you encountered before lies very thick over the whole area. However, the grey mist or the green shimmer is nowhere to be found. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6177}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6179}{0}{<248>}{At a dead end (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{You are at a dead end. Half-broken chunks of rock cover the tunnel floor. Someone or something was working on extending the tunnel further north but for some reason the work has stopped. The thin gray mist that you've seen in other places of the tunnel system is nonexistent here. Looking up you notice that the inner ceiling of the tunnel is slightly lower than the other caverns and even though it easily is large enough for you, you feel a bit more claustrophobic than before.  }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6177}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6180}{0}{<248>}{In a circular tunnel (w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{You're in an almost circular tunnel. The walls and inner ceiling are completely smooth. Glancing off towards the west you see an eerie green glow. It appears to be fairly far away, yet it still provides adequate lighting for you to see. As you stare off towards it you notice that the tunnel section is becoming bigger and branches off in several directions. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6176}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6181}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6181}{0}{<248>}{In a enormous cavern (nw,sw,w,e,n,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{You are standing just on the eastern outskirts of what appears to be a truly enormous cavern. It stretches on far and wide to the west. Large tunnels fork out leading to other massive passageways. The rocky surface is almost completely smooth and there are no pointy edges anywhere. It's almost as if the wall was sanded down with painstaking perfection. Lit up by the radiant green glow from the west you notice that your reflection in the shiny walls is truly alien. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6180}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
