R {6182}{0}{<248>}{In a large slime filled chamber (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{As you enter this large chamber you immediately notice several large pools of slime. They seem to occupy the majority of the northern part of the room. Taking a deep breath you start to choke and gag on the sour smell of acid which lies heavily in the air. Your lungs start to burn and you can feel your body starting to deteriorate almost immediately. A murky brown shimmer seems to cover the floor and strands of sticky goo sticks to your feet as you move about. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6181}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6183}{0}{<248>}{In a enormous cavern (w,sw,s,se)}{<248>% %<088>}{You're at the northern part of a massive cavern. It stretches on in a southeastern, southern and southwestern direction. Far to the west you see another large tunnel branch off. Directly to the south is the centermost area and there is some kind of commotion there. Towering high above you is a dome shaped ceiling and its surface appear to be as smooth as the walls around you. The whole cavern smells very strongly of a mixture between acid and sulfur. Off to the southwest you see a bright green glow which lights up the whole grotto. The mist that you've been seeing down here is fairly strong and seems to grow in density in the western region of the cavern. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
