R {6184}{0}{<228>}{In a pool filled chamber (e)}{<228>= =<088>}{Several smaller pools dot the immediate area. All the pools emit a thin gray mist which clings to floor and the lower parts of the walls. The mist looks like the mist that you have seen in other parts of the underground system and this might possibly be the source of it all. The only exit from the cavern is the large opening to the east.  }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
