R {6185}{0}{<248>}{In a enormous cavern (w,e,s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{You're standing in the absolute center of an enormous underground cavern. Looking up, you see that the doomed ceiling arc high above you. The floor is as smooth as sanded wood and it's hard to believe it's in fact stone. A large pool occupies the majority of the centre area and it's pulsing in an eerie green glow. A thin coating of something unknown sticks to your feet as you move around the chamber. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
