R {6186}{0}{<248>}{In a enormous cavern (w,e,ne,se)}{<248>% %<088>}{The large cavern ends rather suddenly here. Separating this part with the tunnel to the west is a shallow crevice. It's currently filled by some orange liquid that look extremely hazardous should you come in contact with it. In the northern most part of the crevice you see a small overpass which allows you to get from one side to another. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
