R {6187}{0}{<248>}{In a strange and alien tunnel (w,e,s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{You've reached the western-most branch of the underground cave system. Smaller tunnels fork out to rooms all around you. To the east is the large centre cavern which you passed through to get here. Tall, almost complete smooth tunnel walls stand around you and they form into a dome shaped ceiling which rests somewhere high above you.  }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
