R {6188}{0}{<228>}{In a mindnumbing slimy chamber (s)}{<228>= =<088>}{Slime covers everything in this room. It covers every wall, every single piece of rock, and it even drips down from the ceiling. The color of the slime shifts as you move around in the room. It shifts from a radiant red to a pungent brown. Immediatly as you enter the large chamber you feel that your body start to tingle. It is as if you were poked and prodded by a myriad of minuscule needles. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
