R {6189}{0}{<178>}{Surrounded by mist (n)}{<178>~ ~<088>}{This chamber is completely covered by gray mist. You can barely make out your hand in front of your face. Fumbling around you try to figure out why you didn't see this before. It should be clearly visible from the outside. Bumping into various things, some more squishy than others, you at least manage to make out that the floor and the wall appears barren. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
