R {6190}{0}{<248>}{In a enormous cavern (nw,ne,w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{You're standing in the furthest south area of the enourmous cavern. It extends far to the northeast, north and northwest. A wide tunnel branches off to the west and a faint gray mist seems to originate from that direction. The mist makes it hard to make out the details of the ground but it feels almost perfectly smooth. Looking up, you see a ceiling that stretches on high above you and as the ground it's equally smooth. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
