R {6191}{0}{<248>}{In a pool filled chamber (e)}{<248>% %<088>}{There is a myriad of small holes on the western side of the chamber. Wisps of grey mist slowly puff from each and every one creating a fine misty blanket which cloaks the floor and the bottom part of the walls. As you enter it is almost as if the mist is drawn to you, seeking you out. A large opening leads east, back out to the center cavern. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
