R {6192}{0}{<248>}{In a large slime filled chamber (d,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{A burning sensation surrounds you as you enter this southern chamber. Yellow pools of slime have been dug and occupy the southern portion of the room. The floor is covered by a similar golden shimmer which seems to cling to your body as soon as you enter. Surrounding the pools on all sides are the familiar smooth cavern walls. There is a small hole in one of the corner of the room. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
