R {6193}{0}{<248>}{In a newly crafted tunnel (s,u)}{<248>% %<088>}{This tunnel is in a rather unfinished state: the walls are a little rough, not quite as smooth elsewhere; rock chunks litter the ground; and the tunnel isn't as regularly shaped as it could be. Perhaps construction is still ongoing and was stalled for some reason? Which wouldn't be surprising since you're on a lower level - this is likely the newer section of the cavern system. There is a small hole in one of the corners of the room. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
