R {6195}{0}{<248>}{At a dead end (n)}{<248>% %<088>}{Greenish slime coats the walls and floor of this cavern. The air is sour and acrid, like a foul mixture of vinegar and sulfur. You catch a glimpse of something moving, but before your eyes can adjust it's gone, leaving behing a foul smell. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
