R {6196}{0}{<248>}{At a dead end (sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{You've reach another dead end in this smaller cavern system. The tunnel from which you came vanishes into the darkness in a southwestern direction. Coating the rocky walls and ground are the now familiar slime which reeks of death and decay. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
