R {6197}{0}{<248>}{At a dead end (nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{It looks like the cavern would continue off in a southeastern direction but a recent cave-in has caused large chunk of slimy rock and debris to block the passageway. Whatever caused the tunnels to form in the firm place are clearly unstable and you can't help wondering how long these will last until they crack and fall apart. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
