R {6198}{0}{<248>}{In a misty cavern (e,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{This tunnel section is slightly larger than the ones you passed through when you entered. Whoever designed this part had some kind of plans for the layout. The chamber itself is rough-hewn and with a generous sprinkling of rocks on the floor coupled with the coiling mist forming a kind of white-silvery carpet, they make for a rather treacherous footing.  Cautiously you move on. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
