R {6199}{0}{<248>}{In a large open cavern (e,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{A huge cavernous room spreads out before you. With the proper furnishings - a long table, chairs, sconces, and rugs - it can easily be changed into a banquet hall fit for a king. The walls and floor have been sanded until they are as smooth as glass and the hall is pleasingly shaped, symmetrical in its construction - clearly, an intelligent mind has been at work on its design. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6198}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6200}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6200}{0}{<248>}{In a large open cavern (w)}{<248>% %<088>}{The large chamber looks like it would continue off into an eastern direction. However, in the middle of the chamber, is a glowing pale blue barrier which hums as you get closer. All around you are movement of one sort or another yet with the eerie glow from the barrier it's hard to focus on anything else. There is a small pile of boxes next to the barrier. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{westersea_barrier}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6199}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6201}{0}{<248>}{In a summoning chamber (e)}{<248>.<118>@<248>.<088>}{You step into a fairly small chamber. Shocked by the sudden change in decor you stare around in wonder. Up against the western wall, you see a wooden pedestal and it is currently emitting some kind of yellowish glow. A bright red circle has been drawn in the middle of the room and several lit candles have been placed in a perfect square inside of it. The smell of sulfur is incredibly strong in this room and it's clear that powerful magic is at work. Even though the lit candles provide adequate light, it is as if a shroud of darkness has been placed over the whole room. }{The City of Westersea (Chasm)}{dotar}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6187}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6202}{0}{<238>}{Before the gates of Westersea (w,d,in)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You're standing just before one of Westersea town gates. Many guards patrol the area and check everyone that is trying to enter for their purpose and their papers. Above you, you notice even more guards which are patrolling the high city walls. There is a line with people waiting before the city gate and the guards are doing their best to be as quick as possible. The harbor lies just a stone's throw off in the western direction and the smell of fish and salt water hangs like a thick blanket over the whole area. There is a small metal grate next to the road. }{The City of Westersea}{tommy}{}{}{1.000}{1}
