R {6203}{0}{<238>}{In the harbor district of Westersea (e,w,s,n)}{<238>|||<088>}{You're at the entrance to the Westersea harbor. All around you are sailors and fishermen going about their daily jobs. The town's merchants eagerly watch their goods being unloaded and you can almost see the greed in their eyes. The western gate of Westersea stands just slightly off in the eastern direction and several guards patrol the area making sure that only those with proper reason to enter may.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
