R {6204}{0}{<238>}{In the harbor district of Westersea (w,s,n)}{<238>|||<088>}{As you explore the dock region you occasionally bump into a sailor. They never pay any attention to you and comfortably move around you with bizarre grace. You, however, have to constantly watch the wooden boards so you don't accidentally fall into the water. High above you shines the warm sun making this an exceptional day. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
