R {6205}{0}{<148>}{In the harbor district of Westersea (s)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{This part of the dock is mostly reserved for maintenance of different ship and fishing utensils. Several nets are mounted on wooden poles and fishermen are examining them with painstaking scrutiny. A sudden shift in wind tells you that today, plenty of fish were caught. Someone has errected a small makeshift stand here. }{The City of Westersea}{abes}{}{}{1.000}{1}
