R {6206}{0}{<238>}{In the harbor district of Westersea (e,s)}{<238>|||<088>}{A large fishing vessel seems to have just recently arrived. Large barrels which reek of fish are being carried off towards the town while harbor workers are trying frantically to keep track of everything. The wooden planks that the dock is resting on are partly covered by fish residue making it slippery and hazardous to walk on. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
