R {6209}{0}{<238>}{In the harbor district of Westersea (n)}{<238>|||<088>}{Standing in the far southern part of the docks you have a fair view over the entire area. Here and to the west, large ships dock and anchor while the smaller ships and fishing vessels dock closer to land. Several men carrying large leather books walk around taking painstaking notes of everything that enters as well as leaves the harbor. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
