R {6216}{0}{}{At a southwestern fishing spot (return)}{ }{Thick dark clouds hang low in the sky and as you watch them they seem to move fairly fast. A brisk wind flows in from the east creating waves which causes your little vessel to move slightly too much for your liking. Cold droplets of rain fall over you, drenching your clothing and equipment.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
