R {6217}{0}{}{At a southern fishing spot (return)}{ }{Thick dark clouds hang low in the sky and as you watch them they seem to move fairly fast. A brisk wind flows in from the east creating waves which causes your little vessel to move slightly too much for your liking. Cold droplets of rain fall over you, drenching your clothing and equipment. Just as you thought it couldn't get worse you see flashing streaks of lightning hitting the watery surface and shortly after a resounding booming noise echoes over the black waves.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
