R {6222}{0}{}{The Beginning of Infinity (e,w,n,u,s)}{ }{You are standing in a long, swirling hallway that stretches onward as far as your eyesight allows.  Unexplainable barriers block your passage in most directions though you stand at the precipice of greatness.  An exit leads northward to Eradan's musings.  A southern gateway leads into Beren's imagination. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
