R {6223}{0}{}{Base of a mountain (e)}{ }{You are on a small plateau at the base of the mountain. The Verbeeg camp located in the ravine below is clearly visible and the climb down is only a few meters in length. The mountain rises up steeply without any jagged edges to pull yourself further up. The plateau you are on is stable and wide enough for you to travel to the east. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
