R {6227}{0}{}{Mountain trail (w)}{ }{Looking down, you see the Verbeeg camp located in the valley below. The camp is only noticeable by the huts and fires that are found down there with the Verbeegs themselves barely distinguishable. The trail comes to a sudden end eastward due to some impact which took out a large portion of the trail. There are also no visible means to scale this part of the mountainside. A small crack is here. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
