R {6228}{0}{}{High up on a mountain ledge (e)}{ }{The weather at this altitude is rougher than it was lower down the mountain. A strong breeze is constantly pushing you to one side and flurries of snow travel lightly in the air. You are situated on a ledge that leads to the east and drops off to a nasty fall to the bottom of the mountain westward. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
