R {6229}{0}{}{High up on a mountain ledge (w,e)}{ }{The mountainside curves slightly as you travel along the ledge, blocking the view of what lies ahead or behind you. The ledge is very narrow, forcing you to travel with your body as close to the mountain wall as possible. Various branches and roots protrude out of the mountain cliff and they sometimes snag your clothing when you aren't paying attention. These protruding objects also provide a grip for scaling the mountain. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
