R {6230}{0}{}{High up on a mountain ledge (w)}{ }{Your body starts to shiver a bit from the wind-chill factor you are forced to endure. Looking above, you notice that there is still a great distance to be climbed before you reach the top of the mountain and you hope that what you seek can be found before then. The ledge slowly blends into the mountainside eastward until it is completely gone. The mountain wall has the right curves and angles to provide traveling further up. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
