R {6231}{0}{}{Snow covered mountain trail (e)}{ }{A wild snow storm pushes you about and snowflakes are blown into your face. Despite the weather, you are hearty enough to journey on. The trail you have found leads a little higher up the mountain to the east and the mountain walls are too icy to scale up any farther. The trail is heavily covered in snow and each step you take sinks down until it reaches a solid surface. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
