R {6232}{0}{}{Snow covered mountain trail (w)}{ }{The air is abundant with flakes of snow making long distance sight impossible. The howling wind scoops the snow off the mountainside and tosses it into the air as if it was joyfully playing. The trail is deeply covered in snow as it continues eastward and any further travel in that direction would freeze your body solid. Luckily, the wind has eroded the mountain in such a way as to make advancement upwards feasible. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
