R {6233}{0}{}{Small mountain clearing (w)}{ }{While not at the top of the mountain, you have come upon a large plateau in which many trees have grown. This area looks as if a chunk of the mountain was ripped out leaving such a leveled area behind. The mountain wall in the distance shoots vertically up too sharply to allow climbing up it. The wind still blows snow everywhere but you seem to make out the outline of a tower to the west. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
