R {6234}{0}{}{Outside an isolated tower (enter,e)}{ }{The repetitive snow covered landscape is interrupted by a misplaced tower overlooking the mountain cliff. The storm blows its material against the rectangular stones that make up the sizable tower. The single story tower's only opening is an entrance way that faces the edge of the mountain. Movement to the north and west are blocked by steep mountain walls leaving the eastern direction your only path along the mountain. }{Ice Mountains}{cryohydra}{}{}{1.000}{1}
