R {6235}{0}{}{Inside an inhabited tower (out)}{ }{You have stepped into a well lit room that is drenched in magic. The circular structure has tall walls that bring out the depth in your surroundings. The tower is cluttered with mystical reagents, stacks and stacks of books, and rotting corpses of sacrificed animals. There is also some basic furniture, a desk, chair, bed, yet they are much larger in size than you are used to seeing. The air is quite warm in here but there doesn't seem to be any source of heat radiating the room.  A small portal hangs overhead. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
