R {6237}{0}{}{entryway (w,leave)}{ }{You are in the entryway of a small keep here on the border of the icelands. The structure is small but well built. Looking closer at the walls and floor you can see scorch marks and broken weapons scattered all over. It seems like the small castle has been the target of a recent raid by vandals. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
