R {6238}{0}{}{courtyard (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are standing in the courtyard of the small keep now. This is a scene of total horror to see. Corpses are strewn about like childrens toys and are now left steaming in the cold morning air. The carnage of the remains you see are horrible. Broken weapons and armour lie about as well. You wonder who could have been so vicious and evil as to do this. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
