R {6239}{0}{}{eating hall (d,s,w,e)}{ }{This room was once the eating hall. The large oaken table is now scratched and cracked in many places. The once-exquisite chandelier lies in a broken heap in one corner. Small torches light the dark room with a pale golden light. The room lends itself to a feeling of honor, honor fouled by evil. }{Unknown}{hk}{}{}{1.000}{1}
