E {6245}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6240}{0}{}{servant's quarters (s)}{ }{You shudder when you enter the room. This was the servant's quarters for the keep. The entire room is in disarray now. Drawers have been ripped apart by thieves, and the dresser mirror has been broken. On the torn bed lies a once-beautiful girl. She is dead now and appears to have been raped many times over. The entire scene lends you to a feeling of utter horror and repulsion. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6238}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6241}{0}{}{guard's quarters (n)}{ }{This was once the guard's quarters for the castle. The room is strewn with broken bits of furniture and weapons. Like all the other rooms in the keep, burn marks blot the walls with a horrible design. The stench of death is horrible in here and you want to leave. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6238}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6242}{0}{}{master's room (e)}{ }{A feeling of sadness and despair wash over you like a shroud of guilt as you enter the room. This room has been spared much destruction of the other areas of the keep, but still remains in disarray. A bed and chairs are smashed into timber and a stone fireplace against the north wall lies in rubble, fouled with a stench which makes you recoil. A young woman and her son are here now and they cower away from you with terror and abject fear in their eyes. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6239}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6243}{0}{}{stables (n,w)}{ }{This is the stables for the keep. You can't believe what you see here. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
