E {6244}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6244}{0}{}{chicken coop (e)}{ }{This is a chicken coop west of the stables. This is where some of the delicious meat of the keep came from.  That was before the violence though. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
