R {6245}{0}{}{hallway (sw,u)}{ }{A dark hallway beneath the keep. The sorrow is strong and you sense great evil. To go southwest would be against your complete and better judgement. The horror you feel is causing your mind to scream. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
