R {6247}{0}{<218>}{Ethereal Tomb (u,d)}{<218>. .<088>}{You find yourself standing in the front section of this walled compound. Recent activity has effectively cleared the forest from the compound, whilst the casual scattering of trees would to the careless observer still portray an air of neglect. To the east a large stone building bisects this compound, while small groves of ancient trees can be seen in the northwest and southwest sections of this large compound.  }{Pinnacle}{death}{}{}{1.000}{1}
