R {6262}{0}{}{Rabbit Hole (e)}{ }{You have entered the throne room to the King Rabbit.  The place is in complete disarray.  The once small and humble throne has been converted into a torn and tattered mishmash of bone and flesh. The once serene rabbit kingdom has been twisted and evil.  What could have caused such a change? }{Rabbit Fields}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
