R {6263}{0}{}{Below the Rabbit Throne (n,u)}{ }{You are standing in a corridor below the Rabbit King's Throne.  A sense of evil hangs in the air like a fog.  Chills run through your spine as a small waft of air blows down from above.  The ground is littered with bones and the walls run red with blood. }{Rabbit Fields}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
