R {6264}{0}{}{The Alchemist's Lab (s)}{ }{This room is utterly packed with vials and scrolls and beakers and burners and thousands of items and unknown creations.  Burning liquids line tables and scrolls hang in the air dotted with incomprehensible formulas.  Stools lie on the floor, kicked out of the way in a haphazard array.  Green sticky goo covers the floor, composed of hundreds of experiments gone wrong... }{Rabbit Fields}{cae}{}{}{1.000}{1}
