R {6279}{0}{<258>}{Entrance to the Dragon Realms (sw,u,vortex)}{<258>(<158>P<258>)<088>}{You are standing in the entrance to the dragon realms, a very dangerous place for mortals.  It is here that the Dragons have chosen to make their new homes since the Prime Material plane has been overrun with humans. Obligatory warning: This area is created upon the premise that dragons have been around since the dawn of time, and are thus more powerful than any other creature known to exist... Consider this your final warning. }{The Dragon Realms}{dragon_realms}{}{}{1.000}{1}
