R {6280}{0}{<238>}{Mountain Path (ne,w)}{<238>.^.<088>}{You are walking along a mountain path that winds upward to the northeast and downward to the west.  Off in the distance you can see dragons flying through the air, entering and exiting caves and valleys. }{The Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
