R {6281}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,climb)}{<238>"""<088>}{You have entered the realm of Neutral Dragons. A dull red glow illuminates the area around you as if warning you of impending doom. To the east is the mountain trail you came down from. You are surrounded by trees and mountains in every direction. The air smells of fresh forest air unpolluted by the stench of mankind. To your northeast a gaping canyon opens the ground to reveal a river flowing along the bottom. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6282}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6280}{climb}{climb}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
