R {6282}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You seem to have traveled a long way. Far off to the east you can see the red glow of the portal you arrived through. Mountains surround you to the  south and west. The valley you are traveling through twists north just ahead. Trees skirt the bottom of the mountains. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6281}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6283}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6283}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are standing on the western edge of the large canyon you saw before. The mountains to the west of you continue along northward. The trees seems  slightly less dense here than in the rest of the valley. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6282}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6284}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6284}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{The mountains to the west slowly lower themselves to the ground until they  are finally low enough to actually be passable. The canyon has expanded to  the north here making for a nice view but bad for travelling. The trees have also thinned out here. The air here seems to almost glow. You feel strange. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6283}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6285}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6285}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{The glow in the air has followed you here. The ground is covered in a thin layer of volcanic ash. In fact everything here is covered in volcanic ash. The sky is dark. The trees stand like silent guardians of the realm. Even the wind is calm. You are very uneasy. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6284}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6286}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6286}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{The mountains begin to rise again to the east. The ash is everywhere here as we well. You can see a small box canyon to the south and to southwest you see sunlight reflecting off a large body of water. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6285}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6287}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6288}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6287}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n)}{<238>. .<088>}{You have entered into a small box canyon. The sides are overgrown with small plants and lichens. Water seems to sweat from the steep walls and  trickle down to form a small stream of clear, cool water. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6286}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6288}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You climb to the top of a small hill and look around. Far off to the north a huge black mountain looms up into the sky. You can see smoke rising from fissures in the mountain. To the east you can see the light of the portal  you arrived here through, as well as the canyon. As you scan the western horizon you see a long thin lake surrounded by mountains. And to the south you see a piece of jagged rock jutting out of the ground like  a needle. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6286}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6289}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6289}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{You have walked down the hill and stand close to the lake you saw. Thankfully you have a lot of tree cover here and the dragons shouldn't be  able to see you. Trees grow profusely along the entire shore-line. You can follow the shore to the south and the west. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6288}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6290}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6293}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6290}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{Light shimmers off the glass-like surface of the lake. The trees have thinned slightly here, however they still provide adequate coverage for you. To the south mountains rear up and the path you are on begins to gradually move upwards. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6289}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6291}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6291}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{Trees are few and far between now. A large mountain to the east blocks any  attempts to move in that direction, and its steep barren slopes don't look like they could be climbed. There is a light wind that carries with a scent  of fresh water. The beach to the southwest is barren of vegetation only smooth sand is washed over with the tide of the lake. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6290}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6292}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6292}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n)}{<238>. .<088>}{The mountains to the east have dropped off and now a monumental canyon gapes before you to the east and south. The lake has widened out slightly and is now just to the west. There are no trees for cover here and you feel extremely paranoid about being seen by the great creatures in the lake. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6291}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6293}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The lake begins to narrow out here and becomes slightly more shallow. The trees have begun to thin out as well. You could be easily seen from the air here. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6289}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6294}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6294}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{The trees are completely gone here. The ground is rocky and covered in ash. The entire landscape is almost completely barren. The dragons circling above you are starting to rally in your direction. Steep mountain sides block you to the north and east. You are on the north eastern tip of the lake. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6293}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6295}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6295}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{Trees begin to grow again here. The sky is very dark and pregnant with rain. Lightning dances across the heavens and thunder rolls though the air. The lake begins to churn and the dragons turn toward the west. The mountains to the north have lowered slightly and are now passable. However to the west the trees now grow too densely to move through. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6294}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6296}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6296}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{You have moved though the steep mountain path. To the east is a very deep crack running along the plateau you are standing on. To the north a steep  mountain wall prevents you from moving north. You have a better view of the  lake from here and of the dragons who are moving swiftly towards something to the far west. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6295}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6297}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6297}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The wall of rock to the north has settled to the ground in a gentle slope. A well-trodden path to the south offers passage closer to the western shore of the lake. West of here a great stand of trees looks oddly out of place  from the rest of the terrain. The air is still here, and you notice a great clamor in the distant west. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6296}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6298}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6358}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6387}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6298}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You have entered a short valley just north of the now calm crystalline blue lake you saw earlier. Barren grey mountains rise high into the sky to the east and  west. There is a light scattering of ash on the ground, but it has been worked into the ground for the most part and is hardly noticeable at all. The scant, low-lying vegetation that grows on the ground here is mostly scrub brush and thorn bushes. A low, almost unnoticeable sound rides on the wind from the  north-west. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6297}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6299}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6299}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are standing at the start of a huge valley system which seems to lead off to the west.  Far to the north you can see several mountains dotting the skyline, and to the southeast you can see a spire towering in the sky. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6298}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6300}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6300}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You are standing at a turnoff in the valley you are in.  From here the valley leads off to the east, and to the south.  Far to the southeast you can see a spire towering in the sky. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6299}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6301}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6301}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,n)}{<228>, .<088>}{The valley you are travelling in appears to continue for quite some distance to the north and south.  The walls of the valley do not seem to have any other exits that may lead you out of here.  Far to the southeast you can see a spire towering into the sky. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6300}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6302}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6302}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You are standing at the beginning of a long valley which seems to stretch for quite some distance to the north.  To the east you can see a connecting valley.  And far to the southeast you can see a towering spire reaching into the sky. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
