R {6349}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are standing atop a large barren hill.  From here you can see for quite a distance.  To the north you can see a peaceful ravine with a cave in it.  To the east you can see the beginnings of a large plain and to the south the hill leads down into a small valley. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
