R {6350}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n)}{<228>, `<088>}{This small valley does not quite impress you.  There are a few trees and plants, but it all appears very drab.  You think about leaving and the only apparent exit from this area appears to be a path leading out of the valley to the north. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
