R {6351}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,n,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{The ravine you have entered is a lot deeper than you originally guessed it was.  All around you plants of every sort are flourishing here.  Looking up you see the sunlight mixing with some mist to form a large rainbow. As your eyes follow the rainbow from one end to the other, you notice that where the rainbow ends at the east wall there is a large cave opening. To the north and south there are paths out of the ravine. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
