R {6352}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are at the opening of a large cave.  The first thing you notice about this cave is the lack of stalagmites and stalactites.  The cave appears to be in very good proportions as if it was not a natural occurrence.  But upon closer inspection you fail to notice any indications that this is not a naturally formed cave.  The exit from the cave is to the west, and you feel as if you are being beckoned to continue north. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
