E {6353}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6353}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are at the mid-point of a large cave, this part of the cave is also strangely barren of stalagmites and stalactites.  As you stare around the cave you notice how well proportioned and even it is, leading you to think that it was constucted rather than a natural occurrence.  But when you inspect it more thoroughly, you are unable to find any indication that it  is not a natural occurrence.  To the south you can see a light entering the cave and to the east the cave continues. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
