R {6354}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have come to an ending in the cave, from here you can see that the cave opens to the outside to the south.  It is difficult to tell what is outside the cave, due to the sunlight which seems brighter than usual after being in the dark cave.  To the west the cave continues and to the south there is an exit from the cave. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6353}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
