R {6355}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n)}{<228>, `<088>}{The cave you were in has put you out onto a ledge about halfway up a very large canyon wall.  From here you have a great view of the canyon and you are able to see for miles around.  To the east you can see that the ledge drops off and falls for over 1000 feet, and to the north you see a cave leading into the cliff face. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6354}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6356}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{The path you are following appears to be in rough shape, as if a creature of great size ran through here.  Alot of the trees and plants have been snapped off, and there are several large burn marks in the earth.  To the south there appears to be a small ravine, and to the west the path you are following continues. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
