R {6357}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{The ground here is in fairly poor condition, as if a creature of great size ran through here at a very fast pace.  A lot of the trees and plants have been broken off, and there are several large gouges in the earth.  To the north there appears to have been a conflict of some sort, and to the east the field continues. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
