R {6358}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have entered into a cluster of HUGE trees. Some of the trees stand well over one-hundred feet, and even the smallest of them dwarfs any tree that you have seen. The trees seem to grow in a circle around a large clearing, where the ground is barren and devoid of life. Some of the innermost trees show evidence of scorching and other damage. There are paths leading west, east, and south from here. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
