R {6361}{0}{}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e)}{<158>H<088>}{You are standing under a rock outcropping. Moss hangs from the rock above you and, in places, almost reaches the ground. There is a cool breeze blowing across your skin in the shade.  }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{huvele}{}{}{1.000}{1}
