R {6373}{0}{<228>}{Entrance to the Castle of the Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{Before you stands a wonder of magical engineering. A castle made entirely of crystal and gemstone. Towering spires reach for the heavens and long  battlements wave brightly colored banners. You cannot see a single joint or crack along the walls of the structure as if it were carved out of one solid piece of gemstone. The castle is skirted by a wide moat full of a flowing green liquid. The drawbridge however, is down and would allow you passage into the castle, if you dare. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
