R {6374}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You feel very small and insignificant as you look around you. Decadent opulence is only overpowered by the feeling of immense power and emanating from every corner of this huge chamber. Torches hang on the wall in crystal sconces and  illuminate the room. The walls are without crack or crevice and seem to be fused together through some powerful heat source. Heads of powerful beasts line the walls like trophies taken in battle. Torchlight flickers and dances within the walls casting shadows like ghosts out of the corner of your eye. A tingle of paranoia shivers down your spine as you imagine what powerful creatures might inhabit this mighty fortress. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
