R {6376}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{This small alcove is only small in relation to the rest of the castle. Your skin crawls with the feeling of magic in the air, and the pulse of power. The walls here have darkened to a crimson tint and the light seems heavy in the air. The light seems dimmer in here. While you can still see clearly the corners of the room are faded in shadows. A massive door stands eerily open on the  western wall. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
