R {6377}{0}{}{Councillors' chambers in the Neutral Dragon Realms (e)}{<118>G<088>}{Torches hang along the sparkling walls in sconces. Your eyes adjust to the light and your pulse begins to quicken. The walls are draped with tapestries of epic battles between dragons of all shapes and sizes. Nothing much else catches your interest, except maybe the footfalls you hear crashing down behind you. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{gaadaan}{}{}{1.000}{1}
