R {6378}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{Your footfalls thunder like battledrums echoing throughout this gargantuan chamber. Torchlight dances across the gleaming walls. The ceiling of this  room is skirted by long colourful tapestries that hang almost to the floor. Glittering crystals hang magically in the air above you, suspended by some unknown power. There is a large door to the south that stands open. It appears  that this is an ante-chamber. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6375}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
