R {6379}{0}{}{Princely Chambers in the Neutral Dragon Realms (e)}{<128>Z<088>}{As you enter this room a burst of brilliant light assaults your eyes and your vision fails for a split second. As you open your eyes you are amazed by what you see. The walls are covered with beautiful, flowing script, that has been etched into them from floor to ceiling. Indeed even the floor and ceiling are covered with the same writing. A pile of gemstones dominates the north-western  corner of the chamber, as it glitters by the magical light that fills the room. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{ziafen}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6378}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6380}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{Your jaw drops as you enter this chamber. The grandiose splendor that surrounds you could not have been even dreamed of by you before you had seen it. Piles of gems the size of your fist sit at the far western end of the room. Golden statues and towering stacks of coins dwarf anything you have ever seen. The scent of incense hangs heavy in the air and wafts along on air currents that circulate through the room. The crowning glory of this room, that which makes it surpass all your wildest dreams, the one thing that dominates all other treasure in this room, is the gargantuan statue standing along the northern wall. Nothing else catches your interest in this room. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
