R {6381}{0}{}{The Royal Chambers of the Neutral Dragon Realms (e)}{<058>N<088>}{The entire chamber seems to have been cut from a vein of precious gems. The room is dominated by a throne more massive than any you could have imagined. Even the floor is a mirror of gemstones. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{nemoulu}{}{}{1.000}{1}
