R {6387}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are standing at the base of the enormous, black volcano. It sits like a squatting giant to the north. The path continues on toward the volcano and ends  at a small cavern. The path also curves to the west and into a small forest of green, coniferous darkness. The wind draws the freshness from the trees in the west and it caresses your face, beckoning you to follow its  sweetness. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
