R {6388}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{The ground becomes a little muddy here, the further west you travel. Trees stand like silent sentinels, guarding this serene beauty. The wind blows softly against your cheeks and carries the scent of green forests on it. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
