R {6389}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have come to a dead end on the path. The trees close in around you and  completely block any further passage in any direction but back the way you  came. Small, glittering specks of light play along the ground among the grass and bushes. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6388}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6390}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s)}{<228>, `<088>}{You keep heading deeper and deeper into the beautiful forest of green. The trees become even more green, the further north you travel. Suddenly though, the path stops and you are staring out over an ocean of blue water, from atop a large plateau. Unless you can fly this is as far as you can go. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
