R {6391}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{ You enter the cavern and realize that it is bigger than you first thought. Stalagmites and stalactites grow from the floor and ceiling. Some have been broken off though, and lay on the ground. It seems hotter in here than it was outside. The cavern opens up into a large passage heading east into  darkness. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
