E {6392}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6392}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{Smoke tendrils rise from cracks in the walls and floor, and there is a smell in the air that you can't quite identify. The smoke is definitely not harsh toxins seeping up from the bowels of the earth. In fact it brings with it an almost pleasant and relaxing sensation. The passage continues deeper into the volcano to the south. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
