R {6393}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The heat is beginning to get to you. The air is almost stifling here, with  the heat and smoke and humidity. The passage takes an eastward twist here and as you look down the passage you can see a glow on the far eastern wall. Smoke still issues forth from tiny cracks in the floor and walls. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6392}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
