R {6394}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The smoke is thick in the air and your vision is beginning to become obscured. You can see the glow along the far eastern wall from here but any details are lost in the smoke. The walls are hidden behind a screen of whiteness, as is the floor. Not much to see here overall. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
