R {6395}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have come to the end of the passage east. The glow on the wall is coming from somewhere to the north. The smoke is not so thick here. You can actually see the walls and the floor through it. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
