R {6397}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have to crawl along the ground to get through some parts of this passage. The ground is littered with small, sharp stones that dig into your elbows and knees as you crawl on your belly like a worm. The small amount of light that trickles in from behind you slowly winks out, but light begins to appear again ahead of you.  }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6396}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6398}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6398}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have to squeeze through a tight opening to enter this room. You stare in wonder at the cavernous size of this area and at the source of the light. In the center of the room sits a pool of pure liquid light. The room is so bright you are almost blinded by the rays radiating from the pool. The ceiling is so high that the light begins to dim before you see it. There is a annex to this cavern to the west. To the north and south are small openings in the walls that would afford passage. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6397}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6399}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6400}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6399}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e)}{<228>, `<088>}{This alcove is smaller than it originally looked. The rock face to the west is covered with strange marks that are illuminated by the intense light that floods into the room from the pool to the east. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6398}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6400}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{This twisty passage is so low and narrow that you have to crawl on your hands and knees to get through it. The ground is covered in small stones protruding to the center. Your knees and elbows are continually scraped. To the south, you can see the source of the light that illuminates this room. To the north, and east, you see nothing but darkness. In the background you can hear water dripping. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
