R {6401}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,w,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{You squeeze through the narrow passage and plop out into a large room filled with steam. The rocky walls are hot to the touch and you find the floor to  be warm as well even through your boots. You can't see the ceiling from here, but there looks to be a ledge atop the east wall. The passage continues to the south and back to the west the way you came. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
