R {6402}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have reached a dead end in the tunnel system. There is a large hotspring here. This hotspring must be the source of the steam.  }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6401}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6403}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have entered a hall of stone. The air seems full of goodness here.  Everything from the stalactites and the stalagmites to the walls and ceiling have a glow of happiness about them. Even the smoke filtering into the room and the lava slowly creeping in seem unmenacing. The hall extends to the east and north and a small tunnel will allow passage south. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
