R {6406}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{This cavernous hall is illuminated by a bright orange glow coming from the  distant east. The walls sparkle and glitter with light from small gems  embedded into them as the orange glow washes over the entire room. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
