R {6407}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have found the source of the glow. There is a huge lake of molten stone and metal here. Crystalline dragons of all shapes and sizes lie basking in the warmth and light. You can see small islands in the middle where larger dragons have claimed the best spots. High above you, you can see the open sky through a large opening that can only be the mouth of the volcano. You don't feel very safe out here in open view for these mighty beasts to see. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6406}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6408}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The walls encase you in a tomb of darkness here. You can feel life crackling in the air like electricity but it doesn't seem to transfer over to you. Like a feather on the breeze you just can't catch. You shiver from the  sensation. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
