R {6409}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The long corridor continues on east and west in a long stretch of splintered basalt walls and floor. The air is charged with energy and you almost feel a  spring in your step. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
