R {6410}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{The air is hot and damp here. The passage west is straight and even. The  passage south slopes upwards slowly then at an alarming rate until the top is dozens of feet higher up than where you are standing. There is a rush of wind that blows down the natural stone ramp. The wind is hot and almost burns your face. The ceiling height changes accordingly with the elevation of the floor. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6409}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
