R {6412}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have to duck your head as you enter this short passageway along the ledge.  To the south you can still peek your head over and see the fiery pool of molten lava and the congregation of dragons around it. You feel a rush of wind and  it carries the fresh smell of outside air mingled with sulphur and smoke. The mouth of the volcano is above you just to the south. Passages lead off to the north, east and west. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
