R {6413}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{Light glitters off the walls here like they are mirrors. The passageway leads off to the south and east. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
