R {6414}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The air in here seems to be getting thinner and you begin to breathe heavier. The walls literally glow as light bounces off of them in all different  directions. You can hear muted cries from the eastward passage. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
