R {6416}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The narrow ledge you are standing on begins to widen and lower to the east. You find yourself hugging the wall for fear of falling into the huge pool of lava far below you to the south. You are inches from your doom. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
