R {6421}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n)}{<228>, `<088>}{This small cavern is littered with debris. The walls to the north and west are scorched and partly melted in some parts. Along the southern wall you can see a small hole. Upon closer investigation you realize that the entire southern wall is made of a crystalline substance that dully reflects your light. The room is uncomfortably silent considering the screeches you heard emanating from here before you entered. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
