R {6463}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{The heat still lingers from the impact of the meteor. You can feel your face begin to flush and turn red. The heavy smell of sulphur and ammonia don't seem to be flushed from the air by the constant light breeze. You can smell fresh rain somewhere in the mix as well, although maybe it's just another component of the meteor that evaporated into the air. A small pass in the surrounding mountains opens to the south. The edge of the crater continues north and west of here. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
