R {6464}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e,n)}{<238>, .<088>}{This is like a scene from your mind of the netherworlds. Steam and smoke rise from the base of the crater and carry with it the scent of fire and brimstone. You stare in amazement and see in your mind's eye a vision of apocalyptic doom that will one day come to pass in every world of every part of the universe. You shed a tear at the inevitable fate that you know cannot be avoided. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
