R {6474}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are standing in the entrance to some sort of cave system, the bright sunlight entering the cave from the west is making it hard for you to  focus on anything.  You can tell that all the stalagmites and stalactites that used to be here have been broken off somehow.  To the east the cave opens up into the sunlight, and to the south the cave continues on into darkness. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
