R {6479}{0}{<248>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{You have come to the end of the cave.  At this point in the cave there appear to be fewer stalagmites and stalactites here.  The dark cave walls appear to be in sharp contrast to the bright sunshine, which is entering the cave from a much larger opening than the one you first entered from.  The cave heads back west the way you came, and east out of the cave into the sunshine. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
