R {6480}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,w)}{<228>( *<088>}{You squint as you come out and into the sunshine.  You appear to have left the cave to come into some secluded valley.  This is one of the most beautiful places you have ever been, you have never seen such an abundance of such pure life before.  The grass seems greener, the trees taller, the songs of life sing all around you.  Oddly you feel like you are trespassing here.  The valley continues to the north, and back west is the cave you entered through. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6479}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6481}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6481}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{The valley continues here, the rolling hills are put into perspective by the bright sunlight, this is definitely nature at its best.  The tall grass feels comfortable to walk on, and the trees provide an ample amount of shade.  You feel like you are in heaven.  There also seems to be a presence that makes you feel unwelcome.  The valley here branches to the east and south. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6480}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6482}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6482}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,w,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{The trees are becoming more sparse here and the valley is becoming shallow. You are still bothered by the feeling that you are trespassing, but you put it behind you and enjoy the beautiful landscape.  The valley continues to the north and west, and to the east you can see the beginning of some plains. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6481}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6483}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6484}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6483}{0}{<238>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s)}{<238>(<148>~<238>)<088>}{You have arrived at a cul de sac, the valley ends here as you see a large waterfall pouring water into a small pool.  The spray from the waterfall causes the light to bend and twist into a beautiful rainbow.  Trees and  other plants are growing healthily, the trees and other bushes seem to be growing in a pre-arranged pattern.  You have an eerie feeling about being here.  The valley here continues to the south. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6482}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6484}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have arrived on an apparently well tended field.  The odd thing that strikes you is that there is no sign that anyone takes care of it.  As you stop to take a better look at the field you see a multitude of flowers growing in huge coalescing patterns.  To the east and north the plains drop off and turn into cliffs, beyond which you can see an ocean.  You realize that you are on a plateau, it continues to the south.  And a valley is to the west. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6482}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6485}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6485}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The fields here have taken a more ominous look to them.  While still the picture of health something feels wrong to you.  As you survey the surrounding area you get a chill for some inexplicable reason.  You should seriously consider heading back.  As you gaze southward an ocean is in sight which seems rather inviting.  The plains continue to the north, east and west. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6484}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6486}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6487}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6486}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (e)}{<228>, `<088>}{This part of the plains ends as the plains drop off into cliffs in all directions but the one you came from.  To the west and north you are  looking down on a valley, and to the the south the cliffs drop off and a large ocean starts.  You feel very unwelcome here. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6485}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6487}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The plains here are steadily narrowing out into a plateau that continues to the east.  The grass and vegetation growing here looks to be the picture of health, but something still doesn't feel right.  To the north and south the plateau drops off, and you can see an ocean.  To the west you can see the start of a large field. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6485}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6488}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6488}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{The plateau continues to steadily lose width as you travel eastward.  The plant life here is starting to thin out, baring exposed clumps of earth with the occasional plant or stand of grass growing here.  To the north and south the plateau drops off, and you can see the ocean.  To the west the  start of a field is visible. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6487}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6489}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6489}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (n,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{The plateau has come to an end here, gazing around you can see the ocean in all directions except the west.  To the west you see the plateau expanding and turning into a grassland.  To the north you see a small trail leading down the cliff wall. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6488}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6490}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6490}{0}{<228>}{Neutral Dragon Realms (s)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have climbed down, and are now standing at the base of a very steep cliff.  Water laps on rocks in front of you, and you are a short distance away from a reef that lies out in the sea.  To the south you can see the trail you climbed down to get here, and in all other directions you can see the ocean. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{auro}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6489}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7357}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6491}{0}{<278>}{Castle Foyer (u,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are standing in the foyer to a dark and forboding castle. Wind howls through the halls and a chill runs down your spine. The walls are crafted of a dark, possibly clay based stone.  They are well crafted but the stones are rough and grooved from years of erosion and from the constant, yet slight wind that blows through. There are cob-web riddled sconces on the walls, but they are not functioning.  A passage leads deeper into the castle. }{Shansabyk's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6267}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6492}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6492}{0}{}{Forboding Passage (nw,s)}{ }{You are standing in a passage of a dark and foreboding castle. Wind howls through the halls and a chill runs down your spine. The walls are crafted of a dark, possibly clay based stone.  They are well crafted but the stones are rough and grooved from years of erosion and from the constant, yet slight wind that blows through. Signs of battle abound here... Dried blood on the floor, bone fragments swept into the corners, and broken weapon shards litter the room. }{Shansabyk's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
