R {6496}{0}{<248>}{Western Guest Quarters (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You are in the guest quarters to the west of the throne room. This is where very powerful allies of Shansabyk are allowed to stay whenever they are visiting.  The not so powerful ones are lucky if if they are allowed inside at all. There is a bed and a small dresser here. }{Shansabyk's Castle}{sauk}{}{}{1.000}{1}
