R {6498}{0}{<238>}{Before the Throne (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{You stand at the end of the throne room in a mass of twisted bone fragments and upon a crimson hued floor.  Ahead of you lies the great throne of this castle.  The walls here have shackles upon them and therein lie only the memories of the poor souls that have died within their grasp. Chills pass through you intermittently, and you almost feel a force pushing you back out from this room.  It's almost as if the life energies of those that died here were warning you to stay away. }{Shansabyk's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6495}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
