R {6499}{0}{<138>}{Before the Throne (s)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{You are standing before the Throne of the owner of this castle.  It is more ergonomically designed than it is picturesque.  It appears to be constructed from demon hide and demon bone, with a soft mat of fur for a cushion.  It looks very comfortable but not very pleasant.  The back of the throne is matted with dried blood and hair apparently worn off the master's armor.  A foul smell drifts around the room, though not enough to make you stagger. }{Shansabyk's Castle}{shansabyk}{}{}{1.000}{1}
