R {6500}{0}{<248>}{A Cold, Dark Place (portal)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{You're standing in an eerie place, mists swirl beneath your feet, darkness surrounds you, there are no walls, almost no features, no ceiling, and potentially no floor.  The only features you see are a huge anvil and a billowing fire nearby. }{Shansabyk's Castle}{grathmoore}{}{}{1.000}{1}
