R {6533}{0}{}{Eastwick Road (n,s)}{ }{This is the Eastwick road.  The lurching, sidewinding street leads straight as an arrow north and south, or rather south and north, or perhaps both at the same time.  The mottled sky is dark and shadowy, caused both by the existence and non- existence of a fixed source of light, and the giant warehouse that floats happily over your halo.  Which way to head?  Which way to feet?  Which way to the nearest nail factory?  Questions, questions. }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
