R {6535}{0}{}{Eastwick Road (n,s)}{ }{As you travel west you start to realize... You are going south. The world in eastwick is chaotic and turned around.  To the south is a barren wasteland.  It looks as though it has been hit by an atomic weapon.  The gooey tar-like substance was once an asphalt road.  You can almost feel the radiation pouring through your shoes. The road to the north leads into eastwick.  The road south trails off into a steamy, twisted world. }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
