R {6586}{0}{}{Zelligar's Castle (e,w,s)}{ }{A cool breeze blows through this hallway, which splits off to the south and continues to the east.  It feels almost as if you were standing outside, but your surroundings tell you this is false. }{Zelligar's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6585}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
