R {6587}{0}{}{Zelligar's Castle (s,n)}{ }{This narrow hallway leads to the south to what looks like an abandoned armoury, and to the north splits off to the east and the west. }{Zelligar's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6586}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6588}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6588}{0}{<238>}{Zelligar's Castle (n)}{<238>] [<088>}{This irregularly-shaped room is designed to house the arms supply of the stronghold.  It is mostly empty now, however.  The rock walls of this room are mostly smooth, and there are carved ledges within several of them.  Wooden pegs also line the walls. }{Zelligar's Castle}{zellgloves}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6587}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6593}{e}{search shelves;get gloves;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6589}{0}{}{Zelligar's Castle (w)}{ }{The hallway comes to an abrupt halt here, ending at a stark blank wall.  From behind the wall, there is a great commotion, with someone who seems to be in distress. You hear loud banging and cries for help from the other side. }{Zelligar's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6586}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6590}{0}{}{Zelligar's Castle (s,e)}{ }{This narrow hallway opens up to the east.  There is a faint smell of burnt flesh in the air, but perhaps that is just your imagination. Back to the south is the center of the castle. }{Zelligar's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6585}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
