R {6591}{0}{}{Zelligar's Castle (n,w)}{ }{There is a pungent smell to this hallway that seems to be emanating from the north.  You look at the floor and notice a fine black soot that has settled.  }{Zelligar's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6590}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6592}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6592}{0}{}{Zelligar's Castle (s)}{ }{This room seems as if it is dedicated to the worship of some god.  On the back wall of the room, opposite the door, is a rock carving of a great idol, sculpted from the wall itself. The floor is smooth black slate.  In the center of the room is a circular depression, or pit. }{Zelligar's Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6591}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

