R {6620}{0}{}{Zelligar's Castle (e)}{E}{This is home for Erig, Zelligar's only trusted friend.  The room is rather simple with few furnishings.  In the southeast corner is a crude bed, and alongside it is a table.  On the south wall is a wooden chest.  On the wall at the western extremity of the room are numerous pegs and brackets. }{Zelligar's Castle}{erig}{}{}{1.000}{1}
