R {6674}{0}{}{Entrance to Clanworld (s,enter)}{E}{This is the entrance to the Clanworld. From within this large stone structure you hear the sounds of strong voices singing about the deeds of conquest and victory. Your blood pulses in time to the beat and you surge forward to join the action! If you do not belong to a Clan currently, take the opportunity to sign up!   There is a huge plaque next to the portcullis.  Type 'clanfix' to restore your clan symbol.  }{Clan World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
