R {6675}{0}{}{Voluntary Access Fee Room (n)}{ }{		Voluntary Access Fee Room Gathered about in somber deliberations, the players and wizards discuss in animated groups the role each person needs to play in order to maintain a stable link to the outside world. A majestic bulletin board hangs mid-air, and glows with the commitments and ideas of the whole 3k community. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6673}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6676}{0}{}{The Chamber of the Players' Council (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You have entered a spacious circular chamber.  The domed ceiling rises in an arc above you, drawing your attention to the wrought-iron chandelier that hangs suspended in the center of the room.  The twenty bright white candles in the chandelier cast flickering light over the tiered benches that circle the chamber. A dark wooden podium stands silently on a dais in the center of the benches, echoing voices of past venerated speakers that have taken the stage. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6673}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6677}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
