R {6680}{0}{}{Rules Room (s)}{ }{		Rules Room This is the room where all of the various rules of 3 Kingdoms and their punishments are posted.  It is expected that you should know all of the rules posted on this board.  If you are caught breaking any of these rules, an 'I didn't know' will not be acceptable.  As you will note, the punishments tend to be rather harsh, conversely, the reporting of major bugs to high wizards will be rewarded. Just type 'look at board' to see the various topics covered. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6679}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6681}{0}{}{Ideas Room (d,n)}{ }{This is the Ideas room for 3-Kingdoms.  If you think you have a great idea for the game, you may post it on the board for others to read, consider, and discuss.  All notes will be stored if this board becomes full. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6679}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6682}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6682}{0}{}{Ideas Poll Room (u)}{ }{This is the Ideas poll room for 3-Kingdoms.  If you want to get a vote on an idea for the game, you may post it here.  All votes will be stored if this booth becomes full. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6681}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6683}{0}{}{Help Room (e)}{ }{		Help Room This is the room where you may find out who to contact for specific information.  I'd highly suggest taking advantage of this board and getting all of your questions answered from the appropriate wizards. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6679}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6684}{0}{}{Anteroom to the offices of the High-Mortal Council (s,w)}{ }{This is the anteroom of the High-Mortal council.  There are doors leading to private offices all around the room.  This area is reserved for the use of council members only.  There is a board here with important information for all members. To the south is a meeting hall. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6679}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
