R {6685}{0}{}{Meeting chambers of the High-Mortal Council. (n)}{ }{This is the meeting chamber of the mighty High-Mortal council. Many decisions that govern the entire course of events in the Kingdoms are made in this room.  The walls are decorated with ancient tapestries and the floor is covered in a plush red carpeting.  A scribe, ready to record the proceedings, sits in the southwest corner of the room. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6684}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6686}{0}{}{The Announcements Room (n,u,s)}{ }{This basement appears to have been recently constructed.  The roughly hewn stone walls and dark, dank surroundings seem to indicate that the work was done quickly and not terribly well. Lit torches adorn the walls and cast a shadowy light upon the room's only feature: a large bulletin board.  It is used by the wizards of Three Kingdoms to inform the players of any important changes and developments to the mud. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6679}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
