E {6688}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6687}{0}{}{Discussion of the Portal MUD Client Area (n)}{ }{You stand in a small, grey stone room. There is little of interest here, little to detract from the opulent magnificence of the bulletin board in the centre of the room. Perhaps this is the intention - you are in this room to see and make use of the board, not to admire the furnishings. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6686}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6688}{0}{}{Quest Discussion Room (n,s)}{ }{	Welcome to the quest discussion room.  Here you can voice 	your thoughts on quest changes or simply ask questions. 	This is only a temporary room and it is to be used for 	constructive thoughts only. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
