R {6689}{0}{}{3-Kingdoms Explorer's Inn (s,w)}{ }{This wood paneled room deep under the adventurer's guild is where the top explorers of the Three Kingdoms come to register their exploits, share a tale or two, and prepare for their next adventure. Type: 'explorer' to see your current rating, or       'explorers' to see the top 10. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
