R {6690}{0}{}{The Area Changes Boardroom (e)}{ }{Freshly waxed hardwood floors shine dully in the light provided by floating globes that slowly make their way around the room. There's not a stick of furniture to be seen in this place, just walls and a ceiling painted a soothing shade of blue. The focal point of the room is a large bulletin board that practically demands your attention. Beside that board is an equally important sign. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
