R {6691}{0}{}{Level advancement room (e,w,d,n)}{ }{                  * Adventurers Guild * This is the main hall of the Adventurers' Guild.  You can come here to advance your stats and level.  You may also get information about the various quests that exist in 3 Kingdoms, and the requirements you must fulfill to reach certain levels. To the east is the guild bulletin board, and to the west is the donation room.  A small man sits at a desk in the corner, acting as a scribe to record all transactions of consequence. There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Adventurer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
