R {6693}{0}{}{Adventurer Board Room (w)}{ }{This is the Adventurers Guild board room, where guild members can exchange ideas, information (no quest info!) and advice with each other.  The board will be monitored, so comments/questions about the workings of the guild can also be raised. }{Adventurer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
