R {6694}{0}{}{Recruitment Hall (d,n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are standing in a large room with 3 archways leading out to the west, east, and north, and a metal staircase leading down.  Back to the south is the Adventurer's guild.  There's a very important sign here for you to read. }{Adventurer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
