R {6695}{0}{}{Fighter Guild Hall (out)}{<138>F<088>}{The guild hall is decorated with distinctive trophies that come from exotic places. The room is filled with weaponry decor which gives the feel of what could be utilized by a fighter. The armor statues line the hall in salute of the highest members of the guild who have achieved the status of Blade Master.  In the back of the room there is a large shelf filled with steins, and in the center of the room is an enormous oak table. There are many large wooden chairs that surround the table.  Against the eastern wall sits a row of kegs filled with ale.  A large chair, laced with the fur of a great bear,  sits at the head of the table. The brick floor is cracked in places from years of heavy boot traffic. There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Fighter Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
