R {6704}{0}{}{A silent woodland (n,portal)}{P}{Tendrils of mist creep out from the darkness to curl about you.   The shadowy forest seems to close in about you, low branches  tugging at your clothes as you wander between the ancient trees.   Dark shapes flit by through the darkness, teasing your senses.   Warily you continue your way through the forest. }{Necromancers}{necromancers}{}{}{1.000}{1}
