R {6705}{0}{}{A silent woodland (n,s)}{ }{You pause to listen to the darkened wood.  Your own breathing  sounds in your ears with the light rustling of the leaves above.   Ahead of you a softly glowing moonbeam touches the forest floor,  shadows flickering through its eerie light. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6704}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6706}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6706}{0}{}{An ominous wood (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The shadows wrap you in their cold embrace.  The ancient forest  rises up about you, swallowing you in its dark depths.  The chill  shadows of the night raise goosebumps along your body even as you  suppress a shiver.  The darkness about you is absolute, shadowing  the very sky from your view as you look upwards towards the moon. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
