R {6707}{0}{}{A Dark Keep (n,s)}{R}{The path you are traveling comes to an abrupt end at the front gate to the Necromancer's Guild.  Directly to the north is a large keep with two towers, one to the east and the other to the west, that reach up to the heavens.  The dark stone walls of the keep emit an aura of power that you can feel course through your being.  A swirling mist intertwines itself around the trees of the forest and drifts up to the gated entrance, obscuring your vision through it. You can 'restore' here if you have gobj issues. }{Necromancers}{raylorn}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6706}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6708}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6708}{0}{}{Guild Courtyard (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The scent of jasmine flowers and others you are unaware of swirl around you, giving an aura of peace and tranquility to the garden.  The courtyard is overflowing with stately shrubs, trees, and exotic plants, all manicured to perfection.  There is a brick walkway leading through the garden, guiding you further into the depths of the keep.  An occasional young neophyte hustles past you, probably on their way to greater learning from the elders of the guild. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6707}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
