R {6709}{0}{}{Recruitment Chamber (n,e)}{ }{This rather large chamber abuts the courtyard to the east.  It is sparsely decorated, maintaining its focus to deliver candidates into the dark arts.  There are several young candidates milling about, deep in magical thought.  It is here that you begin your life as a Necromancer. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6708}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
