R {6763}{0}{}{Antechamber (e)}{ }{You currently stand in the antechamber for the hall of audience.  This is where people come to prepare themselves right before they have a royal audience.  A plain chair rests against one wall, and a small hearth lies against another wall. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6762}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6764}{0}{}{Grand Hall (w)}{ }{This is the grand hall of the stronghold.  A large hearth stands upon the east wall, and a large throne rests upon a dais near the north wall.  The south wall is entirely covered by a huge tapestry. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6762}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6765}{0}{}{Throne Room (ne,nw,s)}{ }{This is the throne room of the stronghold.  In this room the lord of the keep holds audience.  For some reason, however, this room has a palpable feel of pervasive evil, almost as if it was cursed.  Darkness seems to hang in the corners and spider webs drape a large dais.  Upon the dais there is some rubble. Small passages lead off to the northeast and northwest. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
