R {6806}{0}{}{Approach to the Red Stronghold (s,n)}{ }{  The path here widens to about twenty feet across, and the forest in this area has been cut back an additional twelve feet from the sides of the trail.  To the north, a large stronghold rises above the woods, thrusting twin towers over one hundred feet high.  The stone of the stronghold seems to be some sort of glorious red marble, which glistens in the brilliance of the sun. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6805}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6807}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6807}{0}{}{Red Stronghold (n,s)}{ }{Directly to the north stands a magnificent stronghold.  The stones of its construction appear to be hard red marble, and the lowered drawbridge is made of solid oak.  The way into the keep seems to be clear since the portcullis is  raised. Twin towers thrust high into the sky, and a large banner is flying from one of the towers. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6806}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6808}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6808}{0}{}{Entrance Hall (w,e,s,n)}{ }{This was formerly the entrance chamber of the keep, yet now the chamber lies in ruins.  The walls look badly scorched, and the floor is lined with smoking embers. In fact, this whole room has a very burned look to it. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6807}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6809}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6810}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6811}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6809}{0}{}{Ruined Antechamber (e)}{ }{At one time this was an audience chamber of grand proportions, yet now the furniture lies burned and broken upon the floor. In fact, the whole room looks as if a great blaze has swept through it, burning the wood and singing stone.  The only remaining feature of the room is a small chimney leading up through the ceiling. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6808}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37866}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6810}{0}{}{Cracked Hall (w)}{ }{This appears to have once been a grand hall of some sort, yet it is now cracked in half.  The floor has cracked apart and has revealed a fiery stream of lava flowing underneath the castle.  The rest of the room has been melted into slag. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6808}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6811}{0}{}{Room of Slag (ne,nw,s)}{ }{This whole room looks as if the hottest fires of hell have blazed within it, burning wood and melting stone.  The walls and floor have been melted into a mass of slag, and all other features that may once have existed in this room have been  vaporized. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6808}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6812}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {6815}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6812}{0}{}{Bottom of Staircase (u,se)}{ }{You stand at the base of a large tower.  The walls are made of solid marble, and a large staircase rises upward into the higher levels of the tower. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
