R {6813}{0}{}{Landing (u,d)}{ }{This is a large landing approximately 500 steps from the bottom of the tower.  The landing is about 40 feet in diameter, and has stairs leading both up and down. A large window offers a view through one of the walls. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
