E {6814}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6814}{0}{}{Mosaic Chamber (d)}{ }{This chamber is at the top of a long staircase.  The walls and floor look as if they were one glorious and well kept, yet now the red stone of the chamber appears cracked and discolored, as if some sort of foul evil has desecrated the pristine marble.  Rubble lies about the floor, and a large door lies to the north. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
