R {6818}{0}{}{Entryway into the Infinite Chamber (enter,s)}{E}{You are standing in the doorway, looking into a chamber. This chamber is octagonal in shape, and has no floor. floating in the middle of the room is a large stone pedestal.  Looking down, you see the floorless room extends downwards into infinity. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
