R {6819}{0}{}{Dark Cave (w,out)}{<228>O<088>}{You are standing in a large underground cavern with a disproportionately small entrance.  Tree roots and rocks stick out from the walls of the cave, and bones from  many different types of creatures litter the floor.  You can't help but notice that a strongly putrid odor comes from the back of the cave to the west. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
