R {6820}{0}{}{Dark Cave (sw,e)}{ }{The cave walls here look like they are made of pure obsidian, as if the walls were seared by a fierce heat.  The floor of the cave seems to vibrate beneath your feet in a strangely rythmic fashion.  The cave proceeds deeper southwest. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
