R {6840}{0}{}{Entrance Chamber (w,e,s,n)}{ }{You are standing in a large circular entrance chamber. The walls are made of smooth, unblemished white marble, and the ceiling is vaulted high above.  Corridors lead in several directions. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
