R {6841}{0}{}{Antechamber (e)}{ }{You are standing in a fairly small room.  All of the walls, the floor, and the ceiling are covered in a thick layer of ice.  The ice is opaque white, and hides all features of the small room. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6840}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6842}{0}{}{Grand Hall (w)}{ }{This room looks as if it might once have been used for a mess hall, since there is a large table and several chairs here.  The entire room, however, is now covered with a thick layer of frost and ice.  A chill hangs in the air, and your breath fogs as you exhale with each passing breath. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6840}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {6843}{0}{}{Fountain Room (ne,nw,s)}{ }{This is a large rectangular room.  Coming out of its northern wall is a large waterfall fountain, which pours into a circular pool in the middle of the room. All of the water in the room, including the waterfall, seems to have been frozen solid. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
