R {6850}{0}{}{Lord's Study (s)}{ }{This is apparently the lord's study.  A large crystal sphere lies in the center of the room, and a marble chair rests beside it.  It would appear that perhaps the lord of this keep dabbled in the arcane art of scrying. In addition, a large pedestal rests against one wall. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
