R {6864}{0}{}{Antechamber (e)}{ }{You currently stand in the antechamber for the hall of audience.  This is where people come to prepare themselves right before they have a royal audience. A plain chair rests against one wall, and a small hearth lies against another wall. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
