R {7021}{0}{<238>}{Inside a shack on the ice. (door)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You gasp in awe as you enter this small building.  The idiots who put this on the ice must be planning to spend the entire winter here. Staying here would explain the numerous articles in this tiny shack, such as the chair, blankets, clothes, and numerous appliances that clutter the place along with the normal gear required for fishing.  In one corner is a generator to keep the lights and other electrical items working.  The walls here are painted in streaks and smudges of purple and yellow.  As you look around, you realize that everything in here is of those two colours, and most have a Vikings logo on them.  Whoever stays in here must be as serious about their favorite sports team as they are about ice fishing. }{Ice Fishing}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
