R {7022}{0}{<238>}{Inside a shack on the ice. (door)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{As you enter the shack, you blink in disbelief.  Although there are a few comforts here, you really expected more.  This place is doing little more than blocking the wind and keeping the snow off of the cleared patch of ice.  You see the essentials for ice fishing here, such as the tackle box, fishing pole, a small stool to sit on, an auger, blankets, a Thermos, and, of course, beer.  One thing that stands out the most here is the fact that almost everything is either green, yellow, or both. }{Ice Fishing}{}{}{marble}{1.000}{1}
