R {7027}{0}{}{Lake Shore Drive (sw,n,e)}{ }{Somehow, and by what means you are still unclear, you are now zooming down Lake Shore Drive.  It is the dead of winter yet there is no snow and warm balmy breezes play off the shore of Lake Michigan.  A nagging voice tells you that there is something wrong with this picture but you jet onward. }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
