R {7028}{0}{}{Inside a decrepit looking house (out,enter)}{E}{What a mess. It looks like this place hasn't been cleaned - ever. There is an old television on one side of the room, and a lounge on the other. There is also the remains of a dirty window and a closet door near it. There are dirty footprints on the carpet near the closet. }{Beavis and Butthead}{beavis_and_butthead}{}{}{1.000}{1}
