R {7029}{0}{}{Wacker Drive (n,s)}{ }{No place has ever seen a street like this.  Overhead tram rails trail wires on to the ground.  Every now and then, one of them reaches out and takes a hunk of skin out of an unwary pedestrian. But you zoom on blithely.  No time for the hoi polloi now!  You're going to feed peanuts to the orangutans! }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
