R {7030}{0}{}{Da Museum (n,s,e)}{ }{Somehow you've managed to drive your shiny little thingie into the lobby of a great museum.  Dedicated to all the people of Chicago by a rich guy who thought they were all scum, the museum looms over the slums that encroach upon it. }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
