R {7031}{0}{}{Da Slums (w,e)}{ }{You have suddenly zipped into Da Slum.  You lock your windows.  This is a barren wasteland and looks as though it has been hit by an atomic weapon.  The gooey tar-like substance was once an asphalt street.  You can almost feel the radiation pouring through your shoes. }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
