E {7032}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7032}{0}{}{Da Pits (w,e)}{ }{Your careening path of destruction has come to an end or it has just started.  You have just been ejected from the thingie, or you just flew through the air into it.  This is confusing.  There are peanuts on the ground and the tang of orangutan poop is in the air. }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
