R {7033}{0}{}{An asphalt alley (back,ne)}{<238>B<088>}{The alley you stand in leads to an asphalt path up to a small house. You can see it is just a short distance from here. The hot asphalt feels nice to walk on, and the green trees on the sides make you happy. As you listen carefully, you can hear birds sing in the warm sun. You feel like you are in love.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{einsteins_cottage}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3578}{back}{back}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7034}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7034}{0}{}{Almost at the small house (n,sw)}{ }{You are walking on the asphalt path, pretty close to the small house. As you look around you realize that the birds stopped their singing, and the sun suddenly feels cooler here. Maybe something scary is living in the house? You have a feeling that reading the small sign in front of you might help you getting your questions answered.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7033}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7035}{n}{climb gate}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7035}{0}{}{Outside Einstein's house (w,e,n,s)}{ }{You are standing on the soft grass outside the house of Einstein. The red cottage with cute white curtains is rather small, and looks like the perfect place to hide when you want to be alone while you work at the best of your abilities. South of here is the gate leading back to the asphalt path. East and west the garden stretches around the house. }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
