R {7036}{0}{}{The southwest corner (n,e)}{ }{This is the southwest corner of Einstein's garden. Just a few yards northeast of here the red cottage where he's supposed to live stands. Along the walls several nicely arranged sets of flowers have been placed to make the garden even more wonderful. A white fence borders the garden south and west of here. North and east the garden continues.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7035}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7042}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7037}{0}{}{The southeast corner (n,w)}{ }{This is the southeast corner of Einsten's garden and you are amazed how empty this corner feels compared to the rest of the beautiful garden. No beautiful flowers, no trees, no nothing indeed. The only thing of interest is the white fence running from north to west. Northwest of here is the cottage where Einstein is supposed to live.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7035}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7038}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7038}{0}{}{The east side of the wonderful garden (n,s)}{ }{The east side of Einstein's garden looks pretty much like the rest of this place, apart from the big garden table and the chairs which have been placed in the middle of the lawn. To the west is the cottage, shining with its bright red color as the sunlight hits the wall. In the middle of the wall is a small window, covered with white curtains. }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7037}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7039}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7039}{0}{}{The northeast corner of the garden (enter,w,s)}{<168>E<088>}{You are now standing in the northeast corner of the genius' garden. Placed against the north side of the long white fence that borders the lawn is a red and blue painted outhouse. Against the eastern side of the cottage just a yard or two southwest of you is a cute little arrangement of summer flowers.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7038}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7040}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7043}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7043}{n}{enter}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7040}{0}{}{Behind Einstein's house (e,w)}{ }{You are now standing behind Einstein's house, and the view is as stunning as ever before. A rather large telescope stands proudly on the freshly cut lawn, making it possible to look into space. West of here you see a small strawberry field and to the east you see an outhouse of some sort. Just a few yards south of here is the cottage of Einstein, and to the north you can see the sparkling white fence that surrounds the garden.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7039}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7041}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7041}{0}{}{The northwestern corner of Einstein's garden (e,s)}{ }{You are now standing in the northwestern part of The Genius's garden. North and west of here the white fence blocks your path, and southeast is the small cottage of Einstein. As you look down on the ground you notice that strawberry plants have been planted in a small mound of earth here. South and east of here the wonderful garden continues.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7040}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7042}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7042}{0}{}{At the west side of Einstein's cottage (s,n)}{ }{The west side of Einstein's cottage looks as pleasant as all the other places in his beautiful garden. The white fence to the west that borders the garden has a row of wonderful bushes right inside of it, and on the newly cut lawn you see strange and exotic flowers mixed with the good-smelling grass.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7041}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7036}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7043}{0}{}{The outhouse (out)}{ }{Wow! Talk about terrible smell! You have ended up in Einstein's outhouse, and you now have some serious evidence that even a genius has his needs. The northern part of the small room is a large bench with a cute pink lid in the middle. A pile of magazines is placed on the floor, and on the west wall a paperholder has been attached. A normal outhouse.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7039}{stagedive}{stagedive}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7039}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7039}{s}{out}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7044}{0}{}{Einstein's cottage (s)}{<138>E<088>}{You are standing inside the cottage of Einstein! On the walls you see different posters of smart people that helped the world in one way or the other. The wooden floor is perfectly clean and a large, red carpet rests upon it. A mahogany desk has been placed in the northern part of the room, and behind it is a soft and comfortable-looking blue chair. Behind you to the south is the door leading out of here, and you have a vague feeling that disturbing this legend of brains will be a VERY unpleasant thing to do.  }{Einstein's Cottage}{einstein}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7035}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7045}{0}{<238>}{shadowy branches (nw,enter)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You travel along the precarious rope bridges between the housetrees.  The spirits of the elven dead walk beside you.  The silvery moon shines down upon the spirits of the elven dead.  The dark entrance to an elven home is here. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
