R {7046}{0}{<108>}{house of death (e,out,n)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{Dark wafts of cold, charred wood overcome your senses.  This place is evil, and the souls of the dead do not take lightly to intruders.  Creaking mournfully, even the floorboards of this evil place seem to detest your presence.  Horrid shadows are cast about by your flickering light.  You only hope that they remain nothing more than tricks of the eye. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7047}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7048}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
