R {7047}{0}{<108>}{room of vile horror (w)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{This home holds no warmth now.  You are in danger here.  You tread upon the shattered memories of the dead.  Their vile anger will not be satisfied until your warm blood flows freely over the charred wooden floor.  Filtering softly through holes in the roof, the silvery moonlight dots the black room with faint light.  Your stomach turns as the soft glow drapes itself over the seemingly silent remains of an elven citizen. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7046}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7048}{0}{<108>}{charred elven home (s)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{Shadows chill your soul as you look around at the violated remains of this once proud elven home.  Evil chills pass through the home.  It almost feels as if the place is alive with some evil presence.  Horrid shadows are cast about by your flickering light.  You only hope that they remain nothing more than tricks of the eye. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7046}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

