R {7084}{0}{<228>}{in the dark treetops (sw,ne)}{<228>( *<088>}{The rope bridge, elven design in nature, holds your weight with surprising support.  This does not detract, however, from the dark nature of the black curse that has taken a stranglehold of this land.  The spirits of the elven dead walk beside you.  An eerie moaning can be heard somewhere in the far distance of this dark and evil wood. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
