R {7085}{0}{<238>}{shadowy branches (ne,enter)}{<238>|@|<088>}{Swinging slowly and creaking quietly, the rope bridge reacts to your every step and movement.  An eerie moaning can be heard from somewhere nearby.  The sound is soft, yet extremely forlorn and dark.  The silvery moon shines down upon the spirits of the elven dead.  The dark entrance to an elven home is here. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
