R {7090}{0}{}{shadowy dwelling (w,nw,out)}{O}{Shadows chill your soul as you look around at the violated remains of this once proud elven home.  Black as night, the coldness eats through your clothing.  Unnatural and freezing, its like no other chill you've ever felt.  Vileness is at work here.  What horrible curse could have left such devastation in its wake? }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
