R {7091}{0}{}{charred elven home (e,n)}{ }{Sadness is all you can feel when you look over the desolation of this home.  Black streaks of charcoal scour the walls.  This is a place of horror.  You are careful not to make too much noise, lest you disturb something that is better left avoided.  Vileness is at work here.  What horrible curse could have left such devastation in its wake? }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
