R {7092}{0}{}{black home (se,s)}{ }{This dark place used to be the home of an elven family.  You are in danger here.  You tread upon the shattered memories of the dead.  Their vile anger will not be satisfied until your warm blood flows freely over the charred wooden floor.  Deathly light seeps into this room from the cold moon. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
