R {7353}{0}{<238>}{-= Wayhaven Docks =- (n,board)}{<238>|||<088>}{This pier looks newly constructed, the stone still unmarred by travelers and relatively unharmed by the elements.  It leads to various privately owned docks where a few ships are moored for business and pleasure.  Beyond the docks lies the vast Dragonspire Bay, stretching as far as the eye can see.  The sounds of sailors hailing one another, calling to their friends and shipmates, ring across the water.  The strong ocean breeze whips through your hair.  A large galleon, rests quietly alongside the dock here, rocking gently in the ocean swell.  A gangplank runs up onto it, and you could board it if you wished. }{Wayhaven Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
