R {7354}{512}{<238>}{-= Wayhaven Dock =- (n,w)}{<238>|<138>F<238>|<088>}{From here you can look out over the Dragonspire Bay which opens up into the ocean to the south.  Mighty ships once sailed across the waters.  While the occasional large ship will dock here, the majority of activity is due to smaller ferryboats, transporting adventurers between Wayhaven and various islands.  This ferry service is run by Johawn, a ferrymaster, who employs retired fishermen as his ferrymen. }{Wayhaven Docks}{ferry}{}{}{1000.000}{1}
