R {7355}{0}{<138>}{-= The Hitown Dock Exchange =- (s)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{This is a small pawn shop set up in a temporary facility at the Hitown docks in Wayhaven.  Looking at the sparse decor, you get the impression that it was thown up rather hastily to accommodate the influx of adventurers sailing between the islands.  A small permit is tacked to the wall, above a counter. }{Wayhaven Docks}{}{}{shop}{1.000}{1}
