R {7356}{0}{}{** The Docks of Ao ** (se)}{ }{You find yourself standing on the shore of a jungle isle. A wooden dock protrudes from the sandy beach and into the dark waters of the sea. The wooden planks of the dock are gray from weather and age, obviously very old and not well maintained. The sand leads towards the edge of a dense jungle and an overgrown path leading further inland. The tide rolls up over the sand, quickly erasing your footprints, hiding any trace of your passing. The jungle canopy looms before you, ominous in its damp, dark secrets, waiting for the adventurer brave enough to enter its embrace. }{Wayhaven Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {7357}{0}{}{Neutral Dragon Realms : The Reef}{<168>A<088>}{You are standing on large, rocky reef about 50 meters from the shore of the Neutral Dragon Realms.  The ocean stretches out all around you and as far as the eye can see to the north, east, and south. }{Neutral Dragon Realms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
