R {7358}{0}{<238>}{A forest path. (nw,se)}{<238>. .<088>}{You amble leisurely along a narrow forest path. Winding from the northwest, it stretches southeast into the depths of the dark forest. The faint gurgling of a distant river meets your ears, the only sound to break the heavy silence. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
