R {7359}{0}{<238>}{A shrouded trail. (se,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{You walk along a narrow trail winding northwest to southeast. Surrounding you on all sides is a silvery mist. Straining your eyes you think you can see the faint silhouette of forest trees around you. You are careful not to stray from the path, afraid that you would be doomed to wander lost amongst the trees. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
