R {7361}{0}{<238>}{A shrouded trail. (w,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are walking along a narrow trail leading from the northwest to west. Surrounding you is a dense mist. Your clothes grow heavy with moisture from the thick fog. To the west the fog seems to clear as the moon's pale light becomes visible. To the northwest the mist thickens, seemingly stretching on forever. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
