R {7362}{0}{<238>}{A shrouded trail. (w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The trail you are following leads from east to west. Gazing westward you think you see the outline of a settlement. You wonder if your eyes are playing tricks on you, or if someone, or something actually lives out here. Tall shadows of the darkened forest trees surround you. They stand silently, like beings hiding in the shadows, waiting... }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
