R {7363}{0}{<238>}{A path towards a graveyard. (e,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are walking slowly on an old path. The moon is shining with a bone-white light, casting long shadows everywhere. Looking ahead you see stones and crosses jutting up from the ground. You realize that you are heading towards a graveyard of some sort. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
