R {7364}{0}{<248>}{Inside a dark cemetery. (e,sw,nw,w)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{You are inside the entrance of a small graveyard. As you look around, you see crosses and headstones that seem to be everywhere. Most graves seem to have been ravaged by time and there are few crosses that remain standing. You see a path that is branching out here, with forks leading northwest, southwest, east, and west. Towards the east, you see the exit of this unholy ground, while to the west you see a building in what appears to be the center of the graveyard. Just outside the graveyard, held back by a big iron fence, you can see dark trees that move silently in the soft, cold wind. }{Elven Graveyard}{westersea_graveyard}{}{}{1.000}{1}
