R {7381}{0}{<108>}{Dark tunnel (e,sw)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel continues downwards in a curve. The stench of excrement is even stronger here. Further down the tunnel a strange light casts an eerie red glow on the walls. The ceiling is lower here, making you unconsciously duck your head. The heat intensifies causing sweat to run heavily down your brow. You hear the humming grow louder. As you take a second to relax from the heat you hear a faint chirping sound. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
