R {7382}{0}{<118>}{Lava river (ne)}{<118>` ^<088>}{Abruptly the tunnel is interrupted by a large river of lava. The heat rising up from it burns your lungs, making it difficult to breathe. The river itself seems to be at least 30 feet wide and looks hot enough to incinerate anything it touches. The manure on the walls here has started to boil and the smell from it chokes you. The ground burns your feet as you approach the great burning river. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
