R {7383}{0}{<248>}{Room of symbols. (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{As you safely pass the molten river you continue into the tunnel. Finally reaching the end, you enter a large chamber. The walls, constructed of smooth granite, are covered with various symbols. Below you the floor is made of pure white marble. The ceiling, however, is too far into the darkness for any closer examination. The air is fresher here and the heat is not so intense, but the humming has increased, almost making you shiver. Eastwards the tunnel leads back to the infernal river. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
