R {7384}{0}{<218>}{Chamber of the demon prince Ioth-Tah (s)}{<118>(<178>~<118>)<088>}{You step into an enormous octagonal chamber. Fires burn in every corner, casting a red glow upon the smooth granite walls. From each wall, eight long pikes stick out carrying an impaled human body. Still writhing in pain, their suffering is emitted as a low droning, filled with sorrow. From the ceiling, cages of iron hang, and the floor is covered with blood. In the center of the chamber towers a pyramid of human skulls. On the top of it, you see a throne made out of human bones. Upon the throne sits a massive humanoid shaped figure with four arms and a single long horn jutting out of its forehead. You realize that you are standing in front of Ioth-Tah, the demon prince. }{Elven Graveyard}{ioth}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7383}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

