R {7498}{0}{}{A horrible sight (s,w)}{ }{You continue your wander through the huge stacks of bones.  Some of the bones you see have little bits of flesh still hanging off them, now.  Most of them are still pretty clean, though.  The bone-strewn passage continues to the south, from which direction you can hear some sort of slurping noise. There's a slight breeze of fresher air back to the west. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7476}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7499}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7499}{0}{}{A foul hideaway (n)}{ }{Finally, you've reached the end of this revolting passageway.  The bones around here are less organized, more scattered across the room.  There are a few small piles building up to the back of the room, where you entered, but most of the bones lying around here appear to still have fresh, dripping meat stuck to them.  Obviously this is where the new kills arrive. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7498}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7500}{0}{<238>}{Abandoned Courtyard (n,s,w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You have stepped foot into the abandoned courtyard of a once great keep.  To the north you see the remnants of a once beautiful courtyard now overgrown with weeds and brush.  On both sides of you lurk quiet and dark rooms, awaiting you to explore them. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
