R {7501}{0}{<108>}{A Dark Receiving Parlor (e,n)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{This receiving parlor, once lavishly furnished, shows signs of a recent battle.  Broken furniture and ripped rugs are strewn about the chamber and debris is piled up in the southwest corner.  The room is pitch dark and without your light source, you would not be able to see anything at all.  There is an exit to the north and to the east.  They both lead to similar chambers cloaked in darkness. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7500}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7503}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7502}{0}{<108>}{Dark Chamber (n,w)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{This dark chamber may have once been used as a gathering place for the old inhabitants of this tower to discuss news and business of the day. Now, it lays in ruins.  A broken down announcement board lies scattered about the room and the southwest corner of the chamber has collapsed into a pile of rubble.  The exits to the north and west are dark.  There is no telling what dangers may lie ahead. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7500}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7505}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7503}{0}{<278>}{A Dark Armory (d,s,w,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This broken down chamber appears to have once been a store room or armory.  It has since been turned into a catastrophe.  Broken weapon and armor racks lie strewn about the chamber with no sign of their old contents.  Glass curio cabinet frames, which used to display items from across the realms, sit empty with their glass shattered.  A thick layer of dust covers everything and gives the chamber a ghastly appearance.  The dried blood is here as well.  It is everywhere. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7501}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7504}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
