E {45859}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7504}{0}{<108>}{A Dark Chamber (e)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{This small chamber off the old armory has an old wooden scroll case in it.  The case is covered with a layer of dust and cobwebs and it contains no scrolls.  The inky black walls of the small chamber loom over you, making the small exit to the east look inviting. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7503}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7505}{0}{<278>}{Stairwell (u,s,w,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are standing at the base of an exquisite circular staircase.  The beautiful oak wood spirals upwards to the upper levels of the guild.  You notice spots of dried blood on the floor and walls from no apparent source.  There is an overgrown garden courtyard to the west and a shadowy path leads out of the abandoned keep to the east. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
