R {7506}{0}{<108>}{shadowy path (ne,w)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{You are walking along a shadowy path east of the guild hall.  There is a quiet peacefulness to the night air and you can hear crickets chirping in the underbrush. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
