R {7516}{0}{<248>}{A half lit crypt (e)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{You've wandered into a room different from the others you've seen  here.  The black stone of the walls and pillars are laced with grey  streaks, brightening the room compared to the others.  Strands of  ivy snake up the back wall of the tomb.  The flickering of light  from the standing braziers casts dancing shadows about the room. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
