R {7519}{0}{<248>}{A half lit crypt (e)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{The walls of this room seem different somehow, though they are of  the same dark stone.  Even the light of the braziers standing in  the four corners of the room seems to be affected by the  concentration of dark magics in this tomb, casting shadows which  seem almost tangible.  Your eyes are drawn away from the inky black  walls and pillars towards the coffin which rests on a small dais  near the far wall. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
