R {7520}{0}{<248>}{A half lit crypt (w)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{You've entered a small room, roughly square in shape.  Though only a few paces across, the black marble walls swallow the torch  light, making the room seem somehow larger and less substantial.   Flickering torches are mounted on the stone pillars, adding to the  luminous glow of the coffin which rests on the pedestal before you. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
