R {7523}{0}{<238>}{Courtyard (w,e,s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{You stand in an overgrown courtyard in the keep.  Hedges, bushes, and flowers grow uncontrollably throughout the garden.  A gardener hasn't stepped foot into this garden in a long time.  To the north you see the courtyard continues and there is an old iron gate separating this space from the garden to the north. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
