R {7524}{0}{<248>}{Courtyard of the Dead (w,e,s,n)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{It is difficult to navigate through the overgrown hedges, bushes, and weeds in the courtyard.  The scent of pine and wild flowers is heavy here and a slight breeze blows in from outside.  You are not certain why, but no small animals appear to make their homes here.  You don't hear the typical cheerful whistles of songbirds or the quiet chirping from crickets in the underbrush.  The courtyard seems devoid of life for no apparent reason. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
