R {7526}{0}{}{Forest Shelter (nw)}{ }{Strong smells waft from this section of the forest.  There are several different animals in small cages and bowls scattered around under a small shelter.  Amidst the wildlife, a kind old man shuffles about caring for them.  He seems to talk to some of the animals in a strange language you don't understand. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
