R {7527}{0}{}{Entrance Corridor (n,s)}{ }{A long hallway leads north deeper into the guild.  Banners hang along the ceiling and tapestries line the dark gray granite walls.  The hallway is a flurry of activity.  Necromancers of every circle come and go paying little attention to you and continue on to complete their business. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
