R {7528}{0}{}{Corridor (ne,nw,n,s)}{ }{The long corridor branches off in three directions to the north.  The dark granite walls are cool to the touch and the sounds of foot steps echo about you.  Periodically spaced down the hall are several claw-shaped sconces with glowing orbs of energy.  They cast a flickering light into the corridor, illuminating the area to make passage easier. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
