R {7531}{0}{}{Antechamber to the Western Tower (w,e)}{ }{There is a block arch set in the western wall that leads into the tower.  Etched into the keystone of the arch is a glowing rune that radiates a feeling of raw power which courses through your body.  A corridor continues off to the east lined with claw-shaped sconces.  The claws hold glowing orbs of light that illuminate the halls. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
