R {7534}{0}{}{West Tower Annulus (sw,ne)}{ }{The corridor wraps around the southeast part of the tower here.  There are several sconces spaced apart down the corridor providing dim light for you to navigate by.  The walls are cool, dropping the temperature here in the hall.  A small shiver runs down your spine. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
