R {7535}{0}{}{West Tower Annulus (nw,s)}{ }{The hallway leads northwest around the outside edge of the west tower. The corridor is dimly lit and the air smells damp and stale.  You see an occasional piece of small ancient furniture along the outer edge of the corridor. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7532}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
