R {7536}{0}{}{West Tower Annulus (nw,se)}{ }{The granite block corridor curves around the eastern side of the west tower.  Several old unadorned tapestries hang here in an attempt to warm the hallway.  They also serve in dampening the echos from necromancers who travel the annulus.  Several sconces hang from the walls, illuminating the corridor in an eerie light. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
