R {7538}{0}{}{West Tower Annulus (e,w,s)}{ }{You are at the furthest northern point in the western tower.  The walls begin to curve to the south in both directions.  In the south wall sits a small wooden door.  It is closed and appears locked.  Your footsteps echo slightly off the floors as you make your way around the tower. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
