R {7539}{0}{}{West Tower Annulus (sw,e)}{ }{The curving corridor seems a little more damp and cooler here.  On the exterior wall, small drops of condensation have formed.  They cling on to the cool wall, slowly drifting down to the ground.  Several sconces are attached to the walls.  They cast a dim light into the room and cause eerie shadows to dance around the corridor. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7538}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
