R {7541}{0}{}{Corridor (w,e)}{ }{The dark blocks of cool granite push in on you from the north and south.  Voices and footsteps echo down the passage from your passing guild mates as you make your way through the west tower.  To the west you can make out a grand staircase leading up. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
