R {7542}{0}{}{Stairwell (u,d,n,s,w,e)}{ }{An exquisite oak staircase leads up and down to other floors of the tower.  There are claw-shaped sconces holding magical orbs of light illuminating the chamber.  A cool breeze flows in from the chamber below, slightly brushing past your face and cools the chamber. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
