R {7550}{0}{}{Corridor (s,w,e)}{ }{You are in a corridor that leads east to the eastern tower.  The solid block walls of the tower keep the dangers of the dark forest outside at bay, allowing the necromancers peace and quiet for studying their dark arts.  To the west you can make out the main boardroom of the guild. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
