R {7554}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (n,s,w,e)}{ }{This vast chamber has exits leading north and south that lead around the inside edge of the tower.  To your west is a large block arch that leads back into the entrance keep of the complex.  Necromancers of every circle push past you, busily tending to their business. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
