R {7555}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (se,n)}{ }{The annulus curves to the southeast, leading around the eastern tower. A slight breeze blows past your face, emanating from some unknown source.  The gray block walls of the corridor have several tapestries that hang on them, warming the room and reducing the echos. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7554}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
