R {7556}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (nw,se)}{ }{The solid block walls of the tower are covered with several tapestries.  The tapestries have images of several old necromancer towers on them.  Small echoing sounds emanate from your footsteps as you travel along the corridor.  Sounds of bustling guild life come from the northwest }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
