R {7559}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (w,ne)}{ }{The annulus curves from the southwest to the northeast, making you dizzy as you navigate around the tower.  The walls are covered with old tapestries.  They seem to warm the corridor up slightly and reduce the echos from peoples footsteps as they travel the corridor. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
