R {7561}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (sw,n)}{ }{The corridor bends from the southwest to the north here.  Small beads of condensation have formed on the exterior wall.  As you walk down the corridor your footsteps echo off the block walls and floor.  Very few necromancers pass you in this secluded area of the tower. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
