R {7562}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (w,n,s)}{ }{You stand at the furthest east point in the tower annulus.  Along the exterior wall of the tower, tiny droplets of water form.  There is a small wooden door to the west that is closed.  Below its handle you see a small keyhole. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
