R {7563}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (s,nw)}{ }{You are nearing the eastern section of the tower annulus.  The dark granite walls are barren here and you see some condensation built up on the exterior wall.  The corridor is lighted by several sconces which are attached to the walls.  You feel a draft and are unsure of its source. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
