R {7565}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (se,w)}{ }{The corridor turns from the west to the southeast here.  The dimly lit hall is slightly illuminated by several sconces which are attached to the granite block walls.  Your footsteps echo softly off the hard floor as you make your way through the annulus. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
