R {7566}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (w,e,s)}{ }{You stand at what you believe is the furthest north area of the east tower annulus.  There are a few sconces placed along the walls to illuminate your travels and several old tapestries hang from the walls.  To your south is a large wooden door.  It appears to be quite sturdy and has a keyhole near the handle. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
