R {7567}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (sw,e)}{ }{You are rounding the northern end of the east tower.  The dark blocks of granite making up the walls are beginning to mezmerize you as you walk in a circle around the tower.  The area to the east appears to be less frequented as you see fewer and fewer necromancers passing you. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
