R {7569}{0}{}{East Tower Annulus (ne,s)}{ }{You are in a long curved corridor that appears to wrap around the outside edge of the eastern tower.  There is an occasional tapestry hung on the wall, probably to muffle the echoing sounds that bounce down the granite corridors. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
