R {7571}{0}{}{East Tower Corridor (se,nw)}{ }{The corridor you're in appears to end to your southeast at a large winding staircase.  The walls here are covered with heavy tapestries that suppress noise and seem to keep the area warmer.  There is a sconce on the wall that is a bit different from the rest.  The exit to the northwest leads back to the east tower annulus. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
