R {7574}{0}{}{A dim corridor (se,nw)}{ }{The dark stone corridor continues on into the depths of the tower.  To the southeast lies a flickering curtain of pure energy, blocking any details behind it.  There are two sconces here, one on each wall.  They cast an eerie artificial light into the hall. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
