R {7575}{0}{}{Members room (ne,sw)}{ }{This is a resting room for members of the Necromancers' guild.  The room has a few comfortable sofas and chairs to relax upon.  The high-guild chambers are to the southwest and only members of darklord status and above may enter.  A wet bar is here also and you may order anything you like. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
