R {7576}{0}{}{Lord Room (ne)}{ }{This room is only available to the lords and ladies of the  Necromancers' guild.  The room is lavishly furnished and there are couches to lie upon and overstuffed chairs to sit upon.  A fireplace lies against the west wall and there is a bar set up at the northern end of the room. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
