R {7577}{0}{}{Stairwell (se,sw,s,d,n)}{ }{You are at the top of a large granite stairwell.  The large dark granite steps lead down into the depths of the tower.  There is a large shimmering door to your north and some type of magical field to your south.  The corridor continues off to the southwest and southwest. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
