R {7578}{0}{}{Advocate Antechamber (sw,ne)}{ }{This small comfortable chamber is the foyer to the Guild Advocate's chambers.  The walls are covered with tapestries and paintings depicting various necromancers throughout the ages.  There is a heavy wooden door blocking your way to the southwest.  The door is solid and you can here no sounds coming from the other side. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
