R {7579}{0}{}{Apprentice Antechamber (se,nw)}{ }{This small serene chamber before the Apprentice Guild Masters chamber is lavishly decorated with heavy tapestries on the walls and lush rugs on the floor.  There is a large wooden door set into the wall to the southeast that appears locked.  An electrical charge or mysterious form of magic radiates from the other side of the door raising the hair on your body. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
