R {7580}{0}{}{Corridor (s,n)}{ }{You are on a side passageway off of the main corridor of the keep.  To the north the small passageway intersects with the corridor leading to the Guild Advocate and Guild Apprentice's suites.  The walls are solid gray blocks of granite and they appear solid and sturdy.  A slight breeze brushes your face, sending a small shiver down your spine. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
