R {7586}{0}{}{RallyRoom (s)}{ }{You have entered the RallyRoom! This is where necromancers from everywhere come and compete in a road rally all over the Three Kingdoms. /-------------------------------------------------------\ | Commands:                                             | |                                                       | |       rally : begin a new NecroRally!                 | | rallystatus : shows the leader's score and your score | |       abort : aborts the current NecroRally!          | |       rules : lists the rules of the NecroRally!      | \-------------------------------------------------------/ }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
