R {7587}{0}{}{NECROTAG! (sw)}{ }{NECROTAG! This is the Necrotag Room, you come here if you want to get in on a game of NECROTAG! or check up on the one presently running.  There is a button here that you can press to get the information you desire.  Messages from the current game get piped into this room so you can hear what's going on. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
