R {7646}{0}{}{Flame Atheneum (n,w,e)}{<118>F<088>}{The air in this room is extremely dry and hot.  Sweat drips down your forehead as you strain to make out your surroundings.  Along the south wall you see a long wooden bookshelf which contains books related to the spell school Flame.  Several sconces line the walls providing light to the chamber and an occasional gust of super heated air brushes past your face. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
