R {7657}{0}{}{Corrosion Atheneum (s,w,e)}{<128>C<088>}{This dimly lit chamber looks similar to the rest of the rooms in this atheneum.  Several sconces line the walls providing light to see by and there is a large wooden bookshelf along the northern wall.  The air in here has a peculiar sour taste to it.  It almost seems to slightly burn the inside of your mouth. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
