R {7658}{0}{}{A Silent Chamber (n)}{ }{A quiet study chamber opens up before you.  The silent room is ringed by several ornate wooden bookshelves.  On the shelves you see books related to the necromancer spell school Corrosion.  Several desks are placed about the room and each has a tall candelabra set next to it to provide light to study by. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
