R {7660}{0}{}{A Silent Chamber (n)}{ }{The quiet chamber before you has several bookcases erected along the walls.  Each shelf carries many ancient tomes relating to the necromancer spell school Lightning.  The chamber also houses several ornately carved wooden desks used by necromancers to study and learn.  Next to each desk is a tall silver candleabra which provides ample light to read by. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
