R {7661}{0}{}{Cavern (ne,u,w)}{ }{The stair landing opens up to a large underground cavern.  A path carved out of the bedrock narrowly leads west and northeast along side the seemingly endless cavern.  A cool bone-chilling breeze gently blows up from the depths of the cavern, cooling the atmosphere around you. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
