R {7663}{0}{}{Narrow Passageway (nw,n,s)}{ }{The cavern has fallen behind you to the west and a wall rises up turning the small path into a tight narrow passageway.  There is a small but sturdy wooden door facing into the new wall to the northwest.  To the north you see a faint light flickering and a thick wispy mist hovers over the ground. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
