R {7693}{0}{<248>}{In Creepy's temporary abode (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{        After narrowly escaping the same fate as his house, Creepy has set up a temporary camp site while his new, smurfy mushroom-house is growing. In true Creepy fashion, he has outfitted the area with all the comforts of his old home. Spider webs abound, while tangled moss hangs from every tree. A cauldron rests on hot embers that churn its sickly-green contents slowly, and emits a truly foul smell. }{Smurfland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
