R {7766}{0}{<268>}{Cargo bay (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the southeast corner of a very large cargo bay. Various pieces of cargo are everywhere. You guess that this stuff must have been headed for Midway until the crew disappeared. Signs of battle are visible all over. The cargo bay continues to the north. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
