R {7768}{0}{<268>}{Cargo bay (w,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The containers seem to be stacked up here like a barricade. The crew members must have used this as a safe hiding place. Judging by the absence of blood and signs of battle, it must have worked rather well. Although it must not have been enough. The cargo bay continues to the north and the south. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
