R {7776}{0}{<078>}{Engineering (w,n,s)}{<078>| |<088>}{This is the engineering section of the ship. In this section, as in the others, there are a large number of battle signs. Blast marks litter the computer display screens, and blood is smeared all over the floor. Large scratch marks also cover the equipment. The air is also warmer in here than any other part of the ship. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
