R {7778}{0}{<078>}{Engineering (e,s,n)}{<078>| |<088>}{You are on the west side of the engineering section of the ship. You are amazed that the ship is still operating with all the damage that has been done to the computers. The air is warm from all the electric circuits exposed from the battle. The walls here bear a grim reminder of a recent battle. You notice a corpse of a technician lies next to a small console. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
