R {7785}{0}{<268>}{Corridor within barracks (w,e,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This corridor is in the area of the ship where the crew lived. To both the east and west are rooms that were once inhabited. In the dim light you can see that the doors to the rooms are lying on the floor next to the portals they once blocked. Scorch marks pepper the walls, floor, and ceiling here. The corridor continues to the north and south. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
