R {7786}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a room in the barracks section of the ship. The emergency lighting has failed here, so only the dim light from the corridor provides any illumination at all. Everything is in shambles here. The bed is overturned and it looks as if it was used as a barricade against something. There are dried pools of blood on the floor, but no bodies. You wonder why. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7785}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7787}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This was once the living quarters of a crew member of this ship, but it is now nothing more than the site of a disaster. The furniture now lies in a pile of twisted metal all over the floor. On top of the pile is a twisted grate that came from somewhere. Something very large and violent must have done this. The corridor is back to the west. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
