R {7789}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{For some unknown reason this room seems to be untouched. Looking around you, you realize that even the bed is made. Everything here is in perfect order, and all signs of battle seem to end at the doorway to this room. Somehow you feel safe here. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
