R {7790}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The battle here must have been fierce. Blood is splattered against one wall roughly in the shape of a human. It looks like one of the crew members might have suffered an unpleasant death. The room is in shambles and blast marks riddle the walls. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7788}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7791}{0}{<268>}{Corridor within barracks (e,w,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor continues here within the barracks portion of the ship. To the east you see a door that has been welded closed. On the door is the word, 'MEDICAL' with a white cross below. By the vicious marks on the door, you realize the wisdom of the people that welded it shut. To the west is an opening into another barracks room and the corridor continues to the north and south. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
