R {7792}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The devastation in this room is complete. It looks as if something was upset it could not get into the room across the hall. Rubble litters the floor and the bed has been destroyed and thrown against the wall. Blood is splattered everywhere. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
