R {7793}{0}{<268>}{Corridor within barracks (e,w,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{In the dim red light you can make out the words 'MEDICAL' on the sealed door to the east. Looking at the door you see that there is no way you could get in there with less than a good-sized chunk of C-4. To the west is another room, and the corridor continues to the north and south. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
