R {7794}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You feel a strange peace surround you as you enter this room. You are not sure why you feel this way or why this room has remained ordered in the center of all this chaos. There is no damage to speak of anywhere within this room. Even the red glow of the emergency lights, seems to be a bit brighter in here. The corridor is back out to the east. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7793}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7795}{0}{<268>}{Corridor within barracks (w,e,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Under the dim lighting this corridor continues north and south through the living quarters of the ship. To both the east and west lay crumpled steel doors that once blocked access in the rooms. There is a dried pool of blood on the floor here, and blast marks riddle the walls. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
