R {7796}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The destruction in this room is incredible. In the dim red glow you can't make out anything recognizable from the rubble that lies strewn about the floor. On the walls you can make out countless scratch marks and plasma burns. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7795}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7797}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a room in the living quarters section of the ship. It is very dark in here because it looks as if the emergency lights have all been smashed by something and the only illumination is coming from the corridor. Your skin crawls as you see what looks to be a human finger lying under some rubble. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7795}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7798}{0}{<268>}{Corridor within barracks (e,w,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This corridor runs north and south in the Barracks area of the ship. In the dim red glow of the emergency lights, you can make out some lettering on the wall that indicates there are escape shuttles to the north down the corridor. To the east and west are two barracks rooms. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
