E {7801}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7799}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Deep scratches cover the walls in this room. Blood stains the floor. This was obviously the site of a vicious attack on the crew members of the ship. By the look of things, their death was not a pleasant one. The corridor is back out to the east. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7798}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7800}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (w)}{<238>[<178>S<238>]<088>}{From what you can tell, there wasn't much of a battle in this room. It looks as if something entered, slaughtered the crew members and dragged their bodies out. There is a streak of blood running along the floor, out the door, and into the corridor. The room is pretty much intact. The bed is made, and all the compartments are closed. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7798}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7801}{0}{<268>}{Corridor north of barracks (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This corridor runs from the living quarters of the ship to the south, to the escape shuttles to the north. In the dim light you can see burn holes in the walls and floor of the corridor. You wonder what could have caused this type of damage. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7798}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7802}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7802}{0}{<268>}{Corridor south of escape shuttles (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{To the north of here are the escape shuttles of the ship. Back to the south is the barracks and the rest of the ship. The lighting is very poor here, and you can't really make anything out in detail. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7801}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7803}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7803}{0}{<268>}{Escape Pods (w,e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor comes to an end here at the back of the ship. To the east and west, you can see the escape pods in the dim lighting. This looks to be the only way off the ship. Lucky for you the crew of the ship did not make it this far or you might not have been able to get home. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7802}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7804}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7805}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7804}{0}{<178>}{West escape pod (e)}{<178>(<268>P<178>)<088>}{You are in the west escape pod of the ship. On the south wall are the controls to the pod. There is room in the escape pod for many people and items, but who knows where it might take you. This might be the only way off the ship and back to safety though. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7803}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7805}{0}{<178>}{East escape pod (w)}{<178>( )<088>}{You are in what looks to have been an escape pod. Everything in sight, as well as the controls that run the pod have been smashed and torn to bits. You can only imagine the fight that must have taken place in here. In the rubble you are almost sure you can recognize human body parts. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7803}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7806}{0}{<268>}{Corridor (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Since the main lighting seems to be down, the red glow of the emergency lights is all you have to see by. On the east wall you can barely make out some yellow lettering and an arrow pointing to the south. You notice some very large scratch marks on the floor as well as a stripe of maroon running down the corridor. To the north is the docking bay. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7763}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7807}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7807}{0}{<268>}{Corridor (n,s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are in a corridor leading towards the main bridge south of you. A small doorway to the east reads 'SUPPLIES'. To the north the corridor leads back to the docking bay. The red glow from the emergency lights illuminate your way. You also notice some very large scratch marks on the floor as well as a crimson smudge running down the corridor. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
