R {7808}{0}{<268>}{Corridor (n,s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{A long corridor that connects the storage are with the shuttle bay and the main bridge. A doorway to the west reads 'WEAPONS', you might be needing one here soon. The walls here contain a crimson portrait of what is left of the crew. A few bloody smudges here and there explain it all. You see a slight flicker in the distance to the south. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7807}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7809}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7809}{0}{<268>}{Corridor (w,e,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are in small corridor that connects the main bridge to the rest of the ship. A faint cloud of smoke drifts from the south, you might want to investigate. The exit to the east is blocked by a large pile of rubble, making it impossible to enter. The walls here are splattered with blood, and the ever familiar blast marks. A small emergency light flickers, lighting your way. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
