R {7811}{0}{<078>}{Main Bridge (nw,ne,n)}{<078>| |<088>}{The navigational center for the entire ship. The large viewer to the front of you allows to view into the vast reaches of space. A small helm sits here, you determine that is the main station for controling the ship. To the northeast of you sits a small communications outlet. The room is hard to see anything in here from the intense smoke that the fire to the west seems to be producing. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
