R {7812}{0}{<078>}{Communications (w,sw,n)}{<078>| |<088>}{This is the communication hub for the entire ship. The large console here would allow you to communicate with anyone on the ship. To the north of you it seems that wall has collapsed making entrance into the room impossible. A body of the late communications officer lays dead across the console, crimson blood flows from his chest all over the controls. You will have to move him if you want access to the controls. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
