R {7823}{0}{<078>}{Science Lab (n,s)}{<078>| |<088>}{This is the chemical testing room. Beakers and test tubes now lay broken about the room. Traces of the experiments they once held now drip to the floor. A large fume hood sits in the corner attached to the ventilation system. The walls all about the room are splashed blood, though the room is spotless of corpses. You better hope what caused this is still not around. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7822}{u}{open vent;enter vent}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
