R {7824}{0}{<078>}{Science Lab (s)}{<078>| |<088>}{There are a variety of cages here with creatures that you can not recognize. You determine that this is some kind of experimentation lab where creatures are examined. Some of the species have been wounded or killed in the battle. The area smells of decay, and there are bodies scattered about the floor. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7823}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7825}{0}{<078>}{Science Lab (s,n)}{<078>| |<088>}{This is a rather large operating room. Vials and jars lay scatterd about the room. Bits and chunks of what looks to be small alien like creatures lay strewn about. You determine that the crew must have tried to perform experiments on the creatures before they took over. Acid drips off the operating table to the floor, where it has created a large hole down to the reactor. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
