R {7826}{0}{<078>}{Science Lab (n)}{<078>| |<088>}{Large rocks, and mineral samples lay scattered about. Broken shelving lays toppled onto the floor. The room once used to study geology, now lays in ruins. You notice a large corpse of an alien laying in the corner. A trail of acid leads to a small rock used to pummel it to death. The sight of the corpse gives you a sense of gratitude that the crew tried to fight back. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7825}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7827}{0}{<238>}{Near the reactor (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A long corridor heading towards the reactor control room. The walls here are covered with an alien webbing that forms a holding chamber for their next meal. From the amount of exo-plasmic goo around here you feel that you are getting close to something important. Though through the darkness you can't make out what is ahead. Above you in the ceiling is the hole that you just dropped through. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7825}{climb up}{climb up}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7828}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7825}{u}{climb up}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7828}{0}{}{Reactor Control Console (n)}{<178>(<118>~<178>)<088>}{You stand in the room once used by the crew as the control room for the reactor core. Now converted by the alien queen as the breeding ground of this horrendous race. The walls here are covered with an alien webbing that forms a holding chamber for their next meal. From the webbing you can see bodies of the crew members struggling to become free. A large control console, that once was used to monitor the reactor core sits here. You here a loud noise coming from inside the core.  }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7827}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
