R {7829}{0}{<078>}{An air chamber (crack,u)}{<078>| |<088>}{This is a small chamber where air passes through before it heads up into the ventilation system. The room is completely empty, except for the smashed grate you just entered from. The walls here are made of a smooth stainless steel. From the looks of the place the aliens haven't made it in here, so you're safe for the moment. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7828}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7830}{crack}{pry crack;crack}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7830}{s}{pry crack;crack}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7830}{0}{<248>}{A small room (crack)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The room is very small, and probably used as a hiding place. The room is completely empty. The room is so small that only one person could have hidden here. The room is spotless of any blood, so it must have been a good hiding place. The walls here are made up of stainless steel. It is odd for this room to exist here, must have been an engineering error during the creation. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7829}{crack}{crack}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7829}{n}{crack}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7831}{0}{}{Inside the reactor (out)}{ }{You stand in a large room, where the reaction for the nuclear core of the ship use to take place. The walls here are lined with a thick layer of graphite, to protect the workers from its hazardous radiation. Since you are now standing inside the core you hope no one turns it back on. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7828}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7832}{0}{}{First floor of the Spire (u,d)}{ }{You have climbed into the first floor of the Shaman's spire.  Drawn upon the floor is a pentagram intended for summoning.  Energy crackles in the air in flits and flickers. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6235}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7833}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7833}{0}{}{Second floor of the Spire (d,portal)}{ }{This is the second story of the Shaman's spire.  Skulls are built in to the floor in an odd way, not forming a specific shape, but clearly intended for a purpose beyond decoration.  The air is stale here, with a hint of decay. }{Ice Mountains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7832}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7834}{portal}{portal}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7834}{0}{}{A strange, shifting field of embers (portal)}{ }{You are standing (maybe?) in a large field of burning embers.  Although it is unpleasant, it doesn't seem to be hurting you.  All around you are bits and pieces of floating ash and burning bits.  They rise and fall in no particular way.  It's almost like snow on a windy day, but without the wind.  The field stretches on in all directions, while a small portal floats behind you. }{Ice Mountains}{karontor}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7833}{portal}{portal}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7835}{0}{<228>}{Hills (n,s,e,path)}{<228>.<238>P<228>^<088>}{Hills This is a hilly area with an occasional tree.  There is a piece of rock extending out of the ground.  There are some footprints of a humanoid style here.  Further to the north you note a road.  The dourness of the western mountains and northern icelands begin to fade quickly here, as green grass sprouts out of the warm ground and covers this area lushly.  The shadows of rolling hills and depressions can be seen to the south, and a well-travelled road lies to the north and east.  An old path leads up a hill, just to the west. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1501}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1503}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
