E {7836}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1504}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7842}{path}{path}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7842}{w}{w}{8}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7836}{0}{<228>}{Hills (n,s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Hills The ground gradually declines here.  There is a piece of rock extending out of the ground.  You've entered some bumpy terrain which appears to increase further to the north.  Further to the east you notice a road, while to the west you notice that the hills continue.  The land begins to flow up and down here, and the hills increase in size to the south.  To the northwest, you can see the beginnings of an enormous mountain range.  The sun beams down on you and your skin tingles with warmth.  Looking around you see the plant life fostering nicely, an arrangement of grass, weeds, flowers, and bushes.  There is a road far to the east, but you can see only wilderness stretching out in the other directions. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
