R {7843}{0}{<228>}{Grove (sw,n,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are in the center of a small pine grove between two hills.  Mountains rise all around you except to the east, creating a valley sheltered both from weather and from sight.  The dry bed of a stream leads off to the southwest and was once fed by the still-flowing water north of here. Now its path is severed by a gaping crack in the ground and the water flees from the surface into its depths.  Something has caused a violent change in the earth here not too long ago. }{Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
