R {7845}{0}{<148>}{Streambed (ne)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{You are just southwest of a small pine grove between two hills. Mountains rise all around you except to the north and northeast, creating a valley sheltered both from weather and from sight. To the north, within the valley, lies a knoll, covered with grass and wildflowers. The dry bed of a stream leads south, disappearing into the base of the mountainside and was once fed by the still-flowing water in the grove. Tucked against the westerly mountains is a small wooded area, where something definitely seems odd about the trees. }{Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
