R {7849}{0}{}{Pool (out)}{ }{As you look down, neck deep in the pool, you can now see its rocky bottom. The water is absolutely freezing and is probably the product of snowmelt. Water endlessly splatters into the pool from the spring at the north end, while the excess escapes down the stream to the south. Your body starts to feel numb from the cold and it might not be wise to stay here long. }{Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
