R {7850}{0}{}{Cavern (w,dive)}{ }{The soft gurgle of flowing water echoes throughout this apparently natural cavern of rock. Next to you is a clear pool of water which continues south through an opening under the rock, where sunlight is penetrating the water and dimly illuminating this cavern. Off to the west steps have been carved into the rocky floor as the cavern leads deeper into the mountain, and the sounds of gurgling water seem to originate from that direction. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
