R {7851}{0}{}{Landing (u,d)}{ }{You have arrived on a landing at the midpoint of the staircase carved into the solid rock of the cavern floor. The landing is about five paces in length, about as wide as the cavern is at this point. The steps are worn from use and age. In the center of the landing is a low-lying stone pedestal, where the statue of a dwarf stands facing the ascending staircase. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{rohm}{}{}{1.000}{1}
