R {7853}{0}{<238>}{Bridge (w,e)}{<238>===<088>}{Spanning the swiftly-flowing underground river, this entire bridge seems to have been carved from a huge chunk of rock and placed intact. The west end of the bridge rests upon a shelf of rock that channels the river between it and the east wall of the cavern, while the east end of the bridge rests at the opening to a smaller tunnel. To the north you can faintly make out what appears to be the end of this cavern, while to the south the cavern fades into darkness. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
