R {7854}{0}{<238>}{Shelf (n,s,e)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{This shelf of rock, several paces in width, acts as a walkway along the river to the north and south. To the east lies the stone bridge leading to the passage back to the surface. The base fixture of what was probably once a sconce remains uselessly set into the cavern's west wall. Bits and pieces of weapons lie scattered upon the ledge and you see some larger debris to the south. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
