R {7855}{0}{<238>}{Shelf (n,s)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{This shelf of rock, several paces in width, acts as a walkway along the river to the north and south. The bridge is now barely visible through the darkness to the north, and to the south you can make out what appears to be the end of this large cavern. In front of you a metal frame of some sort juts out from the shelf, and the river flows swiftly by as its channel narrows slightly. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
