R {7857}{0}{<238>}{Tunnel (w,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{After a short stretch of tunnel, you come across the remains of a barricade that once fortified the tunnel against the east. It appears that someone or something has partially dismantled the barricade from its western side in a hurried and disorganized manner, allowing further travel down the passage. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
