R {7859}{0}{<148>}{Water (w,e)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The depth of the pool forces submergence almost up to your neck, and the ceiling has sloped down low over the water, intensifying the feeling of a lack of mobility brought about by the water. Not far off, to the east and west, lie the exit points of this stagnant pool. Now and again, a few suspicious bubbles churn the surface of the otherwise calm water. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{temper2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
