R {7862}{0}{<238>}{Passage (se,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{This section of tunnel is markedly different from that to the southeast. The walls and floor have been squared off and finished, and the ceiling curves over you in a near perfect arc. Along the walls intricate carvings have been chiseled from the stone, depicting scenes with masterful craftsmanship. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
