R {7864}{0}{<238>}{Passage (e)}{<238>] [<088>}{The passage, with its finished floor, arched ceiling, and intricate carvings along the walls, comes to an abrupt end here at a seamless wall. Upon the wall is posted a decree. Back to the east you can just make out an intersection. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7863}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7865}{0}{<238>}{Gates (n,s)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You stand in a broad and tall passage. To the north your path is flanked by two massive doors, standing open before you.  To your south the passage comes to an end at a T-intersection. Several wall-mounted sconces hold torches that illuminate the area. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
