R {7866}{0}{<248>}{Arcade (n,s)}{<248># #<088>}{Half-columns sculpted from the walls arch overhead to form decorative supports for the wide passage.  Lit periodically by gilded, sconce-held lanterns, the arcade ends just to the north, opening into what appears to be an enormous space.  From that direction you can hear indiscernible chatter and a bustle of activity.  Just to the south stand the massive stone gates that help secure this entrance. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7865}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
