R {7867}{0}{<268>}{Hall (n,s,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The expansive Grand Hall of Rohm Giddor extends around you almost as far as the eye can see.  Six enormous square pillars extend diagonally from the east and west sides of the hall, the three pairs crossing each other before they reach the ceiling far above.  Brilliant orbs of light line the tops and bottoms of the pillars, providing most of the light for the Hall.  The southern two pillars cross each other high above you on their way to the lofty ceiling.  Dwarves of all sorts can be seen either milling about in conversation or traveling throughout the Hall. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
