R {7868}{0}{<268>}{Hall (e,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The expansive Grand Hall of Rohm Giddor extends around you almost as far as the eye can see.  Six enormous square pillars extend diagonally from the east and west sides of the hall, the three pairs crossing each other before they reach the ceiling far above.  Brilliant orbs of light line the tops and bottoms of the pillars, providing most of the light for the Hall.  One of the pillars makes its footprint here before rising steeply to the east.  An alcove to the south seems to be a center of activity, where it appears goods are being exchanged. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
