R {7869}{0}{<148>}{Marketplace (n)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{This large alcove rises to about a third of the height of the Grand Hall to the north.  Its southern end is rounded off and the only exit appears to be back north.  Dwarves have set up stands to show their wares, which appear to mainly consist of various tools and dwarf-sized clothing, though there are a few more exotic items, such as weapons and light armor.  Around the stands, dwarves of all kinds can be seen browsing wares or engaged in exchanges. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{glowstones}{}{}{1.000}{1}
