R {7877}{0}{<268>}{Hall (w,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The expansive Grand Hall of Rohm Giddor extends around you almost as far as the eye can see.  Six enormous square pillars extend diagonally from the east and west sides of the hall, the three pairs crossing each other before they reach the ceiling far above.  Brilliant orbs of light line the tops and bottoms of the pillars, providing most of the light for the Hall.  One of the pillars makes its footprint here before rising steeply to the west.  An arched doorway opens into a wide passage to the north, and to the west lies a raised area of the Hall, accessible by about a dozen steps from this side.  Dwarves amble by frequently here, heading to various points in the Hall or through the archway to the north. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
