R {7878}{0}{<238>}{Passage (nw,s,se)}{<238>] [<088>}{For the most part, this large passage is empty and clean.  It starts to slope downward as it fades from sight to the southeast, and comes to an end just to the northwest, where an open doorway reveals an empty dining hall.  The royal crest of Rohm Giddor is embossed on the north wall.  To the south lies the northern entrance to the enormous Grand Hall. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7877}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
