R {7879}{0}{<238>}{Ramp (n,nw)}{<238>. ^<088>}{A seemingly bottomless pit drops off into darkness both above and below you.  Bordered by a stone railing, a ramp juts out from the circular walls.  The spiral ramp circles downward from the northwest passage, traveling around the pit counterclockwise before exiting a full story lower into another tunnel to the north.  An eerie sound of rushing wind echoes from far below, fading in and out like giant bellows or crashing waves on a stormy night.  There are no visible light sources here, yet you seem to have no trouble seeing a fair distance away. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7878}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7880}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7880}{0}{<238>}{Passage (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{This wide tunnel is capable of supporting quite a bit of foot traffic if the need arose.  The passage is lit by neither torch nor visible magic.  Marble-like veins of luminescent rock embedded in the walls glow brightly enough to illuminate your surroundings.  Here it is rather quiet, though you can hear more activity to the north. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7879}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7881}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7881}{0}{<238>}{Passage (nw,s,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{This wide tunnel is capable of supporting quite a bit of foot traffic if the need arose.  The passage is lit by neither torch nor visible magic.  Marble-like veins of luminescent rock embedded in the walls glow brightly enough to illuminate your surroundings.  Dwellings of all sorts can be seen around you, but this passage seems to lead off to more interesting places.  The passage continues north and south, and there appears to be some sort of library to the northwest. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
