R {7882}{0}{<238>}{Library (se)}{<238>"""<088>}{Rows and rows of tall bookcases line both walls of this immense room all the way to the back.  As far as you can tell, the shelves are at or near their book-holding capacity.  Low tables and chairs sit in the wide space between the rows.  Upon the tables are clean-burning oil lamps, some writing implements, and a few scraps of blank parchment. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7881}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

