R {7885}{0}{<258>}{Circle (nw)}{<258>(<158>P<258>)<088>}{This room is a perfectly round cylinder that extends above to about twice your height.  Marbled veins of glowing rock permeate the walls, but the brightest light in the room comes from a geometric pattern in the circular floor.  A narrow passage leads northwest. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
