R {7894}{0}{<238>}{Tunnel (s,se)}{<238>] [<088>}{Having traveled deep enough into the rock to muffle most of the sounds of flowing water, the tunnel takes a sharp turn to the south here and comes to an end at a solidly-placed wooden door. Mounted to the left of the door is a lantern, its glass well without fuel. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
