R {7895}{0}{<278>}{Chamber (d,s)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This small, square chamber is simple and unadorned.  Sconce-held torches cast light down a narrow staircase.  Giving only the view of the back of a tapestry, an opening in the south wall grants access to the Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7873}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7896}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7896}{0}{<278>}{Passage (u,n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{At the bottom of a set of stairs, a narrow passage leads north.  The walls are bare, save for a large seal carved from the rock wall to the south, where the passage ends at the foot of the stair.  The stair itself leads upward a short bit before twisting around, blocking the top from view.  The air is cool but dry, and you think you can hear voices echo from some distance down the hall. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7895}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7897}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7897}{0}{<238>}{Passage (n,s,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{The faint glow coming from the walls in this tunnel is bright enough to see your surroundings, but is not enough to allow you to see further down the passage.  The eastern wall is broken by a gaping hole with jagged edges, while the main passage continues to the north and south.  A glowing rune is inlaid into the floor near the eastern hole. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
