R {7898}{0}{<278>}{Stair (d,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The floor has been cleared and leveled to be even with the adjacent passage, but except for this and a staircase leading down, the rest of the room appears to be untouched by tools.  Strange, natural rock formations cover the walls and ceiling.  The opening to the passage is to the west.  A stone sign has been placed at the head of the stair, whose steps seem to glisten in the light. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{temper4}{}{}{1.000}{1}
