R {7900}{0}{<238>}{Antechamber (ne,n,s,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{You stand within a small antechamber with four egresses.  Two doorways with sturdy wooden doors lead east and north.  A dim passage leads back to the south and a shimmering archway leads northeast.  The room is sparsely furnished.  An antique table sits against the west wall and two pole-mounted braziers rise on either side of the table, the flames within flooding the room with light. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
