E {45713}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45741}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7911}{0}{}{Shaft (u,d)}{ }{You rest upon a narrow ledge at the base of a staircase leading up.  The geometrically perfect, glistening stairs lie in stark contrast to the dull, craggy rock of volcanic origin that surrounds you.  Below, a shaft drops down into more darkness, but there seem to be plenty of hand and footholds to go down if you wanted.  The faint odor of sulfur wafts up from below. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7910}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7912}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7912}{0}{<278>}{Shaft (nw,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{Small vents release noxious gases into this natural cavern.  Igneous rock surrounds you and crumbles under your weight as you test the ground, though some effort has been made to keep a level path to the northwest.  The smell of sulfur is almost overwhelming, and the air is incredibly hot.  A shaft leads up here, away from the heat. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7911}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7913}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7913}{0}{<238>}{Passage (se,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{A noticeable rumble is coming from the floor here, though it feels stable enough to walk upon.  Hot steam randomly gushes out of small vents in the floor and walls, burning you despite your attempts at evasion.  The earth is definitely active here, and it would be best to keep moving. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7912}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7914}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7917}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7914}{0}{<238>}{Passage (nw,s,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{The cavern branches here, leading northwest, west, and back to the south.  A noticeable rumble is coming from the floor, though it feels stable enough to walk upon.  Hot steam randomly gushes out of small vents in the floor and walls, burning you despite your attempts at evasion.  The earth is even more active here, and it would be best to keep moving. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7913}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7915}{w}{w;pluck massive vine}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7916}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7915}{0}{<118>}{Flames (e)}{<118>` ^<088>}{The floor rumbles violently beneath you.  It seems barely stable enough to support you.  The hot steam activity has increased, gushing out with force and burning you.  One particularly large hole in the cavern floor exposes a flow of lava.  You try to remain calm amidst the chaos. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{temper5}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7914}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7916}{0}{<248>}{Forge (se)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{You have entered a large room that is likely the main forge of the dwarves. About the room are scattered several furnaces and a number of anvils and other implements for working metal into shape.  A narrow channel runs the length of the back wall, and through it flows a steady stream of magma.  Above the channel, liquid metal glows brightly in heavy vessels.  It is still quite warm in here, but the temperature is somehow kept bearable. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{balaban}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7914}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7917}{0}{}{Pits (sw,n)}{ }{Two rows of faintly glowing stones fail to illuminate this dark and crooked passage.  Between the rows appears to be a safe path to the north, where the pits seem to continue, and back to the southwest.  All around you, foul-smelling pits gurgle and emit noxious but colorless fumes.  A step off the path could very well mean your death. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7913}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7918}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7918}{0}{}{Pits (n,s)}{ }{Pits of viscous, bubbling liquid of various sizes permeate the floor of the cavern.  A relatively safe pathway is lined by stones and winds its way north where there seems to be more light.  The stones, as well as the walls of the cavern, glow with a faint luminescence, but the passage to the south is consumed by darkness. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7917}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {7919}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7919}{0}{}{Concavity (s)}{<148>P<088>}{You have entered a small round chamber in the depths of the earth that is quite surreal.  Flecks of brilliant light in the walls, ceiling and floor twinkle and flash randomly, and when combined with the lesser glow of the rock, they illuminate the chamber brightly.  There are no furnishings or evidence that the dwarves made this place, but you can't see how it could have formed naturally.  A circular pool of silvery liquid is contained in the middle of the floor by a low wall of rock.  Small ripples in the pool shimmer with reflected light. }{Grand Hall of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7918}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {7920}{0}{<168>}{Tundra (n,s,w,e)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Tundra This is a cold dead land, seemingly supporting no life.  You feel an overwhelming sense of loneliness on this extending plain.  There is a small formation of ice here.   }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
