R {7923}{0}{<168>}{Tundra (n,s,w,e)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Tundra You have entered a cold treeless desert of frozen soil.  The ground in this area is coarse and distorted.  The frozen soil crackles underfoot.  Further to the west, south and east you can see that the tundra continues.  The vast frozen tundra makes you shiver.  You look north to see a glacier filled land of ice and snow.  The thought of that place chills you to the bone.  You rewrap your clothing around you and press onward. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
