R {7924}{0}{<168>}{Icelands (e,w,s,n)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Icelands In the distance, you see light reflecting off the peak of an icy glacier, glistening in the sunlight.  You are on a flat plain covered in snow, broken by glaciers.  A blast of arctic wind freezes you to the core.  Further to the west and north you see that the land of ice continues.  To the south, tundra as far as the eye can see. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7923}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
