R {7925}{0}{<168>}{Icelands (n,s,w,e)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Icelands In the distance, you see light reflecting off the peak of an icy glacier, glistening in the sunlight.  You find yourself backtracking around a treacherous snowdrift.  This is a cold, icy region of the north.  Further to the north and west you see that the land of ice continues.   }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7924}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
