R {7926}{0}{<168>}{Icelands (n,s,w,e,enter)}{<168>^<238>E<168>~<088>}{Icelands The wind moans like a dying soul.  This is a cold, icy region of the north.  A blast of arctic wind freezes you to the core.  Further to the north and west you note that the land of ice continues.  Mounds of icy soil lie around the entrance to a tunnel that leads directly into the ground here. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7925}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1777}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
