R {7989}{0}{<168>}{Icelands (n,s,w,e)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Icelands You are on a flat plain covered in snow, broken by glaciers.  A blast of arctic wind freezes you to the core.  To the north you see snow capped mountains.  Further to the south and east you see that the land of ice continues.   }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
