R {7990}{0}{<168>}{Icelands (n,s,w,e)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Icelands To the north you see snow capped mountains.  You find yourself backtracking around a treacherous snowdrift.  This is a cold, icy region of the north.  Further to the south and east you notice that the land of ice continues.   }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7989}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
