R {7991}{0}{<168>}{Icelands (e,w,s,n)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Icelands You have entered a land of snow and ice.  The wind moans like a dying soul.  You barely save yourself from falling as you slip on a patch of ice.  Further to the north and east you can see that the land of ice continues.  Tundra lies to the south, while to the north the icy plain continues. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
