R {7992}{0}{<168>}{Tundra (n,s,w,e)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Tundra You have entered a cold treeless desert of frozen soil.  Some drifting snow swirls around your feet.  There is a small formation of ice here.  Further to the east and south you note that the tundra continues.   }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
