R {7993}{0}{<168>}{Tundra (n,s,w,e)}{<168>^ ~<088>}{Tundra A harsh, biting wind chills you to the bone.  This is a cold dead land, seemingly supporting no life.  Some drifting snow swirls around your feet.  Further to the north and south you see that the tundra continues. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
