R {7996}{0}{}{A crumbling hall (se,sw,u,n)}{ }{You've dropped down through the hole above to find yourself in a crumbling tunnel beneath the earth.  Dust swirls around your feet as you scuff your way across the smooth square cut blocks of stone that are the floor of this ancient hall. As you glance about to get your bearings, you find a shock nearby: an operating pub!  This is certainly like no dark  catacombs that you've ever raided before.  You steel yourself for the surprises that are sure to come. }{Catacombs}{catacombs}{}{}{1.000}{1}
