R {8003}{0}{}{The ancient dwarven halls (se,n,w)}{ }{You push your way past a stone block which has fallen from the  ceiling above and leans across the corridor.  The massive stone  block weighs tons and is several feet thick, showing cracks from  age, but still whole even after all this time.  A portion of the  wall has fallen inwards where the ceiling block crushed it as it  fell, a dark recess in a shadowy hall. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
