R {8004}{0}{}{A darkened chamber (nw)}{ }{A darkened room which seems to have been a storage room at some  time in the past.  Shattered casks and crumbling crates litter the  floor, yet strangely seem to have been swept away from the center  of the room.  A portion of the floor has been charred as if by  recent and frequent fires.  Someone has camped here, and not so  very long ago. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
