R {8007}{0}{}{A shadowy room (w)}{ }{The scent of crushed berries and stripped sugar maple bark waifts  to your nose.  A small sleeping pallet has been laid out against  one wall, looking to be fairly new and often used.  Small bottles  of strange liquids sit upon a small chest which is the only other  piece of furniture in the room. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
