R {8008}{0}{}{The dwarven ruins (w,e)}{ }{The rugged walls of the ancient citadel are crumbling here and  there with age.  Stones skitter across the floor leaving trails in  the dust.  You can smell dried blood despite the age of the place,  there are even a few red stains here and there still. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
