R {8014}{0}{}{A dead end (w)}{ }{You've come to a dead end in the hallway.  Fallen rock blocks  the passage further east.  Layers of dust lie stirred by the cave in, obviously a recent occurence.  That also explains why there are few signs of goblin infestation here. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8013}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8015}{0}{}{A dark, smelly hall (e,s,n)}{ }{The overpowering odor of goblins assaults you as you stand in this dark passage.  Scraps of food and discarded clothes litter the  stone floor, all the indications of a goblin infestation.  How tragic it is that this once proud dwarven stronghold has fallen to the likes of these green skinned parasites. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8013}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8016}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
