R {8016}{0}{}{A dead end (n)}{ }{You've come to a dead end in the hallway.  Fallen rock blocks  the passage further south.  Layers of dust lie stirred by the cave in, obviously a recent occurance.  That also explains why there are few signs of goblin infestation here. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8015}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8017}{0}{}{A bend in the passage (w,s)}{ }{You've come upon a turning in the passage.  A faint glow finds its way around the bend to cast the barest equivalent of star light upon the stone.  As you glance about, you come to the conclusion that this part of the old citadel is worse off than any of the others you've been in.  The stench of urine and rotting food permeates everything and the floor is littered with enough refuse that you think twice about advancing further. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8015}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8018}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8018}{0}{}{The court of the Goblin Lord (e)}{ }{It takes a moment for your eyes to adjust to the dim lighting of the room, but when you do, you stand shocked at what lies before you.  The floor is littered with slowly rotting corpses, some human, others goblin or unidentifiable.  A massive throne sits against one wall,  flanked by stone tables covered with the remains of a massive feast. The stench of unwashed bodies and rancid meat mingles with that of blood, rotting flesh and excrement.  What a marvelous court this  self proclaimed lord of goblins must hold. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8017}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8019}{0}{}{The top of a ramp (d,s)}{ }{The ancient stone walls begin to gently slope downwards here, following the gentle curve of a long sweeping ramp.  The stones here show all the signs of a pitched battle, gouged and stained from some ancient war.  Small recesses line the walls at the very top of the ramp, though they stand empty now.  This can only be one of the main interchanges between levels of the ancient citadel, perhaps the only passage still servicable after years of disuse and abuse. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8006}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8020}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8020}{0}{}{A passage deep within the earth (u,s,w)}{ }{The long, stark passages seem to swallow sounds, leaving you jumping at imagined sounds.  Your lights seem to barely penetrate the darkness, casting dancing shadows along the stone, bringing to life your worst fears in an intangible enemy.  Perspiration chills your skin in the cool air of this underground fortress, sending your skin crawling. A long, curving ramp leads upwards towards the surface. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8019}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8021}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21082}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8021}{0}{}{An ancient dwarven hall (n,e)}{ }{The stonework seems to glisten in the sharp light you carry, coated with a faint sheen of moisture.  The glistening stone seems black in the garish light, making it impossible for you to tell if it is simply water, or perhaps something more grisly. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8020}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8022}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8022}{0}{}{A dark hall in the ancient citadel (s,w)}{ }{An unearthly silence swallows any sounds of your passage, seeming to muffle your footsteps even before they reach your own ears.  The smooth stone floor and walls are exceptionally clean, showing only the lightest layers of dust.  A disturbing aura permeates the very air, sending a icy shiver down your spine. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8021}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8023}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8023}{0}{}{A dark and eerie hall (n,s,e)}{ }{The dark stone halls are colder here, deeper within the earth.  The ancient stonework seems to have seen less wear and tear than that above, though you sense that something is quite amiss here in this dark fortress in the earth.  The long halls, once hung with ancient shields and weapons, tapestries and stonework, are now dark and empty. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8022}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8024}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21099}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8024}{0}{}{A stone corridor (n,w)}{ }{The dark winding halls of the ancient clan home seem colder here, slightly more sinister.  Perhaps it is the scarred rock, gouged  by some unearthly force.  Or maybe it's just the infernal darkness that not even your torches and lamps can dispel.  Some great evil has been here, and it's not long gone. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8023}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8025}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8025}{0}{}{A large chamber. (s,e)}{ }{A darkened chamber. deep within the earth.  Ancient stone, worn smooth over the years, stretches out to the stone block walls, dust free. The massive carved blocks of stone are broken in only two places around the chamber, the hall leading south and the small doorway in the eastern wall. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8024}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8026}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8026}{0}{}{A small chamber (w)}{ }{A small side room off a larger chamber.  This was probably once a ready room for guards or a storage room for the trappings of official dwarven celebrations.  Plain and sturdy, the room has survived the years well, even if its contents have not.  Shattered and splintered wood litters the floor, the remnants of chairs and tables from the  looks of them. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8025}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8027}{0}{}{Backyard (w,back)}{<148>B<088>}{This place is filled with snow. Wherever you look, all you can see is snow, snow and more snow. To the west however you notice something that looks like a small door leading inside a small house. A faint light comes from the opening and you think you can hear singing coming from inside. }{Toy Factory}{toy_factory}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6536}{back}{back}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8028}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8028}{0}{}{A corridor (w,e)}{ }{You find yourself standing in a small cozy corridor. Sounds of machines, and eager voices come from the west. A doormat  lies on the floor. You can feel that this is a really friendly place. An opening to the east leads out to the snow and cold. }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8027}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8029}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8029}{0}{}{A corridor (e,w)}{ }{You stand in the middle of a small corridor leading in the east-west direction. The sound of machines grow stronger further to the west. A sweet smell reaches you, and you can't help but to feel very happy. You notice a small sign attached to one of the walls. }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8028}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8030}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8030}{0}{}{A corridor (e,n)}{ }{The corridor turns north into a small cozy chamber. You notice a lot of machines ahead. This room is filled with paintings on the walls, making the room really colorful. Colors of red, blue, yellow and green light up the room. You can hear lots of music playing and singing coming from inside the chamber. This place is weird indeed. Maybe you should just go back?  }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8029}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8031}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8031}{0}{}{A chamber (e,w,n,s)}{ }{You have stepped into a small toy factory. There are toys and small machines everywere you look. Gnomes and elves run around trying to keep up with their work of producing presents for the children. In the corner of this room you notice a small machine.  The humming sound from the machine makes you feel really relaxed, and tired. A small note is attached on the wall here. }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8030}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8032}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
