E {8034}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8032}{0}{}{A chamber (e,n)}{ }{The factory walls make any further progression to the west and south impossible. A speaker in the west wall sings out 'Happy happy joy joy, happy happy joy'. You feel like singing also! This place is just plain happiness!  }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8031}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8033}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8033}{0}{}{A chamber (s,e)}{ }{The chamber opens up before you. On the floor lies lots of presents, papers and toys. East from here you spot a huge green tree. Some snow lies on the floor. Wonder where it came from? }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8032}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8034}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8034}{0}{}{A chamber (w,e,s,n)}{ }{This must be the center of the chamber. Exits go in all directions from here. A huge Christmas tree stands in the middle of the room and you see elves and gnomes dancing around, singing Christmas songs. A lot of snow lies on the floor, but still this room radiates warmth and friendship. You get a feeling Santa Claus must be close by. Have you been nice this year? }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8033}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8036}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8031}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8037}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8035}{0}{}{A chamber (w,n)}{ }{You are in the southeast corner of this small factory. Shelves filled with different toys line the wall. This entire room is painted in yellow, making you want to throw up. You notice a long note attached to one of the walls. }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8031}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8036}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8036}{0}{}{A chamber (w,s)}{ }{You are in the northeast corner of this small factory. A long pole is placed in the middle of the room and a rope is secured to it, probably for some animal. To the west you can see a huge tree. Wonder what that might be? }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8035}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8034}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8037}{0}{}{A small room (s)}{<118>S<088>}{This is a small room filled with snow. A large window is on each of the four walls. The starlight from outside reflects against the snow and that's the only light there is in this room. In the middle of the room is a huge throne. This must be Santa Claus's private office. Now, behave or you won't get any presents this year. }{Toy Factory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8034}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8038}{0}{<238>}{Narrow Path up a Mountain (se,ne)}{<238>.^.<088>}{Ahead, to the northeast you notice a small trail which ends at the base of a small mountain.  In the midst of a great range, this mountain seems to stick out for some reason.  Perhaps you should check it out? }{Harfain}{harfain}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1639}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8039}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8039}{0}{<238>}{Narrow Path up a Mountain (sw,u)}{<238>.^.<088>}{A brisk breeze whips at you as you climb up the rough rocks on the side of the mountain. You smile to yourself for your physical prowess at having climbed this far. You see that the mountain gets a little  steeper ahead. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8038}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8040}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8040}{0}{<238>}{Narrow Path up a Mountain (d,cave)}{<238>.^.<088>}{A brisk breeze whips at you as you climb up the rough rocks on the side of the mountain.  You are amazed at the view which seems to extend to the farthest reaches of the realms.  But even as you peer outward, you stumble on the entrance to a small cave. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
