R {8160}{0}{<238>}{A sterile laboratory (se,nw,sw,ne)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've wandered into some kind of laboratory.  White countertops  line the walls cluttered with outlandish equipment, vials, test  tubes and bottles of various chemicals.  You're not sure what  they're doing in here, but it's definitely something beyond your  comprehension. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
