R {8161}{0}{<238>}{A sterile laboratory (sw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This portion of the lab seems unnaturally cluttered with  glassware, as if some experiment was recently completed.   You can still smell the faint odor of the brine solutions  that are popular for cloning procedures. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8160}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8162}{0}{<238>}{A sterile laboratory (nw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The countertops here are only slightly less cluttered than the  others, lacking much of the expensive equipment and dedicated to  the purer wet chemistry which the laboratory requires.  You can  smell the residue of thousands of past experiments, detecting the  sharp odor of many acidic compounds.  You think twice about  touching anything here, not sure what you may find on your skin  after the fact. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8160}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8163}{0}{<238>}{A sterile laboratory (se)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is one of the most amazing laboratories you've ever  encountered.  They've got just about every piece of equipment  for poking, probing, dissecting and evaporating organic tissues.  The place is entirely too sterile for anything other than gene  splicing and cloning. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8160}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8164}{0}{<238>}{A cramped office (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A tidy little corner squeezed between two of the station's major  bulkheads.  The desk is little more than a table barely large  enough to hold the computer that's on it.  A single chair sits  behind the desk, and a communications panel is embedded into the  wall.  This is definitely not one of your more important corners of  the station. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8115}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8165}{0}{<238>}{A cluttered storage room (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{An immense storage room.  This must occupy the entire space  between the perimeter hall and the central core of the station  along this quarter.  As far as you can see the room is stacked  with crates and gas canisters holding things you can only imagine. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8117}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8166}{0}{<238>}{An enormous storage room (sw,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You marvel at the size of this storage bay.  The entire quarter of  this level must be storage, because this room is nearly that size.   Stacks of boxes and crates clutter the expanse of the room.  Across  the gigantic room you spy an immense set of doors in the outside  wall of the station. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8119}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
