R {8167}{0}{<238>}{An immense storage room (w,ne)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand near the center of an immense storage room on the  corporate level of the station.  Stacks of crates and boxes stand  waiting to be unpacked and their contents used.  The area directly  before you is cleared out, leaving an immense loading area before  the monstrous doors which breach the skin of the space station. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
