R {8168}{0}{<238>}{An enormous storage room (e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The immense storeroom takes up most of this portion of the  corporate level in Midways.  Crates and boxes are scattered  about the floor, stacked in places, cluttered together in  others.  Across the room you see a pair of immense doors set  into the exterior wall of the station. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8167}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8120}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8169}{0}{<238>}{A storeroom (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A narrow corridor of crates greets you as you step through the  doorway.  The entire room is stacked with crates and boxes, leaving  only small alleyways through them so that some poor  Midways  employee can check the crate numbers against some silly inventory. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8123}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8170}{0}{<238>}{A storage room (w,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A rather large storage room within the space station.  You can't  quite imagine why this one seems different than the others though,  yet something seems strangely unique.  Perhaps it is the relative  lack of piled crates hiding the walls in the far corners of the  room, or maybe the dim lighting which seems unique to only this room. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8171}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8124}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8171}{0}{<238>}{A barren storeroom (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This back portion of the storeroom is strangely empty of crates  and boxes.  A strange silvery pod rests in a pair of steel cradles  against the back wall.  You can't imagine what this thing can be,  but you get the feeling that it's been stuffed back here until  someone decides to take a look at it. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8170}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42522}{enter pod}{enter pod}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8172}{0}{<238>}{The COMSTAR-Midways shuttle bay (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This small, cramped docking bay hosts just enough room for a single small ship to dock at.  Judging by the size of the space, this area seems to be intended for a small maintenance shuttle.  The metallic bulkheads which separate the station from the icy cold of space have been painted over with a harsh yellow and black pattern to denote this area as a non-public access area. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8126}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42973}{board shuttle}{board shuttle}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8173}{0}{<238>}{A corporate office (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've wandered into the cluttered office of one of the Midways  corporate lackeys.  The small desk is dominated by the terminal  keyboard and the large monitor where someone spends their days  slaving away.  It's kinda amazing in this computer age that a desk  can become so cluttered with useless junk.  You'd thought such  things were long gone with the writing paper associated with it. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8129}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8174}{0}{<238>}{A corporate office (nw,se)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A stylishly decorated office and waiting room.  The lighting here  is subtle, provided by recessed lighting.  Two soft chairs and a  couch provide comfortable seating for those waiting to be admitted  to the inner office.  A desk colored to look like deeply stained  walnut.  It's much less cluttered than you'd expect, in fact it  seems like whoever works at it doesn't really do much work at all. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8131}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8175}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8175}{0}{<238>}{Midways executive office (se)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You gawk at the lavish decor in this executive office.  You can  almost forget that you're in orbit high over the Earth.  A huge  desk of real wood dominates a holographic image of some tropical  island.  Two overstuffed leather chairs face the desk, though  you're not sure if you'd want to be the one in them across the desk  from an executive in this company.  The walls are adorned with  banners showing the logo of the Midways corporation. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8174}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8176}{0}{<238>}{A corporate office (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A fairly stylish office as far as closets go.  The acrylic see  through desk will surely get some leggy secretary a promotion some  day, though she'd have to clear the clutter off of it.  The rest of  the room isn't really stellar, but it's tastefully knick knacked.  A  plastic chair is wedged into one corner facing the desk while an  actual living plant occupies the other corner. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8133}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8177}{0}{<238>}{A sterile laboratory (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've wandered into some kind of laboratory.  White countertops  line the walls cluttered with outlandish equipment, vials, test  tubes and bottles of various chemicals.  You're not sure what  they're doing in here, but it's definitely something beyond your  comprehension. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8134}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8178}{0}{<278>}{Midways central core (descend,ascend)}{<278>< ><088>}{As you hang weightless in the zero gravity of the Midways core,  you glance about you to take in the surroundings.  The core below  you extends hundreds of feet towards the other end of the  station.  Along the extent of the core you can see shadowed  openings where tunnels connect to the core, allowing access to  other levels of the station.  As you glance above, you gasp in  astonishment at the sight of millions of stars screened through the  fine leaves of several different types of trees. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8110}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8179}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8179}{0}{<178>}{The end of the Midways core (e,w,n,descend,s)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{You hang precariously at one end of the central core to the  Midways station.  The zero gravity of the core holds you aloft  unsteadily as the gravity of the surrounding level tugs at you.  All about you the station has burst to life with plants of every  description, all flourishing beneath a transparent canopy giving  you a breathtaking view of the stars.  Beneath you the central  core drops away towards the rest of the station. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8178}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8180}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8186}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8194}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8200}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8180}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (w,e,n,s)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{The drooping limbs of willow trees intertwine about you, creating  a strange canopy of leaves and tangled branches overhead.  The air  feels like it just rained, though you know that can't have happened  here.  Through the tangle of leaves you can glimpse the metallic  walls of the central core of the station to the east. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8179}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8181}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8201}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
