R {8184}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (e,w,s,n)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{You pause beneath a sprawling willow, finding little comfort from  the humid air beneath its branches.  The still air allows the faint  song of the space station's birds to reach your ears.  Even as you  listen to their song you begin to forget the stresses of space  travel, feeling as if you've entered a special sanctuary where the  world was spared from the ravages of war. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8183}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8185}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
