R {8185}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (e,w,s,n)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{You listen to the gentle rustle of the willow branches in the  gentle breeze from the station's central core.  The cooling winds  refresh you from the stale confines of the station's other levels,  letting your mind wander from the sterile environment of the  Midways station. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8184}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
