R {8187}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (w,e,s,n)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The gentle rustle of the willow tree's drooping branches sounds  a gentle counterpoint to the mild twitter of the garden's birds.  As you wander the garden, enjoying the small sliver of Earth  transplanted into space, you marvel at the efforts taken to keep  this large a wilderness area in space. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
