R {8189}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (sw,w,n)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The gentle rustle of the wind through the leaves seems like a  memory from a far gone land.  The darkness of space looms through  the trees, separated from this lush garden by the thinnest of  barriers.  Yet even with the frigid cold of the void so close, the  wildlife here in the garden follow their instincts, ignorant of  their precarious position in space. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8188}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
