R {8190}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (ne,w,n)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The laden branches of the drooping willow trees form a soft canopy  above you.  The warm air beneath the greenery lightly caresses your  skin, allowing you to forget that you're only feet away from the  icy blackness of space.  The soft tufts of moss under foot are  like a gentle carpet as you wander through the Midways gardens. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
