R {8192}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (w,ne,n)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{A light breeze stirs the leaves overhead even as it cools your  skin.  You marvel at the sliver of paradise that the Midways  ecologists have nurtured to flourish here in the icy grip of  space.  The soft grasses brush at your legs, leaving faint marks  as you shake the dew from them in passing. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
