R {8193}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (e,nw,n)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{You stand amazed at the miracles produced with the station's  environmental controls.  The air is heavy and humid and the  temperature has risen to a sweltering 38 Celsius.  The trees have  largely given way to small bushes and vined growth.  Pools of water  abound, apparently just forming in shallow depressions where the  earth can't drain it off.  A miniature paradise has been created  here, a complete recreation of the tropics on Earth. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
