R {8194}{0}{<178>}{The Midway gardens (w,e,s,n)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{The mossy earth is soft and spongy beneath your feet.  The branches  of several willows hang down to the ground about you, forming a  series of little shelters within the gardens.  You marvel at the  ability to recreate such an environment on the station.  The warm,  humid air and smell of wild plant growth only add to the atmosphere  and help you to forget the fact that you're drifting in space. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
