R {8208}{0}{<238>}{A Starcraft Expansion Shuttle Bay (e)}{<238>|||<088>}{A docking bay on the Starcraft Expansion space station. This docking bay is in a state of disarray. The confederate forces have only recently regained access to the station. You can hear explosions, and the sounds of fighting off down the corridors of the space station. The bulkheads are the drab gray of the Midway station, but they are covered with scorch marks. There is a security check point to the east. There is a shuttle waiting here to take marines rotating off the station, back to the home world.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{broodwar}{}{}{1.000}{1}
