R {8209}{0}{<268>}{Security Checkpoint Alpha (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing at Security Checkpoint Alpha on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The security checkpoint consists of a small security stand out in the middle of the corridor with usually only a single marine to guard it. The steel grating clanks softly under your feet as you walk, in comparison to the sounds of battle and the mechanical whine of SCVs off to the east. The sounds of shuttle craft coming and going in the hangar off to the west are less audible, but still recognizable. The walls of the corridor remind you of the Midways Space Station, because of the drab gray paint that was originally used to paint them. The scorch marks and bullet holes portray the sense of an enormous battle having been fought here in the not so distant past.  There is a sign on the wall here.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8208}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8210}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8210}{0}{<268>}{A corner space station corridor (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a corner corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs north on into the station, and back to the security check point and the shuttle bay to the west. This space station must be massive, considering that you could fit a siege tank in here and still have room for squads of troops to maneuver to either side. The soft metallic clank of the floor grating under your feet echoes off the enormous walls, and gives the feeling of being trapped in a cavern.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8209}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8211}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8211}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor that you are standing in runs north and south. You can see that the massive hallways turn to the west in both directions. Strangely you can not hear the sounds of battle from here, there is a kind of eerie calmness broken only by the clanking of floor grating as you walk past. There is a calming warmth radiating from the walls.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8210}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8212}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8212}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This corridor runs west and south here and it must be a full twenty-five paces wide here. It looks like the SCVs have been actively repairing the walls and sections of the floor grating in this section. As you begin to move deeper into the space station you begin to have second thoughts about continuing with this course of action.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8211}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8213}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8213}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (w,e,door)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs east and west here. There is a door to the south. The walls are splattered with blood and remains. The north wall is in very bad shape. There must have been a fire fight here, by the looks of it the opposing force came from just the other side of that door. You almost fall on your face as you slip on a pile of blood and guts that has not been cleaned up yet.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8212}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8214}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8214}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The space station corridor runs north and east here. You can see that the northern corridor has an off shoot to the west, but still continues in a northerly direction. The SCVs seem to have taken care of most of the initial damage done during the retaking of the station. The few scorch marks that remain here seem to be quite recent.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8213}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8215}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8215}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (n,s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs north, south, and west here. It looks like the SCVs have been quite busy here. As you move deeper into the station the enormity of it becomes overwhelming and you begin to ask yourself again, 'Why am I here?'  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8214}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8216}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
