R {8216}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs east and west here. It looks like the SCVs have finished repairing this area. When you look at the freshly painted walls, bulkheads, and grating you almost feel safe here.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8215}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8217}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8217}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor runs north and east here, and looks brand new. The freshly painted surfaces of the corridor and the comfortable warmth radiating from the walls almost makes you forget that you are in the middle of a power stuggle between extremely powerful forces.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8216}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8218}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8218}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{By the look of it, the SCVs are almost done repairing this section of the space station. You marvel at the fact that such an enormous space could feel so warm this deep into outer space. The warmth seems to be radiating from within the walls of the corridor, there must be heating coils of some sort.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8217}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8219}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8219}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (n,s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs north, east, and south here. The corridor turns to the west futher north, and you hear strange sounds to the east. The SCVs must not have made it this far, the walls and bulkheads here are covered with scorch marks and holes.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
