R {8220}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (w,e,door)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs east and west here. There is a door to the south, and a sign on the wall here. There are strange noises coming from beyond the door.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8219}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8221}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
