R {8221}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This corridor runs south and west. There are some strange noises coming from the west. You realize that the reason why the condition of the corridors improves as you go deeper into the station, would be because it is nescesary to strengthen the barriers between us and the enemies that surely must be on the other side.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8220}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8222}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8222}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{It looks like the SCVs have been actively repairing the walls in this section of the space station corridor recently. The corridor runs north and south here and must be a full twenty-five paces wide here. You begin to imagine what it would be like to fly an Interceptor up and down the corridors of this enourmous facility.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8221}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8215}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8223}{0}{<238>}{A large storage compartment (door)}{<238>[<128>Z<238>]<088>}{You are standing in a large storage compartment that seems to have been converted into a make-shift prison cell. It is awfully smelly in here. The space is twenty-five paces square.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{zerglings}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8220}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8220}{door}{door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8224}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (s,w,door)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station runs south and to the west, where it looks to be a dead end. There is an enormous door to the north. The inhuman noises that vibrate through the door make you seriously reconsider any previous thoughts of finding out what might be on the other side.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8219}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8225}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8225}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (w,e,door)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a long corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs east and west here. This station is enormous, you could fly a dropship up and down the corridors. By the look of it, there has been a battle here recently, maybe you shouldn't be here. Steam shoots up though the floor grates, making you that much more uncomfortable about being here.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{firebat_e}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8224}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8226}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8226}{0}{<268>}{A space station corridor (e,door)}{<268>[<118>F<268>]<088>}{You are standing at the end of a corridor on the Starcraft Expansion space station. The corridor runs east from here. Even in the enormity of this place, you begin to feel like a trapped rat on a sinking ship. There is a door to the north.  }{Starcraft:Broodwar}{firebat}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8225}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8227}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (n,w,e)}{ }{   These are the lush, green pastures of the vibrant town of Springfield, in...some American state.  The high sky paints a  brilliant backdrop for the mangy crows that soar above, while the aroma in the air is that of feces and mold...and wonderful rotting fungus.  A street sign nearby informs you that this is Evergreen Terrace, the backbone of this community.  Your breast is filled with spirit anew as you prepare to venture through this marvelous wonderland!  }{Simpsons Expansion}{simpsons2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50823}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8290}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50815}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8228}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (w,e)}{ }{   You are adventuring on the east-west expanse of road known officially, and affectionately as Evergreen Terrace.  Among the many quaint houses which line the pavement along this road, an interesting, almost pastel-colored home to the northwest invites you into its warm hearth.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50823}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50822}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8229}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (s,w,e)}{ }{   Evergreen Terrace continues east/west, while a tangent road leads off to the south, where you can see a large complex of buildings and structures.  The litter beneath you is fresh and varied, the true mark of an elite city!  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50822}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50817}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50826}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8230}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (w,e)}{ }{   The stench in the air begins to fade in the easterly direction, although your nostrils burn still from even the modest stench of lovely waste.  Springfield brings new meaning to the term 'Nuclear family'. This area seems more ripe with giggling children, there must be a school or a crematorium nearby.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50817}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50816}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8231}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (n,s,w,e)}{ }{   To the north, the bustling Springfield Elementary School engulfs little minds and spits out little geniuses like watermelon seeds. To the south is the elegant yard of a church!  Is there no end to the bliss to be found in this town?  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50816}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8232}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8241}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8242}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8232}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (n,w,e)}{ }{   The school building to the north reminds you of your youth, when you either spent your days studying in grade school or went off to train in adventuring school, depending on how thick your personal line between fantasy and reality is drawn.  The church across the street is spartan, eschewing the traditional stained glass windows in favor of more classic and functional clear windows.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8231}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50818}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8240}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8233}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (w,e)}{ }{   Judging by the almost total lack of habitation in this end of town, you surmise that you are nearing the Springfield City limits. Good thing too...this town, where once a beautiful and pastoral suburban setting, is now a run-down prune pit of a community.  }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50818}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50819}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8234}{0}{}{Evergreen Terrace (se,n,w)}{ }{   The once-beloved Evergreen Terrace, with its chipped asphalt and utterly charming piles of dog poo and various human refuse, ends here. There lies a convenient store of some sort to the north, perhaps the last outgrowth of this dwindling, pathetic city.  }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50819}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8235}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8239}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8235}{0}{}{The Kwik-E-Mart Parking Lot (s,enter)}{<168>E<088>}{The decrepit old Kwik-E-Mart rests to the north as if it had plopped down from the heavens in an act of goodwill by some cheap Lord.  The parking lot you stand in now is barren, the yellow lines of demarcation USELESS and worn.  This black wasteland of a lot is a sad reminder of the grim profits involved in the Kwik-E-Mart industry.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8234}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8236}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8236}{ne}{enter}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8236}{0}{}{The Kwik-E-Mart (out)}{ }{   The Kwik-E-Mart is a treasure trove of convenient foodstuffs!    There is a large plastic menu above the counter, which you could    look at (NOT read) if you were hungry at all and wished to acquire    some handy and portable sustenance!  Why, how convenient!  Not to    mention Kwik!  In the back of the store is a large freezer case.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8237}{open freezer}{open freezer}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8235}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8235}{sw}{out}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8237}{0}{}{A Hidden Stairway Behind the Non-Alcoholic Beer  (u,out)}{ }{Icy walls line this barren stone stairway hidden conveniently behind the non-alcoholic beer refrigerator.  The steps lead up to the north, towards a dark wooden door outlined with sunlight obviously leading to either the roof or an artificial-light generating trout hatchery.  Most likely the hatchery.  Behind you is the rear of the non-alki beer facade.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8236}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8238}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8238}{0}{}{Apu's Garden in the Shade (door)}{ }{You are engulfed in heavenly shade from a nearby palm plant,  momentarily hindering your take of where you stand...but you soon adjust your pupils by force and stand, jaw agape, at the beautiful and surprising sight!  The roof of the Kwik-E-Mart has been  transformed into a magnificent garden!  Hedges and shrubs fill the place with masses of green, while lovely pink blossoms from small potted saplings cast speckles of pastel color across the lush scape. Buried under a mass of vines is a wooden door set into a partial incline in the roof which leads back down into the interior of the Kwik-E-Mart.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{paul2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8237}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8237}{door}{door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8239}{0}{}{Herman's Military Antiques (nw)}{ }{Dust covers most of the shelves and their contents here.  This appears to be the kind of shop where the owner takes offence at someone actually buying his goods, preferring to hoard them for himself.  Military antiques are littered around the room, with some of the owner's more prized possessions kept in the counter against the back wall. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8234}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8240}{0}{}{Springfield Elementary Dropoff (s,w,enter)}{<168>E<088>}{   The entrance to the huge Springfield Elementary School building is wide and inviting to the north.  Kids reluctantly file in, accepting their fate of increased knowledge and life experience. A yellow schoolbus is parked here, depositing all the poor little morons at this place of lower learning.  The driveway curves back out to Evergreen Terrace to the south.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8232}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8241}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8246}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8246}{n}{enter}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8241}{0}{}{Springfield Elementary Dropoff (s,e)}{ }{   A circular driveway passes in front of the school building, allowing for the bus to drop off the students without having to worry about commuters screaming and cursing from their cars about how 'the bus is taking up the whole damn road, why not get a farking driveway...' the Board of Education funded this with no problem.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8240}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8231}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8242}{0}{}{Yard of the Church (n,enter)}{<168>E<088>}{This neatly tailored little courtyard is overflowing with grass  green as the zero on a roulette table.  The main doors to the church  are open to the public (however unwisely) to the east, inviting all who be pious and fearful to pray with others of their faith.  Or just to mooch free food and steal from the donation plate.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8231}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8243}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8243}{e}{enter}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8243}{0}{}{The Springfield Church (e,out)}{<168>O<088>}{The interior of this church is fairly bland - pretty much what you'd expect from a suburban religious establishment, only slightly less.  The plaster ceiling is fairly high, and the pews which line the floor in rows are wooden.  Well, wooden-colored plastic anyway. Large wooden doors lead outside to the west.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8244}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8242}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8242}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8244}{0}{}{Approaching the Altar (e,w)}{<138>N<088>}{The altar of the church is near to the east, and the pews here are occupied with the more elderly churchgoers who are hard of hearing. The grand sounds of an organ whistling a hymn bring to your heart hope that you will one day find your way out of this town.  As you glance further, you notice a confession booth to the south of you.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{ned}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8243}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8245}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50820}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8245}{0}{}{The Altar of the Spider Queen (just kidding) (w)}{ }{The awkwardness that pervades you as you stand upon this moderately sacred ground is furthered by the piercing gazes of the churchgoers who have no idea what is going on and why someone so unlike them in dress and appearance is on their altar...the altar they have sat  before since they were children.  Do you dare shed blood on this hallowed place?  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8244}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8246}{0}{}{Main Lobby of Springfield Elementary (n,w,e,out)}{<168>O<088>}{This main lobby is actually very impressive...it has walls and everything.  Halls lead off in three directions: north seems to lead out to the schoolyard, while east and west leads to the classrooms.  The exit out of this hellish nightmare of a flashback is behind you.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8247}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8249}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8253}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8240}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8240}{s}{out}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8247}{0}{}{West Hall of Springfield Elementary (n,w,e)}{ }{The hall extends towards the west to the other classrooms. All of the rooms around here look very uninteresting, except for one directly to the north of you, from which you hear the sounds of stupidity mixed with the sounds of intelligence.  Perhaps this is where the players of 3K realize their inferiority by being taught manners by the intelligent 3K wizards!  Or maybe not...  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8246}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8248}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8252}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8248}{0}{}{West Corner of Springfield Elementary (n,e)}{ }{This is the west end of the Main hall.  There is a classroom to the north here which seems to be filled with some of the older students at Springfield Elementary.  This place is beginning to smell funny; you sneeze as thick clouds of asbestos infiltrate your lungs.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8247}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8251}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8249}{0}{}{East Hall of Springfield Elementary (n,w)}{ }{This east end of the hallway has only one doorway to the north. You don't have esp (although maybe it's one of your guild powers) but you can surmise what lies beyond that door.  The thought of it sends absolute shockwaves down your spinal cord...actually kind of a rush... }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8246}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8250}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8250}{0}{}{Principal Skinner's Office...DOH! (s)}{ }{The stench is of coffee.  Before you, a desk belonging to the foulest of all foul school administrators...the principal... sits in a mocking pose, its neat and tidy surface creating blistering tensions and emotions within you.  A burgundy leather swivel chair is the cockpit from which the principal carries on his operation, its plastic wheels turning effortlessly upon a clear plastic mat whose purpose is to facilitate such things.  Various framed certificates dot the off-white walls, and a furled American flag in the corner pays silent homage to the poor children misfortuned enough to have passed through here at one time in their lives.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8249}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8251}{0}{}{A Classroom (s)}{ }{This classroom brings back some pretty unholy memories.  There is a large blackboard at the front of the room, while a bunch of students sit at their desks, writing, drawing, disrobing, vandalizing, spitting, passing notes, eating, sleeping, creating mildly destructive nuclear devices...your everyday classroom.  Sigh...so many memories... }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8248}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8252}{0}{}{A Classroom (s)}{ }{A classroom, almost identical to all the other ones, except inasmuch as this one is fully coded whereas the others are not.  The kids seem to be in the middle of taking a test.  Some, you can tell, are doing well.  Others are going to the bathroom in their pants.  There is a desk at the front of the room from which the teacher commands her little math slaves, and behind that a blackboard broadcasts today's learning news to the children.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8247}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8253}{0}{}{North Hallway of Springfield Elementary (d,s,out)}{<168>O<088>}{A set of double doors leads out to the hallowed schoolyard to the north, while the hall leads south to the main lobby.  A nearby staircase leads down to a place from which some fairly raunchy odors are wafting.  There is a large sign taped to the wall here that appears to have been written in crayon by a youngster.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8246}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8254}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8255}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8255}{n}{out}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8254}{0}{}{The Lunchroom (u)}{ }{   You feel ready to pass out as the stench of cafeteria gruel infiltrates your nostrils!  Numerous rows of tables dot the expanses of the cafeteria, each table with four or five dead children slumped over it, victims of the cuisine being served here.  A nearby staircase leads up to the (reasonably) better-smelling ground level.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8253}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8255}{0}{}{The Springfield Elementary Playground (n,s,w,e)}{ }{Before you lies the great expanse of land known as the Springfield Playground.  All sorts of paraphernalia are here such as sandboxes, teeter-totters, swings; kids everywhere are having fun!  However, as you glance to the west, you discern the evidence that bullies run that part of the yard.  Perhaps best to avoid it, li'l newbie.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{willie}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8253}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8256}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8257}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8259}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8256}{0}{}{Uter's Corner (w)}{ }{A multitude of very colorful candied bar wrappers have been tossed on the ground here by some disrespectful Austrian foreign exchange student. The aroma of melted caramel and cotton candy causes you to forget about such petty crimes, the sweet sweet fumes making your complexion bubble and pop.  Your footwear sticks to the ground like a Saturday double-feature.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8255}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8257}{0}{}{Uh... Yer Approaching Nelson's Turf...  (n,w,e)}{ }{The vandalism in this area, along with the conspicuous lack of the frolicking, jocund youngsters present in other parts of the playground, leads you to the conclusion that these parts aren't exactly the friendliest of parts.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8255}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8258}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8266}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8258}{0}{}{Nelson's Turf (e)}{ }{This is Nelson's turf!  You can tell because spray-painted on the wall in orange are the words 'Nelson's Turf'.  This corner is the veritable Hell for the good, innocent children of Springfield Elementary.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8257}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8259}{0}{}{The Center Bit of the Schoolyard (n,s,w,e)}{ }{This appears to be the most popular part of the whole yard...  all sorts come together in peace, harmony and fun to wile away their precious recess time here.  The school building to the south is but a memory as you glide on this cloud of nostalgia.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8255}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8260}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8266}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8262}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8260}{0}{}{The East Bit of the Schoolyard (n,w)}{ }{This eastern edge of the schoolyard is a magnificent scene indeed.  Bird poop dots the ground like a toned-down Jackson Pollack painting.  You notice a particular square inch of asphalt beneath you that hints upon spiritual enlightenment.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8259}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8261}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8261}{0}{}{The Springfield Elementary Schoolyard (s,w)}{ }{The wind in this desolate area of the schoolyard is brisk, and along with this chill comes a bleak isolation, a very cold loneliness which echoes throughout your empty soul.  Only the most outcast and unknown of all students spend their recess here.  The wire fence which surrounds the entire schoolyard is within your reach, and you feel the urge to escape this solitude.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8260}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8262}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8250}{climb fence}{climb fence}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8262}{0}{}{The Springfield Elementary Schoolyard (s,w,e)}{ }{This area of the schoolyard is merely flat black asphalt.  No swings, teeter-totters, no nothing.  Just a big flat open area ripe for skinning toddlers' knees as they fall to the ground, the victims of yet another schoolyard lunch money heist.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8261}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8263}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8259}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8263}{0}{}{The Springfield Elementary Schoolyard (w,e,s)}{ }{This northern part of the playground is where all of the no-names of Springfield Elementary sulk in their solitary, superficial paradise. The cooler kids and those involved in gangs and/or cliques all hang out together in the southern areas of the yard.  A cruel and harsh reality...segregation of those youths who have not yet convinced their parents to buy them the Radioactive Man action figure.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8262}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8264}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8266}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8264}{0}{}{The Springfield Elementary Schoolyard (s,e)}{ }{This is the northwest corner of the Springfield Elementary schoolyard. You are set aglow with nostalgia as you gaze upon these animated pastures.  Broken glass, rotting food and empty spray cans only add to the wealth of charm this wondrous place has to offer.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8263}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8265}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8265}{0}{}{The West Bit of the Schoolyard (e,n)}{ }{This is the western bit of the schoolyard.  The school building a ways to the south is the hard reminder that the bell shall soon toll...meaning recess is over.  You feel very fortunate to not be in elementary school right now!  Heh, you can stay out here as long as you dang well please.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8264}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8266}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8266}{0}{}{The Center Bit of the Schoolyard (w,e,s,n)}{ }{ As you meander through the schoolyard, a sense of youth pervades your soul; you begin to feel young again!  All of the varied aspects of childhood are represented here in this hodge-podge of humanity, this melting pot of the young in which they are seasoned and boiled. A quick glance to the south detects the spoor of the more evil of the schoolchildren, the bullies of Springfield Elementary.  All other directions lead to more peaceful habitats.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8265}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8257}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
