R {8267}{0}{}{Pinetree Road (n,s,w)}{ }{Pinetree Road is a fairly barren stretch of pavement branching off from Evergreen Terrace to the south.  Its destination, not too far in the distance, appears to be a building complex of some sort.  The air in this area is fetid with the stench of greed... one could actually smell such esoteric things.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50826}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50827}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8284}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8268}{0}{}{Pinetree Road (n,s)}{ }{Immediately to the south are the gates to the one and only Springfield Studios!  This is the place where stars are born and legends are made and cartoons are drawn and floors are swept and people are paid money to do various things!  Is there anything more mind-numblingly fantastic?!  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50827}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8269}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8269}{0}{}{The Springfield Studios Gatepost (n,s)}{<238>G<088>}{   In wise anticipation of the hordes of writhing fans and insane mental asylum-type people who would flood the stars, this gatepost  is set up to prevent such undesirables from infiltrating the grounds any further.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8268}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8270}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8270}{0}{}{The Main Promenade of Springfield Studios (n,s,w,e)}{ }{   This place is literally swarming with makeup people, camera people, technical people, all sorts of stage help people, people, people who love people...you are flanked on both sides by large hangar-resembling studio structures, inside each of which a little  piece of television and movie history is being recorded into the annals in which such history is kept, so to speak.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8269}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8271}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8272}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8274}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8271}{0}{}{The Set of the 10 o'Clock News (e)}{ }{   A bright light shines down upon a newsdesk in this set... a large blue sign behind it says '10 o'clock News with Kent Brockman'.  Makeup people and various technical crew members scurry about, ducking underneath camera lenses to avoid being embarrassed in front of millions of people.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8270}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8272}{0}{}{In the Audience of the Krusty the Clown Show! (e,w)}{ }{   You are shoved in every direction from the giant masses of screaming, veritably moshing children that are wild on sugar highs that would kill most 50 year olds.  The stage is to the east, and the exit out of this very LOUD place is west.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8270}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8273}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8273}{0}{}{On Stage With Krusty! (w)}{ }{   You blush as you realize million of children across the United States and even the world are watching your every move! You are blinded by lights which come from every direction, and the noise from the audience is deafening you!  The backdrop is a large red curtain from which Krusty would come running out of at the beginning of each episode.  There is also a television set on stage playing a cartoon for the audience to see!    }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8272}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44641}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8274}{0}{}{End of the Promenade (sw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{   The promenade ends here...you are surrounded by studio houses inside of each something completely different is being filmed!   You can truly feel 'movie magic' in the air here!  Or that could just be the industrial pollution this place is emitting.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8270}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
