E {8279}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8275}{0}{}{A Very Small Studio (s,w)}{ }{   Posters of the Simpsons and various other items such as Simpsons mugs, Simpsons pencil holders and Simpsons desk lamps decorate this miniscule studio.  A Simpsons animator's board sits in front of a little stool.  On top of the desk are various strange-looking tools also ostensibly used for animation.  If this is how cartoons are actually produced, it is rather sad.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8274}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8276}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8276}{0}{}{A Padded Room (n)}{ }{   Huge pink pads cover the floors, walls and ceiling of this room, and you just DON'T care for a room without windows.  It smells faintly British in this strange room.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8275}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8277}{0}{}{A Strange Studio (e)}{ }{   Este dormitorio es llano.  Las paredas son blancos y no es un cama parele inco'modo.  There is a crucifix on the wall over the bed. What a strange studio, you wonder how this show ever became the hit  that it apparently is.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8274}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44642}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8278}{0}{}{Inside A Huge Studio (sw,n)}{ }{   This place, in contrast with the others here at Springfield Studios, is gigantic and wildly impressive!  Explosions and gunshots can be heard echoing randomly about the walls...sets resembling steamy jungle scenes and terrorist camps abound!  Whatever is being filmed here is high budget!  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8274}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8280}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8279}{0}{}{A Crappy Studio (ne)}{ }{   This studio is kinda run down...it appears that some of the equipment and furniture used here is still from the 60's and 70's!  Perhaps this place carries with it a lot of tradition, although more likely it carries a lot of diseases.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8274}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8280}{0}{}{Among The Crew (ne,s,e)}{ }{   You are now on the other side of an action/adventure flick!  The director's chair is here, beside the catering table. Lights are shining everywhere, cameras and all sorts of equipment are buzzing and whirring away, burning electricity!  It is all very exciting...  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8278}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8281}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
