R {8281}{0}{}{The Off-Set Waiting Area (n,e)}{<178>A<088>}{   This part of the studio is simply a small lounge where the actors/actresses wait while the crew is preparing to set up another take or scene.  Usually an actor will spend 95% of his/her time waiting around, why not make him/her comfortable as can be while he/she gets paid hundreds of dollars per hour.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8280}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8282}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8282}{0}{}{The Set of a Love Scene (n,w)}{ }{   The heart-shaped bed is the centerpiece of this alluring set.  The walls are draped with satiny curtains, and a mirror on the ceiling serves dubious purposes.  Soft music plays to help the actors get into the mood...of the scene.  Marvin Gaye!  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8281}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8283}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8283}{0}{}{On The Set (s,w)}{ }{   This looks like the set of a love scene...there are mirrors in various places, all placed strategically so that the viewer can't see the camera in them.  There is a bed to the south, shaped like a heart, and the crewmembers are busy to the west.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8282}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8280}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8284}{0}{}{On the porch of the retirement home (e,w)}{ }{    Two large chairs grace either side of an arched doorway in the Springfield Retirement Castle.  The floorboards are made from polished wood, now showing scratches and scuff marks from the old folks' wheelchairs and walking frames.  A large sign has been posted just outside the entrance. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8267}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8285}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8285}{0}{}{Springfield Retirement Castle (s,e)}{ }{    There is an oppressive atmosphere to this building.  Many of the old folks who are forced to live here obviously do it because they lack anywhere else to stay; they don't appear happy about it.  The walls are painted a hospital-shade of green, over which there are occasional patches trimmed with fake wood paneling. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8284}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8286}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8286}{0}{}{Springfield Retirement Castle (e,w,s,n)}{ }{    Rooms branch off the hallway here, leading into the private rooms for the citizens.  Whoever designed this hallway obviously attempted to pick the most sedate, boring colour scheme imaginable, soft browns dominate.  There are three private rooms visible from here, to the east, west and south. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8285}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8287}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
