R {8298}{0}{}{Upstairs Hallway of the Simpson House (s,w,e,stairs)}{ }{Stairs lead down to the main floor from this upstairs hallway. There are bedrooms to the west and south, and the hallway continues east.  A dim fluorescent light overhead casts your shadow against the pastel-pink wall.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
