R {8299}{0}{}{The Upstairs Hall (s,w)}{ }{The end of the world is near!!  Well, the end of the hallway, anyway. To the south is what you assume to be the parents' bedroom, judging from the abundance of crumbs on the floor that lead directly into the room.  The stairs to the main floor are way back west, shouldst thou wish to returneth.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8298}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
