R {8300}{0}{}{Marge and Homer's Bedroom (n,w)}{ }{You feel all icky just standing in the room where Homer sometimes exists naked... *shiver* to think that he lays himself down upon the bed not 3 feet away from your touch... may the Lord strike down he who might touch Homer's naked germs before they take hold of his poor senses.  Actually it just smells like sweat.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8299}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8301}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8301}{0}{}{Maggie's Bedroom (n,e)}{ }{This room is painted all different pretty colors and has pictures of silly-looking cartoon characters and clowns to amuse little Maggie before her bedtime.  There is a crib in the middle of the room, filled with toys that would occupy a baby for hours, even as they might seem only tepidly droll to your adult senses.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
