R {8332}{0}{<248>}{Principal Skinner's Office...DOH! (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The stench is of coffee.  Before you, a desk belonging to the foulest of all foul school administrators...the principal... sits in a mocking pose, its neat and tidy surface creating blistering tensions and emotions within you.  A burgundy leather swivel chair is the cockpit from which the principal carries on his operation, its plastic wheels turning effortlessly upon a clear plastic mat whose purpose is to facilitate such things.  Various framed certificates dot the off-white walls, and a furled American flag in the corner pays silent homage to the poor children misfortuned enough to have passed through here at one time in their lives. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
