R {8380}{0}{}{The Simpsons' Garage (n,s)}{ }{   This grungy old garage is so encrusted with smut and soot, it actually looks like a dark stone cave!  You fear that each step might land you on a mousetrap or bottomless pit or 5 month old tuna sandwich.  A doorway that leads into the house lies to the north while the huge (and broken) garage door is eternally in the open position.  There is an almost unbelievable amount of garbage strewn about the place. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
