R {8393}{0}{<268>}{Inside Burns Manor (e,u,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{    The entrance hall of Burns Manor is a massive room, lit by a large chandelier that hangs from the ceiling.  Two large statues flank either side of a wide staircase that leads up to the second floor.  A large persian rug has been placed in the center of the marble floors.  Archways lead off from here to other parts of the mansion. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
