R {8394}{0}{<248>}{Living room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{    This is Mr. Burns' living room, a massive space filled with all the comforts he could ask for.  Soft lounges, comfortable reading chairs, a massive TV and shelves of books are all scattered around the room.  There is a large fireplace next to one of the chairs, complete with a roaring fire.  A large set of armour stands in one corner. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
