R {8395}{0}{<248>}{Dining room (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{    A massive wooden table stretches over thirty feet across the dining room.  Two chairs, one positioned at each end, demonstrate that Mr. Burns is not one for visitors.  Several animal trophies have been hung on the walls, and there is a large fire dancing in the fireplace. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
