R {8396}{0}{}{Outside Mr. Burns' room (w,d)}{ }{    A massive marble staircase descends from here, its banisters gleaming from the light of a chandelier.  The floor is covered in thick red carpet, while the walls hold a number of framed paintings.  There is a large wooden door to the west. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
