R {8397}{0}{<278>}{Springfield Avenue (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{   Springfield Avenue leads directly to the Springfield Nuclear Power Plant.  In the real world, and even more esoterically, the entire town leads to the plant.  The prosperity and wealth of its people depends on the plant.  If the reactor goes down, the people of Springfield go down with it.  Figuratively of course.  This is all figurative you realize. Good. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
