R {8398}{0}{<238>}{The Springfield Nuclear Power Plant Parking Lot (e,enter)}{<238>|||<088>}{The Springfield Nuclear Power Plant casts an immense shadow over both you and the entire parking lot you stand in.  The  absolutely momumental twin reactor housings tower above the rest of the world like gigantic bombs, waiting to annihilate the universe. Directly in front of you, the grey monolith of the control building invites both workers and visitors alike to tour its halls in naivete, unknowing and oblivious to the vast crime on the environment and on humanity that this entire compound commits.  Very few windows allow the sacriligious solar energy to infiltrate their synthetic world of radioactivity, but a revolving door allows you the opportunity to observe the power for yourself. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
