R {8399}{0}{<248>}{The Springfield Police Station (s,w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Police officers scuttle back and forth in the distance, fetching their coffee as the subtle sounds of Muzak gently ease your brain into submission.  This is the Springfield Police Station, where crimes are solved over long periods of time and coffee is spilled over important documents.  There is a set of chairs here for waiting to report the crime done unto you, and a desk in front of you is where all the serious work gets ignored.  A revolving door leads outside to the west, and a doorway with a sign that reads 'Authorized personnel only' leads south. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8389}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
