R {8400}{0}{<248>}{Chief Wiggum's Office (enter,n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This office is the workplace of one Police Chief Wiggum, the pride of all Springfield.  It is at this desk that some of Springfield's most unsolvable crimes remain unsolved.  Papers are everywhere, most of which have coffee stains all over them.  There is a temporary holding cell to the south where criminals may meet with their lawyers under Wiggum's supervision of course. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
