R {8402}{0}{<268>}{The Springfield Nuclear Power Plant (w,n,s,out)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Even in this age of technology, the concurrence of nuclear power and worldwide corruption is conspicuous.  Towering metal walls, sterile and clean in their arcs above you, confine this main lobby area hugely.  There is one main hallway which leads off north and south from this point, and a workroom directly to the west of where you stand.  Banners and various other pieces of propaganda attempt to quell the notion that atomic power is at all...dangerous.  One very prominent in-house advertisement hanging above your head states 'Nuclear Energy and you: Perfect Together'. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
