R {8403}{0}{<248>}{Carl and Lenny's Workroom (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{   The console is full of all sorts of buttons and lights and whatnot!  It is all sparkly and pretty and bright, and the neato nifty keen buttons and levers and dials and switches... really makes you want to instigate a nuclear disaster. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8402}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8404}{0}{<268>}{South Hallway of the Nuclear Power Plant (w,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{   The carefully-engineered sounds of MUZAK waft sweetly across the idle walls in this spartan hall.  The massive lobby is visible to the north, from where you can hear the echoing footsteps of a human being in the process of walking.  There is a workroom to the west that appears to be emitting lots of beeps and whirrs. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
