R {8407}{0}{<268>}{A Narrow Hallway (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{   As you walk through this hallway, you get the feeling that this part of the reactor isn't exactly meant for casual touring. It does not seem as frequented as the other areas, and there is a sign on the wall which says 'This Area Not For Casual Touring' which heightens this intuition somewhat. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
