R {8408}{0}{<268>}{A Restricted Area (s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{   Now you realize that this is a place in which you TRULY do not belong...red and white striped bands line the room in obvious warning, and a sign attached to the wall beside you demands attention.  Notice that the sign shows up even if you are lazy and are exploring in brief mode.  I am TOO nice. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
