R {8409}{0}{<268>}{**A Restricted Area** (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{   This room is tiny...the steel walls seem rough, as if they have been dented, scraped and marred and then been made to look as if they had endured no such weathering.  You can even discern a faint patch of blood on the floor which could not be totally cleaned.  A square metal tunnel leads through the south wall, and the dire stench of death seems less upon you to the north. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8408}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
