R {8410}{0}{<278>}{**A Restricted Area** (u,n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{   Spikes jut out from the wall, preventing you from leaning up against them for any reason.  The floor is a slick blue metal alloy, creating a bind...if you slip you had better not fall into the wall.  In general, the appearance of this room reinforces the idea of 'restricted'.  A metal lattice stairway leads up to another area which you might guess is quite restricted as well. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8409}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
