R {8411}{0}{}{**A VERY Restricted Area** (n,d)}{ }{   Torn bits of human flesh are scattered about the floor here, making this room resemble a slaughterhouse.  Caked innards lend much ambience to the walls and ceiling, and slimy brown marrow and busted bone parts crackle underfoot.  A metal lattice staircase leads down to the first level, and a hand-shaped archway is set into the north flesh-colored wall. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
