R {8412}{0}{}{**A VERY Restricted AREA** (n,s)}{ }{   Ghostly gray tapestries line the interior of this square chamber.  A sickly chill numbs your knees as the howling of distant spirits bewitches you utterly.  A mistlike curtain to the north conceals what lies beyond, and a hand-shaped archway leads south. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
