R {8413}{0}{}{**A VERY Restricted Monkey Area** (vine,s)}{ }{   This room -- decorated strangely and completely with leaves, vines and other such junglish accoutrements -- smells like monkey poo.  Sounds from the wild kingdom echo far in the distance as you step in a pile of chimp chechre.  A thick vine leads up into a hole in the ceiling, while a mistlike curtain provides an exit south. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
