R {8414}{0}{}{**An UNBELIEVABLY Restricted Area** (s,d)}{ }{   The walls are covered in sweet, SWEEEET honey!  It drips from the ceiling, slips and slides down the walls...your salivary glands swell at the sight and aroma of all this sweet, natural sugar.  You wonder where all this honey came from!  A hole in the floor leads down to a vine, and a veritable waterfall of honey piques your curiosity as to what lies beyond it. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
