R {8415}{0}{}{**An UNBELIEVABLY Restricted Area** (s,n)}{ }{   This room is painted completely red!  On top of the red facade has been painted numerous yellow lightning bolts... is this just a motif representing the energy generated by the reactor core of the power plant?  Or does it signify something else... something more...fictional?  A lightning bolt-shaped doorway leads to the south. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
