R {8416}{0}{}{**A MONUMENTALLY Restricted Area** (u,n)}{ }{   This room, in stark raving contrast with its predecessors, is elegant and Victorian.  Finely crafted furniture with plush surfaces and polished burgundy woods rest atop a marvelous parquet floor.  A suit of armour provides period decoration, whilst a chandelier beset with heart-faceted Austrian crystals and Brazilian sapphire dust illuminates the room with posh brilliance.  A very stately hand-carved circular staircase leads up to somewhere special. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8415}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8417}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8417}{0}{}{The Private Office of Mr. Burns (d)}{ }{   The evil in the air is monumental here.  You feel the goodness of every man, woman and child who has ever walked this earth, and you feel it evaporate within these walls.  The ceiling, a full 30 feet above your head, is painted a dark red hue, and the walls, lined with extremely valuable birch panels, surrounds a room the size of football field.  You can feel your heartbeat echo endlessly through the expanses of this monumental office, at the head of which is but a simple desk, behind which rests a simple leather chair. A giant stuffed polar bear looks over the proceedings, its claws outstretched and its jaw open, fangs bared, ready to feast upon the dead. A huge picture window overlooks the power plant, and the dark pall of black smoke which wafts from the reactor housing's heights enforces its stranglehold on the defenseless community of Springfield as you stand with awe at this occasion. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8416}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8418}{push button}{push button}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {8418}{0}{}{Within the Reactor Core Housing}{ }{   The temperature is unbearable as you are bathed with the green fumes of radioactive decay.  You stand within an immense cement tower set eerily aglow from the green sparks that leap about before you. You stand on a metal grate that shakes slightly beneath your feet, both from the tremors coming from the machinery and from the fear you hold that this is the most dangerous situation you have ever had nightmare enough in which to be caught. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
