R {8429}{0}{}{Lisa's Bedroom (n)}{ }{This very attractive, neatly organized room overlooks Evergreen Terrace.  Not exactly the Appalachians after a snowstorm, but a view if nothing else.  This room is sparsely decorated... Lisa doesn't seem to have very many hobbies.  She plays the saxophone, but she wouldn't go putting up pictures of a saxophone on her wall, her friends would think her weird or something... weirder even. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
