R {9012}{0}{}{In a small tent (s,e)}{ }{As you enter the tent you're attention is drawn to the potent odour of rotting animal carcasses left on the ground. You soon realise you are in the middle of the feeding hall for the camp. Long tables are asymmetrically positioned with beer mugs and food scraps scattered all over them. Travelling east will return you to the armoury tent and the southern exit leaves the tent heading down a rocky path. }{Longshadow Camp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
