R {10350}{0}{}{Inside a Crippled Spaceship (n)}{}{It's unnervingly quiet.  Through a porthole you can see the planet below spinning slowly away from you.  Broken cabling hangs from the ceiling.  A panel on the wall flashes the same symbol over and over, a bright red that can only mean EMERGENCY.  Part of the hull is gone and were it not for the force shield covering it you would surely be blown out to space.  You can feel a faint breeze but you cannot determine the source.   }{Kayos Wars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
