R {10357}{0}{}{Hills (s,e)}{<188>B<088>}{You are caught inside a bubble in the maelstrom of time and space.  Purple and pink whorls of temporal energy explode all around you.  A faint shimmer is all that protects you from eternal oblivion.  You can exit the void tunnel either back to the general safety of the world you know, or you can dive ahead into dimensions unknown. }{Kayos Wars}{beacon}{}{}{1.000}{1}
