R {10358}{0}{<278>}{The Vigilant: HQ (sw,w,e)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{You've stepped through a dimensional rift of some kind.  What looked to be nondescript from the outside is actually a giant spaceship of some kind.  Purple lighting reflects off shiny chrome surfaces, causing glare everywhere you look.  Women and men in long flowing purple robes rush hither and yon, occasionally disappearing through what seemed to be a solid wall.  A small force bubble keeps you relatively confined within this space and the hallway to the east. }{Kayos Wars}{vigilant}{}{}{1.000}{1}
