R {10359}{0}{<278>}{The Vigilant: Situation Room (e)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{A spotless metal oval table dominates this austere room.  Purple lights racing along the chrome walls are reflected along the table's shiny surface, and back again along the length of the walls.  It is eerily silent in here, and you assume something must be deliberately muffling the sound from the adjacent spaces. }{Kayos Wars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
