R {10360}{0}{<278>}{The Vigilant Quartermasters (w)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{You are standing inside a giant metallic sphere whose only obvious exit is back the way you came.  The walls appear perfectly sheen except for the purple lights tracing neural-network like patterns across its surface.  There are no visible consoles or seams - the level of technology or magic is vastly beyond your understanding.   }{Kayos Wars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
