R {10578}{0}{<248>}{At the base of a Crystal Stairway (u,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{   A breathtaking stairway made of intricately carved crystal rises towards the surface here. It glows with an inner light that refracts through the facets of crystal countless times, softly illuminating the room. The light barely brushes the vaulted ceiling, which is over fifty feet overhead. This room appears to be an immense greeting hall for a palace carved out of crystal. }{Crystal Tunnel}{crystal_tunnels}{}{}{1.000}{1}
