R {10579}{0}{<248>}{In a Crystal Chamber (se,sw,s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{This chamber is much smaller than the room with the staircase, seeming to be a security station to halt further access to the palace. The walls and floor and ceiling are all made out of the same glowing crystal as the grand entry chamber, but the facets are less intricate, somewhat lessening the glow in the room. A passageway, mostly clear of rubble leads southwest. A  tunnel, barely high enough to crawl through, lies to the southeast. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
