R {10580}{0}{<248>}{A crystal passage (s,ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This small passage is very plain, but the walls are made out of the same crystal as the rest of the palace. This corridor seems to have been a smaller accessway for servants. It somehow survived the destruction of the rest of the edifice, allowing access into the depths of the ruins. It seems structurally sound, but there are small piles of rubble lining the passage. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
