R {10581}{0}{<248>}{A crystal passage (sw,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This is the end of the corridor, the original shape of the area detroyed by fallen crystal. A small archway to the southwest allows access into the chamber beyond. The area around the arch has been narrowed, making it easy for one defender to hold off any enemies. This appears to be where the inhabitants of this place have set up their last stand. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
