E {10582}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {10582}{0}{<248>}{A small crystal chamber (ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{   Bands of fused crystal rise in arches here, forming a dome of stability that keeps an avalanche of crystal from falling. A small pedestal rises in the center of the room, also of fused crystal. This room seems to have been formed mainly by sheer force of magic, to keep the occupants safe from the devastation of the rest of the palace. A small archway leads out of the dome to the northeast. A crystalline lady is sitting here, gazing into the crystal pedestal. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {10581}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {10583}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (n,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{The passage here is narrow, barely allowing enough room to stand.  Bands of crystal support the ceiling, stabilizing the mass of crystal above. The ceiling is much lower than it used to be, showing signs of collapse. To the north and south, the passage widens considerably. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
