R {10584}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (n,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This part of the corridor seems almost completely whole, although bands of solid crystal support the ceiling and prevent any mishaps.  The corridor to the north is somewhat collapsed, the crystal supports barely allowing one to stand beneath them.  The corridor to the south is difficult to make out any details about, because the light refracting off the facets of crystal obscure anything definite that you might have made out. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
