R {10585}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (n,sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{   Large bands of crystal line the ceiling, mostly following what was once the natural ceiling. The sparkling corridor continues southwest and north, the light from the refracting crystal making it impossible to make out any details of what lies at either end.  The corridor in both directions seems mostly whole, although the southwest tunnel gives the feeling of more weight, as though it is leading deeper into the crystal cavern. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
