R {10586}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (s,ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{   Large bands of fused crystal line the ceiling, roughened from whatever cataclysm caused the destruction of much of the cavern.  The luminous corridor stretches south and northwest, the ends of corridor well beyond your field of vision.  The corridor is mostly safe, any further instability braced by softly glowing arches of crystal. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
