R {10587}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (n,se)}{<248>% %<088>}{   Large bands of solid crystal line the rough ceiling, preventing further damage to the corridor.  The passage continues southeast and north from this point, but any details of the distant parts of the corridor are completely eradicated by the intricate patterns of light cast by the differing intensities of light refracting off the facets of the crystal.  The corridor in both directions seems mostly whole, though the ubiquitous bands of stabilizing crystal continue to line the way. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
