R {10588}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (se,nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{   The crystal of the walls seems to be transparent, but the refracting facets and sheer thickness of the material makes them as opaque as steel, while retaining a translucent opalescent sheen.  The corridor isn't smooth and even, looking more like it was dug through the crystal after a massive earthquake that collapsed the original passageway. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
