R {10589}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (sw,nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{  This area looks like it was once the edge of a much larger space, but whatever cataclysmic force ruined the rest of the crystal caverns did not leave this area untouched, either.  This small section of the wreckage seems to have been saved from collapse by the structural integrity of the outer wall of the larger area, and by a few bands of crystal that support the ceiling against further collapse. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
