R {10590}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (se,ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This appears to have been the connection between two larger areas.  The ceiling and walls seem to be mostly intact in their original form, but the areas to the north and south have almost completely collapsed.  The only open area left in the devastation has been stabilized by arches, formed of crystal that looks like it was melted and then hardened into those forms. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
