R {10591}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (s,nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{   The wall to the northeast looks as though it were once a corridor, but a fall of crystal has completely blocked it off.  Other than that, this portion of the caves looks to be mostly intact, the crystal walls showing few signs of the cataclysm that rocked the rest of the city.  To the northwest, a passage leads to what seems to be a larger area, while the intact corridor leads south. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
