R {10592}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (sw,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{   In this small corner of the city, it would be very easy to forget about the destruction of the rest of the crystal caverns.  The ceiling and walls are completely intact, with no signs of the destruction of the other places in the city.  The small scale of the corridor was probably what saved it, the sturdy walls protecting it from collapse.  The corridor to the north is just as unremarkable as this, while to the southwest there seems to be an intersection. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
