R {10593}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (s,ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{   The northern part of this area is shored up by crystal arches, preventing further collapse.  A passage lies open to the northeast, but the north and northwestern areas are completely collapsed.  To the south, a fairly intact tunnel leads off, but you can't make out any details because the refracting crystal casts coruscating patterns on the walls, dazzling your eyes and obscuring anything that might be to the south. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
