R {10594}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This stretch of the corridor seems mostly stable, with only a few places where the crystal has chipped and been shaken loose.  The ceiling is approximately fifteen feet high, and the corridor is wide enough for five people to walk abreast.  The walls are highly faceted, intensifying the light into brilliant abstract patterns on the walls, weaving with the patterns of the faceting into a breathtaking spectacle of crystal that almost seems to flow across the walls. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
