R {10595}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This once was a major intersection, but whatever detroyed the city ravaged this section severely.  The passages that used to go east and south are completely blocked off by fallen crystal rubble, leaving only a large open passage to the north and a smaller, partially collapsed passage to the west, held stable by an arch of solid crystal. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
