R {10597}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (s,nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{   The eastern wall of the corridor is solid, and gives the impression of being very thick.  The western wall, however, seems to be held in place by the ubiquitous crystal arches, as though a massive cave-in happened on the other side of it.  The patterns of the facets in the crystal seem to be more utilitarian in this section, the less ornate crystal standing in clean, straight lines, except in the places distorted by the fallen crystal. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
