R {10598}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (nw,se)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This section of the corridor continues in the clean, straight, sweeping lines, instead of the intricate patterns of facets that you saw in other areas.  This portion of the cavern shows only a few signs of the devastation that you saw in other areas, but a few chips and pieces of rubble serve as a reminder of the terrible destruction this city has endured. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
