R {10611}{0}{<248>}{A crystal passage (ne,nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{   Large bands of crystal line the ceiling, mostly following what was once the natural ceiling. The corridor takes a sharp turn here, continuing northeast and northwest, the light from the refracting crystal making it impossible to see any details at this distance. The corridor to the northwest seems mostly whole, though the ubiquitous bands of crystal continue to line the way. The corridor to the northeast seems to open into a larger cavern. To the east, it seems as though there was once another corridor, but it is entirely collapsed. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
