R {10612}{0}{<248>}{A crystal cavern (nw,sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{   This was once a much larger cavern, but the ceiling has almost completely collapsed. A few arches of fused crystal hold the nearby crystal stable, but the ceiling is much lower than it used to be. To the north and northeast, all you can see is fallen crystal, though the clear area supported by the arches continues to the northwest. }{Crystal Tunnel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
