R {13704}{0}{<238>}{A weathered path (n,s,library)}{<238>. .<088>}{A large foreboding gate lies to the north.  As if by magic, it opens up occasionally allowing new denizens of Three Kingdoms access to and from the grand city of Pinnacle.  A worn and well traveled path leads south towards a large majestic looking tower.  From this distance, the large structure looks vacant, but curiosity demands a more thorough investigation of the property.  Perhaps the secrets of the realms lie inside.  You can also return to the Woonsocket library simply by typing the word library. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {88}{n}{n}{1}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {13705}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {13705}{0}{<228>}{Newbie tower courtyard (w,s,n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{The doors of a large majestic tower lie open to the south, and it appears as if the building itself was inviting wanderers inside.  To the north and west, a weathered path veers away from the current courtyard and tower.  Tall green trees lined up in rows and columns surround the majestic building, and a small wooden sign is nailed up onto the trunk of the closest tree. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {13704}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {13707}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {13708}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {13706}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {13707}{0}{<238>}{A weathered path. (e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The weathered path comes to an end amidst a wall of impassible oaks.  The surrounding trees form a hidden cove in which a small timber constructed dwelling sits.  Small flashes of light dance along the branches of trees.  Examining them more closely reveals that they are indeed brownies flying gracefully in the air, busy in their own brownie endeavors.  Next to the wooden dwelling is a pedestal with a large leather-bound journal.  The Brownie Queen smiles warmly as you enter her hidden cove, perhaps you should type 'say hello' to talk with her. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
