R {13708}{0}{<238>}{Newbie Tower: Entrance (se,sw,s,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{The walls of the interior tower are all painted white.  Upon them are many shelves containing books, tomes and artifacts.  The smell of burning incense floats through the air, and the lighting here is provided by small sconces adorning the walls.  To the south a giant circular stairway leads up through the muraled ceiling and into the second level of the tower.  Going north leads back to Pinnacle, while the other adjoining rooms lead off in various directions. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
