R {13709}{0}{<248>}{Newbie Tower: Armory (sw,nw,w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The circular staircase is directly westward while a door exiting the tower can been seen to the southwest.  Along the walls in this section of the tower are the commonly placed shelves, except instead of books and scrolls, various armors and weapons adorn them.  This looks like an armory of sorts.  A stalwart warrior stands here behind a large oak desk.  He is seen handing out supplies to many of the people that visit his counter.  A wise adventurer might also get some equipment from him if fighting was in their foreseeable future. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
