R {13710}{0}{<248>}{Newbie Tower: Sage (w,ne,se,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The burning incense is stronger here than any other location within the tower.  A small woman standing behind an oak desk looks up occasionally at people as they pass by.  Upon the desk is an opened scroll with neatly penned instructions.  It might be worthwhile to take a moment and read what is written upon it.  The stairs leading up to the second level lie eastward, while it looks as if there is another door exiting the tower to the southeast.  A beaded curtain covers a doorway that leads to the west. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
