R {13711}{0}{<278>}{Newbie Tower: Stairs (e,w,d,u,n,s)}{<278>.@.<088>}{At the approach of the circular staircase, an exit down through the floor is now identified.  Its descent was not easily discernible from a distance.  It appears as if a small scholarly study is located down below, while bright lights flicker above.  The faint aroma of incense emanates from the west, while exits from the tower are to the north and south.  A small opened scroll has been attached to the metal framing of the stairs. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
