R {13715}{0}{}{Newbie Academy Entrance (u,d,n)}{ }{      This is the world famous 3K Newbie Academy. Each day, newbies come out with the skills and knowledge they need to survive the harsh reality of the Three Kingdoms.  To handle the large number of applicants, the administration has greatly simplified the enrollment process. Now all you need to do is to type 'pay tuition' here. The school entrance is to the north. }{Newbie Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
