R {13716}{0}{<258>}{Newbie Tower: Advancement (portal,d,n,s)}{<258>(<158>P<258>)<088>}{The epicenter of the Newbie Hall.  Many adventurers run through here on a crusade to hone their skills.  Within these walls, adventurers are able to advance their levels and stats, provided they have earned the required amounts of experience.  Others gather information on various quests available to those that seek them.  The sounds of battle rage from the strange doorway to the south, while the legendary mirror rooms are accessed through the remaining doorway to the north.  A circular staircase leads down from here to the primary level.  A bright blue portal hangs in the air here.  There are indications that it will take you to the adventurer's guild hall in the town of Pinnacle.  You should go there when your treks through newbieland are complete. There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
