R {13719}{0}{}{Newbie Tower:Challenge Room (n)}{ }{Partitioned walls almost paper thin enclose this room.  The hardwood floor below creaks as pressure is placed upon it in various places.  A few feet ahead, a roughly spun mat on the ground is the only piece of furniture located here.  This space is used by warriors who wish to practice their arts in privacy.  An old man sitting on his hands in the corner, looks up at the stranger invading his meditation and points to some writing upon one of the walls.  A doorway leads north into the Newbie Tower. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
