R {13724}{0}{<238>}{Newbie Tower: Forest (s,enter)}{<238>] [<088>}{The door to the Newbie Tower opens and closes as newly arriving citizens start on their quests of adventure.  A dark forest comprised of age old elms stretches out as far as the eye can see to the south.  The underbrush is light, making travel through here quite easy.  Sounds of distant footsteps can be heard, signifying that this forest is also not devoid of other dangers lurking about.  Any traveler should be cautious as they explore beyond the safeguard of the tower to the north. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
