R {13725}{0}{<228>}{Newbie Tower: Forest (w,e,n,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{A small path leads north to the Newbie Tower ahead, while it seemingly dissipates in every other direction into the forest underbrush.  The elms cast their looming shadows onto the ground and barely let in enough light to see by.  Upon the forest floor rests a small ant hill with many of its inhabitants scurrying about.  Their choice of location for their home is most likely less than desirable as many adventurers wander by upheaving the earth around it. }{Newbieland}{newbie_forest}{}{}{1.000}{1}
