R {13727}{0}{<228>}{Newbie Tower: Forest (w,e,s,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{The small stream from the west drains into a large pool of water.  Amazingly, the liquid is crystal clear and the rock-bed bottom below can be seen with pristine clarity.  Small ripples along the surface of the water fade away as they reach the outer rim.  Amidst the center of the pool stands a large wooden post with a engraved sign hung upon it. The elm forest continues onward in all directions. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
