R {13728}{0}{<228>}{Newbie Tower: Forest (ne,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{From underneath the earth, a stream emerges from the ground and flows eastward into the elm forest beyond.  The excess of water beneath the soil keeps the ground moist and the trees flourishing.  Small rays of light shine down through the foliage of the trees, providing only adequate amounts of light to navigate these woods by.  Adventurers should be very careful when exploring these woods.  There have been rumors of people entering the forest and never returning. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
