R {13729}{0}{<228>}{Newbie Tower: Forest (se,w,e,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{A noise resembling footsteps can be heard in this portion of the elm forest.  The direction from which it emanates is undiscernible.  It might very well be nothing, but it might also mean something.  Perhaps someone, or something, within this forest is keeping a close eye on those that travel within it.  A small twisting stream originating from the west continues eastward through a rock-bed channel. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
