R {13730}{0}{<228>}{Newbie Tower: Forest (ne,nw,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{It appears that someone made a campfire here at one time.  A ring of stones centers itself within the outlying trees, their edges blackened from the charred wood that remains in the fire pit.  At least they were conscientious enough to remove most of the flammable debris from the forest floor around the pit.  It doesn't appear that there are any animals around; this might be a good place to rest for a moment.  Then again, is it? }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
