R {13731}{0}{<228>}{Newbie Tower: Forest (sw,w,e,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{Although the forest is relatively quiet, it does not mean that it is barren of inhabitants.  The lack of direct sun from the sky above adds an ominous feel to the woods.  Traveling through it becomes tedious as adventurers must maneuver their way around the underbrush present within such a vast majority of its space.  Gusting winds of over fifteen knots blow through the trees, seemingly shaking them to their foundations. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
