R {14086}{0}{<138>}{Beach (s,se,nw,w)}{<138>, `<088>}{Beach At this point the cliffs have collapsed, forming a sandy beach front to Dragonspire Bay, which is just to the east.  Further off to the west, the land rises.  This broad peninsula is rocky and windswept, and stretches far to the south.  The air is sharp with the tang of kelp and salt.  Only tough heath and scrub manages to grow along this windswept beach.  Further to the west you note a road.  Looking out over the water to the east, you can make out a small island not that far from shore.  The waters are calm enough in these parts that you might chance swimming. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
