R {14098}{0}{}{Coliseum of an old city (e)}{ }{  As you enter the ruins of the old coliseum through the huge gates, you realize that this city must have once been one of the grandest in the known world. All around the arena are statues of monsters, some well known to you and some so arcane and twisted that you begin to wonder if they really are of this world. Looking up from the arena for a second you reconnoiter the vast number of audience seats, with the topmost almost touching the sky. You slowly turn your attention to the sun setting in the west and feeling the warm mid-summer breeze you decide that this would be a perfect place to camp. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
