R {14102}{0}{<238>}{Cape Headland (e,nw,w)}{<238>, `<088>}{Cape Headland This thin, rocky headland lies at the southern end of the cape.  The rocky landscape is almost entirely barren here.  The roar of the wind and waves drowns out almost every other sound.  To the south lies nothing but open ocean.  Waves boom mercilessly against the rocks, and the air is thick with spray.  To the north lies the foaming, but less turbulent, waters of Dragonspire Bay.  Further to the east you note that the headland continues, while to the west you note a road.  An old road runs east-west along the headland. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
