R {14126}{0}{}{Plant Parking Lot (n,s)}{ }{The parking lot, which runs north and south along the front of the Murdock Chicken Plant, is full of junk cars.  The east side of the parking lot is lined with a chain link fence beyond which you see the open waste that the land has become over the years.  Towards the north is a guard shack in front of a break in the fence, which must be the parking lot entrance.  The blacktop parking lot is riddled with cracks, and littered with broken glass and junk car parts. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
