R {14127}{0}{}{Plant Parking Lot (s,e)}{ }{Junk cars stacked upon each other make up useless piles of scrap metal across the parking lot.  The piles are stacked up against the chain link fence that surrounds the plant grounds.  The piles are so large, that any travel further west within this lot would be impossible.  The plant has a industrial sized door in the building's north side where employees and supplies can enter the main warehouse.  Over the door is an electric scanner.  The parking lot continues to the east where the plant exits at a guard shack. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
