R {14140}{0}{}{Data Processing Center (e)}{ }{The data processing center is full of large tables that hold ancient computers.  The back of the room has a large machine, which looks to be a mainframe of some kind.  Data processing slips, run paper and spare computer parts litter the floor.  A small, under powered window air conditioning unit tries in vain to cool the room full of machines. A small doorway east leads back out into the main hallway. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
