R {14141}{0}{}{Fileroom (n,w)}{ }{As you enter the file room of the Murdock plant, you wonder how this company ever managed to survive into modern times.  The room is organized into rows of blue file cabinets, each containing customer billing information.  The file cabinets end where the accounts receivable area begins just to the north.  To the west is the main office hallway. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
