E {14154}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14151}{0}{}{Hallway (w,e)}{ }{This small and dirty hallway leads to a set of double doors.  The doors are clearly marked 'Safety Goggles Beyond This Point.'  Each one of the doors is sturdy and could withstand a large force.  The floor is stained and covered in chicken feathers.  A small sensor appears to be installed over the set of doors. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14148}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14176}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14152}{0}{}{Executive Conference Room (w)}{ }{A main board table is the centerpiece of the conference room.  The table is made of oak, and looks like it was really nice at one time.  A picture window looks out over the parking lot.  The once dark carpet is full of stains.  A doorway west leads back out into the hallway. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14148}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14153}{0}{}{Conrad Clucker's Office (e)}{ }{The main executive office still shows signs of being a plush office.  A large oak desk has a nameplate that reads 'Conrad Clucker.'  The carpet has a few feathers here and there, but for the most part it is in decent condition.  The south side of the room has the wall broken out where an executive washroom once existed.  The doorway east leads back out to the executive secretarial bay. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14150}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14154}{0}{}{Courtney Cluckerson's Office (w)}{ }{This corner office was once one of the most prestigious places in the building.  You can see a nice view of the parking lot outside the large picture window, while a set of bookshelves sit on either side of it.  A large oak desk sits in the center of the room, covered in various papers.  The once nice carpet is covered in chicken feathers and droppings.  The west doorway leads back out to the executive secretarial bay. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14150}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14155}{0}{}{Murdock Processing Plant (n,s)}{ }{Standing in the huge warehouse, you have come to the loading area of chicken processor number two.  Chickens are loaded from the bin directly north onto the conveyer belt where the chickens are carried up to huge processors. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14179}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14180}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14156}{0}{}{Murdock Processing Plant (n,s)}{ }{The floor is covered in chicken guts that has been squished and stomped by the work crews.  Workers take the processed chickens off of the conveyer belt and load them into storage bins up against the south wall.  The stench at this end of the processor is unbearable. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14135}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14167}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14157}{0}{}{Murdock Processing Plant (n,w,e)}{ }{The stench at this end of the plant is unbearable.  Processed chickens lay rotting in huge storage bins up against the south wall.  Just to the north, workers try to keep up with the infinite chickens coming off the processor. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14135}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14185}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14186}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14158}{0}{}{Hallway (n,s)}{ }{The hallway gets a little wider in this section of the plant.  Rows of desks are lined up along the walls each of them having a telephone ringing.  Each of the desks contains a lot of contact leads for the sales force.  It looks as if the company makes a lot of calls for their poultry sales.  With these poor conditions, it's no wonder this plant is in such bad financial shape.  The floor is stained like the rest of the hall. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14138}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14161}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14159}{0}{}{Engineering Room (n,s,w,e)}{ }{Engineering Room -  The hallway opens up into a large drafting room.  Drawing tables of engineering theories on how to better process chicken fill the room. There is a door on both the north and south ends of the room, which appear to lead to offices.  The tile floor is quite dirty and littered with chicken feathers and wadded up sheets of paper.  A large set of double doors is immediately to the west.  A sign across the doors is written in red 'DO NOT ENTER.' }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14138}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14168}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14169}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14160}{0}{}{Men's Restroom (w)}{<138>U<088>}{The hard tile floor is cracked and covered with mildew. Each of toilets within the bathroom stalls are overflowed onto the floor causing quite a stink.  The sinks are covered with dust, and don't look as if they have been used in years.  Overall, things are quite a mess.  The urinals could probably be used, but you might catch some disease. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{murdock_urinal}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14138}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14161}{0}{}{Hallway (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The sales area continues through the Murdock hallway.  Rows of desks are stacked up against the wall full of sales agents.  A small door in the west wall appears to lead to the woman's bathroom.  A doorway in the east wall leads into the office of Chris Clucker.  The stained tile floor leads a long way north, while to the south the hallway ends in a door. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14158}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14162}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14163}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14164}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14162}{0}{}{Hallway (n,w,e,door)}{<168>D<088>}{The sales floor comes to an end at the end of the hallway.  A small door on the south wall leads outside to what appears to be a small break area.  A small pile of feathers sits in the corner of the hall, where it looks as if someone tried to sweep them up.  On each side of the hallway appears to be a sales office.  The hallway extends far to the north. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14161}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14165}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
