R {14163}{0}{}{Women's Restroom (e)}{ }{The hard tile floor is cracked and covered with mildew.  Each of the bathroom stalls contains an overflowed toilet, causing quite a stink.  The sinks are covered with dust, and don't look as if they have been used in years.  Overall, things are quite a mess, and you might be better off to use another bathroom, or just hold it.  }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14161}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14164}{0}{}{Chris Clucker's Office (w)}{ }{The office of Chris Clucker is disarray.  The oak desktop is empty and smooth, but the stapler, inboxes, desk pad, and other items normally found on the desk are scattered about the floor.  A picture frame lies broken on the floor.  The doorway west leads back out to the sales floor. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14161}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14165}{0}{}{Paul Poultry's Office (e)}{ }{This small sales office appears to belong to the junior manager of sales.  A small desk made out of pressboard engulfs most of the room.  A large portrait of a distinguished man hangs crooked on the north wall.  The desk chair is off balance and looks like it has most of the padding ripped out.  The doorway east leads back out to the sales floor. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14162}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14166}{0}{}{Kristy Clucker's Office (w)}{ }{This small corner sales office appears to have been made for the head sales manager.  It is quite ugly and uncomfortably cramped.  A nice wood desk with a brass nameplate highlights the room.  The corner window looks over the parking lot outside.  You hear phones ringing through the doorway to the west. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14162}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14167}{0}{}{Murdock Processing Plant (n,s,e)}{ }{You are near the south end of the huge chicken processor.  Feathers and chicken guts pile up along the floor as they fall off the conveyer belt above.  Processed chickens travel south along the belt to the awaiting crew to the south.  A set of double doors lead east into the drawing room. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14156}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14171}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14159}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14168}{0}{}{Supervisor's Office (s)}{ }{This small drawing office is barely larger than a closet.  Likely it belongs to an engineering supervisor and is used to prepare final proposals before they are approved and given to the sales force.  The walls are covered with pinholes from drawings being tacked on them.  The carpet is old and worn, and should be replaced. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14159}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14169}{0}{}{Supervisor's Office (n)}{ }{This small drawing office is barely larger than a closet.  Likely it belongs to an engineering supervisor and is used to prepare final proposals before they are approved and given to the sales force.  The walls are covered with pinholes from drawings being tacked on against them.  The carpet is old and worn, and should be replaced. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14159}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14170}{0}{}{Murdock Processing Plant (n,s)}{ }{The conveyer belts of the giant machine begin to descend towards the south as you are on the backside of the huge presses that process the chickens.  Feathers fly through the air nearly causing you to sneeze. }{Murdock Chicken Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
