R {14223}{0}{}{Entrance to a ramshackle house (leave,n)}{<168>L<088>}{The floor creaks and dust swirls around as you enter this house, the walls are bowing and splintering planks with knotholes in them.  Overhead, the ceiling is riddled with gaps allowing unregulated access to the elements.  Bits of rubble lie strewn about in this apparently uninhabited shack.  A path through the dust leads northward. }{A Refugee House}{refugee_house}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14225}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14221}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14224}{0}{}{The middle of a house (s,n,w,e)}{ }{The hallway opens up into other rooms here.  Another hallway leads eastward, and this hall runs back south to the entrance of this shack. To the west lies a living room much more pleasant looking than this hall which is just a path carved through dust and debris from the wastelands outside.  Northward is a curious looking kitchen. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14225}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14227}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
