E {14230}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14225}{0}{}{In the main hall (s,n,w)}{ }{This hallway leads down the center of the decrepit shack. Dust drifts around in the air, descending slowly through shafts of light and settling on the floor.  The rubble is piled in banks along the wall away from the path. The hallway continues northward, and off to the west there seems to be a little family room. A picture is hanging on the wall. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14223}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14224}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14226}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14226}{0}{}{In the family room (e,n)}{ }{Wonders never cease, this room doesn't look half bad.  There is some ragged carpet on the floor and the walls have some shabby paneling, probably to cover the unsightly planks from which the house is made.  There's a small bench and table here, neither of which have any dust on them.  This room seems strangely quiet and clean compared to the hall. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14225}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14227}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14227}{0}{}{In the Living room (s,n,e)}{ }{This living room is orderly, clean and nicely furnished.  Sufficient sun streams through a glass window to adequately light and warm the whole room.  On a wall between a small sofa and an easy chair is a well populated bookshelf.  On the opposite side is a fireplace with a marble hearth and heavy oak mantle.  The floor has a thick rug. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14226}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14228}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14224}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14228}{0}{}{In the dining room (s,e)}{ }{The furniture suggests that this is the dining room. Judging by the dust, it is seldom used. Dust coats the ground and the long-unused furniture sits sullenly on the uneven floor. There is a large picture on the west wall and a window paned with cracked plastic to the north. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14227}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14229}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14229}{0}{}{In the kitchen (s,w)}{ }{The kitchen has gotten a lot of attention, it seems to be aptly designed and the surfaces are clean.  The counter top is linoleum and clean but scratched and faded with years of use.  There are no cabinets or drawers; it's a very simple room.  A circular table and three chairs are where the inhabitants congregate for meals. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14228}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14224}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14230}{0}{}{A small hallway (s,n,w)}{ }{This small hallway has doors to both the north and south.  The floor here is nearly clean carpet.  The walls are paneled with dark brown hardboard.  A little sconce is secured to the wall and holds a candle. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14224}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14231}{s}{open south door;s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14232}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14231}{0}{}{A bedroom (n)}{ }{This must be the master bedroom.  There is a disheveled, queen-size bed squatting unhappily in the corner.  Beside the bed on one side is a bed-side table, on the other side is a window in the wall.  A dresser is the only other furniture sitting on the circular rug in this room. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14230}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14232}{0}{}{A small bedroom (s)}{ }{The bedroom floor is strewn with rudimentary toys and games. There are small stacks of wooden blocks, a very crude carving of an old- fashioned space shuttle. In addition, there is a little bed and a chest of drawers. }{A Refugee House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14230}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14233}{0}{<138>}{Coastal Wastelands (n,s,w)}{<138>, `<088>}{Coastal Wastelands You wonder if you'll ever find the end of this rolling expanse.  A foul wind whips by you as you survey this desolate landscape.  You catch the smell of something rancid burning. You probably don't want to find out what it could be that could be burning.  To the south and north you vaguely sense the continuation of the wasteland.  The Atlantic Ocean stretches out to the east. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
