R {14234}{0}{<138>}{Coastal Wastelands (board,w)}{<138>,<228>B<138>`<088>}{Coastal Wastelands A foul wind whips by you as you survey this desolate landscape.  This whole area looks like someone has come through and strip mined it. It looks much more desolate than the rest.  You've got to wonder how anything could survive way out here.  A submarine seems to have run aground here. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
