R {14237}{0}{}{Command Deck (u,fore,aft)}{ }{A periscope shaft occupies the center of this deck. Navigation, steering and depth controls and instruments are on the forward wall. Fire control, weapons systems and countermeasures are on the starboard side. Sonar, radar and communications are on the port side. Damage control and power systems are on the aft wall. Between the periscope and forward wall is a chest high table with all sorts of papers on top. }{The Lost Submarine}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
