R {14238}{0}{}{Missile Room (fore,aft)}{ }{Eight large tubes take up most of the space in this compartment. A control panel sits near the hatchway to the command deck. Several hoses and conduits line the ceiling and the deck. A small safe is mounted to the wall above the control panel. }{The Lost Submarine}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
