R {14240}{0}{}{Torpedo Room (aft)}{ }{Rotating racks fill each side of the room. Four torpedo tubes stick out from the forward side of the ship. Deck plates are slightly submerged by an inch of water. Chains and cranks hang from the ceiling. Several valves and gauges surround the tubes. }{The Lost Submarine}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
