E {14236}{s}{aft}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14241}{0}{}{Reactor Control (fore,aft)}{ }{This compartment houses the main power source of the submarine. Normally the nuclear reactor is sealed behind a thick, protective encasement with a reinforced door. The door appears to be missing. It feels oddly warm in here and there is a oily, metallic smell in the air. A control panel sits on the side of the encasement. Several uniforms are scattered all over the deck. }{The Lost Submarine}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
