R {14242}{0}{}{Engine Room (fore)}{ }{A massive electric engine rides the propeller shaft in this compartment. Huge, black cables run from the engine into the bulkhead. A large control panel with several status displays takes up an entire wall. A slight smell of burnt electronics wafts in the air and everything seems to have oil on it. A door to the aft of this compartment has been sealed shut. }{The Lost Submarine}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
