R {14304}{0}{<238>}{A concrete tunnel (w,leave)}{<238>]<228>L<238>[<088>}{As you enter through the rift, a strange essence passes through you.  You're obviously not in the same place that you had left.  Looking behind you, the rift is still there, maybe to pass back through, possibly not.  Looking around, you seem to be at the end of a large concrete tunnel.  What light exists here seems to be coming from the rift you just passed through.  Undecipherable voices can be heard to the west, echoing throughout the tunnel. }{Camazots}{camazots}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14305}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14301}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14305}{0}{<238>}{Opening to Camazots (w,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're standing at the opening of a huge underground complex.  The ceiling stretches a good two hundred feet above you.  The walls of concrete extend down in a dome like fashion.  High at the top of the ceiling is a strange ball of energy unlike anything you have ever seen before.  A deep tunnel of concrete leads off to the east towards a strange rift. }{Camazots}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14304}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14306}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14306}{0}{<238>}{Complex in Camazots (n,s,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{As you enter the complex, you're immediately surprised at the warmth and noise level.  The ground is covered in lots of miscellaneous garbage. People mostly walk through trails formed by the junk as it's stacked and pushed off to the side.  A huge white structure can be seen in the middle of the complex, although it seems to have no openings from this side.  The ball above you shines brightly giving light to the room. Makeshift tents can be seen to the north and south. }{Camazots}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14305}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14307}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14308}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14307}{0}{<238>}{Complex in Camazots (s,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{As you stand in the waste and dirt of this northern section of the complex, you deduce that if a residential section of this complex exists this would be it.  Small makeshift tents are setup here around a large steel barrel with a fire burning within it.  The strange energy ball high above you burns brightly giving light and warmth to the area.  The walls extend high above you, and are covered in graffiti. }{Camazots}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14306}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14311}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42828}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42828}{n}{enter}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14308}{0}{<238>}{Complex in Camazots (n,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The southern section of the complex is strangely colder.  No apparent reason why, and the energy ball above still gives bright light to the area, but the temperature definitely drops in this section of the complex.  Small tents are setup here within the garbage and filth. }{Camazots}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14306}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14309}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14309}{0}{<238>}{Complex in Camazots (nw,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You walk along a cramped trail formed within the junk of this huge concrete complex.  A huge energy ball shines brightly above you giving light to the area.  To the north is a huge white structure.  Strangely enough, it seems to be the only clean thing in this entire area.  You hear some strange sounds up to the northwest that you cannot decipher. }{Camazots}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14308}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14310}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14310}{0}{<238>}{Complex in Camazots (se,ne,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This cleared out area within the complex appears to be the entryway into the white structure.  The ground is made of concrete, but appears to be cleaned on a regular basis.  Large scorch marks are permanently burned within the concrete below your feet.  The structure has a large doorway with strange symbols carved above it.  To each side of the doorway is a burning torch stand. }{Camazots}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14309}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14311}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14312}{e}{pull left torch;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14311}{0}{<238>}{Complex in Camazots (sw,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{There is very little room to move here with the amount of junk here.  A small trail leads east towards what appears to be a set of tents, and you hear some strange, yet indecipherable sounds towards the southwest. Directly south of you is a huge white structure.  It sits directly under the energy ball high above you. }{Camazots}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14310}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14307}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14312}{0}{<178>}{White Structure (w)}{ }{Surprisingly the inside of the structure is nothing like the complex outside.  Everything is meticulously clean, with white walls and a white marble floor.  The room is filled with unusual items that have colorful blinking lights.  A strange high tech throne sits on the middle of the room.  The throne is the centerpiece of a huge symbol that is embedded within the marble floor.  There is no apparent light source in the room, yet the room is brightly lit.  The ceiling is strangely transparent, yet you cannot see anything through it. }{Camazots}{icodileies}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14310}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42829}{sit throne}{sit throne}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14313}{0}{<238>}{Desolate plains (n,s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Desolate plains You wonder if you'll ever find the end of this rolling expanse.  A gigantic crater lies before you. It's hard to imagine what could have exploded and caused something as impressive as this.  A foul wind whips by you as you survey this desolate landscape.  To the south you determine the continuation of the plains.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
