R {14324}{0}{<228>}{A pathway in the forest (path,n)}{<228>(<238>P<228>*<088>}{A dirt pathway cuts through the thick forest.  The trees on both sides look strangely healthy given the destruction acid rain has caused on the rest of the forest.  Intermixed with the trees you notice stumps that look as if they were cut with primitive saws and hand axes.  Looking northwards along the pathway you see some buildings.  Perhaps they would give you an idea of how this forest is kept healthy. }{Luddite Commune}{luddite_commune}{}{}{1.000}{1}
