R {14332}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (n,s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Small, rolling hills covered in scraggly grass and weeds march towards the horizon in every direction.  Blades of grass sway gently in the wind, struggling to survive in the dusty and dry heartland of North America.  The sun dips behind some clouds, hidden behind the dark promise of rain.  To the south you sort of see the continuation of the hills.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
