R {14333}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (n,s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills You stand atop a small hill staring out over the countryside.  Tufts of grass sprout from the gently rolling hills.  Each looks as though it would be considered a weed elsewhere, but out here where water is scarce and the sun bakes the earth, they are a sight for sore eyes.  The sun dips behind some clouds, hidden behind the dark promise of rain.  To the north you just barely see the continuation of the hills.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
