R {14339}{0}{}{The camp gateway (e,out)}{ }{This is the gate into the camp.  It's a simple barrier and wall thing, only designed to keep out the occasional intruder...like you.  Through the barrier to the east you see the smaller inner building, its flag flapping gently in the breeze.  You can see the logo on it more clearly now. }{CybDom Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
