R {14340}{0}{}{Building entrance hall (s,w)}{ }{Inside the building is a small reception area, which is almost totally empty.  There are the remains of a small desk here, and several large holes punched into the walls.  Apart from this, there are just fragments of wood and stone lying around.  It's quite dark in here, except for the light shining in from the entrance to the west.  Some light also seems to be coming from the doorway to the south. }{CybDom Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14339}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14341}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14341}{0}{}{The planning room (n)}{ }{You blink in the bright artificial light as you enter through the doorway. Looking around, you see a large map of the wastelands and its surrounding cities.  Directly opposite you is a banner with writing on it, similar to the flag outside.  A bright phosphorescent tube on the ceiling illuminates the room.  In front of you is an important-looking desk, with a small flag and several documents on it.  Behind that is a plush chair. }{CybDom Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14340}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

