R {14365}{0}{<278>}{Inside the Bomb Shelter (exit,e)}{<278>[<238>X<278>]<088>}{An eerie feeling creeps over you as you look about you.  The walls are old and grimy, and the metallic glint that they once had is more than gone.  Dirt covers the walls and the ground.  There is a more than faint smell of urine and excrement in the air.  It appears as if you are the only person to pass through here in years, but the dirt seems to indicate otherwise. }{Bomb Shelter}{bomb_shelter}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14367}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14334}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14366}{0}{}{The Kitchen of the Bomb Shelter (n)}{ }{This room appears to have been, at some time, used to prepare food. Before, that is, the people living here started losing any civilized behaviour that they at one time had.  At least the smell of urine and excrement isn't so bad here.  A table sits in the middle of the room, and an old TV sits on the table.  Besides that, there doesn't seem to be much in here.  The cupboards have been torn down from the walls; anything that was on the shelves now lies in complete ruin on the ground.  In a chair next to the table is a body, slumped onto the table. }{Bomb Shelter}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14367}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14367}{0}{<278>}{Inside the Bomb Shelter (s,e,w)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{The smell of urine and excrement is VERY strong now.  You hold your breath as you examine the room.  The room is in total disarray.  Papers, books, cans, toys, utensils, bedding, clothes, and other things are just strewn about the room as if whoever was here didn't even care about the conditions they were living in.  The walls are filthy, and as you look about, you step in a pile of human waste. A dirty and dented door leads east. }{Bomb Shelter}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14365}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14366}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14368}{e}{unlock door;open door}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14368}{0}{}{The Washroom of the Bomb Shelter (w)}{ }{HOLY GOD ALMIGHTY does it REEK in here!  This _must_ be where the smell was coming from.  Holding your breath, you look around you. Fumes rise from the ground.  Excrement is piled upon excrement upon excrement.  You are up to your ankles in human waste.  It is like walking around the bottom of an outhouse.  You slosh from one area of the room over to another.  There appears to be something like a toilet in one corner, and a sink up against the wall.  There is a mirror above the sink. }{Bomb Shelter}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14367}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

