R {14375}{0}{<238>}{The Rocky Mountains (n,s,w,e,trail)}{<238>^<228>T<238>^<088>}{The Rocky Mountains Naked soil shifts beneath your feet, a true sign of the desolation wrought here.  Huge boulders have been pounded to rubble leaving only small pebbles strewn about you.  Some great force has ravaged the landscape.  Noble and majestic, the Rockies rise up before you. They look steep and dangerous.  To the north you vaguely sense the continuation of the Rockies.  A small trail winds around the base of the mountains towards a crater. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
