R {14410}{0}{}{Church altar (ne,nw)}{ }{Having climbed a couple of steps to this dais, you find that the outstanding beauty of the altar takes your breath away.  It seems to have been hewn from a huge chunk of white marble and then someone with immense skill carved beautiful visions of angels into the front and sides of this marvelous creation.  A wooden cross and a vase of flowers decorate the top of the altar along with a few sheets of paper.  Four small stained glass windows allow light in from the back of the church and a small cushioned seat lies in the far left corner. }{Mortimer's Church}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
