R {14411}{0}{}{Secret room (e)}{ }{This is a small square room with no decoration to speak of at all.  This is where Mortimer Kane comes when he is in need of solitude.  A small bed is the sum total of the items in this room. }{Mortimer's Church}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
