R {14414}{0}{<238>}{The Appalachian Mountains (n,s,w,e)}{<238>.^.<088>}{The Appalachian Mountains Huge mountains rise up before you here. They look steep and dangerous.  You've got to wonder how anything could survive way out here.  The trees here look like the pollution and smog have just about killed them off. You wonder if anything will grow here again.  To the south you make out the continuation of the Appalachians.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
