R {14450}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (n,s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills You stand atop a small hill staring out over the countryside.  The sun dips behind some clouds, hidden behind the dark promise of rain.  Tufts of grass sprout from the gently rolling hills.  Each looks as though it would be considered a weed elsewhere, but out here where water is scarce and the sun bakes the earth, they are a sight for sore eyes.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
