R {14468}{0}{}{Central hall (s,n,e,w)}{ }{From here, there are exits in all directions.  A sign pointing north reads 'Preparation', and one to the south reads 'Recovery'.  The east exit is unmarked, and it is from there that the strong smell of blood emanates. The disinfectant smell comes from all three directions.  Trails of blood lead east and south. }{ICARE}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
