R {14469}{0}{}{Recovery room (n)}{ }{A simple room, with the standard black tiles and whitewashed walls.  Beds are lined up against both walls, with trails of blood leading towards several of them.  Looking back, you see these trails originate from the room to the northeast of here.  There are several inscriptions on the walls. }{ICARE}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
