R {14470}{0}{}{Preparation room (s)}{ }{This is a fairly plain room, with whitewashed walls and a black tiled floor. A few empty 'beds' are lined up against one wall; and on the opposite wall there is a table, upon which are several medical instruments. }{ICARE}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14468}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14471}{0}{}{Surgery (w)}{ }{The smell of blood hits you as you enter this room.  The walls and floor are both spattered with the stuff, and there's even some on the ceiling.  The centre of the room contains one trolley-bed next to a fixed table, with straps across it.  On the floor is a pile of plasticine-like stuff. }{ICARE}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14468}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

