R {14490}{0}{}{A cave (n,leave)}{ }{You have entered a small and narrow cave which won't even let you stand upright. To the north it looks like the cave gets bigger and you can smell the stench of oil coming from there. The rocky walls around you reveal an opening to the south.  }{Oil Storage Cave}{oil_storage_cave}{}{}{1.000}{1}
