R {14501}{0}{<278>}{An abandoned guardpost (road,e)}{<278>-<238>R<278>-<088>}{What's left of the highway leads to this old abandoned guard post.  You can see that the road continues on beyond the barrier here, and it even appears like someone's been using it recently.  The little guard house  barely stands on its own anymore, leaning to one side, its small roof completely rotted through and only the small support beams remain.  Small tufts of grass cling precariously to life against the fence which stretches apparantly mostly intact to both the north and south.  The gatehouse  barrier lies canted across the road in a vain attempt to keep you out. }{Air Force Base}{air_force_base}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14504}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14498}{road}{road}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14502}{0}{<138>}{Coastal Wastelands (n)}{<138>, `<088>}{Coastal Wastelands You wonder if you'll ever find the end of this rolling expanse.  The ground under your feet cracks and snaps as you walk. The dirt is jet black, with soot, ash, and pieces of bone strewn throughout.  Before you stretches a vast expanse of destruction and desolation.  The waters of the bay stretch out to the west while the Atlantic stretches to the east and south. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14500}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14503}{0}{<278>}{An abandoned military base (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{This road seems to be only slightly better off than the highway leading to here.  While cracks and pot holes abound, it appears that someone has at least made the effort to maintain it.  The road stretches further east towards what looks like the old control tower for the base.  Along the way, there are buildings in various states of disrepair. }{Air Force Base}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14504}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14505}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32617}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14504}{0}{<278>}{An abandoned military base (e,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You're on a long road.  It runs from the west through the guard post nearby and continues eastward.  Here, just on the inside of the perimeter fence lies the charred wreckage of a military troop transport from the early part of the last decade.  Grass grows intermittently about the roadside, large patches in some places but mere tufts or simply hardened, sun baked dirt in others.  Further east is the beginnings of the base proper, where you can see dilapidated buildings struggling to survive against the  hardships of the wastelands. }{Air Force Base}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14501}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14503}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49631}{truck}{truck}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49631}{n}{truck}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14505}{0}{<278>}{An abandoned military base (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{As you glance down the road in both directions, you notice that you are  about half way between the perimeter fence and the control tower and the fence just beyond it.  Buildings lie devastated on both sides of the road here, most likely service auxiliary buildings in the past.  From this point on the road, you can see a large hangar to the northeast beyond several  more smaller buildings, and strangely, the lights are on inside it. }{Air Force Base}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14503}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14506}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14506}{0}{<278>}{An abandoned military base (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{As you glance up the road to the east, you can see the skeletal remains of several aircraft out on the runways.  All about you, the buildings of the base lie crumbling, some more than others.  In the distance, to the northeast looms the gigantic hangar you glimpsed before.  The base's control tower rises from amongst the rubble to  the southeast, a shadowy monolith in the bright haze of the badlands. }{Air Force Base}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14505}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14507}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32618}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14507}{0}{<278>}{An abandoned military base (w,n)}{<278>-+ <088>}{Directly east of you are the runways of the air base. Between you and them is another fence, of similar construction to the perimeter one.  Just south of you lies  the entrance to the control tower.  The road curves north  here and heads towards the hangar in the distance.  The  lights from the hangar seem to be the only ones in the area. }{Air Force Base}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14506}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14508}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
