R {14508}{0}{<278>}{An abandoned military base (s,n)}{<278> | <088>}{You're standing about halfway between the large hangar to the north and the control tower to the south.  The road here isn't much better than  elsewhere on the base, still cracked and full of holes.  To the west is  a small fenced in cage.  East of you are the giant runways of the airbase littered with metallic debris from the skeletal aircraft lying on them. Between you and the runways is a large chain link fence which effectively blocks you reaching the wrecked planes. }{Air Force Base}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
