R {14543}{0}{<238>}{The Rocky Mountains (n,s,w,e)}{<238>.^.<088>}{The Rocky Mountains Naked soil shifts beneath your feet, a true sign of the desolation wrought here.  The trees here are tall and sparsely foliated, the effects of radiation and pollution taking their toll.  You wonder if they will ever grow into the lush, verdant forest that once stood here.  The mountains around you rise and fall in a never ending pattern.  To the east and west you see the continuation of the Rockies.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
