R {14547}{0}{}{Ruins (sw,n)}{ }{Approaching what seems to be the wreckage of a once thriving city, you feel your throat well up with sadness as you look upon the massive graveyard that lies before you.  Each step you take makes you wonder how many dead are beneath your feet.  Ashes to ashes as the saying goes, but now you have learned what happens to concrete and metal. Only the forces of time have seen the entirety of this city's fate, and only they will live to see the end of the rest. }{Lost City}{lost_city}{}{}{1.000}{1}
