R {14549}{0}{}{Ruins (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are aghast with horror at the destruction about you.  Long ago this was a city, thriving and growing through the scientific medium of technology.  But now, you see nothing but a collapsed pile of concrete and steel, rusted and falling apart faster than time should allow. Looking up, your view shows nothing more flattering, as the dust of the land just piles up on the ruins, to one day cover them for eternity. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
