R {14550}{0}{}{Ruins (w,s)}{ }{Wandering around the area, the going is quite difficult, but you do somehow manage to notice through it all that this area is relatively well off.  Truthfully it looks like hell, but it looks like a better hell than the rest of this graveyard of steel.  The wind still blows dust into your face and strange creaking noises reach you from every direction, but you're slowly getting used to it you think. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
