R {14551}{0}{}{Ruins (n,e)}{ }{This area is no different from the rest, just piles of rubble and metal. The wind still blows sand in your eyes and movement is tricky as you make your way through.  Still, besides the insects buzzing and the creaking of the metal, you can make out nothing strange.  Yet for some reason you have a feeling of dread here.  It's probably just your imagination, but you never know. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
