R {14552}{0}{}{Ruins (w)}{ }{Moving gingerly into this area, you find yourself in a clearing of sorts. A flat slab of concrete lies on top of all the rubble and looks to have been cleared off.  Strangely, a small campfire is smoldering here, and you wonder who or what would be way out here. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14549}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14553}{0}{}{Ruins (s,e)}{ }{Your progress is halted here as you run into a huge mountain of steel and rubble, piled so high that you imagine some massive buildings must have collapsed here.  Movements seems a bit tricky here, and as you look about, you boggle at the demise of the city. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
