R {14577}{0}{<238>}{Acid Eaten Forests (n,s,w,e)}{<238>( *<088>}{Acid Eaten Forests You've got to wonder how people could let such beauty be destroyed so completely.  Soft, dark earth gives way beneath your feet as you travel through the sickly forests of the northeast.  Since the late twentieth century there have been warnings about the effects of acid rain, but now with the mass increase in industrialization and the radiation, the deforestation is at an all time high.  Yellowed leaves cling to drooping branches in this twisted forest.  To the east and west you barely detect the continuation of the wasteland.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
