R {14582}{0}{}{Inside an abandoned trailer (leave,hole)}{ }{The inside of this trailer home makes you think that this place has been deserted for a very long time. The food that was left in the small kitchenette looks like it dried hard ages ago. The little dinner table has dishes and trash piled all over it. You also notice how grimy and grungy the walls, the stove, the windows, and the linoleum floor are too. Whoever lived here before sure left in a hurry. }{D.C. Megatech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
