R {14590}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (s,n,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Small, rolling hills covered in scraggly grass and weeds march towards the horizon in every direction.  Clouds roll across the sky, carrying with them the faint promise of much needed rain.  Tufts of grass sprout from the gently rolling hills.  Each looks as though it would be considered a weed elsewhere, but out here where water is scarce and the sun bakes the earth, they are a sight for sore eyes.  To the east you almost miss the continuation of the hills.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
