R {14733}{0}{}{A Decimated Room (n,w)}{ }{What happened here after what appears to have been a nuclear war, is unknowable.  There is nothing left in this room except burnt walls.  If it weren't for your adequate spatial sense, you might not be able to tell the walls from the floor or ceiling, they are so evenly blackened.  The faint scent of motor oil is all you even notice. }{Kilton Research, Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
