R {14754}{0}{}{A Janitorial Closet (w)}{ }{A very small closet.  There is barely enough space for you.  The brown wood walls are lined with thin wooden shelves, all of which are bare.  This room appears to have been scrubbed clean.  There is not a scratch or mar to be found. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
