R {14781}{0}{}{The Paper Records Storage Room (s,w)}{ }{Burned and charred papers, cabinets and other now unrecognizable pieces of furniture fill this room.  Nothing at all seems remotely salvageable.  Soot even covers the ceiling.  The burn damage seems to have somehow been contained, because it does not extend to the computer room to the west, or out into the hall to the south. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
