R {14784}{0}{}{A Data Entry Room (s,e)}{ }{Four destroyed computer terminals are mounted on four small metal desks.  The desks appear to be bolted to the walls.  Each terminal seems to have the key components:  a monitor, a CPU, and a keyboard; it is pretty obvious they do not work since every one of them has the glass of the monitor crushed in.  To the south lies what appears to be an office, to the east, another computer room. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
