R {14785}{0}{}{The Records Office (n,s)}{ }{A wooden desk lies in two pieces in the center of the room.  Faded papers have fallen to the ground and cover the blue carpet near the broken desk.  The walls are covered in a once decorative, now mostly shredded wallpaper.  There appears to be a room full of computers to the north, and maybe a waiting room to the south. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
