R {14786}{0}{}{The Records Waiting Room (n,e)}{ }{Several brown couches are pushed into the center of this room.  The cloth covering the couches is torn and covered in dust.  Scattered about are several piles of wood and glass that may have once been other furniture or fixtures.  What looks like an office is to the north, the hallway is to the east. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
