R {14789}{0}{}{A Well-Lit Hallway (n,s,w)}{ }{The hallway leads north and south.  Your view of both directions is clear.  The fluorescent lighting shows that the walls and floor seem to have gone through some sort of war or explosion, char marks scar them.  The cracked glass of the eastern wall is allowing just a hint of sunlight into the hallway.  An office lies to the west.  There used to be a door to it, but now all that remains is the cracked door frame. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
