R {14790}{0}{}{The Bottom of a Stairwell (u,e)}{ }{A gray solid concrete stairwell.  The floor and walls are all unpainted, uncovered concrete.  A stairwell leads up from here.  A black, metal hand rail runs up the stairway, the paint is flaking off. The large metal door in the east wall is dented in, but somehow remains on its hinges. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
