R {14791}{0}{}{A Stairwell (d,e)}{ }{A gray, solid concrete stairwell.  The floor and walls are all unpainted, uncovered concrete.  The air is cold and musty.  A stairway leads down from here.  A black, metal handrail runs down the stairway, and the paint is flaking off.  There is an open doorway to the east from which there seems to be some activity. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
