R {14792}{0}{}{A Corner in a Well-Lit Hallway (n,e)}{ }{The hallway heads north and east.  You can see far down the hall in either direction  due to the fluorescent lighting.  To the west and south the white wall, with its char marks and gouges, forms the outside corner of the hall, while to the east a glass wall picks up at the inside corner. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
