R {14793}{0}{}{A Secretary's Office (s,e)}{ }{This part of the office is in complete disarray.  The metal desk is bent in half, and the berber carpeting is shredded in various places.  The only thing that seems to not be destroyed is the black telephone mounted on the far wall.  The door frame leading to the hallway is to the east and the offices continues south. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
