R {14794}{0}{}{A Secretary's Office (s,n)}{ }{This is the rear half of a secretary's office.  The floor is almost completely covered in old yellowed papers.  A blue berber carpet is visible on the floor in the few places that the papers do not conceal. The office continues to the north and a vinyl floor picks up to the south. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14793}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
