R {14795}{0}{}{The Secretary's Break Room (n,e)}{ }{The vinyl floor is torn and ragged in many places in this room.  There is a counter on the far wall, above which is mounted a small cabinet.  A small metal sink is set into the counter.  Next to the counter a white refrigerator is leaning at an angle, propped against the wall next to it.  Several mostly unrecognizable objects sit on the counter. There appears to be carpeted offices both to the east and north of here. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14794}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14796}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14796}{0}{}{A Secretary's Office (w,e)}{ }{This portion of the office looks to at some point have been the work space for a secretary.  A chair-level shelf is against one wall. Next to the shelf is a black metal filing cabinet.  The cabinet is on its side and yellowed papers spill out of it.  The dark blue berber carpet continues to the east, but to the west the flooring changes. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14795}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14797}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14797}{0}{}{A Secretary's Office (n,w)}{ }{This office looks to have been thoroughly trashed.  A large metal desk is thrown on its side and rests next to the far wall.  A scorched blue desk chair is sitting in the center of the floor.  A dark blue berber carpet covers the concrete floor wherever it has not been torn or burned away.  An empty door frame to the north leads out into the hallway and the office continues to the west. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14796}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14743}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14798}{0}{}{Security Station (n,s,w)}{ }{A large room dedicated to the security of the upper floors of the building.  A counter is in the center of the room.  The stairway down is to the west.  You can tell there is something important to the north and south, because the room is designed to make it hard to see into them.  The counter is positioned such that the your line of sight is cut off around the corner. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
