R {14799}{0}{}{Mainframe Room (s)}{ }{The room has a drop ceiling and a raised floor.  The floor and ceiling are both comprised of white plastic tiles.  The hum of computers and fans provides an almost serene environment.  There is a very large mainframe against the west wall, other than that, the room is bare and spotless. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
