R {14802}{0}{}{A Lunch Room (n,s)}{ }{This room is basically a small kitchenette.  It has a refrigerator, a microwave, and a coffee pot.  Just about anything that could be useful for storing or eating lunch is available.  The white tile floor makes the room appear quite bright. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
