R {14804}{0}{}{A Large Office (s)}{ }{You are in a large, neatly kept office.  The office opens up to a lab to the south, and there is a solid metal door to the east.  A small card-reader is mounted next to the door.  A large metal desk, covered in papers, sits in one corner.  A bulletin board covered in charts on the west wall.  There is also a large black chair sitting on the floor in front of the desk. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
