R {14805}{0}{}{A Large Laboratory (s,w)}{ }{You are standing in a large laboratory of some sort.  The floor is covered in cracked white tile and the walls are covered with burn marks.  One large bench is smashed against the far wall.  There are what appear to be pieces of androids littering the floor. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14804}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
