R {14806}{0}{}{A Stairwell (u,n)}{ }{A gray, solid concrete stairwell.  The floor and walls are all unpainted, uncovered concrete.  The air is cold and musty.  A stairway leads up from here.  A black, metal handrail runs up the stairway, and the paint is flaking off.  There is an open doorway to the north. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14805}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14807}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14807}{0}{}{A Stairwell (d)}{ }{A gray, solid concrete stairwell.  The floor and walls are all unpainted, uncovered concrete.  The air is cold and musty.  A stairway leads down from here.  A black, metal handrail runs down the stairway, and the paint is flaking off.  There is a smooth metal door sealing the west doorway. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
