R {14808}{0}{}{Waiting Room (n,s,e)}{ }{This is a very nice waiting room.  There is an old couch against one wall and a table with some magazines on it in the corner.  The only thing odd is that both the north and south rooms appear to be charred and destroyed. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
