R {14809}{0}{}{A Decimated Room (s,w)}{ }{The prior use of this room is completely indiscernible.  The room is destroyed.  The walls have huge gouges in them, and huge piles of debris and char cover the floor.  The smell of burnt flesh is enough to nearly make you retch. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14808}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
