R {14810}{0}{}{A Decimated Room (n,w)}{ }{What happened here after what appears to have been a nuclear war, is unknowable.  There is nothing left in this room except burnt walls.  If it weren't for your adequate spatial sense, you might not be able to tell the walls from the floor or ceiling, they are so evenly blackened.  The faint scent of motor oil is all you even notice. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14808}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14811}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14811}{0}{}{A Prototype Room (e)}{ }{This room appears to be some sort of main or central area.  You are not sure what that means or entails, but the display terminals here are spitting out data at an even more incredible pace than the other rooms.  Various cubby holes and extrusions can be found all over, their use, quite unfathomable. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14810}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14812}{0}{}{A Prototype Room (s,e)}{ }{You are standing in a very large and very high-tech room.  Technology that is so advanced it appears alien, covers the walls.  Lights flash on the various displays.  Letters and symbols scroll across display terminals in various directions, faster than humanly possible to read. Various cubby holes and extrusions can be found all over, their use, quite unfathomable. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14809}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14813}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14813}{0}{}{A Prototype Room (n)}{ }{You are standing in a very large and very high-tech room.  Technology that is so advanced it appears alien, covers the walls.  Lights flash on the various displays.  Letters and symbols scroll across display terminals in various directions, faster than humanly possible to read. Various cubby holes and extrusions can be found all over, their use, quite unfathomable. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14812}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14814}{0}{<238>}{Acid Eaten Forests (s,e)}{<238>( *<088>}{Acid Eaten Forests Drops of water fall from the leaves above and stain your clothes a dark sickly color, a sure sign of the pollution they carry.  Leaves rustle softly in a faint wind, a portent of the storm to come.  A storm which will only drown this area in more toxic rains.  Dark clouds blanket the sky, blotting out the sun and only making this desolate forest that much more depressing.  To the south and east you barely detect the continuation of the wasteland.  The grimy waters of Lake Erie stretch out to the north and west. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14615}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14742}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14815}{0}{<238>}{Tree Stumps (s)}{<238>( *<088>}{Even though the trees here are impressively tall, with so many dead stumps and the almost complete lack of animal life, you'd swear you were looking at a petrified forest. You'd swear you had seen a spot of green, but everything seems to be the color of the dust clouds... }{The Fern Man}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14613}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {14816}{0}{<238>}{Acid Eaten Forests (n,s,w)}{<238>( *<088>}{Acid Eaten Forests Weak and sagging trees march along the hillsides.  Drops of water fall from the leaves above and stain your clothes a dark sickly color, a sure sign of the pollution they carry.  Soft, dark earth gives way beneath your feet as you travel through the sickly forests of the northeast.  Since the late twentieth century there have been warnings about the effects of acid rain, but now with the mass increase in industrialization and the radiation, the deforestation is at an all time high.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
