R {14818}{0}{<238>}{Acid Eaten Forests (n,s,w,e)}{<238>( *<088>}{Acid Eaten Forests Soft, dark earth gives way beneath your feet as you travel through the sickly forests of the northeast.  Since the late twentieth century there have been warnings about the effects of acid rain, but now with the mass increase in industrialization and the radiation, the deforestation is at an all time high.  You've got to wonder how people could let such beauty be destroyed so completely.  Dark clouds blanket the sky, blotting out the sun and only making this desolate forest that much more depressing.  }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
