R {14826}{0}{}{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal (d,n)}{ }{This large passageway echos with the sounds of a loud subway train. The shiny metal and plastic walls reflect all sound and most of the light that streams in from the large chamber to the north. You notice large plexiglass windows set deep into the walls here. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
