R {14827}{0}{}{Under the Terminal (e,u)}{ }{You're standing somewhere below the Northern Expansion Terminal of the HTC. Large metal poles come down out of the ceiling here and continue on through the floor. Occasionally you can hear the sound of the subway trains arriving and departing overhead. The surrounding walls seem to be very smooth even though they had to have been blasted from the rock here. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
