R {14828}{0}{<278>}{Wastelands (u,d,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{			Wastelands You stand in front of a very large shining structure. It is made out of a metal that looks to be almost glowing. You can see a huge tube coming up out of the ground and connecting to the rest of the structure and then running back into the ground. The rest of the surrounding countryside looks the same as all the rest of the Wastelands, barren and desolate. There is a large metal stairway going up into the structure here and running down below it. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
