R {14829}{0}{}{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal (d,e)}{ }{You find yourself in a long metal passageway that seems to lead into the center of this gleaming structure. Everything looks so new around here. It's hard to believe that anyone would want to build something new out in the middle of nowhere. Light streams in from the central hall to the east, as well as a multitude of very loud noises. There is a large metal door to your south. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
