R {14830}{0}{}{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are standing on a long platform. You can see a huge tunnel stretching away from you in both directions. There are passageways leading off in several directions from here. Tall pillars and arches rise up over the platform, supporting it as the trains come up out of the ground to here, and then back out. The walls gleam from the golden lights that hang from central positions on the ceiling. This place looks shiny and new. There is a large electronic sign flashing at you from one of the walls. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
