R {14842}{0}{}{Under the Terminal (s,u)}{ }{A smooth and shiny stone tunnel stretches out before you. To the south you can see a great deal of light. There is a flight of metal stairs that goes up from here to the surface. You can tell that you're directly below the Houston Northern Expansion Terminal from all the noise that's coming down from above and from all of the metal beams and pipes that have been drilled down through the ceiling and floor. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14840}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
