R {14843}{0}{}{Under the Terminal (sw,se,nw,ne,n,s,e,w)}{ }{You find yourself standing at what appears to be a crossroads of tunnels. The tunnels are large and square shaped and head off in many directions. A huge amount of light is coming from one of the passages to the southwest which is illuminating this and the rest of the tunnels. The light reflects off of the smooth shiny rock walls. You also notice many metal beams and poles coming down out of the ceiling here and going through the floor. The distant sound of the Houston bullet train arriving and departing echos down these tunnels every now and again. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
