R {14858}{0}{<238>}{The Rocky Mountains (n,s,e,w)}{<238>.^.<088>}{The Rocky Mountains The trees here are tall and sparsely foliated, the effects of radiation and pollution taking their toll.  You wonder if they will ever grow into the lush, verdant forest that once stood here.  Storm clouds hang high on the mountain peaks, dark with rain or snow.  The mountains around you rise and fall in a never ending pattern.  To the west you sort of see the continuation of the Rockies.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
