R {14860}{0}{<238>}{The Rocky Mountains (s,n,e,w)}{<238>.^.<088>}{The Rocky Mountains Naked soil shifts beneath your feet, a true sign of the desolation wrought here.  Huge boulders have been pounded to rubble leaving only small pebbles strewn about you.  Some great force has ravaged the landscape.  Snow capped mountain peaks rise in the distance, a reminder of a once pure world.  To the south and west you vaguely detect the continuation of the Rockies.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
