R {14874}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (n,s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Gently rolling hills stretch out towards the horizon.  Tufts of grass sprout from the gently rolling hills.  Each looks as though it would be considered a weed elsewhere, but out here where water is scarce and the sun bakes the earth, they are a sight for sore eyes.  The soft ground is a comfort beneath your feet, a sure sign that life will continue to flourish here, even if it is only scrubgrass.  To the north you vaguely sense the continuation of the hills.   }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
