R {15031}{0}{}{*{ An examination room }* (stairs,s)}{ }{*{ An examination room }* You have entered what used to be a doctor's examining room.  There is a long, bare metal table running down the center of the room with some apparatus on it.  Cabinets line the walls, all of them with conspicuous locks.  Bright fluorescent lights glare from overhead, providing a cold illumination to the room.  Almost unnoticed in the corner is a small staircase leading up. }{Drug Lab}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
