R {15032}{0}{}{Foyer & Reception (e,n)}{ }{Gazing around this austere foyer, several objects catch your attention.  A large desk sits opposite the main entrance and the floor is covered by plush grey carpet.  With your back to the main entrance, a poster occupies the wall to your left, a plaque is visible to the right of the main desk and a holographic display occupies a pride of place in the centre of the room.  A security station sits in an alcove to your right, the main glass double doors of the office lie behind you and soft light shines down from fluorescent bulbs in the ceiling. }{European Robotics - Survey, Design and Development Office}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15029}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15034}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
