R {15033}{0}{}{*{ A doctor's office }* (stairs)}{ }{*{ A doctor's office }* This room was probably a doctor's office at one point, but is now the base for a very different kind of business.  The room is dimly lit by a couple of old-fashioned incandescent lamps.  The furnishings have seen more than their share of use, but judging by the clutter on the floor, the current occupant doesn't much care.  The room is dominated by a large wooden desk. }{Drug Lab}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15031}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
