E {15035}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15035}{0}{}{A short hallway (s,n,e,w)}{ }{Leading from the foyer, past some small offices to a dead-end, this hallway has the familiar grey carpet and white walls that you've seen elsewhere in this building.  There are two offices coming off this section of hallway and two more attached to the dead-end at the end of the hall. }{European Robotics - Survey, Design and Development Office}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
