R {15037}{0}{}{The Design office (w)}{ }{An open doorway separates this room from the hallway outside. A plain metal and plastic desk sits close to the far wall and an executive chair sits behind it.  In front of the desk are two moulded plastic chairs.  Spread out upon the desk, you can see some sort of floor plan.  The white synthstone walls are unadorned and the grey carpet is soft beneath your feet. }{European Robotics - Survey, Design and Development Office}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15035}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15038}{0}{}{The Survey office (e)}{ }{An open doorway separates this room from the hallway outside. A plain metal and plastic desk sits close to the far wall and an executive chair has been placed behind it.  In front of the desk are two moulded plastic chairs.  The only item that mars the perfection of the white synthstone walls is a map of Detroit.  The grey carpet and fluorescent lights make this office seem familiar. }{European Robotics - Survey, Design and Development Office}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15035}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15039}{0}{}{The Corporate Liaison office (w)}{ }{An open doorway separates this room from the hallway outside. A plain metal and plastic desk sits close to the far wall and an executive chair has been placed behind it.  In front of the desk are two moulded plastic chairs.  The only unusual thing about this room is that there is a vidphone and fax machine on the desk.  Aside from that, the carpet, walls and ceiling are all the same. }{European Robotics - Survey, Design and Development Office}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
