R {15040}{0}{}{The Hiring office (e)}{ }{An open doorway separates this room from the hallway outside. At the far end of the office you can see a hologram generator, similar to the one found in the foyer.  The same white synthstone walls, grey carpet and fluorescent lights mark this office as elsewhere in the building. }{European Robotics - Survey, Design and Development Office}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
