R {15082}{0}{}{A grimy hallway (s,n,e,w)}{ }{Wooden walls covered in peeling paint line this long hallway.  The carpet is relatively intact but dirty and very worn.  A single electric light bulb illuminates an alcove to the east and an open doorway to the west.  From within the doorway, you can hear the sound of voices. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
