E {15083}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15084}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15085}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15083}{0}{}{The end of the hallway (stairs,s,e,w)}{ }{A rickety set of stairs leading upwards lies at the end of the hall.  This area is lit by a single electric bulb, but you almost wish it weren't.  To the west, you can see some sort of communal area.  East, an open doorway reveals a communal bunk room. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15082}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15088}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
