E {15090}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15088}{u}{stairs}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15084}{0}{}{A dirty eating area (s,w)}{ }{This grubby little alcove is barely large enough to hold a small table and four dirty chairs.  The linoleum covering the floor is cracked and grimy and the walls bear signs of water damage.  A single bulb above the dividing counter illuminates both this area and the kitchen to the south. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15082}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15086}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15085}{0}{}{A TV room (e)}{ }{The TV room is connected by an open doorway to the hallway outside.  A single, overstuffed lounge takes pride of place in front of a battered TV set.  There seems to be no water damage to the carpet and the walls.  You are almost surprised by the lack of mildew.  A single bulb sheds pale light into this room and a doorway leads east into the hall. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15082}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15086}{0}{}{A kitchen of sorts (e,n)}{ }{This small but functional kitchen contains an old stove, some wooden cabinets and a noisy, battered refrigerator.  The tops of the cabinets and the counter separating the kitchen from the dining alcove all look to have been used for food preparation.  You can clearly hear the scratching of rats from somewhere nearby. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15084}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15087}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15087}{0}{}{The gang's bar (w)}{ }{More of an alcove to the kitchen than a separate room, this area is dominated by a drinks cabinet and a wooden bar.  The floor is carpeted and the walls painted, but you think they won't stay that way for long.  Water damage is very apparent in large patches of damp and mildew and the carpet is rotting in places.  The room is illuminated by a single light bulb in the centre of the ceiling. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15086}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15088}{0}{}{A landing on the first floor (stairs,s,e,w)}{ }{The quiet hum of air-conditioning emanates from the ceiling and you notice that the air is not humid at all.  In contrast with the squalor of the ground floor, this landing and the adjacent rooms are immaculate and well-maintained.  While the walls and ceiling are still primarily wooden, a fluorescent light illuminates the landing and reveals that the carpet is new. You can see that there are small rooms to the west and east of this landing and a large room to the south. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15094}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15095}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15096}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15083}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15083}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15089}{0}{}{A communal bunk room (e,w)}{ }{Four wooden single beds take up most of the space at this end of a large room.  At the eastern end, you can see another four bunks.  Each bed has a mouldy mattress and the smell of mildew is so strong that you wonder how anyone could possibly sleep here.  This room is dirty, dingy and the paint is peeling from the walls and the ceiling.  All in all, not a very comfortable sleeping area. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15083}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15091}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15090}{0}{}{A communal recreation area (e)}{ }{The recreation area is largely open to the hallway to the east.  Hanging from the ceiling near the south wall is a punching bag of the old canvas type.  In the centre of the room is a padded bench complete with weights set and the northwest corner boasts a dart board.  Remarkably, this room seems to have escaped most of the water damage infecting the rest of this building. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15083}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15091}{0}{}{A communal bunk room (s,w)}{ }{Four wooden single beds take up most of the space at this end of a large room.  At the western end, you can see another four bunks.  Each bed has a mouldy mattress and the smell of mildew is so strong that you wonder how anyone could possibly sleep here.  This room is dirty, dingy and the paint is peeling from the walls and the ceiling.  All in all, not a very comfortable sleeping area.  South of here is a small room that smells of fine machine oil. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15089}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15092}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15092}{0}{}{A small armoury (n)}{ }{In contrast with the external rooms, this armoury is in excellent repair.  There is no evidence of water damage, the floor is tiled and clean and the paint on the walls looks relatively new.  Several empty racks hang on the east wall and a workbench runs along the south wall. An open doorway leads to a communal bunk room to the north. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15091}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15093}{0}{}{A private workshop (ne,n)}{ }{This small workshop is dimly lit by a single fluorescent light.  The walls have been painted black and the doorway positioned to minimise incoming light.  Just north of here is a bed chamber.  This room is filled with strange equipment, monitors and tools.  You aren't completely certain about the purpose of any of it, but if you had to guess, it would be for repairing complex mechanical devices like cyberware. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15094}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15097}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15094}{0}{}{A communal room (sw,n)}{ }{This large room has an exit southwest into what appears to be a workshop.  North are the stairs leading down to the ground floor.  Set around a central coffee table are a long, leather lounge and two single-seater leather chairs.  You can see a table-tennis table against one wall.  The room is lit by several fluorescent lights and the walls are wood-paneled. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15088}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15093}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15095}{0}{}{A guardroom leading into a hallway (s,w)}{ }{This small guardroom is situated at the intersection of a short hallway leading south and an alcove connecting to the landing.  There is a small desk against one wall with a chair positioned in front of it so that an occupant could see the landing easily.  The walls are wood paneled and bare and the floor is covered in grey carpet.  A single fluorescent light illuminates this room. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15088}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15098}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15096}{0}{}{A small guardroom (e)}{ }{The small desk in this guardroom is littered with mangled pieces of wire.  At first glance, their purpose isn't obvious at all.  In front of the desk, a low stool has been placed in such a position that an occupant could observe the landing outside.  The rest of the room is neat, but unadorned. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15088}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15097}{0}{}{A small bedroom (s)}{ }{This room contains an old-fashioned, double waterbed and little else.  Faded posters of 20th century movies adorn the walls and there seems to be some sort of still in one corner of the room.  Near the doorway is a light switch and the fluorescent light above you is dark. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15093}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15098}{0}{}{An intersection of corridors (n,e,sw,se)}{ }{This area looks and feels like a foyer of sorts.  Short hallways run southwest and southeast to stairs and a computer room respectively.  The south wall is blank and entirely paneled in wood.  East of here, you can see a bunk room and north is the guard room near the stairs down to the ground floor. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15095}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15099}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15100}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15101}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15104}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15099}{0}{}{A communal bunk room on the first floor (n,w)}{ }{This medium sized room has four double bunks.  All of the bunks have been neatly made and each has two footlockers beside it.  The room is wood paneled and painted white.  Grey carpet covers the floor and light comes from the fluorescent bulb on the ceiling.  To the north, the room continues and contains another four bunks. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15098}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15103}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15100}{0}{<278>}{Newly repaired stairs (stairs,ne)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The stairs here look similar to the stairs on the ground floor, save that they have been repaired, repainted and look stable enough to walk on.  There is not much else to this area, the stairs seem to lead upwards to another landing. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15098}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15102}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15102}{s}{stairs}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15101}{0}{}{A quietly humming computer room (nw)}{ }{This small room is immaculately clean and lit by soft, fluorescent lighting.  The carpet is grey and the walls have been painted white.  A single long desk lies along the east wall.  On the desk are two computer monitors that currently display Paradigm, the virtual coding engine of the DataNet.  Whoever works in here has access to some pretty high level tech.  There is a single chair in the room, facing both of the monitors. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15098}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15102}{0}{<278>}{A quiet landing on the second floor (stairs,e,w,s)}{<278>.@.<088>}{       The hum of air-conditioning is muted by the thick carpet.  Unlike the first floor, the carpet is plush.  It is still light grey and spotlessly clean.  The walls are a pastel blue colour and the area is lit by a fluorescent light.  You can see a small alcove to the south and a hallway extends both east and west.  In both of those directions you can see and hear computer equipment.  The impression you get is of understated competence. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
