R {15104}{0}{}{A small, metal lift (n)}{ }{This small elevator is made entirely of polished metal.  Two buttons shine steadily from near the door and a fluorescent light shines down from a panel set into the ceiling. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
