R {15105}{0}{}{A well-lit basement corridor (n)}{ }{The walls of this corridor are made entirely of polished metal and the floor is thickly carpeted in blue.  Fluorescent lights are mounted on the ceiling and you can see a button at the southern end of the corridor. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
