R {15107}{0}{}{Monitoring room in the basement (s,ne,nw)}{ }{Like the other rooms in this basement, this room is completely walled in polished metal.  A single, fluorescent light is fixed to the ceiling and it illuminates a desk with a bank of three monitors.  A short corridor runs south and this room opens up to the northeast and northwest. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
