R {15108}{0}{}{A spartan bedchamber (w,sw)}{<118>A<088>}{This must be the most empty bedroom you've ever seen.  It is simply carpeted floor with a pallet in one corner surrounded by blank walls of polished metal.  The room opens southwest and west and you feel almost overwhelmed by this much space. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{azrael}{}{}{1.000}{1}
