R {15125}{0}{}{Control Bunker (u)}{ }{This cool, tiny, dusty bunker must have served some important purpose before the apocalypse hit.  Now, its contents have been destroyed.  Debris covers the floor of the small room, and the cinder block walls have been defaced with graffiti.  The only things left marginally intact are a telephone jack set in one wall, and a dented metal panel set into another.  A staircase leads back up to the surface. }{Hidden Bunkers}{hidden_bunkers}{}{}{1.000}{1}
