R {15294}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,nw)}{ }{You are walking through a dark, damp sewer. Rats scurry at your feet and noxious fumes bombard your senses. Water drips from the ceiling which echos off the walls. To the northwest, you can make out some light. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15290}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15298}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15295}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (e,w)}{ }{You nearly trip over a rock as you make your way through the tunnel. You find yourself grasping the wall for balance as to prevent falling flat on your face. It's quite dark so it's hard to tell what lay ahead. You think you hear noises, though it's hard to place where they are coming from. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15293}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15296}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15296}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,e)}{ }{This newly excavated tunnel smells just as pungent as the rest. It is damp and dark in here, not to mention that you are starting to get tired of tripping over all this debris. It is also unsettling when you feel something brush against your feet, most likely unwanted vermin. You hear voices coming from the south. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15295}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15297}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15297}{0}{}{A dead end (n)}{ }{You've reached a dead end. It looks like whoever dug this place stopped here. It's apparent why since there is a manhole in the center of the room. It wasn't uncommon for there to be sewers built up on top of one another but seems kind of strange at the same time. Might be worth a look. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15296}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15301}{climb down}{climb down}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15301}{d}{climb down}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15298}{0}{}{A dead end (n)}{ }{You are walking through a dark, damp sewer. You hear strange noises and man, it stinks down here! You have obviously hit a dead end since there's a wall blocking your way. Might not be a bad idea to go back the way you came. Those noises seem to be getting closer. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15294}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15322}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15299}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s)}{ }{You have arrived at a small shelter, probably some poor survivor's last retreat. Scattered on the floor are some clothes and a ratty old bed. How could anyone live with that foul stench? }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15292}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15300}{0}{}{A looted room (w)}{ }{Someone obviously made his home here quite a while ago, as you can tell from the remains of a bed and other furniture that are scattered on the ground. Whatever was left behind has been completely looted or broken. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15292}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15301}{0}{}{An abandoned sewer tunnel (u,e)}{ }{After gathering your bearings, you notice that you've entered a much older sewer system. The construction is similar to the sewer above, however it is in much more disrepair. The walls contain several cracks which are wide in some places and just beginning in others. An old rusted ladder is bolted to the wall and a tunnel opens up to the east. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15297}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15302}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15302}{0}{}{An abandoned sewer tunnel (n,w,e)}{ }{The sewer branches out in three directions. West takes you back to the entrance, while either going east or north takes you further into the tunnels. A strong odor permeates the corridor leaving your stomach less than appeased, while strange scraping sounds echo throughout. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15301}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15303}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15304}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15303}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,e)}{ }{The sounds of your footfalls echo down the tunnel. The smell is nauseating. A modern sewer probably smells better than this. It's obvious that the strange inhabitants of these old sewers are causing this wretched stench. It's amazing that the rats can tolerate the smell, but then again, they're rats. Anything is possible. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15302}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15305}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15304}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,w,e)}{ }{The darkness casts eerie shadows on the walls. A rat skitters past your feet, stopping to take a drink from a murky puddle. Water drops rhythmically from the ceiling hitting the puddle with a slight splash. The tunnel branches off in three directions. West leads back to the entrance or south and east take you further in. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15302}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15307}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
