R {15305}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (w,e)}{ }{You suddenly feel as if the walls are closing in on you as you try and feel your way through the dark. Shuffling noises echo throughout disorienting your sense of direction. Going back doesn't sound like such a bad idea. You jump when you realize that you have bumped into a body laying haplessly on the ground. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15303}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15306}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15306}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,w,e)}{ }{You can smell the dampness in the air, which is stagnant and old. The ground beneath your feet crunches as you step on dried out twigs and leaves; mere remnants of a past that no longer exists. This area branches out in three directions, though they all look equally uninviting. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
