R {15307}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The lack of light forms strange shadows, not to mention that every little noise seems to echo off the walls. The tunnels branch out in all directions leaving you several choices of where to turn next. The smell of sulfur is strong here, which is making your gag reflex go into over-drive. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
