R {15308}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,w,e)}{ }{You are in an old sewer tunnel that seems to go on forever. The dampness in the air feels old and musty causing you to cough every now and then. A water droplet hits your head from above. An innocent squeak calls out from the south, which echoes throughout the area. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
