R {15309}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The tunnels branch out in all directions, making it seem like an endless maze of twists and turns. Strange noises continue to echo throughout making it impossible to pinpoint which direction sounds are coming from or to distinguish whether a rat squeak is actually a rat squeak. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
