R {15310}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,w)}{ }{You find yourself in the northeastern corner of this old sewer. Oddly, the ground is less compacted than in other areas. The longer you stand in one place the more your feet sink into the sludge. A steady stream of water pours down from the ceiling aiding the mud further. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
