R {15311}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,s,w)}{ }{Not surprising, these tunnels are all starting to look the same. Fortunately, the cracks in the walls are all just a little bit different from one another. The tunnels branch off in all directions, however, the east tunnel looks like it has caved in and may not be passable. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
