R {15312}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,s)}{ }{Strange shuffling noises vibrate the ground beneath your feet. Dust falls down from the ceiling onto your head. Whatever is causing the strange noise has probably been the culprit of all this structural damage. It's surprising that there haven't been more cave-ins, or that the whole sewer hasn't collapsed. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
