R {15313}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,s,w)}{ }{Walking along, your footfalls echo down the corridors which make the rats stir and squeak back at you. The darkness lends itself to the eeriness that dwells within the tunnels and casts strange shadows everywhere you go. This place doesn't seem habitable, even by rodents. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
