R {15314}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The walls are slimy and cold as you run your hand along them to help maintain some balance. The ground is uneven and along with the darkness makes it difficult to stay on two feet. You hear a crunch as you snap a dried out twig in half. You have four directions to choose from. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
