R {15315}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,w,e)}{ }{The tunnels seem to go in every direction. Looking around it would seem that it would be easy to get lost down here. Yet, you keep moving completely drawn by curiosity to figure out just what it is that lurks within these sewers. A rat seem to follow you, perhaps hoping for a scrap of food. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
