R {15316}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (s,e)}{ }{You find yourself in the southwestern corner of the sewer system. The air is thick and it smells like mold and sulfur mixed together. It is so rancid down here that a morgue probably smells better. You have the option of going east or south.  It looks as if the ground has been disturbed recently. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
