R {15317}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,e)}{ }{It is somewhat confining walking down this passage. The walls seem narrower, the ceiling almost touches your head and the ground seems lopsided. The layers beneath you probably contain many secrets of a long forgotten history, or perhaps nothing but layers of dirt. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
