R {15318}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (w,e)}{ }{Walking along, you jump as you get caught up in a spider web. Its owner scurries down the wall and out of sight. You kick up dirt as you walk, which adds to the dust already in the air. You can either go east or west, but neither look very inviting. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
