R {15319}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,w,e)}{ }{You find yourself in the southern portion of this old sewer system. The darkness casts eerie shadows everywhere making a small bug seem huge. Not to mention that every little sound is amplified as well. The tunnel opens up in three directions here. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
