R {15320}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,w,e)}{ }{The smell is twice as rancid in this area for some reason. You find it hard to breathe and the air is thick. Combined with the sulfurous stench, your gag reflex has gone into overdrive. A rat stops to sniff at a pile of rubbish but is disappointed when it finds nothing edible. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
