R {15321}{0}{}{An old sewer tunnel (n,w)}{ }{You are in the southeastern corner of this stench-ridden sewer and it looks like you just stepped into a crime scene. A big puddle of blood has settled in the middle of the dirt, but there's no sign of a body anywhere, at least nowhere obvious. Perhaps it would be wise to walk away before whatever caused this comes back. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
