R {15322}{0}{}{hidden room in sewer (n)}{ }{You have stumbled into the hidden living room of a survivor. There are some empty crates as well as a worn bed and rusty tools in here. This is probably the nicest looking shelter you've seen in this whole drab place. Still not what you would consider a home. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
