R {15374}{0}{}{SolChem stairwell (s,u,d)}{ }{This stairwell leading up and down must once have been sterile and bleach-white, but it is now filthy and repulsive, dirt and graffiti covering all the walls. Under the graffiti you make out an arrow pointing up saying "Administration" and one pointing down saying "R&D". }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15375}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15384}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15385}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15375}{0}{}{T-intersection (n,w,e)}{ }{You've come to a T-intersection just after the SolChem lobby, which lies to the west.  A corridor continues to the east, and to the north you see a stairwell.  On the wall an arrow pointing east says "Production". Another arrow pointing north says "Administration and R&D". }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
