E {15374}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15376}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15376}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (s,n,w)}{ }{You are standing in a huge production hall.  In the middle, to the east of you, stands a huge tank in which you figure chemicals were mixed up and turned into whatever they mass-produced here.  The walls are covered with crude graffiti and drawings. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15375}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15377}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15378}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15377}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (n,e)}{ }{This is the southwest corner of SolChem's production floor.  This must once have been a spotfree place of wonder, but those days are long past, the walls now being covered with graffiti.  Dominating the production floor is a huge chemical mixing tank, to your northeast. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15376}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15379}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15378}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (s,e)}{ }{This is the northwest corner of the SolChem production floor.  Grit and grime covers the walls, as well as colorful graffiti.  A chemical mixing tank dominates the floor, to your southeast. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15376}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15383}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15379}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (w,e)}{ }{You are at the south wall of SolChem's production floor.  You can tell nothing has been produced here for a long time, because no equipment remains, and what was once clean white walls are now covered with graffiti.  Dominating the hall is a huge tank used for mixing mass produced chemicals.  It is to the north of you. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15377}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15380}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15380}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (n,w)}{ }{Grit and grime and graffiti covers the southeast corner of the SolChem production floor.  Blocking your view to the northwest is a huge tank for mixing chemicals.  To the north you see some piping and machinery attached to it. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15379}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15381}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15381}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (n,s)}{<108>H<088>}{Here thick piping with attached gauges runs into the tank.  Machinery which was once probably attached to the pipe lays broken on the floor. This must have been where the finished chemicals were drained from the tank. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15380}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15382}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
