R {15382}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (w,s)}{ }{You have come to the northeast corner of the SolChem production hall. What was once a perfectly clean production site is now just run down and covered with graffiti.  Taking up most of the hall is a chemical mixing tank, to your southwest.  To the south you can make out some sort of machinery attached to the tank. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15381}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15383}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15383}{0}{}{SolChem production floor (w,e)}{ }{You are at the north wall of the SolChem production floor.  The once clinical cleanliness of this place is now but a faded memory.  Taking up much of the room to the south is a chemical mixing tank. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15382}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15378}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15384}{0}{}{Top of the stairwell (e,d)}{ }{This is the top of the stairwell, the administrative floor; this is where the suits worked.  A door leads to the administrative offices. A lot of graffiti covers the walls here, as well as the door.  There is a card slot next to the door.  The door is closed. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15374}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15387}{e}{insert card;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15385}{0}{}{Bottom of the stairwell (e,u)}{ }{You are at the very bottom of the stairs; the basement level, where R&D took place.  A door leads east, to the lab.  There is a card slot here, next to the door.  The door is closed. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15374}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15386}{e}{insert card;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15386}{0}{}{SolChem R&D floor (w,e)}{ }{Finally, you are in the research & development department of SolChem. This place is a mess.  Broken bottles clutter the floor, a bad smell hangs in the air, and there is smoke everywhere.  Apparently, someone has been doing some experiments, though the SolChem researchers have been long gone.  There is a button here, controlling the door. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15385}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15394}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15387}{0}{}{SolChem administrative floor (s,w,e)}{ }{This is the first cubicle on the SolChem administrative level.  Though the cubicles are still here, everything has been removed and changed. Now strange and complicated equipment for a purpose of which you have no clue is arranged on the desks.  The cleanliness of this level strikes you as odd, the rest of this place being so dirty.  To the west is the stairwell leading down.  There is a button controlling the door here. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15384}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15390}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15391}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15388}{0}{}{Inside the chemical mixing tank (out)}{ }{You are inside the chemical mixing tank.  It looks like someone made this their home; there is graffiti on the walls, on the floor of the tank is someone's bedding.  The smell is really bad in here, you doubt the inhabitant cleaned it out much before turning into a home. A round hole in the tank leading into a pipe forms a tunnel, and the only exit out. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15381}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15381}{u}{out}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15389}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {15390}{0}{}{SolChem administrations floor (e,n)}{ }{You have come to a cubicle in the southwest corner of this floor. A large desk dominates this cubicle.  It is covered with papers. The cubicle contains nothing much else. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15387}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15392}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15391}{0}{}{SolChem administrative floor (s,w)}{ }{You have come to a cubicle in the northeast corner of this floor. A large desk dominates this cubicle.  It is covered with papers. The cubicle contains nothing much else. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15387}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15392}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15392}{0}{}{SolChem administrative floor (s,n,w)}{ }{Here sat the vice president of SolChem.  You are in the largest cubicle you've seen, but it is still no office.  The only one who got his own office at SolChem was the president, whose office lies to the south, as indicated by the text "President" on the open door. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15391}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15393}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15390}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15393}{0}{}{SolChem president's office (n)}{ }{In the past days of SolChem production glory, the president of the company sat in this spacious office.  The old SolChem president is long gone, though, and the regional leader of the DMR occupies it now.  The desk of the old president is still here, of course, being oak and surely weighing several tons. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15392}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15394}{0}{}{SolChem R&D floor (w)}{ }{This is where the SolChem research and development took place.  Now the DMR do their R&D here.  A desk with all sorts of test tubes, chemicals, beakers and bottles is here, all of them unlabeled.  You gather that they are not finished products, but rather raw materials. }{SolChem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15386}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15395}{0}{<238>}{Desolate plains (s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Desolate plains Could it be your imagination, or is that the smell of burning flesh?  A foul wind whips by you as you survey this desolate landscape.  You catch the smell of something rancid burning. You probably don't want to find out what it could be that could be burning.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15366}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15396}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15373}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15396}{0}{<238>}{Desolate plains (s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Desolate plains Before you stretches a vast expanse of destruction and desolation.  You see a bright flash of light far in the distance. It takes a very long time for the sound of the explosion to reach you.  Could it be your imagination, or is that the smell of burning flesh?  To the east you vaguely detect the continuation of the plains.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15365}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15397}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15395}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15397}{0}{<238>}{Desolate plains (s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Desolate plains The clouds above you move in over the sun and block out its light.  You wonder if you'll ever find the end of this rolling expanse.  A gigantic crater lies before you. It's hard to imagine what could have exploded and caused something as impressive as this.  To the south and west you just barely see the continuation of the plains.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15363}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15398}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15396}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15398}{0}{<238>}{Desolate plains (s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Desolate plains A gigantic crater lies before you. It's hard to imagine what could have exploded and caused something as impressive as this.  The clouds above you move in over the sun and block out its light.  Could it be your imagination, or is that the smell of burning flesh?  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15362}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15399}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15397}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15399}{0}{<238>}{Desolate plains (s,w,e)}{<238>, `<088>}{Desolate plains Huge clouds of dust and ash rise in the distance as you look around.  Could it be your imagination, or is that the smell of burning flesh?  You catch the smell of something rancid burning. You probably don't want to find out what it could be that could be burning.  To the east you sense the continuation of the plains.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15361}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15400}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15398}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15400}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Clouds roll across the sky, carrying with them the faint promise of much needed rain.  Blades of grass sway gently in the wind, struggling to survive in the dusty and dry heartland of North America.  Gently rolling hills stretch out towards the horizon.  To the south you see the continuation of the hills.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15360}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {8313}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15399}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15401}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (s,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Tufts of grass sprout from the gently rolling hills.  Each looks as though it would be considered a weed elsewhere, but out here where water is scarce and the sun bakes the earth, they are a sight for sore eyes.  You stand atop a small hill staring out over the countryside.  Clouds roll across the sky, carrying with them the faint promise of much needed rain.  To the south you sort of see the continuation of the hills.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15371}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15402}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15402}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Wind rustles through the grass and carries with it the hint of searing heat from nearby.  The desolation seen in the grasslands has only been spared in the hills because of the tentative hold that the plants have here.  You stand atop a small hill staring out over the countryside.  The soft ground is a comfort beneath your feet, a sure sign that life will continue to flourish here, even if it is only scrubgrass.  The new Great Wall separating the wasteland of the former United States and the sovereign state of Canada rises up to the north. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15370}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15401}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2998}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15403}{0}{}{Warehouse (e,w)}{ }{For as far as you can see in front of you, is a large warehouse. Boxes and bags are everywhere.  You wonder what this place could possibly be dealing in.  As you look around at the high ceiling, you notice a sophisticated security system, and electronic eyes scanning the area.  You hope you can blend in enough not to be noticed. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3009}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15404}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15404}{0}{}{Warehouse (s,w)}{ }{As you make your way through the warehouse to get a better idea of what's going on, you start to notice a foul, burnt smell.  You make your way over to a large green plastic trashbag and take a peek inside.  You can't believe what you've just seen!  Piles of burnt human flesh and broken bones are horrifically tangled up together.  You see some kind of sorting machine to your left. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15403}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15405}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15405}{0}{}{Assembly Line (s,n)}{ }{Still shaking off the image you've just seen, you come upon a large bin and the beginning of a conveyor belt assembly line.  You take a look inside the bin and discover the wads of human flesh you saw earlier.  You look up to see a ladder leading to a hand- operated crank, and with a turn of the handle, the flesh disappears under sharp metal flaps. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15404}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15406}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15406}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,n)}{ }{The picture of what's going on here is becoming a little clearer, although you won't let your mind believe it.  A loud hissing noise catches your attention and as you turn around to see where it's coming from, a blast of steam burns your face.  You start to realize that this is a giant compressor.  You can hear a squishing sound as you picture the chopped up flesh being flattened like pancakes by a compactor. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15405}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15407}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15407}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,w)}{ }{As you make your way further along the assembly line you are now positive about what is going on.  The flesh and bone of humans is being compressed into long flat sheets.  Your eyes flutter as they try to focus on the pink fleshy sheets fly by on the conveyor belt. Small pieces of bone lie on the floor, no doubt left overs that didn't get crushed enough. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15406}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15408}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15408}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,w)}{ }{A machine overhead of the belt mechanically moves along a track stamping out circles about four inches in diameter.  Now, you REALLY know what's going on.  Those circles of flesh look exactly like hamburger patties.  You wonder what kind of person could condone such activity, and you cross your fingers that you don't run into him or her. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15407}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15409}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15409}{0}{}{Assembly Line (n,w)}{ }{Further down the assembly line, you see the leftover flesh from the machine stamping out hamburger patties.  Your stomach starts to churn as you wonder how long this place has been here and if you've ever eaten one of these things before.  God, you hope not. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15408}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15410}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15410}{0}{}{Assembly Line (n,s)}{ }{You come across another loud hissing sound.  But this one also is producing a horrible smell.  You look up and see two small hoses spraying out some kind of chemical onto the hamburger patties.  As you stand there wondering what it could be, you notice the word 'TRICYCLONIDE' painted on one of the hoses.  You recognize that name as a type of pesticide that is sprayed on crops.  You can't believe people are actually getting away with this. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15409}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15411}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15411}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,s)}{ }{After the patties are sprayed, they are carried along the line to a small metal box.  It must be some kind of freezing device, because it is very chilly here and the box is cold to the touch.  Frozen patties come out the other side, all prepared for shipment. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15410}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15412}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15412}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,w)}{ }{This is supposed to be the Quality Control part of the assembly line.  But somehow you think it might be just for show.  You seriously doubt, with what is going on here, that anyone would care about any type of quality product. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15411}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15413}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15413}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,w)}{ }{This is the packaging part of the assembly line.  The patties are stacked into cardboard boxes for shipping to God-only-knows-where. There are forty-five patties to each box.  A metal flap scoops them up and slides them into the boxes, then another machine places the box lid on top. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15412}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15414}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15414}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,w)}{ }{A giant machine arm moves up and down stamping the name 'Hamilton Enterprises' on top of the boxes.  Another arm stamps Hamburger Patties underneath Hamilton Enterprises.  You can't believe that these horrors against mankind are actually going out into the world. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15413}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15415}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15415}{0}{}{Assembly Line (e,w)}{ }{This part of the assembly line wraps plastic around the boxes for shipment.  One large metal arm lifts the box up while another arm wraps plastic around the box and still another cuts the wrap. That cutter looks pretty sharp, be careful you don't stick your hand there. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15414}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15416}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15416}{0}{}{Employee Bathroom (n,w)}{ }{This is the employee bathroom.  There are a few urinals and two stalls.  You can't believe it, but there is a security camera in here too.  Two porcelain sinks sit against the west wall with pink powdered hand soap in jars hanging next to them.  A paper towel dispenser hangs on the wall next to the doorway.  There is no actual door to speak of.  It is surprisingly clean in here. Whoever is in charge of this place is a stickler for cleanliness. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15415}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15417}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15417}{0}{}{Warehouse (s,u,n)}{ }{After making a trip through the bathrooms, you stumble across another type of warehouse.  You notice all the boxes you saw on the assembly line being prepared for actual shipment.  Wooden crates, covered with the plastic wrapped flesh pattie boxes, line one wall. Dollies and small forklifts carry the crates from one checking station to another and then onto the loading dock for shipment. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15416}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15418}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15419}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15418}{0}{}{Supervisor's Office (e,d)}{ }{You've somehow managed to make your way to the supervisor's office. The walls are covered with thin wood paneling and old girlie calendars. A small wooden desk and chair sit against the far wall.  This is a modest office.  Papers are scattered all over the desk.  You try and sneak a peek at them to see what they are. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15417}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15440}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15419}{0}{}{Loading Dock (s,n)}{ }{It seems you've found the other end of the warehouse.  The place where the packaged boxes get shipped out.  It is similiar to the first loading dock you found, but now you know what's inside the boxes, and you have a good idea where these boxes are going.  The security is a little heavier here.  Each truck must be thoroughly examined with a x-ray security scan camera to make sure that no unauthorized documents leave the premises. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15417}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15420}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15420}{0}{}{Outside of a building (s)}{ }{You finally make it outside of the plant.  You breathe a heavy sigh of relief as you can now put all that ugliness you witnessed behind you.  As you think back on all those poor souls who were stripped of any dignity they had left, your stomach starts to tighten.  You are just thankful you made it out alive. }{Hamilton Plant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15419}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15421}{0}{<228>}{Rolling Hills (s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Rolling Hills Small, rolling hills covered in scraggly grass and weeds march towards the horizon in every direction.  Tufts of grass sprout from the gently rolling hills.  Each looks as though it would be considered a weed elsewhere, but out here where water is scarce and the sun bakes the earth, they are a sight for sore eyes.  Clouds roll across the sky, carrying with them the faint promise of much needed rain.  To the south you barely sense the continuation of the hills.  Lake Superior stretches out to the north towards Canada. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
