R {15465}{0}{<238>}{** The Path of Ao ** (nw,s,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You're walking along a path that follows the northern shore of the Isle of Ao. The path continues to the northwest and towards the east while the jungle wilds lie to the south. The gritty sand of the path is warm beneath your feet, heated by the tropical sun overhead. In contrast, the jungle canopy looks dark and forbidding. The heavy foliage blocks most of the sunlight from reaching the ground and a hot, damp darkness, too deep to penetrate, seems to consume all within. You could explore that wilderness if you had the courage, but it feels much safer here in the sunlight, where the sea and its way off this strange isle remain in sight. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
