R {15466}{0}{<238>}{** The Path of Ao ** (sw,ne,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{This path follows the shore of the jungle isle, its gritty sand giving way to the sea to the north and the jungle to the south. The waves crash against the shore which is at least 30 feet below, the path elevated from the water due to steady erosion over time. The encroaching jungle tempts you with the promise of adventure even while its shadows and sounds hint at unknown dangers and the possibility of a painful death. The path continues to the northeast and southwest while it looks like you could enter the jungle itself to the south if you dared. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
