R {15467}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (ne,n,s,w,e)}{<228>* *<088>}{The palm trees grow so thickly in this portion of the jungle that one can barely move amongst them. The fronds overhead block all but the smallest amount of sunlight, making it very difficult to see much of your surroundings. It appears something or someone has set up a makeshift dwelling here. Fronds have been gathered together to cover part of the moist ground and a blackened firepit sits in the middle of them. Off to one side of the fronds are several tree trunks that have been cut down and strewn together with vines to make a rudimentary hut. The hut isn't fancy enough to have anything like a door, but it does look sturdy enough to keep out some of the moisture for anyone that sat within its meager protection. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
