R {15468}{0}{<238>}{** The Path of Ao ** (sw,s,w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You've come to the eastern end of the path that follows the shore of Ao. The jungle overtakes the path up ahead as well as to the south, although it looks clear enough back towards the west. There is a steep dropoff towards the shore to the north, easily 40 feet or more. The foliage of the jungle creates a great deal of shadows on the path, shading it from the hot sun more often than not. The crowded palms that border the path make it difficult to discern what might lie deeper inland, but it looks as if you could wander into them if you had the courage. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
