R {15469}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (se,sw,n,w,e)}{<228>* *<088>}{The jungle terrain is a bit rocky, as the moist soil begins to give way to the black stone of the mountains to the south. The palms grow in abundance as they do throughout the jungle, yet here they grow in dense clumps. The trees must find nourishment in between the stones as nothing seems capable of growing on the rough obsidian surface of the stones themselves. Further north it looks a bit lighter, as if a path back to the shore might lie in that direction. To the east and west you see more of the green palms and the eerie shadows their swaying fronds create along the ground. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
