R {15470}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (s,w)}{<228>* *<088>}{The heat of the jungle is stifling, the humidity almost too much to bear. Within the canopy of the palms this isle is as hot as an oven and almost as dark. The palm fronds overhead block out all but the smallest amounts of sunlight, leaving the jungle dappled in shadow throughout the day and pitch black at night. The moist earth beneath your feet squishes slightly as you tread upon it. Rain and dew soak through the canopy regularly, keeping the ground wet and fertile for the multitude of plant-life that flourishes here. Looking around the jungle you see hundreds of varieties of plants, more than you could ever hope to learn the names of. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
