R {15471}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (n,w)}{<228>* *<088>}{The sound of water crashing against the shore echoes in this portion of the jungle. The palms rise up into the sky overhead while sunlight strays through the thinning trees to the east. The edge of the island lies just out of sight in that direction. To the north stretches more green trees and shadowy darkness while the obsidian peaks of the Ao Mountains tower into the distance to the south. The ground is gritty, part soil, part sand and it is full of the black rocks that mark the beginning of the mountain range. Water drips from a few of the fronds swaying overhead, making tiny puddles in the soil that squelch beneath your feet. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
