R {15472}{0}{<238>}{** The Mountains of Ao ** (sw,nw)}{<238>.^.<088>}{You've climbed high enough into the mountain range of Ao to look over the shore of the island and down upon Sapphyre Bay to the east. Its dark blue waters sparkle in the bright afternoon sunlight. The view of this beautiful landmark is truly breathtaking from this height. Its waters stretch as far as the eye can see, vanishing into the horizon far away. It lies in stark contrast to the dark, merciless mountains rising into the sky to the south. Their peaks consisting of jet black rock, their surface all but lifeless. Standing here on the outskirts of the mountains, you notice that little seems able to grow from the ebony stone and flaky soil. A few clumps of scrub brush hang onto the dirt here and there, but the rest of the mountain is barren. }{Isle of Ao}{zaubernuss}{}{}{1.000}{1}
