R {15473}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (ne,n,s,w)}{<228>* *<088>}{The jungle foliage has been utterly destroyed in this area. The palm trees are nothing but burnt cinders, leafless black stalks rising no higher than five or six feet from the ground. The ground itself is blackened as well. The dirt is baked into a hard crust. Steam rises from the ground, acrid and foul, offending your senses and almost blinding you with its hazy curtain. It seems some tremendous source of heat lies beneath this part of the jungle, making it nearly uninhabitable. A passage into the mountain range lies to the south. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
