R {15481}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (w,n)}{<228>* *<088>}{The rocky terrain is tough on your feet. The ground is littered with the black stone that marks the beginning of the mountains of Ao along the western shore of the island. The thick jungle canopy overhead blocks out most of the sunlight, leaving the jungle in a hot, hazy shadow. Tree roots twist through the dirt, trying to flourish despite the difficulty the oncoming mountains promise. The roots stick out in such a jumble, it's a wonder you don't trip over them. Any further to the west or south will lead you into the mountain range while the path back to safety seems to lie to the north. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
