R {15482}{0}{<238>}{** The Path of Ao ** (ne,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{The path ends abruptly to the south, the jungle wilderness overtaking the sandy walkway and covering it in lush tropical greenery. The shoreline falls away to the west, easily a 40 foot drop into the salty waters of the sea. Your only means of travel appear to be back along the path to the northeast or to wander off the path and into the great unknown of the jungle to south. The jungle canopy hangs high overhead. The palm fronds sway in the breeze, creating shadows that dance along the path, tempting you to explore further, to throw caution to the wind. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
