R {15483}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (n,e)}{<228>* *<088>}{The jungle foliage is damaged in this portion of the island. The tree trunks are blackened and the fronds are curled. Holes are burnt through their tender shoots. A pungent odor wafts on the breeze coming from the east. The soil beneath your feet seems to bubble, as if something was boiling just beneath the surface. Steam rises from the jungle floor, blinding you to what might lie further ahead. You could travel further to the east to investigate if you dared, but moving back towards the northern side of the island might be a safer bet. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
