R {15484}{0}{<228>}{** The Jungle of Ao ** (n,s,e)}{<228>* *<088>}{Condensation drips from the leaves overhead, pattering on the ground in a staccato rhythm that is almost maddening. The palms surround you, blocking out the sunlight and trapping in the humidity. Shadows move across the ground as the fronds overhead sway in the breeze. The terrain is difficult to traverse, roots stick out from the earth at odd angles, thick weeds are scattered in all directions, and several holes dug into the soil are large enough to break an ankle in if one isn't careful. It looks like there is more light to the north while every other direction only seems to lead to more foliage and darkness. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
