R {15489}{0}{}{** A Rock Ledge In The Mountains of Ao ** (d)}{ }{       You're standing on a very narrow ledge of rock formed in the middle of the steep incline of a mountain. It's only about four feet deep so you'll want to watch your step. If you peek over the edge, you'll notice it's quite a ways down. How did you get up here anyway? The ledge is about eight feet long, apparently carved out of the mountainside by the wind and elements. There is really nothing to see here but the jet black rock of the mountain and the view down below. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
