R {15493}{0}{<248>}{** A Cave Within the Mountains of Ao ** (u,forward)}{<248>% %<088>}{It's very dark. You seem to have slid right down into a cave hidden within the mountains. It's deep enough below the peaks that no light reaches it. Unlike many caves, this one is quite dry. The heat is stifling and apparently evaporates any moisture as soon as it arrives. This cave is used as refuge by the island's goblins during violent storms or times of danger. As spooky as caves tend to be, you feel strangely safe here. It's as if you were surrounded by terrible danger, but knew it couldn't touch you nestled here in the darkness. Of course, moving forward deeper into the cave could be a completely different story. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
