E {15493}{w}{back}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15496}{0}{<248>}{** A Cave Within the Mountains of Ao ** (back)}{<248>% %<088>}{You've reached the far end of the cave. It's nearly pitch black and very difficult to see much of your surroundings. The cave appears to be fairly large, probably 30 feet in diameter and vaguely round in shape. The rock ceiling above you is more than 15 feet high and made of the same black stone as that of the cave walls and floor. A mat of palm fronds and scrub grass sits to one side, the modest bed of Gibbergeist, the leader of Ao's goblin tribe. Bones lie scattered around the edges of the cave, remnants of past meals, otherwise the cave appears to be empty. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15495}{back}{back}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15495}{w}{back}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
