R {15497}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,exit)}{<248># #<088>}{You stand inside the entrance to the sacred hunting grounds of the Ophidian race that protects the Dragon Labyrinth. Only those that have proven themselves Champions of Ao may enter these dangerous tunnels. The exit back to the isle lies behind you while the darkness of the tunnels beckons before you. It's quite dark even this close to the exit, but your light source provides enough illumination to see stone columns lined along either side of the tunnel. They appear to stand like guardians to a secret underground fortress, overlooking your every move. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15498}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15494}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
