R {15498}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,s,e)}{<248># #<088>}{This narrow tunnel leads deeper into the Labyrinth to the north and closer to the exit to the south. Columns mark the sides of a stone archway to the east that provides entrance to the crumbling remnants of an ancient underground structure. The building looks like it might once have been a meeting area of some sort. Stone rubble is piled at the base of the columns, evidence of the structure's slow but relentless decline into oblivion. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15497}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15499}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
