R {15509}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,e)}{<248># #<088>}{This cavernous room serves as a smithy for the castle's current Ophidian residents. Large fiery forges blaze in the center of the room, their heat radiating throughout the castle. The forges cast an eerie red glare that lights the room in a blood-red hue and casts strange shadows that dance along the dark stone of the ceiling overhead. Long tables of stone line the walls and several weapons are hung above them, suspended by metal spikes that have been driven into the ancient partitions. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15508}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
