R {15511}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,w)}{<248># #<088>}{This abattoir is reserved as space for butchering the creatures that the Ophidians have killed. Pelts and skeletons hang from hooks in the walls and the tables lined up and down the room are covered in crusted blood and gore. The air is rank with the smell of death and decay, a fetid odor that seems to infest the very stone of the castle. The floor is sticky with coagulated blood and footprints are scattered about the room, dark red reminders of the hunters that have come and gone from this place over the years. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15510}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
