R {15512}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,s,e)}{<248># #<088>}{Long banners of scarlet and black hang from the stone walls of this antechamber. Four chairs with tall backs and wide seats are spaced around the room, one in each corner. A large archway leads east, seemingly leading you to a place of some importance. The floor of this chamber has been swept clean, the black stone almost shining in the red hue that lights the inside of this castle. Draped across this floor is a scarlet carpet that leads inside the archway. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15511}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
