R {15514}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (w)}{<248># #<088>}{This is the castle's war room, home of the Ophidians' most powerful general. A scarlet carpet leads through the middle of the room from an archway on the west end to a tall chair on the east. On either side of this carpet sit tables that span the length of the room. On the walls above these tables are paintings of dragons, massive creatures pictured in a multitude of settings, all of them violent. This chamber is used by the Ophidians to plan their defense of the Labyrinth's masters, the Dragons of Ao. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15512}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15515}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (w)}{<248># #<088>}{The stench in this chamber is nauseating. This appears to be a dumping ground. The rocky floor is covered in refuse and bones. The litter is piled to such a degree that picking your way through it is nearly impossible. At the far side of the clutter is a pile of rock that marks the end of this tunnel. A cave-in has blocked any further progress, leaving your only exit back to the west the way you came in. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15507}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15516}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {15517}{0}{}{^;^ Entrance to the Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (enter)}{<168>E<088>}{You're walking along a precarious path that leads through the mountains of Ao. The black stones of the mountains absorb the heat of the harsh afternoon sun, making your hike almost unbearable as your body wears down and the exertion takes its toll. Very little grows amongst the sharp inclines and steep precipices of the mountains. A few patches of scrub grass and some stunted palms survive, but little else. Down below you to the east you can see the tops of the palm trees that make up the jungle canopy. To the west is a vertigo inducing drop onto the rocky shore of the island. The drop must be at least 200 feet. Falling from this vantage would spell certain death. The mountain range continues to the southeast. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15518}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
