R {15518}{0}{<278>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (e,exit)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The cave is dimly lit, a bit of sunlight filtering in from the exit back out onto the shore of Ao. Here beneath the island, the air is damp and hot. The walls of the cave drip with moisture, the liquid slowly trickling from the high rock ceiling and rough hewn walls, pooling onto the uneven floor at your feet. The rock is black, matching that of the mountains somewhere high above, reaching over the surface of the island. Underground, the island seems even more mysterious; unknown dangers lurk all around you. The cave leads deeper into the Labyrinth to the east. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15519}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15517}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15519}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,e,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{The Labyrinth envelops you in darkness, every turn looking the same. The black rock of the walls and floor bruises your body and feet as you continually bump into sharp edges and trip on uneven footing as you make your way through the confusing passages. Occasionally the soft guttural noise of one of the Labyrinth's creatures echoes down the tunnel, leaving you to wonder if an attack awaits your next step. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
