R {15521}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{The cave is pitch black and eerily silent. The only sound you hear is the beating of your own heart. The air is damp and musty, cloying at your lungs, filling them with the stench of death and decay. The Labyrinth was created many eons ago. Who knows what evil has taken up residence here since then? }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15519}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15522}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15522}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,n,w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The deathly stillness of these caves is a bit spooky. Buried beneath the island, cursed for centuries by the Dragons of Ao, the only things that seem to survive down here are creatures of darkness and stealth. Silent killers bred for nocturnal hunting, the Labyrinth's denizens are virtually forgotten beyond this remote isle, living beneath it in obscurity. They are forever spellbound by the ancient masters that slumber somewhere in these depths. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
