R {15525}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (se,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{The evil residing in these caves begins to crawl beneath your skin, drumming in your skull, whispering dreaded warnings of impending doom. The curse that lies on this island like a suffocating blanket seems even thicker here beneath its surface. The darkness surrounding you only amplifies the fear, leaving you to wonder what horrors lie in wait in the blackness just beyond your vision. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
