R {15531}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{Silence surrounds you, the empty blackness of the underground corridors filled with dread and rotting evil, but none of it making a sound. These caves have lain beneath a dragon spell for so many centuries that they almost exude a malevolent presence, an evil consciousness that hovers on the air, watching and waiting for your first mistake before it pounces upon you, devouring your soul. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
