R {15532}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{The cave is pitch black and eerily silent. The only sound you hear is the beating of your own heart. The air is damp and musty, cloying at your lungs, filling them with the stench of death and decay. The Labyrinth was created many eons ago. Who knows what evil has taken up residence here since then? }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
