R {15535}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The deathly stillness of these caves is a bit spooky. Buried beneath the island, cursed for centuries by the Dragons of Ao, the only things that seem to survive down here are creatures of darkness and stealth. Silent killers bred for nocturnal hunting, the Labyrinth's denizens are virtually forgotten beyond this remote isle, living beneath it in obscurity. They are forever spellbound by the ancient masters that slumber somewhere in these depths. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
