R {15538}{0}{<278>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (u,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{An ancient staircase to the east leads higher into the Labyrinth. To the west stretches more of the black rock you're all too familiar with from seeing it throughout the upper level of these caves. The atmosphere is slightly different at this depth of the maze, darker and warmer than above. Reddish-brown moss grows in patches along the walls and steam rises from the floor where the heat has turned the caves' condensation into vapor. Echoes occasionally bounce off the ceiling high above you, sounds of creatures you probably don't want to run across. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15537}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
