R {15539}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,e,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{Your tenebrous surroundings leave most of the details of these caves to your imagination. Very little can be seen in the murky darkness, only the rough surface of the rocky walls, partially obscured by the moss that grows upon them, and the steam that rises from the floor, floating through the passages of the Labyrinth like specters of past victims. This place seems bent on maddening you, leaving you lost and confused until some creature of darkness comes to claim your soul. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
