R {15541}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The sound of your footsteps joins the other haunting echoes that ring throughout the caves of the Labyrinth. Judging from some of those echoes, you're far from alone down this deep beneath Ao. Monsters of darkness are rumored to wander these depths, eager to find lost adventurers that are fat with blood and easy prey. You might want to watch your step in these caves, the wrong move could easily cost you your life. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
