R {15542}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The constant turns of the Labyrinth seem to taunt you, challenging you to remember which direction you just came from and which direction you wish to go next. The walls look the same virtually everywhere you look and the billowing steam makes determining any level of detail in your surroundings next to impossible. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
