R {15544}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,nw,ne,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The darkness of the Labyrinth threatens to overwhelm you. Everything in this maze seems bent on confusing your sense of direction, turning you around and leaving you at the mercy of the caves' evil inhabitants. The steam rising from the rock floor only adds to the murky quality of the environment, billowing about the caves in a hot, damp haze. About the only detail you can make out in the gloom is the rock of the walls, floor, and ceiling that never seems to change regardless of which turn you take down here. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
