R {15545}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,n,w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The atmosphere in the Labyrinth is eerie. The billowing steam flowing through the murky passages is almost like ghosts floating in the darkness, remnants of those that have perished in these caves over the centuries. Moss clings to the walls in reddish-brown patches like blood drying on dead flesh. The thought of dying down here in this gloom is difficult to avoid. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
