R {15558}{0}{<278>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (e,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You stand at the entrance to the deepest level inside this part of the maze. Steam billows so thickly that you can barely see your hand before your face. The heat is nearly unbearable, the humidity is stifling in its intensity. The sound of dripping condensation sizzling as it hits the cavern floor reminds you of how hot that surface must be, and explains the white vapor that floats around the cave. A powerful heat source dwells somewhere down here in the depths of the isle, although what and where it might be remains a mystery to you. The stair leading back up to cooler realms lies before you while a passage to the east leads deeper into the Labyrinth. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15557}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15559}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15559}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (se,w,ne,e)}{<248># #<088>}{This maze is known as the Dragon Labyrinth. If it is indeed a dragon that has caused this heat, it is a large one, ancient and not likely to accept disturbance. You are wandering in one of the deepest levels of the maze, possibly getting closer with every step to the Labyrinth's namesake. Take heed before exploring any further, lest you find the creator of this unbearable heat directing its wrath toward you and your meager defenses. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15558}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15560}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
