R {15560}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,s,nw,e)}{<248># #<088>}{The air is so thick this deep in the Labyrinth that you must labor just to breathe. The heat and the humidity weigh on you like a woolen blanket. Water drips from the ceiling and walls, echoing as it lands on the floor where it burns into vapor. The rocky ground underfoot is treacherous, the moisture making it slick and the uneven surface leading you to stumble regularly as you make your way through the darkness of this underground maze. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
