R {15562}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (s,e,w)}{<248># #<088>}{The heat this deep within the Labyrinth is overpowering. It rises from the floor and sweeps over you in waves of merciless intensity. Your breath comes only in shallow gulps and sweat drenches your skin as your body attempts to compensate for the temperature. Something of immense power dwells nearby, something capable of turning these passages into a virtual oven. What that something is has yet to be seen, but just the thought of it should give an adventurer pause. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
