R {15568}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (n,se,w,e)}{<248># #<088>}{The floating steam gives this level of the Labyrinth a haunted feel, as if ghosts were floating along these passages, lamenting their lonely and untimely passing. As the steam swirls along the caverns, it breaks from time to time, offering you brief glimpses of the bare black rock that this maze was carved from so many centuries ago. The surface of this rock is slick, moisture dripping down toward the rough hewn floor where it hisses in complaint before the heat turns it into yet more steam. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
