R {15573}{0}{<248>}{^;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^;^ (w)}{<248># #<088>}{This maze is known as the Dragon Labyrinth. If it is indeed a dragon that has caused this heat, it is a large one, ancient and not likely to accept disturbance. You are wandering in one of the deepest levels of the maze, possibly getting closer with every step to the Labyrinth's namesake. Take heed before exploring any further, lest you find the creator of this unbearable heat directing its wrath toward you and your meager defenses. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
