R {15579}{0}{<278>}{-= Solonaris Street =- (n,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{Solonaris Street runs east and west here.  To the north is one of the buildings of the university, a small wooden structure that houses the alchemy school.  To the south is the fabled Aramathea Library.  Further to the west you can see the intersection with Jasmine and the beautifully tiled walls of the Temple of Kourlyn. To the east rises the grand Cathedral of All Gods, home of the priests.  Beyond the cathedral are the walls of the Citadel, the military fortress of Wayhaven. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
