R {15580}{0}{<278>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy for the Alchemic Arts*=- (n,s)}{<278> | <088>}{You stand before the entrance to a small building, housing a school teaching alchemy.  Judging by the size of the building, it is a small school, though the state of the building suggests that it is prosperous. A door to the north leads to the foyer of the Academy, over which a small sign hangs. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{rilians_alchemy_academy}{}{}{1.000}{1}
