R {15581}{0}{<278>}{-= Solonaris Street =- (s,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{Solonaris Street runs east and west here.  To the north is the university, its buildings pristine in the sunlight.  To the south is the fabled Aramathea Library.  Further to the west you can see the intersection with Jasmine and the beautifully tiled walls of the Temple of Kourlyn.  To the east rises the glittering Cathedral of All Gods.  Beyond the cathedral stand the walls of the Citadel, the military fortress of Wayhaven. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
