R {15582}{0}{<238>}{-= Aramathean library =- (n,s,w)}{<238>"""<088>}{This is the entrance hall of the Aramathean library. Outside, Solonaris Drive runs east and west.  To the south the interior of the library is dimmer, even dark in places. You can see the main desk with its attendant librarians clearly, however. In contrast to the noise outside, the interior is quiet. This is truly a place of learning. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
