R {15583}{0}{<278>}{-= Solonaris Street =- (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{Solonaris Street runs west from here.  To the north is the university, its buildings pristine in the sunlight.  To the south is the fabled Aramathea Library.  To the east you see a clearing in front of the Cathedral of All Gods.  Beyond the cathedral are the walls of the Citadel, the military fortress of Wayhaven. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15581}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
