R {15584}{0}{<278>}{-= Aramathean Library =- (u,n,w,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are inside the Aramathean Library.  It is much dimmer in here than outside.  The ceiling soars high above you, supported by graceful gothic arches.  Immediately to your south is the main desk of the library, where people come to bother the librarians. Bookshelves lead off into the darkness to east and west.  A bit of light is visible from the entrance to the north.  A staircase wends its way up the back wall behind the librarian desk.  There is a small notice board next to the main desk. }{Wayhaven}{library}{}{}{1.000}{1}
