R {15585}{0}{<238>}{-= Aramathean library =- (s,e)}{<238>"""<088>}{You are at the northwest corner of the great Aramathean library of Wayhaven. It is very dark here--the only light shed besides that which you carry comes from the torches of other seekers of knowledge like yourselves. To the east you can see the faint gleam of daylight around the main entrance to the library.  To the west are some reading desks, a few of which are occupied. Bookshelves stretch away into utter blackness to the south. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
