R {15586}{0}{<238>}{-= Aramathean library =- (n,e)}{<238>"""<088>}{You are at the southwest end of the great Aramathean library of Wayhaven.  It is very dark here.   The only other lights you can make out at all are the flickering pinpoints of the torches of other seekers of knowledge like yourselves and a larger pool of light around the main librarian desk to the east.  The bookshelves stretch away into utter darkness to the north.  Against the wall directly to your south there are some reading desks. A few are occupied. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
