R {15593}{0}{}{Entrance to the Cathedral of All Gods }{<168>E<088>}{You are standing in a tree-lined clearing.  Towering to the east in front of you is a beautiful gothic cathedral, home to the powerful Priest Guild.  To the west you can see the streets of Wayhaven. Non-members may join the guild by asking a current priest or leave the guild <unjoin priest> at a cost of one-half of their total experience. Both decisions are of great importance and should be carefully weighed before being made. Clerics of old may not enter until they 'recant' their past, a permanent step on the path of faith.  Do not make this decision lightly. }{Wayhaven}{priests}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15583}{w}{w}{8}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15594}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
