R {15594}{0}{}{Ceremonial Circle (ne,s)}{ }{A score of megalithic stones rise out of the well-groomed lawn among the clusters of oak trees.  The stones are balanced on end in an even circle.  They rise well over your head.  To the east, the Cathedral of All Gods towers over the ceremonial circle and the surrounding buildings.  A stained glass window is set high in the cathedral wall.  A small altar is set in an alcove under the window. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15593}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15595}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15595}{0}{}{Path through a statue garden (ne,sw)}{ }{Statues of marble, alabaster, bronze, and iron line the brick walkway through this verdant garden.  Hydrangeas and marigolds are in full bloom in the well-kept flowerbeds.  The path winds through the garden, circling around the carefully maintained landscaping.  Tall oak trees shade the garden.  You can hear birds twittering from the branches. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15594}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15596}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15596}{0}{}{Beneath a towering oak (e,sw)}{ }{Four small trees in raised planters ring a venerable oak that towers overhead.  The canopy of the oak reaches above the lowest rooftop of the cathedral.  The massive trunk is several armspans around.  The lawn is neatly kept. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15595}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15597}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15597}{0}{}{Passing near a strange fountain (ne,w)}{ }{A neat pebbled path winds through the trees and shrubs, passing by a small stone fountain.  A dozen or so gargoyles ring the fountain; water trickles from their elongated mouths into the pool beneath.  To the south, the massive wall of the cathedral towers overhead.  Above the trees to the north, you spot the rooftops of Wayhaven. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15596}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15598}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15598}{0}{}{In a flower garden (n,sw,ne)}{ }{This beautiful, sunny spot next to the cathedral wall is lush with flowers and shrubs.  Some of the shrubs have been painstakingly pruned into topiary creations by the priests.  A small stone bench by the wall gives a nice spot to rest and enjoy the beauty.  It faces across the garden toward a low stone building. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15597}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15599}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15600}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15599}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15598}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15600}{0}{}{Standing in a pebbled round (n,sw)}{ }{The pebbled path widens into a round about five paces across.  Around the circle is a ring of braziers.  A few venerable oak trees dot the lawn here, and the huge stone wall of the Cathedral of All Gods is just to the south.  It's quiet, with the city sounds echoing faintly from far across the Priest Guild grounds.  Perhaps the gardens are set up as a good place for meditation. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15598}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15601}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15601}{0}{}{A quiet path (s)}{ }{Along the wall of the cathedral are several carved stone scrolls.  The path runs close to the wall; on the other side an expanse of green lawn stretches to the wall of the seminary.  This is a peaceful place. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15600}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15602}{0}{}{-={@ A quiet clearing among the trees @}=- (se,n,s)}{ }{You step past the hardwood trees and enter a glade of serenity.  A pool of cool, crystal waters gathers to the side from a sparkling waterfall.  Stone benches surround the pool, many filled with your brethren, assisting the folk of Wayhaven by listening to their problems and providing spiritual guidance back to their true paths. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15593}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15603}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15603}{0}{}{-={@ A well-manicured lawn @}=- (se,nw)}{ }{You're standing on a lawn between the Aramathean Library and the Cathedral of All Gods.  The flat expanse of green grass is kept well-trimmed by the priests.  A path leads northwest into a stand of trees.  The sky above you is clear. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15602}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15604}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15604}{0}{}{-={@ A well-manicured lawn @}=- (s,nw,e)}{ }{A wide green lawn, kept neatly cropped and trimmed by the initiates of the Priest Guild, stretches around the south end of the Cathedral of All Gods here.  The Cathedral itself towers overhead, a massive stone structure with ivy encroaching on its walls. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15603}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15605}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15606}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15605}{0}{}{-={@ South end of the lawn @}=- (n,enter)}{ }{You stand at the south end of the lawn on the Priest Guild grounds.  On the far side, the Cathedral of All Gods towers overhead.  Just in front of you to the south is a low edifice of dark gray marble with a single oak door open.  Above the door is a chiseled marble plaque.  Although the door is open, the silent building doesn't look inviting. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15604}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15606}{0}{}{-={@ A well-manicured lawn @}=- (e,w)}{ }{You stand on a narrow strip of impeccably trimmed grass between the Cathedral of All Gods just to the north and a row of alder trees to the south.  Ivy climbs high up the stone wall of the giant Cathedral.  A covered well is nestled among the alders. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15604}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15607}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15607}{0}{}{-={@ A well-manicured lawn @}=- (se,w)}{ }{The lawn curls around the southeast corner of the gigantic Cathedral of All Gods here.  A strip of short green grass separates the soaring stone wall of the Cathedral from a stand of alder trees.  To the northeast, the wall of the Wayhaven Citadel rises high into the air.  The Citadel is the only structure in Wayhaven more massive than the Cathedral.  A path winds through the trees to the southeast. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15606}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15608}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15608}{0}{}{-={@ Cobblestone Path @}=- (nw,s)}{ }{You're walking through a stand of alder trees on a cobblestone path about an armspan or two wide.  The leafy boughs close around you, swaying slowly in a gentle breeze.  Through the trees to the south, you spot a bluestone building.  To the northwest, the Cathedral rises so high it blots out almost half the sky. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15607}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15609}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15609}{0}{}{-={@ Curate Sect Hall @}=- (s,n)}{ }{A wide bluestone archway with wood gates and a raised iron portcullis guards the entrance to the courtyard of a bluestone abbey.  The flagstones underfoot match the blueish walls of the abbey.  A cobblestone path leads into a stand of alder trees to the north.  To the immediate east of the abbey looms the Citadel. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15608}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15610}{0}{<278>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Foyer*=- (s,u,w,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This is the foyer of the Academy, through which you can get to the various areas of the small, but well-made building.  The room is panelled in wood, giving the impression of prosperity, but not opulence. A stairway to the north leads up to the second floor, and the sleeping quarters of the residents of the Academy.  An opening to the east leads to the classroom and laboratory, where the teaching of the school goes on.  Another opening to the west leads to the dining room and kitchen, where the inhabitants take their meals. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15580}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15611}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15612}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15613}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15611}{0}{<278>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Upper Hallway*=- (n,d,w,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This is the central part of the hallway on the second story of Master Rilian's Academy.  The wooden stairway here leads down to the foyer of the small school.  The room to the north is rather large, most likely the living quarters of Master Rilian himself.  He purposely placed his apartment at the top of the stairs, to make sure his students don't sneak out after dark. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15610}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15616}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
