R {15612}{0}{<238>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Dining Hall*=- (n,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the large dining hall where the inhabitants of the Academy take their meals.  A long table sits in the middle of the room, with a large armed chair for Master Rilian at one end, and benches along either side for the students.  A door to the north leads to the kitchen, while another opening leads east to the foyer. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15610}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15614}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15613}{0}{<238>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Classroom*=- (n,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the classroom of the Academy, although it looks as though classes held here are rather informal.  The students all advance at separate paces, meaning that all the lessons which require classroom space would coincide.  Hence, this room is occupied mainly by long tables, to which folding chairs can be pulled up.  The room is surprisingly devoid of what are usually considered the accoutrements of alchemy.  Instead, there are bookshelves full of various texts.  The experiments are all contained in the laboratory, to minimize any accidents.  An opening to the west leads to the foyer, while a door to the north leads to the laboratory. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15610}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15615}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15614}{0}{<238>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Kitchen*=- (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the kitchen of Master Rilian's Academy, where the Cook makes the food for the inhabitants of the school to eat.  A large stove occupies one side of the room, while the other is taken up by a pantry and other cupboards.  A large table takes up the center of the room, where the Cook and her assistants do the various tasks involved with preparing the food. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15612}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15615}{0}{<238>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Laboratory*=- (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the laboratory where the students of Master Rilian perform their alchemical experiments.  The room is laid out neatly, with two large tables forming two separate workstations, so that two experiments can be performed at once.  One wall holds a rack of bottles, next to which is a bookshelf.  A door in the south wall leads to the classroom. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15613}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15616}{0}{<238>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Rilian's Private Chamber*=- (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room seems to serve the purpose of both a bedroom and a study.  A large wooden bed takes up a fair amount of space, the thick mattress and comfortable blankets the only concession Rilian has made to luxury.  A large desk is piled high with papers and assorted writing instruments.  A bureau sits in the corner, the top covered with assorted knick-knacks. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15611}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15617}{0}{<268>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Upper Hallway*=- (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the western part of the hallway on the second story of Master Rilian's Academy.  The stairway is to the east, leading down to the foyer of the school.  A small room is to the north, most likely the living quarters of some of the school's inhabitants. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15611}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15619}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15618}{0}{<268>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Upper Hallway*=- (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the eastern part of the hallway on the second story of Master Rilian's Academy.  The stairway is to the west, leading down to the foyer of the school.  A small room is to the north, most likely the living quarters of some of the school's inhabitants. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15611}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15620}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15619}{0}{<238>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Dormitory*=- (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the dormitory for the most advanced students of Master Rilian, those who have advanced enough to take over some of the teaching and disciplinary tasks of the academy.  The furnishings are rather spartan, consisting of several bunk beds, dressers, and desks.  Rilian does not tolerate untidiness or sloth, and it seems unlikely that the occupants of this room spend much time here. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15617}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15620}{0}{<238>}{-=*Master Rilian's Academy: Dormitory*=- (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the dormitory for the more general students of Master Rilian, those who have come here for general studies involving alchemy.  The most hopeless cases get sent home and never complete their studies, while those who excel are advanced to the larger educational institutions.  The accomodations are rather spartan, consisting of several bunk beds, dressers, and desks.  Rilian does not tolerate untidiness or sloth, and it seems unlikely that the occupants of this room spend much time here. }{Rilian's Alchemy Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15618}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

