R {15622}{0}{<268>}{Temple of Kourlyn (s,n,e,w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You are inside the Temple of Kourlyn, Goddess of the Sea and Storms. The whole temple is illuminated with candles which float in  troughs of water carved from the walls of the temple. To the east is the Sea shrine and to the west lies the Storm shrine. Immediately to your south is the main area of worship, where temple-goers can pray to the goddess and receive enlightenment. The walls of the temple are a clear blue colour as is the ceiling, with a grey and gold trim. }{Kourlyn Temple}{kourlyn_temple}{}{}{1.000}{1}
