R {15636}{0}{}{The ground floor of Zalasta's tower (out)}{ }{You stand inside Zalasta's tower. There is plenty of light in here, which is generated by balls hanging from the ceiling. You surmise these to be magical in nature. The chamber is circular, and very large. The walls, however, appear to be paper-thin. There are some steps leading upward to the next level. All the furnishings you can see around you are elegant--not flashy, just elegant. }{Wayhaven}{zalastas_tower}{}{}{1.000}{1}
