R {15642}{0}{<268>}{-<=>- Research room of Rauthgar -<=>- (w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{The walls of this room of the temple are covered in bookshelves, which in turn are covered in ancient books and scrolls.  There is a glass-topped table in the centre of the room, but otherwise the room seems to exist solely for the purpose of holding the bookcases.  There is a feeling of knowledge in the air here, as if all the books and scrolls are somehow leaking their wisdom into the room. }{Temple of Rauthgar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
