R {15665}{0}{}{A long forgotten shrine (out)}{ }{You are standing within a long forgotten shrine dedicated to the goddess Aquatys. There is an altar here, and a statue of the goddess alone. The walls are dry and without growth upon them. Though lost and forgotten, the shrine is still a holy place, and you can feel the benevolence of the goddess around you. }{Kourlyn Temple}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
