R {15677}{0}{}{Beneath the Temple of Kourlyn--Level 2 (se,s)}{ }{The underground of Kourlyn's Temple is unending. Deathly silence fills the air as you continue on your journey. To the south lies what looks like a shrine of some sort but you can't make out any details. You can however, hear evil chuckling noises. It sounds like whatever is in there is more than one. }{Kourlyn Temple}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
