R {15678}{0}{}{Beneath the Temple of Kourlyn--Level 2 (n)}{<168>E<088>}{You are in a larger room beneath the Temple. In the centre of the room is a fountain. It is the shape of a great fish, perhaps a whale or leviathan, but you cannot tell. The water covering the ground on this level seems to be coming from here. Beyond the fountain, you can see the ruins of a once glorious shrine, but where there was once a door, there is now only a slab of rock. }{Kourlyn Temple}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
