R {15787}{0}{}{Beneath the Temple of Kourlyn--Level 6 (se,nw)}{ }{You light flickers as shadows flicker across the passage walls. To the northwest lies a shrine. There is a light from within. The shrine and this area look untouched by the evil that abounds everywhere else. }{Kourlyn Temple}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
