R {15788}{0}{}{Beneath the Temple of Kourlyn--Level 6 (enter,se)}{<168>E<088>}{You have reached the entrance to the Shrine of Kourlyn, Goddess of the Seas and Storms. You can sense a clear feeling of evil and defilement from within. The blue marble that once stood so majestically have been cracked in pieces that now lie on the ground. The shrine in within. Dare you enter? }{Kourlyn Temple}{kourlyn_lostone}{}{}{1.000}{1}
