R {15789}{0}{}{The Shrine of Kourlyn (portal,out)}{ }{You are standing in the Shrine of Kourlyn. Destruction lies all around you. The walls have been painted with evil symbols and the altar of the goddess has been cracked in two. The statue of Kourlyn is in pieces, and mystical symbols have been carved or burned into the floor. All remnants of the  gentle goddess have been destroyed.  }{Kourlyn Temple}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
