R {15801}{0}{<248>}{A Dark Cavern (e)}{<248>% %<088>}{You are in a very dark and damp cavern. Strewn all over the floor is one of the largest collection of bones you have ever seen. Whatever lives here doesn't have a very discriminating taste either- cow bones, troll bones, elf bones, and yes, even human bones. Some of them still have flesh on them. The atrocities commited here are so violent that the aura normally undetectable by mere humans is retchingly strong. Perhaps you should leave, no? }{Carnelian's Lair}{carnelian}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14024}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15803}{enter mirror}{enter mirror}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15802}{0}{}{A turning in the stairs (d,climb)}{ }{The stone stairs upon which you travel cling to the interior wall of the lighthouse by what appears to be sheer will.  No railing stands between you and the floor far below, and in spite of what your brain tells you, these steps seem very narrow all of a sudden.  Above you a hatch stands open, leading out onto the roof of the tower.  The floor far below  appears as just a mass of clutter from this height.  Hope you don't fall over the edge by accident. }{Tower of Fire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14120}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15828}{u}{climb}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15828}{climb}{climb}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15803}{0}{}{On a Dirt Path (s,n,e,w)}{ }{You find yourself at the start of a dirt path, with large grassy fields to either side.  It appears to be a brilliant day outside, with large fluffy clouds and bright sun.   You hear the sounds of birds and insects both chirping off in the distance.  The mirror leading back to the realms lies directly behind you, the halls of Newbieland beckoning beyond.  You wonder what you'll find in this place--perhaps some big scary farm animals or something... }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15805}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15806}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
