E {15801}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15804}{0}{}{Grassy Field (se,ne,n,s,e)}{ }{You are wandering along the western edge of a large field of grass--lots of scrubby underbrush to your west prevents you from proceeding any farther in that particular direction.  You wonder why these nice fields haven't been cultivated as regular farmland--they seem to grow the grass quite healthily. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
