R {15805}{0}{}{On a Dirt Path (se,sw,nw,ne,n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are walking along a small dirt path, flanked on either side by tall grass fields.  You are nearing some sort of small hill to the north, and a bit off to the south you can see the mirror that brought you here. The grass is thin enough that you can enter the fields in one of many directions from here. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
