R {15806}{0}{}{Grassy Field (n,nw,e,w)}{ }{You are on the western edge of a grassy field, with a small dirt path directly to your west.  You can see little but chest-high grass extending to your north and east.  Admiring the beautiful day, you can see the mirror that brought you to this world somewhat off to the southwest. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
