R {15807}{0}{}{Grassy Field (nw,ne,n,w,e)}{ }{You are walking through a chest-high field of grass, which extends to the east and north of here.  Just to the east you see a small dirt path. You hear the sounds of birds and insects both chirping away. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
