R {15808}{0}{}{Grassy Field (s,n,w,e)}{ }{The small dirt path lies directly to your east, heading both to the northeast, where you see a hill of some sort, and to the southeast, back to the mirror that brought you here.  These grass fields may be tall, but they really are quite pleasant to walk through. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
