R {15809}{0}{}{Grassy Field (n,sw,e)}{ }{You are standing in the southwestern edge of a small grassy field.  You press onward through the tall grass, disturbing small rodents and insects as you look about.  The mirror entrance to this serene world is somewhere to the east.  You believe you see a small structure a short distance off to your southwest.  Some prickly-looking underbrush inhibits any farther passage west. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
