R {15816}{0}{}{Path's End (u,s,e,w)}{ }{The short path that you have been following ends here, at the foot of a small but fairly steep hill.  The dirt of the path is very tightly packed, as if trampled by many feet, up to this point.  Grassy fields flank you to either side, and a small, scraggly bush grows at the foot of the otherwise barren hill.  You can barely make out a glint of sunlight reflecting behind you, the only indication of the mirror that brought you to these calm meadowlands. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
