R {15817}{0}{}{Grassy Field (sw,n,s,e,w)}{ }{A frog scampers from underfoot with a protesting croak as you miss squishing him by mere inches.  The frog makes one mighty leap and is lost from sight amidst the tall grass of this field.  You see chest-high grass everywhere except to the west, where a small dirt path leads north and south through the field. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
