R {15819}{0}{}{Grassy Field (n,nw,w)}{ }{You are at the southeastern end of a large grassy field.  You wonder why the grass hasn't been tended, that it might reach as high as your chest in some places!  You can see nothing but grass to your west and to your north.  The noises of various animals can be heard nearby.  A small brook wends its way along the rolling meadows to your east. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
