R {15825}{0}{}{A small kitchen (sw,ne)}{ }{You stand amid a jumbled kitchen.  A wood stove sets against one wall, next to an open hearth fireplace.  A wooden table commands the center of the room, littered with the remains of last night's cooking.  Shelves cover another wall, stacked with bags of rice, vegetables and other grains.  Pots and pans hang from hooks along the walls and a wood rack sits in the corner next to the stove. Stone archways lead out of the room; one back to the main building and the other further into the living quarters. }{Tower of Fire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
