R {15830}{0}{<238>}{On the Rocks (nw,se)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{On the Rocks. The natural rip of the tide flowing around the headland has created this backwash where floating objects can wash up. The relative calm of the sea on this side of the headland provides a natural sanctuary for seals and sea lions to bask in the sun. The sheer cliff wall offers no access to the top of the headland. }{Seacave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
