R {15831}{0}{<238>}{On the Rocks (se)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{On the Rocks. The small band of rocks has finally ended. Further on, the sea washes up directly on the cliff wall and there is no way to make progress. As the rock band descends into the water, channels connect the rock pools together until eventually only a few of the largest boulders peak above the surface. The water is decorated with all sorts of plant life. }{Seacave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
