R {15832}{0}{<148>}{Ocean (e,n)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{Swimming along, it is hard to make anything out in this darkness. Odd looking shapes continue to play tricks on your vision. Exotic ocean life and fish swim about acting like you aren't there. You can make out an odd shimmering light coming from the northeast. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
