R {15833}{0}{<148>}{Ocean (w,n)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{It seems a lot darker in this section, perhaps because you can no longer see the ocean floor from here. The light from the surface has nothing to bounce off of. Fish swim freely about and the odd shapes continue to play tricks on your mind. To the north you can just barely make out a small glowing light. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
