R {15836}{0}{}{Village Square (n,e,w,out)}{O}{You are in a busy market square where the village is bustling with activity. People are meandering about, chickens clucking, birds chirping; all as you would expect a busy square to be. Oddly, these people seem very simple and not at all the advanced culture you expected them to be. Most people are dressed in simple tan cloth and many women wear their hair in long braids. To the north you notice greenery as far as the eye can see and the village square contains many tents and benches stacked with fresh food. You cannot fathom how these people survive like this so deep in the ocean. Is it magic that gives this place such a euphoric feeling? You can't quite place your finger on it. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
