R {15838}{0}{}{Village Square (n,ne,w)}{ }{The Willothorn citizens are busy working here. There are several tents set up with various people performing different tasks from casting pots to sorting through food. The people seem oblivious to your presence. The square echoes with the voices of the villagers conversations. You see the walls of a large structure east of you. The northeast leads to some huts. The village continues west. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
