R {15839}{0}{}{Village Square (n,nw,e)}{ }{The Willothorn citizens are busy working here. There are several tents set up with various people performing different tasks from casting pottery to sorting fruits and vegetables. Everything about this place is very simple. With all this technology available you would think that their way of life would be a lot more advanced. To the west you see an endless field of grass and to the north and east the village square continues. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
