R {15841}{0}{}{Willothorn Village (s,n,sw,w)}{ }{Along this stretch of path lies more housing. You see villagers out and about in their yards, tending gardens or conversing amongst themselves. You don't feel unwelcome here but you certainly feel out of place. To the south you notice a much larger building, very different from the rest. It must hold some importance here. To the west is the village square and to the north are more huts. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
