R {15843}{0}{}{Willothorn Village (n,se,e)}{ }{Lined along the path here are rows of huts. They are made very simply out of wood and straw. Willothorn citizens don't have to worry about storms damaging buildings. In fact, they don't seem to have any kind of threat here at all. Any indication of hostility is just simply non-existent. You suddenly feel like an outsider as everyone seems to stare at you. To the north are more huts and to the east the village continues. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
