R {15844}{0}{}{Willothorn Village (s,e,ne)}{ }{Continuing along the path are more huts. People are busy here tending to their yards and gardens. You cannot fathom how anything can grow down here much less survive. To the north are open fields and beyond that appears to be a dense forest. The people seem completely oblivious to the fact that they are not on land as they go about their lives as if they were. You look at the sky in awe. How is all of this possible? }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
