R {15845}{0}{}{Village Square (n,s,e,w)}{ }{The Willothorn citizens are busy working here. There are several tents set up with various people performing different tasks however they do seem to take the time to stop and make conversation with one another. Everyone seems so friendly and happy. It's almost too euphoric. There has to be something more to this place that you don't know about. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
