R {15848}{0}{}{A large Building (n)}{A}{You stand before a very large building. It is not at all like the rest of the housing here. It contains intricate carvings throughout the whole facade which make it look more like a work of art than a building. You aren't sure as to the purpose of this place but it must hold some importance here. Perhaps this would allow you some answers. The entrance stands before you, however it doesn't look like there's an obvious way to get in. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
