R {15852}{0}{}{Willothorn Farmland (s,w,e)}{ }{Along this stretch of path are huge farm fields, some producing thick crops, orchards or open pastures. The fields have a variety of color ranging from deep greens to harvest browns. To the east and west are more farmland. The south leads back to the village. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
