R {15853}{0}{}{Willothorn Farmland (s,sw,e)}{ }{Along this stretch of path are huge farm fields, some producing thick crops, others are open pasture with horses, chickens and other wildlife. You cannot fathom how all this is possible and the villagers don't seem too willing to divulge any information. To the east is more farmland and south leads back to the village square. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
