R {15854}{0}{}{Willothorn Village (ne,w)}{ }{Along this stretch of path is more housing. You can see villagers out in their yards working or conversing with their neighbors. There is a little bit of an incline so you an see a lot of the village from here. It is quite stunning seeing the landscape. To the northeast is farmland and the west leads back to the village square. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
