R {15855}{0}{}{Willothorn Farmlands (e,sw)}{ }{Along this stretch of path lies more farmland which seems to extend quite a ways. This particular field seems to be growing a plant you've never seen before. It's almost like a cross between a sunflower and corn. The men in the field seem to be hard at work likely preparing for the coming harvest. You look at the sky and wonder if they ever see rain or how they manage to water their crops. So many perplexing oddities about this place make your mind wander every which way. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15854}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15856}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15856}{0}{}{Willothorn Farmlands (e,w)}{ }{Along this stretch of path lies more farmland which seems to extend quite a ways. This particular field seems to be growing more of that strange plant that looks like half sunflower, half corn. Toward the east you see more fields. Walking along the path you notice a little squirrel running through the field. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
