R {15858}{0}{}{Willothorn Farmlands (n)}{ }{Along this stretch of path are huge farm fields and pastures. This particular field looks like it is a vine orchard. Miles of grapes span this stretch of land. You spot workers in the fields tirelessly watering and pruning the vines. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15857}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15859}{0}{}{<< The Gates of Xaxis >> (w,e)}{ ⛩️}{You stand within the magnificent entrance to the fabled floating city of Xaxis. Towering gates crafted of gold and onyx stand before you, ushering you down the streets of this magical municipality. The gates are triple-arched, leading east and west as well as north, back out toward the frightening drop to the desert below. The streets are smoothly paved in black flagstones and the outer walls that protect you from falling over the edge of the city limit are made of glittering gold. Further down the streets to either side of you come the sounds of merchants eager to sell you their exotic wares. }{Xaxis}{xaxis}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15860}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15861}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
