E {15905}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15903}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15907}{0}{}{<< The Auruetian Tower >> (d,ne,e)}{ }{You can barely make your way through this room it is so crammed with machinery. Humming engines and whirring gears fill the floor and the walls. The proliferation of noise and motion is truly disconcerting. The purpose of all this metal is not readily apparent, but it certainly seems to be in production for something. Watching your step would be advisable as many of the spinning gears look quite sharp. The room is lit by a blindingly bright ceiling that pulses with white coruscation. It is much too bright to look at directly. A marble staircase leads from the western corner of the room down towards the floor below. }{Xaxis}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15905}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15908}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15910}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15908}{0}{}{<< The Auruetian Tower >> (u,se,sw)}{ }{This library is one of the most bizarre you've ever seen. It has the standard items you'd expect to find in a library, shelves on the walls, tables and chairs on the floor, books and scrolls scattered about, but nothing sits still. The chairs float around the room. The tables hop around the floor like wooden rabbits. The shelves spin around the walls in lazy circles. Most disturbing of all, the books and scrolls phase in and out of sight, disappearing for several seconds before reappearing in a different location. Some magic is at work here. It seems the owner of this library either has a strange sense of humor or a desire to keep interlopers like you from learning the secrets of his collection. A golden staircase rises out of this room at the northern end. }{Xaxis}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15907}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15909}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15911}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15909}{0}{}{<< The Auruetian Tower >> (nw,w)}{ }{This appears to be a bedroom, although it is certainly not the type of bedroom most are familiar with. The floor, ceiling, and walls are all covered in mirrors. Reflecting the room in every direction, hundreds of times, the mirrors leave you dizzy and disoriented. Floating about the room, circling overhead, are round dishes of burning paraffin. They light the room in flickering effulgence. How they maintain their state of constant motion is unclear, but in the middle of them, taking up the bulk of the air, is a huge floating bed. It hovers just out of your reach, its silk sheets billowing slightly in the draft created by the dishes' movement. }{Xaxis}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15910}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15908}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15910}{4104}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {15909}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15907}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15911}{0}{}{<< The Auruetian Tower >> (d)}{ }{This is the apex of the Auruetian Tower, home of the Supreme Archmage Tristar Auruetian. The room is decorated in fine leather sofas and chairs, a grand bed of ebony and gold, and a huge desk that takes up most of the southern wall. The northern wall features a golden staircase leading back down into the lower rooms of the tower. The ceiling is breathtaking, painted to look like the desert sky, moving from sunrise to a full moon as the eye progresses from east to west. Along the walls, dragons have been painted in bright hues of red, blue, green, and black. They seem to fly around the room, some trick of light making their wings appear to beat and their mouths seem to open into hungry cries. The floor is solid black and polished to a high sheen. }{Xaxis}{tristar}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15908}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15912}{0}{}{The Floating Airship, Jubilee}{ }{You're standing in the cabin of an airship. It flies from the city of Xaxis to territories throughout the realm of Fantasy. Take a deep breath and relax, nothing to do now but hold on and hope you make it to your destination in one piece.}{Xaxis}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {15913}{0}{<238>}{The Docks of Equinity (ne)}{<238>|||<088>}{The Docks of Equinity This well-maintained wooden dock serves as the arrival and departure point for travelers to and from the mainland.  Ropes dangle from posts set on the sides of the platform, ready for airships to anchor themselves when boarding or deboarding passengers.  The sandy coast of the Isle of Equinity stretches off to the northeast while a steep cliff marks the western border of the harbor, making landing a bit tricky for air pilots unaccustomed to the island's geography.  If you wish to leave the island it looks like you could board right away. An airship is just about to lift off! }{Isle of Equinity}{isle_of_equinity}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15914}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15912}{board ship}{board ship}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15914}{0}{<138>}{Beaches of Equinity (sw,e)}{<138>, `<088>}{Beaches of Equinity Soft white sand presses underfoot as you walk along this secluded beach, far removed from the bustle of the realm's mainland.  Light green clusters of saw grass on the south side of the coast undulate in the warm breeze, looking a great deal like the waves of the ocean that stretch off into the horizon if you look out to sea.  The sun shines down brightly, promising yet another day of heat and humidity for this remote isle.  The powdery strand continues both to the southwest and to the east. }{Isle of Equinity}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15913}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15915}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {15915}{0}{<138>}{Beaches of Equinity (s,e,w)}{<138>, `<088>}{Beaches of Equinity Water laps at the sandy shore of the island, washing it clean as the bright sunshine bleaches the sand.  Saw grass grows tall along the southern side of the beach, waving gently in the afternoon breeze. A tall sand dune rises behind the grass, blocking your view of what lies beyond the strand.  A wide path has been cut through the grass, leading over the dune and into whatever lies on the other side. }{Isle of Equinity}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
