R {15916}{0}{<228>}{A Sunny Meadow (se,n,s,e,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{A Sunny Meadow The blue skies overhead promise a day of warmth and comfort.  The wispy clouds that skip by offer not a hint of rain.  The sound of running horses echoes from off in the distance.  You're walking through a sweet smelling meadow of long grass.  A few weeds prosper amidst the grass, basking in the sunlight.  A wide path has been cut in the grass and over a low hill to the north. }{Isle of Equinity}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
