R {15917}{0}{<138>}{Beaches of Equinity (w)}{<138>, `<088>}{Beaches of Equinity The ocean stretches out before you to the north, its blue expanse fading into the horizon far away.  The sand is hot beneath your feet, its soft grains squishing with your every step.  A tall sand dune rises to the south, blocking passage to the isle beyond.  To the east lie the calm waters of an ocean bay.  Coral reefs can be seen rising from the bay, providing a haven for sealife and a beautiful view for beachcombers such as you. }{Isle of Equinity}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
