R {15926}{0}{<238>}{Maugwood (n,se,sw,ne)}{<238>( *<088>}{Maugwood Ancient trees surround you, looking sickly and rotten.  Something evil has poisoned this wood.  You can't see the sky above the trees.  Gray fog hangs in the air, blocking out virtually all light.  A growling sound reaches your ears, the noise emanating from somewhere in the distance.  Rocky terrain bruises your feet as you make your way through the dark forest.  The forest opens up to the north, exposing a much more inviting looking meadow. }{Isle of Equinity}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
