R {15939}{0}{}{Maugwood Castle (d,n)}{ }{Maugwood Castle This vantage point gives you a wide view of the forest of Maugwood below.  Off on the horizon beyond the forest lie the green fields of Equinity.  Here atop the cliff, the rocky ground leads to a castle gate standing open before you.  The castle looks old, overgrown with ivy, its ramparts cracked and crumbling.  The gate is rusted and lopsided due to a broken hinge.  Weeds cluster around the corners of the gate, slowly swallowing the path that leads beyond the gate and into the castle's courtyard. }{Isle of Equinity}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
