R {15986}{0}{<178>}{Aracel's Garden (e,enter)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{Aracel's Garden Broad-leafed aspens and towering red maples shade this beautiful garden that lies in the midst of Fairdale.  The flowers of the garden, purple delphiniums, white lilies, and pink snapdragons provide a wealth of fragrance that wafts on the air, intoxicating you with their scent.  A path leads through the garden and up a slight hill. At the top of that hill stands a silver tower.  This is the tower of Aracel, Sorceress of Light and Protector of the Forest.  You might try to enter the tower. }{Isle of Equinity}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
