R {15999}{0}{<278>}{Approach to Medlar (w,se,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are standing on a very large path, or maybe it is more like a road. To the north and west looms a very big castle. It seems to be greatly out of proportion. You wonder why anyone would want a castle built so large. There is very little wind here due to the castle blocking out most of it, although the  snow is falling steadily. West would bring you closer to the structure, southeast is a rather steep hill. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
