R {16001}{0}{<178>}{Strange Forest Clearing (sw)}{<178>. ,<088>}{This is a dark clearing in a thick pine forest. There is no wind here, but the snow falls down gently. There is a small fire in a makeshift pit here in the center of the clearing. Far to the  west you can make out some kind of dark structure, and to the southeast all you can see is blowing snow. }{Medlar Castle}{puddlum}{}{}{1.000}{1}
