R {16002}{0}{<278>}{Approach to Medlar (e,s,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{The castle dominates your view to the north. Everything about it seems to be bigger than normal. The wall is made out of very large stones and bricks. It is very quiet here with the snow falling gently. East takes you away from the castle, to the west you can see something that might be the entrance to the castle. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
