R {16006}{0}{<238>}{Gateway to Medlar Castle (s,n,w)}{<238>===<088>}{You've entered the gateway of the castle. There are usually a set of guards here. You are standing under an archway so there is no snow falling and very little wind. There is a torch hanging from both walls, lighting the gateway. You can see snow gently falling in the courtyard to the north, and a metal door to the east. To the west is a small window in the wall, and an open door, with firelight coming through it. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
