R {16009}{0}{<238>}{Gatehouse (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the gatehouse for the castle. The guards can come in here and sit by the fire to warm up. There is a roaring fire in the stone hearth, which warms the air and the stone tile floor. There is a very large wooden table, with two enormous chairs sitting next to the hearth. A window on the east wall, looks out on the entrance to the castle. Everything here looks to be twice as big as it should be. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
