R {16017}{0}{<268>}{Mainhall (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the Grand Hall of Castle Medlar. It is incredibly huge. You almost can't see the other end. A huge table dominates this room, spanning it from one end to the other. There are a few giants roaming about, lounging, and eating at the table. Servant giants also run in and out, picking up and cleaning up. The hall is lit by enormous hanging candle chandeliers. There are many colorful banners and flags hanging from the walls and rafters. To the north the hall continues, south leads to the courtyard. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
