R {16018}{0}{<268>}{Mainhall (e,w,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the north end of the great hall. You stand in awe of its incredible size and length. You could fit two or three good sized dragons in here. The main dining table comes to an end with two enormous chairs on the end. To the south the hall continues on, large doors lead off to the east and west, and there is a large dais to the north. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
