R {16021}{0}{<138>}{Throneroom (s)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{Two huge thrones sit here on this raised platform. To the south you can see all of the great hall, in all its splendor. The Lord and Lady of Medlar usually sit here, to preside over their realm, which they consider is all of the realm of fantasy. There are two large torches in golden stands on both sides of the thrones.}{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
