R {16034}{0}{<238>}{Medlar Dungeon (n)}{<238>|@|<088>}{This is the far end of the dungeon. This looks like it is used more than the rest of the dungeon that you have seen. There are tracks in the dirt floor that look like someone, or something was dragged through here. There is an iron bar door to the east. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
