R {16036}{0}{}{Ladies Bedchamber (e,n)}{ }{You've stepped into a massive room with an enormous bed dominating one corner. It looks like everything in the whole room has been very well crafted. Only the lady of the house would deserve a bedchamber like this. Large oil lamps light the room, and you  are lost in the plush carpet that surrounds you. To the north is a large hallway, and to the east is a door that is slightly ajar. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
