R {16037}{0}{}{Lady's Preparation Chamber (w)}{ }{This is a small room in comparison with the rest of the castle. There is a large wash basin in one corner, and a huge vanity with a  mirror in another corner. This room is lit with large oil lamps that throw out lots of light. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
