R {16038}{0}{<178>}{Outside Medlar (n,e)}{<178>. ,<088>}{The snow is making it very difficult to see. The castle walls rise up to the east, while there is a lower wall to the west and south. There is a large archway to the east, with an iron bar gate that stands open. You can't make out anything to the north due to the snow. }{Medlar Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
