R {16054}{0}{}{Doctor Hibbert's office (w)}{ }{    Plain white walls, scrubbed surfaces, clean examination table.  This is the epitome of sterile doctors' offices.  The only non-standard item for a doctor's office is a large jar.  The jar overflows with bright red lollipops that Doctor Hibbert is famous for giving his patients. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
