R {16055}{0}{<238>}{Moe's Tavern (out)}{<238>[P]<088>}{   Moe's is the retreat for all of Springfield's hard- working men after a rough day at the job.  Moe may be a bit stingy when it comes to watering down beer, and he may charge a bit more per drop than the Shelbyville pubs, but this place has ATMOSPHERE!  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
