R {16117}{0}{<238>}{Entrance to Cybers Insurance (n,w)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The front of the building is covered in soot and ash.  It looks as if no one has cleaned it up since the war.  Through the dirty windows of the building you think you see someone moving around.  There is a small sign beside the door. }{Cybers Insurance}{cybers_insurance}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16116}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16118}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16118}{0}{<248>}{Reception Desk (s,n,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The foyer of the insurance office is dominated on one side by a large desk.  This must be where the receptionist normally sits and answers incoming calls.  The overhead lights give off just enough light to allow you to see the dirt and grime covering the floor.  Across from the receptionist's desk, you see a small waiting room. }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16117}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16119}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16120}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16119}{0}{<268>}{A Walkway (s,w,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The fluorescent lighting is giving you a headache.  The walkway extends from the foyer toward several cubicles.  The only thing that catches your eye is a large steel door set into the wall.  Ringing phones and noisy workers can be heard from inside the cubicles up ahead. }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16118}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16121}{w}{unlock door; open door; w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16122}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16120}{0}{<248>}{Waiting Room (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The waiting room for Cybers Insurance is sparsely furnished.  Only a couple of chairs and a wobbly table have been provided for waiting customers.  Back through the doorway you can see the receptionist's desk.  There are several old looking magazines on the table. }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16118}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16121}{0}{<248>}{A File Room (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{     Is this part of the office or a prison cell?  The only light in the room is coming from a single bulb in the middle of the ceiling.  Multiple file cabinets line the walls.  The smell of human feces and urine assaults your nose.  As you begin to explore the room, your foot trips over a chain bolted to the floor. }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16119}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16122}{0}{<268>}{A Walkway (s,n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Busy workers are answering phone calls all around you.  The lighting in this part of the office is a little better.  A couple of small cubicles are on your left and right.  An elegant doorway stands at the north end of the walkway.  A gold plaque is attached to the front of the door. }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16119}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16124}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16125}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16126}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16123}{0}{<278>}{The street. (n,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{Limestone Street runs west-east. North of here is the entrance to the parking garage of Kord Mutual. There doesn't seem to be much activity around here, the corporate security firm employed by Kord seems to have chased off most of the gangs for now.  South of here is a burnt-out shell of a building. }{Atlanta}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16100}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16127}{n}{n}{1}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16128}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16124}{0}{<248>}{Office of the Manager (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This office is nothing like the rest of the building.  Most everything in the office is made out of cherry.  The floor is covered by thick, plush carpeting.  There are a couple of leather chairs sitting in front of a massive cherry desk.  Gold plated lamps and fixtures are placed throughout the room.  Behind the desk sits an elegant leather desk chair. }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16122}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16125}{0}{<248>}{A Small Cubicle (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This must be the smallest cubicle you have ever seen.  An antique computer and telephone sit on what can only be called a shelf.  A chair sits in the middle of the cubicle.  A bunch of insurance jargon is scrolling across the monitor.  Who in their right mind would want to work here? }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16122}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16126}{0}{<248>}{A Small Cubicle (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{It appears that no one works in this cubicle.  There are no signs that anyone has worked here for some time.  A layer of dust covers the shelf-like desk and chair.  The only thing that catches your eye is the outline of what looks like a body on the floor.  You shudder to think that someone actually died in this place. }{Cybers Insurance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16122}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16127}{0}{<278>}{A parking garage. (n,s,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are in a parking garage, watch out! This is the southwest corner of the ground level.  It is hard to see in here.  You hear roaring engine noises echoing off the walls. You hope that anyone driving around in here would have the sense to avoid hitting you, but somehow you doubt it. }{Kord Mutual}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16123}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16129}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16130}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16128}{0}{<278>}{The street. (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{Limestone Street runs west-east. Just north of here is part of the Kord Mutual Skyraker.  A few offices on the upper floors are lit, some people are staying late tonight. It's rumored that some of Kord's employees actually live in the  upper floors of the building.  South of here is a street hospital, known affectionately as a 'chop-shop' by its patrons.  It appears to be an incredibly seedy establishment. }{Atlanta}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
