R {16173}{0}{<278>}{A street corner. (d,n,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{Limestone Street runs west-east. You gasp for breath, car exhaust filling your lungs.  It is night in the city.  Strange sounds fill the air, along with recognisable ones, like the occasional gunshot or police siren.  Northeast from here is the Kord Mutual skyraker, stabbing up into the clouds and out of sight. Just south of here is an occult bookstore, but it is closed at this late hour in fear of gang attacks.  To the north is an alley, running into the darkness between Kord and neighbouring apartment buildings. Down from here is a BulletTrain station. }{Atlanta}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
