R {16178}{0}{<248>}{A trash filled alley (e)}{A}{Entering a small niche between the marvelous skyrakers you find yourself in a quiet back alley.  The echoing sounds of the busy streets of Atlanta can be heard far off in the distance and things are strangely tranquil here.  Dumpsters full of various discarded items are packed full and you hear the sounds of rats rustling.  Old crates are stacked well over head height and it looks as if things have been dumped here for years.  Next to one of the trash containers is lifeless body. }{Dead End Alley}{dead_end_alley}{}{}{1.000}{1}
