R {16208}{0}{<238>}{Entrance to Drexler NanoLabs, Inc. (out,n)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The glare from the brilliant white floor, walls, and ceiling nearly blinds your eyes.  Shiny metallic tubing runs across the room, reflecting the bright light from the globes lighting the ceiling right into your eyes.  A rather stiff-looking couch, tolerably uncomfortable at best, juts out of the western wall, and a squat, squarish coffee table stands in front of it.  A large metallic bookshelf stands to the left of the couch.  A large desk juts out from the eastern wall and occupies the northeast corner of the room.  A shimmering translucent computer terminal appears to float above the desk.  There is a heavy steel door on the north wall, behind which must be the actual development laboratories. }{Drexler Nanolabs, Inc.}{drexler_nanolabs}{}{}{1.000}{1}
