R {16211}{0}{}{A brightly lit, sterile hallway (w,s,n)}{ }{        Impeccably clean, the hallway reflects the intense fluorescent lights in the ceiling.  The walls and ceiling are one smooth, continuous rounded surface, incredibly smooth to the touch.  The floor is made out of some highly reflective, mirror-like material.  The ordinarily dim lights in the ceiling are amplified by the high surface albedo of the walls and ceiling, and by the reflective floor.  The shiny steel pipes hug the center of the ceiling, and run northward, towards the back of the laboratory.  To the west is a secured door. }{Drexler Nanolabs, Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
