R {16316}{0}{}{A Hallway (s,w)}{ }{Light shines in from the window making a square of light on the ground. The floor creaks slightly under your weight as you  walk through the house. There is a thick layer of dust on the ground. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16312}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16314}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16317}{0}{}{A Hallway (s,w)}{ }{The floor creaks slightly as you walk on it. Cobwebs hang from the ceiling, making it hard to see very much. You can hear birds singing outside, but otherwise, there is only silence. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
