R {16318}{0}{}{A Hallway (n,w,s)}{ }{The hallway continues north and south. To the west is an open closet. The air is full of dust, making breathing a little harder. The sound of the wind whistling through the leaves outside is the only thing you can hear. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
