R {16319}{0}{}{A Closet (e)}{ }{You are in a small musty closet. The smell of mothballs is quite strong in here. The closet is empty except for the piles of dust and webs. Not a terribly exciting sight. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16318}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16320}{0}{}{A Hallway (n,w)}{ }{The hallway comes to an end here. To the west is a small bathroom. The white of the walls has faded to a pale yellow colour from  years of neglect. All is quiet here, not a sound to be heard. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16318}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16321}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16321}{0}{}{A Bathroom (e)}{ }{The dull white of the bathroom greets you as you enter. There is a toilet and a sink here. The wallpaper has long since faded and some of the floor tiles have cracked and broken. Everything is covered in a fine layer of dust. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16320}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16322}{0}{}{A Hallway (n,w,e)}{ }{You are at a split in the hallway. Cobwebs hang from the ceiling brushing against your face. The floor is covered in a fine layer of dust, undisturbed for many years. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
