E {16323}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16324}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16323}{0}{}{A Hallway (n,s,e)}{ }{You are in a dim hallway between the dining room and the kitchen. The floor is made of a solid wood and doesn't creak when you walk on it. The kitchen is to the south and the dining room is to the north. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16322}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
