R {16324}{0}{}{A Hallway (s,w)}{ }{The dim hallway continues as you walk through the house. There is not a sound to be heard. The only light here is from the windows on the west side of the house. The dust in the air frames the light so that you can see the beams. To the south is what used to be the den of the house. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16322}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16325}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16325}{0}{}{A Den (n)}{ }{You are in the den of the old house. The room is long since empty save for an old couch and broken coffee table. The room is quite dark as there are no immediate sources of light. There is also a fireplace in the corner. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16324}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16326}{0}{}{A Dining Room (s)}{ }{You are in the dining room of the house. A long table stretches out before you in the middle of the room. To the east is a china cabinet and on the west wall, there is a small painting. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
