R {16327}{0}{}{Outside the Kitchen (s,n,u,e)}{ }{The hallway continues south from here. The kitchen is to the east. The hall is full of cobwebs and dust. It is quite dim here with no light source or windows. There is a staircase leading up here. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
