R {16328}{0}{}{Corner of a House (e,n)}{ }{You have reached the southwest corner of the house. This corner of the house seems to be a favourite nesting place for spiders as the place is covered in cobwebs. They're all over the ceiling, the walls, over the pictures, just everywhere! }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16327}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16331}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16329}{0}{}{Top of a Stairway (d,w,s)}{ }{You are standing at the top of a rickety staircase. Down below is the first floor of the house. To the west you can see an old bedroom. Further south lies the rest of the second floor. The hallway is lined with a dusty brown carpet. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16327}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
