R {16330}{0}{}{A Kitchen (w)}{ }{You are in a small, dim kitchen. Most of the furniture has been taken away. There is a space where the fridge and stove used to be. All that is left is a small dining table, the counters and cupboards. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16327}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16331}{0}{}{A Hallway (e,w)}{ }{You are in a long and dark hallway in the southern part of the house. To the west is the rest of the house. To the east, the hall gets darker and darker. Cobwebs hang everywhere, and the house is very quiet. Not a sound is to be heard. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16328}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16332}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16332}{0}{}{Top of a stairway (w,d)}{ }{The hallway is much dimmer as you continue through the house. You are at the top of an old stairway leading down to the cellar of the house. No matter what you try to do, all you can see below is darkness. You get the feeling that anything down there will be a little harder than what's up here. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
