E {16333}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16333}{0}{}{Bottom of a Stairway (w,u)}{ }{You are at the bottom of the stairs that descend to the cellar. The air is damp and cooler than upstairs, but offers no warmth. To the west is the rest of the cellar, but only darkness greets you there. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
