R {16334}{0}{}{In a Cellar (e,w)}{ }{You are in a narrow passage in the cellar. To the east is the staircase from which you came. To the west is the rest of the cellar. The passage is quite small and cramped, not allowing for very much movement. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
