E {16335}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16335}{0}{}{In a Cellar (e,n)}{ }{The cellar takes a bend here in the southwest corner. The walls are thick with moisture from the condensation of the dampness in the air. Darkness surrounds you. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
