E {16336}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16336}{0}{}{In a Cellar (n,s,e)}{ }{The air is thick with moisture down here. Only the light from your source lights your way. Beyond the boundary of that however, lies only the darkness. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
