R {16338}{0}{}{In a Cellar (w)}{ }{The cellar reaches a dead end here. Only the sight of three rough walls greets you as your light source reflects off the moist walls. To the west is the rest of the cellar. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
