R {16339}{0}{}{In a Cellar (n,w)}{ }{The air is stale and damp from years of stagnation. The  cellar is very quiet. Not a sound is to be heard down here, other than the occasional drip of water. This place has not been used in  many years. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16337}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
