R {16340}{0}{}{In a Cellar (e,s)}{ }{The light from your source offers you little warmth down here. It is hard to see anything beyond the range of your light. The air is  damp and rank just from being stagnant all these years. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
