R {16341}{0}{}{In a Cellar (s,w,e)}{ }{The cellar takes a fork here. To the east, you can see nothing but darkness. To the south, you can see nothing but darkness. What a  surprise. The air is heavy with moisture, making it difficult to breathe easily. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
