R {16342}{0}{}{In a Cellar (s,n)}{ }{The cellar continues down this narrow passage. In the distance you can hear the quiet dripping of water. The air is cold and dank making for a pretty uncomfortable experience altogether. The passage continues to the north and south. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
