R {16352}{0}{}{A Bedroom (e)}{ }{You are in a musty bedroom. The room holds a bed, a dresser, and a small table. The wallpaper, from what you can see, is faded, though some details are still visible. A set of old curtains covers the window. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
