R {16353}{0}{}{Bend in the Hallway (e,n)}{ }{The floor groans wearily as you continue through the hallway. The brown carpeting continues through the second floor as the hallway takes a bend. The walls are now a pale yellow colour, a result of many years of neglect. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
