R {16354}{0}{}{A Hallway (s,w,e)}{ }{The faint scent of soap breezes by your nose as you pass by the bathroom to your south. To the east and west lies the rest of the hallway. A web-filled north-facing window lets in only the faintest of light. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
