R {16355}{0}{}{A Bathroom (n)}{ }{You are in a small and dusty bathroom. There is a sink with a mirror on one wall, and a toilet and bathtub on the other wall. Everything would be a lovely porcelain white if it wasn't covered in a fine layer of dust. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
