R {16356}{0}{}{Outside a Bedroom (w,n)}{ }{The hallway brightens momentarily as light from the bedroom to the north shines into the hall. The carpet outside the door has started to fade from continuous exposure to the light. The hallway also ends here. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
