R {16357}{0}{}{A Large Bedroom (s)}{ }{Light streams from the large window in this bedroom. There is a huge bed partially up against a wall with a canopy over it. The room also holds a dresser and a small desk. Cobwebs hang from all around. The room looks like it hasn't been used in many years. }{Mouse House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16356}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16358}{0}{}{A balloon of silver. (exit)}{ }{A basket, woven of thin strands of steel, hangs beneath a balloon of silver.  No controls, the balloon must know its way, through the sky and through the day.  A ride to parts unknown, a journey through time, the balloon takes its travellers through the heart and mind. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
