R {16359}{0}{}{Beside a light chasm (n)}{<238>B<088>}{White, pure, bringer of life, light lifts the spirit of the area, filling it with peace and heart.  Life-giving trees burst forth from the land all around, towering high, and clustered tightly.  Sudden drop, bottomless chasm, fine spray of mist fills the air.  Bright against the ebony sky, there is nothing but luminescence hovering about the moon.  Crackle and split, a Resilient pushes through the undergrowth nearby. }{Night of Colour}{noc}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16360}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
