R {16360}{0}{}{Beside a light chasm (ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{Scattered by the forest, a soft light comes from the moon above, breathing life into the night.  Spread out over the land, the thick forest encompasses the land completely, spreading its life everywhere.  The bright ocean drops out of sight, disappearing into a bottomless chasm in an endless cascade.  Nothing but luminescence don the oft admired surface of the moon.  A whisper here, a rustle there, but seeing the source is beyond you. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
