R {16361}{0}{}{Beside a dark chasm (se,sw,ne,n,s,w,e)}{ }{Blotting out the moon, darkness seeps in from all around.  Emerging from the darkness all around, shadows hanging from their branches like a shroud of darkness, trees form a thick and gloomy forest.  Dark chasm, dropping endlessly out of sight sates itself on the dark water of the ocean cascade. Crackle and split, a Resilient pushes through the undergrowth nearby. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
