R {16362}{0}{}{Beside a light chasm (se,sw,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{A warming glow filters through the trees, full of life and heart and joy and promise.  Forest lays like a comforting blanket across the land, enveloping it with life and warmth.  Sudden drop, bottomless chasm, fine spray of mist fills the air.  Nothing but luminescence don the oft admired surface of the moon.  Crackle and split, a Resilient pushes through the undergrowth nearby. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
