R {16363}{0}{}{Beside a light chasm (se,sw,s,w,e)}{ }{Beating back the shadows of the night, a soft light surrounds, caresses, abounds.  Life-giving trees burst forth from the land all around, towering high, and clustered tightly.  The bright ocean drops out of sight, disappearing into a bottomless chasm in an endless cascade.  Inviting, but never welcoming, the moon above is marred by nothing but luminescence.  Pain and suffering, the soulless cry of a Dismal bites at your soul from somewhere too close. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
