R {16364}{0}{}{Beside a light chasm (sw,ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{Gentle, comforting, light softly fills your senses.  Trees abound, full of life, full of green, a forest grand.  The bright ocean drops out of sight, disappearing into a bottomless chasm in an endless cascade.  Round and satisfying, the moon spins high above, nothing but luminescence on its surface.  Sloughing though the air comes the biting call of a nearby Swoop. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
