R {16433}{0}{}{Beside the light ocean (se,ne,n,s,e)}{ }{Though night is well advanced, light seems to softly glow from nothing, or everything; perhaps both at once.  Life-giving trees burst forth from the land all around, towering high, and clustered tightly.  A thousand waves course through the ocean, its slow breath pulsing the water.  In, out.  Up, down.  Such is the way of life.  Shining to the northwest, a small island in the endless ocean peeks above the otherwise featureless water.  Ruling the sky, and eying the land hungrily, the greedy moon is surrounded by nothing but luminescence.  A sound like pure light rings in your mind as a nearby Radiance calls in the night. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
