R {16481}{0}{}{Resonant (u)}{ }{Perfectly circular, almost a hundred paces in diameter, the base of Resonant is home to a thin crust of bare earth.  Nothing grows, the dirt must not be deep, supported below by the same smooth stone as the walls are formed from.  A single blemish, the pathway up, mars the otherwise perfect, cylindrical hole. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
