R {16482}{0}{}{Beside the dark ocean (se,sw,nw,s,w)}{ }{Swarming over and under, around and through, shadows smother the light.  Forest across the land, everywhere it can grow it tries to expand.  Rotten trees, and grasping branches, infected by shadow.  Dark and foreboding, the black ocean consumes the light as it consumes the land.  Forever eroding, relentless, unstoppable.  Leathery whisperings tell of the flight of a nearby Gloom. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
