R {16512}{0}{}{Beside the light ocean (s,n,se,e,ne)}{ }{Gentle light floods the area, pushing away the shadows and the dark.  Trees stripe the land, filling the forest with a thousand shades of green.  A thousand waves course through the ocean, its slow breath pulsing the water. In, out.  Up, down.  Such is the way of life.  Like a beacon in the endless ocean, an island swathed in light lies far to the northwest.  The eye of the sky, the moon is haunted by nothing but luminescence.  A sound like pure light rings in your mind as a nearby Radiance calls in the night. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
