R {16513}{0}{}{Beside a light chasm (sw,nw,n,s,w)}{ }{A warming glow filters through the trees, full of life and heart and joy and promise.  Trees stripe the land, filling the forest with a thousand shades of green.  The bright ocean drops out of sight, disappearing into a bottomless chasm in an endless cascade.  Inviting, but never welcoming, the moon above is marred by nothing but luminescence.  A sound like pure light rings in your mind as a nearby Radiance calls in the night. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
