R {16514}{0}{}{Aspect (backward)}{ }{Aspect extends over the chasm below, perched precariously, dangerously above the never-ending drop.  A natural stone outcrop, worn by the spray of the ocean as it cascades into the chasm, Aspect will one day be gone.  Across the chasm, the dark maw of Forlorn can be seen. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
