R {16516}{0}{}{Beside the light ocean (s,w,sw,nw)}{ }{A twinkle of light brightens the area, a warmth fills your heart.  Spread out over the land, the thick forest encompasses the land completely, spreading its life everywhere.  Now flat, now broken with waves, the ocean changes beat to beat.  Calling to the sailors heart, wide and open, free and clear.  Bright against the ebony sky, there is nothing but luminescence hovering about the moon.  Laughing, but not amused, the noise of a nearby Timorous brightens not the air. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
