R {16517}{0}{}{Beside the light ocean (n,s,se)}{ }{A twinkle of light brightens the area, a warmth fills your heart.  Spread out over the land, the thick forest encompasses the land completely, spreading its life everywhere.  Now flat, now broken with waves, the ocean changes beat to beat.  Calling to the sailors heart, wide and open, free and clear.  Like a beacon in the endless ocean, an island swathed in light lies far to the northwest.  Often glimpsed, but never to be touched, the moon is awash with nothing but luminescence.  Silence echoes like thunder, deafening all other sound. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
