R {16518}{0}{}{Beside the light ocean (s,ne)}{ }{Dappled on the trees, the moonlight drives the shadows of the night away.  Trees abound, full of life, full of green, a forest grand.  Moon reflected in the great wide ocean, rippling gently with tiny waves.  Shining to the northwest, a small island in the endless ocean peeks above the otherwise featureless water.  Nothing but luminescence don the oft admired surface of the moon.  A piercing call, sending a ray of light dancing in the night, echoes from nearby. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
