R {16519}{0}{}{Beside the light ocean (sw,climb)}{<238>C<088>}{Beating back the shadows of the night, a soft light surrounds, caresses, abounds.  Brilliant life, trees flourishing in the light, their leaves filling the forest with green.  Ocean far and ocean wide, pulsing, living with the tide.  Shining to the northwest, a small island in the endless ocean peeks above the otherwise featureless water.  Bright against the ebony sky, there is nothing but luminescence hovering about the moon.  Silence echoes like thunder, deafening all other sound. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
