R {16520}{0}{}{Promise (u,d)}{ }{Winding trail, up the spire, into the mist.  Forest below, a carpet of green glistening in the moonlight.  Worn smooth with time, and steps of feet, the light brown rock is shot with sparkles of yellow.  Through dark, through light, over life and death one thing persists; Promise. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
