R {16521}{0}{}{Promise (u,d)}{ }{Lost in mist, not even the rock underfoot is visible.  Soft, moist, caressing the skin, the mist pervades the senses, blocking sight and sound.  Touch remains, the feeling of solid rock beneath, winding up, spiralling down. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
