R {16522}{0}{}{Promise (d)}{ }{A blanket of mist below, Promise emerges straight and true, alone above white except for the moon.  The spire broadens, a stone nest atop, worn smooth like the spiralling trail.  Dark stains mar the light rock, almost radiant in their contrast, spilt from inside the nest. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
