R {16523}{0}{}{Beside the light ocean (nw,w,s,se,sw)}{ }{Gentle, comforting, light softly fills your senses.  Brilliant life, trees flourishing in the light, their leaves filling the forest with green.  A thousand waves course through the ocean, its slow breath pulsing the water. In, out.  Up, down.  Such is the way of life.  Shining to the northwest, a small island in the endless ocean peeks above the otherwise featureless water.  The eye of the sky, the moon is haunted by nothing but luminescence.  Laughing, but not amused, the noise of a nearby Timorous brightens not the air. }{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
