R {16581}{0}{}{Resonant (u,d)}{ }{A thin path circles around the cylindrical hole that is Resonant, descending towards the bottom.  Small trickles of dirt cascade over the lip, and drift down the smooth rock walls.  From below, the echoing sounds of your footsteps upon the rock drift back up to meet you. }{Night of Colour 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
