R {16582}{0}{}{Resonant (u)}{ }{Perfectly circular, almost a hundred paces in diameter, the base of Resonant is home to a thin crust of bare earth.  Nothing grows, the dirt must not be deep, supported below by the same smooth stone as the walls are formed from.  A single blemish, the pathway up, mars the otherwise perfect, cylindrical hole. }{Night of Colour 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16581}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16583}{0}{}{Beside the dark ocean (ne,nw,n,s,e)}{ }{A dark dance of despair, the shadows slide smoothly over the light, extinguishing it gracefully.  Shadow-shrouded trees loom out of the darkness like sentinels of doom, their branches clawed and grasping.  Coursing gently towards and away, towards and away, towards and away.  Ocean, seemingly reflecting the tears of Blue, stretches till your heart aches.  Island lurking in the ocean, seemingly out of reach, the only dot in the otherwise endless ocean.  A gentle gurgling is in the air, rhythmically tempting you forward. }{Night of Colour 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
