R {16694}{0}{}{Promise (u,d)}{ }{Lost in mist, not even the rock underfoot is visible.  Soft, moist, caressing the skin, the mist pervades the senses, blocking sight and sound.  Touch remains, the feeling of solid rock beneath, winding up, spiralling down. }{Night of Colour 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16693}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16695}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16695}{0}{}{Promise (d)}{ }{A blanket of mist below, Promise emerges straight and true, alone above white except for the moon.  The spire broadens, a stone nest atop, worn smooth like the spiralling trail.  Dark stains mar the light rock, almost radiant in their contrast, spilt from inside the nest. }{Night of Colour 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16694}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {16696}{0}{}{Entrance to The 3k Mall (d,w)}{ }{This is the entrance to the parking garage which is used by the numerous shoppers at the 3k Mall. A guard station stands here, with a sign posted on it, stating the parking rates. Chances are that if the guard is on duty, you're gonna hafta pay this in advance. To the west you can see a bunch of cars parked in small slots, and past them, a set of metal doors, presumably leading into the mall. }{Chaos Mall}{chaos_mall}{}{}{1.000}{1}
