R {16697}{0}{}{A bridge (w,e)}{ }{You are crossing a bridge of mist.  In places, the mist gives way to hideous shapes made out of gold.  Which, you suddenly realize is absolutely impossible.  The more you look at them the more you start to look like them.  And anyone with an ounce of sense wouldn't like that!  Of course, they wouldn't be here either but you ignore that thought. }{Chaos}{jjj_enterprises}{}{}{1.000}{1}
