R {16704}{0}{}{In the Audience (s)}{ }{You are in a huge room full of crazy people.  They are completely out of control.  They are screaming out prices and generally making fools of themselves.  Their madness tries to invade your mind, compelling you to join them. Who knows, it might be fun. A line of people has formed in northern part of the room, probably the contestants for the next spot on the show. Perhaps you could join the line. }{Game Show}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
