R {16707}{0}{}{Your Family's Turn}{ }{Well, there's no way out now. You're stuck up here to win or lose for your entire family. The other family just screwed up and your family has the chance to steal.  You are at the head so it is ultimately up to you what your family answers. The question seems simple enough.  All you have to do is 'answer' the question 'Name something that floats'.  See what you can do.  Your family has some hints, but all you have to do is 'answer'. }{Game Show}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
