R {16708}{0}{}{-=( A messy bedroom )=- (doorway)}{ }{You have stumbled into a dimly lit room.  The pale red blinds are parted slightly, allowing a small stream of rather weak light to filter into the room.  A weak light bulb casts some additional light, but it fails to fully illuminate the room.  The light plays slowly over a scene of total chaos.  The floor is covered by a thin brown colored carpet.  A rather dirty bed is pushed tightly against one corner of the room.  A set of dirty, crumpled sheets lie over the bed.  The corner of a magazine can be seen sticking out from under the crumpled corner of the bed.  There is a large poster from Angra's "Holy Land" album fixed to one wall.  Underneath the poster is a large, rather cluttered wooden desk  with a single drawer built into it.  A large, black stereo system and  two black speakers take up the corner of the desk.  Three large shelves have been fixed to the wall above the bed.  There is a large doorway leading out of the room, and another leading into a hallway on the opposite side of the room. }{Lostar's Bedroom}{lostars_bedroom}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16700}{doorway}{doorway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

