R {16721}{0}{<238>}{Oasis (w)}{<238>(<148>~<238>)<088>}{You stumble through the hot land, sweat trickling down your face.  Suddenly you come across a sort of oasis.  Small patches of green surrounding a small pool, which seems to be slowly drying up.  You see footprints in the thin layer of dust surrounding the pool. }{Land of the Dinosaurs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
