R {16723}{0}{<238>}{Shrinking copse (se,e)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{You look around in sadness as you see that the small collection of trees that surrounds you is being gradually dried out and destroyed by the hot desert land encroaching from the north.  However, there's still a fair bit of vegetation around\; trees and bushes sprout around you, although much of their new growth appears to have been eaten away by the inhabitants of this land. }{Land of the Dinosaurs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
