R {16724}{0}{<238>}{Soft ground (nw,e,n)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{The ground squelches beneath your feet as you trudge along through the thick vegetation.  The tree roots seem to attempt to trip you, the branches block your path and the bushes scratch at you.  This doesn't seem like such a pleasant area to be in, and you decide to move on swiftly. }{Land of the Dinosaurs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
