R {16725}{0}{<228>}{Muddy ground (e,w,n)}{<228>; ;<088>}{Walking is becoming a bit more difficult now, as your feet sink a fair way into the muddy ground with each step you take.  The plant life surrounding you sags slightly as it attempts to lay down solid roots in this unsupportive ground, but some of the smaller types of grass seem to be having less trouble growing in this environment.  Looking to the east, the ground is getting even wetter, but in other directions it dries out somewhat. }{Land of the Dinosaurs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
