R {17472}{0}{}{Outside Mr. Burns' room (d,w)}{ }{    A massive marble staircase descends from here, its banisters gleaming from the light of a chandelier.  The floor is covered in thick red carpet, while the walls hold a number of framed paintings.  There is a large wooden door to the west. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17471}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
