E {17476}{climb into chute}{climb into chute}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17476}{0}{}{The laundry (e)}{ }{    This small dank room serves as the laundry for Burns Manor.  Two large washing machines sit side-by-side, with an equally large dryer on the opposite wall.  A string clothesline has been stretched across the room between the washers and dryer.  There is a small chute on the west wall that delivers the dirty laundry from elsewhere in the house. The dirty laundry is deposited into a large basket placed under the chute. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17477}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17477}{0}{}{The kitchen (w,e)}{ }{    This kitchen is on a scale that you normally would not expect to see outside of a busy restaurant.  Rows of ovens, stoves, blenders and other tools of the chef's trade are lined up along the walls.  A pantry stands open to the north. }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
