R {17481}{0}{}{-=\x7D Ticket Booth \x7B=- (s)}{ }{-=\x7D Ticket Booth \x7B=- You stand at the front of the line of the ticket booth.  It's a yellow wooden box just big enough to hold one person, a pile of cash and a roll of tickets.  The words 'Billy Bob's Big Top Circus' are painted in bright red letters across the top of the booth.  A blue sign with the price of a ticket hangs in front of ticket window. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
