R {17482}{0}{}{-=\x7D Circus Stands \x7B=- (sw,ne,e)}{ }{-=\x7D Circus Stands \x7B=- As you go through the turnstile, you are now in the stands.  Rows of wooden benches encircle the inside of the big top.  Many poles stand vertically holding up the tent.  As far as your eye can see, there are rings with various circus acts being performed in each.  To the north, you see a flurry of white flash before your eyes.  Towards the northwest, you an barely make out the center ring.  The turnstile leading you out is to the southwest. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
