R {17483}{0}{}{-=\x7D Dancing Poodle Ring \x7B=- (sw,n,e)}{ }{-=\x7D Dancing Poodle Ring \x7B=- You come upon the first circus ring and find that this is where the dancing poodles do their act.  Small staircases and brightly colored hoops are on the ground.  A little blue tutu sits on top of one of the stairs.  You cringe as you accidentally step into a small puddle of pee. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
