R {17484}{0}{<138>}{-=\x7D Big Top Shop \x7B=- (w)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{-=\x7D Big Top Shop \x7B=- The smell of cotton candy and lemons fill your nostrils.  A cotton candy machine whirls and spins behind the counter.  A large plastic box holds dozens of fresh lemons in it.  Several souvenirs hang from the wall to your left.  A sign displaying what is for sale hangs from the counter. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
