R {17489}{0}{}{-=\x7D The Center Ring \x7B=- (n,w,nw)}{ }{-=\x7D The Center Ring \x7B=- This is the center ring.  It is the largest of all the rings and many different colored spotlights dance in and out of it.  Most of the audience's attention is turned toward this ring to tell them what the next act is going to be and where. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
