R {17490}{0}{}{-=\x7D The Elephant Ring \x7B=- (n,ne)}{ }{-=\x7D The Elephant Ring \x7B=- You step carefully into the elephant ring.  A couple of stacks of hay stand at the rear of the ring.  You notice a push broom lying on the ground to your right.  Several octagon shaped stands dot the ring in a circular fashion.  You hear a cracking noise beneath your feet. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17488}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
