R {17491}{0}{}{-=\x7D The Cannon Shot \x7B=- (s)}{ }{-=\x7D The Cannon Shot \x7B=- This is the most prized ring in the circus: The Cannon Shot.  The cannon stands proudly on a small circle on the ring.  About 30 yards to the west, is a square shaped net.  In front of the ring is a long yellow line. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17489}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17492}{0}{}{-=\x7D Tightrope Ring \x7B=- (e)}{ }{-=\x7D Tightrope Ring \x7B=- This is the tightrope ring.  Two tall poles with small platforms attached to them stand inside the ring.  A long, thick cable stretches the length of the poles.  A safety net hangs from ropes tied to the poles.  This is another death defying circus act. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17489}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
