R {17493}{0}{}{-=\x7D The Stunt Ring \x7B=- (s,sw)}{ }{-=\x7D The Stunt Ring \x7B=- This is where the stuntman does his death defying act.  A large round cage dominates the center of the ring.  Just in front of the cage, is the motorcycle the stuntman rides for his act.  To the southwest, you hear a tiger's roar. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17490}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17494}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17494}{0}{}{-=\x7D The Tiger Cage \x7B=- (ne)}{ }{-=\x7D The Tiger Cage \x7B=- The dark and frightening tiger cage.  It's a large cast-iron box used to keep tigers from running amok.  Bits of bloody animal meat lie on the floor, as well as the largest water bowl you have ever seen.  A large studded collar lies on top of a wooden plank being held up by two large triangular stands. }{Billy Bob's Big Top Circus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
