R {17497}{0}{}{FuNkY sUn}{ }{You are standing on the surface of the sun.  This goes against almost everything that you have ever learned.  You find that it's pleasantly warm rather then scorching hot.  You can finally get a closer look at those sun spots and solar flares that everyone is always talking about back home. }{Funkytown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
