R {17498}{0}{}{A Path to a Pretty Garden (nw)}{ }{A well kept path leads northwest into what looks like a very pretty garden.  Small stones make up a little border that runs along the edges of the path.  Soft grass grows on both sides. }{Queen of Heart's Garden}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
