R {17499}{0}{}{The Garden Gate (w,se,ne)}{ }{The cute little path leads right up to a nice little iron gate.  You can easily tell the path would take you out of the garden to the southeast, but it also heads west and northeast around the garden.  The garden is clearly visible from here, but a nice iron fence keeps you from straying from the path.  Many fountains and sculptured hedges grace the garden, many will probably be easily viewed from the path. }{Queen of Heart's Garden}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
