R {17505}{0}{}{West Side of the Garden (ne,s)}{ }{You are on the west side of this very pretty garden.  The path continues to wind around, following the fence.  From here you can see a nice hedge sculpture. The sculpture really dominates this corner.  It is well kept, not a leaf or a twig is out of place.  The fence keeps you out of the garden, and the path leads both south and northeast from here. }{Queen of Heart's Garden}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
