R {17521}{0}{}{~o~ the Garden of Live Flowers ~o~ (ne,w)}{ }{The Garden of Live Flowers Gently drooping tree branches sway overhead, filtering the summer sunlight into soft green shade.  The gravel path cuts weird angles through the lush foliage.  The pathway circles and winds between the flower beds, making it difficult to see too far along the path.  The trees here are occasionally dizzyingly high up, as though you've shrunk, but they also sometimes seem entirely normal - how curious!  The pathway heads back to the entrance to the west, and appears to go uphill to the northeast. }{Looking-Glass Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
