R {17532}{0}{}{~o~ the dark garden glade ~o~ (e)}{ }{The dark garden glade Soft shadows from filtered sunlight pool across the wide circle of gravel at this place, the center of the garden.  Graceful willow branches arch over the circle, forming a natural dome.  For some reason this area seems in less repair than the rest of the garden - the gravel is less well groomed, and bits of grass poke between the pebbles.  Low flower beds line the edge of the circle.  The only way out is a gravel path to the east. }{Looking-Glass Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
