R {17536}{0}{}{~o~ overlooking the Chessboard ~o~ (n)}{ }{Overlooking the Chessboard The trees bow outwards from this clearing at the top of the hilly garden, open to the sky and the bright sunlight.  Vibrant green grasses that would make an excellent croquet pitch cover the space.  A gravel pathway winds down the hill towards the north.  The hilltop overlooks a strange landscape to the south.  Huge squares of wooded land are divided by straight brooks, all together making a grid in the form of an enormous chessboard. }{Looking-Glass Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
