R {17538}{0}{}{Sports Fan-atics Hall (n,w,sw,se,s,e,ne)}{ }{This is the well-appointed back sports-bar section of the Pinnacle Palisade.  The floor is made of dark oak hardwood, polished to a bright shine.  Shaped like an octagon, the expansive room's walls contain many archways leading to separate sections of the sports bar.  Where there aren't archways, clean mirrors hang on the walls, serving to make the room look even larger than it really is.  Hanging from the ceiling are symbols of each sport, describing what's through each of the archways. }{Pinnacle Sports Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
