R {17539}{0}{}{The Trivia & Puzzle Room (u,s,d,n,w,e)}{ }{This room is filled with hip and reverent artifacts of an alternative world that seems so familiar, yet is non-existent. On the walls hang photos and paintings of a thick black-haired dancer in bell bottoms with his right arm outstretched to a disco ball, a moebius strip with several ants crawling around it, a bubbly blonde with the name 'Marilyn Monroe' inscribed under- neath, and more. Also strewn about the room are Cabbage Patch Dolls, Rubik's Cubes, Chinese Finger Traps, GI Joe figures, a Mr. Potato Man to name a few. You notice a half-burnt parchment entitled 'Constitution' and your eyes light up as you think only of more hit points. It's a curious collection transported here by a most curious and powerful magic, and although you have never seen these items before, it is as if you have stumbled upon a forgotten dream. A marble stairwell twirls upwards into a swirling portal of color and light. }{Trivia Room}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
