R {17540}{0}{<248>}{Getaway (w,e,u,s,n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You are at the entrance of the Great Getaway, where everyone has fun, enjoys company, and exudes happiness!  There could truly be no other place to go for enjoyment after a hard day in the realms.  Everyone is having a great time.  There is a stairway leading up out of the getaway, but you can't imagine why anyone would want to leave this fine place. }{The Great Getaway}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
