R {17542}{0}{}{A College Dorm Room (u,e)}{ }{You are standing in a typical college dorm room. From the moment you entered, you felt a definite sense of being at home. Clothes are thrown about the room in a disorderly fashion, with little regard for keeping the room clean. There is one bed on the left wall, right next to a small closet. On the wall above the bed lie two posters, mirrored on the other wall by an even larger poster. The other bed is elevated above your head, with a computer desk beneath it, so as to maximize space. Across from the desk are two bureaus, stacked on top of each other. In the upper left hand corner of the room, on top of the bureaus is a large stereo, with long wires leading to four feet speakers sonically placed in different corners of the room. Finally, there is a small spiral staircase in the upper right-hand corner of the room\; and on the wall next to the closet, there is a large window that for some reason has been screwed shut. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17537}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17545}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17543}{0}{}{The Pinnacle Humidor (out)}{ }{As you enter the humidor you are assaulted by the sweet smell of the fine tobacco around you.  The entire room is made of red cedar with deep shelves lining three of the four walls floor to ceiling.  On each shelf, spaced out to allow for breathing room, lie smaller humidors filled with a multitude of different cigars.  Each of the smaller humidors is open to offer a pleasing view of its contents.  The fourth wall is dominated by a cedar counter and the man sitting behind it who seems to be the owner of the establishment.                                              You could type "list" to see what is available.                          }{The Pinnacle Humidor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17537}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17537}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17544}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {17545}{0}{}{Uno Tournament Room (d)}{ }{Welcome to the Uno Tournament Room.  This is the place where the denizens of Pinnacle come when they wish to compete for the coveted Uno Championship title.  In the center of the room are five large mahogany card tables.  Each table is surrounded by four very comfortable-looking leather chairs.  Hanging from the ceiling, high above each table, is a small glass chandelier. Situated within the southwest corner of the room, is a small wooden booth where information about upcoming tournaments can be found.  A large plaque hangs on the west wall beside the booth. }{Uno Tournament}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17542}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17546}{0}{}{Sports Fan-atics Hockey Lounge (s)}{ }{The walls here are painted white on the bottom, and there is a red chair-rail running around the perimeter of this oval-shaped room.  Above the chair-rail are mirrors in the shape of the plexiglass that surrounds hockey rinks.  The floor is ice-white, and has all the standard markings of a hockey rink.  Along the wide far wall is a bank of televisions, each showing a different game.  Spread around the room are chairs and tables to sit down and watch the games at. }{Pinnacle Sports Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17538}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17547}{0}{}{Sports Fan-atics Basketball Lounge (e)}{ }{The lights are brighter in here than they are in the other rooms.  Additionally, the floor is a lighter color -- this one is the same color as the floorboards in the NBA!  This floor even has all the same markings as a basketball court does\; about the only thing missing are the hoops.  TVs on the far wall display a multitude of basketball games, and tables and chairs are scattered about the room, offering places to sit. }{Pinnacle Sports Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17538}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17548}{0}{}{Sports Fan-atics Golf Lounge (ne)}{ }{Here, the floor is actually a grass-green rug.  In the far corner is a small hole in the floor, with a yellow flag sticking out of it.  There are a couple of TVs on the far wall, and it's very quiet in here.  For seating arrangements, there are tables and chairs about, but they look like they're trying to hide in the shadows so as not to be seen. }{Pinnacle Sports Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17538}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17549}{0}{}{Sports Fan-atics Soccer Lounge (nw)}{ }{This lounge looks like the back room of a pub.  It's dingy and dark with spilled beer on the floor and scarves adorning the walls.  Despite the decor you still feel extremely welcome somehow.  Pictures of the legends of the past and present stretch from wall to wall gazing down upon you, instilling you with a sense of awe and history.  A massive widescreen T.V. takes up the northeast corner of the ceiling and plays live games back to back.  So grab a pint from Hey You, sit yourself down on one of the worn sofas, kick back and enjoy the match.  They don't call it the beautiful game for nothing. }{Pinnacle Sports Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17538}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17550}{0}{}{Sports Fan-atics Baseball Lounge (n)}{ }{The floor in this room contains a miniature painted replica of a baseball field.  Home plate is right at the entryway, with the first base line extending diagonally to the right, and third base going diagonally left.  The pitcher's mound is about six steps into the room, and second base is six steps beyond that.  At each of the bases, of course, is a table with four bar stools around it, giving adventurers places to sit and enjoy the games playing on the TVs.  Around the edges of the room are benches made to look like bleachers. }{Pinnacle Sports Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17538}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17551}{0}{}{Sports Fan-atics Football Lounge (w)}{ }{The floor is covered with FieldTurf[TM], marked every three feet with yardage markers.  According to the floor, this room is about 15 yards long, and about 10 yards wide.  Overstuffed leather couches line the left wall, whereas the right wall is covered with widescreen digital TVs, each showing a different football game.  The walls are covered with pennants of every team in the league, as well as memorabilia from throughout the history of the NFL. }{Pinnacle Sports Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17538}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17552}{0}{}{At the base of a dune (board ornithopter,s)}{ }{You are in between some very large dunes, where the sand has become smooth and flat.  Unscalable mounds of desert sand surround you with the exception of a rock outcropping to the south.  Ornithopters frequently land and take off from this spot, transporting the fremen legions to their destinations.  You can hear the whirring sound of the 'thopter engines coming from all around you.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53348}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {72}{board}{board}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17553}{0}{}{o( On a loading ramp )o (n,s,e,leave)}{ }{You're standing along the slightly slanted floor which allows access into the Traak.  Heading east leads into the main halls, while heading west leads back out the giant creature's maw.  The temporary storage rooms to the north and south have been transformed into an equipment vault and a makeshift store to equip Sii before they head out on their adventures.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
