R {17554}{0}{}{The Back Room (u)}{ }{You're in the backroom of the pub.  A shady place, where people come to discuss their 'exploits', if you know what I mean.  You see graffiti all over the walls and several unkind references to 'your' mother and father.  This is not a place for children. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17541}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17555}{0}{}{A Shadowed Room (d)}{ }{A barren and empty storage room. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17541}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17556}{0}{}{}{ }{}{Trivia Room}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17539}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17557}{0}{}{A small bridge club (n)}{ }{Small square tables sit empty throughout the room, each surrounded by four chairs.  The lighting here is pleasant, but you're struck mainly by the silence, as if a fortune has been spent on acoustic damping.  In the back of the room a notice board sits beside some sort of vending machine. }{Bridge Club}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17539}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17558}{0}{}{A smokey card room (s)}{ }{A typical smokey card hall except you don't see anyone really sitting around playing.  All of the tables and chairs are covered in dust. In the corner of the room you see a dispenser of some sorts.  On the wall to your left is a cashier machine.  Perhaps you should look at them. }{Poker Room}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17539}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17559}{0}{}{Bruno's Body Piercing (e)}{ }{Bruno's Body Piercing Entering Bruno's body piercing many things stand out.  A counter extends along the northern and western wall.  The glass case is filled with many types of earrings.  A large sign is fastened to the back wall behind the counter on the northern wall.  On the east wall is a large mirror.  A few stools are in front of the mirror all having their own little table top.  The many light fixtures mounted to the ceiling give off ample light. }{Bodyshop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17539}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17560}{0}{}{Scavenger Hunt Room (w)}{ }{This is the scavenger hunt game room. If you want to enter the hunt,  type 'enter scavenger hunt' to pick up a list of items you need to  find. When you find an item in the list, you need to come back and  'submit <item>' to submit it. You can take as long as you need to  finish the hunt. There is no time limit, if you can't find all items  in one reboot. Don't worry,  your progress will be saved when you  logout. And you can continue the next time you logon.  Note: If you are stuck, you can 'restart scavenger hunt' to get        a new list of items for 1,000 coins. But if you choose to        do so, all your previous work, items found will be erased.        And if you lost your item list, you can replace it here by        typing 'replace item list'. If you think an item in your       list is no longer available, you can 'check <item>' to see        if that's the case. It will cost you 100 coins to check        an item. Make sure you type the short description of the        item exactly as it appears in your item list.  }{Scavenger Hunt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17539}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17561}{0}{}{The office of P.J. Kludgenstone (exit)}{ }{What a strange office, it appears to be made completely out of frankfurters!  Big ones, small ones, fat ones and skinny ones, they are everywhere you look.  Besides the door you entered, there is a large desk, behind which Mr. P.J. Kludgenstone usually sits, with a formidable bookshelf situated against the wall behind it.  There is a faint smell of sausagey goodness in the air. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{sausage_dimensions}{}{}{1.000}{1}
