R {17562}{0}{<258>}{A freezer full of meat (portal,s,se,e)}{<258>(<158>P<258>)<088>}{One of the hanging carcasses behind you starts to swing noisily, but when you turn around, it stops suddenly.  All around, rows and rows of freshly killed meat glisten in the crisp, cool air for as far as the eye can see.  Underfoot, a cold concrete floor threatens your footing, making travelling around this meat locker very treacherous.  You appear to be in the northwest corner of the meat locker. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
