R {17598}{0}{}{Stranger's treehouse (e)}{ }{   You stumble upon a large tree which stands in the middle of the clearing.  Large limbs shoot out from its upper trunk and spread above your head.  A slight breeze blows across your face, the smell of beer filling your nostrils. You begin to wonder exactly what kind of tree this is.  Looking higher amongst the tree limbs, you can scantly see a treehouse that has been built at the very top.  Either some children have been playing or some adults got really bored and made their own private drinking area.  A rope dangles in front of you beckoning you to climb up the rope.  }{Stranger's Treehouse}{strangers_treehouse}{}{}{1.000}{1}
