R {17599}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (s,n)}{ }{The willow trees sway to and fro from a light gust of wind that blows by you.  The ground beneath your feet shifts and moves as you walk upon it.  The swamp floor is littered with leaves and branches.  Small shrubs block your way to the east and west.  A small sign can be seen coming from one of the shrubs. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
