R {17600}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (w,n)}{ }{The humid weather brings out the wildlife of the swamps, whether they are welcome visitors or not.  The willows here are tall and makes things hard to see in any direction.  Off in the distance you hear strange noises\; possibly just in your head. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
