R {17601}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (n,e)}{ }{Small patches of upturned soil make your movement through the swamp tricky.  Green moss lines the trees and the surrounding area.  The cawing of some of the local birdlife echo in your ears.  All and all, the scenery about you is divine. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
