R {17602}{0}{}{Murky swamp water (n,s,w)}{ }{It looks like you just stepped in a rather large puddle of water and mud.  The number of trees in this particular area seem to be getting fewer and fewer.  Rays from the sun shine down upon you like streaks of fire.  It just seems to be getting hotter with every step you make further into the swamp. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
