R {17603}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (w,s)}{ }{Off to the west you hear the chirping of crickets and what seems to be someone talking.  A small hole in the ground here almost makes you trip as you pass by it.  The willows around you give an eerie sensation, almost as if there is an evil presence somewhere hiding. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
