R {17604}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (n,s,e)}{ }{Sweat pours from the brow of your forehead.  The temperature of of the swamps is ever increasing, the need for a drink is clear. In the distance to the north a small pond can be seen, but getting to it seems impossible through this obstacle course. The sound of a running motor can be heard to the south. What would be way out here? }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
