R {17605}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (e,s)}{ }{You are now standing in front of a large pond within the swamps.  The smell from the murky water almost makes you gag.  A lot of lily pads float along the top of the pond, and you wonder which of the swamp's wildlife dwells around here.  Debris from a nearby tree also litters the pond's surface. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
