R {17606}{0}{}{Edge of a swamp (s,n)}{ }{A small open marshland lies in front of you. The willow trees seem to be growing sparsely around you.  Some small tree trunks can be seen every few yards or so.  It seems as if someone or something has been uprooting the trees.  The over turned soil and the wet marsh floor make traveling harsh. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
