R {17607}{0}{}{Highway 99 (e,n)}{ }{A large highway road intersects here coming from the the northeast and leading off eastward. A couple small willow trees dominate the surrounding area of the road.  Looking upon the pavement, you see some tire tracks.  A vehicle must have just passed through recently. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
