R {17608}{0}{}{Highway 99 (e,w)}{ }{The highway turns off to the northeast as well as westward from where you came.  There seems to be a Budweiser truck parked here along side of the road.  Apparently the driver noticed he had a stow-away along for the ride.  The willow trees of the marshlands sway back and forth as a cool brisk breeze of wind blows by. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
