R {17609}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (s,w)}{ }{Travelling along through the swamplands, a distant flowing sound can be heard.  The confusion of the highway behind you now, you look off to the south and see more of the swamplands that seem to just keep going onward.  The willows become more abundant in the surrounding area, a water source must be near. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
