R {17610}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (n,s,e)}{ }{It's awfully peaceful here in the swamps.  The only sound you hear is that of the chirping of crickets as well as the sound of running water.  The willow trees here seem to thrive off the wet swamp environment.  The sun's rays beam down upon you through the patches of sky you can see through the tree tops. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
