R {17611}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (n,s,e)}{ }{Deep within the Brewery swamps, you begin to feel a little shaken. Everything about you seems the same and you begin to lose your directional senses.  The willows are still here if not more and more populated than other sections of the swamp.  The sound of running water catches your attention to the east. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
