R {17612}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (w,s,e)}{ }{Animal tracks catch your attention upon the swampland floor. Judging from their small size, it could be a numerous amount of woodland creatures.  Mosquitos fly around you, smelling the sweat from you body and clothing.  If anything is clear, it's that you yearn for a nice cold drink.  The heat in the swamps is unreal. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
