R {17613}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (w,n,s,e)}{ }{The heat is now really getting to you.  Where in this god forsaken swamp can you get a nice cold drink?  Rumbling noises can be heard to the east, just beyond the large expanse of the willows and shrubbery.  Your feet sink in to the soft and delicate soil on the marshland floor. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
