R {17614}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (s,w)}{ }{Walking in to this room you immediately notice your mistake. A large snake's nest rests on the ground of the swamp.  If you you are lucky enough to avoid a confrontation, it would be in your best interest to leave as fast as you came.  The willow trees around you impair your vision, but you think you hear running water to the southeast. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
