R {17615}{0}{}{Entrance to a bridge (w,n,s,e)}{ }{You've reached the swampy marshland's end.  A large river protrudes from the earth in front of you.  Further to the east you see a small island in the distance.  The only way you are going to get to the island is by crossing the wooden bridge you see before you. Looking across at the island, it appears to be elevated by a large riverbank, so swimming across would be extremely useless. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
