R {17616}{0}{}{A swampy marshland (e,n)}{ }{The floor beneath your feet is quite muddy, which makes any form of movement a challenge.  A large fallen down willow tree rests upon the ground.  The forested swamp around you becomes less dense to the south.  The sound of rushing water alerts you to a larger water source nearby. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
