R {17618}{0}{}{Wet swampy marshland (w,n)}{ }{Not totally paying attention to where you're heading, you nearly fall face first into a large river that flows through here.  Looking across the way, a small island can be seen to to the east.  There's no way to cross the river here on to the island.  Your body sweats from the pores as the heat in the swamps increases. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
