R {17619}{0}{}{A wooden bridge (e,w)}{ }{Walking along the bridge you gaze out at your surroundings.  The river Jalyn flows underneath you. As you look down into the water, you marvel at how clear the water is.  A school of fish swim by peacefully.  The few small ripples in the water tell you the tide must be coming in. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
