R {17620}{0}{}{A wooden bridge (n,w,e)}{ }{Continuing your way across the wooden bridge, you notice a small building to the north of you.  It leads directly down on to the  the water's surface.  This would be an ideal place to catch a few fish.  The river beneath you begins to pick up speed.  The once small ripples along the top now look like small waves. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
