R {17621}{0}{}{A wooden gazebo (s)}{ }{The gazebo leads down into the water's depths.  It serves as a fishing pier as well as a loading dock or launching pad.  A rather large boat is docked here, and takes up most of the area.  The waves of the river seem to subside as the motor on the racing boat comes to a halt. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
