R {17622}{0}{}{A small island (s,w)}{ }{A small bridge leads over the riverbank.  The willows around you thrive off of the river that flows by.  Directly to the west you see the swamplands you traveled through to get here.  In your best interest you scan your surroundings and notice that you walked upon a small island within the river Jalyn itself. The only thing connecting you to the mainland, is the small bridge you crossed. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
