R {17623}{0}{}{A small island path (e,n)}{ }{Walking along a windy path through the island, strange sounds and noises can be heard to the northeast.  The river flows on to the south of you, and the willow trees all around.  Light from a small building peeks through the brush along the path. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
