R {17624}{0}{}{A small island path (w,n)}{ }{Directly to your north is the source of the strange noises you have been hearing.  The building is small, but looks like an ideal place for a pub. The large willow trees envelop you, and only the sound of the river nearby do you know where you are located.  The temperature remains to rise, the need for a nice cold drink is clear.  What better time to find a pub. }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
