R {17625}{0}{<238>}{The Reservoir Tavern (s)}{<238>[P]<088>}{            Welcome to the Reservoir Tavern!!           A large bar can be seen directly in front of you.  This place looks rather empty, but not too many visitors travel this way. Chairs and tables line the walls, and a small dance floor lies in the middle of the room.  A well lit sign in a green neon light advertises to the customers what this place is vending to the public.    For the heavy drinker.        For the light hearted.     Budweiser        20 coins      Coffee   320 coins     Liquid Orgasm   200 coins      Water     80 coins     Rolling Thunder 390 coins     Eclipse         980 coins }{Brewery Swamp}{}{}{bar}{1.000}{1}
