R {17626}{0}{}{Stranger's treehouse (w,e)}{ }{   You stand in the middle of the first floor of Stranger's treehouse. Looking down you notice that you are about twenty-five feet from the ground.  Looking around the middle of the room, you notice that most of this treehouse has been created out of little pieces of wood and duct tape.  It's a good thing Stranger knows how the world is held together or else this place wouldn't last through a gentle breeze. Rooms extend to the north, west and east, although it appears that you will have to crawl through a small hole to go northward.  It looks like Stranger ran out of wood to make the hallway bigger.  A large rope in the center of the room makes you believe that this treehouse is bigger than it appears.  }{Stranger's Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
