R {17627}{0}{}{Stranger's secret treehouse (e)}{ }{    You've walked right into the bird's cage.  It's not necessarily a bird cage but the entire floor is covered in newspaper and a single perch stands in the middle of the room.  The room is a complete disaster area.  Someone really should clean this place up.  It appears that the only way out of here is from where you came.  It looks like some large bird lives here.  Watch out where you step, you might end up with bird poop on your boots.  }{Stranger's Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17626}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17628}{0}{}{Stranger's treehouse (w)}{ }{   You have stumbled into the most secretive place that you have ever encountered.  This is Stranger's relaxation room. This must be where Stranger comes to unwind and program those neat little monsters that you so dearly love to hack and slash.  In the corner of the room lies a few crates that Stranger must've used to haul everything up to this treehouse.  A computer desk sits near the far wall, his computer turned on.  Directly to the right of you sits one of the oldest couches that you have ever seen.  }{Stranger's Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17626}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17629}{0}{}{The cat's corner (s)}{ }{   You walk into a small section of the treehouse where the overwhelming smell of cat urine and catnip fill the air.  A small litter box sits in the corner waiting for its master to make a deposit.  Yellow stains blot the lower two feet of each wooden panel on the wall. Situated in the back of the room is a small bed with a few torn up blankets which appears to be a bed of some sorts.  You can't help but wonder why someone would ever want to sleep here.  }{Stranger's Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17626}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17630}{0}{}{Chaos Laundry Services (leave)}{ }{This is the Chaos Laundry, home of Zaziekl the Chaos Laundry Master. If you need clothes cleaned, scrubbed, or dried, this is the place to come! To the left of you is a line of washing machines, and to the right is a line of dryers. In the middle of the room, a worn wooden counter stands, with a small register on it. The black marble floor is layered with dust, looking like it hasn't been cleaned in ages. }{Chaos Laundry}{chaos_laundry}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17595}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
