R {17631}{0}{}{A path in the wall. (return,ne,nw)}{ }{You now stand in a narrow walkway, somewhere between the washing machine and oblivion. Mildewed piles of lint are scattered throughout the walkway, with pools of water forming at the bottom. To the northwest and northeast, the smell of fabric softener wafts in. Light seeps in from the ceiling, giving the walkway a strange glow. }{Chaos Laundry}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
