R {17632}{0}{}{A bend in the walkway (s,nw)}{ }{Another curve in the walkway, somewhat like the one before. Piles of lint are scattered throughout the area, making it hard to traverse the narrow floor. The smell of fabric softener is almost overwhelming, making it seem that you are stuck in a bottle of it. }{Chaos Laundry}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
