R {17633}{0}{}{A narrow walkway (sw,n)}{ }{This part of the walkway is somewhat like the others, drab in appearance, and lacking anything too interesting. Various pools of stagnant water and moldy lint are scattered throughout the area. The soft dripping sound of water echoes from the distance. The walkway continues to the north, and to the southwest. }{Chaos Laundry}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
