R {17634}{0}{}{Further along the path. (n,se)}{ }{It seems the walkway continues leading onwards towards the unknown. From what you can tell, this place hasn't been disturbed in years. Wavering pale light filters into the area from above. The piles of lint are still present, and the walkway leads north, or back southeast. }{Chaos Laundry}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
