R {17635}{0}{}{At a junction (se,sw,s)}{ }{This seems to be an intersection of sorts, with the walkway continuing southeast, southwest, and also branching off to the south. The lint piles seem to lessen towards the south, but the smell of fabric softener almost overwhelms your senses. }{Chaos Laundry}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
