R {17639}{0}{}{Lair of the Pants Nazi (n)}{ }{This is it! This must be the source of all the missing laundry. Huge piles of pants litter the room, some stacked neatly, and the rest just chaotically strewn about. This is the home of the Infamous Pants Nazi! }{Chaos Laundry}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
