R {17647}{0}{}{Entrance to Bowling City (n,w,e,out)}{<168>O<088>}{You have entered through the doors of Bowling City. All around you the sounds of pins cracking can be heard.  The rug is pretty worn down and ugly but still quite usable for a bowling alley.  To the west, you can make out a desk and a few pool tables.  To the north, rows and rows of bowling lanes stretch from east to west as far as the eye can see.  To your east lie some type of food joint and a small arcade that doesn't look too exciting.... }{Bowling City}{bowling_city}{}{}{1.000}{1}
