R {17648}{0}{}{Corner in a Mall (s,w)}{ }{From here you see rows of stores lining the hallway, which flows westward. South of here is the exit to the mall, leading out to the parking garage which you entered. There don't seem to be many people in this section of the mall, but further west you see some commotion. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
