R {17650}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (w,s,e)}{ }{Through the glass wall to your south you look into a CVS pharmacy, which isn't exactly the most exciting thing you've seen all day, so you look around this section of the east-west hallway looking for something to pique your curiosity. But not surprisingly, there is nothing to look at except perhaps the grime between the ceiling panels. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
