R {17651}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (w,s,e)}{ }{To your south lies a CVS Pharmacy, which doesn't seem to be too busy. It's a rather large one, and it continues to the east. The floor tiles around here could probably use a waxing, as your feet are kinda sticking and moving choppily. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
