E {17654}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17652}{0}{}{CVS Pharmacy (n,w)}{ }{There's nothing like a CVS when it comes to convenient everyday shopping - except maybe K-Mart. Or any other number of stores which have basically all the same things that these convenience stores do. But, credit should be given where credit is due, and CVS has done a good job of putting many different kinds of household merchandise together under one not-too-huge roof, in a well organized way. The aisle you happen to be standing in is the Hygiene Section. CVS continues to the west, where you see the prescription desk. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17650}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17653}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17653}{0}{}{CVS Pharmacy (e,n)}{ }{You stand at the pharmaceutical desk at CVS, probably the single most annoying place in the world. All around you, you see boxes and boxes of medical supplies. Unfortunately, none of the clerks at the desk ever look up from their friggin' notepads on which they furiously scribble nothing of importance. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17652}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17651}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17654}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (w,n,s,e)}{ }{You are walking through more of the hallway which stretches west-east along the southern side of the mall. The white tiles are a bit grimy here. To your north you hear a lot of commotion, but as you peer that way you cannot see what's causing it. You just see a lot of people. To the south is a door marked 'Ladies Room'. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
