R {17655}{0}{}{Hallway in a mall (w,s,e)}{ }{This is just a plain old hallway, identical to the other parts of the mall you've seen. To the south is Egghead Software, while the hall continues to the east and west. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
