R {17656}{0}{}{At an escalator (s,n)}{ }{This is where people will be able to go up to the second level of the mall, or down to the Food Court below, once their construction is complete. As you can imagine, having four escalators (One leading up, one leading down, two bringing people to this level) in one little section is going to lead to a very messy situation, so you hope the mall administrators will think up something more logical. But for some reason, you doubt they will. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
