R {17657}{0}{}{Ladies Room (n)}{ }{There are about three stalls in this room, and they are all perpetually full, no matter what time of the day it might be. A huge mirror lines the western wall, and a number of mall chicks stare at you strangely with one eye, as the other stares into the mirror. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17654}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17658}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (n,s,e)}{ }{This is a hallway on the first level of the shopping mall. To your west is JC Penney, your mom's favorite store, and to your south is a new store called Natural Wonders. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17655}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
