R {17659}{0}{}{Egghead Software (n)}{ }{This place is generally regarded as one of the better places to find your software supplies. They have a really stupid looking mascot, that Egg-Dude, and he's everywhere you look. The shelves are full of programs. Hardware is also sold here, they have CD-ROM drives, Soundblasters, basically everything except the computers themselves. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17655}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17660}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (s,w,n)}{ }{This is a hallway on the first level of the shopping mall. There is a vile stench here, as if someone poured a bottle of toe out on ground and let it simmer in the summer heat. You assume Pike has been here recently. To the west is JC Penney, and you can barely make out some shops to the north and south. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17658}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17662}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17663}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17661}{0}{}{Natural Wonders (n)}{ }{This is a rather new store, and seems very popular. As you walk in you see all kinds of strange little mind games along the eastern wall, and natural jewelry in a case on the west wall. Numerous other items fill in the rest of the store, such as maps of Africa, stuffed animals, and clothes. There is also a bin full of rainsticks towards the southern end. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17658}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17662}{0}{}{JC Penney (s,n,w,e)}{ }{This is the main entrance to the first level of JC Penney. A stack of catalogs stands by the door, and a large perfume booth fills the general area in front of you. There is a large white sign hanging from the ceiling and the scent here is wonderful. There is a cashier's station to the north, while to the south and west your view is blocked by the perfume booth. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
