R {17663}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (s,n,e)}{ }{This is a hallway on the first level of the shopping mall. To your west is JC Penney, and to your north is The Wiz, while the hallways continues south and east. Someone seems to have dropped some ice cream here, you hope it doesn't attract a bunch of bugs! }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
