R {17664}{0}{}{JC Penney (n)}{ }{This is the women's apparel section. Dresses, skirts, cheesy business suits, pocket books, and gaudy evening gowns hang on the many clothing racks. Few women do their holiday shopping here. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17662}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17665}{0}{}{JC Penney (s,w)}{ }{Here is the cashier's table in JC Penney. Occasionally you will find an actual cashier within thirty feet of this table, but it is rare. Usually they are to the south, in the perfume section, yapping with the saleswomen, or to the west, looking at clothes for their husbands. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
