R {17666}{0}{}{JC Penney (n,s,e)}{ }{This is the area which is basically clear of everything for no reason. The white tile floor shines dully, and a PA speaker is mounted high up on the ceiling. If the speaker is on, you might get annoyed by it. You see a dressing room to the south, some clothing to the north, and you smell a beautiful smell from the east. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
