R {17667}{0}{}{JC Penney (s,e)}{ }{This is the mens' section of Penney. It is full of tightly packed racks of three year old clothing, flourescent T-shirts, and in their 'modern man' section, the newest in mens' fashion, the bright yellow flannel. How this place stays in business you don't really know. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
