E {17666}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17668}{0}{}{JC Penney (n)}{ }{You are in the dressing room, where all the slimy townies hang out trying to catch a peek up some girl's skirt. As if mall girls wear skirts! Boy, how ridiculous... }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17666}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17669}{0}{}{The Wiz (e,s)}{ }{This is one of the best electronic stores in the nation, there can be no doubt. This is the CD section, where they have thousands and thousands of CDs, but surprisingly, they don't carry the ones you want. The best thing about The Wiz is that they usually have very good prices. This one is no exception. Most CDs are priced at $12.98 or less, just like the sign said as you walked in. CDs storage racks are piled up in the western corner, and the classical section is towards the northern end of the room. Pop and rock make up the majority of the center aisles. The Wiz's Audio/Visual section is to the east. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17663}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17671}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17670}{0}{}{Hallway in a mall (n,w,e)}{ }{This hallway is as white and as plain as all the other parts of the mall's halls, but in this area there usually sits a small Korean woman selling jewelry and interesting trinkets from a vending cart. To the north is The Wiz, and the hallway continues to the east and west. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17663}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17671}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17672}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17671}{0}{}{The Wiz (s,w)}{ }{This is the Audio/Video section of The Wiz. Nobody beats it. Here you can find many different brands of TVs, stereos, CD players, and every other kind of home entertainment out there. Surprisingly, The Wiz's ads are true- they do have pretty darn good prices. But those bright red uniforms just gotta go! How tacky! }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17669}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17670}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17672}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (w,n,s,e)}{ }{The hallway continues here, and intersects with a corridor from the south. You look that way and notice what you think to be escalators. North of you is a door labeled 'Men's Room'. To your west and east the hallway continues. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17670}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
