R {17673}{0}{}{Men's Room (s)}{ }{This is the mall's one and only WC, can, john, crapper, pisser, and toilet. It's remarkably clean, but you would _never_ put your butt on one of those things! }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17672}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17674}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (w,n,e)}{ }{You're in a hallway which heads east-west, traversing the northern side of the mall. To your north lies the entrance to Victoria's Secret, and you look around in amusement as single guys either avert their eyes, or stare into the store with hopes of seeing a naked mannequin. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17672}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
