R {17675}{0}{}{Victoria's Secret (e,s)}{ }{Well, here you are in the most popular of all mall stores, Victoria's Secret. Women's underattire adorn the walls and clothing racks. You might be wanting a much more detailed description of this room... but you're not going to get it. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17674}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17677}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17676}{0}{}{Hallway in The 3k Mall (w,n,e)}{ }{The first thing you notice as you enter this section of the hallway is the large stream of people entering the store to your north. Peering at the sign above the door tells you why - it's Victoria's Secret! The hall continues to the west, where you notice V's continues, and to the southeast is the mall's exit. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17674}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17677}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
