R {17677}{0}{}{Victoria's Secret (s,w)}{ }{This is the room in Victoria's Secret where nobody goes, the body lotion and perfume room. However, this particular store has used its brain and put some lingerie in here as well, which keeps the customers flowing. The majority of the lingerie, however, is to the west. }{Chaos Mall}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17675}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17676}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17678}{0}{<238>}{Lanes 51-100 (s,w)}{<238>|||<088>}{From here you can see the end of the bowling lanes.  The vast expanse of lanes comes to an end over by the eastern wall.  This portion of the lanes seems to be overcrowded by a redneck get together of some sort. You find it rather funny to watch the drunken rednecks as they stumble over the recently waxed floor. }{Bowling City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17647}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17685}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {17679}{0}{<248>}{Main Desk (s,n,w,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You start to gag as you get your first whiff of the smoke that lingers within the building.  It seems to carpet everything in sight.  The only reason you can orient yourself is that you can still hear the loud smack of bowling balls as they knock down pins. Through the smoky haze you can see a large desk in front of you. }{Bowling City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17647}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {17685}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
