R {17680}{0}{<268>}{Hallway (se,w,s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Somehow you've ended up so that you are in no one particular area of Bowling City.  You seem to be sort of stuck between the lanes, the arcade and the snack shop.  Not much here to see or do so why don't you just move on? }{Bowling City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
