R {17728}{0}{}{Old Legoland Castle Wall (d,jump,nw)}{ }{You find yourself atop the yellow lego wall surrounding the castle.  On one side you see the wicked moat which would surely be a fatal fall. But on the other side you can see the writhing lego fields that you encountered on your way here. Back to the southwest a narrow walkway leads to some stairs back into the castle. }{New Legoland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
