R {17730}{0}{<228>}{Sewer (u,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{You stand at the bottom of a cylindrical-shaped stairwell with a grate in the west wall. A dark and menacing tunnel leads off to the east. Foul smelling water flows in through the iron grate in a steady stream and into the tunnel opening to your east. The tunnel is illuminated by a green light source that glows from every piece of slime covered goo. You can leave the sewers by climbing up the stairs, or venture further into the sewer. }{Radioactive Sewer}{radioactive_sewer}{}{}{1.000}{1}
