R {18108}{0}{}{Female Stripper Section (s)}{ }{	There are still flames here. There is a small stage here for the strippers to prance around on. Considering that they are all burned almost beyond recognition, it's really rather disgusting. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
