R {18109}{0}{<208>}{A nice padded cell (s)}{<208>|||<088>}{	You are in a padded cell. The door out is still open, for now. Let's hope an orderly doesn't come wandering in here and think you're a patient. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
