R {18110}{0}{}{Male Stripper Section (n)}{ }{	There are lots of flames here. The stage is almost burnt down, and the tables are nothing but ashes. The male strippers perform in here anyway. Considering how blackened they are from the fire, it's completely disgusting to witness. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
