R {18111}{0}{}{Dolen's Office (e)}{ }{	This entire room is nothing but flame. The walls, the ceiling, the furniture, even the floor is flame. The heat is intolerable in here. You have also probably disturbed someone you probably shouldn't have. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
