R {18112}{0}{}{Other Species Stripper Section (w)}{ }{	You have just entered the section which caters to inhumans. The burning stage here brings out all sorts of non-humans to strip. This is by far the most revolting thing you've ever seen in your life. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
