R {18113}{0}{}{Shelter for Wayward Youths (e)}{<168>E<088>}{	You are in the Elm Street Shelter for Wayward Youths. It looks to have been recently shut down. The only thing remaining is the TV. Now why would they leave that? 	You take a closer look at the TV and notice that it's still working but has no screen. You might be able to ENTER it. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
