R {18114}{0}{}{Classroom (s)}{ }{	This is another classroom. You're not sure what subject was studied here since all the books and posters are missing. The blackboard has something written on it. 	Your soul shall be mine, PIGGY! 				Signed, 					Freddy }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
