R {18115}{0}{}{Trignometry Class (n)}{ }{	This classrom is for math. Especially, Trig. The only thing that could be worse is Calculus. The only problem is that there is no teacher. You also notice a lot of bugs crawling around. You think that they're roaches, but you can't tell for sure. They run away before you can get close to them. }{Chaos Cinemaplex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
