R {18137}{0}{}{Larissa's front lawn (s,n)}{ }{Stepping through the shrubs, you find yourself on a concrete walkway leading up through the lawn to a very strange looking house.  The house is surrounded by a dark blue fence that has orange polka dots all over it.  To the north appears to be the front porch of the house. A small mailbox sits here. }{Larissa's Funhouse}{larissas_funhouse}{}{}{1.000}{1}
