R {18138}{0}{}{A small cottage (w)}{<108>H<088>}{A feeling of goodness enters you as you stand in a small yet pleasant cottage.  The aroma of a freshly baked loaf of bread fills the air. The walls are covered with shelves which are filled with cookbooks, ingredients, utensils, and other baking supplies befitting a kitchen. A small mouse hole, in the corner of the room, catches your eye.  An old woman stands over the stove with a pleasant smile, whistling a happy tune as she cooks. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
