R {18139}{0}{}{Larissa's Porch (s)}{ }{The old boards squeak under the weight of your feet as you step onto the porch of this old house.  An old wooden rocker sits next to a swing built for two.  A bit of light comes from a picture window in the front of the house.  On the other side of the porch a large wooden crate sits in the corner.  An old, yet sturdy door appears to be the entrance into the house. }{Larissa's Funhouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
