R {18140}{0}{}{A mouse trail (n)}{ }{Gradually adjusting to your new surroundings, you deduce that you are trapped between the walls of the cottage.  Bits of chewed up wood lie about here, scattered amongst the dirt and dust.  The room is lit by a swirling vortex of light that apparently brought you here. Ahead of you lies darkness and the unknown.  }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
