R {18141}{0}{}{A mouse trail (n,s)}{ }{Crawling along the inside walls of cottage, the trail gets much darker. The dust and dirt grows thicker here.  Strange chirping sounds are all around you, and this is quickly becoming a very spooky place.  Above you is a large spider web while the trail continues to the north and south. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
