R {18157}{0}{}{A mouse trail (e,w)}{ }{The trail continues to taper to the west, and the air is becoming moist and uncomfortable.  Is that the odor of mildew that you smell?  The dust and dirt seem undisturbed here.  The walls are still very high and unclimbable.  Will you ever find a way out of here? }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
