R {18158}{0}{}{A mouse trail (e,w)}{ }{The smell of mildew is definitely apparent to the west as you continue down the ever narrowing trail.  The open path back to the east looks very appealing.  You begin to hear strange sounds to the west as well. The dust and dirt are still undisturbed here. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
