R {18159}{0}{}{A mouse trail (e,w)}{ }{The air is extremely humid, and a pungent mildew odor invades your nasal passages.  Strange chirping is coming loudly from the west.  Dust and dirt around you make you want to sneeze.  The walls become very thin here but still tower high above you. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
