R {18160}{0}{}{A mouse trail (e,w)}{ }{The trail has almost narrowed to a close.  You can almost feel your sides touching the wall here.  Loud chirping comes from the west in this dark corridor.  The dust and dirt weigh heavily in your lungs as you fight to breath the moist thick air.  Back to the east, the corridor widens as it stretches into the darkness. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
