R {18161}{0}{}{A mouse trail (climb,e)}{<238>C<088>}{The trail ends here.  Extending out of the hole in the floor is a large water pipe.  The chirping sounds become louder inside the hole as well as the heightened repulsive mildew odor.  The walls are very high, and there seems no now way out except the way back to the east. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
