R {18187}{0}{}{A mouse trail (e,w)}{ }{Dust and dirt still all around you as you walk in between the walls of the cottage.  The walls are ominously high and unclimbable, and they seem to laugh at your search for a way out.  To the east you see an intersection.  The smell gets worse in that direction. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18154}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18188}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18188}{0}{}{A mouse trail (s,w,n)}{ }{Following the dark trail you have come to another intersection. Dust and dirt are still all around you. The inner walls appear to continue north and south. An awful stench comes from the north, while a bit of a breeze comes from the south. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18187}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18189}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18190}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18189}{0}{}{A mouse trail (s,n)}{ }{As you move south through the trail between the walls, the stench you smelled is obviously coming north from you.  To the south you feel warmth, as you walk through the darkness.  Only a couple of tracks are here on the ground, and for the most part the dirt and dust are undisturbed. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18188}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18194}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18190}{0}{}{A mouse trail (s,n)}{ }{The stench here begins to become unbearable.  The ground is somewhat slimy with little silver trails all over the place.  The floor is damp, while the walls are still high and unclimbable.  Whatever is creating this smell is definitely coming from the north.  The dirt and dust here has become sticky and almost like mud. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18188}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18191}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18191}{0}{}{A mouse trail (s,n)}{ }{The stench here nearly becomes unbearable.  The ground starts to become very damp, and it appears obvious whatever is causing this moisture is coming from the north.  The dirt is clumped up in small chunks of half dried mud.  Slick and slimy trails are all around you. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18190}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18192}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18192}{0}{}{A mouse trail (enter,s)}{<168>E<088>}{Coming to a seemingly dead end in the trail between the walls, you can barely stand the stench here.  The area is covered in gooey slime and clumps of dirt are all around you.  The walls still look unclimbable, but the wall at the end of the trail is a stained off-white color.  A large crack covered in black mold easily catches your attention. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18191}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18193}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18193}{0}{}{porcelain bowl (enter)}{ }{Squeezing through the crack you find yourself in a huge porcelain bowl of some kind.  A shallow puddle of old stinky water is here and it's really quite gross.  Looking above you, there seems to be a huge lid closed, which small rays of light coming from a gap at the lid.  A large crack in the back of the bowl seems to lead into the wall.  How in the hell did you end up here? }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{sewers}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18192}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18194}{0}{}{A mouse trail (s,n)}{ }{Moving down the trail, a definite sense of warmth comes from the south.  The tracks are mostly undisturbed in the dust and dirt and its very quiet here.  Wait, was that a 'meow?'  What would cats be doing around here? }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18189}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18195}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18195}{0}{}{A mouse trail (climb,n)}{<238>C<088>}{You seem to of reached the end of the trail here between the walls of the cottage.  Several electrical cords run up the wall here and dust and dirt lie all about as this area seems fairly deserted.  Several tracks seemingly lead back to the north. }{Mouse Trails Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18194}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18196}{climb}{climb}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18196}{u}{climb}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18196}{0}{}{cottage attic (s,n,w,e)}{<238>C<088>}{The attic of this small cottage is filled with dust and clutter.  You are surrounded by lots of miscellaneous junk.  The sounds of cats can be heard from all directions.  The air is filled with the aroma of cat pee, but there is a breeze that seems to come from nowhere. }{Mouse Trails (attic)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18197}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18198}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18199}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
