E {18195}{climb}{climb}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18195}{d}{climb}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {18197}{0}{}{cottage attic (n,w,e)}{ }{You immediately notice the smell of cats in this airy attic above the cottage.  Miscellaneous junk fills the attic, but nothing seems to be here that will help your plight to get out of the cottage.  The sounds of hissing cats can be heard all around you, as they prepare to pounce. }{Mouse Trails (attic)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18196}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {18201}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
