R {18198}{0}{}{cottage attic (s,n,w,e)}{ }{This attic is quite fragrant with the smell of cats.  The floor is quite dirty and lots of miscellaneous junk here is covered with dust.  From every corner eyes seem to be looking at you as terrifying hiss echoes throughout the attic. }{Mouse Trails (attic)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
