R {19263}{0}{}{Strange Museum (sw,e,nw)}{ }{There are exotic places hiding in all the lands of Three Kingdoms.  In these places lurk dangerous monsters and exquisite treasures beyond the darkest fantasies of normal mortals.  Some objects are lost in the fearsome combats which are normally associated with their retrieval, others are recovered by these fearless adventurers and returned to the town of Pinnacle.  A select few items which are brought back are considered too dangerous and even Cancer with his lack of business scruples will not buy them.  This exotic store, hidden in the bowels of Chaos, deals in such rare and forbidden items.  Your curiosity is overwhelming, and you can't resist taking a look around. }{Chaos Museum}{chaos_museum}{}{}{1.000}{1}
