E {19400}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19402}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19402}{0}{<228>}{Dead End (n)}{<228>= =<088>}{Dead End The stench within the sewer is quite awful.  Reflections of faint light shine off the wet surfaces throughout the maze.  Small puddles in the floor ripple as you disturb their peace.   }{Chaotic Sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19401}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19403}{0}{}{Strange Museum (se,ne)}{ }{You can feel a great source of evil in this room.  The feeling invades your being on the most basic of levels and you can't help but feel uneasy.  When the feeling of dread subsides you take a quick look around and see the obvious cause of the evil.  To either side of the wheel is a wide red banner. }{Chaos Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19386}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19312}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
