E {19427}{e}{door}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19425}{0}{}{The Streets of London (gates,w,e)}{ }{The fog spins in a tiny waft of air and clears for a split second, just long enough to spot the massive wall and iron gates to your immediate south.  A small bronze plaque rests by the gates, but the fog closes in again before you get a chance to read it.  The road meanwhile, seems to continue on to the east and west.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19413}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19426}{gates}{gates}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
