E {19426}{s}{gates}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19426}{0}{}{Scotland Yard (office,leave)}{ }{You've entered the main foyer of the famed Scotland Yard.  A massive desk is the main feature here, which is clearly a reception area of some kind.  Numerous corridors branch off in all directions, but they are dark and empty.  At this time of night it would seem most of the people who work here have gone home.  You notice a single office to the left still has its lights on, so at least someone is still here working.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19425}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30644}{office}{office}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
