E {19434}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19432}{e}{gates}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19432}{0}{}{A Courtyard (gates)}{ }{You've entered a courtyard of a fairly large looking manor house.  It seems extremely out of place here, with its neat garden and pleasant facade highly at odds with the streets you have left behind.  The fog is still quite heavy, so it is not easy to make out any real details about the place, but it could be assumed that someone quite wealthy lives here.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19431}{gates}{gates}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19431}{w}{gates}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19433}{0}{}{By the Banks of The River Thames (w,s)}{ }{The road ends abruptly at the banks of the mighty River Thames, with only a small alleyway leading off to the west from here.  The fog hangs thickly over the water, giving it a strange and eerie appearance.  The river itself gurgles quietly as it passes, the sound disturbingly similar to that of the last dying gasps of a person.  There seems to be no way to cross it here, the far banks are not even visible.  A solitary signpost stands by the water's edge, a strange sentinel guiding you through the haze.   }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19431}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19430}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19434}{0}{}{The Streets of London (n,w,s)}{ }{You've arrived at a T-intersection deep in the heart of London's west end.  There is a scent of rottenness and decay in the air, although it seems more likely to be associated with the nearby River Thames than anything more sinister.  A signpost sits by the side of the road, pointing out your options for continuing.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19431}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19435}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19436}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19435}{0}{}{The Streets of London (e,w)}{ }{The air seems colder here, as if the fog that enshrouds your surroundings has an extra chill to it for some reason.  From somewhere off in the distance you can hear muffled shouting, and the shrill blast of a whistle.  This part of the street itself is extremely dark. You can make out light in either direction, just none about here.  In these conditions it would be very easy to hide. }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19434}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19422}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19436}{0}{}{The Streets of London (s,n,enter)}{<168>E<088>}{The road runs from north to south in an unerring line through the darkness.  The fog is thick and acrid, and the lamp posts seem even less effective here than normal.  To the east stands a large building, lit up brightly, and buzzing with activity, which is quite unusual given the time of night.  Whatever is happening in there must be of some importance.  To the south you notice that the road becomes even darker than normal, the shadows taking hold of the street completely in that direction.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19434}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19437}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19438}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19438}{w}{enter}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19437}{0}{}{The Streets of London (n)}{ }{You've arrived at a dead-end.  The lane ends in a huge pile of garbage that is lined up against several old wooden fences, and the stench emanating from it is almost completely overpowering.  There is almost no light, the nearest source is some distance to the north of here, and the fog is thick, making the houses that surround the lane seem dark and foreboding.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19436}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19438}{0}{}{Dorset Street Police Station (out)}{ }{You've entered a busy police station.  Constables wander about performing a range of tasks, and even at this time of night it is a hub of activity, especially during these dark times.  A huge desk blocks off any easy access to the rest of the station\; the gate that sits beside it is being watched constantly.  You notice that the walls are covered in maps of the local area, as well as the usual assortment of wanted posters and general notices.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19436}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19436}{e}{out}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19439}{0}{}{Middle of big room (ne,nw,s,w)}{ }{You are now approximatly in the middle of the room. You commend yourself for your bravery and add this moment to one of the tales you will surely tell your grandchildren by the fireplace. You try to look around but a bucket keeps drawing your attention. }{A Gigantic Bedroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19241}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19440}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
