E {40862}{n}{enter bucket}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19440}{0}{}{An open space (sw,s)}{ }{You are in an open space between the dresser and the table. Immediately you lie flat on the ground... Your eyes dart from side to side, your ears waiting to hear the slightest sound... you raise your head, you search the perimeter for any deadly snipers... you stand up and sigh with relief but your senses will alert you to any imminent danger. }{A Gigantic Bedroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19439}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19445}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19441}{0}{}{North part of bed (n,se,s,ne)}{ }{You arrive to the other side of THE BED. Being surrounded by all of this furniture makes you want to go back to the world of the normal sized people which reminds you that you haven't met the owner of this room nor would you really want to meet him or her or especially it. You climb out of the pit of self pity to the rumblings of cars. }{A Gigantic Bedroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19439}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19442}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
