E {19444}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19442}{0}{}{South part of bed (n,e)}{ }{You walked until you reach the boundary of light and dark as defined by the shadow of the huge furniture you are standing near. Straight above you looms THE BED. At your feet there are a few balls and a unicycle. }{A Gigantic Bedroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19439}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19441}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19443}{0}{}{Under a couch (e,s)}{ }{You are near the couch in the northwest corner of the room. The couch looks comfortable although it appears that its main use is not to provide the usual comfort and rest after a long day, but rather as a storage for dirty laundry. A pile of laundry has been massing on the floor as well. }{A Gigantic Bedroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19441}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19444}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19444}{0}{}{Under the window (sw,w)}{ }{You have reached the most distant point in the room. The gods themselves are in awe due to your audacious feat and they shine upon you with divine light. You are the stuff of legends, a true hero, an unearth... the light fades. You look up and see you are standing under a window and a cloud just hid the sun. You look to the east and see a table, and to the west a couch with piles of rich, almost magical, laundry. }{A Gigantic Bedroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
