R {19495}{0}{}{-= Grape Vines =- (s,n)}{ }{-= Grape Vines =- The tangle of grape vines makes it hard to maneuver through the field.  The grape leaves are full of holes and show the tell-tale signs of rot.  A giant grape rolls back and forth searching the ground for water.  Soon, it too, will fall victim to a flying or crawling predator. }{Freaky Fruit Orchard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19494}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19496}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19496}{0}{}{-= Weed Patch =- (s)}{ }{-= Weed Patch =- The weeds are at their highest in this part of the orchard. A large rock makes it difficult to move in any direction other than back south.  Creepy, crawly things scurry around in the underbrush, secure in their cover. }{Freaky Fruit Orchard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19495}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19497}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19497}{0}{}{-= Dilapidated Shack =- (s)}{ }{-= Dilapidated Shack =- The shack is in such bad shape, it's a wonder that it's still standing.  The thin, tin roof is full of rusty holes, the front door is hanging off its hinges and the plywood keeping this deathtrap up is dry and cracking.  Giant weeds, standing shoulder-high, swarm the outside of the shack.  Rotted baskets and rusty gardening tools are scattered on the ground.  A giant rat runs out from behind the shack with something furry and alive in its maw. }{Freaky Fruit Orchard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19496}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

