R {19540}{0}{}{A warm feeling (n,light)}{<178>L<088>}{You stand before a gaping, swirling, shimmering section of the northern void.  Crackling spears of light irradiate from the fuzzy center of the mass, impossibly bright within themselves but not radiating the slightest bit of heat.  You can catch fleeting images beyond the light, but they are all extremely fuzzy and hard to focus on. }{Xanth Swamp}{xanth_swamp}{}{}{1.000}{1}
