R {19544}{0}{}{Captain Pope's Office (s)}{ }{The walls are almost painfully white in this room. This room looks incredibly clean, no sign of dust or dirt anywhere. You can smell only boot polish in here, and a hint of coffee. Some papers sit here on Captain Pope's desk, they look as if they may be important.  The papers sit atop a large oak desk with a chair pushed in.  A large picture hangs on the wall next to a medal case.  This office is not very comfortable, but that could be because of the lack things in this room. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19543}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

