R {19547}{0}{}{Captain Meyer's Office (s)}{ }{You feel miserably dirty in your surroundings.  Everything here is so clean even your mother could not find anything wrong. The air smells kind of like a cross between a new room and a hospital.  Some papers sit here on Captain Meyer's desk.  There is a lot of print on them.  There is a large oak desk here with a chair pushed in.  A large picture hangs on the wall next to a medal case.  This office is a little more comforting, but that could be because of the lack of things in this room. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19545}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19548}{0}{}{Admiral Rogers' Office (e)}{ }{This office looks quite a bit larger than the other offices. That being the case, things still look very orderly here.  You can't help but feel the air around you almost tingle with a sensation of leadership.  You may be making a mistake by being in the presence of such esteemed people.  There is a large oak desk here with a chair pushed in.  A large picture hangs on the wall next to a medal case.  You don't think it would be wise to stay here too long.  In fact, you had better use the only exit you see. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19545}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19549}{0}{}{Captain Truebenbach's Office (s)}{ }{This office has a unique feel to it.  It may be because there is a large gold shot put and a large gold discus sitting on his desk.  There are fewer papers here on the desk than in the other rooms.  This chair is different from the others, you will need to take a closer look though.  A large picture hangs on the wall next to a medal case.  You begin to feel uneasy. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19546}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19550}{0}{}{ROTC hallway (s,w,e)}{ }{To the west you see the ROTC offices of the cadre. There is not a speck of dust in this room.  The walls look as though they have been just cleaned with a toothbrush. There is a utility closet to the south.  A large picture hangs on the north wall next to the United States flag. To the east is the Cadet Lounge area.  The lights flicker slightly here, it seems odd. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19546}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
