R {19551}{0}{}{ROTC Supply Closet (n)}{ }{You have entered a musky smelling room.  This closet is not very big by any means.  The shelves have assorted supplies on them.  There are some clothes in the corner. Nothing here is very interesting except for the large device that is sitting on the desk.  The light is not as good in this room.  The lights seem to flicker a lot. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19550}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19552}{0}{}{Cadet Lounge (n,s,w,e)}{ }{This lounge looks rather comfortable.  The hallway extends to the left, while the rest of the lounge lies to the east, south and north.  There is a computer here, as well as a phone and printer.  All of this sits on a silver desk.  The air doesn't seem as stuffy here, and the light tone is a bit more subdued.  The walls and floor are almost comforting. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
