R {19553}{0}{}{Cadet Lounge (e,s)}{ }{There is a big bookcase sitting on the south side of this room.  On the north wall sits some shelving with a bunch of boxes in it.  There is a large table here with a bunch of chairs to sit in.  This looks like a comfortable area to read in.  You see a big map and another table to the east.  You hear a television to the south.  Everything seems normal here. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
