R {19554}{0}{}{Cadet Lounge (e,n)}{ }{This lounge looks rather comfortable.  The lighting makes you feel at ease as you stand here looking at things. Some announcements are here on a black postboard on the wall.  Next to the board is a case with an assortment of medals.  There is another case with different colored ribbons in it.  The walls here all look the same, as well as the floor. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
