R {19555}{0}{}{Cadet Lounge (n,s,w)}{ }{There is not anything really spectacular about this room. You note there is a large map on the wall north of here, and the exit lies off to the west.  The only thing you see here is a bunch of new boots.  You can smell some boot polish and new leather.  Your gaze shifts from the shiny boots to the map, it looks interesting. }{ROTC}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
