R {19673}{0}{<278>}{The road to Darkmoore (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are on the road that leads to Darkmoore.  It is a small town that was built on a solid area within a marsh.  The people are rather unfriendly toward strangers.  There is a lot of mystery surrounding the town and the marsh itself.  Part of this mystery is a LARGE OSTENTATIOUS SIGN (hint, hint) right in front of you the like of which you have never seen before. }{Darkmoore}{darkmoore}{}{}{1.000}{1}
