R {19674}{0}{<278>}{Road to Darkmoore (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are on the road to Darkmoore.  You can see the city well now. It is very dreary, dismal, and all very dark.  The marsh completely surrounds the city.  You do notice an island to the southeast.  It's probably the only other piece of solid ground for miles around. }{Darkmoore}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19673}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
