R {19675}{0}{}{Fort Frosty (w)}{ }{You have entered a small igloo that seems to resemble a small fort. Ice here layers the ground making it dangerous to move around. The walls here are made of the clearest ice in the land, it causes the reflection of anything in here to be seen millions of times. You better hope you're alone. There is a BIG flashy sign, here maybe you should look at it. }{Frosty Igloo}{frosty_igloo}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7025}{w}{w}{8}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19676}{0}{}{A forest path (n,s)}{ }{You are on a forest path going north and south. All around you are maple trees with small birds singing beautifully. The ground is covered with all kinds of different flowers. There is a soft breeze flowing through the trees swirling up the pollen from the flowers. You can smell the sweetness in the air. A small board is nailed to one of the trees here. To the south the path goes into another part of the forest. }{Mystic Forest}{mystic_forest}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7025}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
