R {19677}{0}{}{A forest path (s,n)}{ }{You are on a forest path going north and south. Tall trees line the path around you. High up in the trees you can spot small birds that seem to be looking down on you. There is a breeze flowing through the trees and as it touches the ground it swirls up pollen from the blooming flowers. }{Mystic Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19676}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
