R {19678}{0}{}{A forest path (s,ne)}{ }{You are on a forest path going northeast and south. The trees around you stand very close together, making the forest quite dense. Further to the northeast you notice the forest getting less dense. The air is thick with pollen from all the flowers that has been rocked by the wind. }{Mystic Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
