R {19687}{0}{}{A forest trail (ne,sw)}{ }{You are on a small trail going northeast and southwest. The forest is very dense here so you cannot make out where the trail to the southwest ends up. You can hear the sound of running water coming from the west and northwest. To the northeast you see some bushes, where the trail joins the path. }{Mystic Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
