R {19689}{0}{}{A tent for bandits (out)}{ }{You are in a tent. There are a few bedrolls on the floor. There is a large wooden crate in the middle of the tent. The bedrolls are placed around the crate. It smells quite bad from the bedrolls and from all the bottles scattered on the floor of the tent. By looking at the mess around you judge these bandits have had some kind of party. }{Mystic Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
