R {19694}{0}{}{A rabbit burrow (u,d)}{ }{A dark tunnel leads sharply downwards into blackness. The walls have funny looking marks along them, and there is a trail of footprints leading both ways along the floor. The roof is high enough for you to stand upright. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{easter_bunny_academy}{}{}{1.000}{1}
