R {19695}{0}{}{A rabbit burrow (u,d)}{ }{The tunnel evens out here, making movement easier. There are even more footprints, and a light coming from further down. There is a lot of loose dirt here, as though something had been digging in the walls. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
