R {19696}{0}{}{The Easter Bunny Academy (n,w,s,out,e)}{ }{Standing out more than anything else in this room is the large logo on the floor. A huge tiled Easter egg, with the words Easter Bunny Academy written around it, fills up the whole floor. There are doors leading in all directions, and noises come from most of them. A reception desk sits near the far wall. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
