R {19697}{0}{}{Master Easter Bunny chambers. (s)}{ }{These chambers are where all the Master Easter Bunnies come to talk with their fellows, and relax after a hard days work. There is a map of the realms on the wall, and a few chairs lying about. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19696}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19698}{0}{}{Training Room (e)}{ }{This is the training room for all the apprentice Easter Bunnies. There are various pieces of equipment all around the room for the bunnies to train their skills with. Some bunnies are here training, but most ignore you, leaving it up to the others to deal with your intrusion. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19696}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19699}{0}{}{A hallway in the Academy (s,n)}{ }{An amazing spectrum of colours assaults your mind. The walls are very bright with pictures of easter eggs. There is even a larger than life (you hope) picture of the Easter Bunny with a basket of eggs. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19696}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
