R {19701}{0}{}{Lounge (w)}{ }{This is the lounge area of the Academy. Apprentice and Master bunnies alike come here to relax in between training. There is a Coke machine near the doorway, and a counter against a nearby wall, filled with snacks. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19696}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19702}{0}{}{A hallway in the Academy (s,n,w)}{ }{The walls are bright and colourful, much like most of the rest of the Academy. Easter eggs adorn the walls, a constant reminder of the purpose of this place. Like anyone could forget. }{Easter Bunny Academy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19699}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19703}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
