R {19711}{0}{<268>}{A Hallway (n,s,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{A four way intersection leads to the kitchen, the bedroom, the laundry room and the dining room. The gray carpet continues east and west, but gives way to tiled areas to the north and south. An empty socket is hanging from the ceiling, and every so often it emits sparks. It appears that someone pulled too hard on this socket because the plaster around it is cracked. Above you on the ceiling is an air vent. }{Gamer's House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
