R {19712}{0}{}{Laundry Room (s)}{ }{The laundry room is fairly small, containing only a washer, a dryer, and some white cupboards. The floor is tile and has a thin layer of lint that has accumulated. There is evidence of many detergent spills on both the dryer and the washer. An open container of a generic brand detergent sits on the washer. }{Gamer's House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
