R {19713}{0}{<248>}{Kitchen (n)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{The carpet ends as you enter the kitchen and an off-white tile floor begins. From the looks of it, you highly doubt it is supposed to be off white. Dishes lie about the sink crying out to be washed. The smell of abandoned pizza boxes and leftover Chinese food fills the air. A white freezer-fridge unit occupies one wall, while the other is adorned with many cupboards. The dishwasher seems to serve as a temporary repository for dishes, destined to hold them until they are needed once more. An army of ants forms a line down the counter. }{Gamer's House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19711}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19714}{0}{<248>}{Bedroom (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The bedroom is arranged as if a large tornado had just touched down on it. The sheets are all over the place and the bed hasn't been made in ages. Homework is piled on the floor and appears to have not been touched since it was assigned. Various game boxes and manuals lie in piles on the floor, and a trail of clothes leads to the bathroom door. }{Gamer's House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19711}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

