R {19753}{0}{}{On the brink of nothingness (se,ne,n,s,e)}{ }{A massive, all-encompassing nothingness brings the fields to a startling stop in their journey westwards.  The edge is unnaturally straight, and continues for as far as you can see to the north and south.  The barely-remembered, but always present stench and heat invade your senses, but the nothingness holds your attention so that you barely notice. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
