R {19759}{0}{}{The edge of the field (sw,nw,n,s,w)}{ }{A perfectly straight line deliminates the eastern edge of the fields, beyond which is empty, grey nothingness.  How you didn't notice something like this when further away is a complete mystery.  There is a strange feeling in the air, as if everything is somehow wrong, or everything is right, and it is you who are out of place. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
