R {19760}{0}{}{Northeast of a clump of trees (se,ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{Standing out against the otherwise flat and endless fields, a small clump of trees stands to the southwest.  Casting a little shade, the trees look eminently more bearable than the oppressive and endless heat out in the open.  Underfoot, the grass is soaked with blood, and chunks of gore are splattered everywhere. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
