R {19765}{0}{}{A clump of trees (n)}{ }{Beneath the sheltering canopy of trees the heat segues into shade. Not wanting to be forgotten, the wind occasionally blows the thick stench of hot air into the trees. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
