R {19768}{0}{}{The corner of a field (se)}{<118>K<088>}{More than anywhere else in the field, the green, lush grass is hidden by gibbets of gore and flesh, leaving what few blades are visible dyed red by blood.  There is a strange throne, constructed of old, yellowing bones, sitting right on the brink of the drop into nothingness. The normal Cow King is pawing at the ground with his huge hooves. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19754}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19769}{0}{}{Foyer of the Jedi Academy (n,s)}{ }{          As you enter the pyramid, a sense of peace and serenity fills you. The Force is very strong here.  Legend has it that Yavin was the home of the Massassi race, who built this pyramid as a Nexus of Power for the first Darklord of the Sith, Exar Kun.  Since those dark days, Luke Skywalker, the most powerful Jedi Knight in this era, has  cleansed this, the larger of the two pyramids, of the Dark Side forces and turned it into a school of sorts, the Jedi Academy, dedicated to training future Jedi for the fight against the Dark Side. The hangar is to the south, while the hallway continues north. A small plaque here reads: Han Solo shot first. }{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15492}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19770}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19770}{0}{}{A Hallway in the Jedi Academy (n,s)}{ }{As you continue down the dim hallway, it suddenly occurs to you that there are no guards at the Academy.  For one thing, the Academy is well hidden here on Yavin.  Also, any attempted invasion of the Academy by Dark Side forces would be quickly and easily repulsed by the scores upon scores of Jedi Knights that live and train here. You hear what sounds like crackling energy and fighting further ahead to the north. A small shrine to the light is here with a donation bowl besides it. You could 'make' a donation if you have strayed from the path into the darkness. }{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19769}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19771}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19771}{0}{}{Jedi Chambers (se,sw,ne,nw,u,d,n,s,w,e)}{ }{You stand in the central chamber of the Jedi Academy.  Jedi Knights and trainees rush past you as they go about their studies.  Several passages radiate off of this central room, leading to smaller chambers where Jedi spend time learning about the Force.  A stairway leads upwards to the second level of the pyramid and downward to the barracks where the trainees live during their stay on Yavin IV. }{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19770}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19773}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
