E {19777}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19778}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19779}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19780}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19781}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19772}{0}{}{Outside A Sandcrawler}{ }{You stand in a sandy desert before a large sandcrawler that buzzes with busy Jawas running around and moving parts and pieces of various things. Off to the right you see a Jawa standing next to a repurposed droid with a large sign above it. It says in Galactic Basic 'Academy Droid Shop'. This must be where the Jawas dump their bits and pieces of recovered droids to be rebuilt and sold to Jedis seeking a robotic companion for their adventures. You could 'list' the droids available at the moment. Their inventory changes every so often depending on what the Jawas manage to recover and what the Academy manages to fix. You may board the shuttle back to the temple when you are done with your business here. }{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15492}{board shuttle}{board shuttle}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19773}{0}{}{Jedi Chambers (e,w,s,n,d,u,nw,ne,sw,se)}{ }{Right away you notice the silence of this room.  The walls of this room as well as the door seem to prevent the transmission of sound.  In addition, no one within the room is speaking.  Everyone in here is deeply in hibernation trances.  You can tell this by the fact that their lungs seem to expand and contract only a few times per minute.  This place is obviously very conducive to peaceful relaxation.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19771}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19774}{0}{}{Jedi Chambers (e,w,s,n,d,u,nw,ne,sw,se)}{ }{You have found the library of the Jedi Academy.  The walls of this chamber are honeycombed from floor to ceiling, providing hundreds of cubby holes for scrolls of every shape and size.  Whispy glowrods illuminate the room without the risk of fire to all these precious documents.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19771}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19775}{0}{}{Guest Chambers (sw)}{ }{These are the chambers set aside for visiting Jedi Masters to use when they stop by the academy to share their knowledge with the students.  A few comfortable couches are scattered about the room for relaxing between instructional sessions.  A long table rests against the rear wall of the chamber.  The room is well lit with glow rods and kept very clean.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19771}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19776}{0}{}{A cluttered workshop (se)}{ }{This is the main workshop in the academy.  Every Jedi spends some time here tinkering on their lightsabers or on other projects.  The various tools needed for working with fine circuits and delicate crystals litter the work benches around the room.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19771}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19777}{0}{}{Second Floor of the Academy (e,s,w,u,d,n)}{ }{You climb the stairs up to the second floor of the Academy. This floor is reserved for storage of equipment and for shops selling necessities to the Jedi that study within these walls.  To the north is the Academy advancement room where you may advance your levels and stats.  The armory lies to the east where you can store or borrow equipment.  The chambers of the Jedi Knights lies to the west, their private sanctuary from the bustle of the Academy.  The Academy's shop lies to the south.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19771}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53574}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53575}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53576}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53577}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19778}{0}{}{Jedi Board Room (u,n,w,s)}{ }{Down here, below the main training levels of the Academy are the barracks where the students live and sleep when not busy at their studies.  Because of the busy regimen of Academy life, many students find it hard to keep up with all the activities of their friends and fellow students.  To help them keep in touch with other Jedi, a bulletin board has been put up at the bottom of the stairs where all Jedi may check for messages after a days work, or just before beginning their studies for the day.  A sealed door with a touch pad leads off to the east.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19771}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53581}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19779}{0}{}{A temple passage (n,s)}{ }{The stone walls of the temple seems to press in on you in this narrow passage that leads from the central chamber out into the jungles of Yavin IV.  The light rods set into the ceiling may be farther apart than elsewhere in the temple, or it might be your imagination, but either way, their light is barely enough to illuminate the passage that you stand in.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19771}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19780}{0}{}{A side hall (w,e)}{ }{You stand in a corridor leading off from the central chamber of the massive Massassai temple that houses the Jedi Academy.  The walls are of the same smoothed stone blocks found elsewhere in the temple's construction, having been weathered over the years by hands and feet of human and alien alike.  The passage leads back to the central chamber, or out towards the chambers in the circumference of the temple.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19771}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19783}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19781}{0}{}{A side hall (e,w)}{ }{You stand in a corridor leading off from the central chamber of the massive Massassai temple that houses the Jedi Academy.  The walls are of the same smoothed stone blocks found elsewhere in the temple's construction, having been weathered over the years by hands and feet of human and alien alike.  The passage leads back to the central chamber, or out towards the chambers in the circumference of the temple.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19771}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19790}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19782}{0}{}{A side hall (e,w,nw,ne,sw,se)}{ }{The western hall ends here in a small hexagonal chamber.  The center of each wall has a sturdy blast door in place, with an ancient locking mechanism to the left of each door.  The hall runs back to the east, towards the center of the temple.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
