R {19812}{0}{<238>}{Base of the Lighthouse at Land's End (enter,n)}{<238>^<178>E<238>^<088>}{You stand on a rocky peninsula at Land's End. Above you towers the great Lighthouse that guides incoming ships from their journeys to beyond Land's End. Large impressive stone doors make the entrance to this majestic structure. It is rumoured that the light in the lamp can never go out. The doors to the lighthouse oddly, are open, as though they were forced. Something is odd here. }{Great Lighthouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19810}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19813}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19813}{0}{}{Inside the Lighthouse (u,out)}{ }{You are in the round base of the lighthouse. There is a cracked dirt floor that circles the outside walls and the round stone center. Wooden steps spiral upwards around the stone center. The place looks very well kept, as though the person that lives here cared very much about it. }{Great Lighthouse}{great_lighthouse}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19814}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19812}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19814}{0}{}{In the Lighthouse (u,d)}{ }{The steps continue to spiral up and down the staircase. Placed every so often at regular intervals are small windows from which you can see out onto the ocean. The sound and smell of the ocean fill your ears and lungs as you continue your  journey. }{Great Lighthouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19813}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19815}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19815}{0}{}{Inside the Lighthouse (u,d)}{ }{The steps continue to spiral up and down the staircase. just above however, is the landing where sits the lamp of the Lighthouse. Oddly, you can see no light coming from above. Could the source have gone out somehow? Something is obviously wrong here. }{Great Lighthouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19814}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19816}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {19816}{0}{}{Landing of the Lighthouse (d)}{ }{What a view! The whole landing is surrounded by seamless glass, magically polished and put together so that no seams can be seen or felt. You are surrounded from every angle by a giant panoramic view of the eastern forest and the ocean beyond Land's End. The lamp sits in the middle of the room, but alas it is dark! What is going on here?? }{Great Lighthouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19815}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

