R {20027}{0}{<268>}{The temple of an ancient god (nw,e)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{The inside of this area is monstrous.  You could store several jet liners in here.  The only furniture you see is an altar at the far end of the temple.  Better watch out.  Whatever would come here to worship a god like this one must not be too pleasant itself. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20026}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20033}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20028}{0}{}{Second level of the tower (u,d)}{ }{This is the second level of the tower of the nightgaunts. It's getting darker as you go up. You've also noticed more roosts for the nightgaunts as you go up.  Who knows how many there are at the top. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20004}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20029}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20029}{0}{}{Third level of the tower (u,d)}{ }{You have made it to the third level.  It is getting nasty up here. It looks like the top level is approaching.  Venture on if you dare. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20028}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20030}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20030}{0}{}{Top level of the tower (d)}{ }{Well, you've reached the top level of the tower, but whether you should be glad of this is another story. It seems this is the home of a rather large nightgaunt, and if he is here, you could be in a world of hurt. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20029}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20031}{0}{<268>}{Inner sanctum of Father Dagon (out)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You have just walked into the inner sanctum of Father Dagon.  You might want to consider leaving before he gets pissed off.  There isn't much in here except a hole in the floor filled with fresh salt water.  There must be access to the open sea somewhere down there. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20020}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20039}{dive}{dive}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20032}{0}{<268>}{Inner sanctum of Mother Hydra (out)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{This is the inner sanctum of Mother Hydra.  Better hope she's not in or else you're in deep crap.  This area is rather simple in comparison to the elaborate outer chamber.  You do notice a hole in the floor filled with non-stagnant salt water.  There must be a connection to the ocean somewhere down there. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
