R {20033}{0}{<268>}{Temple of an ancient god (w,e)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You are halfway into the temple.  You hear strange sounds here.  It sounds like a flute, but has a strange, unearthly tone to it.  You find it hard to concentrate.  Your mind seems flooded with strange thoughts, but you can't seem to think what they are. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
