E {20034}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20034}{0}{<268>}{Altar in the Temple of an ancient god (w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You have reached the altar.  There is a pit here that looks as if sacrifices are thrown into with frequency.  You should be able to get around it if you can move about unhindered, but you'd better make sure you can make it before you try.. you wouldn't want to become the latest sacrifice.  }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
