R {20035}{0}{<268>}{Behind the altar of an ancient god (w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{This is the innermost sanctum of the temple. Hidden behind the altar which you have just passed, it is home to one of the most feared creations in existence... }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
