R {20041}{0}{}{Entrance of an old tomb (u,n)}{ }{You are standing in the entrance shaft of an old tomb, it is quite damp in here and you feel a bit uncomfortable about what might be hiding in front of you in the dark. In the pale light that is shining down upon you, you notice that the structure of the tomb rests completely on the old rotten logs supporting the earth ceiling. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
