R {20043}{0}{<248>}{Underwater lair of a lloigor (s,ne)}{<248>~ ~<088>}{You are in what looks like the lair of some large, underwater beast. The claw marks on the wall are wider than both of your hands. These could have been made by a lloigor which means bad news for you. }{R'lyeh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
