R {20055}{0}{}{Narrow corridor (n,s)}{ }{You stand in a narrow corridor leading north further into the tomb, and south into a large old hall. You notice that the floor is covered with a 1/2 feet thick layer of dust, and long thin spiderwebs span the room creating a curtain of spiderwebs. The north exit is effectively blocked by a lattice of bars. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
