R {20056}{0}{}{Tomb crossing (w,s,n,e)}{ }{You have come to a four way crossing. In the flickering torchlight you notice some bars further to the south but to the west, east and north you see only darkness. You begin to feel a bit uncomfortable, not only because of what might be hiding out there, but mainly because you notice that the logs supporting the ceiling are rotten all the way through. There is a thick layer of dust on the floor. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
