R {20057}{0}{}{West chamber entryway (e)}{ }{This is the entry way to the burial chamber, on the north wall you  can see a wall painting showing men in golden armour fighting a huge black demon. A thick layer of dust covers the floor, and a huge block of stone effectively blocks any further movement to the west. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
