R {20058}{0}{}{North chamber entryway (s)}{ }{This is the entry way to the burial chamber. On the east wall you can can see a wall painting showing men in golden armour fighting a huge black demon. A thick layer of dust covers the floor, and a huge block of stone effectively blocks any further movement to the north. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
