R {20059}{0}{}{East chamber entryway (w)}{ }{This is what was the entry way to a burial chamber. On the north wall you can see some remains of what once must have been a beautiful wall painting, but now it is almost completely destroyed by the cave-in that also effectively blocks any further movement to the east. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20056}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20060}{e}{#5 get stone;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20060}{0}{}{East burial chamber (w)}{ }{You are standing in what once must have been a richly decorated burial chamber, but since some of the ceiling has caved in, stones and dirt are spread all over the room. As you lift your torch up to be able to see better you notice an old sarcophagus made of black stone in the middle of the room. It's almost covered with blocks of stone from the cave in as is the rest of the room. On the floor in the north corner you notice the remains of a fallen statue. }{Ruins of an Old City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20059}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20061}{0}{}{The Courtyard (s,n)}{ }{The Courtyard -  Grass, brush, and all other vegetation has been cleared from the open courtyard of the wooden fort.  The dirt covered ground is hard packed and shows hundreds of crossed footprints from the many travelers who pass through the fort.  Small wooden buildings can be seen further within the fort, surrounded by the protective outer walls. }{Fort in the woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20063}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {16910}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20062}{0}{}{Inner Fort (n,s)}{ }{Inner Fort -  You take notice of a rut in the dirt that heads north and south as you travel towards the back of the fort.  Farther to the north is the protective rear wall.  A guard tower is in each corner of the fort keeping look out for any types of predators.  To the west is a small building that seems to have little activity, while a two story wooden structure is to the right. }{Fort in the woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20063}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20064}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
