E {37978}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20063}{0}{}{Inner Fort (n,s)}{ }{Inner Fort -  The sun shines high above as it bakes the hard packed dirt under your feet.  The inner fort is alive with energy.  To the west you hear the sounds of laughter and clanking of glasses coming from within the wooden structure.  To the east you hear the distinctive sound of an hammer hitting an anvil. }{Fort in the woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20061}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20062}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
