E {37976}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20064}{0}{}{Inner Fort (w,s,e)}{ }{Inner Fort -  Reaching the back of the fort, the protective wall towers high above you.  Directly to the east is a set of stalls containing the distinctive smell of horses.  To the west you see a guard post next to a door leading up to the guard tower above. }{Fort in the woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20062}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20065}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
