R {20068}{0}{}{Guard Tower (s,stairs,e)}{ }{Guard Tower -  A small round room in the corner of the fort.  Up high in the air this guard tower allows one to see across the fields into the distant forest for bandits or any other kind of rabble.  You can also look down into the fort to make sure that all is peaceful within the protective walls. A small table sits in the middle of the room to hold supplies for the guards who keep watch.  A small walkway leads to the other towers. }{Fort in the woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20067}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
