R {20083}{0}{}{Underground corridor (s,n)}{ }{Walking down an underground corridor, your footsteps are echoing back at you eerily off the smooth concrete walls.  To the south you see a stairwell leading back up to ground level.  The corridor continues on to the north. }{Military Bunker}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
