R {20087}{0}{}{Oil field (n,d)}{ }{You are standing on a muddy oilfield.  Looking up, you see the open blue sky.  Around you is a tall fence, which surrounds and protects the oil well.  To the north you spy a huge oil drilling machine. Steps lead down into an underground tunnel. }{Military Bunker}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
