R {20088}{0}{}{Oil field (s,n)}{ }{You are at the center of the oil field, and a huge oil drilling machine stands here, throbbing slowly as it draws oil from the ground.  Tall fencing blocks movement to the west and east.  To the south you see an entrance leading down into the ground.  The oil field stretches on to the north.  The ground is muddy and makes sucking noises as you walk. }{Military Bunker}{}{}{marble}{1.000}{1}
