R {20096}{0}{}{Lounge (e)}{ }{This must be the single largest room in this stronghold.  This chamber has three large windows which offer a panoramic view of the surrounding landscape.  Against many of the walls, and also placed in the center of the room are several low couches and cushions in eye-pleasing earth tones. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
