R {20100}{0}{<238>}{Library (s,e)}{<238>"""<088>}{This room is immense.  Shelves that reach to the top of the ten-foot-high ceiling line each wall.  Many of the shelves are empty\; still, there are hundreds of books here. The room smells musty - the odor of old books and of standing empty.  A fine film of dust seems to cover everything in the room, including the dark-colored floor, which looks somehow darker because of the shadows cast by the bookcases.  An archway in the southern wall leads to another room, as does an archway leading east. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20098}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20102}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20101}{0}{}{Laboratory (w)}{ }{Shelves lined with glassware cover the northern walls of this room.  The center of the room is taken up by three work benches covered with more glassware, boxes, and large ceramic bowls.  The room smells of vacancy with a hint of stringent chemicals. The walls at the far south end of the room are blackened from the floor up to about one foot from the ceiling.  Webs hang in patches from the ceiling.  Part of the floor is shiny, the remainder dull, singed, and rutted.  No wind blows through the room, but you hear a forlorn sighing, like a cold breeze blowing through bare branches. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20098}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20102}{0}{<238>}{Reading Room (n)}{<238>"""<088>}{Comfortably furnished and well-lit, this would see to be the perfect place to peruse material from the library.  Several tables and chairs make up the only furniture in this room. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20100}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20103}{0}{}{Guard's mess hall (s,u)}{ }{The southern passage leads into the base of a tower.  You are greeted by the sounds of silence.  What once may have been a busy mess hall is now empty and lifeless.  Tables and benches are placed about the room.  A stairway leads upwards. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
