R {20110}{0}{}{Balcony (w)}{ }{You step out of the corridor and onto a balcony with a view of the area surrounding this stronghold.  The balcony is bordered with a crenalated stone wall.  You can see this structure has three towers, two towards the northwest, and one to the south of the balcony. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
