R {20114}{0}{}{Guest quarters (e)}{ }{An elegantly decorated guest quarters.  There is a bed and small table with chair to the side.  The carpeting and walls appear to have been carefully selected to match the furniture decor.  Too bad it's all rotted and dusty. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
