R {20115}{0}{}{Guardroom (w,u)}{ }{The bottom floor of this tower is set up as a guard station.  Are you unlucky enough to stumble upon it while it's manned?  A door leads east, a passageway goes west, and a stairway leads up. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
