E {20106}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20120}{0}{}{Dining room (s,n)}{ }{A dozen black wooden chairs ring an oblong matching table in the center of this room.  The furniture is covered with intricate carvings of serpents, bones and skulls.  The room is lit by a single candle that sits in the middle of the table.  On the table in front of each chair is a dark colored woven place mat.  You guess the last meal served in this room was ages ago\; dust covers most everything. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20108}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20122}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20121}{0}{}{Drawing room (s)}{ }{You have entered a dark and somber room.  Wall to wall curtains in deep red plunge this room into an abysmal parody of a sitting room.  Plush garnet carpeting and upholstered chairs complete the setting. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20108}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20122}{0}{}{Kitchen (n)}{ }{Wooden counter-tops are illumated in the light of some luminous moss that clings to the ceiling.  A stove loaded with logs sits in the center of the room\; counter tops ring it.  Cabinets with glass doors are above the counters\; inside are colorful china dishes, cups, and crystal goblets.  At one end of the room, a stone-and-steel basin sits, filled with water from a pump attached to it.  Under the basin and the counters are wooden cabinets.  Dust covers everything. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20120}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20123}{0}{}{Practice hall (u,d)}{ }{This room appears to be a practice chamber for the guards to hone their fighting skills.  The room is unfurnished except for a large hard-wood area in the center of the room's floor.  The stairs continue upwards and downwards here. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20097}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20124}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20124}{0}{}{Observation lounge (d)}{ }{The stairs end at the top of the tower here, and exit into a comfortable room used by the guards in their off-hours.  Tables and chairs dot the room, covered with discarded gambling games. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20123}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20125}{0}{}{Prisoner's quarters (d,cell1,cell3,cell5,cell4,u)}{ }{This level of the tower is subdivided into various cells which ring the perimeter of the room.  Each cell has a wooden door bound with rusted metal straps and a small barred window.  Each door has a keyhole as well.  Only the door to the second cell appears to even function\; the others are in various state of disrepair.  The circular stairway continues upwards and downwards. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
