R {20131}{0}{}{Observation deck (d)}{ }{You step from the stairs onto the top floor of this tower. The walls of this room are made up almost entirely of glass, the roof supported by steel reinforcing bars.  You note the floor is very unusual in that the area from the outer wall inwards for ten feet rotates slowly.  Four chairs are set evenly about the perimeter. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
