R {20134}{0}{}{Kumahl's bedroom (d)}{ }{You step onto the top floor of this tower.  A large curtained bed rests against the wall. The walls, where not punctuated by large windows are covered by wardrobes set against them.  There is also a huge dresser with three flanking mirrors.  The top of the dresser is covered with myriad jars and cans of various makeups -- obviously an extremely sophisticated and complete collection.  You also see a number of freestanding full-length mirrors set about the room. }{Zith-el}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
