R {20135}{0}{}{Kumahl's office (n)}{ }{An ebonwood desk, the legs of which are carved to resemble serpents, dominates the room.  The room's lack of light and gray walls make the place seem somber and dark.  A black leather couch, coated with dust rests against the southern wall.  An ebonwood bookcase containing trinkets and knicknacks leans against the eastern wall.  Only the northern wall, which has an oak door in it, is adorned.  A picture of a female elf in flowing green robes hangs from it. }{Zith-el}{}{}{marble}{1.000}{1}
