R {20158}{0}{<238>}{Entrance to a Cabin (s)}{<238>#<138>E<238>#<088>}{Before you lies a ramshackle old cabin that seems to have seen the better side of an eternity or two.  The windows are dark and obscured by countless layers of dirt and grime. Looking down the path you came up, you realize exactly how far up you truly are.  You can see the far off walls of Wayhaven from here, with the expansive desert to its west and dense forest to the east...  An awe-inspiring view. }{The Old Hermit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
