R {20160}{0}{}{Spring of Kierlanai (exit,enter)}{ }{The old man says: "In ancient times, before the Dark Mages and the    Kayos, Kierlanai was a great kingdom in the northern lands. Kings    of strength and wisdom held peaceful court, and holy men from    across the realms would arrive on pilgrimage. Through a forest,    across a stream, and atop a peak was the Sacred Spring. It was    rumoured to grant everything from power to genius to love." }{Spring}{spring_of_kierlanai}{}{}{1.000}{1}
