R {20169}{0}{<278>}{Western Lemuria (s,n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The old man says: Western Lemuria... The main gates were in this    section of town.  There were always a great number of merchants    and travelers coming and going through this area... no doubt    the reason for its reputation... Ruffians and rabble crowding    streets, with an equal number of city guardsmen to maintain the    peace... did a good job of it, they did. }{Lemuria Dream}{lemuria}{}{}{1.000}{1}
