R {20170}{0}{<278>}{Southwestern Lemuria (e,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{The old man says: Southwest Lemuria... as I recall,    grand palaces and large manor homes filled this    section of town.  Lords and ladies, nobles of every    sort built their homes here.  The streets were    always clean and well kept... a beautiful spot. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20169}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20178}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20171}{0}{<278>}{Northwestern Lemuria (e,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{The old man says: Northwestern Lemuria... A quiet corner of the    city... home mostly to commonfolk.  I never occasioned the    opportunity to explore much of this area.  Always a good many    children in the streets as I remember. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20169}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20177}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20172}{0}{}{Exit (awaken,lemuria)}{ }{The old man says:  From here you may awaken back    to my cabin, or return to my tale of Lemuria. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
