R {20173}{0}{<278>}{Eastern Lemuria (s,n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The old man says: Eastern Lemuria... 'The Gateway to    a Thousand Lands', as a local poet once called it...    This section of town marked the transition from the    port to the city.  With the port to the east and the    market to the west, there was never a moment when this    area of town was not filled to overflowing. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20174}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
