R {20174}{0}{<278>}{Northeastern Lemuria (s,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{The old man says: Northeast Lemuria... home to large    warehouses and buildings.  Over time, many different    people stored many different things here.  Close enough    to the docks to provide easy access, but far enough    to keep them from smelling too strongly. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20177}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20173}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20175}{0}{<278>}{Southeastern Lemuria (w,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{The old man says: Southeast Lemuria... closer towards    the docks it was... most of the inns and taverns    were located here... so they could get the traffic    from the port, but keep some distance from the wharfs    themselves... kept down on the fights that way. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20173}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20178}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20176}{0}{<238>}{Lemurian Docks (s,w)}{<238>|||<088>}{The old man says: The Port of Lemuria... the true    lifeblood of Lemuria... Thousands of ships docked    here, most belonged to traders and merchants, their    hulls filled with goods and their dreams dancing    with gold.  Smaller craft docked here as well...    I seem to recall a tour of some sort as well. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
