R {20179}{0}{<278>}{Central Lemuria (e,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{The old man says: Central Lemuria... The home of the    'Lemurian Traders Market'... the only establishment    to even compare it to was that of Wayhaven, but even    the main square bazaar of Wayhaven paled in the    brilliance of the LTM.  Sights, sounds, smells and    all other stimuli abounded here, and all were for    sale. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
