R {20180}{0}{<238>}{Lemurian Docks - South (s,n)}{<238>|||<088>}{The old man says: To the best of my memory, the docks    continued a fair distance to the south.  Personally,    I never had much opportunity to explore exactly how    far they did go... so don't bother looking. }{Lemuria Dream}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
