R {20181}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (se,nw)}{ }{You're near the entrance to these dark woods, the exit just a short walk southeast.  As you peer down the path, you feel that the trees are bending over you ... closing in on you. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
