R {20182}{0}{<238>}{Halfway up the Mountain (se,nw)}{<238>.^.<088>}{Completely surrounded by enormous trees, this portion of the trail is covered by the shade of the nearby branches.  An occasional breeze blows through the trees, gently rustling the leaves as it moves its way eastward. Ahead, the trail winds northwest up into the trees, while to the southeast it heads down to the land below. }{Clear Falls Valley}{clear_falls_valley}{}{}{1.000}{1}
