R {20183}{0}{<238>}{Top of a Mountain (se,n)}{<238>.^.<088>}{This section of the trail opens up into a clearing high in the mountains.  The lack of trees in this part of the mountain allows for a very good view in all directions.  In the distance far down and to the north, there is the meadow of a small valley, discretely hidden and protected by the surrounding forest and mountains.  It appears that the trail heads north, in the direction of the valley.  To the south, the trail winds down the southeast side of the mountain as it heads toward the forest below. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20182}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20184}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20184}{0}{}{In the Valley (n,trail,nw,e)}{<238>T<088>}{A gentle breeze blows through the valley, ruffling the tall, lush grass as it makes its way across the meadow.  To the northwest, a thundering waterfall crashes into a stream, which gurgles as it makes its way swiftly through the center of the meadow.  To the south and far to the east, giant trees of the forest loom over the meadow as they stretch their limbs to the sky.  In the distant north and west, towering cliffs of the adjacent mountains make passage through them all but impossible. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20185}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20187}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
