R {20185}{0}{}{By the Stream (w,se,s,ne,e)}{ }{The stream turns slightly northward at this point, heads to the northeast for a distance and then turns east again to flow down the remainder of the meadow.  Across from the stream, at the point where it turns east, a portion of the meadow lies resting up against the northern cliffs.  The sun shines brightly down as a breeze from the west gently blows through the lush grass.  There is a cottage directly to the east. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20184}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
