R {20186}{0}{}{In the Valley (ne,w)}{ }{Directly ahead and to the north is a chicken coop, while a cottage awaits to the northwest.  A waterfall on the distant western cliff is barely visible from this point, causing the crashing sound of its descent to be but a quiet whisper.  Behind a chicken coop to the north, the tail end of a stream is visible just before it turns to head around the northern cliffs.  The forest stretches across the south and east mountains, looming over the meadow as it casts its shadow across the grass. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20188}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20189}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20187}{0}{}{By the Waterfall (e,se)}{ }{An enormous waterfall crashes down into a stream, sending stinging mist in all directions.  The constant onslaught of the waterfall has killed any attempt at plant life.  To the west, a cliff towers up into the sky, hovering relentlessly over the meadow.  Slightly to the northeast, a small portion of the meadow rests beyond the stream. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20184}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20185}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20188}{0}{}{In the Valley (w,nw,e)}{ }{Off in the distant northwest, a waterfall crashes into a stream which gurgles as it makes its way swiftly across the northern edge of the meadow. A small cottage quietly awaits to the north, while a chicken coop lies to the northeast.  The leaves on the trees to the south and east rustle gently as a breeze passes by. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
