R {20189}{0}{}{In the Valley (nw,sw)}{ }{The looming mountains to the south and east cast a comfortable shade over this section of the meadow.  The tail end of a stream is visible it runs along the edge of the north cliffs before turning to disappear around them. A chicken coop is to the west, while a cottage sits adjacent to the west side of the coop.  A fence surrounding the coop keeps predators out, while safely keeping the chickens inside. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20186}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20190}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20190}{0}{}{By the Stream (w,se)}{ }{To the north, a stream rushes by before turning sharply to head through a passageway between the east mountain and the north cliffs.  This section of the meadow is out of the shade created by the east and south mountains, permitting the sun to shine down on the valley.  To the northwest lies a small spot of the meadow across the stream.  A chicken coop and cottage are to the south and southwest. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20189}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20191}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20191}{0}{}{By the Stream (e,sw)}{ }{The stream widens and seems to be fairly shallow at this point.  Farther down to the east it becomes narrow and deep again, then makes a turn to head northward around the cliff side.  Across the stream, a portion of the meadow sits resting up against the northern cliffs.  A large tree has grown across the stream, sitting in the center of the grass.  It almost seems out of place compared to the rest of the trees in the forest of the east and south mountains.  A cottage is directly south. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20190}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
