R {20192}{0}{}{Inside the Cottage (w,e)}{ }{A small window on the south wall seems to be the only entry for the sunlight to shine into this small cottage, and as a result the room is slightly dark.  Two doors, the front door to the west and the back door to the east are the only ways in and out of this cottage.  On the floor is a large woven rug, which manages to cover all but a foot of the floor on each side.  Slightly off from the center of the room is a table, with three simple chairs pushed up underneath.  Off to the side, squeezed up against the north wall lie three cots, fairly small, but adequate size to sleep on. A counter and a row of cabinets rest up against the east wall, in between the back door and the south wall. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20185}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20193}{e}{open back door;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20193}{0}{}{Chicken Coop (w)}{ }{A fence runs around the perimeter of this coop, keeping the chickens safely inside and away from predators.  Straw has been scattered on the ground, almost covering it completely.  Near the south end of the coop, a simple hen house has been built to provide shelter. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{marble}{1.000}{1}
