R {20195}{0}{<238>}{Lower Tower Chamber (leave)}{<238>]<228>L<238>[<088>}{You have entered a strange shimmering tower.  Strangely, the ceiling of this room is much lower than the height of the tower would suggest, yet there are no obvious exits save the door you entered from.  A large table dominates the room, with a single chair behind it.  A large mirror is mounted on the east wall. }{Tower}{tower_of_grand_summoner}{}{}{1.000}{1}
