R {20196}{0}{<238>}{Somewhere in the Tower (u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You are in a round room somewhere in the middle of the tower.  The room is unadorned except for a brilliant circular staircase ascending into the upper reaches of the tower. There appears to be no exit back to the lower room from here. }{Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20197}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20197}{0}{}{Top of the Tower (d)}{ }{You have reached the top of the tower.  This appears to be a workshop of a magical sort.  Along the east wall are assorted glass jars filled with all manners of odd items. To the west, north, and south, large mirrors frame the room, reflecting you and your surroundings with a surreal intensity. In the middle of the room is a waist-high bookshelf with many strange tomes.  The circular stairway you rose from is in the very center.  This is obviously the study of a very knowledgeable wizard. }{Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
