R {20301}{0}{<238>}{An exhibit room (sw,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This appears to be some sort of exhibit room. Numerous ancient and beautiful tapestries line the stone cobbled walls here. The ancient tapestries appear to be made out of a heavy cloth which was woven with rich, varicolored scenes of history. To the southwest you can see more bookshelves. A thin layer of mist swirls across the ground here. The carpet continues to the southwest and east. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
