R {20302}{0}{<238>}{An exhibit room (se,w,ne)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The walls of this exhibit room are completely unadorned. To the northeast you can see a study room where others can go to read and do their research. At the center of the room is a small projector. To the west and southeast you can make out some bookshelves. There is a light layer of mist swirling across the ground here. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14027}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
