R {20303}{0}{<238>}{Amongst towering bookshelves (se,ne)}{<238>"""<088>}{Towering bookshelves line both sides of the passageway here. They are filled with all sorts of books covering diverse subjects, ranging from scholastic and academic works to stories of grand battles, biographies, politically satirical essays, and even fictional stories have found their way onto the nearby shelves. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20301}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20304}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20304}{0}{<238>}{An exhibit room (sw,nw,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Like the other exhibit rooms, elegant tapestries line the walls here. The tapestries appear to recount the tales of this land. Along with the tapestries are scenery paintings of different places throughout the realm. The paintings, rich in color and beauty, were probably painted by a wandering artist. There are golden placards underneath the paintings that may indicate who the artist is. There is a private study room to the southwest. A thin layer of mist swirls across the floor here. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20303}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20305}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20306}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20305}{0}{<238>}{A study room (ne)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered a study room in the library. This is apparently where everybody goes to study, unless they are too absorbed into their research before they could even make it here. There is a large oak table at the center of the room and chairs along each side. There is a small layer of mist here. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20304}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20306}{0}{<238>}{Amongst towering bookshelves (e,w)}{<238>"""<088>}{Towering bookshelves line both sides of the passageway here. But for some strange reason, the bookshelves are completely empty. Dust marks show that there used to be books here but it is unknown as to why someone would get rid of such valuable works. There is a light layer of mist swirling across the ground here. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20304}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20307}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20307}{0}{<238>}{An exhibit room (ne,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Numerous tapestries line the walls here. While some of them are in good condition, others appear to be singed or torn. The remnants of a broken stool lay on the ground here. One of the stool's wooden legs has been shattered into numerous pieces. To the west and northeast you can see bookshelves. A thin layer of mist swirls across the ground here. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
