R {20308}{0}{<238>}{Amongst towering bookshelves (sw,nw)}{<238>"""<088>}{Large oaken bookshelves line both sides of the walls here. To the northwest and southwest you can make out exhibit rooms. Dozens of books stand like little sentries on the bookshelves. A lot of the bindings on the books appear to be in very poor condition, but probably due to the wear and tear of time. This section of the library appears to be somewhat barren. Some of the books have been toppled over and others appear to be missing. There is a thin layer of mist swirling across the ground here. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20307}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20302}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20309}{0}{<238>}{A private study room (sw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered one of the library's study rooms. At the center of the room is a large oak table and surrounding it are numerous lounging chairs. A plethora of plants have been placed at the four corners of the room. There is a bookshelf on the west wall. A small layer of mist swirls across the ground here. }{Library of Elandra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20302}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20310}{0}{<178>}{A Beautiful Garden (se,ne)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{As if it couldn't get even lovelier, the garden has brightly colored flowers planted in arranged blocks adding another touch of beauty to the already elegant garden. A fountain rushes with water to your east with a mellow sound of splashing as the water hits the fountain's basin. The air is peaceful and revitalizing as it fills your lungs. The sun continues to shine brightly on this stretch of grass. The song of a bird brings happiness to your ears as the garden continues to emanate joy from its very essence. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14031}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20312}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20311}{0}{<178>}{A Beautiful Garden (sw,nw)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{The garden continues to amaze you with its never ending beauty. A few sparse trees scatter amongst the outer sections of the garden, and although they hinder the sun's bright glow, they manage to provide a comfortable shade still pleasant from the warmth of the sun. The grass remains trim as it is throughout the rest of the garden with the same perfect glistening of dew sparkled on top of it. A few small groups of hummingbirds fly quickly around the garden, most likely looking for flowers to nip from. The soft gurgle of a fountain can be heard nearby. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14031}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20312}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20312}{0}{<178>}{A Beautiful Garden (se,sw)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The garden's local butterflies flutter about in circles throughout the area, with a large spectrum of colored wings bringing an intriguing spark to the already ravishing sights. A fountain gurgling water from its centerpiece to the basin below with a soft, mellow splashing sound can be seen to the south. The grass continues to emanate its green shade with powerful presence. The sun's golden hue gives the garden an almost angelic appeal to its already magical demeanor. The garden spreads out to both sides in the southern direction. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
