R {20313}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (se,w)}{ }{The path takes a sharp turn here.  To the southeast, the path leads out of the forest.  However due west you see the front of a large, ancient house.  For some reason you feel a chill down your spine as you look upon the house\; and a premonition that you should not enter it lightly. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20181}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20314}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20314}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (w,e)}{ }{The path becomes narrow here, as the trees seem to tighten their grip around the thin path.  Perhaps this is their last chance to claim you, before they lose you to the ominous dark manor to the west ... }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20313}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20315}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20315}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (n,e)}{ }{Finally the path has opened up to create a small clearing.  You're standing at the front entrance to an ancient manor, built of decaying wood.  The front door lies directly west of you, and shuttered windows are set about twenty feet north and south of the door.  A narrow path continues around the house to the north. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20314}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20316}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20316}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (n,s)}{ }{You can see the shuttered windows and the front corner of the house from here.  Bushes surrounding the house are thick and unkempt, but must have been beautiful once.  Farther north, you can see the path twisting around the corner of the house. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20315}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20317}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20317}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (s,w)}{ }{The bushes end abruptly at the corner of the house directly southwest of you.  Farther along the path to the west, you see the north side of the house\; it looks as uninviting as what you've seen so far.  Glancing to the north, you notice some mist creeping around at your feet.  The path becomes foggier to the west, and the forest to the north is also obscured by fog. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20316}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20318}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20318}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (w,e)}{ }{The thick mist curls around you, restricting your sight.  Your knees begin to feel weak as you notice the dark forms of the old forest crowding you against the house.  You can barely make out another shuttered window to the south. You place your hand along the house to keep from wandering off and stumbling into a tree.  The path seems to continue to the east and west. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20317}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20319}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35753}{climb window}{climb window}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35753}{n}{climb window}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20319}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (w,e)}{ }{The mist begins to clear a bit, but you still cannot see further than ten feet in it. You step on a twig, breaking it, and start as the sound quivers ominously around you in the damp fog.  Above you, thunder crashes, and then a faint echo of it sounds again from the west.  Dragging a hand along the side of the house you feel another shuttered window.  The foggy path continues to the west. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20318}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20320}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20320}{0}{}{=( A Twisted Path )= (e)}{ }{The mist is much thinner here.  You look at the northwest corner of the old house\; the wood is pretty decayed and dingy, as it was elsewhere. You notice there is another shuttered window to your south.  Whoa!  As you walk around the corner of the house to investigate the backyard, you slip on a couple of small pebbles.  The pebbles skitter a few feet and suddenly drop off into the darkness to the west!  Peering through the light fog you notice that there's a steep and deep chasm at the edge of the house.  You make a mental note to pay careful attention to your surroundings. The path ends here and you cannot continue around the house.  You could head back east along the path, but you cannot risk the chasm without certain death. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20319}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

