R {20322}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* The Street of Song *\x7D=- (se,nw,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road, made of smooth bricks, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  On either side of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact wait quietly for you to explore.  It is frighteningly silent.  There are not even any birds in the small trees that have taken root in and around the foundations of the buildings.  To the west and south rubble from ruined pubs and hotels lies in heaps, while to the northeast Flaxen's Ride branches off into ruined parkland.   }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
