R {20331}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* The Street of Sorrows *\x7D=- (n,s)}{<278> | <088>}{The ancient small rocks of this street lead you through this abandoned city of the elves.  Sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago, only the foolhardy explore here.  This street defines the southeast border of the city.  On the east side of the street, the ruins of largely intact larger dwellings hold back the forests, while on the west side similar dwellings block access to an overgrown parkland.  Just off the street, grander buildings in disrepair amongst the rubble wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is very quiet.  Small weeds poke through the steps, stairs and ornamentation of the ruined buildings. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
