R {20335}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Flaxen's Ride *\x7D=- (sw,ne)}{<278>- -<088>}{This street in the southeast corner of the city housed the more well-off mages, some shops, and further south the famed Hall of Guild Faunists.  On the east side of the street ruined shops and homes border an overgrown park.  It is unnerving, as small creeping vines and grasses run over the buildings.  To the sides of the lane, bigger buildings that are almost intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
