R {20336}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (se,n,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{You watch the high towers in the distance for signs of predators as you proceed cautiously down this road made of loose bricks.  The dense forest to the northeast comes almost to the road, with white stone homes and buildings choked with trees and thick vines barely holding it at bay.  To the south, more open parkland dotted with ruined buildings indicates that this was once an affluent part of the city.  On either side of the road, large houses and buildings in serious disrepair wait quietly for you to explore.  It is hard to detect advancing foes, as low shrubs dot the landscape and choke the openings. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
