R {20349}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (s,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{The dense forest to the north comes almost to the road, with the rubble of a blown apart mage's tower barely holding it back.  A street branches off to the south.  Just off the road, smaller buildings amongst the rubble wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is like a weird park, where small trees and shrubs can be seen growing inside some of the long abandoned buildings.  As you make your way down this road you notice that the bricks shows some signs of recent traffic. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
