R {20350}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Darthil Street *\x7D=- (sw,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{Just off the street, multi-story buildings and offices with some holes in their roofs wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is unsettling, as huge vines and leafy shrubs seem to crawl out of and obscure the openings in the buildings.  The street runs roughly north-south following a stream to the east, and bordering the more heavily populated (and ruined) sections of Murus Faralain.  This street was once the site of numerous homes and houses of the founding families of elves.  Stepping quietly on the large flat stones of this street you listen for signs of life and hardly surprisingly, you detect none at all.  Any living thing with any common sense avoids this place. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
