R {20386}{0}{<178>}{III The Wyvernwatch III (n,e)}{<278>###<088>}{Formerly one of Murus Faralain's swankiest hotels, this long chateau-like building is largely intact, although its many windows have been boarded up by someone (or something).  The front doors have been barred shut. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
