R {20401}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (s,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{The ancient loose bricks of this road lead you through this abandoned city of the elves.  Sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago, only the foolhardy explore here.  The forest to the north provides a sylvan setting to the once elegant homes and temples here.  A side-street leads south.  By the road, multi-story buildings and offices with some holes in their roofs hide both treasures beyond the imagination and unimaginable death.  It is unsettling, as huge vines and leafy shrubs seem to crawl out of and obscure the openings in the buildings. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
