R {20402}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Temple Way *\x7D=- (n,s)}{<278> | <088>}{As you make your way down this street you notice that the broken cobblestones shows some signs of recent traffic.  It is mostly clear of vegetation.  Just off to the sides of the street, bigger buildings that are almost intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
