R {20403}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (n,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{It is hard to imagine, but there is not a living thing in sight.  Just off to the sides of the road, completely destroyed buildings pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.  The vegetation north of you comes right to the edge of the rubble, except for a narrow gap heading into the forest.  Hidden behind a veil of trees, you can make out a smokey blue-grey tower to the north.   }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20401}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
