R {20404}{0}{<278>}{Outside a Shimmering Tower (s)}{<278> | <088>}{You stand before a tall tower, rising approximately 80 feet above you.  It's made of an unusual stone, gray with veins of blue running through it.  The joints where the stones meet are almost invisible.  Clearly this tower was fashioned by magic, and magic has preserved it over the years.  Walking around it, you notice that there's a door set in the south side of the tower. }{Ethereal Tower}{ethereal_tower}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20403}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20406}{n}{open door;n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20405}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (s,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{The road, made of worn pavers, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  On either side of the road, multi-story buildings and offices with some holes in their roofs wait quietly for you to explore.  It is unsettling, as huge vines and leafy shrubs seem to crawl out of and obscure the openings in the buildings.  The forest comes to the road here.  A destroyed mage's tower can be seen rising above the forest to the northeast, while a street leads off to the south.   }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20403}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20427}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20428}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20406}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (n,s)}{ }{You're in the entrance of a strange tower, built of gray-blue stone.  The room is rectangular, with a door leading out set in the middle of the south wall, and an archway in the middle of the north wall.  You're relieved to have stumbled upon this haven from the chaotic forces of the surrounding ruins.  Still, despite the apparent order, there's a lingering magical presence that causes your stomach to quiver anxiously. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20404}{s}{open door;s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20407}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20407}{0}{<238>}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (ne,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're at the north end of the first floor of the strange tower.  There are a number of destroyed crates against the west wall, their contents scattered on the floor.  You can see a set of circular stairs rising up to the other levels to the northeast.  To the south is the entrance room of the tower, and past that, your escape out. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20406}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20408}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20408}{0}{<238>}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (sw,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're at the bottom of a circular staircase, which stretches up at least six stories above you.  The stone stairs are solid beneath your feet\; which is reassuring as they won't crumble beneath your feet, but you hesitate and consider that a tumble down these hard stairs would likely spell your death.  The archway to the southwest leads back toward the entrance of the tower ... your way out! }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20407}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20409}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20409}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (sw,u,d)}{ }{You're at the second level of a circular staircase, which stretches up far above you.  Craning your neck, you can see at least three more stories above you before the stairs disappear into darkness, beyond the range of your light.  There's an archway to the southwest which leads to a room of the tower. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20408}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20410}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20411}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20410}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (ne,s)}{ }{You've entered the north room of the second floor.  The shattered shelves, broken pottery, and the large hearth set into the west wall give evidence that this was once a kitchen.  To the northeast the staircase continues.  An archway to the south leads to another room. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20409}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20412}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20411}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (sw,u,d)}{ }{You glance down the staircase between the winding stone stairs and are struck with a mild vertigo.  The bottom stairs are faintly visible, only two stories below.  You're at the third floor of a circular staircase, which stretches up at least another three stories above you.  There's an archway to the southwest which leads to the tower, or you could climb the winding stairs into the darkness above. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20409}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20413}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20414}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20412}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (n)}{ }{You're in the south end of the tower, on the second level.  You suspect that this room was once a dining hall\; the remains of a long table lie smashed on the floor, surrounded by shattered sticks which may have once been chairs. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20410}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20413}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (ne,s)}{ }{You've entered a small study room, with two broken tables and what appear to be the remains of chairs. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20411}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20415}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20414}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (sw,u,d)}{ }{Having kept a count, you know that you're on the fourth level of the tower, but you cannot see the bottom floor nor the top from here.  The stairs extend at least three stories below you and three stories above you, before they become lost in darkness.  There's an archway to the southwest which leads to the tower. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20411}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20416}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20417}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20415}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (n)}{ }{This room was once a dormitory.  The remains of five narrow beds lie shattered and broken on the floor.  There's no other furniture in the room, although a small pile of dust seems to indicate that an armoire once rested in the corner. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20413}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20416}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (ne,s)}{ }{You've entered the northern room on the fourth floor.  There's a broken table and several smashed chairs scattered on the ground.  Likely this was once a study room for the mage's students.  The large window set in the west wall would offer a good view of the surrounding ruins. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20414}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20418}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20417}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (sw,u,d)}{ }{You're at the fifth floor of a circular staircase, but as you glance down towards the ground floor you feel a sense of vertigo.  The stairs disappear into the darkness below, but you know that if you were fall, the cold hard stones would split your skull like a ripe watermelon!  Edging to the safety of the outer wall, you glance up, and see two more floors awaiting you. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20414}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20419}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20420}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20418}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (n)}{ }{You've entered what was a dormitory.  Four broken beds rest against the walls, and a small shattered bookshelf rests on the ground near the archway.  Neither the beds nor the bookshelf has withstood the damage of time and damp weather, having deteriorated past any use or value. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20416}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20419}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (ne,s)}{ }{The northern room of the fifth floor of the tower has a long wooden table, with smashed vials, flasks and beakers strewn on its top, and spilling over onto the floor.  The ceiling is noticably different here\; directly above the table, the stone has been stained with a circular black mark. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20417}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20421}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20420}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (sw,u,d)}{ }{You're at the sixth floor of a circular staircase, but you avoid looking down into the darkness below.  A fall from this height onto the stone stairs below you certainly spell your death.  You stay close to the center of the stairs, and pray that you aren't forced into battle.  Glancing up, you can see that the stairs continue one more floor.  An archway to the southwest seems to beckon you to leave the staircase. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20417}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20422}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20423}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20421}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (n)}{ }{The southern room of the fifth floor of this strange tower is filled with many strange items.  Glass beakers, vials, and odd devices constructed of metal and glass rest atop several long tables.  It appears that the mage and his students practiced alchemy here.  One vial in particular catches your eye.  It's propped up on the table, nearest to you. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20419}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20422}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (ne,s)}{ }{This room is completely empty.  There's an archway in the south wall which leads into the southern room of the sixth level of this wizard's tower.  Looking hesitantly through the archway, but unable to make out the room beyond, you consider heading northeast to the stairs, and leaving this place. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20420}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20424}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20423}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (sw,d)}{ }{You're at the top floor of a circular staircase.  Glancing down, you see a full six stories below you.  Shuddering, you stick to the wall, waiting for the vertigo to pass.  Falling down that distance, to land on the stone floor, would prove fatal.  There's an archway to the southwest which leads to the tower. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20420}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20425}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20424}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (n)}{ }{You've entered the southern room high up in the magical tower.  The room is devoid of furnishings, except for a very odd sight: In the middle of the room, a golden pentagram has been traced onto the floor. In the center of the pentagram, a strange stone block has been fastened to the floor. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20422}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20425}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (ne,s)}{ }{This room is completely empty\; but the emptiness serves only to highlight the odd colour and composition of the surrounding rock.  You've reached the top level of the tower, and while there may not be much inside the tower to look at, the window would undoubtably provide a good view of the surrounding ruins.  An archway in the southern wall leads into another room, while the stairs to the northeast tease of an escape from this mysterious tower. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20423}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20426}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20426}{0}{}{=( A Shimmering Tower )= (n)}{ }{This room was once home to the mage of the tower.  It must have been extravagant once, but most of the decorations have deteriorated years ago:  A large broken bed lies in pieces below the window.  Only splinters remain of something that may have once been a large dresser\; a few small brass pieces which may have held the wood together remain.  A few scraps of material -- perhaps once rich tapestries? -- lie scattered on the floor. }{Ethereal Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20425}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20427}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Callinghorn Street *\x7D=- (n,s)}{<278> | <088>}{The street, made of round field stones, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  It is impossible to check the houses at a distance, as thick shrubs obscure the entrances, windows and holes of buildings.  To the sides of the street, larger edifices and shops that are mostly intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20405}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20634}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20428}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The forest comes to the road here.  Ruined temples can be seen on both sides of the road.  It is deadly silent and not a living thing can be seen.  Just off to the sides of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20405}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20429}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20429}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The forest comes to the road here.  Ruined temples can be seen in the bush to the north and south.  A small movement in some shrubs in the distance catches your eye.  You pause in the middle of the road and wish you could just disappear into the worn bricks and hide.  If you wait out here in the open much longer your wish may come true.  By the road, grander buildings in disrepair amongst the rubble hide both treasures beyond the imagination and unimaginable death.  It is unsettling, as huge vines and leafy shrubs seem to crawl out of and obscure the openings in the buildings. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20428}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20430}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20430}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (sw,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road, made of loose bricks, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  The forest comes almost to the road here, held back only by the dense stone warehouses and other stone buildings.  Just off the road, larger edifices and shops that are mostly intact wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is frighteningly silent.  There are not even any birds in the small trees that have taken root in and around the foundations of the buildings. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20429}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20431}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20431}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (ne,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{Just off the road, larger edifices and shops that are mostly intact wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is hard to detect advancing foes, as low shrubs dot the landscape and choke the openings.  You watch the high towers in the distance for signs of predators as you proceed cautiously down this road made of bricks.  The forest comes almost to the road here, held back only by the dense stone warehouses and other stone buildings.   }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20430}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20432}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20432}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (n,s,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{Just off the road, multi-story buildings and offices with some holes in their roofs wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is mostly clear of vegetation.  The forest comes almost to the road here, held back only by the dense stone warehouses and other stone buildings.  An overgrown road leads off into the forest to the west.  The ancient worn pavers of this road lead you through this abandoned city of the elves.  Sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago, only the foolhardy explore here. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20431}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20433}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20434}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20433}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (n,s)}{<278> | <088>}{The forest comes almost to the road here, held back only by the dense stone warehouses and other stone buildings.  It is mostly clear of vegetation.  To the sides of the road, large houses and buildings in serious disrepair pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.  The road, made of worn pavers, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
