R {20472}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (n,s,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{To the west, a green field that was once a park is bordered by the encroaching forest, while on either side of the street here are ruined and abandoned hotels, inns, restaurants and other buildings of the hospitality trade.  A street leads off to the east.  The road, made of bricks, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  On either side of the road, larger edifices and shops that are mostly intact wait quietly for you to explore.  It is unnerving, as small creeping vines and grasses run over the buildings. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
