R {20553}{0}{<228>}{i_i Hall of the Guild of Faunists i_i (se,enter)}{<228>,<238>E<228>`<088>}{As you stand in the grass in front of the entrance to the ruined guild, you see that the building has had its eastern face torn off completely.  Peering into its interior you cannot make out any detail what-so-ever.  You would have to enter to see more detail, but you remember that discretion is the better part of valour. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20552}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
