R {20554}{0}{<278>}{Inside the Hall of Guild Faunists (leave)}{<278>< ><088>}{Inside the Hall of Guild Faunists You stand in a dust-choked building with great cracks in its arched nave, and scatterings of fallen rocks here and there where the walls and ceiling have given way.  It is devoid of animal life, and contains a large stone seat or throne of massive construction, unadorned by inscription or ornament. }{Faunist Guild}{faunist_guild}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20553}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
