R {20570}{0}{<148>}{A stream (ne,s)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{Just north of a bridge, you are surrounded by the ruins of buildings on the banks overhead.  The stream flows past you as you stand on the gravel bank. }{Murus Faralain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
