R {20684}{0}{<268>}{Hall of Kings (u,s,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Hall of Kings This breathtaking chamber is the central room of the legendary Hall of Kings.  Resting place to many of the realm's royal family, this holy place was buried beneath rubble for over 190 years before recent excavation revealed its hiding place.  Forgotten by many, it was sought and restored to its former glory by members of the Knights of the Realm, the monarchy's historic protectors and champions.  Now its stately white marble columns, magnificent bas reliefs, and heroic roundels are once again displayed to all who enter this hall seeking knowledge of the realm's history and splendor. }{Hall of Kings}{hall_of_kings}{}{}{1.000}{1}
