R {20695}{0}{<268>}{In a large mansion (se,sw,n,s,e)}{L}{The nicely furnished house continues in the same style as the foyer. Everything is neatly ordered and the small table placed just next to the eastern wall appears completely new and untouched. A lush red carpet lies in the middle of the hallway and it continues directly in a northern to southern direction. Smaller rooms branch out from this spacious hallway into other parts of the mansion. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_mansion}{}{}{1.000}{1}
