R {20698}{0}{<268>}{In a large mansion (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The main hallway continues deeper into the large mansion. Two wooden bureaus stand alongside each wall and above them, in the centre of the ceiling, hangs a small chandelier. The floor is covered by a lush red carpet which continues along the hall in a northern to southern direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
