R {20699}{0}{<268>}{In a large mansion (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{As you walk through the small hallway you almost hit your head on a very low chandelier. It hangs just slightly above your head and if lit, you'd imagine it would shine most beautifully. The northern wall has a large window, allowing a good view of the outside and some of the daylight to light up the normally dark corridors. Looking towards the west you see that the hallway open up to a more spacious part of the mansion. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20695}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20700}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20700}{0}{<238>}{In a library (w)}{<238>"""<088>}{This appears to be the library of the house. Bookshelves stand along all the walls and rows upon rows on books are crammed in them. There is a large chair in the middle of the room and a small desk next to it. The floor consists of the same dark fine wood that you've seen everywhere else and the smell of freshly oiled wood lies heavily here. The room itself contains no apparent light source and there are no windows at all, yet it's still not dark. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_library}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20699}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20701}{0}{<278>}{On the upper floor of a large mansion (d,n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The corridor on the top floor appears to be more a lot more colourful than the bottom floor. Instead of the bottom part being covered with dark wood, it's painted in a light shade of green. The floor, however, looks exactly the same with its dark shiny surface. There is a small stairway here which leads down to the first floor. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20696}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
