R {20703}{0}{}{In a small playroom (s)}{D}{This must be the mansion's playroom. Toys of every different kind lie in disarray across the floor. A wooden cradle stands in the northeastern part of the room next to a small wooden dresser. A large window facing the northern direction provides good light in the room as well as a beautiful view over the garden. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20702}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20704}{0}{<268>}{On the upper floor of a large mansion (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You think you see something on the ground. A bead or a children's toy but as you bend over to study it closer you realize that it's just a trick of light coming from the western hall window. Glancing over at the window, you shrug your shoulders and continue down the corridor. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20702}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20708}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20705}{0}{<268>}{On the upper floor of a large mansion (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You're on the top floor of the large mansion. The hallway continues in a straight eastern to western direction. There are several different paintings on the walls here and by the looks of it they are very old. The dark wooden floor creaks slightly as you continue on your way. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20702}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20706}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20706}{0}{<268>}{On the upper floor of a large mansion (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The small corridor stops before a large window mounted in the eastern wall. A small door leads off to a room to the north while the corridor continues off in a straight western direction. There is a wooden bench sitting right under the window, allowing the inhabitants of the mansion to sit inside yet still see the sun and get fresh air. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20705}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20707}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20707}{0}{<248>}{In a well furnished wash room (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This is the mansion's wash room. Wooden barrels stand along the northern wall and a large metallic tub next to it. Instead of wood, the floor is covered by smooth slabs of marble and walls are coated with some kind of glazed substance. Several holes have been made in the stone slabs and you see that pipes have been mounted to them, acting as drainage for any water than might be spilled. It's truly an ingenious construction which you've only seen in the wealthiest of homes.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20706}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20708}{0}{<268>}{On the upper floor of a large mansion (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway ends before a large open window. As you lean out you see the main garden and slightly to the north is a newly planted tree. It's too far down to jump but the open window provides an excellent source of fresh air. There is a small ledge next to the window, making it a good spot to relax from a busy day. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20704}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20709}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20709}{0}{<248>}{In a large bedroom (s,in)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You're standing in the master bedroom. Two large beds have been pushed together in the centre of the room and several wooden dressers stand next to the western wall. A large window mounted on the northern wall offers both great views of the surrounding gardens as well as allowing plenty of daylight to come in. A particularly large wardrobe covers most of the eastern wall. It looks big enough to enter. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20708}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20710}{in}{in}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
