R {20710}{0}{<108>}{In a dark closet (out)}{C}{Clothes are everywhere. Pantaloons, shirts, and other garments hang on finely carved hangers. Wooden boxes containing shoes and similar things are stacked on the floor. The smell in the closet reeks of dust and stagnant air. Staying in here for any longer period of time would definitely give you a headache. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20709}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20709}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20711}{0}{<248>}{In a large dining room (n,w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You're standing in the dining room of the mansion. A long table is in the centre of the room and several wooden chairs stand next to it. Along the walls are elaborate paintings describing all kinds of wondrous events. There is an intricate drawing in the ceiling portraying a beautiful sunset. Acting as the sun is a large crystal chandelier which hangs down directly above the table. A closed door blocks your immediate passage in the western direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20698}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20712}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20712}{0}{<248>}{In a well equipped kitchen (w,e)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{The small kitchen contains anything you'd ever need to make and prepare food. A large table, coated with a fine steel sheet, stands against the northern wall and directly next to it, you see both a large oven as well as a wide range of different cooking utensils. Along the southern wall is a wooden shelf that contains any spice the chef might need. All the cooking and baking in this room has left an interesting scent in the room. It's very pleasant and you feel your stomach growl. There are several wooden crates and boxes stacked around the walls. Crammed between the many crates, are two small wooden doors.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20711}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20713}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20713}{0}{<248>}{In a kitchen storage (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You're in what must be the kitchen storage. Sacks, crates and barrels of all shapes and sizes clutter the small room completely. There are no windows in this room, and it's surprisingly cold considering the warm temperature outside. A small door leads out to the kitchen. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20712}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20714}{0}{<108>}{In a nice basement (u,s)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{As you step into the cellar you immediately discard all notions of cellars being dark and murky places. This storage area is in tip top condition and not a single speck of dust can be seen. Both the western and eastern walls are stacked with containers which most likely serve as excellent storage bins. A large wooden staircase leads up to the ground floor of the mansion while the cellar continues off in a southern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20697}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20715}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20715}{0}{<108>}{In a basement (n)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{This part of the cellar is fairly empty. The only furniture here is a completely empty desk which sits against the western wall. Above it is a sparkling window allowing you to see parts of the outside garden.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20714}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20716}{0}{}{Top of the Shed (d)}{ }{You are standing on the top of an old run-down shed.  Vines have pried their way to the top and small shrubs are growing in the cracks and pits of the rooftop.  From this vantage point you can see out over the grassy field as the sun shines overhead. }{The Drow Kingdom of fe dar Shad}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4853}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20717}{0}{}{Dark passage (crack,passage)}{ }{You find yourself within a cramped and dark passage within the mountain.  Every now and then, the low rumble of thunder can be heard, followed by loose pebbles falling around you.  Your better judgement tells you that you should not spend any more time here than necessary, lest you become trapped by a cave in. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20718}{crack}{crack}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5312}{passage}{passage}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20718}{0}{}{Mechanism room (s,e,stairs,crack)}{<238>C<088>}{This room lies in hushed darkness.  Hideous shadows float about, and you feel as though you are being watched by some unseen eyes.  The room smells of oil and dank stone.  Rotted wooden shelves line the walls of the room, containing various items all covered in thick cobwebs.  All corners of the room are also covered by cobwebs, including the southern doorway, blocked completely by heavy rocks and chunks from the collapsed wall.  A small crank mechanism lies in the southwestern corner of the room, and a dark crack is cut into the northern wall. }{Der'Thalas}{ravenloft_mechanism}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20720}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20721}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20717}{crack}{crack}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20719}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20721}{u}{stairs}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20719}{0}{<238>}{Gatehouse (n,s,opening)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You are in the keep's moderately sized gatehouse just north of the windswept courtyard.  The whole of the wooden structure creaks softly and sways in the night wind.  The entire room smells of oil, grease and rotten wood.  Slight beams of moonlight filters in through the broken boards of the roof of the gatehouse, barely penetrating the stale gloom.  Though large enough for two carriages, only one is present, crashed into a heap in the northeast corner of the structure. A doorway leads north from here, but is blocked by debris from the collapsed northern wall.  Just near the broken carriage, a dark opening is cracked in the stone, leading east into the dark keep. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20722}{e}{opening}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20725}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20722}{opening}{opening}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20720}{0}{<268>}{Lower battlements (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are now in the enclosed, lower battlements of Der'Thalas Keep.  The wind whistles through the arrow slits here mournfully, and the air is stale and dank.  A strange, pale odor seems to emanate from the stone walls themselves.  Looking more closely, you see that they are slick with some putrid ochre.  Strange noises echo along the long hallway.  Coupled with the shadows everpresent in the damned keep, your mind is constantly on the alert for whatever horrors reside in this place.  The dark battlements continue south from here.  A doorway leads west from here. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20718}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20722}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20721}{0}{}{Upper battlements (s,stairs)}{<238>S<088>}{You stand on the high, upper battlements on the eastern edge of Der'Thalas Keep.  The night wind blows about you fiercely here, almost buffeting you over the edge and into the dark forest below.  Looming high above you to the north and further west are the twisted crags of the Valadak mountains.  Looking out over the eastern edge, you can see the vastness of the haunted forest.  Further northeast, over the twisted branches of the dark trees, you can make out the faint gaslights of Barovia.  The dark courtyard and garden are below you to the west.  The distance you are from their dark embrace does not offer much comfort.  A dark set of stairs leads down into the dark keep to the west. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20726}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
