R {20725}{0}{<228>}{Courtyard (n,s,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You stand in the open courtyard of Der'Thalas Keep.  Dead leaves blow around your feet, guided by the haunted wind of this land.  The battlements of the keep run north and south, east of here, dark shadows visible on the towering parapets.  To the north is a partially collapsed gatehouse, rotten from age.  West of here is a shadowed garden.  Huge shapes loom out of the misty garden, taking monstrous form as the lightning flashes in the dark sky above you. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
