R {20728}{0}{<178>}{Forgotten garden (n,e)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The dark garden embraces you in a cold, draining grasp.  The hedges of the horrid place stand shaped into the forms of animals. Dead and creaking, the black plants crumble to the ground with every stroke of the wind.  The main courtyard of the keep is to the east and the southern battlements stretch over the whole of the keep and out of sight to the west.  The door to the keep stands open north of here, revealing the dark interior of the keep, but little of the horrors that lie within. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20725}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
