R {20729}{0}{<268>}{Dark hall (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You travel along a dark and cold hallway within the haunted keep of Der'Thalas.  You are not alone here, as the spirits of the dead share your footsteps.  Your footsteps echo softly off the cold stone walls.  Barely illuminating the hallway, your meager light shines no more than a few feet into the unholy darkness.  You think you see something further along in the darkness, it appears to be a glowing candelabra, floating unsupported in the air. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
