R {20739}{0}{<138>}{Throne room (n,s,w,e)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{As you step into this dark chamber, your breath catches in your throat as the wonder and horror of the scene unfolds before you.  Along the walls, torches sputter black oily smoke into the air, casting dim, unyielding light into the room.  High above you, sweeping arches soar into the air, like the giant ribcage of some great beast.  Once exquisite columns of charred marble line the walls, looking as hideous as the decaying teeth in some monstrous mouth.  A rotted, royal purple carpet streaks through the center of the room, spilling forth from a cracked pedestal like a fouled river.  The edges of the carpet are blackened by age and decay, fraying in almost every spot.  A brigade of burned and cracked elven armour stands at attention, motionless against the east and west walls.  At the far end of the chamber, a black throne rests atop the charcoal-black, ivory pedestal.  Vermin infested, large cushions litter the floor of this royal chamber.  Near the back, northern side of the hall, you see the tattered remains of a royal banner, swaying gracefully in the air even though there is no wind.  The banner softly licks the wall near a doorway leading north.  Dark portals leads east and west from here, while the main entrance to the chamber is south. }{Der'Thalas}{tharon}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20738}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20741}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
