R {20744}{0}{<248>}{Kitchen (w)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{This large kitchen was once filled with elven cooks preparing and serving food, but now the only living creatures are the spiders and rats.  In the center of the room is a huge oaken carving table that is bare except for vermin tracks in the thick dust.  Along the walls are long wooden shelves holding assorted kitchen utensils and crockery.  Several of the bowls have been shattered into tiny bits, and you think you see traces of red on one of the larger serving forks.  Below the shelves is a long row of cabinets, most of them missing doors.  Whatever was stored in them has long since rotted into dust.  Several of the shelves in the cabinets have been been broken and you see shards of glass all over floor. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20731}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20745}{0}{}{Eastern gate battlements (n,w)}{ }{You stand on the high, upper battlements on the eastern edge of Der'Thalas Keep.  The night wind blows about you fiercely here, almost buffeting you over the edge and into the dark forest below.  Looming high above you to the north and further west are the twisted crags of the Valadak mountains.  Looking out over the eastern edge, you can see the vastness of the haunted forest.  Further northeast, over the twisted branches of the dark trees, you can make out the faint gaslights of Barovia.  The dark courtyard and garden are below you to the west.  The distance you are from their dark embrace does not offer much comfort. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20727}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
