R {20746}{0}{}{Eastern gate battlements (n,w)}{ }{You stand on the high, upper battlements on the eastern edge of Der'Thalas Keep.  The night wind blows about you fiercely here, almost buffeting you over the edge and into the dark forest below.  Looming high above you to the north and further west are the twisted crags of the Valadak mountains.  Looking out over the eastern edge, you can see the vastness of the haunted forest.  Further northeast, over the twisted branches of the dark trees, you can make out the faint gaslights of Barovia.  The dark courtyard and garden are below you to the west.  The distance you are from their dark embrace does not offer much comfort. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
