R {20747}{0}{<148>}{-=( A serene river bank )=- (n)}{A}{A flowing river rushes past you to the east.  You look to the other side and see only the same willows of the forest.  The water looks clear and surprisingly clean.  Distant bellows emanating from the graveyard echo in the air as the wind blows through, shaking the trees.  The pathway leads back in a northern direction.  Your fear of getting lost only gets worse as you look ahead and see only forest. }{Masque}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4616}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20748}{0}{<238>}{-=( Before an ancient fence )=- (w,e)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The tall heavily foliaged willow trees grow in such abundance that the light from the sky above, does not shine down as directly as it once did.  Now the path before you lurks with shifting shadows and mental images you create.  The heavy mass of trees to the north prevents any passage beyond.  The path you followed here, continues further west into the willow forest. }{Masque}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45170}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20749}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20749}{0}{<238>}{-=( The paths end )=- (e,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{The path filters off into the expanse of the forested wilderness, and comes to a complete stop here.  The concentration of the giant willows prevent any further movement westward, allowing only travel to the east or a northwestern route.  A well hidden fence to the west is engulfed by the forest around you. }{Masque}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20748}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20750}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20750}{0}{<238>}{-=( Gateway to the dead )=- (se)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The willows of the forested wilderness surround a well hidden iron gate that stands before you to the north.  The century old fixture looks to have lasted the elements of nature and time.  The gate casts a looming shadow down upon the ground.  A silhouette of the great emblem upon the gate rests gently upon a rock bed next to a nearby willow tree. }{Masque}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
