R {20751}{0}{<238>}{house (e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the living room of a large house.  What was once fine furniture now lies old and rotten.  To the north is the front courtyard of the house and to the east lies another room.  The entire building is shut up with boards across the windows.  Pale moonlight filters through the cracks in the wood creating an eerie glow upon the room. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20752}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4589}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20752}{0}{<238>}{room (u,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a small corner in the house to the east of a large living room.  There is a great aura of sadness here, so strong you can almost touch it.  This room, like the entire house is completely boarded up and secured.  You see a staircase leading to a room above this one. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20751}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20753}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20753}{0}{<238>}{room (d)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in a small room.  The air is clear here and is lit by a single candle in the center.  On a small bed, off to the side, lies a beautiful girl.  Though she looks rather weakened, you a feel an inner strength coming from her soul. }{Barovia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20752}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20754}{0}{}{carriage (out)}{ }{You sit in a large and comfortable carriage, the seats are leather and the frame is made of polished oak. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
