R {20757}{0}{}{courtyard (se,ne,w,enter)}{<128>E<088>}{Thick cold fog swirls around in this darkened courtyard.  Sporadic flashes of lightning lance the angry clouds overhead.  Thunder pounds the courtyard. A light drizzle begins to fall.  Eastward, torch flames flutter in the wind on each side of the keep's main doors.  Warm light spills from those open doors into the courtyard.  Two gate towers stand up to the west of the courtyard, silhouetted against the flashing sky.  A howling wind rushes through the courtyard.  The dark towers of the keep loom far above in the mists. Flickering lights shine from a short, round tower on the south east side of the keep. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20758}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20759}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20761}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20756}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20758}{0}{}{south courtyard (ne,nw)}{ }{You are now on the southern edge of the castle.  The courtyard here is huge and continues around the walls to the northwest and northeast.  You see a massive wall overhead, joining the keep to the outer walls to the south.  The rain and wind pick up here and seem to get colder. You certainly feel as if you were being watched. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20757}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20760}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20759}{0}{}{north courtyard (sw,se)}{ }{You are now on the northern edge of the castle.  The courtyard here is huge and continues around the walls to the southwest and southeast.  You see a massive wall overhead, joining the keep to the outer walls to the north.  The rain and wind pick up here and seem to get colder. You certainly feel as if you were being watched. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20757}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20760}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20760}{0}{}{garden (sw,nw,e,entryway)}{<128>E<088>}{You are standing at the rear of the keep now, on the eastern border. You see a small garden here struggling to survive.  Small flowers press sadly, skyward against the gloom here.  To the northwest and southwest, you see the castle courtyard.  To the east is a small overlook, viewing high from the mountains here.  On the northern edge of the rear wall here, you can see a small entryway into the castle. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20759}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20758}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20762}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20760}{entryway}{entryway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20761}{0}{}{entryway (w,e)}{XXX}{You enter a small foyer west of a great entry hall.  Massive doors swing open in the wind to the west while an opening leads east into the hall.  Overhead, in the entryway, four statues of dragons glare down, their eyes flickering from the torches on the walls. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21524}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20757}{w}{w}{8}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20762}{0}{}{overlook (w)}{ }{Dead leaves turn spirals about your feet, wheeling and careening over the stone railing.  Dark, surging clouds overhead drizzle constantly. By looking over the edge of a low stone wall, you see that you are on a  construction jutting out at least twenty feet from the cliff face.  The gray, dismal town of Barovia lies about a thousand feet below and you can barely see the street lamps through the night.  Looking below you, you see a set of dirt-caked windows set into the cliff face about a hundred feet below the platform.  Behind you, to the west, stands the awesome presence of Castle Ravenloft. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20760}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20763}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {20764}{0}{}{The Eternal Gateway (enter,leave)}{ }{This is it, the threshold of ultimate power on the road to immortality. You feel an unseen cord pulling from the center of your being toward the enthalpy and greatness which lies before you.  Beyond this gateway stand the forces which, if harnessed, may define your role within the universe as a key to its very existence. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20765}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {115}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20765}{0}{}{A Storm of Mists (time,death,life,possessions,leave,space)}{ }{Swirling around you are mists comprised of the raw components of life. The decisions which affect the very fabric of your reality are here and tangible, passing before your eyes and through your fingers, each direction you look delivering a deeper glimpse into the true nature of your being. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20766}{time}{time}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20767}{death}{death}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20768}{life}{life}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20769}{possessions}{possessions}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20771}{space}{space}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20764}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20766}{0}{}{Dilations of Time (leave)}{ }{Every moment is now layed before you as if on display.  Linear time is no longer an obstacle, as it exists to you here as any other type of moldable substance.  Consequence has a very different meaning now, as the fabric of time and age itself is now yours to swim within and harness as a tool of true and ultimate power. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20765}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20767}{0}{}{Depths of Mortality (leave)}{ }{The pressure pushing in on you from all sides stings of death and desecration - not your own death, but that of your enemies with whom co-existence is not an option.  The sheer blackness is oppressive as it fills your eyes, and the power you feel surging through your veins is a reminder of your ability to rob those around you of their gift of life. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20765}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20768}{0}{}{Echelons of Life (leave)}{ }{You are acutely aware of your inexplicable being as its every particle tingles and soars.  Life, in all its mystery, is suddenly as material as the flesh and bone which support it.  You sense a link to the very force which sustains your existence in this blinding white vortex, a tie to much more than just your mere mortal livelihood. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20765}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20769}{0}{}{Weight of Possession (leave)}{ }{If ever an ethereal altar to wealth and abundance were to exist, you have found it.  Beams of golden warmth pour over your skin, instilling you with not a sense of greed, but of entitlement and control over the material world.  Your senses all focus on physical possessions, and your ability to manipulate and command power over them overwhelms you. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20765}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

