R {20771}{0}{}{Relativity of Space (leave)}{ }{The space between atoms and the distance between galaxies are one and the same here.  The deep and intimate relationship between all objects is witnessed here with no uncertainty, as a feeling of total spacial awareness washes over you.  From mountains to molecules, your control over distance has become tangible indeed. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
