R {20966}{0}{}{Village Common Room (e)}{ }{  This is the village common room.  Whenever the members of the village or the families of the nearby farms feel like getting together to talk about changes in the village or prices for the local market, this is where they do it.  The room is a large straw building with a large stone hearth at one end.  The floor is strewn with straw as well, and the place has a very comfortable feel to it. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20961}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20967}{0}{}{A crumbling hall (se,sw,u,n)}{ }{You've dropped down through the hole above to find yourself in a crumbling tunnel beneath the earth.  Dust swirls around your feet as you scuff your way across the smooth square cut blocks of stone that are the floor of this ancient hall. As you glance about to get your bearings, you find a shock nearby: an operating pub!  This is certainly like no dark  catacombs that you've ever raided before.  You steel yourself for the surprises that are sure to come. }{Catacombs 2}{catacombs2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
