R {20968}{0}{<238>}{The Tavern, Razed (nw)}{<238>[P]<088>}{You've found your way into the catacomb's tavern.  It's not much to  look at as far as pubs go, but then again when you build in the  ruins of an ancient citadel you can't expect pristine conditions.   A few stools are snugged tight against the long counter, but no  tables have been set up.  Apparantly these folks don't have many  people stay around for long.  A small sign over the counter has a  list of drinks. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20967}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20969}{0}{<138>}{The Catacomb's Necessities Shop (ne)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{This fair sized room has been cleaned up and furnished with crates of all shapes and sizes.  What's in the crates you can't be sure, but whatever it is, it's for sale here.  This small pocket business sure could use a better location, but I guess you take what you can get right? }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20967}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20970}{0}{<268>}{A room, turn on your goddamn verbose mode (n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{A narrowing of the passage, making it nearly impassable.  The  sharp, angular rock squeezes in not only from the sides, but  the ceiling as well.  You can make your way through, but you  wouldn't want to fight anything in here. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21048}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21049}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21050}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20971}{0}{<268>}{The dwarven ruins (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The rugged walls of the ancient citadel are crumbling here and  there with age.  Stones skitter across the floor leaving trails in  the dust.  You can smell dried blood despite the age of the place,  there are even a few red stains here and there still. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20967}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20972}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20972}{0}{<268>}{The ancient dwarven halls (n,s,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You push your way past a stone block which has fallen from the  ceiling above and leans across the corridor.  The massive stone  block weighs tons and is several feet thick, showing cracks from  age, but still whole even after all this time.  A portion of the  wall has fallen inwards where the ceiling block crushed it as it  fell, a dark recess in a shadowy hall. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
