R {20980}{0}{<278>}{The top of a ramp (d,s)}{<278>( )<088>}{The ancient stone walls begin to gently slope downwards here, following the gentle curve of a long sweeping ramp.  The stones here show all the signs of a pitched battle, gouged and stained from some ancient war.  Small recesses line the walls at the very top of the ramp, though they stand empty now.  This can only be one of the main interchanges between levels of the ancient citadel, perhaps the only passage still servicable after years of disuse and abuse. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20979}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20992}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20981}{0}{<268>}{A dark stone hall (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The stench of rotting flesh wafts its ways through the darkness to  your nose, reminding you that these darkened passages aren't empty  or safe.  Stones skitter into the darkness despite your best  efforts to pick your way through the debris.  You strain to hear  any sign of danger nearby, but the darkness seems to swallow up  everything beyond a few feet. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20979}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20983}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20982}{0}{<108>}{A shadowy room (w)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{The scent of crushed berries and stripped sugar maple bark waifts  to your nose.  A small sleeping pallet has been laid out against  one wall, looking to be fairly new and often used.  Small bottles  of strange liquids sit upon a small chest which is the only other  piece of furniture in the room. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20979}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

