R {20984}{0}{<268>}{A smelly corridor (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This side corridor of the ancient citadel seems different to you, somehow dirtier.  The stench of unwashed bodies and rotting flesh combine to assault your nose.  The floor seems to have accumulated less dust here, that or someone regularly travels through here.  Caution is foremost in your mind as you venture  further into the darkness. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20983}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20985}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20985}{0}{<268>}{A dingy passage (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You pick your way through the dark twistings of the ancient  citadel, wondering still at the power which laid low such  marvelous construction by the ancient dwarven craftsmen.  All about you the thick stone walls seems to yet vibrate with the power of the mountain people.  Yet with the aura of the lost dwarven clan comes the stench of the new occupants: the  scavengers.  Even now you can hear them nearby, scurrying in the darkness, though to attack or to flee you cannot be sure. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20984}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20986}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20986}{0}{<268>}{A smelly hall (s,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The dark passages of the ancient dwarven ruin reek of unwashed flesh and excrement.  You're almost thankful for the darkness about your meagar light, at least you can't clearly make out  what you're walking through.  Yet even through the grime and filth, you can make out the masterful craftsmanship of the  dwarven masons who build this place so long ago. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20985}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20987}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
