R {20987}{0}{<268>}{A dark, smelly hall (n,s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The overpowering odor of goblins assaults you as you stand in this dark passage.  Scraps of food and discarded clothes litter the  stone floor, all the indications of a goblin infestation.  How tragic it is that this once proud dwarven stronghold has fallen to the likes of these green skinned parasites. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20986}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20989}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20990}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20988}{0}{<248>}{A dead end (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You've come to a dead end in the hallway.  Fallen rock blocks  the passage further east.  Layers of dust lie stirred by the cave in, obviously a recent occurence.  That also explains why there are few signs of goblin infestation here. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20986}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20989}{0}{<268>}{A bend in the passage (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've come upon a turning in the passage.  A faint glow finds its way around the bend to cast the barest equivalent of star light upon the stone.  As you glance about, you come to the conclusion that this part of the old citadel is worse off than any of the others you've been in.  The stench of urine and rotting food permeates everything and the floor is littered with enough refuse that you think twice about advancing further. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20987}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {20991}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20990}{0}{<248>}{A dead end (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You've come to a dead end in the hallway.  Fallen rock blocks  the passage further south.  Layers of dust lie stirred by the cave in, obviously a recent occurance.  That also explains why there are few signs of goblin infestation here. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20987}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20991}{0}{<138>}{The court of the Goblin Lord (e)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{It takes a moment for your eyes to adjust to the dim lighting of the room, but when you do, you stand shocked at what lies before you.  The floor is littered with slowly rotting corpses, some human, others goblin or unidentifiable.  A massive throne sits against one wall,  flanked by stone tables covered with the remains of a massive feast. The stench of unwashed bodies and rancid meat mingles with that of blood, rotting flesh and excrement.  What a marvelous court this  self proclaimed lord of goblins must hold. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20989}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {20992}{0}{<268>}{An ancient dwarven hall (u,s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The stonework seems to glisten in the sharp light you carry, coated with a faint sheen of moisture.  The glistening stone seems black in the garish light, making it impossible for you to tell if it is simply water, or perhaps something more grisly. A long, curving ramp leads upwards towards the surface. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
