R {20993}{0}{<268>}{A dark and eerie hall (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The dark stone halls are colder here, deeper within the earth.  The ancient stonework seems to have seen less wear and tear than that above, though you sense that something is quite amiss here in this dark fortress in the earth.  The long halls, once hung with ancient shields and weapons, tapestries and stonework, are now dark and empty. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {20992}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
