R {20994}{0}{<268>}{A passage deep within the earth (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The long, stark passages seem to swallow sounds, leaving you jumping at imagined sounds.  Your lights seem to barely penetrate the darkness, casting dancing shadows along the stone, bringing to life your worst fears in an intangible enemy.  Perspiration chills your skin in the cool air of this underground fortress, sending your skin crawling. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
