R {21013}{0}{<248>}{A small room (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{A small chamber tucked away in an unfrequented corner of the dwarven warrens.  Perhaps someone's private chambers, or maybe a small meade hall, whatever it once was, the room is nothing but crumbling stone and shattered furniture now. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
