R {21024}{0}{<108>}{A dark room (n)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{A crumbling hallway.  The ceiling has given way here and fallen in, blocking the passage south.  Whether from time or intentionally demolished, you can't be sure, but the result is the same.  Smaller stones litter the floor, having bounced away from the pile of rubble.  Each small shifting of your foot seems to churn up more dust than you thought possible, and before long you have to fight back fits of coughing. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21022}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21025}{0}{<268>}{A dark stone hall (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The stench of rotting flesh wafts its ways through the darkness to  your nose, reminding you that these darkened passages aren't empty  or safe.  Stones skitter into the darkness despite your best  efforts to pick your way through the debris.  You strain to hear  any sign of danger nearby, but the darkness seems to swallow up  everything beyond a few feet.  The very air feels malevolent about you as you creep through the blackened corridors. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21022}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
