R {21070}{0}{<148>}{Before an archway (e,archway)}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{The room is lit by the soft glow of ancient runes.  The flickering writing crawls up and around a dark archway in the western wall, casting strange shadows down the stairs beyond the portal.  The  rough hewn stone walls are drier here than elsewhere, but still show none of the signs of dwarven excavation which the upper levels exhibited.  The ceiling dips low in places, barely high enough for you to pass without hitting your head, though the floor is worn smooth, as if it has seen a great deal of traffic. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21068}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21071}{archway}{archway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45957}{w}{archway}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21071}{0}{<278>}{A dark landing (se,stairs)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You stand at the base of a twisting stair.  The small chamber you stand in seems entirely seamless, the floor and ceiling melding perfectly with the walls.  Even the stone looks strangely different than that from the warrens above, seeming to pulse with power of its own, as if it were created by something other than the earth itself.  A truly strange place you have entered, step with caution. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21079}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21070}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45956}{e}{stairs}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21072}{0}{<268>}{A dark tunnel (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The ceiling of the passage dips down in places, making you  duck your head to get through.  The angular rock is strangely  out of place here, though in the back of your mind you're sure  that a determined crew of dwarven miners and smiths could turn  this bruising maze into an orderly home in a matter of weeks. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21069}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21073}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21073}{0}{<268>}{A room, turn on your goddamn verbose mode (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{A narrowing of the passage, making it nearly impassable.  The  sharp, angular rock squeezes in not only from the sides, but  the ceiling as well.  You can make your way through, but you  wouldn't want to fight anything in here. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21072}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21074}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

