E {21075}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21075}{0}{<268>}{A twisting passage (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The silence of the darkness is broken only by the faint drip  of water into one of the small pools in the uneven floor and  the scrape of your boots and muffled curses as you trip  through the darkness.  These tunnels make you long for the  spacious halls above, rather than the punishing sloping floors  and narrow passages that you can barely squeeze through in places. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21074}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21045}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21076}{0}{<268>}{A tunnel deep beneath the earth (s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The rugged stone walls remain sharp here deep in the earth, protected from the effects of rain and wind.  The chill air leaves the stone coated with a glistening sheen of moisture and your body shaking with the damp chill that precedes  pneumonia.  Wonderful place isn't it? }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21049}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21077}{0}{<268>}{An underground tunnel (e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Rough walls curve and wind through the darkness, carved by ancient natural forces.  Long dormant lava tubes or ancient underground rivers?  Such idle thoughts pass through your mind as you wander through the darkness of this maze of caverns.  Moisture glistens from the walls, though condensation or a trickle from an underground spring you can't be sure. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21049}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21078}{0}{<268>}{A dark, twisting passage (w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The uneven floor of this natural cavern is murder on your ankles after the smooth paved halls of the warrens above.  But a twisted ankle is the least of your worries down here in the darkness.  Something nags at your mind as being very wrong here in the darkness, the powerful aura of evil permeates this place like nothing else you've ever encountered. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21049}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21079}{0}{<248>}{A bare corridor (nw)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The slick stone floor makes navigating this strange passage extremely difficult.  Not a single bump or hole marks the surface that you walk upon.  Similarly, the walls seem to have been created seamlessly, perhaps by an air pocket in a magma flow from ages past.  Whatever the reason for the strange construction here, you don't feel quite comfortable in this deep, dark world. }{Catacombs 2}{trace e/s/w/n rune to summon golems}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21071}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21080}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21080}{0}{<238>}{An ancient study (e,n)}{<238>"""<088>}{Small candles flicker in ancient silver candlesticks, casting dancing shadows across the room.  The faint odor of ancient parchment fills the air.  You cast a questing glance around and notice a paper littered desk against one wall and cluttered bookshelves along the others.  The floor is surprisingly clear of dust, leading you to believe that you've stumbled upon the private study of someone or something. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21079}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21081}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21081}{0}{<138>}{The Lich Treasure Room (w)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{A secret niche where the ancient lich hoards his treasures.  The  room would be very plain if not for the piles of shiny trinkets  which the undead has accumulated over the years.  A chill  permeates the entire room, despite the warm glow reflecting from  the treasure trove. }{Catacombs 2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21080}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21082}{0}{}{A passage deep within the earth (w,e)}{ }{The long, stark passages seem to swallow sounds, leaving you jumping at imagined sounds.  Your lights seem to barely penetrate the darkness, casting dancing shadows along the stone, bringing to life your worst fears in an intangible enemy.  Perspiration chills your skin in the cool air of this underground fortress, sending your skin crawling. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8020}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21083}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21083}{0}{}{An ancient dwarven hall (s,e)}{ }{The stonework seems to glisten in the sharp light you carry, coated with a faint sheen of moisture.  The glistening stone seems black in the garish light, making it impossible for you to tell if it is simply water, or perhaps something more grisly. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21082}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21084}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21084}{0}{}{A dark and eerie hall (n,s,w)}{ }{The dark stone halls are colder here, deeper within the earth.  The ancient stonework seems to have seen less wear and tear than that above, though you sense that something is quite amiss here in this dark fortress in the earth.  The long halls, once hung with ancient shields and weapons, tapestries and stonework, are now dark and empty. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21083}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21085}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21086}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21085}{0}{}{A dark hall in the ancient citadel (n,s)}{ }{An unearthly silence swallows any sounds of your passage, seeming to muffle your footsteps even before they reach your own ears.  The smooth stone floor and walls are exceptionally clean, showing only the lightest layers of dust.  A disturbing aura permeates the very air, sending a icy shiver down your spine. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21084}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21087}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21086}{0}{}{An old storeroom (e)}{ }{An ancient storage room, at least as best you can tell.  The floor is covered with wood shavings and dust, all that remains of the crates and casks that were once here.  Whatever was stored in them is by now long gone. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21084}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

