R {21089}{0}{}{An ancient archway (d,e)}{ }{An ancient archway marks the end of this short hall.  The smooth stones of the floor begin to slope downwards as they pass through the archway, and then curve out of sight into the darkness below. This must be the main access to the lower levels of the catacombs. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
