R {21090}{0}{}{Within dwarven ruins (w,e)}{ }{Tufts of dust swirl around your ankles as you wander the dark halls.  Dark stains mar the ancient stone in places, remnants of the great struggle which brought this place to ruin.  You can still see traces of the masterful craftsmanship of the tunnels that still remains. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
