R {21091}{0}{}{A dark stone hall (u,n,s,e)}{ }{The stench of rotting flesh wafts its ways through the darkness to  your nose, reminding you that these darkened passages aren't empty  or safe.  Stones skitter into the darkness despite your best  efforts to pick your way through the debris.  You strain to hear  any sign of danger nearby, but the darkness seems to swallow up  everything beyond a few feet.  The very air feels malevolent about you as you creep through the blackened corridors. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
