R {21095}{0}{}{A laboratory (e,n)}{ }{Why someone would want to set up a magical laboratory down here in the depths of an undead infested catacombs is anyone's guess, but that appears to be exactly what this is.  Benches and tables ring the room, littered with vials and bowls and jars.  Burn marks scar the walls in places where magical experiments have gone awry.  You silently hope that you're not walking into one of those. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
