R {21096}{0}{}{A storage room (w)}{ }{A small cramped alcove that's been sealed off from the magical disasters that occur in the next room.  A single shelf runs the length of one wall.  This must be where the most precious of a mad sorceress's treasures are kept. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21095}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

