R {21105}{0}{}{A darkened chamber (s)}{ }{A once proud meade hall now fallen to ruin.  Shattered stone tables criss-cross the floor, polished table top and ornately carved legs now nothing more than rubble.  The rotting, worm eaten remains of several kegs of ale are crumbling against a wall.  Stone benches lie overturned and cracked near the tables. You fight back a tear as you look over all the destruction, thinking what a waste it is to destroy all that beer. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
