R {21111}{0}{}{A darkened room (e)}{ }{A small side chamber, probably once a home for a dwarven family. The crumbled remains of wooden furniture is little more than dust on the floor.  A massive stone hearth sits unused against the room's far wall.  Something about this room hits you harder than the destruction of the rest of this ancient place, perhaps because it was obviously a home, rather than just a workshop or gathering hall. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
