R {21120}{0}{}{One of the citadel's crumbling halls (n,w)}{ }{You step around chunks of stone littering the floor and pick your way past the less stable looking stretches of the ceiling. Dust swirls about your feet as you walk down the corridor, kicked up with each step you take.  The odor of rotting flesh reaches you from someplace nearby.  You hope you don't end up like that. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21118}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21121}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21121}{0}{}{The dwarven ruins (n,s)}{ }{The rugged walls of the ancient citadel are crumbling here and  there with age.  Stones skitter across the floor leaving trails in  the dust.  You can smell dried blood despite the age of the place,  there are even a few red stains here and there still. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
