R {21123}{0}{}{A rubble-strewn hall (w,s)}{ }{Dark corridors stretch out of sight here deep within the stone of the earth.  Shattered stone litters the floor, fallen from holes gouged in the walls and ceiling.  This portion of the ancient dwarven fortress obviously was the site of frantic fighting some years ago, or perhaps it still is. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21122}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
