R {21124}{0}{}{A rubble-strewn hall (d,e)}{ }{The passage dead ends here where the floor has fallen through to a cavern below.  The walls appear solid enough, and the ceiling certainly is still in place, but several of the giant paving stones that make up the floor here have crumbled away into the darkness below.  A chill blast of air gusts up from the hole, making you wonder just what lurks in the darkness. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
