R {21125}{0}{}{A twisting passage (u,e,w,n,s)}{ }{The silence of the darkness is broken only by the faint drip  of water into one of the small pools in the uneven floor and  the scrape of your boots and muffled curses as you trip  through the darkness.  These tunnels make you long for the  spacious halls above, rather than the punishing sloping floors  and narrow passages that you can barely squeeze through in places. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
