R {21157}{0}{}{Before an archway (archway,e)}{ }{The room is lit by the soft glow of ancient runes.  The flickering writing crawls up and around a dark archway in the western wall, casting strange shadows down the stairs beyond the portal.  The  rough hewn stone walls are drier here than elsewhere, but still show none of the signs of dwarven excavation which the upper levels exhibited.  The ceiling dips low in places, barely high enough for you to pass without hitting your head, though the floor is worn smooth, as if it has seen a great deal of traffic. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
