R {21162}{0}{}{A dark landing (se,stairs)}{ }{You stand at the base of a twisting stair.  The small chamber you stand in seems entirely seamless, the floor and ceiling melding perfectly with the walls.  Even the stone looks strangely different than that from the warrens above, seeming to pulse with power of its own, as if it were created by something other than the earth itself.  A truly strange place you have entered, step with caution. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21163}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21157}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21163}{0}{}{A bare corridor (nw)}{ }{The slick stone floor makes navigating this strange passage extremely difficult.  Not a single bump or hole marks the surface that you walk upon.  Similarly, the walls seem to have been created seamlessly, perhaps by an air pocket in a magma flow from ages past.  Whatever the reason for the strange construction here, you don't feel quite comfortable in this deep, dark world. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21162}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21164}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21164}{0}{}{An ancient study (e,n)}{ }{Small candles flicker in ancient silver candlesticks, casting dancing shadows across the room.  The faint odor of ancient parchment fills the air.  You cast a questing glance around and notice a paper littered desk against one wall and cluttered bookshelves along the others.  The floor is surprisingly clear of dust, leading you to believe that you've stumbled upon the private study of someone or something. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21163}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21165}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21165}{0}{}{The Lich Treasure Room (w)}{ }{A secret niche where the ancient lich hoards his treasures.  The  room would be very plain if not for the piles of shiny trinkets  which the undead has accumulated over the years.  A chill  permeates the entire room, despite the warm glow reflecting from  the treasure trove. }{Catacombs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21164}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21166}{0}{}{Hallway in the Mages School (u,s,n)}{ }{This is a long corridor in the Mages Training school.  Wandering mages of the different schools pass by you, discussing various topics. This is where the mages train in their respective schools.  They choose a role they want to take on upon joining.  The three schools are red, white, and black.  Each school teaches different disciplines.  The white school teaches one how to affect things with one's mind.  The black school trains in the use of corrosive attacks and offense, and the red school teaches fire and heat.  Overall, each is very dedicated to their field of study, and very apt at its use. }{Mage Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19953}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21167}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21168}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

