R {21294}{0}{}{The main hall of the mansion (u,e,s,w)}{ }{     This is the main hall.  It was once rather lovely, but neglect has turned it into a dull area that is not very appealing.  A staircase leads up, there appears to be a ballroom to the east, and a den to the west. }{Darkmoore Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
