R {21295}{0}{}{The ballroom/dining room (w,n)}{ }{     This room doubles as a dining room and a ballroom.  The room could use some work.  The floor is dull and scratched, the walls need to be repapered, the windows need to be washed, and the curtains need to be replaced.  It would look rather nice after all that work. }{Darkmoore Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21294}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21297}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21296}{0}{}{The den (e)}{ }{        You are in the den of the mansion.  There are comfortable chairs arranged in front of a fireplace.  The fire casts strange shadows on the walls.  You notice a cabinet on one wall with strange devices like something out of a torture chamber.  On another wall, a shelf filled with books on all aspects of occult lores.  A large cabinet covers another wall and has strange puzzles from several different cultures.  The fourth wall by the door is blank except for a large painting depicting some religion's version of hell. }{Darkmoore Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21294}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21300}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21297}{0}{}{Arcane study (s)}{ }{        You walk into what seems to be a library consisting of books with incredible age, and your lungs are immediately filled with stale dust-filled air emanating from the surrounding tomes. Faltering slightly, you press on through the haze of particles and eventually come upon a man sitting behind a huge desk. Upon the desk, you notice a peculiar box that appears to be a puzzle of some sort. }{Darkmoore Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21295}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29800}{n}{n}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29800}{enter box}{enter box}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21298}{0}{}{The master bedroom (w,e)}{ }{        You are in the master bedroom.  The only feature in here is the large bed.  You could probably sleep six people comfortably in that bed though.  You find it odd that there is no window in here. There is also a set of stairs upwards to the west. }{Darkmoore Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21293}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21299}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43634}{sleep in bed}{sleep in bed}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43634}{n}{sleep in bed}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21299}{0}{}{An attic (e)}{ }{    Reaching the top of the stairs your breath is taken forcefully from you by the scene before you. Like rows of soldiers, two ice sculptures of children lead their friends in a march of youthful play. Each statue, with sled or snowball in hand, greets you with a smile of youthful energy. Looking up, you notice a stream of ice flakes flowing out a huge hole in the roof. Following the column of particles back to its source, you see a man like no other busily working on the last sculpture in line. }{Darkmoore Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21298}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21300}{0}{}{Behind a Mansion (se)}{ }{        After a frightful journey through the dark passage, you emerge and are blinded by the intense sunlight. Blinking several times, you regain your sight and look at your surroundings. You're standing in a small clearing bordered on one side by the mansion's back wall, and on all other sides by dense underbrush. Suddenly, a shout of incredible intensity greets your ears and you are now aware that you have a companion. }{Darkmoore Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21296}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

