R {21509}{0}{}{An Observation Chamber (s,n)}{ }{                                                                     |                                                                              ?         The walls of this long, narrow hallway are actually windows that overlook two large, warehouse-like chambers.  The one to the west is dark, but the one to the east appears to overlook the cryogenic freezing chamber.  Banks of complex looking controls stand waist high near the windows.  The corridor to the south is framed by a reinforced metal door frame and a corridor leads to the north. }{Halo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
