R {21514}{0}{}{A Smoke Filled Room}{ }{The room is so thick with smoke it is difficult to make anything out.  There is a large quantity of debris scattered everywhere that you can make out.  The thick smoke is very disorienting and it is even difficult to tell which direction you came from. The sound of crackling flames seems to come from everywhere, and it is intensely hot. }{Halo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
