R {21523}{0}{<278>}{landing (u,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are on a very large landing of a set of massive stairs.  The stone staircase rises up to the south, ending at a huge room.  Sloping downward, the stairs lead east, then curve south.  Stone arches support a ceiling covered with frescoes.  Dust floats in the air here, making it difficult to breathe.  There are two alcoves recessed into the western wall here, and it looks as if something might be lurking in their shadowy depths. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{An ebon key, on Doom Guard}{1.000}{1}
