R {21524}{0}{<268>}{Great hall (n,s,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Cobwebs hang from dust-covered columns of this great hall, illuminated by torches fluttering in iron sconces.  The dust and webs cast strange, moving shadows across the faces of stone gargoyles squatting motionlessly on the rim of the domed ceiling.  Cracked and faded frescoes are covered by centuries of decay.  A great hallway opens to the east, while a large staircase to the north winds northwest into darkness.  You see a dark room to the south and also to the west. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
