R {21525}{0}{<268>}{hall (n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Torchlight flutters along the walls of this large room. You see a dark hall leading east from here contrasted by a set of double doors hanging open to the west.  A steady light spills from the doors, lighting this room barely. Right next to the eastern hall stands a dark alcove.  It looks like there might be something in it.  You think you hear organ music coming from the west. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
