R {21527}{0}{<248>}{dining hall (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You enter this room and are overwhelmed by the size.  It is well lit and you see a long table set with all sorts of foodstuffs.  On the west wall stands a massive pipe organ.  The smell of food is fresh and tantalizing, but you have no time for such a distraction.  For some reason you feel a strong sense of evil here, this close to the entrance to the castle. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
