R {21552}{0}{<248>}{Room (w,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Dark low shapes thrust up out of the still, black water that fills this room.  The shapes you recognize as iron maidens, stocks, and other torture apparatus.  Looking closer, you can see dark forms moving silently through the murky water. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
