R {21554}{0}{<248>}{torture chamber (e)}{<248>.<118>@<248>.<088>}{You stand in a very dark room flooded with a dank green liquid.  The putrification of the place overcomes your senses as you struggle simply to breathe.  Just like the previous room, this one is also filled with various implements of torture and pain.  Corpses and skeletons hang along the walls, some freshly dripping blood into the murky waters.  Many of the corpses have been disembowled, leaving their entrails hanging limply from the gaping holes in their abdomen.  Others have their skulls ripped from their head, leaving the skin and hair folded upon the shoulders. You turn in absolute disgust from the ungodly scene, retching and fighting to hold your sanity.  What creature could be responsible for such atrocities you ask.  This must be stopped. }{Ravenloft Castle}{debaucherat}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21552}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21555}{0}{<268>}{Chapel (sw,nw,w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{Dim, colored light shines through the broken and boarded up stained glass windows.  Pews and benches lie about the floor in jumbled disarray, coated with centuries of dust.  Beyond the debris, lit by a single shaft of moonlight, a small platform stands out.  You see some figures draped over the pews and benches, though they don't seem to be moving much.  To the northwest and southwest are two darkened alcoves.  The western passage leads to a large hallway.  You feel cold and distraught in such a scene of utter despair. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
