R {21567}{0}{<278>}{room (se,d,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{Dim light from the courtyard falls into this room in jagged shafts through the large window in the west wall.  This immense room stands in a chilly, brooding darkness.  Hundreds of dust-thick cobwebs drape the room, hiding the ceiling from view.  Directly across from the window is an open doorway in the east wall.  Further south, a smaller doorway leads through the east wall.  At the far end of the southern end of the hall, a huge throne stands atop a raised platform.  The back of the throne is turned to the room.  Staircases in the north wall lead down into darkness. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
