R {21572}{0}{<248>}{Room (n,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Dust fills your lungs.  The musty smell of death and decay swirls around you.  Before you, a long table of polished oak lies beneath a blanket of dust.  The rotting tablecloth lies tattered beneath dusty china plates and stained silverware.  In the center of the table, a large, tiered cake leans heavily to one side The once white frosting has turned green with age.  Cobwebs drape like dusty lace down every side.  A single doll figure of a bride adorns the crest of the cake under thick layers of dust.  A window in the south wall is covered with heavy curtains.  You see rooms both to the north and to the east. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21570}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
