R {21576}{0}{<248>}{Room (s,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Sweet smells waft from this delicately lit room.  Windows on the west wall are flanked by heavy red draperies, hanging stiffly from the high, cathedral ceiling.  Their tassles of golden fiber glint in the light of three candelabras sitting atop small tables about the room.  Tall white candles burn with bright, steady light.  A large bed, canopied by silken curtains, sits with its headboard against the north wall.  There are rooms both to the east and south. }{Ravenloft Castle}{gertruda}{}{}{1.000}{1}
