R {21609}{0}{<238>}{hightower peak (d)}{<238>] [<088>}{The spiralling staircase finally ends at a five-foot walkway that circles the shaft.  In the center of the tower's highest floor, a fifteen-foot diameter hole drops into the cold heart of Ravenloft, itself.  Ice cold air rushes up from the shaft sending a chill through your every bone.  Aging beams support a steep roof.  One beam and a part of the roof have fallen away, leaving a gaping hole open the the night sky and the raging storm.  The shaft itself opens into the entire room and the rain and wind almost make you lose your footing.  You catch yourself and try not to lean too near the hole at all, for the wind would surely wisk you into its gaping darkness. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
