R {21674}{0}{<248>}{crypt (out)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{This tomb rests in hushed silence.  Great stained glass windows filling the eastern wall enchant the view of the two beautiful coffins resting in this crypt.  One is made of gold, the other, silver, both are closed and at peace.  Attached to the floor, between the two caskets is a small plaque. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
