R {21676}{0}{}{Room (d,n,e)}{ }{Dim light filters in through the dust-caked windows in the east wall.  A large, heavy table sits in the center of the room coated with dust.  A thick book lies open on the desk with an inkwell and quill next to it.  There is a broken door in the north wall.  A staircase drops into total darkness in the south wall.  On each side of the stairwell, a skeleton in bright armour stands sagging at attention holding a rusty halberd.  There is a door in the east wall, just between the windows. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
