R {21677}{0}{<248>}{Room (u,s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Broken furniture and torn cloth are strewn about this medium-sized room. Dim, very faint light comes in through the windows in the east and north walls.  A rickety staircase, snakes its way up the northern wall, leading westward, then turning south farther up. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
