R {21679}{0}{}{The Crafting Utilities Room (d)}{ }{An austere room of pure efficiency sits before you.  A true minimalist design.  The walls are a featureless snow white with nary a crack nor seam to be seen, other than the door through which you entered.  A glowing ball hovers before you, and you instinctively know that you can 'list' to see what the glowing ball can perform. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21680}{0}{}{A standard kitchen (out)}{ }{This is a standard kitchen.  The walls are made of varnished wood, but to be honest it's a very shoddy job.  Whoever did it should be sacked. The floor is also a step above a dirt floor, but only because they built steps above the dirt floor.  You have to hop from wood step to wood step. Thank goodness there's one right in front of the cookpot. A wooden spoon hangs above the cookpot. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21681}{0}{}{The Kiln Room (out)}{ }{This room is where gem crafters come to practice their trade.  A small table and chair sit against one wall and a medium sized kiln sets opposite it.  Shelving lines the remaining wall and is filled with vials and canisters.  Various bits of glittering dust and powders litter the floor. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21682}{0}{}{The Forge Room (out)}{ }{Various blacksmithing tools line the wall, hung neatly in their expertly crafted cradles.  Hammers, tongs, and picks are all within easy reach.  A collection of leather straps, various types and sizes of padding are available for crafting armours, and a wide array of wooden hafts are arrayed in soft cushioning.  On the side of the room is a giant forge, with flames billowing out the bottom.  On the other is an anvil that has clearly seen a lot of trade. }{Pinnacle}{forge}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21683}{0}{}{A musty mine shaft (out,se)}{<238>O<088>}{You can hear water dripping somewhere in the background.  As your gaze wanders over the rugged walls, you pick up a slight musty odor.  There seems to be a lot of cracks in the floor here.  You could probably spelunk around here. }{Pinnacle}{mines1}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {40}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21685}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21684}{0}{}{The Smelting Room (out)}{ }{This simple room is where miners come to smelt their wares into something useable.  A large smelting pot is present for converting ores to metal bars.  Splashes of metal and dirt rim the edge of the smelting pot.  The room stinks with the fumes of past smeltings. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {40}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {21685}{0}{}{A stale mine shaft (nw,e)}{ }{The air is very stale down here, but breathable.  Piles of dirt and debris litter the floor, most likely left over from the  excavation of the mines.  The air is very cool and drops of condensation have formed on the walls.  Looks like a good area to do some spelunking. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
