R {21985}{0}{}{In a faerie circle (d)}{ }{You find yourself standing in a large faerie circle, on a grassy hill overlooking what can only be described as a collection of giant spotted mushrooms.  Grouped in a small valley, they are bordered by this hill and a larger hill to the east. Your senses revel in the sunshine bathing this area mixed with pollen borne on the warm summer breeze. In contrast to this warm scene a large group of thick black clouds appear to have gathered around the hill to the east. There's something important about the faerie circle here but you can't quite seem to put your finger on it. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
