R {22016}{0}{<228>}{Chinese Checkers Board - Evil Green's Fort (ne)}{ }{This busy corner of Evil Green's fort is a blur of motion, activity and repulsive colors. You feel sick to your stomach for a moment as a waist-high pus-green chinese checker rolls up beside you, taunting you with the assault on your senses. It is daring you to make a move on it, here in Evil Green's headquarters. }{Chinese Checkers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
