R {22017}{0}{<148>}{Chinese Checkers Board - Good Blue's Fort (se,ne,nw)}{ }{A high wall encircles Good Blue's fort, but poses no hindrance to your gaining access, and the checkers don't even seem to mind. The huge blue chinese checkers sit near the fort walls, waiting for whatever battle is about to go on. Unlike the other forts, no sense of urgency can be felt. }{Chinese Checkers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
