R {22018}{0}{<148>}{Chinese Checkers Board - Good Blue's Fort (se,sw)}{ }{Behind the high walls of Good Blue's fort, you feel very safe. Despite the sheer size of the checkers here, they seem like gentle giants. They roll by very slowly and sluggishly, from one end of the wall facing the playing board to the other. You find it hard to imagine the small red checkers attempting to gain access. }{Chinese Checkers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
