R {22019}{0}{<148>}{Chinese Checkers Board - Good Blue's Fort (se)}{ }{Despite the enormity of these chinese checkers, they make you feel safe and secure. They mill about their headquarters lazily, sure that they will overcome any and all who would dare attack them in their magnificent fort. One of them rolls across the vibrant blue surface toward you, as if to offer you greeting. }{Chinese Checkers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22017}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22020}{0}{}{On a sunny hillside (e,u)}{ }{The path you're on slopes gently downward towards the mushrooms. From here you can just make out the paths connecting some of the mushrooms and even more amazingly some of the mushrooms seem to have windows and doors in them. Stunned you finally realize these aren't just giant mushrooms, it's a town and it's a town full of leprechauns. Shivering nervously you glance around looking for any of the wee folk that might be waiting to greet you with open arms and quick fingers... }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21985}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
