R {22021}{0}{}{On a pathway (ne,s,w)}{ }{Walking between these giant mushrooms along a well trodden path, you can't help but marvel at the splendor of these fungi. To the south you can see a small cluster of homes carved from the mushrooms whilst the path curves  northeasternly towards the rest of this weird village. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
