R {22022}{0}{}{Along the path in town (e,nw,sw)}{ }{Travelling along the path through this town, you can't help but admire the workmanship involved or even perhaps the power of faerie magic  needed to create these houses. Even though the mushrooms are quite close together, shafts of golden sunlight illuminate the area, creating pools of warm golden light. One particular mushroom house to the northwest stands silently with its door ajar. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
