R {22024}{0}{}{In one of the wee folks house (out)}{ }{You are standing inside one of the mushroom houses used by the leprechauns You find yourself idly gazing around to see how the wee folk live, only to be surprised by just how simple their lives are. The room is empty save a  set of table and chairs and an open turf burning hearth which dominate the  room. A fragile wooden staircase leads up to what you can only assume is the occupant's bedrooms. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
