R {22027}{0}{}{In one of the wee folks house (out)}{ }{You are standing inside one of the mushroom houses used by the leprechauns. Curious, you gaze around to see how the wee folk live, only to be surprised by just how simple their lives are.  The room is empty save a set of wooden chairs and a large wooden table. A delicate, fragile wooden staircase leads up to what you can only assume are the occupants bedrooms.  Scattered over the floor are numerous wooden carved toys, obviously belonging to the children living here. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
