R {22028}{0}{}{In one of the wee folks house (out)}{ }{Standing inside one of the mushroom houses used by the leprechauns, you gaze around curiously to see how the wee folk live, only to be surprised by just how simple their lives are.  Some plain wooden chairs and an open turf burning  hearth dominates the room.  This house looks very bare compared to the other  houses you have been in, perhaps there is such a thing as a poor leprechaun ?? }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
