R {22029}{0}{}{Travelling through the village (e,w,n,s)}{ }{The leprechauns mushroom houses crowd in on the path here creating a shady area. It feels refreshing to have the cool air on your face, but the shade here almost seems to cast an air of gloom and depression  on the surrounding area. Most of the houses here look closed and empty,  testimony that perhaps all is not well in this village. Winding its way to the south is a path leading to a particularly large mushroom. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
