R {22034}{0}{}{Before a large mushroom (e,w,n)}{ }{You are standing before a large mushroom, from which there seems to be an almost constant stream of leprechauns entering and leaving the building. Judging by the fact that the ones leaving seem just a little too happy and stagger just a little bit too much ... You reckon this must be some kind of pub.  Swinging on the gentle breeze is a wooden sign hanging from a stout wooden pole.  }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
