R {22035}{0}{}{Just past the village (w,e)}{}{This is the just outside the eastern portion of the village, a feeling of dread and depression hangs here.  Maybe it's just you, but it sure  feels like these feelings are coming from the dark hill to the east. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
