R {22036}{0}{}{The end of the rainbow bar (out,n)}{ }{The sweet smell of beer mixed with the heavy aroma of pipe tobacco fills the taproom of the End of the Rainbow bar.  All around you are sets of small wooden tables and chairs just the right size for the wee folk to sit back and enjoy their drinks.  The actual bar itself is further to the north.  Perhaps it's all this smoke and the warm sunlight streaming in the windows ... but your throat seems to be getting a  little parched ... perhaps you should go drown the shamrock so to speak. }{Leprechaun Village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
