R {22051}{0}{}{Enigma (exit)}{ }{Another world, distinct from the forest outside, the striped tent is plush and rich.  Velvet abounds, deep purple and crimson, draping the floor, the walls, the ceiling.  Smoky haze drifts in the air, partially obscuring the centered table, low and wide, surrounded by cushions. }{Night of Colour 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
