R {22052}{0}{}{Forlorn (u)}{ }{Circular cavern, hewn out of rough stone, worn smooth underfoot.  The heart of Forlorn, home of Grey.  Soul-chillingly cold, breath shifts the shadow-filled air past you, heading towards the exit far above.  Darkness has never seemed so solid, engulfing, complete. }{Night of Colour 2.0}{grey}{}{}{1.000}{1}
