R {22091}{0}{}{Bard Guild Foyer (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The foyer of the bard guild has a high ceiling that vaults up into darkness.  The center area is completely open, and light pouring in through tall windows illuminates a great seal on the marble floor.  There are doorways to your left and right, and flanking each doorway are pedestals on which rest potted ferns.  Another entrance in front of you leads west to the center staircase of the tower.  On either side of that entrance hang giant tapestries depicting great battle scenes of bard history.  Standing before these works of art, you feel a reaffirming sense of kinship with the bards that have come before you and those who will follow in your footsteps. }{Bard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3959}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26620}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26622}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26623}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22092}{0}{}{The Central Deck (aft,gangplank,fore)}{ }{You're standing on the deck of a large galleon.  Lined with  an ornate railing, its pitted and rough surface rocks almost  imperceptibly from side to side.  A dizzying array of ropes and  lines stretch out before you, joining to one of the numerous  masts that dominate the view, or leading to the furled sails  high above you.  The fore of the ship seems to be a hive of   activity as various gnomes lower crates into what must be the  ship's hold.  The aft seems to contain the crews quarters   beneath the fo'castle.  A gangplank leads back onto the dock  from here. }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{thistlebeards_galleon}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7353}{gangplank}{gangplank}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22093}{aft}{aft}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22094}{fore}{fore}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38592}{climb rope}{climb rope}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22094}{n}{fore}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22093}{s}{aft}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22093}{0}{}{The Aft Deck (door,fore,stairs)}{ }{The galleon's deck ends here at the large fo'castle of the ship.  You can see two flights of stairs winding up to the upper reaches of it, lined by ornate bannisters.  The front of the fo'castle is made of a solid gilded timber, and in its midst is a large  door that you surmise leads to the crew's quarters and living  areas.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22092}{fore}{fore}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22097}{door}{door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22101}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22092}{n}{fore}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22094}{0}{}{The Foredeck (d,aft)}{ }{You've arrived at the front portion of the galleon's deck.  The  crew of the ship seem to be focused here, all happily hoisting a a large number of crates through an opening in the deck which  you assumes leads to the hold.  A large winch sits nearby, and  you can see a massive chain leading overboard which you assume  holds the anchor.  The prow of the ship is dominated by a large figurehead of some kind, and the foremast also stands here like some enormous sentinel.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22092}{aft}{aft}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22095}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38590}{climb chain}{climb chain}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22092}{s}{aft}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {52339}{climb prow}{climb prow}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22095}{0}{}{The Hold (aft,u)}{ }{You've entered the ship's hold.  You are surrounded here by a  vast array of crates, barrels and boxes, which create quite a  claustrophobic atmosphere.  It is also quite dark, and you  cringe as you tread firmly in an unseen puddle of bilge water. The platform you descended on is here, waiting to return you to the deck above. }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22094}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22096}{aft}{aft}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22096}{0}{}{The Engine Room (fore)}{ }{You stand in awe of the region of the hold you've just entered.  Before you is a huge steam engine of some type.  Enormous pipes  run everywhere, while cylinders and valves spout steam at a  mildly alarming rate.  Various incomprehensible levers and gauges sit idle before you.  An enormous furnace is the centrepiece of  the main chamber of the machine, and it roars with an intense  heat.  One wall is stacked with a variety of firewood, clearly  intended to keep the engine's fire burning for some time.  Nearby a shelf filled with various alchemical powders also stands out. }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22095}{fore}{fore}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22097}{0}{}{Fo'castle Corridor (carveddoor,battereddoor,largedoor,polish}{ }{You've entered the fo'castle proper and stand in a small dimly  lit corridor.  The walls are the same wood as the deck, and you  see a stout door in every wall.  The corridor itself seems to be  empty of any decorations.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22093}{largedoor}{largedoor}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22098}{carveddoor}{open carved door;carveddoor}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22099}{battereddoor}{open battered door;battereddoor}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22100}{polisheddoor}{open polished door;polisheddoor}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22098}{0}{}{Thistlebeard's Quarters (out)}{ }{You have stepped into a quite plushly decorated room.  Velvet  curtains cover a large window that dominates the rear wall.  A  large desk occupies one side of the room, whilst a large bed  takes up the other side, a large seachest sitting at its base. Charts and maps cover the wall behind the desk, and a large  portrait sits above the bed.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22097}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22099}{0}{}{The Crew's Quarters (out)}{ }{You've entered what would seem to be the crew's quarters.  Rows  of hammocks line the room, and each has a small chest at its  base.  A porthole in one wall lets light in here, creating a  somewhat more pleasant and airy feeling to the room.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22097}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22100}{0}{}{The Galley (out)}{ }{You've entered the ship's galley.  Several pots boil happily  over a large stove that sits in the corner.  A solid bench  dominates the center of the room, and utensils are hung over  what seems to be every spare inch of wall space.  Another  corner is full of crates and barrels which seem to be full of supplies.  The whole room is shrouded in a fog of steam that  is pouring out of the pots.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22097}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22101}{0}{}{The Wheeldeck (stairs)}{ }{The wheeldeck of the ship is dominated by the large ship's wheel  that sits at its center.  Two huge ropes come off it and run  over the rear of the ship, presumably down to the rudder that  lies somewhere underneath you.  The smallest of the ship's three masts also sits here.  Its furled sails looking almost like a  strange cloud.  Two flights of stairs wind down from here to the main deck.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22093}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22102}{0}{}{MicroTech Highway (w,e)}{ }{This really is a barren wasteland.  An interesting rock formation catches your eye to the east.  It is round and seems to be very smooth.  Almost too perfect to be natural.  Could it possibly be a man-made object? }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22103}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22104}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22103}{0}{}{MicroTech Highway (w,e)}{ }{As you journey forward, your confidence rises that something is happening to the east.  There are obvious signs that this path has been traveled before.  Maybe those are tire tracks you see on the ground. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15364}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22102}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22104}{0}{}{MicroTech Highway (w,e)}{ }{Standing this close to the rock formation, there is no doubt in your mind, that it is man-made.  As you approach the rock, you can't help but notice that it looks more like a hi-tech round gateway that is just camouflaged like a rock.  Perhaps you should investigate a bit further to the east. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22102}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22105}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22105}{0}{}{MicroTech Highway (w)}{<108>B<088>}{You stand before a giant, perfectly smooth rock.  It appears to be a type of granite and looks unnatural somehow, almost as if someone placed it here and tried to make it look like a normal rock.  It looks like it could roll away from the side of the cliff it is leaning against, but it is much too heavy for any one person to possibly move. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22104}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22106}{e}{push button}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22106}{push button}{push button}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22106}{0}{}{MicroTech Cavern (w,e)}{ }{This is a man-made cavern with lights and all.  Its ceiling is at least 10 stories high.  It is the largest cavern you have ever seen.  It could probably house an entire city.  To the east you see a building that looks brand new.  There is a large sign that says: Welcome to MicroTech. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22105}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22107}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22107}{0}{}{MicroTech Lobby (e,w,s)}{ }{You are in the lobby of MicroTech.  It is very plush and professional looking.  A secretary's desk sits in the middle of the room.  Beyond that desk there are two doors that lead to the inner offices.  On the desk is a visitors log. The log says 'Please Sign In'. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22106}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22108}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22109}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22108}{0}{}{MicroTech R&D (w,s)}{ }{You are in the Research and Development office of MicroTech. This is where all of MicroTech's new products are developed. There are dozens of desks lined up in neat rows but no developers here at the moment.  Maybe they're on break or something.  All of the desks have monitors sitting on them.  One of them appears to have been left on. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22107}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22110}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22109}{0}{}{MicroTech Reception (e,w,n)}{ }{You are in the reception area of MicroTech.  The room is quiet, nothing but soft music filtering through a hidden sound system to keep you company.  There are a few couches to relax on and a coffee table sitting in the middle of them.  There is a magazine on the table. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22107}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22110}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22112}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22110}{0}{}{MicroTech Accounting (w,n,s)}{ }{You are in the accounting department of MicroTech. Three large wooden desks dominate the room.  There are many documents atop the desks but one in particular catches your eye.  None of the corporate accountants are in the room right now.  You could probably take a peek at the document if you were quick. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22108}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22109}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22111}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22111}{0}{}{MicroTech Project (e,s,n)}{ }{This is the Project Room for MicroTech.  A long boardroom table stretches from one end of the room to the other.  A dozen chairs sit around the table.  This is where final approval is given to all the products that the company sells.  It's empty of executives right now, but highly classified information is shared here when meetings are in session. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22110}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22119}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22120}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22112}{0}{}{MicroTech Breakroom (e,s,w)}{ }{You are now in the break room of MicroTech.  This is where the MicroTech employees take their breaks and relax.  There are a few tables and dingy chairs sitting about.  Some empty soda cans litter the room as well.  A trash can stands in the corner. You'd think the employees could throw away their garbage, wouldn't you. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22109}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22113}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22114}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22113}{0}{}{MicroTech Bathroom (s,n)}{ }{This is the MicroTech bathroom.  Good job, you've discovered a place to relieve yourself.  A shiny toilet sits against one wall. On the opposite wall is a sink with a paper towel dispenser above it.  A small trash can sits beside the toilet. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22112}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22115}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22114}{0}{}{MicroTech Coffee Station (e)}{ }{This little niche off the break room sees a lot of traffic thanks to the coffee drinkers in this office.  A stand takes up the back wall where the coffee maker sits percolating all day long. The smell of the fresh brew is enough to bring a smile to the face of even the most tired of employees. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22112}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22115}{0}{}{Reactor Room (e,n,s)}{ }{This is the engineering area of MicroTech.  A lot of intricate and dangerous work is done in here.  Staying in this room for any length of time would not be wise.  Work tables line the outer walls and in the center of the room is a sunken platform housing a nuclear reactor. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22113}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22116}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22117}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22116}{0}{}{Loading Dock (e,s,w)}{ }{This is the shipping dock for MicroTech.  There are many large crates sitting around.  Dock workers are busy loading trucks. On the wall is a sign. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22115}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22118}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22119}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22117}{0}{}{MicroTech Assembly Line (e,n)}{ }{This cavernous room houses the assembly line for MicroTech's products.  Large industrial machines churn endlessly, producing miniature components that are then assembled into computer parts like the new Octagon 888 microchip.  It's very loud in here and a bit chilly. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22115}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22118}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22118}{0}{}{MicroTech Stockroom (w,n)}{ }{This is the stockroom of MicroTech, where all shipments are packaged before being moved to the loading dock.  Neat rows of boxes line the cement floor and several rolls of tape lie on a long work table sitting on the far wall. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22117}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22116}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22119}{0}{}{MicroTech Closet (w,n)}{ }{You have walked right into a closet.  Not a whole lot to see really.  Don't you think it's about time you came out of the closet?  There is a mop and bucket in the corner. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22116}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22111}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22120}{0}{}{MicroTech Hallway (w,e)}{ }{This short hallway divides the project room from a large set of double doors to the east.  Thick carpeting muffles your footsteps down this hall.  A large poster advertising MicroTech's latest product decorates the northern wall.  A plaque hangs on the southern wall just before you reach the doors. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22111}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22121}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22121}{0}{}{Secret Office (w)}{ }{Oh boy, you really should have stayed out of here.  This is Bill Gates' secret office at MicroTech.  No one is supposed to know that he controls this company!  A huge desk sits in the middle of this room with a large swivel chair stationed behind it.  A bank of flat screen monitors covers the back wall, each screen featuring information about the company's production figures and those of MicroTech's competition. }{MicroTech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22120}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22122}{0}{}{This is the entrance to the hyperfunk ZONE! (s)}{ }{It's da hyperfunk ZONE. Yes, this is the place where trees appear to be  colored by blind fingerpaint artists! You think you recognize  burnt sienna over there on that patch of grass. Your third grade teacher  would be so proud of you.  }{Hyperfunkzone}{hyperfunk_zone}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22123}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22123}{0}{}{da HYPERFUNKZONE! (e,n,s)}{ }{It's da hyperfunk ZONE! Your mind is assaulted by a psychedelic onslaught. This place looks like a Crayola box run over by a steamroller. Every color  imaginable is spotted, splashed, or striped across the proverbial canvas of  reality here. You think you are beginning to go blind from the pure shock  of your retina burning out from the spectrum of the land.  }{Hyperfunkzone}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
