R {22239}{0}{<268>}{WLC Foyer (e,s,w,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You step into the school and immediately wish you hadn't.  North is what appears to be a carpeted common's area.   There is a lot of activity there. Must be lunchtime. West is the cafeteria, where healthy, nutritious meals are prepared for the grateful students.  A noxious odor emanates from the cafeteria doors, something akin to putrifying meat.  The foyer continues to the east where you see a trophy case.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
