R {22240}{0}{<268>}{WLC Trophy Hall (e,w,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You stand in front of a long trophy case.  Inside are plastic trophies, medals, pictures, and ribbons depicting hard-fought victories by Central's athletic teams.  They're all pretty boring, actually.  North is a door leading to the gymnasium.  Further east is the lobby and the auditorium.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
