R {22241}{0}{<268>}{WLC Cafeteria (e,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Following your nose, you come to the source of the stink, the cafeteria.  Students mill about, bumming for change or watching in horror as the goop served up by the kitchen dissolves their plastic tableware.  Everyone is seated neatly according to cliques.  It all seems so mechanical!  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
