R {22242}{0}{<268>}{WLC Commons (w,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the commons area, WLC's obvious attempt to be a school of the 90s. The area is carpeted with a carpeted bench along the east wall and a bunch of giant carpeted blocks for students to sit on along the west wall.  This place can be even worse than the cafeteria if you're not into P.D.A..  (Public Displays of Affection).  There are also two kiosks used to post announcements and the like.  North is an intersection, while south takes you back to the entrance to this hell-hole.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
