R {22243}{0}{<268>}{WLC Cafeteria (e,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The smell is stronger here, since you are closer to the kitchen. Here and there are the slumped bodies of students who have succumbed to the stench rising up from their lunch trays.  To the north is the kitchen. Why anybody would want to go in there is beyond you.  Double doors lead east into the commons area.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
