R {22244}{0}{<248>}{WLC Kitchen (s)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{The smell of this place just about bowls you over.  The lunch ladies are all wearing gas masks.  You also notice that they seem to be armed, and that they glance nervously at the floor every so often.  Suddenly, one of them lets out a shriek!  You look at the floor.  Amazingly, some of the spilt food has decided to take a little stroll around the kitchen. This place is disgusting...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
