R {22245}{0}{<268>}{Outside School Store (nw,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You stand outside the school store where you can purchase WLC shirts, shorts, sweats, jerseys, cards, stickers, long-distance calling plans, and the like.  There is also a bathroom here. Don't worry about going in the wrong one, nobody seems to care.  North is an intersection.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
