R {22247}{0}{<238>}{A Gymnasium (n,s)}{<238>|||<088>}{A deep gust of hot, stinky, rank air hits you flush in the face as you boldly enter the gym.  About 30 sweaty guys are playing a bizarre form of pick-up basketball.  No teams or nuthin', just who can be the most obnoxious... Flocks of ugly girls point and giggle at the shirtless prepubesent jocks. Every few minutes, one of the studs in the group shouts 'BOOMSHAKALAKA!!' apparently relishing a succesful shot, or perhaps celebrating his own manliness. You retch.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
