R {22253}{0}{<238>}{North end of Gym (n,s)}{<238>|||<088>}{This is the north end of the gym. Unlike the south end, nobody plays here. This side is reserved for gang fights.  A couple of gang-bangers usually guard the door to watch for the administration.  Kind of silly, considering that the principals would rather bet on the outcome than break up a fight.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
