R {22256}{0}{<248>}{ The WLC Band Room (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{ARRGGGGHHH!! This music is horrible!!  Central's band is practicing in here, and the sound is physically painful to you!  Horns played discordantly, drums unable to form any kind of beat...  And standing above the whole maelstrom is Mr. Helm, looking real bad and cringing at every note... Get out while you still can!  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
