R {22258}{0}{<268>}{WLC Lobby (e,nw,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the northernish part of the auditorium lobby.  From here, you could visit the most useless place on Earth, WLC's attendance office. You can also enter the auditorium, though that may be very dangerous. Mrs. Rexroat, the drama teacher, is trying to get the students ready for their production of 'Naked Lunch,' and she wouldn't like to be interrupted.  Her students are loyal to her to an almost neurotic extreme... Enter at your own risk... }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
