R {22260}{0}{<268>}{West End of 100 Hall (e,w,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are walking down the 100 hall of Walled Lake Central. The classroom to the north is full of TVs.  On both walls there are banks of ugly orange lockers.  Students run past you, oblivious to your weapons and armor. What a bunch of weenies...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
