R {22261}{0}{<268>}{Main Hall (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This part of the main hall runs by the counseling offices and the principal's office.  There is a window here, looking into the counseling offices.  Inside, you see some people talking about obviously unimportant garbage.  It looks as though one of the students is having real problems.  He has tears rolling down his cheeks.  Suddenly, his counselor busts out laughing!! What a jerk!! You get an urge to stuff that counselor into one of these lockers.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
