R {22262}{0}{<248>}{Mr. Ruggles' Room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You walk into chaos.  Students are talking loudly, shouting at each other from across the room, and throwing stuff.  There are maps everywhere for some reason.  Mr. Ruggles is obviously a History teacher.  He also obviously has little control over his class...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22259}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22263}{0}{<268>}{100 Hall (e,s,n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You force your way through the crowded halls.  Be careful who you bump into!  Rumor around school has it that some of these belligerant codpieces are just itching to fight....  A fight is a strange thing to watch at WLC.  You can always tell when one is happening because the crowds in the halls become a tidal wave, rushing towards the fight.  Sad, really... Maybe you could get in one of the lockers.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
