R {22264}{0}{<248>}{The I.T.V. Room (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This is the I.T.V. room, short for interactive television.  The place is totally wired.  Cameras are mounted on the walls, mics dangle from the ceiling, and 4 TVs stand on carts in the front of the room.  WLC uses this room to allow Central students to take classes that are only offered at Walled Lake Western, Central's sister school across town.  It's cheaper than busing, so of course the admin jumped at it...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22260}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22265}{0}{<268>}{100 Hall (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Man! These halls are crowded!  What pisses you off the most is the annoying couples that hold hands and stroll oh-so-slowly down the halls.  They always seem to be right in front of you!  Anyways, to the east is the 100 hall-400 hall junction.  West are some classrooms. If they would get rid of some of these lockers maybe the halls would be a little wider.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22263}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22268}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22266}{0}{<248>}{Ms. Perfetti's Room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You feel watched as soon as you enter this room.  Ms. Perfetti has a stare that will put you right through the wall.  It is the rare student that has the balls to cross her, still rarer the one that lives to tell about it. Most of the students here are sitting upright behind their desks, avoiding any unnecessary eye contact.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22263}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22267}{0}{<248>}{Da Computer Lab (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Whoa!  You feel like you just stepped back in time!  This computer lab, if you could call it that, consists of about 20 networked IBM 8088s.  The server is an IBM 80386.  Wow!  What speed!  You feel like crying.  No modems!  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
