R {22269}{0}{<248>}{Ms. Nuzzi's Room (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Ahhh....  Finally, a nice, comfortable room.  Spanish and French decorations are hung on the walls.  They look authentic, too.  The students here are speaking French well, mostly because it is taught to them well.  What a charming place.  You could stay here forever...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
