R {22270}{0}{<248>}{Nope, Not Quite (w,n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You were wrong.  The doors are chained.  Bummer, eh?  To the west you hear badly pronounced French...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
