R {22271}{0}{<268>}{400 Hall (n,w,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is probably the most crowded section of hallway in the school.  People, for some unknown reason, just come to a dead stop in front of you.  Argg! The newspaper room is to the west, home of The Call.  The orange lockers stretch north forever...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
