R {22272}{0}{<248>}{Ms. Davies' Room (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{What is it with this school?  All the classrooms stink!  They all have the same crappy desks and dirty chalkboards. This one is no exception...  But what's worse than the stench is the sound of French being spoken by Americans.  The students mock Ms. Davies tone for tone, which is probably why it sounds so horrible.  You REALLY want to leave.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
