R {22273}{0}{<268>}{400 Hall (e,w,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The crowds and the noise are closing in around you!  You are surrounded by students running here and there, shouting inanely.  A bunch of muscular guys are grunting loudly and patting each other's butts.  Weird... The school must have gotten a good deal on orange lockers.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
