R {22277}{0}{<268>}{Middle of 400 Hall (e,w,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've come to the junction between the 400 hall and the 200 hall.  It's not as crowded here, mostly because there's more space in the junction...  Over to the east, you hear cliches being repeated over and over again...  To the north and south, the lockers stretch forever to the horizon...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
