R {22278}{0}{<248>}{Mr. Walsh's Room (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You follow the sound of the cliches into this room.  Inside, some students are having a conversation with a guy who looks like he's ready for some sorta Mexican wedding.  Actually, you kind of like it here.  You don't feel like a student here, more like an adult.  The conversations are actually interesting and engaging.  What a contrast from the halls...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22277}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22279}{0}{<268>}{200 Hall (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are in, perhaps, the dirtiest place in WLC, except for maybe the kitchen... The drinking fountain here is clogged with dip-spit.  Brown, fetid water flows out of the basin.  A strange stink emanates from the locked-up teachers' bathroom here, or is it coming from one of the lockers? Perhaps you should move along?  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
