R {22280}{0}{<268>}{400 Hall (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are surrounded by orange!!!  Arggg!  The lockers on both sides of you seem to breath and pulse with a life of their own!  Students come and go in masses here, their feet making hollow noises on the metal grating.  You think you see the end of all the orange to the north, but you're not sure.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
