R {22281}{0}{<268>}{Middle O' the 200 Hall (e,s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You force your way through the crowd to the middle of the 200 hall.  This hall seems darker than the others...  It therefore lends itself well to face-sucking.  You feel the urge to shout 'Get a room!'  To the south, you hear girls giggle and coo softly...  WTF? You wish they would paint the lockers a different color, all this orange is beginning to become annoying! }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
