R {22282}{0}{<248>}{Mr. Darnton's Room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You have entered a bizarre scene.  About 20 female students are sitting in this classroom, oo-ing and ahh-ing and rubbing their thighs...  At the edge of hearing, you hear a voice whispering 'I love you... I really love you... You are my favorite student... You are a great writer... You want to sleep with me... I am the hottest chunk of Man you've ever seen...'  The few male students in here seem confused.  They don't understand what Mr. Darnton has that they don't have...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
