R {22284}{0}{<268>}{Four Corners (e,s,n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Welcome to Four Corners!  This is the center of Walled Lake Central, both literally and figuratively.  The 200 hall, running east and west, intersects the main hall of the school, running north and south.  Students congregate here during lunch and passing period.  It used to be you couldn't hang out here unless you were a senior.  The administration ripped out the benches, though, so now seniors have no place to sit and pontificate.  Four Corners is abuzz with activity... There is a phone on the wall here.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
