R {22287}{0}{<268>}{Hall to Four Corners (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is another short hallway.  There seem to be a lot of short hallways in this school. For some reason, the lockers are painted a dark orange, rather than the school's colors, blue and gold.  A stripe of the same color runs along the wall at eye level.  Some people have no sense of color...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
