R {22288}{0}{<248>}{The Boiler Room (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Waves of heat assault you as you enter WLC's boiler room. Actually, it's more than just a boiler room.  This room handles all the heating, electricity, air-conditioning, microwaves, and shop equipment in the school!  Tons of unidentifiable appliances are here.  Doc, the oldest janitor in the world, virtually lives in here, tinkering with the heaters and boilers.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22285}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22289}{0}{<248>}{An Utterly Useless Place (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This is WLC's attendance office.  This is where attendance is recorded and where discipline is handed out.  In other words, this place is useless. The administration hasn't done jack crap about any breach of the code of conduct for the past 5 years.  Gangs roam the halls and students are perpetually tardy.  You can feel the uselessness come upon you. All you want to do is sit in your little office and spank it, and let the students go to Hell in a hand-basket.  There are some totally useless secretaries sitting here behind their desks.  Kill them.  Nobody will reprimand you.  Who cares...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22258}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22290}{0}{<248>}{WLC Auditorium (se)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Waaah!  You were warned not to come in here!  Boy, is Mrs. Rex pissed!  The actors on stage all stop working, waiting for her command... You consider hiding under the seats, but decide against it. There is a pile of unused programs by the door.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22258}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22291}{0}{<268>}{A short hallway (e,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is a short hallway connecting the lobby to the library. Also, the doors to the counseling office are to the east. The counselors at WLC are some of the most inept people you will ever meet. You should try to go see your transcript... 'Huh? Transcript?' More of the ever present orange lockers line the walls.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
