R {22292}{0}{<248>}{WLC Counseling (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This is the WLC counseling office, yet another haven of ineptitude. This is where many students come to check on their transcripts, talk to their counselors, and plan their future.  Unfortunately, none of the counselors give a rat's ass about the students.  They would sooner dismember themselves than help a student in a crisis.  And don't bother them with petty things like choosing a college.  They have better things to do, like recommending students they don't even know for drug therapy.  You hate this school. You wonder which brown-noser sent one of these counselors the flowers sitting on the desk.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22291}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

