R {22305}{0}{<248>}{Mr. Kochenderfer's Class (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This seems to be the source of the strange laughter.  Mr. Kochenderfer, perhaps the strangest teacher at WLC, just made a horrible pun.  He laughs maniacally while the students sit in aghast silence.  Suddenly, one of them falls to the floor, quite dead...  Get Out!  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
