R {22306}{0}{<268>}{300 Hall (e,n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are in the middle of the 300 hall, commonly referred to as the Science Wing.  This hallway is less crowded than others.  You can actually manuever at a reasonable pace down the hall. One thing this school is not short on is lockers.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
