R {22307}{0}{<248>}{Ms. Burt's Room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You are greeted by loud groans as you enter the classroom.  You look over at the chalkboard...  Whoa!  Major homework!!!  A couple of students faint and slump over their desks. You hear many, many remarks about Ms. Burt's parent's sex lives... Disparaging remarks...  Stuff people get arrested for...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
