R {22308}{0}{<268>}{300 Hall (e,w,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Sunlight filters down from the skylight in the ceiling here reflecting off the lockers, causing the whole place to glow orange.  Unfortunately, so does the rain and asbestos...  The 300 hall runs east and west.  East is 'Fight Central,' one of the more dangerous places at WLC...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
