R {22309}{0}{<248>}{Mrs. Ervin's Room (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You walk into what seems to be a normal physics classroom.  Laid out on the lab tables are ampmeters, balances, and various other lab equipment.  The next thing you notice is the neatness of the equipment.  Everything has its own little niche.  The desks are all clean, the board is washed.  What a pleasant place.  Boring as Hell, but pleasant...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
