R {22311}{0}{<248>}{Dr. Cox's Room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{A spray of spittle hits you full in the face as you enter the classroom. You look around nervously...  Spit drips from everything in here!  The ceiling, the desks, the mangled bodies...  Mangled bodies?  AHHHHH!!!!!  Whose class is this?  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
