R {22314}{0}{<248>}{Mr. Ervin's Room (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Whoa!  This place looks like the generic mad scientist's lab from all those late night movies you've seen.  Bubbling beakers froth and boil while a greenish mist pours out of them. Bunsen burners flare, burettes drip.  You look over at the students.  It looks like they all want to burst out laughing at the strange man standing in front of them, but they hold it in out of respect.  You want to touch the chemicals arrayed before you on the counter but you're a bit afraid...  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
