R {22315}{0}{}{A grassy field (e)}{<238>T<088>}{A thick, lush grass covers a wide open field leading up to a large greenhouse.  A small path of crushed white stones slowly meanders through the field before stopping at a set of automatic sliding doors. Flowers and weeds break up the green landscape with a rainbow of colors.  A trail leads off into the distance.   }{Greenhouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
