R {22316}{0}{}{The greenhouse control room (e,w)}{ }{This is a small room squeezed in between two sets of automatic sliding glass doors.  The east and west doors lead into the interior and outside the greenhouse respectively.  A small table runs along one wall, while an elaborate console of buttons, switches, and lights takes up the other.  Above the console is a series of eight monitors.  Light coming in from the glass walls and ceiling illuminates the room. }{Greenhouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
