R {22330}{0}{}{PG's (exit,w)}{<168>X<088>}{The smell of burned hamburgers, over fried onion rings and people stinking with sweat almost makes you gag as you enter this greasy joint named PG's. Old hamburgers and french fries lie scattered all over the floor, which is almost impossible to see from all the grease that has been worn into it during the last years. The tables are covered with red pieces of cloth which nobody has ever cleaned. In the corner is a door leading towards a toilet and also a pile of garbage that almost reaches up to the ceiling. A menu stands on the greasy counter in front of you.  }{PG}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
