R {22337}{0}{}{:) Smiley Restaurant :) (e,s,n,w)}{ }{You are standing inside Smiley Restaurant. This place is renowned for its great Smiley cakes and service that always comes with a smile. It is also a great hangout for fellow smileys. There are a few tables and seats scattered about and a counter at the back of the shop. To the south is the entrance to Smileyland, west is the bad smiley area of town, northward is a home and eastward you can see the coast. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
