R {22338}{0}{}{:) Smileyland :) (e,s,w,n)}{ }{The beautiful wide open grasslands of Smileyland. There are less trees here as you approach the sea. You can hear the faint sound of waves crashing against the coast. A sandy path leads south and east of here. To the north is Smileyville, a suburb of Smileyland. Westward is Smiley Restaurant. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
