R {22339}{0}{}{:) Smileyland Coast :) (n,w)}{ }{The beautiful wide open grasslands of Smileyland come to a halt at the coast. Waves crash into the rocky shore ceaselessly. A small sandy cove is obscured from sight by a rocky outcrop. Westward you can see the open fields and to the north is more coast. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
