R {22342}{0}{}{:) Downtown Smileyland :) (e,w,n)}{ }{Downtown Smileyland is full of busy Smileys moving around. There is a shop here: Smiley's Guns n Knives. Smileys go there to purchase hunting equipment. To the north there are some hills, east is Smiley's Restaurant and west is Smiley Alley. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
