R {22343}{0}{}{:) Smileyland Alley :) (e,n)}{ }{You have to be careful here. Smileyland alley can get a little rough at times if you don't watch it. This place is shadowed from the tall buildings by day and dimly lit by night. The alley, as it is referred to by Smiley homeys, is where a lot of the illegal frown trade takes place. North is the shabby Smileyland shanty town and east is downtown Smileyland. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
