R {22344}{0}{}{:) Smileyland Hills :) (e,n,w,s)}{ }{These are the undulating hills of Smileyland. Hill after hill after hill. This area once was a beautiful forest but ever since Undead Smiley took the Smile(tm) all of the trees have disappeared. Southward is the industrial downtown area of Smileyland and to the north is the untouched beauty of the smiley forests. To the east is Smiley square. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
