R {22345}{0}{}{:) Smileyland Shanty town :) (e,s)}{ }{This is area of Smileyland has been overlooked by the great Lord Smiley. Trashcans and homeless smileys are everywhere. To the east you can see the great Smileyland hills and south is Smiley alley. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
