R {22346}{0}{}{:) Smileyland Forest :) (e,s)}{ }{A beautiful tropical forest with large smiley-shaped ferns and moss-covered smiley face rocks. Even though the forest is an abode for people following the smiley, some dangerous smiley creatures live here. East you can see a glowing aura and south there is some smoke rising over the hills. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
