R {22347}{0}{}{:) Smileyland Beach :) (s,w)}{ }{A jutting headland protects this slice of coast. The calm beach here is a popular swimming spot for the Smileys. The rocky coast of Smileyland continues to the south. The suburbs of Smileyland lie to the west. }{Smileyland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
