R {22355}{0}{}{-= Inside Studio B =- (out,e)}{<258>O<088>}{-= Inside Studio B =- Cameras, wires, and microphones lie scattered around.  Light gels dangle from their metal holders in the catwalk.  Bits of colored construction paper and odd paper plate shapes litter the floor.  The hustle and bustle of a show being readied for taping echoes through the halls. }{Barney's Studio}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
