R {22356}{0}{}{-= Inside Studio B =- (n,w)}{ }{-= Inside Studio B =- Dressing rooms of all sizes span the hallways.  Giant gold stars adorn each door.  Pancake make-up and red lipstick smear the walls.  A thick line of carpet lies in the center of the floor.  Children's laughter bounces through the halls. It sounds like everyone is getting ready to tape 'Barney'. }{Barney's Studio}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22355}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22357}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22357}{0}{}{-= Inside Studio B =- (s,n)}{ }{-= Inside Studio B =- The clamour of children screeching with delight and stagehands moving and adjusting equipment grows louder.  The area leading down to the main sound stage is heavily littered with props, lunch garbage, and drawing paper.  A hurried stage mother runs towards the set, pushing her child toward stardom. }{Barney's Studio}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22356}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22358}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22358}{0}{}{-= Playroom Set =- (w,s)}{ }{-= Playroom Set =- The main sound stage for the 'Barney' show consists of two sets. The larger of the two sets is a replica of a playroom with a giant toy box stuffed with toys of all sizes, a make-shift ship, a futuristic robot made from cardboard and tinfoil, and more arts and crafts stuff than any person could do in ten lifetimes. }{Barney's Studio}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22357}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22359}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22359}{0}{}{-= Playground Set =- (w,e)}{ }{-= Playground Set =- Facing east, a wall of fake brick makes up the outside of a school building.  A set of four steps leads down into the make-believe playground.  Behind the jungle gym, lies a fake metal fence complete with schoolyard backdrop.  On the ground, a sheet of vinyl acts as asphalt where kids can play hopscotch or other children's games. }{Barney's Studio}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22358}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22360}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22360}{0}{}{-= Backstage =- (s,e)}{ }{-= Backstage =- Behind the moleskin flats, worn furniture, costumes, large metal scaffolds, and dried out make-up are thoughtlessly tossed aside.  Two heavy sliding doors for deliveries adorn the back wall.  There is a technician on the catwalk, adjusting the lights. }{Barney's Studio}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
