R {22457}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Gumdrop shrubs and small bunches of sweet lollipops grow in the shade of tall trees. The tree branches spread out wide and provide a cool canopy of shade. Shadows from the leaves shift mysteriously on the grass. Pink icicles dangle from a cave ceiling that lies to the west. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22456}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
