R {22458}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. A cold breeze whips around the icy cave. Thick, pink icicles hang down from the cave ceiling. Small bits of hard kandies are stuck in the walls. The path is slippery and covered with green and red peppermints. Melted snow drips down the walls and plops into a small puddle, making a *PLUNK* sound. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22457}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
