R {22459}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. The temperature drops dramatically, chilling the bones. Snowflakes drift down, adding to the already tall snow mounds. Hard kandies lay on the ground, providing the mountain's creatures with a sweet treat during their travels through Kandy Mountain. Kandy kanes and pine trees pepper the snowy drifts. The air is crisp and clean. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22458}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22460}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22460}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Sparkly flakes gently fall on the snow-covered ground. Small snow mounds flank the kandy path. Kandy kanes and peppermints cover this winter wonderland. A frosted pine tree cookie rests in a snowy bank. A few real evergreens are scattered throughout the Kandy Kane Forest. The intertwining smells of pine and mint are intoxicating. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22459}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22461}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22461}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Kane Forest .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Kane Forest .oOo. The Kandy Kane Forest is filled with pine trees, snowy hills, kandy kanes, and peppermint kandies. The air is crisp and refreshing, and very minty. The snow is blindingly white and cold. The kandy kanes stand as high as the pine trees and the peppermint kandies lay scattered in the snow. It looks as if someone has been marching around the forest as indicated by a flurry of footprints. In every direction there is either a kandy kane or peppermint kandy, making it difficult to maneuver through the forest. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22460}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22462}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22462}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (n,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Pink mountains are to the west. Clean snow covers the ground. Striped kandy kanes are stuck at odd angles in the snow. Several pine trees spruce up the bright white fluff. Half-eaten mint kandies lay on the snow, left-overs from the critters scampering through Kandy Mountain. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22461}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22463}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22463}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (s,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. A small tan house is nestled in a corner of Kandy Mountain. A bird bath and gumdrops grace the front yard. Pink mountains, covered with white fluff and gumdrops lie to the west. The house is round with a roof that skews to the right. The brown door is outlined by red gumdrops. A green, squishy parrot squawks from an open window. Five gumdrop trees flourish in the expansive yard. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22462}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
