R {22464}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Gummy birds swoop down from the sky and snatch up a variety of colorful, sweet kandies off the ground. The glub-glub sound of slow-moving molasses seems to be eminating from the east. A blue squirrel scampers by with a red gumdrop in his mouth. Hope he doesn't drop it. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22463}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
