R {22465}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Thick, dark molasses oozes down the mountain. The bubbles glub to the top and then <*POP*> in a spray of goo. A blue squirrel desparately tries to retrieve his trapped gumdrop from the brown muck. A swarm of red and black bats screech overhead. Wonder where they came from. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
