R {22466}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Black and red licorice sticks cover the path, making travel difficult. A variety of gummy kandies also make their home here. The ground is hard, brown, and uninviting. Amazingly, small yellow flowers flourish here. To the east, the sky grows dark red. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
