R {22467}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. A dark and gloomy kastle sits atop a brown patch of land ahead. The spire tops have red flags waving from them. The surrounding land is brown and rocky. The sky is blood red, adding to the mystery. Strange sounds emanate from the kastle and bats fly out of the windows at regular intervals. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
