R {22468}{0}{}{.oOo. Licorice Kastle .oOo. (e,gate,w)}{ }{.oOo. Licorice Kastle .oOo. A large kastle made from licorice whips and other licorice pieces looms overhead. The kastle is protected by a strong licorice gate. Behind the gate, the land is bare of vegetation, save a lonely black licorice tree that is covered with just a smattering of brown leaves. Black licorice sentries guard the kastle from trespassers. A long licorice whip fence lines the surrounding land. A few kandy pieces lay forgotten in front of the gate. The kastle's three spires are covered with licorice and each spire has a red flag waving from it. Black and red bats fly overhead, screeching out their song. Even though the kastle looks scary, there is really no evil being done here. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
