R {22469}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (n,w)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. A swing set, made from licorice whips and kandy kane sticks, sits among the lollipop trees. A blue see-saw sits next to the swing set. A canopy of lollipops is to the north and a scary-looking kastle is to the west. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
