R {22470}{0}{}{.oOo. Licorice Kastle Laboratory .oOo. (out)}{ }{           .oOo. Licorice Kastle Laboratory .oOo. The Licorice Kastle laboratory is where Kount Licorice creates all of his weird licorice inventions. The floor is covered with tiles made from red and black licorice. Twisted licorice sticks frame the doors and windows. A gold machine with three large buttons and two output holes is in the center of the room. Along the south wall is a wooden counter that is covered with bubbling beakers and test tubes. On the north wall, stands a credenza that has a round lamp, that resembles a crystal ball and a black- and red-striped box. Only one of the doors on the credenza works. A painting of an old man hangs on the wall next to the credenza. Red and black licorice bats fly in and out of the kastle via an open window. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
