R {22471}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (s,w)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Dozens of lollipops, in a rainbow of colors, stand among the jelly bean shrubs and gumdrop trees. Some of the lollipops lean at odd angles, creating a shade canopy. Cute brown squirrels scamper up the lollipop sticks to feast on the sugary surprise at the top. A little blue bunny hops around, sniffing at the jelly beans. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
