R {22472}{0}{}{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Kandy Mountain .oOo. Lollipop trees border the path. Green, purple, yellow, red, and blue suckers cover the grass. Real trees, bearing red and yellow gumdrops, fight for space among the tall, white lollipop sticks. To the west, low, pink clouds provide cover for the Ice Kream Kastle. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22471}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22473}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22473}{0}{}{.oOo. Ice Kream Kastle .oOo. (w,e)}{ }{.oOo. Ice Kream Kastle .oOo. Kotton kandy clouds cover the kastle. Only the top of an ice kream spire and its sprinkles and cherry can be seen through the clouds. A cookie path leads from the kandy button path to the kastle. The green grass is dotted with multi-colored gumdrops. Sweet lollipops and minty kandy kanes and peppermints mix in with the sugary treasures and flower patches. A red flag flaps in the breeze from an unseen spire. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22472}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
