R {22474}{0}{}{.oOo. Ice Kream Kastle .oOo. (e)}{ }{.oOo. Ice Kream Kastle .oOo. The kastle is made entirely of ice kream cones and ice kream. Rainbow sprinkles and cherries top each scoop. The cookie path leads all the way to the front gate of the kastle. A black licorice fence surrounds the property. Gumdrops, lollipops, kandy kanes, and cookies decorate the grounds. A yellow flag flanks the left side of the kastle, while a red one is on the right. In the blue sky, clouds lazily float by. The tall trees provide ample shade and provide a delicious treat to weary adventurers. }{Kandy Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22473}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22475}{0}{}{Living Room (n,exit,w)}{<168>X<088>}{The typical living room of a house with a young child living in it. Strewn about the floor are numerous articles of clothing, toys, and food. It looks like a tornado came through here, or maybe just a rambunctious toddler, who knows? Some kids show is blasting away on the television, which is both annoying and completely boring. There are other rooms branching off from here, however you can't really see what is going on in them. }{Toddler House}{toddler_house}{}{}{1.000}{1}
