R {22476}{0}{}{Stairway (u,s,w)}{ }{A small hallway at the base of the stairs to the upper level of this two story suburban house. There are a few family pictures hanging on the wall opposite the railing moving up the stairway. On the western side of the room is an archway leading away into the kitchen, with a gate blocking the toddler from entering mom's sanctuary. }{Toddler House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
