R {22477}{0}{}{Dining Room (n,e)}{ }{Not a formal dining room as might be seen in a more sophisticated home, but it is still furnished with semi-nice furniture. There is a high chair folded and laying against one of the walls. It is surprisingly clean in here, probably because there is a child gate in the doorway to the living room, preventing the toddler from entering. A set of bay windows on the south side of the room open the room up, and allow a lot of light in. }{Toddler House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
