R {22478}{0}{}{Kitchen (e,s,n)}{ }{The typical haven of a house mom, the kitchen is small but clean, and with a decent amount of storage available. The appliances are not new, but they aren't ancient either. You can smell some fresh bread baking in the oven, and it smells delicious. The doorway to the hallway is gated to prevent the toddler from getting in. A low rumbling is coming from the archway to the north. }{Toddler House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
