R {22479}{0}{}{Utility Room (s)}{ }{A small room off the back of the house, which is used for utility purposes. There is a washer and dryer here for the family's laundry. The walls haven't even been covered in wall board. Pipes and electrical conduit are visible between the studs in the wall. A small window lets in some natural light. }{Toddler House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
