R {22480}{0}{}{Stairway (d,s,w)}{ }{A hallway at the top of the stairs continuing west. To the south is the family bathroom. The walls are painted white, and have fresh crayon scribbling all over. The banister and railing of the stairway are in good condition. }{Toddler House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
