R {22481}{0}{}{Bathroom (n)}{ }{A typical bathroom for a house such as this. At one end is a molded white fiberglass tub. Next to that is a porcelain toilet. Along the wall next to the toilet is a counter with a cast iron sink painted in white enamel. The floor is tiled with gaudy tiles, and has a bath mat next to the bath. }{Toddler House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22480}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22482}{0}{}{Hallway (e,s,n)}{ }{A narrow hallway leading back to the stairs in one direction, north of here is Silas' nursery, and to the south is the master bedroom. The walls are painted white and the floor is carpeted with light beige carpet. }{Toddler House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
