R {22486}{0}{}{An open field (out,e)}{<178>O<088>}{Fields of grass stretch out as far as your eye can see.  It doesn't look like construction has made it out this far yet, but the ground has definitely been trampled out by the workers coming and going.  Different pieces of equipment lie on the ground. }{Ashridge Acres}{ashridge_acres}{}{}{1.000}{1}
