R {22487}{0}{}{An open field (e,w)}{ }{There is more construction equipment covering the ground than there is grass.  It seems that this area has been dug up to make way for a new highway on-ramp.  Odd that the workers would leave in the middle of the job like this... they must be union. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
