R {22488}{0}{}{A circular driveway (e,w,s,n)}{ }{A large fountain stands sentry in the middle of a great circular driveway.  Someday this will be the grand entryway to the wonderful new development, Ashridge Acres, but right now it looks like someone put in a large drinking fountain and left.  The entrance to where the business office would be someday is to the east. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
