R {22498}{0}{}{A BBQ Pit (e,s,w)}{ }{All vegetation has been removed from this area.  A large slab of concrete has been set to prevent the spread of uncontrolled fires.  Several coal burning BBQs have been placed strategically near tables and benches so families can enjoy a warm summer's day.  A dark and uninviting forest lies to the east. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
