R {22505}{0}{}{Inside a hole (u)}{ }{You have climbed down into what was going to be the swimming pool of Ashridge Acres.  It looks like they dug in the wrong place.  Dirt and mud has been piled up and molded into a make-shift throne.  A large black ball of light shimmers behind what seems to be the sepulcher for important monchie artifacts. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
