R {22506}{0}{}{An outdoor library (e,s,n,w)}{ }{It seems that the library never got built around this treasure trove of books.  Bookshelves stand where a library would have been built.  Perhaps one was planned, but it appears the books came to an empty lot and were just set up. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
