R {22509}{0}{<138>}{CoffeeBuck$ (e,n,w)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{It's amazing that in all the destruction CoffeeBuck$ was still able to get a store setup.  Then again, you can find a CoffeeBuck$ anywhere you go.  A pretty young barrista, named Whitney, is ready to take your order.  Behind her a menu hangs on the wall. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
