R {22510}{0}{}{A half finished house (n,w,e)}{ }{What was once the frame of a majestic new home, has now fallen into disrepair.  Tools lie scattered over the foundation. It seems like the workers just walked away.  Even the birds have got up and left. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
