R {22511}{0}{}{An empty pond (e,n)}{ }{The ground here has been dug out for a tranquil koi pond.  Large rocks decorate the edge and miniature pine trees wait to be planted.  A bridge lies on its side on the bank\; you can imagine folks looking over the side at the fish and finding peace. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22493}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
