R {22535}{0}{}{By the Big Board (e,w)}{ }{You are standing by Alex's podium and look up in awe at all the television sets that they use to put the answers on.  All this intelligence in one place kinda gives you the heebie jeebies.  You wonder if you could play this game.  You know that when you watch it at home, it is sometimes easy.  Nevertheless, that is when you are in your living room with no pressures. }{Game Show}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16706}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22536}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22536}{0}{}{The Contestants}{ }{You have taken your place in a cubicle, with the other contestants on either side of you.  You know it is very unlikely that you could win this game, but nonetheless, your eyes are drawn to the glamorous board and the endless questions.  You panic a bit as you realize there is no way out, until you win or fail. You really hope they don't make you look TOO stupid. There is a small piece of paper for you to read. }{Game Show}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {22537}{0}{}{A closet (out)}{ }{This dusty, bare walled closet can hide no secrets. Its smooth walls look as if nothing has ever touched them. Along the back is a bar to hang clothes, but it is empty. Beavis and Butthead mustn't own any other clothes than what they wear. Or else they hide them. }{Beavis and Butthead}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
