R {22538}{0}{}{In the backyard (hole,window)}{ }{Negotiating your way through this highly overgrown yard is not easy. All you can see over the grass and weeds, is a smashed window, and a fence. There are a couple of palings missing on the fence, and you could probably leave through the hole they make. }{Beavis and Butthead}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
