R {22539}{0}{}{On a street (shed,hole)}{ }{On one side of the street you see the hole leading back to Beavis and Buttheads house. On the other side of the road, a camper sits in a driveway, and beyond the house, you can see an open garden shed. Looking either way down the street, you see nothing else of interest. }{Beavis and Butthead}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
