R {22540}{0}{}{Inside Anderson's shed (out)}{ }{This tool shed is cluttered with various gardening implements, but still there is ample room to stand around near the doorway. The walls are made of metal, and it is a bit warm in here. }{Beavis and Butthead}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
