R {22541}{0}{}{Da Shoebox}{ }{Oddly enough, you find yourself inside a shoebox! It's awfully cramped in here. You might be able to squeeze through the pinholes in the north, south, west or east walls. Through the pinhole to the north you see something blindingly bright, while the aroma of coffee and salt water wafts in from the western and eastern pinholes respectively. }{Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
