R {22542}{0}{}{In front of Starbucks Coffee Shop (e,w)}{ }{This is the front of Starbucks Coffee, the makers of the finest coffee beverages in the world. It is also the hangout of the strangest people in the world. There are several small round tables scattered haphazardly in front of the building, each with an umbrella in the center. The enticing aroma of fine coffee beckons you to enter the building. }{Starbuck's Coffee}{starbucks_coffee}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22541}{e}{e}{2}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22543}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22543}{0}{}{Inside Starbucks Coffee Shop (w,e)}{ }{The smell of coffee is stronger here, so strong that all other odors are drowned out. The same tables that littered the outside of the shop are neatly lined up on the inside, minus the umbrellas. On the walls on either side of you hang several pictures of people doing what else, but drinking coffee. The counter and the line to buy drinks is to the west of here. }{Starbuck's Coffee}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22542}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22544}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22544}{0}{}{In front of the counter at Starbucks Coffee Shop (e)}{ }{A mighty espresso machine stands at the center of attention here with an eager barista working vigilantly at it. A large menu hangs above the counter with a list of the drinks and their prices. You could 'order' a drink if you feel like it, or 'list' to see what is on the menu. }{Starbuck's Coffee}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22543}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22545}{0}{}{The front door (s,enter)}{ }{This is a nice-looking house with a nice-looking front door.  It all seems pretty normal except for its blinding pink color and that three-foot diameter, yellow happy-face.  You get a feeling of absolute warmth. }{Sweetboots' House}{sweetboots_house}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22541}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22546}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22546}{0}{}{main hallway (nw,e,out)}{<168>O<088>}{You can't believe you're actually here. As the realization that _this_ is Matt Sweetboots' house hits you, you stumble backwards.  You look around and gather in your surroundings. This is a pleasant room.  True, the wallpaper is pink, but it is a nice room.  Windows adorn the walls adjoining the outside and the multitude of plants lying around give the room a homey feeling. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22545}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22547}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
