R {22547}{0}{}{A side hallway (se,n,w)}{ }{Brown carpeting makes this room seem inconsistent with the theme. It's too drab. The hallway continues north and west and there's a pink shine to the southeast. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22546}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22569}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22570}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22548}{0}{}{Room of mirrors (e,w,n)}{ }{Nice room, it's got strong, oak panelling and several mirrors lining the south wall.  There's a solitary window in between two particularly large mirrors on the south wall which lets in a single beam of sunlight.  The beam then bounces off another mirror which you hadn't noticed before on the northern wall. It continues its path of reflection until it bounces out the very window from which it entered.  The doorway to the west leads back to the main hallway.  There is a musty smell coming from the eastern doorway and a very proper looking, marble door titled 'WAX MUSEUM' lies open to the north. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22546}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
