E {22550}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22549}{0}{}{The library (e,n,w)}{ }{This room has a very homey feel.  You love the smell of musty books, and, that being the case, you've come to the right place.  Books line all four walls, and the only break in their monotony are the three doorways on the northern, western, and eastern wall. A delicious smell wafts in from the east.  But no time for that. 'Books!' you chuckle to to yourself.  'Books!' }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22548}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22551}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22552}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22550}{0}{}{Wax museum entrance (s,w)}{ }{As you enter the room, a happy, squeaky voice rings out from the powerful loudspeakers hanging in the corners of the room. It says, 'Welcome to my museum, it's not completely open yet, but I hope you enjoy my works!'  It's the voice of Matt Sweetboots.  You can go west, deeper into the museum, or south to a more comfortable room. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22548}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22564}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22552}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22551}{0}{}{Pizza parlor (w)}{ }{The smell of Italian food overpowers you as you walk into the room.  You fight with it for a moment, but to no avail, you begin salivating as you think of all that good food.  But the lights are off, you notice, indicating that the pizza parlor (what else could you call it?) is closed.  Yet, Matt Sweetboots is known throughout the land for his benevolence and has insisted that his chef, Sir Bob Myette (knighted for his talents in the kitchen), leave some pizzas on the counter in case someone gets hungry.  A basket lies next to the pizzas labeled: '400 coins per slice please.'  Enjoy! }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22549}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22552}{0}{}{a hallway (e,n,s)}{ }{You've entered a hallway in the home of Sweetboots.  This one seems pretty nice.  It's got a pleasant, pink shag carpet on the floor that makes you wish you could take off your boots and just stand here all day.  The hallway continues north, ends to the south, and a doorway will lead you to the east. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22549}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22553}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22554}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22550}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22553}{0}{}{Musical chairs (n,w)}{ }{If Matt Sweetboots does not possess class, then such a thing as class does not exist.  Entertaining guests had become a dry habit for Matt Sweetboots.  Who needed the food, the wine, the music?  Indeed, Matt had nearly turned away from the ordeal of receiving guests entirely.  But then, he thought, why not do something innovative and new?  So, he did! In this room are ten chairs, two rows of five, placed back to back.  And lying rather unobtrusively in the corner, rests a manual reading 'Musical Chairs Made Easy'... }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22552}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22555}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22554}{0}{}{A hallway (e,n,s)}{ }{There's a beautiful rainbow painted on the western wall of this portion of the hallway. It seems to add to the cheer that the shag carpet brought to the room. Anyway, the hall continues north and south, and to the east is a doorway from which music seems to be emanating. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22552}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22555}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22556}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22555}{0}{}{The kitchen (w,s)}{ }{You have entered the kitchen of Matt Sweetboots' home. 'Nice looking', you mumble to yourself. Indeed, it does look nice. Very modern, the kitchen looks like it should be in a magazine. There are cupboards lining the northern and eastern walls, while a refrigerator softly hums 'Old McDonald' in the background, tapping its foot, ever so slightly, along with the beat. A stove smiles happily next to the refrigerator, and the microwave seems content just to sit there on the counter. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22553}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22554}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22556}{0}{}{Hallway junction (e,n,s)}{ }{The hallway nears completion in this section.  To the east is an open door and to the north you think you can see a set of stairs.  Looking south you see the pink, shag carpet continuing on forever. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22554}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22557}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22558}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22557}{0}{}{A broom closet (w)}{ }{You have just entered a broom closet. True, it's a big broom closet, but a broom closet nonetheless. Looking around, it does not surprise you to see several brooms. Eerily, these brooms, lining all four walls, seem to be quite animated and give you a chilling feeling similar to the first time you saw 'The Sorceror's Apprentice' in the Disney classic, 'Fantasia.' }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22556}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
