R {22558}{0}{}{stairway up (u,s)}{ }{Indeed, these are definitely stairs.  They are covered in a fine, velvety carpet that makes you feel kind of guilty when you step on it.  The stairs go up. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22556}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22559}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22559}{0}{}{stairway down (d,e)}{ }{Well, it comes as no great surprise that you find the top of a staircase at the top of the stairs. You still feel very bad about stepping on that beautiful carpet though. Oh well, time enough for penance later. Another hallway seems to pick up again to the east. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22558}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22560}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
