R {22560}{0}{}{Entrance to the Stadium (e,w)}{ }{'Get your ice cold beer!' the vendor shouts. The vendor? Oooo! Look at all that baseball paraphenalia! Could this be a baseball stadium? In a house? One thing can certainly be said about Matt Sweetboots, he takes his hobbies quite seriously. The, um, stadium (?) continues to the east and there's just a hint of stairway to the west. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22559}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22561}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22561}{0}{}{Bleachers (w,d)}{ }{You're standing at the top of the stands of the stadium, inside Matt Sweetboots' house.  Authenticity never being one of Matt's major concerns, has resulted in clean stands!  The sparkling stands continue downward, and you can hear the sounds of a vendor advertising his wares to the west. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22560}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22562}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22562}{0}{}{Home plate (e,w,n,s)}{ }{You're standing on home plate! You look over to the right and see... right field! And to the left, by George, is left field! And of course, straight ahead is second base.  The only thing missing is a roaring crowd and a brawl in the middle of the field.  But, you remember, their absence is to be expected. It's the off season. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22545}{w}{w}{8}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22545}{e}{e}{2}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
