E {22562}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22563}{0}{}{Matt Sweetboots' secret collection of G.I. Joes (w)}{ }{Wow! A brief inspection of the room tells you that it's special. You look around in amazement as you see literally thousands of G.I. Joe figures! You have stumbled upon Matt Sweetboots' secret collection of G.I. Joes. He sure does have a lot of them! He even has the foot-tall figures that they just don't make any more. After seeing this, you can die a complete person. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22557}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22564}{0}{}{Ticket booth (e)}{ }{You have entered a ticket booth.  The surrounding walls are bare and you begin to think that you are all alone in the room until you see the flashing lights of a 2xl in the far side of the room.  One of those little toy robots. It seems to be saying something.  On the northern wall is a turnstile. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22550}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
