R {22565}{0}{}{Wax museum (e,s,n)}{ }{This is what you expect of any museum.  The walls are white and smooth and there is a slight chill to the air.  There is also a pair of lavender, velvet rope barriers, blocking you from the priceless exhibits.  They, however, do not appear to have blocked the exhibit from you. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22564}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
