R {22566}{0}{}{Wax museum (n,w)}{ }{Such a beautiful place to sit and rest your weary bones. You can just sit back and enjoy the exhibits.  Although, some exhibits don't want to be enjoyed apparently.  There are doorways to the north and west. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22565}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22568}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22567}{0}{}{Wax museum (s,e)}{ }{The same austere look dominates this room.  Not too much to look at here. Although it does appear that Matt Sweetboots was telling the truth\; the museum isn't completely open yet.  Your passage north is blocked by a humongous boulder with a grin (spray-painted?) on it.  It seems very happy stopping you from going north, and, in fact, is a bit over-zealous with its guard.  There are doorways to the east and south. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22565}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22568}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22568}{0}{}{Wax museum (s,w)}{ }{The pleasant museum atmosphere is continued in this room. Kick back, relax.  Stare at the blank, white walls. Enjoy the very life-like exhibits. Be merry. :-> }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22566}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22567}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22569}{0}{}{The family room (s)}{ }{The humongous T.V. and stereo give the identity of this room away.  You look around and marvel at the technology of Matt Sweetboots' entertainment center.  Hmmm, that T.V. seems a bit odd. Oh well, no time for that... the B-52's are blasting and it's time to get those love juices in groove with the cosmic beat! }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
