E {22571}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22571}{0}{}{End of hallway (e,s)}{ }{To your relief, the dull, dry hallway ends here.  You look around, avoiding that unfriendly carpet's gaze, and notice a few interesting things.  There's a closed door to the north, and an open one to the south.  Also, on the western wall, there's a photo of the Sweetboots' family, framed in a lovely wooden frame. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
