R {22572}{0}{}{Tula's bedroom (n)}{ }{The theme of the home has not been disturbed by this room. Indeed, you can't help smiling as you enter the room. It's quite cheerful.  Though the wallpaper is yellow you notice with a frown.  Oh well.  There's a bed lying alongside the southern wall with a nice, flowery bedspread enveloping it. There's a dresser against the eastern wall and a window right by it.  Also, there's a mirror hanging on the western wall. You can go back north to the drab hallway. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22571}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
