R {22573}{0}{}{Matt Sweetboots' stereo (e)}{ }{Well, this certainly wasn't expected!  You have entered the stereo of Matt Sweetboots, and it is such a mess! In fact, the whole place is covered in wires and circuit chips and any other electrical components you can think of.  Hmm, what is Elliot Shoemaker doing in the midst of this disarray? You thought he taught french... }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22569}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22574}{0}{}{In an Aquarium -- You had better take a LOOK. (se,d,s,e,out)}{<168>O<088>}{You find yourself in the back corner of a rather large aquarium.  In fact, it looks like it could hold half of the ocean.  There is a large thermometer beside you, maybe you should take a look at it.  You get a _strong_ feeling that you wouldn't want to swim down without some SCUBA gear. }{Aquarium}{aquarium}{}{}{1.000}{1}
