R {22575}{0}{}{In an Aquarium (ne,nw,d,n,w,e)}{ }{You swim further out in the aquarium, feeling the pull of the currents rock you back and forth, back and forth...  Lazily, you wish you could stay here forever, just rocking to and fro with the tide.  The water truly gives you a feeling of pure serenity, although you feel some trepidation, that something dangerous might be lurking about. }{Aquarium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
