R {22576}{0}{}{In an Aquarium (u,e,d,s,se)}{ }{Swimming just below the surface is strange enough as it is for your land-based body, but being able to breathe down here is a peaceful shock to your systems.  The warm waters swirl around you in subtle currents, tickling your hairs as they flow back and forth with the water. }{Aquarium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
