R {22577}{0}{}{In an Aquarium (ne,d,n,e)}{ }{The surface waters swirl around you dancing to the glory of the moon.  Looking around, all you can see is perfectly blue water extending to the horizon, miles away.  Curiosity takes hold as you wonder what lies below this beautiful scene. }{Aquarium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
