R {22582}{0}{}{In an Aquarium (u,d,w,sw,s)}{ }{The surface dances with the tide just above your head, and the warm water swirls around you with subtle currents.  You feel thankful for the airtank strapped to you back, since it is what gives you the ability to visit that magnificent place.  It may just be your imagination, but something green seems to be swimming towards you. }{Aquarium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
