R {22618}{0}{<228>}{A clearing (enter,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{You've stumbled on what appears to be the remains of a party. Large kegs of ale lay around the area, and the table in the corner of the clearing is covered with bones, apparently from a big meal.  The trees loom all around the area, but one giant oak tree stands out from the rest. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
