R {22619}{0}{<238>}{King Lion's Room (exit)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered the plush room of the King of the Beasts.  Although it is hard to believe, this room is actually furnished!  It no doubt belongs to a lion, as is evident from the paintings of lions adorning the walls.  There is a desk and chair here, albeit crudely made.  You cannot understand how an unintelligent animal can create these things. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
