R {22621}{0}{<108>}{A dark path (n,s)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{You continue down the dark path, treading cautiously.  The trees group closer here, pushing you to the light just to your south. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
