R {22622}{0}{<108>}{A chilly path (ne,w)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{It's getting much much colder now.  You shiver slightly, trying to warm in this frigid atmosphere.  The trees have thinned out, almost to the point that there aren't any.  The dark path you just left is to your northeast.  It seems to get brighter to the west, but the cold air also seems to come from there. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
