R {22623}{0}{<228>}{A messy clearing (n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You've entered a clearing in the woods, but it isn't exactly what you'd call a 'clearing'.  It's a mess, plain and simple.  There are things laying all over the place.  It is disgusting.  There is no order to anything here.  The trees even seem to cringe away from the area. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22621}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22624}{0}{<168>}{An ice floe (e)}{<168>~ ~<088>}{You step cautiously on the ice floe, watching your step.  It's incredibly slippery.  As you regain your balance, you check your surroundings.  Although you would expect it to be unliveable, there appears to be a little 'home' sitting here.  It's not sheltered very well, and odds and ends are laying about pell mell. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22622}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22625}{0}{<238>}{Inside the zookeeper's house (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{As it looked like outside, there is a warm feeling coming from this house.  You feel at peace with the world.  It is no wonder to you why zookeepers take on such responsibilities.  As you gaze around the rooms, several things catch your eye.  The zookeeper's house has many beautiful things in it.  You notice in particular that a gorgeous painting hangs on the wall, slightly askew.  A desk rests over in another corner, the chair pushed up against it.  The windows allow some sunlight to come in, lighting the room.  The light lands on a mirror, reflecting the sunlight all over the room.  You wipe your feet on the rug, preparing yourself for a more extensive search. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22598}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22626}{0}{<278>}{A path in the ZOO (e,w,n,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are walking along a path in the zoo.  There are trees here, trying to make you forget that the animals here are all locked in cages, with no freedom whatsoever.  You inhale deeply and quickly supress the urge to vomit.  Nothing quite like the smell of animals, is there?  You can hear some sort of of laughing to the north and some hissing noises to the south. The zoo pub is to the east. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
