R {22627}{0}{<238>}{Willie's Water Hole (w)}{<238>[P]<088>}{This is the Zoo pub.  The smell of animals isn't as bad in here, but somehow you get the impression that no matter where you go, the presence of animals will not escape you.      1  Baboon Broth         non-alcoholic  :   325 coins       2  Puma Pudding         non-alcoholic  :   750 coins         3  Brontosaurus Brew      alcoholic    :   1000 coins          4  A Mapper                Item        :   5000 coins     To order the food, use 'order <num>'. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
