R {22628}{0}{<238>}{A path to the monkeys. (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{This path will take you to see the monkeys.  It, as everything else in zoo, is made of cement.  There are large, dirty handprints on the walls here.  It smells awful. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22626}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22630}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22629}{0}{<238>}{A path to the snakes (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are walking along another path to another cage.  You can hear faint hissing and slithering sounds, as if many many creatures are sliding all over each other. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22626}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22631}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22630}{0}{<238>}{Baboon's Cage (s)}{<238># ]<088>}{You've entered the baboon cage.  It smells awful in here and the place is a mess.  The baboons are so messy that they dirty the cage the minute that they are cleaned.  There is a jungle gym here for the baboon's amusement.  As you continue to look around, you notice how inordinately large the cage is.  It is much bigger than you would normally expect. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22628}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22631}{0}{<238>}{Snake Room (n)}{<238># ]<088>}{This is the snake room.  You notice that it is a small room, but high enough for a human being to walk around in.  The floor is cleaner here, and you almost stumble on the rocks placed here for the snakes to curl up on and bask in the sun.  There is no roof to this room, and the sun shines brightly. }{Chicago Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22629}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22632}{0}{}{Large Field (forsake,w)}{<108>F<088>}{You are at the end of a large field, in the city of Jericho. You can see farmland for miles and miles, mountains and animals. Not too far away roams a herd of sheep, perhaps looking for their shepherd. The incandescent red and blue skies light up the area, giving the whole area a strange sort of feel, perhaps the feeling of being at home. A mountain trail begins not too far to your west. Do not forsake your heritage. }{The Ten Commandments}{ten_commandments}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7032}{forsake}{forsake}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22633}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49976}{Heavens}{Heavens}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22633}{0}{}{Trail Leading Up to a Mountain (e,sw)}{ }{You are standing on a small winding trail leading up to a mountain, the Sinai mountain. The trail does not appear to be often- traveled, as most of this area's inhabitants fear the mountain. Perhaps the reason it is so feared is because no one has ever returned from a journey to the top, where God is rumored to live. The trail is made up of soil and clay, soft to your feet. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22632}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22634}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22634}{0}{}{Trail Leading Up to a Mountain (sw,ne)}{ }{You are standing on a small winding trail leading up to a mountain, the Mount Sinai. The trail does not appear to be often travelled, as most of this areas inhabitants fear the mountain. You are in the middle of the trail, with the mountain's base just a bit southwest of here. The sounds of the sheep have died down, so nothing can be heard but peacefulness. The trail is made up of soil and clay, soft to your feet. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22633}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22635}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22635}{0}{}{Base of the Mountain (w,ne)}{ }{You are at the end of the trail leading up to the mountain, and at the beginning of the one leading UP the mountain. This trail is made up of much rougher objects, such as rocks and sticks. The mountain seems to glow with a reddish tint. At the top you think that you can see a bush that is on fire, but not burning. The trail ahead seems a steep climb, but nonetheless you wish to continue. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22634}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22636}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22636}{0}{}{Mountain Trail (w,e)}{ }{You are walking upon a narrow trail leading up to the mountain top. The trail is comprised of rough objects, such as rocks and sticks. The mountain seems to glow with a reddish hue that illuminates the area. Not too far away you can see the herd of sheep you spotted earlier. At the top you think that you can see a bush that is on fire, but not burning. The trail ahead seems a steep climb, but nonetheless you wish to continue. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22635}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22637}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22637}{0}{}{Mountain Trail (e,nw)}{ }{You are walking upon a narrow trail leading up to the mountain top. The trail is comprised of rough objects, such as rocks and sticks. The mountain seems to glow with a reddish hue that illuminates the area. Directly to your right, you can see a large rock upon which you might rest. At the top you think that you can see a bush that is on fire, but not burning. The trail ahead seems a steep climb, but nonetheless you wish to continue. You wish to continue and fight for the freedom of your people. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22636}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
