R {22638}{0}{}{Midway Up the Trail (se,ne)}{ }{You are walking upon a narrow trail leading up to the top of the mountain. You are about halfway up the mountain. You can begin to see a lot more of your land, the straw roof of your house, or your herd. The bush you saw earlier is beginning to become more of a reality as you approach the highest point on this great mountain. You can see to your left the remains of a previous traveler, who attemped to converse with God, as you now do. You, Moses, need to know the reason that God has abandoned your people. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22637}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22639}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22639}{0}{}{Midway Up the Trail (ne,sw)}{ }{You are walking upon a narrow trail leading up to the top of the mountain. You are about halfway up the mountain, and you can begin to see a lot more of your land, from afar. You can barely see the straw roof of your house from here, or your herd. The bush you saw earlier is beginning to become more of a reality as you approach the highest point on this great mountain. A strange pile of rocks lies just to your left. You feel a great inner force driving you farther and farther up the mountain. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22638}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22640}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22640}{0}{}{Midway Up the Trail (e,sw)}{ }{You are walking upon a narrow trail leading up to the top of the mountain. You are about halfway up the mountain. As you climb higher, you can begin to see a lot more of your land. A strange wind blows strongly up here, making it difficult for you to retain balance. The bush you saw earlier is beginning to become more of a reality as you approach the highest point on this great mountain. From deep within your heart and soul you feel that climbing this mountain is the right thing to do for you, and your people. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22639}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22641}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22641}{0}{}{Midway Up the Trail (se,w)}{ }{You are walking upon a narrow trail leading up to the top of the mountain. Step by step you are coming closer to the top of this great mountain which you climb for your people. A strange wind blows strongly up here, making it difficult for you to remain balanced. The bush you saw earlier is beginning to become more of a reality as you approach the highest point on this great mountain. As the top is almost in sight, you remember the words of your Memnit, cursing you because of your Hebrew heritage. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22640}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22642}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22642}{0}{}{Nearing the Top of the Mountain (sw,nw)}{ }{You are almost at the top of the great mountain, Sinai. Your legs ache with the pain of the steps you have taken, but your heart aches with the thought of the steps you KNOW you must take to free your people from the Egyptians, to set them free. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22641}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22643}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22643}{0}{}{Just Before the Bush (ne,w)}{ }{You are steps away from the great burning bush. Your eyes cannot believe the fact that it is on fire, but still not burning. You sense the presence of a certain force somewhere close by. All of your life you were told that you were Egyptian, that you were a prince. You were lied to. You are Hebrew, and proud to be so. Now you wish to speak with the Lord and demand upon him why he abandons your people. Step forward Moses. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22642}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22644}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22644}{0}{}{Top of the Mountain (e)}{ }{You are at the top of the great mountain, Sinai. Suddenly you feel like you have been waiting your whole life for this moment, you feel like you belong here, and were chosen. The great bush stands directly in front of you, as does a ever-present feeling of God. You feel compelled to kneel down. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22643}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22645}{study tablet}{study tablet}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22645}{0}{}{Pharaoh's Chamber (out)}{ }{You have entered the chamber of the great Pharaoh Ramses. You know what it is that you have to do here. So go ahead and do it. }{The Ten Commandments}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22632}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

