R {22747}{0}{}{Guppy Cargo (deck)}{ }{This is the cargo hold of the ship. Dark and stuffy, you find it hard to breathe down here. You almost choke as you can smell nothing but the overpowering odor of sweet breakfast cereal. Looking around you realize the hold is completely full of thousands of boxes of sugar coated Cap'n Crunch cereal. }{Cap'n Crunch Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
