R {22751}{0}{}{At the top of the beanstalk (d)}{ }{You are at the top of the beanstalk. If you are lucky, there isn't a giant here to greet you. As you look around you can see a HUGE house. In fact, everything around you looks huge. Wait!!! You seem to have entered another world when you climbed up the beanstalk. You are too scared to venture any further. }{Jack's House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
