R {22752}{0}{<078>}{The Cytel Mining complex (s,n)}{<078>| |<088>}{You're pretty much lost.  You know that you've entered the Cytel  Mining complex somewhere in the western US, but beyond that you  really have no idea where you are.  The compound is hemmed in by a  large fence, making you wonder just what Cytel has inside here.  A  road runs from the gate right behind you directly north.  Small  squat buildings line the road.  Most appear to be office buildings  of some kind, but a few are warehouses and others smelting plants  for the ore Cytel obviously deals in. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {474}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
