R {22755}{0}{<078>}{The Cytel Mining complex (e,w)}{<078>| |<088>}{The side street that you're following seems to lead through the  older, unused section of the complex.  The buildings look  abandoned, even though they're within the compound.  The blazing  sun overhead has beads of sweat running down your back, soaking  your clothes.  Maybe you'd better give up this crazy exploration  and find shelter? }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
