R {22756}{0}{<078>}{The Cytel Mining complex (s,n)}{<078>| |<088>}{The heat waves make it difficult to see anything clearly, but  you'd swear that there was a landing strip to the north.  And  unless you're losing your mind, it's equipped to handle an  interplanetary shuttle.  This is just too strange.  Why does  Cytel need an interplanetary shuttle? }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
