R {22758}{0}{<238>}{A landing pad in the Cytel compound (s)}{<238>|||<088>}{You stand beneath the blazing sun at the edge of a huge landing  pad.  Apparantly Cytel's got some major airlifting going on here,  but you'd only expect that from the corporation who bought the  exclusive mining rights to Mars.  This must be where they bring all  those off planet ore shipments to. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
