R {22784}{0}{<278>}{Venusville (nw,ne,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You stand outside the transit tunnel leading from Venusville  towards the spaceport.  The swirling eddies of red martian dust lie  behind you in the tunnel, kicked up by the racing traffic.  Before  you, beneath the plasteel dome, is the fabled collection of sleeze  and amorality which people flock to from the earth and other  colonies.  This is Venusville, where anything can be bought. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
