R {22785}{0}{<278>}{Venusville (se,enter,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{The sickly odor of such toxins as crack, nuke and thunderball  waft to you from a nearby building.  The closed doors and  shuttered windows do nothing to contain the odors of some serious  chemical usage, especially with the volume of people shuffling  through its doors.  You turn away from the drug emporium and  glance about at the rest of Venusville, only to find similar sights  glaring at you from beneath the neon lights of the colony's cesspool. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
