R {22786}{0}{<278>}{Venusville (sw,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{The glitter of neon and plasma lamps give life to the otherwise  drab surroundings of sheet steel and dusty red stone which makes up  Venusville.  The pulsing beat of some techno-metal music can be felt  from a nearby club here in the perpetual playground of the deviant  and excessive of Mars. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
