R {22789}{0}{<248>}{Purgatory (e,out)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You've left the streets to find yourself within the house of sin  known as Purgatory.  You glance about and notice the abundance of  scantily clad figures of both sexes.  This is certainly the spirit  of Venusville, everything your twisted heart might desire.  People  lounge on couches and chairs all about the room, while a lone  figure seems to be overseeing it all quietly from behind a desk  near the back of the room and the stairwell leading to the second  floor. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
