R {22790}{0}{<238>}{Deever's Tavern (stairs,out,s)}{<238>[P]<088>}{You've wandered into the infamous Deever's Tavern.  This is the  oldest establishment in Venusville, built and opened only a week  after the dome above was completed.  The dingy place so resembles  any dive bar on Earth that you can almost forget where you are.  I  suppose that's why they people like it so much.  An iron stairway  leads up to the second floor from a corner nearby. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22794}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22795}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
