E {22788}{n}{out}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22791}{0}{<278>}{Venusville (s,ne)}{<278>- -<088>}{The crowds bustle about you as tourists and colonists alike lose  themselves into chemical or alcohol induced hazes.  Surely nothing  constructive ever come out of here, nor do those who frequent the  establishments of Venusville remain long on the colony.  Guard your  credit well, for this is definitely the place to lose it. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22788}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22785}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22792}{0}{<248>}{A smoke house (out,w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{This den of debauchery is perhaps the worst in Venusville.  The  smoke is nearly thick enough to blind you, limiting your sight to  only a few feet.  To top it all off, there are dozens of people in  one state of oblivion or another occupying the small room of the  drug emporium.  Mostly the people are calm and enjoying their  trips, but you can see that some are having a tough time of it, and  still others have had a tough time and moved on to the next life. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22793}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22785}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22785}{e}{out}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22793}{0}{<248>}{A smoke house (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You've made your way to the back of the smoke house.  A small  table piled with drugs is guarded by some awfully large men who  seem to be immune to all the stuff that's being used about them.  A small man sits in a chair beside the table, apparantly the  proprieter of the establishment and its major dealer. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22792}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22794}{0}{}{Upstairs from the tavern (d)}{ }{You've slipped upstairs away from the noisy tavern below.  The  small room you find yourself in seems to be a combination of an  office and a bedroom.  The small pallet in the corner serves as  a bed, and the piece of sheet steel across the cement blocks  certainly passes for a desk, even if crude.  A small window  overlooks the street below where the colonists and tourists mix  in their search for the strange and taboo in Venusville. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22790}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22795}{0}{<238>}{The bar (n)}{<238>[P]<088>}{You've found the bar inside the tavern, far to the back, just like  you'd expect.  This place really isn't so bad once you get past the  smell of unwashed bodies and spilled beer.  It's actually kind of  relaxing.  The barkeep looks to be a rather friendly sort, or at  least willing to talk rather than pass you a drink and throw you  out.  You could really get to like this place. }{Mars}{}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
E {22790}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22796}{0}{<278>}{Purgatory (stairs,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You've ventured further into Purgatory.  The stairs to the second  floor are nearby to the north.  The lavish furnishings about you  are all draped with alluring figures of both sexes, each trying to  catch your eye and your favor.  Before you is a small desk. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22789}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22797}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
