R {22797}{0}{<268>}{Purgatory (s,d,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've wandered up to the second floor of the brothel.  The hall  has several doors along it, obviously where the establishment's  clients do business. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
