R {22798}{0}{<268>}{Purgatory (n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've found your way to the southern hall of Purgatory.  This is  the portion of the building which holds rooms which can be rented  out to patrons for their own private use.  Each door seems to be  numbered, making it easy for patrons to find their rooms. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
