R {22799}{0}{<268>}{Purgatory (w,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You're wandering the north hall of Purgatory.  Judging from the  closed doors and the sounds eminating from them, it's safe to say  that most of these rooms are in use by the employees and their  'guests'.  Of course, not all of the rooms are in use, a single  door remains open, awaiting a customer. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22797}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22800}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22800}{0}{<248>}{A room in Purgatory (out)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You seem to have found one of the only vacant rooms not for rent  in Purgatory.  It's a quaint little room, functional with some  style of its own.  A small bed sits in one corner of the room,  looking rather comfortable and often used.  A soft looking chair  sits in the opposite corner, also seeming to see a lot of use.  A  single mirror adorns the wall, leaving the room otherwise bare. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22799}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22799}{e}{out}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22801}{0}{<238>}{A tunnel entrance (n,s)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You stand along the side of the narrow road which runs between  parts of the Mars colony.  The red rock of the walls and ceiling  cast an eerie glow from the sparsely spaced sodium lamps.  Dust  chokes you as cars and drones speed by in all directions. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22781}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22802}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22802}{0}{<278>}{The street (e,n,w,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You blink twice as the strange red rays of the sun stream down  from the dome overhead.  The entire expanse of the dome glows in  the strange color, making everything seem rosey as you glance at  it.  The strange phenomenon seems to take years to get used to, and  as a tourist, you doubt you ever will.  You glance down to clear  your vision and stare at the thin paved way that winds southward  past the hotels and plaza.  Just to the north the street is  swallowed by the red stone of mars as it winds its way under  ground to another portion of the colony. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22801}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
