R {22803}{0}{<278>}{A small side street (e,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{A small street which runs along the cavern wall of the tourist  district.  The giant shadow of the Galactic Suite's hotel looms  above you to the south, rising towards the plas-steel dome above. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52619}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
