R {22804}{0}{<148>}{The plaza (e,sw,s)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{A grand plaza on the edge of the hotel and business district.   Tables cover the deep red bricks, providing a place to sit and eat  or talk.  The giant plas-steel dome over this portion of the city  comes right down to the edge of the plaza, providing a magnificent  view of the Martian landscape and the enormous bulk of Olympus Mons  in the distance. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
