R {22805}{0}{<278>}{The street (e,n,w,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{One of the better kept streets in the mars colony.  A large plaza  spreads out to the west towards the dome's edge.  The street winds  its way through this portion of the colony in a nearly north south  direction, dividing the hotels and shops from the plaza.  The  towering Galactic Suites hotel rises to the very crest of the dome  directly east of you. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
