R {22806}{0}{<278>}{A small side street (enter,w,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{A small street which runs along the cavern wall of the tourist  district.  The thin ribbon of pavement turns to the south, entering  the old core colony where the initial colonists lived.  You can  make out the shadows of the apartment buildings beneath the  overhanging rock of the cavern's ceiling. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
