R {22807}{0}{}{KRAK broadcasting (out)}{ }{You've found your way into the only independent broadcasting  company currently with facilities on Mars.  The operation doesn't  look like it's doing a booming business however, since the  receptionist happens to be the woman you recall seeing as the news  anchor.  Personnel costs must be pretty low here.  A small desk  cluttered with a phone and computer are tucked into the corner of  the room near the entrance to the studio. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
