R {22808}{0}{<278>}{A small side street (n,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road seems to run along the rear of the Galactic Suites  hotel.  The street runs off in both directions, wrapping about  the hotel and rambling through other parts of the colony.  Small  apartments rise about you in the shadow of the hotel, crowding in  beneath the red stone of the cavern roof. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22806}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22809}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

