R {22810}{0}{<278>}{A bend in the road (s,w,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{You've wandered away from the plaza, further from the view of the  martian landscape and deeper into the caverns which house most of  the colony.  Small shops and various offices line both sides of the  street.  The red stone of the cavern ceiling looms quietly above  you.  You notice that this section of the colony appears to be less  frequented than others, catering more to the colonists than to the  tourists of the colony. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
