R {22811}{0}{<138>}{Doran's Outfitters (out)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{You stand inside Doran's Outfitters, the best (and only) shop in  the colony from which to buy your supplies for an excursion onto  the surface of the planet.  If you're lucky today, Doran himself  might just show up to work to wait on you, if not, he's sure to  have his son here to see to your needs.  A large sign above the  cash register lists the major items that the establishment deals  in, though there are samples hanging about the shop for you to poke at. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22810}{n}{out}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22810}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22812}{0}{<278>}{A side street (e,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You wander down a street running away from the plaza.  Small shops  and various offices line both sides of the street.  The red tinted  skies are visible overhead through the plas-steel dome.  This area  of the colony appears to be less frequented than others, catering  more to the colonists than to the tourists of the colony. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
