R {22813}{0}{<278>}{The end of the street (e,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{You've reached the end of the main street through the Martian  colony.  The bulk of the Galactic Suites hotel rises over your  shoulder to the northeast, while the plaza opens up opposite it to  the west.  You seem to be entering a district of smaller shops and  businesses.  The street winds its way eastward into that district  of the colony. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52621}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
