R {22814}{0}{<278>}{The street (n,w,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You stop to glance about you, finding the plaza to radiate a calm  and welcoming air.  The bulk of the Galactic Suites hotel rises  opposite the plaza, thankfully blocking your view of the expanse of  red stone which rises behind it to support the dome overhead.  The  street winds its way south past the hotel and into the shop  district of the colony. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
