R {22816}{0}{<248>}{The lobby of the Galaxy Suites hotel (e,out)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the gigantic lobby of the Galactic Suites hotel.  A  bank of elevators line the southern wall, taking patrons up to  their rooms high above the colony's streets.  Potted plants are so  abundant here that it's a jungle compared to anyplace else in the  colony.  Just ahead is the main desk of the hotel where patrons can  check in and receive their messages. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
