R {22818}{0}{<248>}{The main desk of the Galactic Suites hotel (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You stand before the main reception desk of the Galactic Suites  hotel.  The immense eyesore of some polymer substance that is  supposed to look like marble is manned by a too happy clerk.  Even  so, you can't help but marvel at the lavish nature of the hotel,  especially in the colony, where things seem to be falling apart  daily. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
