R {22823}{0}{<248>}{Deep within Mars (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{You stand before an elevator which leads back towards the surface  of the planet.  The red stone of the planet surrounds you on all sides, even the ground you walk on is merely smoothed Martian  stone.  The cavern you stand in is fairly small, barely ten feet  high and only about twice that wide.  The mining company surely  can't get their ore out through here. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
