R {22825}{0}{<248>}{A mined out tunnel (e,n,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{ Dust from the mining fills the air, creating a thick haze in the   air of the passage.  The floor has been scraped flat so the   carry-alls can pass deeper into the tunnels.  The walls show all   the scars of recent mining, gouges in the rock showing where miners   gave up their search for ores.  }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
