R {22826}{0}{<248>}{A mine tunnel (se,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{ The tunnel winds deeper into the planet, tracking pockets of ore   through the rock of the planet's crust.  The shattered remnants of   the useless stone litter the floor, left behind while the   profitable ore was carted to the trains to be shipped back to earth   on the shuttles.  The dark tunnels are strangely chill and quiet,   though you know there is mining going on all about.  }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
