R {22862}{0}{<238>}{A storage room (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the storage area of the main level of the shelter. It looks as if the guards store the food and whatever else they want to save from being used by the refugees. The room is cubic with high dirt walls and a dry dusty floor. }{Fallout Shelter}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3040}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22863}{0}{<248>}{Backstage (e,w,n,s)}{<248># #<088>}{You did it. You made it backstage. Now that you are here you realize that it is nothing like you expected. This area of the club is actually even more plain than the club floor. The stage lies through a curtain to the west, and there is a door to the east. }{Club Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1823}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
