R {22864}{0}{<238>}{Office (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a pretty typical office. There is a desk with a chair behind it, a file cabinet, a computer, and a painting on the wall. Other than those items the room is fairly non-descript. }{Club Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22863}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22865}{0}{<238>}{On Stage (e,nw,s,w)}{<238>|||<088>}{You did it. You made it on stage. Out in front of you is a crowd of hundreds of punk rock fans screaming and dancing to the music of their favorite band, The Dropkick Murphys. The stage is a plain wooden floor with a high ceiling. Hanging from the ceiling is a cage of spotlights that are already making you start to sweat. }{Club Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22863}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22867}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22869}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1824}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22866}{0}{<248>}{Backstage (s)}{A}{This small nook of the backstage area is where the bands keep their equipment and cases. The area is littered with cases and boxes bearing the Dropkick Murphys insignia. Otherwise the room is very plain and somewhat boring. }{Club Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22863}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22867}{0}{<238>}{On Stage (sw,se)}{<238>|||<088>}{You are in disbelief as you stand on stage! This is the back portion of the stage. It is pretty much filled up with the drum set. To each side of you is large amps and other sound equipment. Out in front of the stage is a crowd of hundreds of rowdy punk rockers. }{Club Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22865}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22868}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22868}{0}{<238>}{On Stage (e,ne,s)}{<238>|||<088>}{You are on stage! You still can't really believe it. You stand in front of hundreds of punk rock fans. Everyone of them going crazy for the band that is standing right next to you. You start to break a sweat. You aren't quite sure if it is from the excitement of the situation or from the spotlights. }{Club Chaos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
