R {22874}{0}{}{In an church back room}{ }{This must act both as a back room and as a shed to the church. Boxes and other miscellaneous items can be found here. There are no windows or doors from this room. The walls are made from the same stone material as the rest of the church. There is a musty smell that lingers in the room and it's most likely due to the lack of fresh air. }{The City of Westersea (Church)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5849}{push button}{push button}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22875}{0}{<228>}{Along a hidden garden path (n)}{<228>( *<088>}{You find yourself just to the west of the grandiose mansion. Thick bushes and flourishing green vegetation are all around. There is a small path leading off in a northern direction and it leads out to a more open part of the garden.   }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5911}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
