R {22876}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (e,w)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The water looked sparkling clear from above, but as you are actually submerged in it you quickly realize that it's used for more things than simply decoration. Every now and then you bump into something rather conspicuous and trying not to think about what it might be you swim onward. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {5988}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22877}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22877}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (w,e)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The fairly large canal continues in a straight eastern to western direction. You see small drainage holes mounted directly into the stone wall but other than that they are completely barren. High above you lies one of the most central streets in the whole town and the roar of city life echoes between the channel walls.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22876}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22878}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22878}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (w,ne)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{You're bobbing away in the slightly chilled city canal. People stop and point at you from the street above laughing. Several children throw small pebbles in the water and some come close to hitting you on top of your head. The canal itself continues in a western to northeastern direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22877}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22879}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22879}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (e,sw)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{This part of the canal must be situated a little bit outside of the main street. You can hear the familiar sound of city life yet it's still rather faint. Trying to look around, both partially blinded by the glittering water as well as partially submerged, you see nothing except the familiar canal walls surrounding you. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22878}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22880}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22880}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (w,e)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The sound of trumpets blaring in the distance echoes through the small canal. Some kind of event is happening above. Unfortunately you don't see any good place to climb out of the water to check it out. With the warm gazing sun above, you are fairly comfortable in the chilly water and continue rather merrily on your way. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22879}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22881}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22881}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (e,w)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{Dirt and mud floods the water and it feels like you're swimming through a large ditch instead of a canal. Every now and then you feel something slippery brush up against your leg and you hope it's not something dangerous. The canal continues in a straight eastern to western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22880}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22882}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22882}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (w,ne)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{This part of the canal has a fair amount of waste in its water. There is plenty of grass, mud, and other grit and grime floating around. As you look upwards you see no buildings. The part of town which the canal goes through must be fairly empty of people. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22881}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22883}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22883}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (sw,e)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The cold water feels very nice on this warm summer day. As you're swimming in the canal, you occasionally come across some people who are pointing at you and laughing from above. It's mostly children, but every once in a while an adult or worse, a guard sees you. Still, no one has actively tried to get you out of here but it's probably only a matter of time. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22882}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22884}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22884}{0}{<238>}{Under a stone bridge (u,e,w)}{<238>===<088>}{You're swimming directly underneath a small stone bridge. This appears to be a fairly active part of town. The loud sound of people's feet on the stone streets is enough to give you a headache. There are several iron rings mounted in the northern canal wall that would allow you to climb out should you want to.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22883}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
