R {22885}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (w,se)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The noise of the city reverberates from above down to the canal. Every now and then you overhear parts of conversation and it's rather surprising that you can hear them from here. The canal continues in a western to southeastern direction.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22884}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22886}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22886}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (nw,e)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{This part of the canal is fairly narrow. With tall stony walls on the northeastern and southwestern sides, you feel fairly small bobbing up and down in the cool water. You hear city noise coming from high above you, but you don't see anyone at all. This part of the city must be less inhabited than some of the others that you've encountered while swimming. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22885}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22887}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22887}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (e,w)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{You're passing through a part of the canal which seems rather empty. Whatever buildings lie above on the ground level must not attract many people. Only a few staring eyes and pointed fingers meet you as you swim on. The canal itself continues in an eastern to western direction. Every now and then you feel something tugging on your feet and for a moment you conjure up images of gigantic sea monsters chewing on fleshy bones. As you quickly come to your senses, you assume the tugging must be the under current of the water getting sucked somewhere else. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22886}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22888}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {22888}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a canal (w,se)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The canal continues in a western to southeastern direction. In the warm summer weather the temperature of the water is rather comfortable. You'd be comfortable floating here in the dirty water if it weren't for those people staring down from the walls and pointing fingers. The stone walls surrounding this part of the canal are completely barren so climbing out at this location would be out of the question. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22887}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {5897}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

