R {22907}{0}{<238>}{In an armory. (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The inside of the tent is hazy and very warm. The sun has been blazing down on it most of the day and the combined with people running in and out of the tent make it almost unbearable. Loud sounds are coming from the outside and you get the distinct feeling that there are many more waiting for their turn. The tent itself is sparsely decorated. A wooden desk with a small stool stands in the center and several weapon racks as well as chests with other miscellaneous equipment have been placed along the sides of the tent. }{Encampment}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
