R {22917}{0}{<238>}{A trail. (w)}{<238>. .<088>}{You find yourself at the beginning of an overgrown path that begins at the town wall of Angelo.  The path is quite narrow, allowing just enough room to pass through the thick trees and shrubbery.  The cobblestones of Angelo have ended, being buried by time by layers of dirt.  Looking up and towards the southwest, you see what appears to be a set of run down stone towers.  The path continues to the west, or you can climb back over the wall to the safety of Angelo. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
