R {22921}{0}{<238>}{Path leading to Tower (s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{Taking the south fork of the path, it leads towards a twin-towered structure.  Up ahead you see a large figure standing in the shadows. The forest leading down the trail is still quite thick.  The branches grow over the trail blocking out almost all sunlight.  The trail leading towards this structure has an eerie sense of evil about it. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
