R {22922}{0}{<228>}{A clearing (e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You've entered a small clearing in the dense forest.  The clearing is round shaped and the dirt has been packed hard.  The forest trees that surround the clearing are extremely dense allowing little or no light to pass through them.  Above the trees to the southwest you see the towers of what appears to be castle ruins.  The forest trail leads back to the east. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
