R {22923}{0}{<238>}{A trail (enter,n)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You stand at the entrance to a mammoth tower.  At the entrance to the tower is a large portcullis.  The tower gate is generally manned.  A large plaque is mounted on the side of the portcullis.  Next to the plaque is some kind of mechanism.  The trail leads back north into the forest. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
