R {22924}{0}{<238>}{Castle Perplexus (exit,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{Stepping into Castle Perplexus, you find that the inside resembles nothing like what the rundown outside finish portrays.  The floor is made of closely fitted marble stones, and the stone walls are polished and dusted.  Torch stands extend south down the castle corridor and the sounds of metal clanking against stone can be heard echoing off the walls. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
