R {22925}{0}{<238>}{Castle Perplexus (e,s,n,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{The corridors intersect within this section of the castle.  Torchlight reflects ominously off the stone walls and the sharp echoes can be heard from every section of the castle.  The north corridor leads to the castle entrance, while the south appears to lead into the main heart of the castle.  The east and west corridors lead towards the castle towers.  }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
