R {22926}{0}{<238>}{Castle Perplexus (w,se)}{<238>] [<088>}{The corridor widens slightly as you enter what appears to be a trophy showcase.  Within the room are a number of paintings and sculptures depicting acts of battle.  Various other pieces of artwork sit on marble stands.  Within each corner of the rooms sits a torch giving low, but adequate lighting to the room.  Across the floor is a large woven rug with the depiction of a giant.  The hallway leads west towards the heart of the castle, and also branches southeast towards the castle tower. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
