R {22937}{0}{<238>}{Castle Perplexus (w)}{<238>] [<088>}{Entering the alcove you find yourself in the main barracks for the castle guards.  Rows upon rows of neatly made up bunk beds line the room.  Each one has a footlocker sitting at the end of it.  There are no doors or windows to the room, and it appears to be used for the most basic of living quarters. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
