R {22938}{0}{<138>}{Castle Perplexus (e,n)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{Entering the main throne room, you find it brightly lit from a chandelier above.  A large throne is the focus of the room, sitting against the south wall.  The violet carpet leads from the northern room up to the base of the throne.  An ominous looking iron door is to the west.  The door is quite solid but has a small grate in order to look inside.  There is also a doorway leading to the east. }{Angelo}{wzeliven}{}{}{1.000}{1}
