R {22939}{0}{<238>}{Castle Perplexus (e)}{<238>] [<088>}{Glancing around the room you have entered a small servants' alcove. Stacks of hay are arranged throughout the room where the servants sleep.  The north wall makes up a pseudo kitchen where the servants prepare meals for the castle's inhabitants.  The room is dimly lit with a single torch, and has only one exit back out into the main hall. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
