R {22940}{0}{<238>}{Castle Perplexus (w)}{<238>] [<088>}{Entering this small alcove, it appears to be setup as a royal bedroom. A large bed sits in the middle of the room covered in silk sheets.  A large desk is up against the wall with what appears to be some kind of journal on it.  In each corner of the room is a torch stand providing good lighting to the room.  A west doorway leads back into the throne room. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
