R {22941}{0}{<238>}{Mountain trail (n,se)}{<238>. .<088>}{The thick shrubbery is quite difficult to traverse through along this long overgrown trail.  The trees of the forest are so thick that it's almost impossible to tell which direction the trail leads in.  Just through a small gap to the southeast, a small opening can be detected and the ancient trail also appears to continue to the north. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
