R {22942}{0}{<238>}{Mountain trail (s,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{The thick brush makes it almost impossible to traverse along this trail.  The long forgotten path has been overgrown by the mountain forest.  A cold breeze blows from the north, probably whipping down a nearby mountain.  An occasional glimpse of a snow capped peak can be seen through the forest canopy as it shifts in the wind.  The trail appears to exit to some rocky ground just to the northwest while a brave soul could venture deeper into the woods to the south. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
