R {22943}{0}{<238>}{Base of Mountain (se)}{<238>.^.<088>}{Emerging from the dark trail you find yourself at the base of a tall mountain.  A brisk wind howls down the face of the mountain.  Eerily, it seems to be speaking a warning of danger.  Stones and pebbles fall from the cliff side and lie scattered about ground.  To the south of you lies the safety of the great western forest. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
