R {22966}{0}{}{Mountain Cliff (ne,sw,w,n)}{ }{The wind gusts from the north nearly blowing you off the cliff.  The cold dirt below your feet is packed hard.  Any loose gravel that does exist gets blown over the edge of the cliff.  The top of Mount Perplexus appears to have a forest valley within it.  The forest sits between two huge mountain peaks and extends as far north as you can see.  To the north you barely see an opening to a forest.   }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
