R {23186}{0}{}{Foothills (ne,e,s)}{ }{Not having the forest to slow it down, the wind whips through these foothills at a frightening rate.  You stand at the edge of the forest reaching the foothills of the western peak of Mount Perplexus.  The western peak rises as high as you can see above you.  You stand in a small section of dirt and rock between the forest and the western peak.  To the south you just barely see that the foothills continues, while to the east you see an opening to a forest.   }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
