R {23187}{0}{<248>}{Foothills (ne,e,s,sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{The rocky ground is difficult to travel.  Boulders and drifts of dirt are everywhere between the forest edge and the mountain peak.  The western peak of Mount Perplexus rises high into the sky above you.  An occasional bit of dirt and debris fall from the peak above as the wind blows away loose sections of the mountain.  To the northeast you barely detect that the foothills continues, while to the south you sense an opening to a forest.  Several trees have fallen, and gathered at the base of the mountain. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
