R {23288}{0}{}{a dark cave (n)}{ }{You've entered the great treasure chamber of the dragon Mamakin!  Hoards of gold, too numerous to carry is stacked within the room.  The treasure is so thick you cannot even see the dirt walls.  Within the center of the room is a great hole which appears to lead into a southern tunnel.  A large archway north leads back into the main caves. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23284}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23289}{0}{<278>}{A Lovely Fountain (pathway)}{<278>( )<088>}{A huge circle of stone lies directly in front of you.  Stretching twenty-five feet across at the center, this magnificent structure is made from beautifully polished granite.  Each block looks to have been carved by hand and set seamlessly into place.  Large slabs of marble have been placed along the edge of the pool to provide a place to sit and admire the surroundings or perhaps dangle your feet into the cool water.  In the center of this huge pool stands a towering white marble statue of the most stunningly beautiful woman you have ever seen.  Crystal clear water trickles slowly from the maiden's eyes and hands, pattering gently to the pool below. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
