R {23291}{0}{<228>}{A clearing by a hill (ne,e,w,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{The forest ends abruptly at the edge of this clearing. The trees push up against the soft grass, but seem to be held back by some unseen barrier. Not even a stray leaf has fallen on the wildflower-speckled glade, which rises up to a small hill to the northeast. Sad strains of music can also be heard from that direction. A slight break in the trees to the west suggests a path. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
