R {23293}{0}{<228>}{A clearing by a hill (e,n,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{The southern side of this clearing is dominated by a ghostly merry-go-round, spinning silently. The trees cluster futilely against the greensward, never crossing the forest edge. Blue wildflowers are predominant here. The glade rises sharply in the north to a small hill. A ceaseless tune drifts across the grass, lonely and sad. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
