R {23294}{0}{<228>}{A clearing by a hill (e,n,s)}{<228>` ^<088>}{The clearing continues to the north and south. To the east, the ground slopes gently upwards to a cliff edge overlooking the forest. Soft, sad music drifts over the hill. To the west, the impenetrable trees cluster against the edge of the grassy glade. There are only a few wildflowers here. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
