R {23297}{0}{<228>}{A hilltop in the forest (w)}{<228>( *<088>}{The bare rock of the hilltop thrusts against the boundary of the forest. The edge of the cliff pushes up against the middle of the closest trees. Sad notes swirl up from the forest below. To the west, the hill descends at a steady pace to the grassy glade again. A jumbled, impassable rocky slope falls off to the north and south. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23292}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23298}{0}{<228>}{A clearing by a hill (e,s,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Here, the forest borders the clearing closely on the north, trees competing for space near the bench. A somewhat steep but passable slope leads up a hill to the south, and to the southeast, the hill turns into a rocky cliff. Wildflowers are scattered thickly across the green grass. The omnipresent music seems somehow nostalgic here. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
