R {23299}{0}{<228>}{A clearing (w)}{<228>, .<088>}{The clearing to the north of the rocky hill seems particularly vibrant, the grass greener and the flowers fresher than the rest of the grassy glade. Even the dense forest seems somewhat less forbidding here. A ceaseless tune drifts out of the wood and around the glade. To the south, a rocky slope juts up from the greenery to the hill above. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
