R {23303}{0}{<238>}{Mountain Path (w,n)}{<238>.^.<088>}{As you trudge along the mountain path, you feel the warm sun of a cheerful day.  But despite the seeming brightness, there is something amiss about it all.  You feel as if you do not belong.  In the distant valley below you can see the buildings of a town. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
