R {23306}{0}{<278>}{On the Road to Harfain (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The glaring sunlight makes your eyes water.  You can feel only the lightest of breezes in the air.  Not far from here, to the east, you can hear the excited banter of Harfain's marketplace.  West of here you can see that the road continues off into the forest, and to the south you see a small mountain. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
