R {23311}{0}{<278>}{On the Road to Harfain (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{Something about the dryness in the air makes you uneasy and it seems stronger traveling west than east.  The deep grooves in the road continue on, the same as the rest of the old road.  The forest seems to press in close to the road here. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
