R {23312}{0}{<278>}{On the Road to Harfain (e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road comes to an abrupt halt, The forest and all the land seems to come to an end here, a vast expanse of nothingness continues past the jagged, broken cliff of reality.  Deeply worn paths in the stones at your feet tell the tale of a bustling trade coming and going from the town far east of here as if everything were quite ordinary.  The road once continued east and west. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
