R {23313}{0}{<278>}{Harfain Town (n,s,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{Just within the gates of the town, you notice the sheriff's office to the south, and a small inn to your north.  Dozens of small booths and shops are scattered around this section of town.  Directly in the center of the square, which lies to your east, stands a statue.  People brush by you in their haste to see the newest wares on the market. The gate to the town stands open to your west. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
