R {23332}{0}{<278>}{Gaevano Street (s,w,n)}{<278>-+ <088>}{The sun continues to harass you needlessly as you continue down the road.  You see now that there is a specialty shop to the west, a curio shop of some kind.  Strange sounds originate from within.  To the east, you see the side of a small church.  Just south of here you can see a bend in the road to the east. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
