R {23334}{0}{<278>}{South Gaevano Street (n,e)}{<278> +-<088>}{You can see the church better from here, but the entrance seems to be on the east end of Gaevano Street.  A few young children are playing a game with some small colored stones and paint-speckled rocks here.  Some residences are scattered around this bend in the road near the church.  To the north you see a few shops and far to the north, the busy marketplace. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
