R {23335}{0}{<238>}{Harfain Curio Shop (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Long counters extend along the walls with shelves going up the walls. The air seems kind of dry and dusty in here, charged with an unidentifiable energy.  Some old tomes line one of the bookshelves, and there is a sign on one of the counters. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
