R {23370}{0}{<278>}{North Forest Road (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The air has a bleak feel to it here. Something feels wrong. The forest cowers close to the road forming almost a canopy over head. You hear your own breath catch in your throat wondering what it could be. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
