R {23381}{0}{<238>}{Vermin's Potion Emporium (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is Vermin's Potion Emporium.  Strange liquids burble in large cauldrons behind the shop counter.  The air is full of strange smells. You are compelled to look at what the proprietor has to offer.  In the crystal case she has fitted into her counter, you can see a few flasks which are labeled.  Just type <list> to see what's there. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
