R {23423}{0}{}{Natural tunnel (s,n)}{ }{Rock formations form a natural tunnel, widening a bit towards your south. The tunnel is about 13 feet wide and ten feet tall here. North of you the tunnel narrows in and lightens up. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
