R {23424}{0}{}{Natural tunnel (s,n)}{ }{You are in a wide underground tunnel with rough walls. Several stalagmites and stalactites line the wall. Some of the stalactites have a drop of water at their tip, and you hear the sound of water dripping. To the north you can see light and while the tunnel is dark towards the south, you think you can hear the sound of water running. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
