R {23425}{0}{}{Natural tunnel (e,n)}{ }{A small but rapid river makes traversing this part of the tunnel a wet and straining task. The tunnel is filled with stalagmites, stalactites, and columns. The latter seem to be the ones holding up the low ceiling of the tunnel. You hear a splashing sound to the east. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23424}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
