R {23443}{0}{}{An Unspoiled Tomb (e)}{ }{   This room is small, about the size of a small closet and is unadorned except for a gnome-sized casket made of stone that stands upright at the back of the room. }{Explorer's Tomb}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23442}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23444}{0}{}{An Unspoiled Tomb (e,s)}{B}{The west wall of this chamber is decorated by a raised carving of a wheel of chance.  The wheel is separated into six equal sections and a sigil is carved into each one.  Snatches of color flit about at the edges of your vision and somehow give the dark corner the feel of a carnival.  The center of the chamber is dominated by a large pillar which is itself surrounded by a carving of a serpentine dragon. }{Explorer's Tomb}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
