R {23541}{0}{<228>}{Forest Outside the Tower (n,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{You move your way further along the clearing around the west side of the tower.  The ground is covered with twisting weeds that have invaded the clear space around the tower.  Dense clumps of sumac trees also grow up close to the walls of the tower.  The trees on the edge of the forest reach high into the sky, casting the same eerie shadows you saw on the main path.  You hear on ominous, low growling coming from the larger trees at the edge of the forest. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
