R {23542}{0}{<228>}{Forest Outside the Tower (s,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{You are on the western side of the tower.  The forest doesn't appear to be as thick here.  The ground is covered with twisting weeds that have invaded the clear space around the tower.  You notice a few wild flowers attempting to break the choke hold of the weeds.  The trees on the edge of the forest reach high into the sky, casting the same eerie shadows you saw on the rest of the path. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
