R {23543}{0}{<228>}{Forest Outside the Tower (s)}{<228>( *<088>}{In front of you is a stream that meanders from the north, flows past the tower to the southwest, and disappears back into the forest.  The forest is thin here and the weeds and underbrush grow up to the bank of the stream.  There is a weathered wooden bench next to the stream.  The wall of the tower curves further around to the north. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
