R {23544}{0}{<108>}{A Charred Landscape}{<108>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the middle of a barren, charred landscape.  The ground is made up of ashen dirt, charcoal gray in color.  There is a hot breeze about you, steadily blowing your hair back.  The sky is full of swirling clouds and is reddish orange in color.  There is a dry heat enveloping you, stifling your breathing. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
