R {23551}{0}{<238>}{Courtyard (sw)}{<238>] [<088>}{You step out into what once may have been a grand courtyard, but is now overgrown with vegetation.  To your left is the wall of the tower. On your right, there is a stone wall that rises up twenty feet or so.  There is no ceiling and the whole courtyard is open to the sky.  You see several alcoves where statues may once have stood, but they are empty now. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
