R {23553}{0}{}{Third Floor Landing (s,d)}{ }{The spiral staircase terminates here at a small landing.  The stone landing is damp, dark, and chilly.  You feel a slight draft blowing up through the center of the circular stairwell.  There are no decorations or furniture here at the top except for a lone torch, providing you with dim, magical light.  There is an opening in the south wall allowing you passage in that direction. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
