R {23609}{0}{<238>}{Cliff Edge (e)}{A}{The path seems to have come to an end here.  To your south is the edge of the cliff, dropping down at least one hundred feet.  The rest of the area around you is thick, congested forest.  You see no way to continue onward from here. }{Alizarian Forest}{alizarian_rune2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
