R {23610}{0}{}{The Booknook Attic (d)}{ }{Wooden floorboards stretch out around you until they reach the cream-colored walls that rise toward the attic's vaulted ceiling.  Bookshelves line the walls, crammed with volumes of literature of every sort.  Low slung chairs are spaced around the room for readers or listeners to sit and relax as they lose themselves in a good story. A large rocking chair sits in the middle of the room and in that chair sits a smiling old man. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {21390}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23698}{ask}{ask}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23611}{0}{}{The Arena (nw,ne,sw,n,se)}{<138>S<088>}{You find yourself standing in the center of a gigantic arena.  The  hard packed sand beneath your feet is stained dark in places with  blood.  Five giant stone arches break the thousands of seats about  the arena.  The galleries are now empty in the twilight, but  perhaps in the morning they'll fill with spectators for some  grisly spectacle.  Somewhere in the back of your mind you remember  that it's only a game though...and you can just stand up and walk away. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
