R {23641}{0}{}{The Pendelhaven Entry Hall (door,out,stairs)}{<238>S<088>}{You stand in a tiny room.  Two stout wooden doors lead from the room, both are open.  The walls slant slightly inward, arching  ever so slightly towards the wooden ceiling.  The entire room  has been carved out of the interior of a great oak tree, the air is perfumed with the sap glazing the walls.  A small stair has been carved into the curve of the wall and leads upwards into the tree. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
