R {23642}{0}{}{A side room in Pendelhaven (door)}{ }{You find yourself in a small side room.  A small table ringed by three stools and a cot are the room's only furnishings.  Most likely this is just a ready room for the guards of the main hall\; a place where they can take a break when they're not needed.  The walls here are glazed with sap like those outside, reminding you that you're inside a giant oak tree. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23641}{door}{door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23641}{w}{door}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23643}{0}{}{In the trunk of Pendelhaven (stairs,d)}{<238>S<088>}{You stand on a wide landing as the stairs wind up the inside of the tree.  The floor is smooth but showing signs that it might sprout soon like the ceiling one floor below.  The odor of sap is strong here as it runs down the walls, giving them their amber sheen.  Above you dance the faerie lights, bobbing between the broad fanning leaves of the shoots reaching down from the ceiling. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
