R {23644}{0}{}{In the trunk of Pendelhaven (e,stairs,d)}{<238>S<088>}{The landing at this stage of the tree trunk opens out through a knothole onto one of the lower branches of the tree.  A gentle breeze blows in through the opening, sending the faerie lights dancing about the room in a dizzying display.  The stairs continue to wind upwards into the tree's heights. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23643}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23645}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
