E {23646}{u}{stairs}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23645}{0}{}{Out on a limb (w)}{ }{You stand out on one of the lower limbs of the great tree haven. Leaves drape down about you from above, shading you from the sun or anyone trying to catch a glimpse of this secluded place.  The top of the branch has been flattened to create a type of landing strip for faerie flying in from other parts of the forest.  A small knothole provides access to the interior of the tree. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23644}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23646}{0}{}{Before the faerie court (e,n,d,w)}{<238>S<088>}{The long winding stair leading up from the base of the tree stops here.  The chamber you stand in is a large domed affair, with the stairs winding down along the south wall and massive double doors set in the north wall.  Two tunnels lead upwards into the tree on either side of the chamber, but they don't appear to have any method of climbing them. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23644}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23647}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
