R {23647}{0}{<238>}{In an ascending tunnel (se,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{You hang in a steeply slanted tunnel of the tree home.  It runs from the landing before the faerie court up into the higher levels of the mystical tree.  There is no floor or ceiling as such, since the passage is nearly perfectly round.  The normally smooth walls found in the rest of the tree are rougher here, providing hand holds for the faerie-kin as they wing their way up to the levels above. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23646}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23654}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23648}{0}{<138>}{The council chambers (s)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{You find yourself in the council chamber of the faerie kingdom, where the nobles of the forest meet to govern their own kind. A long oval table runs down the center of the room surrounded by stools which have grown up from the floor of the tree itself. Faerie lights dance and bob in the air on an unfelt air current, casting shadows about the room. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23646}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

