R {23650}{0}{<238>}{In an ascending tunnel (nw,sw,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{The passage snakes around a little here, leading upward and outward as if along one of the great tree's branches.  It is still steep enough here that if you weren't flying you'd be sliding back down the long passage to the floors below.  For some odd reason, someone has placed a door here which leads off towards the southwest. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23649}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23651}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23652}{sw}{unlock door; open door; sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23651}{0}{<238>}{In an ascending tunnel (w,se)}{<238>] [<088>}{The tunnel, which you're fairly sure is the hollow inside of a tree branch at this point, bends again as it winds upwards into the tree. Below you the passage winds its way out of sight while above you it seems to come to an end. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23650}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23653}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23652}{0}{<238>}{A tiny library (ne)}{<238>"""<088>}{You have found the library of the faerie kingdom.  The walls of this chamber are honeycombed from floor to ceiling, providing hundreds of cubby holes for scrolls of every shape and size.  A single desk sits in the center of the room with a single chair, the only thing in the room besides parchment.  Whispy faerie lights bob in the air to illuminate the room without the risk of fire to all these precious documents. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23650}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23653}{0}{<238>}{An airy patio (e)}{<238>|||<088>}{The tunnel winding up the interior of the tree ends here in a level hollow of a branch.  The walls here have been coaxed to grow a  spectacular combination of knotholes and translucent bark.  The entire effect is of a peaceful gazebo in the upper branches of the tree.  The leaves of the surrounding branches shade most of the room from direct sunlight, but allow enough through to illuminate the chamber without the need for faerie lights.  The knotholes that have been opened to the outside let a pleasant breeze in.  You could spend hours here in pleasant relaxation. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23651}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23654}{0}{<238>}{In an ascending tunnel (s,nw)}{<238>] [<088>}{The tunnel winds around in a serpentine manner, but always reaches upwards, as much vertical as horizontal if not moreso.  Above you the passage appears to come to an abrupt end.  Unlike the rest of the tree, these winding branches seem to be personal chambers, used by the faerie-kin court and the residents of Pendelhaven for whiling away their leisure time. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23647}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23655}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23655}{0}{<238>}{The end of a tunnel (se,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{You've come to the end of the winding tunnel.  The passage simply closes together into a domed cap.  A door is set into the wall, but besides the door, there isn't anything to distinguish this section of tunnel from any others.  Amazing how the wood grain, so unique when a piece of furniture among other surroundings now appears simply ordinary when the distinguishing feature of your surroundings. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23654}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23656}{se}{open door;se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23656}{0}{<268>}{A small chapel (nw)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You stand in a small chapel within Pendelhaven.  The room is barely twice your height across and only half again your height from floor to ceiling.  No windows break the walls and only three small faerie lights hang in the air near the apex of the ceiling to illuminate the room.  A small altar has been grown from one wall which has a wreath of holly upon it and a sprig of mistletoe. }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23655}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23657}{0}{<228>}{A forested island (e,s,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{ The sea laps gently at the shores of the small island.  You stare   intently out over its aquamarine surface, watching the flying fish   leap from the waves.  The towering trees inland cast their shadows   even to the water's edge, now backlighted by the setting sun.  }{Magic The Gathering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
