R {23700}{0}{<228>}{Florin Countryside (se,n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You're travelling on a dusty path in the middle of a peaceful countryside meadow. The sun shines down on this lovely patch of land covered in lush grass and smelling of fragrant flowers. You hear the sound of birds chirping in the distance and you marvel at the simple beauty of this place. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
