R {23701}{0}{<228>}{Florin Countryside (s,nw)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're close to the city now and you see a wooden bridge spanning a small stream before you. On the other side of the bridge lies the towering stone wall that surrounds Florin City. The great city rises up to greet you over the wall and you see that the gates within the wall are open to travelers. Perhaps you'd like to visit for awhile? }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
