R {23702}{0}{<238>}{Florin City Gate (s,n)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The city wall towers over your head here within the gate. The road inside is paved in smooth brown stones and looking to your left, you notice a guard post that stands just inside an alcove. This is where the Prince can post a guard to protect the citizens of the city. Between you and the city itself lies a small courtyard boasting a group of beautiful maple trees and the road passes directly underneath their high reaching boughs. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
