R {23703}{0}{<178>}{Florin City Courtyard (sw,n)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{This courtyard is shaded from the afternoon sun by the overhanging boughs of the tall maple trees circled around you. The road into the city cuts directly through the center of this circle of trees and passes into the streets beyond. The trees tower above you and you get the feeling that they have been here a very long time. Be assured, you are not the first, nor the last, to enter this historic city. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
