R {23723}{0}{<228>}{Thieves Forest (e,w,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{You're standing at the entrance to Thieves Forest. This wilderness is within the limits of Florin's city wall, yet renown for its unkempt nature and ruthless inhabitants. Towering oaks and maples rise into the sky around you, while the bridge back to safety lies to the east. You can wander deeper into the forest to the west and south if you like, but you do so at your own risk. The thieves that dwell here don't take kindly to visitors. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
