R {23724}{0}{<268>}{Florin Cathedral (w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You have entered the glorious Florin Cathedral. Lit by hundreds of cream colored candles held in ornate copper candelabra, you stand in awe of the religious power and beauty of this place. Wooden pews are lined from the back of the church up to the front where a raised altar stands beneath a massive stained glass window. To one side of the altar is a huge organ with pipes reaching all the way to the steepled ceiling high above. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
