R {23725}{0}{<228>}{Thieves Forest (e,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{You're within Thieves Forest, surrounded by trees in every direction. Majestic maples and oaks reach skyward, towering above you. Thick weeds grow from the fertile ground and bushes are scattered everywhere. An open rain shelter stands here, or at least that's what it looks like. It really isn't anything more than some sticks holding up a thatched roof. It probably is used as a home by one of the forest's residents. The wilderness to the west is too thick for you to explore, but the forest continues to the south and east. Your way north is blocked by the city wall. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
