R {23736}{0}{<228>}{Florin Woods (nw)}{<228>( *<088>}{You're on a dusty path leading through Florin Woods. It looks like you've come to the end of how far you can travel along this path. Before you lies a huge oak that has fallen across the way, blocking anyone from going further into the woods. The only direction you can walk is back towards Florin City. Tall oaks, elms, pines and birches crowd around you, their branches stretching overhead and their leaves shading the path from the warm spring sunshine. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
