R {23737}{0}{<238>}{Florin Dock (ne)}{<238>|||<088>}{You've come to the very edge of Florin Woods. To the west lies the Sea of Florin which reaches all the way to the Cliffs of Insanity. The dock is made up of a long wooden platform from which several ships are moored while not in use. The water looks cold and murky, definitely not a good place to swim. Rumor has it some very nasty things are known to live in the depths of this sea. The path back into the woods lies to the northeast. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
