R {23738}{0}{<248>}{Lotharon's Sitting Room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You've entered the sitting room. This plushly furnished room is where Lotharon's guests typically await his presence. It contains several high-backed arm chairs covered in soft blue velvet, dainty cherrywood end tables alongside each chair and a beautiful rug spread out over the middle of the floor. The brown flagstones of the floor can be seen past the edges of the rug and the walls are decorated with hanging murals depicting scenes of glory from Florin's past. A stone archway leads out of this room back to the entrance of the castle to the north. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
