R {23739}{0}{<268>}{Lotharon's Castle Corridor (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You're walking along the main corridor within King Lotharon's Castle. The way back outside to the entrance is to the east, while the corridor continues deeper into the castle to the west. A red carpet lies beneath your feet. It leads straight down the corridor, covering most of the flagstones that make up the floor. The walls are made of cold brown stone and sconces are placed along them that hold torches to light your way. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
