E {23744}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23742}{0}{<238>}{Lotharon's Castle Corridor (w,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{This is the southern corridor on Lotharon Castle's ground floor. The Great Hall lies to the north while the corridor also turns toward the west. Rich red carpet lies under your feet, covering the cold brown flagstones beneath. The stone walls are hung with blue banners celebrating the rule of Lotharon and every six feet is a wall mounted sconce containing a lit torch to help light the way of visitors and castle residents alike. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23741}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23745}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23743}{0}{<238>}{Lotharon's Dining Room (s,w,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{This grand dining room has hosted many of the realm's most renown guests. The room is dominated by a long mahogany table that almost stretches the entire length of the room. Sitting around the table are dozens of velvet clothed chairs. A blue velvet runner decorates the top of the table along with a magnificent centerpiece of crystal and gold. The stone walls are ornamented with hangings of red and gold and overhead is a chandelier so grandiose in design it nearly takes your breath away. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23741}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23747}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23749}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23744}{0}{<238>}{Lotharon's Throne Room (e,s,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{This is the throne room of King Lotharon. The very heart of the castle, this is where the king makes all of his big decisions. These days he may not be quite the powerful leader he once was, nevertheless, this room holds a certain awe. The walls are covered in banners of red and blue, the floor is brown flagstone, and a red carpet leads from each of the doorways towards the throne itself. The throne sits on the west side of the room. Magnificently crafted from silver and trimmed in rubies and fur, it looks like it must weigh a ton and cost its weight in gold. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23741}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23745}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23747}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23745}{0}{<238>}{Lotharon's Castle Corridor (u,e,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{This corridor runs along the southern side of Lotharon's Castle. It continues further to the east. To the north stands a pair of open doors leading into the King's throne room and to the west is a staircase leading up to the second floor of the castle. The walls are lined with iron sconces that light the way and the floor is carpeted in red velvet. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23742}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23746}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
