R {23746}{0}{}{Lotharon's Castle Balcony (u,d,w,n)}{ }{This is the balcony overlooking the ground floor of the castle. Stairs lead back down in that direction as well as higher up into the castle's south tower. A door stands to the west while the balcony continues off to the north. The balcony is carpeted in red velvet to cushion the stone floor beneath. Along the walls are lit sconces and portraits of the royal family's ancestors hung in gold frames. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23745}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23753}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
