R {23748}{0}{<238>}{Lotharon's Castle Courtyard (w,se)}{<238>] [<088>}{The courtyard behind the castle is landscaped in vibrant red and blue flowers in beds of rich brown soil. The grass is soft beneath your feet and bright green in color. Ivy grows up the stone walls of the castle and the door leading back inside stands to the southeast. Further west you can see the stables where Lotharon keeps his wonderful collection of horses. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23747}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23751}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23749}{0}{<248>}{Lotharon's Kitchen (s,d)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{This kitchen is where all of the Royal Family's meals are prepared. Sparkling clean steel topped counters and finely crafted mahogany cabinets line the walls. A huge iron oven sits on the north end of the room and a large icebox sits to the west. A rack of knives and utensils hangs beside the oven and a steel sink sits in the counter near the icebox. Pots and pans hang from hooks set in the ceiling and a staircase leading downwards is off to the east. A wonderful aroma seems to emanate from the oven. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23743}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23750}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23750}{0}{}{Lotharon's Wine Cellar (u)}{ }{This well stocked wine cellar holds hundreds of bottles of wine. All four walls are lined floor to ceiling with row after row of glass bottles. It's very dry down here and a little cooler than it is up above. The castle's chef is charged with maintaining this room and ensuring the wine collection is in pristine condition. This collection is worth a small fortune. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23749}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23751}{0}{<238>}{Lotharon's Stables (w,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{These are the royal stables. Quiet for the time being, they are often full of beautiful horses, thoroughbreds of the finest heritage. Several wooden doors stand open to empty stalls. Inside each is fresh hay lying in wait for the horses return. Bridles and bits hang on metal hooks between the doors and sunlight filters in from either end of the open barn. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23748}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23752}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23752}{0}{<238>}{Lotharon's Castle Courtyard (e)}{<238>] [<088>}{The beautiful gardens of the courtyard come to an end here. The forest that surrounds the western side of the castle encroaches onto the well-kept grounds. The lush grass grows right up to the edge of the trees. The trunks of the trees stand so close together in the forest that they provide natural protection from invaders. To the east stands the stables and the way back to Lotharon's Castle. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23751}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
