R {23758}{0}{}{Lotharon's Northern Tower (d,u)}{ }{Steep brown stone stairs lead both up to the top of the tower and back down into the castle hall. The stairs are wide and deep, made to accommodate troops of several men across in times of trouble. Along the plain stone walls are metal sconces, lit to provide a soft glow to light your way. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23757}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23760}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23759}{0}{}{Humperdinck's Bedroom (e)}{<128>H<088>}{This is the private retreat of the evil Prince Humperdinck. The walls are paneled in solid wood, the stone floor cleanly swept. Black chandeliers hang from the high ceiling, providing light for the room. A plain metal bed sits against the northern wall alongside a large dresser. The southern wall has a desk and chair in front of it while the center of the room contains a small table and two chairs with a wooden chess set atop the table. The western wall has two floor to ceiling windows on either side with a large stone fireplace in between. }{The Princess Bride}{humperdinck}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23757}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45240}{flip switch}{flip switch}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45240}{d}{flip switch}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23760}{0}{}{Lotharon's Northern Tower (d)}{ }{You stand atop the northern tower of Lotharon's Castle. The brown stone beneath your feet matches that of the parapets that encircle this perch high above the city below. Flags of red and blue flap in the breeze, hanging from a pole set in the center of the floor. The bright afternoon sun shines down upon the stone. The view from here shows off the city square of Florin. Citizens meander the streets, browsing the merchant's goods, completely unaware that an invader spies upon them from high above. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23758}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23761}{0}{}{Lotharon's Southern Tower (d)}{ }{You stand atop the southern tower of Lotharon's Castle. The brown stone beneath your feet matches that of the parapets that encircle this perch high above the forests below. Flags of red and blue flap in the breeze, hanging from a pole set in the center of the floor. The bright afternoon sun shines down upon the stone. The view from here is magnificent. The tree tops of the southern forest stretch out around you to the south and west. To the north and east you can see the roof of the castle itself. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23753}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23762}{0}{}{Florin Ship}{ }{You're standing aboard a ship. It sails from the relative safety of Florin to the dangerous Cliffs of Insanity. Whatever made you want to board this thing? }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {23763}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity}{<238>S<088>}{You're standing beneath the Cliffs of Insanity. Looking at them, you realize how they got their name. They reach so high into the sky you can't even see the top. There isn't a cloud in the sky, yet the top of the cliffs is so far above you, you lose them in a haze of distance. It would take a madman to attempt to climb them. Not to mention someone of incredible strength. The water just off the shore looks even murkier than that on the shore you came from. All in all, not such a pleasant place. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23764}{board}{board}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23765}{climb up}{climb up}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23766}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {52319}{dive into sea}{dive into sea}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23764}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity}{ }{You're standing aboard a ship. It sails from the dangerous Cliffs of Insanity to the much safer city of Florin. Might want to get going while the going is good! }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {23765}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {23766}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (u)}{ }{You're more than halfway up the rock face of the Cliffs of Insanity. The rope is burning your hands from the tightness of your grip and your muscles ache from the strain of climbing, but you can't stop now! There is no way to move back down, it's simply too steep and too dangerous. Your only option is to keep climbing towards the summit of the cliff. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23763}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23767}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23767}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (w)}{ }{You made it to the top of the cliff! God knows where you found the strength, but you're now standing miles above the Sea of Florin in the middle of the ruins of an old castle. Broken walls of gray stone stand around you. Ancient passages, windows, and archways can still be recognized in the remains of the once great keep. The bright blue sky is above you, the ceiling of the castle long blasted away. The floor is nothing more than sand and debris. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23766}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23768}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23768}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (nw,e)}{ }{The courtyard of the ruined castle is now nothing but overgrown weeds and piles of rubble. Once this courtyard held beautiful gardens, meandering paths of white stone, and lovely fruit trees, but that was all taken away during the battle that left this place in ruins so long ago. It looks like you can pick your way through the rubble to the east or head into the forested hills that lie to the northwest. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23767}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23769}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23769}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (se,nw)}{ }{These hills of lush grass and towering trees are absolutely beautiful. It's quiet here. The sounds of birds and forest creatures scampering about reaches your ears, but nothing that might be misconstrued as the sounds of civilization can be heard at all. It seems these lands were abandoned long ago, left to the wilderness. The green color of this place goes on for miles in every direction. The only break in the scenery is the blue of the sky above, and faint traces of gray rock in the hills to the northwest and broken stone to the southeast. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23768}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23770}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23770}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (se,w)}{ }{The hills are more rugged here than they are further to the southeast. Large outcroppings rise from the grass, their rock old and gray. Piles of stones lie around your feet where they've broken off and rolled to the ground. Just above you on the crest of these hills to the west there are several large oaks rising into the sky. A few clouds dot the otherwise perfect blue above them. Something resembling a dirt path leads up towards the crest and the trees, but I wouldn't be too quick to run up there. Who knows what might lie on the other side? }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23769}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23771}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23771}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (sw,e)}{ }{Here at the crest of the hills one can see for miles in every direction. Rolling hills of green grass and flourishing trees dot the landscape before you. Tall weeds grow amongst the grass here at the top, proliferating in the abundant sunlight. Oak trees tower into the sky, their branches laden with shiny fresh leaves, their trunks firmly rooted in the fertile soil underfoot. To the east the hills wander back down toward rockier ground while to the southwest, it looks like a clearing opens up before rising toward a hill almost as high as this one. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23770}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23772}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23772}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (ne,s)}{ }{This grassy clearing spreads out in every direction for almost 100 yards before disappearing back into the hills and trees that surround it. It's quiet here, almost as if the wilderness were waiting with bated breath for you to make a decision. Do you dare explore further? In the middle of the clearing lies a low pile of gray stone with a large tree branch beside it. A white linen cloth covers part of the largest of the stones. Rather unusual in the middle of nowhere wouldn't you think? }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23771}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23773}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23773}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (d,n)}{ }{The view from this hill is amazing. Mile upon mile of grasslands and hills stretch out below you. The ground underfoot is rocky, the grass less plentiful than further to the north. To the south is a steep drop into a weed infested ravine. The drop looks unpleasant, but not impossible. Fallen trees lie in various places amongst the rock, most likely hit by lightning at some point, now left forgotten in this wilderness to rot in the elements. It must be awful to die in such a lonely place with no one to note your passing. One might wish to consider this before heading down the slope to the ravine below. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23772}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23774}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23774}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (se)}{ }{The bottom of the ravine is choked with thick vegetation and scratchy weeds. The vegetation is so dense it can barely be maneuvered through. Up above the weeds are steep slopes of rock leading back up to the hilltops. They look much too steep to successfully climb. The ground beneath the weeds and flora is rather muddy, rainwater having collected over time due to a lack of proper irrigation. The mud sticks to your feet as you squelch in it. The mud looks like it gets even deeper to the southeast where the ravine continues towards a dark swamp. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23775}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23775}{0}{}{Cliffs of Insanity (nw,enter)}{<228>E<088>}{The ravine extends off to the northwest and comes to an abrupt end at the Fire Swamps to the immediate south. The mud underfoot is deep enough to cause difficulty in travel and the surrounding vegetation is scratchy and thick. Pollen drifts up from the weeds growing in the mud and nearly chokes you it's so abundant in the muggy air. The hills on either side of this ravine are steep and rocky, much too steep to climb. It seems there is little choice but to remain in this ravine until death takes you or to enter the swamp ahead and find your demise that much quicker. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23774}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23776}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23776}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (s,w,e)}{}{Trees as black as night tower into the darkness all around you. The swamp envelopes you completely in its murky embrace. The ground is wet, sloshing beneath your feet as you move about. Vines hang from the tree branches looming above in the gloom, draping themselves from tree to tree. Mushrooms and other fungi cling to the dark wood of the trees and sprout from the mud, their mottled appearance sickly and vaguely disturbing in the deepening twilight. Animalistic grunts echo through the foliage, accompanied by rustling noises as if some beast were hunting nearby. A thick wall of trees blocks your way to the north, but the swamp looks navigable to the east, west, and south. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23777}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23778}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23779}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23777}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The dreaded fire swamps surround you. Trees crowd around you on all sides, their branches hanging overhead and blocking your progress. The ground is soggy, the bogwater sloshing underfoot and sucking at your feet. Every step feels like it is too much to bear, the swamp silently insisting that you give up and turn back. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23776}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23783}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23786}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23781}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23778}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (sw,s,e)}{ }{You're actually exploring the dreaded fire swamps. Only the greatest of fools would venture into such a place of horror! Oh sorry...anyway you might want to be careful wandering around this place. Stories tell of all sorts of dangers lurking in the depths of this dank swamp. They say no one has survived to reach the other side. Will you? }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23776}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23780}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23781}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23779}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (se,s,w)}{ }{Your breathing seems loud in your ears as you move about the creepy fire swamps. It's said that no one that enters the swamps ever comes back out alive. Let's hope that's just a rumor since you're stuck here now. The trees crowd around you, blocking out the light. Vines drape the branches, hanging down across your path and making travel difficult. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23776}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23782}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23783}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23780}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (ne,s,e)}{ }{The swamp is dank and dark, the trees towering above you, the vines draped between them. The ground is damp with moisture, sucking at your feet with every step. The air is thick, heavy with humidity and filled with the acrid smell of sulfur. Spider webs cling to the foliage in places, hinting at spiders or other insects you'd rather not think about. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23778}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23781}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23788}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23781}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The dreaded fire swamps surround you. Trees crowd around you on all sides, their branches hanging overhead and blocking your progress. The ground is soggy, the bogwater sloshing underfoot and sucking at your feet. Every step feels like it is too much to bear, the swamp silently insisting that you give up and turn back. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23778}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23777}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23787}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23780}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23782}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (nw,s,w)}{ }{The sounds of birds in the trees and hunting swamp predators echo in the darkness. The uneven ground offers difficult footing and the moist soil sticks to your feet, making movement sluggish and rather odd. The trees of the swamp are tall and dark, towering into the sky overhead, their foliage thick, blocking out nearly all light. Vines hang from the trees, dangling before you, crossing your path and blocking your passage. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23779}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
