R {23783}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The oppressive damp heat of the swamp begins to wear on your senses, dulling your mind and slowing your step. The darkness makes everything around you seem as if it is blanketed in a hazy curtain of blackness. The trees tower above you, blocking the sunlight and holding in the moisture collected from recent rainfall. Vines hang from the trees, like nooses on the gallows, awaiting their next victim. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
