R {23784}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,w)}{ }{You're actually exploring the dreaded fire swamps. Only the greatest of fools would venture into such a place of horror! Oh sorry...anyway you might want to be careful wandering around this place. Stories tell of all sorts of dangers lurking in the depths of this dank swamp. They say no one has survived to reach the other side. Will you? }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
