R {23786}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,w,e)}{ }{Your breathing seems loud in your ears as you move about the creepy fire swamps. It's said that no one that enters the swamps ever comes back out alive. Let's hope that's just a rumor since you're stuck here now. The trees crowd around you, blocking out the light. Vines drape the branches, hanging down across your path and making travel difficult. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
