R {23788}{0}{<238>}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,e)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{A massive tree lies fallen across the swamp, felled no doubt by a lightning strike. It happened recently by the look of the tree, still fresh, its pulp yellow and moist where it is now exposed to the elements. The tree was at least fifty feet high and its fall has crushed a great deal of the surrounding vegetation. The nearby brush and weeds are torn and smashed into the muddy ground. The vines that hung from the tree are now tangled throughout the brush and are strewn all over the ground. The soil near the base of the fallen tree looks suspect, as if it might not be soil at all, but lightning sand, one of the most dangerous aspects of the Fire Swamps. It would be wise to avoid this threat at all costs. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
