R {23790}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,w,e)}{ }{While the swamps don't seem to be getting any more pleasant, you start to think they're really not that bad. You're not saying you'd build a summer home here, but all in all, they could be worse. The trees might be dark and twisted, but they do provide plenty of shade. The dirt is quite fertile and there certainly aren't many other people around to bother you. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
