R {23792}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The dank air of despair in this swamp is so pervasive it feels as if it is seeping into your very soul. The heavily leaf laden trees block out nearly any trace of sunlight from above and the damp soil sucks at your feet with every step. Vines twist and turn around the tree branches, clinging to the wood and draping themselves across your path. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
