R {23793}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (sw,n,w)}{ }{The swamp is dank and dark, the trees towering above you, the vines draped between them. The ground is damp with moisture, sucking at your feet with every step. The air is thick, heavy with humidity and filled with the acrid smell of sulfur. Spider webs cling to the foliage in places, hinting at spiders or other insects you'd rather not think about. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
