R {23795}{0}{}{The Fire Swamps (w,e,exit)}{<238>X<088>}{The darkness of the swamp is nearly overwhelming. Tree branches loom above you, creatures lurk in the gloom, waiting for your demise. Thick vines hang from the trees, looping their way from branch to branch, blocking your passage and hampering your progress. The ground is wet, the mud sucking at your feet, as if in an effort to pull you underground, buried alive. Yellow and orange lichen grows on the tree bark, thriving in the damp umbra of their shadow. The wind howls in between the trees, answered by the hum of unseen insects and the grunts of hungry predators. An almost concealed exit lies to the south, a small break in the wilderness towards what must be safer ground. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
