R {23797}{0}{}{A Hidden Beach (board,enter)}{<238>S<088>}{This secluded beach lies hidden beyond the southern end of the Fire Swamps. Unknown to virtually all citizens of Florin, it provides the perfect hideout for the Dread Pirate Roberts and his infamous ship, Revenge. The waters of Giant Eel Bay lap against the sandy shore and the sun shines brightly upon the ship itself, anchored just off the coastline. Gulls fly overhead, wheeling back and forth, screeching their persistent cries, while the dark menace of the swamp looms to the north. While stories say the Dread Pirate Roberts leaves no survivors, you've made it this far. You can board his ship if you feel up to the challenge. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23798}{board}{board}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23795}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23798}{0}{}{The Ship Revenge (disembark,fore)}{<238>D<088>}{The aft of the ship Revenge is swept clean of debris, the wood of the floor slick and spotless. Barrels are stacked along the very back of the ship and the mast is just ahead in the middle of the deck. The wood of the ship is dark, polished to a sheen that looks almost black. It would be very difficult to see this ship in night waters. The reputation of this vessel is renown, a ship captained by the fearsome Dread Pirate Roberts. It's said that he takes no survivors, killing all who cross his path on the open seas. Maybe you should leave before he finds you aboard his ship. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23797}{disembark}{disembark}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
