R {23799}{0}{}{The Ship Revenge (aft)}{<238>T<088>}{The fore of the ship Revenge is spotlessly clean. The ship's wheel stands in the middle of the deck, round and made of solid ebony. The secondary mast rises into the sky above the wheel, flying its billowing sail just above that of the main mast behind it. To the very front of the ship lies the bow, carved into the shape of a giant skull peering into the distance. It is little wonder this ship brings such fright to the local sailors. The skull-shaped bow is horrifying to behold and the massive guns lined along both sides of the fore deck look more than capable of blasting any ships to smithereens that the Revenge might come across while sailing the open seas. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
