R {23817}{0}{}{In the Living Room (w,n)}{ }{The living room is where Calvin's father chooses to spend his evenings' quiet repose.  The room is simple, with a couch, an easy chair, and an end table with a lamp.  To the west you can see into the kitchen, and north of here is the house's entryway. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
