R {23818}{0}{}{In the Kitchen (e,n)}{ }{The kitchen is home to the oft-raided cookie jar and the ever-lamented table at which the most foul of concoctions must be ingested for young Calvin's health. The room has a refrigerator, a sink and counter, and a window looking southward out of the house. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
