R {23819}{0}{}{A Second Floor Landing (e,d,s)}{ }{A set of plain, carpeted stairs travels from here down to the first floor.  A wooden banister, attached to the wall, runs the length of the stairs. From the landing, you can see the open door of what must be the master bedroom to the east and another, smaller bedroom to the south. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
