R {23820}{0}{}{Master Bedroom (w)}{ }{This room is perfectly clean. Calvin's father's exacting standards and Calvin's mother's cleanliness would allow nothing less. There is a bed against the east wall and dresser to the south. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23819}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23821}{0}{}{Calvin's Room (n)}{ }{This place is totally trashed.  Toys and games lie strewn across the floor: cardboard boxes, string, drawing materials, and clothes have been thrown everywhere.  The only neat little pile in the room is the apparently unused schoolbooks sitting in the corner. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
