E {23834}{ride bus}{ride bus}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23825}{0}{}{In the Entryway (e,w)}{ }{This is the main entry hall of a little elementary school.  Children bustle around fearing authority and bullies.  The walls are cold and hard taupe-colored ceramic bricks.  The lights are pale fluorescent bulbs mounted in the ceiling.  The whole place seems unfriendly. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
