E {23824}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23826}{0}{}{At a Hallway Intersection (w,n,s)}{ }{This is the main intersection of a little elementary school's halls. Westward is the school's main lobby. Running north and south here is the school's hallway.  The decor is sparse, and all that adorns the cold walls are some lockers reflecting the pale overhead lights. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23825}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
