R {23827}{0}{}{At a Classroom Door (e,n,s)}{ }{The hallway continues north and south, but there is a doorway on the east side of the hall here.  Your footsteps echo down the long corridor and you feel very confined in this school. The cold walls and dim pale light seem to wick the life from you. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
