R {23829}{0}{}{In a Classroom (w)}{ }{Miss Wormwood's classroom is a typical elementary school room. There is a blackboard, a big desk, a window, some desks, a big bulletin board, and some decorations to stimulate the children's minds.  To the west, a door goes out to the hallway. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23827}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23830}{0}{}{A Seemingly Endless Hallway (n,s)}{ }{This hallway seems to go on forever, stretching as far as you can see. Both sides are covered with lockers and the floor is glossy linoleum. The flickering fluorescent lights overhead provide a cold, pale look to the taupe glazed walls. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23827}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23830}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23831}{0}{}{In the Principal's Office (w)}{ }{The principal's office is very formal looking.  It seems he's tried to produce an intimidating aura by making it very sophisticated. The furniture is of good quality, and the pictures on the walls are matted and framed nicely. Harsh fluorescent light shines down on you. A door leads west into the hall. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23828}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23832}{0}{}{A Dim Hallway (n,s)}{ }{This hallway seems to go on forever, stretching as far as you can see. Both sides are covered with lockers and the floor is glossy linoleum. The light here is dimmer, some of the bulbs must be out.  It gives the cold school a sinister feel. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23828}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
