R {23834}{0}{}{Riding the Bus}{ }{The bus is a long tube of steel sheet filled with green vinyl benches big enough for two.  With each turn and gust of wind, the frame groans and creaks.  The windows are either stuck closed or open, and the floor is very sticky. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {23835}{0}{<248>}{The Medal Archives (w)}{}{You've entered a small, utilitarian room with plain walls.  In the far wall, a sizable window looks into a second room, filled with shelves of files.  At the bottom of the window is a counter on which a small man leans, watching you and waiting to see why you've come.  On the walls to your left and right are small sets of hanging shelves, and a framed poster hangs by the entrance.  The wooden floor is devoid of decoration other than a couple of simple chairs next to a small round table in one corner, and two potted plants.  Two torchieres provide ample lighting for the space, and a plaque above the counter reads 'MEDALS ARCHIVE'. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {68}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23836}{0}{}{Entrance Hall of Court World (n,w,e,leave,ideas,hall,observe}{<168>L<088>}{Tapestries of every color and design hang down from the high ceiling above you. Each signifies a separate clan pledge to a peaceful treaty within the walls of this castle. }{Clan World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
