R {23837}{0}{}{Clan Meeting Hall (w)}{ }{Walking into this chamber you realize that this acts as the clan meeting hall for all the clan members of Three Kingdoms. This is the non-partisan discussion chamber where all men are equal and where everyone is entitled to their opinion. Many scribes scurry about the room with bundles of paper and scrolls under their arms. They seem a little to preoccupied with thier duties to even notice you are here.  }{Clan World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23836}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23838}{0}{}{Clan Council Chamber (e,u,s,n)}{ }{This is the Clan Council Chamber. This room radiates with the amassed glory of the assembled clan leaders. A large oak circular table lies directly in the center of the room and various chairs are cluttered around it. }{Clan World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
