R {23840}{0}{}{Clan Punishment Report Room (n)}{ }{This is a place for the hierarchy of Clanworld to post punishments which have been placed on your fellow players. Also, please make note of anyone who is considered to be a constant cause of trouble. This board is also to be used as a reference source for you to use. When posting a note, make sure to include the player's name which is being punished or made note of.  }{Clan World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23838}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23841}{0}{}{Clan Council Voting Chamber (s)}{ }{Upon the wall of this huge chamber lies a voting booth.  Members of the Clan Council come here to vote on new recommendations for clanworld. Each man, woman and child is entitled to their own opinion and no one will be reprimanded or ridiculed from speaking what they need.  }{Clan World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23838}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {23842}{0}{}{Clanworld Bug Report Room (s)}{ }{This is a place for the members of Clanworld to post known bugs which can be found in Clanworld. Please review this board before posting a bug so that we have as little repetition as possible. Also, please be aware that some bugs will need to be handled by your guild wizards instead of by the Clanworld Wizards.  }{Clan World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
