R {23987}{0}{<168>}{Mouth of an Icy Cave (leave,d)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{The air is blistering cold, too cold for any living thing to bear. The icy walls are smooth and appear almost metallic. The white snow covered floor has numerous footprints scattered about going in all directions. A cloud of mist makes the room's darkness harder to penetrate. Cold water drips from above, splashing into various puddles quietly on the ground. In the center of the room a narrow staircase plunges into the darkness below. }{Jaffa's Lair}{jaffas_lair}{}{}{1.000}{1}
