R {23988}{0}{<168>}{A Dark Icy Cavern (u,e,s,n,w)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{The winding, descending staircase has entered into what could possibly be described as a tomb of some long forgotten person, or being. The room's lack of decor could only symbolize that who, or what, this place was constructed for must have been of little or no importance. A lone, unlit lantern protrudes from the western wall. The sloping floor becomes a large, blackish blotch beneath the ancient lantern above. The darkened ceiling, high above, admits small icy drops of water to fall into the room, splashing into various puddles. The deep cracks and crevices on the floor and walls are filled with a cold, eerie dampness. }{Jaffa's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
