R {23994}{0}{<168>}{Dead End (e)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{This dead end corridor is quite ordinary and barren like the rest of the cold icy tomb, but seems colder than the rest of the cavern. A sharp, blistering, cold gust of wind is pounding in from the east, but from where exactly cannot be determined. This section is empty, and devoid of gathering ice formations, unlike the rest of the cavern. Crack-filled walls seem to close in on what has become an extremely tight and narrow corner. }{Jaffa's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
