R {24002}{0}{}{Dark Cave (d,n)}{ }{This is a large cave located in the cliff wall about 130 feet off the cliff base.  There is a horrible stench present here, causing your eyes to tear and forcing you into a fit of coughing.  Your feet squish and slide through some strange substance spread unevenly across the floor of this cavern.  Looks as though the cave stretches further into the darkness to the north. }{Catapult}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
