R {24003}{0}{}{Cave (n,s)}{ }{This tunnel reeks of putrescent dung.  Your feet squish and slip clumsily across the cave floor giving you a pretty good indication of the source of the stench.  To the south, light appears to glow from a distant portal.  The north holds only musty blackness and a fouler aroma.  Whatever inhabits this lair is obviously not far away. }{Catapult}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
