R {24006}{0}{}{The stairway of Pak-Tor (u,d)}{ }{You are climbing up the rickety stairs.  Floorboards creak beneath you with each step.  You are surrounded by darkness.  Your light source casts faint flickering images onto the smooth grey walls. }{Tower of Pak-Tor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24005}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24008}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24007}{0}{}{Dungeon of Pak-Tor (s)}{ }{        You have come to a tiny room that looks nothing like the rest of the Tower. It is dark here, the only light coming from the torch on the wall, lighting a very small area of the room, and barely that.  Water drips down from the walls and ceiling, forming a little stream along the ground and disappearing into the darkness.  A musty smell permeates the room, and you feel like you are about to be sick.  This is a very unpleasant place to be, and a little voice tells you that you should be leaving here as soon as possible. }{Tower of Pak-Tor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24005}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24008}{0}{}{Top of the stairs of Pak-Tor (enter,d)}{ }{You breathe a sigh of relief as you trudge up the final step of the stairway.  You have come to a small alcove, with a single door to the north.  The stairs stretch down into the darkness below you. }{Tower of Pak-Tor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24006}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24009}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24009}{0}{}{Hamstel's Study (s)}{ }{          You have just stepped where no other mortal has ever been.  You have just entered Hamstel's lab, where he would sit many days practicing his magic, shaping it, and finally mastering it.  The air in here crackles with an unknown electricity, and you feel the flesh on your skin begin to crawl.  While Hamstel was alive, no other mortal was allowed into this room, no matter what the case may be.  All that is evident in this room now is the table in the middle of the room, a counter with an assortment of magical items, and the window from which you saw the silhouette.  The door through which you passed is to the south. }{Tower of Pak-Tor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24008}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24010}{0}{}{A Small Hut (out)}{ }{This is the interior of a tiny hut, lit only by two small lamps on the north wall of the room.  The only other affectations here are a broken-down desk in the northeast corner, a rocking chair, and a firepit in the center of the room. }{Kazhir's Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
