R {24017}{0}{<248>}{A stinky cave (u,se,sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{This is a large cavern in the cave system.  You're pretty certain by now why this place smells so bad: it's a Grue lair.  That's not good.  Grues are nasty nasty nasty.  The Grue juice that lies in puddles on the floor here has a distinct reddish tint...  Exits lead southeast and southwest, and you could probably go up to the cavern above. }{Grue Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
