R {24019}{0}{<248>}{A stinky cave (nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{After walking through a cramped corridor in the cave system, you stumble into this vaulted cavern.  This is obviously the 'throne room' for the Grues, and in a corner you see a gigantic heap of stones, awash in a sea of Grue juice.  Sounds echo off the ceiling, making the room seem magnificent indeed. }{Grue Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
