R {24027}{0}{<248>}{Bed Chamber (w,d,se)}{<248>% %<088>}{This section of the cavern serves as the fire giant's bed chamber. Pallets of uncured pelts and pine boughs line the floor in systematic disarray. The stench from unwashed bodies and the uncured pelts is almost enough to drive you to your knees. A stone staircase leads down into a new section of the lair. }{Fire Giant Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
