R {24028}{0}{<238>}{Food Storage (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the section of the cavern that you have dreaded seeing since you arrived. The meat locker. Several corpses are hung from protrusions of rock around the cavern. Dried blood is pooled beneath each corpse and the thing that you notice the most are the flies. There are hundreds, if not thousands, of them covering the corpses. You can't imagine how anyone, or anything, could eat this. }{Fire Giant Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24027}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24029}{0}{}{Bed Chamber (n,u)}{ }{Due to the recent additions to the clan, a new sleeping chamber was added to facilitate the new members. Unlike the chamber above, this room has crude beds and scraggly blankets arranged in a somewhat recognizable pattern. A stone staircase leads up to the first level. Several torches line the walls providing adequate light. }{Fire Giant Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
