R {24033}{0}{<248>}{Warm Passage (nw,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{The passage begins to bend toward the left as you advance your way through the Fire Giant's lair. A four foot wide hole lies in the floor near the center of this section of the caverns. Warm gusts of air rush out of the hole bringing a strong smell of sulfur into the room. The walls of this cavern are covered with a variety of plant life that flourishes in the warm moisture. }{Fire Giant Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
