R {24051}{0}{<248>}{tomb (s,ne)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{You stand in front of a set of double doors. Torches flank the portal and glow with a strange crimson light. It looks as though this tomb was carved by hand from the very living rock of the earth itself. You are overcome with dread and a feeling of terror and wonder if you are up to the challenge that awaits you. Listening carefully, you can hear a faint howling coming from beyond the great doors, perhaps it's only your imagination. }{Pyron}{pyron}{}{}{1.000}{1}
