R {24069}{0}{<278>}{Livingroom (e,s,w,n)}{C}{Upon entering the cabin you find yourself in the main room.  There is a fire burning in the cook stove, and the table seems to be set for three people.  You also notice an old rocking chair near the stove which looks to be just about as run down as the cabin itself.  Just to the right of the stove is a ladder which you figure could not even hold the weight of a child, let alone yourself.  An open doorway leads to a path out back of the cabin. }{Troll Hunter's Cabin}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8941}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
