R {24070}{0}{<278>}{Bedroom (w)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{This small but functional room is the only clean place you have found so far in this cabin.  A very large bed sits against the south wall and heating stones are just under its edge.  It almost looks inviting! The floor is made of a good solid hard wood, and a well worn throw rug sits atop it.  }{Troll Hunter's Cabin}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24069}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24071}{0}{<228>}{Dirt path (n,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{This dirt path runs from the back of the cabin, south towards a little village.  Small shacks can be seen from this vantage point and the edge of a pond can also be spotted.  Running along each side of the path are white stones of some kind, outlining where the dirt path ends and the dirt of the yard begins.  Of course there is no purpose for this but it sure looks cute.  }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24069}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24073}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24072}{0}{<278>}{Megan's room (e)}{D}{You notice right away the strong odor of canine, slightly masked by the smell of the flowers placed around the room. Two tin bowls and a straw mattress lie on the floor.  You wonder why a dog would have its own room? }{Troll Hunter's Cabin}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24069}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24073}{0}{<228>}{Dirt path (e,w,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{This section of the path has small stones lining both sides of it with red dirt making up the path itself.  Leading in three directions, the path takes you north back to the cabin.  West goes to a campfire and east towards the pond.  All three are good choices and you have nothing to lose going whichever way you choose.  Going west you could warm yourself by the fire or heading east you could take a dip in that refreshing pond, either way it's all good. }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24071}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24075}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
