R {24084}{0}{<278>}{Fish cleaning station (ne,s,sw)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{The smell of rotting fish overpowers this area.  There is a cleaning table in the middle of the path that has a few dozen dead fish on it waiting to be cleaned, and the garbage pail to the left of the table looks to be over flowing with fish guts and bones.  The path goes in three directions from this point, southwest into a hut, north back towards the main cabin and south deeper into the village.  }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24083}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24086}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
