R {24085}{0}{<238>}{Hut (nw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are inside the hut of Blaph the merchant.  Being a fairly well off trader has allowed for him to do the lazy thing and pay someone to build this hut for him.  No one in the village knows who he paid, the hut was just built one day and here it has sat ever since.  Blaph has a large two-person bed to the right of the entrance and a finely crafted dresser right beside it.  There is a rocking chair to the left of the entrance and a small table next to the rocker with a few books sitting on top. }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24083}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24086}{0}{<148>}{Pond (sw,w)}{B}{You're standing before a small pond that's maybe two hundred hands in diameter.  There are cattails and other water-type reeds along the edge of the pond.  The water is crystal clear, allowing you to see right to the sandy bottom and tempting you to go for a quick swim.  You can see a few fish swimming around in the pond and what looks to be an extremely small island out in the middle of it.  }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24084}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24088}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36510}{swim}{swim}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24087}{0}{<238>}{Hut (ne)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in Gord's hut.  He built it for his grandchild and himself when they moved here to help out the troll hunters.  If there are two things Gord knows, that's how to build stuff and how to catch and clean fish.  This hut has two comfortable looking beds in it on opposite sides of the room and a table and chairs in the middle of the room to sit at and eat meals with his grandchild.  }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24084}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24088}{0}{<238>}{Racks (ne,e,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have come to the area in which the villagers tan all the furs and pelts they have gathered while out hunting and trapping.  The racks are made from six small tree branches bound together with sinew from various animals.  There is a pile of already tanned hides lying to the side of the rack waiting to be used or sold to the fine folks of Wayhaven. }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24086}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24089}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24074}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24089}{0}{<238>}{Hut (sw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered Jacob's hut.  It's sparsely furnished with a small bed along the north wall, a single chair next to the head of the bed and a dresser just to the right of the entrance.  The hut is made from scrap timber that has been gathered from around the village.  Since he isn't home too often it would have been a waste of materials for Jacob to have built himself anything too fancy. }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
