R {24137}{0}{}{A large tent (s,e)}{ }{One disadvantage of living in the desert is the lack of extra water for keeping clean, and judging from how much your eyes are watering, these nomads have been out here for their entire lifetimes. Turning your blurry eyes to the floor you see that it is covered in bedrolls, spare clothing and scattered fire-pits. The only open ground appears to in front of the east and southern exits. }{Nomad Camp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
