E {24143}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24142}{0}{}{Scorpion Caves (w,ne)}{ }{Scorpion Caves The air in this room is really dry.  The wall is made out of a reddish sandstone that has a majestic glow to it.  A small trickle of water is running down the wall, forming a reddish puddle on the ground. }{Scorpion Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24141}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24144}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

