R {24151}{0}{}{Scorpion Caves (ne)}{ }{Scorpion Caves This part of the cave seems to be leading into a dead end. The reddish sandstone that was going to be carved has halted. There are marks on the wall that show the scorpions were digging. There are a few tiny cracks in the sandstone, nothing grows out of them. }{Scorpion Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24149}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

