R {24169}{0}{}{Subway loading platform (e,s,n,w)}{ }{A large intersection of several tunnels.  Off to the east, you see the turnstiles which lead up to the Main Concourse.  A sign hangs in the center of the chamber. }{New York City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24168}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
