R {24179}{0}{}{Subway Entrance Gate (e,w)}{ }{There is a turnstile on the east wall of this room.  In large letters painted on the wall are the words: All Trains -> East.  People scurry about their business ignoring you if you are lucky.  The tunnel leads west toward the token sales booth. }{New York City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
