R {24191}{0}{<228>}{Mantle Corps :: Exercise Yard (nw,e,ne,sw,s,se,w,n)}{<228>, .<088>}{The exercise yard of the prison is depressing. This part of the yard is little more than cracked asphalt where the prisoners are allowed to walk and stretch their legs before resuming another week's captivity. The sun beats down mercilessly from directly above and the asphalt is beginning to stick to your shoes. It appears someone has spent a great deal of time in this part of the yard attempting to scratch a pattern into the ground. }{Mantle Corps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
