R {24192}{0}{<228>}{Mantle Corps :: Along the Wall (nw,e,ne,w,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're standing along the outer wall of the prison's main exercise yard. Brick, reinforced with plasteel walls extend two stories up, uninterrupted by any recess or window that could be used to aid in climbing. The top of the wall is wreathed in barbed wire. }{Mantle Corps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
