R {24228}{0}{<238>}{Mantle Corps :: Guard Tower (e,ne,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{This section of the wall is dominated by a guard tower. Instead of ending in a corner, the wall juts out several feet deeper into the exercise yard and supports an observation sphere. The guard inside is seated in an observation turret equipped with the latest in crowd dispersal armaments. Because of the extra construction, this section of the yard has a little extra shade and is a favored resting spot for the inmates. }{Mantle Corps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
