R {24229}{0}{<228>}{Mantle Corps :: Exercise Yard (nw,e,ne,sw,s,se,w,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{The exercise yard of the prison is depressing. This part of the yard is little more than cracked asphalt where the prisoners are allowed to walk and stretch their legs before resuming another week's captivity. The sun beats down mercilessly from directly above and the asphalt is beginning to stick to your shoes. There is an awful scent in the air, like rotting flesh and excrement, but you don't have to look very far to see what is causing it. }{Mantle Corps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
