R {24252}{0}{}{-(Munich, Germany)- (n,sw,w)}{ }{This is a small German cafe.  While a bit cramped, this place certain does have a homely feel to it, with a strong scent of coffee in the air, and the murmer of German citizens talking quietly at their tables.  Behind the counter at the front of the store, the entire wall is covered in bins of coffee beans from various parts of the world. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2174}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24254}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24256}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24253}{0}{}{-(Vienna, Austria)- (e,se,n)}{ }{This is the foyer of the Vienna Opera, one of the most famous concert halls in all of Europe.  There are many people standing around socializing.  The walls and ceiling are dark brown marble and there are archways leading into the auditorium.  There is a light mist in the room but you can't make out where it is coming from. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2174}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24254}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24255}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24254}{0}{}{-(Vienna, Austria)- (w,e)}{ }{You find yourself in a large room in what looks to be a lavish apartment.  There is a piano here and a large bookcase on the wall.  There is a large window here, but the only view it has is that of a cloud of fog. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24253}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24252}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24255}{0}{}{-(Vienna, Austria)- (ne,s)}{ }{You are standing in a small rehearsal room.  There are about 10 chairs here and a piano.  This room is used for rehearsing chamber music.  The windows are open in this room and there is some type of smoke entering the room. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24253}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24257}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24256}{0}{}{-(St. Florian, Austria)- (nw,s)}{ }{This is the small monastery town of St. Florian.  You are standing on the road that leads up to the Monastery on top of the hill.  You can see a few monks on their way to town to pick up supplies.  This area is very mountainous and there is a dense fog drifting around the foothills of the mountains. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24252}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24257}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24257}{0}{}{-(Vienna, Austria)- (n,se,sw)}{ }{You are in a large library/sitting room.  There are many plush chairs and couches in this room as well as a forte-piano.  There are many people in this room apparently here for some sort of recital.  By the looks of all the people, this is not a formal recital.  The room is filled with cigarette smoke. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24256}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24258}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24255}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24258}{0}{}{-(Leipzig, Germany)- (nw,ne,s)}{ }{This is the teachers lounge at the Leipzig Conservatory.  Many of the professors are taking a smoke break here.  The room is filled with smoke, somebody open a window. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24257}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24259}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24260}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24259}{0}{}{-(Vienna, Austria)- (ne,se)}{ }{This is a park in downtown Vienna.  There are trees and flowers all around you.  Park benches line the sidewalk here and there are fences to stop people from walking on the grass.  Most of the people on the benches are rather elderly.  They are feeding the birds with breadcrumbs.  The park is covered in a light patch of fog. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24258}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24261}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24260}{0}{}{-(Salzburg, Austria)- (nw,sw)}{ }{This is the court of the Hieronymus, Archbishop of Bavaria.  You are standing in a grand ballroom. There is a party going  all around you, but nobody seems to notice you.  Near the front of the room there is an orchestra playing.  The room is clouded by a mysterious haze. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24258}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24261}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24261}{0}{}{-(St. Thomaskirche, Leipzig)- (sw,se)}{ }{This is the famous church of Saint Thomas.  You are standing in the organ loft, where there seems to be some kind of organist convention going on.  The organ here is massive, bigger than any instrument you have ever seen.  Down on the ground level, there are many people walking around looking at the church.  The music comming from the organ is stunning.  You are overwhelmed.  There is a light haze in the church hindering your vision. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24259}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24260}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24262}{0}{}{-(London, England)- (fog,nw)}{<108>F<088>}{This is a traditional English Pub.  There are about fifteen older gentlemen sitting around, smoking pipes, all drinking ale. This room is clouded with pipe smoke and your eyes are having trouble making out your surroundings. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
