R {24271}{0}{}{-(London, England)- (nw)}{ }{This is the Royal Theatre, in London.  Many famous English operas were premiered here.  The auditorium is empty now but all the stage lights are on, you wonder why.  There is a dense cloud of smoke hovering over everything here. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
