R {24272}{0}{}{-(Paris, France)- (fog,w)}{<108>F<088>}{Ahh, the streets of Paris, one of the most famous cultural centers in Europe.  You are walking down a busy street with outdoor cafes and boutiques on both sides of the street.  The light scent of freshly baked bread and coffee fills your nose. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
