R {24273}{0}{}{-(Paris, France)- (e,n,w)}{ }{You are in the grand ballroom of Louis the 14th, the court is presently watching a sweeping ballet performance. Overcome by the grandure of the spectacle is simply overwhelming. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
