R {24274}{0}{}{-(On a hillside overlooking the Seine river)- (s,w)}{ }{You are standing on a peaceful hillside overlooking the Seine river just outside Paris.  This is one of the most tranquil places in all of France.  Your view of the city is limited due to the dense fog that surrounds this area. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
