R {24275}{0}{}{-(Paris, France)- (e,n,w)}{ }{You find yourself in the middle of a smokey cabaret.  There are dancers on tables and on a stage in the middle of the room. The room is filled with smelly frenchmen.  You feel slightly uncomfortable.   }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
