R {24276}{0}{}{-(Paris, France)- (e,s,w)}{ }{This is the organ loft of the beautiful French cathedral of St. Gervais.  The enormous cathedral resonates with the sounds of organ music.  There are throngs of people down on the main floor of the cathedral that have come to hear the music.  There is a light mist in this holy place that makes you feel as if you were in a dream. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
