R {24277}{0}{}{-(Paris, France)- (n,e)}{ }{You find yourself in a lavish parlor.  There are chairs all over the room. and a large piano in the middle of the room You assume this must be some type of 'mini-recital'. A mixture of fog and cigarette smoke makes visibility almost impossible in here. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24275}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24278}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24278}{0}{}{-(The French Countryside)- (e,s)}{ }{A small dirt cart-path runs through the forest. This part of France is heavily wooded, making for a peaceful walk.  There is a small castle, and you can hear soft music coming from inside.  This section of the woods is draped in a dense fog. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
