R {24279}{0}{}{-(St. Petersburg, Russia)- (e,fog)}{<108>F<088>}{St. Petersburg is one of the most cultured cities of Russia.  Most all of the great musicians of Russian history were trained in this city. You are walking down a street here near the music conservatory.  This is a very clean city, nothing like Moscow in spirit or sight.  There is a strange fog here, you almost feel like you are in a dream. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
