R {24280}{0}{}{-(St. Petersburg, Russia)- (e,n,w)}{ }{You are standing in the back of a classroom at the St. Petersburg Conservatory.  There is a piano in the front of the room and a few rows of chairs.  There doesn't seem to be any class going on right now.  There must be a fire somewhere, outside the window, all you can see is smoke. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
