R {24281}{0}{}{-(St. Petersburg, Russia)- (e,w,n)}{ }{This is the park in university district of St Petersburg. Many professors and intellectuals come here to eat lunch and chat with friends.  There are many park benches and picnic tables around the park.  The thick fog hinders your view of the city. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
