R {24282}{0}{}{-(St. Petersburg, Russia)- (s,e)}{ }{This is the St. Petersburg Opera house.  Many famous Russian operas have been premiered here.  Tonight's opera is 'Boris Godunov', by Musorgsky.  The house is full of young students from the Conservatory.  You can hardly see the stage for all the mist. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
