R {24283}{0}{}{-(St. Petersburg, Russia)- (w,n)}{ }{You find yourself standing onstage in a large auditorium.  There is a large piano onstage here, and you can tell that the auditorium is full of people, but they don't seem to notice you onstage.  A large cloud of mist is hovering in the room, making it difficult to see very well. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
