R {24284}{0}{}{-(Moscow, Russia)- (e,w,s)}{ }{You are in a small office in the Moscow Conservatory.  There is a piano here and a small desk.  There is a door with writing on it open behind you, leading to a hallway.  The room is filled with dense smoke but you can't seem to trace the origin of it. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
