R {24286}{0}{}{-(Rome, Italy)- (fog,ne)}{<108>F<088>}{You find yourself in a huge opera hall, there are many people onstage singing and dancing.  The audience is fixated on the stage and they don't seem to notice you standing here.  There is a light fog around your ankles and you can't see the floor. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
