R {24292}{0}{}{-(The Italian Countryside)- (sw,w,s)}{ }{You are walking on a small road leading up to a cottage on a hilltop.  The cottage has smoke coming from the chimney. It looks as if someone is home.  The view from here is quite lovely, far off in the distance you can see a large city.  There is a light haze in the hills. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
