R {24295}{0}{}{-(The Papal Chapel, Rome)- (ne)}{ }{This is the official musical chapel of the Pope and his clergical staff.  Most all of the music that goes on in the Vatican, takes place in this chapel.  There is a concert of vocal music going on here now, and the chapel is full of clergy, monks, and musicians.  There is a light mist floating throughout the chapel. }{Wax Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24292}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24296}{0}{}{Bamboo thicket (e)}{ }{You are in the middle of a thicket of fast-growing bamboo. Some unknown beast has bulldozed a path through the tough outer perimeter growth and trampled the stems in the interior. Bamboo and other grass leaves litter the hard ground. The tall stems sway and creak in the wind. }{Valley of the Tribes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {975}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24297}{0}{}{Ruins (climb)}{ }{You find yourself surrounded by metal and the only exit you see is the door to the outside.  But then, there is that strange shaft that sticks out from the metal.  Hmm, what could be down there?  And unless you've been there before, there's no way to know.  Well, you only live once right? Unless you've died before.  Heh. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14553}{climb}{climb}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24298}{shaft}{shaft}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
