R {24298}{0}{}{Shaft}{ }{You are in a shaft. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {24299}{0}{}{Lost City (e,ne)}{<238>C<088>}{You find yourself within the massive pile of rubble that was outside. It seems that this area underneath it has been somewhat cleared out. Looking upward, you can tell that you are literally within an enormous underground, or would that be underrubble, cavern.  You hear some strange noises all about you, and can make out flickering fires in the distance.  But beyond anything, the smell is putrid and the air is very thick making it very hard to breathe. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24300}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24301}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
