E {24298}{u}{climb shaft}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24300}{0}{}{Lost City (e,w)}{ }{You are following somewhat of a path, if winding around heaps of rubble and trash can be called that.  To the east, you can make out a small fire and something else, which you can't quite make out for sure.  Still, one thing is for certain, the smell is getting seriously foul here. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24299}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24302}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24301}{0}{}{Lost City (sw)}{ }{This area looks as if it has been turned into a makeshift home for some of the dreggs of humanity that inhabit this cavern.  You can make out some small metallic bits that seem to be used as utensils and some concrete slabs that serve as seats and a table, the comforts of a miserable existence. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24299}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24302}{0}{}{Lost City (e,s,w)}{ }{The main feature of this area is a burning fire in a metal barrel, which just so happens to be sitting next to a huge pile of dung!  Eeeww...Yuck! Hopefully there isn't anything else that gross around here.  Strange sounds float toward you from the south and you wonder what might be causing them. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24300}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24303}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24304}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42485}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24303}{0}{}{Lost City (e,w)}{ }{Deep in the heart of this underground city, you can still only feel shock at the thought of these people having survived here so long.  The clearing you are in provides the grisly sight of decay and destruction, and you can only guess that there is more all around you.  You can make out a burning barrel to your west. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24302}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24310}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24304}{0}{}{Lost City (e,s,w,n)}{ }{You are at a clearing of sorts, meaning there is less rock, metal, and trash than anywhere else.  You notice two smaller clearings to the east and west, as well as a path to the south.  The light of the fire is still visible to your north, as well as the foul stench from that direction too, but beyond that, only your nerves deserve attention. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24302}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24305}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24306}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24307}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24305}{0}{}{Lost City (w)}{ }{A small little clearing which looks as if it is used frequently.  Trash litters the entire area and the smell is horrible.  Beyond that, you can't really make out anything more. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24304}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24306}{0}{}{Lost City (e,w,n)}{ }{A wall of wreckage covers the southern end of this small clearing, but you do notice two small alcoves of sorts, one to the east and another to the west.  Nothing else seems to jump out at you, which is a good thing, you guess. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24304}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24308}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24309}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24307}{0}{}{Lost City (e)}{ }{A small clearing, the debris stacks up all around you, giving you an almost claustrophobic feeling.  The rock and metal seems to hang at a dangerous angle, that you're sure means it could collapse at any moment.  Looking closer at your surroundings, you can make out some car parts, an old street sign, and some tires all in a pile, as if they'd been purposely set there. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24304}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24308}{0}{}{Lost City (w)}{ }{A tiny space that at one makes you want to gasp for air, you can make out a small slab of rock that provides a seat as well as some some small bits of paper that line the walls.  A torch placed into the rubble wall lightens up the area. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24306}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24309}{0}{}{Lost City (e)}{ }{A small little alcove formed by the rubble around you, moving is a bit tricky and you have to be careful to dodge the bars sticking out above you.  Still, it looks lived in, and in the very center lies a large rock slab that looks as if it is used as a desk.  A small lantern sits up in a crack in the metal lights up the area. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24306}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24310}{0}{}{Lost City (e,s,w,n)}{ }{You arrive at a large clearing which looks to be the center of the underground city.  Quickly scanning the area, you can make out tiny openings in the metal to the north and south, while the path seems to widen out to the east.  You can barely make out the barrel to the west, which flickers and throw strange shadows all around you, but at least allows you to see. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24303}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24311}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24312}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24313}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24311}{0}{}{Lost City (e,s,w,n)}{ }{You seem to be in somewhat of a clearing, though by the standards here it doesn't take much to qualify as one.  You can make out what seems to be a burning barrel to your east, but that doesn't surprise you any. Strangely you see a sign pointing south that says 'Red House.'  Boggle that. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24310}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24314}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24315}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24316}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24312}{0}{}{Lost City (n)}{ }{This place has been destroyed!  Then again, maybe it was just never cleaned before.  The metal walls enclose this small space, and it looks as if bits of it have fallen to litter the ground here.  You have to be careful not to hit the ceiling as you move about, and you're certain that no one or thing calls this place home. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24310}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24313}{0}{}{Lost City (s)}{ }{A small little niche that looks like a makeshift house, this place makes you feel almost at home.  A small rock sits next to a big rock and appears to work as a table and chair.  A small watch lies smashed on the table, making you wonder what happened to it.  And you can see some pictures stuck along the rock and metal wall. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24310}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24314}{0}{}{Lost City (e,w,n)}{ }{Not surprisingly, you find a large burning barrel here that provides light for the area.  A small opening leads to the east, and a foul stench comes to you from the area to the north.  Beyond that, you can only make out the panoramic view of metal and rock that you pray doesn't collapse anytime soon.  Using the light from the barrel, you look up in an attempt to see the ceiling of this metallic cavern, but can make out only some oddly angled girders of metal and slabs of rock. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24311}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24317}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24318}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24315}{0}{}{Lost City (n)}{ }{Strangely enough, you've walked through a doorway into a room.  It would seem that this is about as close to a house as you can get down here.  There is a dirty mattress here with abominable stains, mostly red, so you guess that's where the name comes from.  And a small glowing orb provides the light. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24311}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24316}{0}{}{Lost City (s)}{ }{A tiny little space formed by someone having moved piles of rubble around it, it looks almost cozy.  It even looks as if someone has turned this area into their home, as you notice a small pile of dirt covered by some torn rags that appear to make up a bed.  A half a mattress lies in front of a metal block serving as what must be a dining arrangement to add even more of lived in feeling.  It's really upscale compared to what you've seen so far.  A tiny glowing orb has been placed up along the rubble to provide light here. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24311}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24317}{0}{}{Lost City (w)}{ }{You find yourself wedged into a little space between the rubble, and can't really make out anything unusual.  And every move you make seems to cause the wreckage to shift.  Your gut feeling tells you to get out of here quickly, because digging around in this place  would bring the heavy wreckage down on your head! }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24314}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24318}{0}{}{Lost City (s)}{ }{You feel the bile rising up in your throat as you enter what seems to be the graveyard of the area.  With as many sickly looking people around here as you've seen, you guess this place isn't a surprise.  Bodies litter the entire area, and some stacks rise up over your head, most still have a tiny bit of rotted flesh on them, but horrendously, many look half eaten.  Some of the bodies look fresh too, though that doesn't surprise you too much. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
