R {24335}{0}{}{A Crocodile Cave (u)}{ }{This small cavern underneath the surface of the mound in the swamp is about eight feet across, just large enough for a single creature to retreat to when it is finished hunting for the day. It looks like that is precisely what has happened here. However, you also see some old books off to one side. Very strange. }{Jeremy's Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
