R {24336}{0}{<248>}{Dry storage (e,s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You find yourself walking about an old storage room, once used to house dry goods and items.  Lined along the walls are crates of supplies\; some open, some broken.  Splintered wood and broken locks sign the pillage and plunder that this room once suffered.  In the center of the storeroom room lies a heap of half-eaten dry goods, spoiled by the unyielding wrath of time.  In a far corner of the room stands a wooden cabinet, its drawers empty and lined with cobwebs.  Atop the cabinet stands a small round mirror. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
