R {24337}{0}{<278>}{Lower battlements (n,e,stairs)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are now in the enclosed, lower battlements of Der'Thalas Keep.  The wind whistles through the arrow slits here mournfully, and the air is stale and dank.  A strange, pale odor seems to emanate from the stone walls themselves.  Looking more closely, you see that they are slick with some putrid ochre.  Strange noises echo along the long hallway.  Coupled with the shadows everpresent in the damned keep, your mind is constantly on the alert for whatever horrors reside in this place.  The dark battlements continue east from here and a doorway leads north, towards the heart of the keep.  A circular staircase, rusted from years of neglect, leads up. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
