R {24350}{0}{<278>}{A Magical Repository (w)}{<278>[<158>O<278>]<088>}{The room is lined with marble block, seeming as if it was magically cut out of a single chunk of stone with one precise action. Around the edge of the room are a plethora of shelves and bookcases filled with an odd assortment of items. A small wooden counter sits in the middle of the room with a large machine resembling something akin to what a mage might perceive a cash register to look like if he had never seen one before. A small sign sits next to it. On the rear wall is a section which appears to be similar to a scoreboard made of colored glyphs. A grizzled wizard stands behind the machine perusing a ledger. }{Pinnacle}{ogotaz}{}{}{1.000}{1}
