R {24399}{0}{}{-<*>- Newman's Apartment -<*>- (n)}{ }{-<*>- Newman's Apartment -<*>- You push your way through a large red curtain and find yourself in Jerry's neighbor, Newman's apartment.  All that is here is a couch and an overstuffed, battered chair.  Shelves of junk clutter the walls.  Mounds of Chunky chocolate candy wrappers litter the floor.  You guess that Newman isn't as concerned with neatness as his neighbor is. }{Seinfeld Studio Set}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
