R {24401}{0}{}{-<*>- A dirty Subway Train -<*>- (w)}{ }{-<*>- A dirty Subway Train -<*>- Somehow you've managed to make your way onto a New York subway train.  You've heard horror stories about subways in this city.  Luckily, this is only a set and chances are you won't get hurt.  The inside of the train is covered with different graffiti sprawled on the walls, floor, and ceiling.  They did a really good job at making this look like a real subway train. }{Seinfeld Studio Set}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
