R {24403}{0}{}{-<*>- Monks Restaurant -<*>- (se,n)}{ }{-<*>- Monks Restaurant -<*>- The infamous Monks Restaurant.  A cash register is to your left.  A lone pay telephone is on the east wall of the restaurant.  An eat-at counter lies against the northern part.  A row of booths line the west wall.  Waitresses move about quickly to bring the customers their orders. This restaurant seems very homey and you wish you had time to sit for a meal. }{Seinfeld Studio Set}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
