R {24464}{0}{<268>}{-=( Entrance foyer )=- (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in an large foyer, the tiled floor gleaming brightly under the light from several lanterns. The floor has a large, circular mosaic pattern set into it, giving the area a wide, airy feel. On the east and west walls, large tapestries hang, illuminated brightly to show off the rich colours. The main doors to the manor are north, while the hallway continues south. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
