R {24466}{0}{<238>}{-=( The eastern gardens )=- (enter,w)}{<238>|@|<088>}{This portion of the garden is dedicated to the flora of the eastern forests. The thick trunks and evergreen leaves gives this area a peaceful feel. Dense bushes fill the spaces between the trees.  Lord Askar has recently built a small aviary here, and the sounds of chirping birds fills the garden. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{100.000}{1}
