R {24467}{0}{<238>}{Reception Room (s,out)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The reception room is a study in opulence. Chairs and couches upholstered in rich velvet cluster in small groups of twos and threes. Expensive paintings and tapestries cover the walls, creating bright splashes of color against the dark stone of the walls. A thick carpet of a deep emerald green cushions your feet while giving the impression that you are treading on thick grass. A door in the western wall leads out into the estate, and a  southern door leads into the aviary proper. A small table next to the southern door contains a neat stack of broadsheets with a  small plaque hanging above it. A servant circulates the room, serving the guests champagne and hors d'oeuvres. }{Askar's Aviary}{askars_aviary}{}{}{1.000}{1}
