R {24468}{0}{<178>}{Inside an Aviary (s,n)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{Before you lies Paradise, or the closest thing to it that could be created by mortal hands. The ceiling rises spans above your head, stone supports inset with enormous panes of magically treated glass. You stand on a slight rise, with the door to the reception room to the north, and the rest of the aviary to the  south. A gravel path winds down the hill, leading through the  dense foliage that makes up the avian residents' homes. A small mountain rises above the tropical vegetation in the south. }{Askar's Aviary}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
