R {24469}{0}{<178>}{Inside an Aviary (se,n,sw)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The soft music of a waterfall plays upon your senses as it tumbles carelessly from a sculpted hill created expressly for that purpose. The water flows into a peaceful pool twenty feet below the hilltop, overflowing to create several streamlets that wind their way about the aviary. Large lush ferns, along with other greenery, cover the ground completely\; bright flowers of various hues create islands of color in a veritable sea of green. }{Askar's Aviary}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
