R {24474}{0}{<268>}{Inside an Aviary (ne,nw)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{You stand at the lowest point in the aviary, on the shore of a  small lake. Sparkling white sand frames impossibly blue water.  Small birds dot the edge of the water\; sunning, bathing, and rather half-heartedly looking for something to eat. Farther out, you see several species of ducks and geese bobbing on the surface of the lake, lazily bobbing for edibles under the water. To the north, the aviary starts a slow rise, rich and opulent gardens slowly  transforming into verdant rainforest and jungle, and rising high  above the treeline, the top of a small mountain is barely visible. }{Askar's Aviary}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
