R {24492}{0}{<238>}{-=( On a worn pathway )=- (enter,s)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You are standing on a worn pathway through the maze.  To the north is a small stone building, its walls covered with the symbols of Tempus, the god of war.  The hedges here look darker and thicker, providing the area with more privacy than the rest of the maze. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
