R {24493}{0}{<268>}{-=( Inside a small temple )=- (n,s)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{As with most of Tempus' smaller temples, this one is close to bare.  The walls have simple carvings of Tempus's symbol on them, showing a gauntlet crushing two lightning bolts.  There is a small stone altar, covered with a crimson cloth.  A thick stone door to the north and the archway to the south appear to be the only exits. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24492}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
