R {24494}{0}{<248>}{-=( The inner sanctum )=- (s)}{<248>.<118>@<248>.<088>}{This room is bare.  Not a single stick of furniture or ornament marks the room's bleak stone walls.  This room is used by the priests of Tempus to meditate before battle, as well as a room in which they can train their combat skills.  A thick stone door leads south into the temple. }{Askar's Manor}{kilmyarar}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24493}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

