R {24528}{0}{<238>}{-=( In the center of the maze )=- (n)}{<238>(<148>~<238>)<088>}{You are standing in the exact center of the maze. There are thick hedges all around you, with only a thin path leading north. In the center of the clearing, there is a large fountain, spraying water high into the blue skies. }{Askar's Manor}{padrin}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24504}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24529}{0}{<268>}{-=( Long hallway )=- (n,s,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{As you look around the room, you notice that whoever decorated here should have stayed an adventurer, and left interior decoration to someone else. The walls are covered in an assortment of strange weapons and even stranger trophies. Against the eastern wall, a massive trophy case has been positioned so that anyone entering the hall has no choice but to see the grisly items inside.  There is a blank scroll hanging high on the western wall. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24464}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24530}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24531}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24532}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24530}{0}{<278>}{-=( At the base of the stairs )=- (u,n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are standing at the base of a large, winding staircase leading to the manor house's second floor. Along the walls the same style of decoration from the rest of the hallway continues. Weapons, armour and banners from slain enemies of the manor's owner decorate every spare inch of the walls. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24529}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24533}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24531}{0}{<238>}{-=( The kitchen )=- (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in the large kitchen for the manor house. A large wood burning oven is built into the northern wall, the smell of baking bread coming from inside. There is a large bench set against the southern wall, covered in pots and pans. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24529}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24532}{0}{<238>}{-=( A brightly lit study )=- (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This large, brightly lit room acts as the manor house's study. Large bookshelves cover the walls, filled with scrolls and books from all over the realms. Two small tables, each with their own lamp, stand in separate corners of the chamber. A single large window in the eastern wall allows natural light into the room, giving the area a warm, open feel. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24529}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24541}{n}{flick switch;n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24533}{0}{<278>}{-=( Top of the stairs )=- (d,n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are standing at the top of a large, winding staircase that leads down to the ground floor of the manor. It appears that this floor serves as the living quarters for the owners. A large painting is displayed in its silver frame on the eastern wall. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24530}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24534}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44561}{enter painting}{enter painting}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44561}{s}{enter painting}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24534}{0}{<268>}{-=( A large hallway )=- (s,w,n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing near the southern end of a large hallway that leads through the top floor of the manor. It appears that this floor serves as the living quarters for the owners. Large archways on either side of the hall leading into private chambers. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24533}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24535}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24536}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24537}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24535}{0}{<238>}{-=( Padrin's chambers )=- (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room looks like a cyclone hit it. There are clothes scattered all over the room, and several small books have been left lying on the floor. A small cot can just be seen under a pile of clothes in one corner of the room. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24534}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24536}{0}{<268>}{-=( Halfway down the hallway )=- (w,n,s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are about halfway down a hallway through the top floor of the manor house. There are two large archways, one on either side of the hall, leading into living quarters for the owners of the house. Above each doorway is a small plaque. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24534}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24538}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24539}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24540}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24537}{0}{<238>}{-=( Kylithia's chambers )=- (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This rather bare chamber is used by Kylithia while she is staying at the manor. The only furniture in the room is a small cot, pushed up against one corner. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24534}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24538}{0}{<238>}{-=( Kilanor's chambers )=- (e)}{K}{The walls of this room have been covered in natural rock formations, making it almost look like a small underground cave. A large blanket has been stuffed up against one wall of the room. The only exit is back out the archway to the east. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24536}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24539}{0}{<238>}{-=( Askar's chambers )=- (s)}{A}{This strange room disturbs you slightly. Painted in bright shades of blood red, and contrasted with deep patches of midnight blue, the room is made to feel smaller than it is. A single cot has been placed against one wall of the room, almost invisible in the dim light. A large symbol of the God of War has been painted onto the back of the room in bright red paint. }{Askar's Manor}{askar}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24536}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24540}{0}{<238>}{-=( Miranda's chambers )=- (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room is the very model of neatness. A small writing desk is placed carefully near the wide window, so that light can shine onto the desk during the day. A small sleeping mat with two neatly folded blankets has been placed against another wall, in such a way that the morning sun will shine through the window onto the sleeper's face. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24536}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24541}{0}{<278>}{-=( A dark stairwell )=- (d)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are standing at the top of a large, dark circular stairwell that leads down below the manor house. Two torches are set into the wall, but they have both burnt down to small, useless stubs. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24532}{s}{pull torch;s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24542}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24542}{0}{<278>}{-=( A subterranean hall )=- (e,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are standing in a wide hallway at the base of a set of stairs that lead up to the ground level of the manor. Strange sounds drift down the hall from the east. There is a bright glow filling the area, yet you can not see where it is coming from. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24541}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24543}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24543}{0}{<268>}{-=( A well lit chamber )=- (se,w,e,ne)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This well lit chamber, deep underneath the streets of Wayhaven, seems to have been carved from the rock through magic. The walls are perfectly smooth, without a single imperfection. The chamber itself is quite large, and stretches off into the distance. There seems to be a desk to the east, and large cages northeast and southeast. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24542}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24544}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
