R {24544}{0}{<268>}{-=( A well lit chamber )=- (n,ne,nw)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in the southern most point of the chamber. A strange glow fills the entire room, yet you can see no torches or lanterns. In the corner there is a large, metal cage, its bars bent and twisted out of shape. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24543}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
