R {24547}{0}{<268>}{-=( The eastern corner of the chamber )=- (sw,w,nw)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in the eastern most portion of the large chamber. All around you strange tools of a wizards trade have been neatly stored on shelves. Jars and bottles of all shapes and sizes line the wooden boards.  A large cloth has been draped over something leaning against the corner. }{Askar's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24545}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24544}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
