R {24548}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Foyer (s,w,exit)}{<168>X<088>}{You stand in the foyer of Windraker Manor.  Next to you stands a large coat rack with many pegs and a few jackets hanging from it.  A polished hard wood floor extends from the front door halfway into the room where it is covered with elegant foreign rugs.  Towards the rear sits a long couch with tables on both ends.  A large chair sits on the east side of the room near the lit fireplace. The door to the west leads into what you believe to be the dining room and the southern door leads towards a rather large staircase. }{Windraker Manor}{windraker_manor}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4065}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24549}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24550}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24549}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Stairway And Bathroom (u,n,w)}{ }{A wide staircase with a single landing leads up to the next floor.  The steps are covered in a soft, velvet material.  Peering into the large room beginning under the stairs you see that you're in a rather large and elegant bathroom.  A large black marble bathtub sits below a pure silver showerhead.  There is a small rug stretching from in front of the sink to the front of the bathtub.  A very clean porcelain toilet sits in the corner of the room.  The door to your west leads into the kitchen while the door to your north leads into the foyer where you arrived. }{Windraker Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24548}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24551}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24552}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24550}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Dining Room (s,e)}{ }{Entering the room, your nostrils flare at the lingering scent of the many meals served in its presence.  A white, silk tablecloth is draped over the length of the dinner table.  Your eyes dart toward the shimmering of crystal in the two china cabinets in the far corners of the room.  The table has seven chairs to a side and the two head chairs for a total of sixteen.  Between Abigale's social affairs and Thelone's business deals, the table is probably the center point of every party. At first glance nothing appears out of place in the room. }{Windraker Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24548}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24551}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24551}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Kitchen (e,n)}{ }{Entering the room you're greeted by a blinding glare from the many chromed surfaces, all polished to a high shine.  On the far wall is a countertop with a dual sink. To the right sits a rather large clay and brick oven with several racks inside.  Bread is currently being kept warm on a few of the many internal racks.  Out of the window you can see a small windmill perched along the fence. Your guess would be that this is the source of the house's running water.  Quite a marvel of innovation.  Along the east wall sits a large, dual-door refrigerator. On top of it sits a cookie jar, knocked over onto its side.  A pile of napkins sits on the large butcher's block at the center of the room.  A door next to the refrigerator leads to the bathroom while to the north lies the dining room. }{Windraker Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24550}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24549}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24552}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Study (n,d)}{ }{Ascending the stairs reveals a large study with a heavy wood motif. In one corner stands a large oak rolltop desk with a candlestick standing on each end.  Large bookcases fill up the north and east walls with windows on either end of them overlooking the city. Glancing at the edge of the rug beneath you, you notice that underneath is another dark stained hardwood floor like you saw in the foyer.  There's a door to the north into the master bedroom. }{Windraker Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24549}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24553}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44552}{u}{search bookcase;push button;u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24553}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Master Bedroom (w,s)}{ }{Soft carpeting pads your steps as you enter this large bedroom. A massive four poster bed sits in the center of the south wall with two light brown maple nightstands, one on either side of the bed.  On top of them sit two matching reading lamps.  A dresser lines the east wall while a wardrobe fills the west wall up to the door. Old cast iron candle holders sit in various positions around the room to provide ample lighting when needed.  On the west wall is a door into Timothy's room while the south door returns you to the study. }{Windraker Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24552}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24554}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24554}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Timothy's Bedroom (e)}{ }{A very neat and orderly room, especially for a child.  There is not a single toy on the floor, they all appear to be located in the large toy bins.  His bed is small and the sheets are pulled tight. There is a stack of stuffed animals in the corner and a dresser against the west wall below a small window. The walls are all made of wood paneling going half way up with the rest of the wall painted dark green. }{Windraker Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24553}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24555}{s}{push panel;s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24555}{0}{}{Windraker Manor: Alcove (n)}{ }{This alcove was walled over long ago for some unknown reason but it appears as if Timmy has made it his current hiding place from his parents.  The room is fairly empty and small, with dust covering the floor and little footprints from the panel to Timmy's makeshift bed.  There's a half-eaten sandwich, a drinking glass, some toys, and a pillow on the ground.  Not a ray of light enters the room from any direction leaving it pitch black. }{Windraker Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24554}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24556}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a well -<*>- (u,d)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a well -<*>- As you climb into the well, you hear noises in the far distance. You hope you don't lose your footing on the way down.  It is damp and musty in here. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4005}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24557}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24557}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a well -<*>- (u,d)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a well -<*>- Farther into the well, you begin to get cold.  A shiver runs down your spine.  You're uneasy about what lies at the bottom.  You almost choke on the spiderwebs. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24556}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24558}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24558}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a well -<*>- (u,d)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a well -<*>- The air is becoming stagnant.  The noises are becoming increasingly louder as you get closer to the bottom.  You are getting a little more scared.  A large sign is here also. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24557}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24559}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24559}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- (u)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- Just when you think you can't stand the not-knowing, your foot touches hard dirt.  The noises are much clearer now.  Thick spiderwebs are woven almost wall to wall in this underground cave. Even though you should be scared, a weird sense of calmness sweeps through your body. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24558}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24560}{e}{search dirt;light torch}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24560}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- (w,e)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- Even though you are in the middle of a dirt cave, this place is so beautiful.  Blood red gems are deeply embedded into the cave walls. You almost feel bad about disturbing anything in here, but you can't help yourself but to look around. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24559}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24561}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24561}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- (n,s,w)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- The air here is very dry and stale. It's as if you've come upon a place that has remained undiscovered for a long time. Unlike the well to the west, the floor here is very smooth and free of dirt or dust. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24560}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24562}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24563}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24562}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- (s,e)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- A warm feeling of good washes over you in this corner of the Cave. The walls are covered in murals depicting scenes of a forest from a land far away and long ago.  Even the floor gives the illusion of sprouting growing grass, very strange indeed. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24561}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24564}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24563}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- (n,e)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- This part of the cave seems bright and alive. A breeze slightly caresses your cheek, and you wonder how that is possible in this dark underground cave. The walls themselves have even been altered to show a vast field and clear sky. If you look long enough, plants and insects appear to move occasionally. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24561}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24565}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24564}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- (w)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- This part of the cave feels warm and humid. What appears to be a small pond is visible on the ground.  The walls have drawings depicting a marsh, and a deep blue sky in the background. The land of Crenda certainly was a beautiful place to be. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24562}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24565}{0}{}{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- (w)}{ }{-<*>- Inside a cave -<*>- It is very dark and cold in this corner of the cave. The walls give off a faint crimson color and are free from any drawings or sketches. }{Great Well of Crenda}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24563}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

