R {24578}{0}{}{An Incense Stall (out)}{ }{You instantly sneeze as you enter as your nose hairs curl under the baleful effect of the incense hanging in the air.  This isn't a healthy place to hang out! There's a white banner on the side panel of the stall. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3917}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24579}{0}{}{The Ladder & Things Shoppe (out)}{ }{You are in a long stall jam-pack filled with the weirdest assortment of ladders and religious items.  Whoever dreamed up this combination needs some lessons at the Merchant's Guild.  Fast! There's a ratty sign tacked on the wall. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3913}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24580}{0}{}{A Cramped Clothier's Stall (out)}{ }{You nearly sneeze as your nostrils are assailed by the closed, heavy air of this stall.  Cloth bolts are all over the place showing every variant of green velvet you could possibly imagine.  Unfortunately, the only cloth to arrive in Wayhaven in months was of this sick and ghastly hue.  The Clothier is desperate! A scrawled blurb is by the door! }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3925}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24581}{0}{}{A Cramped Notions Stall (out)}{ }{You enter the cramped and narrow stall and find yourself surrounded by empty racks.  This place is nearly barren. Some bazaar this is turning out to be!  You grumble. A small embroidered sign is stuck to the wallboards. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3927}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24582}{0}{}{A Cramped Music Stall (out)}{ }{You stoop through the low doorway and find yourself in a cramped stall filled with guitars.  The sweet scent of pine fills your nostrils.  You can leave out the same door you entered by. A small sign is tacked on the wall to your left. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3921}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24583}{0}{}{A Stall of Death (out)}{ }{As you enter the stall your nostrils are assailed by the iron stench of blood.  Blood which is splattered over the bare and looted boards of this stall. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3919}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24584}{0}{}{Doorway to a temple. (doorway,leave)}{ }{You find yourself standing in mid-air.  All of reality seems to distort around your being here.  Behind you is a portal that you could probably use to return to where you were, and in front of you, hanging in mid-air, is an odd doorway. }{Tree of Life}{tree_of_life}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6502}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24585}{doorway}{doorway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24585}{0}{}{Temple of Malkuth (turnaway,onward)}{ }{Passing through the doorway, you find yourself in a large temple.  The whole room appears to be made from stone.  Assorted plants sprout from the stone as if it were the richest soil in the world. A doorway lies in front of you. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24586}{onward}{onward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24586}{0}{}{Path to Yesod (turnaway,doorway)}{ }{Passing through the doorway, you find yourself climbing a shimmering ethereal staircase.  A formless void surrounds you, allowing no sound or light to pass from your immediate vicinity.  At the top of the staircase a doorway hangs out over the void, beckoning you closer. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24587}{doorway}{doorway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24587}{0}{}{Temple of Yesod (turnaway,onward)}{ }{The first thing you notice upon entering this temple is that it is open-aired.  The night sky lies open above you, and the moon positively glows with radiance.  In front of you on a plain altar lies an open book. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24588}{onward}{onward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24588}{0}{}{Path to Hod (turnaway,doorway)}{ }{Passing through the doorway, you find yourself on a warm sunny path through a grassy meadow.  The sun shines down upon you, warming you with its loving light.  A lone bird flies overhead, silhouetted against the bright blue sky and the fluffy clouds.  It would be easy to give up your quest for knowledge, and stay here forever. A lone doorway waits for you on the other side of the meadow. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24589}{doorway}{doorway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24589}{0}{}{Temple of Hod (turnaway,onward)}{ }{This temple stands on top of a great mountain.  Wind whips at you as you view your surroundings.  A pentacle dominates the floor, and is inscribed with Hebrew script.  A plain stone, weatherbeaten by the wind stands in the center of the pentacle, and the symbol of Mercury, planet of magick, is carved on its face. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24590}{onward}{onward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24590}{0}{}{Path to Netazch (turnaway,doorway)}{ }{Stepping off the side of the cliff, you feel your being ripped apart and rebuilt.  Strangely this is not a painful feeling. Coming to your senses, you find yourself sitting under an apple tree.  It is daybreak, and there is only one star in the sky.  In front of you, a doorway glimmers. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24591}{doorway}{doorway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24591}{0}{}{Temple of Netazch (turnaway,onward)}{ }{You have entered the next temple.  A copper statue of a lynx sits in the middle of a round, stone walled chamber.  In a small bowl at the foot of the statue are fresh rose petals.  On the other side of the statue is a doorway. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24592}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24593}{onward}{onward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24592}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {24593}{0}{}{Path to Tipharet (turnaway,doorway)}{ }{Walking through the doorway, you find yourself in a rich jungle teeming with plant life.  Many small insects buzz around your head, and the dense canopy of foliage blocks the sky from your view.  Most of the light illuminating the area comes from the open doorway in front of you. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24594}{doorway}{doorway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24594}{0}{}{Temple of Tipharet (turnaway,onward)}{ }{This temple is by far the most plain you've seen. You stand on a large, flat, rock surface.  The brightest sun you have ever seen burns down upon you, but somehow you are protected from what would be devastating heat.  A doorway lies across from you. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
