R {24595}{0}{}{Path to Geburah (turnaway,doorway)}{ }{Passing through the doorway, you find yourself walking down a dimly lit passage underground.  The walls glow with a dim emerald light, revealing inconsistencies in them. Ahead of you stands the next doorway, shining a crimson red light that mixes with the emerald forming an odd russet. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
