R {24596}{0}{}{Temple of Geburah (onward,turnaway)}{ }{Heat rushes your face as you enter this temple.  A large brazier sits in the middle of the room, burning brightly with magickal fire.  Frescoes on the walls depict Mars the god of war in battle against assorted foes.  A blood-stained altar lies behind the brazier, and imbedded in it is a fiery red sword.  A doorway lies on the far wall. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
