R {24598}{0}{}{Temple of Chesed (turnaway,onward)}{ }{The first thing you notice about this temple is its location.  You are on an island in the middle of what seems to be a large ocean.  There is no other land in sight in any direction.  An altar made from giant clam shells is in the very center of the island, and on it is a chalice.  A doorway lies behind the altar. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24584}{turnaway}{turnaway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24599}{onward}{onward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24599}{0}{}{Path to Binah (turnaway,doorway)}{ }{Passing through the doorway, you begin sliding down a bright yellow tube of energy.  The speed picks up and you begin to break apart atom by atom.  There is no pain. Suddenly, the motion seems to slow down, and come to a stop.  Your being recoalesces, and you stand in front of a doorway. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
