R {24600}{0}{}{Temple of Binah (turnaway,onward)}{ }{This temple is forged of the blackest onyx.  A single lamp sits on a black onyx altar, shining light that is immediately absorbed into the walls.  Straining your eyes to see through the dim, you notice a doorway behind the altar. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
