R {24601}{0}{}{Path to Chockmah (turnaway,doorway)}{ }{Passing through the doorway, you find yourself enveloped in mists.  Testing your surroundings by touch, it seems that the mists are solid in some places, forming the walls and floor of this path.  Far away, the outline of a doorway shines through the mist, marking your path. }{Tree of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
