R {24610}{0}{<228>}{Path to Hod (turnaway,doorway)}{<228>. ^<088>}{Passing through the doorway, you find yourself on a warm sunny path through a grassy meadow.  The sun shines down upon you, warming you with its loving light.  A lone bird flies overhead, silhouetted against the bright blue sky and the fluffy clouds.  It would be easy to give up your quest for knowledge, and stay here forever. A lone doorway waits for you on the other side of the meadow. }{Tree of Life 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
