R {24611}{0}{<268>}{Temple of Hod (turnaway,onward)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{This temple stands on top of a great mountain.  Wind whips at you as you view your surroundings.  A pentacle dominates the floor, and is inscribed with Hebrew script.  A plain stone, weatherbeaten by the wind stands in the center of the pentacle, and the symbol of Mercury, planet of magick, is carved on its face. }{Tree of Life 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
