R {24627}{0}{}{The Simpson Backyard (tree,house)}{ }{The typical suburban backyard... perfectly square, fenced in on all sides by order of the neighbors who became ill at the sight of Homer not wearing a shirt.  The lawn here is surprisingly well-groomed, and a large elm tree near the house has a makeshift ladder leading up into its foliage.  }{Simpsons Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
