R {24634}{0}{}{An ice path in the mountains. (cave,s)}{<238>C<088>}{You are now far from the forest, deep within the mountains. The path comes to an end here but it appears that there is a hole in the glacier that you might be able to enter.  You shiver in the cold and think to yourself that it might not be wise to enter the glacier without some sort of warm protective clothing. }{Valley of Forests and Glaciers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
