R {24666}{0}{}{A Safe Place on a ledge (n)}{ }{You have found an exit from the ice caves and are now standing in the sunlight high above the valley.  The sun warms you and melts some of the ice off of you.  You like the feel of the warm air and the pleasant banter of songbirds floats to you from the trees below.  You would rather not reenter the Ice Caves but that appears to be the only way off of this ledge.  You decide that it might be a good idea to pause here for awhile to regain your strength. }{Valley of Forests and Glaciers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
