R {24674}{0}{}{Deck (bow,gangplank,stairs)}{ }{You are on the deck of a large sailing ship.  The vessel is old and creaks beneath you with uncertain stability.  Strange noises well from beneath the planks which is odd, because there seems to be nobody running the ship.  The rotted sails waft sadly in the breeze.  There is an old iron bell near the bow. }{Taslen}{taslen_ship}{}{}{1.000}{1}
