R {24676}{0}{<278>}{A dark, dreary shoppe (leave)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{You feel as if you have walked right into the kind of nightmare that made you run to mommy when you were eight years old.  You're quite  certain that the thick fog surrounding your feet wasn't produced by some silly machine.  A few chandeliers filled with dim, single-wick candles hang from the inky, black ceiling light the chamber just enough for you to see five feet before you.  There are no windows or skylights to help cut through the gloom, and for some odd reason not a single ray of light is able to work past the open doorway behind you.  Did I say open? I'm sorry, I forgot to mention that it slammed shut behind you of its own volition. Quieting your fears, you push forward into the shoppe, noticing that the monsters that had your skin crawling only moments ago are all suspended lightly on hangers from racks that fill the room.  Hah!  These are only costumes...or are they?  Count Dracula himself stands behind a counter near the door.  You notice three things on or near the counter: a large sign, an old, mechanical cash register, and a small, silver plaque. Noticing that the Count is staring at you rather coldly, you decide it would be best to purchase something from him or, ahem, attempt to leave empty handed. }{Pinnacle}{costume}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {132}{e}{leave}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {132}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {148}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24677}{0}{}{hold (bow,stairs)}{ }{You are in the ship's hold. There are many barrels and boxes here and a door to the stern. The air is very musty and old here. }{Taslen}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24674}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24678}{bow}{bow}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24678}{0}{}{hold (stern,ladder)}{ }{You are in the hold, beneath the deck. The place is utterly barren and smells horrible. }{Taslen}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24675}{ladder}{ladder}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24677}{stern}{stern}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24679}{0}{}{On a Rooftop}{ }{You are standing on the rooftop of an old abandoned building of some kind. The rooftop is surrounded by a large fence, made of metal, offering no possible way off. In one corner, there is a small brown box, and in another there is a group of 3 metal canisters, ready to explode. The rooftop's floor is comprised of wooden plankings, which are sturdy enough. Right in the middle of everything lies the top of a skylight, long since unused. Of all the items that grab your attention, the one that stands out the most is a small fan near the canisters. }{Duke Nukem}{duke_nukem}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24680}{fan}{kick fan;fan}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24680}{0}{<278>}{On the Street (w,e,wimp)}{W}{You are on the streets of L.A, now overtaken by monsters. Everything around you looks dark and dreary, making you feel a little down. Right behind you is the abandoned building you came from, and as a matter of fact, all around you are other abandoned buildings. Further down the street you can see a dumpster that is burning, and before it an old movie theatre. A little down the street to your right is a large box, just before some kind of sign, with graffiti on it. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24681}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24682}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {378}{wimp}{wimp}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24681}{0}{<278>}{On the Street (w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are at the end of the street, further away from the theatre. A large box stands just to your right, perhaps a good hiding place for something. The sign you saw earlier is now closer, and there appears to be something next to it. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24680}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
