R {24682}{0}{<278>}{On the Street (n,w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are on the run-down streets of L.A. Just to your left is an old movie theatre. The title of the movie featured is 'Biker Bimbos'. Further down the street is a dumpster that has something inside it burning. There is a small ticket window just outside the theatre that draws your attention. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24683}{n}{n}{1}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24698}{w}{break window; window}{8}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
