R {24683}{0}{<278>}{On the Street (s,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are on the mean streets of L.A. The skyline is as dirty as you have ever seen it, as no anti-pollution measures are being taken. The smell of assault troopers is strong here\; strong enough to make you want to kick some ass. Something has been set ablaze inside the dumpster next to you, and it is burning strong. Just ahead of you is an alley, which leads to the back entrance of the theatre. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
