R {24684}{0}{}{Johnson's RV (out)}{ }{        As you enter the RV, you are immediately overwhelmed by the sheer luxury in which the `healer' travels.  At one end of the RV is a full-size jacuzzi and a wet-bar.  A waterbed, well-used by the look of things, is immediately to your left.  To your right is a plush living room and a mahogany desk.  Further to your right is a well- appointed kitchen, bath, and shower.  You can barely see where the driver operates this vehicle. You are impressed.  RV's aren't for grandparents any more! }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34899}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24685}{0}{<248>}{In an Alley (e,s)}{<248>. .<088>}{You are in a small alleyway behind the theatre.  A large window leads behind the viewing screen. You sense some movement from behind the screen. A door with the word 'Exit' above it lies in front of you, leading into the theatre. A small patch of water lies next to the door, apparently from a leak in the drain above. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24683}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24686}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24686}{0}{<268>}{In a Small Hallway (w,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in a small hallway from the back door to the rest of the theatre. There is not much room to move here, as the walls are constricting. On the wall is a fire extinguisher, right next to the theatre entryway. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
