R {24687}{0}{<248>}{In the Screen Room (s,e)}{<248>. .<088>}{This is where the movies are actually viewed, the screen room. The room is comprised of red walls, brown seats, and a black floor. Just in front of you are three rows of seats, one after another, empty for a long time. There are two doors leading into the rest of the theatre, and one large window above the two, which appears to be from the projection booth. You can hear troopers approaching from the south. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
