R {24688}{0}{<268>}{In the Hallway (sw,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are in the hallway leading from the screen room to the lobby of the theatre. There is a small trashcan here, right next to a long column shaped glass display. There is a lightswitch on the wall, right before the entryway to the lobby. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
