R {24689}{0}{<248>}{In the Lobby (n,w,se,ne)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You are standing in the movie theatre lobby. This is the largest room you have seen so far, and many other rooms are connected through here. West of here is the concession stand, north is a door, and southeast of here is the arcade. There are two posters in this room, one of them reads 'Sister Act III', and the other, the featured film 'The Attack of the Bleached Blonde Biker Bimbos.' A security camera looms overhead, watching your every move. You feel like kicking some ass. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
