R {24695}{0}{<238>}{In the Bathroom (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in the movie theatre's bathroom. As you first enter the room the thing you notice the most is the large mirror. The mirror is complimented by a brown couch, something rarely seen in a bathroom. There are six basins on the right side of the room, and on the left lie two urinals. In between the urinals and and basins are two stalls, one of which has a 'out of order' sign on it. On the wall lies a vent. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
