R {24697}{0}{<148>}{In the Arcade (d)}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{You are standing in the arcade for the movie theatre. It is very noisy here, with the sounds of arcade games playing, in harmony. There is a group of canisters in the corner, next to a strange door with a keycard slot. There is a pinball machine, a flight simulator, and an arcade game in the other half of the room. }{Duke Nukem}{bigpig}{}{}{1.000}{1}
