R {24699}{0}{<078>}{A secret room (s,vent)}{<078>| |<088>}{You are in a secret hidden room behind the projection room. The room is rather barren, except for a woman who is wrapped in some sort of cocoon. }{Duke Nukem}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
