R {24704}{0}{}{Terran Bunker (leave)}{ }{You stand inside a small bunker. It looks like a dome made out of some strange metal. There are view holes all the way around from which Terran troops may fire at their enemies. You notice that the bunker is on fire, and has sustained heavy damage. You are not sure how smart it would be to remain here much longer. You may leave by way of the door at any time.  }{Starcraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
