R {24707}{0}{<228>}{Forest Trail (ne,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{A tranquil feeling rushes across your senses as you enter this part of the majestic forest.  Golden sunlight flows down from the sea-blue sky, offering warmth and natural luminance to this forest trail.  You can hear birds chirping merrily not far off in the distance.  The wondrous smell of blossoms drifts into your surroundings from gaps in the trees dwelling within these enchanted woods.  A slim trail breaks off towards the northeast, leading ever further into nature's grace.  The treetops cast a shadow across the emerald-green grass, causing a glow to faintly be seen. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
