R {24708}{0}{<228>}{Small Forest Trail (sw,ne)}{<228>( *<088>}{The potent scent of flower blossoms overcomes your sense of smell, sending you into a world of delight.  Lush emerald-green grass has begun to overtake this small forest trail, covering the forest floor in a sheath of beauty.   Large redwood trees spread out along the edges of this trail, creating a type of natural barrier.  Rays of golden sunlight filter through gaps in the dense treetops, dimly illuminating your surroundings.  The pleasant sound of a flock of birds merrily singing in union echoes into this area from not far to the northeast. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24707}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24709}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24709}{0}{<228>}{Tranquil Orchard (sw,n,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{The golden sun is directly overhead, shining down brightly upon this tranquil orchard.  You hear the sound of birds merrily chirping from their nestled spots in the treetops.  The forest floor is covered with lush green grass and some colorful pink daisies.  The blossoms on the many different types of fruit trees give off a wonderful floral scent. The worn forest trail continues leading towards the northern woods, but stops dead to the south at the beginning of the grass-covered plains. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
