R {24710}{0}{<238>}{Northern Trail (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{This northern trail is nearly overtaken by the lush green grass that overflows from the plains to the south.  A bed of lavender rose bushes is planted near the side of this dirt trail.  Clouds drift by quickly, as if some supernatural force was leading their way.  There is a breach in the wall of redwoods to the north of here, leading deeper into the enchanted woods.  The song of birds singing and chirping merrily echoes throughout this land. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24709}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
