R {24711}{0}{<228>}{Grass Covered Plains (n,s,e)}{<228>, .<088>}{The dirt trail comes to a dead stop where the emerald-green grass has totally overtaken the plains.  Rays of golden sunlight flow down from the sea-blue sky, brightly illuminating the area around you.  The back of a giant canvas tent covers the south end of this part of the grasslands.  The sweet fragrance of flowers is carried into this area by a gentle breeze originating from the east.  You hear the sound of many different voices meld in with the natural noises of the surrounding forest. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
