R {24712}{0}{<238>}{Centaur Encampment (n,s,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Emerald-green grass covers the plains like a sheath for almost as far as the eye can see.   The wall of a giant canvas tent is set up along the east side of this section of the encampment.  A few wispy white clouds hover overhead, slowly drifting towards the north.  A wall of redwood trees grows along the west, creating a natural barrier.  The moist soil of the forest floor has been dug up in a small circular hole, where the remains of an extinguished campfire lay.  Howling echoes across the plains from a source somewhere off in the distance.  A gentle breeze blows past you, carrying with it a weak perfume-like scent. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
