R {24713}{0}{<228>}{Behind The Giant Tent (w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{This section of the grassy plains is almost completely covered by the back of a large canvas tent.  Golden sunlight flows down from the sea-blue sky, falling across the giant tent, it casts a large shadow across nearly everything in this area.  The sound of someone talking can vaguely be heard through the canvas wall of the tent. A small patch of lovely violets grow within a man-made circle of stones, located next to the wall of redwood trees facing the north. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24711}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
