R {24714}{0}{<238>}{Centaur Encampment (n,e)}{A}{The beautiful emerald-green grass that covers the plains subsides here.  A few stout redwoods can be seen through the tangled mass of vines, that grow along the west.  Dozens of wispy white clouds hover overhead, in the otherwise sea-blue sky, slowly drifting toward the north.  The northern part of these grasslands is almost completely blanketed by a large canvas tent.  Growing along the edge of the southern wall of redwoods, is a legion of some strange looking plant.  A musky scent lingers within the air, causing your nose to not only tingle but also itch. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
