R {24715}{0}{<238>}{Centaur Encampment (enter,s,w,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand before the front of a large canvas tent that is spread across the beautiful grasslands.  Golden sunlight flows down from the clear sea-blue sky, brightly illuminating the area around you. The emerald-green grass that covers the fertile soil like a sheath, has been worn away from the front the tent.  A couple of healthy tomato plants grow next to a large wooden table, which sits flatly on the ground.  Directly to the south beyond a smaller version of the tent placed here, is a large wooden building. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
