R {24716}{0}{<238>}{Centaur Encampment (enter,s,e,w,n)}{E}{A small canvas tent has been placed in the center of this section of the grasslands.  The potent fragrance of flowers that drifts into this area must be from a location not far from here.  Strangely, a flock of white doves drifts directly overhead in the sea-blue sky.  Though your vision to the north is obscured, you're still able to make out a larger version of the canvas tent that has been set up here.  Laughter can be heard echoing outward from a wooden building, standing not far to the south. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
