R {24717}{0}{<238>}{Large canvas tent. (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Rays of golden sunlight seep in through the many various-sized holes covering this tent.  Sparsely decorated, and somewhat of a mess, it would appear whoever lives here doesn't care about cleaning up after themselves.  A bundle of covers lies in a heap in the east corner of this tent, while a leather bag sits in the west.  A small fire-pit lies in the center of the tent, while a rusty barrel sits right next to its opening.  It's more than a little difficult to hold your gag-reflex in check, with the disgusting smell that lingers here. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
