R {24718}{0}{<238>}{Outside the Silvermane (n,s,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{A finely crafted wooden building has been built in this section of the grasslands.  Rays of golden sunlight fall across the top of the roof, casting a medium-sized shadow down upon this area.   Another large cluster of redwood trees forms a wall around this section of the plains.  The emerald-green grass that covers the land like a protective sheath has been cut away to a measly few inches here. A few clay flowerpots sit next to the giant windowsill set into the front of the building.  You hear the sound of laughter echoing outward from the open doorway to the south. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
