R {24719}{0}{<238>}{Centaur Encampment (enter,s,w,e,n)}{E}{Grey smoke drifts upwards from a small teepee-like hole in the top of the canvas tent set up in this section of the plains.  Strangely, the emerald-green grass does not grow nearly as densely here as it does within the rest of the majestic grasslands.  A cool, gentle breeze seems to constantly blows across this area, bringing with it the sweet fragrance of flowers.   Nearly a half-dozen dark clouds gather overhead, slightly obscuring the brilliance of the glaring, golden sun.  As gloomy as this part of the grasslands are, there's a distinct presence of serenity dwelling here. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
