R {24720}{0}{<238>}{Tent's entryway (out,e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        Sunlight seeps into the entryway of this giant tent through both the open flaps and the thick canvas, which this tent is made from.  Very little has been placed near this area, in fact if not for the hoof prints that cover the floor this tent would appear to be abandoned. From here you may either walk east towards what looks like the guards' quarters, north past two partly closed tent flaps, or out where the grasslands lie.  Even within here you can still hear the sounds of the myriad animal-life which dwells within the enchanted woods. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
