R {24721}{0}{<238>}{Centaur Encampment (s,w,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The grasslands before you are covered not only by emerald-green grass but also by a legion of flowers.  Violets, daisies, buttercups, tulips and the strange weed called dandelions colorfully cover the landscape as only they can.  The golden sun is located almost directly overhead, and as such it sends rays of life-giving sunlight down upon all the flora growing here.  The plains continue to expand towards what looks like a well to the east, and a giant canvas tent to the west.  All the pollen in the air is nearly suffocating, but the scent of all these flowers mixed together is somewhat intoxicating. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
