R {24756}{0}{<148>}{A magical spring (s)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The sun shines down upon this clearing, sending golden rays of light to reveal a magical haven, divine in nature.  Lush emerald-green grass, redwood and oak trees, and bushes and flowers of every type sprout up in legions across this land.  Dimly glowing, the flora thriving here has beauty unmatched by any other in nature.  Sunlight sparkles off the enchanted water of a spring, enhancing the majestic aura of power and serenity already surrounding it.  The dense treetops bend, sway, and rustle as a cool breeze gently blows the divine aroma of the combined fragrances over you.  Ahhh. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
