R {24759}{0}{<228>}{In an enchanted forest (n,e,w)}{<228>( *<088>}{The ancient redwoods of this majestic forest subside, creating a small man-made clearing.  Your nostrils are assaulted by the intense fragrance of the potent herbs being cultivated in the small mini-garden planted near the front of the wooden shack.  A white picket fence blocks access to the northern forest, allowing only those who pass through the opening the trail presents, to travel any deeper into the enchanted woods.  The sea-blue sky holds the golden sun directly overhead.  The only protection offered from the glaring rays of sunlight are the few clouds drifting towards the northwest. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
