R {24760}{0}{<238>}{A cozy log shack (w)}{<238># #<088>}{This homely wooden shack looks like it has been around for awhile, made of redwood it has a red hue to it.   Golden sunlight flows in through the front and side windows, brightly illuminating this room. Next to the front door lies a cluttered, worn, wood desk.  While an oak counter lies on the west side of the room, located next to the side window.  About to tip over, an old lopsided bookshelf sits next to a comfortable-looking bed in the southern part of this cozy log shack. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24759}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {24761}{0}{<228>}{In an enchanted forest. (w,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{The path on which you stand leads through a majestic forest.  There are lush plants, flowers and gigantic trees as far as the eye can see. Dark green shrubs and flamingo-pink rose bushes are planted along the dirt road.   Patches of emerald-green grass and layers of moist brown clay cover the path.  Up ahead, to the east is a wooden shack and a white picket fence.  It's a nice and sunny day, as few clouds obstruct your view of the sea-blue sky. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
