R {24762}{0}{<238>}{Forest crossroad (s,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{The forest trail breaks off into two directions, towards the east where an ancient massive oak tree is rooted, and to the south where the grasslands are located.   A sweet fragrance overcomes your nostrils, blown into this area by a gentle breeze from the east.  A large marble bench has been placed upon the edge of this trail.  The sun sends rays of golden sunlight down upon this part of the forest, fending off the early morning chill. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
