R {24784}{0}{<238>}{A Gildenrod Boat (back)}{<238>\_/<088>}{You are in one of the legendary granite boats of the Giants, formed out of the rock of the Land and powered by a keel of the magical gildenrod.  It was once thought that all knowledge of the crafts of granite-melding and the fashioning of gilden were gone with the Desecration.  But here is evidence of its possible restoration!  You are in awe of the boat's beauty. The Soulsease river pushes hard against the boat's bow, bending it back towards the hills of fair Andelain.  The stern visage of Mount Thunder rises up to the west. }{The Land}{saltheart}{}{}{1.000}{1}
