R {25250}{0}{<248>}{Cavern (ne,sit)}{<248>% %<088>}{You are in a slightly illuminated cavern with smooth walls. A torch is mounted on the west wall. On the ground, there is a low table covered in a blood red, silk tablecloth. Black, satin pillows are arranged around the table. The rest of the room is bare and undecorated, however, there is a definite odor emanating from an unknown source.   }{Garou Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
