R {25251}{0}{<248>}{Cavern (nw,sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{This softly lit room has all the makings of an artist's studio. There is an easel in the middle of the room with a half done painting placed upon it. There is also a tray sitting next to the easel with an array of paintbrushes laying on it. Paintings of different styles are hung on the walls and white candles glowing a soft, yellow color are placed haphazardly on the floor.   }{Garou Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25250}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
