R {25252}{0}{<248>}{Cavern (sw,se)}{<248>% %<088>}{The walls in this room are made out of dark grey rock, however they do not look smooth. There are red candles placed in a circle inside a larger circle of white, satin pillows. Placed along the floor of the perimeter of this room are various types of musical instruments.   }{Garou Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25251}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25253}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25253}{0}{<248>}{Cavern (n,ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{You are standing in a room with dark purple and emerald green satin pillows. Nearly the entire floor is covered with them and they have tufts of fur on them. A small pathway leads from where you entered to the other exit. The walls are rough and dark grey, and have torches mounted on them. You almost trip over a furry bundle directly in front of you.   }{Garou Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25252}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25254}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25254}{0}{<248>}{Cavern (nw,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{This room is almost pitch black, except for a small black candle placed on a table near the south entrance. The table is covered in a black, silk tablecloth. The walls are bare and the candle displays shadows dancing along them.   }{Garou Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
