R {25258}{0}{<248>}{Cavern}{<248>% %<088>}{This is the great Werebeast Caern. In the middle of the room, there is a small circle of rocks enclosing a small fire. There are white, satin pillows placed around the rocks and on each of the walls, there are mirrors framed in gold. The walls are carved into with strange looking runes.   }{Garou Cave}{shirokane}{}{}{1.000}{1}
