R {25259}{0}{<238>}{Inside a Cottage (w)}{<238># #<088>}{The good sorceress Mira lies unconscious on the bed. Her husband, Gerrik sits next to her waving his hand in strange motions over her face now  and then while whispering strange words. Sweat drips down his face as if it is taking great strength to perform his spell. A servant bustles about trying to help Gerrik take care of Mira. }{Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24455}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25260}{0}{<178>}{In a garden (enter,shed)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{You are in a small vegetable garden. It looks like someone takes very good  care of it. A small shed is here with its door open. Birds chirp in the nearby trees. }{Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
