R {25262}{0}{<278>}{A secluded path (s,n)}{<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>}{The forest path stretches out before you leading you deeper into this immense ancient forest.  The trees here seem older and larger than those along the path to the south.  They seem to crowd in on the path more tightly than before, creating a feeling of oppression. Even the sun seems unable to penetrate the leafy green canopy as it did before. }{New Arovian Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24460}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25263}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25263}{0}{<278>}{A secluded path (w,s)}{<278>-+ <088>}{The trees seem to have almost completely crowded in on the path here as it turns westward. The temperature feels like it has dropped a few degrees as a light mist seems to have sprung up from the barren forest floor.  The towering trees on either side have formed a thick green canopy so thick that no direct sunlight reaches the ground leaving the forest floor devoid of plant life. }{New Arovian Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25262}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25264}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25264}{0}{<278>}{A secluded path (w,e)}{<278>---<088>}{The air has a definite chill to it here, as the wispy tendrils of mist that seem to have arisen reach out to grasp you and draw you  into their shadowy embrace. Overhead, the thick green canopy of leaves and branches allow no sunlight into this ominous scene.  Nervously  you glance around, considering your options: go east towards a bend and perhaps get out of here or press westward to where the forest seems to be getting lighter?  }{New Arovian Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25263}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25265}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25265}{0}{<278>}{A secluded path (e,w)}{<278>---<088>}{The forest seems to end abruptly here, opening into a large clearing in the forest.  The air is refreshingly warm and it feels good to have the sun on your face once more, compared to the gloom and chill of the misty forest. Relaxed, you feel able to proceed onward. }{New Arovian Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25264}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25266}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25266}{0}{<238>}{Amidst the Arovian graves (n,e,w,s)}{<238>. <178>+<088>}{Ancient moss-covered stone tombs and intricately carved gravestones loom out of the swirling mist like ferocious creatures ready to devour your very soul.  Everything seems so much more mysterious and frightening.  Looking up, even the sun seems to have turned a dull red in this eerie mist. }{New Arovian Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25265}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25267}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25268}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25269}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25267}{0}{<238>}{Amidst the Arovian graves (n,w,s)}{<238>. <178>+<088>}{After a few moments of careful consideration, you decide that in this mist, it seems rather easy to lose yourself amidst the sinister towering tombs of the dead. Luckily, you seem to have stumbled upon a path leading north.  Perhaps it can lead you out of this place. }{New Arovian Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
