R {25297}{0}{}{A silent tomb (e,w)}{ }{The air in here is musty and carries the faint stench of decay and mildew. As far as you can see this tomb stretches off along this corridor vanishing into the inky blackness of this tomb. Devoid of any furnishings this section of the tomb of quite nondesript, just about the only thing of immediate note is the rubble and debris that seems to have been caused when the western wall was breached.  }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
