R {25298}{0}{}{A silent tomb (n,w,e)}{ }{The corridor stretches off into the gloom on both sides leaving you with a decidedly claustrophic feeling. The air is damp and chilly with the lingering faint stench of decay. Set into the north wall here is a large impressive doorway that leads into what appears to be a large antechamber. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
