R {25299}{0}{}{A large antechamber (s)}{ }{This large room is veritable treasure trove of chests, vases, jars and other carefully stored possessions of the king. Taking  pride of place in the center of the room is a large wooden chariot, now covered in dust and looking exceedingly fragile. Everywhere you look the glint of gold catches your eye. This must truly have been a powerful king to have so much wealth buried with him. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
