R {25300}{0}{}{A silent tomb (s,w,e)}{ }{A large arched doorway is set into the southern wall of the corridor here. The air is decidedly colder here, causing your breath to mist up, sending small clouds of steam rising up  to the ceiling of the corridor. Deathly quiet you swear you hear your own heart pounding. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
