R {25301}{0}{}{A silent antechamber (n)}{ }{The silence of this tomb seems to hang on the air here,  condensing around you, threatening to swallow you whole.  The chamber itself is mostly empty save for a large stone altar at the far end of the room, behind which the statue of an Arovian god stands guard. Covering the floor here  are the remants of long dried flower petals. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
