R {25303}{0}{}{A silent tomb (n,s,e,w)}{ }{Large doorways on either side of the corridor lead off, into ominiously dark chambers. Whilst the corridor maintains its straight east/west direction vanishing off into the gloom of the tomb. Bracketing each doorway are two ancient sconces each containing a darkened torch. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
