R {25306}{0}{}{A silent tomb (e,w)}{<238>H<088>}{The corridor continues onward and deeper into the tomb.  Glancing in either direction the corridor fades out into encompassing darkness. Silent and empty the corridor seems to be tempting you explore ever deeper into the tomb. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{hengst}{}{}{1.000}{1}
