R {25307}{0}{}{A silent tomb (e,w)}{ }{The corridor appears to be coming to an end here, as  up ahead, the gloom of the corridor suddenly gives way to the inky darkness of a large room. Unable to see  the contents of the room you will have to proceed further east if you wish to know more. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
