R {25309}{0}{}{A silent chamber (s,e)}{ }{You find yourself in the northwest corner of this large chamber. Nestled in the corner is a massive stone statue of an Arovian god, his arms upraised connecting with the ceiling as if supporting it. Looking up at the statue you can't help but be struck with a feeling of awe at the sheer scale of this tomb. Resting at the feet of the statue is a large heavy brazier which would have been used to illuminate this area. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
