R {25310}{0}{}{A silent chamber (n,e)}{ }{Looming above you, here in the southwest corner of this large chamber is a massive stone statue of an Arovian god, her arms upraised, connecting with the ceiling. Tiny and insignficant compared to the statue, you feel a real sense of grandeur and awe about this tomb. Resting at the feet of the statue is a large heavy brazier which  would have been used to illuminate this area. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
