R {25311}{0}{}{A silent chamber (n,s,w,e)}{ }{Here in the center of this large chamber, the darkness and silence of this vast room is oppressive. Darkness surrounds you threatening to engulf you once your illumination is extinguished. In the gloom large shapes loom in the corners of the room threatening to strike out at any moment. Resting silently before you is a large stone block with a large metal ring, inset into the floor here.  }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
