R {25313}{0}{}{A short corridor (s)}{ }{The corridor ends abruptly here in a dead end, dust and cobwebs adorn the walls giving this place and undisturbed appearance. Two burnt out torches rest in their sconces one on either side of the corridor's walls. To the south you can make out the empty blackness of a large dark  room. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
