R {25314}{0}{}{A silent chamber (s,w)}{ }{Standing serenely in this corner of the chamber is a  large statue of an Arovian god. Dressed in the finest robes this statue depecits a beautiful woman bedecked in jewels, with her hands raised up to the ceiling as if supporting it. Standing between her feet is a  large heavy brazier which would have been used to  illuminate this area. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
