R {25316}{0}{}{A silent chamber (n,w)}{ }{Dominating this southeastern corner of this large chamber is a massive statue of an ancient Arovian god, his arms upstretched to the ceiling as if he were  supporting it. Amazed by its beauty and sheer size you can't help but ponder what other treasures are hidden  down here. Resting at the feet of the statue is a large heavy brazier which would have been used to illuminate this area during the King's burial ceremony. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
