R {25317}{0}{}{A short corridor (w)}{ }{The corridor ends abruptly here in a dead end. The air here is slightly stale and is heavy with the smell of rot and decay. Thick coats of dust lie everywhere, indicating that no-one has been along this corridor in a very long time. Two ancient torches remain in their sconces, untouched since the kings tomb was sealed. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
