R {25319}{0}{}{A short corridor (n)}{ }{The corridor ends abruptly here in a dead end. Judging by the thick coats of dust that lie everywhere, no-one has  been this way in a few centuries. Oddly though it would appear that someone has sprinkled some kind of flower petals near the south wall. Apart from this only other noteworthy thing about this dead-end corridor is the  two ancient burnt out torches that remain in their sconces. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
