R {25320}{0}{}{Chamber of the Champion (n)}{<148>H<088>}{Undisturbed for several centuries this looks like the burial chamber of mighty warrior.  Lined around the walls of this chamber is an array of varied weapons and pieces of armour all covered in centuries deep dust. Resting in the center of the room on a stone plynth is a large stone coffin. It would appear that someone has recently tunnelled their way into the northern wall here, scattering rubble and debris over the floor of the chamber. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{harakir}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25319}{n}{break down wall;n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25321}{0}{}{Chamber of the High Priestess (w)}{<148>M<088>}{Undisturbed for centuries, this dust in this chamber has coated everything like a thin layer of snow, making the large white marble coffin in the center of the room appear slightly grey. Even the golden chalices and bowl on the stone table at the  far even of the room gleam dully. Curiously it would appear that before the priests left this room all those years ago they almost entirely covered the floor of this room in  flower petals. It would appear that someone has recently  tunnelled their way through western wall here, scattering  rubble and debris over the floor of the chamber. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{mircarla}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25317}{w}{break down wall;w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25322}{0}{}{Chamber of the Vizier (s)}{<148>S<088>}{The air in here is musty and stale, as if this chamber has been sealed off for a very long time. Lined around the walls of this chamber is an array of varied golden objects from vases right up to a large golden throne like chair. Covered in dust everything gleams with a dull glow. Dominating the center of the room on a stone plynth is a large stone coffin. It would appear that someone has dug their way through the southern wall here, scattering rubble and debris over the  floor }{Tomb of King Alaren}{sumaren}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25313}{s}{break down wall;s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25323}{0}{}{An ancient stairway (u,d)}{ }{The steps of the stairwell end here, rising up into what appears to be a large darkened cavern. Descending off into the darkness below the stairwell leads off deeper into the crypt.  }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
