R {25324}{0}{}{An ancient stairway (d,u)}{ }{There is a definite chill lingering on the air here, causing your breath to mist slightly, and making you shiver ever so slightly. Your vison on this stairway only lasts for as long as your light can reach out into the darkness that surrounds you. To go up or down, the choice is yours.  }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25323}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
