R {25325}{0}{}{At the bottom of an ancient stairway (u)}{}{Here at the bottom of an ancient staircase, the air is heavy with the smell of midrew and centuries of dust. Silence abounds as does the all encompassing darkness, yet even so you can't quite shake the feeling that you're being watched. From here you have two simple choices climb the stairs and return to the level above or proceed through the gates barring your progress along the passageway stretching off into the darkness eastward. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25324}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
