R {25326}{0}{}{An ancient passageway (w,e)}{ }{The Stone passgeway comes to an abrupt halt slightly west of here at the base of a set of stone steps rising up into the darkness. Further eastward the passageway leads off in the heart of the tomb. A large golden gate that once blocked the western end of this passageway has been yanked open and no longer threatens to entomb you down here. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
