R {25327}{0}{}{An ancient passageway (e,w)}{ }{The passageway vanishes slowly off to into the gloom in either direction. The air here is heavy with a damp fusty smell that seems to catch in the back of your throat causing you to sniff the air apprehensively. To the west you think you can just about make out a yellowish gleam in the darkness while eastward the gloom most definately appears to have a flickering red tinge. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25326}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
