R {25328}{0}{}{An ancient passageway (n,e,w,s)}{ }{Gaping doorways on the northern and southern walls lead to darkened rooms here, their contents as yet unknown. Further  to the east the darkness has been replaced by a reddish orange  glow that seems to flicker ever so slightly.  }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
