R {25329}{0}{}{A silent chamber (s)}{ }{This room is completely empty except for a low stone bier that occupies the center of the room. Resting quietly upon the bier are the dust covered skeletal remains of 2 warriors, most likely some form of honor guard in the afterlife for their king. Long burnt out torches rest in their sconces on the western and  eastern walls. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
