R {25330}{0}{}{An ancient passageway (e,w)}{ }{The darkness is definitely receeding here, allowing you glance further towards where you think the corridor finally opens up into some kind of large chamber. To the west only darkness awaits, while a little further along the passageway you can see 2 gaping doorways in the northern and southern walls. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
