R {25334}{0}{}{An ancient passageway (e,w)}{ }{The long passageway ends here, opening out into what appears to be a large chamber. Shadows dance and play merrily about the walls here, cast by the amber glow of the torchlight streaming out of the chamber before you. Behind you the corridor rapidly dwindles off into the darkness. Everything is silent here, as silent as the proverbial grave.  }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
