R {25338}{0}{}{Hall of the King (n,w,e,s)}{<138>A<088>}{Resting on a massive black marble bier is a large golden   Inix     Uptime: 1.6 days  Reboot: 6.9 days  Lag: 0.00  Idle: [00:00:01]   coffin the sparkles and glows in the surrounding torchlight. Even the black marble of the bier seems to attract and reflect the light giving it a glossy black sheen. The air here seems charged with raw energy, that almost seems to crackle and sizzle\; without doubt powerful magical spells have been cast here. Just standing here you cannot help but be impressed by the sheer scale and attention to detail the Arovians have lavished on their  departed king.  }{Tomb of King Alaren}{alaren}{}{}{1.000}{1}
