R {25340}{0}{}{A quiet Antechamber (s)}{ }{A single stone bier takes up much of the room in this small antechmaber. Resting upon this bier is a large white stone coffin. Numerous colourful frescoes cover the walls of this room, much of which seem to depict Arovian gods watching over the actions of a beautiful woman. Unlike most of the rest of this tomb complex there is a distinct feeling of peace and serenity here. To the south you can see a large chamber  containing a circle of massive stone columns. }{Tomb of King Alaren}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
