R {25344}{0}{}{HQ -- Gentech Entrance (e)}{ }{This is the Gentech space station `HQ`, head quarters of the Gentech guild. You're standing on the direct link bodyslide pad to Pinnacle. From the huge view ports that surround this barren metal room, you can see all of the town below. A strange glow seems to come from the walls and light the room. If you wish to join in the battle with the Gentech, please contact a current member. If, as a member of the Gentech, you happen to lose your lower arm casing, come to this room and type 'restore'. }{Gentech}{gentech}{}{}{1.000}{1}
