R {25356}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Offense Division Lounge (s)}{ }{You stand within a medium sized triangular room. The walls are lined with couches and a subtle relaxing atmosphere is created by the soft glow of the few lights which adorn the walls. Members of the Offense Division come here to discuss division issues. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
