R {25360}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Storage-Facility (s)}{ }{The hallway ends here in a spartan lab. You see black marks along the surface of the shiny floor. A large machine stands in the middle of lab, with huge pipes leading into it. The walls have all been very painstakingly cleansed here as well. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25352}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25361}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Arsenal (n)}{ }{This is a very small room, but you can see that all of the space within it has been put to very good use.  Every square millimeter holds some kind of weapon or armour.  This is the guild Arsenal. Type 'list' to have the HQ computer display what is in stock.  If you wish to acquire an item, type 'buy <item name>' or to purchase an entire suit of armour and weapon, type 'suitup #', where # is the weapon on the list you wish to purchase. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25352}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25362}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Stores (e)}{ }{This is a large circular room with a high ceiling. There are many shelves lining the walls, and there are metal boxes and crates piled neatly throughout the room. In the center of the room is a large digitization pad, the marvel of the 40th century. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25352}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25363}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Remote Timeslide Link Pad (n)}{ }{You've stepped into a narrow room which is encircled with a fine and narrow band of glowing metal. You can feel the waves of energy being diverted into the circle. There is a small shiny black control panel on a small stand in the center of the circle. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25353}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25364}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Shuttlebay (w)}{ }{A huge open doorway into empty space stands before you. The only reason that you aren't being pulled out into space is because of the light blue force field that borders the bay doors. The large shuttlebay is the only entrance into HQ for those that don't appreciate the greatness of the bodysliding technology. There is a large control panel on the back wall of the bay. On the back wall of the bay stand huge mooring casements, the storage compartments of the Gentech dropships. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25353}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25365}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Advancement Room (u,s)}{ }{This is the level advancement room of the Gentech guild. Here is where you come to advance your levels and stats and search for information about quests. To advance your Rank you will have to speak with the computer at the main access node that is on the platform up the stairs. There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25350}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
