R {25366}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 1 :: Access Node (d)}{ }{This is where a Gentech guild member may advance their Rank. In front of you stands the main access node of the resident intelligent operating program of HQ. The node consists of a large wide shiny black half-circle computer terminal. Many different colored lights flicker on its surface. To one side there is a small holographic display projector. To advance your Rank, just type <commence>. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
