R {25372}{0}{}{Workout Room (e)}{ }{You find yourself surrounded by equipment that is the latest that technology has to offer the art of physical fitness. Each machine is uniquely designed in order to maximize its effectiveness in each workout session. As with all fitness endeavors, you will not see immediate results, nor keep the results you worked for if you don't work out regularly. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25370}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25373}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 2 :: Cloning Chamber (w)}{ }{This wide room stretches out before you with walls that slope away fromyou on both sides. Lights appear embedded in the otherwise smooth ceilingand take up angles running down the ceiling with the walls. Dominatingthe room are huge cylinders which contain a clear liquid which bubblesand swirls behind the cylinders' plasti-steel walls. Surrounding the base ofeach cylinder is a large computer workstation. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25371}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25374}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 2 :: Experimentation Cylinders (n,w)}{<148>X<088>}{You stand in an immense hexagonal room. Many lights beam up bright arcs from the floor, and stretch to the ceiling. There are numerous shiny black benches that are equipped with all sorts of technologically  advanced equipment. There are two large plastisteel cylinders embedded into two of the walls. Computer consoles are stationed throughout the laboratory and two of the walls contain sets of shelves which appear to be lined with even more advanced equipment. It looks as though any number of experiments could be performed here. There is one vast computer station located in the center of the room. Lights shine down from above it, encircling it in a soft white glow. }{Gentech}{experimentation_cylinders}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25369}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25375}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25375}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 2 :: Science Class Lounge (e)}{ }{You stand just beyond the experiment chamber in what appears to be a large office. Many couches and chairs line the walls and a large rectangular desk takes up one side of the room. Large holographic charts hover in the space in different places throughout the office. Members of the Science Class come here to discuss class issues and meet with the Chief Science Officer. A large display panel is mounted on one wall. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25374}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25376}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 2 :: Infusion Center (s,e)}{ }{Before you stands a large bank of computer screens and medical equipment. There are large needles and scalpels along with two very large cylinders that seem to be boiling with a greenish liquid. Also within this oval room are a few chairs and on a glass dividing wall you can see a medical emblem. Beside that is a large containment console, which looks as if it contains something toxic or biohazardous. }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25368}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25377}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25377}{0}{}{HQ -- Level 2 :: Infirmary (w,e)}{ }{This is a long rectangular room. There is a large glass wall on the east side of the room. You can see many elevated flat cushioned beds spread in an orderly manner throughout the room. On the south wall is a large bank of machines and computers. On one of the screens in bright blue letters are the words 'Admit whom?' }{Gentech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25376}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
