R {25383}{0}{}{-={@ Light Hallway @}=-}{ }{Towering over your head are the large gothic arches of the Cathedral.  On either side of you, light teak pews face towards a white altar far to the north.  Icons and statuary of the light gods line the hallway, and are set in ornate niches carved by the skilled stonemasons of Pinnacle.  The floor is a gleaming white marble, and shows evidence of the penitence and worship of the light brethren who use this portion of the cathedral.  To the south you see a large arch leading back to the main receiving room of the cathedral. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
