R {25384}{0}{}{-={@ Belltower @}=-}{ }{The top of the cathedral belltower provides a magnificent view of the western part of Wayhaven.  Treetops poke up among the buildings to the east, and you can see the top of the citadel peeking above the treeline.  The bell itself gleams as if it were made of polished silver.  Newly installed and barely tested, it waits to ring out the glory of the gods to all within earshot.  Below you, a narrow spiral staircase begins its treacherous descent into the cathedral. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25380}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25385}{0}{}{-={@ Light Board @}=-}{ }{Towering over your head are the large gothic arches of the Cathedral.  On either side of you, oaken pews face towards a white altar to the north. Icons and statuary of the light gods line the hallway, and are set in ornate niches carved by the skilled stonemasons of Pinnacle.  The floor is a gleaming white marble, and shows evidence of the penitence and worship of the light brethren who use this portion of the cathedral.  To the south you see a large arch leading back to the main receiving room of the cathedral. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25383}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25386}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25386}{0}{}{-={@ Light Hallway @}=-}{ }{Towering over your head are the large gothic arches of the Cathedral.  On either side of you, light teak pews face towards a light altar just to the north.  Icons and statuary of the light gods line the hallway, and are set in ornate niches carved by the skilled stonemasons of Pinnacle.  The floor is a gleaming white marble, and shows evidence of the penitence and worship of the light brethren who use this portion of the cathedral.  Far to the south you see a large arch leading back to the main receiving room of the cathedral. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25385}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25387}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25387}{0}{}{-={@ Light Altar @}=-}{ }{Your eyes are rivetted to the massive altar in front of you.  Carved from a single piece of pure white alabaster, it is adorned with the finest linens, and gleaming white gold symbols of the gods of light.  Behind the altar to the north a small archway leads to a chamber which flickers from dark to light. You may pray at this altar for an alignment adjustment, for the price of a coin donation.  You may also sacrifice items to the greater glory of the gods of light. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25386}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25388}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25388}{0}{}{-={@ Galan's Altar @}=-}{ }{As you enter the room, you notice that it is completely empty save for an enormous brass pendulum, the cable of which extends up into the void.  As the pendulum swings back and forth it draws a representation of the face of Galan in the fine gray powder on the floor.  To the south, are three arches leading to the portions of the cathedral appropriate to each path. High overhead on the north wall is a huge rose window. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
