R {25395}{0}{}{-={@ Darkened World Portal @}=-}{ }{Glowing blue sigils are embedded in the perfectly smooth and polished black marble flooring.  These sigils were magical activators for portals to different locations through-out Pinnacle.  As you approach the closest portal to you, it flickers -- but then reverts to a deadened black.  A circular staircase leads up to the ground level cathedral, while to the north are the rooms of the cathedral foundation. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
