R {25396}{0}{}{-={@ Celestial Stairway @}=-}{ }{Below you, and down the staircase is the main room of the cathedral, while up above you, the stairway just sort of disappears.  You hear a faint tinkling of bells and a rumbling of thunder from above, and you know you are as close to the gods as you will ever be allowed to get without their permission to proceed. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
