R {25397}{0}{}{-={@ Guild Master Applying Room @}=-}{ }{This is the Guild master applying room.  Here you apply for GM positions, AGM being the lowest rank, then GM, and CGM. Each rank has more responsibility than the previous.  Use the board here to post your applications, and also use to post your opinions about persons applying for a GM position or any current GMs. To see the list of current GMs, type:       'priest gms' }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
