E {25418}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25398}{0}{}{-={@ Storage Room @}=-}{ }{Here in the foundation of the Priest's Cathedral you are surrounded by huge block walls of cut limestone and massive supporting pillars.  The floor of this room is a dark polished marble, which contrasts greatly with the rough stonework of the foundation.  Baskets for storing both fireseeds and goodberries sit in the center of the room.  To the north you can make out the World Portal room. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25395}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25399}{0}{}{-={@ Foundation Hallway @}=-}{ }{Here in the foundation of the Priest's Cathedral you are surrounded by huge block walls of cut limestone and massive supporting pillars.  The floor of the hallway is a dark polished marble, which contrasts greatly with the rough stonework of the foundation.  Everything is perfectly clean, gleaming in fact.  To the south you make out a staircase, while to the north the long hallway continues.  The acolyte room is to your west, and to your east is a donation room. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25395}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25400}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
