E {25402}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25400}{0}{}{-={@ Acolyte Room @}=-}{ }{Here off of the central nave is a tidy room where the acolytes, those aspiring to become Priests and Priestesses someday, come to wait for guild members to procure their services.  Some of the older acolytes look like they have been here since Galan was a boy, but all of them, young and old alike, seem eager to please.  A sign hangs on the wall, and if the Master of Acolytes is here you may hire the services of an acolyte. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25399}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25401}{0}{}{-={@ Donation Room @}=-}{ }{This is the Donation Room.  Priests come here to donate for increased faith The walls are made from huge blocks of cut limestone and the ceiling is supported by massive pillars.  The floor is a polished, black marble which contrasts greatly with the rough stonework of the foundation. There is a small, wooden box here which you can place your monetary donations in. To donate: donate <amt>. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25399}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25402}{0}{}{-={@ Foundation Hallway @}=-}{ }{Here in the foundation of the Priest's Cathedral you are surrounded by huge block walls of cut limestone and massive supporting pillars.  The floor of the hallway is a dark polished marble, which contrasts greatly with the rough stonework of the foundation.  Everything is perfectly clean, gleaming in fact.  Far to the south you make out a staircase, while to the north the long hallway continues.  The reagents room is to your west, and to your east is the Priest guild board. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
