R {25403}{0}{}{-={@ Priest Main Board Room @}=-}{ }{Here in the foundation of the Priest Cathedral you are surrounded by huge block walls of cut limestone and massive supporting pillars.  The floor of the hallway is a dark polished marble, which contrasts greatly with the  rough stonework of the foundation.  Everything is perfectly clean.  In this small room off the hallway, you find the Priest Guild's Main Board. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
