R {25406}{0}{}{-={@ Alcove of Flapping @}=-}{ }{You have emerged from the glistening marble atmosphere of the temple foundation into a cozy sunken alcove.  Beer-stained burgundy shag carpet covers the floor, and several beanbag chairs are strategically positioned about the room.  An assortment of magazines rests on a low table.  The dim glow of a vending machine exudes from one corner of the room. This is the legendary Priest Guild junk room, where priests have gathered for years to waste large quantities of time.  A bulletin board, standing prominently in the middle of the room, will aid you in such pursuits. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25403}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25407}{0}{}{-={@ Alcove Idea Room @}=-}{ }{Here in the foundation of the Priest Cathedral you are surrounded by huge block walls of cut limestone and massive supporting pillars.  The floor of the hallway is a dark polished marble, which contrasts greatly with the the rough stonework of the foundation.  Everything is perfectly clean.  In this alcove north of the Main Board room is a place where Priests can gather and share their ideas with each other, and the Wizards of the guild.  To the south, a short corridor leads back to the main board room. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25403}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25408}{0}{}{-={@ Reagent Room @}=-}{<238>R<088>}{As you enter the room, you are overcome by the smells and sight of all the reagents maintained here by the Herbal Master.  This room off the foundation hallway is festooned with bunches of drying herbs hanging from wooden pegs.  Oaken shelving attached to the limestone blocks of the cathedral foundation bears jars and boxes filled with god-knows-what. On the floor, baskets and bins are full of the raw materials necessary to cast the more powerful and arcane spells of the Priest guild.  To see what the master has to offer, enter 'list'. }{Priests}{reagent_room}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25402}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25409}{0}{}{-={@ Foundation Hallway @}=-}{ }{Here in the foundation of the Priest's Cathedral you are surrounded by huge block walls of cut limestone and massive supporting pillars.  The floor of the hallway is a dark polished marble, which contrasts greatly with the rough stonework of the foundation.  Everything is perfectly clean, gleaming in fact.  To the north and south the long hallway continues.  The guild pub is to your west, and to your east is the bank. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25402}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
