R {25410}{0}{}{-={@ Guild Bank @}=-}{ }{This is the Priest's Guild ATM, placed to save time better spent on spiritual matters and in the pursuit of one's own faith.  The hallway is to your west, while just to the north is a shop. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
