R {25411}{0}{}{-={@ Priest's Shop @}=-}{ }{This small island of commerce in a sea of religiosity still reflects the reverence and devotion that Priests bring to all tasks.  Here in a room among the foundation pillars is a shop overseen by the Master of Commerce. His shop is spotless and utilitarian, and carries those items deemed to be necessary for adventuring Priests and acolytes.  He buys and sells the special items shown when you enter 'list'. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
