R {25416}{0}{}{-={@ Priest Quester's Retreat @}=-}{ }{This retreat in the cathedral is a relatively new and clean room. There are some tables and chairs available to sit on and converse with fellow adventurers of tales in dangerous and mystic places. There is a list on the wall which contains the best of the Priest questers. The floor is made from black marble and is layered with a number of soft rugs. }{Priests}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
