R {25425}{0}{}{-= Celtic Wood =- (n,s)}{ }{Hanging from a branch deeper into the forest, you see some mistle-toe.  Tufts of seeded grass, dead-fallen branches and creeping vines conspire to make spectral shapes that loom before you in the fog.  While at first glance they startle you, they form a beautiful counter-point to the dark oak trunks.  Rising up out of the forest to the south of you, you see the dark form of a huge tor.  You 'check the grade' here and wonder how you can get to its top.  You see an opening to the south that leads into the dark forest. }{Menhirs}{menhirs}{}{}{1.000}{1}
