R {25463}{0}{<238>}{A Dirt Bath (s,e,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{Chaotic forces have pushed you into what seems to be a field of dirt. All around you, gargantuan roots dig into an endless sea of soil.  You know this is a tree, but you cannot tell if you've shrunk down to the size of an ant or if the tree is a massive monstrosity. Knowing Chaos, it could be either. Looking toward the sky, you make out few details\; just clumps of darkness split with the rare beam of light. Ahead, you notice that there are breaks in the roots where you can cross and with your trusty sundial, you determine they are to the east and west.  Mountainous stones obscure your vision to the south but you think you could return that way. }{Terra's Terrific Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
