R {25468}{0}{<238>}{The Trunk (ne,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{As you look around, the field of dirt is now completely gone. Before you stands the infinite plane of bark\; a towering mass of wood that sends your mind reeling. You know in your heart that climbing the tree would be an impossibility that would not only take lifetimes but guarantee your death.  But what if instead of climbing the tree, you could simply go north? After all, moving in cardinal directions has never been a problem for any seasoned adventurer, and you are quite seasoned. Practically marinated. Calling upon the forces of Chaos and your own twisted psyche, you flip the tree (or perhaps yourself) and up becomes north! Oddly, the path eastwardly remains the same, leaving you free to return to the entrance. }{Terra's Terrific Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
