E {25507}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25507}{0}{<238>}{Bug abusing the trunk (nw,se)}{<238>] [<088>}{Your complete cheatery has made the impossible task of climbing the tree slightly more possible! The trunk of the tree, which you are now climbing, is still an infinite mass of bark. Protrusions along the bark that might've served as handholds to help you climb are now obstacles slowing you down.  You keep your eyes on the path, for now that the tree has been flattened, there is only the darkness of Da Void around you. Hopefully, gravity will hold you in place. Who knows where you would end up if you fell up! }{Terra's Terrific Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
