R {25577}{0}{<278>}{A Well Traveled Road (s,ne)}{<278>-+-<088>}{You are on a small road leading up to a crossroad. Trees line the road on each side rather sparsely, leaving little room for wildlife to grow. The emptiness of the forest leaves an empty feeling inside your heart, as you long for adventure and glory. You can smell the scent of something burning not too far from here, perhaps you should go investigate. }{The Overlands}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
