R {25581}{0}{}{Near a small tower (ne)}{🗼}{You are standing just outside a small, but seemingly powerful tower. The tower glows with a strange intensity and seems to be emitting a peculiar energy field which is preventing you from advancing further. The quiet, peaceful sounds of the forest have left your ears, only to be filled with the sounds of the glowing barrier that surrounds the tower. }{Javelin's Tower}{javelins_tower}{}{}{1.000}{1}
