R {25582}{0}{}{The Sea of Suffering (n,ne,sw,e)}{ }{You find yourself swamped by an enormous wave.  You flail and tumble about in a vicious, choppy sea.  Off to the  east, in the glow of the setting sun, you think you see a dark shadow on the water. Could it be land?  Perhaps you  can make it if you swim hard, but your muscles DO ache. }{Sea of Suffering}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
