R {25583}{0}{<278>}{Just Outside the Gates (ne,w,se)}{<278>. .<088>}{You are on a small road just southwest from the gates of Casaria. The huge, iron gates are open at the moment, but when closed they make it very difficult to enter, being so strong. The road leads into a thick forest, so thick that you can not see what lies beyond it. The town of Casaria lies ahead of you, for you to explore. }{The Overlands}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
