R {25635}{0}{}{Entrance to an Underground City (w,enter)}{<108>E<088>}{You stand at the entrance to a strange underground city.  The road into the city is blocked off by a large, iron gate.  Looking through the gate's bars, you can make out several buildings.  In the center of the town, is a town plaza.  Small roads run off from the town plaza to the southwest, southeast, northwest and northeast.  These roads lead into four buildings.  A weapon and armour shop, a magic shop, an inn, and an arena.  Each of these buildings appears to be run by a gargoyle. }{Gargoyle Den}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
