R {25679}{0}{<228>}{Mountain Plateau (sw,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{     You stand in a great flat plain, miles high in the sky.  Except for some sort of rock a few hundred feet to the south, this appears to be the top of the mountain.  A blinding yellow light seems to originate at the rock.  The plateau is triangular in shape, and approximately two-hundred feet long.  The ground, though flat, contains many cracks.      Far off to the horizon, you can see the sun beginning to rise. A warm breeze blows from the south, relaxing your senses.  A strange sound, somewhat of a deep, low whistle, fills the air.  It's not the wind though, it seems more magical in nature. }{Mount Silvermoon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
