R {25684}{0}{}{Before the Summit (n,u,nw,ne)}{ }{     You stand before the peak of Mount Silvermoon, only feet away from whatever it is that lives atop this wretched mountain.  To either side of you, the plateau drops off into oblivion, the only way to proceed is up the giant rock you stand before.  You can sense the ground beneath you beginning to tremble, as if you have awoken the gods.  A gaping hole has opened up in the clouds above.  From the hole, a brilliant white light shines down upon you and the entire surrounding region.  You sense the gods are watching with great interest.  The whistling noise continues to pervade the air, only becoming louder.  A warm breeze blows from up upon the rock. }{Mount Silvermoon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
