R {25688}{0}{}{Presence of the Master (d)}{ }{     A serene wind blows softly against your cheek, flushing away all the pain you once held.  You stand high atop Mt. Silvermoon. The azure sky looms above, watching eagerly the events which are transpiring.  A single silver rose is carried by the wind, never falling to the ground, but never blowing away.      Heavenly beams of light shine down upon the mountaintop, enveloping you with tranquility.  Looking into the light, you think you see the face of God looking back at you. }{Mount Silvermoon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25687}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25689}{0}{}{-=\x7D In a dim hallway. \x7B=- (n,s,e,w)}{ }{-=\x7D In a dim hallway. \x7B=- You've come to a faintly lit hallway in the bar.  To your right and to the left are doors.  Just ahead of you, you can see a doorway with what looks to be a flight of steps.  Behind you, is the swinging door that leads back into the main area of the bar. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
