R {25690}{0}{}{-=\x7D In a doorway. \x7B=- (u,d,s)}{ }{-=\x7D In a doorway. \x7B=- You come to a dimly lit doorway with two flights of stairs.  The one leading up is totally dark and the one leading down appears to take you into a narrow hallway.  Behind you is the hallway leading you back into the main part of the bar. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
