R {25691}{0}{}{-=\x7D Inside the mens room \x7B=- (w)}{ }{-=\x7D Inside the mens room \x7B=- The mens' room is a small five by five room consisting of just a toilet. The smell is enough to make you want to hold it in and leave altogether. The floor of the room looks as if it used to be white in color, but age and sloppiness have left it in very poor condition.  To the west (thank god) is the door leading out of here. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25689}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25692}{0}{}{-=\x7D Inside the ladies room \x7B=- (e)}{ }{-=\x7D Inside the ladies room \x7B=- The ladies room isn't quite what you would expect.  Judging from look and smell of this hole, the female patrons of this bar definitely are NOT ladies.  The smell in the air is far worse than the urine/feces combination of the mens room.  To the east (thank god) is the door leading out of here. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25689}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25693}{0}{}{-=\x7D The top of the stairs \x7B=- (s,d)}{ }{-=\x7D The top of the stairs \x7B=- You stand at the top of a flight of stairs.  The only thing you see is a lone door in front of you.  Behind you are the stairs leading you back down in the doorway. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25690}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
