R {25694}{0}{}{-=\x7D A narrow hallway \x7B=- (w,u)}{ }{-=\x7D A narrow hallway \x7B=- You're at the base of a flight of stairs entering a small hallway.  The lighting is faint and you can make out a small room to your left.  Behind you are the stairs leading up to another hallway. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25690}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25695}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25695}{0}{}{-=\x7D The tattoo parlor \x7B=- (e)}{ }{-=\x7D The tattoo parlor \x7B=- You enter a small private room.  The lighting in here is much different than in the bar itself.  Posters adorn the walls, a multitude of colored tapestries cover the walls.  Near the center of the room is a long table covered with many tools and illustrations.  To your left, is a small shelf containing many small bottles.  The only way out of here, is the door behind from which you entered. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25694}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25696}{0}{}{-=\x7D Inside Jag's office \x7B=- (n)}{ }{-=\x7D Inside Jag's office \x7B=- You've entered the private office of Jag, the owner of this bar and grill.  Certainly he is not going to be happy to have company.  The office is quite sparse, lacking any decorations or windows.  The only way out of here is the door from which you came. }{Jag's Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25693}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25697}{0}{}{Base of Tower (u,leave)}{B}{This is the base of a small tower. There is very little light and fresh air in here. A thick layer of dust coats the room. The walls curve outward to form a circular chamber and there is a definite pattern on them that you can't quite make out. }{Uslopta's Tower}{usloptas_tower}{}{}{1.000}{1}
