R {25712}{0}{}{In a tunnel (out,n)}{<128>O<088>}{In a tunnel Particles of dust and dirt are illuminated by a stream of light from the hole above you\; the same hole which brought you into this parched hell. The ground is covered in a thick inch-deep layer of dirt which looks as though it hasn't seen a drop of water in years. Coughing on the dry air you see that the tunnel leads north into a shroud of black. }{Bukken Tunnels}{bukken_tunnels}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6714}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25713}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25713}{0}{}{In a tunnel (s,n)}{ }{The utter silence in the tunnel suggests that whatever built these walls is long gone, and that you are the first person to walk them in decades. The air is dry and thick with dirt and dust, causing you to cough uncontrollably. The ceiling is a little low and you crane your neck so as not to hit it. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25712}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25714}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25714}{0}{}{In a tunnel (w,ne,s)}{ }{The tunnel breaks off to the northeast, leading deeper and deeper into the heart of the tunnel. Covered in a fine layer of dirt a corpse lies here, decayed and battered by the years beyond recognition. The tunnel is high enough so that you can stand upright, although judging from the height of the northeast tunnel, it doesn't stay like this. On the west wall what looks like a recently dug hole leads away from the main tunnel. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25713}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25715}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25716}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25715}{0}{}{In a tunnel (w,hole)}{ }{The tunnel is completely void of sound. Fresh marks on the walls suggest this part of the tunnel has been dug recently. The air feels cold and the ground slightly damp, in stark contrast with the main tunnel which was as dry as old bones. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25717}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25714}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25714}{e}{hole}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25716}{0}{}{In a tunnel (sw,ne,se)}{ }{The tunnel is very low so you find yourself squatting with your hands deep in a layer of dirt. The dry air burns your throat and you try to cover your mouth somehow. You get the feeling that the further you go down the closer you are getting to the mouth of hell. Looking nervously around you try and decide whether to turn around or whether to head deeper into the dark. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25714}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25718}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25719}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25717}{0}{}{In a tunnel (e)}{ }{The tunnel ends abruptly to the west. The air feels cold and what could only be described as 'sticky', as though millions of tiny water droplets were clinging to you. The ground is slightly damp and the ceiling looks ready to drop under the extra weight added by the water. A low rumbling noise, which is only just audible, seems to disturb the relative peace of the tunnels. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25715}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37285}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37285}{d}{hole}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25718}{0}{}{In a tunnel (nw,e,sw)}{ }{The darkness in the tunnel is almost impenetrable and would leave any adventurer with a sense of fear of the unexpected. A thick layer of fine dirt covers the otherwise hardened ground, and in the air a myriad of dirt particles hang, waiting to be sucked into your lungs. This place has clearly seen no water in a very long time. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25716}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25720}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25721}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25719}{0}{}{At a dead-end (nw)}{ }{The tunnel comes to a dead-end, leaving you with only one possible route of escape. The air is thick with particles of dirt, which burn your lungs as you try to breathe steadily. It would be all too easy to panic in this very claustrophobic situation. The ceiling looks unstable and is very low, forcing you to crouch on your hands and knees. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25716}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25720}{0}{}{In a tunnel (ne,w,se)}{ }{The darkness in the tunnel is almost unholy in its persistence, leaving you in an eerie orb, void of light. The tunnel is very narrow yet the ceiling is high enough for you to stand upright. Fine particles of dirt hang in the parched air, until you inhale them into your lungs with a sharp intake of breath. This place is surely some kind of hell. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25718}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25723}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25724}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25721}{0}{}{In a tunnel (w,e)}{ }{In this part, the tunnel seems to close in around you, as though it doesn't want you to leave. The slightest movement you make echoes around the walls, threatening to bring them collapsing down at any time. Rubbing your eyes to try and get rid of the dirt particles you notice that some sort of stone is sticking out of the ground. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25718}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25722}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25722}{0}{}{At a dead-end (w)}{ }{The tunnel draws to a dead-end where the ceiling dips low and the walls close in. Crouched in the corner you realize that you could very easily get trapped if anything were to block your only means of escape. Bits of dry dirt fall from the ceiling as you breathe, and small particles fill your lungs with a burning sensation. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25721}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25723}{0}{}{In a tunnel (nw,e,ne,sw)}{ }{The air burns your throat, making it painful to breathe. Three exits present themselves, one to the east, southwest and northwest, but all lead into complete darkness. There is an odd smell in the air, mingling with the dirt particles, but you can't quite make out what it is, or what is causing it. The dark is almost inpenetrable in this part of the tunnel, suggesting you are deep in its heart. There is a hole to the northeast which looks like it has been recently made. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25720}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25725}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25726}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25727}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25724}{0}{}{At a dead-end (e)}{ }{The tunnel slopes down here, tapering until it reaches a narrow dead-end. Dirt particles in the air sting your eyes, but you don't want to close them for fear of getting lost. The low height of the tunnel here causes you to get on your hands and knees and crawl, the dirt on the ground irritating your hands. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25720}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25725}{0}{}{At a dead-end (se)}{ }{The tunnel stops at a dead-end, where the walls and ceiling angle inwards towards the far wall, making this room very cramped. You could very easily find yourself trapped here if something decided to block your only route of escape. Bits of dirt fall on your head as your breathing echoes through out the otherwise silent tunnels. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25723}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25726}{0}{}{In a tunnel (w)}{ }{The tunnel stops suddenly here. There is a quite strong smell but you can't really make out what it is or what is causing it. The dirt in the air burns your throat as you struggle to breathe, and you try to shield your eyes from the same torture. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25723}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25727}{0}{}{In a tunnel (sw,e)}{ }{An awful stench fills the cold tunnel and it smells like it is coming from the east. An unholy cold seeps from the walls and ground, a cold that perturbs the relative calm of this isolated tunnel. The ceiling dips low forcing you to duck your head down. These tunnels certainly weren't built for humans. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25723}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25728}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25728}{0}{}{A small cave (n,ne,e,w)}{ }{The tunnel opens out into a cave which is about five meters wide and long. The air is musty and an awful stench fills your lungs. Bits of animal carcasses litter the muddy ground and in the southeast corner is the corpse of a human. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25727}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
