E {25731}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25729}{0}{}{A small cave (se,e,s)}{ }{A small cave in the heart of the underground tunnels. The air down here is musty and stale, and is filled with the stench of bits of rotting animal parts which are scattered all over the ground. The cave is high enough to allow you to stand. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25728}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25731}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25730}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25730}{0}{}{A small cave (s,w,sw)}{ }{The cave is very cold and the air is musty and stale. Every wall seems to radiate an unholy chill which passes through you, leaving your body shivering. The ground is covered in body parts of animals which give off a gut-wrenching stink that fills the cave. Some sort of mucus covers parts of the north and east walls. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25728}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25731}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25729}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25731}{0}{}{A small cave (nw,n,w)}{ }{The cave is high enough so that you can stand up, making a pleasant change from the confines of the tunnels. The ground is littered with bits of animals which give off an awful stench. The walls seem to radiate an unholy chill which bites deep into your body, making you shiver. The east and south walls look like they are covered in some sort of mucus. }{Bukken Tunnels}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25728}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25729}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25730}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25732}{0}{<228>}{</> In an Elven Hall <\\> (w,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{</> In an Elven Hall <\\> Almost perfectly life-like, the walls have been carved to resemble trees.  Almost seeming to lick the stonework, torchlight gently fills the hall with light.  The ceiling is a solid mass of stone branches, interwoven too tightly to see through.  Quite a ways to the east, the hall disappears around a corner.  To the west, the hall turns south.   }{Elven Woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16306}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25733}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25733}{0}{<228>}{</> In an Elven Hall <\\> (e,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{</> In an Elven Hall <\\> The ceiling is a solid mass of stone branches, interwoven too tightly to see through.  The walls of the hall have been carved into amazingly life-like tree-shapes, perfect down to the texture of the bark.  The hall to the east disappears into darkness, while the hall to the south turns around a corner to the east.  Almost seeming to lick the stonework, torchlight gently fills the hall with light.   }{Elven Woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25732}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25734}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25734}{0}{<228>}{</> In an Elven Hall <\\> (e,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{</> In an Elven Hall <\\> The surface of the walls has been carved to mimic the bark of trees almost perfectly.  The hall to the north turns disappears around a corner.  Just to the east, the hall widens into a larger chamber.  Flickering torchlight illuminates the hall.  The ceiling is a solid mass of stone branches, interwoven too tightly to see through.   }{Elven Woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25733}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25735}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25735}{0}{<228>}{</> In an Elven Hall <\\> (w,enter)}{<228>(<238>E<228>*<088>}{The narrow hallway to the west widens into a larger space here.  Strange torches line the walls, burning with a white flame that doesn't consume the material of the torch.  The ceiling is not very high, but large sweeping arches give the illusion of the space that was sacrificed to keep the hall from being detected by the outside world.  The surfaces of the hall are unornamented, the beauty of the room completely in the clean and flowing lines of the architecture.  On the eastern wall, a large barred door separates the hall from what appears to be a jail cell. }{Elven Woods}{eremon}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25734}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25736}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25736}{e}{enter}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25736}{0}{<248>}{</> In an Elven Cell <\\> (w)}{<248># #<088>}{This cell is very small, less than ten feet on each side.  The walls are covered in glowing symbols which light the area dimly.  The floor is bare stone, upon which sit an assortment of items.  The wall to the west bears a barred door. }{Elven Woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25735}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25737}{0}{}{Entrance to an Encampment (path,gate)}{ }{The dirt path leads between the steep slopes of two hills, ending at a wooden wall, built between the slopes, and towering above them.  In the center of the wall is a wooden gate, currently standing open.  From beyond the wall you can hear guttural snaps and yips, seemingly the barking of large dogs. }{Gnoll Outpost}{gnoll_outpost}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7839}{path}{path}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25738}{gate}{gate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25738}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (n,gate)}{<138>G<088>}{You are standing inside an open-aired enclosure.  The ground here is smooth dirt, marred by several sets of tracks going in each direction.  To the south is the wooden wall and entrance gate, and to the west, the sheer slope of the hill makes for a natural barrier.  Ahead of you, to the north, is a large open area, and a wooden hut lies to the east. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25737}{gate}{gate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25739}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25739}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (n,e,w,s)}{ }{You are standing on the south side of a large open area in the middle of a fort.  To the south, a path leads towards the entrance, while the cleared area expands in all other directions.  A wooden hut stands to the southeast, while another, larger hut lies farther west of you.  To your disgust, you notice that you have narrowly avoided stepping on the carcass of some small animal. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
