R {25740}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (cave,s,e,w)}{<238>C<088>}{You are standing on the north side of a clearing in the fort.  To the north, in the steep face of the hill, is a dark cave entrance.  The  clearing continues in all other directions. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
