R {25741}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (n,hut,w,e)}{<238>H<088>}{You are on the southeast side of an open area in the fort.  To the south of you lies the entrance to a small wooden hut.  Another hut lies to the northeast, while to the north and west, the clearing continues.  East of here, the clearing narrows. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25739}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25746}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
