R {25742}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (e,n)}{ }{You are standing on the southwest side of a clearing in the fort.  South of you, the hill rises in a steep slope, making climbing impossible.  East and north, the clearing continues, while to the west, a large wooden hut looms.  From within the hut comes a foul odor, reminiscent of rotten meat and worse. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25739}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25743}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25743}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (s,hut,e)}{<238>H<088>}{You stand on the northwest side of a large open area in the fort. Directly to your west stands the entrance to a large wooden hut, while east and south, the clearing continues.  To the north, is the sheer face of another hill, this one towering some twenty feet in the air, and steep as a cliff.  To the northeast appears to be an opening into a cave in the rock face. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25742}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25744}{hut}{hut}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25740}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25744}{0}{}{In a Shrine of a Dark God (s,out)}{ }{You are inside a large wooden hut.  There are rough benches made out of large tree trunks on the ground.  The walls are covered in rough wool tapestries.  Bloodstains cover the ground, remnants of grim sacrifices.  To the east is the exit, while south is the altar area. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25743}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25750}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25745}{0}{}{Just Inside a Cave (out,n)}{<138>O<088>}{You have entered a cave dug out of the side of the hill.  It is more of a chamber than a cave, having been roughly mined out of the bedrock of the hill by the gnolls.  There are tapestries and hides on the wall, and on the floor is a large pile of furs that serves as someone's bed. Farther north, the cave continues, while the entrance is to the south. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25740}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25751}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25746}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (s,w)}{ }{You are on the northeast side of a clearing in the fort.  To the north the stone face of a hill stops your progress.  Northwest of here, there is a cave opening in the hill.  Blocking your way east is a wooden hut, and south and west, the clearing continues.  A small pit holds the burnt out remains of a fire. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25740}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25741}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25747}{0}{}{Inside a Wooden Hut (out)}{ }{You are inside a wooden hut.  The inside of this hut is sparsely furnished.  A few straw bundles covered in animal hides make for very uncomfortable looking beds.  On the walls hang other animal furs.  A wooden tree stump serves as a table, upon which is spread assorted clay cookware.  The exit to the hut is to the north. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25741}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25748}{0}{}{Inside an Outpost in the Hills (hut,w)}{<238>H<088>}{You stand on the east side of a fort in the hills.  To your east and south, steep inclines make the hills impossible to climb, while to your north is the opening to a small wooden hut.  A similar hut lies to the southwest.  Rising up above the slopes of the hill is a large tree. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25741}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25749}{hut}{hut}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25749}{0}{}{In a Wooden Hut (out)}{ }{You stand in a small wooden hut.  The walls of the hut are covered with animal hides, and the ceiling is thatched, presumably water-proof.  One corner of the hut is filled with stacked sacks, while a bunch of barrels is stacked in another.  Dried, smoked hunks of meat hang from ropes suspended from the roof.  Your senses are overcome by the smell of bitter ale. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25748}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25750}{0}{}{Altar of a Dark God (n)}{ }{You have moved toward the altar of this shrine.  In front of you is a grisly scene.  Lying atop a stone altar is the recently slain body of a young male human.  Behind the altar is the statue of a giant gnoll, roughly eight feet in height.  In its hand is clutched a large three-headed flail.  On the wall behind this statue there is some writing scrawled in blood. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25744}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25751}{0}{}{A Cave-In (s)}{ }{The cave comes to an abrupt halt here where the tunnel has collapsed, leaving an insurmountable pile of debris.  You guess that this is what happened to the rest of the gnolls.  What a pity. }{Gnoll Outpost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25745}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25752}{0}{<238>}{On a steep mountain path (path,nw)}{<238>^<228>P<238>^<088>}{The path is steeper than it looks, and the abundance of loose rocks and other debris makes it difficult to keep your footing.  The path leaves the mountains to the southeast. }{Fantasy}{hobgoblin}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7840}{path}{path}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25753}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
