R {25774}{0}{<278>}{-= Skid Road =- (n,e)}{<278> +-<088>}{A horrible smell comes rolling over you as you enter this very dark and narrow turn in the passageway.  A strong befouled wind blows in from the east.  The red brick wall to the east and south has leaned so far over that it leans against the putrescent building, forcing some kind of begrimed greasy ooze out of the walls of uncertain color that hold the building up. }{The Mews}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25772}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25775}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25775}{0}{<278>}{-= The Old Dock =- (w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You have reached a dead end of sorts.  An old dock area.  But time and the weight of millions of tons of manure have closed all access to the river.  A veritable wall of green refuse of the consistency of concrete blocks off both the east and the sun's rays as huge blocks of the stuff have fallen across the narrow gap between the building to the north and the crumbling red, brick walls.  The whole thing looks very unstable. }{The Mews}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25774}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25776}{0}{<278>}{-= Skid Road =- (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You have entered a narrow passage between two crumbling excresences of masonry made up of crumbling red walls.  If you sneeze they will come crashing down on top of you!  Ahead of you the gloom intensifies. If you keep going you will just fall more deeply under the spell of the inhabitants of the Mews! }{The Mews}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25769}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25777}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25777}{0}{<278>}{-= Skid Road =- (s,e)}{<278> +-<088>}{The narrow passage bends around to the south here, forced in that direction by the collapse of one of the red brick walls. The pile of rubble is recent and actually makes this a cleaner stretch of road than you might expect in the Mews.  However, the walls come so close together here that only some form of magical light can cut through the gloom caused by the absence of light.   This is not, after all, a very pleasant place. }{The Mews}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25776}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
