R {25782}{0}{<138>}{A Pawn Shop (n)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{You stumble into one of the meanest, nastiest, downright unpleasant shops this side of the Underdark ...  or Hell for that matter.  It was once a pawn shop, as you can tell from all the ticketed items lying about.  But now, if the sign outside is to be believed, there won't be any redeeming of this stuff until some mythical owner shows up.  You ponder the scam as you read the sign that explains how this joint operates.  Outside you can hear screams of rage. }{The Mews}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
