R {25794}{0}{}{Inside a stable (arena)}{ }{You follow the path of bloody hoof prints into the dark stable. The smell of damp hay and horse dung offends your senses.  Two rusty water troughs sit in a cob-webbed corner.  Worn out horseshoes are scattered on the floor.  Blood-spattered ropes hang on the wall.  A family of rats scurries across your feet.  It is far from pleasant in here. }{Bell Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
