R {25821}{0}{}{A small shack (dock)}{ }{You enter a small wooden shack where all the fishing equipment is stored.  Nets and fishing poles hang on the wall in front of you.  The floor is slippery from fish scales and guts.  Several long rusty fillet knives hang on the west wall, giving you an eerie feeling.  You gather from the smell and the number of flies in here, that this place is not cleaned too often. }{Bell Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
