R {25822}{0}{<278>}{-= Castle Street =- (n,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{You are at the southern end of Castle Street which runs north to Riverford Drive.  To the west you can see the narrow Cliff Walk, and the towering Citadel cliff and walls.  To the east there is a large courtyard filled with officious looking taxscum and other bottomfeeders who probably work in the buildings that circle the courtyard to east and south. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
