R {25823}{0}{<278>}{-= Cliff Walk =- (s,e)}{<278> +-<088>}{You are on a narrow walkway which runs from Castle Street south towards the Seaside Promenade.  Towering high above you to the west is the Great Cliff, upon which stand the vast granite walls of the Citadel.  To the north you can see the mansion of a city official while Castle Street and the city buildings lie to the east. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
