R {25825}{0}{<238>}{-= Taxman's Court =- (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are at the southern end of Taxman's Court.  It is gloomy here, with light cut off in all directions but north by the looming city buildings.  No trees, shrubs, or flowers break the monotony of the courtyard and the marble walls with their blank windows staring down with disdain. You shudder. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
