R {25828}{0}{<278>}{-= Seaside Promenade =- (e,n)}{<278> +-<088>}{You are at the western end of the Seaside Promenade, which runs east and north from here along the bay and river shores.  To the south, the waves roll in from Dragonspine Bay, while to the west a huge cliff rises out of the earth, topped by the massive walls and tower of the Citadel.  The blank backsides of City buildings are to the northeast. There is a small, iron-wrought sign here. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
