R {25833}{0}{}{-= Wayhaven City Hall =- (sw,n)}{ }{      You have entered the office area of one of Wayhaven's City Councilman.  The desk and chairs are made of the very finest East Forest woods, showing that this Councilman is properly servile to her lord and master, the Mayor.  The door leading north is made of deep rich mahogany.  A small passageway leads to further offices to your southwest. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
