R {25837}{0}{<238>}{Outside a Colosseum (w,enter)}{<238>[<138>C<238>]<088>}{An old marble colosseum stands before you.  Etched in magnificant rock pillars standing four stories high, are scenes of horse drawn chariots.  Standing in the chariots are drivers lashing out at their horses as if the road behind them was on fire.  Great clouds of dust rise up from behind the wheels of the chariots.  Behind the dust ridden chariots are portraits of faces that are smiling, while others have tears running down their cheeks but, most look to be having a good old time.  From within the walls of the colosseum a great burst of cheering erupts. }{Colosseum}{colosseum}{}{}{1.000}{1}
