R {25838}{0}{<238>}{The Wayhaven Pub (w,corner)}{<238>[P]<088>}{The inside of the pub is scattered with commoners of Wayhaven. There are a few tattered dart boards up on one of the far walls and a couple drunk looking sailors playing a game of pool. The far corner of the pub is a bit shadowy.  Hard to tell from here but perhaps there could be a lonely gentleman there drinking away his sorrows. A rather mean looking bartender waits to serve you. A list of drinks hangs on the wall above the bar. }{Wayhaven}{wayhaven_pub}{}{}{1.000}{1}
