R {25839}{0}{}{Dark Corner of a Pub (leave)}{ }{The sounds of revelry and merriment barely reach into this corner of the pub. The large room is well lit, but a table sits here with one lonely chair in shadow. Upon the walls there are no dressings, no cloth of gold on the table, and no candle to push back the shadows. }{Lovers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
