R {25840}{0}{}{Colosseum Lobby (out,enter)}{ }{All types of people wander about here wearing white togas.  Most of the people seem to heading north into the arena.  A few people are standing in front of a long counter placing bets for the upcoming chariot race.  The area is rather spacious and can hold well over a thousand people at once.  From the north alot of cheering and hollering can be heard.  Spaced out along the long counter are a number of guards watching over the stacks of cash sitting behind the counter.  Large columns spaced every fifteen feet rise high into the air supporting a flat marble roof.  Wooden benches are placed everywhere to allow the old and tired a place to sit.  A sign hangs down just in front of you. }{Colosseum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25837}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25841}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25841}{0}{}{Colosseum Viewing Area (out)}{ }{Standing inside a large circular arena.  Down at ground level is a dirt track surrounded by a railing on both sides.  All around the track is carved stone going up like steps.  All together there are twenty steps where spectators can sit and watch the chariot races. On the far side of the track, on the other side of the railing, stand fifteen trumpeters who blow their trumpets to announce the starting of a race.  The steps are half full of spectators whose cheering is causing a loud ruckus. From where you are standing you can get a pretty good view of the chariot races. Above the entrance where you came in hangs a sign. }{Colosseum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25840}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25842}{0}{}{Trash Shelter (n)}{ }{You have found your way into a cramped living space that is surrounded on all sides, top, and bottom, by garbage.  Somehow, within these dark and smelly confines, a home has been fashioned with a bed and a small table.  There is a small gap in the garbage to the north that leads back into the alley. }{Pulp Fiction}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
