R {25845}{0}{<238>}{A rocky outcrop (sw)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{You have reached a rocky outcrop that has shoved its way into the  water.  Waves crash against the large boulders, and swirl into a  vicious white foam.  Looking out into the sea, you notice a small shape on the horizon.  It looks to be an old ship, with huge white sails stretching high into the sky.  Your urge to swim to the vessel overshadows your fear of almost certain death. }{Phantom Ship}{phantom_ship}{}{}{1.000}{1}
