R {25868}{0}{}{Crows Nest (d)}{ }{You are standing high up over the main deck of the ship, with the wind whipping through your hair.  The noises from the main deck are scarcely a whisper, and you feel almost as if you are someplace else.  You notice the beautiful view and can't help but want to scan the horizon and take in the earthly power of the churning waters down below. }{Phantom Ship}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
