R {25869}{0}{}{Cargo Hold (aft)}{ }{You are standing near the bow of the ship.  You can hear the waves slapping against the sides of the ship and the gentle swaying is making you feel slightly nauseous.  Old wooden crates are stacked around the hold.  There are two doors leading further towards the bow of the ship. }{Phantom Ship}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
