R {25885}{0}{}{Entrance to a dark tower (trail,enter)}{<238>T<088>}{You stand at the base of the blackened tower of Arcanarton. The wind here is harsh and chilling, making it extremely difficult to hear anything over the deafening howl. The gate to the tower stands hauntingly open.  Just beyond the gate lies the open courtyard below the great tower.  A small trail leads back down the mountain. }{Arcanarton}{arcanarton}{}{}{1.000}{1}
