R {25886}{0}{}{Hills (ne,trail)}{ }{Hills There is a piece of rock extending out of the ground.  The ground gradually inclines here.  You've entered some bumpy terrain which appears to increase further to the north.  Rugged mountains lie in all directions except the northeast, forming a dead-end valley.  You also notice a small trail leading up a mountain to the southwest. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
