R {25887}{0}{}{The tower (n,out)}{<238>O<088>}{It is dark inside the entry to Arcanarton's tower. Everything in this room is charred and black from some sort of magical explosion detonated years ago. A lump rises in your throat as your eyes adjust to the dim light. You notice the pale magical outlines of small tables and other decorations which once lined this hall. Time seems to have had no effect here. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
