R {25892}{0}{}{Courtyard below the dark tower (n,s)}{ }{You stand at the base of the blackened tower of Arcanarton. The wind here is harsh and chilling, making it extremely difficult to hear anything over the deafening howl.  To the east lies the base of the tower. Here in the west corner of the courtyard is where the combined armies of Wayhaven, Khotesh, Tapan, Raric, and Desaren penetrated the outer wall of the courtyard and laid siege to the tower of Arcanarton. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
