R {25893}{0}{}{Courtyard below the dark tower (e,s)}{ }{You stand at the base of the blackened tower of Arcanarton. The wind here is harsh and chilling, making it extremely difficult to hear anything over the deafening howl.  To the southeast lies the base of the tower. The ground here is black glass.  The courtyard wall has fallen down somewhat, but remains mostly intact. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25892}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25894}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25894}{0}{}{Courtyard below the dark tower (e,w)}{ }{You stand at the base of the blackened tower of Arcanarton. The wind here is harsh and chilling, making it extremely difficult to hear anything over the deafening howl. To the south lies the base of the tower. There is an old graveyard here. Some of the tombstones have names which you recognize from legend. The graveyard was put here by the victors of the War of the Magi, who thought that the tower of Arcanarton would become a holy shrine of the realm following the conflict. But soon after came the freak weather, the creatures of the night, and the rumors that Arcanarton had not been entirely defeated after all... }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25893}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25891}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25895}{0}{}{The tower (u,s)}{ }{This room is in the same shape as the last. The walls are blackened and buckled outward.  Many of the floorboards crack when you walk on them. There are more ghostly outlines of objects which used to be in this room. A set of stairs goes up from here, but they look horribly unsafe. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25887}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25896}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25896}{0}{}{The tower (d,e)}{ }{This is the second floor of the tower. You are in what once must have been a library. There are many blackened and rotten shelves lining the walls, and a few scraps of moldy paper still remain here as well. This room was probably ransacked by the victorious mages after defeating Arcanarton. Very little remains now.  You can also make out the faint magical outline of a chandelier hanging from the ceiling. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25895}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25897}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25897}{0}{}{The tower (u,w)}{ }{This is what used to be a waiting room. The walls are burnt and buckled here too, but every square inch of them is covered with arcane symbols. There are stairs here leading up to the third level of the tower. These look much safer than the rotten stairs down on the first level. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25896}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25898}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25898}{0}{}{The tower (d,s)}{ }{You aren't quite ready to believe what you see. Instead of burnt and blasted, this room is quite the opposite. The walls here are clean, but still covered with runes marked with black charcoal. The room is dimly lit, the only light source being several full and completely lit candelabras. You hear sounds of chanting to the south, human chanting. A cold chill grips your spine. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25897}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25899}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25899}{0}{}{The tower (s,n)}{ }{This appears to be a shrine of some sort. It looks VERY well looked after. There is a huge painting of an Archmage across the ceiling of the room, you assume it to be Arcanarton. He is holding an object in his hand which emanates great power, but you can't quite make out what it is.  The room continues to the south. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25898}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25900}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25900}{0}{}{The tower (u,n)}{ }{This is the altar area of the shrine. It is dimly lit, the only light comes from black candles decorating the altar. The altar itself is just a faintly glowing shadow like most everything else in the tower. Stairs rise upwards immediately behind the altar. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25899}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25901}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25901}{0}{}{The tower (u,d)}{ }{You are on a long winding staircase. The walls are terribly chipped and cracked. They are also covered with more magical runes, but these are not charcoal drawn\; they are much older. They glow with power. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25900}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25902}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25902}{0}{}{The tower (u,d)}{ }{You are on a long and winding staircase.  You are almost to the top. The wind makes strange noises as it whistles down the stairwell.  The runes on the wall are glowing more brightly now than ever.  The only other light source in this room is a torch on the west wall. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25901}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25903}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25903}{0}{}{The workroom of Arcanarton (d)}{ }{This is Arcanarton's workroom.  Strange arcane symbols cover the walls and floor of this room.  The smell of ash hangs heavy in the air.  There is a magical circle inscribed into the floor, cut into the very stone.  The circle itself is covered with black ash. There are few tables in here, as well as a huge library shelf along the north wall.  There is a fireplace along the west wall. }{Arcanarton}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25902}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

