R {25934}{0}{}{A Country Lane (out,s)}{<158>O<088>}{You're standing on a small, pleasant dirt lane.  A small wooden fence runs along both sides of the lane, bushes entwined through the palings.  Several small trees also line it, and the fields on the far side of the fence give the whole place a pleasant rural feeling.  In the distance you can see a red-roofed farmhouse, and beyond it a dark wood.  Birds twitter and flit from the trees.  The sun shines brightly, although there is still a sharp bite in the air, as if spring has only just begun.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{secret_of_nimh}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4151}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25935}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25935}{0}{}{By the Gate (n)}{ }{The lane ends here at a securely locked gate.  The gate is quite large and has a large sign sitting on it.  A large chain and padlock show you're not getting past the gate by any normal means. The farmhouse is still in the distance, with the dark wood behind it.  The fences assist the gate in cutting off any further progress into the farm.   }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25934}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25936}{enter haze}{enter haze}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25936}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (s,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're standing amongst the field you had spotted previously from the lane.  Clumps of grass tower above you like a giant forest, with dew droplets as large as your arm hanging off them.  Tiny pebbles appear as boulders to you now, and the damp earth is a maze of hills and valleys that mere moments before you would have walked over totally unnoticed.  The fence is to your west, and is blocking any hope of returning that way.  To your north a tiny trickle of water is now an uncrossable river, blocking all hope of heading in that direction. }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25937}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25938}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25937}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You're deep in the farm's field.  The grass is thick and plentiful, obscuring your vision of much of the rest of the area. The fence to the lane blocks any passage to the west, but it seems you could continue on in any other direction.  Strange sounds echo through the field, giving you pause to wonder what else lives in this vicinity.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25936}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
