R {25938}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (s,w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have wandered deeper into the field.  The grass is more tightly clumped together here, and it's difficult to see far in any direction. There are noises of some kind coming from somewhere in the distance, and you wonder what else calls this place home.  The small river of dew and rainwater is still blocking any progress further to the north. }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
