R {25939}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,e,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're standing in the middle of a field.  The grass towers above you, blocking out most of the light, making it somewhat dark here and giving you a sense of a wild jungle. The ground is littered with pebbles and stones, making the landscape somewhat uneven, but not impossible to traverse.  Several patches of dew still sit on the grass here, and when the light strikes them they sparkle with a rainbow of colours.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
