R {25940}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (s,w,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You're standing in a small clearing in the field.  A large puddle of water has formed here from the rainwater and dew.  Grass springs up all around it and creates a scene quite reminiscent to a lakeside for you.  The ground even forms a kind of natural beach by the edge of pool, with small round pebbles rather than sand.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
