R {25941}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,e,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{This part of the field is dominated by a large patch of weeds that has taken over the grass.  The dew is still plentiful, and the ground continues to be slightly muddy and damp from the moisture.  To the south, you can spy what would appear to be a large boulder of some kind, as it towers above the surrounding grass like some strange monolith.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
