R {25942}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have emerged from the grass of the field to a curious scene of nature's changeability.  The river of rainwater that has passed through the field ends at a miniature waterfall. The water spirals off into a deep gully which runs along the eastern border of the field.  Across the other side of the gully you can see the dark forest that was originally visible from the road.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25940}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
