R {25943}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,w)}{<228>, .<088>}{The grass of the field gives way to a large gully that blocks any further progress to the east.  The gully itself is full of rainwater and creates the impression of a strange miniature gorge.  On the far side you can see a dark wood that has a somewhat menacing air, making the wild grassland of the field considerably more appealing.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25942}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
