R {25944}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,w)}{<228>, .<088>}{The field abuts a large gully that blocks any further passage to the east.  The gully itself is full of water and seems much like a river to your small form.  Beyond it lies a dark wood, full of foreboding.  The grass so common everywhere else is almost non-existent here, as the ground is mainly rocks and stones and allows little to grow.  To the west is a large boulder of some kind.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
