R {25945}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,e,w)}{A}{Before you is a huge boulder that rises out of the field like a giant monolith.  The grass forms an almost perfect circle about it, as if someone or something has cleared it.  At its base is a half-buried cement block that seems to have been abandoned some time in the past.  The ground is especially muddy and it sucks hungrily at you as you walk, as if it wants to pull you down beneath its surface.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
