E {25969}{enter block}{enter block}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25946}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,e,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're standing somewhere in the middle of the field.  The tall grass extends in all directions, while the ground is damp and muddy.  A large hole in the ground indicates some kind of burrow, although it now seems to be abandoned.  To the east you can see a large boulder of some kind, that towers above the top of the grass.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25939}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25947}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25949}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25945}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25947}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,e)}{<228>, .<088>}{The field continues as does the fence that blocks any further progress to the west.  The tall grass is as plentiful as before, although the ground is somewhat rockier and strewn with small stones.  Over the tops of the grass you can see the red roof of the farmhouse in the distance.  Bird calls echo though the field and you feel quite at ease here.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25937}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25948}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25946}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25948}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're standing at the meeting of the field to the north and a wide river to the south.  The grass is plentiful, and it lines the bank of the river.  The fence to your west has stopped and for the first time you could head in that direction if you wanted.  To the southwest you can see the farmhouse in greater detail and it would seem that you are at the end of the field.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25947}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25949}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25953}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25949}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,e,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're at the edge of the field where it meets up with the bank of a river that is slowly winding past.  Grass is as common here as elsewhere, and various large reeds dominate the bank.  In the distance to the southeast stands what appears to be a mill of some kind, whilst far to the southwest you can make out the roof of the farmhouse.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25946}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25950}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25948}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25950}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,s,e,w)}{<228>, .<088>}{You're standing at the southern end of the field.  This part is dominated by the large mill that sits just to the south of you.  Clearly run-down, it has the same grass that is common to the whole field growing through holes in its outer walls. The river runs past here, and partly under the mill itself, while to the north a large boulder of some kind can be seen above the top of the grass.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25945}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25951}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25952}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25949}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25951}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Field (n,w)}{<228>, .<088>}{The field comes to an end at the junction of the gully to the east and the river to the south.  This area is alive with plants of all kinds, reeds, waterlilies, weeds and grass, as the abundance of water creates a natural breeding point for them.  To the southwest you spy a mill that seems somewhat rundown, while to the east a dark wood looms.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25944}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25950}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25952}{0}{}{The Mill (n,s,e)}{ }{You've entered the run-down mill.  Sunlight streams in in dusty rays from the numerous holes in the walls.  A variety of weeds and grass spring up from the floor, and cobwebs line the beams of the old tiled roof.  Some holes in the floor allow a view of the river gurgling quietly past underneath you.  Dust coats just about everything, and it is clear this place hasn't been used in some time.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25950}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25954}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25955}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25953}{0}{<278>}{By the Gate (s,e,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You're standing on the lane that leads to the farmhouse.  Just to the north of you is the gate leading out into the lane by which you entered, still securely locked and shut tight.  To your east is the grassy unploughed field, while to the west is another field that seems to still be full of old wheat plants.  South of you is what seems to be a front garden for the farmhouse itself, which sits just behind it. }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25948}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25957}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25958}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25954}{0}{}{The Mill (e,n)}{ }{You've wandered into a corner of the mill where the huge water wheel sits, still turning slowly from the water of the river.  The walls are intact, and cobwebs run thickly about, giving the place a slightly haunted look.  In the corner sits what appears to be some old rotting flour sacks.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25952}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25956}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25955}{0}{}{The Mill (s,w)}{ }{You're standing within the old mill. The walls are not as run down here as elsewhere, and there is an old net hanging from one.  Cobwebs abound, and the thought that whatever made them may well be sizing you up right now is not a comforting one.  There's a quiet atmosphere, but whether it's a peaceful one or more a calm before the storm is yet to be seen.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25952}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25956}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25956}{0}{}{The Mill (n,w)}{<108>J<088>}{This portion of the mill seems to have collapsed at some point in the past as the walls and roof are broken and crumbled into a large pile of debris.  You have, as a result of this, quite a good view of the river, and the atmosphere is much more pleasant than in the darker corners you have passed through.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25955}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25954}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25978}{say go}{say go}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25957}{0}{<178>}{In the Garden (n,se,sw)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{You're on the dirt lane that runs into the front garden of the farm.  Before you is the garden itself, stretching out to the south.  Small shrubs and neat flowerbeds line the lane.  Apparently someone on the farm is quite a keen gardener.  The farmhouse itself rises further to the south, and you'll need to go through the garden to reach it.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25953}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25963}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25964}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25958}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Wheat (n,e)}{<228>, .<088>}{You've entered the densely packed wheatfield.  Large stalks of wheat extend in every direction except to the east, where you can see the lane by which you entered this field.  The wheat is very tightly packed to the south and west, and you doubt that even in your current small form you could head in those directions.  To the north, however, it seems to open out into some kind of clearing, and you could head that way untroubled.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25953}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25959}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25959}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Wheat (n,s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're standing in a clearing that has been made in the field of wheat.  Flattened stalks cover the ground, and it looks like some kind of harvester must have been used.  In fact, the large harvester sitting off to your northwest would seem a likely culprit.  You can make out the fence that lines the lane to your east through the few plants still standing on that edge of the clearing.  To your south there seems to be an opening between the plants that would let you head that way also.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25958}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25960}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25961}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25960}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Wheat (w,s)}{<228>, `<088>}{You're in a clearing that has been carved out of the wheat field by the harvester to your west.  Wheat plants block any progress to the north, while the fence that lines the lane stops you from heading east.  The ground here is covered in damp stalks of dead wheat, which make a squelching noise as you walk over them.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25959}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25962}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26005}{n}{n}{1}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25961}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Wheat (n,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You've entered the clearing sitting in the middle of the field of wheat.  To your north is the large harvester that must be used when the wheat is ready to be harvested.  To your south and west the wheat field resumes, blocking any further progress in those directions.  To your east the clearing continues, but your attention is held by the large scarecrow sitting here on a pole that seems somewhat sinister in the morning light.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25959}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25962}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25962}{0}{<228>}{Amongst the Wheat (s,e)}{H}{The clearing is dominated by the harvester that sits like a gargantuan metal beast.  The ground is churned and sodden, and the harvester has sunk somewhat into the mud.  The wheat extends to the north and west, stopping you from heading in those directions, whilst the clearing continues to the south and east.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25960}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25961}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25974}{climb harvester}{climb harvester}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25963}{0}{<178>}{Amongst the Garden (nw,s,w)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{The garden is bisected by a small path that runs through from the northwest, and turns to the south.  Where it turns stands a metal clothesline that towers above your diminished form, a selection of clothes flapping wildly on its many wire lines.  The lawn here is neat and well-trimmed, and the rest of the garden extends to the west of you.  To your south the garden ends at the front of the farmhouse.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25957}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25965}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25966}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25964}{0}{<178>}{In the Garden (s,ne,e)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{The lane ends here at what essentially is a large dirt clearing in the garden.  Parked in the centre of it is a beat-up old car, that clearly has seen better days.  The garden itself extends around the edges of the dirt, and is full of pleasant flowers.  The farmhouse is to the south of you, and its roof gleams brightly in the morning sun.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25957}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25966}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25967}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25965}{0}{}{On the Porch (n,w)}{ }{The path from the north ends at a set of stairs that lead up onto the porch of the house.  Flowers line the stairs in small rows and you have a good view of the garden from here.  A wire flyscreen door is set into the front wall of the house, and it presents a very solid barrier to any attempt you might make to enter the house.  A straw doormat completes the picture of rural tranquility, sitting on the porch.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25963}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25968}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25966}{0}{}{Amongst the Garden (e,w)}{<118>R<088>}{You've wandered away from the lane to your west and the path to your east and now find yourself in the centre of the garden.  Flowers abound here in neat flowerbeds that are ringed by the lush green lawn. The centerpiece of the garden is an enormous rosebush that stands almost six feet high.  It seems whoever is maintaining this garden is truly dedicated to making it the best it can be.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25963}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25964}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25980}{push thorn}{push thorn}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25967}{0}{}{By the House (n)}{ }{You're at the edge of the garden.  The neat lawn and beds of flowers run right up to the side of the house.  The house itself is a large wooden structure that would probably be fairly small if you were still human, but to your mouse form it's enormous.  A garden hose rests quietly on the ground, attached to a tap at the base of the house.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25964}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25968}{0}{}{On the Porch (e)}{ }{You've climbed up onto the porch in front of the farmhouse which gives you a great view of the garden.  The porch itself is comprised of neat wooden floorboards that show no sign of having aged badly.  A rocking chair sits quietly next to the railing of the porch, and several small potted plants are lined up along it.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25965}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25969}{0}{}{The Brisby Home (e,out)}{<138>O<088>}{You've entered an amazing room.  It appears to be some kind of foyer and living room combined into one.  A large table sits in the centre, with several candles placed upon it that are illuminating the room with a soft glow.  A wide variety of items and objects are scattered about, giving the impression of a well lived-in home.  A curtain sits in the east wall that seems to act as a lightweight door, while in the west a small flight of steps leads up and out through the door you entered by.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25945}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25970}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25970}{0}{}{The Brisby Home (se,e,w,ne)}{ }{You've entered a small corridor in the Brisby's house.  There's a single small candle here that lights the area and sputters slightly as you pass through.  To the west is a curtain leading into the main living area, while there are doorways leading to the northeast, east, and southeast.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25969}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25971}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25972}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25973}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25971}{0}{}{In the Brisby Home (nw)}{ }{This room belongs to the two daughters of Mrs. Brisby and is suitably decorated.  Two beds with frilled blankets are in the center of the room, and a dresser covered in ribbons and lace sits to one side.  The pink curtains have been opened to allow the morning light in, and the room has a messy quality from the collection of dolls scattered about the floor.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25970}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25972}{0}{}{The Brisby Home (w)}{ }{You're in what would seem to be Mrs. Brisby's bedroom.  A single bed sits in the center of the room and is covered in a pleasant green blanket.  The curtains in the east wall have been thrown open, allowing the morning light to stream into the room.  A dresser sits in one corner, with a piece of glass cunningly set into it to act as a mirror.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25970}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25973}{0}{}{The Brisby Home (sw)}{ }{This bedroom is quite dark.  What light there is comes in faintly from the closed curtains that cover a small window in the north wall.  Two beds are lined up in the room, and a small side table rests between them.  A small chest of drawers sits up against the south wall, and a collection of small stuffed animals sits on top of it.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25970}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25974}{0}{}{On the Harvester (d)}{ }{You've climbed up on top of the old harvester in the wheat field.  Its rusted chassis provides you with an excellent view of the surrounding farm, and you can see all the way to the farmhouse from here.  The harvester itself is in no better condition up here than it was down on the ground, and it's clear it hasn't been used in some time.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25962}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25975}{squeeze through crack}{squeeze through crack}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25975}{0}{}{In the Harvester (d,out)}{ }{You've entered a strange section of the engine.  It should be dark in here, but a small series of christmas lights have been strung up to light the area.  A pipe of some sort leads down into the bowels of the engine and someone has made a mouse-sized bucket and pulley system used to lower yourself down it.  You can hear sounds of banging, and someone muttering to themselves echoing up from somewhere below you.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25974}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25976}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25976}{0}{}{The Bottom of the Pipe (w,u)}{ }{You're at the base of a large pipe.  A large pool of water sits in a round depression in the floor of the fuel tank, which you seem to be inside.  Floating gently on the surface is the bucket you used to get down here.  More christmas lights are strung up here, small sparks of electricity visibly jumping between them as they flicker on and off.  A passage leads west from here, lined with strange pipes and wires.  A soft glow can be seen from down in that direction, and the banging you heard before is now much louder.   }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25975}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25977}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25977}{0}{}{Ages Laboratory (e)}{<238>A<088>}{You've entered an amazing room.  Christmas lights adorn the walls in a blinking cavalcade of colours.  An oaken table sits in the center of the room, and is covered in plans, diagrams and an array of beakers and tubes.  Bookshelves are stacked around the room, with multitudes of books and scrolls sitting on them.  A small cot sits in one corner, its blankets unmade.  Various bits of machinery sit on the floor in various states of repair, and a ladybeetle scuttles about the room, looking disturbingly like a pet.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25976}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25978}{0}{}{A Tree Branch (opening)}{ }{You're standing on a large dead tree branch, about halfway up a mighty old oak tree.  The wind whispers through the area making an eerie groaning sound, and the surrounding forest is dark and full of menace and strange noises.  In the trunk of the tree itself is an opening, leading into the interior of the tree.  Home of the great owl, it's a foreboding place, and the knowledge that owls eat mice doesn't fill you with much confidence.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25979}{opening}{opening}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25956}{say return}{say return}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25979}{0}{}{Inside the Tree (out,e,ne)}{<228>O<088>}{You're just inside the entrance of the Owl's abode.  It's dark and smells faintly of decay.  The wood of the tree itself seem to be riddled with disease and age, and it creaks as the tree sways in the breeze outside.  Occasional strands of spider web trail here and there, providing you with yet another thing to worry about besides being eaten by an owl. There's a crack in the wood leading to the northeast, and the main chamber extends to the east.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25981}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25982}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25978}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25980}{0}{}{Amongst the Thorns (e,out)}{<118>O<088>}{You've stepped in amongst the thick tangle of thorns that make up the interior of the rosebush.  Someone has cleared a path amongst the leaves and there is a small tunnel that descends into the earth in front of you.  The thorny doorway that you used to enter here has sealed itself neatly back into place, leaving no evidence that there is any way back out.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25966}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25983}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25981}{0}{}{The Owl's Abode (w)}{ }{You've come to the end of the large cavity inside the old oak tree.  The Great Owl's home is sparse, decorated only by some long abandoned spider webs and several piles of bones left over from its last meal.  The floor is treacherous here, as the majority of the tree is hollow, and one misstep could send you plunging over the edge of the platform that you now stand on, and into the depths below.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25979}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25982}{0}{}{The Spider Nest (sw)}{ }{You're in a tiny chamber within the great oak that seems to be being used by several spiders as a nest.  Webs cover almost everything in here, and you can't make out anything but the prospect of sudden and nasty death if you remain here.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25979}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25983}{0}{}{The Entranceway (w)}{<148>B<088>}{The tunnel quickly expands out into a large chamber.  The dirt path has given way to a series of small pebbles that have been laid here in such a way as to pave the floor.  Overhead the ceiling of the chamber seems to actually be the arc of half a brown glass bottle, giving the room a golden hue.  Plant roots from the rosebush arc about the place, acting as a natural support for the ceiling.  The way onwards is blocked by a large set of double doors that are twice your height.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25980}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25984}{push top corner}{push top corner}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25984}{0}{}{A Dark Passageway (descend,doors)}{ }{The passageway you're now standing in descends at a fairly steep rate into the ground.  It is totally unadorned in any fashion, and is a stark contrast indeed to the wonders of the chamber above you with its glass ceiling.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25983}{doors}{doors}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25985}{descend}{descend}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25985}{d}{descend}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25985}{0}{}{The Storehouse (s,ascend)}{<148>J<088>}{You've entered an odd room.  Scattered about are many strange objects, all of which appear to have been scavenged from the farm.  Loops of electrical wire, pieces of cloth and thread, a selection of buttons, even a set of toy soldiers, line one wall.  It appears from the layout that this place is used as a temporary storage facility of some kind.  A single lightbulb provides weak light for the room, and you notice an archway in the south wall that leads to a much larger open area.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25984}{ascend}{ascend}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25986}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25984}{u}{ascend}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25986}{0}{}{The Lantern Cavern (n)}{ }{You've entered a large underground cavern, that extends both high above and far below you.  A platform has been erected here that you now stand on, while immediately before you is a large lantern, which seems to be suspended from somewhere high up above you by a series of chains.  Several small waterfalls rush by the platform, descending noisily into the depths.  A number of small lights have been set up around the platform, providing the scene with ample lighting.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25985}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25987}{stamp floor}{stamp floor}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25987}{d}{stamp floor}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25987}{0}{}{The Main Cavern (doors,elevator)}{<138>E<088>}{You've emerged from the elevator into a huge cavern.  Lights are strung up everywhere, and arcs of electricity jump from wires strung between them.  Dozens of passageways and tunnels lead off in various directions, and a number of rats come and go from them in varying degrees of hurriedness.  To the east stands a set of ornately worked and carved doors, from which you can hear the sound of raised voices.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25986}{elevator}{elevator}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25986}{u}{elevator}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25988}{doors}{doors}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25988}{0}{}{The Council Hall (doors)}{ }{You're standing in a large hall.  All four walls are lined with balconies from which dozens of rats peer at you in a mixture of annoyance or bemusement.  Rows of candelabra run around the hall providing ample light, causing reflections to dance on the burnished floor.  The inlaid designs upon it seem to glow brightly, and it's polished so smoothly that you can see your own reflection clearly in it.  A hush falls over the assemblage, as if the onlookers are waiting to see what happens next.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25987}{doors}{doors}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25989}{say johnathon}{say johnathon}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25989}{0}{}{The Library (out)}{ }{The room you're now in is lined with a large number of shelves, all of which are densely packed with a variety of books, tomes, and scrolls.  A wooden lectern stands at one end of the room, with an old candle burning softly on it.  A large leatherbound chair sits next to it, and seems to be a favoured place to read for some of the rats, if the worn state of the chair is anything to go by.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25988}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25990}{say ready}{say ready}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25990}{0}{}{A Small Passageway (hole,return)}{ }{You've been led to the very end of the rats network of passageways.  Before you is a large opening in the wall that seems to lead into the farmhouse.  You can hear the loud sounds of Mrs Fitzgibbon preparing cat food, and the yowling of their cat, Dragon.  You watch as Mrs Fitzgibbon puts a bowl full of catfood down on the floor on the opposite side of the kitchen, and begins walking towards the door leading outside, apparently intent on letting the cat inside to eat.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25987}{return}{return}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25991}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25991}{0}{}{The Kitchen Floor (n,hole,e)}{ }{You're in the southwest corner of the kitchen.  A hole here leads back into the tunnels of the rats, while to the northeast you can see the food bowl for Dragon.  The sheer size of everything, and the movement of people about the kitchen is setting your mind whirling.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
