R {25992}{0}{}{The Kitchen Floor (e,s)}{ }{You're in the northwest corner of the kitchen.  The kitchen door is directly in front of you here, the alarming yowls of Dragon taking on a sinister edge.  The catfood bowl is to your east, while the hole to escape from this place is to your south.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {25991}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
