R {25993}{0}{}{The Kitchen Floor (n,w,e)}{ }{You pause for breath for a moment, here underneath the kitchen table.  Billy Fitzgibbon's feet dangle alarmingly close to you, and your destination of the food bowl seems only somewhat closer to you, lying further to your northeast.  The tiles are slippery on your paws, and make running harder than normal for you.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
