R {25994}{0}{}{The Kitchen Floor (e,w,s)}{ }{You're now by the sink of the kitchen.  The smell of whatever food it is that has been prepared wafts down from the counter above you.  Water has spilled down from the sink here, making it extremely slippery, and you find you need to watch your footing quite carefully. The catfood bowl is directly east of you now.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
