R {25995}{0}{}{The Kitchen Floor (n,w)}{ }{You're in the southeast corner of the kitchen.  Overhead you can see a series of cupboards that probably contain the family's foodstuffs if the smell emanating from them is anything to go by. To the north of here is the food bowl, the smell of Dragon's food overpowering all others.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
