R {25996}{0}{}{The Kitchen Floor (w,s)}{ }{You're in the northeast corner of the kitchen.  A large window set in one of the walls allows a large stream of light in, fully illuminating the catfood bowl that sits here before you. It smells very strongly, and makes you feel somewhat ill, and you realise that unless you're very careful, you could end up being consumed along with this meal.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {25995}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25994}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25997}{0}{}{In a Birdcage}{ }{You've been put in a wire birdcage that would normally be home to some kind of canary.  The floor of the cage is covered in strips of newspaper, making rustling sounds as you move about.  The bars of the cage are quite close together, and fairly strong, with only a food and water tray hanging off them for any form of decoration.  There's a plastic ladder leaning against the side of the cage, and far above you a perch and bell.  There doesn't seem to be any way out of here.}{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25998}{kick water tray}{kick water tray}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25998}{0}{}{Outside the Cage (hole)}{ }{You're perched on a small ledge that runs outside the base of the cage.  The kitchen floor is a long way down from here and you can see no way to escape your predicament.  The rest of the kitchen is quite dark, and unless you can think of something it looks like you're stuck here.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25997}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {25999}{tie thread}{tie thread}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {25999}{0}{}{The Ruins of the House (ne,nw)}{ }{Rain pelts down from the dark night sky, and you sink up to your ankles in mud as you stand by what was once the site of the Brisby family home.  Torn timbers and shattered equipment lie strewn about in disarray, and where the cement block once lay is now nothing but a large puddle of dangerous quicksand-like mud.  Rats scurry about you desperately, trying to clear the wreckage, and an air of confusion and despair hangs over them.  Lightning occasionally splits the sky, and the great stone boulder looms over the scene like a grave.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26000}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26001}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26000}{0}{}{The Winch Wreckage (nw,w,sw)}{ }{You're standing amidst the wreckage of what appeared to be some kind of large winch or crane.  Broken beams, snapped ropes, and twisted metal are lying strewn about the place, the rain making everything further complicated.  If this failed while trying to lift the Brisby home it would explain much.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
