R {26001}{0}{}{By the Mudpool (ne,se,e)}{ }{The rain continues to pelt down as you come to stand by the huge pool of mud that was once where the Brisby home lay.  The rats are avoiding this area, as if they feel guilt over the loss of the Brisby family.  The stone continues to loom over the scene, and at one point you could swear you see someone or something moving about on it.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
