R {26002}{0}{}{The Base of the Stone (se,sw)}{ }{As the rain continues to drive onto you, you have arrived at the base of the large stone that towers over the field.  Slick and covered in cracks and grooves it looks like you could climb up it.  The peak is outlined by flashes of lightning, and you're certain you can spy something moving about up there.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
