R {26004}{0}{}{The Stone's Summit (d)}{ }{You have reached the top of the stone.  The wreckage of the rats' attempt to move the Brisby home lies strewn out beneath you, lit luridly by the flashing lightning.  The rain drives into you with full force up here, making just standing difficult.  An anchor point that the rats had set up here to brace the winch lies smashed and broken at your feet, and several ropes that had also helped counterweight the winch lie about.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {26002}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26005}{0}{}{Amongst the Wheat (s)}{ }{You're standing deep in the wheatfield.  You can barely see in any direction, except for the east where the fence is.  In all other directions all you can see is more wheat.  The ground squelches underfoot, and you think you're standing in a puddle of some kind.  }{The Secret of Nimh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
