R {26006}{0}{<228>}{Forest Path (sw,ne)}{<228>( *<088>}{You are on a small trail amidst a thick, beautiful pine forest in the great overlands. The wind blows not here, and it seems as though it has all stopped, as all you can hear are the quiet sounds of a peaceful and thriving forest community. A woodpecker can be seen not too far off in the distance working on its new home. }{The Overlands}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25594}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26007}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26007}{0}{<228>}{Forest Trail (w,ne)}{<228>( *<088>}{You are on a small trail amidst a thick, illustrious forest in the great overlands. The ground crunches with each step you take, as pinecones and fresh leaves litter the path. A squirrel runs by your feet and up a tree to your right, only to be followed by another squirrel. You wonder, are these squirrels lovers, brothers, friends? You think how simple it must be to live as a forest animal, frolicking amongst your fellow forest inhabitants. A strange moon looms overhead. }{The Overlands}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26006}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
