R {26008}{0}{<228>}{Woodlands (w,e,cottage)}{ 🏕️<<088>}{You are on a small road leading from the forest to a small river. The road winds west and north, towards the famous cave of Sin'Jun. Tracks upon the ground indicate that this road has been travelled upon fairly recently. A small fawn steps out of the woods in search of adventure. A larger deer follows, and then nudges the fawn back into the woods. Seeing this puts a big smile upon your face. A narrow side road leads up to a tiny cottage to the north.  You might be able to enter the cottage, but it is unusually small so it'd be a tight squeeze. }{The Overlands}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
