R {26010}{0}{}{A Small Cottage (leave)}{ }{              After barely being able to squeeze through the front door, you now have to hunch down because the ceiling is only four feet off the ground.  This house was obviously not built for someone your size.  Three chairs, not much bigger than your head, are placed around a tiny table.  In the center of the table, sits a small plate carrying a cooked ant.  There is a bed about the length of your arm on the other side of the room.  Against the northern wall, a fire blazes in a fireplace.  Above the fireplace, hangs a portrait of a metallic slime wearing a golden crown and smiling.  }{Fwiffo's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26008}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26011}{0}{<148>}{Calm River (se,w)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{You are wading along a little river around a cave. The river flows slowly in a circle, around and around, never ceasing. Not too far below the surface, you can see fish happily swimming around. The air is rather cool here, making this a very nice place to relax. A strange moon looms overhead. }{The Overlands}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
