R {26014}{0}{<248>}{An underground cavern (leave,ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{     As you walk through the forbidding cave, the shaft of light at the entrance gets smaller and smaller.  However, torches line the walls, enabling you to see, at least somewhat.  You haven't seen any life yet, but you can hear the beating of drums up ahead.  Do you dare proceed farther?  Rumors of a savage race of cave dwellers have filled the inn halls in recent weeks.      Painted on the west wall, is a primitive work of art, you'll have to examine it to learn more. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26013}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26015}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26015}{0}{<248>}{An underground cavern (e,sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{     Upon turning the corner, you become totally dependant on the torches to provide you with light.  The cavern opens up quite a bit here.  The most noticeable feature of this room is the skeleton of what was once a dragon, which lies in the center. Other, smaller skeletal remains litter the ground.      Another noticeable feature of the room are the many stalagmites, which tower up to thirty feet above the ground, almost to the ceiling.      On the largest of these stalagmites, there is another cave painting. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26014}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26016}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26016}{0}{<248>}{An underground cavern (e,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{     You are now deep within the underground network.  The drum beating is now accompanied by faint chants... Uou uou uou uou... The cave has narrowed down again.  In addition, the ground and walls are getting moist.  Water is dripping slowly from the ceiling.      On the north wall, there is another painting. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26015}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26017}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26017}{0}{<248>}{An underground cavern (se,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{     Ugh, this must be the room where the Sin'Jun torture their victims.  Chained against the south wall are decaying remains of once brave adventurers.  Many of these unfortunate people appear to have been severely beaten to death.  Arms and legs lie alone on the ground.  One particular poor victim has a hatchet deeply lodged in his skull.      On the north wall, there is another cave painting. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26016}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26018}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26018}{0}{<248>}{An underground cavern (d,nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{     You have come to the end of the natural part of the cavern.  Broken drums litter the ground.  An open fire is burning in the center of the room.      Another mural is painted against the back wall.  In addition, there is a man made hole leading down. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26017}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26019}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

