R {26020}{0}{<238>}{Sandstone corridor (e,nw)}{<238>] [<088>}{     You stand deep beneath the natural cave in this man-made underground network.  Ancient torches line the walls, illuminating the room.  You can make out the sound of waves breaking against a shoreline to the southeast.      Against the south wall, there is another cave painting. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
