R {26022}{0}{<148>}{At an underground lake (n)}{~A~}{As you turn the corner, the corridor opens up into a huge cavern.  Before you, lies an underground lake, which stretches as far as the eye can see. There is a small raft drifting near the shore. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
