R {26023}{0}{}{A tiny raft}{ }{     You are drifting along on a tiny raft, upon this huge underground lake.  Looking over the side, you can see deep down into the crystal clear water.  Much aquatic life lives down there.  You think you can barely make out some sort of underground city, deep on the ocean floor, but it's hard to tell. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26024}{land}{land}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26022}{land2}{land2}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26024}{0}{}{Shrine of Breaking Waves}{ }{You stand upon a small island.  Thick rods placed into the ground, hold softly burning torches at their ends.  Flames from the torches flicker, and cast looming shadows that race along the floor before you.  A black pot, filled with some strange liquid, boils in the center of the island.  Blood stains the ground around the pot.  Beneath you, skulls are scattered about, some still with rotting flesh attached.  Among the sounds of the burning torches and the waves crashing against the shore, an occasional scream is heard in the distance. }{Sin'Juns Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26022}{board raft}{board raft}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

