R {26163}{0}{<278>}{The pathway continues through the town (n,e,w,s)}{<278>-+-<088>}{The noise of the street here is drowned out by the rasp and clank of metal on metal which seems to emanate from your west.  It reminds you of blacksmiths and their forges.  Piles of thin cotton shirts adorn the entrance of the store to your east.   }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26164}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26168}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
