E {26170}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26164}{0}{<278>}{The pathway enters a town (n,e,s,w)}{<278>-+-<088>}{A dirt pathway enters a small town.  The building on the west has a red cross over the doorway.  On your east a large building sits with rows of even windows.  It has the look of a small motel or maybe a college dormitory. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14324}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26163}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26166}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26167}{n e s w}{n e s w}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26164}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26165}{0}{<238>}{A big crater (e,w)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{You find yourself standing in the middle of a crater. A satellite is stuck in the mud and the ground has been blackened by a tremendous explosion.  Obviously it has crashed here for some reason after orbiting the Earth.  Steel parts are spread all over the area and from the size of this crater  you can tell the impact must have been hideous.  }{Crashed Satellite}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14381}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32410}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26166}{0}{<238>}{Medical Center (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{At first glance this looks like a small but otherwise typical medical center.  A hospital bed sits empty in the room, and the walls are lined with cabinets containing medical equipment.  As you look things over, though, you notice that none of the equipment is electronic and there are no outlets on the walls. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26164}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26167}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {26168}{0}{<278>}{The pathway winds further (n,w,e,s)}{<278>-+-<088>}{Both sides of the street are alive with the noise of people doing business.  To your west crowds mill over seemingly random products in a large, open pavilion.  Baskets of fruit and vegetables sit outside the building to your east.  To the north fields and crops stretch out unbroken by buildings as they approach a steep ridge that borders the commune. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26163}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26171}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26172}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26173}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26169}{0}{<238>}{A clothier (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room is kept quite clean.  Wood slats cover the floor between the white brick walls.  Pants and shirts hang on racks around the room.  They all appear to be cotton and of the same color and style and seem to come in about 6 sizes. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26163}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26170}{0}{<238>}{Blacksmith's shop (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{An oppressive heat from the brick forge at the back of the room seems to push you back.  A rack of tools such as tongs and pokers sits next to the forge.  Several farm implements and household items decorate the bare studs of the walls and the dirt floor showing the handiwork of the smith.   }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26163}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26171}{0}{<278>}{The pathway nears a hill (n,e,w,s)}{<278>-+-<088>}{The buzzing of the crowds has stopped and both sides of the path are now bordered by fields.  While neat rows of crops stretch out in large square plots to the east, rows of shrubs dominate the landscape of the west.  Continuing to the north the path starts up a steep hill to a ridge topped by a cylindrical tower.   }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26168}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26174}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26175}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26176}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26172}{0}{<138>}{Flea Market (e)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{You get bumped and jostled as crowds buzz around you looking for deals.  All sorts of goods are set out on tables around the area.  This place seems to contain stuff made outside this area.  You're not sure your currency is accepted here.  Perhaps the sign by the entrance would tell you.   }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26168}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26173}{0}{<238>}{Grocery Store (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Rows of crates and shelves containing various fruits and vegetables stock what appears to be a nice grocery store.  The quality of the produce is surprisingly good given the destruction done to the environment. The quantity, on the other hand, doesn't seem like it would be enough to meet this area's needs.  }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26168}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26174}{0}{<278>}{The pathway climbs a hill (n,s)}{<278> | <088>}{You continue along the road as it starts up the hill.  As the steep climb takes its toll and exhaustion slows you down, you look around and are once again taken aback by how healthy the trees look in this particular part of the forest.  Your east is bordered by a large pipe of some sort\; maybe that holds the key to why the path goes up this hill. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26171}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26177}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26175}{0}{<228>}{A large vegetable garden (w)}{<228>, `<088>}{Grains and vegetables of various types sprout from furrows plowed in the snow-white ground in front of you.  The plants here are of impeccable quality with nary an insect or wilted leaf to be seen.  Quite impressive given the inevitability of acid rain falling on the crops. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26171}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26176}{0}{<228>}{Cotton Fields (e)}{<228>,<128>F<228>`<088>}{Long, straight rows of shrubs sprout from the white, well tilled ground around you. Each shrub shows the beginning signs of cotton fiber as its seeds begin to grow. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26171}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26048}{grasp rake}{grasp rake}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26177}{0}{<228>}{A water reservoir (u,s)}{<228>. ^<088>}{As you follow the pipe to the top of the hill you see a large cement reservoir with a ladder going up its side.  This must be where the commune stores their water.  It looks as though, like all the buildings in the commune, it has a glass roof.  Maybe if you climb up there you can see how they manage to make something useful from the acid rain. }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26174}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26178}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26178}{0}{<238>}{On top of the water reservoir (d)}{<238>] [<088>}{Standing on the glass roof of the reservoir you have a clear picture of what it contains.  The reservoir appears to actually be two cylindrical tanks joined by a pair of huge filters.  The first filter is carbon and looks like it's constructed of rough cut trees that have been partially burned.  The second seems to be the same tightly packed limestone you see in the grounds of the commune.   }{Luddite Commune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26177}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

