R {26218}{0}{<148>}{Revelwood Entrance (s,ford)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{Once the most beautiful region of the Land, Lord Foul poured his evil hatred into its lush grasses and tall, life-giving trees. For four centuries the lords of Revelstone and Revelwood have fought the desecration.  And while the most obvious harm has been healed, the evil still runs deep through the marrow of this land. The Llurallin River is just to the north and east. There is a small ford to the north here. The tallest, biggest, and most beautiful tree you've ever seen towers high into the sky here.  It is obviously inhabited. }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
