R {26325}{0}{}{Revelwood (chaos,se)}{<158>C<088>}{You have entered a simple, nearly empty apprentice cell.  Except for a cot, the room is completely bare.  Nevertheless, you feel an enormous concentration of landpower here.  So strong, even your weakly attuned senses are nearly overwhelmed.  A tear in the very fabric of the Land is visible to your eyes! }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
