R {26326}{0}{}{Revelwood (nw,se,sw,ne)}{ }{You stand in the heart of the great trees of Revelwood.  Here, the woods combine and meet, nurtured by the Lore of the Land, to make the living wood that fights Foul.  The chamber glows with the light thrown off by the heartwood of the great tree. A long living tree table stands in the center of the throbbing room.  This is the meeting place of the famed wardens of the Council of Revelwood.  Only Despite, and perhaps the Lords of Revelstone can match their combined power. }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
