E {26372}{climb vine}{climb vine}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26329}{0}{<228>}{Trothgard (n,w,e)}{<228>, .<088>}{Once the most beautiful region of the Land, Lord Foul poured his evil hatred into its lush grasses and tall, life-giving trees.  For four centuries the lords of Revelstone and Revelwood have fought the desecration.  And while the most obvious harm has been healed, the evil still runs deep through the marrow of this land. The Rill River is just to the south.  It is not passable here. }{The Land v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26264}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
