R {26523}{0}{}{Small clearing (center,leave)}{<138>L<088>}{You are standing in a small clearing somewhere in the foggy dank plains of Diantia.  Far off to the north through the mists you see mountains and to the east through a thick stand of pole trees is Lake Bieren.  You can continue traveling through Diantia by leaving this place.  Toward the center of the clearing, and looming large in the fog, large standing stones can be seen. }{Serinth}{sopem}{}{}{1.000}{1}
