R {26524}{0}{}{Stone structures (center,leave)}{ }{You stand at the edge of a ring of ancient menhirs.  These large mossy stone blocks are set upright in a circle, gathered in an orderly fashion around a large dark stone block in the center.  You clearly feel a malevolent energy about this place, and every nerve in your body tells you to leave. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
