R {26525}{0}{}{Dark Stone Block (leave)}{ }{You are standing in the center of the menhirs.  They circle all around you and the huge dark stone block.  The sense of raw power from the menhirs is all but overwhelming, and the dark block before you practically pulses with dark force.  The ground around the block is ritualistically stained a deep ochre red, and the feeling of evil is palpable and profound. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
