R {26547}{0}{}{Ganeshan's Lair (n)}{ }{This is the lair of Ganeshan. The walls are made of a sandy stone and it seems more stable than the ordinary sand of the pit you came down to get here. The bones of a recent victim lie at your feet and you wonder if it's not too late to run away with your life intact. }{Sand Pit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
