R {26548}{0}{}{A desolate area (s,u)}{ }{Barren sands gust in your face.  There is nothing but desolation here.  No signs of fruitful life.  Just predators and the remains of  some poor souls who ventured down the wrong path. There is a large crucifix implanted in the sands.  The vultures hover above, looking for a scrap of flesh to feed on. }{Temple of Drackonus}{temple_of_drackonus}{}{}{1.000}{1}
