R {26549}{0}{}{A desolate area (n,nw,ne,s)}{ }{You slide down the desert dunes.  The sands push you down the hill. Your clothes are full of sand.  Your skin is parched from the intense heat of the sun.  Worst of all, almost every step leads to your eventual death. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
