R {26553}{0}{}{A dimly lit hole}{ }{You have stumbled into the hidden crypt of the Snake King, Venomant.  Fear his presence.  As you peer around the room you notice many ancient runes and drawings covering the walls.  The hole that you entered is way overhead--you cannot reach it from here. }{Snake Pit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
