R {26554}{0}{}{A dark room (e)}{ }{A dark room. There is a huge blood-stained rock resting on an incline, teetering anxiously as you move about.  It seems the cleric transported you here--there's no way back to the other side of the bridge from here. }{Snake Pit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26555}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26555}{0}{}{Hidden Treasure Room of the Snake King (w,portal)}{<138>X<088>}{You seem to have stumbled into Venomant's hidden treasure room.  The Snake King must have had many loyal followers that brought him all sorts of gifts.  It seems that nobody has been in this room for ages and ages, though...Many cobwebs line the ceiling and dust covers the entire area. A large torch hanging on the far wall dimly lights this chamber.  A large pile of snakeskins sits in a pile in the corner, half-covering a large chest. }{Snake Pit}{xenophrax}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26548}{portal}{portal}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {26554}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26556}{0}{}{A hidden ice fortress}{ }{With a sudden motion you are able to break the layer of ice. You slide down the ice to find a subterranean ice fortress.  In the vicinity you see four robots\; their creation is of unknown origin. The room is comprised of eight walls of reflective ice fused together to create an octagonal sort of clear-room cell.  You can see your reflection in those glassy walls... }{Temple of Drackonus}{twins}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {26557}{push surface}{push surface}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26557}{0}{}{A small cave-like entrance}{ }{In front of you stands a huge steel door.  It seems inpenetrable. There are no apparent openings on the door for a key or any tool to open it.  All that is there are 16 holes.  Coming from within the door you hear a hissing sound.  It sounds like the door is alive. It might be possible to stick your hand into the hole, but why would you want to do that?  If you feel brave just type 'insert <num>.' }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
