R {26674}{0}{}{Chamber of Power (out)}{ }{You have entered the Chamber of Power, where many of the stores of knowledge concerning the guild's powers are kept.  The room is elegant yet utilitarian, with a hardwood floor and long, blue drapes that are currently drawn back giving a view on the courtyard below.  A single painting in a gold frame hangs on the wall.  Tall bookcases along the walls are filled with books and scrolls, and a wide desk is similarly scattered with various texts.}{Bard}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {26672}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26675}{0}{}{Mana Vault (out)}{ }{You enter a square, featureless, concrete space.  Your footsteps smack loudly on the hard surface, but the sound ceases almost immediately with no echo.  At first it is even difficult to ascertain the true size of the small room due to the complete lack of features.  As a reference point, your eyes are drawn to the only object in view, a silver basin resting on a nondescript concrete pillar.  The iridescent liquid in the basin provides the only source of illumination in the room other than the light which spills in through the open doorway behind you.  The air has a slight chill that presses lightly against your skin, like the faint cool breeze you can feel when you place your hand close to a block of ice on a hot day.}{Bard}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {26672}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {26676}{0}{}{Hall of Knowledge (s)}{ }{The hall of Knowledge is a circular chamber filled with tomes, books, scrolls and other precious possessions gained by bards and sages throughout the centuries.  The domed ceiling is smooth and illuminates the room with a dull white light.  The hall is extremely quiet as sound is magically dampened allowing bards to research and increase their knowledge in peace.  Layers of shelves encircle the chamber with each layer consisting of two separate semi-circles separated by a small gap allowing access to the inside rows.  This large hall is where Bards come to increase their knowledge of the realms and lore. }{Bard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
