R {26765}{0}{}{Inside a small tent (desert)}{ }{     You are inside a very small tent which has been put up haphazardly.  The blue material of the tent has a few holes in it from age.  The sand enclosed in the tent still seems warm to your feet so the tent couldn't have been up for more than a few hours.  A few dead scorpions are laying in the sand. Their bodies have been torn open and all the meat has been eaten. }{Desert Psionicist Tents}{desert_psionicist}{}{}{1.000}{1}
