R {26905}{0}{}{Inside a red tent (desert,n)}{ }{      The walls of the tent are made up of a red material with gold trim outlining the corners.  Luxurious rugs are scattered through out the tent covering most of the sand floor.  On the west side of the tent sits a wooden table with two chairs in close proximity.  Next to one of the chairs is a large cactus housed in a clay pot.  Small flowers can be seen starting to form on the arms of the cactus.  The tent continues to the north. }{Desert Psionicist Tents}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
