R {26977}{0}{}{Entrance (desert,n)}{ }{        This is the main entrance room of an abandoned keep.  The entrance way is just a stone archway that isn't selective on whom it lets in.  The floor's bricked pattern near the archway is covered with sand from the storms that blow by this area frequently.  On both sides of you, the mistreatment of this keep can be seen.  The ancient arches that support the weight of the ceiling are beginning to fall apart and pieces of stone are scattered across the floor from the crumbling walls.  The light from the archway disperses to the northern interior of the keep. }{Desert Keep}{desert_stronghold}{}{}{1.000}{1}
