R {27190}{0}{}{A huge cavern (platform)}{ }{As you enter, you are amazed at the sheer size of this cavern. The walls and ceiling appear to vanish into the distance. As you explore the cavern you become aware that all the surfaces are very smooth. In fact, they are so smooth you're not sure what in the world could have made them this smooth. Then it dawns on you that what ever it was must have been huge. That is when you realize that there is something glittering on the cavern floor. }{Desert Tomb}{}{}{fulgurite marble}{1.000}{1}
