R {27194}{0}{<238>}{A long tunnel (e,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{Now, that's interesting. The tunnel still continues onward, as dark and mysterious as before, but there is something that breaks the flow of the seamless tunnel walls. Also, so faint, so faint you almost can't hear it. A very slight hissing seems to be coming from further up the tunnel. Your skin crawls hearing this and you're not quite sure why... }{Desert Tomb}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
