R {27195}{0}{<238>}{A long tunnel (w)}{<238>] [<088>}{The long dark tunnel abruptly comes to an end. Its walls are still totally seamless and the end of the tunnel is as well. It's almost like the maker of the tunnel never got the chance to finish it, having bumped into something that stopped construction cold. You get the feeling you really don't want to meet what stopped the construction. }{Desert Tomb}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
