R {27262}{0}{<238>}{A Manicured Path (d,w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{You are on a wide, wellkept, and manicured path.  Careful swirled patterns have been made in the gravel.  A thick and carefully maintained forest can be seen to the north and to the west.  To the north, you can make out the august majesty of the great castle of Kimlark's Good King.  But it has been empty of all human life for centuries.  You can see a small gap in the forest to the east in the direction of the smoking peak at the center of the great island.  A wide marble stairway goes down the side of the mountain here. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
