R {27318}{0}{<228>}{Climbing the Cone (s,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{You are partway up the great Cone of Kimlark!  Cold winds rip at your clothing and exposed flesh.  Far below you can see the pleasant forests of the top plateau and the elegant castle of the Good King.  The smell of sulphur is now almost overpowering.  You wonder if you should turn back now! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
