R {27342}{0}{<238>}{A Path and A Lovely Fountain (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{A lovely fountain tosses water into the air, casting a cold mist over the entrance to the great castle of the Good King of Kimlark to your immediate north.  A carefully tended forest is visible to east and west.  A smoking mountain peak is visible to the east.  A slight hint of sulphur is in the air. There is a VERY large pink flamingo standing here!! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
