R {27343}{0}{}{The Entry Hall (n,s,e)}{ }{You are in a long room, with tall arched ceilings.  An ancient tapestry dominates the west wall.  To the east you can see a small chapel.  The hall continues to the north. An odd-looking White Rook stands here! An odd-looking Black Rook stands here! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
