R {27344}{0}{}{The Entry Hall (n,w,e,s)}{ }{You are at the north end of the great hall of the castle of the Good King.  It extends to the south.  Doors lie in all other directions.  They are all wide open. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
