R {27345}{0}{<268>}{A Royal Chapel (w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{You are in a small chapel.  The central nave runs forward to a black basalt altar.  Ancient tapestries grace the walls, setting off the wood grain in the narrow pews.  A feeling of great peace fills the room. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27343}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27346}{0}{<138>}{A small shop (s)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{You find yourself in a strange castle shop.  Strange because there is no one here to attend you but you know, or feel that you know, that anything you sell will be purchased and anything you buy will be sold.  You shudder. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27344}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27347}{0}{}{A Royal Gallery (n,s,e)}{ }{A long room stretches east to west, interrupted only by narrow openings to north and south and large bay windows overlooking the royal forest to the west.  Paintings adorn the whitewashed walls offset by the occasional antiquity. An odd-looking White Knight stands here, guarding the paintings! An odd-looking Black Knight stands here, guarding the paintings! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
