R {27348}{0}{}{A Royal Throne Room (w)}{ }{You are in a spacious throne room.  A wide open space, now covered with leaves and other natural detritus, leads up to a graceful marble dais upon which stands a beautiful and wonderfully wrought throne.  A large wooden bas relief lies behind the throne. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
