R {27350}{0}{<248>}{In A Dirty Cave (u,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{A narrow crevice leads upward here.  A small tunnel heads off to the east.  While the smell of sulphur has lessened here, the smell of death and decay has grown nearly unbearable! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27349}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27351}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27351}{0}{<248>}{In the Goblin King's Throne Room (w)}{<248>% %<088>}{Your eyes strain to make anything out.  A dais stands at the far east of the hollowed out cave.  A huge solid granite throne stands on the dais.  The heat here is intense.  You shudder! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27350}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27352}{0}{<238>}{A Dank Storeroom (s)}{<238>] [<088>}{The walls are covered with wooden shelves, filled with jars of what were once foodstuffs but are now, obviously, unfit for human consumption.  The room is close and dank.  And something here, something....makes you shiver. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27347}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27362}{d}{move grate}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27362}{move grate}{move grate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

