R {27359}{0}{<228>}{A Natural Spring (s)}{<228>( *<088>}{You stand in a quiet meadow.  A small spring seeps up from the ground, its waters running gently down the slope and over the cliff towards the sea far below.  The enchanting forest of the Good King lies all about you, its harmony and peace fill you! There is a very large and strange looking creature here.  It looks a whole lot like a tree! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27356}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27360}{0}{}{A Bucolic Country Scene}{ }{You stand before a sun-drenched peasant cottage.  Behind you a hissing rent in the air disturbs the scene and reminds you of how you came to be here and how you may leave again.  You shiver and bless the gods for saving you from your foolishness. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27361}{enter cottage}{enter cottage}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27347}{enter rent}{enter rent}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27361}{0}{}{Inside A Cottage (out)}{ }{The cottage is as nice inside as it was out.  A room combining a kitchen, sitting, and sleeping area all in one nurtures the eye, filling you with an odd sense of peace and gladness.  You feel as if you would gladly give up the world for the chance to just stay here and live.  But the feeling passes. An old lady sits here in a nice rocking chair. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27360}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27362}{0}{}{A Smelly Cellar (u,s,sw,se)}{ }{You are in a very dark cellar.  A large aperture in the ceiling leads upward.  At the south end of the cellar two passageways lead off to southwest and southeast.  A horrible smell assaults your nostrils.  You hold in a sneeze. A massive dragon, thick coils spread about it, lies sprawled at the center of the castle cellar basement! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
