R {27412}{0}{<238>}{A Dark Labyrinth (n,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{You are in a roughhewn and gloomy tunnel hacked unevenly out of the harsh black granite of Kimlark.  The tunnel seems to be sloping downward but is otherwise completely nondescript.  It's almost as if someone made this place to trap the unwary. A massive metal door stands in the granite wall to the north. A rather mean looking gnome stands here glowering at you! }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27411}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
