R {27413}{0}{}{The Heart of the Maze (s)}{ }{You are in a dimly lit chamber in the center of the great maze of Kimlark.  The heat here is intense.  Sweat begins to pour off your body in veritable waves.  The room is empty of all human...or inhuman touches. A massive minotaur stands here in the center of this chamber. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27412}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27414}{0}{}{A Treasure Trove (s)}{ }{You are in a small but high-vaulted room.  No adornments or furnishings of any sort are present.  This is not a room for spending your spare time or contemplating reality. }{Isle of Kimlark}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27348}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27415}{0}{}{o( Sii vault room )o (s)}{ }{This small chamber has been temporarily allocated for quick access to equipment on the way in or out of the Traak.  The Traak has manipulated its inner structures to provide a vault.  This vault, encased in hard flesh and bone, is used to hold communal equipment.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17553}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27416}{0}{}{o( Sii guild store )o (n)}{ }{You're in a small shop located near the entrance of the guild.  This shop is run by a kindly old Sii named Vynar, who offers reasonable supplies at a reasonable price.  This particular room is similar to the others; a purplish chamber within the body of the Traak, however there is a large cabinet set against the wall, behind a small wooden counter.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17553}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27417}{0}{}{o( The outer hall )o (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You're in the outer battle hall of the Traak.  The outer hall is formed by a chain of interconnecting caverns which provide vacant space to protect the inner hall in the case of collision or combat.  In a fully-loaded battle Traak, gun turrets are mounted off the outer hall.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
