R {27429}{0}{}{o( The inner hall )o (w,e)}{ }{You're in the inner hall of the Traak.  The central chambers of the great beast are well protected from attack.  Consequently, the majority of mission critical conversations and purposes take place in these inner chambers.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27417}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27430}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27430}{0}{}{o( The inner hall )o (u,d,n,s,w,e)}{ }{You're at the very center of the great beast.  Above you, chambers have been reserved for lounging and discussion of events.  Also, there are the essential chambers of the Form Smiths.  Below you lie many long and curving passageways for meditation.  Elsewhere on this main level, you have access to Pinnacle (or whereever the beast has landed), and temporary facilities to assist in your exploration of this world; a room with portal jumps, a pub, a training and advancement area, and similar conveniences.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27429}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27431}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27432}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27433}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27434}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27451}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27431}{0}{}{o( The Traakshun pub )o (s)}{ }{You've entered a brightly lit room, which has been radically redesigned by the Traak.  The usually faint purple glow from the walls is brighter than usual, illuminating a large chamber.  A large clump of bone cuts through the middle of the room, creating a bar that you rest your drinks on.  Sii mill about, ordering drinks from the bar.  A menu is posted on the wall behind the bar.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27430}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27432}{0}{}{o( Advancement room )o (n)}{ }{This is a small chamber off the major one to the north.  At only five meters square, it is the same as other chambers--dark purple light pulsing from the walls of the Traak.  There's only one adornment to the room; a placard on the wall.  There's a small placard here.  Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]            cost, tally, required, questansi,          list [name -or- # -or- short]}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27430}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27433}{0}{}{o( The portal room )o (w,fantasy,chaos,science,cot,residential)}{ }{You're in the inner hall of the Traak, in a small chamber with several sparkling portals set in the walls.  The Traak has grown up its flesh around the magical portals that were brought in from Pinnacle, so that they're flush with the walls.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27430}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27434}{0}{}{o( The halls of the Form Smiths )o (u,d,n,w,e)}{ }{A large, busy chamber opens up here, the skin of the Traak forming an almost dome-shaped room.  Many other Sii pass you by, and the quiet, focused Form Smiths bustle into and out of the rooms to the west and east.  You realise from the tired-looking Sii entering the room to the east, and the fresh-looking Sii emerging, that that must be the place to merge with new host forms.  To the north is what appears to be a laboratory, which is likely the place to donate any fresh DNA samples so that the Form Smiths keep a steady supply needed for creating new forms.  Bright-eyed and eager Sii seem to hurry into the room to the west, then emerge followed by a Form Smith rolling a host form headed for the eastern room.  You get the feeling that the west room is used to choose which forms you are eligible to inhabit, and should visit there whenever you qualify.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27430}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27435}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27436}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27437}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27438}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27435}{0}{}{o( The Form Viewing Hall )o (e)}{ }{Through a large transparent screen you can see the formsmiths busy at work maintaining and preparing the host forms, getting them ready for habitation.  After they are produced in the birthing chambers deep in the belly of the Traak, the forms are moved up here for the formsmiths to take care of.  Occasionally, a formsmith will remove a form from its tank, and carefully wheel it out to be used.  Though they are kept busy with their preparations, the formsmiths are also available to bring forms up to the screen for you to view, so that you may choose which forms you wish to use.  You can indicate your desire to the formsmiths by 'view'ing a form, though they will only consider requests for forms which you are eligible to use.  Should you be experienced enough, you can also 'choose' a form, whereupon a formsmith will note on the tanks that you are approved to merge with it.  You may also 'unchoose' a form, though you are limited to doing this once per day so as not to waste the formsmiths time.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27434}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27436}{0}{}{o( The merging rooms )o (w)}{ }{You're in a large chamber with huge tables formed from hardened skin of the Traak.  Many small passageways branch off in all directions, but those passageways serve the storage chambers for empty forms, so only the Form Smiths are permitted to explore them.  There are several Form Smiths actively working on helping a Sii inhabit a new form.  Others can be observed repairing the physical damage to uninhabited forms.  You're able to 'list' the forms that are currently available, choose to 'merge' with one that suits your purposes and is within your ability to control, or 'remerge' to merge into a new host of your current form.  Should you have any difficulty during the merge process, it is possible to 'remind' the formsmiths that you are in need of assistance.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27434}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27437}{0}{}{o( The laboratory of the Form Smiths )o (s)}{ }{A large, partitioned room within the Traak has been sterilized and converted for use by the Form Smiths to process and investigate DNA samples donated by the various members of the radix.  You can see a number of Form Smiths, usually inhabiting Wellig or Shai'quai'lat hosts, hard at work analyzing and storing tiny samples.  There are a few younger-looking apprentices who are available, should you wish to 'donate' any DNA samples you may have collected.  One of the apprentices seems to be in charge of keeping track of the donated DNA samples, you could probably 'view' the list he keeps.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27434}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27438}{0}{}{o( Lounge area )o (nw,se,u,d,n,s,e,w)}{ }{You're in the center of a series of large chambers used for lounging and resting between battles.  You can see comfortable rooms to the north, south, east and west where you will be isolated from the hubbub that bubbles up from the hall of the Form Smiths below.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27434}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27439}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27440}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27441}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27442}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27443}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27444}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27445}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27439}{0}{}{o( Western lounge )o (e)}{ }{The Traak's inner skins have been folded repeatedly to create numerous couches of varying sizes about this chamber.  Several Sii lounge about, talking of adventurers, or enjoying a meal together.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27438}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27440}{0}{}{o( Garden Lawn )o (se)}{ }{The Traak's floor is perfectly smooth and dotted with large potted trees.  From some unseen vents a soft breeze is pushed through and causes the leaves on the trees to rustle.  A portion of the floor has been shaped to house a sand pit; beside this are a collection of balls and a wooden rake.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27438}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27441}{0}{}{o( Northern lounge )o (s)}{ }{The Traak's inner skins have been folded repeatedly to create numerous couches of varying sizes about this chamber.  Several Sii lounge about, talking of adventurers, or enjoying a meal together.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27438}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27442}{0}{}{o( Eastern lounge )o (w)}{ }{The Traak's inner skins have been folded repeatedly to create numerous couches of varying sizes about this chamber.  Several Sii lounge about, talking of adventurers, or enjoying a meal together.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27438}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27443}{0}{}{o( Inner Garden )o (nw)}{ }{Here the Traak's protective skins fold around a garden.  Raised garden beds wind their way around the room and between them are pathways dotted with benches.  Other Sii are enjoying the relaxing atmosphere while sitting on the benches or wandering the pathways.  The calm sound of a waterfall fills the air.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27438}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27444}{0}{}{o( Southern lounge )o (n)}{ }{The Traak's inner skins have been folded repeatedly to create numerous couches of varying sizes about this chamber.  Several Sii lounge about, talking of adventurers, or enjoying a meal together.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27438}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27445}{0}{}{o( Guild masters' chambers )o (u,d,n,s,e,w)}{ }{You're in the center of a series of large chambers used for guild masters' meetings.  The Traak recognizes those who have business within the rooms, and automatically allows them entrance - otherwise the doors remain closed.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27438}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
