R {27450}{0}{}{o( Control rooms )o (d)}{ }{You've entered the control room--the chamber closest to the Traak's brain, through which Jain's symbiotic form has been inserted.  In fact, he's been in the Traak for such a long time, that the skin of the Traak has completely grown over the incision point.  If you hadn't known about the significance of this chamber through the others, you'd have no way to distinguish it from the other areas.  However you have learned that this room leads to many control rooms from which the highest levels of the Sii direct combat forces.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27445}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27451}{0}{}{o( Entrance to the meditation chambers )o (d,u,w,e)}{ }{You're at the entrance to a long chain of meditation chambers, the rooms where Sii come to rest and meditate on their experiences.  Your silence is requested, so as not to disturb others.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27430}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27452}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27453}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27454}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27452}{0}{}{o( Meditation chamber (recruitment) )o (w)}{ }{You're in the meditation chambers in the lower levels of the great Traak.  The beating of the great beast's heart seems stronger here, more soothing.  You're tempted to relax and meditate}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27451}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27453}{0}{}{o( Meditation chamber (level tzet) )o (e,w)}{ }{You're in the meditation chambers in the lower levels of the great  Traak.  The beating of the great beast's heart seems stronger here, more soothing.  You're tempted to relax and meditate.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
