R {27454}{0}{}{o( Entrance to the Tulnar )o (u)}{ }{You're at the entrance to the Tulnar--the birthing chambers within the Traak.  While there are passageways winding off in all directions, and Sii wandering these halls, it is not appropriate for you to continue to wander in these hallways.  This is also where broodlings gather while their Sii masters are disconnected from the Radix.}{Sii}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
