R {27467}{0}{}{Outside the Golden Hawk (return,e,enter)}{<138>R<088>}{A small bar is in front of you, with the door opened. As you look in, you can see that the bar is filled to its brim with cigarette smoke, and you almost recoil from the stench of beer that meets you through the open door a few yards away. You can hear a lot of noise in there, and it sounds like people are arguing and yelling at each other.  }{The Golden Hawk Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27468}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27469}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {13718}{return}{return}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27468}{0}{<238>}{The parking lot (w)}{<238>` ^<088>}{This looks like a parking lot for the customers, and it is filled with different kinds of motorcycles. To the north you see a bar, but you can't see a door here, so probably you have to enter from somewhere else.  }{The Golden Hawk Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27467}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27469}{0}{}{Golden Hawk entrance (e,out,n)}{<138>O<088>}{You stand in the entrance to the local biker gang hangout, Golden Hawk. Rumor has it that the Hawk gang usually hang around here, looking for some people to fight. Since most people know about this not many people except Hawks go here, and maybe you should follow their example and just get lost.  }{The Golden Hawk Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27467}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27470}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27471}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27470}{0}{}{The Golden Hawk (n,w)}{ }{You stand in the southeast corner of the Golden Hawk bar. The old tables spread around the room are all filled with dried beer stains and full ashtrays. The chairs around the tables are old and repaired several times as far as you're concerned. To the north you can see the bar.  }{The Golden Hawk Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27469}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27472}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27471}{0}{}{The Golden Hawk (s,e)}{ }{To the north you see a smaller platform against the wall, it looks like a stage, and there is usually a band there to play when the bar is open. In front of the stage you see a small table with old green tablecloth. The floor is dirty. The bar is to the east, and is probably the most well-crowded place in this bar.  }{The Golden Hawk Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27469}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27472}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27473}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27472}{0}{}{The Golden Hawk (s,w)}{ }{In front of you the large bar stands. Above it you see a homemade stand filled with beer mugs. There are a few tall chairs in front of the counter. To the west you can see some sort of stage, where the bands usually play.  }{The Golden Hawk Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27470}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27471}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46407}{open door}{open door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46407}{e}{open door}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27473}{0}{}{A secret hideout (exit)}{ }{Wow, a secret underground room! The trapdoor that led you down here is overhead. The floor and walls are made of plain wood boards without any decoration. A lumpy-looking mat covers part of the floor and seems to act as a makeshift bed. A small clay pot sits in the corner. It's probably used as a toilet. Gross.  }{The Golden Hawk Bar}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27471}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27471}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27474}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (hole,n)}{<138>H<088>}{-= Elven Hills =- Along the vast horizon lie layers of emerald green hills.  Patches of yellow and purple flowers dot some of the rolling pasture.  The sky is clear blue and white clouds slowly drift by.  In the distance, a brook babbles.  A hole shimmers in the lush grass. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {13721}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27475}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27475}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (s,enter,n)}{<148>E<088>}{-= Elven Hills =- The lush green grass covers the hills, both small and large.  A small hole has been dug into the side of a hill, like some sort of home.  Clumps of dirt carelessly fall to the ground as a gust of wind passes through.  The sound of the brook comes from the west. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27474}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27476}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27477}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48346}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27476}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (out)}{ }{-= Elven Hills =- Barely enough sunlight seeps into the small hole.  The only surrounding is a reddish-brown, clay like dirt and roots from shrubs and grasses. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27475}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27477}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (s,w)}{ }{-= Elven Hills =- The hills continue to span off in every direction.  The sun is covered momentarily by a passing cloud.  A speck of black darts across the sky.  Only the occasional set of footprints in the thick grass gives any indication that someone is here. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27475}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27478}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27478}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (w,e)}{ }{-= Elven Hills =- The hills continue to span off in every direction.  A large patch of yellow and purple wildflowers covers this particular hill.  A flurry of butterflies shoot up out of the flowers and take off into the sky.  The babbling brook grows louder. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27477}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27479}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27479}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (n,e)}{ }{-= Elven Hills =- A small babbling brook curves out a path through the green hills.  Small pebbles stand in the middle of the brook bed, making little ripples as the water flows over them.  Tall blades of grass surrounds the outer edge of the bank. Small insects dart across the brook from one side to the other. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27478}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27480}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27480}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (s,w)}{ }{-= Elven Hills =- Small, branchy shrubs dot the green grass.  Circles of dirt surround each one.  A few rocks peek out from the ground.  The sun burns bright in the sky and a flock of sparrows swoop down behind a distant hill. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27479}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27481}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27481}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (enter,e)}{<148>E<088>}{-= Elven Hills =- The small hills abruptly end and bring into view a large hole dug into one of the hill sides.  A long, thick branch from a shrub acts as a blockade.  Footprints, only slightly larger than those found in the rest of the hills, mark the ground.  A small light shines from the inside of the hole. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27480}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27482}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27482}{0}{}{-= Elven Hills =- (out)}{ }{-= Elven Hills =- A small torch light hangs on the wall.  The floor and walls are completely made of dirt.  There is a flat gray rock in the back of the hole.  There are no decorations in this place other than the many footprints embedded on the ground. }{Elven Hills}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27481}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27483}{0}{}{On the edge of a small farm (hole,e,s,n)}{<138>H<088>}{This is the edge of a small farming area, and must be where the villagers on the other side of that hole get their food. The fields extend to the north, south, and east. The fields are worked by peasants and farmers of all ages. The annoying little boys look like they might be the easiest to kill.  }{Peasant Farm}{peasant_farm}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {13721}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27484}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27485}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27486}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27484}{0}{}{The middle of a small farm (e,w,s,n)}{ }{All types of beans are being grown on this portion of the farm. There are rows of lima beans, string beans, and a few other types of bean that are not recognizable. It is amazing how the peasants can grow so much in such a small space here in Mandor. It must be the warm sunny climate, or the water that they use.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27483}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27487}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27492}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27493}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27485}{0}{}{On the edge of a lettuce patch (e,s,n)}{ }{Here on the edge of a small Mandorian farm is a neat lettuce patch. The local peasants and farmers are busy tending their crops in order to provide the village with food. The small farm extends to the north, south, and east.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27483}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27493}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27496}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27486}{0}{}{In a corn field (e,s,n)}{ }{The tall rows of corn make it hard to see very far in any direction. Judging by the forest that is visible over the tops of the corn to the west, you must be close to the edge of the small farm. The farmers and peasants take a great deal of pride in their ability to grow corn.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27483}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27487}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27488}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27487}{0}{}{In the middle of a small farm. (e,w,s,n)}{ }{This is the middle of a small busy farm. Celery grows all around with very few peasants to watch over it. The farm continues to the north, south, east, and west.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27486}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27489}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27491}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27484}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27488}{0}{}{North western corner of a small farm (e,s)}{ }{The Manadorian forest borders this small field to the north and west. This corner of the farm looks quite desolate compared to the rest. Not much more than weeds grow here, and even most of them look like they have been stomped on. There is a field of corn to the south, and what appears to be sugar cane to the east.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27486}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27489}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27489}{0}{}{A field full of sugar cane (e,s,w)}{ }{There are tall trees visible to the north over the top of the head high sugar cane. Peasants are visible walking in and out of the rows of cane. Not much more is visible from inside this field.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27488}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27490}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27487}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27490}{0}{}{Northeast corner of a small farm (w,s)}{ }{The beet field is bordered to the north and east by a forest of large trees. Other fields of this small farm are visible to the south and west.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27489}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27491}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27491}{0}{}{A field full of onions (w,s,n)}{ }{This field is filled full of peasants, and farmers weeding between rows of onions. The forest to the east cuts off all movement in that direction, but fields are visible to the north, south, and west.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27487}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27492}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27490}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27492}{0}{}{A strawberry patch (w,s,n)}{ }{The strawberry patch is nice and neat and teaming with life. The farmers and peasants move around the patch seemingly ignoring the presence of all the bandits, but oddly they do not come within arm's length of the bandits at all. The fields of the small farm continue to the north, south, and west. The eastern edge of this field is bordered by a forest of very tall trees. There appears to be a small path of some sort.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27484}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27494}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27491}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27498}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27493}{0}{}{The center of a small farm (e,w,s,n)}{ }{This is the center of the small farm. The farm continues north, south, east, and west. It is quite remarkable to see such a variety of crops growing here. The peasants are nurturing beautiful tomato plants, while others within sight are tending lettuce, watermelons, beans, and asparagus. }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27484}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27494}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27485}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27495}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27494}{0}{}{A field of asparagus (w,s,n)}{ }{The peasants are hard at work tending the asparagus in this small field, and pulling what weeds can be found. The small farm continues to the north, south, and west, while the forest on the eastern side makes moving in that direction impossible.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27493}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27497}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27492}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27495}{0}{}{A small watermelon patch (e,w,n)}{ }{The southern end of the watermelon patch is bordered by a forest, while this small farm continues to the north, east, and west. By the look of it, the sunny warm climate here in Mandor is very conducive to the growth of watermelons.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27493}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27496}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27497}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27496}{0}{}{Southwest corner of a small farm (e,n)}{ }{The area is bordered by the tall trees of the Mandorian forest to the south and the west. The fields of squash are not nearly as organized as the other parts of the farm. Many of the vegetables and their vines have been stomped flat into the ground, leaving a pulpy mess. The farm spreads out to the north and east.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27485}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27495}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27497}{0}{}{Southeast corner of a small farm (w,n)}{ }{The forest borders this small cucumber patch on the south and east, while the rest of the farm continues to the north and west. Even with the distractions caused by the bandits, the peasants are all still hard at work, to provide fresh fruits and vegetables for their village.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27495}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27494}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27498}{0}{}{A path into the woods (e,w)}{ }{The small forest path runs farther into the forest to the east, and west back to the farm. This might be where all of the bandits are coming from.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27492}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27499}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27499}{0}{}{A turn in a small forest path (w,s)}{ }{The path that makes a sharp turn here. To the west, farm sounds can be heard, and from the south, the beautiful chirps of birds echo loudly. A large tree, just south of the trail, stands taller than anything else in the woods.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27498}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27500}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27500}{0}{}{A large tree with a nest in it stands here (n,e)}{ }{The small path runs north and east here. One tree stands out from the rest. A bird's nest sits in a large maple tree, just off the path.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27499}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27501}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48374}{climb tree}{climb tree}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48374}{u}{climb tree}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27501}{0}{}{A path through the woods (e,w)}{ }{The small forest path runs east and west here. There is a large tree just off the path to the west and it looks kinda gloomy to the east.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27500}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27502}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27502}{0}{}{A mysterious place on the path (e,w)}{ }{The path continues a little further to the east. There is something different about the trail, almost as if something is being concealed here. An eerie chill passes through the air and the trees seem to shimmer. Wicked laughter echoes through the trees, but it is impossible to determine which direction it is coming from.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27501}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27503}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27504}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27503}{0}{}{The end of a path (w)}{ }{The path abruptly comes to an end. This portion of the path does not seem to be as well traveled as the rest, and this looks like a very odd place for it to end. It is almost as if someone, maybe the bandits, planned for this path to go elsewhere, and never finished it. Trees crowd in on the small trail from all directions, except the west. The tall weeds that grow up from the path suggest that people do not come here often.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27502}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27504}{0}{}{North of a small camp (s,n)}{ }{There is a small camp to the south. Only one small hut is visible from this distance, but it does not appear to be all that sturdy. Even from here the trash that litters the area is quite visible, but it appears to be deserted.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27502}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27505}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27505}{0}{}{An intersection in the bandit camp (e,w,n)}{ }{This is an intersection in the bandits' camp. The path runs to the north, east, and west. There is a small, crudely built hut to the west. The area is littered with trash, clothing, and rotten vegetables.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27504}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27506}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27507}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27506}{0}{}{A path leading out of the camp. (e,w)}{ }{This path leads out of the bandit camp. A strange smell lingers in the air, but it is very hard to tell what it is.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27505}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27508}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27507}{0}{}{A quickly built bandit hut (e)}{ }{This quickly built bandit hut is the home of several bandits. It's not any cleaner than the rest of the camp. There are a few cots around the walls of the hut, and dirty blankets litter the floor around the small fire pit.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27505}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27508}{0}{}{The path continues. (e,w)}{ }{The path is littered with garbage. The hard packed ground of the trail is filled with large ruts. The ruts appear to have been formed by large items being dragged off to the east. Tall trees form impenetrable walls to the north and south.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27506}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27509}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27509}{0}{}{A path leading into the woods (e,w)}{<238>E<088>}{The smell is simply awful here. It overwhelms the air and even the smell of the forest is gone. Ahead, there is a large mound of something. It seems to be a trash dump site. A pile of sticks and leaves sits to one side of the path. }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27508}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27510}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27511}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27510}{0}{}{A foul smelling part of the woods. (w)}{ }{You are at a clearing in the woods. There are things all around this clearing. Your nose quickly determines that this is where the bandits throw all of their garbage. The mess here is unbelievable. Anything could be in here.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27509}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27511}{0}{}{A secret hideout (out)}{ }{If you hadn't been looking closely, you'd have never noticed this little hut. A rumpled blanket lies on the dirty floor. Several empty beer bottles are sitting near the open doorway that leads back out of here.  }{Peasant Farm}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27509}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27512}{0}{}{Small Stairway (return,u)}{<138>R<088>}{You stand at the entrance to a truly evil place.  Masses of spandex brush by you, covering mounds of flesh both firm and flabby alike.  Your nostrils are assaulted by a sickly sweet odour.  The foul stench is a combination of fruity, melon-smelling air freshener, tainted by an over-powering scent of sweat.  There seems to be a number of people both coming and going through here. }{New World Fitness}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {13723}{return}{return}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27513}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27513}{0}{}{NWF reception desk (e,w,d)}{ }{Welcome to New World Fitness... where the masses come to lift, press, push, pull, run, jog, walk, step and basically beat the hell out of themselves in the interest of gaining some small degree of greater physical fitness.  There is a reception desk here where members can check in, as well as a schedule on the wall.  Beside the schedule, you see what seems to be a map of the facilities (for new members you would assume). }{New World Fitness}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27512}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27514}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27515}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27514}{0}{}{Step Class Room (s,e,w)}{ }{A large group of people here bounce repeatedly onto, off of, and over a small piece of plastic, while loud music blares from somewhere.  Almost all of them seem to be following the lead of one of the perkiest people you have ever seen on the platform to the south.  This must be what they call a 'step class'. There is also an exit east, out to the track. }{New World Fitness}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27513}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27516}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27517}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27515}{0}{}{Cybex Weight Room (s,e,n)}{ }{The room before you is filled to the brim with the most modern pieces of weight training apparatus available. Dark and vile images of medival torture devices flash through your mind as you glance around the room.  You also notice that the overwhelming majority of people here are either nattering old grandmothers who seem to do nothing but sit on the equipment, or loud-mouthed youths with seemingly little regard for anything but annoying everyone else. }{New World Fitness}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27513}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27524}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27525}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27516}{0}{}{Instructor's platform (n)}{ }{You are on a small, raised platform which is made even smaller by the presence of a loud, annoying, perky-as-hell step instructor.  There is a mirror to the south and the rest of the class to the north of here. }{New World Fitness}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27514}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27517}{0}{}{Track (w,s,n)}{ }{This is the track that circles the outside of the gym. There are lanes for both walking and running, and windows through which you can see the city.  A rather disgusting gray film covers the windows, obscuring your view slightly. From here, you can walk in through the step aerobics room to the reception desk. }{New World Fitness}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
