R {27532}{0}{}{Path (hole,s)}{<138>H<088>}{You are on a small gravel path. There is a hole in the ground. The path extends towards the south and it's almost like an invitation to adventure onwards to new and exciting places. }{Newbie Forest}{newbie_forest}{}{}{1.000}{1}
