R {27534}{0}{}{Path (s,n)}{ }{You are on the edge of a small forest. The trees extend away from you on both sides. You cannot see any animals but you are sure that there should be some in there. It looks very cool and peaceful. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
