R {27535}{0}{}{Path (w,s,n)}{ }{You are at the outskirts of the forest. It definitely is cool and peaceful in here. Sunlight trickles down from the holes in the canopy above. You observe a deer trail heading west. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
