R {27536}{0}{}{Forest (s,w,e)}{ }{The sun seems to smile on you as you enter this part of the forest. To the south you hear the laughter of fairies and to the west you hear the sounds of quiet animal movements. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
