R {27540}{0}{}{Forest (e)}{ }{The trees surround you here in this natural grove. There almost seems to be no one around then you realize there is something odd about the trees. You get the feeling you are being watched... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27539}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27541}{0}{}{Forest (s,w,e)}{ }{There is little space between the trees here. You have to move carefully to avoid bumping into one. As you look around to get your bearings, you see a tall tree that towers above all the others to the south. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
