R {27542}{0}{}{Forest (s,e,n)}{ }{The tree in the center of this clearing towers above you, extending itself hundreds of feet into the air above. You wonder how something so huge and natural could have survived in this world so long. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
