R {27543}{0}{}{Forest (e,s)}{ }{You hear mischievous laughter but still cannot see who is responsible for it. The giggling is driving you crazy in a nice sort of way. You feel like you are in a hide and seek game... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
