E {27544}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27544}{0}{}{Forest (s,n)}{ }{The forest here echos with both the sounds of laughter and the soothing sounds of singing. When you concentrate on the singing, you realize that there is the faint sound of music coming from the south. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
