E {27545}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27545}{0}{}{Forest (s,n)}{ }{The forest still surrounds you, but the music is louder now. Its smooth clear sounds are enchanting and you find yourself compelled to find out who or what is making that incredible melody. You find yourself dancing towards the south. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27544}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27546}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27546}{0}{}{Forest (n)}{ }{You step into a cool, calm clearing. The forest surrounds you in a natural amphitheatre with the highlight being the deep pool positioned in the very center of the clearing. You can't help but dance to the astral music soothing your senses... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27545}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27547}{0}{}{Forest (s,n)}{ }{The forest is rather dense here yet strangely orderly. A tall tree catches your attention to the north. You hear the sound of humming to the south yet the forest still looks very peaceful. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27542}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27549}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27548}{0}{}{Forest (s,w)}{ }{The rustling of leaves is the only sound you can hear in this part of the forest. A tall tree catches your attention to the west. A glimmer of light shines through the trees from the south as well. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27542}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27550}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27549}{0}{}{Forest (n)}{ }{This part of the forest is definitely more orderly and less wild than the rest of the forest. It's almost like someone has been landscaping the forest bringing out its most beautiful features. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27547}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27550}{0}{}{Forest (s,n)}{ }{As the forest becomes less dense you feel the sun flicker off of your face. To the south you hear laughter and giggles and wonder who's chasing who. You wonder if you should disturb their privacy. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27548}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27551}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27551}{0}{}{Forest (n)}{ }{The sun blazes into your eyes and you are blinded momentarily. As you shade your eyes, you behold a remarkable arrangement of shrubbery. Kinda looks comfy but wildly messed up... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27550}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27552}{0}{}{Path (s,n)}{ }{You can see now that there is something seriously wrong with this forest. As you look around, you see that many trees are stunted and leafless. It is almost like the trees are fighting each other for every bit of the remaining sunlight. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27537}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27553}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27553}{0}{}{Path (e,s,n)}{ }{It seems like you have spent forever in this dark and gloomy forest. You feel crowded by the trees and stumble about in the darkness. As you search for a way to go, you notice that there is a dark gaping hole in the forest to the east. There is a strange whistling sound coming from the south. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27552}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27554}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27555}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27554}{0}{}{Forest (s,w,e)}{ }{You stand inside the dark gap. This part of the forest has a nightmarish feel to it. Twisted and leafless trees surround you. They almost appear to be screaming in agony. Very strange... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27553}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27563}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27564}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27555}{0}{}{Path (s,n)}{ }{The forest seems to be thinning out as there are patches of flat rock that the trees cannot get their roots into. This effect seems to get greater the further south you peer. The source of the sound still is not evident. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27553}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27556}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27556}{0}{}{Path (s,n)}{ }{You finally emerge from the dark woods but realize that there still is not a lot of sunlight about. A cliff to the south overshadows everything, leaving it dim and cool here. You feel a chill as you examine the craggy cliff face that goes straight up. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27555}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27557}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27557}{0}{}{Path (s,n)}{ }{The dark forest stands to the north while the cliff dominates your view to the south. You are not certain which looks more forbidding. As you scan over the cliff face you realize that there is a small break at its base. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27556}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27558}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27558}{0}{}{Cave mouth (s,n)}{ }{You stand at the mouth of the cave. Its walls, floor, and ceiling are all of the same sheer rock as the cliff face. This is a natural place for predators to hang out. But they would either need a good fur coat or a fire as it is cold in here. You get the feeling you are not alone... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27557}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27559}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27559}{0}{}{Cave (s,e,n)}{ }{Wow, it got dark in here all of a sudden. You almost can't see the cave walls as it is so dim in here. You get a spooky feeling as you search around looking for some way out. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27558}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27560}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27561}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27560}{0}{}{Cave (n)}{ }{The dark cave echos with your footsteps. Its walls, floor, and ceiling are all of the same sheer rock you've been seeing all along. You almost smack your face into the rock but save yourself as you realize the cave ends abruptly here. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27559}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27561}{0}{}{Cave (d,w)}{ }{Ugh, it smells bad in here. You wonder who'd died lately then suddenly realize you don't want it to be you. There is a dark hole leading down but you are not certain at all if you really want to find out what is down there. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27559}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27562}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27562}{0}{}{Cave hole (u)}{ }{Garbage, filth, and other discarded remains litter the slick surface of this stinking hole. Someone has claimed this as their home but it's not a natural predator as the stink would drive them out. You get the feeling you are not alone... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27561}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27563}{0}{}{Forest (n)}{ }{As you enter this part of the forest, you become aware of the sound of growling coming from the bushes around you. You look around nervously and spot several pairs yellow eyes in the underbrush. Are you sure you want to stick around? }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27554}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27564}{0}{}{Forest (e,w,s,n)}{ }{A dense fog is rising and you find that you can barely see your hand even when you place it directly in front of your face. Your eyes and ears appear to be playing tricks on you. But you are fairly certain that you can hear a humming noise to the east, and a dry rustling sound coming from the south. Strangely, you cannot hear anything from the west or the north. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27554}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {27565}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
