E {27567}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27565}{0}{}{Forest (w)}{ }{Ouch, that humming noise suddenly resolved into the buzzing of busy creatures. You seem to be too close to their hive. Unless you want to get stung badly, it may be a good idea to drift away quietly... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27564}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27566}{0}{}{Forest (e,n)}{ }{The dry rustling sound almost seems to be more of either a rasping or rattling sound. You're not quite sure which, however the one thing you're certain of is that it's much louder to the east... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
