R {27567}{0}{}{Forest (s,w,e)}{ }{The fog swirls around you. You can tell by the lack of tree branches slapping you in the face that you have entered some sort of small clearing. Through a hole in the fog you spot the stump of a very large tree standing alone and abandoned. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
