R {27568}{0}{}{Forest (n,e)}{ }{You trip over some strange low mounds in the ground that you barely see in time. What sends shivers down your spine is that the mounds squeal as you step on them. You find you are having a very hard time maintaining your footing around here. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
