R {27569}{0}{}{Forest (n,w)}{ }{The fog swirls around you so densely that you stumble on blindly through the forest. Tree branches whip your face and bushes grab at your feet. Moving around in here is not fun... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
