R {27570}{0}{}{Forest (e,s)}{ }{The fog seems to be settling down to the ground, clinging to your ankles and surrounding your feet. Strangely you still can't see very well in this part of the forest. Not a place easily explored. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
