R {27571}{0}{}{Forest (n,w)}{ }{As you enter this part of the forest, you become aware of a steady clacking noise. Almost like someone is sharpening hundreds of knives. Then you become aware that the noise is coming from a large mound standing directly in front of you. You don't want to go near that. }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
