R {27572}{0}{}{Forest (w,s)}{ }{Now that is the darkest thicket you've ever seen. It even makes this part of the forest look darker. You begin to wonder if the darkness is natural or not. Then you start to wonder if you really want to find out what could make such a darkness... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
