R {27573}{0}{}{Forest (e)}{ }{Yep, this is indeed a very dark thicket. Your light barely reaches to its corners. This would be the perfect place for someone to hide when counting their stolen treasure or planning some other nefarious deed... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
