R {27575}{0}{}{Forest (s)}{ }{In the fog you see vague shapes moving about. Every so often you see the flash of dark red eyes that appear to be glaring at you with hate and hunger. Not really the place to be invited to supper, unless you want to be the main course... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
