R {27576}{0}{}{Forest (w)}{ }{The ground seems to be moving under your feet. The forest is very dark and cool here. You have a hard time seeing just what is making it so hard to walk here. What bothers you even more is that the vines on the ground seem to move once in a while... }{Newbie Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
