R {27577}{0}{}{A circular, funnel-shaped room (climb,d)}{ }{Walls made of a smooth substance resembling wood, yet which could also be metal, curve around you in a smooth arc.  The southern wall looks climbable. Maybe you should climb back out now.  The floor is vaguely funnel-shaped, leading to a hole in the center which falls to an unknown place.  You can hear strange, guttural noises coming from the hole. }{Newbie Hell}{newbie_hell}{}{}{1.000}{1}
