R {27580}{0}{}{Before a dark and evil altar (w)}{ }{You are standing in a small room of roughly hewn red rock.  Before you, to the north, is a bizarre altar of sorts, upon which rests five goblets of various colors.  There is an archway in the west wall which leads back to the adjacent room.  A sense of piety overwhelms you, though it is a penitence not of your realm. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
