R {27581}{0}{}{A crystal corridor (pole,se)}{ }{You feel as though you are stepping upon meter-thick crystal.  The highly-wrought geometric corridor through which you are passing is constructed of an impossibly smooth crystal, translucent to the eye. You can see approximately a foot into the surface, after which point it becomes hopelessly opaque.  There is a hole in the floor, and a pole extends from the ceiling of this room, through the hole, into the room below. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
