R {27582}{0}{}{A crystal nursery chamber}{ }{This crystal room has an uncomfortable-looking glassy bed in the corner, suggesting that someone or something actually lives in this cold, hard chamber.  The walls and floor are constructed of solid, translucent crystal.  In the ceiling there is a hole, and a smooth pole leads up through it to another room. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
