R {27583}{0}{}{A chilly chamber (d,n)}{ }{The walls of this hexagonal chamber are coated with a thin sheen of frost.  Beneath the icy layer, the walls seems to be constructed of a brushed metal.  There is a hole in the middle of the room, and a ladder leads down to another room. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
