R {27584}{0}{}{A chilly nursery room (u)}{ }{This chamber is small, and shaped as a pentagon.  The walls are made of a somehow soft metal which undulates gently, as though floating upon itself.  There is a small bed of ice against one wall, tiny and wet. A ladder in the center of the room leads up through a hole. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
