R {27585}{0}{}{A corridor dripping with filth (se,w)}{ }{This corridor is completely covered in all sorts of filth, in all colors, sizes and consistencies.  To the west is an opening to a swirling morass of energies, and the passage bends to the southeast.  The smell of this place is almost unbearable. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
