R {27586}{0}{}{A bedchamber of filth (nw)}{ }{You have entered a small chamber that has no visible semblance   of a floor, walls or a ceiling...rather, it is merely an amorphous enclosure of all manner of unmentionable, diseased substances.  There is even a bed in what might be considered the corner, where some  truly indiscriminate being must rest.  There is an opening in the hovel to the northwest. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
