R {27587}{0}{}{A hall of embers (d,s)}{ }{The walls of this strange room are covered with gently gliding embers of fire, as though a recent blaze had been only partially extinguished here.  There is a large hole in the ground, through which you can see another fiery room. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
