R {27589}{0}{}{A cavern of rock (se,ne)}{ }{This rocky cavern is unbearably hot, yet it is arid and decidedly dry.  The rocky crags on the surfaces of the corridor make for some menacing surroundings.  The cavern opens somewhat to the southeast, and to the northeast, you can see a room filled with brightly-colored swirls of energy. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
