R {27593}{0}{}{A Staircase (d,u)}{ }{You are on an old crude staircase. Above you can make out a dim light. Below, there is only darkness. The stairs are made of stone\; probably the same stone as the rock above. The walls are made of dirt. You can see the roots of trees penetrating from them. }{New Kobold Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
