R {27594}{0}{}{Bottom of a Stairwell (n,u)}{ }{You are at the bottom of an old crude stone staircase. The air is cold and damp. The earthen floor looks recently trampled on as though a lot of traffic runs through here. In the ceiling, you can see bits of roots penetrating into the room. There are rooms to the north, east and west, but they all have doors on them except for the northern one. }{New Kobold Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
