R {27595}{0}{}{A Den (s)}{ }{You've entered a den of some sort. The floor is covered in dirt, or wait..it's made of dirt. There is a table in the middle of the room with a bowl in the middle of it. Six small wooden chairs sit around the table. They look quite short. As though they were made for a smaller species. }{New Kobold Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
