R {27596}{0}{}{A Small Dusty Keep (stairs,s,hole)}{<138>H<088>}{Footsteps echo loudly in the tiny courtyard as a cold wind sweeps from the north. To the south, the bulk of the keep rises up\; an intimidating edifice of stone and mortar. Two arrow slits high up on the wall bear a startling resemblance to baleful eyes\; an effect that is heightened by the southern corridor looking like a wide open mouth, the portcullis, sharp teeth. The courtyard is surrounded on three sides by a high wall, rising two stories into the air. A steep staircase climbs up the western wall, leading up onto the walkway above. In the center of the northern wall, a swirling  hole awaits your return. }{Undead Keep (Newbie)}{undead_keep_newbie}{}{}{1.000}{1}
