R {27597}{0}{}{A Small Dusty Keep (stairs)}{ }{       Up on the parapets, you can look for miles in all directions. Nothing but destruction meets your gaze. Nothing is left of the village except for collapsed walls and burned out shells of  buildings. The fields and pastures lie fallow, with nothing  growing in them. A cold wind sends chills down your spine as you realize that this land is dead. The stairs leads back down into the courtyard. }{Undead Keep (Newbie)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
