E {27596}{d}{stairs}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {27598}{0}{}{A Small Deserted Keep (e,w,n)}{ }{The entry hall of the keep shows disrepair and neglect that can be seen all around the castle. It seems as if a battle was once fought in this room, judging from the dark stains that cover the walls and floors. Deep scars and holes mark the walls, the stone surrounding them blackened as if by some sort of  great and powerful magics.  }{Undead Keep (Newbie)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {27596}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
