R {27636}{0}{}{-= Monk Advancement Room =- (n,s,e,fantasy,chaos,science,sho}{<238>G<088>}{-= Monk Advancement Room =- A red-stained bannister lines the walls. Tall wood columns, bearing the same red stain, act as a stablizing force. The base of the columns are very worn with age. The floor is pale brick and cold to the touch. The walls are covered with tapestries. Monks find this room to be especially important in their advancement to higher enlightenment. There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Monks}{grand_monk}{}{}{1.000}{1}
