R {27638}{0}{}{-= Monk Temple Donation Shop =- (w,stairs)}{<138>S<088>}{-= Monk Temple Donation Shop =- The upstairs of the Temple Shop allows Monks to drop off equipment and items that they don't need any more today. Monks may also donate extra coins that they have obtained from their journeys and chores. The Monks' kindness and kinship is readily apparent to all. The donation shop is sparsely decorated and just has the basics. A long wood counter, hooks, and a wall for all the items. A few candles flicker, but otherwise the room doesn't catch much attention. On the back wall is a plaque.  A quick-reference card on the counter informs you that you can buy, sell, and sacrifice items here. }{Monks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
