R {27639}{0}{}{-= Cellar =- (u,e)}{ }{-= Cellar =- The cellar is cool and free of any dust or mildew. The walls are covered with thin, pale wood. The floor is made of brick. Giant sacks of rice, grain, flour, and wheat are stored here. As well as extra clothing, bedding supplies, and a variety of other necessities. Small clay pots have been placed along the floor boards. Each one holds a flickering red candle which provides just enough light to see. The monks also have an extensive wine collection hidden down here. }{Monks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
