R {28082}{0}{}{Plains of Diantia (e,ne)}{ }{Plains of Diantia Fields of mushrooms and mandrake stand still in the swirling mists of Diantia.  This is not a very nice place, and you feel compelled to move along.  Row on row of fungi glisten in the mist.  Their grayish colour gives no indication of whether they are edible or not.  To the east you determine that the plain continues.  Rolling seas wash the shore of the plain to the west and south. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
