R {28083}{0}{}{Plains of Diantia (n,s,e)}{ }{Plains of Diantia All around you the wet fungi stands stock still in the fog -- their purpose a mystery.  This is not a very nice place, and you feel compelled to move along.  Here the fields are bordered with sharp stone fencing piled neatly but sharply, creating a sense of menace and mean-spiritedness.  To the north and south you see that the plain continues.  The plain ends at a steep decline overlooking open ocean to the west. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28079}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
