E {28086}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28084}{0}{}{Plains of Diantia (s,n,w)}{ }{Plains of Diantia Row on row of fungi glisten in the mist.  Their grayish colour gives no indication of whether they are edible or not.  The overgrown remains of a road here show how rich the soil must be, although with no sun only the most persistent of weed could survive here.  The fungi seem to thrive.  The oppressive and foggy plains of Diantia spread for miles and miles.  To the north and west you notice that the plain continues.  The plain ends at a steep decline overlooking open ocean to the east. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28078}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28085}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28083}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28085}{0}{}{Plains of Diantia (n)}{ }{Plains of Diantia Misty and foggy fields of mushrooms and fungi stretch out around you.  The scenery is broken here and there by mounded dirt homes that seem to loom ominously in the fog.  An emerald green python slides slowly by, sizing you up for a snack.  Determining that you are too small, it moves on.  Row on row of fungi glisten in the mist.  Their grayish colour gives no indication of whether they are edible or not.  To the north you determine that the plain continues.  The plains of Diantia end abruptly here on a promontory overlooking open ocean to the south and east.  Across a narrow bay to the west you see land. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28084}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28086}{0}{}{Plains of Diantia (n)}{ }{Plains of Diantia Everything seems heavy and oppressive here.  You are standing in the mist-cloaked plains of Diantia.  From somewhere in the fog, some animal cries out in mortal terror, screams, and then all is silent.  The plains of Diantia end abruptly here on a promontory overlooking open ocean to the south and west.  Across a narrow bay to the east you see land.  Inix     Uptime: 3.0 days  Reboot: 9.0 days  Lag: 0.00  Idle: [00:00:01]   }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28083}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

