R {28271}{0}{}{Small clearing (center,leave)}{ }{You are standing in a small clearing somewhere in the foggy dank plains of Diantia. Far off to the north through the mists you see mountains and to the east through a thick stand of pole trees is Lake Bieren. You can continue traveling through Diantia by leaving this place. Toward the center of the clearing, and looming large in the fog, large standing stones can be seen. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28067}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28272}{center}{center}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28272}{0}{}{Stone structures (center,leave)}{ }{You stand at the edge of a ring of ancient menhirs. These large mossy stone blocks are set upright in a circle, gathered in an orderly fashion around a large dark stone block in the center. You clearly feel a malevolent energy about this place, and every nerve in your body tells you to leave. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28271}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28273}{center}{center}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28273}{0}{}{Dark Stone Block (leave)}{ }{You are standing in the center of the menhirs. They circle all around you and the huge dark stone block. The sense of raw power from the menhirs is all but overwhelming, and the dark block before you practically pulses with dark force. The ground around the block is ritualistically stained a deep ochre red, and the feeling of evil is palpable and profound. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28272}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
