R {28301}{0}{}{The devil's port (e)}{<158>T<088>}{This is the port of the devil's isle. It is rumored that one of the most powerful devils lives somewhere on the island. It is also rumored that it possesses the most powerful weapon. Of course no one has ever found the devil, or if they did, they never returned to tell of it. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28302}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28299}{enter traveler}{enter traveler}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28302}{0}{}{A small path (w,e)}{ }{This is a small path leading into a dark, thick forest. The trees are hovering over you like they are either going to attack or as if they are protecting you from something. To the west is the port. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28301}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28303}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28303}{0}{}{A path (w,e)}{ }{This path continues east and west. The deep forest seems to be preventing the sunlight from touching the damp soil. Be careful and be very observant. Look before you go. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28302}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28304}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28304}{0}{}{Path (w,e)}{ }{To the east, a small village can be seen. The path continues west to the port. This place does not seem as bad as what the rumors have said. There is nothing much to see except for trees. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28303}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28305}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28305}{0}{}{Entrance of village (w,e)}{ }{This is the entrance of a small elven village. Why these elves have chosen to live on a floating island, you do not know. The elven folk tend to stay away from you. A lot of visitors come to this island and they know what people like you might do to them. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28304}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28306}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28306}{0}{}{Elven village (s,w)}{ }{You are in a small elven village. The elves tend to stay away from you. They seem to have a worried look on their faces.  You are just wondering why people are living on a floating island. And how are these islands flying in the air?  Haven't they heard of gravity? }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28305}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28307}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28307}{0}{}{Center of elven village (n,s,w,e)}{ }{This is the center of the elven village. This part of the village is the busiest. There is a small pub to the west and a shop to the south. You are beginning to think that the devil rumor was created to attract adventurers here to support the elven economy. But what do you know? }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28306}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28308}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28309}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28310}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28308}{0}{}{Elven shop (n)}{ }{This is a small shop built right inside a tree. It is amazing that the tree is still alive. The shop sells all sorts of stuff. Type <list> to see what is available at the moment, or buy <number>, to buy something. A thin elven shopkeeper stands against a wall attending to his customers. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28307}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28309}{0}{}{The elven pub (e)}{<238>P<088>}{You have entered Elven Spirit. You never knew elves liked to drink so much. There are tables everywhere about the pub and the actual bar is on the southern wall. There is a large sign above the bar. The elven folk are having so much fun here, they don't even notice you. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
E {28307}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28310}{0}{}{Edge of elven village (n,w,e)}{ }{This is the edge of the little elven village. There isn't much activity here. To the west is the main village and to the east is the forest. To the north is a very, very large tree with a man-size hole in it. Another thought flashes through your mind, 'How do trees grow way up here?' }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28307}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28311}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28312}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28311}{0}{}{Inside a tree (s)}{ }{You are inside a very large tree. An old elven sage lives here. Why anyone would live in a tree is beyond you. There doesn't seem to be anything in the tree, but you figured that anyway. The person who lives here must think he or she is a squirrel. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28310}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28312}{0}{<228>}{Light forest (w,e)}{D}{This is the beginning of a beautiful forest. The trees block some of the sunlight, making it feel nice and cool. You can't understand why or how a devil could live on such an island. The forest gets thicker to the east and the village is to the west. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{durantalist2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
