E {28374}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28376}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28376}{0}{}{End of pass (s,e)}{ }{You have come to the end of the mountain pass. To the east, you can walk up along the side of the mountain. It seems to go way up. There are bones of all kinds of creatures scattered about the area. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28375}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28377}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28377}{0}{}{Mountain side (ne,w)}{ }{You are on the side of a mountain. You can go up the mountain side. There is a little sign posted here. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28376}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28378}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28378}{0}{}{Along the mountain ledge (sw,n)}{ }{You are now along the mountain ledge. You are about twenty cubits above the ground. There isn't much to look at from here.  The ledge continues up towards the north and down towards southwest. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28377}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28379}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28379}{0}{}{Mountain ledge (nw,s)}{ }{You are traveling along the mountain ledge. You are still on the eastern side of the mountain. You are about fifty cubits off the ground. The ledge wraps around the mountain northwest and south. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28378}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28380}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28380}{0}{}{Mountain ledge (se,w)}{ }{You are now on the northern part of the ledge. You are very high above the ground now. It is hard to tell exactly how far you are up. To the north, you can see another isle. It is hard to see it from here. The ledge continues west and southeast. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28379}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28381}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28381}{0}{}{Mountain ledge (sw,e)}{ }{You are on the northern end of the mountain side. To the north, you can see an isle more clearly. It seems to drift like a cloud.  There are trees and mountains on it also. It looks much like the isle you are on now. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28380}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28382}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28382}{0}{}{Mountain ledge (ne,s)}{ }{You are now really, really high above the ground. A fall now would be devastating. To the north, you can still see the other isle. way off to the southwest you can see a small forest. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28381}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28383}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28383}{0}{}{End of mountain ledge (n,e)}{ }{You have come to the end of the mountain ledge. The way down is to the north. To the east is a large cave.  You can feel immense evil radiating from the cave. I would think twice before entering.  You are now extremely high above the ground. A fall now may mean death. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28382}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28384}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28384}{0}{}{A large cave (w,e)}{ }{You entered a large cave. The cave seems very clean.  There are no dead bodies or bones lying around. The dead remains must have just been dumped down the mountain. The cave continues east. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28383}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28385}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28385}{0}{}{Inner cave (w)}{ }{This is the inner cave of the dragons. There doesn't seem to be much here. It's just a plain old cave.  You wonder if there could be  anything in here. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28384}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28386}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28386}{0}{}{Dragon's lair (s)}{<148>B<088>}{This is a dragon's lair. There are many things scattered about the ground. Just being here makes you tremble with fear. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{byrontic2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28385}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28387}{0}{}{Tower door (n,s)}{ }{This is a large dark tower. It seems to be made from a strange, magical material. Although it seems dark and evil, you get the feeling that this place is friendly. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
