R {28392}{0}{}{A large room (d)}{<148>S<088>}{This is a large room on top of the staircase. You can feel great powers of magic from this room. Magic like never known before. It's as if the magic is reading your mind and soul. You get an uneasy feeling here. }{Serinth: The 2nd Dimension}{sabrena2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
