R {28413}{0}{<278>}{A small path (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{This is a small path leading into a dark, thick forest. The trees are hovering over you like they are either going to attack or as if they are protecting you from something. To the west is the port. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28411}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
