R {28414}{0}{<278>}{A path (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{This path continues east and west. The deep forest seems to be preventing the sunlight from touching the damp soil. Be careful and be very observant. Look before you go. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
