R {28415}{0}{<278>}{Path (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{To the east, a small village can be seen. The path continues west to the port. This place does not seem as bad as what the rumors have said. There is nothing much to see except for trees. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28414}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28416}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28416}{0}{<278>}{Entrance of village (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{This is the entrance of a small elven village.  Why these elves have chosen to live on a floating island, you do not know.  The elven folk tend to stay away from you.  A lot of visitors come to this island and they know what people like you might do to them. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28415}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28417}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28417}{0}{<278>}{Elven village (w,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{You are in a small elven village.  The elves tend to stay away from you. They seem to have a worried look on their faces.  You are just wondering why people are living on a floating island.  And how are these islands flying in the air?  Haven't they heard of gravity? }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28416}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28418}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28418}{0}{<278>}{Center of elven village (n,s,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{This is the center of the elven village.  This part of the village is the busiest.  There is a small pub to the west and a shop to the south.  You are beginning to think that the devil rumor was created to attract adventurers here to support the elven economy.  But what do you know? }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28417}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28419}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28420}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28421}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28419}{0}{<138>}{Elven shop (n)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{This is a small shop built right inside a tree.  It is amazing that the tree is still alive.  The shop sells all sorts of stuff.  Type <list> to see what is available at the moment, or buy <number>, to buy something.  A thin elven shopkeeper stands against a wall attending to his customers. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28418}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28420}{0}{<238>}{The elven pub (e)}{<238>[P]<088>}{You have entered Elven Spirit.  You never knew elves liked to drink so much.  There are tables everywhere about the pub and the actual bar is on the southern wall.  There is a large sign above the bar.  The elven folk are having so much fun here, they don't even notice you. }{Serinth}{}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
E {28418}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28421}{0}{<278>}{Edge of elven village (n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{This is the edge of the little elven village.  There isn't much activity here.  To the west is the main village and to the east is the forest.  To the north is a very, very large tree with a man-size hole in it.  Another thought flashes through your mind, 'How do trees grow way up here?' }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28418}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28422}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28423}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28422}{0}{}{Inside a tree (s)}{ }{You are inside a very large tree.  An old elven sage lives here. Why anyone would live in a tree is beyond you.  There doesn't seem to be anything in the tree, but you figured that anyway. The person who lives here must think he or she is a squirrel. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28421}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28423}{0}{<228>}{Light forest (w,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{This is the beginning of a beautiful forest.  The trees block some of the sunlight, making it feel nice and cool.  You can't understand why or how a devil could live on such an island.  The forest gets thicker to the east and the village is to the west. }{Serinth}{durantalist}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28421}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28424}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28424}{0}{<228>}{Thick forest (s,e,w)}{<228>( *<088>}{The tall trees tower over you.  These huge trees must be very, very old, which means this whole island must be ancient.  The whole environment gives you a feeling of tranquility.  The forest continues all around you, but in some directions, trees block your way. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28423}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28425}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28426}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28425}{0}{<228>}{Elven forest (n)}{<228>( *<088>}{This large tree covers this island like a blanket. Everything seems so peaceful. You also get the feeling something or someone has been here. You are not a ranger but, you can still see the footprints on the ground. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28424}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28426}{0}{<228>}{A light forest (e,w)}{<228>( *<088>}{This is a light forest. To the west you can see the small elven forest and to the east, off in the distance, a dark tower can be seen. }{Serinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28424}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28427}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

