R {28584}{0}{}{On the Rocky Plain (s,n,w)}{ }{On the Rocky Plain Shafts of light break through the cloudy cover to illuminate the rocky ground.  The land around you has become rougher, areas of bare stone poking through the grass.  The soft breeze is rather nippy, containing the hint of distant snow.  To the north you determine an opening to a hill, while to the south you notice that the plain continues.   }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
