R {28585}{0}{}{In the Deepest Swamp (s,n,e)}{ }{In the Deepest Swamp The moist, warm air sends shivers cascading up and down your spine.  Grasses grow on small puddles, making the ground seem firmer than it really is.  Mud and filth trail behind you as you trudge through the murky filth.  To the north you determine that the swamp continues.   }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
