R {28586}{0}{}{In the Deepest Swamp (n,sw,w)}{ }{In the Deepest Swamp Deformed trees cling to the wetter spots of the ooze-covered landscape, their roots easily visible above the ground.  Soft, spongy ground sucks at your feet, sinking you to the ankles in dark brown muck.  Your stomach turns and you wrinkle your nose against the invasive smell of decay and filthy water.  To the north and southwest you see that the swamp continues.  The ocean comes right to the edge of the swamp. }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
