R {28591}{0}{}{In a Secluded Lagoon (n)}{ }{In a Secluded Lagoon The still air is hot and humid, causing you to sweat profusely.  Exotic plants grow in a profusion of colours around the waters' edge, greens vying with the reds and yellows for attention.  The warm water comes up to your hips, its crystal clear surface hiding many small fish and animals.  To the east you see an opening to a swamp.   }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
