E {28668}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28666}{0}{}{In Darkened Caves (se)}{ }{In Darkened Caves Rough and pitted, the floor of the cave is littered with animal feces and broken bones.  Death and decay hang everywhere, filling every inch of the caves with their dank stench.  Claustrophobically close, the walls of the cave are little more than solid shadows in the darkness that no light seems to fully penetrate.   }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28664}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28667}{0}{}{In Darkened Caves (e)}{ }{In Darkened Caves The stench of excrement and death is overwhelming, making you gag as the dank air assaults your lungs.  Trickling across the floor, streams of water carry away disgusting globs of filth and decay.  Rivulets of water trickle down the dark stone walls of the cave, in some places as large as small waterfalls, in others, merely tiny drips.  To the east you observe that the cave continues.   }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28664}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28668}{0}{}{In Darkened Caves}{<148>S<088>}{In Darkened Caves Claustrophobically close, the walls of the cave are little more than solid shadows in the darkness that no light seems to fully penetrate.  The dank air reeks of unidentifiable carrion, mixed liberally with the smell of unwashed dragon.  The floor of the cave is cluttered with the debris of centuries, shards of bones mixed with ancient feces in a malodourous carpet.   }{Dragon Isle}{saoirse}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28665}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28669}{0}{}{In the Mountains (se,w)}{ }{In the Mountains The path beneath you is treacherously strewn with loose rock and pebbles.  You are surrounded by sheer cliffs of weathered granite that tower up to cold and distant peaks.  Goosebumps rise on your skin as the chill breeze seeps into your bones.  To the southeast you see an opening to a cliff.   }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28647}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28670}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {28670}{0}{}{In the Mountains (e,w)}{ }{In the Mountains The road under you winds its way among the breathtaking spectacle of the ancient mountains.  Sparkling clear, the mountain air invigorates you, taking your breath away.  The terrain around you is craggy, as rough as if titans had crushed it beneath their feet.  To the west and east you see that the mountain continues.   }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {28669}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {28671}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

