R {29097}{0}{}{A Launch Silo}{<148>S<088>}{The room around you expands into a large circular launch silo. The polished stainless walls around you sparkle in the glow of the massive rings of LED light on the perimeter of the ceiling. In the center of the room a cockpit of a rocket stands emitting a low pitched rumble as a frothy smoke slowly bubbles up from the deep shaft that extends down into the floor. The large door you entered from stands behind you. Aside from a small ladder leading into the open cockpit hatch, the only other item of note is a small TV monitor on the wall immediately next to the door. }{Dexter's Laboratory - Spacestation}{dexters_spacestation}{}{}{1.000}{1}
