R {29099}{0}{}{A Space Station Hallway (s,n)}{ }{As you progress down the hallway, your mind begins to wonder what this place is. Obviously, it's a space station, but does it serve a grander purpose? Why do the floors need to be so clean? Why are there no details, no protrusions, no dents, no scuffs, no anything? The walls just continue on down the hallway, never changing, no matter how much you might wish they would. }{Dexter's Laboratory - Spacestation}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29098}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29100}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29100}{0}{}{Space Station Intersection (s,n,e,w)}{ }{Standing in an intersection between the sterile pathways of the space station presents you with an opportunity to venture off in a new direction. While this would be a welcome relief, you are reminded that regardless of which direction you head, the hallways remain the same, reaching out into madness with their lack of decor. }{Dexter's Laboratory - Spacestation}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29099}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29101}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
