E {29103}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29101}{0}{}{Space Station Hallway (s,n)}{ }{Your eyes strain to see any semblence of difference from one hallway section to the next. The only difference you can find is the passage of time as you walk. Each wall looks the same, each floor feels the same against your feet. The lights flicker and dance all the same. You wonder if you're descending into madness. }{Dexter's Laboratory - Spacestation}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29100}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29126}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29102}{0}{}{Space Station Hallway (ne,e,w)}{ }{The hallway continues on, its stainless walls playing tricks with your eyes as they line the hallway with no details, no changes in shape, no protrusions to make shadows, no contours to follow. You wonder what purpose it serves to be so plain, as if its merely a prototype for some grander design that will be full of things to look at or items that serve a purpose. }{Dexter's Laboratory - Spacestation}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
