R {29110}{0}{}{Space Station Post (e)}{ }{The hallway terminates here in an expansive pod-like room, which is probably due to the modular nature of the space station's construction. The lights are dim, but you can still make out a large number of crates in the room. You think you see a shadow moving around the edges, as if someone, or something, is hiding behind the crates. }{Dexter's Laboratory - Spacestation}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
