R {29111}{0}{}{Space Station Corner (s,e)}{ }{The hallway comes to a sharp corner here at end of the station. The flickering lights dance across the stainless walls. The walls go on in both directions without distinction. It's an eerie feeling standing in a space so devoid of detail. }{Dexter's Laboratory - Spacestation}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
