R {29130}{0}{<278>}{Mos Eisley Street (n)}{<278>- -<088>}{This street is bustling with activity. It holds many of the races of the galaxy intermingled with droids of all kinds.  Uh oh you think over the crowd you see the white of the sun bouncing off a stormtrooper's helmet, better be careful. To the north you see some sort of cantina. To the south is a YT-1300 Transport to take you back. }{Cantina}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
