R {29131}{0}{}{The Cantina Entrance (s,n,e)}{ }{You find youself within the Mos Eisley Cantina. It crawls with strange creatures and aliens from all over the galaxy.  You had better be careful or else you'll become Bantha fodder. }{Cantina}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
