R {29157}{0}{}{Archway to Spacing Guild (d,exit)}{ }{This is a tall, arched room with a wide set of stairs leading down to the some new construction.  You've heard that shuttles may be found down there to take you to various planets.  The walls are not yet painted and various building materials lie here. }{Dune}{dune}{}{}{1.000}{1}
