R {29158}{0}{}{Front room of the Spacing Guild (u,e)}{ }{This is the front room of the Spacing Guild.  It is spacious and is richly appointed.  The floor is of a red-streaked marble and there are glowglobes hovering near the ceiling.  To the east is a hallway leading towards the shuttles.  There is a wide stair leading up here. A LARGE SIGN READS:      PLEASE READ THE BULLETIN BOARD FOR ANNOUNCEMENTS.            - THE MANAGEMENT }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
