E {29159}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29159}{0}{}{Front Hall of the Spacing Guild (s,n,e,w)}{ }{This is the front hall of the Spacing Guild.  The entrance is to the west.  To the north is a waiting room, to the south is an office where you can find out possible travelling destinations, and to the east is the rest of the Guild. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
