R {29161}{0}{<238>}{Spacing Bar (s)}{<238>[P]<088>}{This is the waiting room of the Spacing Guild.  Passengers come here while waiting for their shuttle to arrive.  There are people coming and going, some lounging around, some at the bar, drinking.  You may also buy drinks here to take with you on your voyage.   ===========================================    Drinks Available:                               Reclaimed Dune Water:         250 coins       Spiced Tea:                   300 coins       Spice Beer:                   550 coins       Pan-Galactic Gargleblaster:  2400 coins    =========================================== }{Dune}{}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
