R {29162}{0}{}{Spacing Guild Reception Room (n,s,w)}{ }{This is the reception room of the Guild.  Black robed figures stand around a huge matte black tank filled with some sort of gas.  You fail to see anything in the tank, but you have heard that these tanks are normally occupied by Guild Navigators. To the north is the Duty-Free Shop. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
