R {29250}{0}{}{Corner of the Borg Cube. (d,s,portal,e)}{<158>P<088>}{Corner of the Borg Cube. Three walls here are part of the external surface of the Borg Cube. Everything is black, with heavy bracing supporting the structure and a multitude of pipes and cables attached at various points. Metal pillars make the room seem somewhat small and claustrophobic and define an enclosed grid which allows you to move in any direction. Every inch of wall space is covered with vents and there are many alcoves packed with mechanical and electrical hardware. A portal is formed here from a shimmering rift in the air. }{Borg Cubes}{borg_cubes}{}{}{1.000}{1}
