R {29375}{0}{}{Gateway to the Solar System (door,s)}{<138>D<088>}{You have entered the gateway to destinations in the solar system. Shuttles depart regularly from here to all points in the Sol system (or will at any rate). }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{fuzzy_aliens}{}{}{1.000}{1}
