R {29376}{0}{}{A departure bay (n)}{<138>S<088>}{You are in a departure bay. The room looks drab and boring as though someone built it in a rush, with the plan to move and renovate it. Nothing to see here, other than the shuttle, and if that's not here, well, then you're pretty bored, aren't you? }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
