R {29385}{0}{}{A seemingly barren planet (n,s,w)}{ }{As you trek along the planet, a great structure arises along the eastern horizon. Upon taking a closer look, you see that it is a huge crater! It's so big, it practically takes up the whole eastern half of the planet. }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
