R {29386}{0}{}{Hallway in a crater (s,out,n)}{<138>O<088>}{Light from the walls greets you as you enter the crater cavern. The cavern seems to be hewn from the rock, or rather the rock fashioned to make a cavern. Sounds of revelry bounce off the walls, making their source hard to trace. }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
