R {29391}{0}{}{A seemingly barren planet (n,s,e,w)}{ }{A cold wind blows around, stirring up dust. The surface of the planet is cold and hard making for a rather unfriendly environment. Odd-looking craters dot the landscape in all directions. They don't seem to be naturally made though. }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
