R {29394}{0}{}{A seemlingly barren planet (s,e,ne)}{ }{You have reached the edge of the planet here. Far to the west looms the great red planet of Mars. Craters spot the ground everywhere, but they look artifical, as though something or someone built them. }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
