R {29397}{0}{}{A seemingly barren planet (s,w,e)}{ }{As you reach the northern edge of the planet, the light of Demos lights your way. For a moon named after the god of panic, it looks quite peaceful. Beyond the edge lies the vastness of space. }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
