R {29401}{0}{}{A seemingly barren planet (s,n,e,w)}{ }{The blackness of space surrounds you, marred only by the steady light of the stars. The ground is littered with craters and rocks, probably a remnant of a bombardment of meteors. The air is cold but fresh. }{Fuzzy Aliens of Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29383}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29381}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
