R {29442}{0}{}{Lieutenant's Quarters (s,se)}{ }{This is the quarters of a Harkonnen Lieutenant.  Though better than the quarters allocated to the normal guards, it is quite sparse.  There is a table and chair and a hard bunk. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29440}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
