R {29443}{0}{}{Lieutenant's Quarters (sw,s)}{ }{This is the quarters of a Harkonnen Lieutenant.  Though better than the quarters allocated to the normal guards, it is quite sparse.  There is a table and chair and a hard bunk. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29440}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29446}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29444}{0}{}{Captain's Quarters (s)}{ }{This is the quarters of a Harkonnen Captain.  Though better appointed than the barracks or the Lieutenants' quarters, it still looks quite plain and uncomfortable.  There is a desk and two stools in addition to the captain's bunk. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29440}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29445}{0}{}{Barracks (e,n)}{ }{This is the barracks for the guards.  There are lines of bunks in rows against the walls.  To the north is the Lieutenant's quarters. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29440}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29442}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

