E {29443}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29447}{0}{}{Waiting Room (n,s)}{ }{This is the waiting room.  To the south, if he is in, the doctor may examine you.  Of course, if the rumours are true, you might not survive the examination.  There is a couch and several old magazines here. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29441}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29453}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

