R {29449}{0}{}{South Hall (n,s,w)}{ }{This is a hall in the fortress of the Harkonnens.  It is wide, with hard grey walls of stone.  There is little lighting. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29437}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
