E {29451}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29450}{0}{}{Mess Hall (n)}{ }{This is the mess hall, where the guards eat.  It is a shambles. There are long tables and benches here with putrid food on them. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29449}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29451}{0}{}{Kitchen (s,e)}{ }{This is the kitchen.  There is slop hanging off the walls.  You find it quite revolting.  How the Harkonnens can survive on this stuff is beyond you.  Half a large animal is sitting here.  It has begun to decay. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29449}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29452}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29452}{0}{}{Kitchen (n)}{ }{This is the main kitchen of the fortress.  This is where the the slop is prepared by the kitchen staff.  They are not well- liked by the guards.  There are all sorts of kitchen implements here and all manner of foodstuffs. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29451}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29453}{0}{}{Doctor's Office (n)}{ }{This is the office of Doctor Tlexin.  The lab is in disarray. There are body parts stewn about.  It looks as if the Doctor has been carrying on some experiments.  There is an operating table here and some instruments. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29447}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29454}{0}{}{East Hall (d,w)}{ }{This is a hall in the fortress of the Harkonnens.  It is wide, with hard grey walls of stone.  There is little lighting. There is a dark, gloomy stairway going down. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
