R {29459}{0}{}{Grand Hall (se,sw,ne,nw,w,e)}{ }{This is a grand hall with passages going everywhichway.  The floor is a miraculous composition of colored bits of marble and precious gems.  Old fashioned chandeliers hang from the ceiling and rich tapestries depicting the Harkonnen line fill the walls.  A strange cackling laugh can be heard from the west hall. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
