R {29461}{0}{}{Trophy Room (nw)}{ }{This is the Baron's Trophy Room.  There are heads of several kinds of animals, including more than one human and the head of of the last known slorr.  The Baron also keeps his pet - a wild zontar here.  They are common to the wastelands surrounding the fortress. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
