R {29462}{0}{}{Feyd's Room (ne)}{ }{This is the room of the wicked Feyd Rautha.  He lives his life for torture and pain.  The room is sparse, holding only a flat, hard bunk and a personal sauna. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29459}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29463}{0}{}{Rabban's Room (sw)}{ }{This is Rabban's room.  He is nicknamed 'the Beast', and his room reflects his name.  There are small boxes with small crushed animals lying about.  He crushes them and drinks the juice they leave behind.  He has a huge, messy bed and rugs on the floor. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29459}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29464}{0}{}{Piter's Room (se)}{ }{This is the room of Piter DeVries, the famous Mentat of House Harkonnen.  There are documents scattered around and a full desk in the corner. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29459}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29465}{0}{}{Wide Hall (w,e)}{ }{This is a wide hall leading to the deepest part of the stronghold. High metal arches hold up the ceiling and your footsteps clank no matter how stealthy you are.  Lights flicker from the west and to the east is a grand hall. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
