R {29466}{0}{}{The Baron's Room (e)}{ }{This is an immense room of eccentric furnishings.  The ceiling is nearly out of sight.  There are four small bonfires lighting the macabre scene.  Blood and body parts lie about in random fashion. A grand chair sits in a corner, probably the Baron's.  There is a huge tapestry depicting the Baron at a great feast.  The walls and floor evoke a sickening feeling in you.  The only bright spot, a vase of flowers, is spattered with blood. }{Dune}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
