R {29514}{0}{}{Observation Deck (d)}{ }{Because of the scarcity of windows on Galactica, the observation deck is in very high demand by civilians and off-duty soldiers.  This room is often used by dating and married couples to relax on the couches and gaze at the stars outside.  Lights are kept dim, to give the couples some illusion of privacy.  Stairs lead visitors back to the harsh confines of Galactica's main deck. }{Battlestar Galactica}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
