R {29518}{0}{}{CIC: Communications Center (command,tactical)}{ }{To one side of CIC, raised on a platform, is Galactica's communications center.  All wireless traffic between Galactica, fighter ships, and the rest of the fleet are routed through the computer here.  Attached to the panel over the computer is a display that shows DRADIS output.  The tactical station is next to here, while the command station is towards the center of the room. }{Battlestar Galactica}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
