R {29524}{0}{<248>}{Baltar's Laboratory (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{Dr. Gaius Baltar's laboratory is a complete mess.  Shelves along the walls are full of electronic instruments.  In the center of the room is a long desk, upon which is a computer attached to what appears to be a microscope.  Next to the computer are racks of test tubes.  A metal door to the west leads to the rest of Galactica. }{Battlestar Galactica}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
