R {29527}{0}{<238>}{Starboard Landing Bay (w,s)}{<238>|||<088>}{Galactica's starboard landing bay is much quieter compared to its portside cousin.  The room seems to be used for storage.  In one corner are metal bins\; in another corner are several pallets with crates on top.  The bay extends southwards\; the rest of Galactica can be found to the west. }{Battlestar Galactica}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
