R {29530}{0}{}{Pilot Ready Room (e,s)}{ }{The ready room is used for training, mission briefing, and other types of meetings amongst Galactica's pilots.  A number of pilots are sitting on chairs on one side of the room.  To the front is a lectern. Behind the speaker's position are a number of whiteboards.  To the east is another training room\; on the southern wall is a door. }{Battlestar Galactica}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
