R {29531}{0}{<138>}{Wardroom (n)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{This is probably the most lavish room on all of Galactica.  Mahogany tables form a 'U' around the speaker's podium.  Over a dozen ornate stuffed chairs provide seating to the audience.  Flags of the Twelve Colonies drape the walls.  Soft blue carpeting accents the lighting.  An open doorway to the north leads to the main deck. }{Battlestar Galactica}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29510}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29532}{0}{}{Pilot Training (w)}{<128>V<088>}{This room contains several Viper combat simulators.  Most are occupied by pilots that are fulfilling their training regiment.  An open doorway to the west leads to the ready room. }{Battlestar Galactica}{viper_simulator}{}{}{1.000}{1}
