R {29553}{0}{}{Windbrake (d)}{ }{This is the topmost room within the tower. It is surprisingly empty. There are only a few features of note in this room. The grinding shaft continues upwards from below into a smaller hole in the ceiling.  Next to the shaft is a lever arm and locking mechanism. The mechanism is currently engaged. The room is dimly lit via the four windows in the exterior stonework. }{Aruwin's Windmill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29551}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
