R {29554}{0}{}{Kitchen (e,w)}{ }{The kitchen is in complete disarray: bowls, plates, mugs, utensils, and half-eaten foods can be found everywhere, on the small round table, all along the eastern counter, the fireplace hearth, and of course the floor.  Cabinets of oak occupy most of the upper walls, and several narrow doors guard the pantry to the south. }{Aruwin's Windmill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29552}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29555}{e}{unlock door;open door;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29555}{0}{}{Master's Chamber (w)}{ }{The master's room is not much better than the kitchen. The canopy bed is unmade\; in fact the sheets are on the floor next to a small nightstand. A dresser with drawers in various states of use is against the eastern wall by a large window. A framed pane of silvered glass stands on top of the dresser serving as a mediocre mirror. In the far corner of the room, adjacent to a small desk, is a pile of clothes. }{Aruwin's Windmill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29554}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29556}{0}{}{The Wind Cap (d)}{ }{The top of the tower has been capped by a bronze dome.  The exterior wall is crenelated, leading you to believe the tower stood here long before the dome was installed. The grinding shaft terminates here where it intersects the wind axle. Next to the wind axle, close to the dome wall, are a number of ropes leading outside, along with the axle itself. }{Aruwin's Windmill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29553}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29557}{0}{}{A Crystalline Hallway ~ First House (archway,right,forward,l}{<118>A<088>}{An amazing hallway of pure crystal curves off to your left and right. The walls, floor and ceiling are all made of cool, hard crystal.  Light refracts beautifully through the crystal, causing rainbows to dance and splash all over the hallway.  A large passageway leads forward, into the center of the circle.  An archway, also made of solid crystal, leads off away from the center of the circular hallway. There is a small marking above the archway.  A strange glowing portal wavers in one wall. }{The Zodiac}{zodiac}{}{}{1.000}{1}
