R {29596}{0}{}{A light island (n)}{ }{A twinkle of light brightens the area, a warmth fills your heart.  Spread out over the land, the thick forest encompasses the land completely, spreading its life everywhere.  A thousand waves course through the ocean, its slow breath pulsing the water.  In, out.  Up, down.  Such is the way of life.  Ruling the sky, and eying the land hungrily, the greedy moon is surrounded by a fluttering few points of light.  An unknown sound ruffles the hairs on the back of your neck. }{Night of Colour}{phase}{}{}{1.000}{1}
