R {29728}{0}{<238>}{ The barren surface of Mars  (s,w)}{<238>|@|<088>}{ You stand before the massive airlock which leads back beneath the   series of domes and caverns that comprise the Mars colony.  The   giant steel doors are sealed shut.  A small panel is seated into   the steel frame of the door which might be some help. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
