R {29729}{0}{<238>}{ The barren Martian landscape  (sw,w,n)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{ You stand amid the desolate wasteland which is Mars.  The red earth   reflects the light eerily into the crystal clear sky.  The blaze of   the sun beats down on you through the thin atmosphere, threatening   to bake you where you stand.  The towering pinnacle of Olympus Mons   rises like a god's finger towards the sky, dwarfing all that   surround it. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
