R {29730}{0}{<238>}{ The barren Martian landscape  (e,w,n,s)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{ The rugged rock of the Martian landscape challenges you in your   trek, tiring muscles that have crossed continents on even a small   journey such as you're on now.  The uneven terrain hides its   mysteries from you, presenting only its unearthly red glow beneath   the searing sun. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
