R {29764}{0}{<238>}{An airlock (outside)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You stand within the pristine environment of a martian airlock.   Not much distinguishes this room, except the two sets of large  doors on each end of the room.  A small panel is set in the west  wall which holds the controls for the airlock. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
