R {29765}{0}{}{An exit to the mines. (n)}{<178>A<088>}{You stand before the huge doors to an airlock.  You stare in awe  as you try and imagine what they must move through these things.  You glance about you at the rest of your surroundings and notice  that you're in a cavern of some kind.  The red stone which makes up  the entire planet surrounds you on all sides.  Several crates are  tossed carelessly aside near the airlock, obviously used in some  previous venture.  A string of lights lead down the corridor into  the darkness. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
