R {29766}{0}{}{A mining tunnel (nw,s)}{ }{The tunnel about you seems fairly fresh.  The walls are still not mined out, nor has all the rubble been removed as it would be in a mined out tunnel. The floor is still uneven and coarse, rather than smooth like an old mine would be. You can't for the life of you figure out what they're mining way out here though, since the turbidium mines are beneath the colony. Aren't they? }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29765}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
