R {29792}{0}{}{Home For Infinite Losers (s)}{ }{What a lucky break that you landed in this fountain!  Glancing around you note a very unfriendly landscape.  The sky is an odd color of red, and there is very little vegetation at all.  In fact, the water of the fountain seems to be the only water in sight and frankly, this water looks disgusting.  There is a sign next to the fountain. }{Dragonball Z Classic}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
