R {29809}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{You emerge from the pipe into a rather large, well-lit room.  Oddly, you see a large machine half-stuck in the ground, its humongous drill bit and only a portion of its cabin sticking through the earth.  To your sheer delight, the floor is sewage free and continues to the west.  That awful sewage pipe can be reentered to your east. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
