R {29810}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{The smell indicates you've entered the Turtles' kitchen.  At the moment pots, pans, and flour cover the floor and counters, and a grossly-misshapen pizza can clearly be seen smouldering in the oven.  What do you expect from turtles? }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
