R {29811}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (n,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{Uh oh, by the looks of it, you have just stumbled upon the refuge of Shredder and his foot clan.  It looks like a bunch of rooms down this rough tunnel have been haphazardly cleared to make a clumsy 'base of operations'.  What they're doing down here in the sewer, you have no idea.  You can reenter the pipe to the south if you wish. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29808}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29812}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29812}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (n,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{Having passed Beebop's station <what a mess>, you don't seem to have gotten very far at all.  The tunnel branches to the left and the right, but you have a feeling that forward is the direction you want to go. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29811}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29813}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29813}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (n,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{Well, you've asked for it, traipsing through the enemy's defenses in such a haphazard fashion.  You can see to your north a large, well-lit room from which you hear a female screaming and a man whining.  That deliciously refreshing sewer pipe beckons enticingly south of you. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29812}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29814}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29814}{0}{<228>}{Deep Inside the Sewers (n,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{Oh my.  It seems the forces of evil hadn't expected anybody to get past Shredder's station.  This room is in relative disarray, with papers and scribblings all over the ground, as if someone were frantically looking for or researching into something.  A large metal door blocks your passage north. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29813}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29815}{n}{unlock door;open door;n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29815}{0}{<228>}{Inside a Small Room (s)}{<228>= =<088>}{This is small cell is now quite evidently the spot from which you heard all the commotion when you were crawling around that sewer pipe (I STILL can't believe you did that!).  Certainly not the most comfortable of sleeping mats has been thrown in a corner for any prisoners that would be thrown in here.  Shredder and Krang were surprisingly able to throw together these rooms in a hurry...but what else would you expect from a silly cartoon? }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29814}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29816}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{This looks like the room in which the Turtles practice their ninja skills.  The walls and floor are padded to break the worst of falls that they might take.  A tatami by the far wall looks rather well-used. It must be the Turtles' off-hours however...you're not convinced much practicing is being done right now. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29810}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29817}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29817}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{This is the Turtles' meeting room, where Splinter usually comes in to  talk to the bickering reptiles about honor and their purpose in life. Leonardo likes to hang around here sometimes, polishing weapons or just meditating. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29816}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29818}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29818}{0}{<228>}{Inside the Sewers (e)}{<228>= =<088>}{You have found Splinter's workroom.  Unlike you would expect from the half- rat that he is, this room is very neat, and rather spartan, with only subtle non-essential decorations lining the walls.  This is the heart of the Turtles' lair, and only those that Splinter allows really ever enter here. }{Teenage Mutant Turtles}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29817}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29819}{0}{}{Underground}{}{You are stuck in a pretty deep hole, too high to climb out of and what's more the top appears to have caved in.  It looks like the only way out would be to dig your way out. }{Darkmoore}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
