R {29820}{0}{<278>}{Entrance into the ghast caverns (s,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{There is a large mound here with the entrance to the ghast caverns.  There  is usually a gug sentinel here keeping the ghasts from running all over the city.  There is a sign over the entrance. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
