R {29822}{0}{<278>}{Center of the gug city (e,w,s,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{You are in the center of an underground city populated by gugs. Gugs are rather hideous creatures with bad tempers and a craving for raw meat.  Getting down here was easy, but it may not be so easy finding your way out again.  Perhaps only careful searching of the city may provide you with an answer, if the gugs don't tear you apart first. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
