R {29827}{0}{<278>}{East-west street in gug city (e,w,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{A crude dirt pathway has been trampled into the floor of this deep underground cave by the passage of many gug feet.  It doesn't seem that anything other than gugs live down here, in fact.  Either everything else is smart enough to stay away from here, or else the gugs ate them all... }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
