R {29828}{0}{<278>}{Market area in Gug city (w,s,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{You seem to have wandered into the market center of the Gug caves. Several gugs are milling about, eyeing you with suspicion.  Various vendors are selling their wares in dark corners.  You feel pretty uncomfortable and out-of-place. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
