R {29829}{0}{<278>}{Dead end (n,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{You've reached the back wall of this large underground cave.  It appears that the gugs haven't carved anymore through the rock in this direction.  There is an opening in the northern earth to a small house. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
