R {29830}{0}{<238>}{Home of a gug (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in the home of a gug.  Looking at the bloodstains on the table, you get the feeling that you're just in time for dinner. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
