R {29831}{0}{<238>}{Decker's room (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The walls of this room are covered with blades of every sort from every time and culture.  Don't even try taking any.  Not only are they tightly secured to the wall, but their owner would take great offense if you were to even try. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
