R {29832}{0}{<278>}{Dead end (w)}{<278>. .<088>}{You are at the end of the street.  This looks like a gathering place where the gugs interact (however that is).  Several tend to hang around here and generally don't like outsiders. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29826}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29833}{0}{<238>}{Home of a gug (n,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the home of a gug family.  It looks like mommy(?) is getting dinner ready.  You hope it's not you.  You hear the kids(?) screaming in the next room. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29826}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
