R {29834}{0}{<238>}{Home of a gug (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the home of some gugs.  There appears to have been a struggle in here recently.  Apparently, their dinner wasn't too cooperative. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29826}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29835}{0}{<238>}{A Gug child's room (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You thought your room was a pig sty.  This place is an absolute disaster! Rats wouldn't be caught dead in here (not only because it's so messy, but they'd also probably get eaten).  You wonder where the little monsters (monsters literally) are that made this mess... }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
