R {29836}{0}{<138>}{The Gug butcher shop (e)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{This is the butcher shop for the Gug city.  The Gug behind the counter actually looks pleased to see you in here.  Looks like he'll sell to anyone as long as you have the money to buy from him.  Just type 'list' to find out what's available today. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29828}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29837}{0}{<138>}{Gug Store (s)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{Welcome to Grlumph's Store, only the very best to suit all of your everyday Gug needs.  Considering all the funny looks you've been getting lately, something tells you that non-gug presence here isn't particularly welcomed.  Luckily you speak the universal language of gold. Just don't try Grlumph's patience. }{Gug City}{}{}{shop}{1.000}{1}
E {29828}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29838}{0}{}{Stairs leading up and down (u,d)}{ }{You're getting a little tired climbing these stairs.  No human was meant to be walking on them. }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
