R {29839}{0}{}{A large staircase leading down (u,d)}{ }{This staircase leads down.  The stairs themselves are very large.  Not built for human legs to climb, you suppose.  Strange sounds and smells can be detected coming from below.  Do you REALLY want to know what's down there? }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29838}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
