R {29840}{0}{}{Bottom of a well (s,u)}{ }{You are in the bottom of a dry well.  You hear strange noises coming  from the south.  You feel a very cold breeze coming from that direction and you almost wish you hadn't come down here in the first place. }{Darkmoore}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
