R {29841}{0}{}{Well passage (s,n)}{ }{You are in a passage inward from the well.  The breeze is getting stronger and colder.  You also notice the stench of death being carried by it.  Shadows produced from your light make strange images on the walls. }{Darkmoore}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
