E {29842}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29842}{0}{}{Cultist chamber (n)}{ }{Here in this chamber is where the dread cult of Cthulhu meets. You notice an altar in the middle of the room covered with blood. The only other feature of the room are the tapestries depicting Cthulhu along the walls and the great statue behind the altar. There is a door in the back of the room which leads north, but a strange green glow covers the opening. Fortunately for you, the cultists seem to be away. This might be a good opportunity to leave before they return. }{Darkmoore}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29841}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29843}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29843}{0}{}{Stairway beneath the statue (d,u)}{ }{This stone staircase spirals downward into darkness. You feel awe and power emanating from down below. You are careful to keep your footing on the thin steps as you head towards whatever lurks beneath the statue. }{Darkmoore}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
