R {29858}{0}{}{A ledge (sw,ne)}{<138>C<088>}{Glancing down, you notice you are standing on a narrow ledge about three feet wide.  The ledge travels in a oval pattern around a huge pit in the center.  The pit is a hundred yards long and fifty yards wide. All around the ledge is constructed a wall closing in this area.  The wall stands close to fifteen feet high and meets a rock ceiling that covers the entire area. On the piece of ledge you are standing, lay three rocks that form a circle. You are standing just outside of these rocks. }{Hellpit}{hellpit}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29856}{enter circle}{enter circle}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
