R {29860}{0}{}{Vast Tunnel (n,s)}{ }{You enter a vast stone tunnel, the edges of which are rough.  The whole region exudes a sense of dullness, and after travelling down the tunnel for a while you wonder if you are actually making any progress. }{Pandaemonium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29859}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29918}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29861}{0}{}{A ledge (sw,n,d)}{ }{Stopping only to take in your surroundings you resume your journey heading into who knows where!  There is very little sign of life on this part of the ledge.  The ledge itself is strewn with rubble and the air has a faint smell of staleness to it. The wall which continues to follow the ledge all the way around the outside, is rather smooth and as it rises into the air it begins to form into the ceiling more like an arched dome.  The ledge travels on to the north and southwest. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29858}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29862}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29863}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29862}{0}{}{A ledge (d,n,s)}{ }{Stopping only to catch your breath, you notice you have made your way to one end of the large pit which is now down to your left.  You notice several slab-like stones here, obviously used for some grisly purpose, for they bear the dark brown splatters of ancient blood stains.  The wall continues to follow you on your right side as the ledge leads north and south. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29861}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29865}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29866}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29863}{0}{}{The Pit (sw,w,u,n)}{ }{Upon entering you realize you stand in bones that reach up to your knees! You wonder how so many bones could have been brought here. You begin to realize these bones belong to warriors who, at their last glance probably saw nothing but these bones. You shudder at the possiblity this could be your final resting place too. It is not too late to climb out! In every direction you look you see nothing but more bones. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29861}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29882}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29904}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29865}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29864}{0}{}{A ledge (w,ne,d)}{ }{You continue on your way, battered, bruised and exhausted. Sweat pouring down your face from the hot, humid, clammy rooms. You peer over the ledge to the pit down to your north. You stand motionless over the remains of what once used to be human beings but now just a pile of skulls and bones. You take a moment to be thankful that your remains are not with the hereafter. The ledge continues to both the west and northeast and the wall which surrounds the ledge is to your south. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29858}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29881}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29882}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29865}{0}{}{The Pit (w,u,s,n)}{ }{The sea of white bones stretch out to your right like a vast ocean.  As strange as it seems, it looks like some of the bones further in the distance are moving!  On your east side stands the ledge that surrounds the field of bones.  The ledge raises up about four feet from the top of the bones, allowing easy access to escape the pit if need be. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29862}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29863}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29905}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29867}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29866}{0}{}{A ledge (d,n,s)}{ }{You skull your way to what seems a much wider part of the ledge. Sweat begins to trickle down your forehead as the moisture from deep within these cavern walls begins to swell up.  This part of the ledge has obviously seen some fairly recent fighting as bloodied bodies lay scattered along the path.  You only hope that you do not run into the same creatures that caused this blood bath. The pit of bones looms to your west while the ledge seems to continue to both the north and south. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29862}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29867}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29868}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29867}{0}{}{The Pit (w,u,n,s)}{ }{Everywhere you look it looks like a small field of large white bones piled waist high.  You wonder where all these victims came from and why their bodies had to be piled here. Chances are, these victims met a cruel and unusual death. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29866}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29865}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29870}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29913}{w}{w}{8}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29868}{0}{}{A ledge (nw,s,d)}{ }{You resume your journey heading into who knows where! There is very little sign of life on this part of the ledge. The ledge itself is strewn with rubble and the air has a faint smell if staleness to it. Down to your west you can enter into the pit of bones if you dare wish! It feels like you are walking in circles. The ledge continues on to the northwest and the south. The wall that encloses the area continues to follow the ledge on the east. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29866}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
