R {29869}{0}{}{A ledge (se,nw)}{ }{You clamber on.  The rocks crunch beneath your feet and you look down in horror to realize you are not walking on pebbles but, rather on bones.  In fact, the ledge seems to be made only out of bones. You wonder why someone would make a ledge out of bones.  Whoever did this was sick and probably tormented as a child!  The ledge continues to both the northwest and southeast. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
