R {29871}{0}{}{A ledge (w,d,se)}{ }{You continue on your way, battered, bruised and exhausted. Sweat pouring down your face from the hot, humaid, clammy rooms. You peer over the ledge to the pit down to your south.  You stand motionless over the remains of what once used to be human beings but now just a pile of skulls and bones.  You take a moment to be thankful that your remains are not with the hereafter. The ledge continues to both the west and southeast and the moisture coated wall is now to your north. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
