R {29917}{0}{}{The Pit (w,e,n,s)}{ }{You hear nothing but the clanging of bones as you step further into the pit. Truely whoever caused such human loss must be evil indeed. You can almost make out the horror in the once human faces, which are now nothing more then lifeless skulls. Looking around the decay you get the sense that the victims did not meet their death here, but were brought here after their death. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
