R {29918}{0}{}{A hazy tunnel (s,w)}{ }{This place has an evil presence to it.  There is an indescribable haze drowning the radiance of your light.  The floor, the ceiling and the walls all appear to be made of rock.  Strange carvings appear to dance quietly along the walls.  There are two alcoves here, one on the left side and one on the right side of the tunnel.  Both alcoves contain a silent statue, peering out from the darkness of the shadows.  It is almost as if they have been placed here for a specific reason. }{Pandaemonium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
