R {29926}{0}{}{Vast Tunnel (se,n)}{ }{You are continuing down a huge tunnel.  To the north you can see the gates of Pandaemonium, while to the south lie miles and miles of underground tunnels.  The lifelessness around you chills your soul, and the fact that before you lies the city of Hell, Pandaemonium, destroys all attempt at rational thought. }{Pandaemonium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
