E {29930}{n}{n}{1}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29928}{0}{}{The Inner Circle of Pandaemonium (ne,nw,e)}{ }{You continue around the inner circle, staring at the riches around you.  Your light reflects back at you in a myriad of colored reflections.  Diamonds and rubies glisten in the walls of cavern, as the wealth of the underworld has been collected to decorate this vast hall.  To the northwest and east are gem-studded passageways leading on around the inner sanctum.  To the northeast is an entrance to that sanctum, a place of great evil and terrible danger.  Mere mortals were not meant to challenge the power of the Dark One in his own abode. }{Pandaemonium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
