R {29930}{0}{}{Inner Sanctum of Lucifer (out,d)}{ }{You have entered a most dangerous place.  Guards whose power has been left to grow for millenia stand here, ready to destroy you should you attempt to pass them.  There are a myriad of exits to the room, but you cannot tell which you entered from.  If you wish to leave, you will have to simply choose one and hope there isn't something waiting for you on the other side. }{Pandaemonium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
