R {29939}{0}{}{Inner Sanctum of Lucifer (u)}{ }{This is the private sanctuary of the lord of Pandaemonium, Lucifer.  Bone altars are scattered about, and the essence of evil around you is suffocating.  The great throne is carved from a solid blood red gem.  Your only thoughts are of escaping from this room with your life.  That may prove difficult if Lucifer notices your presence. }{Pandaemonium}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29930}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29940}{0}{}{Hidden chamber (s,n)}{ }{The fear is insurmountable as you shakily inch your way into this dark underground cavern. Wave after wave of the purest evil ebb and flow from the center of the room, draining your heart of its will, flashing hallucinations of lost, damned souls before your terrorstruck eyes. You have entered the realm of Cthulhu, the central point of his power on this plane. Lightning discharges between swirling red eddies of true chaos, like the dying synaptic cascades of a flattened brain nerve center. The brightest light emanates from the central miasma like a pulsar, and you can make out an object of utter darkness within\; the epitome of dread and despair. This is the lair of Cthulhu you have invaded, and there is only one way you will be allowed to escape this vile realm! }{Gug City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29846}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {29842}{n}{n}{1}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {29941}{0}{<148>}{In the Balooga River (drift,panic)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{You can barely see as the water foams around you and hurls you forward towards the Balooga Falls.  You swim about crazily, trying to keep your head above the water, you bump into rocks and nearly get swept under by the current.  If you really want to go through with this, drift. }{Balooga Falls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
