R {29942}{0}{}{Drifting fast, everything's a blur (panic)}{ }{The river roars violently like a lion seizing its prey.  Everything's a blur and to make matters worse, the water seems to kick up in your face at the most inopportune times. }{Balooga Falls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23526}{panic}{panic}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
