R {29943}{0}{<108>}{Inside a barrel. It's dark. (panic)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{You are alone in the dark, inside a wooden barrel.  Outside of you the river seems to taunt you as the barrel, and yourself, spin head over heels through the rapids. }{Balooga Falls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
