R {29945}{0}{<248>}{Cave entrance (dive,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{You are standing behind the monstrous Balooga Falls.  Feared.  If you were to tilt your head back into the raging waters' path, you'd be instantly beheaded.  Set into the cliff wall before you is a cave entrance of sorts.  To the left a sign is posted.  You also have the option of escaping now while you can and live to tell the townsfolk about your miraculous survival by diving into the less violent rapids below and see where you surface. }{Balooga Falls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
