R {29949}{0}{<248>}{Cave (nw,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The tunnel veers upwards to the northwest and heads back east.  The lone set of footprints continues northwest.  You're not sure if it's just you, but it would seem as if the air is getting warmer. }{Balooga Falls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {29948}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
