R {30003}{0}{}{Inside the pyramid (d)}{ }{Complete darkness engulfs this cramped area.  The air is full of dust and bits of sand that fall in from the darkness above.  Extremely old blocks of stone and wooden beams create this small alcove, and the air is dank and musty.  A plaque, layered in thick dust, hangs on one of the wooden beams.  Directly next to it is a sconce containing an old and unusable torch.  A brittle and untrustworthy ladder leads through a small hole in the dirt floor. }{Tomb of Rutha-Al}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
