R {30004}{0}{<238>}{gypsy wagon (out)}{A}{You are in a small gypsy wagon.  There are many things here that catch your eye.  Bottles and boxes litter the interior and you detect the smell of sandalwood.  On the walls are torches that sway slowly in the night breeze. In the middle of the room lies a table with a beautiful crystal ball gracing the center.  In a large, overstuffed chair, behind the table, sits an old woman, dressed in brightly colored clothing. }{Ravenloft - Svalich Woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
