R {30005}{0}{<278>}{Drafty Room}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are in a small room that has a slight breeze blowing through it.  It is difficult to tell where the breeze is coming from, but it flows out the cracks and into the underdark.  The walls here were once painted in very vibrant colors, but all that remains is the dull washed out appearance created after years of wind erosion.  The scene painted is hard to make out but it appears to be a great battle. }{fe dar Shad}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
