R {30177}{0}{}{Public Toilets (e,n)}{ }{The same white tiles that greeted you outside are also here. The main items of interest in the room are the row of sinks on the west wall, and the metal hand dryer mounted near the north doorway. A garbage bin sits in the corner. }{Public Restrooms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {102}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30179}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30178}{0}{}{Public Toilets (w,n)}{ }{     The ladies toilets are to the north, while everything else you would expect to find in a bathroom can be found in this room. There is a mirror hanging on the tiled walls above a row of sinks, a hand dryer near the door, and a bin in the corner. The room is fairly clean, with no obvious traces of dirt. }{Public Restrooms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {102}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46419}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30179}{0}{}{Public Toilets (s)}{ }{You've entered a man's holy shrine, his final sanctuary. A row of cubicles beckon to you to take your place upon the porcelain throne. A call to sit and read the paper while you do your thing. All the while, around you the gleam of the white tiles on the walls goes unnoticed. There is a sign on the wall near the end cubicle. }{Public Restrooms}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30177}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

