R {30185}{0}{<238>}{The ruins (gate)}{<238>, `<088>}{A dark and desolate clearing, is this place you have entered. The coldness chills your bones and leaves behind an emptiness that you can't quite understand.  Thoughts and memories pass by you in the mist, but moments later, they slip through your mind like a wisp of smoke.  Other than the large, iron gate guarding the way south, only a large, obsidian stone adorns the landscape. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {129}{gate}{gate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30186}{0}{<228>}{Overgrown forest path (ne)}{<228>(<278>W<228>*<088>}{An ancient path winds its way through the forest here, towards an as yet unknown location. Ancient trees rise majestically on either side of the path, casting deep pools of shadow where the leafy boughs of the trees block the suns light. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
