R {30187}{0}{<228>}{Before an overgrown compound (sw,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{The forest path ends here, in an ancient and overgrown compound. Beneath all the creepers and vines you can occasionally make out sections of a sturdy stone wall that surrounds this compound. There appears to be some kind of defensive gateway blocking your entrance to the compound due east of here.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30186}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
