R {30188}{0}{<178>}{Beneath an ancient gatehouse (e,w)}{<278>###<088>}{Rising up out of the forest here, is an ancient gatehouse its massive wooden gate presently unbarred and open, allowing you access to an overgrown compound. Signs of recent repair work are clearly visible here, showing that this compound is now inhabited. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30187}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30189}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30189}{0}{<178>}{Inside an ancient compound (se,n,w,e)}{<278>###<088>}{You find yourself standing in the front section of this walled compound. Recent activity has effectively cleared the forest from the compound, whilst the casual scattering of trees would to the careless observer still portray an air of neglect. To the east a large stone building bisects this compound, while small groves of ancient trees can be seen in the northwest and southwest sections of this large compound.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30188}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30190}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30191}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30192}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30190}{0}{<228>}{Within an oak grove (nw)}{<228>( *<088>}{Peace and tranquility overwhelm you here, silence abounds in this corner of the compound. A simple stone bench rests near a particularly large oak the perfect place to rest and commune with nature. Resting quietly across from the the bench is an ancient weather beaten notice board. Careful pruning of the nearby trees and patches of fresh earth where small bushes have been removed indicate great care has gone into restoring this area.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30189}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30191}{0}{<228>}{Within a grove of elm trees (s)}{<228>( *<088>}{Resting in the center of this well tended grove of elm trees is a large obsidian monolith rising some 12 feet up into the sky, highly decorated with elven runes. The air around the monolith seems to be highly charged with a strong magical aura. Judging by the care and attention undertaken in restoring this grove, this monolith must be very important to this compound's new owners.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30189}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30192}{0}{<178>}{Entrance to a large building (enter,n,w)}{<278>#<238>E<278>#<088>}{Rising up before you is the large stone building that dominates the center of this compound. Partially covered by vines and moss this building has a distinct derelict look. Yet recent signs of maintenance seem to indicate that once more this building is inhabited. Carved above the doorway are a series of elven runes. Suspended above this is a rather ancient looking flag bearing some kind of military insignia. Easily defendable with few windows and only one major entrance point, this building must surely have performed some kind of military function.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{bladesinger}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30189}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30193}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30194}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30193}{e}{enter}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30193}{0}{<268>}{Bladesingers Guild Hall (d,n,s,e,out)}{<268>[<128>O<268>]<088>}{The damp fusty smell of a centuries old unused room is only just beginning to fade from this the central room and meeting point of the old bladesingers training academy. Signs of recent repair and restoration work is evident everywhere you look, from the fresh built benches that now rest along the walls of this building to the freshly fitted torch sconces from which several long burning torches now reside. Decorating the massive stone pillars that support the building ceiling are a number of ancient and tattered flags, trophies of some sort no doubt. Whilst scattered around this large hall are all manner of suits of armour and racks holding almost every kind of weapon imaginable, just the kind of thing you would expect in a training academy. A corridor runs north south through this hall.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{bladesingers}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30192}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
