E {30192}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30194}{0}{<178>}{Inside an ancient compound (s)}{<278>###<088>}{You find yourself standing in a recently cleared area of the western part of this compound. It would appear that recent activity has effectively cleared the forest from the compound, whilst the casual scattering of trees would to the careless observer still portray  an air of neglect. Yet it would appear that this far from true. To the south east a large stone building bisects this compound, while small groves of ancient trees can be seen due west from here. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30192}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30195}{0}{<268>}{Hall of Statues (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This large marble hall of statues contains many statues of knights both honorable and valiant. Many more statues will be erected here as time goes by. All these knights will be remembered for their deeds forever. You can stroll through the area to see all of the statues standing within this great big hall. }{Knight's Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {137}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30196}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30196}{0}{<268>}{Armoury Ante-Chamber (n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Beyond the honorary statues that stoically gaze into the distance, you see a grand hall\; a living history of the glorious guild of the Knights. Oaken doors stretching scores of feet toward the heavens mark entrance to the armoury. It is here that the heraldic symbols of each Knight who has achieved the great honor that is called the Noble class are displayed.  Please enter and rest your eyes upon the history and beauty that marks the Nobility and its history. }{Knight's Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30195}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30197}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30198}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30197}{0}{<268>}{Armoury of the Knight's Guild (s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This tremendous hall has been decorated with a myriad of banners, suits of armour, weapons, and other instruments of the Knights Guild.  Stained glass windows line the hall, shining light of all colours into the room. In the center of the hall, atop a raised dais, is a stand of oak, upon which there rests a thick tome.  A feeling of reverence mixed with respect wells up inside of you as your eyes dart from armour to coat-of-arms to woodwork.  The book silently beckons to you to read it. }{Knight's Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30196}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30198}{0}{<278>}{At an iron gate (e,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You've reached the end of a short path, which stretches out east of you, passing through a small building before leading to the Keep.  West of you, a huge iron-wrought gate is flanked by a tall, thick hedge of thorns.  Beyond the gate, you can catch a glimpse of the Knights' Garden.  A tall white marble structure has been erected in the center of the garden.  It rises several stories above you. }{Knight's Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30196}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30199}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30199}{0}{}{A Tranquil Garden (e,w,nw,sw)}{ }{You're at the entrance of an immaculately kept garden.  A small ivory fountain sits nestled in the hedges, spitting water.  The Knights' Garden stretches out before you, to the west.  Beyond that, you can make out the tree tops of the great forest west of Pinnacle.  The Knights' Keep lies to east, and the Guild's Chapel is southeast.}{Knights}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30198}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
