R {30203}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (n,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{It seems this vault is a giant warehouse of sorts.  It just goes on and on, yards of steel walls and flooring that stretch into the odd green light that illuminates this place.  Buried so deep underground and so well guarded, you wonder what all the secrecy is about.  Whatever is stored here must be of the highest value to Mr. Mechler and Aegis Global. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {2976}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2975}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30204}{0}{<268>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (n,s,e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This place is massive, much larger than you might have guessed when considering the vault door in Mechler's office.  Buzzing noises and strange mechanical sounds echo throughout the giant steel expanse.  The air is cold and dry with a metallic odor that suggests machinery.  A green hue is cast over every inch of the vault's interior, leaving you to wonder what might be the source of this odd light. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
