R {30206}{0}{<238>}{Aegis Global - Hidden Level (s,e,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Machinery lines the walls of this room, large harness-like devices with an array of green lights down the middle that seem to indicate power.  The machines appear to be docking stations, perhaps power units for charging up new robots.  The lights create a green glow that lends an odd hue to your surroundings.  Wires and cables hang from the ceiling, connected to the machines in black sockets along the sides of the units. }{Aegis Global}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
