R {30236}{0}{<268>}{A Holy Shrine (leave)}{H}{You have entered a grassy clearing in the copse of trees. Overhead, the sunlight breaks through the thick overhanging branches of the surrounding trees to illuminate your surroundings.  You estimate the clearing to be twelve feet in diameter, but you cannot determine how the grassy clearing held back the trees and thick vegetation which you passed through to get here.  An ancient tombstone lies before you, protruding through the grass as if it had grown from the ground.  You feel at ease here, as if the magic that preserves this place would prevent harm from coming to you. }{The Holy Shrine of Tarmatin}{holy_shrine_of_tarmatin}{}{}{1.000}{1}
