R {30245}{0}{<248>}{Inside an ancient mausoleum (out)}{<248># #<088>}{You are inside an ancient mausoleum.  As you look around, you see a large coffin in the center of the room.  The coffin sits on the floor and is made of marble with a heavy marble lid.  The mausoleum floor and walls are dusty and dirty.  Even the coffin has a lot of dirt all over it. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30237}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30246}{0}{}{Inside a very large mausoleum (out)}{ }{       This is the inside of a very large mausoleum.  As your eyes adjust, you can see that there is a large coffin in the center of the room.  Something else catches your eye as well, there is a lot of glittering coming from the walls all around you.  Another thing that is really odd is that this mausoleum is immaculate.  There seems to be no dust or dirt anywhere in this mausoleum.  There is an oak door that leads out of the mausoleum which appears to be your only way out. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30244}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36344}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30247}{0}{<248>}{Inside a medium sized mausoleum (out)}{<248># #<088>}{You have entered into a medium sized mausoleum.  As you look around, you see a coffin instead of a crypt.  The coffin is made of a light colored maple wood that appears to have aged quite a bit.  The walls, floor, and ceiling are made of a dark marble and hardly reflect any light. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30241}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30248}{0}{<248>}{Inside a small mausoleum (out)}{<248># #<088>}{This small mausoleum is very cramped.  The roof is only six feet from the ground level and the coffin that is in this mausoleum is only three feet long which means who ever is in it must be really small.  In addition to the small coffin, the marble lid that covered it has been pushed onto the floor and smashed into pieces.  The door which leads out is off one of its hinges but you could still leave if you wanted. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30239}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30249}{0}{<238>}{foyer (n,w,e,leave)}{<238>[<228>L<238>]<088>}{The furniture placement in this cheerful yellow entranceway has made good use of the available wall space between doorways, while still refraining from crowding the area.  Facing the entrance is a charming hall table, with a mirror set above the hat pegs, on which hang a collection of summer hats.  Beside the doorway, and in slight contrast to the natural charms of the table, is a wooden stool with a silver tray balanced on top and dotted with several rectangular cards.  The tray sparkles with the colour shadows from the rose and ivy stained glass that edges the door. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{aunt_mays_cottage}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30250}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
