R {30250}{0}{<238>}{dining room (n,s,e,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a modest dining room with enough chairs to comfortably seat six while providing enough mingling room for guests to remain comfortable.  Aiding in the comfort of guests is the decanter and matching crystal glasses placed precisely on the sideboard, on the opposite end from the flower-filled vase.  The furniture and accessories are elegantly simple, from the candelabra above the central wooden table, to the pastel artwork on the walls.  French doors dominating the north wall act as a large frame to highlight the garden and provide a focal point within the room. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30249}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30253}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
