R {30251}{0}{}{library (e,u)}{<238>"""<088>}{A floor to ceiling bookcase houses a tremendous range of diverse books, creating splashes of colour and texture that could be considered artwork.  A wooden ladder, running on a wheel and groove system, provides easy access to all the stored books.  By a window is a pair of over-stuffed red leather chairs that are snuggled up beside a coffee table, creating the perfect reading spot.  At the end of the room is a black spiral staircase that curls up to a landing on the first floor. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30249}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30268}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30252}{0}{<238>}{parlour (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A blue striped lounge suite is placed about the room and across each headrest is draped a delicately knotted piece of lace.  Behind the pianoforte at the back of the room, is an oak sideboard with a long tapestry runner with tassels hanging off each end.  On its surface amongst the small collection of curios is a silver tea set with fine swirls of an etched design.  Several small tables are scattered around the room, each within easy reach of a chair, and each playing host to a lovely collection of silver candle holders. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30249}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30253}{0}{<278>}{a garden path (s,n,w,e)}{<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>}{Cobbles have been laid to sprawl from the cottage door and down the gentle slope towards the bottom of the garden.  Flanking this paved area are colourful privet-edged gardens with a diverse range of colourful plants.  Butterflies and bumblebees traverse the courtyard as they flutter between the two gardens. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
