R {30257}{0}{<228>}{herb garden (n,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{A myriad of plants brush and tumble into each other with seemingly little regard for balance or the clash of texture.  In stark contrast is the controlled and symmetrical design of the garden beds.  Each segment is separated from the lawn by the clever use of a short privet hedge.  The coupling of both control and disorder create a charming herb garden for the butterflies to visit. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
