R {30258}{0}{<178>}{flower garden (n,w)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{Privets have been planted close together to form the quaint edges of a segmented flower garden.  Four large wedge shapes of garden almost meet at their tips, providing a wheel spoke effect with the garden's pathways.  Interspersed amongst the plants are a small collection of hedgehog ornaments, peeking out from behind flowers or engaged in their single frozen act. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
