R {30259}{0}{<278>}{fountain (n,s,w)}{<278>( )<088>}{The raised gardens surrounding the stone oasis appear tumultuous in the landscape design\; with large leaves drooping over the garden edge and smaller plants cascading down its side.  As these gardens embrace the allotted space, they also edge a central cobbled area that plays host to a sculptured fountain.  The soft gurgling of water wells up under the feet of a stone cherub before tumbling down a plinth into the brick rimmed pool below. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
