R {30263}{0}{<148>}{garden stream (w,s)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The gentle downward slope of the garden lawn stops at the bank of a small stream where the water flows steadily over the rocks on its bed. Across the waterway is a wall of bushes of varying greenery that provides a natural backdrop to enhance the beauty of the rivulet.  A wooden bench has been positioned to allow a quiet contemplation of this natural charm. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
