R {30266}{0}{<148>}{garden stream (e,s)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{The gentle downward slope of the garden lawn stops at the edge of a small stream.  Here the clear water flows steadily past and is only interrupted by the occasional large rock on the stream's bed.  Providing a stunning backdrop to the waterway is a bevy of trees and bushes that line the opposite bank. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
