R {30267}{0}{}{an amazing maze (n,s,w,e,crawl)}{<178>~ ~<088>}{The maze path widens into a circular hub of crushed shells with a small brick rimmed pond at the center.  Softening the harsh appearance of the pathway is a small scattering of fallen leaves.  The untrimmed sides of the hedges press into the pathway and will require some skillful maneuvering to pass through. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
