R {30270}{0}{<238>}{a girl's bedroom (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{With the soft, subtle colours bringing out the textured candlewick pattern on the bedspread and the rosebud pattern on the wallpaper, the room has a fresh feminine atmosphere.  A small china doll rests against the bedspread-covered pillows\; with its head tilted to the side, it appears to be watching the doorway.  At the foot of the bed is a sea chest with a rounded top that has been decorated with painted ivy.  This pattern is carried through to the fabric covering the bedside table, which sweeps down from the top to the floor and is anchored by an oil lamp with a glass chimney. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30269}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30271}{0}{<238>}{master bedroom (se)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Overwhelming the room is a large four-poster bed with a dark velvet canopy that drops towards the floor to form curtains.  Toning down this dramatic scene is the bed's quilt with fabrics of numerous colours and fabric patterns.  Bedroom furniture is tucked around the walls, crafted from a dark wood and waxed to a shine.  There is a lace doily on the vanity table with a matching bristled brush and mirror set.  At a skewed angle in front of the vanity is the table's matching stool with a tapestry-covered cushion perched on top. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30269}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30272}{0}{<238>}{sewing room (w,cupboard)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Bolts of fabric and scattered bobbins of thread are laid out on the central table, creating an air of chaotic activity.  In the middle of this, on a reed-woven tray, is an array of sewing tools and gadgets\; from scissors and thimbles to a material puff covered with pins.  A comfortable chair with a straight back lounges beside the window\; beside which is a large basket filled with socks and a small side table with a partly completed linen embroidery still stretched taught in its frame. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
