R {30273}{0}{<238>}{cupboard (out)}{<238># #<088>}{Blankets, clothing and fabric bolts are folded and carefully stacked along the shelving in a tidy manner.  Dotted amongst them are small linen bags filled with the dried lavender that is giving the room its lovely flower fresh aroma.  An ambient glow filters in from the sewing room to provide soft but adequate light. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
