R {30274}{0}{}{attic (d)}{ }{Amid a jumble of old, broken furniture and long forgotten family heirlooms, a sheet of dust has settled.  The air is still and humid in the attic, perpetuating the feeling of being caught in a pocket of time.  Haphazardly stacked furniture prevents access to the entire upper floor and all but one wall is largely unseen.  Like a giant eye on this one viewable wall, is a large window. }{Aunt May's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30273}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30275}{0}{<238>}{South Dock (n)}{<238>|<148>W<238>|<088>}{You are standing on the massive south airship dock on Worm's Talon.  All around you people hustle about boarding airships.  Cargo and deliveries are stacked along the edges of the dock in preparation to be loaded onto airships.  A strong breeze blows in from across Zahar Bay, parting your hair and cooling your skin.  Two columns rise up from the ends of the dock with ropes attached to their ends. }{Worm's Talon Airship Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
