R {30276}{0}{<238>}{West Dock (e)}{<238>|<148>X<238>|<088>}{The west dock of Worm's Talon protrudes perilously out over Zahar Bay. The platform is crowded with travelers from different regions heading to and from Xaxis.  Cargo of all sorts is strewn across the dock awaiting handlers to load it into the cargo section of the airships.  A brisk breeze blows in from the ocean and your knees tremble slightly as you peer down over the edge of the platform. }{Worm's Talon Airship Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
