R {30278}{0}{<228>}{Near a large bonfire (e)}{<228>, `<088>}{Near a large bonfire The outline of a circle has been worn into the grass just within the  boundaries of the clearing.  In the exact center of the circle, a large  bonfire burns brightly, its smoke carrying the scent of burning herbs.  You can feel the tingling of the raw power surrounding you, eventually  flowing through you.  Although you may not understand the rites that  occur within this circle, you recognize this as sacred space and know  you should not disrupt the peace within its boundaries.  }{Witch Coven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
