R {30280}{0}{<268>}{~\x7BReception Hall\x7D~ (leave,e,w)}{<268>[<128>L<268>]<088>}{This large room seems to have been a grand entrance or reception hall at one time. Now the stones which make up the walls and floor are worn and chipped with age, damp from some unmended leak. Scattered around in the corners and against the walls are scraps of rotting wood and sodden lumps of cloth. The combined scents of mold and decay are not overwhelmingly strong, but have been present long enough to make this place their home.  Fresh air is an intruder here. }{Vago's Stronghold}{vagos_stronghold}{}{}{1.000}{1}
