R {30302}{0}{<278>}{~\x7BOutside the Wall\x7D~}{<278>* .<088>}{My god... it's full of stars... The space outside of the stronghold walls is just that- space... You are floating in a black void, lit by countless distant stars. Interspersed among the stars you can also see beautiful cloud-like shapes. Behind you the cracked walls of the stronghold still stand, but on nothing. }{Vago's Stronghold}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
