R {30326}{0}{<278>}{Tookwich Road (s,n,e,w)}{<278>-+-<088>}{This dirt path continues into the town of Tookwich. To the east and west are large grass covered hills covering the underground hobbit houses within them. A gentle breeze blows from the west and birds fly high above your head in the summer sky. }{Tookwich}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
