R {30332}{0}{<238>}{The Sleeping Dragon Pub (w)}{<238>[P]<088>}{You've entered the Sleeping Dragon Pub. This dimly lit underground eatery boasts some of the finest food and drinks in the realm. It is panelled in dark oak and has a long oak counter to one side which the bartender stands behind. Wooden chairs and tables are spaced evenly throughout the place for patrons to sit and enjoy the fine hobbit fare. Typically it is only frequented by hobbits, but while you're here, why don't you look at the menu, order a drink and some food and relax. Enjoy your stay! }{Tookwich}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30328}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30333}{0}{<278>}{Tookwich Road (s,e,w)}{<278>-+-<088>}{You are now in the middle of the town of Tookwich. More underground hobbit houses lie along the path, the closest being the one to the south. You are on steep ground, overlooking most of your surroundings. Further past the houses you can see the encompassing forest and its towering trees which hide this town from much of the outside world. }{Tookwich}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
