R {30366}{0}{<248>}{Cave entrance. (leave,n)}{<248>%<168>L<248>%<088>}{The entrance to this dark cave is moist from the waterfall. Coated with feathers and bones, the floor smells extremely rank with the musk of whatever inhabits this cave.  A deep echoing noise can be heard from deep in the cave.  Large claw marks can be seen on the moist earth, indicating something rather  large must live here. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
