R {30367}{0}{<248>}{Old lair. (s,ne,nw)}{<248>% %<088>}{The cave here is in complete disarray.  To the northwest a large section of the wall has been torn away and a tunnel leads off in that direction.  The rough hewn edges of that path definitely would deserve some further investigation. Catching your attention is a large, unnatural opening in  the northeastern wall. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
