R {30368}{0}{<248>}{Icy Cold Cave. (sw)}{<248>%<238>S<248>%<088>}{After struggling to force your way into this room, you are unsettled by what you find.  The entire floor is coated with extremely slippery ice.  The moisture from the waterfall rolling in waves and coating everything with a glassy cover. The only other feature of the room is a rather large sinkhole pressed into the far corner. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30367}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
