R {30372}{0}{<168>}{End of an Icy tunnel (e)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{The crystalline cave ends here, the trapdoor that once led to the icy chute is now shut.  From what you can see, the moisture has sealed your escape route.  The air smells of death and decay, though its immediate source is not known. Faint tracks can be seen on the icy floor. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
