R {30375}{0}{<168>}{Icy Tunnel. (sw)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{The crystalline cave continues here, leading on towards an unknown destination.  The sound of water can be heard in the distance.  The walls of the tunnel glisten with ice and you begin to wonder what lives down here, if anything at all.  Hopefully you won't get lost.  Faint tracks can be seen on the icy floor. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
