R {30379}{0}{<168>}{Ice Deva's Chamber. (s)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{As you enter this room, you are marveled at the icy chill that instantly assaults your senses.  You sense the presence of great evil.  In the corner of the room is an elongated bed, which lies in disarray.  Scraps of meat lie strewn across the  floor, frozen in the aftermath of a feeding frenzy. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30378}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30380}{0}{<168>}{Ice Deva's Chamber. (w)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{As you enter this room, you are marveled at the icy chill that instantly assaults your senses.  You sense the presence of great evil.  In the corner of the room is an elongated bed, which lies in disarray.  Scraps of meat lie strewn across the  floor, frozen in the aftermath of a feeding frenzy. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30378}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30381}{0}{<168>}{Beginning of the Ice Bridge. (se,ne)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{As you round the corner of the passage, you can just see something that nearly takes your breath away.  The tunnel opens up somewhat to reveal an awesome sight.  The floor in front of you is clear as glass, the ice worn smooth by movement of creatures over it.  Underneath runs crystal clear blue water, moving left to right its source and end are unknown.     }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
