R {30382}{0}{<168>}{Middle of the Ice Bridge. (se,nw)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{You now stand in the middle of the ice bridge.  Beneath you the  crystal clear blue water flows from left to right.  From further down the passage you can hear sounds of movement.  The ice on this bridge is as smooth as glass and just as clear. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
