R {30383}{0}{<168>}{End of the Ice Bridge. (nw,ne)}{<168>[ ]<088>}{The end of the ice bridge runs quickly into an antechamber of some sort.  Flanking the northeastern exit are two alcoves, which are home to a pair of gargoyles.  The air here is cold, unearthly cold.  Each step towards the guarded tunnel drops the temperature more and more. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30382}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30384}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30384}{0}{<268>}{Chamber of Serthemon. (sw)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{The size of this room is somewhat astounding.  The room is  divided into three main parts.  Dominating the rear of the room is a large black pool. Its ebony waters send a chilling wind whipping throughout.  Running along the western border of the room are the crystal blue waters you saw under the ice  bridge.  The remainder of the room is ice covered rock, upon which rests the spiked throne of Serthemon. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30383}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
