R {30385}{0}{<148>}{In the Crystal Blue Waters}{<148>~ ~<088>}{You are being forced down an icy tube filled with water.  Your lungs strain at the chilling cold and you struggle to maintain consciousness.  About the only thing you can do is... swim. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30384}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
