R {30386}{0}{}{The Nexus of Death}{ }{As you awaken from the pain of the eternally damned waters, you notice the horrific nature of your predicament.  You  are in the middle of a chaotic nexus of swirling evil.  In some sort of border plane, your eyes come to rest upon the sole inhabitant of your extra-planar prison. }{Owlbears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30384}{answer yes}{answer yes}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30387}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing In The Forest (trail,se)}{<228>,<238>T<228>`<088>}{You've come to a strangely quiet clearing in the forest.  To the southeast, you hear human voices murmuring in a language you can't begin to understand.  The path leading towards the clearing  bends such that you cannot see who is making the noises.  Your instincts quicken as you see flashes come from the clearing.  Well, brave adventurer...  Will you investigate or turn back?  }{Druid Copse}{druid_copse}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4835}{trail}{trail}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30388}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30388}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (s,nw,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are in the NW section of a quiet, serene clearing in the woods.  For some reason, the grass and foliage in this is either stunted or scorched and burnt.  The air smells of smoke.  The strange murmuring seems to be coming from all directions...  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30387}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30389}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30390}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30389}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{Now _THIS_ is a strange place!  The weather here at the western edge of the clearing seems to change from second to second.  First it's pouring rain, then it's desert-like dryness.  Very strange...  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30388}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30396}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30390}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (e,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You are at the northern edge of the clearing.  The air here seems clean and healthy.  A gentle breeze wafts past you as you walk lazily through the grass.  If not for the murmurings, which seem to come at  you from all directions at once, this would be an ideal place to relax.  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30388}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30391}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30391}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (s,w)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have come to the NE corner of this quiet little clearing in the woods.  The ground in this corner is mud, and you have to avoid many puddles.  The air itself is humid and heavy with water.  Strange...  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30390}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30392}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30392}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{You have arrived at the eastern side of the clearing.  All around you, rocks of different sizes and types stick out of the soft clay. There is very little vegetation here.  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30391}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30393}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30393}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (n,w,nw)}{<228>, `<088>}{You very nearly have to hack your way through the vegetation to get to this SE corner of the clearing.  All around you, enormous plants tower above you.  You have never felt more life within a plant than the life you feel in these.  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30392}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30394}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30395}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30394}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (w,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{As soon as you come to this southern edge of the clearing, you feel watched by a thousand beady eyes...  From the forest beyond you hear growls and other animal noises.  You only hope that whatever they are, they stay in the forest.  You mutter a silent prayer and move on cautiously.  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30393}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30396}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30395}{0}{<238>}{A Mystical Burial Cairn (se)}{<238>. <178>+<088>}{At the center of the clearing, you have come to a burial cairn, a huge mound of smooth stones built around the grave of an honorable soul.  The Celtics buried many people in these cairns, including Taliesin, Chief Druid on the Isle of the Mighty.  Your mind wonders who is buried in this particular cairn.  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30393}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30396}{0}{<228>}{A Clearing (n,e)}{<228>, `<088>}{This SW corner of the clearing feels unnatural to you.  Though darkened by the lengthening shadows, it seems to glow faintly with an Otherworldly aura.  You imagine that you see spirits in the forest around you, but they disappear when you turn to look at them.  Your nervous instincts quicken.  }{Druid Copse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30394}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30389}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30397}{0}{<228>}{[ Temple Entrance ] (path,n)}{<228>(<238>P<228>*<088>}{You almost stumble over exposed roots as you walk through the recently exposed brush.  As your eyes adjust to the dim light you see how this temple remained hidden for all these decades.  It appears to have been built with the forest in mind as cover.  The builders apparently never intended anyone to find it without help.  The structure itself is overgrown with weeds and other forest life.  The temple appears to be entirely made of granite bricks.  Every detail from the steps to sloping walls show signs of being crafted by devoted hands. }{Temple of Alythra}{temple_of_alythra}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4836}{path}{path}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30398}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30398}{0}{<278>}{[ Shimmering Fountain in the Hallway of the Temple ] (s,n,e,}{<278>( )<088>}{Water from an ancient fountain gutters and spews in turbid torrents, trickling into murky puddles on the floor.  Most of the debris from the excavation seems to have been washed away leaving the ground shimmering and sparkling in the torch-lit hallway.  The air here feels much cooler than other parts of the temple and drops of condensation form on the walls and ceiling making the room reminiscent of a starry night. }{Temple of Alythra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
