R {30402}{0}{<238>}{[ Cultist Chambers ] (sw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{An acrid smokey haze fills the air as several torches flicker and sputter casting the room in an orange light.  An ancient mahogany desk is stacked high with yellowed papers, books and scrolls.  The scents of sulfur, mold, and mildew assault your nose, inferring something far more sinister.  The cold-stone floor is covered by a threadbare rug and a half-rotted bookshelf rests along the north wall.  Unlike the barren stone of the hallways, this chamber is painted in grotesque swirls of puce and vermillion and canary. }{Temple of Alythra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30400}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30403}{0}{<268>}{[ A granite hallway ] (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The granite hallway stretches out before you, the rectangular construction seems confining.  The ceiling, floor, and walls are all carved out of the same dark stone.  Torches dot the walls, illuminating the simple construction.  Your eyes are drawn to a tall demonic looking statue set in an alcove. }{Temple of Alythra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30401}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
