R {30404}{0}{<268>}{[ Dim Hallway ] (se,s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the dimly illuminated hallway of an ancient temple.  Several torches sputter and flicker, filling the air with their acrid fumes and hazy smoke.  Shadows leap about in their own macabre dance obfuscating long lost secrets or maybe just playing with your imagination.  Small piles of dirt and rubble are scattered against the recently excavated walls and along the cool stone floor. }{Temple of Alythra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
