R {30405}{0}{<238>}{[ Cultist Chambers ] (nw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Soft luminescence from a lantern gently fills the chamber with a brilliant opalescence.  Everything has been coated in a thin sheen of a metallic-oil that reflects and refracts light.  Your senses are overwhelmed with the pungent stench of rotten milk as your feet slide around the greasy floor.  Remnants of an old, white, hide carpet lie scattered around the ground and a brittle looking white bookcase stands against the northern wall.  The floors, ceiling and walls have been painted white adding to the effect of the shimmering oil.  A fountain in the shape of a voluptuous woman seems to be the source of the oily-substance as you see the goo spewing forth from her mouth. }{Temple of Alythra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
