R {30421}{0}{<278>}{[ Balcony ] (n)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{What a view!  While most of the trees are higher than the temple, you can still see through them quite a distance.  There is a scent of fresh wood lingering as the forest heals itself from the fire that revealed the temple.  The balcony, like the rest of the temple, is made of solid granite and is largely unremarkable other than the view. To the north you can see a stairway. }{Temple of Alythra}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
