R {30456}{0}{<238>}{[] Amongst the Menhirs []}{<238>^ ^<088>}{In the centre of the stones burns a small smudgey fire.  By its dim glow you make out the forms of the huge blocks.  At the base of each stone is a small stack of cedar kindling.  Above your head, the stars wheel about, and here in the centre of the stones you are sure you can feel the power locked dormant within the stones. }{Menhirs}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
