R {30463}{0}{<248>}{Tight Boulder Crawl (w,ne)}{<248>% %<088>}{After squeezing your way gradually down through the jumble of boulders, you reach a small space just large enough to turn around in. To the west you can see the way back out. To the northeast there looks to be a way to continue on downwards, although it gets even narrower still. }{The Green Lion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30461}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30463}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

