R {30465}{0}{<238>}{Sandy Tunnel (se,sw,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{The stream has formed a small shallow pool here on a shelf of quartz. Crystal clear water reflects your light onto the roof overhead as ripples of gold constantly chasing away shadows. The cavern is filled with the sound of water spilling over the edge of the pool as it continues its course downwards to the west. The main cave heads back upwards to the south east, and there is a thin crack in the cave wall to the southwest. }{The Green Lion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30462}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
