R {30466}{0}{<248>}{Narrow Crevice (u,ne,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{After spending several minutes squeezing through a narrow crack with your nose pressed up against the rockface, it is a relief to reach a section of cave that widens out slightly. The ceiling has risen out of sight in the dark overhead and a fresh breeze is coming down from somewhere up there. To the west and north east the crack continues off into the darkness. }{The Green Lion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30465}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30469}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
