R {30467}{0}{<248>}{Cave-in (e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The cave passage opens out here to a wide cavern where the cave apparently comes to an end. The little stream flows continually down to the lowest point in the floor where it has formed a large pool against the western wall of rock. It looks as if the passage continued to the north west at one point, but there is now a vast rockfall blocking the exit. }{The Green Lion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30465}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37178}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

