R {30469}{0}{<248>}{Echo Chasm (e)}{<248>% %<088>}{You find yourself standing on a shelf right at the edge of a deep chasm sinking into the earth. From here it is impossible to gauge how far down the hole goes, although the echoes in this chamber seem to be coming from a long way off. If there is something on the other side of the chasm it is well hidden by the darkness. Behind you to the east, a narrow crack barely wide enough to enter heads into the rock wall. }{The Green Lion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30466}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30470}{0}{<228>}{Forest (nw,sw)}{<228>( *<088>}{You are in the heart of the forest now with nothing but the beating of your own heart.  All is silent here and the sky is dark above you.  Deep black clouds roll in from all around and there is a definite chill to the air.  To the west of you stands a slender tower.  Although the tower is only about four stories high, you can't help but feel sheer evil and terror radiating in waves of agony from it. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {19818}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30473}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30471}{0}{}{tower (s,u,n)}{ }{         The darkness of the tower chills your bones.  Every ounce of your being screams at you to leave this awful place. Evil surrounds you like a cold, dark shroud here.  You see nothing but the smooth obsidian stone of the walls and a circular staircase leading up, yet you know that you are being watched.  Uncontrollably, you shudder with innate fear and feel your heart pulsating violently in your chest. There is a door on the north wall, it is closed. There is also a closed door leading south. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
