R {30474}{0}{<248>}{Just inside a dim cave (out,n)}{<248>%<228>O<248>%<088>}{You have entered a long dark cave tunnel which seems to stretch onwards into infinity. A burning scent makes your nostrils twitch comes from the somewhere in the darkness. The tunnel itself is a work of nature, made up of rough, grey stone. The ground is completely covered with some kind of brown manure that sticks to your feet, making sure that you will remember this place a long time after you have left it. }{Cavern}{cave_in_the_hills}{}{}{1.000}{1}
