R {30475}{0}{<248>}{In a dark cave (s,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The tunnel takes a sharp turn here, heading on eastwards into the darkness. A faint rattling sound can be heard from deep within. The ground is covered with the same kind of brownish manure here, and the temperature has risen considerably, making it smell even worse. }{Cavern}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
