R {30476}{0}{<248>}{At the end of a dark cave. (w)}{<248>% %<088>}{The tunnel comes to an end here, and you can see that the ground is covered with bones instead of manure. Most of them seem to be from large animals, but you quickly recognize a few of them as human originated. The scent in here smells like a mixture of rotten fleshy remains and manure, making it very hard to breathe. }{Cavern}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
