R {30477}{0}{}{Inside a small hut (leave)}{ }{You are standing inside a small, make-shift hut designed to afford some comfort to the fatigued explorer. The retreat is about seven foot in height, length and width which provides adequate space to sleep and stand in. A rug and rucksack lay scattered on the ground. A gentle radiance nigh induces a sensation of harmony and security in you. }{Hut}{hut}{}{}{1.000}{1}
