R {30483}{0}{}{Inside a tiny hovel (leave)}{ }{You have stumbled across the dwelling of the ancient mage, Karticos. Several shelves, filled with ancient tomes, line each of the walls. The only light in the room is provided by a small, guttering candle sitting on a table in the center of the room. Sitting next to the candle is a book so old, it looks as if it could turn to dust at any moment. }{Hovel}{hovel}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8445}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30484}{0}{<248>}{Cave opening (path,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{You stand at the entrance to a large cavern. The air here is quite musty, your nose is filled with the stench of death and decay coming from nearby. The room is rather ordinary, you seem compelled north by some unseen force. You notice on the ground many footprints that lead deeper into the cavern, never to be seen again. }{Dragon}{dragon}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8509}{path}{path}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
