R {30485}{0}{<248>}{Cavern of Prismatia (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{This large cavern is the home of the one of the most feared creatures in the entire realm. Home of Prismatia, the prismatic dragon, one of the last survivors of its kind. You notice on the ground of the cavern several skeletons, lay decaying from the years of age. The walls here are smeared with blood. From the looks of things you have just missed a fierce battle, which looks to be in favor of the dragon. As you examine the walls more, you notice the large cracks in the walls. }{Dragon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30484}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

