R {30495}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Republic of Knivur -[*] (s,n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Passing through the gates and deeper into the mountain, the torch lit hallway veers off in several directions under mammoth sized archways.  The dome shaped ceiling is roughly ten feet overhead and two columns of marble pillars reach up and support it.  The northern archway leads into the heart of the Republic of Knivur while the other two head into corridors.  South from here lies the gateway back outside of the mountain.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
