R {30496}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Archways of Knivur -[*] (s,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{The sounds of civilization grows with each step toward the dwarven city.  The archways loom overhead and comprise the walls to either side.  The cold draft fades while a warm humid heat begins to take its place.  As the torches burn brightly, small embers float off of them and give this place a mystical appearance.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
