R {30497}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Western Corridor of Knivur -[*] (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The radiant light from burning torches illuminate the corridor revealing two wooden doors further west.   The marble archway to the east also glows due to the light that sparkles upon it.  The granite stone floor begins to slope downwards and the ear popping starts to begin.  A cold breeze from the hallway to the east blows gently through the room, chilling the area and whatever is within it.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
