R {30498}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Eastern Corridor of Knivur -[*] (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The stone corridor is well lit from the burning torches along the smooth walls.  Distant footsteps ring through the air signifying some sort of movement further ahead.  The marble archway to west leads back into the main hallway of Knivur.  Looking ahead east reveals what looks to be a series of closed wooden doors into small quadrants of the mountain side.  Only by further exploration will reveal what may lie behind them.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
