R {30499}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Western Corridor of Knivur -[*] (n,e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Two wooden doors within the stone walls end the corridor.  Further travel west has ended, and by the only free passage is returning eastward.  The oak doors look rough and scratched up by what could be considered battle marks.  The ever burning torches hanging along the walls, light up the room.  The cool breeze that flows from the west, blows through here chilling anything that lies within these walls.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
