R {30504}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Eastern Corridor of Knivur -[*] (n,e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Two doors within the walls of the mountain end the corridor on this side of the main hallway.  The lit torches burn ever so brightly and illuminate the room.  The eastern door appears to have just been replaced compared to the appearance of the northern door.  The residents must be in the process of fixing the place up since the orc war.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
