R {30505}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Soldier Quarters -[*] (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The soldier quarters is full of beddings and other personal belongings of the dwarven militia that reside here.  The small enclosed quarters hardly looks like a suitable dwelling, but the high council needs to have ready militia.  And who ever said that it was a life of luxury.  A small breeze of cold crisp air blows through the room.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30504}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30506}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Soldier Quarters -[*] (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The soldiers' quarters are bare except for beddings inside.  The dwarven high council of elders must have recently established this barracks and haven't gotten around to assigning soldiers to it.  The stone walls are bare and the ground is also clean from debris as well.  Since there is hardly anything to look at, it wouldn't be a total waste of time to just go on to the next one.  Perhaps one day, this place will bustle with a little more activity and movement.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30504}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30507}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Inner city of Knivur -[*] (s,n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{Walking into the great city of Knivur, the full effect of the most recent war with the orcs becomes clear.  The rubble upon the ground and stains of blood upon the floor, leave their mark on this once joyous city.  A few broken sculptures of great dwarven heroes lie here in utter ruins.  The city appears to be rebuilding, but it may take some time to clear all of the debris.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
