R {30508}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Inner city of Knivur -[*] (n,s,e,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{The city is full of commotion as the residents of the dwarven republic scurry about.  The distant bellowing of crying and sobs of pain and anguish ring through the city at the discovery of slain loved ones.  A cool breeze blows past causing the torches on the ceiling to flicker.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
