R {30509}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Inner city of Knivur -[*] (n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The city, once a beautiful and prosperous place, now lies in ruins and rubble.  The republic is in the process of cleaning the city, but it may take a few more months to get the stains off the stone floor.  The Orc war has caused a lot of changes that are relatively noticeable while wandering around.  Often, some of the Knivur soldiers patrol through the inner city and make sure everything is secured and no aggressive behavior arises.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
