R {30510}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Inner city of Knivur -[*] (n,w,e)}{<278>. .<088>}{The city is full of life, but also with death in the same instant.  Patrols of the dwarven city often travel by here in their security checks.  Things have definitely tightened up since the Orc war, but a lot of it appears to be for the good.  The ground is cluttered with broken sculptures and miscellaneous debris.  It may take some time to clean the area up, but it will be just as, if not more, glorious than its previous stature.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
