R {30520}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Inner city of Knivur -[*] (s,n,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{A crumbled sculpture lies upon the ground in piles of rubble.  While scanning over the activity of the city, a small dwarven citizen silently approaches and glances up.  With small teardrops forming at the corner of his eyes, 'The dwarves have won!' he says, 'But it may be a long time before we can again live without out fear.'  Just as fast as he arrived, he wanders off into the crowd.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
