R {30521}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Command HQ -[*] (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Upon entering the dwarven headquarters, the first thing of notice is a collection of maps hanging up along the walls.  Each map shows the movements of the orcish army and the plan of attack.  Since the war is over now, there is no need for them, but being on guard is never a bad thing.  A large oaken desk rests in the center of the room, just in front of a well hidden door on the eastern wall.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
