R {30522}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Inner city of Knivur -[*] (s,e,w)}{<278>. .<088>}{A small hallway leads off to the east and away from the city.  The row of battle pikes standing here cast an evil aura that shadows over the once joyous environment Knivur has been famous for.  The northern wall prevents any further movement ahead and a strange trickling sound can be heard to the west.  It would be rather humorous to find a leak within the mountain top.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
