R {30527}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Dwarven tunnel -[*] (ne,w)}{B}{The tunnel ends here with a huge block lying on the ground ahead.  The tunnel ends abruptly in a pile of stone.  The citizens of the city must have bombarded the stone to conceal something.  After remembering the tracks on the floor previously, a good assumption is that the orcs used this exact tunnel to invade the city with.  A granite stone door on the western wall glows oddly.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
