R {30528}{0}{<248>}{[*]- Dwarven Housing of Knivur -[*] (w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{Upon the walls and ceiling of the mammoth cavern, various dwarven homes have been built right inside of the mountain.  The housing district, a commonly traveled place in Knivur encircles all around and continues to the west.  The dwarven dwellings have windows and doorways built right into the stone.  The marvelous dwarven architecture is more than just merely breathtaking, it is astounding beyond words.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
