R {30529}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Dwarven crypt -[*] (e)}{<238>. <178>+<088>}{    You enter a damp octagonal dwarven crypt.  When you look around you see seven stone tombs.  Everything in here is covered with a thick layer of dust and when you move into the room you leave big foot prints on the floor.  Suddenly you get a strong urge to leave this crypt.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
