R {30530}{0}{<248>}{[*]- Dwarven Housing of Knivur -[*] (w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{Continuing down the housing district of Knivur, the dwellings along the walls and ceiling appear to get heavier and heavier.  The torches along the stone walls light this place up in an aluminous light.  A cool draft blows past causing the flames to flicker but not die out.  The huge cavern seems to never end, but then again, there are a lot of residents in the city.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
