R {30531}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Stairwell of Knivur -[*] (u,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{A large marble staircase leads up into the second level of Knivur.  The composition of the stairwell is highly contrasting with the stone of the walls, ceiling and ground.  There must be some rather important figures of the Knivur society that dwell up the stairs, to be protected by the dwarven army headquarters west of here.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
