R {30532}{0}{<278>}{[*]- Stairwell of Knivur -[*] (d,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The archway to the west leads out into the second level of the dwarven republic.  The glistening marble stairwell sparkles from a nearby lantern upon the eastern wall.  It is quiet here, unlike the bustling city noise below, and a sense of serene peace floats through the air.  The council of the great elders lies somewhere up here, perhaps they would be willing to see a few visitors on this day.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
