R {30533}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Upper level of Knivur -[*] (e,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The dwarven hall stretches out ahead to the north and ends through an archway to the east.  Small lanterns hang down upon the walls of the hallway providing a little light to see by.  The marble tiles on the ground stand out like a black panther in an icy blue tundra.  The separation between classes of the dwarven residents is evident.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
