R {30534}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Upper level of Knivur -[*] (s,n,e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway splits off into several directions here.  The distant sound of footsteps can be heard all around.  The loyal followers of the republic wander around busy in their endeavors with some pretty complex issues of government.  The council of Knivur must be close by, as the population in the upper level grows.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
