R {30535}{0}{}{[*]- Upper level of Knivur -[*] (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The granite wall ahead prevents any further movement north, while the hallway makes a turn and starts going west.  The lanterns along the walls, not only light the room up but provide some heat for those that wander through.  The marble tiles on the floor are so shiny that one could see their own reflection in the stone.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
