R {30537}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Upper level of Knivur -[*] (n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway presses on, and the lanterns upon the walls continue to burn brightly.  The quest to find the council is almost to an end as the residents of the dwarven city all flock to the northwest.  The chessboard tiles on the floor, repetitive in design, shine as the light shines down upon it.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
