R {30538}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Passageway of Knivur -[*] (s,n,w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The passage ends abruptly here in front of a series of doors lined up along the northern, southern and eastern walls.  The light from the burning lanterns does not reveal much about them other than the glossy surface.  The tiles on the floor appear to end right under where each door starts.  The sounds coming from behind each of them is quite startling, and only by further inspection will the source of those noises be found.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
