R {30539}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Soldier Quarters -[*] (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A small enclosed room with a few tables and chairs lying upon the ground.  The militia of the republic often come here to rest up and wait for the call of duty from the great council.  Beddings also line up along the stone walls as well.  On average, each quarters usually house approximately from three to five soldiers.  It may not be the most spacious place to hold so many of them, but it is the militia after all.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
