R {30540}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Soldier Quarters -[*] (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The light in the quarters is dim, but there is not a whole lot of need of it here.  Tables and chairs are neatly placed in the center room while the militia beddings are located along the walls.  The stone ground below is not made from marble anymore as it once was, but no sense in spoiling anyone that doesn't need it.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
