R {30541}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Soldier Quarters -[*] (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The soldier quarters look much the same as the ones located down in the lower city, but there is not much room for diversity either if it all serves the same purpose.  The small wooden desks in the center of the room look like they have been used recently, and a few scattered items of personal belonging are on the floor.  The beddings have all been made neatly and with precision against the walls.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
