R {30547}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Council room of Knivur -[*] (se)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The marble floor in this room has a pattern unlike the hallway outside.  The symbol of the dwarven republic, half crescent moon and mining axe, are depicted by the white and black tiles.  The walls are adorned with large candles, and incense sticks that send off an original aroma that cascades through the chamber.  Hanging from the ceiling just overhead a golden scale sparkles under the flickering light.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
