R {30548}{0}{}{[*]- Prison chamber of Knivur -[*] (w)}{ }{      The prison chamber is nothing fancy nor would one expect it too.  Bloody remains of countless orcs lie upon the ground in piles of waste waiting for disposal.  The smell emitting from the room alone has the tendency to kill. The ground is littered with the dead, and the walls have quite a share themselves.  The only clear thought you can think of is how to exit here quickly.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
