R {30551}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Hallway of Knivur -[*] (s,e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{To the south the sound of conversation echoes throughout the hallway with loud and obnoxious drunken voices.  The hallway continues east and then again back west to the inner city.  The walls of the mountain on each side are adorned with torches and commonly written ancient scriptures etched into them.  The journey through the republic of Knivur has been nothing less than enjoyable thus far.  What bad things could possibly happen by exploring this hall to its end.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
