R {30553}{0}{<278>}{[*]- The dwarven Fountain -[*] (s)}{<278>( )<088>}{The source of the trickling sound that echoes through the city can be found here.  A small dwarven crafted stone fountain rests gently in the center of the room.  The walls around it are decorated with beautiful drawings and sketches all along them.  Even the torches take on a different shape as they look like huge fish heads.  This room is totally uncharacteristic of the city, but that is what makes its presence here unique.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
