R {30555}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Dwarven Hallway -[*] (e,nw)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{A big octagonal dwarven hall.  The floor is made of enormous white and black blocks and the room gives you the feeling you are walking on a big chessboard.  Hanging from the ceiling are big bronze lanterns that makes traveling through the hall a little bit easier to navigate.  A small sign has been set into the ground.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
