R {30556}{0}{<248>}{[*]- Dwarven mine -[*] (se,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{The dwarven mining tunnel is small and condensed.  Walking through the hall and between the close knit walls becomes rather difficult.  The overhead ceiling is supported by wooden logs that span the whole length of the mine.  Bronze lanterns have been placed randomly along the mine to provide the dim light now available to those that work here. }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
