R {30557}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Northern corridor of Knivur -[*] (se,sw)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The dwarven corridor splits off into separate directions.  The peaceful surroundings and lack of frequent visits make this place a nice spot to sit and relax a few moments.  The floor here is still covered with red blood stains, but finding a place within the city that is not would be amazing.  A strange buzzing sound can be heard to the east, but where it is coming from exactly is uncertain.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
