R {30558}{0}{<238>}{The Golden Nugget (n)}{<238>[P]<088>}{This is the heart of the dwarven city.  The golden nugget pub. There are dwarves everywhere.  And they sing their favorite song 'GOLD GOLD GOLD'.  There are four enormous wooden tables placed around a big fireplace and around the tables sitting on small benches the dwarves use their empty jugs as drumsticks.  A dwarven barkeeper has a busy time filling all those empty jugs.  A small menu is posted on the wall near the counter.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
