R {30559}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Hallway of Knivur -[*] (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{From the sound of applause and screams to the north, one could possibly conclude that a large crowd has been assembled just north of here.  It might be wise to check out what could be creating all the noise.  The overhead ceiling seems to get higher and extend a larger distance above.  A small incline in the ground leads downward ahead, but to the west the floor leads back up to the inner city.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30551}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
