R {30560}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Knivur arena -[*] (d,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Stone benches surrounding a small pit below encircle the room.  The crowd sitting upon them roar and cheer as they watch the brave dwarven champions confront hideous and ugly beasts of all kinds.  Sitting from this vantage point provides a clear view of the action happening below.  Within the rows of seats, a small secluded pathway leads down into the cavernous pit below for members of the audience to wander down and try their luck.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30559}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
