R {30561}{0}{<238>}{[*]- Arena pit -[*] (u)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are now standing at the bottom of the pit.  The walls surrounding you are about ten feet high and made of stone.  The floor is sand and there are pieces of broken armours, rusty swords and bones lying everywhere.  Right in front of you are four cages containing beasts for the shows.  They seem very hungry and roar when you move.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30560}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30562}{0}{<248>}{[*]- Dwarven Mine -[*] (n,s,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{The damp mining tunnel appears to never end.  The natural granite walls and ceiling become ever shorter in size and height.  In the distance the sound of some sort of working noise echoes through the tunnels.  There are a few lamps here lining up along the walls.  To the east is a big entrance to a cave and you can hear the sound of metal against metal coming from it. There are also steel tracks on the ground here. }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
