R {30598}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Wizard Hall of Knivur -[*] (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The walls of the hallway are full of magical runes and markings that have been etched into them by a magical entity.  A large mirror inside the northern wall reflects the light from a torch on the opposing side.  Small stone carvings make up the frame around it.  Some of them appear so life-like, that its hard to determine whether or not they watch the visitors that come here, or if it is just the way the light hits them.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
