R {30599}{0}{<268>}{[*]- Wizard Hall of Knivur -[*] (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway makes a small turn and heads north where it ends in a small chamber.  A big wooden desk with a few ancient scrolls and scriptures upon it, rests quietly within the center of the hall.  An odd place to put a desk, but to each their own.  It is rather dark here since there is no torch lighting the hall up.  A small mist floats precariously above.  }{Mount Knivur}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
