R {30628}{0}{}{Corridor (w,n)}{ }{You stand in a corridor that wraps around the tower.  The cold dark walls of the hallway are unadorned and there are no torches here to light your way.  The air is damp and musty and you can hear the dark moaning sounds the creatures of this tower emit.  The corridor leads north to the stairwell or west to the next chamber. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
