R {30629}{0}{}{Library (e,w)}{ }{This chamber opens up into a vast room.  It is constructed of the same dark granite as the rest of the tower and tall wooden shelves line the walls.  There are old tattered banners and tapestries hanging from the walls and ceiling.  They appear to be placed to diffuse sound from outside the room. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
