R {30630}{0}{}{Study (e)}{ }{This chamber is furnished with several antique plush chairs and couches.  There are also several tables around the room with unlit candles on them.  The walls have several torches on them, casting dim light into the room.  The floor is covered with several soft but tattered rugs that look easy on the feet. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
