R {30631}{0}{}{Dark Chamber (e)}{ }{You stand in a small dark and empty chamber.  The dark granite walls of the chamber create the illusion of absorbing all the light around you.  There is a small arch in the wall to the east allowing passage in that direction.  A globe of magical light illuminates the room.  It casts mysterious shadows along the walls and ceiling. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
