R {30632}{0}{}{Circular Chamber (d,w)}{ }{This chamber opens up to a small circular stairwell that leads down the center of the tower.  A magic globe casts flickering shadows and dim light onto the walls.  The spiral staircase is constructed out of the same dark granite as the walls and leads down into the belly of the tower. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
