R {30633}{0}{}{Spiral Stairwell (d,u)}{ }{Traveling on the stairwell, you notice that the walls seem to be getting cooler and more damp.  The air you breathe is stale, as if it has been trapped in here for eons.  The spiral stairwell is illuminated by a magical globe perched on a stone sconce.  The hidden stairs spiral further down deeper into the tower. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
