R {30634}{0}{}{Spiral Stairwell (d,u)}{ }{You continue along in the dim circular stairwell.  The granite steps appear to be getting damper as you descend further into the tower.  Looking down the center of the stairwell, you can see a landing below where the stairwell terminates.  The air around you is moist, heavy, and stale.  A very light fog begins to develop around your ankles. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
