R {30635}{0}{}{Bottom of Stairwell (n,u)}{ }{The stairs twist to an end here at a circular landing.  There is a dim globe hanging from a sconce attached to the wall.  A very thin fog wisps above the ground here and condensation drips down the wall.  To the north the passage continues to another dim chamber. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
