R {30636}{0}{}{Dim Passage (n,s)}{ }{This dim passage has an arched ceiling and is constructed out of the same dark granite as the rest of the tower.  The air is stale and moist and condensation drips down the walls.  To the north the passage appears to open up to a large underground cavern and the stairwell is off to the south. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
