R {30637}{0}{}{Large Cavern (s,n,ne,nw)}{ }{You stand at the entrance to a large underground cavern.  The cavern is dome shaped and carved out of the bedrock below the tower.  The circular stone wall of the cavern arches up to the dome's zenith and is unadorned.  You see four marble obelisks with glowing runes etched into them spaced around the cavern. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
