R {30638}{0}{}{Large Cavern (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You make your way to the center of the cavern and notice there is a large hole here.  It is about ten feet wide and you can't see the bottom.  Directly in front of the hole, you see a small pedestal.  The top of the dome is high above your head and drops of condensation drip down to the ground. }{Alizarian Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
