R {30644}{0}{}{Anderson's Office (hall)}{ }{You've entered the cramped office of the famed Sir Robert Anderson.  As chief of the special crimes unit of Scotland Yard, the Ripper investigation has been passed to him personally to supervise.  This has made his office one of the main nerve points to the investigation and its current cramped condition reflects this heavily.  Stacks of papers and letters cover almost everything.  The disorganization of it all does not inspire you with a lot of confidence in the progress the investigators are making.  }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
