R {30645}{0}{}{A cobblestone path. (leave)}{ }{A cobblestone path As you walk through the forest you stumble upon a small clearing. Directly in front of you lies a cobblestone path. You begin to follow the path and notice that it ends abruptly. Situated at the end of the path lies a peculiar looking shoe. The shoe oddly resembles a house. There is an old woman here, perhaps you could stay and talk with her for a spell. }{Old Woman in the Shoe}{old_woman_in_the_shoe}{}{}{1.000}{1}
