R {30647}{0}{}{Eggland Entrance (leave,n)}{ }{      You stand just outside the gated entrance to Eggland Village, home to Humpty Dumpty and other less famous eggs, chickens, and humans.  The village is surrounded by a high stone wall and you can enter through an iron gateway to see what is going on in the hustle and bustle you glimpse to the north.  Alternatively, you can leave Eggland and return to the realm of Chaos. }{Humpty Dumpty}{humpty_dumpty}{}{}{1.000}{1}
