R {30650}{0}{}{The twins' bedroom (hallway)}{ }{The twins' bedroom Looking cautiously around the room, you determine the <<>>DO NOT ENTER<<>> sign on the door was merely a warning and not a threat. You see a set of bunk beds along the wall and a desk in the center of the room.  }{Old Woman in the Shoe}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
