R {30653}{0}{}{A small closet (out)}{ }{A small closet You are standing in the children's closet. There is a bar that extends across the length of the closet, several hangers are currently resting upon the bar. A few items of clothing hang neatly on the hangers, while others remain empty. Directly above your head lies a shelf. After a quick scan you determine there is nothing there worth looking at. If you are lucky, you may find Susie hiding in here. }{Old Woman in the Shoe}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
