R {30654}{0}{}{Just south of a quiet village (n,e,path)}{P}{You find yourself standing upon the brink of some sort of village, which extends northward and beyond.  Strange sounds seem to emanate from the village, a sort of lowing, mooing sound.  The atmosphere is one of peace and tranquility, as if you have stumbled upon a hidden paradise.  Green fields stretch off to the east, and a path leads through them in that direction.  There is a path that leads south, back to where you came from, though surely you would much prefer to stay here.  There is a wooden sign next to the road that heads north. }{CowVille}{cowville}{}{}{1.000}{1}
