R {30655}{0}{}{The south end of Main street (n,s)}{ }{You are at the southern end of CowVille's main street, aptly named 'Main Street'.  To the north of you the village continues along the road, while to the south the road leads out of CowVille into greener pastures.  Well, green pastures.  You can make out sounds of the village filtering in from the north, mostly mooing and bustling noises which make the village seem friendly and inviting. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30654}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30660}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30656}{0}{}{On a path to a farm (e,w)}{ }{You are following a pleasant path towards a farmhouse, travelling through green fields of what look to be tightly packed corn plants.  As you move along the path, the corn sways gently in the breeze, appearing to be a single mass rather than thousands of individual plants.  Further along the path to the east you can make out a quaint-looking farmhouse amidst more fields, while to the west you see the path leads back to Main Street. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30654}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30657}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30657}{0}{}{On the porch of a quaint farmhouse (e,w)}{ }{You are standing on the porch of the farmhouse, overlooking the green fields of corn that stretch all the way back to Main Street.  The shade offered by the porch is a nice change from the hot sun that shines on this fine day.  The door into the small farmhouse is open, allowing what breeze there is to blow through, cooling the inside. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30656}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30658}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30658}{0}{}{Inside a farmhouse (se,w)}{ }{You are in a small, homely single-room farmhouse.  Though it only holds a bed and basic kitchen, there is a feeling of warmth and comfort about it.  There are two doors leading outside, both wide open to allow a small breeze to wash through the house, cooling it.  Whoever lives here is probably quite happy not having anything other than the basics. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30657}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30659}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30659}{0}{}{A golden field of barley (nw)}{ }{You are at the edge of a huge golden field of barley behind the farmhouse.  Whatever the farmer has been fertilizing with must have worked, as the barley stalks stand well over head-height, blocking your view.  There are a couple of steps leading back through an open door into the farmhouse to the northwest, but otherwise you are surrounded by barley. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30658}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43674}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30660}{0}{}{Towards the south end of Main Street (n,s,w)}{ }{You are in CowVille, village of cows.  All around you there is bovine activity as the locals go about their everyday business.  The cobblestones of main street extend north and south from here, leading you deeper into CowVille to the north, or towards the outskirts to the south.  There is a large, new looking building to the west from which comes the thump thump thump of a bass beat. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30655}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30661}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30662}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30661}{0}{}{The main street of CowVille (n,s)}{ }{You are travelling along the cobblestoned main street of CowVille.  It is a beautiful day with the sun shining down upon the inhabitants of the town as they go about their business.  From the south, you can make out a faint bass rhythm, while from the north comes the mooing sounds of a busier section of town. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30660}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30670}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30662}{0}{}{Outside MTV studios (w,e)}{ }{Right in front of you to the west is a large, new-looking building that houses the studios of MTV (if the sign is to be believed).  The building itself is pure white, and shines brightly in the sun in comparison to the darkness of the tinted windows.  You can hear the THUMP THUMP THUMP of a bass beat emanating from within, which could either be a good or bad thing.  The path you are on leads back east to Main Street. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30660}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30663}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30663}{0}{}{MTV studios reception (w,e)}{ }{You are just inside a large reception room, with some glass doors leading east out of the building.  The room is huge, and decorated with good taste, just the right amount of nothingness is mixed with an occasional potplant.  A strip of carpet leading across the marble floor draws your eyes to the reception desk that lies to the west. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30662}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30664}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30664}{0}{}{MTV studios reception (n,s,e)}{ }{You stand in front of a large reception desk at the western end of a large room.  Two doors lead off to the north and south, each with a small plaque informing you of their contents.  Along the front of the curving desk is carved the studio logo and name: M.T.V - Moo-sic TeleVision.  The strip of carpet leading right up to the desk also leads back east to the doors out of the building. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30663}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30665}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30666}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30665}{0}{}{MTV studios meeting room (s,w)}{ }{A big empty meeting room in the MTV studios building.  A huge table takes up most of the room, with about thirty chairs surrounding it.  Around the walls are many inspirational posters, obviously designed so that if somebody is bored in a meeting, they will have something enlightening to read while looking over the head of the person talking.  A door to the west leads deeper into the building, and one to the south leads back to reception. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30664}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30669}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30666}{0}{}{An office in the MTV studios (n,w)}{ }{This is a small office which looks as if it is used to interview potential hosts of MTV shows.  There is a desk with a large, plush chair behind it and a small, uncomfortable chair in front of it.  Typical interview room.  The walls are bare, though there is a window in the southern wall, allowing natural light into the room.  Doors lead north and west from here. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30664}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30667}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30667}{0}{}{An empty office in the MTV studios (n,e)}{ }{This office looks like it hasn't been used in a while, even though it would seem to have a prime position in the building, with plenty of sunlight streaming through the many windows on the west and south walls.  A desk sits abandoned in one corner of the room, without a chair to sit at it, and an empty bookshelf stands next to a door on the north wall. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30666}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30668}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30668}{0}{}{MTV studios DJ booth (n,s)}{ }{You are in a cramped DJ booth, where a DJ records voice-overs and introductions for shows.  Most of the room is taken up with recording equipment which surrounds the chair in the center.  This is the room where the THUMP THUMP THUMP of the bass you have been hearing originates, with big speakers against the east wall are pumping out the noise. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30667}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30669}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30669}{0}{}{A storage room. (e,s)}{ }{This room is filled with shelves, all of which are packed with videos and tapes for playing on the MTV shows.  There is a slight mustiness in the air, giving the room a feeling much like a library.  Perhaps it comes from the accumulated knowledge ... or in this case, the accumulated lack of talent.  There are two ways out of this mess, to the east and south.  The THUMPing of the bass seems to be loudest from the south. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30668}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30665}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30670}{0}{}{Smack bang in the centre of CowVille (n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are standing in the middle of CowVille's main street, Main Street. The day is hot and sunny, and you would kill for an ice-cream.  You can hear the locals of CowVille in the town around you, mooing happily.  There is an entrance to a building west from here, and another building nearby to the east, both of which look quite busy. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30661}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30671}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30672}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30673}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30671}{0}{}{The main street of CowVille (s,n)}{ }{You seem to be in the northern half of Main Street, the main road through CowVille.  To the west is a large grey building which has its entrance just south of here.  There are fewer buildings north of here where there is quite a lot of wooded areas and grassy expanses.  Above you the sky is blue and you can see the moo-n hanging just above the treeline. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30670}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30685}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30672}{0}{}{Entrance to the Moo-seum (n,e,w)}{ }{You stand in the entrance of the CowVille Moo-seum.  From the outside the building was a dull grey, but inside it has been decorated and furnished to resemble a barn!  There is hay on the floor, and big wooden rafters overhead ... the whole works.  The moo-seum continues to the north and west, where you assume there may be exhibits, and the exit lies to the east back on to Main Street. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30670}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30674}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30675}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30673}{0}{}{Outside a Moo-vie theatre (e,w)}{ }{You are right at the entrance of a Moo-vie theatre, excellent!  The building is almost entirely covered in glittering, sparkling lights that continually dance in eye-popping patterns.  The doors of the theatre stand wide open and you can hear occasional noises suggesting a Moo-vie is currently playing.  The path you are on leads back west to Main Street, where you can hear the sounds of CowVille over the noise of the theatre. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30670}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30688}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30674}{0}{}{Moo-seum exhibits (s,n)}{ }{A path of hay leads south towards the exit, and north deeper into the Moo-seum.  Hay has been piled against the east wall, surrounding a large seat of some kind, but a path has been cleared which would allow you to get up close and personal.  Above the seat, mounted on the wall, is a small brass plaque. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30672}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30684}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30675}{0}{}{Moo-seum Exhibits (w,e)}{ }{Amongst the Moo-seum exhibits.  Set against the southern wall in the middle of a pile of hay there is a larger than life wax figurine with a corresponding brass plaque set on the wall beside it.  The hay path you are following continues further into the Moo-seum to the west and towards the exit to the east. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30672}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30676}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30676}{0}{}{Moo-seum exhibits (w,e)}{ }{Another wax figurine stands against the north wall here, standing out proudly against the pile of hay surrounding it.  A small brass plaque is affixed to the wall beside the statue.  The path continues east and west, leading on to different exhibits in both directions. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30675}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30677}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30677}{0}{}{Moo-seum exhibits (n,e)}{ }{The hay path you have been following turns here, heading north and south to more exhibits.  The barn walls create a corner here, where a larger than life wax figurine is on display with a small brass plaque mounted on the wall beside it. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30676}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30678}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30678}{0}{}{A pathway through the Moo-seum (n,s)}{ }{The hay path leads north and south here, though there are no exhibits on display in this area.  The walls stand about ten feet back from the path, enough room to give a sense of space without letting you wander aimlessly. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30677}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30679}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30679}{0}{}{Moo-seum exhibits (e,s)}{ }{The hay path winds its way through the exhibits of the Moo-seum, passing a large painting here as it turns a corner.  More exhibits lie off to the east and south as well.  There is so much to see! }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30678}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30680}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30680}{0}{}{A pathway through the Moo-seum (s,w)}{ }{The hay path leads west and south here, though there are no exhibits on display in this area.  You must be quite a way into the Moo-seum here, as the only sounds you can hear are of other patrons who have come to immerse themselves in the wonderful array of exhibits on offer. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30679}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30681}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30681}{0}{}{Moo-seum exhibits (e,n)}{ }{Something is not quite right here.  The hay path turns another corner and heads east and north, but the painting it leads past in the southwest corner looks totally out of place.  It is almost as if somebody ripped out the actual exhibit and stuck up a picture of their own. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30680}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30682}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30682}{0}{}{A pathway through the Moo-seum (n,w)}{ }{The hay path leads west and north from here towards more exhibits.  This area of the Moo-seum is bare of exhibits, leaving just the hay pathway and ever-present barn walls for you to admire.  The sounds of other patrons making their way through the Moo-seum reach your ears occasionally. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30681}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30683}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30683}{0}{}{Moo-seum exhibits (e,s)}{ }{The hay path you have been following splits to encircle a large, glass-topped display case in the centre of this area.  The walls are spaced more widely here, in order to accommodate the large case, which is surrounded by a large pile of hay. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30682}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30684}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30684}{0}{}{A pathway through the Moo-seum (s,w)}{ }{The hay path leads west and south here, though there are no exhibits on display in this area.  In the distance to the south you can see where you first entered the Moo-seum, though it looks like there might be an exhibit before that. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30683}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30674}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30685}{0}{}{A beautiful stretch of Main Street (n,s,e)}{ }{As you travel along Main Street through the town of CowVille you are filled with a sense of peace and happiness.  This stretch of the road is lined by trees, except for a gap to the east where a path leads off.  The trees continue northwards, whereas to the south there are more buildings. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30671}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30686}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30687}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30686}{0}{}{Near the North end of Main Street (s,n)}{ }{From here among the beautiful trees you can see that Main Street comes to an end not far to the north where there is a building of some kind. Also from the north you can make out faint whimsical music, as if a carnival or circus were in town.  To the south the trees continue for some distance, but eventually are replaced by most of the town of CowVille. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30685}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30703}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30687}{0}{}{A gateway in the trees (e,w)}{ }{Across the path before you stands a huge archway, with intricate wrought iron gates.  The archway looks to have been created from a single piece of wood, bent into the shape of a hoof.  Right at the apex of the arch is carved what looks to be a motto.  The trees continue to line the path through the gates to the east. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30685}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30692}{e}{open gate;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30688}{0}{}{Inside a Moo-vie theatre (se,w,ne)}{ }{You are in the foyer of the Moo-vie theatre, where normally you would buy tickets and snacks, but there doesn't seem to be anybody around to serve you.  The counters are all closed, perhaps everybody is inside enjoying the Moo-vie that is playing?  There is a sign above the counters on the north wall displaying what Moo-vies are currently being shown, and on either side a large staircase curves up to enter the back of the theatre itself. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30673}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30689}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30690}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30689}{0}{}{The back of a Moo-vie theatre (nw,ne)}{ }{You are right at the back of a theatre on the left hand side.  Strangely, the view is somewhat better from this side than the other, meaning there are a few more patrons scattered about the seats here.  The big screen is currently showing a Moo-vie, and everybody is engrossed in watching it.  Just to the northwest you can make out a crack of light indicating the doors to the foyer, and to the northeast there seems to be a path to the front of the theatre. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30688}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30691}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30690}{0}{}{The back of a Moo-vie theatre (se,sw)}{ }{You are right at the back of a theatre on the left hand side.  The theatre looks to be mostly empty, but the few patrons who are here look to be enjoying the Moo-vie playing on the screen immensely.  It is dark, though you can make out a faint light from the doors to your southwest, leading back to foyer.  A pathway leads down to the southeast between the rows of seats towards front of the theatre. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30688}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30691}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30691}{0}{}{The front of a Moo-vie theatre (sw,nw)}{ }{You are standing right in front of the screen in the Moo-vie theatre.  If you tried to watch the whole Moo-vie from here, you would end up with terrible cramp, which is probably why nobody is in the front seats.  Two paths lead towards the back of the theatre between the rows of seats, one to the northwest, one to the southwest. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30689}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30690}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30692}{0}{}{Inside the gates of Moo-U (e,w)}{ }{You are just inside the gates of Moo-U, the university of CowVille.  The path through the trees leads towards the campus to the east, and through the archway to the west.  All around the path, trees sway slightly in the breeze, making quiet rustling sounds. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30687}{w}{open gate;w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30693}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30693}{0}{}{The Moo-U campus (e,w)}{ }{You stand on the grounds of the university of CowVille, Moo-U.  There are buildings scattered to the east amongst trees and fields, and to the west the path you are on enters a large amount of trees, disappearing from sight. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30692}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30694}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30694}{0}{}{The grounds of the Moo-U campus (se,w,ne)}{ }{The path you are on splits here, heading to different parts of the campus.  There is a small signpost positioned right at the fork.  Everywhere you look you see green, of the trees and of the fields.  Occasionally though, as the trees sway in the breeze, you get a glimpse of a building or two hidden away behind them. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30693}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30695}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30696}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30695}{0}{}{Outside a university lecture room (n,e,nw)}{ }{North of you, hidden away in a grove of trees, is a small stone building with its doorway standing open.  The path you are standing on continues east and northwest, leading to different parts of the campus.  The green of the trees and fields surrounding you creates a feeling of peace and harmony. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30694}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30697}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30698}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30696}{0}{}{A path through the university campus (e,sw)}{ }{You are following a path through the campus of Moo-U, the university of CowVille.  From here, you can continue along the path eastwards or southwest.  You can't really see much of anything except trees and fields, though perhaps there might be a building off to the east. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30694}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30701}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30697}{0}{}{Inside a small university lecture room (s)}{ }{This is a small room, probably used for an occasional lecture to small classes, or more likely as a tutorial room.  There are about twenty seats facing the front of the room, where there is a large blackboard almost covered in writing.  The doorway outside to the south stands open, inviting you out into the sun. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30695}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30698}{0}{}{Outside the university stadium (e,w)}{ }{Before you to the east lies the stadium of Moo-U, where their team vigorously defends the university's honor on Friday nights.  The path you are on leads right into the stadium as well as leading westwards towards the rest of the campus grounds.  The ever-present trees are scattered around this area as well, with a number surrounding the stadium itself, blocking most of it from view. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30695}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30699}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30699}{0}{}{Inside the university stadium (n,w)}{ }{You stand among the seats inside the small stadium of Moo-U.  While it doesn't look that big, it is well looked after, with the white paint of the stands not showing any cracks or chips and the field in the center of the stadium looking lush and green.  There is a path down to the field northwards, where you could pretend to be part of the team. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30698}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30700}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30700}{0}{}{The center of the university stadium (s)}{ }{You are standing right in the center of the stadium at Moo-U.  This must be what it is like to play on their football team, though the stands are empty at the moment.  Even though it is quite a small stadium, it feels quite large when you are standing right in the middle.  The grass underfoot is lush and green, obviously tended to with a caring hoof, and the stands around the edge shine in the sun. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30699}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30701}{0}{}{Outside a university building (s,w)}{ }{The path comes to an end here, leading up to the entrance of a stone building just south of here.  Even up close, the building seems to blend into its surroundings, the natural stone walls somehow becoming lost among the trees.  The doors are open, leading into what looks like a lecture theatre. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30696}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30702}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30702}{0}{}{Inside a university lecture room (n)}{ }{The inside of this building looks a lot bigger than the outside did.  Row upon row of seats rise up in tiers away from the front of the lecture theatre, where a large empty whiteboard and lecturn are located.  There is obviously no class on right now as all the seats are deserted, making the big room seem even bigger in its emptiness.  The only doorway out lies to the north. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30701}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30703}{0}{}{The North End of Main Street (ne,n,s,e)}{ }{You are right at the northern end of Main Street, the cobblestoned street that runs right through CowVille.  There is an inviting looking building to the north, and a well-travelled path leading eastwards.  There are still a lot of trees in this area, in particular they line the western side of the street thickly.  The sky looks amazingly clear and blue today, as if the gods were smiling down on CowVille from the heavens.  There is a new road leading northeast past the building. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30686}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30716}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30705}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30706}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53013}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30704}{0}{}{Southern Church Street (n,e,sw)}{ }{Newly laid gray and white cobbles lie underfoot at the southern end of Church Street.  Stretching out eastwards, along both sides of a pretty lane, are sculptured topiary trees.  The less manicured trees continue to surround Church Street as it meanders northwards into the newer sections of CowVille, as well as to the southwest where Church Street meets Main Street.  Faint sounds of chanting can be heard from the northwest, bringing with them a sense of peace. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30716}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30707}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30755}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30705}{0}{<238>}{-( )- The Queen's Hoof -( )- (s)}{<238>[P]<088>}{This is a pub, cow-style.  It is a fairly simple affair, with a few tables around which you could sit and enjoy your drink or food.  Daisy the bartender stands behind the bar ready to serve you, and the menu is above her head on the wall. }{CowVille}{}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
E {30703}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30706}{0}{}{The entrance to an A-Moo-sement Park (e,w)}{ }{From the east you can hear the jolly jingly-jangly music of an A-Moo-sement park.  The entrance is here, though it looks like you need a token to pass through into the park, luckily there is a machine here that dispenses tokens.  The moos of joy and happiness emanate from the park, it sure sounds like a fun place to be! }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30703}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30709}{e}{thump machine;get token;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30707}{0}{<238>}{Beside some large gates (n,s,e,w)}{<238>|@|<088>}{Standing on the western side of Church Street, amidst the trees, is a pair of huge gates.  They look to be permanently open, as if inviting visitors to pass through.  The cobbles underfoot continue north and south along Church Street, and look quite new.  Chanting can be heard coming from beyond the gates, though its meaning is lost out here on the street. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30704}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30726}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30727}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30728}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30708}{0}{}{Tanglefoot Lane (n,w,e)}{ }{The soft grass of Tanglefoot Lane meets the cobbled surface of Church street just to the west.  Set back from the lane a small way on the southern side, is a tidy looking house, whilst on the northern side of the lane there is a freshly-painted doctor's office.  There is a peaceful, relaxed feeling in the air of this area, suggesting that the houses here would be much sought after. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30725}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30715}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30717}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43676}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30709}{0}{}{Just inside an A-Moo-sement Park (e,w)}{ }{Just west of you is the giant hoof that marks the entrance to the park, should you wish to leave you could go that way.  The park itself lies off to the east where jolly music plays and bright colours dance in the sunlight.  You can see the top of a giant black and white spotted tent in the distance. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30706}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30710}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30710}{0}{}{In an A-Moo-sement park (ne,w,e)}{ }{You are in a fun-filled A-Moo-sement park in CowVille.  There are a few tall posts with speakers poorly disguised as cartoon cow heads which play typical A-Moo-sment park music.  To the east you can see there are what look to be sideshow tents, and further off there is a huge black and white tent. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30709}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30711}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30712}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30711}{0}{}{In an small, brightly-coloured tent (se,s,e,sw)}{ }{You are standing in a small, open tent.  Poles support the corners and center of the tent, but there are only walls to the north and west, leaving all other directions open for you to walk through.  It looks like this tent was the waiting area for a ride on a rollercoaster, but the rollercoaster seems to be closed. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30710}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30712}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30714}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30713}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30712}{0}{}{By a sideshow tent (n,ne,w,e)}{ }{You are in the middle of the A-Moo-sement park with three tents open to you from here.  To the east and north lie brightly coloured sideshow tents and to the northeast is the huge black and white tent.  You can't make out what is inside any of the tents, so take your pick and head inside! }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30710}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30711}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30713}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30714}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30713}{0}{}{In the Big Tent (s,sw,w)}{ }{The black and white material of the biggest tent surrounds you.  This must be what it would be like to be inside a giant cow.  Surprisingly, this tent is mostly empty, with a small table in the back corner the only interesting furnishing.  A bit disappointing really, all this room that could have been used for a three-ring circus or mud-wrestling pit.  Oh well, perhaps the table is worth checking out now that you are here. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30712}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30714}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30711}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30714}{0}{}{In an Sideshow Tent (n,nw,w)}{ }{This is the inside of one of the sideshow tents in the A-Moo-sement park.  This brightly coloured tent seems to be home to a game of 'Toss the Hoof', or so the banner draped from the ceiling of the tent says.  There doesn't seem to be anyone here at the moment, but it would probably be alright to have a go anyway.  There are three exits to the tent, one leading outside to the west, and two leading to other tents, north and northwest. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30712}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30713}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30711}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30715}{0}{}{A white hallway (s,n,w)}{ }{Running from the front door of the house straight down to the doctor's office in the back, the hall is spic and span and glaringly white.  The reception is off to the west, where you can hear soothing moosic obviously intended to calm the patients.  Right behind you to the south is the front door, made from frosted glass through which you can see the blurry shapes of trees. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30708}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30756}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30757}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30716}{4104}{}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {30704}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30703}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30717}{0}{}{Tanglefoot Lane (w,e)}{E}{The calm, relaxed atmosphere of Tanglefoot Lane continues to the east and west, lined with topiaries in both directions.  Half hidden behind the large topiary on the north side of the lane stands a somewhat neglected looking house.  The opposite side of the Lane is lined with trees. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30708}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30718}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30780}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30780}{n}{enter}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30718}{0}{}{Tanglefoot Lane (e,w)}{ }{Tanglefoot Lane appears to end just off to the east, though it is hard to tell with all the topiaries in the way.  There is a house on the southern side of the lane here, but it appears in very poor condition, especially compared to the other houses of the lane.  The trees on the northern side of the lane sway gently in a soft breeze, rustling slightly. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30717}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30719}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43678}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48585}{enter window}{enter window}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48585}{n}{enter window}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30719}{0}{}{The end of Tanglefoot Lane (se,w)}{ }{Tanglefoot lane continues through a dense patch of trees to the southeast, curving out of sight.  On the northern side is located a massive house, obviously expensive and well cared for, definitely a nice change from the one back to the west.  Standing on both sides of the lane are the remaining two topiaries. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30718}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30720}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48584}{enter monkeybars}{enter monkeybars}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48584}{n}{enter monkeybars}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30720}{0}{}{Tanglefoot Lane (nw,e)}{ }{The houses that line Tanglefoot lane further to the northwest are absent here, where the trees thicken and close in on both sides of the road.  Sounds of somebody shouting can be heard from the southeast, though all you can see in that direction are more trees.  A slight breeze moves the leaves of the trees, creating a soft background rustle. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30719}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30721}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30721}{0}{}{Before some large, closed gates (s,w,e)}{ }{Standing across the road leading south is a set of large, imposing gates, surrounded on both sides by thick trees and shrubs.  Supporting the gates on both sides, half hidden by the greenery, are solid brick posts, with an important-looking sign attached to the left one.  From beyond the gates, the sound of harsh voices can be heard chanting and yelling. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30720}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53019}{s}{push through}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30723}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30722}{0}{}{The corner of a parade ground (s,e,se,n)}{ }{       This corner of the parade ground is dominated by the compound gates to the north, leading back out into the general population of Cowville.  The rest of the parade ground extends southeast, though it appears largely unused at present.  There are some buildings situated around the southern and eastern edges of the field, but you cannot make out their purpose from here.  Trees and bushes surround the western and northern edges, broken only by the imposing gates. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53019}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43680}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43681}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43682}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30723}{0}{}{Tanglefoot Lane (e,w)}{ }{Tanglefoot lane narrows slightly, encroached upon by the mass of trees on both sides.  The Great Rump Forest continues to swallow the lane as it winds into the country to the east.  The trees thin slightly to the west, towards where most of Cowville town lies, though there is still a lot of foliage to be seen.  The soft sound of birds in the trees bordering the road mixes with shouts that come from the southwest. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30721}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30724}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30724}{0}{}{Tanglefoot Lane (w,ne)}{ }{The forest closes in around the road, the trees on either side arching overhead to almost meet in the middle.  The road changes from Tanglefoot lane to Tranquil Line, which leads deeper into the forest.  There is a feeling of unease lying over the forest, though it takes a few moments to notice what gives that impression.  The forest is completely, totally silent. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30723}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30724}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30725}{4104}{}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {30708}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30755}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30726}{0}{}{Halfway along Church Street (n,s,e,w)}{ }{Church Street narrows, passing between two buildings set amongst the trees.  On the western side of the street, a shabby-looking building with blacked-out windows squats, whereas on the eastern side, a whitewashed store looks much more inviting.  The cobblestones underfoot stretch out north and south, as Church Street continues. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30707}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30748}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30749}{e}{open east door;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30750}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30727}{0}{}{Before a hidden structure in the trees (w)}{ }{Hidden away amidst the trees, an ancient stone archway stands revealed by a recently fallen tree.  Moss encroaches on the lower stones of the arch, suggesting that perhaps the structure has been in place even longer than the trees surrounding it.  There are several worn runes carved into either side of the archway, their meaning lost in the mists of time. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30707}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43696}{trace rune}{trace rune}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30728}{0}{}{Before a church (w,e)}{ }{Standing before you in a clearing amongst the trees is a majestic building,  constructed from massive stone blocks.  It rises above the tree tops, topped with a towering spire.  The arched doors at the top of three steps stand open, allowing entry.  Opposite the entryway is a path that leads back into the trees of Church Street. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30707}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30738}{w}{climb step one;climb step 2;climb step 3;w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30730}{n s w e}{n s w e}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30729}{0}{}{Inside a church (n,s,w,e)}{ }{Standing just inside the large, arched doorway of the church with two huge staircases disappearing upwards to the north and south. A smaller doorway leads into the church proper to the west.  The building is quiet, with only the occasional the sound of shuffling feet bouncing around. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30738}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30739}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30740}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30733}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30730}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {30731}{0}{}{Halfway up the northern stairs (s,w)}{ }{A small, triangular platform forms where the stairs turn and continue up to a balcony in the west.  At the base of the stairs the entrance to the church can be seen standing open, where an arch of sunlight manages to penetrate the church. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30739}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30734}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30732}{0}{}{Near the back of the church pews (n)}{ }{The hard, wooden pews stretch out towards the front of the church to the west, where the large black and white altar can just be made out.  Curving ever so slightly overhead is the southern wall of the church, bending inwards to eventually meet the northern wall in an arched ceiling. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30740}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43973}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30733}{0}{}{Inside a church (n,s,w,e)}{ }{The eastern end of the huge church, with deep rows of wooden pew lining the sides of the church to the north and south, and a few scattered cows deep in prayer sitting on them.  Stretching high above, the stone walls of the church are broken by a balcony about half way up, where brief flashes of movement can be seen.  To the west, the church continues, culminating in a spectacular altar far off to the west. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30729}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30741}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30742}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30743}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30734}{0}{}{On a balcony in a church (e,w)}{ }{The narrow balcony leads around the wall towards the front of the church.  Large stone stairs descend to the east, leading back down to the church entrance.  A railing is in place to stop any over-enthusiastic churchgoers from hurling themselves off the balcony, but it leaves plenty of room to view the church below. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30731}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30735}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30735}{0}{}{A balcony (e,w)}{ }{The balcony continues east and west, framed by the sturdy railing to stop cows falling to the church below.  Hoof-falls echo loudly around the church, but it is almost impossible to tell where they originate from in such a large space. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30734}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30736}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30736}{0}{}{Near the end of the balcony (e,sw)}{ }{The balcony comes to an end just to the southwest, where there should be a much better view of the altar.  Peering over the railing, the altar is blocked from view by the way the walls curve in, framing it at the front of the church.  From the looks of it, there is a large tapestry adorning the wall at the end of the balcony, but what it depicts cannot be seen. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30735}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30737}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30737}{0}{}{The end of a balcony (ne)}{ }{The balcony ends at a railing, overlooking the black and white hoof-shaped altar at the front of the church.  The large stained-glass window that serves as an impressive backdrop to the altar extends up above the balcony, taking up the whole front wall of the church.  There is an ornate tapestry hanging on the wall of the balcony, depicting some kind of battle. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30736}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30738}{4104}{}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {30729}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
