R {30764}{0}{}{Front of the warehouse (s,n)}{ }{The warehouse is filled with shelving units that reach up to the high ceiling and run down the length of the building.  Stacked within these steel confines are cardboard boxes and wooden packing crates.  Above all these are tubes upon tubes of fluorescent lights that buzz with electricity. }{Cowville Moofia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30758}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30765}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30765}{0}{}{Back of the warehouse (sw,n)}{ }{The rear of the warehouse plays host to the tail ends of the steel shelving, on which are stored fewer boxes and crates.  A small portion in the corner has been partitioned off for an office, complete with a couple of windows covered in blinds.  On the back wall is a sign stating that the painted square below it is for forklift parking only. }{Cowville Moofia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30764}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
