R {30767}{0}{}{warehouse office (ne)}{ }{A paper-strewn desk faces the doorway and almost fills the entire office.  Despite the cramped conditions, there is just enough room for the filing cabinet, which obviously gets little use, and the water cooler, to sit side by side on the back wall.  The monotonous hum of an air conditioner is the only sound, proving the partitioned walls are well soundproofed from external noises. }{Cowville Moofia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30765}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30768}{0}{}{A hushed graveyard (w,se)}{ }{Bare earth, devoid of grass or shrubs, makes up the graveyard, as if even the plants have been laid to rest.  Most of the graves are marked with simple stone headstones, carved into the shape of an upturned hoof, and engraved with the details of the deceased.  A number of recently filled graves are scattered around, as if there had been a number of deaths lately. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30753}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30769}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30769}{0}{}{A quiet graveyard (nw,ne,e,w)}{ }{Every few feet, a large tombstone marks a more important grave.  In the distance to the northwest, a large tomb can be seen, dark against the sky.  Most of the graves are marked with simple stone headstones, carved into the shape of an upturned hoof, and engraved with the details of the deceased. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
