R {30780}{0}{}{A chaotic cowhouse (exit)}{ }{Constructed in the typical one room style of most cowhouses, the house is filled to overflowing with beakers, bottles, flasks and cabinets of all shapes and sizes.  There seems to be no sense of order at all, and many of the liquids in the various containers are leaking out or bubbling over.  Several large, black patches cover the ceiling, most likely caused by overly excited particles being released too quickly, and the hay on the floor is clotted with all kinds of gunk. }{Northern CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30717}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30717}{s}{exit}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30781}{0}{<238>}{A cliff-side ledge (leave)}{<238>^<228>L<238>^<088>}{The sun shines brightly, sending golden rays of sunlight down upon this deep chasm ledge.  The rickety bridge attached to the cliff-sides sways back and forth, casting its shadow down across the ledge.  Tall bushy shrubs grow along the west wall, clinging tenuously to life.  The legendary Balooga River's icy depth roars loadly as it slams against the chasm walls, sending misty vapors up into the fissure's atmosphere. Not much else is of notice or importance upon this ledge. }{Seal}{seal}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1497}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30782}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30782}{n}{enter}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30782}{0}{<248>}{Crevice fissure (n,out)}{<248>%<138>O<248>%<088>}{The bland gray walls of this mountain fissure are unbelievably smooth to the touch. Carved within the walls are ancient runes of warding. Dimly gleaming, they appear to absorb the brilliance of your light source. Dancing shadows are cast about the room, encompassing everything within this fissure of gloom. The dead silence and undertone of barely contained evil seep into the recesses of your soul, impressing upon your mind a sense of danger and cryptic evil. The rays of sunlight shining into the crevice's entrance try in vain to penetrate this dark abode. }{Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30783}{n}{n;say incantation}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30781}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30781}{s}{out}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30783}{0}{<248>}{Mystic seal (s)}{<248>% %<088>}{Light sparkles off the giant matrix of blue crystal merged within the northern wall.  Pulsing with arcane energy, the crystals radiate a blue aura, which sends a bright magical light across the surface of the rune-covered stone of this fissure. Carved upon the bland gray walls, the mystic runes appear to have some odd effect upon the unnatural darkness located within this room.  An eeriness engulfs this strange place, perhaps caused by a combination of the silence, animated shadows, unnatural darkness, warding runes and the heart-like beats of the arcane matrix. }{Seal}{arlane}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30782}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {31754}{touch matrix}{touch matrix}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {31754}{n}{touch matrix}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30784}{0}{}{A flowing, shimmering cave (enter,out)}{ }{Forces of incredible magnitude smash and crush against the invisible barriers of this room, filling the area with a deafening roaring sound, and shaking it like no earthquake could ever hope to.  You are in the eye of the storm, a small place in the chaos of the universe where there is no time, where there is no direction, where you can feel the light, see the sound, and hear the feelings.  Spinning gently before you is a tremendous pool of protoplasm, its translucent depths beckoning to you. }{Changeling}{changeling}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30785}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30785}{0}{<238>}{An undulating pool of protoplasm (downward,surface,outward)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{Here at the centre, you are more aware of the gentle spin of the pool the chaotic flows and eddies of the greeny-yellow protoplasm swirling in a clockwise direction around you.  Distances and time appear to have little meaning here, the only spatial sense you have is how deep, or how far out into the pool you are.  Light seems to come from all around you, its intensity and colour changing randomly, producing a soothing, hypnotic effect.  Feelings of peace and contentedness flow into you here, this being the place of your birth, and also a place where you know you are safe and welcome without a doubt. There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Changeling}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
