R {30786}{0}{<238>}{A sea of protoplasm (downward,outward,upward)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{Dim, directionless light illuminates the pool, allowing you to see your chaotic surroundings. Chaotic flows of protoplasm whirl around you, or perhaps it is you that is moving while the protoplasm remains stationary, it is hard to be certain.  Thick bands of colour, all shades of yellow and greens can be seen within the flows. The protoplasm is silent as it flows around in the pool, the only sounds being those of foreign origins.  Fluctuating in volume, clarity and coherency, they are chaotic, yet soothing.  }{Changeling}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30785}{upward}{upward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
