R {30787}{0}{<238>}{Floating in protoplasm (downward,outward,inward)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{Spiralling around you, the protoplasm forms bands of greens and yellows which appear to glow in the dim, strange light.  At times you feel like you are moving, but a glance to the centre of the pool where you can see the patterns orbiting, shows you that it's only your imagination. The protoplasm is silent as it flows around in the pool, the only sounds being those of foreign origins.  Fluctuating in volume, clarity and coherency, they are chaotic, yet soothing. The light which illuminates the pool appears to fluctuate erratically, both in intensity and colour.  }{Changeling}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
