R {30808}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (se,nw)}{<278> +-<088>}{The dense forest to the north and east comes almost to the road, with white stone homes and buildings choked with trees and thick vines barely holding it at bay.  To the south, more open parkland dotted with ruined buildings indicates that this was once an affluent part of the city.  A small dirt path leads off to the northeast.  By the road, large houses and buildings in serious disrepair hide both treasures beyond the imagination and unimaginable death.  It is difficult to see approaching danger, as taller grasses obscure the approaches to the lower buildings. A small movement in some shrubs in the distance catches your eye.  You pause in the middle of the road and wish you could just disappear into the cracked bricks and hide.  If you wait out here in the open much longer your wish may come true. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{murus_faralain2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
