R {30809}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (nw,e)}{<278> +-<088>}{It is unnerving, as small creeping vines and grasses run over the buildings.  Just off to the sides of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.  The ancient worn pavers of this road lead you through this abandoned city of the elves.  Sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago, only the foolhardy explore here.  The dense forest to the northeast comes almost to the road, with white stone homes and buildings choked with trees and thick vines barely holding it at bay.  To the south, more  Inix     Uptime: 3.5 days  Reboot: 6.1 days  Lag: 0.00  Idle: [00:00:01]   open parkland dotted with ruined buildings indicates that this was once an affluent part of the city.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
