R {30810}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (se,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{You watch the high towers in the distance for signs of predators as you proceed cautiously down this road made of loose bricks.  The dense forest to the northeast comes almost to the road, with white stone homes and buildings choked with trees and thick vines barely holding it at bay.  To the south, more open parkland dotted with ruined buildings indicates that this was once an affluent part of the city.  It is unsettling, as huge vines and leafy shrubs seem to crawl out of and obscure the openings in the buildings.  To the sides of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
