R {30811}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (nw,e)}{<278> +-<088>}{The dense forest to the northeast comes almost to the road, with white stone homes and buildings choked with trees and thick vines barely holding it at bay.  To the northwest is a bridge, while directly west, ruined buildings stand on the high banks above a stream.  As you make your way down this road you notice that the cracked bricks shows some signs of recent traffic. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
