R {30812}{0}{<238>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Bridge *\x7D=- (se,w)}{<238>===<088>}{On either side of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact wait quietly for you to explore.  It is very quiet.  Small weeds poke through the steps, stairs and ornamentation of the ruined buildings.  You stand on the ruins of a once magnificent white stone bridge.  Through holes in the ivy covered balustrades you see a stream flows north-south under it. The dense forest to the northeast comes almost to the bridge, while the stream flows off to the south through more open parkland dotted with ruined and abandoned buildings.  The road, made of bricks, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
