R {30814}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Darthil Street *\x7D=- (sw,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{Stepping quietly on the uneven flagstones of this street you listen for signs of life and hardly surprisingly, you detect none at all.  Any living thing with any common sense avoids this place.  On either side of the street, bigger buildings that are almost intact wait quietly for you to explore.  It is frighteningly silent.  There are not even any birds in the small trees that have taken root in and around the foundations of the buildings.  The street runs roughly north-south following a stream to the east, and bordering the more heavily populated (and ruined) sections of Murus Faralain.  This street was once the site of numerous homes and houses of the founding families of elves.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
