R {30867}{0}{<278>}{The base of an ancient stairwell (u,e)}{<278>.@.<088>}{Wracked by the massive explosions that ripped through the city in its final moments, the ceiling at the base of these stone steps has partially caved in, blocking the passageway with a large mound of debris. It seems that tomb robbers have at some time in the past tunneled just enough of  the debris to allow you to crawl further into the crypt. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
