R {30868}{0}{<268>}{A dark corridor (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{As your footsteps echo softly off the stone floor, you find yourself  glancing nervously about this darkened corridor. Your eyes constantly  roving from the carvings on the walls to the stone flagstones beneath  your feet. Something, somewhere in the back of your mind is telling you it shouldn't be this easy to get into an elven family crypt. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
