R {30869}{0}{<268>}{A dark corridor (e,w)}{<268>[<138>J<268>]<088>}{It seems your worst fears have been confirmed, for protruding from the walls just a little north of you are two sets of wickedly sharp spikes, their metal spear points gleaming in your light. If you're careful and  don't do anything truly stupid you should be able to walk past them and progress further into the crypt. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
