R {30870}{0}{<248>}{A spike-filled pit}{<248># #<088>}{Glancing around, the room you shiver with a slight sense of apprehension  as you stare at the rows of wickedly sharp spikes filling the bottom  of this pit.  Just looking around you are overwhelmed by a sense of joy  and relief that you are able to still look around and that you haven't  become just another corpse impaled upon the spikes.  }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30869}{climb out}{climb out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30871}{0}{<268>}{The Hall of Farewells (w,e,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Your footsteps echo softly off a large mosaic covered floor. You  find yourself looking around in awe at this large vaulted room,  which is supported by four massive stone pillars. Each pillar is  delicately carved to resemble a giant oak tree. Perhaps this is  where the elves held their funeral ceremonies for their departed  kinsmen, before interring them in the crypts beyond. As if to echo  this, you find yourself staring into the jaws of two beautifully  carved stone dragon heads that flank the eastern doorway.  }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30869}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
