R {30872}{0}{<278>}{At top of the steps (w,d)}{<278>.@.<088>}{A set of ancient stone steps lead down from an archway in the back wall of this small ante-chamber, down into the darkness and the  lower levels of the crypt.  Faded paintings of elves cover this  chamber's walls. Perhaps at last you have found the entrance to  the undercrypt, the final resting place of the elven house's greatest leaders and heroes. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30871}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30881}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30873}{0}{<248>}{A collapsed chamber (s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{Whatever the cause, the ceiling in this burial chamber is collapsed, burying the far end of the room under many tons of rubble. Who knows what riches lie beneath the rubble. What little remains of this chamber is perfect, from the elegant runes describing past glories of this elven family, to the uncounted gems that reflect beams of light back at you. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30871}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30874}{0}{<268>}{A silent corridor (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Monstrous shadows of imaginary creatures created by your light  seem to leap out at you as you progress slowly along this corridor. Examining everything as if your life depended on it, you inch your way slowly but surely along the corridor's walls towards what looks like another large chamber. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30871}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30875}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30875}{0}{<248>}{A silent burial chamber (e,w,n,s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{The sound of your footsteps on the marble floor echo around this large burial chamber.  Glancing around, your eyes move over the large granite  sarcophagi arrayed throughout the room. Flickering shadows dance off the walls of the chamber, creating shadowy forms that seem to take on the  shape of ancient elven warriors, once more in battle defending their proud city. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30874}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30876}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30877}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30878}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30876}{0}{<248>}{A silent burial chamber (w,s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{There is a definite chill in the air here, causing the hair on the back of your neck to stand on end. Shivering slightly you get the distinct impression you're being watched from the pools of shadow that seem to haunt your vision here. Whirling around, you survey the area only to find it exactly the same as before. Feeling more than a little sorry for your actions in this crypt so far, you begin to start to wonder if staying in this crypt is such a good idea. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30875}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30880}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30877}{0}{<248>}{A silent burial chamber (e,s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{In this, the far corner of the burial chamber, you feel yourself compelled to stop a moment and run your hands over one of the smooth stone sarcophagi resting in this chamber.  Touching the  stone lid, you feel a deep sense of sorrow well up at the thought of these elves remaining buried down here in this dark place away from the sunlight they loved so much.  }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30875}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30879}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30878}{0}{<248>}{A silent burial chamber (e,w,n)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{A quiet hush seems to have settled over this section of the chamber creating a solemn air of reverence, you seem unwilling to break lest you offend the spirits of the dead entombed within the nearby sarcophagi. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30875}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30879}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30880}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30879}{0}{<248>}{A silent burial chamber (e,n)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{In this, the southwestern corner of the burial chamber, something  doesn't feel right. It feels like you are being watched or maybe  it's the way shadows seem to move at the edge of light. Either way,  with all these sarcophagi resting silently here, it's starting to  give you the creeps.  }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30877}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30878}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30880}{0}{<248>}{A silent burial chamber (w,n)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{Silent and empty, this quiet corner of this chamber holds none of the stone sarcophagi scattered around the rest of this chamber. Perhaps the great tragedy that befell this once great city prevented the elves from burying their dead here, or perhaps this elven clan simply ran out of family members. Either way, you pause a moment in silent reflection, offering a quick prayer for these long dead elves. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30878}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30876}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30881}{0}{<278>}{At the bottom of the steps (e,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{Here in the undercrypts, the air seems much colder than it did before everything seems full of menace. Deep dark shadows seem cling to the edge of your vision, whilst the glow of your light reflected back from the faces of elven warriors painted on the walls give you the distinct feeling of being watched. More now than ever you have the feeling, that you don't belong here. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30872}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30882}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30882}{0}{<268>}{Before an ancient door (w,enter)}{<268>[<108>E<268>]<088>}{The glow of your light rebounds off a large closed metallic door that is  bordered by some sort of runic inscription. Convinced that this is the  last guardian of this crypt, you can almost smell the riches on the other side of the door. Eagerly looking for any mechanism to open the door, only a stone basin, a metal plaque and a carved stone head above the door seem to be out of the ordinary here. Pausing a moment you think, maybe I have been here too long. The door is probably not even locked, but then again... }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30881}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30883}{enter}{get dagger;cut hand;enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30883}{0}{<268>}{The hall of ancients (out,e,n,s)}{<268>[<108>O<268>]<088>}{Glancing around the chamber you find it hard to believe your eyes,  for scattered throughout this immaculately maintained room are five  large sarcophagi, each beautifully constructed from various materials.  Everything, from the marble floor to the mithril sconces on the carved  walls, speaks of untold riches and a proud elven heritage that was  Myth Drannor. Sheer wealth aside, there is an almost tangible feeling  of reverence mixed with an aura of timelessness here, something that  perhaps only a fool would seek to disturb.  }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30882}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30884}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30885}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30886}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30884}{0}{<248>}{The hall of ancients (w,n,s)}{<248>.<128>K<178>+<088>}{The torches have dimmed ever so slightly in this area allowing the occasional shadow to creep into this otherwise brightly lit chamber. This decrease in light only enhances the emerald sarcophagus regally resting nearby, causing it to catch and trap the light, giving it a serene almost magical look. Set against the backdrop of the carved walls, this scene seems so deeply sad and haunting, the last glimpse of a long destroyed city perhaps. }{Symbearn Crypt}{kathaelis2}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30883}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30887}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30888}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30885}{0}{<248>}{The hall of ancients (e,s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{The torches reflecting off the white marble brighten this section of the chamber, illuminating it in an almost pure white light. Glancing around at the intricately carved walls and polished marble floor, you are struck by an ominous thought, ancient tombs, shouldn't they be dusty and dark, not clean and well lit? }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30883}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30887}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30886}{0}{<248>}{The hall of ancients (e,n)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{Gently reflecting off the surface of a large golden sarcophagus, a soft golden glow is shed by your torch light, creating the impression of  immeasurable wealth. Perhaps this is where some of the legendary treasure was hidden when this once proud city was destroyed, or perhaps it is just the remains of once majestic but now dying race. }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30883}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30888}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30887}{0}{<248>}{The hall of ancients (s,w)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{Standing quietly in the northeastern corner of the chamber you are struck by the utter silence of this place.  Everything, from the carvings on the walls to the mithril sconces that light the chamber, lend an air of timelessness, as if the passing of the  last elf from this chamber was merely a few moments ago.  }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30885}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30884}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30888}{0}{<248>}{The hall of ancients (w,n)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{Standing silently in the southeastern corner of the chamber is a  massive obsidian sarcophagus. Intrigued by the way the light from  the wall-mounted torches reflect off its shiny surface, you find  yourself gazing into the sarcophagus's endless black depths. Barely able to draw your eyes away you glance around this area amazed by  the workmanship and exquisite beauty.  }{Symbearn Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30886}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30884}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30889}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (n,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{The forest comes almost to the road here, held back only by the dense stone warehouses and other stone buildings.  Just off the road, larger edifices and shops that are mostly intact wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is unsettling, as huge vines and leafy shrubs seem to crawl out of and obscure the openings in the buildings.  You watch the high towers in the distance for signs of predators as you proceed cautiously down this road made of cracked bricks. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30854}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30890}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30890}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (sw,n)}{<278>- -<088>}{The forest comes almost to the road here, held back only by the dense stone warehouses and other stone buildings.  The ancient worn bricks of this road lead you through this abandoned city of the elves.  Sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago, only the foolhardy explore here.  It is frighteningly silent.  There are not even any birds in the small trees that have taken root in and around the foundations of the buildings.  Just off to the sides of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30889}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30891}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {30891}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (ne,s,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{To the west, a green field that was once a park is bordered by the encroaching forest, while on either side of the street here are ruined and abandoned hotels, inns, restaurants and other buildings of the hospitality trade.  On either side of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact wait quietly for you to explore.  It is impossible to check the houses at a distance, as thick shrubs obscure the entrances, windows and holes of buildings. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30890}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
