R {30892}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (n,s,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{The road, made of pavers, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  To the west, a green field that was once a park is bordered by the encroaching forest, while on either side of the street here are ruined and abandoned hotels, inns, restaurants and other buildings of the hospitality trade.  It is frighteningly silent.  There are not even any birds in the small trees that have taken root in and around the foundations of the buildings.  To the sides of the road, multi-story buildings and offices with some holes in their roofs pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
