R {30995}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The fragments and detritus of blasted buildings lies to the north while to the south, old stone buildings hold the encroaching forest back from the road (barely).  It is difficult to see approaching danger, as taller grasses obscure the approaches to the lower buildings.  To the sides of the road, small homes and shops that are mostly intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.  A small movement in some shrubs in the distance catches your eye.  You pause in the middle of the road and wish you could just disappear into the worn bricks and hide.  If you wait out here in the open much longer your wish may come true. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
