R {30998}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Tarin's Ride *\x7D=- (sw,ne)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{To the south, old stone buildings hold the encroaching forest back from the road (barely).  The ancient loose bricks of this road lead you through this abandoned city of the elves.  Sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago, only the foolhardy explore here.  It is difficult to see approaching danger, as taller grasses obscure the approaches to the lower buildings.  Just off to the sides of the road, multi-story buildings and offices with some holes in their roofs pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
