R {31004}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Darthil Street *\x7D=- (ne,s)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{The street runs roughly north-south following a stream to the east, and bordering the more heavily populated (and ruined) sections of Murus Faralain.  This street was once the site of numerous homes and houses of the founding families of elves.  The rubble of several of them lie to the west, while to the south is a broader concourse.  On either side of the street, smaller buildings amongst the rubble wait quietly for you to explore.  It is like a weird park, where small trees and shrubs can be seen growing inside some of the long abandoned buildings.  Stepping quietly on the cracked and rutted flagstones of this street you listen for signs of life and hardly surprisingly, you detect none at all.  Any living thing with any common sense avoids this place. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
