R {31041}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (se,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{Strolling quietly down this road, you pause to examine the roadbed of smooth bricks.  The dense forest to the northeast comes almost to the road, with white stone homes and buildings choked with trees and thick vines barely holding it at bay.  To the south, more open parkland dotted with ruined buildings indicates that this was once an affluent part of the city.  On either side of the road, multi-story buildings and offices with some holes in their roofs wait quietly for you to explore.  It is very quiet.  Small weeds poke through the steps, stairs and ornamentation of the ruined buildings. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
