R {31075}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Blazen Street *\x7D=- (sw,n)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{It is very quiet.  Small weeds poke through the steps, stairs and ornamentation of the ruined buildings.  To the sides of the narrow street, large houses and buildings in serious disrepair pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.  Once home to the more affluent of mages and merchants, this street proceeds in a north-south direction through overgrown parkland with largely intact buildings on either side of the street.  The ancient cobbles of this narrow street lead you through this abandoned city of the elves.  Sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago, only the foolhardy explore here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
