R {31079}{0}{<238>}{II_iII The Six Tyryl Towers II_iII (w)}{<238>] [<088>}{This once vast building was largely destroyed in the downfall of Murus Faralain, when the apprentice wizards who dwelt here fought against the army of evil and met a brutal end.  The two western-most towers still stand but are separated from the eastern towers by devastation\; the centre of the building was blown apart in the final battle of the city.  At the time of the battle, the Six Tyryl Towers was a newly-established school of wizardry. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
