R {31097}{0}{<278>}{<|> Dark Hall <|> (n,u)}{<278>< ><088>}{As you examine the walls, you notice that the damp dust of ages has not been disturbed.  You stand in the southern end of a long hallway, with a high vaulted ceiling.  The supporting arches are anchored by two rows of smooth cut granite pillars.  At the southern-most end of the hallway you see hand and foot-holds carved into the wall, and proceeding up into a dark shaft.  From the shaft, mineral rich water trickles onto the floor, creating a mineral stain on the floor.  The almost featureless hallway was cut through the gray marl beneath the city.   }{Faunist Guild 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
