R {31196}{0}{<148>}{|__| Dark Pool |__| (e,w,n,nw,ne)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{Trailing weeds in the waters below you snag your legs and slow your progress.   You wonder if they don't hide some lurking aquatic horror.  You scan the pool looking for a way out.  The wall to the south provides no avenue for escape from the pool.  As you relieve yourself, you notice that the waters around you get suddenly warmer and momentarily go bright orange (how embarrassing).  The good news is that it now smells more like urine than fish around you.   }{Faunist Guild 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
