R {31242}{0}{<238>}{-(v)- Central Council Chamber -(v)- (sw,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the centre of the great chamber of the Faunists.  All around you the table arcs, and you imagine the chamber filled with the leaders of the guild as you present your case for some brave and expensive expedition to capture one of the rarities of the animal kingdom.  This must have been a wonderful place to study 600 years ago.  Great decisions and great arguments once filled this grand chamber.  Looking at the huge table, it is not too difficult to imagine that the decorum was occasionally broken by guild members pounding on it to make a stronger case.  The walls of the chamber are smooth, but clearly this place, like all the other rooms of the guild, were carved out of the marl beneath Murus Faralain.   }{Faunist Guild 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
