R {31388}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (sw,nw,e)}{<278> +-<088>}{The concourse proceeds off to the northwest while southwest is Flaxen's Ride.  The road, made of worn pavers, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  It is hard to detect advancing foes, as low shrubs dot the landscape and choke the openings.  To the sides of the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
