R {31389}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (se,n,w)}{<278>-+ <088>}{Strolling quietly down this road, you pause to examine the roadbed of cracked bricks.  The dense forest to the northeast comes almost to the road, with white stone homes and buildings choked with trees and thick vines barely holding it at bay.  To the south, more open parkland dotted with ruined buildings indicates that this was once an affluent part of the city.  It is mostly clear of vegetation.  To the sides of the road, large houses and buildings in serious disrepair pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
