R {31390}{0}{<278>}{-=\x7B* Torchstroll Way *\x7D=- (s,w,e)}{<278>-+-<088>}{It is frighteningly silent.  There are not even any birds in the small trees that have taken root in and around the foundations of the buildings.  To the sides of the road, grander buildings in disrepair amongst the rubble pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.  Strolling quietly down this road, you pause to examine the roadbed of pavers.  This paved road connects the ruins of the more fortified southeast end of Murus Faralain to the more open and consequently devastated central part of the city.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
