R {31409}{0}{}{-=\x7B* The Street of Song *\x7D=- (nw)}{ }{By the road, bigger buildings that are almost intact hide both treasures beyond the imagination and unimaginable death.  It is frighteningly silent.  There are not even any birds in the small trees that have taken root in and around the foundations of the buildings.  The road, made of smooth bricks, was first constructed by the elves and their human companions over 1000 years ago, and was destroyed over 600 years ago.  At the southeast end of Murus Faralain, you look to the north and west and see a city in ruin.  You recall the warnings of the many perils to be found in Murus Faralain and your heart misses a beat.  Then you recall the legendary wealth that is said to be hidden in its ruins and you proceed onwards over the rubble filled street.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
