R {31467}{0}{<278>}{<|> Dark Hall <|> (n,u)}{<278>< ><088>}{Small patches of iridescent moss grow on the walls, and while they seem to glow somewhat they afford no light strong enough to explore by.  You stand in the southern end of a long hallway, with a high vaulted ceiling.  The supporting arches are anchored by two rows of smooth cut granite pillars.  At the southern-most end of the hallway you see hand and foot-holds carved into the wall, and proceeding up into a dark shaft.  From the shaft, mineral rich water trickles onto the floor, creating a mineral stain on the floor.  The dark hallway was cut out of the native gray marl beneath the ruined guild hall.   }{Faunist Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
