R {31821}{0}{<278>}{Ascending tunnel (u,d)}{<278>< ><088>}{The steep slant of this passage levels out slightly, making it seem mildly less onerous to traverse.  Ancient sigils are carved into the stone walls.  Their combined synchronized bursts of radiance stab into and partly disrupt the gathering gloom.  The stale air is both thin and musty, making deep breaths necessary for those forced to physically ascend the ramp.  Humming emits from the rune-marked walls as they build energy, causing your entire body to vibrate. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
