R {31822}{0}{<278>}{Ascending tunnel (u,d)}{<278>< ><088>}{Darkness shrouds this place so completely that you are cocooned by it\; even then, only the flares of the rune-marked walls prevent it from swallowing you entirely.  Ascending endlessly into darkness, the passage slants upward so much that scaling it is both dangerous and tiring.  The mist created by exhaling is a testament to the cool temperature.  The scent of the musty air is stale, but not gaggingly unpleasant. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
