R {31826}{0}{<278>}{Ascending tunnel (u,d)}{<278>< ><088>}{Bland gray stone composes the circular confines of this wide tunnel, which ascends steeply enough to tire even the most robust.  The temperature is so cool that it causes mist to billow forth with each exhalation of breath\; to make matters worse, the air is stale and thin, making physically scaling the passage even more tiring.  Dancing shadows skid and flit around the flickering radius of your light source, only to be annihilated by the warding runes' flaring milliseconds later. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
