R {31827}{0}{<278>}{Ascending tunnel (u,d)}{<278>< ><088>}{Murky darkness is entangled here so thickly that it cocoons you in a shroud of gloom.  It does such a superb job at concealment that sight is inhibited beyond a few yards.  Slanting up at a fairly steep angle, this circular tunnel twists itself level, then continues onward with only a mild ascent.  The air is chill and musty, but not entirely unpleasant to smell. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
