R {31828}{0}{<278>}{Ascending tunnel (u,d)}{<278>< ><088>}{As it curves north, the tunnel once again levels out, but then within a matter of feet it begins ascending again.  Shrouding you in gloom, inky darkness gathers so thickly that it consumes light almost as fast as your light source can provide it.  Carved into the dull gray stone walls are mystic sigils.  They hum as they gather energy, making the open space vibrate, then release it in bursts of radiance.  Fortunately while it is cool here, the temperature is not so low as to allow freezing.  Although there is a small trace of a tantalizing but indistinguishable scent in the air, it still smells musty and stale.  Wisps of mist drift down the tunnel from above. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
