R {31842}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (e)}{<238>] [<088>}{At odds with the connecting passage, this recess is rough and misshapen, although runes of warding still adorn its walls.  A small pool of putrid water gathers below a massive stalactite of gray stone, from which droplets of highly mineralized water occasionally drip.  Littering the side of the western wall, an assorted collection of pebbles, rocks and small boulders appears to have been gathered into a pile.  The sense of highly concentrated magic is in the air, and for some reason, unrelated or not, the shadows do not seem to gather so strongly here. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
