R {31850}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (sw,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{Curving sharply to the east, this tunnel narrows slightly only to expand outward to nearly double its original width a few yards later.  As you cast the illumination from your light source about the passage, you see a familiar picture emerge from the cloak of inky shadow.  Smooth grey stone composes the entire passage's circular width, while glowing sigils are carved in parallel rows across the walls on the both left and right.  It is mostly your sixth sense that registers what's different about this spot.  Some places seem almost natural, while others possess the lurking presence of an evil, demonic intelligence. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
