R {31854}{0}{<248>}{Holy Chamber (w)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{Shaped into a perfect triangle, this room is formed out of a gleaming white stone.  Gleaming faintly, the mystic sigils that pulse so brightly elsewhere instead emit a constant gentle glow.  A large sarcophagus is embedded within the floor in the center of this chamber.  It gives the sense of being untouched for decades.  The sarcophagus is inscribed with rows of carefully carved text - an epitaph, perhaps.  Consecrated to the forces of light, this place exudes a feeling of tranquility, relaying a hint to the holy forces at work here.  Divine radiance pours out into the western passage, keeping the lingering twilight and its gloom far at bay. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
