R {31855}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (se,nw)}{<238>] [<088>}{The circular confines of this passage constrict to nearly half their original width, although it is still spacious enough to allow several men to walk abreast.  Carved into either side of the otherwise smooth, bland, gray stone walls are runes of warding from which arcane energy flares in a rhythm that disturbingly imitates a beating heart.  Shadows dance between the border of your light source's illumination and the murky gloom, their inky embrace nearly swallowing you between each of the runes' flaring pulses. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
