R {31860}{0}{<278>}{Strange Tunnel (d,u,n,s)}{<278>< ><088>}{You've emerged at the crossing of two tunnels here.  One plunges steeply downward\; another climbs upward from here to a higher floor.  The second runs north and south from here.  Like most of the other passageways you have traveled in this place, it is circular and made of smooth gray stone, dark, cold, and bedecked with pulsing red runes of warding.  Your head throbs with the energy released by the bursts of light from the runes. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
