R {31861}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (e,sw)}{<238>] [<088>}{Continuing its steep incline, this passage angles upward at roughly an eighty percent grade, making it a both onerous and dangerous route.  Ancient runes of warding are imprinted across the otherwise smooth walls.  Their combined arcane might barely disrupts the unnatural darkness that dominates this place.  An eerie presence can be felt here, ever watchful, its demonic taint seeming to build the further to the east you travel.  A small, square passage cuts north here.  A flickering image of a tunnel wall seems to be attempting vainly to impose itself over the opening to the passage. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
