R {31866}{0}{<238>}{Ascending tunnel (n,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{Curving sharply eastward, this tunnel's already steep angle ascends yet further, becoming a mild obstacle for those forced to pace its slope.  Circular, yet wide enough to allow level footing, the passage is free of natural obstructions.  With the exception of the glowing sigils etched into them, the walls are smooth and the stone floor is gently roughened.  Shadows swarm forward between each pulse of the warding runes, only to be banished once more by the combined strength of your illumination and the runes' synchronized flaring. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
