R {31868}{0}{<238>}{Circular passage (ne,archway)}{<238>(<178>A<238>)<088>}{Bland gray stone forms the spacious passage of this circular tunnel.  Its steep ascending incline ends shortly before an archway of gleaming white stone.  Darkness clouds this area thickly, its gloomy mass constricting the ever-flickering luminance of your light source.  The runes of warding etched into the walls flare in a synchronized unison, each of their pulses releasing a burst of energy partially disrupting the inky gloom.  A field of energy encompasses the arch, concealing, if not barricading, whatever lies beyond the opening. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
