R {31869}{0}{}{Tranquil copse (distortion,archway)}{<238>(<178>A<238>)<088>}{Knee high grass sprouts all around you, blanketing the ground in a lush dark green sea.  Impossibly, a golden sun hangs at the apex of the thinly clouded sky, showering the area with rays of warming illumination.  Giant pine trees surround this small clearing, their rough barky exteriors forming a seemingly impassable barricade.  Rooted into the precise center of this place is a small copse of oaks, with a leafy apple tree and small spring in their center.  The scent of apple blossoms fragrances the air, highlighting the sense of tranquility this place so easily inspires.  An archway stands near the western border of the clearing, while a fizzing spatial distortion is outlined a dozen steps from it. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
