R {31929}{0}{<248>}{Holy chamber (s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{This perfectly hemispherical chamber is gleaming white.  Its alabaster walls are covered with red warding runes, but they glow more weakly than in the labyrinth outside due to the absence of hungry shadow.  The shadow seems to stop suddenly in the passage to the south, transitioning from inky darkness to bright white light.  In the center of the circular room is a dais of two steps, upon which rests an inscribed white sarcophagus.  The feeling of evil that permeates the labyrinth is noticeably absent in this consecrated place. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31928}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

