R {31939}{0}{<238>}{Dead End (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{From an opening in the north part of the corridor, bright white illumination floods into the passage, fighting back the shadow and creating a thin film of twilight that jumps every time the warding runes flare.  It's very cold, and your head buzzes with the magical energy of the runes.  Somewhere in the darkness to the south, you think you hear the shuffle shuffle of something large moving ponderously down the corridor. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
