R {31940}{0}{<248>}{Holy chamber (s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{This chamber, shaped into a hemisphere with a flat circular floor and a domed ceiling, is gleamingly white.  Its alabaster walls are covered with red warding runes, but they pulse and glow weakly compared with the runes in the dark tunnels nearby.  Atop a dais of two steps is a white sarcophagus, upon which an epitaph has been carefully carved.  Shadow nips at the light at the opening to the southern corridor.  It feels peaceful here, in sharp contrast to the labyrinth. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31939}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {31941}{0}{<238>}{A lonely tower (nexus,u)}{<238>] [<088>}{You're in a capacious circular room in a cold but otherwise cozy tower. The walls are lined with shelves stretching from floor to ceiling. Upon the shelves are books, vials of exotically hued liquid, alchemical apparatuses, ornate wooden chests, tubes of scrolls, skulls of sundry creatures, an assortment of geometric puzzles, and a miscellany of arcane and mundane paraphernalia. Richly hued carpets adorn the flagstone floor. In the center of the room, a wooden door leading into a circular stairwell hangs ajar. A nexus of shimmering energy floats impassively near one wall. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Heliosponte}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
