R {31942}{0}{<238>}{A lonely tower (u,d)}{<238>] [<088>}{Windows are set all around the walls of this circular chamber, looking out at a bizarre landscape. A blue wall, undulating creepily like a fluid membrane, encloses the tower like a bubble. Nothing is visible beyond the aqua-hued membrane. It looks like the edge of existence. Your head hurts just staring at it. The chamber itself is very plain. The floor and ceiling are made of gray stone. There are burn marks visible in places on the floor. A black iron telescope rests on a shaky tripod near one of the windows. A stairwell in the center of the room contains a spiral staircase leading up and down. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Heliosponte}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31941}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {31943}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {31943}{0}{<238>}{A lonely tower (d)}{<238>] [<088>}{The staircase terminates here at a lavish smoking room. Paintings line the walls of the circular chamber. The ceiling is covered with ornate bronze leaf. Most of the floor is covered underneath a thick red carpet. The room is accoutred with a four-poster bed, a number of upholstered couches and chairs, and a stone fireplace inside which a fire roars pleasantly. The eerie blue undulation of the membrane containing this place is visible out a window.  A game is in progress on a marble chess table. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Heliosponte}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31942}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {31944}{0}{<108>}{A cold dark place (east,south,nexus)}{1}{Your mind is buffeted with darkness as you enter the room.  You get a sinking feeling like the floor beneath you is gone and you are falling, but just as suddenly it's gone.  Neither your breath, your body temperature, nor your light manage to drift more then foot or two from you before being consumed by the blackness.  You long to be back in the safety of Pinnacle, where the darkness is banished by the light. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{seal_shadow_prison}{}{}{1.000}{1}
