R {32080}{0}{<278>}{Demonic Plains (w,nexus,n)}{<118>,<158>N<218>`<088>}{A shattered wasteland of red dust and rock stretches to the distant horizon.  The ground is littered with corpses and other detritus of battle.  A shimmering nexus of energy floats in midair here.  It looks over the broken landscape like an emotionless sentinel.  The stale air smells of blood. }{Mystic Seal - Infernal Wasteland of Craxolmx}{craxolmx}{}{}{1.000}{1}
