R {32081}{0}{<218>}{Demonic Plains (e,n)}{<218>` <118>,<088>}{The scattered bones of an enormous beast litter the red dirt of the barren plains.  The skull has been sundered into two pieces by a mighty blow to the forehead, doubtless the killing strike.  Other corpses and debris cover the ground for as far as you can see.  The sky glows with amber light, but you don't see a sun anywhere. }{Mystic Seal - Infernal Wasteland of Craxolmx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
