R {32082}{0}{<218>}{Demonic Plains (w,s)}{<118>^ <218>^<088>}{A large arch of red rock towers over the demonic plains here.  Its bare rock surface is covered with scratches near the ground, and higher by blast marks left by terrible spells.  Corpses are strewn everywhere, filling the hot air with their stench.  Clouds of red dust form a haze that fills the air. }{Mystic Seal - Infernal Wasteland of Craxolmx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
