R {32083}{0}{<218>}{Demonic Plains (e,w,n,s)}{<218>~ .<088>}{You're standing in a barren, demonic wasteland littered with corpses, severed limbs, and piles of rubble.  In the distance, you spot rock cliffs climbing high into the amber sky.  It's hot, sticky, and windless here.  The air is thick with the scent of the blood spilled liberally across the dusty red ground.  You can't imagine anything living in this place of death. }{Mystic Seal - Infernal Wasteland of Craxolmx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
