R {32085}{0}{<218>}{Demonic Plains (w,n,s)}{<218>` <118>,<088>}{A crater mars the flat landscape here.  It's deeper than you are tall, and several times as wide as it is deep.  Dirt is scattered across its sides\; its bottom is solid red rock.  It's unclear if it was created by natural events or an extraordinarily destructive spell.  Given the evidence of warfare scattered over the plains, you'd guess the latter. }{Mystic Seal - Infernal Wasteland of Craxolmx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
