R {32228}{0}{<148>}{Strange Tunnel (n)}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{The corridor ends suddenly here at a tall wall.  Completely covering the wall is an intricate matrix of glowing blue crystals.  The warding runes behind the crystals wink purple as their red luminance filters through the blue matrix.  The crystals buzz with obvious arcane energy that makes your head ache.  To the north, thick shadow swallows the light from your light source.  The steady blue glow of the matrix glints off a sticky mess on the floor.  You look down and suddenly realize it's blood. }{Mystic Seal}{seal_crumblingruins}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32227}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32229}{touch matrix}{touch matrix}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32229}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (n,nexus)}{<178>{<158>N<178>}<088>}{A devastated ruin stretches for miles before you.  To the north, a gently sloping hill is littered with giant fallen stone columns.  A few enormous structures remain standing on the slope.  They loom overhead like mountains.  At the far edge of the slope, the hillside climbs steeply up, up, up into the sky.  Far above, you spot a titanic temple complex atop the mountain.  To the south, a roughly hewn rock cliff rises perhaps half a mile straight up.  The daytime sky is a uniform deep blue, sunless but bright.  An unkempt carpet of green grass covers the hillside, climbing to your knees in places.  A glowing nexus of light is hidden near the cliff face. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32228}{nexus}{nexus}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32230}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32230}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,s,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{Fallen and shattered stone columns restrict your passage and your view here.  One column blocks passage to the east.  You could probably squeeze around others nearby.  Far to the north, you spy the mountain rising over the shattered city.  To the south, an unnaturally tall cliff rises heavenward some distance away.  The grass is trampled and broken, as though thousands of men had marched through here recently. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32229}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32231}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32232}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32231}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,e)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You stride along a corridor formed by fallen stone columns lying roughly parallel to each other to your north and south.  You can't see much beyond them - just the top of a tall cliff peeking from above the southern wall, and the mountaintop rising well above the northern one. The weird daylight from the sunless sky casts no shadows on the grass underfoot. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32230}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32233}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32232}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (n,s)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You stride along the trampled grass between a fallen column to the east and a mound of rubble and boulders to the west.  The latter must once have been a building.  Small sections of steps remain, each step as tall as two men.  The temple atop the mountain far to the north looms mysteriously, as though it were taunting mortals on the slope below. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32230}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32243}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32233}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (n,e)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{Fallen columns and boulders litter the ruin around you.  This must once have been a mighty city of giants, a long time ago.  Now, it's splintered and wrecked, lifeless except for the grass, and maybe some mad marauding denizens.  A wide avenue of grass stretches northward, gently curving upward to the mountainside a mile or so away. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32231}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32234}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32234}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,n,s)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You're just west of a misshapen mound of boulders and shattered stone columns stacked many stories high.  It must once have been a grand building.  The grassy slope climbs upward to the north toward a distant mountain.  To the south, sheer cliffs rise above the landscape of light gray stone and green grass, perhaps scraping the eerie blue sky. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32233}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32235}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32236}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32235}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,w,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{A gigantic white marble bench, entirely intact although cracked and chipped, rises two stories overhead here.  Only a titan could make use of such an amenity.  It faces north, looking toward the looming mountain, and the many-columned temple on top.  The thud of giant footsteps echoes off the fallen columns. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32234}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32237}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32238}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32236}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,w,s,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{A wide lawn runs north-south, sloping steeply upward to the north toward a towering mountain.  Atop the mountain, a colossal colonnade reaches toward the uniform blue heavens.  The grass is knee-high in places, where it hasn't been trampled and flattened.  A light breeze whistles through the temperate air. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32234}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32238}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32241}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32242}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32237}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (s,e)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{A fortified masonry wall obstructs passage to the west.  Just to the north, a structure with intact columns and a partial roof hundreds of feet in the air waits quietly for your intrusion.  The ground vibrates slightly with the passage of angry titans.  The tip of each blade of grass quivers with every reverberation. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32235}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32239}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32238}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,w,s)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{Just to the west is a standing structure with a partly fallen roof held hundreds of feet above the ground by enormous marble columns.  Wide stone steps lead up to the floor of the building.  Each step stands higher than you can reach.  Just to the north, the ground slopes sharply upward and climbs steeply to a mountaintop miles overhead. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32235}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32236}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32240}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32239}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{A tall masonry wall bends here, blocking the way south and west.  The wide grass lawn here is mostly clear of boulders.  It looks well-traveled.  Although there are no paths worn through the grass, it's trampled flat.  To the north, you can barely see the mountaintop temple above and to one side of a standing building. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32237}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32240}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,w)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You stand in a crumbling white marble building with gigantic columns holding a ceiling so far overhead that it's difficult to see it.  Fallen stone walls used to divide the floor into rooms.  Their effectiveness was enhanced when they were still upright.  Wide stone steps lead out and down to the ruined plain to the east. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32238}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32258}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32241}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,w,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You stand on a moderately sloping lawn of thick green grass covered with gigantic bits of debris that were once part of titanic stone buildings.  A mountain rises miles into the air a short distance north of here.  Far to the south, you spot a tall cliff face.  Shattered columns lie toppled atop one another, each one a mammoth edifice far taller than a man even overturned. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32236}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32243}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32244}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32242}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,s,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{The shattered city slopes upward here to the side of a vast mountain, rising epically into the unvarying blue sky.  A wide staircase winds upward, its steps as tall as a man and ten paces apart.  Sections of stone walls surround this part of the lawn to the east and west.  Most of them have fallen, leaving boulders littering the grass. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32236}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32244}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32246}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32243}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (s,w)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{A square stone pedestal the size of a cathedral rises from the lawn.  It must once have supported a statue, but all that remains now is a great marble leg rising up to a shattered plane just below the knee.  Columns to the north stand upright in a long row, stretching to a disintegrating architrave far overhead. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32241}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32232}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32244}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,e,s)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{Two monumental statues guard the entrance to a building to the east.  The statue on the right depicts an armored warrior holding a short sword in the air.  His shield arm and half his head have crumbled away.  The left statue is headless and armless, although a hand and shield still remain.  The building's roof has crashed to the floor, but its columns still stand.  The frieze still sits atop the columns in some places, hundreds of feet in the air.  Three ten-foot steps lead up to the building's floor.  Just to the north, a sheer mountainside rises miles over the tops of the tremendous columns. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32241}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32242}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32245}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32245}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{Most of the walls in this building have been smashed, perhaps by the fallen ceiling.  The center of the floor is now covered in a sixty-foot mound of debris and stone.  So much is destroyed that it's not clear what this building used to be.  Wide steps to the west lead back down to the city. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32244}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32246}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (s,w)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You're on a winding path leading slowly up a massive mountain above a ruined stone city.  Every few paces, you have to climb up a six-foot stone step.  It makes for slow going, and lots of rests.  The mountaintop towers miles above you.  Although you're well above the soaring columns of the city, it seems you're barely started on the climb up. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32242}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32247}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32247}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,w)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{The exhausting climb up the mountain continues.  The steps lead up the winding path, thousands of them, one after another.  Each step is a six-foot high exercise in calisthenics.  You're far above the ruined city now, peering almost even with the top of the cliffs far to the south.  Nevertheless, the mountaintop remains far overhead. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32246}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32248}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32248}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You're on a switchback on a long, wide stairway winding up a colossal mountain.  The ruined city on the green slope is far below you now.  You can pick out the largest standing buildings, but most of the ruin is difficult to distinguish.  If there were any clouds in this strange place, you'd probably be above them.  The sunless, cloudless blue sky shines impassively down on you. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32247}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32249}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32249}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (s,e)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{The winding staircase continues up the mountain, steadily, endlessly.  Each six-foot step is an ordeal.  You've climbed thousands of them, and the mountaintop is still far overhead.  The air has thinned a bit, although it's not any chillier here than it is on the slope amid the ruins. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32248}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32250}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32250}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,e)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{The thin air miles above the city makes you gasp for breath every time you have to climb a step.  The stairway climbs monotonously, gaining twelve feet for every ten paces.  Even the ground between the marble risers is inclined.  The ruins below are barely visible from here, and the clifftop far to the south is at least a couple of miles down. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32249}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32251}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32251}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You're on a tortuous path leading up a massive mountain, miles above the outlet to a shattered ruin.  The stairs are made for giants\; each stone riser is six feet high.  A ways overhead, you spot a long ridge running along the mountaintop.  The columns lining the ridge are so epically huge that they would tower over even the hundred-yard behemoth columns of the city below. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32250}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32252}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32252}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,w,s,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{Here on the lawn of the temple complex, you look around and see two rows of gargantuan columns running along ridges at the front and back of the mountain, a massive stone throne, and a circle of colossal statues facing the throne.  A wide path to the south leads down the front of the mountain.  The ground is flat, and grass has spread to cover it in a sea of green.  The air is thin and still. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32251}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32253}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32254}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32255}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32253}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You're near the ridge at the front edge of the mountain, between a colonnade of titanic marble pillars and a circle of colossal statues.  The pillars and statues climb up into a featureless, sunless blue sky. This temple complex feels distinctly unholy.  Perhaps it's the nature of the statues. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32252}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32257}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32254}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,n)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You're wandering through an immense mountaintop temple high above the shattered city on the slope miles below.  The scale of the pillars and statues up here makes you feel uncomfortably unimportant.  Everything is gigantic - much larger even than the construction in the ruined city on the slope. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32252}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32256}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32255}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,e,s)}{<178>{<118>A<178>}<088>}{A massive throne of marble looms over the lawn, surrounded by a circle of statues.  The throne looks south, out toward the ruined city far below, although you can't see the ruin from here.  The grass is trampled and flat.  The mountaintop shakes faintly beneath your feet.  It smells of charred flesh. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{anaxcleos}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32252}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32256}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32257}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32256}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e,s)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{You're a ways south of the colonnade on the back ridge of the towering mountain.  The air is thin and difficult to breathe, and the scale of the columns looming thousands of feet over you only reminds you of your altitude.  A circle of enormous statues surrounds a stone throne east of here. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32254}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32255}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32257}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (w,s)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{A wide, shallow pool fills a blue and white tile fountain here.  The water is waist deep.  In the center of the pool, a huge marble statue of some sort of fish demon inclines its head deferentially toward the throne to the west.  Water streams from its mouth, continually filling the pool. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32253}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32255}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32258}{0}{<178>}{Crumbling ruins (e)}{<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>}{This side of the ruined building is dominated by a stone colossus that lords over you from a gargantuan marble throne.  The throne is ornately carved, with ridges running up its arms, shield devices along its sides, and marble gems atop the back.  The seated figure is a titan lord, haughty and powerful, staring out over his domain.  His head towers maybe two hundred feet above you. }{Ruins of the Mad Titan Lord}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32240}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32259}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (w,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{Strange Tunnel A drip can be heard in the distance, coming from outside the radius of your light source.  In the distance all that can be seen through the gloomy darkness are occasional flashes of arcane energy.  Dancing shadows skid across the border of your light source.  A slight slope in this tunnel causes it to be even more difficult to traverse without sliding across the smooth floor.  To the east and west you vaguely detect that the tunnel continues.   }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
