R {32375}{0}{<268>}{Ruined Temple (n)}{<268>{<158>N<268>}<088>}{You have climbed up a steep stone staircase to a square chamber.  The room is in poor repair like the rest of the temple.  There is no ceiling to be seen\; an evil shadowy sky lurks not far overhead.  The walls are intact up to a few feet over your head.  The floor is riddled with wide gaps between crumbling stones.  A tilted stone slab, half crumbled away, probably once served as an altar.  The wall immediately behind the altar is covered with a brilliant matrix of glowing blue crystals.  The crystals pulse rhythmically, casting a cerulean glow over the room. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
