R {32396}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (w,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{Strange Tunnel A slight rumbling echoes throughout the depths of this passage.  Flashes of arcane energy continuously pour outward from the runes which are carved into this tunnel's walls.  Tiny clods of dirt, pebbles and crushed powdered rocks are strewn across the otherwise unmarred floor.  To the west you vaguely detect that the tunnel continues, while to the north you vaguely sense an opening to a tunnel.   }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32383}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32397}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32397}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (s)}{<238>] [<088>}{Dead End The tunnel dead-ends here, stopping suddenly at a smooth gray stone wall.  The dull grey stone of this tunnel is so smooth that it's difficult not to slide across the floor.  From some reason the gloomy darkness intensifies here, making it difficult to see beyond a yard in any direction.   }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32396}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32398}{0}{<238>}{Strange Tunnel (sw,n,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{Strange Tunnel The dank smell of stale air assaults your nostrils.  It's tinged with the exotic scent of blood.  A slight slope in this tunnel causes it to be even more difficult to traverse without sliding across the smooth floor.  Flashes of arcane energy continuously pour outward from the runes which are carved into this tunnel's walls.  To the north, west and southwest you just make out that the tunnel continues.   }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
