R {32405}{0}{<238>}{A strange patch of desert (w,path)}{<138>~<238>P<138>~<088>}{As you're wandering around this fairly plain-looking patch of desert, you look down and suddenly notice strange metallic sheets sticking out from the sandy floor.  You decide they might merit further investigation.  Other than this strange occurrence, it's just all sand around here.  Rocky ridges block most exits\; you seem to be entering a sort of valley. }{Desert Path}{desert_path}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32406}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
