R {32406}{0}{<238>}{A shining desert path (w,e)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{As you continue along the constrained desert pathway, the metallic sheets continue to pass by under your feet.  You begin to see various other bits of metal protruding from the sand now.  The rocky ridge continues to surround you, only permitting east-west travel. }{Desert Path}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32405}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
