R {32407}{0}{<238>}{End of the path (e)}{<138>~ ~<088>}{The ridge comes to an end here, the rock surrounding you in all directions except the way you came.  This seems like an uninteresting dead end, just sand and rock.  Or...do you see something glimmering on the ground there? }{Desert Path}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32406}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32408}{0}{}{On top of a tank (hatch,d)}{ }{You are standing on top of the tank. From overhead, the aerodynamics of the body are more pronounced. Before you the main gun sticks slightly out of its conical shroud. Several odd marks speckle the top of tank, giving it a polka dot appearance. }{X1S17 Stealth Tank}{x1s17_stealth_tank}{}{}{1.000}{1}
