R {32411}{0}{}{Lower Deck (rear,u,right,left)}{ }{You are at the base of the tank. A hole leads up into the turret. This area is pretty much a transition area and is surrounded by deck plating. On the right hand side you can see the seat where the gunner sits and on the left is the driver's seat. There is also a crawlspace that leads to the rear of the tank. }{X1S17 Stealth Tank}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
