R {32413}{0}{}{Gunner's chair (deck)}{ }{A black bucket seat sits in the center of this section. On its left is one side of a long tube and on its right is a small computer screen. Directly in front of the chair are some switches, buttons and a large handle. There is a pile of clothing on the floor with some white powdery dust on it. }{X1S17 Stealth Tank}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
