R {32415}{0}{<238>}{A mountainous route (u,trail)}{<238>^<228>T<238>^<088>}{You see a steep mountain towering above you, its jagged peak blocking the sun from your view.  The mountainside is bare and grey, and appears to have many loose rocks and boulders teetering upon its side.  A small shale-strewn path leads up the side of the mountain from here. }{Rocky Mountainside}{rocky_mountainside}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {871}{trail}{trail}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
