R {32416}{0}{<238>}{The mountain base (u,d)}{<238>.^.<088>}{Standing at the base of the high mountain, totally in its dark shadow, you see the stony path rising steeply up before you.  You see some small bits of moss growing on the mountainside, and looking upwards, you see several quite large boulders rocking on narrow ledges above you. }{Rocky Mountainside}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32415}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32417}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32417}{0}{<238>}{The mountain climb (u,d)}{<238>.^.<088>}{Wandering up the winding mountain path, you see streams of rubble slipping down the mountainside on either side of you, and also in front of you, making you stumble as you try to avoid tripping on the loose rocks.  Looking up, you see more small boulders, and the trail seems to come to an end just around behind a particularly large rock. }{Rocky Mountainside}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32416}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32418}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32418}{0}{<238>}{The mountain top (d)}{<238>.^.<088>}{Finally, you've reached the end of the mountain path.  You're not actually at the peak of the mountain, but you're quite high up, and the air has become a little thinner, leaving you slightly short of breath.  You notice lots of rocky debris on the ground, and a shallow dug-out hole in the mountainside. }{Rocky Mountainside}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32417}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32419}{0}{<238>}{Heavily guarded gatehouse (road,enter)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        After a long and weary journey, the ramshackle truck stop greets your eyes like an oasis. The only problem now is getting in, electronically controlled mines rule out the high-speed crash gate and 12 foot concrete walls crowned with razor wire ruin any plan to hop into the complex. The only alternative left is to 'convince' the gatehouse guard to let you inside. Scrawled across the crash gate in large white painted letters is a message you just might want to look at. }{Last Chance Truck Stop}{last_chance_truck_stop}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {513}{road}{road}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32420}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32420}{0}{<278>}{Open courtyard (ne,out,nw,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{        You have made it to the inner courtyard of the truck stop and before you stands a familiar scene. Garbage strewn everywhere, ramshackle buildings, and a prevading stench, all of which reminds you of the slum you grew up in. Directly before you is a multi-purpose building containing all the comforts of home available for use by the many people passing through this place. Off to the left you can see the main attractor of traffic for any truck stop. It is in essence the most advanced facility for the generation and storage of electrical current ever created. You're almost mesmerized by the spinning of the wind powered turbines and flashing reflections of the solar panels. Pulling your eyes to the right, you survey the multiple garage facilities and services available. Somehow you aren't surprised by the lack of a drive-thru car wash. Two heavy steel gates are closed to the south and represent the only available means of escape for you now. }{Last Chance Truck Stop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32419}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32421}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32422}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32423}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32421}{0}{<238>}{A cluttered garage (sw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        Before you entered this room, you had always thought that refuse piles were kept exclusively outdoors. The sight of this garage, however, has easily convinced you otherwise. Giant heaps of metal components grace the several worktables and walls. Amid this great mess there appears to be a thrashed motorcycle with a pair of legs sticking out from under it. The one thing that stands out is a sparkling new ammunition cabinet. As you approach, an incredibly soiled mechanic frees himself from under the cycle, stands up, and wipes his hand on his pants. }{Last Chance Truck Stop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32420}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32422}{0}{<238>}{Electric recharging station (se)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        Standing before you is yet another decrepit building with numerous cracks in its walls. The one thing that sets this building apart are the strange contraptions affixed to the roof. A strange combination of solar panels and wind generators. }{Last Chance Truck Stop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32420}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32423}{0}{<238>}{A filthy bar (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        Your eyes slowly adjust to the dark interior after the blazing mid- day sun and as soon as they do, you wish they hadn't. The whole bar area is in a deplorable state. Numerous tables have been upturned, glass is shattered everywhere, and you can identify the remains of several chairs and bodies. What appears to a be a security guard covered in immense amounts of blood walks up to you and glares at you. }{Last Chance Truck Stop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32420}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32424}{0}{<238>}{A well (u)}{<238>(<148>~<238>)<088>}{You are in the bottom of a dry well.  The area is about six feet around with a dirt floor.  Gray stones make up the walls, and a rusty chain hangs against the wall from above.  On the floor lies a large pile of bones. }{Redneck Trailer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {524}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32425}{0}{}{A secret lab (stairs)}{ }{A secret lab used by the Hudson family to remove unsuspecting travelers' cybernetic implants.  A bloody operation table stands in the middle of the room.  Next to the table is a small bench.  Along the northern wall are shelves that are lined with jars of cybernetic parts.  By the eastern one, is a dirty sink and a dented wardrobe.  The stairs leading back up to the barn are behind you along the south wall. A small metal grate sits on the floor. }{Redneck Trailer}{}{}{}{1000.000}{1}
E {527}{u}{stairs}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {527}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
