R {32427}{0}{<238>}{Outside a small Abbey (n,path)}{<238>,<228>P<238>`<088>}{You are standing outside a small abbey to the north. The mumbled sounds of voices in prayer emanate from the dark interior.  You can see rows of pews through the open door.  The path leads back into the desert.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{bombfreaks_abbey}{}{}{1.000}{1}
