R {32433}{0}{<268>}{A Hallway in the Church (s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This hallway leads from the main part of the church to a room to the east.  You hear movement in that direction.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
