R {32434}{0}{<278>}{A Checkpoint in the Church (d,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{This bleak room serves one purpose, to keep outsiders from going down into the complex beneath the church.  Usually, there are at least two of the Anti-Technologists here to block the way of any impure people.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
