R {32435}{0}{<278>}{A Landing Below the Church (w,s,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{The stairs lead down into a dimly lit landing.  There is not nearly as much of the dust down here, and it is very quiet.  A door to the west leads into what looks like a storeroom, while a door to the south looks out into a long corridor.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
