R {32456}{0}{<238>}{Living Quarters (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room is used to house members of the compound.  Like the walls outside, it looks very practical.  Most everything is stark white, and there doesn't seem to be any sort of entertainment features at all.  In fact, this looks like a very mundane place to live.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32454}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32457}{0}{<238>}{The Police HQ (e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered the Anti-Technologists' police station. This was maybe a bad idea.  The Anti-Technologists are a very xenophobic people, and their treatment of outsiders is harsh. To the east you see a door leading to what looks like an office of some sort.  The hallway is to the north.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32454}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32458}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32458}{0}{<238>}{Chief Bailey's Office (d,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is Police Chief Bailey's office.  You are not supposed to be in here.  A desk littered with notes sits in the middle of the room.  Also, oddly enough, a set of stairs leads down.  No outsider has ever been in here...  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32457}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32459}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32459}{0}{<238>}{Robert's Suite (u)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is Robert's room.  He lives down here in his well protected room whenever he's not in the church giving a sermon.  Unlike the other living quarters you've seen, this room is decorated with many vibrant colors and pictures.  A small shrine in the north wall is lit by a strange inner glow.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32458}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32460}{d}{push button;d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32460}{0}{<278>}{A Cavern Below Robert's Room (e,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You are standing in a musty underground cavern.  The walls seem to glow with a soft white light, illuminating the passageway.  A set of stairs leads up to Robert's room, and the cavern bends to the east.  There, it opens into a larger cavern that is brightly lit.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32459}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32461}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32461}{0}{<248>}{A Strangely Lit Cavern (w)}{<248>% %<088>}{OK, you are thoroughly freaked out now.  This cavern is absolutely huge, with a vaulted ceiling rising easily 40 feet above you.  You can see a hole in the ceiling directly above the center of the room, about 4 feet in diameter.  What freaks you out the most, however, is the bones.  Mounds of human bones, gleaming with an almost unearthly light, are strewn about.  Not a single bit of flesh remains on them.  Along the northern side of the cavern is a huge mound of steel barrels, stacked upon each other in a pyramid.  }{Bombfreaks' Abbey}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32460}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32462}{0}{<238>}{Entrance to the Citadel of the Anti-Mammonists (path,n)}{<238>^<228>P<238>^<088>}{You follow the path and come to a cliff face.  Set into the cliff face is a monstrous black door.  The designer was obviously a fan of the "Dread Portal" school of architecture.  The door is arched and at the crest of the arch is some sort of icon or motif, but it's hard to make out what it's meant to be.  On either side of the door are small metal pillars or posts which are emitting a strange greenish light.   }{Antimammonist Vault}{antimammonist_vault}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1346}{path}{path}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32463}{n}{enter 189;n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32463}{0}{<268>}{Just inside the citadel (s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Blinking in the semi-darkness you take in your surroundings.  This appears to be one end of a long hallway, which stretches off to the east.  Your footsteps are loud and harsh sounding on the metal flooring and they echo down the hall.  The ceiling, some 20 feet overhead, has small electric lights embedded in it.  The huge metal door to the complex is to the south. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32462}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32464}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32464}{0}{<268>}{A brighly lit hallway (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The last echoes of your footsteps die away as you stand in the middle of the hallway, looking around.  The hall is some 40 feet wide and the ceiling is some 30 feet overhead.  As well as the ceiling lights, this room is lit by more of the strange metal pillars, like those you saw outside the citadel.  The brushed metal floor seems to be slightly more polished here.  To the west, you can just make out the corner near the main door.  When you look to the east you can see the hallway eventually ends, but you cannot tell in what. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32463}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32465}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32465}{0}{<238>}{The assembly hall (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A fair sized group could gather in this room.  Perhaps a battalion or more could assemble here.  Near the back of the room part of the floor is raised up to form a dais.  There are curtains or tapestries on the walls around the room. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32464}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32466}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32466}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{After the immensity of the assembly hall, you feel a bit claustrophobic in this narrow corridor.  There is a slight mechanical hum hovering at the edge of your hearing.  Now that you are aware of it the noise is quite irritating, setting your nerves slightly on edge.  The corridor continues as far as the eye can see to the north. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32465}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32467}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32467}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor continues its way through the rock.  There are electric lights set into the walls, casting their light up and down the corridor.  It is quite cool down here. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32466}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32468}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32468}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You continue down the long corridor.  There is a fan hanging from the ceiling here.  The walls are dark and craggy, and the floor is slightly dusty. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32467}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32469}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32469}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{More rough hewn walls and smooth stone floor.  The monotony is broken here by eight little alcoves in the walls.  There are also lights hanging from the roof. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32468}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32470}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32470}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel continues.  Some distance ahead you think you can see the end of the corridor.  Above your head is an electric fan attached to the ceiling. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32469}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32471}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32471}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor continues its way through the rock.  There are electric lights set into the walls, casting their light up and down the corridor.  To the north you can see that the tunnel turns sharply to the west, it seems to stretch into infinity to the south. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32470}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32472}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32472}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You have reached a turn in the tunnel, which stretches off to the west and south.  In the corner is a small bench with a terminal sitting on it. There is also a red button on the wall next to the terminal.  }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32471}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32473}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32473}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor continues its way through the rock.  There are electric lights set into the walls, casting their light up and down the corridor.  To the east you can see that the tunnel turns sharply to the south, it seems to stretch into infinity to the west. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32472}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32474}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32474}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel continues.  Some distance to the east you can see the corner you came around to reach this section of the tunnel.  Above your head is an electric fan attached to the ceiling. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32473}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32475}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32475}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You judge that you are about halfway down this particular tunnel section. Lights in the ceiling shine down from above.  Black rubber marks from the wheels of some unseen vehicle mar the otherwise featureless stone floor. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32474}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32476}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32476}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel continues.  To the west you think you can see it either end or turn another corner.  There isn't a lot of light here, but the floor of the tunnel is smooth enough that you don't think you will stumble over anything. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32475}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32477}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32477}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Halogen lights embedded in the roof of the tunnel shine down on you, illuminating this section of the tunnel.  However, even with a lot of light to see by, there is not a lot to see.  The rock walls are pretty similar to all of the rock walls so far.  To the west you can see a corner in the tunnel.  To the east the tunnel stretches off into the distance. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32476}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32478}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32478}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You have reached a turn in the tunnel, which stretches off to the south and east.  In the corner is a small bench with a terminal sitting on it. There is also a red button on the wall next to the terminal.  }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32477}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32479}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32479}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Halogen lights embedded in the roof of the tunnel shine down on you, illuminating this section of the tunnel.  However, even with a lot of light to see by, there is not a lot to see.  The rock walls are pretty similar to all of the rock walls so far.  To the north you can see a corner in the tunnel.  To the south the tunnel stretches off into the distance. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32478}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32480}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32480}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel continues.  To the north you think you can see it either end or turn another corner.  There isn't a lot of light here, but the floor of the tunnel is smooth enough that you don't think you will stumble over anything. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32479}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32481}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32481}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This must be about half-way down this section of tunnel.  It looks like it stretches off into infinity in both directions.  There are lights in the roof here, casting their light onto the stone floor.  The monotony of the stone walls has been alleviated slightly by a poster on the wall. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32480}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32482}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32482}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel continues on its way into the earth.  The dimly lit walls are unadorned here and stretch off to the north and south.  The air tastes stale and there is a faint whiff of perspiration. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32481}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32483}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32483}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The light embedded in the roof of this corridor is flickering at random, intermittent intervals and while it is lit it emits a buzzing sound that sets your teeth on edge.  The tunnel turns to the east a bit further south. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32482}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32484}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32484}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel turns sharply here, stretching off far to the east and north.  Despite the halogen lights found along the length of the tunnel, it all seems dimly lit and brooding... but not empty, like a vault, not a tomb. To the east there are faint sounds of many fans whirring and other sounds associated with electronics. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32483}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32485}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32485}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The black walls of the tunnel are starting to get a bit monotonous.  The roughly hewn rock stretches out ahead of you to the east.  It might just be wishful thinking, but perhaps you can see light at the end of the tunnel.  To the west you can see the tunnel turns right and heads north. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32484}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32486}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32486}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This section of the tunnel is as unremarkable as any other.  Apart from the lights embedded in the roof, there is little that could be said about it.  What is interesting is that to there seems to be both light and activity to the east.  West is simply more gloomy tunnel. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32485}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32487}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32487}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The tunnel seems to be coming to an end, or at least changing significantly.  The almost circular roughly bored tunnel turns into a neatly tiled corridor with precise right-angles.  The corridor is much more brightly lit than the tunnel, long fluorescent strips shine down on you from the roof.  To the east you can see the corridor turns north, to the west the long, dark tunnel. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32486}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32488}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32488}{0}{<268>}{The Outer Ring (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor turns sharply here.  The corner is rounded slightly and appears to be seamless.  The floor tiles are so smooth that they reflect the light from the ceiling strips and nowhere you look offers you respite from the harsh white glare.  To the north there appears to be a guard post and to the west you can still see where the corridor gives way to rock tunnel. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32487}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32489}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32489}{0}{<268>}{A Guard Post (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor becomes wider here to accommodate a guard post.  Alcoves on either side of you provide places for guards to stand without impeding movement through the corridor.  Next to the alcove in the east wall there is a small desk and workstation. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32488}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32490}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32490}{0}{<268>}{The Inner Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor continues on past the guard post to the south.  The walls gleam a dull silvery blue and their smoothness and straightness is pleasing to the eye.  The floor is still made from the same tiles as before but these tiles are slightly more scuffed and marked and so do not reflect the light to the same degree.  This area must be either older or used more often. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32489}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32491}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32491}{0}{<268>}{The Inner Ring (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The pleasant smoothness of the walls is marred in this section of the corridor.  There appear to be a few scratches and the occasional dent in the walls.  The floor tiles are a little discoloured as well.  There seems to be another corner to the north. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32490}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32492}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32492}{0}{<268>}{The Inner Ring (s,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The walls and floor of the corridor have definitely taken a bit of a beating here.  There are long scratches and gouges in the walls, numerous small dents in the wall suggest small calibre weapons fire and there are some larger dents with blackened edges that could have been caused by explosive projectiles of some description.  The corridor turns again here, heading west.  The guard post is still visible to the south. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32491}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32493}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32493}{0}{<268>}{The Inner Ring (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor runs east west here and the signs of violence you saw are not as evident here.  The walls are not in pristine condition but nor are they marked to the same degree as they are to the east. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32492}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32494}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32494}{0}{<268>}{The Inner Ring (s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor makes another turn here.  The walls are once again in almost perfect condition.  It looks like there is a door in the west wall of the corridor to the south. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32493}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32495}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32495}{0}{<268>}{The Inner Ring (w,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The smooth metal walls of the corridor are interrupted here by a door. It looks like any sliding door you might find in a supermarket, except it is not made of glass.  The door has "Medical" stenciled on it in red letters.  To the north and south you can see bends in the corridor. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32494}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32496}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32497}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32496}{0}{<238>}{Inside a surgery/repair bay (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room is quite small but full of state of the art equipment.  It appears to be a combination field surgery unit and cybernetics installation and maintenance bay. Light glints of shiny pieces of machinery and expensive looking computer consoles. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32495}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32497}{0}{<268>}{The Inner Ring (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor turns again here, the frequency of the turns suggests you are close to the center of the complex.  There is a door in the west wall a bit to the north, and to the east there appears to be another guard post. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32495}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32498}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32498}{0}{<268>}{A Guard Post (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor comes to an end here by another guard post.  This one looks slightly more intimidating than the last one.  There are four alcoves just like last time, but this guard post is in front of an impressively massive and heavy looking vault door.  There is a small keypad on the door. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32497}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32499}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32499}{0}{<138>}{The Inner Sanctum (s)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{You pass through the colossal door into a fairly large vault room.  The walls, floor and ceiling look immensely strong, nuclear bomb shelter strong.  There are banners draped on the walls with quotes stitched into them.  You could fit a lot of loot in this room. }{Antimammonist Vault}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32498}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32500}{0}{<228>}{Southeastern Swamps (d,n)}{<228>; ;<088>}{Southeastern Swamps The hot slimy swamp stretches out from here in every direction.  There is a mist that covers the ground here. It smells of sulfur.  Huge trees and ferns grow in abundance here. There must be something wrong with these plants since they seem to grow so well.  To the north you barely see the continuation of the swampland.  A trapdoor is barely visible amidst the debris of the swamp. }{Science}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {639}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32501}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32501}{0}{<278>}{The dimly-lit entrance to a hideout (u,n)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You have stumbled across the entrance to the base of operations of some kind of gang.  The floor and walls are made up of solid steel, giving the impression that this building may have once been above ground in times gone by.  The stark chill of the metal is balanced by an assortment of symbols and wardings that send a shiver down your spine.  The floor is covered with a layer of debris that must have fallen from the opening above you. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{voodoo_scavengers}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32500}{u}{u}{16}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32502}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32502}{0}{<268>}{An intersection in the hallway (w,e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway becomes an intersection at this point leading west into the heart of the base and leading east into an extended passageway.  Resting on the north wall under some chipped paint is a large and menacing statue of a voodoo doll made of bone and straw.  It stares down upon you with sinister and hollow eyesockets that seem to bore into your soul.  There is still time to turn back. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32501}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32503}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32504}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32503}{0}{<268>}{A hallway in the hideout (e,sw,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The deeper you move into the base the more you feel the presence of a powerful but unusual power.  The wardings you saw previously have given way to collections of animal skins and furs.  They decorate the walls and serve as trophies but also as a warning to those who would bring a challenge to the gang.  A bead curtain leads southwest into what looks like a lounge area and the hallway continues to the north. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32502}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32505}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32506}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32504}{0}{<268>}{A once dead-end (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This hallway is extremely bare with only a large lithograph on the floor to distinguish it.  The walls and ceiling are solid steel giving further suggestion that this was once a large building of some kind.  To the east an outer wall once existed but it has long since been knocked through to extend the hallway out into the earth. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32502}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32508}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32505}{0}{<238>}{A vividly decorated lounge (ne)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A waft of smoke hits you full in the face as you push the bead curtain aside and enter the lounge.  The steel walls are barely visible due to the wide array of posters, paintings and wall hangings.  Well-worn and comfy looking sofas are aligned in a square along the room's edge while a large oak table dominates its center.  A gator skin rug covers a vast majority of the floor while an old window in the south wall stares out into earth and rock. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32503}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32506}{0}{<268>}{A hallway in the hideout (e,w,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The light fixtures that sparsely adorn the walls flicker gently creating an eerie atmosphere and creating shadows that seem to chase you down the hall.  The stark steel walls do little to comfort your unease and provide no solace against the chill that seeps into your bones.  A small terminal that looks like an old information point is fixed to the east wall.  Sadly it appears that it has been broken for decades. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32503}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32514}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32515}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32516}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

