R {32508}{0}{<268>}{The entrance to the garage (w,e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway has been dug out into a garage that the members of the gang use to fix and modify their equipment and vehicles.  The floor is covered with all manner of tools and mechanical parts that seem to be strewn in no organised arrangement.  The garage continues to the east and south. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32504}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32509}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
