E {32552}{w}{enter cage}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32545}{0}{<248>}{A carved out cavern (w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{This cavern appears to have been carved out of the earth in order to accommodate an enormous cage.  The enclosure itself has been built on a three foot high base of unforgiving concrete.  Roars of victory and wails of agony erupt in tandem from the confines of the enclosure.  Perhaps there is still time to go running home to mommy.  From here the walkway continues to the north and west. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32544}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32551}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32546}{0}{<248>}{A carved out cavern (s,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{This cavern appears to have been carved out of the earth in order to accommodate an enormous cage.  The enclosure itself has been built on a three foot high base of unforgiving concrete.  A large duffle bag sits on the floor by the cage overflowing with sparring equipment and training weaponry.  The walkway around the enclosure continues to the west and south. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32544}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32547}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32547}{0}{<248>}{A carved out cavern (e,w)}{<248>% %<088>}{This cavern appears to have been carved out of the earth in order to accommodate an enormous cage.  The enclosure itself has been built on a three foot high base of unforgiving concrete.  A substantial bracket juts from the north wall, creaking under the weight of a well-used leather punching bag.  A pair of boxing gloves lie discarded on the walkway that runs around the cage to the east and west. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32546}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32548}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32548}{0}{<248>}{A carved out cavern (e,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{This cavern appears to have been carved out of the earth in order to accommodate an enormous cage.  The enclosure itself has been built on a three foot high base of unforgiving concrete.  From here you can hear grunts, curses and the occasional thud of fists meeting flesh and bone.  A walkway runs around the cage to the south and east. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32547}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32549}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32549}{0}{<248>}{A carved out cavern (n,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{This cavern appears to have been carved out of the earth in order to accommodate an enormous cage.  The enclosure itself has been built on a three foot high base of unforgiving concrete.  A pair of hooded sweatshirts have been discarded on the ground here in an untidy pile.  The sickly sweet odour of perspiration drifts from the garments and begins to turn your stomach ever so slightly.  Perhaps you should continue along the walkway to the north or south. }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32548}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
