R {32550}{0}{<248>}{A carved out cavern (n,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{This cavern appears to have been carved out of the earth in order to accommodate an enormous cage.  The enclosure itself has been built on a three foot high base of unforgiving concrete.  The sound of a brutal fight echoes from within the confines of the cage.  Judging by the intensity of the muffled screams, this is the true meaning of no-holds-barred.  From here the walkway continues to the north and east.  Inix     Uptime: 3.9 days  Reboot: 5.7 days  Lag: 0.00  Idle: [00:00:01]   }{Voodoo Scavengers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
