R {32570}{0}{<228>}{A Small Airfield (leave)}{<228>,<238>L<228>`<088>}{You emerge from the swamp into a small clearing.  A runway has been cleared from the surrounding area, and a cargo plane of some sort now idles upon it, apparently ready for takeoff.  Two supply trucks sit by, and a small group of workers can be seen standing about watching the plane.  A few of them notice you but they seem unconcerned by your presence.   }{The Amazon Research Center}{amazon_research_center}{}{}{1.000}{1}
