R {32571}{0}{}{In a plane}{ }{You're in the bowels of the cargo hold.  Not a lot to see here, and even less to do.  Guess it's time to wait.   }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32572}{deplane}{deplane}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
