R {32572}{0}{<228>}{Before the Lab (enter)}{<228>.<238>E<228>^<088>}{You're on a small runway, somewhere deep in the foothills of the mighty Amazon Basin.  The cargo plane that brought you here is idling behind you, and it seems ready to return to the US at any time.  To the south is a small compound of some sort, made up of several demountable units that have been fitted together.  A door in one of them would allow you to enter them if you wished.   }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32573}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32571}{board plane}{board plane}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32573}{0}{<238>}{The Entryway (e,out,w,s)}{<238>[<228>O<238>]<088>}{You've entered what you'd guess would be the foyer or entryway for the compound.  Right now though it's highly cluttered and full of various equipment and supplies that haven't been sorted into their correct places.  The lighting is dim, the fluorescent tubes flickering frequently, giving the whole scene an almost unreal quality.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32572}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
