R {32574}{0}{<278>}{The Stairwell (w,u,s)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You're in a small side-corridor running from the entrance to the west to a room of some kind to the south.  The equipment that was cluttering the entrance is absent here, and this corridor is well lit by two halogen globes.  A flight of stairs lead up here to a floor above, and you can hear some kind of odd screeching coming from up there.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32573}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
