R {32575}{0}{<268>}{Side Corridor (s,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You're standing in a small corridor that seems to run between the entrance to the east and a small lab to the south.  A solitary light does a barely adequate job of lighting the corridor and there is yet more equipment left lying about here. Whoever these people are, they're clearly nowhere near set-up to run smoothly yet.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32573}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32577}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32576}{0}{<268>}{Corridor Intersection (e,w,s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've arrived at a junction of two corridors that lead in all four cardinal directions.  There's not actually a lot else here, the stainless walls are bare of any decoration and other than an occasional flicker the lighting here is good.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
