R {32577}{0}{<238>}{Chemistry Lab (e,s,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're in some kind of chemists' laboratory.  Racks of vials and beakers line the walls, containing a variety of strange samples and liquids.  A large steel bench sits in the middle of the room with an experiment set up and running on it.  Several boxes and crates are sitting on the floor, their contents having been taken out and, you assume, stacked around the room.  Corridors run out of here to the north, south and east.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
