R {32578}{0}{<238>}{Biology Lab (e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This lab is a shocking sight.  Dominating your view is a large table that seems to have been used as a vivisection bench.  Blood is spattered across it and the floor around it.  Row upon row of jars line the walls, each containing labelled organs and specimens.  A small trolley is next to the bench, and it holds a variety of surgical tools that look disturbingly effective at their job.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32577}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32579}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32579}{0}{<238>}{The Guard Post (e,w,s,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The room you've just entered would seem to be some kind of guard post. A small table and chair are sitting by a doorway that leads southwards.  The table has a game of cards sitting on it, half finished.  Occasionally you hear a strange shriek emanating from the southern exit, giving you second thoughts about heading down that way. }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
