R {32580}{0}{<238>}{Rec Room (n,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're in what seems to be the facility's recreational area.  A small cot is in one corner for scientists to get a quick rest, while a coffee machine sits against one wall.  A steel table with a magazine or two sits in the centre of the room, and two chairs are arranged around it.  There's even a small radio that sits on the floor.   }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32579}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32582}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32581}{0}{<268>}{Access Corridor (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The small corridor you've entered seems to be little more than a linkage point between the northern research labs and the southern living quarters of the compound.  There appears to be some kind of common room directly south of you, while the security checkpoint is to the north.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32579}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32584}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32582}{0}{<238>}{The Kitchen (w,s,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've entered what would seem to be the scientists' temporary kitchen.  A small portable stove has been set up in one corner, and several cupboards have been set up above a steel bench. A small sink and water cooler have also been placed here, and there is the faint smell of bacon still hanging in the air.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
