R {32583}{0}{<278>}{Top of the Stairs (w,s,d)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You're at the top of a flight of stairs that leads down to the ground floor.  The lights here are flickering wildly, and you have trouble seeing.  More boxes and crates of equipment are stacked here, awaiting unpacking.  There is a loud sound of something screeching to your south, while a corridor heads west.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
