R {32584}{0}{<238>}{Common Room (e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{What was once the common room and lounge facilities of the compound has been reduced to smoldering rubble.  It would appear that something exploded in here and not that long ago.  Shattered remnants of furniture are strewn about, and most of what is left is charred beyond recognition.   }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32581}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
