R {32585}{0}{<268>}{A Corridor (w,e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've entered a corridor that runs south from here. There's a strong smell of gunpowder in the air, and a fog of smoke hangs about the ceiling.  There are two doorways at this end of the corridor, one leading west and one leading east.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
