R {32586}{0}{<238>}{Male Living Quarters (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This large room is where the men of the research team sleep.  Right now it looks like no one has slept in here for quite some time.  Blood is spattered throughout the room and there seems to be at least three bodies in here, although two are so badly damaged they are only barely recognisable as such.  There are numerous beds around, and one or two cabinets, and all seem to be at least partially destroyed.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32585}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32587}{0}{<268>}{A Corridor (e,w,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You're in a corridor that runs north and south from here. The air smells faintly of gunpowder here, and to the north it is thick with smoke.  To the south the corridor seems to continue, and there are doorways in the east and west walls.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
