R {32588}{0}{<268>}{A Corridor (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've entered a corridor that runs east to west.  A heavy gun battle seems to have taken place here, and there are numerous bullet-holes in the walls.  Two corpses, one a marine, and the other, some kind of strange looking monkey, are lying here.  Blood is spattered about liberally, and it's hard to work out what came from whom.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32587}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32593}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32589}{0}{<238>}{Female Living Quarters (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room looks like it was the bedroom for the female members of the Biotech Expedition.  There are four beds placed about the room, each with an adjoining cabinet. Hair-Care Products and various types of feminine hygiene products abound, and were it not for the fact one bed is occupied by a decaying corpse, the room would look quite normal.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32587}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32590}{0}{<268>}{A Corridor (e,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You're standing at the turning point of the corridor that had up until this point, run north and south.  It turns to the east here, heading towards a dark stairwell that looks a little intimidating.  To the north it is much better lit, if a little hazy.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32587}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
