R {32591}{0}{<278>}{The Top of a Stairwell (d,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You've arrived at the top of a dark stairwell.  The lights have either gone out, or been turned off, making it quite hard to see, although the lights from the corridor to the west of here do provide enough to see by.  The stairwell itself is fairly plain and unadorned, but the inky dark that it leads down into is not something to fill you with confidence.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32590}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
