R {32592}{0}{<278>}{The Bottom of a Stairwell (s,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{You're at the bottom of a stairwell that led down here from the ground level.  There is a tiny amount of light coming down from the level above, but not enough to see anything down here clearly.  The corridor leads south from here.  The walls are covered in various panels and screens everywhere you look down here. }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32591}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
