R {32593}{0}{<268>}{A Corridor (w,e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Compared to the carnage of the corridor to the west, this section of corridor is eerily devoid of anything.  There are doorways to both the south and east leading into specific rooms.  The one to the south would seem to be the showers and hygiene facilities, while to the east, you can see what looks to be some kind of communication room.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
