R {32594}{0}{<238>}{The Communication Facilities (s,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've entered what would best be described as the comm's center of the labs.  Radio and radar equipment take up one entire side of the room.  Everything seems to be in good working order, and you would think everything quite normal were it not for the headless corpse sitting quietly in a chair by the radio.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32593}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
