R {32595}{0}{<238>}{A Bathroom (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The Bathroom facilities for the compound seem to be a unisex arrangement, judging by the various bathroom products that are scattered about the the large counter that takes up one wall.  There are two stalls on one side and a shower cubicle as well.  All in all, everything the modern scientist in the Amazon could want for their hygienic needs.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32593}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32596}{0}{<268>}{Access Corridor (e,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You're in a small corridor that leads from the communication facility to the north, to the garage to the east.  There's a dried patch of blood on the floor here, but other than that, there doesn't seem to be much to see here.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32594}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {32597}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {32597}{0}{<238>}{The Garage (s,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've entered the garage for the lab compound.  There are two all-terrain vehicles parked in here, but one is clearly damaged, and is surrounded by trolleys of tools and other equipment.  Large benches stand against the walls, covered in schematics for the vehicles, and various spare machine parts.  To the south there is a huge bay door, that has been left open, allowing you to see outside the compound.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
