R {32599}{0}{<228>}{A Jungle Clearing (e,w,s)}{<228>* *<088>}{You're standing in a clearing in the jungle.  The main compound is just north of you, but there doesn't seem to be any way into it just here.  Just to the west of here is what looks to be a radar tower, while to the south you can see a gate in the fence that encircles the clearing.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
