R {32600}{0}{<228>}{A Jungle Clearing (w,n)}{<228>* *<088>}{This region of the clearing is stacked up with an assortment of crates.  All of them appear to have been dumped here with little concern for the elements, and one or two are starting to show signs of rust.  The most immediate thing however, is a badly devoured corpse, that seems to have been a marine at one time.  North of here is the garage, its huge bay door hanging open, and allowing you entrance into the compound. To the west you can see a gate that seems to be the main point of exit into the jungle.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
