R {32601}{0}{<228>}{A Jungle Clearing (s,e)}{<228>* *<088>}{You're standing at the base of a large radar tower, in the northwest corner of the clearing.  The tower itself is very high, with its pinnacle looking to be at least 50 feet up.  The compound is north of you, but it seems there is no entrance into it around here.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
