R {32602}{0}{<228>}{By The Gate (e,w,n)}{<228>* *<088>}{You're at what appears to be the main exit point from the compound into the jungle itself.  There is a muddy dirt road on the other side of the gate that looks like it was recently carved out of the jungle.  The gate itself seems to be securely locked by a complex looking electronic locking mechanism, and you can see no way past it.  Just east of here you can see what looks like some supply crates of some sort.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
