R {32603}{0}{<228>}{A Jungle Clearing (e,n)}{<228>* *<088>}{The section of the clearing you're now in seems strangely devoid of anything interesting.  Whether it is because the lab staff have yet to utilise it for anything, or they deliberately keep it empty is unclear, but there certainly seems to be nothing here apart from the fence that runs about the clearing.  North of here you can see what looks like a radar tower, while east there seems to be a gate in the fence.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
