R {32604}{0}{<268>}{An Intersection (e,w,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've arrived at an intersection in the corridor.  To the north it runs towards the stairwell you used to enter this basement level.  To both the east and west the corridor leads to a southwards turn.  There doesn't seem to be much here, and there is total silence, making it seem quite sinister.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
