R {32605}{0}{<268>}{A Corridor (w,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor at this point swings in an ninety degree turn from the west to the south.  There seems to have been some kind of explosion here as well, and one wall has collapsed, allowing a large pile of mud and earth into the compound.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
