R {32611}{0}{<238>}{A Strange Lab (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've entered a strange laboratory.  Large banks of machinery line the walls, each housing a variety of instruments and panels.  From the base of each of these runs a series of large tubes, which all meet up in the center of the room at the base of a large blue cylinder.  Constructed of glass, it is the source of the room's illumination, flooding the room with a strong blue glow.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
