R {32613}{0}{<238>}{Repair Bay (s,e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're in the middle of what can only be best described as a totally ruined room.  It looks like at one point it was used as a repair bay of some kind, judging by the electronic components scattered about the room.  Tools are strewn about here as well lying in disarray.  It looks like some kind of fight happened here.  There are bullet holes in the wall, and a good amount of blood as well.  Whatever happened here it trashed the room.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32583}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
