R {32614}{0}{<238>}{Main Lab (w,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You've entered the largest lab in this part of the complex. It's full of equipment that looks like it's been broken or wrecked and there's even a bullet hole in one wall.  Some kind of skirmish has gone on in here and recently too.  A puddle of chemical fluid still smolders in one corner, and there are drops of blood here and there.  A large door is set into the south wall, and a keypad is next to it. An unearthly screeching sound comes from the other side of it.  The lab itself extends to the west.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
