R {32615}{0}{<238>}{Main Lab (e,s,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're in the western section of a large lab.  This part looks like it's primarily used as a briefing room of some kind, as a large table dominates the center of the room.  Strangely one of the chairs around it has been overturned, as if someone leapt up out of their chair in a hurry.  There's a series of charts on the wall, and in the south wall is a doorway leading into another room.  }{The Amazon Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
