R {32622}{0}{<238>}{Inside a hangar (w,e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This side of the hangar seems to have been used to store maintenance tools and parts.  Steel bins and cabinets lie along the floor where they have been torn from the walls.  Nuts and bolts are scattered about, rusting away. Several empty crates lie about as if used for seats or tables, but they look like they haven't been used for awhile now. }{Air Force Base}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
