R {32643}{0}{<278>}{Compound Courtyard (e,n)}{<278>. .<088>}{A huge mountain rises up to your west and a tall chain link fence blocks your way to the south. To the east the compound's courtyard continues, to the north looms a huge building covered in dark glass. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
