R {32645}{0}{<278>}{Compound Courtyard (w,e,n,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{To your north stands a huge entryway into the large black building. Above you, you can see the face of the building rising up into the sky. This compound's courtyard stretches out to the south. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
