R {32646}{0}{<278>}{Compound Courtyard (e,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{A gigantic building rises to the north, its black glass wall reflecting your image. To the west a huge cliff towers over you. You can see lots of activity in this courtyard. You wonder why everyone is so busy. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
