R {32647}{0}{<278>}{Compound Courtyard (w,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{The huge black glass building rises to your north. To the south and west the courtyard stretches out. A tall mountain cliff veers up to the east. The sky here is dark and overcast. Presumably from all of the distant pollution. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32644}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
