R {32648}{0}{<238>}{GenCorps Entry (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{You stand in a huge entryway. There are large concrete pillars to your left and right, and a large open dark glass door. There are huge windows that have the same tinted glass. There is some printing on one of the windows. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {32645}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
