R {32649}{0}{<268>}{hallway (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is the reception area for GenCorps. There is a big black desk in one corner and many pictures on the wall. There is quite a bit of light coming through the dark tinted windows, and it's a good thing because all of the lights are off. There is a security camera aimed at you in one corner of the ceiling. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
