R {32650}{0}{<268>}{hallway (w,e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is a large hallway leading off in many directions. The floor is nicely tiled so that when you walk your footsteps make an eerie echo. There is a small red flashing light in the middle of the ceiling, with no other illumination. It looks like someone probably knows that you are here. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
