R {32651}{0}{<238>}{research lab (w,e,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a rather large room with big tables and lots of complicated looking testing and diagnostic equipment. It looks like GenCorps does some kind of equipment development from the looks of the diagrams on the walls and the equipment on the tables. There is a flashing red light in the center of the ceiling. It looks like the place is mostly deserted. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
