R {32652}{0}{<268>}{hallway (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The large hallway leads off to the east and west here. You can see that it continues for quite a distance in both directions. You can hear voices coming from down both halls, and the echo of your footsteps on the tiled floor mingles with other strange sounds that are reverberating down this hallway. There is a small red light near the floor that is flashing. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
