R {32654}{0}{<268>}{hallway (w,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway continues in both directions from here. There is a small red light flashing near the floor. The walls and floor look to be constructed like the rest of the building. You can hear muffled sounds coming from the east, and there is a large metallic door leading to the south. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
