R {32655}{0}{<268>}{hallway (w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The hallway comes to an end here. You can see a large door leading south from here. To the west the hallway stretches away. In the center of the ceiling is a small red flashing light. You can hear loud noises coming from the south. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
