R {32658}{0}{<268>}{hallway (e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You've walked into a large room filled with tables and drawing boards. It looks like this is the concept and development department. There are all kinds of diagrams and charts hanging from the walls. It looks like someone has been working very hard on something rather important. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
