R {32659}{0}{<268>}{hallway (w,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is a short narrow hallway. It turns to the west and south near the center of it. There isn't much light, and the light that is here seems to be coming from the other rooms near here. You can hear sounds coming from both directions. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
