R {32660}{0}{<238>}{research lab (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This seems to be another part of the research lab that you were in before. There are many lab benches with all kinds of diagnostic equipment on them. There is a little red light flashing in the middle of the ceiling, and there is a narrow doorway leading to the west, it looks like something could be stored in there. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
