R {32661}{0}{<268>}{hallway (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This room is very large. There are counters and workbenches everywhere. You can tell that some very frantic work has been going on here recently by the look of how there are papers and planning equipment strewn about across the room. There is a large diagram hanging from one wall and a large chart hanging from another. }{GenCorps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
