R {33974}{0}{<238>}{An office alcove (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You stand in a small, but richly decorated room.  It looks like a private office of some sort.  A desk occupies a large portion of the room.  The walls are covered with tapestries and religious icons.  Plush carpet makes the floor comfortable to walk on and dampens noises.  Old world lights make it possible for you to see here. }{Temple of Syrinx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
