R {33983}{0}{<238>}{A cluttered candy store (out,e)}{<238>[<228>O<238>]<088>}{Stepping into the store, your nose is assaulted by a wave of wonderful chocolatey smells mixed with the tang of old fashioned wood polish. To say this shop is quaint would be an understatement. It positively bursts with Old World charm.  Covering the wall behind the polished  wooden counter are numerous shelves, each packed with glass jars holding numerous types of candy and chocolate treats.  Almost hidden in this children's heaven is a small unassuming doorway. }{Chaos Candy Store}{chaos_candy_store}{}{}{1.000}{1}
