R {33984}{0}{<238>}{Western end of a storeroom (e,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The light from a small window high up in the west wall barely  illuminates this end of the storeroom.  Boxes of all shapes and sizes lie piled haphazardly against the walls, as if carelessly tossed around by some marauding giant. This isn't quite the picture of efficiency you have come to expect from gnomes. Who knows perhaps they just haven't gotten round to this part of the  room yet or maybe something more sinister is going on! }{Chaos Candy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
