R {33998}{0}{<238>}{Fudge production line (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Nearly completely filling this small room is some kind of huge automated  production line. Winking off and on at you are banks of red LEDs beneath  which is a large green button that's just daring you to push it.  The  sickeningly sweet smell of fresh fudge fills the air here, making you  pine for your Grandma's home-made cooking. }{Chaos Candy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
