R {34000}{0}{<238>}{Converted production room (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Someone seems to have removed the huge candy production machines from here, replacing them with three of the most high-tech printing presses you have ever seen.  The whirr and click of the presses is almost deafening in the confines of this room making you want to run out before you go deaf. Odd isn't it, to find printing presses in a candy factory. What fiendish plans are these gnomes up to? }{Chaos Candy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
