R {34118}{0}{<228>}{Before a small hill (e,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{You shiver at the sight that greets your eyes, for in the center of this clearing is a long flat hill, from which the cold mist seems to be emanating. Set into the hill nearby is a large and ancient set of large bronze doors. Terror and fear seem to wash over you in one great wave of emotion as you stare at those massive doors. What secrets do they hide? Who built them? }{New Arovian Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
