R {34151}{0}{<228>}{Dense, stifling forest (w,n,sw,nw,ne)}{<228>( *<088>}{The forest presses in on all sides, with strange, unfamiliar growths catching your eye wherever you look.  East of here the forest is pressed together so tightly, there is be no chance of pushing a way through.  From the myriad of growths all around, a white tree with filaments waving from its trunk like tentacles fills your vision momentarily, then is lost amidst the chaos.  It is mid-morning and drizzling heavily. }{Erratio Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
