R {34152}{0}{<228>}{A chaotic, multicolored forest (w,e,n,s,sw,ne,nw)}{<228>( *<088>}{Nothing is visible except the strange, chaotic growths that make up this dense forest.  Looking upwards gives a view of the giant canopy formed by the upmost branches of the tallest trees.  A great cup-shaped growth filled with sticky orange fluid catches your attention briefly, but then disappears amidst the chaos.  It is mid-morning and drizzling heavily. }{Erratio Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
