R {34153}{0}{<228>}{A path through a strange forest (w,e,n,s,ne,nw,se)}{<228>( *<088>}{A small, overgrown path winds through the forest here, moving northeast and south.  Encroaching onto the path, almost obscuring it totally, are the strange, chaotic growths that make up the forest surrounding you.  High above, the branches and foliage of the tallest trees creates an almost solid canopy, letting only filtered light pass through.  A broken, twisted black tree that drips grey sap catches your eye for a second, then disappears into the chaos.  It is mid-morning and drizzling heavily. }{Erratio Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
