R {34154}{0}{<228>}{A strange, confusing forest (e,n,ne,nw,se)}{<228>( *<088>}{The forest thickens to the west, becoming too dense to pass through.  The trees and plants grow more sparsely in most other directions, allowing just enough space for budding explorers to push between them. The ground is covered with the detritus that falls from the chaotic array of growths all around.  A trunk that grows a hundred feet tall, but has no branches attracts your attention for a minute.  It is mid-morning and drizzling heavily. }{Erratio Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
