R {34155}{0}{<228>}{A gap in the forest (ne,nw,e,n)}{<228>(<238>G<228>*<088>}{Almost surrounding this spot is a dense forest filled to overflowing with what could loosely be called trees and plants.  Each living growth is not what would normally be found in a forest, with bright colors and odd shapes everywhere you look, creating a dazzling display of chaotic brilliance.  The forest is absent from a small area just south of here, creating a small gap just about the right size to enter.  Looking around, a broken, twisted black tree that drips grey sap stands out for a second, then fades into the chaos.  It is mid-morning and drizzling heavily. }{Erratio Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
