R {34156}{0}{<228>}{Surrounded by forest (ne,nw,w,n)}{<228>( *<088>}{The trees of the forest cluster together east and south of here, effectively forming an impenetrable wall that stops any travel in those directions.  The forest is all around, though most other areas look to be passable, with a little effort.  Out of the corner of your eye, you see a tree that fills the air with a cloud of inky-black spores but when you turn to look it has been swallowed by the forest.  It is mid-morning and drizzling heavily. }{Erratio Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
