R {34163}{0}{<228>}{Green Angel Tower bell-tower (n)}{<228>] [<088>}{A low stone railing prevents you from falling over the edge of this balcony you now stand on. From here you can look out upon the waters of the Kynslagh as it flows in from the ocean, and into the waters that protect this mighty keep from attack on two sides. Here and there, a sailor braves the swells, to catch the fish that feed his family. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
