R {34164}{0}{<228>}{Green Angel Tower (balcony,u,d)}{<228>] [<088>}{This landing in the tower gives your legs a break from the arduous task of climbing. An archway leads to a small balcony, which overlooks part of the Hayholt. Curtains on the walls break the monotony of blank stone which adorns many rooms in the keep. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
