R {34165}{0}{}{Green Angel Tower balcony (landing)}{ }{The view from here is not quite as spectacular as from the bell-tower, but nevertheless you can still see a fair bit, even if most of it is the rooftops and courtyards of the keep. There is a stone wall serving as a railing here. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
