R {34166}{0}{<228>}{Green Angel Tower (d,u)}{<228>] [<088>}{The long and narrow staircase winds up and down this tower as if it never ends. The steps are made of a clean, smooth white stone unlike any other in the castle. They are slippery to the touch, yet sure beneath your feet. The walls are made of the same stone as the stairs, though maybe slightly shinier. Further up you can see a landing. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
