R {34169}{0}{<178>}{In the keep (tower,n)}{<278>###<088>}{You stand in the shadow of Green Angel Tower, near the outer walls of the keep. A drawbridge to the north leads over a moat into the inner bailey of the keep, and there is a door allowing you access to the tower. There is not much else to look at, though Green Angel Tower is enough to hold your gaze anyway. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
