R {34170}{0}{}{Morgenes' chamber (leave)}{M}{This room is a wondrous piece of work. It is unbelievable how much stuff is crammed in here. There are many tables full of various items\; cages, tapestries, and hundreds of books. There is a star chart and a calendar hanging off a wall, a patch of soot on another. Looks more like a mad scientist's lab than a doctor's room. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
