R {34171}{0}{<238>}{On a drawbridge (s,n)}{<238>|||<088>}{You stand upon a drawbridge that crosses a moat, and guards the inner bailey of the keep. Though the moat is not much more than a ditch, it still provides a strong point to protect should the middle and outer baileys fall in a siege. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
