R {34172}{0}{}{In the keep (writing,e,s,morgenes,records)}{ }{Looking around you, you seem to be surrounded by buildings. Funny that, being inside a keep and all. Beyond the buildings you can see the high protective wall of the Hayholt. To the south a drawbridge leads out into the middle bailey, and to the east is an open courtyard. Most of the buildings in the immediate area have doors which you might be able to enter. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
