R {34173}{0}{}{Writing priests room (out)}{ }{This smallish room is strewn with some unhygienic monk's leavings. It wouldn't be surprising to find some rats in here. The walls are blank, though rubbish has been piled up along the base. There are oddments around on the floor too - bolts of cloth, slate tiles and a few stools among other things. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
