R {34176}{0}{}{Hall of records (out)}{ }{Inside this crowded room lie row after row of shelves containing papers on all the things that are happening or have happened in the keep. Maps, and records of battles, garrison notes - everywhere. Sketches hang on the walls, showing places the scribes have been. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
