R {34178}{0}{}{Great Hall (w,sw,outside)}{ }{One of the largest rooms in the keep, it is meant to hold many residents as they eat, drink, and get merry. Meetings are held here with the commoners, and it is also a place for people to come and warm themselves by the fireplace when the need arises. Spread about the room are a few tables and plenty of chairs. To the left of the fireplace, two large windows are set into the dull stone walls. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
