R {34179}{0}{<228>}{Hedge garden. (courtyard,in)}{<228>, `<088>}{This garden is quite beautiful, but then, what would you expect from a place with many gardeners? The sheltering trees, the large well trimmed hedges, and in the centre, the festival oak, all look perfect. There is a door leading into the chaplain's walking hall, and towards the side of the garden near the red stone walls of the chapel, is a small stone statue of a lion. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
