R {34180}{0}{}{Antechamber to throne room (hall,hallway,enter)}{ }{Before you, a set of double doors with large decorative hinges leads into the throne room. On either side of the doors are tapestries displaying the royal coat of arms. On the floor, a mosaic also bears the coat of arms. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
