R {34181}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (w,door,ne)}{<268>[<238>D<268>]<088>}{A wooden door leads north into the jester's room. Being a close friend of the previous High King, his room is close by. Either side of the door, and opposite, are the large stone blocks that make up the majority of the keep. Down the hall to the west is the King's chambers, and to the northeast is the great hall. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
