R {34182}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (door,e,w)}{<268>[<238>D<268>]<088>}{This hallway continues to the east and west. The same dull stone walls that make up most of the keep make this hall no different than any other. What makes this hall different however, is that the door leading off here has a lock. Something rarely seen in the keep. What lies behind the metal door is the King's chambers, and further along you can see the jester's room. Being a close friend to the King, his room is nearby. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
