R {34183}{0}{<138>}{Standing room (throne,u)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{This room is where audiences wait to see the King. It is right next to the throne room, and a staircase leads up to a private room. There is a large tapestry hanging at the back of the room, and in the centre of the room is a large velvet covered seat. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
