R {34185}{0}{<238>}{Towser's room. (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The jester obviously doesn't have many possessions by the look of this room. A bed, a closet, and an oaken chest at the foot of the bed are all that are in here. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
