R {34186}{0}{<238>}{The King's sleeping chamber (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A large, regal-style bed dominates this room. It is covered in a blanket with the royal seal prominently displayed. There are a few dressers, a mirror, and a screen behind which the King can change. A small, high set window lets air in, but it isn't large enough even for a small man to clamber in. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
