R {34187}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (nw,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{A dull and boring hallway that serves as nothing more than a means to get from one place to another. There are no windows, and nothing hangs on these walls. To the northwest is the throne room, and to the east the hallway continues. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
