R {34188}{0}{<268>}{Chapel (courtyard,hall,outside)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{Row upon row of pews fill this beautiful chapel, leading to the altar at the front. It is a very large building, with a high domed ceiling consisting of a mosaic of glass. There are velvet hangings at the back, above which can be seen the choirloft. The whole floor is covered in a beautiful reddish carpet. There is a set of double wooden doors leading out to the courtyard, and a couple of other smaller doors leading elsewhere. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
