R {34189}{0}{}{On top of a wall (s)}{ }{This narrow wall leads a short way around the keep, towards Green Angel Tower. It looks like it may get close enough for you to jump across to the tower further along. From here though, there is a window slit large enough for you to clamber inside. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
