R {34190}{0}{<138>}{Throne Room (w,leave)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{As one would expect, this throne room is massive. Dusty banners, hang row upon row along the walls, a faded bestiary of animals: the sun golden stallion of Clan Mehrdon, Nabban's gleaming kingfisher crest, owl and ox, otter, unicorn, and cockatrice - rank after rank of silent, sleeping creatures. At the farthest end of the room a massive tapestry hangs on the stone wall between the statues of the High Kings of the Hayholt. It bears the royal coat of arms, the Firedrake and the Tree. Grim malachite statues, an honor guard of six, flank a huge, heavy chair that seems entirely carved from yellowing ivory. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
