R {34191}{0}{<238>}{Privy (window,d)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{In the corner of this room sits a chamber pot. Near the top of the opposite wall, above the stairs, is a window slit. It seems the King hasn't used this room in a while, since normally there would be some clothing here for ceremonious occasions. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34183}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
