R {34192}{0}{}{On top of a wall. (n)}{ }{This narrow stone wall runs close to the balcony part way up Green Angel Tower. You can jump to the tower if you dare, or go along the wall further and see where it leads. You can also look down upon the middle bailey and watch people scurry past on their own business, or the King's. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
