R {34193}{0}{}{Choirloft (d)}{ }{A small balcony which overlooks the chapel, and allows the people in the chapel to see the choir. You have a good view of the chapel's domed roof from here, and also the carved railing by the stairs leading down. Velvet hangings cover the back wall. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
