R {34194}{0}{<238>}{A courtyard (s,stairs)}{<238>. .<088>}{This courtyard is full of pine trees and heather, all set about on sloping hills. The whole garden is way past a stone's throw long. There are some steps leading up into the chapel. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
