R {34195}{0}{<238>}{Dining hall (kitchen,refectory,outside)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You have entered a large rectangular room. At the far end, a large dining table commands a view of other smaller tables set up around it in an open square, running alongside the stone walls down to the doorways. It is obviously where the King sits. There are candles on all the tables, but since it is not a meal time, nothing else. There are cobwebs on the ceiling. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
