R {34196}{0}{<278>}{A covered walkway (dining,chapel,n)}{<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>}{This walkway runs alongside a grassy courtyard, filled with pine trees and heather. The path running between the buildings is made from large stones set into the ground, and has been swept clear of any leaves. There is a cover over the path, but it is doubtful it would keep you dry should it happen to rain. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
