R {34197}{0}{<238>}{Kitchen (outside,refectory,dining)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This very large kitchen is rectangular in shape, and filled with ye olde kitchen appliances. It is very organized, with washing tubs grouped together along one side, and ovens on the other. In between lie a row of preparation tables that stretch from one end of the room all the way to the other. There are pots and pans haphazardly left around the room, and there are a few barrels of food set far from the big windows and any sneaky pairs of hands. A door leads outside. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
