R {34201}{0}{<238>}{Store room (d,u)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{In the central chamber of this storage room are great piles of iron-banded casks. Stacked to the ceiling, they create a murky landscape of rounded towers and close hemmed passages. Midway across the shadowed room is a hole leading down into darkness. Behind that, a row of barrels lay under a small window. A small staircase in the corner leads upwards. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
