R {34202}{0}{<238>}{Store room (d,u)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Crowded to the rafters with barrels and sacks, there is only a small aisle to get around down here. It reaches all the way to the back wall. There is a hatchway in the floor, and another in the ceiling. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
