R {34204}{0}{<238>}{Inside the gatehouse (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A smallish room with little to nothing in the way of distractions. A few chairs, a weapon rack, and a desk are the only furniture in here. Guess there isn't much to do when on duty on the gate except watch people walk in and out. But with the gate closed, there isn't even that to watch today. There is a note on the wall, between the door and a large window that looks out upon the gate. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
