R {34205}{0}{<178>}{Nearulagh Gate (commons)}{<278>###<088>}{This gate leads out of the keep, and towards the town of Erchester. The mighty gate is currently closed, and guarded. There are carvings on the walls around the gate. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
