R {34206}{0}{<238>}{Armoury (barracks,outside)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Weapon racks are arrayed along each wall, with more racks down the centre of the room. Most of the racks however, are empty, a sign that a large portion of the Erkynguard is out and about. A few weapons still remain in the Armoury. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
