R {34207}{0}{<238>}{Barracks (armoury,outside)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A few dozen wooden bunks fill this long building. They are lined up against each wall with a walkway down the centre, and in between each one. Some of the bunks are occupied by sleeping men. Beside each bunk is a wooden chest, where the soldiers store their belongings. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
