R {34208}{0}{<238>}{Stables (out,u)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{A few dozen stalls and a slight animal stench greet you as you enter the keep's stables. Over some of the stalls you can see horses, and some other stalls look recently vacated. Those would primarily be from the Erkynguard currently out on patrol in the area surrounding the keep. There are bridles and other bits and pieces hooked up on the walls, and even some lying on the ground in a pile. There is a ladder leading from the muddy floor up into the hayloft. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
