R {34209}{0}{}{Hayloft (d)}{ }{Here above the stables all the bales of hay are stored. Guess that's why it's called a hay-loft. The floor you walk upon consists of wooden boards, most of which look to be in good condition. There is however an occasional rotten looking one, so you'd better watch your step. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
