R {34213}{0}{}{Entrance to a toy store (out,e,n)}{O}{The large shelf of toys to the west dominates the entrance of the store. The shelf, covered in dust and holding various small toys, runs deep into the store. To the east, a large counter continues north into the darkness of the store. Even though this shop provides a haven from the hustle and bustle of New York, it is obviously not in its best condition. All but one of the lights have been smashed long ago. The remaining comes from a small bulb dangling in the middle of the store. It casts ominous shadows on the dust covered floor further northward. The door to New York is to the south. }{Toy Store}{toy_store}{}{}{1.000}{1}
