R {34214}{0}{}{Beginning of the toy counter (n,w)}{ }{This is the southern end of the toy counter, which runs along the eastern side of the store. Most of the models are out of reach behind the counter, but there are several on display. Despite the healthy layer of dust, the models seem to be in good condition. Further into the store there appears to be the shadow of the shopkeeper. It's difficult to discern any details, as the only source of light in the room is dimly flickering. The door exiting to the street is to the west, and through the window to the south, there's an old lady being mugged. }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
