R {34215}{0}{}{Middle of the toy shelf (e,n,s)}{ }{To the west is the middle of the toy shelf that runs the length of the store. The single bulb above flickers dimly as it swings on its cord, casting eerie shadows dance along the shelf. The dust in this area seems to be particularly heavy, making it difficult to breathe. On the east side of the shop, there appears to be several large objects on display, but the only distinguishable features are more shadows. }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
