R {34216}{0}{}{Middle of the toy counter (w,n,s)}{ }{This particular area of the shop is quite different from the others-- there's very little dust, and the counter is illuminated by a small internal light. It looks like the shopkeeper has been using this area as a workspace, as there's several tools lying around. The outline of the shopkeeper himself can be seen just a little further to the north. It looks like he was last working on the helicopter sitting on the counter. }{Toy Store}{dispenser}{}{}{1.000}{1}
