R {34217}{0}{}{Cash register (s,w)}{ }{The cash register sits on the counter beside the shopkeeper. The shopkeeper himself is busy working on something behind the counter, but glances up as you approach. Unlike the rest of the shop, there is very little dust in this area, but there's very little light. There's a list of available items printed on a sign lying on the counter. }{Toy Store}{gear_dispenser}{}{}{1.000}{1}
