E {34218}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34218}{0}{}{End of the toy shelf (s,e)}{ }{This is the end of the toy shelf. The flickering light above casts shadows on the dust covered toy shelf. This section was once devoted to candy, but most of it has decayed or been consumed by roaches. All that remains is a giant lollipop mounted on the wall. The dim outline of the shopkeeper moves fervently, as he works on his toys on the counter to the east. Looking back at the rest of the shop, shadows dance around the various objects within the shop. }{Toy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
