R {34219}{0}{}{Center of the First Rung (d,n,s,w,e)}{ }{You are standing at the center of the first rung of a celestial ladder.  Off the eastern horizon you see a deep purple planet setting.  The ground is slick and shiny like polished metal.  Loud crunching sounds emanate from the east.  Hundreds of tiny lighted objects flutter through the air around your head, distracting you as they float about aimlessly. To the west there are large CRASHING sounds and screams for help. }{Ladder}{ladder}{}{}{1.000}{1}
