R {34221}{0}{}{Droopy Celery Room (e,s)}{ }{You walk into the room and green stringy slime is up to your ankles.  It smells like rotten vegetables, and you can't imagine how anything could be any less crunchy than this.  The ceiling has droopy clear strings of organic matter hanging from it that brush against you and coat you with slime.  Your eyes begin to water at the noxious atmosphere of the room. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
