R {34222}{0}{}{The Land of Dancing Silver (w,n)}{ }{You fall into the room of sharpness, the land of dancing silver. There are large drawers for the silverware to lay down in when they are tired, which appear to be empty at the moment. This is the place the giant silverware call home, when giant silverware talk, that is.  Which isn't often, now that you think about it...  A scream for help interrupts your musings, but you can't tell where it is coming from. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
