R {34223}{0}{}{A stainless steel room (nw,s,w,e)}{ }{CRASH!!!!  The noise seems to be coming from all around you.  The ceiling is stainless steel, the floor is stainless steel, the windows are even stainless steel.  There is no obvious light source, the room just seems to glow on its own...CRASH!!!! }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
