R {34224}{0}{}{A Potato Chip House (ne,e,w,n)}{ }{Strangely enough this is the home of Ruffles potato chips.  The walls are very salty.  There are bits of ruffles scattered all over the room.  It is quite a humble single room house, with a wavey floor that crunches loudly beneath your feet.  The CRUNCHING is so loud all around you that you can hardly think. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
