R {34225}{0}{}{Crunchy Carrot Corner (s,w)}{ }{As you walk into the room your feet sqwoosh into ankle-deep sloppy orange goo.  A strange orange mist fills the air, stinging your eyes slightly, but making everything much clearer, if orange.  A few piles of orange mush lie in the corner, the remnants of the uncrunchy carrots. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
