R {34226}{0}{}{Crunching Chaos (sw,s)}{ }{The floor of this strange room is covered thickly with a yellow-orange dust that kinda smells like cheese, but not really.  Your nostrils burn from the intense smell and your skin crawls from the dust that clings to you. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34224}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34227}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34227}{0}{}{Radical Crunching Madness (w,n)}{ }{This room is rather red, reeking with a revulsive radishy rancidity.  This is the place that the Radical Radishes call home, and everything, from the hard, crunchy, red walls to the wilting greenery spouting out of the floor is permeated with the unbearable odour of radishes.  This is not normal, but it is the only reality that you can see here. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34224}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34226}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34228}{0}{}{Omelette Egg Paradise (se,s)}{ }{This room smells horrible, the stench of sulphur and rotten eggs blinding you.  The floor is gooey, sinking you ankle deep into the rotten-egg muck.  There don't seem to be any walls, but the ceiling spatters yellow rotten egg smuck onto your head. A scream for help catches your attention, but you're just not sure where to look. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34223}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34230}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34229}{0}{}{The Baking Corner (e,n)}{ }{A blast of hot air singes your face.  You can barely make out any of the details of the room, due to the ungodly heat.  The intense CRASHING sound of oven doors opening and slamming closed fills the air, making the room shake violently. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34223}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34222}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34230}{0}{}{Crashing Chaos (n,e)}{ }{A distant hum catches your attention, although you can't determine the source.  This room is made completely of crashing things.  The ceiling and floor are two giant cymbals, poised as if to crash together at any time.  The walls are trashcan lids, and the whole room shakes and jumps, making a tremendous racket.  A horrible smell comes from the north, like the sulphuric stench of rotting eggs. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34223}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34228}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34231}{0}{}{A sidewalk (e,s,n)}{ }{This used to be a sidewalk that surrounded the city square, but not much is left of it since the war.  You feel a strong pull coming from the center of the park.  There are giant mutant trees all around. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34220}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34233}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34235}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34232}{0}{}{A street (e,w)}{ }{The glow pulls you to the east, giving you a comforting feeling almost like it might be your way out of this uncontrollable place.  This road continues east and there is a bend in the road to the northeast.  CRACK!!!!!  Suddenly this area seems new and different. You feel lost... }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34234}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34233}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34233}{0}{}{A street (w,e,s)}{ }{The street is pitted and uneven, bearing the marks of some sort of incendiary explosion.  Some sort of old town square lays to the south, although it looks to be in as poor condition as the rest of this city.  The square seems to glow a strange greenish colour.  The road or at least its remains continues to the east and west. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34232}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34242}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34231}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34234}{0}{}{A street (w,e,s)}{ }{The center of the street is occupied by a huge hole shaped like the inside of a Ford Escort.  The outline of a car has been burned into the wall of a crumbled building.  The stench of burning skin and metal and fabric make you cringe instinctively.  To the southwest a glow emanates from what used to be a town square. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34237}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34232}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34239}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34235}{0}{}{A sidewalk (ne,e,n)}{ }{This used to be a sidewalk that surrounded the city square, but not much is left of it since the war.  You feel a strong pull coming from the center of the park, though you cannot see the source.  There are giant mutant trees all around.  Your eyes are drawn to one particularly large fruit tree. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34220}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34238}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34231}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34236}{0}{}{A sidewalk (w,nw,n)}{ }{You are at the southeastern part of the park.  The center of the park to the northwest is glowing intensely red.  You feel drawn to the center.  The massive void above the center seems to pulsate in a warping motion. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34220}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34238}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34237}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34237}{0}{}{A sidewalk (w,s,n)}{ }{This used to be a sidewalk that surrounded the city square, but not much is left of it since the war.  You feel a strong pull coming from the center of the park.  There are giant mutant trees all around. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34220}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34236}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34234}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34238}{0}{}{A sidewalk (e,w,n)}{ }{You are at the southern end of the park.  It is dark and eerie here.  The center of the park glows red and seems to be pulling you toward it.  Above the park is an odd empty void.  It's difficult to see but it looks as if an old wooden ladder were extending from the ground up into the void. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34220}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34236}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34235}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34239}{0}{}{A street (e,w)}{ }{This seems to be the outer edge of town.  This road continues a little further east.  It's leading to a tangled mess, looks like a twisted bank building that seems to have been occupied by some kind of inhuman creatures. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34234}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34240}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34240}{0}{}{A street (s,w)}{ }{The bank building lies directly to the south, showing every sign of inhabitation by some unknown type of creatures.  Take warning though, this wasteland is the land of mutants.  They don't take kindly to intruders, like yourself.  They will do whatever is necessary to remove any perceived threat. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34239}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34241}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34241}{0}{}{Bank hall (se,sw,ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{This is the main entrance hall of the twisted remains of a bank. The structure of the building is warped beyond recognition, almost like the different exits lead to completely irrational destinations.  Whatever kind of bomb hit this city has warped not only the structure, but the whole fabric of space around it, too. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34240}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34250}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34250}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34250}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34251}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34252}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34253}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34254}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34242}{0}{}{A ruined street (e,w)}{ }{This street is in utter disrepair, cluttered with rubble and the broken bones of the city.  The buildings around you are broken hulks of burned out shells, and completely uninhabitable.  Is this entire city in utter devastation? }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34233}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34243}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34243}{0}{}{An avenue (e,w)}{ }{This street is in surprisingly good condition, compared to the other sections of the street that you've seen.  It looks as though someone has taken the time to rebuild it.  The buildings look to be in much better condition around here, but they are still inaccessible. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34242}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34244}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34244}{0}{}{An avenue (e,w)}{ }{This section of the street is in very poor condition.  To top it all off, there are regular patrols by robotic drones.  The street continues to the east, where the road looks a little more interesting. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34243}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34245}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34245}{0}{}{An Avenue (e,w,s)}{ }{This street is marred by countless potholes.  No repair crew has been here in a very long time.  Damaged and burned out buildings line the street, little more than shadows hulking around the ruined city.  Utter silence reigns in this part of the city, adding to the atmosphere of desolation. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34244}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34246}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34247}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34246}{0}{}{An avenue (e)}{ }{This street is in worse condition than the other sections you've seen.  A building has collapsed to the west, completely blocking the street with a huge pile of rubble and scattering chunks of debris across the open part of the street.  It's too steep to be climbed, so the only way out is the way you came. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34245}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34247}{0}{}{The end of the alleyway (s,n)}{ }{The alleyway opens onto a street to the north.  There aren't the heaps of garbage here, but the street is still filthy, traces of blood and soot leaving the bricks of the street dull.  Everything here, from the walls beside you to the street seems to have been charred in a massive explosion, bleaching most of the colour out of everything. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34245}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34248}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34248}{0}{}{A filthy alleyway (s,n)}{ }{This alleyway is dirty, with heaps of garbage piled around the edges.  Other than that, the alley is featureless.  The bricks of the pavement are charred, eroded by some great heat or explosion. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34247}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34249}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34249}{0}{}{A deserted alleyway (n)}{ }{A few loose bricks litter the ground of the alleyway, and the pavement looks slightly charred in places.  Against one of the walls, you see the outline of a man burned into the brick. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34248}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34250}{0}{}{Office (sw,nw,s,e)}{1}{This must have been the bank president's office at one time, judging by its red plush carpet.  The rest of the furnishings of the room have been removed or destroyed, however, leaving an empty room.  You think its rather funny that the president's office is on the main floor.  That's when you realize that there is no ceiling in any of these rooms.  The building has been gutted. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34241}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34254}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34251}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34252}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34251}{0}{}{Bank hall (sw,ne,n,s,w)}{G}{This long, once majestic hall is twisted almost beyond recognition.  Space itself seems to be distorted, the exits leading in nonsensical directions and ending in the wrong place.  The very structure of the building has been warped into this twisted husk.  The once lush carpet is faded and worn, caked with the filth of gremlin habitation. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34241}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34253}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34252}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34250}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34254}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34252}{0}{}{Corridor (sw,ne,n,s,w,e)}{K}{This is a long narrow corridor which doesn't seem to lead to anywhere in particular, but exits lead in many directions.  It is impossible to tell exactly where the exits go, almost as if the building were truly warped, rooms and exits leading in completely nonsensical directions.  The air smells wretched, full of the stench of death. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34241}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34253}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
