E {34254}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34253}{0}{}{Hallway (se,nw,n,s,w,e)}{2}{This is the end of the hallway which offers many exits.  This room is where the mutants spend most of their time.  It's a large hallway which has ripped leather furniture and strange alien inscriptions on the walls.  Quite the party room. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34251}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34250}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34252}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
