E {34252}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34254}{0}{}{Ball Room (sw,nw,s,w)}{B}{The ballroom is luxurious in the extreme, made almost too glitzy by the vast array of expensive objects that occupy every bit of free space.  There is even a band in the corner, playing a mutant version of 'Ballroom Blitz'. }{Ladder}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34241}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34250}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34253}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34251}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34255}{0}{}{Under a Weeping Willow (leave)}{ }{Under the drooping branches of this large tree, all is sheltered from the prying eyes of the outside world. From this vantage point, there is no way to see how high the tree grows, but the canopy in this small leafy haven rises up high enough for even the tallest man. At the base of the tree, resting against the gnarled trunk, nestled in the lush grass is a small wooden bench. }{Lovers}{lovers}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {3993}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34257}{climb bench}{climb bench}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {47310}{sit down}{sit down}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34256}{0}{}{Your Imagination (stop listening)}{ }{You are caught up in the lonely man's story of love and sorrow. }{Lovers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {25839}{stop listening}{stop listening}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34257}{0}{}{Willow Branches (climb down)}{ }{High up in the branches of the willow tree, no more can be seen than could from the ground. The branches soar up high above, but they are far too weak to support anything heavier than a leaf or a bug. The leaves continue to sway, but the sound of rustling is clearer up here. }{Lovers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34255}{climb down}{climb down}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34258}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34255}{climb}{climb}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34258}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {34259}{0}{}{Ice Dragon's Treasure Cove (s)}{ }{This secret chamber is natural in formation.  The walls look like nothing more than standard ice cavern walls.  In the exact center of the room stands a small ice pedestal, which doesn't look so natural. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23976}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34260}{0}{}{-=(~ ~Jigokudani~ ~)=- (nw,d)}{ }{  The icy mountainside succumbs to the geothermal pressures from beneath, creating a steamy haven of glacial hot springs here.  The warm steam carves away the snow in huge drifts, revealing the bare rock underneath.  Many pools of lucid green water litter the landscape.  As you move closer in, the velvety steam parts and you stumble upon the bathing place of a clan of macaques. }{Jigokudani}{jigokudani}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34261}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1786}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53176}{climbing}{climbing}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53177}{descending}{descending}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53178}{dive largest pool}{dive largest pool}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34261}{0}{}{-=(~ ~Jigokudani~ ~)=- (se,ne)}{ }{  Walls of sculptured ice rise up like a wave on your left.  The spring burbles as bubbles of steamy water rise up from beneath.  Jagged volcanic rock juts out from the ice in a few places and forms the pool.  One large rock that extends out over the pool here serves as a lounge for the occasional macaque. }{Jigokudani}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34260}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34263}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34262}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {34260}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34263}{0}{}{-=(~ ~Jigokudani~ ~)=- (se,sw)}{ }{  This is the far edge of the springs.  You marvel at just how beautifully blue the ancient ice is here.  The snow near your feet has a tinge of green to it as your feet have scraped some algae off the rocks. The wind picks up and breaks the shroud of steam to chill you a bit. }{Jigokudani}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34261}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34264}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34264}{0}{}{-=(~ ~Jigokudani~ ~)=- (nw)}{ }{  Large icicles have formed from steam condensing, then dripping off the rock overhang here.  The spring here is particularly tumultuous as there isn't anywhere for the water to collect.  It just sprays off the surrounding rocks like a fountain and then makes its way into the other pools in icy cataracts. }{Jigokudani}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34263}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34265}{0}{}{>|< In the Center of the Black Pyramid >|< (e,w,n,s)}{ }{>|< In the Center of the Black Pyramid >|< You stand in a square chamber that must take up most of the center of the pyramid.  Corridors lead off in the cardinal directions, from each of the corners of the square.  Approximately 50 feet up, the walls begin to slope sharply to a point, from which hangs a massive green globe.  Rising up from the floor is a slender stand of black ice. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34266}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34267}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34268}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34269}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1784}{kneel}{kneel}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34266}{0}{}{>|< Before the Portal of Hatred >|< (e,w)}{ }{>|< Before the Portal of Hatred >|< This room is little more than a corridor, leading between the central chamber of the pyramid to the chamber to the east.  The room is colder than the rest of the Pyramid, seeming to leech away your strength.  The entrance to the eastern chamber is somehow hazy, not letting you see beyond the obscuring veil. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34265}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34271}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34267}{0}{}{>|< Before the Portal of Despair >|< (w,e)}{ }{>|< Before the Portal of Despair >|< This room is little more than a corridor, leading between the central chamber of the pyramid to the chamber to the west.  The room is bleak, filled with a miasma of utter hopelessness.  The entrance to the western chamber is somehow hazy, not letting you see beyond the obscuring veil. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34265}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34273}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34268}{0}{}{>|< Before the Portal of Fear >|< (n,s)}{ }{>|< Before the Portal of Fear >|< This room is little more than a corridor, leading between the central chamber of the pyramid to the chamber to the north.  The room is cloaked in a miasma of dread, filling your heart and soul with a terrible fear.  The entrance to the northern chamber is somehow hazy, not letting you see beyond the obscuring veil. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34265}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34272}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34269}{0}{}{>|< Before the Portal of Rage >|< (s,n)}{ }{>|< Before the Portal of Rage >|< This room is little more than a corridor, leading between the central chamber of the pyramid to the chamber to the south.  The room is alternately battered by waves of heat from the south and waves of chill from the north.  The entrance to the southern chamber is somehow hazy, not letting you see beyond the obscuring veil. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34265}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34270}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34270}{0}{}{>|< The Portal of Rage >|< (n)}{ }{>|< The Portal of Rage >|< The chill of the Pyramid is completely banished here by the raging portal that dominates this room.  In fact, you can't even see the walls of the room, distorted as they are by the waves of heat and rage emanating from the portal.  To the north, you can make out the misty veil through which you entered this room, although you cannot see through it. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34269}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34271}{0}{}{>|< The Portal of Hatred >|< (w)}{ }{>|< The Portal of Hatred >|< Nowhere else in the Pyramid have you experienced a chill as deep and all-consuming as that which radiates from the portal in the center of this area.  The portal itself pulses with the cold, cutting through to your bones like a knife.  The cold is so intense that it distorts the air, making the walls almost invisible. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34266}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34272}{0}{}{>|< The Portal of Fear >|< (s)}{ }{>|< The Portal of Fear >|< The space before you is awash in shadowy shapes that flicker through the room, entirely distorting any vision you might have of the walls.  Though the shadows flit through the entire space, they are more concentrated in one section of the room, around which the other shadows seem to revolve.  A hazy veil lays to the south, although you cannot see what is beyond it. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34268}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34273}{0}{}{>|< The Portal of Despair >|< (e)}{ }{>|< The Portal of Despair >|< There is nothing to see in this room, except the hazy veil to the east, beyond which you cannot see.  The rest of the room is engulfed in an utter blackness which swallows any light that comes in contact with it.  Although your eyes are useless to differentiate the darkness, your mind senses that the darkness is more solid, more real in an area that you assume to be the portal. }{Black Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34267}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34274}{0}{<268>}{The entrance hall of the operahouse (out,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You stand on the stairs leading into the famous Paris Operahouse.  A plush red carpet cushions your footsteps.  Overhead several small chandeliers light the hall with their flickering candles. The paneled walls are partially covered by thick draperies which  match the carpet in color. }{Phantom of the Opera}{phantom_of_the_opera}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34276}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21398}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53209}{sitting}{sitting}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34275}{0}{}{A room at the bottom of a sewer (w,e,u,n)}{ }{The bottom of the sewer seems to be some sort of communications raceway.  There are bundles of wires running all over the place down here. }{BBN Planet}{bbn_planet}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1896}{u}{u}{16}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34306}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34307}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
