R {34276}{0}{<268>}{The grand hall (w,e,n,s,nw,ne)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You stand in the grand hall of the Paris Opera House.  A pair of  doors stand open before you, leading to the theatre proper.  A long  winding stair rises to the west, leading to the upper floor and the  box seats.  The entire hall is well lit by several small  chandeliers holding flickering candles. }{Phantom of the Opera}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
