R {34283}{0}{<238>}{A powder room (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The room about you is brightly lit with gas lamps.  Several white  chairs are scattered about the room, some in small groups, others  before small tables.  Long oval mirrors hang above each small  table.  Overall the room feels strangely comfortable. }{Phantom of the Opera}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34278}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34284}{0}{<238>}{The theatre (s,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The lights are low here, as the play is about to start.  The huge  gas light chandelier above is only burning half its lights.  The rows upon rows of seats march steadily towards the front of the  theatre and the stage and orchestra pit.  The ceiling of the room arches high  overhead, shadowed in darkness now that the lights are down.  Above  you, and circling about the theatre you can see the private boxes. }{Phantom of the Opera}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
