R {34285}{0}{<238>}{The orchestra pit (n,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Rows of chairs and music stands sit within the soft glow of shaded  lamps.  Several drums of different sizes and types sit off to the  left.  The stage looms large above you, the curtains still closed. }{Phantom of the Opera}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34284}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34286}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34286}{0}{<238>}{On stage (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You're on the stage of the Paris Opera House!  Behind you the  seats seem to stretch out forever in rippling rows.  The orchestra  pit gives off a soft glow just below you.  The heavy curtains hang  closed before you, the colour of blood in the low light.  Small  stage lamps rest in reflective hoods to light the stage during the  show. }{Phantom of the Opera}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34285}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34287}{n}{squeeze}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
