R {34305}{0}{}{A cavern (e)}{P}{The passages have led you to this gigantic cavern under the opera  house.  A large underground lake stretches away to the west,  swallowed in the darkness of the cavern.  A small wrecked boat lies  nearby on the stones. }{Phantom of the Opera}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
