R {34306}{0}{}{A damp sewer (e)}{}{This space seems to be a shrine to wiring.  Every bundle has been meticulously wire tied, and strung out of the way. You've never seen such a nice, clean wiring job before. Of course, having seen the rest of the people here, there must be something wrong with it. }{BBN Planet}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34275}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34307}{0}{}{A cramped wiring closet (w)}{ }{You're surrounded by servers, switches, relays and hubs. The blinking lights are especially obnoxious under the fluorescent lighting.  There's a wall of transceivers that seem to be flashing madly.  Good thing that red lights aren't usually bad, eh? }{BBN Planet}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34275}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34308}{0}{}{A dismal white and grey corridor (w,e,s)}{}{The bleak grey partitions match the dull white wall perfectly. The only thing more obnoxious would be the headache you're getting from the throb of the fluorescent lighting. }{BBN Planet}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34275}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
