R {34309}{0}{}{A cramped wiring closet (e)}{ }{The wiring closet is in total disarray.  Wires are running every which way, with no signs of organization.  Sloppy cabling is highly evident, as you see cables under tension, and a few taking some severe curves. }{BBN Planet}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34308}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34310}{0}{}{A cramped wiring closet (w)}{ }{There's a giant connector here.  It's some of the scariest cabling you've ever seen.  You'd have much more confidence in this company if the connection wasn't attached with duct tape. }{BBN Planet}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34308}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

