R {34328}{0}{}{Paris?! (exit,s)}{X}{You suddenly find yourself in Paris...how did that happen? The day is glorious and the romantic French atmosphere puts you in the mood for almost anything! Well, anything except Mimes! They're everywhere! To the south of you lies the great Eiffel Tower. You don't see any tourists on the tower. Strange, maybe it's closed. }{Paris: Eiffel Tower}{eiffel_tower}{}{}{1.000}{1}
