R {34329}{0}{<178>}{Eiffel Tower Gardens (sw,se,n)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{You stand in a vast open area surrounding the Eiffel Tower. The Tower stands to the south of you and between you and the tower lies a beautiful reflecting pool. Pebbled paths lead deeper into the gardens and finely cut green grass outlines the paths. You see a sign here. }{Paris: Eiffel Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
