R {34338}{0}{}{On top of the Eiffel Tower (d)}{ }{Whew! Made it! You're at the top of the Eiffel Tower. You can see all of Paris from up here. Every direction you look there is something that catches your eye. Unfortunately, it looks like all the paths that lead away from the tower are blocked all except the one to the north. Maybe in the future the paths will be open so you can visit the rest of Paris! Watch your step on the way down!! There is a small plaque here! }{Paris: Eiffel Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
