R {34339}{0}{}{Entrance to a Laboratory (out,n)}{O}{You stand in the entrance of a large laboratory, the room perfectly clean and clutter free.  On the walls hang protective suits, some regular clothes and other odds and ends.  The floor is covered with shiny white ceramic tiles, as are the walls. The lab's ceiling is about ten feet high, made from solid cement, with several fluorescent lights illuminating every corner in the room, giving it a hygienic, hospital-like feel.  The rest of the lab can be seen off through the archway to the north.  It appears that you have arrived here during non-working hours. }{Wormhole Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
