R {34340}{0}{}{Laboratory recreation room (s,n)}{ }{This room appears to be the recreation and common room for this lab.  Several lounges and chairs sit up against the walls, while a large TV sits on a bench near the west wall.  In the centre of the room is a large table, with a few magazines scattered about on it.  A coffee machine sits next to the TV, on top of a large cabinet. }{Wormhole Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34339}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
