R {34341}{0}{}{The Lab's Computer Room (s,e)}{ }{The room is divided into several rows of desks, each of which has various computers and computer equipment sitting on them.  The walls here are covered with printouts and data charts, the results from some unknown experiments and testing.  A space is cleared around one of the computers in the centre of the room, suggesting that it is the main computer in this lab. }{Wormhole Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
