R {34342}{0}{}{Main Test Room (s,w)}{ }{This appears to be the main test room for the laboratory.  There are several desks in the room, on them sit various items of testing equipment and apparatus.  The majority of the items look like they are used for electrical or electronic purposes.  The walls, floor and ceiling are slightly blackened and damaged in some places. }{Wormhole Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
