R {34343}{0}{}{Storage Room (n)}{ }{This appears to be the main storage room for the laboratory.  Shelving is arranged along the walls, and more shelving forms aisles through the middle of the room.  On the shelving are various boxes of all shapes and sizes, test equipment, and things that look like they would be more at home in an alien spacecraft. }{Wormhole Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
