R {34344}{0}{}{A murky swamp (se,sw,ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{2}{You stand three feet deep in foul smelling and filthy swamp waters, the muck under the water threatening to suck and pull you under.  Dominating the swamp here is a large deformed tree, which seems to have grown larger than the others in this swamp.  Its branches are leafless and drooping, as though slumped in defeat.  Decaying vegetation is scattered about the area, the swamp waters dark and devoid of life.  The air is thick with a dense mist, obscuring your vision and assaulting your nose with its stench. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
