R {34359}{0}{}{A murky swamp (se,sw,ne,n,s,w,e)}{ 16}{The mud is fairly soft here, a person of average height would have to struggle to keep their head above the water.  Looking around the area you'd swear that you can see the dead trees sinking slowly down into the swamp waters.  Like early morning fog, the mist hovers above the water surface, obscuring your vision and making it even easier to get lost in this place. The swamp waters to the southwest bubble and froth, jets of swampy water spraying into the air.  Off to the northwest, you see a large muddy lip surrounding a sinkhole, holding the swamp waters at bay.  Foul gases and mist spew up out of the sinkhole, which creep and across the swamp like ghostly fingers.  To the northeast of here, a large gnarled tree can be seen rising up out of the swamp, its branches bare and deformed. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
