R {34361}{0}{}{A murky swamp (se,sw,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ 18}{You stand knee deep in foul smelling and filthy swamp waters.  Gnarled trees and stunted plantlife do their best to cling to life in this cursed muck, the waters dark and devoid of life.  The swamp makes disgusting sucking and slurping noises as you walk through it, the mud threatening to trap your feet. The air is thick with a dense mist, obscuring your vision and assaulting your nose with its stench.  Off to the northwest of you a large healthy bush grows, a strange sight in this dead place.  A large mud bank is visible to the northeast, serving as a lip to hold back the swamp waters from flowing into the sinkhole that is visible on the other side of it.  Off to the southeast of you the swamp bubbles and froths, little jets of water shooting into the air. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
