R {34364}{0}{}{A murky swamp (se,sw,ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ 21}{The swamp here seems to churn and move about, water and other more 'solid' things brushing by you.  The mud under your feet squirms and swirls, your feet sinking deeper into the muck with each step.  The air is thick with a dense mist, obscuring your vision and assaulting your nose with its stench. A large healthy bush grows here, its branches covered with bright green leaves, its roots deep and strong.  It casts an aura of light and life, and you'd swear that the swamp's waters shy back from it. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
