R {34367}{0}{}{A murky swamp (se,sw,ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ 24}{Large bubbles of air burst from the water's surface, spraying you with mud and stale water, filling the air with a sickly decaying smell.  The ever present mist billows along over the swamp, filling your lungs with its damp and stale smell.  Broken and twisted trees lie scattered about the area, long dead and constantly decaying until they become part of the swamp once again. To the south of you the outline of a large boulder is visible.  It sticks up about ten feet from the swamp's surface, moss and lichen growing all over it. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
