R {34368}{0}{}{A murky swamp (e)}{ 25}{You stand on a large mound of solid ground, this section of the swamp is high and dry.  Grass covers the soft soil beneath your feet, growing healthy and normal.  Several trees are scattered about, their trunks healthy and branches full of life.  In front of you to the west is a small hut, smoke rising out of its chimney and into the air.  A small well can be seen just to the south of the hut, while a large woodpile rests against the outer north wall of it. The mists seem to curve around this mound, as though they are repelled by some invisible barrier.  A small garden and flowerbed surrounds the hut, with numerous plants and flowers growing in it which appear to be perfectly  healthy also.  Light shines out from the hut's windows, and you think you can see movement inside.  The door to the hut is on the west wall facing you. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34365}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34369}{enter hut}{open door;enter hut}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34369}{0}{}{A small hut (out)}{ }{You stand inside a small hut, which seems warm and comfortable, unlike the swamp outside.  The hut is a single room, with a large fireplace against the north wall, spreading light and warmth about the room.  A large cauldron sits over the fire, a dark liquid bubbling and boiling in it.  In the centre of the room is a large table, with a few chairs around it, and some flowers in a vase on top.  A small bed sits against the south wall, its sheets and blankets neatly folded and clean.  You can see the mist and swamp outside through windows on each of the walls. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34368}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34370}{0}{}{The bottom of a sinkhole (ne)}{ }{The mist at the bottom of the sinkhole is so thick, it blocks the Sun's light and feels physically restrictive.  It billows past you, overflowing up and out of this deep pit. The walls of the sinkhole are slippery and soft, the mud running down them, forming the large muck-pool that you stand in. Through the thick mist you can just see the outline of a cave opening to your northeast. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34371}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34347}{climb walls}{climb walls}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34371}{0}{}{A large muddy cave (se,sw)}{ }{The cave is a rough semi-circle, about twenty-five feet wide and thirteen feet high.  It appears to be tunnelled out of solid mud, which oozes down the walls, making you wonder just how the thing avoids collapsing.  Muddy waters slush about your feet, threatening to suck you under, while the dense mist rushes past you, almost pushing you backwards.  Muffled rumbling and wheezing sounds can be heard coming from deeper within the cave. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34370}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34372}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34372}{0}{}{A huge muddy cavern (nw)}{ }{The cave opens out into a massive cavern, roughly semicircular in shape and at least one hundred feet across.  The muddy waters are quite deep here, and even more sickly than those seen previously.  Dead and decaying tree roots hang like vines from the cave's ceiling, like giant wind chimes.  The mist is very thick in this cavern, which appears to be its place of origin. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34371}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34373}{0}{}{On top of a large boulder (d)}{ }{The top of the rock is relatively dry and cool. The dense mist surrounds you, blocking your view of everything, even the swamp waters which lap at the base of the rock just below you.  Moss and lichen cover the rock's surface, which feels soft and spongy under your feet. }{Murky Swamps}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34354}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
