R {34374}{0}{}{A very experimental room (out)}{ }{This room is laid out neatly, consisting of several tables, some computer gear, and several weird looking devices.  Four of the devices seem to be positioned in a square shape, facing towards the centre of the room.  Data cables run between these devices and the computers, either for monitoring or controlling purposes.  Much thicker power cables are also connected to the devices, capable of supplying a large current on demand.  The walls, floor and ceiling here appear to be solid cement, differing from the rest of the lab. A control panel sits on a stool near the south door from which you entered. }{Wormhole Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
