R {34375}{0}{}{Golden Arches (s,n)}{ }{As you step through the Golden Arches, you are bombarded by the smell of grease.  For a moment, you can't remember why you came in here.  Severe hunger pains remind you of the 'Big Mac Attack' you are having.  You see the end of a long line in front of you. }{Mcdonald's}{mcd}{}{}{1.000}{1}
