R {34376}{0}{}{Standing in a long line. (s,n)}{ }{You are standing in a long line.  You can't see the counter because of all the people around you.  It feels like the walls are closing in on you and you can barely move. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
