R {34377}{0}{}{Counter (e,door,n,s)}{D}{After waiting for what seemed like forever, it's finally your turn to order.  A row of machines, all eager to suck the money from your pants, line the counter.  You squint your eyes as you struggle to decipher the menu board.  Just as you go to place your order, a 'CLOSED' sign pops up on the cash register.  A door behind the counter piques your curiousity. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34376}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34378}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
