R {34378}{0}{}{Dining Room (w,e)}{ }{Skillfully maneuvering your tray through the sea of people waiting in line, you enter the dining room just in time to witness the 'foodfight to end all foodfights'.  You scope out a table in the back where you might be able to eat your meal in peace. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34377}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34381}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34379}{0}{}{Manager's Office (door)}{ }{The sign on the door reads 'Manager's Office: Stay Out!!' Now you're thinking you should have listened.  The sight and smell is overwhelming.  Moldy coffee cups and faded hamburger wrappers clutter the floor.  A brown vinyl couch, littered with cigarette butts and dirty magazines, sits diagonally against wood-paneled walls. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34377}{door}{door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34380}{0}{}{Kitchen (w,s)}{ }{Somehow you've gotten lost and find yourself in the kitchen.  A despondent employee picks a bun up off the floor and dusts a cockroach off with his hand.  The smell of fried burgers and burning buns assaults your senses.  The food in your stomach starts churning violently, you're not sure if you can keep it down. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34377}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34383}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34381}{0}{}{Trashcan (n,w)}{ }{After forcing down a dry Big Mac and cold fries, you bring your tray to a big yellow trashcan.  Trays covered with crumbs and spilled soda sit on top.  You shiver at the thought of what's inside.  As you go to dump your trash in, you notice some half-eaten food lying on the floor. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34378}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34382}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34382}{0}{}{A Slippery floor (s)}{ }{Knowing what you know, that the food you've just eaten will soon be leaving your body faster than a speeding bullet, you make a trip back to the bathrooms.  After almost slipping in a puddle of water, you notice a yellow 'Slippery When Wet' sign sitting on the floor.  You gather from all the water pouring out of the bathroom, that the toilets have overflowed.  It's at this point you realize you won't be able to use the bathroom. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34381}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34383}{0}{}{Freezer (e)}{ }{You are blasted by the cold as you enter the freezer.  Battered cardboard boxes and dented plastic containers adorn the tall metal shelves.  A mass of ketchup and chopped onion is frozen to the floor.  An opened jar of pickles, spilled in front of a large hole in the wall, catches your eye. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34380}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34384}{escape through hole}{escape through hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34384}{0}{}{French Fry Cooker (se)}{ }{Just as you thought you had escaped one horror, you land yourself into another, the french fry cooker.  Slices of frozen potato methodically do a dance of death around you.  'It's not so bad in here', you think to yourself, as you bob joyously in the oil.  Suddenly, you are swept away by a large, uncaring, metal hand and thrown thoughtlessly on a tray. }{Mcdonald's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34377}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34385}{0}{}{-=( Over by the Soda Fountain )=- (w)}{ }{                  -=( Over by the Soda Fountain )=-   This room is a small alcove where patrons come to sit and enjoy their lovely food and beverages.  There are a pair of overstuffed lounge chairs here, a coffee table, as well as several sets of tables and chairs big enough for two.  The soda fountain is also here, and you can purchase a cup from the shopkeeper and fill it.  The light is somehow softer here, it is warm and comforting.  Very old photographs are framed and hung on the walls along with examples of Patricia's needlework. }{Patisserie}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14940}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34386}{0}{}{-=( In The Kitchen )=- (out,s)}{ }{                      -=( In the Kitchen )=-   You stand in the kitchen of Harry and Patricia's Patisserie.  The room gives an overwhelming impression of hygiene and good organization.  Bulk quantities of cooking ingredients fill the shelves, while bowls and other cooking implements line the walls.  The room contains several stainless steel benches, and a large oven dominates one wall while a stove, a refrigerator and a series of deep fryers sit against others.  There is only one staff member working in the shop, so the kitchen is currently unattended.  To the north is a door. }{Patisserie}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
