R {34395}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,e,n)}{ }{You are in the south part of the refrigerator. Death and destruction are everywhere. Right before your feet you see about ten corpses, both vegetables' and fruits'. You wish there was a way to end this war fast.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
