R {34397}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,n,s)}{ }{The smell in here is terrible! As you look at the wall to the east, you see a yellow mess, which might be the source of the smell. You feel like moving on, to keep your warmth up.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
