R {34399}{0}{}{The refrigerator (e,n,s)}{ }{Woah! It's slippery in here! As you look down on the slippery floor you notice that it is completely covered with butter. You heard recent rumours about a big massacre among the butter brigade in this war, and the butter on the floor must be the victims.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
