R {34400}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,s)}{ }{The northeast corner of the refrigerator looks a lot like the rest of this strange place. The only difference is the smell of orange here, and small signs on the floor with skulls on them. You should probably pay attention to them, since they look important.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34398}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34402}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34401}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,e,n,s)}{ }{The center room of the second floor seems to be cleaned out. Below your feet you see a pile of dead cherries, completely squashed by maybe a melon, or possible something even bigger. You wish you could just run away from all this misery.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34398}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34402}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34399}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34404}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34402}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,n,s)}{ }{Woah! You have found the famous kiwi-pult! Firmly attached to the floor, you see the mighty fruit catapult, ready for action. All around you, the sounds of dying fruits can be heard.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34400}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34401}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34403}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34403}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,n)}{ }{This is the southeast corner of the refrigerator. You sigh with relief as you fail to see any soldiers of either side in here, and you feel slightly more relaxed. The relaxation is suddenly interrupted by a scream further away, and the imagined idyll in your mind disappears.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34402}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34404}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34404}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,e,n)}{ }{Ack! Not this too, you think as you see the south wall, floor and the ceiling completely covered with coca-cola commercials. Jukeboxes, towels and jackets are just a few examples of the environment you learned to hate so much. Is there really no limit?  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34401}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34405}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34403}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34405}{0}{}{The refrigerator (jump,e,n)}{ }{You are now in the southwest corner of this refrigerator-battlefield. As you look up, you see that you can jump up a floor from here. You wonder what will meet you there. More blood and destruction?  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34399}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34406}{jump}{jump}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
