E {34406}{u}{jump}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34406}{0}{}{The refrigerator (jump,e,n)}{ }{This is the southwest corner of the cold box. As you look down on the floor you discover a small plateau, making it possible to jump down a floor from here. The battles seem intensified up here, and you hear screams of fruits and vegetables everywhere.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34405}{d}{jump}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
