R {34408}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,e,n)}{ }{In this room, there is usually a lightbulb to light up the large cold box you are in. There is a socket on the wall where the lightbulb usually dwells. Right above your head is the roof of the refrigerator, and you can see water drip from it, ending up in a little puddle below your feet.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34406}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34410}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
