E {47294}{enter socket}{enter socket}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34409}{0}{}{The refrigerator (e,n,s)}{ }{The smell of onion is the first thing you notice upon entering this area of this strange and chilly box. Your eyes gets watery as the strong smell penetrates your nose, and as you look around you see hacked onion everywhere!  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34406}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34411}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34415}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34410}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,n)}{ }{The southeastern corner of the refrigerator is quiet and peaceful. The thick smoke on the floor convinces you that this shelter is just temporarily though, and the bullet holes in the walls convinces you even more.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34408}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34412}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34411}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,e,n,s)}{ }{The middle area of this floor is filled with rotting shells from killed vegetable beings. Right in front of your feet you notice the corpse of a small onion kid with a bazooka in her hands. Yet another kid gives her life for this totally pointless war.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34408}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34412}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34409}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34414}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34412}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,n,s)}{ }{In this part of the floor the fruit commander usually leads her troops. All around you, you can hear the battlecries from adrenaline-filled fruits as they rush onward to kill the vegetables.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34410}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34411}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34413}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34413}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,s)}{ }{The northeast corner seems to have been forgotten by everyone and everything. Against the east wall you see some leftovers, and the little pile must be from where this horrible stench comes. Poor food.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34412}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34414}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34414}{0}{}{The refrigerator (w,e,s)}{ }{The northern part of the refrigerator has the floor covered with long sharp poles, and you wonder why. The cold air makes you wrap your clothes tighter around you, and you start thinking about how nice and warm it is outside.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34411}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34415}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34413}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34415}{0}{}{The refrigerator (s,e)}{ }{Music fills your ears when you enter the room. About twenty leis are hanging on the north wall, and you also see pictures of half naked women there. You are boggled at how far this room is from the war just a few meters away.  }{Wandering Refrigerator}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34409}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34414}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34416}{0}{}{A Riverbank (u)}{ }{You stand on the bank of a rushing river. A bluestone bridge looms overhead, and a path leads back up the river bank. }{Troll Bridge}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4283}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34417}{climb vines}{climb vines}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34417}{0}{}{Climbing a Pylon (hole,d)}{ }{The climbing honeysuckle ends here, and you can climb no higher. The looming bridge makes this area pretty dark. The river roars below you. You notice a dark hole leading into the pylon... with all the vines you couldn't see it from the ground.  }{Troll Bridge}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34416}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34418}{hole}{hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {47309}{jump in river}{jump in river}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {47309}{n}{jump in river}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34418}{0}{}{A Lair (out)}{ }{This small cavern has been tunneled out of the embankment dirt behind the bridge pylon. The packed walls and ceiling have been reinforced with rough bits of timber, obviously scavenged from here and there. Stones taken from the bridge pave the floor. What strikes you most is the odd stench... some sort of foul-smelling creatures must live here. Bones and other discarded items are scattered across the floor. Two old wooden boxes look like makeshift stools. In the far corner is a pile of rags and straw that is most likely a bed. }{Troll Bridge}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34417}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34419}{0}{}{In a Well}{ }{You are in the close-quarters of a small, fairly shallow well. The walls drip with cool, crisp water and the air is slightly more frigid down here.  The water level in this damp hole rises to about mid-thigh.  You can see light straight above, where the opening of the well exists. }{Unknown}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24094}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34420}{0}{}{Corner of the Borg Cube. (portal,e,d,s)}{<158>P<088>}{Corner of the Borg Cube. Three walls here are part of the external surface of the Borg Cube. Everything is gray and dark, with pipes and cables only sporadically interrupting the uniformity. The walls are sparsely filled with unrecognizable machines and hardware. You feel slightly uneasy and realise you are sensing a sinister power in the air, although at the moment it is faint and hard to define. A portal is formed here from a shimmering rift in the air. }{Borg Cubes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
