R {34509}{0}{}{Edge of the Borg Cube. (w,e,u,s)}{ }{Edge of the Borg Cube. Two walls here are part of the external surface of the Borg Cube. Everything is light gray, the walls are almost perfectly uniform and smooth. One or two pipes, and the odd cable are the only obvious features. There are no machines here, none of the advanced technology you might expect. You feel a heavy pressure in your mind, there is a source of tremendous power nearby. }{Borg Cubes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
