R {34519}{0}{}{The Center of the Borg (portal)}{<158>P<088>}{The Center of the Borg. This place is beyond both space and time. You see no walls, no floor, and no ceiling. Direction is without meaning since there is nothing on which to focus\; all around you is luminescent and pure white. This is the origin of all Borg thought, the attainment of perfection inherent in the Borg logic is manifest from this place. Captured here is knowledge of the biological and technological distinctiveness of thousands of cultures assimilated by the Borg. The only feature is a small portal wavering in the air }{Borg Cubes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
