R {34520}{0}{}{A Swirling Sticky Cavern (sw,climb,se)}{C}{You find yourself in a large cavern.  You are up to your waist in the silicon.  The caverns form some sort of primitive mineral kingdom.  The strange shadows on the walls play havoc with your senses.  The silicon makes foul sucking sounds as it forms slow eddies around you.  There are two narrow openings to the south.  Light streams in through a hole in the ceiling of the cavern.   }{Silicon Caverns}{silicon_caverns}{}{}{1.000}{1}
