R {34545}{0}{}{<-> Secret Lab <-> (u)}{ }{This small enclosed room has nothing but computers, electronic wiring, and control panels, that run along the walls and connect to a pod-like chamber in the corner.  Off to the northern part of the room are a few roll-away beds with occupants lying upon them under sheets.  You shudder to think what caused them their early departure from the world.  If you know anything about your current locale so far, it's that you do not want to end up like one of those adornments on the beds. }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
