R {34567}{0}{<228>}{(*) The Vidarian Wilds (*) (sw,e,se,s)}{<228>* *<088>}{A bright light illuminates the wild and untamed jungle around you.  Ferns and unchecked shrubbery sprout up all along the ground and spread out as far as the eye can see.  Strange-looking trees, of which resemble nothing you would see elsewhere, stretch high into the purple sky above.  You seem to be standing in the only semblance of a path around, and must now decide which direction to explore. }{Vidaria}{vidaria}{}{}{1.000}{1}
