R {34568}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (sw,ne,s)}{<228>* *<088>}{The humidity hangs heavy in the air, while perspiration clings to your body, suffocating your pores.  Twisting vines and roots snag at your clothing and leave scratches upon your skin. The terrain begins to slope downward here, or it could be that you appear to be sinking.  Shaking off the thought of becoming completely lost in this wild jungle, you look further ahead along the unmarked trail. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34567}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34580}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
