R {34569}{0}{<228>}{(*) The Vidarian Wilds (*) (w,e,s)}{<228>* *<088>}{The trees are a little more spaced out here, and the roots less concentrated, opening up a wider area for you to travel through.  From off in the distance, some strange noises make their way to your ears.  They sound much like clicking or tapping of some sort, making you wonder what it could be.  The moon sheds its rays down here, lighting the surroundings efficiently enough to see by. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34567}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
