R {34570}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (n,nw)}{<228>* *<088>}{Off in the distance, you hear the cacophonous clicking noises of some of the jungle's inhabitants.  Scanning the surroundings, you notice the thick heavy jungle brush blocks any further passage southward, while the towering trees block out all but a sliver of the purple moonlight shining down from above. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34567}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34569}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34571}{0}{}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (n)}{ }{The shrubbery of the jungle around you grows quite heavily in all directions but north.  A small campsite resides here with a fire pit at the center, a small make-shift structure built up underneath the cover of the trees, and did you just see a wretched looking body tied up to a stake?  The stench of the decomposing thing enters your nose and you feel a strong urge to gag.  Controlling your internal functions quite remarkably, you manage to deal with the view. You watch as the Huntress of the wilds stalks around searching for her prey.  It would be wise to avoid disturbing her with anything more than quiet conversation. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34567}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34572}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (w)}{<228>* *<088>}{A strange-looking tree stands here, unlike all the others surrounding it.  It shakes back and fourth as the air forcefully blows through.  The heavy jungle becomes too concentrated to go any direction but the one from which you came.  Through a break in the trees, you see the moon shed its purple rays down around you and the jungle floor.  You are astounded at all the colors that are represented here in this alien place. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34569}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

