R {34580}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (ne,s,e)}{<228>* *<088>}{Stumbling through the wild jungle, you notice that even though the alien environment has many trivialities that must be endured, it is also quite scenic and even a little peaceful.  You admire the many to the ground, its last bit colors represented along the trees, leaves and jungle brush.  The alien serenity appeals to all who venture here. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
