R {34581}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (w,e,n)}{<228>* *<088>}{The temperature seems to just keep elevating and you begin to feel faint.  The wild maze you're walking through only adds to your deteriorating attitude.  After every fall you make, you swear at the tangling roots upon the jungle floor, as if they could actually understand your disgust. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
