R {34582}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (* (s,w)}{<228>* *<088>}{With no end in sight, you continue on through the wild alien jungle.  A hanging vine whips you across the face as you clear your path.  You feel the blood trickle down slowly and wipe it off with a quick swipe. The ground begins to get more firm, and footing becomes more easily attainable. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34581}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34583}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34583}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (e,se,n,s)}{<228>* *<088>}{Leaves litter the jungle floor making crunching noises as you travel through.  The jungle opens up, and the thick jungle shrubbery does not grow in such heavy excess here. Through a break in the trees, you see the planet's moon shining above in the sky.  The purple rays of light it radiates make their way down to you, giving your surroundings a neon-like ambiance. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
