R {34584}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (e,w,s)}{<228>* *<088>}{'Lost in the jungle' you say to yourself bitterly.  The tight confines of your surroundings begin to squeeze what little confidence remains from within you.  The trees mock your meager attempts to navigate through and around their entangling roots.  You often find yourself turned around and right back where you started from.  The alien habitat begins to take its toll. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34583}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
