R {34585}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (nw,n)}{<228>* *<088>}{Under the eerie moonlit jungle, you stumble around from tree to tree, trying to keep balanced.  The heavy brush and twisting roots entangle your feet with every step.  The air is dry, and the temperature humid. You cannot be sure whether it is truly day or night in this alien habitat.  Regardless of what it may appear to be, you know this place does not act like anywhere else you have visited. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34583}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34584}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34586}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (n)}{<228>* *<088>}{Alas the jungle forms yet another dead end.  The heavy concentration of shrubs and brush prevent travel any deeper within the 'Wilds'.  A cool breeze whips through the trees, and just for a moment you forget how hot you are.  The moment passes, as does the gentle wind.  Consequentially\; you find yourself sweating profusely once again. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34583}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34587}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (e,w,s,n)}{<228>* *<088>}{As you gaze about the hostile jungle warily, your eyes are unavoidably drawn to the strangely luminous purple moon hanging above you in the sky. Its glow reflects off of the vine-laden orange trees, contrasting in a way that manages to be both beautifully exotic\; and repelling at once. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
