R {34591}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (w,e,n,nw,ne,se)}{<228>* *<088>}{The valley continues on for miles and miles.  The tall grass lies still and restless.  You move through the alien growth.  Giving way briefly allowing you passage, it springs back up as if it was never pushed aside.  You constantly lose yourself in this wide open expanse, and cannot be sure if you have either been here before or not. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
