R {34592}{0}{<148>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (e)}{<118>|<138>|<148>|<088>}{You're standing upon a large cliff.  Peeking your head over the edge,  you see fiery lava flowing rapidly below.  The drop off from the valley to the canal below is at least a few hundred feet down.  It would be suicidal to fall that far, so you take a few steps back.  A large stone protruding from the earth catches your attention here. }{Carina's Observatory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
