R {34594}{0}{<228>}{(*) Vidarian Wilds (*) (n)}{<228>* *<088>}{A small pool of water rests within the ground, circling three quarters of the way around a small tree.  The rest of the jungle becomes too heavy, and the only clear path out is the way from which you came.  The glistening water sparkles as small waves ripple to the very breach of the pool.  The roots from all the surrounding trees seem to be dipped within it.  You are rather surprised to see this since they're usually entangling your feet. }{Vidaria}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
