R {34606}{0}{}{Inside a Toyota truck (out)}{ }{You are inside a Toyota SR5, the outside is painted desert camoflage so you can travel the desert undetected. A young private of the elite team is here to escort you to the Alpha HQ. He is sworn to silence so he won't be much for conversation. You should just sit back because this is going to take a while. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34607}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34607}{0}{}{Alpha Team's Secret HQ (out)}{ }{From the desert appears the Alpha Team's Secret HQ. If you hadn't been driven here, there is no way you could have found it. A large desert-camo tent covering this area makes it invisible in the desert, a perfect place for a HQ. A little off in the distance you notice a small shuttle of some sort. You notice a large satellite uplink here. This must be the main control for all Alpha Team communication. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {605}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34609}{enter shuttle}{enter shuttle}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34608}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {34609}{0}{}{Inside a small shuttle (out)}{ }{You are inside a small shuttle. Obviously one of the many high-tech gadgets paid by the government for the Alpha Team. Mamma Bear has set the controls to take you to the freighter. So sit back in one of the comfy chairs, and enjoy the ride. And _DON'T_ touch anything! }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34610}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34610}{0}{}{Docking bay}{S}{This is the docking bay of the ship. The main power in the ship seems to be down, because only the sporadic lighting of the red emergency lights barely illuminates the room. To the north are the huge doors that allow shuttles and small ships to enter and land on this galaxy cruiser. To the south is a door that leads out into the rest of the ship. You can't help but wonder what terror awaits you out there. There is a panel near the door that is probably used to open it. You also notice a small plaque on the wall. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34611}{s}{push open;s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34611}{0}{<268>}{Corridor outside docking bay (w,e,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are in a corridor outside the ship's docking bay. It is dark here, but you can make out shadows and shapes in the red glow coming from the emergency lighting. Corridors branch off from here to the east, west, and south. The docking bay is to the north. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
