R {34632}{0}{<238>}{Weapons Room (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The weapons locker contains everything you could dream of in the form of firepower. Row after row of guns, and explosives line the walls. You notice where a large flame thrower used to sit, someone must have grabbed it already. With this much firepower you feel that maybe its time to go kick some alien ass! }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
