R {34643}{0}{<268>}{Corridor north of cargo bay (ne,n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{In the dim red light you can make out some yellow lettering and arrows on the west wall of the corridor you are in. To the south, as the lettering indicates, is the cargo bay. To the north is the engineering section of the ship. The lettering also indicates that the Science Lab is to northeast, but there is a door that is welded tight blocking the path. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
