R {34644}{0}{<078>}{Science Lab (n)}{<078>| |<088>}{Large rocks, and mineral samples lay scattered about. Broken shelving lays toppled onto the floor. The room once used to study geology, now lays in ruins. You notice a large corpse of an alien laying in the corner. A trail of acid leads to a small rock used to pummel it to death. The sight of the corpse gives you a sense of gratitude that the crew tried to fight back. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34699}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34645}{0}{<078>}{Engineering (w,n,s)}{<078>| |<088>}{This is the engineering section of the ship. In this section, as in the others, there are a large number of battle signs. Blast marks litter the computer display screens, and blood is smeared all over the floor. Large scratch marks also cover the equipment. The air is also warmer in here than any other part of the ship. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
