R {34646}{0}{<078>}{Engineering (n,e)}{<078>| |<088>}{You are in the west corner of the engineering section. Computers thrown about scatter the room. Tables are piled in the corner creating a small make-shift barricade. Though you realize it must have not been to effective with all the blood around. Sparks fly up from the broken monitor near you. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
