R {34647}{0}{<078>}{Engineering (w,n,s)}{<078>| |<088>}{In the dim light you make out a small figure. It sits facing a row of computers on the east wall of the engineering section. Smoke barrels out from the broken monitors around it. Through the chaos you catch a a brief flicker from the monitor. You also notice the smoke begin to swirl ever so gently in the corner, giving you a feeling that you are not alone. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
