R {34651}{0}{<078>}{Engineering (s)}{<078>| |<088>}{This is the rear of the engineering department. There are many controls here to operate the power generator of the ship. There is a display here, above the controls, showing the status of the ship's engines. Sparks fly from one of the computers that had its display damaged from a phaser shot. The air smells of a putrid mixture of melting electrical components and blood. You see a small closet to the west. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
