R {34652}{0}{<248>}{A small closet (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{As you enter this small dark room, you stumble over many miscellaneous parts that have been thrown here for disposal. You can see a small panel on the back wall that has been shifted out of its initial position. This room is amazingly clean compared to the rest of the ship. You are not alone though, as you notice someone else has sought the shelter of this closet. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
