R {34653}{0}{<268>}{Corridor outside barracks (n,se)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The emergency lights are directly overhead here, making it a little brighter. On the west wall you can make out some yellow lettering with an arrow underneath it pointing to the north. On all the walls you can see scorch marks. It looks as if there might have been a violent battle here.  Inix     Uptime: 4.1 days  Reboot: 5.6 days  Lag: 0.00  Idle: [00:00:01]   The corridor continues to the southeast and the north. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
