R {34655}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a room in the barracks section of the ship. The emergency lighting has failed here, so only the dim light from the corridor provides any illumination at all. Everything is in shambles here. The bed is overturned and it looks as if it was used as a barricade against something. There are dried pools of blood on the floor, but no bodies. You wonder why. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
