R {34656}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This was once the living quarters of a crew member of this ship, but it is now nothing more than the site of a disaster. The furniture now lies in a pile of twisted metal all over the floor. On top of the pile is a twisted grate that came from somewhere. Something very large and violent must have done this. The corridor is back to the west. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
