R {34664}{0}{<238>}{Medical lab (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{You are in the medical lab of the ship. To the west is a set of doors that have been barricaded shut. In the dim light you can see that sealing the doors did not save the crew members. Blood is splattered everywhere and medical supplies lay scattered on the floor and the counter on the east wall. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34667}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34665}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The devastation in this room is complete. It looks as if something was upset it could not get into the room across the hall. Rubble litters the floor and the bed has been destroyed and thrown against the wall. Blood is splattered everywhere. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
