R {34670}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The destruction in this room is incredible. In the dim red glow you can't make out anything recognizable from the rubble that lies strewn about the floor. On the walls you can make out countless scratch marks and plasma burns. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
