R {34671}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is a room in the living quarters section of the ship. It is very dark in here because it looks as if the emergency lights have all been smashed by something and the only illumination is coming from the corridor. Your skin crawls as you see what looks to be a human finger lying under some rubble. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
