R {34673}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (w)}{<238>[<178>S<238>]<088>}{From what you can tell, there wasn't much of a battle in this room. It looks as if something entered, slaughtered the crew members and dragged their bodies out. There is a streak of blood running along the floor, out the door, and into the corridor. The room is pretty much intact. The bed is made, and all the compartments are closed. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34672}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34674}{0}{<238>}{Room in barracks (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Deep scratches cover the walls in this room. Blood stains the floor. This was obviously the site of a vicious attack on the crew members of the ship. By the look of things, their death was not a pleasant one. The corridor is back out to the east. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34672}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34675}{0}{<268>}{Corridor north of barracks (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This corridor runs from the living quarters of the ship to the south, to the escape shuttles to the north. In the dim light you can see burn holes in the walls and floor of the corridor. You wonder what could have caused this type of damage. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
