R {34676}{0}{<268>}{Corridor south of escape shuttles (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{To the north of here are the escape shuttles of the ship. Back to the south is the barracks and the rest of the ship. The lighting is very poor here, and you can't really make anything out in detail. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
