R {34677}{0}{<268>}{Escape Pods (w,e,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The corridor comes to an end here at the back of the ship. To the east and west, you can see the escape pods in the dim lighting. This looks to be the only way off the ship. Lucky for you the crew of the ship did not make it this far or you might not have been able to get home. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
