R {34701}{0}{<078>}{Science Lab (s)}{<078>| |<088>}{There are a variety of cages here with creatures that you can not recognize. You determine that this is some kind of experimentation lab where creatures are examined. Some of the species have been wounded or killed in the battle. The area smells of decay, and there are bodies scattered about the floor. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
