R {34702}{0}{<238>}{Air duct (s)}{<238>] [<088>}{You are in a maze of air ducts that run above the main floor of the ship and provide fresh oxygen to all parts of the ship. Everything here seems to look the same as every other part of the ducts. Your light source reflects back at you in the shined stainless steel. You can tell these ducts have been traveled recently by a large number of beings by the markings in the dust on the floor. In the floor is a large square grate that covers a hole to the room below. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
