R {34703}{0}{<268>}{Near the reactor (s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{A long corridor heading towards the reactor control room. The walls here are covered with an alien webbing that forms a holding chamber for their next meal. From the amount of exo-plasmic goo around here you feel that you are getting close to something important. Though through the darkness you can't make out what is ahead. Above you in the ceiling is the hole that you just dropped through. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
