R {34704}{0}{}{Reactor Control Console (n)}{<178>(<118>~<178>)<088>}{You stand in the room once used by the crew as the control room for the reactor core. Now converted by the alien queen as the breeding ground of this horrendous race. The walls here are covered with an alien webbing that forms a holding chamber for their next meal. From the webbing you can see bodies of the crew members struggling to become free. A large control console, that once was used to monitor the reactor core sits here. You here a loud noise coming from inside the core.  }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
