R {34732}{0}{<238>}{Ammunitions Dump (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Piles of ammunition lay stacked on the floor. Scattered about loose cartridges cover the floor. Missed bullets blanket the walls, explaining the massive battle that had taken place here. Dead corpses of both alien and human alike lay here bleeding. A small doorway to the north reads 'WEAPONS' you might find a little friendly firepower in there. A large file cabinet is leaning against the wall allowing access to the open vent up above. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
