R {34733}{0}{<238>}{Weapons Room (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The weapons locker contains everything you could dream of in the form of firepower. Row after row of guns, and explosives line the walls. You notice where a large flame thrower used to sit, someone must have grabbed it already. With this much firepower you feel that maybe its time to go kick some alien ass! }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34732}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34734}{0}{<248>}{A small closet (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{As you enter this small dark room, you stumble over many miscellaneous parts that have been thrown here for disposal. You can see a small panel on the back wall that has been shifted out of its initial position. This room is amazingly clean compared to the rest of the ship. You are not alone though, as you notice someone else has sought the shelter of this closet. }{Alien/Alpha}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7782}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

