R {34742}{0}{<268>}{corridor (n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{You are in a damp and musty corridor deep within the castle.  The stench is almost unbearble and the cold clings to your breath. The walls are covered with slime and seem to glow slightly. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
