R {34743}{0}{<248>}{secret room (fireplace)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{This smokey room lies behind the fireplace.  Glinting through the smoke and grime, you see some coins on the floor.  A sconce on the eastern wall holds a torch that burns brightly, while the fireplace to the east also sheds light.  A skeleton lies on the floor in broken platemail armour. The room is otherwise empty. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
