R {34744}{0}{}{secret room (e)}{ }{This hall looks very old and ruined.  The entire area is choked by spider webs, their dusty forms hide the very walls and ceiling.  The webs are broken by a single path down the center of the room leading eastward. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34745}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34749}{s}{push brick}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
