R {34745}{0}{}{belfry (w)}{ }{Dusty cobwebs fill the area, their musty smell assaulting your senses and obscuring sight.  Deep pools of darkness lie all about you as you attempt in vain to penetrate the spidery veils with your sight.  A single path leads from the center of the room westward.  Dangling in the center of the belfry is a single large rope. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
