R {34747}{0}{}{secret room (out)}{ }{You are in a secret room north of the belfry.  You see before you some of the plundered riches of the Count.  Cobwebs cover most of the room, but you still catch the sparkle of gold through the gloom. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
