R {34749}{0}{}{trapworks (n)}{ }{You are standing in a small corridor with a marvelous sight to the south.  The entire place is filled with intricate machinery.  Gears, cogs, pulleys and chains make up the mechanism.  There is a small wooden cart here, only slightly larger than a man, but it looks easy enough to fit into. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
