R {34750}{0}{<248>}{trapworks (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{The aroma of grease and well-oiled wood fills your nostrils as you enter the room.  The entire room is filled with intricate machinery. There are small gaps between the gears and the pulleys and you can see more cogs, ropes and levers behind them.  There is a small wooden cart at rest here, just large enough for a person to fit into. }{Ravenloft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34749}{enter cart}{enter cart}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
