R {34753}{0}{<268>}{Hall of History (u)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{This is where the history of our courageous Swordbrothers and Swordsisters is recorded for all time.  Being more short-lived than our Elven counterparts, we have even greater reason to compile and maintain such an archive, for word of mouth only travels while those who remember have the breath to speak.  The walls and floor here seem denser some how and your every movement is accompanied by a series of faint echoes.  Within, beneath and among these sounds you can hear a soft humming, as if many voices were speaking far away. Crystal globes of faerielight hover above and cast a flickering illumination throughout the hall. The various objects arrayed within this great hall have been enchanted to preserve and pass on the stories, origins and folly of those who follow the Elven way.  You need only 'archive' them to learn more of your fellow Bladesingers.  Additionally, a single crystal shard in the center of the room catches your attention. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30193}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34754}{0}{<268>}{Corridor in the Bladesinger Academy (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The chill of the stone walls of the corridor is noticeable here. As are the occasional patches of dampness that occasionally dot the  corridors walls. Just like the rest of this building this section  of corridor shows signs of recent maintenance work. Though unlike  the main hall the work here is in a much less advanced stage. Shafts of light from the arrow slit windows high overhead spatter the corridor with pools of light and shadow.   }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30193}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34757}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34755}{0}{<268>}{Corridor in the Bladesinger Academy (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{Extensive recent repairs has failed to hide the explosive damage that has blasted the plaster of the walls here and pitted the  granite walls and cracked the granite floor tiles. Something big  exploded in this corridor. To the south you can see a large room that appears to have avoided the destruction here.   }{Bladesinger Guild}{corath}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30193}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34761}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34756}{0}{<268>}{Corridor in the Bladesinger Academy (w,out,n,s)}{<268>[<128>O<268>]<088>}{Two large rooms lead off from this small corridor, before it ends at a large doorway through which you can see a large courtyard. To  the west the main hall of this academy awaits.    }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
