R {34757}{0}{<238>}{Bladesinger bored boards room (ne,nw,n,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The corridor ends here in a small well lit room. Clean and tidy the walls here show signs of fresh plaster, in various places. The walls here are highly decorated depicting a tranquil woodland scene so realistic you could almost swear you were seeing the very forest beyond this compound. Set into the center of this room is a massive wooden notice board. While smaller boards can be seen in a number of smaller anti-rooms all leading off from this room.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34754}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
