R {34758}{0}{<238>}{Bladesinger guild ideas room (sw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Resting in the center of this room is a freshly constructed notice board. apart from the small reading stools scattered around the room, this small room is otherwise devoid of  anything of note.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34757}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34759}{0}{<238>}{Bladesinger guild flap room (se)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Resting in the center of this room is a freshly constructed notice board. apart from the small reading stools scattered around the room, this small room is otherwise devoid of  anything of note. Though curiously this room has a window high in one wall of the room, giving the room an extra cheery feel. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34757}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34760}{0}{<238>}{Bladesinger guild area and equipment room (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Resting in the center of this room is an ancient notice board. The room is brightly lit by the torches hanging from sconces on the walls. Apart from the small stools littered around the room, this small room is otherwise devoid of anything of note.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34757}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34761}{0}{<238>}{A large trophy room (n,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{All manner of Weapons, banners and trophies of war decorate the walls of this large room. Whilst along the western wall is a large glass display case.  A single exit in the southern wall leads into yet another room. A testimony to the heroic actions of bladesingers of times past, this room is often full of young students gazing  in awe at the deeds of their predecessors.   }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34755}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34762}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34762}{0}{<238>}{Bladesinger Equipment Room (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This large room is positively packed with all manner of pieces of leather armour in a widely ranging number of styles and sizes. The air here is heavy with the musty aroma of fresh leather. Towards the back of a the room a simple wooden table and chairs appear to be where most of this equipment is man made.  Strewn about the table is all manner of leather working equipment and an almost finished pair of fine leather boots. Amongst all this clutter is a small sign firmly attached to a nearby wall. Perhaps ... you should read it.  }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34761}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34763}{0}{<278>}{Inside an ancient compound (n,s,e,enter)}{<278>.<128>E<278>.<088>}{You find yourself standing in the Northwestern section of what looks like a large parade ground. From the looks of things there has been extensive work carried out here to reclaim this part of the compound from the  surrounding jungle. To the west rises the large central academy building whilst dotted all around the eastern half of the compound are a few  ancient vine covered buildings. Directly north of here is a medium sized domed building that looks slightly different from the rest.   }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34756}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
