E {34756}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34764}{0}{<238>}{A quiet room (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{Silence and tranquility abound in this room.  Large wooden desks sit neatly arranged about this room. Racks containing delicate  tools line the walls here giving the impression you have stepped into some kind of workshop. The aura of magic seems to be everywhere in this room, making the hairs on the back of your neck stand on end and leaving you feeling just a little lightheaded.   }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34756}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34765}{0}{<238>}{Bladesinger summoning room (n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This room is quite small, measuring only some 20 feet across. No furnishings adorn this room and instead of the normal plaster the walls and floor of this room have been clad in a dark grey marble. Inlaid into which someone has inscribed a series of golden runes. Inset into the center of the floor is a large golden circle some 10 feet across. Highly charged with magical energy this room positively crackles and pops with raw magical energy. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34756}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34766}{0}{<238>}{Bladesinger training hall (s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{The interior of this building has been, refurbished as a large training arena. The usual stone floor have been covered over by a think layer of sawdust. Along the north wall is a long line of archery dummies, into which several arrows have already been shot. Along the western wall is a large rack of wooden swords and battered shields, most likely the training implements the academy students use when they come here to train. Decidedly cold and slightly damp, you find yourself shivering slightly as you glance around this room. The fresh smell of sawdust tickles your nose and makes you want to sneeze.  There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Bladesinger Guild}{kerym}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34763}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34767}{0}{<278>}{Inside an ancient compound (e,n,s)}{<278>. .<088>}{The shadows of the academy main building reach out here casting a slight gloom in this the southwestern section of the parade ground. From the looks of things there has been extensive work carried out here to reclaim this part of the compound from the surrounding jungle. A large elaborate building partially screened by ancient oak trees is directly south of here. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
