R {34773}{0}{}{Akh'Velahr lodge room (out)}{ }{      Within this large hall hang all manner of battle trophies, swords shields and other weapons adorn the walls here. This is the lodge room of the Akh'Velahr, the sword lodge of the bladesingers.  Reveling in the glory of melee combat the members of the Akh'Velahr were often considered the group of bladesingers most suited to large scale battles.   }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
