R {34774}{0}{}{Akh'Faer lodge room (out)}{ }{      This is the first floor of a large building, setup to resemble a large library, for large mahogany bookcases line each of the walls while a large mahogany table resides in the center of the room surrounded by a large number of high backed chairs. Just the perfect thing to study a good book at. Revelling in the art of spell casting this is lodge of the Akh'Faer the Battlemages. }{Bladesinger Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
