R {34782}{0}{}{Path to Solace (sw)}{ }{You are walking on a long path leading downwards to a lovely valley. The mountainside below forms a bowl cradled between the mountains. Vallenwood trees fill the valley and blaze in the season colors. Behind the valley you can see distant and high peaks. A big lake in the middle of the valley catches your eyes, its waters blue and inviting. Columns of smoke can be seen around the treetops and the aroma of home fires tingles your nose. }{Dragonlance Solace}{dragonlance_solace}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34783}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21399}{ride dragon}{ride dragon}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34783}{0}{}{Path to Solace (ne,w)}{ }{As you go down and come closer to the valley, you can see the huge vallenwoods all around you. A large boulder sits by the road, warm from the sunlight and some bushes are along the road. The distant lake twinkles in the sun. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34782}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34784}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34784}{0}{}{Main Street (e,s)}{ }{This long street is the main street of the little village. Tall vallenwood trees tower above you. You can hear the quiet noises of people all around you and smell smoke and food around you. Children play and run in the street. In the distant you can see the far peaks of the mountains.  To your west is the back wall of a stable. You can hear the sounds of horses inside. The street continues south while the village exit is to the east. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34783}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34785}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34785}{0}{}{Main Street (n,s,w)}{ }{Main Street continues south while to your west, Oak Street begins. To the south you can see a towering, huge vallenwood tree cradling a large building. To the west several buildings are located. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34784}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
