R {34786}{0}{}{Main Street (n,s,e)}{ }{To the south you can see the large tree getting closer and some details of the building start to come out. You can see some stained windows and smoke coming out of a chimney. To the east you can see a simple stone building. The building has a chimney and a simple wooden door. On the door the name Flint Fireforge is carved as well as a symbol of an axe. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34785}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
