R {34787}{0}{}{Oak Street (e,n)}{ }{Oak street starts here from Main. This is a very short street that only has the village main stable to the north. To the east Main Street can be seen. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34785}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34788}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34788}{0}{}{Solace Stable (s)}{ }{This is the main stable for Solace. It is used to host horses of visitors and locals. Long stalls line the room on both sides with closed gates. On the floor straw and hay mixed with dirt are all around. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34787}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34789}{0}{}{Main Street (n,s)}{ }{The street continues south coming close to the huge tree. You can see the building on top of the tree and make out it is an inn. The sounds of merry voices come out of it. The smoke of a chimney is seen flying up toward the tree top. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34786}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34791}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34790}{0}{}{Flint Fireforge House (w)}{ }{This house seems very comfortable and cozy. A large fireplace is placed against the wall. Next to the fireplace a rocking chair and several other chairs are placed. A bed is placed against the far wall as well as a small sink. The house looks a bit abandoned and out of use. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34786}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34791}{0}{}{Main Street (n,s,u)}{ }{The street ends right against a huge tall vallenwood tree. The tree goes up as far as you can see. On the huge branches, an inn was built. The inn looks like a part of the tree and is very beautiful. You can hear merry voices coming from within and the smell of food invites you. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
