R {34793}{0}{<238>}{Inn of the Last Home - Main Room (d,s,e)}{<238>[P]<088>}{This is the main room of the Inn of the Last Home. Several cracked and old tables are spread around, each one with several wooden chairs next to it. The hard floor is dusty and dirty and you can see the huge tree it is built on from the stained glass windows. There is a long bar which serves drinks. The back of the bar contains tapped kegs of ale as well as several bottles of various types of alcohol. A big sign hangs above the bar. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{pub}{1.000}{1}
