R {34794}{0}{}{Inn of the Last Home - Supply room (n,e)}{ }{A large number of crates and barrels are located in the room. From the barrels you can smell the cider being fermented and prepared for the guests. The crates contain potatoes in all shapes and sizes. Several closets and cupboards are placed along the walls. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
