R {34795}{0}{}{Inn of the Last Home - Kitchen (w)}{ }{This is the kitchen of the inn. You can see pots and pans laying about as well as a large stove and several cabinets. The smell is great. You anticipate trying the famous spiced potatoes that Otik serves. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34793}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34796}{0}{}{Inn of the Last Home - Bedroom (w)}{ }{This is the bedroom of the inn owner, Otik. You can see a small desk, large bed and a fireplace in this cozy room. The bed is made up for the night. A window looks outside over the valley. }{Dragonlance Solace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34794}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34797}{0}{}{Calvin's Closet (w)}{ }{This dim and stuffy closet is usually used only when Calvin "cleans" his room by putting all his things in here.  At the moment, there's just a pile of laundry. }{Calvin and Hobbes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23821}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34798}{0}{}{Character selection (gameover)}{ }{You are in a vast empty hallway with seven windows. The walls, floor, and ceiling around you are nothing more than wide beams of light that somehow hold weight. Thin blue rounded beams run from corner to corner, acting as the projection points for the walls of light. No features, except the windows, interrupt the perfect rectangle that the room forms. Large floating letters bob above your head. }{Dead or Alive 3}{dead_or_alive3}{}{}{1.000}{1}
