R {34799}{0}{}{A Snowy Landscape (e)}{ }{You are standing in a snow bank three feet deep. The icy cold penetrates to your bones and makes walking cumbersome. The trees that cover the area have branches covered in snow. Stumps and rocks can be seen peeking out from under the snow, and a trail of footprints leads to the east. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34800}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34800}{0}{}{A Snowy Landscape (w,s)}{ }{A frozen stream divides a snowy clearing in the woods. The forest floor is composed of rocks and small boulders that are covered by a fresh snowfall. Above you lies a canopy of pine needles that are sprinkled with a powdery layer of snow. The call of an owl pierces the silence of this winter wonderland. A booted trail in the snow runs in from the west and continues to the south. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34799}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34801}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34801}{0}{}{A Snowy Landscape (n)}{ }{The clearing comes to a dead end as the trees in the forest have been cleared in a perfect circle. The only way out of the circle is from the direction traveled in on. In the center of the circle is a large pile of snow. Mysteriously the footprints lead to the pile and stop. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
