R {34802}{0}{}{In a building (w,e)}{ }{You are standing in a cleared out building with a red regal carpet covering the floor. The room extends to the east and to the west. The walls are adorned with mirrors and paintings. The room might have been a ballroom at some time but now is barren. The ceiling rises to a height of about ten feet and you cannot find the window you came from. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34803}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34804}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34803}{0}{}{In a building (e)}{ }{You are in the west corner of the ballroom. In front of you is a large cracked window that is just above a deserted street. The carpet gives way to wood floors, and you can see outlines on the walls where pictures may have once adorned the surface. Above you is a broken chandelier. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34802}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
