R {34804}{0}{}{In a building (w)}{ }{You are in the east corner of the ballroom. A large boarded window covers most of the wall, and appears securely fastened. The red carpet here is very torn revealing the wooden floor below it. A piano, or what is left of one, lies near the window. What music it might have once made will never be repeated. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34802}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34805}{0}{}{On a street (u)}{ }{    You have fallen down onto the street below. The street is deserted except for a few items. Just in front of you on the ground is a sewer grate. To your left is an abandoned car. All the way down the street, the back doors of various businesses face you. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34803}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34798}{open grate}{open grate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34806}{0}{}{On a cliff}{ }{You are on top of a ledge on one of the highest in a series of mountain tops. The sky above you is blue and cloudless, and below you is another ledge with a small pond. The ground that you are standing on is a mixture of dirt and patches of grass. A few flowers sway to and fro in the westward wind. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34807}{jump}{jump}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34807}{0}{}{On a ledge}{ }{You are on a ledge on the side of a mountain. Above you is another ledge and below you, you can see many more ledges. A small pond occupies almost the entire surface of this ledge and you can't help getting a little wet. The ledge above you is too high to get to but you might be able to jump down to the next ledge. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34808}{jump}{jump}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34808}{0}{}{On a cliff}{ }{You are on one of the lower ledges now. It is not much different than the other ledges, except that this one has several trees. Patches of grass and groups of flowers adorn the ground. There are more ledges below you still, inviting you to come take a look. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34798}{jump}{jump}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34809}{0}{}{In a steel cage (se,s,e)}{ }{You are in the north west corner of a small fenced area. The fence extends high above your head and has barbed tips at the top. On the other side of the fence you can see a throng of people cheering, shouting and placing bets at a bookie's table. The roar of the crowd is very loud and it invigorates you. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34810}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41750}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34812}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34810}{0}{}{In a steel cage (n,nw,w)}{ }{You are in the south east corner of a small fenced area. This appears to be the opposing team's corner as there is a metal sign on the fence. The crowd seems an endless mass of people louder here then anywhere else. A man is standing just outside the ring yelling. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34809}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34812}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34811}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34811}{0}{}{In a steel cage (n,ne,e)}{ }{You are in the south west corner of a fenced area. You notice on one wall of the fence a steel mesh door. The crowd is less noisy, and you can see twin lanes heading from the cage to the outer wall of the structure that you are in. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34809}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34812}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34810}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34798}{open door}{open door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34812}{0}{}{In a steel cage (s,sw,w)}{ }{You are in the north east corner of a small fenced area. A large power generator is sitting outside the fence and has wires running from its leads to the fence. The crowd is screaming louder here than before as they cry out for blood. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34809}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34810}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34811}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34813}{0}{}{At an aquarium}{ }{You are now in an underwater complex. Glass windows are all around you, allowing you to look out and see various sea animals and fish. Even the floor you are standing on is glass and the animals and fish swim underneath you as you move around the complex. To your right is a rectangular aquarium, filled with less fortunate fish who have been captured. A ladder spans the side of this aquarium. You also notice that there is one more level above you. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34814}{climb ladder}{climb ladder}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34814}{0}{}{In an aquarium}{ }{You are inside an aquarium. The tank you are swimming in has no roof, so you can breathe easily. The fish around you eye you nervously and dart away whenever you start to approach them. The water is cool, and there does not appear to be any dangerous species inside this tank. Various plants and animals line the walls. The bottom of the tank has an opening of some sort, and a crab sits beside it. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34798}{swim out}{swim out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34815}{0}{}{In a forest (e)}{ }{You are standing on a dirt path in the middle of the woods. The landscape is sloped, so that you are standing on land that is about 3 feet above a creek. Many trees line the path and there a fallen log blocks the path to the west. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34816}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34816}{0}{}{At a cave (w,cave)}{ }{You are now three quarters of the way down a path. You see a fallen log in front of you, and a creek runs parallel to the path. Several cliff walls protrude through a break in the trees. Gaps in the foliage above you allow beams of light to stream in. You see a cave partially hidden by the trees to the north. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34815}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
