R {34817}{0}{}{In a cave (out)}{ }{You are in a dark cave. Water drips slowly from the ceiling into puddles, hinting of a source of moisture nearby. A pile of leaves lies in the center of the cave, and some bones lay next to them. The light from the exit of the cave doesn't penetrate very far inside. }{Dead or Alive 3}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
