R {34838}{0}{}{-=  Eeyore's Gloomy Place  =- (w,s)}{ }{-=  Eeyore's Gloomy Place  =- You stumble upon an area that is strangely gray and depressing.  For some reason a small dark cloud looms overhead.  You can't help but notice that you are getting soaked as rain pours out of the cloud.  This sure is a gloomy place. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34837}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34840}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34839}{0}{}{-=  A Pik-a-nik Spot  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  A Pik-a-nik Spot  =- Wow!  What a great spot for a piknik!  A cool breeze is blowing and the sun is warm.  A red and white checkered blanket lies on the ground.  A piknik basket sits on the blanket.  A large glass of lemonade sits next to the basket. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34837}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34845}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34840}{0}{}{-=  A meadow  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  A meadow  =- A beautiful meadow spans the horizon.  Tall grass sways gracefully in the breeze. A buzzing noise can be heard around you.  Six pine trees lies ahead.  You could head south towards the darkening sky or continue west towards the trees. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34838}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34841}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34841}{0}{}{-=  Six Pine Trees  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  Six Pine Trees  =- You reach a place in the woods where six pine trees grow closely together.  This is a dangerous spot, for all around you are bee hives. Sweet honey and sap drip lazily down the trunks.  You hope that there are no bees to sting you. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34840}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34842}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34842}{0}{}{-=  Coming out of the forest  =- (s,e)}{ }{-=  Coming out of the forest  =- You begin to head south toward the meadow.  Grass is sparser here.  Small rocks peak up out of the ground.  A few trees dot the landscape. A small puddle of water is pooled near one of the rocks.  Sunlight beams down on you. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34841}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34843}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34843}{0}{}{-=  A large rock  =- (n,s,e)}{ }{-=  A large rock  =- You come upon a large rock.  It is about three feet high and about six feet around.  At the top you see that it flattens out.  A perfect place to sit and view the surrounding area and look up at the sky and admire the clouds that float by.  The meadow curves to the south. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34842}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34844}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34845}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34844}{0}{}{-=  A Meadow  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  A Meadow  =- The path through the meadow continues north and south.  The grass is shorter here.  A few small rocks peak up out of the ground.  A few trees dot the horizon. The sun beats down on you. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34843}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34846}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34845}{0}{}{-=  A Meadow  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  A Meadow  =- The meadow stretches a little farther west.  Tall green grass sways in the breeze.  A few meadowland creatures scurry about. The sun is warm and bright.  A large rock is in the distance. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34843}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34839}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34846}{0}{}{-=  A Meadow  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  A Meadow  =- More trees are in this part of the meadow.  The sun is not as prominent.  The grass continues to get shorter here, and dirt becomes more noticeable.  A large tree piques your attention to the south. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34844}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34847}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34847}{0}{}{-= A group of trees  =- (s,n)}{ }{-= A group of trees  =- You walk into the beginning of a forest.  A bunch of trees are clustered together here.  The sun barely makes streams of light through the trees' thickness.  You notice gobs of honey sliding down the tree trunks.  A loud buzzing noise assaults your ears. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34846}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34848}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34848}{0}{}{-=  A Forest  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  A Forest  =- The trees become thicker and the sky gets darker here.  You have to feel your way around so that you don't bump into anything.  It is nearly impossible to see your way around here.  By touch, you can make out trees and branches, but not much else. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34847}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34849}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34849}{0}{}{-=  A Forest  =- (w,n)}{ }{-=  A Forest  =- You continue to edge your way along the forest path.  Every few steps, you trip of over a small rock that happens to be in the path.  Animal noises bounce eerily off the trees, giving you quite a scare. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34848}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34850}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34850}{0}{}{-=  A Dark Forest  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  A Dark Forest  =- The forest continues to be dark and cold.  Something flutters in front of your face, taking you off balance for a moment.  After catching your bearings you could continue west or back east where you came. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34849}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34851}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34851}{0}{}{-=  A Clearing in the Forest  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  A Clearing in the Forest  =- Unexpectedly, you come upon a clearing in the forest.  A large oak tree stands in the middle of it.  A lone thick branch hangs down.  All around the tree are strange markings, almost like someone has been bouncing on a pogo stick here. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
