R {34852}{0}{}{-=  A Path  =- (w,e)}{ }{-=  A Path  =- You are walking along a well-worn path.  A small brook trickles past you on your left.  A few flat rocks line the brook's path, leading you further into the 100 Aker Woods.  To the south you see a bridge peeking through the trees. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34851}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34853}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34853}{0}{}{-=  A path in the forest  =- (s,e)}{ }{-=  A path in the forest  =- You continue along the path.  Small yellow and purple flowers are scattered along the side.  A small bird flutters quickly in front of you and then flies away.  The sun is warm and refreshing here.  You can get a better view of the bridge from here. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34852}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34854}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34854}{0}{}{-=  A Bridge  =- (w,n)}{ }{-=  A Bridge  =- You finally reach the bridge.  Looking down below you see a small river flowing.  There is a long wood railing along both sides of the bridge.  You notice some small sticks on the bridge and then it hits you!  'This is where you can play Pooh Stix'.  You love Pooh Stix.  You hope you can find a stick to play with. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34853}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
