R {34855}{0}{}{-=  A path in the forest  =- (e,w)}{ }{-=  A path in the forest  =- You continue along the path.  Small yellow and purple flowers are scattered along the side.  A small chipmunk scurries quickly in front of you and then runs away.  The sun is warm and refreshing here. There is a bridge to the east. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34854}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34856}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34856}{0}{}{-=  A forest  =- (e,w)}{ }{-=  A forest  =- The path seems to have disappeared.  The pines have become very dense and numerous.  You stumble over a tree root as it becomes increasingly more difficult to see.  Your eyes take a moment to adjust to the impending darkness ahead of you.  The forest continues to the west. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34855}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34857}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34857}{0}{}{-=  A dark forest  =- (s,u,e)}{ }{-=  A dark forest  =- OUCH!  You smack your knee right into a tree stump as you step into the dark forest.  There is a huge tree standing in front of you.  You see a small house sitting atop the tree.  The forest continues to the south. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34856}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
