R {34861}{0}{}{-=  A Forest  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  A Forest  =- You continue through the forest.  Every few steps, you trip of over a small rock that happens to be in the path.  Animal noises bounce eerily off the trees, giving you quite a scare. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34860}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34863}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34862}{0}{}{-=  Inside Pooh's House  =- (out)}{ }{-=  Inside Pooh's House  =- You are now inside Pooh's house.  It is sparsely decorated.  A small wood table and four red chairs sit to the right.  In the corner is a cabinet full of jars of honey.  A little picture hangs on the wall.  A small bed sits against the far wall, perfect size for Pooh.  The door out is now behind you. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34860}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34863}{0}{}{-=  A dark forest  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  A dark forest  =- The trees become thicker and the sky gets darker here.  You have to feel your way around so that you don't bump into anything.  It is nearly impossible to see your way around here.  By touch, you can make out trees and branches, but not much else. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34861}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
