R {34864}{0}{}{-=  A clearing  =- (s,n)}{ }{-=  A clearing  =- You come upon a large clearing.  The forest is now behind you and the beginning of a lovely path lies ahead.  A few tall oak trees sit to your right and left as you enjoy the walk in the open air.  You are relieved as the warm sun hits your face once again. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34863}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34865}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34865}{0}{}{-=  A path  =- (w,n)}{ }{-=  A path  =- You come upon a well-worn path.  Remnants of vegetables lay strewn about the sides.  You notice a yellow wheelbarrow and a watering can to your right.  Fresh clumps of soil dot the path. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34864}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
