R {34866}{0}{}{-=  Rabbit's Garden  =- (e)}{ }{-=  Rabbit's Garden  =- You finally reach the well-tended garden of Rabbit.  It is here that all the vegetables eaten by the 100 Aker Wood animals is grown.  There are tall corn stalks, plump tomato vines, brilliant carrots, blooming lettuce and cabbage, and flowering cauliflower plants all around you.  The smell of these ripe vegetables is almost too much for you to handle, but somehow you manage to suck in a deep breath and enjoy it all. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34865}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34867}{0}{}{Showcase Entrance}{J}{You have entered a large multi-leveled showcase\; it is shocking to see all these lighters here for sale.  With every zippo from the plain silver, to the cool decked out hand painted ones, it's a pyromaniac's dream.  Maybe you should flip the lid and see what is up with this place.  Something feels a bit out of place here\; you might want to be careful!  If you wanted to escape this place, you could jump out from here. }{Zippos Showcase}{zippos_showcase}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6504}{jump}{jump}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
