R {34868}{0}{}{Showcase 1 (e,w)}{ }{This small passage is barely large enough for you to squeeze through, it seems to exist between the lighter and the metal case it sleeps in. A dim fluorescent bulb pulses weakly, sending out soothing rays of light to illuminate this cramped space.  The cold metal walls vibrate slightly with the humming that radiates from the light-bulb.  You might find something of more interest to the east, while squeezing your way back toward the west leads outside this metal casing. }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34867}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34869}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34869}{0}{}{Showcase 2 (e,w)}{ }{Lined with light blue felt and tiny round white lint balls this room is a bit stuffy.  There is a small wooden pine stand for one of the various zippo lighters to rest on.  A few plastic green fern plants are strategically placed in the corners of this room.  The faint humming sound of the lights can still be heard in the background here. The smell of lighter fluid is very strong in this room. }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34868}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34870}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34870}{0}{}{Showcase 3 (u,w)}{ }{You enter a large cubical room with mirrors lining the walls everywhere you look.  The floor is also constructed of the same reflective material as the walls.  A large bottle of brass cleaner is lying at the base of this zippo's case.  A jet black velvet rag is neatly folded in the back corner of this cubicle.  It is obvious this lighter spends hours buffing itself to a perfect shine.  Careful inspection reflects an imperfection in one of the mirrors, a slightly thicker seam is highly noticeable on this round mirror.  An error like this being overlooked shows this lighter is not quite as perfect as it likes to think. }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34869}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34871}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
