E {41905}{s}{push panel}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34871}{0}{}{Showcase 4 (w,d)}{ }{Upon entering this showcase cubicle you notice that the decorations are far more extensive here.  A shiny golden stand lined with the finest white silk is the resting spot of a very flashy lighter.  Tiny gold bars line the side of this stand giving the appearance of royalty.  The walls here have a faint hint of a golden tone that shimmers in the light.  Not a speck of dust can be seen anywhere in this cubicle.  This showcase cubicle has to be the home of royalty for sure. }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34870}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34872}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34872}{0}{}{Showcase 5 (w,e)}{ }{Yellow and cream striped walls emphasize the peaceful aura in this room.  The floor is tiled with gray speckled flooring that adds character to this room.  A rectangular blue plastic stand sits here with a royal blue felt lining inside of it.  The light in here is neither faint nor strong.  Dust free and extremely clean any lighter would be proud to call this showcase home.  The slight hum of the lights can be heard but no other sounds are eminent.  What kind of lighter would be here, if any?  }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34871}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34873}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34873}{0}{}{Showcase 6 (u,e)}{ }{This petite cubicle has just enough room for you and the metal lighter case.  The shiny silver lighter case gives off a reflection of the fluorescent lights present here.  Sitting within the case is a white and silver speckled felt lining that obviously protects this lighter's delicate casing.  Although small in size this room is quite comfortable and even the obnoxious humming is very faint.  Void of any dirt, cobwebs, or dust everything shines with a brand new luster.  }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34872}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34874}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34874}{0}{}{Showcase 7 (e,d)}{ }{Upon entering this room you notice the disrepair this room has fallen into.  Paint that is faded and cracked adorns the walls here.  Littered on the floor are various sizes, shapes, and colors of paper scraps.  The ceiling has a light hanging down threatening to fall at any minute.  Cobwebs stretch from corner to corner and layers of dust cover almost every inch of the room.  A small pine case sits in the center with a torn, faded, green cotton swatch lining the interior.  No lighter appears to be here as this is hardly a place any lighter would want to call home.   }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34873}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34875}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34875}{0}{}{Showcase 8 (e,w)}{ }{Entrance to this room reveals a much more intense aura of extreme energy.  The walls are decorated with posters all varying in size.  An aluminum case sits here with a light pink satin lining to cradle the lighter that calls this room home.  At the base of the case you notice a walkman with a unique set of colorful headphones sitting out of the way.  The corner has a large toothed comb with a marbled pink and white swirl decorating its handle.  This particular lighter spends immense amounts of time here in peaceful bliss and happiness.  }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34874}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34876}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34876}{0}{}{Showcase 9 (w)}{ }{You have just entered a room that appears to be a small piece of heaven itself.  A faint sound of harps playing can be heard in the background.  The walls are bright white in color and have no signs of damage or repair required anywhere.  In the middle of this room is a lighter stand made of the finest white ivory found in the realms.  Delicately placed inside this ivory case is a fluffy cotton ball style cloud with a silver lining.  Made of intricately laid feathers the floor here is a luxury to walk on.  Disturbing this lighter would just be sinful! }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34875}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
