R {34877}{0}{}{Wire panel}{ }{ Stumbling into a room that was not obvious at first glance you notice this room houses all the electrical wiring and power that lights up the showcase.  The lighting in here is extremely poor and shadows dance on the walls all around you.  Eerie sounds can be heard very faintly making this room even less inviting.  Cobwebs string from the wires leading in every direction possible, with wires dangling, and laying everywhere you look, moving around in here is extremely tedious.  Tripping and falling flat on your face is a strong possibility if extreme caution is not exercised.  Attached to the wall about four feet up you also notice a small black fuse panel with various colored wiring protruding from the bottom of the case. Black, red, green, white, gray, yellow, and blue wires entangled and leading in every direction gives you the impression that it would be much easier to leave this room than to search through this mess. }{Zippos Showcase}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
