R {34880}{0}{}{New Haven Pathway (n,s,e,w)}{ }{You are on a narrow gravel pathway that ends, just to the west, at a well-kept cabin.  The door of the cabin is open but it is too dark inside to see much of anything.  To the east the path takes a sharp downward dip so you can't really see much more than the forest off in the distance.  You do, however, hear some coarse shouts and weird chanting coming from that direction.  There is the smell of smoke to the north. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{chronicles_of_thomas_covenant}{}{}{1.000}{1}
