R {34881}{0}{}{A Burnt Shed (s,w)}{ }{As you follow the path north you begin to cough on the smell of old smoke and burned wood.  A small shed lies in smoking ruin. To your left you see the corral.  You do a VSE. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34880}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
