R {34882}{0}{}{New Haven Pathway (e,w)}{ }{You are on a pathway running east to west that wends its way up a steep slope to the cabin where the owner of New Haven Farm must live.  To the east you can see the pathway leads to a gate which opens out onto a highway. Standing in a circle are a group of Jehovah's Witnesses.  They are praying, chanting, and throwing a variety of esoteric fits.  You notice that they are covered in blood and one of them is carrying what looks suspiciously like a cow carcass. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34880}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
