R {34894}{0}{}{County Park (ne,w)}{ }{You are in a parking lot that is completely jammed with cars. Most of them are somewhat ramshackle and not in the best of shape.  You wonder why so many people would come to such a decrepit looking park.  The parking lot is completely surrounded by dry, ugly looking thickets.  The only entrance to the park seems to be a small gravel road that cuts through the brush to the northeast.  Back to the west you see the exit to the county highway. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
