R {34898}{0}{}{County Park (s,n,w)}{ }{The gravel road now gives way to a sea of dried mud broken by thickets to the east and the entrance of the huge tent to the west.  Further north you barely make out what look like large motorized vehicles. The singing and music are now truly excruciating but you think it might be fun to check out the folk who enjoy this kind of activity. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
