R {34899}{0}{}{County Park (e,s)}{ }{You find yourself in a small RV park.  Standing before you in regal splendor is the biggest RV you've ever seen.  There are a couple other large vehicles off to the east. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
