R {34908}{0}{}{Road House Path (e,w)}{ }{This is a narrow gravel path running off of the county highway. If the sign is to be believed, there's a great act at The Door tonight.  Which would be highly unusual.  Because as you can see as you move up the path, the roadhouse is rather run-down. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
