R {34928}{0}{}{Hall of Fame (n,s)}{ }{      Faint rays of sunlight pierce the cobwebs hanging along the cracks in the walls of this building. Rubble scatters and snaps with each footstep you take further into this room, making it more than a little difficult not to trip and fall. An ancient sign hangs from the ceiling on a single rusted hinge, creaking with the slightest gust of wind.  This place looks very old and unused for many many years.  }{Kareless Kanga's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
