R {34954}{0}{}{The County Clinic (e)}{ }{This is the town's clinic.  There is no waiting room, however. Just the bare essentials.  A small examining room, a drug cabinet and an old operating table are about the extent of its amenities. The place is very clean, unlike most of the town though. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34931}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34955}{0}{}{Sheriff's Main Station (s)}{ }{While nothing to write home to your uncle the policeman about, the sheriff's office is almost sumptuous by county standards. You can see a computer, a modem, a fax machine, a luxurious desk, and all the other accoutrements of the modern office. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34953}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34956}{0}{}{Main Street (n,w,e)}{ }{You are walking along Main Street.  You can see the side of the Lytton Gas Company to the south.  To your immediate north you can see the offices of the regional Bell Company. A small beggar boy comes running up to you breathlessly.  His eyes are wary and it is clear that he'd probably run the minute you look at him. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
