E {34958}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34957}{0}{}{Ma Bell Company (s)}{ }{You give a sigh of relief when you finally enter Ma Bell's. These folks are still in business.  There is a long counter to the north, with one open window. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34956}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {34958}{0}{}{Main Street (s,n,w,e)}{ }{You are walking through the intersection of Main Street and Birch Street, which runs north and south.  As best you can make out from here, the entire downtown is less than two or three blocks wide. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
