R {35009}{0}{}{By the Panels}{ }{The set of giant panels before you presents a live and autochthonous view of life in the warehouse.  To the right, there is a panel that is torn and ripped, defiled by time and what the sun knows as its lifelong companion. To the right (and therefore left) of this imperfect panel is another panel, this one brilliant and untouched, a symbol of perfection more lunar and suave than anything else in the warehouse.  Particles swirl around and sniff you. }{A Spectral Warehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
