R {35303}{0}{}{crypt (s)}{ }{You are standing in a large crypt, deep below the cemetery. The room is about fifty feet square and the walls slope to form a type of cathedral effect.  In the center of the room lies a breathtaking tomb made of pure crystal.  There seems to be a body visible within the shimmering casket.  The tomb itself is the only thing of any beauty in this evil place, for the rest of the tomb lies in disarray and neglect.  Sickly yellow moss and a blackish slime covers everything.  There are also many bones lying about on the floor. }{Katin}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
