R {35317}{0}{}{Cart Track (n,exit)}{E}{You almost get a sense of relief as you step out onto this dirt and don't feel the mind-numbing effects of Chaos quite as bad. In fact the further north you travel the more you become infused with a sense of peace and calm. Far in the distance you can see the snow-capped tip of a lone mountain rising above the plain. There is a small sign pointing north here. }{Mortal Kombat}{tencho}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6539}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35318}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35318}{0}{}{Cart Track (n,s)}{ }{You have been walking for several miles and the Mountain has rapidly been growing bigger. Now you can see a small town nestled in a valley between ridges of the great mountain. There seems to be some dark clouds hovering over the lower part of the mountain and casting a dark shadow over the town below. Just off the cart track you see a skeleton lying in the brush. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35317}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35319}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35319}{0}{}{Cart Track (n,s)}{ }{Having walked several more miles you are fairly tired, but at last the town is much closer now.  You can see the wooden walls surrounding a small Japanese town.  Just in front of the gate is a small tree with a nice spread of branches casting a cooling shadow over some benches.  But the shadow cast by the dark clouds gives you a strange sense of foreboding like something is about to leap out and kill you!  You see a note tacked to a tree here. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35318}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35321}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35320}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {35319}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35321}{0}{<238>}{Torii Gates (s,gate)}{<238>|@|<088>}{You are now on a wide, dirt path leading up to a large wooden archway, it is in fact a Torii Gate, a structure used by the Japanese in Shinto religious ceremonies.  Often used as a gate into areas considered special by the Japanese and into towns. This particular Gate appears to be the entrance to a small Japanese town that rests at the foot of a giant mountain.  Higher up on the side of the Mountain rests what appears to be a small Castle. Just outside the gate is a tree with many large signs tacked to it and some low benches strewn around it.  Appears to be a place to  sit and relax before entering the town.  }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35319}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35322}{gate}{gate}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35322}{n}{gate}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35322}{0}{<278>}{Entrance Road (n,gate,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are standing on a small, dusty road running north and west. Behind you to the south is a large Torii gate that leads out of Tencho.  Tencho is surrounded by a low stone wall which holds up a firm wall of thick and pointed bamboo.  There are signs of activity all over the place, but even so the people seem to be dull and lifeless as they move about.  Some seem to be extremely afraid and run away when you try to talk to them. Curious, there seems to be a sign of some kind posted on the building wall, maybe you should look at it?  }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35323}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35325}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35321}{gate}{gate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35321}{s}{gate}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35323}{0}{<278>}{North Tencho Road (n,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{You walk north along the main road of Tencho.  The sense of gloom doesn't seem quite as bad here.  But the town is still strangely quiet.  There aren't many people moving about and even the birds are quiet.  Hmm actually you don't even see any birds, or any other wild- life for that matter.  You do see a sign posted on a wall nearby. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35322}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35344}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35324}{0}{}{Torii Gates (s,gate)}{ }{You are now on a wide, dirt path leading up to a large wooden archway, it is in fact a Torii Gate, a structure used by the Japanese in Shinto religious ceremonies.  Often used as a gate into areas considered special by the Japanese and into towns. This particular Gate appears to be the entrance to a small Japanese town that rests at the foot of a giant mountain.  Higher up on the side of the Mountain rests what appears to be a small Castle. Just outside the gate is a tree with many large signs tacked to it and some low benches strewn around it.  Appears to be a place to  sit and relax before entering the town.  }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {35325}{0}{<278>}{Western Road (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{You are walking along the Western Road of Tencho.  The further to the west you get, the greater the sense of oppression you feel.  And the further east you get the less oppressive.  Something very odd is going on in this town, but you can't quite put your finger on it. There is another sign of some kind plastered to a wall, there is also what would appear to be a body huddled in the gutter. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35322}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35326}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35326}{0}{<278>}{SW Tencho (w,n,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road here curves north and continues on and also curves west. Some small houses line this section of the street and a small Tea Shop that sits at the very corner.  Here the sense of oppression is a little less. In fact a sense of calm and quiet seems to radiate from the small tea shop, maybe you should take a look at it?  There is a sign pinned to the wall of one of the houses. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35325}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35327}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35328}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35327}{0}{<248>}{Tencho teashop (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{You have stepped into a wonderful-smelling teashop that also serves some other tasty items. A kindly-looking old man stands behind the counter waiting to serve you. The shop itself has been decorated by a gentle hand and seems to radiate peace and calm. There is a menu board hanging on the wall. Just <order> whatever you like and be peaceful. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35326}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35328}{0}{<278>}{Northwestern Road (n,s,alley)}{<278>- -<088>}{You're standing on a road running north and south.  There are some more houses here, but they seem to be a little closer and a little more ominous.  The overall sense of oppression is almost palpable.  The houses on the west side of the street are more solidly built  stone foundations raising up about three feet before the thick wood shows up and raises high into the air.  The widely jutting eaves  form thick, black shadows in the alley between the buildings. There is another sign tacked to a wall here. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{A}{1.000}{1}
E {35326}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35329}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35330}{alley}{alley}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35330}{e}{alley}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35329}{0}{<278>}{Western Road (n,s)}{<278>- -<088>}{This is a longer stretch of road leading north.  More buildings either side of the street, but now they seem to have an evil cast to them and they even seem to leer at you as you walk by.  You also keep thinking you see things out of the corner of your eyes, but when you turn to look you only see empty shadows.  But are they truly empty?  There seems to be a faded sign posted here. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35328}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35332}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35330}{0}{<248>}{Crime Alley (out)}{<248>. .<088>}{You have walked into a dank and dismal alley between some very large buildings.  Unlike most alleys there's no garbage here, instead a small table has been set up here and there are several large, tough-looking men sitting around cheering on whatever is happening at the table.  Maybe you should try and take a closer  look at the action? }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35361}{d}{d}{32}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35328}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35328}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35331}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {35332}{0}{<278>}{NW Tencho (path,s,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road here curves east into darkness and horror, while the the way south leads to safety and security.  You can literally feel the evil rolling over you from the east.  The tension is so  thick you could cut it with a knife, hope you got a big knife if you go east.  To the north the great mountain looms ominously over the little village, further adding to the depressing miasma that seems to have settled like a blanket on you and the town. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35329}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35333}{path}{path}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35334}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35333}{n}{path}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35333}{0}{<238>}{Outside a Shaolin temple (path,archway)}{<238>|@|<088>}{The squat stone building rises from the hills, reaching its gently  sloping conical roof into the pristine blue sky.  The high archway  leading into the temple is unadorned and simple, nothing less than  you'd expect from such a temple.  You feel an odd pull at your  soul, urging you to cross the ancient cobblestone threshold and  venture into the temple. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35332}{path}{path}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35332}{s}{path}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35337}{archway}{archway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35337}{n}{archway}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35334}{0}{<278>}{End of the Road (alley,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{The road ends here.  Just stops cold like it doesn't want to go any further.  The buildings also stop here and don't continue any further.  Ahead of you is an alley to the east that makes a quick turn to the north, then end out of your sight. The portion of the alley wall you can see seems to have some sort of image painted on the brick wall.  There is also a hastily scrawled sign tacked to the wall of the last building. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35332}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35341}{alley}{alley}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35341}{s}{alley}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

