R {35336}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {35337}{0}{<268>}{The temple's entry hall (n,archway,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The heavy scent of herbs assault your senses as you enter the  temple.  Small stands of candles light the entry hall, dripping  wax onto the ancient stone and adding their own scent to the heavy  air.  The hall leads further into the temple where you can hear the  murmur of the temple's inhabitants.  A small side hall leads off to  the east to the secondary chambers of the temple. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35338}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35340}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35333}{archway}{archway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35333}{s}{archway}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35338}{0}{<268>}{A meditation hall (s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The inner hall of the temple smells of brewing herbal tea and  incense.  The high vaulted ceiling is clouded by smoke and  darkness.  The hall is lit by a ring of candles, like the entryway,  adding their own fragrant smell to the air.  You can feel a sense  of peace wash over you as you stand in the hall\; there is little  doubt to the effectiveness of this place in centering a person's  soul. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35337}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35339}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {35340}{0}{<268>}{A side hall in the temple (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{The flickering light of the candles in the entryway appear to be  all that lights this side hall.  The close walls wrap their way  about the central chamber, leading to the back of the temple.  A  flash of claustrophobia washes over you as you press through the  tight passage. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35337}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35360}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35341}{0}{<248>}{Dragon Alley (out)}{<248>. .<088>}{You round the corner and stare in shock at the creature here. It sits proudly on its pile of broken and burnt bones, staring at you with an evil twinkle in its eye. Blood has splattered all of the walls, spraying out of the beast's victims. You think you see something half-hidden by the pile of bones, but it's doubtful the beast will let you past to take a closer look. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35334}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35334}{n}{out}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
