R {35373}{0}{<228>}{-= In the middle of the tree =- (u,nw,ne,d)}{<228>( *<088>}{-= In the middle of the tree =- You are standing on a branch which is about sixty feet above the ground. The branches up here are all about three feet wide making it easy to walk on, but still a bit dangerous.  Although you are very high in the air you are still no way near the top of this tree.  You can see the tops of all the other trees in the forest from here.  The tree to your east and slightly to the north is still taller than where you are.  To your northeast along this branch is a large bird's nest. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35370}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35374}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35375}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35376}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35374}{0}{<228>}{-= In the treetops =- (nw,ne,d)}{<228>( *<088>}{-= In the treetops =- There is no more up from here.  Since this is one of the largest trees in the forest, most of fantasy can be seen from here.  The treetops sway in the breeze, giving it the impression of a gentle rolling ocean.  Birds flutter from tree to tree, and some soar high into the clouds, and into the path of the sun making it difficult to see them.  There are two large branches that would most likely support the weight of an adventurer, one branches to the northwest, and the other branches to the northeast.  However aside from those two, the rest are too weak and would send that person plummeting to the earth. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35373}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35377}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35378}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35375}{0}{<228>}{-= On a branch high in the air =- (se,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{-= On a branch high in the air =- These branches are about a foot wide each making it quite easy to walk on.  Between here and the ground is about a hundred foot fall.  That could hurt if someone happened to fall.  Many leaves here have been eaten by some large insect.  There are strands of silk all over the place, either from a spider, or possibly a caterpillar or silkworm. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35373}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35382}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35376}{0}{<228>}{-= On a branch =- (sw,w)}{<228>( *<088>}{-= On a branch =- You are on a branch which grows out from the largest tree in this forest.  A few branches form a cross where a bird has used this to support its nest.  There is another large branch just to the west of here, you might be able to jump to it if you were careful.  To your southeast about fifty feet from here is a large spruce tree which doubles the height of any other tree in this forest. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35373}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35384}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
