R {35377}{0}{<228>}{-= On a branch =- (e,se)}{<228>( *<088>}{-= On a branch =- The view of the town of Wayhaven is much clearer from this side of the tree.  The city walls are just barely visible through the trees, and even some of the medium sized buildings can be seen.  To the north of Wayhaven the frozen lands and their blanket of white make it difficult to make out much detail.  Between those is a glowing portal, like the one to the east.  Numerous trees cover the lands making most of the ground level hidden. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35374}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35380}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35378}{0}{<228>}{-= On a branch =- (w,sw)}{<228>( *<088>}{-= On a branch =- The view from up here is breath-taking.  With the eyesight of an eagle, one could most likely see everything in this realm.  To the northeast and way below you is the faint glow of the forest portal to Pinnacle.  The oceans to the east can be seen, a blanket of blue covering the land and stretching far and wide.  Millions of trees of all kinds litter the country, the leaves reflecting every hue of green, brown, red, yellow, and more.  An artist would only dream of catching this on a canvas. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35374}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
