R {35389}{0}{}{Lost City (e,s,n)}{ }{You're at the entrance to this gang's hideout.  From the looks of things here, and looking around, you guess that it's pretty large A burning barrel to your east provides light and you spot a small niche to the north.  Other than that, only the metal and rock around you catch your attention. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
