R {35390}{0}{}{Lost City (e,s,w,n)}{ }{A huge barrel burns here to provide light for the area, but that no longer seems a bit strange to you.  The area seems clear though, relatively speaking, and you can see exits in all four major directions.  A foul odor reaches you from the south, and you hear strange sounds from the east. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
