R {35392}{0}{<238>}{Lost City (w,s)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{A small little area with some rocks set in a circle.  It almost has the feel of a meeting room of sorts.  Otherwise you can only see walls of metal rising up around you, though there is a path to the south. The light from the west is enough to let you see here, though the shadows are a bit strange. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
