R {35393}{0}{}{Lost City (n)}{ }{You gag as you look about you.  This seems to be the gang's own restroom so to speak.  There is defecation and urine everywhere, and it looks like some of the stuff is years old.  Maggots crawl all over the place, and small larvae hatch and burrow into the feces as you watch in silent disgust.  The stench fills your nasal cavities, and slowly you realize you've been standing trancelike for much too long. It's about time to get out of here. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35390}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35394}{0}{}{Lost City (s)}{ }{Stained and worn mattresses litter this clearing along with old sheets and blankets.  This must be where the gang sleeps, though the area looks badly kept, and smells horribly foul.  The light from the barrel to your south provides just enough light to see here. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35390}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35395}{0}{<248>}{Lost City (n)}{<248>. .<088>}{This area is clear of debris for the most part and looks somewhat like a practice field.  A small glowing orb lights up the area, and you almost feel like you're on the set of Enter the Dragon, except for the excess rubble.  But oh well, you can't have it all. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35392}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35396}{0}{<238>}{Lost City (sw)}{<238>. ^<088>}{You stand in a strange alcove of rubble.  Looking about you can see the normal wreckage that this city has to offer and a small glowing orb that provides the light here. A small broken couch lies to one side and you guess that the user of this place must have a lot of power, seeing as how that couch looks like the most comfortable and valuable item you've seen down here. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35392}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

