R {35399}{0}{}{Hilltop (d,enter)}{ }{You have finally reached the top of the hill!  Looking around, you can see sand dunes for miles in every direction.  Actually, the view from here looks a heck of a lot like the view from anywhere else in the desert, save that you can see a bit farther.  You didn't climb this hill for the view, though. Before you is a prickly bush, picked bare of its flowers. There is a gaping hole in the ground just beneath the bush. }{Rocky Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
