R {35401}{0}{}{Lamia Lair (out)}{ }{This small, stone chamber is covered with blood and the gory, shredded remains of humans and animals.  In one corner lies a pile of mostly-intact carcasses, and in the opposite corner, rocks are piled up to a hole in the ceiling.  Sunlight streams in through the gaping hole, gleaming off of the slick, blood- soaked floor. }{Rocky Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
