R {35432}{0}{}{The end of the line. (backward)}{ }{        You have come to the end of the tunnel, at least for now.  There are plenty of people working at elongating the tunnel and even as you stand here you can see it growing inch by inch.  There is a haze of recently disturbed earth in the air, lending a dank, musty smell to the tunnel, as well as making it quite hard to see.  There is a constant bustle of people heading up and down the tunnel, removing the recently dug earth and bringing great logs to support the new areas of the tunnel. }{Excavation Site}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35434}{backward}{backward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35433}{0}{}{A forest path. (nw,se)}{ }{    You amble leisurely along a narrow forest path. Winding from the northwest, it stretches southeast into the depths of the dark forest. The faint gurgling of a distant river meets your ears, the only sound to break the heavy silence. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4748}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35434}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {35435}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (e,s,w,n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{      Gently the drizzle caresses your face, each droplet unique in path and delicate style.  Golden wisps of grass sway in the shower, the wind causing the surface to look like a vast sea of yellow-green.  The tall grass lashes out around you, leaving welts on unprotected skin.  Walking amongst the stalks is tedious at best, as the ground is uneven, causing you to stumble at unexpected times. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37386}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
