R {35436}{0}{<268>}{River Inlet (w,s,e,nw,n,se)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{       Rounding the inlet's bottom, moonbeams dance like floating swans within the darkish-blue water.  A sense of gloom pervades this narrow inlet, as flashes of lightning spark up the storm clouds haunting the sky. Brown patches of tall cat tails sway in the shimmering water, the effect is slightly hampered by the light shower that invade these grasslands.  The soft-hued bank echoes every footstep, and the eerie sounds of crickets inhabit the gloominess of the inlet. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
