R {35437}{0}{<268>}{River Inlet (e,s,w,n,ne)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{        Waning moonbeams dance within the darkish-blue waters of the inlet, highlighting the intertwining currents in a hypnotic display. Traveling through the wet grass is unpleasant, as the tall blades whip around you, leaving welts on unprotected skin.  Even the light shower of rain is tedious at best, causing you to stumble in pools of thick black mud lining the inlet banks.  The soft-hued brown-yellow fields echo every footstep, and the spooky sounds of crickets drift into the gloominess of this area. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
