R {35439}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (e,w,s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{      Walking through the grassy valley, you ascend a small and gradual set of knolls.  As you ascend them, a camp made up of poorly camouflaged tents can be seen in the distance.  A fierce wind blows, and the wind soaks your face with stinging droplets of rain.  A couple trees stand out against the horizon every now and again, but the surrounding area is mostly wide open fields. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
