R {35440}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (e,se,s,n)}{<228>, `<088>}{      Sparkling raindrops cascade down onto the endless fields that stretch out before you.  Tall, golden wisps of grass rise overhead, forming a canopy that provides little shelter from the rain.  Majestic, looming mountains are dotted with trees and snow covered summits, that lend a surreal air to this area.  The soft-hued black-brown mud echos every footstep, and the sounds of the restless wind fill the air. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
