R {35445}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (w,se,n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{      A great valley extends as far as the eye can see, while on the horizon a mountain range encircles these grasslands.  The earth beneath your feet is unstable, slushing away with each step.  In places, ominous pits gape darkly between clumps of grass, threatening to swallow you up should it collapse.  The golden sea of grass undulates back and forth as the wind passes over it, and its smell permeates the senses. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
