R {35446}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (e,s,w,ne,se)}{<228>, .<088>}{      Stretching from misty horizon to horizon, this golden grassland is remarkable for both its hostility to life and its sheer beauty. Flooded, cracked fissures run across the fields, occasionally emitting a foul smell into the misty, dark-grey sky.  A white sheet of light shimmers in the clouds, as the sound of thunder hovers above the valley floor, climbing gracefully down to lower levels. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
