R {35447}{0}{<268>}{River Inlet (s,w,n)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{      Pillows of faint streaky storm clouds are swiftly moving like racing chariots.  So unpredictable is the wind to the inlet, that lurking water vapor seems to sweep about the water in a state of confusion. This dank and dark shore has the smell of damp earth lingering in the air, and the eerie sounds of the wind are broken up by the melodic songs of the crickets chirping along the inlet banks. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
