R {35448}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (s,e)}{<228>. ^<088>}{      The grass of the valley runs right up to the edge of the canyon, almost as if it intends to dive right into its gaping mouth.  Tall, slender wisps of grass rise overhead, forming a golden canopy that provides little shelter from the relentless thunder showers.  The booming sounds of thunder echo in the distance and every footfall resounds against the bleak, dark mountain range which encircles this valley. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
