R {35449}{0}{<268>}{Left Point (sw,s)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{       You're walking on a long jagged point filled with tiny pools of water, dotting its rugged pockmarked surface.  Violently, rapids roll quickly over the far end of this point, as it juts out into the Chapel River. As you peer across the river, you notice that the force of the rapids continue to halt passage to the opposite side.  An eerie glow twinkles from within the tiny pools, as waning moonbeams fade in and out of view through the cloud cover. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
