R {35519}{0}{}{a huge tree (n,d,u)}{ }{        The size of the royal tree's main welcoming room is quite surprising. Looking around it's hard to imagine that you are actually within a tree trunk from the layout of this room.  Light stands at each corner of the room provide excellent lighting making the chandelier hanging from the ceiling completely unnecessary.  As with the rest of the tree, the design is quite bland, but there is a portrait on one wall, with a plaque on the opposite.  A small doorway leads into a north room, and a circular staircase travels both up and down the trunk. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
