E {35521}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35520}{0}{}{a huge tree (s)}{ }{       You appear to have entered a sleeping area within the elven tree.  As with most of the tree, the walls hold no decoration and the room is quite bland.  The room is perfectly quiet, and it would be quite easy to forget that you are within a large tree hundreds of feet above the ground.  A small bed covered in silk sits in the corner while a desk and chair are next to it.  A doorway leads back out into the tree's main welcoming room. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35519}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35521}{0}{}{a huge tree (u,d,n,s,e)}{ }{       This large room appears to be the royal living room of this great tree. As with the rest of the tree the room is quite bland, but there is a small, yet practical couch with a pair of matching wooden chairs sitting against the west wall.  From the ceiling is a large crystal that glows brightly giving light throughout the room.  Several smaller rooms lead in various directions as well a circular staircase that travels throughout the trunk of the tree. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35519}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35522}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
