E {35525}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35522}{0}{}{a huge tree (w,n,u)}{ }{       You have entered what appears to be the main elven throne room.  Unlike the living quarters of the tree, this room is richly decorated with gold and silver trinkets.  The floor appears to be made of marble with a pair of red carpets leading to a large throne made of silver.  The throne sits on a small pedestal up against the south wall.  A pair of doorways leads north and to the west, and a staircase leaves up into the living quarters above. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35521}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35526}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35527}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35523}{0}{}{a huge tree (s)}{ }{     You have entered what appears to be an elven nursery.  This is the only room that you have seen within the tree that isn't pristinely clean. Unmade beds line the west wall and the floor is covered in toys made of wood.  Several dirty garments lie in a pile on the east wall.  A single doorway leads back south into the main living quarters. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35521}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35524}{0}{}{a huge tree (n)}{ }{      This large bedroom is as bland as most of the tree.  The floor has been coated with something to make it smooth and shiny and it looks to be kept highly polished.  A large bed with wool covers sits in the far corner with a nightstand next to it.  The room has no decorations or other furnishings and the only exit appears to be back north into the main living quarters. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35521}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35525}{0}{}{a huge tree (w)}{ }{      This large bedroom has more furnishings than most of the rooms within the tree.  A large plush bed sits up against the south wall, and a large dresser is next to it.  Along the floor is a huge rug that adds color to the room.  The walls are bare except for a large mirror that sits above the dresser.  A doorway west leads back out into the living room. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35521}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35526}{0}{}{a huge tree (e)}{ }{     Entering into a small alcove, you appear to have reached the queen's sitting room.  The room is colorfully decorated with a few paintings and a few miscellaneous trinkets.  A small throne sits behind a desk against the north wall.  Next to a throne a light stand lights the room.  The doorway east leads back out into the main throne room. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35522}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35527}{0}{}{a huge tree (d,s)}{ }{    This small hallway is much more cramped than the rest of the tree.  The hall ends at a small stairwell leading down as well as extending south into the main throne room.  The hall is completely barren and dust on the stairwell tells you that it's not used very often. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35522}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35528}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35528}{0}{}{a huge tree (door,u)}{ }{     You find yourself in a small lower alcove within the ground level of the tree.  The room has nothing within it, and is very small.  To the south is a concealed door, which leads back out into the mountain forest.  The wooden stairwell leads back up into the main section of the royal elven tree. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35527}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23188}{door}{door}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35529}{0}{}{a forest (n,s,w,e)}{ }{    A crisp mountain breeze causes the treetops to sway as you walk through the forest atop mount Perplexus.  Far to the west you see the snow covered caps of the mountain as you come closer to the edge of the valley.  You noticed a rope ladder hanging down from a large tree. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {35530}{0}{<278>}{Town of Angelo (se)}{<278>. .<088>}{       Stepping off the dirt path, you have come to the northwest corner of town.  Small shacks are lined side by side\; many of them leaning up against the large brick wall that surrounds the city.  The ground is made of barren dirt that has been trampled by traffic to and from the shacks.  To the east you see the backside of the guard station, while the south is blocked by the horse stables.  The dirt path leads back southeast into town. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
