R {35531}{0}{<238>}{A small shack (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{     Upon entering this small shack, you are immediately surprised on how well kept it is.  Although the inhabitants are obviously poor, all the bare necessities are present.  A small wooden bed sits in the corner of the shack, just large enough for two people.  A large area rug covers the floor and everything is neatly cleaned and dusted. }{Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
