R {35576}{0}{}{The town inn (s)}{ }{       The old floorboards creak and groan within the second story of this dilapidated old inn.  It would seem that the building sways to and fro as the outside wind blows upon it.  There is a rickety old balcony rail that leads around the perimeter of the building.  A small break in the rail is where the staircase was once attached and led down to the floor before.  A small hallway leads towards the south where the guest rooms once were. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
