R {35577}{0}{}{Perplexus Discussion Room (n)}{ }{      Broken and rotted pieces of wallboard dominate the clutter around what is now a large room atop the town's inn.  Splinted piles of wood lie in disarray about what was once several rooms.  The walls have long since been broken down, leaving this vast empty area.  In the far corner of the room, a small desk has been setup and a figure appears to be dutifully writing in some kind of journal. }{Around the town of Angelo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
