R {35580}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (sw,ne)}{ }{     This section of the cave slopes deeply towards the southwest and bends around a huge boulder permanently lodged within the dirt wall.  A continual flow of smoke traverses along the soot stained ceiling, seeking escape to the fresh air at the mouth.  A flurry of activity can be heard from deep within the cave to the southwest. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35579}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
