R {35582}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (se,nw)}{ }{     The dirt floor of this dark cave slopes at an extreme angle towards the northwest.  The walls are hard packed, although jagged with roots and rocks.  The dirt ceiling is stained black from an endless trail of soot flowing up the cave towards the mouth.  Sounds of activity can be heard deeper within the tunnel. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35579}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35583}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35583}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (se,w)}{ }{      This tunnel leads westward, deeper into the mountain, is very wide and allows for several large humanoids to walk side by side through the premises.  Just to the southeast the cave gets much narrower, and slopes up to the cave mouth.  Large iron cauldrons on each side of the cave are filled with burning oil.  Soot and smoke from the cauldrons rises quickly, and flows towards the southeast. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35582}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35584}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35584}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (w,e)}{ }{      A smoky haze fills this dirt tunnel that leads east and west through darkness.  An eerie howling wind can be heard far to the east, and the faint sounds of soldiers echo off the dirt walls.  The tunnel is very dark, but wide enough for several men to walk abreast.  Fires from burning cauldrons can be seen down both ends of the hall, but their light is too faint to reach this section of the tunnel. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35583}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35585}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35585}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (sw,e,ne,nw)}{ }{     This section of the wide main tunnel has a couple of branches leading off it to the northeast and northwest.  The main tunnel runs as far east as the eye can see, and also curves to the southwest.  The southern wall has a large iron cauldron full of burning oil, providing light to the area. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35584}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
