R {35586}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (sw,ne)}{ }{     This long corridor leads deep within the mountain.  The smoky haze that looms in the air is thick, making it fairly difficult to breathe. The walls are made of raw dirt, with an occasional jagged rock protruding from them.  The hall is curved, not allowing any light to reach it from the northeast or southwest. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35585}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35589}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35587}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (sw)}{ }{      A huge fire pit sits within the center of this large room.  Crates of metal, leather strips, rivets, and other items of smithing are stacked against the walls.  The dirt ceiling has been burrowed upward into the shape of a cone, leading into a black hole to allow for ventilation.  Next to the fire pit is a large anvil, upon which is a steel forging hammer. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35585}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35588}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (nw,se)}{ }{    This small corridor leads through the dirt of the mountain and is barely wide enough for a single person.  It's quite long, and the walls are filled with sharp protrusions of rocks and dirt.  A loud bit of commotion can be heard to the northwest. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35585}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35617}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35589}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (se,ne,e)}{ }{     This section of the tunnel takes an abrupt curve and circles back around eastward.  The main passage leads to the southeast and northeast, and there is a large cauldron filled with burning oil at the base of the west wall.  Directly to the east is a small doorway, covered in a shimmering blue field. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35586}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35590}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
