R {35591}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (w,e)}{ }{       The bright light reflecting against the pristine white marble stone makes it difficult to remember that this is really the inside of a mountain.  The marble slabs are perfectly fitted to make up the floor, ceiling and walls.  The craftsmanship is fine enough to make even the oldest dwarves envious.  To the west is a shimmering blue field leading back out to the main cave, and the corridor leads far to the east. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35589}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
