R {35592}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (w,u,e)}{ }{    The white hallway, made up of marble continues far to the east and west.  The hall is brightly lit by small balls of light that hover along the ceiling.  A large circular stairwell made of black iron extends through the ceiling to another level above. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
