R {35594}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (se,w,ne)}{ }{     This long corridor is made of white marble, and extends far to the west.  The eastern end terminates in two doorways, one to the the northeast and other to the southeast.  The ceiling is lined with hovering balls of light.  The hall is free of any forms decoration or art, and somehow seems unnaturally clean. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35592}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35595}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35596}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35595}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (nw)}{ }{       This small office is circular in shape, and lined with a fitted stone floor.  A makeshift desk faces the doorway, made out of a simple wooden table.  A wooden chair with faded red cloth cushions is used for sitting at the desk.  On the stone walls are trophies of bear heads, and other wild game.  Along the ceiling are several small balls of light, hovering in mid air they provide illumination and warmth within this deep cave. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35594}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35596}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (sw)}{ }{      This spacious room has a large oval table sitting in the middle of it, and several canvas maps mounted on the walls.  A dim ball of light hovers just below the ceiling over the table, providing light and warmth to the room.  Wooden chairs encircle the table, many scattered in disarray.  The floor and walls are made of fitted stone, with a doorway leading to the southwest. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35594}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35597}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (e,w)}{ }{       This long hall starts out as marble on the eastern end, but the marble stones end in a jagged formation about halfway towards the west.  The remainder of the hall consists of raw dirt, with bits of rock protruding from the walls.  The hallway is fairly narrow, but large enough for a single person to easily traverse.  A bitter cold wind blows eastward, sending small bits of dirt and dust particles with it along the marble floor. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35605}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35598}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (s)}{ }{      This small room contains a small, unmade bed with heavy wool blankets clumped up against the side wall.  A small table made of wood is covered in parchment and bottles of ink of various colors.  Several scraps of paper have fallen to the floor either by accident or discarded.  A large ball of energy hovers just below the ceiling, providing light and a bit of warmth to the room. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35599}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (ne)}{ }{       This small room contains a small bed, neatly made with a wool blanket covering, an end table, and a small reading table and chair.  The smell of sweet incense looms heavily in the air, as several are burning in holders upon the tables.  The walls contain several golden relics and a large painting just over the bed.  Just below the ceiling hovers a large ball of light providing illumination to the room.  The doorway in the northeast corner leads back out to the corridor. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35600}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (nw)}{ }{    This simple room contains only a large bearskin rug lying in the center of the floor.  A large ball of light hovers just below the ceiling, providing light and minimal warmth to the room.  A wool blanket is neatly folded and placed in the far corner of the room.   }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35601}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (se)}{ }{      This small room is lined with plush seating, surrounding a low table.  The walls contain several paintings mounted upon marble.  Hovering at the ceiling, directly above the table, is a large ball of light which illuminates the study as well as gives off a warm radiance.  The table contains several mugs and wooden plates, most of which are empty, or contain scraps from a left-over meal. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35602}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (sw)}{ }{    This large library is lined with wall to wall shelves, filled with books.  The center of the room contains a small table and two simple chairs for sitting.  Just below the stone ceiling, a large ball of light hovers silently, providing illumination and warmth to the room. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35603}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (n)}{ }{      This large room is circular, and has an altar made of stone within its center.  At each corner of the ceiling are small globes of light, directing illuminating radiance upon the altar.  The altar is made of a strange black stone that seems unnatural.  The black altar is in direct contrast to the white marble stones that make up the floor, ceilings and walls. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35604}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (w)}{ }{     This simple room contains a large bed, table and chair.  The head of a large hydra is mounted upon a wooden plaque on the wall.  Just under the head is a large sword within a jeweled scabbard.  Upon the bed are several wool blankets.  Hovering at the ceiling is a large ball of energy, dark and almost colorless.   }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35593}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35605}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (e)}{ }{      This dark alcove is circular in shape, and continues upward as far as the eye can see.  A strong and bitter-cold wind blows from above, bringing bits of dust and dirt along with it.  The tunnel above twists out of sight clockwise, making it impossible to judge the tunnel's length or source of the wind.  A small corridor leads out of this alcove to the east. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35597}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

