R {35607}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (sw,w,s,ne)}{ }{       This humongous room is lined as far as the eye can see with rows of cots, each one having a footlocker at the end.  The putrid stench of sweat and filth lingers in the room, but for the most part, it is kept in tidy fashion.  An occasional soldier walks about, but pays you no mind.  A small corridor leads out of the room to the north east.  The barracks are so large, that it's impossible to see all the way across it. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
