R {35608}{0}{}{A deep and dark cave (se,sw,e,nw)}{ }{      The tunnel leading westward abruptly stops at a huge boulder, forever buried within the mountain.  The hall has been redirected to the north and southwest around it.  In front of the boulder is an iron cauldron, full of burning oil to light and heat the area.  A smaller hall has been dug towards the southeast and the smell of charred meat and other foods loom from that direction. }{Mount Perplexus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
