R {35646}{0}{}{Inner tomb of Almoni Ploni (e)}{ }{     The inner tomb is fruitless, much like the rest of this place.  Such a mighty ruler should have riches for one to profit from.  Or maybe someone beat you to it?  Impossible.  Others would have surely perished or given up.  In the center of the room, on an altar, is a golden sarcophagus. }{Tomb of Almoni Ploni}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
