R {35647}{0}{}{Stairs leading down to the tomb (d,u)}{ }{     You entered the dark opening and you have walked half way down the long stairs. You have reached the point where the sun is unable to reach any deeper and underneath there is only darkness unviolated by the high sun outside. The dust rises as your footsteps pierce the silence, and you see markings on the walls. }{Tomb of Almoni Ploni}{almoni_ploni}{}{}{1.000}{1}
