R {35649}{0}{}{Outer tomb (se,u,ne)}{ }{    This appears to be a foyer.  There are layered elevated stone slabs in the center of the room.  The air is stale from the dust settling over countless years, but your echoing footsteps send some of it back into the air. }{Tomb of Almoni Ploni}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35648}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
