R {35650}{0}{}{Outer tomb (ne,nw)}{ }{     The slabs which make up the floor are uneven here.  The shifting sands have moved them over the thousands of years.  The shift has even made one of the pillars, supporting the ceiling, to shift and topple over.  The event caused the ceiling to buckle and allow sand to trickle into the room. }{Tomb of Almoni Ploni}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35649}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35653}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35651}{0}{}{Outer tomb (se,sw)}{ }{     The footsteps sound hollow in this room.  It's big, but your perspective is limited as your light only reveals portions of it.  As you turn and the shadows move, the secrets they hold beckon you to look more.  The light glimmers off a large set of scales in the center of the room. }{Tomb of Almoni Ploni}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
