R {35653}{0}{}{Outer tomb (sw,nw)}{ }{    The room is bathed in blue.  In the center of the room is a large torch bearing a blue flame.  Apart from that, the room is empty and you're reminded of this with every footstep that echoes in the silence. }{Tomb of Almoni Ploni}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
