R {35654}{0}{}{Inside a shed (out,w)}{ }{     You are standing inside a dark, smelly, dirty shed that has been converted into a small hovel of some sort.  A small, warped rocking chair sits in one corner beside a greasy window that barely lets in any light. A large straw mat on the floor is dirtier than the packed dirt floor itself. It's really amazing this place is still standing, despite such disrepair. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
