R {35656}{0}{}{In a small kitchen (e)}{ }{     This side of the shed has been converted into a rather small, scanty kitchen.  On one side, you can see a small pit for a fire next to a vent to let the smoke outside, and a small metal container you can only guess has been turned into a refrigerator.  On the other side, a makeshift sink or washbasin has been set into the wall, with a few dirty dishes in it. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35654}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35657}{0}{}{On a small trail (w,gap,nw)}{ }{      You are surrounded by large scraps of underbrush on all sides.  They have ominous prickers and sticky suckers that almost reach out for you, barring any attempt to pass through them.  Behind you are some bushes with a small gap, which appears to lead to a grassy field.  The underbrush has been trampled somewhat, leaving very narrow trails you could travel to the west or northwest. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35658}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
