R {35665}{0}{}{Inside the hill (u,w)}{ }{     You are at the bottom of the rickety metal ladder, on ground deep within the hill.  You can see the trapdoor entrance far above you, at the top of the ladder, but you can't see the ledge you were on earlier.  This particular passageway leads west, imprinted with a few scary footprints.  You gasp as you realize what made them... }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15816}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35666}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35666}{0}{}{Inside the hill (w,e)}{ }{    You are walking along a strange corridor, trying to get your bearings.  The walls appear hewn by rather rushed workers, or by some animal trying to claw its way out of a cave.  The passageway continues to the west.  To the east, you can see a metal ladder attached to the wall. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35665}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35667}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35667}{0}{}{Inside the hill (sw,n,e)}{ }{     You're in a small underground corridor, carved right into the hill.  The ragged dirt walls appear carved by toiling clawed hands, or else very jagged digging instruments.  You can hear noises ahead in the dark distance. You can see several passageways trailing away from here, toward the noises. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35666}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35668}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35669}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35668}{0}{}{Inside the hill (se,w,n,ne)}{ }{    The kobold cavern is quite narrow, and forces you to crouch as you walk, which isn't very comfortable.  You have no idea why you're trespassing in this unfriendly territory in the first place.  You can see a heavy stone portcullis next to you, which normally blocks the southeast passageway. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35667}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
