R {35669}{0}{}{Inside the hill (s,sw)}{ }{    It is quite dark this deep into the kobold caves, and very stuffy.  You are starting to understand why kobolds are so disgustingly dirty and smelly! You can hear noises around the bend to the southwest--evil gnashing kobold noises.  You can turn back now, or you can forge ahead if you are brave... }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35667}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35672}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35670}{0}{}{Inside the hill (nw,e)}{ }{    The passageway has opened up a bit from the northwest, opening into a more natural-looking cavern with smooth walls.  Some greenish moss and fungus on the wall provides some bioluminescence--not enough by which to see, but enough to cast eerie shadows.  The corridor appears to end to the east. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35668}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35687}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35691}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35671}{0}{}{Inside the hill (e)}{H}{     You have walked into a small kobold 'office', if you can call it that.  A squared block has been carved from the far wall, somewhat serviceable as a desk, with another rock mound carved from the floor nearby, obviously the accompanying chair.  In traditional kobold style, there's garbage and dirt covering everything. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35668}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35685}{enter hole}{enter hole}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35672}{0}{}{Inside the hill (s,ne,nw)}{ }{      You think about the stories of the mischievous kobolds, that would often hide household and farm tools, and kick over furniture.  You even remember stories of kobolds singing to children in old German folklore. It is unfortunate just how temperamental and outraged the kobolds can become when not properly fed.  You have yet to find any major stockpiles of food...  Was that a noise behind you?  It was probably just your imagination... }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35668}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35669}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
