R {35673}{0}{}{Inside the hill (se,sw)}{ }{   You're near the western end of this small kobold cavern system.  This is obviously just a dark tunnel continuation, without much interesting to see. You'd better scurry along before something more exciting shows up... }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35672}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35674}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35674}{0}{}{Inside the hill (s,e,ne)}{ }{    You have been wandering these tunnels for quite some time, wondering what the heck it is you're supposed to be looking for in the first place!   There's a room to the east that might hold the answer to that question.   But I'd be careful if I were you--that appears to be a guard station. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
