R {35675}{0}{}{Inside the hill (s,w,n)}{ }{   You have come to the western end of the kobold cavern system.  To the west, and the south you see two 'rooms' built out of the caves.  The only exit through the passageways is behind you, to the north. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35674}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35677}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
