R {35689}{0}{}{Kobold Ready Room (out)}{ }{         Somehow, you've made it past the royal kobold throne room, and have entered the kobold king's tactical ready room!  But something is particularly odd, for as you'd envision a room with lots of tables, chairs, and maps of all kinds,  this is just a small room, almost an unfinished afterthought of the otherwise complex cave system.  In the middle of the room sits a small stone table, hardly seeming useful for major battle plans.  Behind the table lies a rather large, low seat of some kind, where the king must obviously sit.  The ceiling is low, and your ankles protest as you squat while in this room. }{Attrition}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
