R {35692}{0}{}{Entrance yard (gate)}{ }{        You find yourself standing in a room lit by sunlight, which is very odd since you just came down from a dark alley.  Looking up you see a series of cleverly hidden mirrors reflecting the light from a hidden skylight.  The rest of the room appears to be a small, but carefully groomed courtyard, complete with neatly  trimmed grass, some small trees and even a small brook that runs  under a low bridge into a reflective pool.  Across the bridge is a small Torii gate with red doors leading south. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35352}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35693}{gate}{gate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {35693}{0}{}{Small Room (e,gate)}{ }{       You are standing in a small room sectioned off by sliding panels. It is sparsely decorated except for the occasional watercolor  paintings hung up on posts.  Tatami mats cover part of the floor while the rest is hard wooden paneling polished smooth and oddly enough it feels warm to the touch.  Then you remember that Japanese homes use hot water pipes under the floors to keep their houses nice and toasty warm.  There's a door to the east. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35694}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35692}{gate}{gate}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

