R {35699}{0}{}{Guard Room (e,ne)}{ }{       This is a rather sparsely furnished room, like the rest of the  rooms in this odd place.  More tatami mats are on the floor and several hacked up looking poles.  Apparently this room is used for practicing the art of kendo, or samurai sword-fighting.  There is another White Lotus symbol on the wall in here too.  Also there is a sign posted to a pillar in here.  Sliding panels leading to the Northeast and to the east. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
