R {35703}{0}{}{A shattered city street (n,w,e)}{ }{     You wander the dark twisted streets of the Outworld's capital  city.  The ancient citadel of the emperor rises in the inky black  sky over the crumbling buildings that line the street.  The twisted  spires reach out to pierce the dark veil above, talons reaching out  to grasp the entirety of the Outworld itself. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
