R {35704}{0}{}{A desolate street (s,n,w,e)}{ }{     The silent streets wrap you in their cold embrace.  The naked  Outworld sky covers you in its chill arms as you wander the maze  of decrepit buildings and fallen stonework.  You can't imagine  what terrible fate enfolded this once great city to bring it to  the desolate place it is now. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
