R {35753}{0}{}{=( An Old Manor )= (w,window,s,e)}{ }{         You stand just inside the old manor.  A worn red carpet lines the center of the hallway, and continues to the south.  The old wooden floor is exposed on either side of the carpet, and creaks with your every movement.  Thin curtains to the side of the open window float in the breeze, trying to cover up the open window, as if they could trap you from the outside world. Looking out the window to the hidden dangers of the misty world beyond, you're not certain if you feel safer in here or out there.  The hallway makes a 'T' here, with rooms to the west and east and the long dark hallway leading south. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
