R {35756}{0}{}{=( An Old Manor )= (w)}{ }{         You've entered a large library in the old manor.  Beneath your feet a thick brown carpet absorbs the dust, and deadens sound.  In the center of the room is a long table, with a few plush chairs around it.  Book shelves lines the walls, and hold quite a few treasures\; books, stuffed birds and animals, and so on.  Particularily noticeable is the prominently displayed stuffed owl which sits atop a book shelf in the southeast corner.  As you continue to explore the room, your light falls on the full length of the table, exposing a mysterious tome.  Also on the large table, is a thin jeweled letter opener. }{Haunted Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
