R {35890}{0}{}{Yoshiko Military Supply (out)}{ }{       The noise of traffic is nearly at an unbearable state as hover as well as conventional vehicles swerve all around you.  The air is thick and gaseous, obviously full of pollutants from this large third world city.  There are no distinguishing markings visible to identify the city from the hundreds like it around the world.  Around the immediate vicinity are dozens of human bodies of all races.  All of them have been scorched to death, as if they were charred to a crisp. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
