R {35891}{0}{}{Yoshiko Military Supply (out)}{ }{       This round lab is quite large and is made of heavily reinforced security walls.  The only exit from this safety lab is through the double doors to the northwest.  The lab is full of electronic monitoring equipment, as well as impact measurement devices.  The eastern wall is full of scorch marks from previous blast tests.  The doorway to the northwest has a blue shimmering security field over it, to keep what ever devices in here from escaping. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
