R {35892}{0}{}{Yoshiko Military Supply (out)}{ }{       Stepping into this creation lab, it seems like a whole other world.  The climate is dry and hot, and the floor is molded to simulate desert landscapes.  Artificial wind has been created, and sand blows through the air.  The walls are nearly indistinguishable from the ground and ceiling causing the lab to look like a desert wasteland.  Upon an artificial hill, a small bunker has been created for a test simulation. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
