R {35893}{0}{}{Yoshiko Military Supply (out)}{ }{       The bitter cold of this arctic wasteland could easily freeze the most well protected of creatures.  Stepping into this lab, equipped with the latest of artificial climate technology, it's hard to remember that you're really in the ultra modern city of Mega-Tokyo.  Blinding snow is spread out as far as the eye can see, being whipped around by a bone chilling wind.  A small oval portal is the only sign of civilization in this winter abyss. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
