R {35932}{0}{}{Mega-Tokyo Fire Station (w,n)}{ }{       This large bunkhouse is dimly lit and lined with rows of single beds.  A walkway extends down the center of the room between the beds that line the east and west walls.  Fluorescent lights are recessed into the ceiling and give just enough light to see by.  At the foot of each bed is a locker to keep personal belongings.  A doorway to the north leads to a recreation center, while another in the west wall leads to the kitchen. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
