R {36094}{0}{}{In a small Alcove (s)}{ }{        This looks like it was once a bathroom. Well, I guess it could still be termed a bathroom in a functional sense. There is feces and urine staining the walls and floor. There is a sound coming from one of the stalls. Whatever is in there sounds like it is having a tough time with whatever it is doing. The water-taps still dispense water but it doesn't look like you could get your hands very clean in them because of the STUFF smeared in them. All in all, this place thoroughly disgusts you. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
