R {36095}{0}{}{In a Dark Factory (n,w)}{ }{      The hallway walls are painted in eye-catching pastels and off-set by a black border all around. Whoever decorated this place has a warped sense of colour schemes. The light emanating from the fluorescent tubes above you is reflected off the walls in a pale yellow, making the colours seem almost somber. There is a sharp turn to the north here that ends the hallway's east-west direction so far. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
