R {36096}{0}{}{In a Dark Factory (n,s)}{ }{       The hallway has taken on a brightness here that you haven't seen so far in this creepy factory. The walls are painted bright white and the light is pure, bouncing off the walls with a brightness that makes them seem to almost glow. The dreary carpet brings the mood of the hallway down though. It is soiled and tattered. All of the components of this scene lead you to one conclusion: the decorator was either blind or mad. And you'd put your money on both. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
