R {36100}{0}{}{In a Crawlspace (e)}{ }{     You have entered a huge, cavernous room. The walls are lined with stacks of skulls and bones. In the center of the room, three figures dance wildly around a raging fire, chanting loudly, engaged in some dark Santa Rian ritual. Your blood turns to ice and hair stands straight on the nape of your neck. You smell certain death in the air. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
