R {36101}{0}{}{In a Dark Factory (e)}{ }{    You have come to the end of the hallway. There are stairs leading up into a dark black area above you. The walls are empty. The floors are bare hardwood. You have a feeling of ominous threat when you look toward the stairs. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36099}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36102}{0}{}{In a pit (u)}{ }{      The air in this room carries the stench of sweat and urine. Light pours in from above where you broke through. Other than that, there is no illumination. There are bars to the north covering the entire wall. You look through them and see a great machine pumping and puffing smoke and reverberating a great thumping throughout the entire room. The floor is bare cement, as are the walls. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36097}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
