R {36103}{0}{}{A Tiny Cubicle (w)}{ }{    You have to wait as your eyes adjust to the deep darkness. You see a pile of hay in the corner and a metal dish close beside it. The walls are made of blackened cement and stained by water that drips from the ceiling. There is a strong scent of unwashed bodies and vileness here. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36095}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36104}{0}{}{In a doctor's office (door)}{ }{     The room smells harshly of antiseptic to the point of burning your nostrils.  There is an examination table along the north wall and some cabinets above the table. A sink sits on the south wall with a mirror above. You could sit and wait for the doctor to arrive, or you could leave through the door you entered. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
