R {36106}{0}{}{In a Dark Pit (s)}{ }{     The machine before you takes up most of the room. There are pipes and hoses sprouting from every conceivable place on the surface of this machine. The pipes and hoses then interconnect and pass upwards to the ceiling and disappear. There is a small metal door in the front of the machine here. }{Care Bears}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36102}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36107}{0}{}{Winter Cave (d,leave)}{ }{      A cold winter chill shivers down your spine as you enter this dark cave.  Sharp edges of ice are all around you, as it looks like whatever dug out this cave, has done so recently.  The ground here descends at a steep angle and the ice-covered floor is quite slippery. Ferocious sounds can be heard from the darkness below you.  Be careful traveler, as you know not what you enter. }{Snowbeast Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
