E {8475}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36108}{0}{}{Snowbeast Lair (u)}{ }{     Sounds echo eerily off the walls here in this deep, dark lair.  The ground is frozen solid as the cold winter chill whips directly down into this cave.  The stench of rotting corpses fills the cavern.  Most of the smell seems to be resonating from a pit at the back of the lair. Miscellaneous bones and corpses litter the cavern. }{Snowbeast Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36107}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
