R {36115}{0}{}{-=( A wide tunnel )=- (e,s)}{ }{      Water drips down off the slick walls, collecting in small pools on the mist-shrouded floor.  The ceiling hangs high overhead, almost lost in the shadows on the edge of the light.  Several stalagmites have formed on the floor where the mineral-rich water drips down from high above.  The floor drops away sharply to the east as the tunnel enters a wide shaft in the rock. }{Azziruth's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
