E {36117}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36116}{0}{}{-=( A small cave )=- (e)}{ }{     Several species of fungi compete for space around the wet floors of this small cave, while water drips constantly down the slick walls.  The cavern is only around ten feet across at its widest point, and the low ceiling crowds the chamber, only a few feet high in places.  A small lantern has been discarded on the floor, its glass lens reflecting the light. }{Azziruth's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36112}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36117}{0}{}{-=( A deep shaft )=- (u,d,w)}{ }{    The walls of this wide shaft are smooth and polished, drops of condensation clinging to the rock like small jewels.  A gentle breeze blows through the shaft from somewhere high above.  A wide tunnel leads out from the main shaft to the west. }{Azziruth's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36115}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
