R {36118}{0}{}{-=( At the top of a deep shaft )=- (d,w)}{ }{     A gentle breeze blows through the tunnel here, the source of which appears to be a dimly lit cave to the west.  The walls are smooth and covered in tiny beads of condensation, while the ceiling it covered in a series of thick stalactites.  There is a deep shaft here cut into the heart of the caves, its depth cloaked in black shadows. }{Azziruth's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36117}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36120}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36119}{0}{}{-=( A massive stone chamber )=- (w)}{ }{     The walls of this massive stone chamber stretch away into the distance.  The cave is over two hundred feet in diameter, strangely illuminated by the flickering glow of several strange glass spheres that float roughly twenty feet off the floor.  The ceiling of the cave is obscured by rolling clouds, move slowly as if caught by gentle winds. }{Azziruth's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36117}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
