R {36131}{0}{}{A cramped corridor (forward,back)}{ }{       A corridor so small you practically have to crawl through it.  You've no idea where it goes or even why it's in the lighthouse, but curiosity has gotten the better of you once more.  The smooth stone of the tower is cool to your touch as you duckwalk down the passage.  Cool and clean. Someone, or something, has been this way recently.  The passage turns downward and curves to the right, following the wall of the tower.  A few more feet and you can slide down it to wherever it goes. }{Tower of Fire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36132}{forward}{forward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36133}{back}{back}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36132}{0}{}{A dark chamber (e)}{ }{    A small square chamber barely as long as you are tall.  A dark opening gapes mockingly at about shoulder height along one wall, showing you the sloping passage up to the lighthouse above.  A single door stands opposite the opening, its wood charred black in places. }{Tower of Fire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36134}{forward}{forward}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

