R {36138}{0}{}{A dim antechamber (s,w)}{ }{        The light here is dim at best, enough to see by, but little more. Three flickering candles cast dancing shadows from a small niche in the eastern wall.  The charcoal stone of the walls only adds to the gloom of the chamber.  There is a wooden door leading out to the west and a graceful archway to the south.  A crumbling wooden bench rests against the north wall.  Except for the decay and disrepair of the chamber, you'd guess it was once a sitting room of some kind. }{Tower of Fire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36136}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36139}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36139}{0}{}{A throne room (n)}{ }{       You can only describe this as a throne room, though you doubt that it has always been one.  The shattered remains of tables, chairs and other furniture has been casually brushed aside to clutter against the walls so that the center of the chamber can be dominated by a massive throne of chalky white bone resting upon a pile of skulls too numerous to count.  Streaks of red run down the walls and the stench of death lies heavily here. }{Tower of Fire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36138}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14117}{enter portal}{enter portal}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36140}{0}{}{A bedchamber (d)}{ }{     A rather sparse bedchamber.  A large bed rests against one wall,  the sheets turned down.  A small dresser sits to one side, an oval  mirror above it, its top cluttered with someone's personal  effects.  A small closet stands opposite the dresser, its doors  ajar.  Stairs lead back down to the bottom of the tower. }{Tower of Frost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23986}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37220}{closet}{closet}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36141}{0}{}{A kitchen (w)}{ }{       A small kitchen which serves the tower.  A large fireplace fills one wall, its chimney joining that of the one in the other room. Two long shelves line another wall, stocked with crocks of preserved food and spices.  A large barrel of water sits in a corner.  A single window is shuttered tight against the icy winds.  A ring of hooks hanging from the ceiling hold all the pots and pans you could need to cook. }{Tower of Frost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23986}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

