R {36183}{0}{}{The hall of the dragon queen (e)}{D}{        You now stand in the mighty halls of Deghna, queen of all dragons. On the floor, you see large black marks, probably coming from the dragon's breath. In one of the corners, you see a huge pile of different skulls and bones, mostly from humans. In the ceiling you see a large hole, from where this dragon leaves approximately once per century to hunt or destroy creatures, humans as well as animals. The hole is too high up for you to reach though, but there is still one escape: east leads back to the stairs.  }{Maze}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36182}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36184}{0}{}{The plateau (jumpeast,jumpwest)}{ }{    The plateau is shaped like a cylinder, made of stone. The top of it is about three to four feet wide in all directions, making it rather unstable to stand on. To the east and west, there is some safer ground to stand on, to which you could try to jump.  }{Maze}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36172}{jumpeast}{jumpeast}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36181}{jumpwest}{jumpwest}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

