R {36187}{0}{}{Feron's Chamber (e)}{ }{    As you stumble into this chamber, the first thing you see is a large five-pointed star on the floor, painted in blood. At the edge of each point, a lit candle stands. Maybe someone tried to summon beings from another plane of existence!  }{Maze}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36164}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36188}{0}{}{Elgrad's Chamber (s)}{ }{    You now stand in a room filled with bookshelves, looking as if an old wizard or something lived here. The bookshelves are filled with tons of books, smaller ones, as well as larger ones. The only thing you understand is that those books must be boring to read, anyhow.  }{Maze}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36164}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36189}{0}{}{Small caveroom (w)}{ }{   This small room differs from the previous ones, since it's actually not a furnished room, rather a common cave room. The walls are filled with slime, and the smell in here is terrifying.  }{Maze}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36164}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36190}{0}{}{Winding Stairway (stairs)}{ }{       A small winding stairway made of concrete winds its away around deeper into the ground. The cracking blocks show evidence of age much older than those making up the fountain above you. Though the stairway is small, the walls around you are wide, allowing space through which even a much larger creature could probably pass. The air around you is silent and even your steps make echoes as you travel along the stairway. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36191}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {23289}{climb up stairway}{climb up stairway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36193}{climb down stairway}{climb down stairway}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

