R {36192}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {36193}{0}{}{Mouth of a Cave (stairs,s)}{ }{       At the bottom of the winding stairway a path travels further into the ground as it spreads out into the wide opening of the mouth of a cave. Clearly this must have been a habitat at one time, and whomever built the fountain overhead might not have even known of this cave's existence when he or she built it. Cold drafts of air blow out of the cave and onto your skin. There's no telling what might have lived here at what time and what might still. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36194}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36195}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
