R {36195}{0}{}{A Dark Cave (se,n,sw)}{ }{        This appears to be the beginning of a small, but wide, cave system. The rocky walls sprout openings in various directions which you could travel by. A faint smell tickles your nose, and you're not quite sure what to make of it. All of any sort of natural light has been sucked from this cave long ago, and the cave sits quietly in darkness. Though in a dark unknown place, the quietness seems a bit disturbing and on the unnerving side. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36193}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36196}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36204}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36196}{0}{}{A Dark Cave (sw,nw)}{ }{     The cave becomes gloomier yet as it winds itself deeper underground. Furthermore the smell that tickled your nose before now is ever present and almost nauseating. The rocky walls twist and turn as the hollow cave continues. Nothing more than your own footsteps breaks the deafening silence which overtakes the cave. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36195}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36198}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36197}{0}{}{A Dark Cave (ne,nw)}{ }{      This section of the cave appears to have the lesser stench and odor. The ground begins to slope downward and deeper in itself as it winds to the northwest, and it rises upwards slightly toward the northeast where the entrance of this cave looks to be. The cave remains utterly silent as you travel, and even the slightest sound could make your nerves jump their ends. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36204}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36205}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36198}{0}{}{A Dark Cave (ne)}{B}{       The cave continues along its windy path through the underground. Embedded deep in a corner of this portion of the cave is a small habitat. A torn and beat up blanket is on the ground, and various small bones are scattered around it with chew marks along them. Anything that lives here couldn't require much, that's for sure. The smell is seriously affecting your sinuses with its strong odor. The cave seems to reach a dead end at this point against a wall. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36196}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36199}{e}{brush away rocks;e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36199}{0}{}{Entrance to a large lair (in,w)}{ }{      A hole in the western portion of the rocky walls leads into another opening branched off from the main tunnels. The walls quickly open up into a wide cavern to your east. The cavern appears to have been settled into as a lair of some sorts, as various objects are scattered about within it, though nothing is too clear from here. Something seems to tickle your mind about this place. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36198}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36200}{in}{in}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36200}{e}{in}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36200}{0}{}{A Large Lair (leave)}{ }{          This wide cavern is fairly tall and roomy even compared to the vast tunnels throughout the rest of the cave. Through various arrangements the cavern appears to have been converted into a livable lair. Towards the walls of the lair the ground has been slightly built up, forming a large, circular area in front of the rest of the lair's objects. While looking at the cavern around you, you notice that the surroundings don't appear as normal images at all. In fact they do not even appear as things normally would in reality. They sort of waver in front of you with an unusual light to them, almost as if they were separated from the world you are fixed in. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36199}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36199}{w}{leave}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36201}{0}{}{<*<*A Verdant Patch of Woods*>*> (sw,nw,n,s,w)}{ }{      Many ancient trees seem to have fallen in this area, clearing the way for young, new saplings.  From the twisted husks of the fallen woods you would guess a tornado went through area.  The sun shines brilliantly overhead through a cloudless azure sky.  The old making way for the new fills this part of the forest with the energy of life and new creation. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
