E {49711}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46255}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36202}{0}{}{A Dark Cave (se,ne)}{ }{        The ground continues its gradual descent into the earth as it travels further deeper into the system of tunnels. The walls have become slightly narrower alongside the expository pathway on which you travel, though they still provide plenty of room to travel through. The smell of the rest of the cave has left its traces elsewhere allowing easier breathing of the cold cavernous air. The cave remains completely silent, without even the slightest sound or stir of movement. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36205}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36206}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36203}{0}{}{A Dark Cave (sw,se)}{ }{       The light continues to be drained away from the environment as the tunnel winds itself around the twisted rock walls of the cave. As the tunnel winds, the ground continues a now steeper descent deeper yet into the earth below. The rock walls continue to become slightly narrower than those further towards the entrance to the cave. The silence as well continues creeping at your mind in this unfamiliar setting. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
