R {36207}{0}{}{A Dark Cave (nw,sw)}{ }{        The ground takes a heavy slant downwards, and creates a rough angle for you to keep your stance on it. As you move further along the pathway, small gravel rocks roll beneath you. Looking back you see you're already several feet below the level earlier along the path. You're not quite sure how much longer you'll be able to hold your footing should you continue traveling down the slope. Further down the path looks to be literally pitch black, even with the light it took to light this already dark area. }{Kalaena's Fountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
