R {36217}{0}{}{A cramped crevice. (leave,w)}{ }{      You have entered a narrow, cramped crevice.  Light filters in through the hole to the east.  The crevice continues, sloping down toward the west.  The walls are dry except a small stream of water running down the north wall.  The ceiling was made when the walls collapsed inward during some cataclysmic event in the past.  The floor is even except where the water has worn down into it. }{A hidden crevice}{hidden_crevice}{}{}{1.000}{1}
