R {36219}{0}{}{A cramped crevice. (e,w)}{ }{      You are in a cramped crevice, although it seems to be getting a bit wider as you go downward.  A little light filters down from above, but not enough by which to see.  The floor is slippery from a small stream of water running down it.  During some cataclysmic event in the past, the walls collapsed inward to form a ceiling of sorts.  The crevice continues up to the east and down to the west. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36217}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36220}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36220}{0}{}{A cramped crevice. (w,e)}{ }{     The crevice is extremely dark and the walls almost seem to swallow up the light you've brought with you.  The floor has been worn smooth by a small stream running through it and is, in fact, quite slippery at this point.  The crevice continues up to the east and starts getting increasingly steeper going down to the west. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36219}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36221}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36221}{0}{}{A small cavern. (s,n,w)}{ }{     As you look around, you realize you've entered a relatively level cavern.  To the east is the crevice which led down here.  You might be able to climb up to where you were if you're careful.  A stream of water runs into the cavern from the crevice then turns south and runs along the wall.  It is so dark that your light seems to disappear. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
