R {36222}{0}{}{A small cavern. (n,w)}{ }{       You are in the southeast corner of a small cavern.  The walls here are completely black and seem to swallow all light.  The floor is quite level except where a small stream of water has carved a path along the wall.  A fire pit that looks as if it hasn't been used in centuries sits in the middle of the room.  A stream enters from the north then turns and leaves the room to the west.  You hear the flap of batwings around you. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36221}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
