R {36223}{0}{}{A small cavern. (s,w)}{ }{    You are in the northeastern corner of a small cavern.  The walls are completely black and seem to swallow all light emitted in the area. The floor is quite level.  You can hear the sound of running water to the south.  You hear the flap of batwings around you. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36221}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
