R {36224}{0}{}{A small cavern. (e,n,s)}{ }{      You are on the west side of a small cavern.  The western wall here is completely black and seems to swallow all light in the room.  The floor is quite level -- almost unnaturally so.  In the unnatural darkness your ears seem sharper than normal.  You can hear the sound of running water to the east and south as well as the nearly silent flapping of batwings around you. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
