R {36225}{0}{}{A small cavern. (n,e)}{L}{      You are in the southwest corner of a small cavern.  The walls here are completely black and clearly swallow your light.  The floor is quite level except where a small stream of water has carved a path along the southern wall.  The stream enters from the east then exits out of the room through a hole in the floor.  You hear the flap of batwings around you. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
