R {36226}{0}{}{A small cavern. (s,e)}{ }{     You are in the northwestern corner of a small cavern.  The walls are completely black and seem to swallow all light emitted in the area. The floor is uneven and you have to watch your step to make sure you don't trip.  It appears the cataclysm that hit the crevice above also damaged this room. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36224}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
