R {36227}{0}{}{A small room. (e)}{P}{          You are in a small, somewhat cozy room.  As in the outside cavern, everything is pitch-black in here.  The room is very orderly with nothing out of place.  You notice there are no sources of light in the room.  A bed lies in the southeast corner of the room.  A fire pit is in the northeast corner and a few pots and pans sit near it.  A bubbly stream runs into the room through a hole in the southern wall, but after going through a sink-like contraption it quickly runs back out again through another hole.  A few books are carefully lined up on a shelf above the bed, though they look like they have not been used in ages.  The door out is to the east. }{A hidden crevice}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36225}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36228}{0}{}{-=( A dark cave )=- (u)}{ }{     You are standing in a deep cavern. Water drips slowly down the walls of the cave, fed by a small hole in the roof above you. A set of broken rocks have tumbled down the walls, allowing you to climb up through the hole, out of the cave. A small pool of water has gathered in one corner of the cave, filling the area with soft sounds. }{A forest trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
