R {36230}{0}{}{-=( A large cavern )=- (e)}{ }{    This cavern reeks of rotting meat and refuse. All around the walls of the cavern, bones have been thrown to form rough piles. A small pool of stagnant water has been trapped by some large rocks which form a rough dam against the east wall. }{A forest trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
