R {36234}{0}{}{-=( At the base of a tower )=- (s)}{T}{    The mountain path leads up to the base of a large, pearl white tower, stretching high into the clear sky. There are a few small bushes clustered around the base of the tower, giving the building a peaceful appearance. }{Tower of the moon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
