R {36235}{0}{}{-=( Inside the tower doors )=- (u,out)}{ }{     You are standing just inside the doors of the tower.  The doors are wide open, allowing you to see the mountains outside.  A wide set of stairs climb up the inside of the tower, ascending to a landing up above you.  A thick red carpet has been laid on the floor, contrasting against the plain gray walls. }{Tower of the moon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
