R {36238}{0}{}{-=( Half way up the tower )=- (d,u)}{ }{      This small landing marks the half way point up the tower. The walls here are slowly shifting from the pale gray stone of the lower levels to a lighter shade higher up the tower.  The floors are covered with the same thick red carpets found elsewhere in the tower.  There is a single window on the northern wall of the landing, and a wide staircase leading up and down. }{Tower of the moon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36236}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36239}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36239}{0}{}{-=( Near the top of the tower )=- (u,d)}{ }{     You are standing on the final landing of the tower.  A set of stairs winds up the inside wall, topped with a trapdoor that stands open, allowing you to see the open sky above the tower.  The carpets here are the same deep red as in the rest of the tower.  There is a large window set into the western wall of the landing. }{Tower of the moon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36238}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36240}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36240}{0}{}{-=( The roof of the tower )=- (d)}{C}{        You are standing on the roof of a large, gleaming white tower.  Overhead the sky is black, filled with twinkling stars and a large crescent moon. Thinking back to the bright sunlight from a moment ago you can only assume some magic is at work here.  The sides of the tower are surrounded with a short parapet, past which you can see all of Fantasy spread around you like a giant map.  In the center of the tower is a large crystalline coffin, glowing softly in the light of the moon.  A trapdoor in the floor allows access into the tower. }{Tower of the moon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
