R {36299}{0}{}{Tower (u)}{ }{    You find yourself in a dark tower room.  The air is very musty and filled with the scent of decay.  Water puddles around your ankles and ancient crates are barely visible in the darkness.  A single stairway spirals up to another level of the tower. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36300}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36300}{0}{}{Tower (d,u)}{A}{     Your footfalls echo loudly in this bare room.  A door to the outside is visible on the south wall, it is probably well concealed on the other side.  Scrap tattered fragments of an old carpet lie limp on the floor. A spiral staircase winds down to the lower level, and another leads up to another room. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36299}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
