R {36301}{0}{}{Tower (d,u)}{ }{    Long shadows fall ominously across the room from long windows letting in the harsh sunlight.  This room is more furnished than any of the others in the tower.  All the furniture looks old and quite faded though.  A spiraling stairwell winds down to the lower level and another goes up. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36300}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36302}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36302}{0}{}{Tower (d)}{J}{     Dust lays heavy in the air.  Bookshelves full of old crumbling books and several long tables covered with oddly shaped flasks, take up most of the space in this room except for a single bed in the corner.  Of particular notice is an old dried up corpse lying on the floor beside some weathered papers and broken glass.  A stairwell winds downward. }{Harfain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36301}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36303}{0}{}{Dimly lit cave (u,e,w,n,s)}{ }{     The walls of this cave are smooth and worn.  A torch mounted on the wall provides a glow that dimly lights the cave.  The floor has also been worn smooth.  You cannot see any specific tracks or footprints.  This area is an intersection, connecting four tunnels together.  In addition, a trapdoor in the ceiling leads back up to the hut. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
