R {36304}{0}{}{Dimly lit cave (w,e)}{ }{     This tunnel is much newer than the rest.  The walls have much fresher pick axe nicks in them.  The ground is littered with dust from recent mining.  Your ears can pick up the sounds of mining, deeper into this tunnel.  An occasional shouted curse tells you that this tunnel is very active and still under development. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36303}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
