R {36305}{0}{}{Dimly lit cave (sw,e)}{i}{    This smaller passageway leads right up to a massive stone door built into the southwest corner of the hall.  In the dim torch light, you can make out an intricate lock built right into the door.  The intersection of tunnels lies just to east. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36303}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36312}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36306}{0}{}{Dimly lit cave (e,s,n)}{ }{      Here the tunnel extends a passage to the east.  In that direction, you can hear the rowdy guffaws, hoots, and hollers of bandits.  From the dim glow cast by a torch on the wall, you can tell that the east tunnel seems to lead into a large cavern.  From the smooth, worn-over appearance of the floor, you tell that this area is frequently travelled. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
