R {36307}{0}{}{Dimly lit cave (s,n)}{ }{    Opening up wider from the intersection, this large tunnel gets wider as you move southward.  From what you can tell by the dismal illumination from the torch on the wall, the tunnel opens up into a much wider cavern. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36303}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36310}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36308}{0}{}{Newly mined cave (se,w)}{ }{     The new tunnel turns toward the southeast here, directly towards Wayhaven!  The smell of freshly dug earth and broken stone is very prevalent here.  From the light of a dim torch on the wall you can see that the mining being done here is very recent.  Farther down the tunnel you can clearly hear the sounds of active mining. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
