E {36309}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36309}{0}{}{Newly mined cave (nw)}{ }{   This part of the tunnel is still being worked on.  Large rocks and mounds of stone chips abound all over the area.  From what you can tell, this tunnel is headed directly under Wayhaven! }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36308}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36310}{0}{}{Bandit Meeting Hall (sw,n)}{ }{      Simple wooden benches form two rows that run the length of the hall.  The room is otherwise bare.  The front of the hall has a slightly raised platform so that the speaker may be seen in the back.  On one of the walls, you see 'Death to Muggers!' and 'Wayhaven will be ours!' scrawled in large letters.  To the southwest you see a light coming from a small room. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36307}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36311}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36311}{0}{}{Bandit Leader's Planning Room (ne)}{k}{      This small room looks as if a tornado hit it.  Papers, books, and parchments completely cover the table.  Indeed, they look as if they threaten its very stability.  The walls are almost completely covered with various maps.  Several chairs are around the table, but one in particular is rather large, looking more like a throne chair than a table one. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36310}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36312}{0}{}{Bandit Armory (ne)}{ }{    This small chamber is bare of any decorations.  Haphazardly thrown about the room are several weapons, pieces of armor, and any other equipment not currently being used by any of the bandits.  Most of the equipment is in some state of disrepair.  Some appear barely useable. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36305}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36313}{0}{}{Mess Hall (ne,w)}{ }{    This widened cavern hosts several large wooden tables strewn about.  Plates, cups, and dull utensils are scattered all over the room and tables.  Benches sit next to each table, some completely turned over and in disarray. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36306}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36315}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36314}{0}{}{Dimly lit cave (e,w,s,n)}{ }{     The cave here widens into a larger hallway.  An open doorway on each side of the hall leads into what appears to be large, spacious rooms.  You  cannot make out what is in the rooms from the dim glow cast by a torch mounted on the wall.  The smell of sweat and other bodily odors hangs heavily in the air here. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36306}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36317}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
