R {36315}{0}{}{Kitchen (sw,se)}{ }{     This cavern serves as the kitchen area.  A large bloodstained wooden table riddled with slash marks, is here.  A large chopping knife is stuck into the table.  Shelves and cupboards line the walls, stacked high and filled with boxes of supplies.  The smell of meat and salt permeate the area. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36313}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36316}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36316}{0}{}{Underground River (nw)}{ }{     This natural cavern houses a rushing and very cold river.  Several metal cages, chained to the riverbank, are immersed into the black waters.  The sounds of rushing water can be heard from both ends of the cavern. You can feel droplets of freezing water splash onto your skin. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36315}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36317}{0}{}{Bandit sleeping quarters (w)}{ }{     This area is packed with ratty, smelly cots and bunks.  They are covered with well-worn and torn blankets and pillows.  The smell of old body odor is stifling in here.  Several changes of clothing are laying around, all just as ratty and torn as the bedsheets.  Ominous stains lurk in the corners. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36314}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36318}{0}{}{Bandit sleeping quarters (e)}{ }{    The smell of bodily odors is stifling here.  Cots and bunks line the walls and fill the room to capacity.  Covered with ratty-looking blankets and pillows, and an almost equal amount of sweat and filth, the sleeping quarters here look squalid at best. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36314}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36319}{0}{}{Dimly lit cave (e,w,s,n)}{ }{     This area is the northern half of a large, wide cavern.  Another pair of open doorways set into the walls is here, each leading into more large, spacious rooms.  The dim light provided by the torch here casts deep, dark shadows into the rooms, blocking your view into them.  A heavy musk of bodily odors lurks throughout the hall. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36314}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36320}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
