E {36322}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36320}{0}{}{Bandit sleeping quarters (w)}{ }{       This room appears to be the dirtiest of them all!  Mold and grime coat the walls and floor.  Some of the beds look broken down, some have nests of vermin in them, and some look so filthy even the vermin are staying away.  Piles of old clothing litter the room, and the stench from the beds and these clothes creates a noxious gas that you can almost see.  The corners are so stained that they look to be building up layers of the nasty stuff. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36319}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36321}{0}{}{Bandit sleeping quarters (e)}{ }{     This room seems to be only slightly cleaner than the others.  The floor is swept and the beds are all made.  The blankets have fewer holes and a few actually appear washed.  The pillows are still lumpy and flat, and there are still odd bits of clothing laying around on the floor. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36319}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36322}{0}{}{Turn in the tunnel (s,e)}{ }{     This section of the tunnel turns toward the east.  In the dim light provided by a torch mounted in the wall you can make out a thick, wooden door with a rather large and complex lock on it.  From behind the door, you can detect air much nicer and fresher than the stale, foul air to the south. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
