R {36323}{0}{}{Bodyguard's Quarters (w,e)}{P}{      This area is amazingly tidy compared to the rest of the hideout. A large painting adorns one wall. A small desk sits in a corner. The bed is neatly made, with a chest at the foot of it. Books line a large wooden shelf, complete with matching bookends on top. A large rug lies in the center of the room. There is a wooden door leading west, and an iron door leading east. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36322}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36324}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36324}{0}{}{Bandit Leader's Quarters (w)}{s}{    A majestic bed is the centerpiece of this well-decorated room. A candelabra sits beside the bed, along with a nightstand with several books on it. A large bearskin rug lies across the entrance to the room. A dresser sits by one wall, complete with a mirror. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36323}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36325}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36325}{0}{}{Secret Room (s)}{I}{   This small, hidden room contains only one feature, a set of iron rings mounted directly into the stone floor.  Attached to them are chains, which themselves are attached to a large iron chest. }{Bandit Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36324}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36326}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {36327}{0}{}{A Dreamscape}{ }{        You have entered a grassy clearing in the copse of trees. Overhead, the sunlight breaks through the thick overhanging branches of the surrounding trees to illuminate your surroundings.  You estimate the clearing to be twelve feet in diameter, but you cannot determine how the grassy clearing held back the trees and thick vegetation which you passed through to get here.  An ancient tombstone lies before you, protruding through the grass as if it had grown from the ground.  You feel at ease here, as if the magic that preserves this place would prevent harm from coming to you. }{The Holy Shrine of Tarmatin}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30236}{wake up}{wake up}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {30236}{wake}{wake}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36328}{0}{}{Inside the odd cottage (out)}{D}{          The inside of the cottage is one room, although it is very large.  Hooks on the plastered clay walls hold many strange things, some of which look as though they have been hanging there for a very long time.  A large portion of the floor is taken up by a fairly deep well, which appears to be a fire pit.  A waist-high shelf crosses one entire wall, covered with an astounding hodgepodge of curious objects, including a large pile of scrolls that covers one entire end of the shelf.  A window looks out of the hut on the northern wall, letting you see the ground below.  Behind you, an opening covered with a large piece of heavy wool hides the ladder, which leads to the ground. }{Geloe's Cottage}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1516}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

