R {36334}{0}{<228>}{Forest (n,s,e)}{<228>( *<088>}{       You stand in an enchanted forest.  Hundreds of years of natural growth surround you, great trees rising in splendour as you walk beneath their massive branches.  From all around comes the sound of birds chirping. To the northeast, the forest opens into a small grassy clearing and you can hear the sound of running water off to the east. To the west, the  cliff face blocks your progress. In all other directions the forest continues. }{Woodsman's Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
