R {36335}{0}{<228>}{Forest (n,s,w)}{<228>( *<088>}{   You stand in a dark and shady forest, bordering a sheer rock wall. All  around you stand silent great trees, unimaginably ancient and encrusted with moss. You feel dwarfed by their presence. }{Woodsman's Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
