R {36336}{0}{<228>}{Forest (w,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{     You stand in a shady forest, surrounded by ancient trees. The cool forest air and shady boughs provide a comfortable journey as you  move unhindered between the massive trunks. To the west, you spot  a clearing of some sort. Cliff faces block passage to the north and east. }{Woodsman's Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
