R {36337}{0}{<228>}{A Woodland Clearing (n,e,s,w)}{<228>( *<088>}{      You stand in the middle of a small woodland clearing, girt by forest. Sunlight streams through this opening in the trees, as if relishing the opportunity to meet the ground. Patches of grass wave in the breeze, a stark contrast to the stout forms of the surrounding trees. To the  north stands a small hut, and to the south a small rock pool, partially hidden by foliage. The forest continues to the east and west. }{Woodsman's Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
