R {36338}{0}{<228>}{Forest (e,s)}{<228>( *<088>}{      You stand in a shady forest, surrounded on two sides by craggy cliffs. Far above, birds chirp in the trees, heedless of your presence as you walk between their forest homes. Here and there, vegetation impedes your progress, but the area is surprisingly free from other debris. To the east, you can barely make out a clearing of some sort, and  to the south the forest continues. }{Woodsman's Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36334}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
