R {36339}{0}{<238>}{A faint path in the forest (se,w)}{<238>. .<088>}{    In a narrow pathway between trees, the forest seems interminable in every direction. The dense trees part slightly to the west and southeast, revealing paths a child would find roomy. The ceaseless tune is quite loud here, and seems to be coming from everywhere. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23299}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36340}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36340}{0}{<238>}{A faint path in the forest (s,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{    The forest presses in impenetrably around this tiny clearing. To the northwest, the trees part slightly to reveal a narrow pathway between the trunks. To the south, an ancient root forms a sort of archway to another trail. A ceaseless tune echoes bewilderingly from every direction. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36339}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36341}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36341}{0}{<238>}{A faint path in the forest (nw,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{      In a narrow pathway between trees, the forest seems interminable in every direction save where the nearby hill juts up against the forest, pushing the trees back. To the north, the dense trees part slightly to reveal a path only a child could find roomy. A slab of rock from the face of the hill seems to form a natural cavern to the northwest. The ceaseless tune is quite loud here, and seems to be coming from beneath the rocky hill. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36340}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36342}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36342}{0}{<248>}{An alcove under a hillside (se)}{<248>% %<088>}{      A cavern has formed beneath the rocky outcropping of the hill, stone ceiling and hard-packed dirt floor converging some ten yards in. Little piles of rocks dot the ground in the back of the cave. To the southeast, the forest crowds up against the entrance to this natural tomb. The unearthly piping is at its loudest here, echoing off the stone to make a maddening din. }{Alagon's Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36341}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36343}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {36344}{0}{}{Underneath the coffin (u,n)}{ }{     You are in the tunnels underneath a large coffin.  As you look above you, you can see the hollowed coffin and a small staircase leading up to it.  It looks as though this tunnel was carved out of the ground a long time ago.  There is a stale smell as if the air down here has never been circulated.  The tunnel continues to the north. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30246}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36345}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36345}{0}{}{In an ancient tunnel (e,w,s)}{ }{      You are inside an ancient tunnel.  It looks as though someone or something carved this tunnel out with some clawed hands.  The walls are slightly concave and have what looks to be claw marks all over it. The ground has footprints all over it which indicates that someone has been roaming around down here.  The air is heavy and thick and carries a stale aroma.  The tunnel continues to the west, east, and south. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36344}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36346}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
