R {36346}{0}{}{In an ancient tunnel (w,n,s)}{ }{    The dirt lightly depresses as you walk around.  The walls have a slight concave appearance with many marks on them.  The floor is covered in footprints and the air is musty and thick.  The tunnel continues to the west, north, and south. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36345}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
