R {36347}{0}{}{In an ancient tunnel (e,n,w)}{ }{      You are at a crossroad in the ancient tunnel.  The walls look like they were carved out by hand and the floor is littered with footprints almost as though someone has been shuffling around aimlessly.  The ceiling hangs a little lower in this section and the ancient tunnel continues to the east and west, and the ground begins to slope downward toward the north. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
