R {36348}{0}{}{A dead end (s)}{ }{       The tunnel ends abruptly here and a single coffin lays on the floor all alone here.  Looking around, you can see that the walls are covered in thin claw marks.  It looks as though someone or something carved out these tunnels by hand.  The ground is soft here and your feet sink very slightly with each step into the dirt.  There is also some blood on the ground.  It looks like the only way out of here is back to the south. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36346}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36349}{0}{}{A dead end (n)}{ }{     You have reached a dead end in the tunnel.  The first thing you notice is the giant pile of dirt at the back end of this section of the tunnel.  The ceiling of this section is much higher to compensate for the giant mound of dirt.  There are footprints all over the ground here and the only way out seems to be back to the north. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36346}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36350}{0}{}{In an ancient tunnel (n,s)}{ }{    You are standing in an ancient tunnel which leads to the north and the south.  There is a slope to the ground and the ceiling running upward to the north and downward to the south.  Footprints cover the ground and there are claw marks all over the walls. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36347}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36352}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36351}{0}{}{A dead end (e)}{R}{    You have reached a dead end in the tunnel.  You can see many tree roots hanging down from the ceiling.  There is a wooden coffin on the ground along with many footprints.  The walls are covered in claw marks and the only way out seems to be to the east. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36347}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36352}{0}{}{In an ancient tunnel (e,s,w)}{ }{    You are at the bottom of a steep slope that leads southwards and uphill.  You can also see that the tunnel continues to both the east and the west.  There are footprints all along the ground as well as a puddle of fresh blood and the walls are covered in claw marks. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
