R {36353}{0}{}{In an ancient tunnel (e,n,w)}{ }{    You are deep in an ancient tunnel.  You can see a steel door to the north and fingernail marks all over the walls.  There are footprints on the ground and a trail of blood.  The tunnel continues to the east and west. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
