R {36354}{0}{}{A dead end (e)}{ }{     This is a dead end section of the tunnel.  There are claw marks all over the walls and footprints all over the ground.  Small pieces of dirt fall from the ceiling overhead.  There are five coffins laying on the ground here in a semi-circular pattern.  The only exit appears to be to the east. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36352}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36355}{0}{}{A dead end (w)}{ }{      You've reached another dead end to the tunnel.  The stench of dead bodies is overpowering.  A large pile of rotting corpses is in the eastern corner and there are footprints on the ground.  There is also a coffin made of jade laying on the ground next to a massive pool of blood.  The ceiling seems to be the only portion of this dead end that wasn't covered in blood.  The tunnel continues to the west. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36353}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36356}{0}{}{A large antechamber (s)}{ }{     You have entered a large antechamber.  The room was carved out so that the walls and ceiling are both curved creating a dome in here.  There are partial skeletons and bones hanging from the walls, ceiling, and lying around on the ground.  There is a trail of blood that leads from the center of the room underneath the door to the south. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
