R {36358}{0}{}{Under the altar room (u)}{ }{     You have entered into a chamber underneath the unholy altar above.  More footprints can be seen on the floor and there is a ladder made of bones that is propped against the southern wall underneath the antechamber above.  Other than the ladder, there does not seem to be any remains or blood down here, the room is bare. }{Larem Cemetery}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
