R {36381}{0}{}{A pitch black cavern (s,n)}{ }{      The previously damp air has suddenly become rather dense and humid. The moss continues to grow on the outer walls of the cavern, still leaving the inner walls completely clear of all growth.  Scurries of little feet can be heard echoing throughout the cavern.  The absolute darkness, combined with the immense humidity creates an incredibly uncomfortable environment. }{A Dark Cavern}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
