R {36382}{0}{}{A bend in the corridor (e,n)}{ }{     The dank air of the cavern has grown increasingly uncomfortable. Perspiration drips and rolls off your forehead in long streams as you proceed further through the immeasurable darkness.  The caked walls of the inner chamber begin to curve eastward, while the outer walls turn sharply, creating an increasingly narrowing passage. }{A Dark Cavern}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
