R {36392}{0}{}{The Alchemist's Garden (n,leave)}{ }{      This simple yet pleasant garden leads up to Zosimus the Alchemist's house.  The grass is closely cropped and the flower beds are well tended.  There are apple trees growing in the garden, laden with fruit.  Small birds sit in the branches.  The door to Zosimus's house stands open to your north.  The surrounding woods add to the quiet isolation you feel here. }{Alchemist's House}{alchemists_house}{}{}{1.000}{1}
