E {1624}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36393}{0}{}{Inside the house (s,e)}{ }{    This house is simply a large room with a curtain that partitions it into two halves.  The room is in some disarray which is a little surprising after the ordered neatness of the garden.  There is a rumpled bed, and shelves containing a vast array of scrolls and books. }{Alchemist's House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36392}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
