R {36398}{0}{}{Willothorn High Council Chambers (e,out)}{ }{     You are standing in a large open space. Aside from the large table in the center of the room, there isn't much else here. This must be a meeting place where the Shaman and village elders meet to discuss the goings on. On the north wall is a large fireplace that stretches to the ceiling. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
