R {36402}{0}{}{A Kitchen (s,w)}{ }{       This room is not overly impressive but it does contain several shelves as well as a working station. There is an oven in the far corner which is currently lit and the smell of fresh bread wafts from it, making your stomach groan. It appears that everything here is made fresh and made with care. Various tools and cooking instruments, all made by hand are laid out and ready to be used. The smell in here is so delicious that it's driving you mad. }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
