R {36406}{0}{}{Storage Room (e)}{ }{       This room is so full that you can barely fit in the room much less look around. It is packed to the ceiling with various items such as extra chairs, paintings, ceramic pots and various other trinkets. The room has a stagnant smell, almost as if the room hasn't been opened in 100 years. Dust is caked on everything but oddly enough there are no signs of any cobwebs or little critters anywhere in here. You wonder why no one ever comes in here? Is this a graveyard for stuff? }{The Lost Village of Willothorn}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
