R {36481}{0}{<248>}{-=( A small cave )=- (ne)}{H}{      This small cave is lined with shelves, each one covered in strange bottles and flasks. A large black cauldron bubbles in the center of the cave, directly under a narrow air hole in the roof. Against the western wall a set of reeds and straw have been piled to form a crude sleeping pallet. The cave opens out into the forest to the northeast.  A single empty flask sits next to the cauldron. }{Isle of Vilanthia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36480}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36482}{0}{}{Underwater (d)}{ }{     The water around you is beautiful and full of life. Fish swim around lazily, the light from the surface illuminating their myriad of colors. Twenty feet below you the sea bottom is a rich tapestry of aquatic plant and animal life. It now appears that the dark shape is actually a ship on the bottom, leaning to one side. }{Stormbringer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36483}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36421}{surface}{surface}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36483}{0}{}{Stormbringer's main deck (u,below)}{ }{       About a dozen feet above the seabed is the ship's main deck. The deck is constructed out of thick wooden planks, and the two wooden masts are as big around as tree trunks. Towards the stern are the remains of what was the bridge house, and both the port and starboard railings show signs of destruction and battle. Miraculously, the figurehead survived the ship's struggle intact. A hatchway amidships provides the only passage to the rest of the ship below. }{Stormbringer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36482}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36484}{below}{below}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36484}{0}{}{A hallway amidships (fore,stairs,aft)}{ }{     The narrow hallway is constructed of wood paneling both on the starboard and port sides. At each end of the hall is a room closed off by a wooden door. A rope ladder leads to the hold through an opening in the floorboards, while a small staircase allows access to the main deck above. }{Stormbringer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36485}{fore}{fore}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36487}{aft}{aft}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
