R {36485}{0}{}{The Captain's Cabin (out)}{C}{     The Captain's cabin is filled with as much luxury as is possible on board a ship. The bed against the wall is fitted with smooth satin sheets. Along the wall above the bed is a shelf for important items. An ornate table in the middle of the room serves as both a desk and a dinner table.  }{Stormbringer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36484}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36486}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {36487}{0}{}{The Firstmate's Cabin (out)}{ }{     The firstmate's cabin is small, yet functional. On one side of the room is a small bed with a chest of drawers at its foot. Against the wall on the other side of the room is a chair and desk, above which an oil lamp is hung. Several colorful paintings and an exotic rug attempt to make the otherwise drab cabin habitable. }{Stormbringer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36484}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36488}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {36489}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {36490}{0}{}{Ship's Hold (fore)}{ }{     Stormbringer's hold is large, accounting for more than half of the ship's volume. Wooden crates and barrels lie strewn about, many of them broken open. Piled in a heap in one corner lies some equipment. Along one side of the hold a white rope ladder leans against the dark wood, leading to the deck above. }{Stormbringer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36491}{fore}{fore}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36484}{climb ladder}{climb ladder}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36484}{climb rope}{climb rope}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36491}{0}{}{Crew Quarters (aft)}{ }{       The general sailor's quarters is basically an extension of the hold, separated from the cargo by a canvas wall with a flap cut to serve as a makeshift door. Attached to the wooden walls are hammocks, stacked like bunk beds to maximize space. Pushed up against the walls on the floor are strongboxes containing each sailor's personal belongings. The center of the room is dominated by a large table which serves as the mess and rest area. }{Stormbringer}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36490}{aft}{aft}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36492}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {36493}{0}{<278>}{The Toy Room (w)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{      The Toy Room You enter a very large room, one of the largest in the house.  There are so many toys on the floor here for the baby gnome.  Mendy spends her days in here playing with toys for countless hours.  The room has a window on the east wall and the rest is toys.  The floor is covered with carpet to keep the baby from getting cold. }{Gnome House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23400}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36494}{0}{<278>}{The Grand Hallway (e,s,n,w)}{S}{     The Grand Hallway The hallway continues through the house.  The red carpet continues to line the path into the kitchen as well as leads off to the rooms east and west.  There are torches that line the walls.  In the corner of the room you notice a very large safe. }{Gnome House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23400}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
