R {36495}{0}{<278>}{First Half's Bedroom (e)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{         First Half's Bedroom As you enter First Half's room you notice a few things are out of place.  The floor is a mess covered in his clothes, nothing is in its place and stuff is strewn about the room.  Finally there are a few things that hang from the rack on the wall.  He has a few torches in here that he lights at night to keep it light but aside from that its pretty basic.  In the corner there is a small bed. Next to the bed stands a beat up oak dresser.  There is a small closet on the north wall. }{Gnome House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {23400}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36496}{0}{<278>}{Peg's Bedroom (w)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{      Peg's Bedroom As you enter the room you notice how neat and clean Peg keeps her room.  The walls have a large rack with a lot of female things hanging from it.  She has a large dresser that sits on the east wall.  There is a large bed in the corner of the room that has a large canopy on it. }{Gnome House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36494}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36497}{0}{}{The Gnomes Kitchen (s)}{ }{     The Gnomes Kitchen You stand before a massive steel stove.  This is among the biggest stoves you have seen in the realms.  There are large wooden shelves and cupboards that line the walls.  Above the sink is a clock that helps them keep their time. }{Gnome House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36494}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36498}{0}{<278>}{The Master Bedroom (e)}{<278>[ ]<088>}{       The Master Bedroom As you enter this bedroom you can tell that it's by far the biggest of the rooms.  There is a large bed next to the wall with a headboard that has some carvings on it.  There is a large dresser with a mirror that is part of the dresser.  There are golden torches in here that burn only when the great people of the house show the room or it's dark. }{Gnome House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36494}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36499}{0}{}{Above the Lair of the Black Dragon (d)}{ }{     You stand atop a rocky outcropping. You can see the world from here, it is a glorious sight. The vast horizon of the Kingdoms spreads out before you. A few small shrubs grow between the surrounding loose rocks. You can see the opening you came up through. }{Dragon Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {18135}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36500}{0}{}{A tent (exit)}{ }{    This is the interior of a large white tent.  Fur rugs made from various animals cover the floor.  A small map of the forest has been attached to one of the walls.  A small folding desk with chair is in one corner while a pile of blankets is in another.   }{Stormrock Castle: Dark Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
