R {36502}{0}{}{Under a lake}{ }{    Tall grass stretches off in every direction you can see, with very little wind to speak of.  A hot, summer sun bears down on the plains causing most creatures to seek shade.  Some animals can be seen grazing on the abundant grasses off in the distance. }{The Barbarian Plains}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
