R {36504}{0}{}{Ledge in the passageway (out)}{ }{       Sticking out from the rock face to the left, a small ledge hangs slightly over the rushing stream below.  It is only a few feet long and a few feet wide, but it seems to be enough space to safely stand on.  The stream continues northwest for a short distance before suddenly dropping over the edge and into a waterfall.  The opening created by the passageway between the cliffs and the east mountain results in an awe inspiring view of the valleys and mountains beyond. }{Clear Falls Valley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
