R {36510}{0}{<148>}{In a pond (s,w)}{<148>^ ~<088>}{     You've swum out to the middle of the pond.  Surrounded by the crystal clear refreshing water, you can feel some tension seep from your body. Swimming south will take you to the island and west will take you back to the village.  A few fish swim around you trying to decide if you're food or a toy to be played with. }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36511}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {24086}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36511}{0}{<268>}{Island (swim)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{         Climbing out of the water, you are on a small island out in the middle of the pond.  It's really nothing more than a small bog, solid enough to stand on but you wouldn't want to try to build anything on it.  The extra weight would surely sink like a brick to the bottom of the pond. There are a few cattails and other water plants you would expect to find out on a bog but nothing that would bring words like 'amazing' or 'wow' to your lips.  It appears as if a blue heron or some other large bird has built itself a nest out here on the island.  You should try not to disturb it since the heron took the time to build it. }{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36510}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36510}{swim}{swim}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

