R {36514}{0}{}{Tree House}{ }{Way up here twelve hands off the ground you can look out over the whole playground.  The scenery is breathtaking, as well it should be, especially if you were between the ages of four and thirteen.  The tree house is made from a good heavy maple and should last a few more years with no problems.  There is a trap door in the floor which you came up through and a waist-high railing running along the western side of the three sided house.}{Troll Hunter's village}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24083}{climb ladder}{climb ladder}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36515}{0}{}{The Loft}{ }{Having managed to climb that weak ladder you find yourself in what seems to be a child's room, although it looks as if it has not heard the joys of a child's laughter in a very long time.  There is a small bed in the corner with a chest at the end of it, you feel a sudden sadness at how well the room has been kept. }{Troll Hunter's Cabin}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24069}{climb ladder}{climb ladder}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36516}{0}{<248>}{Upper cave (u)}{L}{      The shadows retreat into dark hidden corners when the sudden light illuminates what seems like an ancient cave. The walls reflect the light hitting the black polished surface, almost like glass. The air is thick and hard to breathe although a fresh flow of air seeps in from above. Rusty armours, weapons and white bones lie scattered all over.  A large stone table stands in the middle of the room.  A torn diary lies on the ground. }{Balur's Cave}{balurs_cave}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {8937}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36517}{d}{move lever; d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36517}{0}{<248>}{Lower cave (u)}{<248>% %<088>}{    The walls of this cave glow by some unexplicable power, almost as if they were charged by the sun. The air here is very thick and hard to breathe. There are some bones lying in one of the corners of the cave. A set of stairs lead up. }{Balur's Cave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36516}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

