R {36585}{0}{}{Icy Beach (dive,nw,sw,n)}{ }{        =< Icy Beach >= In direct contrast to the rest of the surroundings, the ground here is quite flat.  Trails of waddled footprints lead up a small slope to the northwest, towards a small rookery of penguins.  To the southwest, a small group of seals curiously watch you, as they bask in the afternoon sun.  A feeling of serenity fills your mind as you peer out over the cove, and listen to the sounds of the waves gently break against the icy beach. }{Winter Wonderland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
