R {36586}{0}{}{Frozen Peak (s,w,enter)}{ }{        =< Frozen Peak >= As you carefully adventure across the frozen peak, the setting sun casts a spectacular mauve-colored hue over the snow covered landscape.  Tiny ice crystals brilliantly sparkle, as rays of sun shine refract off them, creating a kaleidoscope effect.  Directly in front of you, a small niche has been dug out of the side of the frozen peak.  The inhabitants of the area appear to use it as a shelter to escape the piercing winter winds.  To the southeast, a small ledge extends from the side of the glacier. }{Winter Wonderland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
