R {36591}{0}{}{A Dark Niche (out)}{ }{       =< Dark Niche >= Stepping out of the open air, this small niche suddenly seems quite cramped and dark.  It measures only sixty inches from floor to ceiling, and the walls are no more than four arm spans across.  Small flipper tracks are all about, and the smell of rotten fish assaults your senses. You would appear to have stumbled across the eating and sleeping locale of several penguins and seals. }{Winter Wonderland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
