R {36592}{0}{}{Peaceful Cove (swim,out)}{ }{         =< Peaceful Cove >= Your limbs begin to stiffen as you dive into the icy water.  Unfortunately, your body was not designed as well for these icy conditions as the local marine life.  You may want to leave here soon, before your blood begins to freeze.  The water leading out of the cove spans as far as the eye can see.  In the distance, a geyser of spray looms into the air followed by a large Blue Whale.  Its enormous tail breaching and flapping with a resounding splash, and then vanishes once again beneath the icy waves. }{Winter Wonderland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
