R {36593}{0}{}{Jagged Rocks (ne)}{ }{      =< Jagged Rocks >= Ice and snow are everywhere.  Jagged rocks, shattered by perpetual frost, are imbedded in the frozen ground.  Except for a few tufts of Tussock grass, there is little to no trace of vegetation.  The animal life here must obviously sustain themselves entirely by means of the nearby inlet. }{Winter Wonderland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
