R {36594}{0}{}{Tranquil Inlet (swim)}{ }{     =< Tranquil Inlet >= Swimming further out into the tranquil inlet, you come across the habitat of the mighty Blue Whale.  The water is crystal clear and extremely cold.  Beneath the surface, hundreds of different species of marine life co-exist in this frigid environment. }{Winter Wonderland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
