R {36600}{0}{}{Secret Ice Cavern (hole)}{ }{        =< Secret Ice Cavern >= This natural ice cavern was created from thousands of years of melted ice and rain seeping through the cracks of the mountain's porous limestone, and freezing into an array of wonderous ice sculptures.  High above your head, long and dangerously-sharp stalactites reach for you.  Winks and gleams from your light source cast an elaborate display of shadows across the maze of stalagmites.  At the far end of the immense cavern, stands a large ice portal. }{Winter Wonderland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
