R {36605}{0}{}{Desert (climb,e,s,w,n)}{ }{     The sun hanging over the wasted landscape beats down on your head like a hammer, driving thought and logic away from your mind. To the south, you can see stone walls that rise only a couple of paces above the sand between you and them, while in all other directions, the desert stretches seemingly without end. }{Desert Palace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
