R {36617}{0}{}{Trophea's Peak (leave)}{ }{             The desolate rocky base of Trophea's Peak thrusts itself out of the surrounding plainlands.  Little grows at the base of the mountain but further up magnificent trees can be seen proudly offering their blossoms up in honor of the gods.  There is an eerie quiet as if even the birds and insects have taken an oath of silence or perhaps have been dumbstruck.  Occasionally the entire mountain quakes and trembles as the inhabitants atop go about their godly business.  The sun hangs low in comparison to Trophea's Peak as the very summit transcends even the clouds.  A treacherous path up the mountain exists but seems at times to disappear, forcing any would-be climber to scale the mountain with hands and feet alone.  Those who wish to attempt the climb may 'ascend'.  There are also 4 statues here that can be examined for more information on the immortal forms. }{The Ascended Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
