E {36611}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36618}{0}{<268>}{The palace gates (s,n,w)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{    The tall gates block some of the sunlight, making it quite comfortable and cool here. For the moment, nothing seems better than just standing in the shadow. To the west, a small doorway leads to a room set into the wall. To the south is the way into the hold. }{Desert Palace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
