R {36619}{0}{<268>}{The courtyard (e,w,n,s)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{       High walls made of white stones surround the courtyard on all sides, giving it enough shade that it is comfortably cool here, especially compared to the blazing heat of the desert. To the north is the passage back to the  burning sands. To the south is a strongly-built building with large stone  doors while to the east you see a short building with a large opening. From  the doorway to the west, you smell what must be the evening's meal being  prepared. }{Desert Palace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
