R {36624}{0}{<268>}{The Throne Room (n)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{       You can hardly believe all the luxury in the middle of the desert. The  floor is covered with one huge piece of carpet woven with intricate  patterns. Large tapestries cover most of the east and west walls. In front of the southern wall, a dais is elevated a few inches above the  ground. On top of it, is a large golden throne. Cool winds constantly  blow into the room, making you almost forget about the desert outside. A large golden throne. }{Desert Palace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
