R {36761}{0}{}{-=( At the base of the stairs )=- (n,u)}{ }{     You are standing at the base of a large set of winding stairs that reach up through the chambers ceiling to the level beyond. A strange light filters down past the stairs, giving this chamber a strange and unsettling glow. There is a large iron doorway to the north, its surface covered in runes and symbols of power. }{Necromancer's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36763}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36762}{n}{open door; n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36762}{0}{}{-=( A large foyer )=- (n,s)}{ }{     This large room has been carved out of the solid rock. The walls are covered in expensive tapestries from over the realms, and the floor is covered in a thick red carpet. A small archway leads out of this chamber to the north, and there is a large iron doorway to the south, its surface covered in runes and symbols of power. }{Necromancer's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36761}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36764}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36765}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36763}{0}{}{-=( Shimmering chamber )=- (e,d,w,s,n)}{11}{    The walls of this room shimmer brightly, as if an intense light exists inside them. A small set of stairs wind down through the floor, twisting in a tight arc. Four portals lead out of the room in the cardinal directions. }{Necromancer's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36760}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
