E {36761}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36764}{0}{}{-=( Lijak's lair )=- (s,se)}{ }{       Waves of terror seem to pulse from the walls of this dark and gothic chamber. Black velvet drapes cover most of the walls, making the room appear much smaller than it really is. In the center of the room is a large wooden podium, surrounded by a thick walled pentagram. A set of shelves have been carved into the natural rock of the walls, and are filled with several thick black leather bound tomes. There is a single archway leading southeast, and a iron bound door to the south. }{Necromancer's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36762}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36765}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36765}{0}{}{-=( An antechamber )=- (nw,w)}{ }{    This dark antechamber serves as a guard post for the dark necromancer. There is a wide portal to the northwest, and another smaller portal to the west. The floor here is dark with spilled blood, mostly dried and brown, but there are a few fresher pools, crimson and warm. }{Necromancer's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36762}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36764}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36766}{0}{}{Jackalman Den (n,u)}{ }{      You have descended into a low tunnel in the sand, snaking beneath the boulders and rocks of the hill.  The passage is lit dimly from sunlight that filters down through the rocks overhead.  You can make out bones, trash, and dung covering the sandy floor in disgusting piles.  It smells awful.  A shaft of light here shines from a gap overhead. }{Rocky Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {36767}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14038}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36767}{0}{}{Jackalman Den (ne,s)}{ }{      The tunnel curves here beneath the hill.  Sunlight streaming through gaps in the boulders overhead illuminate old bloodstains and new trash littering the sand.  The sand walls of the tunnel look really unstable\; you're afraid to step too hard for fear of collapsing the whole thing.  You can hear grunting and growling echoing through the tunnels. }{Rocky Hill}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
