R {36815}{0}{}{\*\x7B In the River \x7D* (surface)}{ }{      \*\x7B In the River \x7D* You are submerged in the swiftly flowing river.  Some magic here controls the river, and the current does not seem to be affecting you. You get the strong feeling, however, that attempting to move upstream or downstream would be a bad idea.  A small opening in the bedrock of the river beckons to you. }{Naiad Lair}{naiad_lair}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {9009}{surface}{surface}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {36819}{enter opening}{enter opening}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {36816}{0}{<248>}{Lake Cavern (out)}{<248>% %<088>}{     You stand upon a narrow spit of land in the corner of a large underwater cavern.  Waves lap softly against the sandy bar with a staccato rhythm. Debris, mostly organic and in various stages of decay, is strewn across the ground. The walls of the cavern have an oily sheen and the water has a thin, filmy layer of algae. }{Unicorns}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24453}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

