R {36819}{0}{}{\*\x7B An Underwater Grotto \x7D* (e,out)}{ }{     \*\x7B An Underwater Grotto \x7D* You are floating in a small, water-filled cavern under the river.  Tiny, fluorescing spots are scattered along the rock walls, providing a soft, soothing light.  The cave feels peaceful, and your tension melts away under its influence. }{Naiad Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
