R {37049}{0}{}{A lair (leave)}{ }{         You stand in a fairly large cavern.  Walls rise up on all sides to eventually form a domed ceiling.  The walls are covered in rows and rows of shelves.  The shelves on the east side of the room are covered in various vials and beakers of all kinds.  The shelves on the western side are covered in books of all kinds.  About the room small candles are burning providing the room with a light glow.  A pile of animal furs rests in the corner of the room next to a crude looking desk.  In the middle of the floor a circle, with a star in the middle, is engraved.  Krat     Reboot: 5.2 days [00:00:02]  Controller: None  }{Demon Summoners}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1776}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

