R {37053}{0}{}{Hole}{ }{You have climbed down into an extremely smelly cave of some kind, with feces laying about the floor.  A small pile of animal skins are heaped in the corner, making it appear as if someone might just be using this place as a home.  A few clay pots and plates can be seen atop a roughly made rack to the left, and a rickety stool sits near the far right wall.  The hole you climbed in through appears as if it could be easily reached.}{Guiles Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1679}{climb up}{climb up}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37054}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {1739}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37055}{0}{}{Altar (s)}{ }{         Scattered around the room are bones of long forgotten beasts and humans.  The walls are streaked with flecks of bone, brain matter, and other assorted gore.  There is an altar in the center of the room that still has blood rolling off it from whatever last victim was just sacrificed there.  A large crimson flag adorned with a strange symbol hangs behind the altar on a brass pole.  The floor is a maze of horror with every nasty human and non-human body part flung haphazardly around.  Whoever accepts this place as a suitable house of worship must be insane or worships one messed up god, that's for sure. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {1739}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37056}{0}{}{Guards room (s,e)}{ }{     The walls of this room are made from slat, gathered from old maple logs that had become useless to Guile.  No pictures or any other kind of art has been allowed to be placed in this room.  There is a small square table aligned along the northern wall but no chairs to sit on, forcing the guards to remain standing while on duty. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37058}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1733}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37057}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {1722}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37058}{0}{}{Master bedroom (w)}{ }{          With walls pained a soft shade of rose, this room has got to have the most calming effect you have ever felt, radiating its warmth right to your heart.  You can see candles carefully placed on almost every surface that can safely handle the flames.  There is a four post canopy bed with a white lace bedspread and skirting.  The dresser along the west wall stretches clear from wall to wall, suggesting it had to have been built in the room because there is no way someone carried it up here.  You can also see a nightstand beside the bed that boasts an elegant pink doily, which has a jar of some kind of clear liquid sitting on it.  }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37056}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37059}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {37060}{0}{}{Septic Tank}{ }{     The road ends at a large portal here in the forest.  The portal itself is large and circular, with sprays of color shooting across it, and strange, mystical energy flickering within.  A road into Pinnacle lies to the east, while you can vaguely make out the outlines of a mysterious tower to the west. }{Guiles Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
