R {37100}{0}{}{A tropical subterranean lair (leave,enter)}{ }{      This dark cave has the musty, damp odour reminiscent of a greenhouse.  The scent of plant life mingles with the peaty aroma of rich, fertile soil and moist rock.  The temperature and humidity is almost uncomfortable and you find yourself already longing for a cool breeze. Signs of plant life increase deeper inside the cavern, which seems unusual as there's considerably less sunlight in there. }{Lair of the Matriarch}{lair_of_matriarch}{}{}{1.000}{1}
