R {37102}{0}{}{A tropical subterranean lair (leave)}{ }{          This is unlike any cavern you have ever seen before.  Countless exotic plants line the walls and carpet the damp, muddy floor of this sinister paradise.  With precious little sunlight penetrating the confines of this grotto, it's unclear how such varied specimens of flora could possibly survive.  Clearly, they've survived indeed, their very existence seemingly unnatural.  Orchids, vines, venus flytraps, pitcher plants, belladonna and cobra lilies abound.  Perhaps most odd, these species do not appear to be living together in harmony, instead they struggle and violently compete with each other for every available resource. }{Lair of the Matriarch}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
