R {37121}{0}{<238>}{(C) A Devastated Hostelry (C) (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{       (C) A Devastated Hostelry (C) You stand between the battered stone walls of what was once a mighty inn. There is no roof - the area is open to the ravages of the weather. All around you lies shattered stone and splintered wood. In the corner of what was once the main room, huddled in the dubious shelter of the conjunction of the two strongest remaining walls, stands a large oaken table. }{Dreamville}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37120}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37122}{0}{<238>}{(C) A Devastated Shop (C) (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        (C) A Devastated Shop (C) You stand in what remains of a general store.  There is no roof and as such the area is open to whatever the Gods of the weather may decide to throw at it.  All around you lies shattered stone and the remnants of the stock once carried by the shop. Around the insides of the walls lies a quantity of splintered wood, presumably left by the destruction of the shop's shelving.  The only recognisable structure is a long wooden counter, across the back of the store. }{Dreamville}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37120}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

