R {37137}{0}{}{(C) At the Northern edge of Dreamville (C) (enter,s)}{ }{          (C) At the Northern edge of Dreamville (C) All around you, marshland gently bubbles. You can hear ominous bubbling noises from the swampland.  You stand at the Northern end of the main thoroughfare of the village of Dreamville. This place really is a paradox. Aside from the devastation and destruction, it can't have ever amounted to much anyway - and yet the buildings there are must have been magnificent. They're made of the finest raw materials, such as the opulent mansion to the North, and must have cost immense amounts to construct. Someone certainly had a real pride in this place, despite its terrible location. }{Dreamville}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
