R {37142}{0}{<268>}{(C) Within the Ruined Palace (C) (w)}{T}{       (C) Within the Ruined Palace (C) You stand within a shimmering vista of white marble.  The marble is not, however, intact - most of it is shattered and spread across the floor.  Amid the rubble, you see occasional smashed treasures. To the East end of the palace is a raised dais, such as would be used for a throne - however you can see no such item. Perhaps it was destroyed in the devastation. }{Dreamville}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37133}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
