R {37151}{0}{}{(C) The Swamp Master's Throne Room (C) (n)}{ }{       (C) The Swamp Master's Throne Room (C) You stand in what must have once been either a dungeon or a wine cellar. It has recently been converted into the Swamp Master's centre of operations.  The throne that was missing from the dais in the palace has been moved here, and piled around it are the spoils looted from the palace above. In the corner of the room, a huge fire blazes. The Swamp Master is here, sprawled languidly on the floor. }{Dreamville}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
