R {37158}{0}{}{A platform. (w)}{ }{     You are standing on the east edge of a platform. The green acid below you bubbles violently and the gases seep up creating a vile odor that singes the insides of your nostrils. You look around for miles at the wonderful view of the land around you, but you still cannot see above the four boulders that are towards the north. }{Harpy Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
