R {37162}{0}{}{Harpy Challenge Area (out)}{ }{     You are standing in the center of a big white painted circle. The ground beneath you is solid rock and the dust invades your lungs in an unearthly way. There are four large boulders around the circle. The air smells of death and smoke. There is a sign on one of the boulders. Maybe you should take a look. }{Harpy Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
