R {37164}{0}{}{The entrance to a woodland glade (leave,ne)}{E}{        The darkness of the eastern forest has given way to a quiet glade of pure natural beauty.  The floor is a luxurious carpet of grass and moss that sinks beneath your feet.  The glade has clearly seen very little traffic as there is no path to guide you, only an absence of dense foliage that allows passage through the wood.  A myriad of flowers bloom amongst the grasses and trees surrounding you while insects and birds buzz and sing in the sky above.  A tiny gap in the trees will allow you to return to the wider world. }{Faerie Glade}{faerie_glade}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37166}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {4932}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

