R {37166}{0}{}{A woodland glade (nw,ne,sw)}{ }{      The glade opens up here before a magnificent alder.  Where the other trees of the forest grow crowded together, this specimen has its own clearing to stretch and grow.  Flowers and fungi grow happily among its roots, enjoying the nutrient rich forest floor of this protected glade.  The thick foliage of the forest will only allow you passage in a few directions. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37164}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37167}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37168}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37167}{0}{}{A woodland glade (ne,se)}{ }{       The glade descends here into a shallow valley before the hill that rises to the northeast.  Trees line this shallow groove in the land creating a naturally protected copse that soaks up sunlight, leaving you gently warmed and content.  In the center of the copse, basking in the warm rays, lies a young hawthorn tree.  It lies nestled in a patch of heather that provides even more security for the still growing bush. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37166}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37169}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37168}{0}{}{A clearing in the glade (se,sw)}{ }{       The sunlight streams into this clearing and dances upon the dew covered flowers and grasses that grow abundantly with the absence of tree cover above.  Situated in the middle of the glade, it appears that this clearing would make an excellent meeting point for its inhabitants.  To that end it has a small circle of stones of variable size in the center that might serve as seats for such an occasion.  In the middle of said circle lies a round patch of dirt. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37166}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37172}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37169}{0}{}{A woodland glade (e,sw)}{ }{      The land rises here and forms a small hill that continues to the east. Strange lights twinkle in the dense forest that surrounds you.  They seem to bob and weave erratically flashing in and out of sight as they pass behind trees and plants.  These strange visions only add to the strong sensation of enchantment that envelops you as you scale the shallow slope leading up the hill. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37167}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37170}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37170}{0}{}{A woodland glade (n,w)}{ }{       The hill has begun to level out here, only rising slightly to the north where a majestic ash flourishes at the height of the wood.  A hazel tree rests here on the side of the hill where it receives abundant moisture but also excellent drainage.  The eerie lights continue to twinkle in the dense foliage that closes in from all sides.  The juxtaposition of trepidation and quiescence only increases as you ascend the hill. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37169}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37171}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37171}{0}{}{In the shade of an ash tree (s)}{ }{       Atop this small hill in the glade lies a tree unlike any other you have seen before.  This noble ash surveys its realm with an imperious gaze and serves as the guardian of the glade.  The top of the hill has only sparse vegetation due to the dense mass of roots sent out horizontally but barely below the surface of the soil.  The top of the tree isn't visible from this point due to thick leaf coverage and you can only speculate what is up there. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37170}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
