R {37172}{0}{}{A woodland glade (e,nw,s)}{ }{       The trees in this region of the glade grow particularly close together.  You have to push your way past branches and bushes that hinder your progress and pull at your limbs and garments.  Because of the extensive tree cover there are fewer flowering plants in this part of the wood, but that makes it no less beautiful.  Ferns adorn the floor while thick mosses and ivy climb and interweave themselves upon the trees. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37168}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37173}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37174}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37173}{0}{}{A woodland glade (ne,w)}{ }{       The trees in this part of the glade are densely populated, forcing you to slow your pace as you pick through the branches and stumble somewhat as you move through the underbrush.  The thick leaf cover overhead makes for few flowers on the forest floor due to the absence of sunlight.  In this slightly darker atmosphere ferns, mosses and ivy have flourished.  While it may be peaceful and calm in this region, you might wish to push on. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37172}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37175}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37174}{0}{}{A woodland glade (n)}{ }{       The glade merges here with a rather gloomy thicket.  It seems darker of a sudden as if all the light and gaiety of the wood before had just been a memory or a dream.  The underbrush and plants grow extremely dense in this area as if they were in intense competition with each other.  Out of the underbrush in the center of the copse stands an ancient weeping willow tree that seems to gaze down upon you with disdain and disregard. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37172}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37175}{0}{}{A woodland glade (sw)}{ }{       The dense growth of the forest has thinned here into a small copse surrounding a holly tree.  Small animals dash through the thick grass and birdsong drifts on the breeze.  Like the holly itself, the atmosphere seems whimsical, but with the ever present sense of insecurity and risk.  In the middle of a large clump of grass lies an old stump that looks like it has been worn away by the persistent patter of tiny feet. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37173}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37176}{0}{}{In the branches of an ash tree (d)}{ }{       Nestled amongst the branches and leaves of the noble ash lies an alcove in which the branches have parted, creating a natural chamber amidst the foliage.  One stout branch remains and contains a deep organic groove that serves as a seat or more specifically, a throne.  Flowers bloom in the ancient boughs that surround you.  Their corollas consist of four white petals while the tree's foliage hangs down from the elegant branches like the dank green locks of some river naiad. }{Faerie Glade}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37171}{down}{down}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37171}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

