E {37179}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37179}{0}{}{Air Pocket (d)}{A}{       After swimming and crawling your way through a maze of underwater rock, you emerge gasping into the surprisingly fresh air of a dry alcove which seems to lie beyond the rockfall. It appears that someone was here before you. The remains of a fire have been laid in the middle of the space with a neat ring of stones surrounding it. Beside the fire some ancient runic writing has been scrawled in charcoal on the bare floor with an arrow pointing to a flat stone.  }{The Green Lion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37178}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
