R {37220}{0}{}{A small shaft (climb,out)}{ }{    You stand at the bottom of a small shaft.  It is approximately eight feet in diameter and only about twelve feet high before it opens into a larger chamber above.  Small holes appear in the inner wall of the shaft, perhaps handholds to climb up and down. }{Tower of Frost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
