R {37221}{0}{}{A casting chamber (d)}{ }{       A large room which takes up the entire top floor of this tower  of ice.  A long table rests against one wall, cluttered with vials  and bottles.  A book shelf rests near one corner, its contents  spilling all over.  A circle is inscribed into the stone floor in  chalk, half wiped away by someone walking over it.  A chill breeze whistles through the room as the gale outside blows across the  hole in the ceiling. }{Tower of Frost}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
