R {37224}{0}{}{Top of a Glacier (d)}{ }{         Top of a Glacier. An expanse of ice stretches out before you, an icy plain filling the mountain valley. Perhaps you would have anticipated it to be smooth and even but this is far from the case. The movement of the glacier has broken and ruptured the ice surface, thrusting towers of ice high into the air, and splitting the glacier with great crevasses. Unfortunately, progress from here is nearly impossible as a huge crevasse opens before you and it looks like you will have to return down the ice chute which brought you here. }{Seahaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
