R {37231}{0}{<238>}{A large stone shack (e,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        In this northwestern corner of the shack, the smell of the black river is almost overpowering.  A wooden door in the north wall bangs in the wind, providing access to an old jetty that reaches out over the watercourse.  An animal hide has been stretched across the west wall, but whether it provides insulation or ornamentation remains a mystery. The ground is even muddier here due to the proximity to the river, and your feet make a squelching noise as you extract them from the grime to take each step. }{Troll Alliance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
