R {37232}{0}{<238>}{A large stone shack (e,w,n)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{      The shack is even more decrepit here than elsewhere.  A large hole has been knocked through the south wall, allowing the fetid swamp air to slither into the hut and assail your senses.  The muddy ground is interrupted only by the stump of an old black willow tree that appears to have often served as a resting place for the inhabitants of the shack. }{Troll Alliance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37229}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
