R {37233}{0}{<238>}{A large stone shack (s,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{      This corner of the shack is quieter than elsewhere, increasing your slight sense of unease.  The eeriness of the silence is compounded by the skeleton of a human adventurer that has been nailed to the north wall.  The old bones are flanked by a pair of lists written in almost unintelligible scrawl and heavily edited.  Mud oozes along the ground from the west where the earth appears to be even wetter. }{Troll Alliance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37229}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37231}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37234}{0}{<238>}{A large stone shack (e,n,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{      Loud, raucous shouting emanates from the north and then echoes throughout the shack.  Large footprints in the mud are more prevalent here than anywhere else in the hut--it would seem that whatever lies to the north generates a great deal of traffic.  Growing in and around the prints are an assortment of overripe mushrooms that fill the air with the slightly sickening scent of decay. }{Troll Alliance}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37232}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37236}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
