R {37343}{0}{}{Small room (e)}{ }{     You are in a small room, with a colourful tapestry hanging on the north wall. The west and south walls are bare, smooth and black. A five foot long bed stands against the west wall, and a small desk with a simple wooden chair have been placed against the south wall. The only exit is past the heavy curtain on the east wall. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
