R {37344}{0}{}{Big, octagonal, pink bedroom (e)}{ }{       You get a shock as you enter this pink room, not only because of the fact that everything in here is pink, but the thick smell of perfume is enough to knock out a horse. The room it rather big and octagonal in shape. A big chandelier throws a bright light at the pink cabinet, and the big, soft looking bed with pink sheets. A pink dresser standing against the southern wall is almost swallowed by the thick waves of the pink wall to wall carpet. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
