R {37346}{0}{}{An octagonal room with a ninth side (nw,ne,sw,se,e,s,n,w)}{ }{        You stand in a very open room, eight arches lead out to eight similar places, a dark room. The room is a perfect octagon and on the ninth wall a small bed has been placed.... Odd.. If you count the sides in the room there are eight, but there are eight exits, each on its own wall and a bed standing against another wall. How can this room even exist you wonder, as you look at the ceiling that appears to be a window looking _down_ upon an apple grove. The bed is speckled black and red all over. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
