R {37354}{0}{}{Small room (w)}{ }{    The pitch-black walls in this small room are naked, the only furniture to be seen in here is a new oak table and a chair. Both the chair and table are empty. The floor however show marks of more furniture, as it obviously hasn't been cleaned since the furniture was removed. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
