R {37355}{0}{}{Tilasmana's room (w)}{ }{     This room is empty apart from a simple bed and a six foot tall mirror. The walls, floor and ceiling are all painted in a dark red colour. The bed is made of ebony, as is the frame of the mirror. The mirror frame is shaped like two black roses, following the elliptic curve of the mirror. }{Durhal's Ant Caves}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
