R {37368}{0}{<238>}{Chapel Forest Bridge (n,s)}{W}{            Mid-way across the bridge you find yourself near a small waterfall.  The waterfall trickles down a tiny cliff to your left, and collects in a pool beneath your feet. The rocks below your feet are covered in moss, and you find it challenging to navigate across the crude bridge. Looking into the pool, the water appears dark and uninviting.  Fortunately, the sheer number of rocks make it impossible to slip into the pool.  As you lift your head up towards the heavens, you finally catch a glimpse into the intense darkness of the midnight sky.  Radiant starlight reflects off the surface of the waterfall, creating an atmosphere of both terror and delight. }{Chapel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
