R {37443}{0}{}{Dead End (n)}{ }{       You have come to the back of this dark cave to find it totally unoccupied by anything bigger than the few bats you notice grouped together along one of the higher ledges. A small pool ripples occasionally as small, white fish break the surface. The occasional chirp from the bats sends goosebumps racing over your skin. Several stalagmites and stalactites make moving around rather difficult without scraping the walls. }{Shadow Dragon Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
