R {37444}{0}{}{The Dragon's Lair (n)}{ }{      At least 400 feet across in any direction and over 300 feet to the ceiling above, this has to be the largest cave you have ever seen. You have found the dark and shadowy lair of the dragon. A small hole in the center of the ceiling provides the light for the mass of shadows you see all around you. The walls of this massive cavern are surprisingly straight and free of plant life. }{Shadow Dragon Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
