R {37446}{0}{<248>}{Inside the Dragon's Lair (ne,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{        You are standing like a toy soldier in a castle.  The cavern before you stretches beyond sight in all directions. Mounds of treasure litter the cavern, though stacked neatly they dominate your view.  Starting about 10 Meters above the cavern floor you can see charred rock and clay.  The charred area stretches as high as you can see.  An enormous tunnel leads northeast out of the cavern about 75 feet up. A (tiny in comparison) exit leads south.  It's about human size. }{Deep Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
