R {37453}{0}{<238>}{Exit from the Mountain Core (out,inward)}{<238>.^.<088>}{           You stand at the exit/entrance to the Mountain Core.  You are thousands of meters up from the mountain base overlooking a mountain range of unparalleled beauty.  Were you to step out from the entrance the drop would be hard to survive.  The view before you is breathtaking.  Gargantuan mountains stretch on as far as you can see, leaving valleys of enormous width and splendor between them.  Snow caps even the lowest of mountains which still stand taller than any you've seen in your travels.  The wind howls around you and through the cave opening.  Ice covers the ledge before you, causing your footing to be precarious at best.  The extreme chill in the air bites through your clothes with great ease, sending you into fits of shivering. }{Deep Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
