R {37462}{0}{<248>}{In the kitchen of Anclas (e)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{            You are standing in the kitchen of the fortress Anclas.  Once the most well protected training grounds of all time, it is now all but deserted since the Dragon Guard war. Anclas was the home and training grounds of the Storm Legion.  The King's spies if you will.  They were the secret organization of Rogan that was used to carry out the less honorable deeds of the nation.  Most of what they accomplished was without the knowledge of the crown, but it was necessary.  The Storm Legion was wiped out by the Dragon Guard by decree of the King due to a deception by his advisor.  All that remains is this hollow and deserted fortress. The kitchen is barren, completely empty.  A door leads east and there's a small cupboard on the south wall. }{Deep Mountain}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
