R {37477}{0}{}{Top of Altar (d)}{ }{       You've made it to the top of the Altar.  You feel threatened here.  Around you are the Drow Priests in the midst of chanting.  They appear to be engaged in turning a failed drow soldier into a drider.  You are glad that it is him and not you.  Were they not involved in this ritual, they would certainly be pummeling your guts out for intruding.  Perhaps you should leave before they finish.  There is a small stone pedestal in the center of this altar upon which the drider has been placed. }{The Drow Kingdom of fe dar Shad}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
