R {37488}{0}{}{Descent of a Waterfall (d,u)}{ }{       A cascade of water crashes down from above.  The waterfall slams into the ice-coated walls as it continues its descent into the dark reaches below.  Mist fills the air, and spawns a heavy dampness across the already treacherously slick surfaces of this place.  The close confines cause the thunderous noise to rebound.  The echo combined with the unearthly darkness makes it nearly impossible for sensory perceptions to function. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
