R {37490}{0}{}{Mist-filled space (s,u,d)}{ }{      A cascade of water crashes down from above, filling the air with billowing clouds of vapor and mist.  The walls are coated with a layer of ice, making it ridiculously treacherous to attempt to scale them.  The incredible humidity is causing it to become increasingly difficult to breathe, while the crashing water and unearthly twilight deafen sound and inhibit sight.  A narrow ledge leads south along the wall. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
