R {37491}{0}{}{Underground Waterfall (s)}{ }{       A torrent of water rushes down the western side of the gaping chasm before you.  Pinpoints of light flare from across the depths separating this ledge from the opposite side - there must be active runes of warding over there.  A fine mist clouds the air, generated by the spray of the rushing waterfall.  Sprinkles of ice coat the surface of the floor, making it treacherous for anyone who tries to leap across the chasm. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37488}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37492}{0}{}{On a ledge (s,n)}{ }{       You are edging along a narrow, slippery ledge above a rushing subterranean stream.  The roar of a nearby waterfall pounds into your eardrums like nails hammered by sadistic imps.  From here you can see the cavern wall opposite you, but the stream itself is lost in dimness below, and the ceiling of the cavern is shrouded in thick shadow.  It's cold and humid here\; mist billows through the air, freezing into snowflakes that coat the treacherous ledge ahead of you. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37490}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
