R {37493}{0}{}{Mist-filled space (d,u)}{ }{      Inky black darkness fills this place completely, and combined with the vapor and mist in the air, limits sight to a mere yard.  Due to the crashing cascade of water flooding from above, this space is filled with deafening sound and intense humidity.  The temperature continues to fall, becoming so cold that it seems to seep into everything except the spirit itself. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37490}{u}{climb up}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
