R {37494}{0}{}{On a ledge (s,n)}{ }{     High above a rushing underground stream, you cling nervously to the icy cavern wall.  The ledge under your feet is no more than twelve inches wide.  The snow and ice covering the ledge make you envision your demise on the cavern floor far below.  The rumble of the nearby waterfall reverberates off the walls of the chasm. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
