R {37495}{0}{}{On a ledge (s,n)}{ }{      Perched upon a precarious, icy ledge along a cavern wall above a subterranean stream, you nervously inch along.  The roar of the waterfall is slightly muted this far south, but it's still all you can hear.  The chasm has widened a bit here.  You can barely see the opposite wall through the cloud of mist.  It's very cold and wet up on the ledge. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
