R {37496}{0}{}{On a ledge (se,n)}{ }{      The ledge curves along the wall of the chasm here.  Fortunately, it's slightly wider here - a foot and a half, perhaps.  You still have to be careful with your footing considering the snow and ice covering the ledge and cavern wall.  You can hear the rush of the water below along with the rumble of the waterfall to the north.  It sounds as though it's a long way down to the water. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
