R {37497}{0}{}{On a ledge (n,nw)}{ }{     The ledge terminates here at a tunnel heading north into the rocky wall of the cavern.  Unlike the tunnels of the labyrinth above, this one is not swallowed in supernatural darkness.  In fact, a dim blue glow reflects off its icy walls.  You hear the roar of the stream far below you, and the distant rumble of the waterfall. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
