R {37498}{0}{<148>}{In a blue tunnel (s)}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{      This tunnel glows blue from the light emitted by a large matrix of blue crystals covering one wall.  The blue light reflects off the snow and ice covering the walls, ceiling, and floor, casting a cerulean shade over everything here.  A thin mist floats in the frigid air.  You can hear the distant rumble and crash of rapidly moving water echo from down the passage. }{Mystic Seal}{seal_entrails}{}{}{1.000}{1}
