R {37501}{0}{}{Dripping Sphincter (nexus,entrails)}{ }{       A huge pink sphincter, dripping mucus, clenches and unclenches rhythmically in this noisome and warm chamber.  The floor, walls, ceiling - everything seems to be biological, as though you were standing in the innards of an enormous creature.  A pulsating sac of fluid throbs overhead, while tarry digestive fluids run sluggishly about your feet.  A nexus of shimmering light floats immobile here, as though observing the scene. }{Mystic Seal - Entrails of the Jumblers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
