R {37503}{0}{}{Slimy Entrails (right,sphincter,left)}{ }{     You're standing in a pool of fetid juices in a tunnel that seems to be part of the entrails of some vast beast.  The entrails fork here, which as far as you know violates the normal conventions of anatomy... but who's keeping track?  Clouds of rancid gas billow down the entrails.  Mucus drips from the ceiling. }{Mystic Seal - Entrails of the Jumblers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
