R {37504}{0}{}{Pool of Acid (entrails,trachea,membrane)}{ }{        This cankered chamber is bowl-shaped and filled with a deep pool of tarry acid.  The surface of the pool bubbles and burps gas as it swirls phlegmatically.  A thin pink membrane takes up most of one side of the chamber.  A dun tunnel looking like an intestine leads off in another direction, pulling clouds of green gas as it pulsates, as though it were smoking from a pipe.  Another tunnel, glistening with mucus, breathes fetid air in blasts that stir the gas floating above the pool. }{Mystic Seal - Entrails of the Jumblers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
