R {37506}{0}{}{Diaphanous Chamber (tongue,entrails,membrane)}{ }{     The entrails squirt you out in a diaphanous chamber of thin membranes, which wiggle spasmodically, spraying mucus everywhere in a thin sticky rain.  The pink floor throbs here\; it looks like a tongue leading down into who knows where.  A large white pustule on the ceiling threatens to burst at any moment. }{Mystic Seal - Entrails of the Jumblers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
