R {37508}{0}{}{Fetid Trachea (forward,back)}{ }{     This mucus-lined passage pulsates as gusts of foul air blow from one end to the other.  The fetid wind nearly knocks you over, as much from its halitosis as from its physical force.  The passage is empty otherwise.  It seems you can go back to the acid pool, or forward to wherever this leads. }{Mystic Seal - Entrails of the Jumblers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
