R {37510}{0}{}{Throbbing Orifice (tongue)}{ }{     This chamber looks like a mutated and closed mouth with numerous slimy tongues wiggling and licking, sloshing about greenish juices and vomitous ooze.  It's difficult to stand in place while the tongues buffet you, slobbering all over in their undulating frenzy.  The ground throbs up and down, bucking at times like a mechanical bull. }{Mystic Seal - Entrails of the Jumblers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
