R {37516}{0}{}{Inside a Pimple (trachea)}{ }{     The trachea terminates at a white chamber that looks like the inside of a pimple.  Thick pus drips down the sides of the domed ceiling.  A pool of creamy pus takes up most of the floor.  It smells horrific - somewhere halfway between rot and flatulence.  You have to be on guard to avoid periodic showers of pus shaken from the white dome overhead. }{Mystic Seal - Entrails of the Jumblers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
