R {37519}{0}{}{Mist-filled space (d,u)}{ }{       The very air vibrates from the intense force of the deluge crashing down from above, while the noise it creates drowns out other sounds.  Unnatural darkness floods this space, and beyond barely discernible ice-coated walls, only the waterfall's vapor is visible through it.  It has become unbearably frigid - so much so that when combined with the mist and humidity, there is real danger of becoming frozen in place. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
