R {37520}{0}{}{Bottom of the Waterfall (s)}{ }{       A cascade of water rushes down from above you, filling the humid air with mist.  An unearthly darkness flutters overhead, moving and contorting into eerie shapes.  It clouds your view of whatever lies above.  Compressed by the slick walls of the cavern, water floods rapidly south, tugging everything in its current along with it.  The noise from the torrent pouring from above thunders through here, drowning out every other sound with its intensity. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
