R {37586}{0}{}{Underground stream (sw,ne)}{ }{      Surging rapidly out of the northeastern tunnel, the stream insistently tugs at everything within its depths.  A radiant blue light flows out of the southwestern passage, casting a colorful cascade of glimmering sparkles across the water's surface.  A bright gleam envelopes the moist walls, caused as a side effect of the radiance flooding into this passage.  A faint echo can be heard coming the northeast. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
