R {37587}{0}{<108>}{Cystal Matrix (ne)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{        Radiant blue light pulses out of the giant crystal matrix, casting a cascade of glimmering sparkles across the surface of the water.  Gleaming brightly, the smooth walls jut out on both sides, increasing the width of this tunnel by a few dozen yards.  The chill flow of water pushes rapidly southward, flowing downward into darkness, while casting a sheen of glowing mist into the air.  Strangely, the pull of the stream is almost nonexistent within this passage.  The flow of water still tugs at things within its depth, but not strongly. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
