R {37594}{0}{}{In a shadowy boudoir (n)}{ }{     Dim, flickering light from gas lamps barely illuminates this small room.  Its only furnishings are a vanity table with a small circular mirror, and a stool set in front of the vanity.  A handful of soft brushes and small pots of cosmetics are arrayed on the table.  A small white door leads back north into the boudoir. }{Mystic Seal - Boudoir of the Shadow Succubus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37592}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37595}{0}{}{In a shadowy boudoir (w,n)}{ }{     A long wooden dresser and a full-length mirror grace this corner of the boudoir.  A plush backless two-seater sofa is set before the dresser for convenience.  Flickering light from the gas lamps plays off the surface of the mirror.  The rest of the spacious boudoir stretches away north and east into the dimness. }{Mystic Seal - Boudoir of the Shadow Succubus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37593}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37596}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37596}{0}{}{In a shadowy boudoir (s,w)}{ }{     This corner of the boudoir is bare, save for a plaster bust of a demon, which sits on a yellowing marble pedestal.  The bust glowers out of the corner like some dark guardian.  Perhaps it scared all the furniture off.  The spacious boudoir stretches away to the west and south. }{Mystic Seal - Boudoir of the Shadow Succubus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37591}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37595}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37597}{0}{}{Hiding under the bed (out)}{ }{     You're hiding under a king-sized canopy bed in a shadowy boudoir.  It's dark here, and smells musty.  The dust gives you a strong urge to sneeze.  From this vantage point, all you can really see of the boudoir is a forest of furniture legs.  You do have a great view of the floor, though. }{Mystic Seal - Boudoir of the Shadow Succubus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37593}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

