R {37600}{0}{}{In a fey glen (out)}{ }{       The world around you is rendered in the brushstrokes of a baroque painter.  You are in a glen deep in the woods - or, rather, in a depiction of a glen deep in the woods.  The moon shines brightly down upon an old stone well and a stand of saplings.  Looking down, you're momentarily alarmed to see your own body rendered in deft squiggles of oil paint.  You sense somehow that you could leave this place by concentrating. }{Mystic Seal - Boudoir of the Shadow Succubus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37591}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37601}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {37602}{0}{<108>}{A Shadowy Tunnel (s)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{      You're in a cramped alcove occupied by a gigantic matrix of faintly pulsing blue crystals, which covers the entirety of one wall.  The crystals fit loosely together, but the gaps between them are uniform.  Clearly this artifact is of superior construction.  To the south, a flickering wall of shadow only partially conceals the way back to the main tunnel. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31861}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

