R {37604}{0}{<238>}{Hidden Mountain Passage (n,leave)}{<238>] [<088>}{        A soft glow emanates forth from the walls of this passage, yet you see no source of light.  It's as if the walls themselves are imbued with a magical light.  The walls are incredibly smooth which leaves no doubt in your mind that this passage was created by some intelligent being. You notice that, while you are currently inside a mountain, there is not a single rock or pebble that lies on the floor.  Despite the fact that you can see in this portion of the passage, there is absolutely no light shed further up ahead. }{Demon Summoners}{demon_summoners}{}{}{1.000}{1}
