E {37605}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37605}{0}{<238>}{Hidden Mountain Passage (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{     The walls here glow with a rather pale light.  Just enough light is provided for you to look about.  The parts of the passage ahead of, and behind you, are pitch black.  It's as if the light given off from this section will not wander into the others.  The walls and floor here are both incredibly smooth. }{Demon Summoners}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
