R {37769}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{     As you travel further down the caverns' corridor the gloomy darkness appears to fade away. The light seeping into this area from the entrance of the cave barely reaches here. A small stack of stones piled together against the east wall is nearly two feet in height. A muffed drip can be heard echoing through the colossal chamber to the south of here. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
