R {37770}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (e,w,s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{       The remains of an ancient battle scar this colossal sized room.  Broken stalagmites and stalactites lie scattered across the floor, creating rubble.  Fossilized bone fragments are strewn across a large section of this room, while dark burns are seared into the walls.  Three medium sized tunnels branch off into three different directions.  To the north where you can vaguely make out sunlight, to the west into a bone graveyard, and to the east into the gloomy darkness of this cavern. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
