R {37774}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (s,w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{      The front seats form boxes with seats inside, discouraging the baser of the species from resting themselves toward the front. A small booth, probably used as a gambling station, rests to the west of all the seats, and along the walls. Two large partitions can be seen from the next section of the cavern. Cages were placed between them as a showplace for the gamblers to view the next contestants before each fight. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
