R {37775}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{      This room appears to have once been a holding cell where the prisoners held for entertainment were locked up in anticipation of the up and coming battle. The walls that once blocked the entryway between here and the former arena, have been broken to dust and pebble from years of corrosion and decay. Chains, benches, and instruments of torture are strewn around the room as though they were the long forgotten toys of a small child. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
