R {37777}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (u,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{      You strain your eyes to see anything other than the strange kaleidoscope of colours visible here.  Dry air entering from above seems to be mixing with the murky air down here, creating the most amazing effects.  Colours you have only seen in your dreams appear then disappear just as quickly.  There is a stairway carved into the cavern wall that leads into the darkness above. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
