R {37778}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{       You have a brief apocalyptic vision of things to come as you survey the area.  You realize that you have indeed not entered some dark layer of hell, but rather you are still in the caves you entered a short time ago.  Several large cracks in the caverns walls belch forth clouds of purplish gas, while at the same time geysers in the floor spew our steam tinged with a sulfuric smell.  This hell on earth continues to the south, while the way back is to the north. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
