R {37779}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (w,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{      The ground here is softer and much hotter. The smaller pockets that have littered the surrounding area, have grown much larger here. The centre of the floor exudes the most heat where the floor splits wide open into the heart of a hot spring. The moisture in the air here makes visibility almost nonexistent. There are pathways on either side of the spring for passage to the next destination. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
