R {37782}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{       To the south, the floor slopes downward to a hall of columns.  The calcareous minerals have dripped from the ceiling for eons, forming solid pillars of white.  The cave is reminiscent of an ancient, cold cathedral where the dull, blind creatures have served for countless centuries.  The darkness and silence are broken by your intrusion.  Every footfall is magnified one hundredfold, resounding in echoing blackness beyond the immediate light source. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37781}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37783}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37783}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{      Gargantuan pillars of rock stretch from the pebbly floor to the rocky vaulted ceiling. The sound of running water echoes loudly through the inky darkness. Narrow streams gurgle on both sides of you.  Your light dances across the surface, and catches the luminescent flashes of a school of blind white fish swimming silently by.  The darkness continues to the north and south. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37782}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37784}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37784}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (n)}{<248>% %<088>}{            Fusing together to create an impenetrable barrier, the stalactites and stalagmites form together, in the process creating a menacing grimace.   A dark pool gathers here, coalesced from the many streams of pungent water that run throughout this cavern.  The titanic size of this enclosed area is both stunning, and at the same time more than a little unnerving.  A crypt-like presence emulates from the room itself, causing not only a spasm of tingles to pass down your spine\; but also giving you the impression that you are being imprisoned. Your flickering light-source casts dancing shadows across the small crack in the stalagmites you squeezed through to get in here.  Tiny droplets of water drip down from the monolithic stalactites, causing an eerie sound to constantly echo as they splash into the calcified stumps of rock on the floor. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37783}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37785}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (s,n)}{<248>% %<088>}{      The passageway leads to a narrow crevasse.  It's a tight squeeze, but you think you can make it.  The earthen floor slopes steeply downward.  The rocks that were once jagged are smooth here.  You realize that at some point, this tunnel was probably the bed of an ancient underground river. As you continue winding your way down, the ground beneath you becomes increasingly muddy. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37781}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37786}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37786}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (w,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{          Your light flickers, and you feel a cool wind across your face. It's coming from a hollow in the rocky wall.  As you near it, you realize it's an entrance to a tunnel.  The passageway turns sharply, and your light catches a shimmering vein in the jagged ceiling.  It sparkles crimson under the glow of your light.  As you further your way into the tunnel, you notice the increasingly frequent rippling of the unusual red stone.  The air is cool, but you follow the veins of blood red stone deeper into the heart of the cavern.  Never before have you felt a cavern feel so alive. You stand on the muddy ground of this former river wondering what you will experience next. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37785}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37787}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37787}{0}{<248>}{A Dimly lit cave (w,e)}{<248>% %<088>}{      The tunnel opens up into a spacious rock cavern.  The beautiful red rock spiders into an extraordinary mosaic of sparkles as you raise your light.  You can distinguish several large boulders near the edges of the room.  The light dances eerily with every movement and you think you saw one of the boulders move slightly.  To the east there is a small tunnel leading out of here and this cavern continues to the west. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {37786}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {37788}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37788}{0}{}{A Dimly lit cave (e)}{ }{    The passageway opens up to reveal another red room.  In the centre is a beautiful red crystalline pillar.  Your light passes through the faceted pillar, and the room glows in red-tinged prisms.  As you circle the room, you notice strange glyphs carved into the wall opposite the entrance. }{Mount Knivur Expansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
