R {37795}{0}{<238>}{Dining area (w,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{       A dozen square tables have been placed next to each other in this section of the giant canvas tent.  A gentle golden luminance flows outwards from several orbs, which are hovering in each corner of this room.  Directly to the west there appears to be a storage room of sorts, while to the south you see sunlight seeping in through the open flaps of the entryway.  A strange smell lingers within the air\; quite unique in fragrance it has a scent you can't place. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
