R {37796}{0}{<248>}{An ancient cave. (out)}{<248>% %<088>}{        This damp cave is enshrouded by a mist-like murky darkness.  Green fungus intertwines with mold and spreads to cover the lifeless rock of this cave's floor and walls.  An occasional drip echoes throughout this area, caused by stale water that occasionally falls from the small stalactites which cover the ceiling.  An unbearable stench of death arises from shredded carcasses which litter the floor.  A single spot within this cave is free from both dried blood and rotting flesh, and that is where a giant skeleton of a fearsome beast lays. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
