R {37800}{0}{}{Shadowed Alcove (e)}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{       You're in a small alcove off the corridor proper.  The wall of the alcove is occupied almost entirely by a large matrix of shimmering blue crystals.  The crystals pulse hypnotically, with a slightly different rhythm than the pulsing of the warding runes.  To the east, the back side of an illusory wall attempts to reassert itself in your mind, giving you a slight headache.  Cold shadows eat up what little light you brought here. }{Mystic Seal}{seal_infernal_prince}{}{}{1.000}{1}
