R {37803}{0}{}{Top of Cliff (d,n)}{ }{         You stand at the top of a tall cliff.  The bottom of the cliff is lost from sight, yet you can see a narrow staircase leading downwards.  You also see a beautiful grove of trees to the north, and a large palace even further north.  A small path leads north into the grove. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
