R {37804}{0}{}{Grove (s,n)}{ }{        You are standing in a wondrous grove of maple trees. Their beauty seems marred, however, as if some sort of evil has tainted their leaves, turning them an unusual shade of green.  A huge palace lies to the north. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
