R {37805}{0}{}{Approach to Palace (s,n)}{ }{        You are standing on a trail that leads north, right up to a huge palace made of translucent crystal. The moat is only about 30 feet to the north, and the palace lies directly past the moat, towering into the sky. A huge drawbridge can also be seen, apparently used to cross the moat. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
