R {37806}{0}{}{Edge of Acid Moat (s,w,e)}{A}{      You stand on the very edge of the moat.  Acid bubbles in the moat, spitting onto the grass, burning all that it touches. The acid itself smells acrid, and is so clear that when you look through it you can see how it has burned the sides of the moat into smooth glass. ========The drawbridge is raised========= }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
