R {37807}{0}{}{Alongside The Acid Moat (e)}{ }{          You are currently standing on the side of the acid moat. The acid bubbles and spits as you look around.  To your north is the palace, and to the south and west are thick stands of red maple.  The moat is over a hundred feet in width here, thus making it impossible to cross at this point.  There is also a smoldering corpse here. Evidently the poor chap tried to cross the moat and got toasted. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
