R {37809}{0}{}{Palace Entryway (e,w,s)}{ }{         You are standing in the main entryway for the crystal palace.  The walls and floor are made of translucent crystal, and light shines into the palace from every direction, refracted by the crystal.  The aura of the place fills you with serenity, and you seem to see everything with a preternatural clarity. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
