R {37884}{0}{}{Top of Tree (d)}{ }{      You are in the top of the tree's trunk.  This room is rather small, yet it seems someone lives here since there is a small bed and a smaller desk against one wall.  In addition, a small window has been cut out of the side of the tree, and light streams in, pleasantly filtered by the leaves of the tree. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
