R {37895}{0}{}{Chamber of the sky (s)}{ }{    This room has low cut granite walls, and is open to the bright blue sky.  The room is completely bare save for a large stone bench which is angled so as to allow people to lay back upon it and gaze at the clouds... }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
