R {37896}{0}{}{Dark Altar Room (s)}{ }{      This is seemingly the altar room for a dark and evil cleric.  There is a large black altar on a raised dais, and a disemboweled corpse lies on its rough surface. There is a large brazier to one side of the room, and a putrid smelling trail of dark smoke rises from its hot coals as human body parts sizzle in its heat. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {6792}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {37897}{0}{}{Glacial Chamber (s)}{ }{     It is hard to tell what this chamber was originally built for since the entire room is coated with a thick layer of glacial ice.  The ice is hard as rock, and looks very cold. In fact, the temperature in here is almost below freezing, and you shiver from the cold. }{Portal of Life}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
