R {37976}{0}{<138>}{Murdoch Smithing (w)}{<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>}{       Murdoch Smithing -  The temperature is considerably warmer in this small shack.  A large fire with several bars of metal sticking out of it burns in a center pit.  Next to the pit is a large anvil with a hammer laying across the top of it.  Mounted on the walls are several pieces of armour and various types of weapons.  Pieces of metal and scraps of leather are scattered about the floor. }{Fort in the woods}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
