R {38023}{0}{}{EMA Complex (u,e)}{ }{    The basement level of the EMA Complex is top secret. It is here that the agency develops new technologies. A staircase leads back up to the main floor while the security station lies to the east. If you don't belong here you probably ought to head back upstairs now. }{EMA Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38025}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {1469}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

