R {38043}{0}{<238>}{Northern Village (n,nw,s)}{A}{     You pass a few houses when you enter this area, but none of them makes you curious. Beyond the small houses you see some bushes along the path, which becomes even smaller further northward where it splits. North and northwest, the path continues, and south is the center of the village.  }{Midgard and Valhalla}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38042}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38048}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38049}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38044}{0}{<238>}{Western Village (e)}{D}{     You now stand in the western part of the village. You notice that there are less people here, and you also notice a stable in the end of the small path. In the mud beside the path you can see the body of a dead man lying upside down, with his face down in the dirt. The small houses makes it impassable anywhere but east.  }{Midgard and Valhalla}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38042}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
