R {38045}{0}{<238>}{Eastern Village (se,ne,w)}{B}{     You walk into the eastern part of the village, and except for the small houses that stand along the small path, there's nothing much to look at. Southeast there seems to be a port of some kind. Northeast the path leads into some bushes and west is the way back to the center of the village.  }{Midgard and Valhalla}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38042}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38046}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
