R {38046}{0}{<238>}{Port (nw)}{<238>|||<088>}{     You have just stepped onto a vast sandy beach, with a large sea lapping the surf quite a bit in the distance. At the beach, there are a few large ships who transports the vikings to their destinations. Merry tunes can be heard from the ships. On the ground someone recently placed a sign.  }{Midgard and Valhalla}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
