R {38173}{0}{}{Crypt of Rutha-Al (exit)}{ }{      This large room is made entirely of stone, and smells of rot and disease.  The stone walls are covered in engravings of ankhs and jackal heads, the symbol of Apotep.  The only exit is through the heavy iron door.  A sarcophagus rests at an angle against the far wall.  The coffin is layered in centuries old dirt, as is the rest of this crypt. }{Tomb of Rutha-Al}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
