R {38289}{0}{<238>}{A Rocky Ledge (d,n,e)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{          The fiery blaze of the sun sinks behind ominous purple clouds which blend into the ocean on the western horizon. You stand about half way up a mountainous island.... Far below you to the west waves crash into a rocky shore. Above you the mountain climbs into the sky, and you notice it is actually a smoking volcano. Directly to your east a great opening in the side of the mountain leads to a large cave. The ledge you stand upon is fairly wide but it narrows to the north. An animal track leads down through the giant foliage of the rain forest. Long shadows are cast from the setting sun. }{Dragon Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
