R {38566}{0}{<238>}{Hidden Mountain Passage (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{      The walls here have not one visible defect.  They are so incredibly smooth that there is no way they could have been built using conventional tools. They also emit a pale light which has no base.  The floor here is spotless and lacks any sort of debris.  Both ahead of you and behind you it is pitch black.  The light seems to be contained to this section of the passage only. }{Demon Summoners}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
