R {38572}{0}{<218>}{Summoning Chamber (ne)}{<218>. .<088>}{     This cavern does not glow with a soft pale light like the others.  Instead it is illuminated in a harsh red light.  This whole room is fairly empty. From the floor, all the way to the domed ceiling fifty feet above, there are no objects.  The only thing of interest in this room is the incredibly large pentagram etched into the floor. }{Demon Summoners}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
