R {38573}{0}{<238>}{Mountain Library (se)}{<238>"""<088>}{       You have stepped into an incredibly massive circular room.  Everywhere you look bookshelves blanket the walls.  The shelves are filled with a countless number of books.  The walls lead to a domed ceiling many feet high.  The ceiling glows with the magical light that is so familiar to these caverns. Spread throughout the massive rooms are various desks and chairs of incredibly fine craftsmanship.  There is a passage off to the southeast of this room. }{Demon Summoners}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38568}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38574}{0}{}{Bunk Room (sw)}{ }{     This cavern is filled with many, many beds.  Most are bunked on top of each other and arranged in rows.  In this room the walls do not glow at all.  The only light comes from the few candles placed about the room next to various beds.  This seems to be some type of sleeping quarters for those who live within these caverns. }{Demon Summoners}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38571}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38575}{0}{}{Private Study (nw)}{ }{      You have come to find yourself inside of a secret room.  It seems to be someone's own personal study room.  The walls glow with a pale white light, and the floor and walls are very smooth.  In the center of the room sits a large elaborate desk.  On top of the desk rests some various items and scrolls.  Behind the desk a few shelves are covered in a plethora of books. }{Demon Summoners}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
