R {38583}{0}{}{Entrance to a tomb (u,w)}{ }{      This is the entrance room to what appears to be some sort of tomb. The walls are constucted of large limestone bricks and the ceiling is covered with soot. You get goosebumps imagining what lies ahead in the interior of the tomb. Perhaps there is a wealth of treasure. Or perhaps there is something menacing guarding it. The only way to find out is to continue on, but you aren't too sure if that is a good idea. }{Sphinx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
