R {38586}{0}{}{A small side chamber (s)}{ }{     This room is much smaller than the antechamber. It appears to be perfectly square, with a very low ceiling. You feel slightly claustrophobic standing here, although the walls are covered in white plaster opening it up a bit. The ceiling and each of the four walls has a mural painted on it. There is a small doorway on the south wall that leads back to the antechamber. }{Sphinx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38584}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38587}{0}{}{A small side chamber (n)}{ }{   This small room has its walls covered in white plaster. On each of the walls is painted a mural. The ceiling is dark from the soot of torches. There is a small doorway in the north wall leading back to the antechamber. }{Sphinx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38584}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38588}{0}{}{Burial chamber (e)}{ }{       You have entered the burial chamber of the tomb. The centerpiece of the room is a rosestone sarcophagus situated lengthwise in the room. The walls of this room are made of the same limestone bricks that have made up the rest of the tomb. The ceiling is black with soot from the torches of those who have been here before you. The room itself doesn't appear to be too threatening, although you have a strange feeling that the contents of the sarcophagus could change that at any instance. }{Sphinx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38585}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38589}{0}{}{A small side chamber (n)}{ }{    On each of the plastered walls of this small chamber are murals depicting stories of some great event. The low ceiling also has a large picture painted on it. There is a small doorway in the north wall that leads back to the antechamber. }{Sphinx}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38585}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38590}{0}{}{On the Anchor Chain (climb)}{ }{       You're clinging to the anchor chain of the galleon just above  the waterline.  Waves slap lightly against the hull, which is  covered in barnacles and seaweed.  Seabirds wheel about you  squawking loudly as your arrival disturbs them, and you try  to remember just why it was you wanted to come down here as  you feel your arms begin to ache from the exertion of holding  onto the chain.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22094}{climb}{climb}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
