R {38592}{0}{}{Amongst the Rigging (u,d)}{ }{       You find yourself amongst a thick tangle of ropes and lines all  entwined thickly around the ship's main mast.  You can see the  ship laid out below you in all its majesty here.  You pause to  admire the view and lean against the mast while you catch your  breath from the fairly tough climb up here.  The rigging extends further above you, and looking past the sails and yardarms you  think you can spy something up higher.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38593}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22092}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38593}{0}{}{The Crow's Nest (d)}{ }{      You have climbed up into the lookout post, or crow's nest, of the galleon.  From here you can see a magnificent view of the realm,  and you can feel a serene calm wash over you as the wind ruffles  across your face.  The ship's flag flutters merrily above you,  and were it not for the fairly hefty swaying motion of the mast  up here, you'd probably feel completely at ease.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38592}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38594}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {38592}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38595}{0}{}{The Ocean Floor}{ }{You stare in wonder at your surroundings.  The hazy blue water is quite clear and you can see large bunches of coral and seaweed extend in all directions.  The fine sand of the ocean floor  rises in small puffs as you step on it, and the galleon's huge  anchor rests here amongst the scene like some strange relic.   Tiny fish dart about you in schools of colour and the sunlight  from the surface streams down in strange beams of light. }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38590}{climb chain}{climb chain}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

