R {38939}{0}{}{Pit Bottom}{ }{You are deep in a pit dug from the snow in the floor of the cavern. What a waste of time, all this effort and nothing more to show for it than a few cubic feet of air. The snow down here is very soft and has an almost gluey consistency which makes moving very difficult. If you were any heavier than you are, it is likely you would be stuck and might be trapped forever. Even so, you wonder if you can scramble out of here, it looks none too easy...}{Seahaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

