R {38974}{0}{<168>}{Ice Tunnel (se,n)}{<168>~ ~<088>}{       Ice Tunnel. A cold and frozen tunnel. Ice crystals sparkle on the roof, refracting light from the walls which glow with an unknown source of internal illumination. The air is so cold, you can feel it penetrating into the core of your bones. Nothing lives here, there is no perturbation of the natural order which has created this place. If you were to die, your corpse would surely remain preserved for eternity... }{Seahaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38973}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38975}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

