R {38976}{0}{<238>}{Dragon Cave (n,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{     Dragon Cave. The ice tunnel has emerged into the back of a vast ice cavern. The light in here is completely different, you recognize the warmth of the colors of normal daylight\; a welcome relief from the unnatural illumination of the ice walls. }{Seahaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38975}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38977}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38977}{0}{<238>}{Before the Gates of Seahaven (s)}{<238>] [<088>}{          Before the Gates of Seahaven. You stare up at the huge gates of the ancient town of Seahaven. Perhaps you are the first adventurer to have reached this place for eons. The gates are as tall as the masts of the largest sailing ships and are constructed of dark wood to prevent fire. They hang from walls of stone which reach to either side. The whole scene is rather abstract, the wall and the gates are embedded in the frozen ice of the glacier which imprisons the city. You wonder how large Seahaven originally was, but there is no way to tell now since in a very short distance the city walls are swallowed by cliffs of ice. }{Seahaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38976}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38978}{n}{open gates;n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {38978}{0}{}{White Marble Square (s,e,n)}{ }{            White Marble Square All the towers, the shops, the libraries, and the places of worship, have long been consumed by the ice of the glacier. All that remains of the ancient city of Seahaven is a small portion of the central market tiled in huge squares of alternating color. The ground here is pure white, as if it has been bleached or purged of all imperfections by blasting it with heat. There is nothing here but a white ash. On the floor there is a symbol. To the south of you rises the huge city walls\; perfect blocks of stone stacked on top of each other rising to tremendous height. In the wall to the south hang the city gates. To the west of you the glacier cliffs soar above you, forever pushing inwards to consume this last piece of the city. }{Seahaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {38977}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38979}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {38980}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

