R {39032}{0}{<268>}{Outside the Cathedral (n,s,w,e)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{       You stand on a small grassy path outside the cathedral.  A family of bluebirds are eating some bread just north of the path.  The grassy field extends for miles, without a tree in sight.  A white cloud floats all alone in the great blue sky.  About five feet to the east, is a small patch of yellow daisies.  Along the eastern horizon, sits an evil presence.  The haunting visage of mammoth Mt. Silvermoon brings darkness to the otherwise serene clearing. The path continues in all directions, including south into the cathedral. }{The Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
