R {39047}{0}{}{Genom Skyraker Coffee Bar (s)}{ }{        Genom Skyraker Coffee Bar The white tile floor of this coffee room is heavily stained and contains several wet spots near the counter.  The smell of coffee fills the room as several pots hold coffee for company employees.  The walls are lined with coffees of multiple flavors as well as several varieties of cocoa and tea.  A coffee stained counter is mounted along the wall, complete with sinks for washing dishes, stirrers, creamer, and all the accoutrements necessary for a deluxe coffee station.   }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35934}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39048}{0}{}{Genom Skyraker Hallway (n,s,w)}{ }{        Genom Skyraker Hallway The walls of this hallway are painted a bland shade of beige and are free of any sort of decorations.  This maze of hallways leads through the Genom skyraker.  Although the halls of the skyraker are very confusing, the Genom employees navigate through it with ease.  The sounds of heels echoing off the tiled floor can be heard coming from every direction.  To the north and west you barely see that the hallway continues.   }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
