R {39522}{0}{}{-= Grand Masters' Quarters =- (e,w)}{ }{      -= Grand Masters' Quarters =- The spicy smell of incense fills the hall.  The white, plush carpet remains spotless despite its age and use. A squat incense burner occupies a corner. Blue candles burn in clay pots. The walls are covered with various hardwoods. }{Monks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
