R {39523}{0}{}{-= Grand Masters' Quarters =- (u,e,s)}{ }{        -= Grand Masters' Quarters =- A pristine white carpet runs down the length of the Grand Masters' hall. It covers a variety of pale and dark hardwoods. Grand Masters pass by on their way to different duties throughout the temple, pausing only to offer a polite nod in greeting. To the east, the hallway continues to the Challenge Viewing Room, to the south, through the Grand Master Hall. }{Monks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
