R {39529}{0}{<278>}{-= Grand Masters' Meeting Room =- (d,w,se)}{<278>.@.<088>}{         -= Grand Masters' Meeting Room =- A sturdy wood desk sits in a corner. A small lantern, an ink well and a quill pen sit on top. A large tapestry hangs on the wall above the desk. A few chairs and straw mats are scattered throughout the room. The Grand Masters convene here often to discuss daily events. An ornate rug lies on the newly swept floor. A small wood staircase leads down to the Grand Masters' of the Universe living quarters. }{Monks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
