R {39782}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{   There is an elevator here.  There is a button beside the door. There is a huge room to the west. Flashing lights bathe the hallway in a blood red light. }{D.C. Megatech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
