R {39783}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{     This room is strikingly different from the other rooms you've seen in the building.  The walls, ceiling, and floor are all made of intricately carved mahogany.  The patterns are fascinating.  The  corridor itself is at least 30 feet wide. Near one corner you see a mid-sized panel. }{D.C. Megatech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39782}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39784}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39784}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{    The hallway continues.  The artistic quality of the walls and floors is absolutely outstanding.  The corridor, not very bright to begin with, grows darker to the west.  You smell the faint scent of smoke from somewhere. }{D.C. Megatech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39783}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39785}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39785}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{       You are just inside the entrance of a massive ballroom.  It is dark here, but you can still tell that at least the floor is made of that same dark mahogany wood.  The ballroom stretches out to the west for what you estimate is a good 100 feet. Your heart stops for a second, as you suddenly sense a massive shape occupying most of the space to the west.  You now hear its quiet, heavy breathing.  You stop in your tracks, afraid to continue west. }{D.C. Megatech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39784}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39786}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39786}{0}{<268>}{A hallway (e,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{   This is the western half of the ballroom.  A huge reptilian shape stands before you.  Your heart leaps into your throat as you find yourself staring face to face with a... it can't be. }{D.C. Megatech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39785}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39787}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39787}{0}{<238>}{A hallway (e)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{     An office You are in an office, a quite luxurious one.  The entire wall to the west is one huge window, showing an impressive view of the clear night sky. Far below lie the polluted clouds of the city, interrupted here and there by other extremely tall buildings. }{D.C. Megatech}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39786}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39788}{0}{<278>}{Boulevard du Temple (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{      As you emerge from the bushes, you find yourself on a dark, desolate street leading off to the west. Buildings line the boulevard, but most look old,  dilapidated and almost anachronistic, mere shells of what they once might have been. Along the way, gas lamps provide a low eerie light, creating flickering shadows that seem to follow your progress. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{theatre_des_vampires}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34330}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39789}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39789}{0}{<278>}{Boulevard du Temple (w,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{     As you continue down the path the shadows grow stronger in the light of the street lamps. The shadows seem to follow you, to speak to you. They speak to you of blood and death. They tell you that these things await you. You begin to feel ill at ease and question your decision to venture down this dark path. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39788}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39791}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39790}{0}{}{Marcel Marceau's Room (w,e)}{ }{      You've entered a small alcove just south of the Eiffel Tower The path is worn away here and completely hidden by a grove of bushes. This must be where all those mimes are coming from!  Marcel Marceau, the Magician of Silence, is here training young Parisiennes in the lost art of pantomime.  }{Paris: Eiffel Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34336}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {34334}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

