R {39792}{0}{<238>}{Passerelle du Temple (w,e)}{<238>===<088>}{     You're standing under a small stone bridge that runs over the Boulevard du Temple. It is very quiet here, almost too quiet. You can see the street continues to your west and a small set of stairs that winds up to the street above. You get an uneasy feeling and feel like you should quicken your pace. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
