R {39796}{0}{}{Theatre des Vampires (out,s)}{ }{      You've entered the lobby of the famed Theatre of the Vampires. It is said that a small troupe of actors live here and perform plays based upon old vampire legend. The plays are performed by invitation only. Hopefully you're one of the lucky few invited to attend. The theatre smells musty and is lit only by dim candle light. Thick, blood-red velvet curtains line the walls and a single door leads into the show. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
