R {39829}{0}{<138>}{Chambre du Santiago (nw)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{      Santiago's room is designed for confusion and deception. Mirrors line the walls making it hard for you to get your bearings. What you can make out is a room full of torturous devices. An Iron Maiden stands in the center of the room. There is a rack designed for stretching\; you could lie on that. Of course all these devices require someone to operate them. So you wouldn't be in any danger if you were alone. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
