R {39837}{0}{<138>}{Chambre du Sol (s)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{        You've stepped into a barren room of cold stone and pale moonlight shining down from a grated ceiling high above. The room is round in shape and the stone walls stretch high into the night, cold and lifeless. By the moonlight you can see that this room offers no escape. The walls are very difficult to climb and the grate is much too high to reach. You think of the vampires that had been trapped in this room and wonder at what horror the sunrise might have brought upon them had they lived to see it. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
