R {39839}{0}{<238>}{Labyrinthe du Mort (w,e)}{<238>] [<088>}{     The hall becomes darker here. Bones and dust lie under your feet, dumped from their coffins so many years ago. The people of Paris buried their dead in these underground chambers, when their cemeteries filled up. Now forgotten, they make a perfect home for some very unsavory creatures. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39833}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39840}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39840}{0}{<238>}{Labyrinthe du Mort (n,e,w)}{<238>] [<088>}{    Your footsteps echo down the darkened corridor. Shadows pass by you, cool air brushing against your face, as if something silent and invisible had just swept past. The cold stone walls seem to press in against you and you can only hope to find an exit. }{Paris: Theatre des Vampires}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39839}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
