R {39845}{0}{<228>}{A dark sewer junction (u,n,e,w,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{        A dark sewer junction Lying beneath the alley, the sewer junction leads off in all directions. Here in the pitch blackness things best left unseen have grown, with the dark waters that flow down the grate nourishing all forms of twisted life.  The walls are coated with dark slimes that glisten wetly in your light.  All around you,  the dampness of the wet stone oppresses your senses, but wafting above all other smells is the metallic tang of blood. }{Alley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22059}{u}{u}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
