R {39846}{0}{<228>}{North of the sewer junction (n,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{         North of the sewer junction Working your way down the damp, dark passage, you happen upon mounds of rotting refuse.  On further inspection however, you realize that the source of this smell is no simple sewage, but is instead towering mounds of corpses in various state of decay.  The realization strikes you like a hammer as you look down and see the mangled and torn remains of dozens of victims of whatever dwells in these sewers.  Ahead, a lone flickering light casts wandering shadows down the length of the passage.  Apparently the source of this carnage is still at work. }{Alley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39845}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {39850}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39847}{0}{<228>}{East of the sewer junction (w)}{<228>= =<088>}{        East of the sewer junction Having put the sewer junction behind you, in the gloom of the tunnel you discover that the passage ahead has been sealed.  The masonry appears to have collapsed from a mixture of age and neglect, and bars all further travel in this direction.  The blocks of stone before you are so massive that shifting them seems a greater task than an attempt to dig around them with a branching tunnel.  However, the builders inconveniently neglected to leave you their tools. }{Alley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39845}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39848}{0}{<228>}{West of the sewer junction (e)}{<228>= =<088>}{        West of the sewer junction Edging slowly into the darkness beyond the sewer junction, you approach a murky pool.  Apparently a settling pool of some sort, your light fades out before revealing the far shore of this shadowy body of water.  Peering into its depths reveals nothing, as the water is so dark and murky that only your faint reflection upon its surface is visible.  At the water's edge, the stone bears some strange signs of wear, but otherwise nothing is discernable from this position. }{Alley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39845}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39849}{0}{<228>}{South of the sewer junction (n)}{<228>= =<088>}{       South of the sewer junction Moving away from the sewer junction, you reach a point in the pipe where a metal gate prevents further access.  Anchored firmly into the rock, the gate is slick with beads of moisture collecting in the damp night air.  Beyond the gate lies further tunnels, with dropping water echoing in the distance.  A gust of air blows from deep within the shadows but carries none of the smells or sounds you seek. }{Alley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39845}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39850}{0}{<228>}{The Chamber of Horrors (s)}{<228>= =<088>}{          The Chamber of Horrors Rivulets of spilled blood trace their way slowly across the floor as you skulk into the chamber ahead.  In the flickering light of a single candle, you see the butcher of the corpses you passed working on his latest victim, a piece of meat that at one time was apparently a human woman.  In this subterranean chamber of horrors, blood and spattered organs drape themselves in horrifying patterns along the walls, apparently the cultured art of a disturbed mind.  A mind which apparently you have disturbed, as it rears up from its work to survey the area. }{Alley}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39846}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

