R {39853}{0}{}{Petting Zoo Entrance (leave,w)}{ }{     This is the entrance of a children's petting zoo.  A small shack with a turnstile beside it stands between you and the animals.  There are numerous cups filled with feed on the counter.  Next to the cups rests a sign.  A small lanky man waits behind the counter for the next person to buy a cup of feed and enter the petting zoo. }{Petting Zoo}{petting_zoo}{}{}{1.000}{1}
