R {39855}{0}{}{In The Petting Zoo (nw,n,e,w)}{ }{       Animals animals everywhere.  Big ones, little ones, fluffy ones, scruffy ones.  All around you it's animal mayhem.  Rabbits and sheep and lions oh my.... Ok so there aren't any lions, but there are chickens.  Each step you take, an animal skitters away, fearing for its life.  Crushed rock, and bits of uneaten animal feed grind underneath your feet as you move around the pen.  A chicken wire fence surrounds you keeping the animals, and you inside the pen. }{Petting Zoo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
