R {39924}{0}{}{Conservatory of Body mansion (n)}{ }{     The Conservatory You're in the conservatory of the mansion.  The conservatory is a large room full of various exotic plants.  A large sky window is in the ceiling allowing bright light to shine into the room.  The doorway to the north leads back into hallway of the mansion. }{Body Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
