R {39925}{0}{}{Art studio of Body mansion (n)}{ }{     Art Studio Several stains of paint are blotched around the studio of the Body mansion.  It would appear that Mr. Body considers himself quite an artist.  An easel with a blank canvas sits in the corner next to a small cabinet.  A window looks out over the grounds of the mansion. }{Body Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
