R {39926}{0}{}{Outside 11 Melville Terrace (leave,n)}{ }{      You are standing on a badly paved path that leads to a weathered red door.  Above the door you can see a large set of windows, but you cannot see inside from here.  The path is lined on either side by a low iron fence that separates you from what some would describe as gardens.  The door has the number 'eleven' on it in brass numbers.  On the wall just to the left of the door is a panel with buttons on it. }{11 Melville Terrace}{11_mellville_terrace}{}{}{1.000}{1}
