R {39928}{0}{}{On the stairs, outside 1F1 (u,n,s)}{ }{       It's quite dark here on the landing outside flat 1F1.  Colours are muted and the greyness of the stone stairs is depressing. The only illumination comes from a skylight way overhead.  An electric light has been thoughtfully installed on the wall, but it appears to be purely ornamental as it's not on.  In front of you stands a door painted a most overwhelming blue colour.  You notice a bit of paper pinned to the door. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
