R {39929}{0}{}{Outside 2F1 (u,d)}{ }{    This is the landing just outside flat 2F1, it seems somehow cleaner than the one outside the flat below.  The stairwell is a bit brighter here as you are nearer the skylight.  Just to your left is the door to flat 2F1, which is a deep red colour. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
