R {39930}{0}{}{The Hall (newbog,s,e,oldbog,n,nw,w,se,ne,sw)}{ }{      The hall is a pretty big room.  It has a polished wooden floor and light blue walls.  There are ten doors leading off the hall in various directions, all of them seem to be painted the same violent blue as the front door.  You glance around and see an old wardrobe standing against the west wall, a bike leaning on the north wall and a small telephone stand, which has a telephone on it. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
