R {39931}{0}{}{The new bog. (out)}{ }{     This room used to be a large cupboard but has been converted to a shower room and bog.  The shower is about 2.5 feet square with glass doors.  The sink in this room is pretty small because the room itself is not very big.  The toilet next to the sink is a cheap plastic affair. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39932}{0}{}{Jennie's Room (w)}{ }{       This is Jennie's room, it's a fairly decent size but not huge.  There's a double bed against the west wall, windows in the east wall and some shelves against the north wall.  This room is fairly tidy and the walls are covered with posters and postcards and so on.  The shelves have various small ornaments on them and a particularly odd mirror hangs on one wall.  There is a weird smell in this room, not a bad smell, just weird. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39933}{0}{}{The Old Bog (out)}{ }{    This is the old bathroom.  It has a bath on your left which has an electric shower in it.  Beyond that is a toilet and a large sink.  The walls and floor are a bit dilapidated compared to the rest of the flat. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39934}{0}{}{Richard's Room (s)}{ }{    This is Richard's room, it has a desk just to the right of the door, a wardrobe just behind that and a double bed next to the window.  The walls are a cool green colour and adorned with a poster of a timberwolf.  There are some clothes on the floor. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39935}{0}{}{Doug's Room (se)}{ }{      Doug's room is quite big, but the piles of clothing all over the floor make it seem smaller than it really is because there are so few places you can safely stand.  There is a double bed in one corner, a hideous pink chest of drawers against the wall and a desk with a PC on it in another corner.  The wardrobe has been pulled away from the wall for no explicable reason.  A saxophone lies on an ugly old rocking chair. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39936}{0}{}{Andrea's Room (e)}{ }{     This is Andrea's room, it's really small.  It only has a single bed in it and a small desk.  There is a sink in the corner near the window.  There are bits of heather and other plants on the walls and an unusual indian rug or blanket like thing provides decoration and covering for one wall. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39937}{0}{}{Andrew's room (nw)}{ }{       Andrew's room is a pretty big room, way bigger than the other rooms in the flat.  The light is provided by large windows in the east wall.  Around the room you see a dresser, a large wardrobe and a double bed.  There is also a table with a PC and stereo on it, 3 chairs sit in front of the PC.  The south wall has a gas fireplace in it which has a Scalectrix set laid out in front of it.  The walls are painted a pleasant yellow and there is a green carpet beneath your feet. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39938}{0}{}{The Living Room (sw)}{ }{       A large airy room with a pleasant bay window in the corner.  This is the sitting room and houses a couple of couches and an armchair.  There is a television and VCR in front of the couches and a smallish dining table surrounded by chairs near the window.  There are some shelves in one corner that are filled with games and videos.  The floor is somewhat less than clean and there's an empty pizza box or three behind or under some of the chairs. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {39939}{0}{}{The Kitchen (ne)}{ }{         The first thing that hits you when you walk into the kitchen is the colour scheme.  The walls and cupboards are painted in bright, primary colours.  Red, green, blue and yellow assault your eyes.  The second thing that hits you is the smell of onion as you realise Richard has again failed to put his sandwich ingredients away.  There is a table and some chairs in the center of the room and a sink by the window.  The refrigerator hums menacingly near the door.  Overhead a drying rack plays host to a small percentage of Doug's grey t-shirt collection. }{11 Melville Terrace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {39930}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

