R {40231}{0}{<248>}{A Great Hall in the Dungeon (e,w)}{<248># #<088>}{        The most obvious features here are the large structures placed right in the middle of and against the west wall of the room. Squatting, like some sort of recreational focus of the room, in the middle of the floor, is an enormous stretching rack. Slightly less prominent, but eye-catching still, is the huge wooden gallows sitting on the west side of the room. Tunnels lead in here from the east and west. An engraving in the dust reads: Sarge was here. }{NetHack}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
