R {40232}{0}{<248>}{A Junction in the Dungeon (se,ne,e)}{<248># #<088>}{    Cavernous passages lead into this massive hall from the east, northeast, and southeast. Cries of horror and pain echo through the passages. Gusts of wind roll in and out of the various passages like a mass of hurried ghosts. }{NetHack}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
