R {40865}{0}{}{On top of the table (s,w)}{ }{     You climbed the waste basket, jumped to the chair, dangled on the drawer and reached the top of the table alive. You look around and the view is spectacular even though it is a merely giant room, the size of everything leaves you in awe. On the table you see a box of... hmmm... chocolates. But you have a feeling that something is very wrong here. }{A Gigantic Bedroom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
