R {40866}{0}{}{Mary Kelly's Room (out)}{E}{        You have entered a room that is straight out of a nightmare.  The first thing you can make out is red, everywhere.  Blood has been splashed about the room with such ferocity that it is difficult to even make out what lies underneath it all.  You can see a simple wooden chair, a chest of drawers and a bed.  All of them are drenched, but it is the bed that is the most disturbing, what can only be described as 'remains' lie atop it, a body so badly mutilated that it is only vaguely human-shaped at all.   }{Old London}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
