R {40870}{0}{}{Bennebroek Manor courtyard (s,n)}{ }{        The imposing, columned facade of Bennebroek Manor dominates the north end of the courtyard, its east and west wings enclosing the courtyard on either side of you. Up above, fleecy, white clouds amble lazily across the sky, and a slight wind gently stirs your hair. In the center of the courtyard, three lions sit in repose facing each other, their jaws pouring streams of water into a marble basin. Tall wrought-iron gates lie open to the south, beyond which a dusty road is visible. }{Bennebroek Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
