R {40874}{0}{}{In a large foyer (u,e,s,w)}{ }{         The vaulted ceiling of the grand foyer rises up two stories, its corners lost in darkness. In the center, a crystal chandelier shimmers and dances with the light of a thousand candles that reflect softly off of the buffed, hardwood floor. The hall is adorned with two floral paintings that are easily a full story high. Beyond the paintings are two small entryways. At the end of the foyer, a massive oak staircase with red carpeting divides diagonally up to the second floor. Centered directly above the mid-floor landing, an enormous portrait of a gentleman looks down on you with a stern visage. }{Bennebroek Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
