R {40875}{0}{}{On a staircase landing (d,e,w)}{ }{     This perch affords you the perfect view of either the sweeping grand foyer below you, or else a close-up of the nose of the giant portrait on the wall. The chandelier, which is suspended from a great height, is almost directly opposite you.  The staircase rises to the east and west up to the second floor, or descends south to the foyer below. }{Bennebroek Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
