R {40876}{0}{}{An elegant conservatory (nw,w,s)}{ }{       The conservatory is bright and airy, with a high ceiling, tall windows, and a low white carpet. Rich heavy blue drapes form a natural backdrop behind a harpsichord at the east end of the room. Finely upholstered sofas and chairs are set around the room, and paintings of baroque-style tulips decorate the walls. A set of double French doors leads to the manor gardens to the northwest, and tall bookshelves are visible just beyond a doorway to the south.  }{Bennebroek Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
