R {40878}{0}{}{The manor garden (enter,sw,se)}{ }{       A patio leads from two double French doors out onto a wide lawn that is bordered by neatly trimmed hedges. Small insects and bees dart low over the grass, their tiny wings glinting in the sunlight. A few feet away from the manor, an oblong flowerbed hosts an array of brilliant colored flowers. In the center of the garden, an octagonal glass gazebo is surrounded by long, elegant tulips that bob gently in the wind.  }{Bennebroek Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
