R {40882}{0}{}{In a hallway (e,s)}{ }{     It is quiet and dim in this section of the hallway. Portraits of maternal ancestors line the north wall, with lanterns casting gentle illumination between them. The most striking feature of the hall is a full-length portrait of a lady on the west wall. A closed door lies to the south.                                                            }{Bennebroek Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
