R {40992}{0}{}{Guard Room (ne)}{ }{      You are standing in the Guard Room, where all the king's men rest after a hard day of egg reparation.  There is a small table with two chairs providing a place for the men to sit and eat.  There is a cot in the corner of the room in case someone wants to take a quick nap.  Other than that, it is an austere environment reflecting the self-discipline of the men for whom it was created. }{Humpty Dumpty}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
