R {40993}{0}{}{Royal Infirmary (nw)}{ }{       You are standing in the Royal Infirmary, a stark white room that appears to be a mix between a hospital and a wizard's workshop.  Wooden tables run along all of the walls supporting a collection of alchemy glassware.  The air is filled with chemical odors and the sounds of arcane machinery.  Humpty Dumpty lies on a large cot in the center of the room with a myriad of tubes and wires connected to every available inch of his eggshell. }{Humpty Dumpty}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
