R {40994}{0}{}{Castle Hall (nw,s,ne)}{ }{    You have reached the end of the Royal Castle's main hallway.  The white granite walls and columns of marble continue here.  Two archways lead to the castle towers to the northwest and the northeast.  The hall continues to the south. }{Humpty Dumpty}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
