R {40996}{0}{}{Royal Kitchen (s)}{ }{     You have entered the Royal Kitchen, an area in the midst of complete chaos.  Flour and sugar coat every available inch of counter space.  The floor is covered with broken wine bottles and spilt milk.  Pots, pans, and cooking utensils have been scattered all over the kitchen.  Someone, or something, has certainly been busy here. }{Humpty Dumpty}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
