R {40997}{0}{}{Throne Room (se)}{ }{     You are standing in King Albert's throne room.  A dark yellow rug leads from where you stand, across an inlaid white wood floor, to a dais of white marble.  Atop the dais sits a throne made of ivory encrusted with yellow sapphires, garnets, and diamonds.  An exit to the southeast leads back to the main hallway. }{Humpty Dumpty}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
