R {41117}{0}{}{The Great Hall (n,s,e,w)}{ }{         You are in the Great Hall of the Fraggles.  This is an enormous cave that has served as the gathering place for the Fraggles for many years.  Actually, the hall is probably not all that big, but it sure seems that way now that you are small.  Light enters the cavern from some sort of opening high high above you, but it is fairly dark here at ground level.  Just off to the west you see a large pond where occasionally Fraggles gather to entertain themselves.  Near you, in the center of the hall, is a very large horn of some sort. }{Fraggle Rock}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
