R {41125}{0}{}{Wonder Mountain (s)}{ }{         You emerge from the tunnel and stand high atop Wonder Mountain, with a clear view of the countryside for many miles around.  From this high up, the vista is truly awe-inspiring and apparently this is the best place to view the Aurora Fragglialis, an awesome spectacle that results in a beautifully colored sky. Indeed, right now the Aurora shimmers magically in the sky above you, dazzling you with shimmering bright colors.  You stand in awe of the spectacle, colors hanging in the sky like cloth, almost palpable like something you could pull from the heavens and don as a costume. }{Fraggle Rock}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
