R {41153}{0}{}{A small military office (exit)}{ }{       The building is small and bare, more unremarkable on the inside than even the plain outside had hinted at.  The only thing of interest in the entire place is Sergeant Sausage, pacing up and down (not so much pacing as hopping - but you get the idea) the short length of the building whilst glaring in your direction.  Oh dear.  He is blocking the way back to the door, leaving you only one option if you want to escape. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
