R {41156}{0}{}{One of a string of sausages (enter,next)}{ }{     The inside of a huge string of sausages is all around, and it's not pleasant!  Viscous, fatty fluid seems to coat the walls, ceiling and floor, all of which are squishy sausage-meat.  It looks like it is possible to travel along the string of sausages, though they are all probably the same. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
