R {41158}{0}{}{In a sausage (last,next)}{ }{     The second in a giant string of sausages, which is disappointingly like the first.  The same fatty fluid coats every surface, and the same stench of meat fills the air.  Another sausage lies up ahead, looking exactly the same as the last.  How long could a string of sausages be anyway? }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
