R {41161}{0}{}{Inside a Giant String of Sausages (last,next)}{ }{     Surprisingly, the third sausage in the giant string is not at all different to the first two, stinky and damp.  Sausages are beginning to be really annoying, with their "I'm meatier than thou" attitude and their big smelly oils.  More of the same lies ahead by the looks of things, with another sausage strung on to this one. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
