R {41163}{0}{}{One of a string of sausages (last,next)}{ }{       Fat and meat, meat and fat.  Sausages have a pretty simple life really, apart from wanting to take over the world of course.  The stench of the inside of this giant string of sausages seems to be getting worse if that's possible, making the air thick, heavy, and difficult to breathe.  Up ahead is another sausage, but I wouldn't hold out too much hope of it holding something different if I were you. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
