R {41165}{0}{}{Inside a Giant String of Sausages (last,next)}{ }{     This string of sausages is huge, and I mean HUGE.  You've been trudging your way through it for quite some time, and there is no end in sight, just more bloody sausages.  Thankfully the string seems to be quite inert, though the meat itself looks a little too lively to be normal. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
