R {41167}{0}{}{In a sausage (last)}{ }{     Having finally reached the end of the giant string of sausages, it is eminently disappointing to see that this sausage looks no different from all the rest.  What an anti-climax.  And it's just as stinky, assaulting your poor nasal passages with its offensive stench.  Oh well, looks like a long trip back along the sausages for you. }{The Sausage Dimensions}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
