R {41170}{0}{}{Used Car Lot (nw,exit,w)}{ }{         This dank used car lot seems to hold onto the old stereotype about used car lots. While a few cars up front seem well cared for, the majority of the cars, trucks, and SUVs appear to be in need of repair. The lot itself extends westward, the worth and viability decreasing the farther you look. The occasional customer can be seen browsing quickly through the inventory, probably trying to get through before they encounter an unscrupulous salesman. The gravel on the lot needs to be redone, as the tiny rocks have just descended into the dirt, rather than covering it. }{Used Car Lot}{used_car_lot}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41171}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41173}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {3580}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41171}{0}{}{Used Car Lot (se,w,s)}{ }{       The exit to the lot is within sight to the southeast, and escape is within reach. The vehicles are what would be expected when one entered a used car lot. Each car, truck, or SUV has been washed and detailed in an attempt to make it more pleasing to the eye, and in turn more likely to sell. Customers wander through the rows, peeking in windows, and kicking tires as it were, to find just the right junker to take home with them. The gravel ground is maintained poorly. }{Used Car Lot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41170}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41173}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
