R {41172}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {41173}{0}{}{Used Car Lot (n,w,e)}{ }{        The farther away from the entrance you move, the more you notice the lack of quality in the cars themselves. The best you see here are some used sedans and sub-compacts, in fairly decent bodily condition, but in need of having one or two dents pounded out of the body. The really odd thing is the really outrageous prices stickered for the quality of the vehicles that are here. Even the couple of used trucks here look like they have seen better days, and are not likely to haul much at all in their rusted beds. }{Used Car Lot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41170}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41171}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41174}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41174}{0}{}{Used Car Lot (e,n)}{ }{        Here in the back corner of the lot are all the rust bucket, broken down lemons the lot can't sell, so they use them for spare parts. Although the quality of said parts would be suspect at best. The smell of old oil, coolant, gasoline, and other vehicle fluid wells up from under each vehicle here. There is not another soul around in this dump ground which, with the chilly air about you, brings a shiver to you. While there is gravel covering the rest of the lot, the ground here has been neglected and is just deep slimy mud. }{Used Car Lot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41173}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41175}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41175}{0}{}{Used Car Lot (s,e)}{ }{       The sea of broken down cars and trucks at this end of the lot is astounding. While the vehicles are not rusted out, they simply don't run. The gravel has given into the muddy foundation and allowed itself to be covered completely. The salesmen and customers tend to avoid this section of the lot, although there seems to be no real reason to do so. Maybe there is something you are missing, but it seems safe enough. }{Used Car Lot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41171}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41174}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
