R {41176}{0}{}{A Dark Cavernous Trunk (out)}{ }{       Climbing into the trunk, you find it darker than you expected even from the outside. Junk litters the floor beneath you, along with an old tire iron, and a small pneumatic jack. The smell is enough to make anyone sick, being a combination of new car smell and cat urine. It is probably an attempt by the lot owners to make the car smell nice again, although anyone could smell the fact that it really didn't work. }{Used Car Lot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
