R {41178}{0}{}{Inside the ceiling (d)}{ }{    Climbing around the rafters in the small dim space between the roof and the ceiling, you come upon an open area. Devoid of any objects which might have made this area habitable, you conclude that its occupant only resides here temporarily. Maybe it is used as some sort of cell. }{Beavis and Butthead}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
