R {41181}{0}{}{A waiting room (out,e)}{ }{       You have entered what appears to be the waiting room of a small doctor's office.  There is a small desk in the corner of the room where a young secretary usually sits.  There are several couches and chairs on the southern and northern walls, and a table covered with magazines is in the center of the room. At the east end of the room there is an exit that appears to lead into the doctor's office. }{Innerspace}{innerspace}{}{}{1.000}{1}
