R {41216}{0}{}{The skull (s)}{ }{    You are now in the skull of Mr. Plank.  You feel very cramped, as there is very little extra space in here.  The brain occupies a large percentage of the skull cavity, and the rest is filled with spinal fluid, in which the brain floats. }{Innerspace}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
