R {41217}{0}{}{River of Babylon (out)}{ }{      You find yourself next to a large flowing river with the sound of running water filling the air. The water is clear and you notice numerous small pebbles in the riverbed. Tall reeds surround the river and the air smells clean and fresh. Tiny fish dart back and forth and dragonflies flick speedily over the water. From further downstream you can hear the faint singing of a despondent people.  }{The Black Case}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17713}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41218}{0}{}{A smoky campfire (out)}{ }{     You find yourself sitting with a group of teenagers. They surround a campfire and are singing Kum by ya. Half cooked marshmallows are burning and dripping off sticks over the fire. You can smell sausages and bread cooking in foil in the ashes. The smoke is blowing into your face and the night is warm with a star filled sky. }{The Black Case}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17713}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41219}{0}{}{A shadowy field (out)}{ }{     In the dim light you sense you're in a grassy field. The field extends to the horizon in all directions.  Crickets chirp noisily all around and you can hear the faint hooting of an owl. The grass rustles and sways softly in a light wind. Lying back, you gaze up into the dark sky. A single spark twinkles in the distance. }{The Black Case}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {17713}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41220}{0}{}{Meat for all (out)}{ }{     You've entered a dingy meat shop. The smell of rancid meat fills the air. A counter splits the space and on it the cash register is sitting open and empty. Piles of thin white paper litter the ground and butcher's knives are sitting atop a blood stained chopping block. A large side of lamb hangs from a hook in the back of the room. }{The Black Case}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
