R {41229}{0}{}{The treble bar (e)}{ }{     Five parallel lines cross a pure white floor. A hash clings to the fifth black line and two number fours stretch from the first to the third and the third to the fifth line respectively. The letter 'f' is scrawled beneath the first line. Gazing upwards all you can see is pure white light. To the east the lines seem to continue forever. }{The Black Case}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
