R {41230}{0}{}{The quaver race (w,e,s)}{ }{    The air is filled with the smell of sweat and the blur of black notes flying past. A stream of quavers are sprinting along the five black lines in various directions. The quavers scream for you to move out of the way. You might trip them up! }{The Black Case}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
