R {41237}{0}{}{The dissonant bar (w,e)}{ }{      You're standing on a flat, white surface. Five thin black lines run parallel across the floor and two thicker lines run along the left and right of the room. The thick lines are perpendicular to the thin lines. Occasionally a quaver races past, or the sound of a marching band filters in from the east. You gaze upwards and see nothing but intense light. }{The Black Case}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
