R {41326}{0}{}{Plains of Ra (out)}{ }{      You are standing in the middle of what would normally be a joyous riot of land color in  the midst of a small cottonwood copse.  But fear and loathing possess you as you sense the profound horror and wrongness to which this woods has been treated. The largest and most hideous Kresh you have ever seen rears up before you.  It almost seems to be laughing at you.  Or sneering! }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41319}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

