R {41328}{0}{<238>}{Ravine Clearing (e,nw)}{<238>. .<088>}{     You are stunned to find yourself in a large grotto, with massive ramps cutting deeply upwards into the Southrons, letting the pure light of the sun grace the clearing.  The roar of the waterfall is now a gentle throbbing under your feet.  To the east you can see the cave-dwellings of the Ramen. }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
