R {41329}{0}{<248>}{Manhome (n,w,s)}{<248>% %<088>}{       You are just inside the lip of a cave that leads outside to a broad clearing.  The cave is huge, graced with a massive bonfire in the middle.  Around the bonfire to the east ramen dancers celebrate the Ranyhyn with intricate dances while in the four corners of the cavern you can see a Ramen Elder.  You have found Manhome, where the Ramen old and young study and learn the ways of the Ranyhyn. }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
