R {41371}{0}{}{The Freshness Gallery (out,n,e,w,s)}{ }{      The gallery is a large and grand place where fine art from all across  the world is displayed.  The gallery floor is made from polished white  stone.  The walls themselves are made out of quartz flecked marble,  and the glass ceiling is supported by pillars of blue stone.   Colored stone arches lead off to other parts of the gallery, to  the east, west, north, and south.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
