R {41372}{0}{}{Down a city street in Fresh City (n,s,mall)}{ }{       Traveling further down the street, you notice a visible improvement  in the quality of businesses around here.  Glass skyscrapers and  new brick apartment buildings tower over the street.  Along the  street are parking meters, and nearly every spot is occupied.   Across the street, you can see a construction site where a new  highrise is being built.  Next to this construction site is the  local mall, Freshcity Shopping Complex.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
