R {41373}{0}{}{Le Snoteaux Cafe (out)}{ }{      The Le Snoteaux Cafe is a typical French style open air cafe,  from the way it's designed to the patrons that frequent this  establishment.  There are tables of businessmen that you saw outside,  but entering the actual cafe, you notice a lot of freaks with  floppy hats seated at the tables, barely touching meals with  weird French names.  }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41370}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41370}{w}{out}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41374}{0}{}{A Wedding in Fresh City (n,park)}{ }{       A large row of green hedge is here, on the right side of the  street, but does not block the view of a spectacular wedding  taking place.  There are plenty of people sitting down, crying,  smiling, and whispering in low tones.  It is a beautiful spring  day out, perfect for such an occasion.  On the left side of the  street is Fresh City Park, a fine place to spend such a sunny  afternoon.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41370}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
