R {41375}{0}{}{Further down a city street in Fresh City (n,s,club)}{ }{          Continuing down the street, you spot more of the same growth in  the city's economy.  The government must really be pumping some  money into this area.  Large highrises and skyscrapers of major  corporations tower above you.  Here, there is a major intersection  of streets, with a traffic light above it.  Painted crosswalks  are on the intersection, but the motorists blantantly ignore them  (and the law) in an attempt to get wherever it is they're going.   The Freshnight Club, Fresh City's swinging nightclub, is on  your side of the street, and it looks like there is some  commotion going on inside there.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
