R {41376}{0}{}{Fresh City Shopping Complex (out)}{ }{     The mall today is crowded with people shopping around for the best  deals, which is sort of paradoxical, because the best deals aren't  found in a mall.  In the mall, you recognize some of the familiar  stores, like Fresh & Full of Life, Mentos'R'Us, The Pack, and J. C.   Pieces.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
