R {41377}{0}{}{Fresh City Airport (s)}{ }{      This area is outside the Fresh City Airport, where flights from  all over the globe come and go daily.  You are outside the airport,  where the non-carry on baggage is being loaded.  A baggage cart stands  by with a load to be put in the cargo section of a jumbo jet.  It  appears that this particular flight will be launching in the next  10 minutes or so.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41375}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41378}{0}{}{Freshnight Club (backstage,out)}{ }{       The nightclub is jammed pack full of people today, because the  Freshmakers, a hot new alternative band, are here for one night  only.  Media and fanatics pack the place, making it hard to breathe  and nearly impossible to move around the place.  The place is under  heavy surveilance by bouncers wherever you look.  Music from the  band is screaming through the amps, and there's a mosh pit going  on down below.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
