R {41379}{0}{}{Backstage at the Freshnight Club (stage)}{ }{       The backstage at the Freshnight Club is kind of grungy and dirty.  A couple of cheap lights hang above, on the ceiling.  The Freshmakers are getting ready to wrap up their concert here  at the Freshnight Club.  Their concert truck is being loaded by  male groupies.  The band is sitting at a table, relaxing with a few  beers.  A bunch of female groupies are fawning over them.  Security  is very tight here.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
