R {41387}{0}{}{The south end of the Mentos Gallery (n)}{ }{    The southern end of the Mentos Gallery is strangely quiet.  Your  footsteps echo off the dazzling white stone floor.  The marble  walls are bare of any art and reflect sunlight coming from  the glass roof above.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
