R {41389}{0}{}{The east end of the Mentos Art Gallery (w)}{ }{      The eastern end of the Art Gallery was just opened last week,  and is very popular.  The white stone is this room is good as new and  completely dust free.  There are benches and chairs for people to admire  the new artwork that has been placed here.  A couple of easels are set up  around the fringes of the room.  The glass roof above allows  sunlight to pour into the room.   }{Mentos}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41371}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

