R {41395}{0}{}{On a monorail (exit)}{ }{       You feel a rush of excitement as you look around the monorail car.  You're not sure exactly where this thing is going to stop, but you know that it's going to be someplace good!  Over the public address system you can hear a pre-recorded message droning on about the Disney monorail system that has been in operation since 1973 in Disney World. You can look out of the windows of the monorail.  There is a small sign affixed over a button next to the door. }{Disney World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
