R {41398}{0}{}{Magic Kingdom monorail terminal (n,board)}{ }{         You stand on the monorail platform at the Magic Kingdom.  There are steel gates here that serve to guide people into pen-like areas to wait for monorails that pass through this station.  You can hear the Mickey Mouse club theme song playing over the public address system in this beautifully appointed station.  Looking around it is hard to believe how clean this place is.  There is a sign hanging down from the ceiling.  There is a ramp to the north that leads down from the platform.  Rising above the trees to the north you can see the spires of Cinderella's castle. }{Disney World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
