R {41399}{0}{}{Magic Kingdom ticket counter (n,s)}{ }{     The Magic Kingdom seems strangely quiet today.  You expected there to be quite a crowd here, but you seem to be all alone.  There is a machine of some kind here.  To the north are the entry gates to the Magic Kingdom.  To the south you can see a ramp leading up to the monorail station. }{Disney World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
