R {41403}{0}{<278>}{An intersection in the Magic Kingdom (n,w,e,s)}{<278>-+-<088>}{          This intersection is the central point in the Magic Kingdom.  The air around you is filled with the delicious scent of fresh flowers and freshly cut grass.  You can hear birds twittering nearby.  There are groups of tourists scattered here and there taking photographs and others that are marching resolutely toward the next major attraction.  From here, you can proceed to Tomorrowland (east), to Frontierland (west), to Mainstreet, U.S.A. (south) or to Cinderella's Castle and Fantasyland (north).  There is a large circular planting in the center of the intersection.  To the north you can see Cinderella's Castle rising high into the sky. }{Disney World}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
