R {41480}{0}{}{Epcot Plaza (w,e)}{ }{         The plaza here is shaded by buildings to the north and south.  A colorful mural on the wall of the north building depicts the progression of scientific advancements that have lead to space travel. The first pictures to the left show men who must be Orville and Wilbur Wright flying off of a cliff in Kittyhawk.  The next shows a man waving out of a single engine plane while wearing a scarf and leather cap.  To the right the progression ends with a picture of one of the Apollo landers approaching the moon and finally a picture of the International Space Station.  A large fountain is visible to the east. }{Epcot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
