R {41495}{0}{}{Spaceship Earth (u,d)}{ }{     You stand in a large round reception area.  The floor is carpeted with a deep red carpet and a brass rail runs around the edge of the room, about four feet off of the floor.  The ceiling is difficult to see because of the dim lighting, but it appears to be painted black and about four feet above your head. }{Epcot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
