R {41497}{0}{}{The Late Cretaceous (u)}{ }{         The carpeted pathway that you are standing on seems completely out of place since, as far as you can tell, it appears to run through a dense jungle.  The pathway continues up.  The jungle around you is teaming with life and you can hear the evidence of what sound like thousands of crickets and insects in addition to the distant sounds of heavy footfalls.  Large leafy ferns surround the path on both sides, preventing you from leaving the pathway.  Overall, the plants seem a bit smaller than they were in the early cretaceous, though the animals sound a bit bigger. }{Epcot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
