R {41498}{0}{}{The Ice Age (u)}{ }{     The carpeted pathway that you are standing on seems completely out of place since, as far as you can tell, it appears to run through a snow filled waste.  Traces of snow and ice have blown across the carpet in some places, making the carpet look a bit slick.  The snow filled tundra around you is barren. }{Epcot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
