R {41499}{0}{}{Post Ice Age (u)}{ }{      The carpeted pathway that you are standing on seems completely out of place since, as far as you can tell, it appears to run through a rain forest.  Enormous trees rise to dizzying heights with thick vines dangling between them.  Sunlight filters down through the humid air, creating bright patches between the boles of the trees.  Creepers and vines of all kinds fight for survival on the densely covered ground. }{Epcot}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
