R {41548}{0}{<118>}{A black void}{ }{    You are in an almost empty, black void. There is no ceiling, no floor, no walls, nothing except for won solitary multicoloured marble. The marble hovers constantly at eye level, and always just out of your reach. }{Dayln's Mind}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
