R {41550}{0}{<118>}{A mountain peak}{ }{      An ocean of white clouds flows below you, thankfully preventing you from seeing just how high up you are on this mountain ledge. It looks as if this is as far up as you can go. The jagged peak of the mountain and bright, clear, blue sky are all that remain above you. You probably shouldn't remain in this thin atmosphere for long\; it would be unhealthy. }{Dayln's Mind}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
