R {41551}{0}{<118>}{A quiet dining room}{ }{     A small, round table for two sits in the middle of this little dining room. All the lights have been turned off, leaving the flickering candles to cast there romantic glow around the room. Judging from the heavenly aromas drifting in from the archway, one would assume the kitchen is to the south. }{Dayln's Mind}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
