R {41650}{0}{}{The love shack, baby! (s)}{ }{   What the hell is going on?  You're inside the B-52's video 'Love Shack'! That eccentric Matt Sweetboots must have gotten an interactive T.V.!  Here comes Fred Schneider now! }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22569}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41651}{0}{}{A land of happy clouds (s)}{ }{          Ahh, it's a beautiful day outside.  The sun is shining, and the only clouds in the sky are happily cumulus. In fact, the setting would be perfect, if not for the fact that you are still inside and there are no windows in the room.  You approach the walls and touch those happy clouds with your hands.  It's amazing what a great painter can do. Well, as long as you're here, you might as well sit back  and enjoy the view.  As you admire the scenery, you notice a small doorway on the south wall.  Krat     Reboot: 7.2 days [00:00:01]  Controller: None  }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41652}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41652}{0}{}{A relaxation room (n,e,w)}{ }{         Well! This is certainly low-key compared to the room you were just in! There's a psychiatrist's couch in the corner and the southern wall is covered with the word 'RELAX'. It seems Tula had some problems with anxiety and needed her own space. Everybody needs to be by themselves once in a while and with her family, why the hell should she be an exception.  There's a couple of doorways, one goes west and the other has found peace and tranquility being on the eastern wall. There's a bright light coming from the north too. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41651}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41653}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41654}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41653}{0}{}{Playground (w)}{ }{         A lot of great memories find their origin in this room. You have just entered a child's dream.  Playground equipment lies over the entire sixty by sixty room.  There's one of those platforms that are set up on springs, so when you step on it you jiggle around!  There is also a jungle gym, and a set of monkey bars! Sigh.  You never were very good at those.  Oooh, there's a slide!  No McDonalds never had an outdoor playground as cool as this!  Tula used to take Matt Sweetboots here when he was younger. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41652}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {22572}{slide on slide}{slide on slide}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41654}{0}{}{Tula's kitchen (e)}{ }{              Yes, tis true, even Tula had vices which she could not overcome. Tula enjoyed making (and eating) sandwiches of all sorts. As a result of her craving, she felt a need to have her own kitchen, one where she would not be disturbed while engaging in her passion.  There lies a refrigerator in the corner.  It appears to be in working condition. There are also some cabinets lining the walls filled with sandwich making utensils, you speculate.  You notice that a keyhole finds its residence on each cabinet door.  There's also a microwave which,  Krat     Reboot: 7.2 days [00:00:01]  Controller: None  unfortunately, has toppled from its perch on a kitchen table. Perhaps it was a victim of Tula's insistence that she had 'everything under control'.  In any case, a doorway lies to the east. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41652}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41655}{0}{}{The bedroom of Vinnie (s)}{ }{      This place is full of sexual devices.  It's revolting even to look at.  So... you try not to.  You see a bed in the northwest corner of the seemingly tiny room.  Looking past a set of shackles you see a mirror, and also there's a rack of torture and pain-- wait.  Forget about that.  This is definitely a well-furnished room. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22571}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41656}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41656}{0}{}{Stone stairway down (d,u)}{ }{      The dampness seeps through your armour as you descend via the stairs. You shiver for a moment and look around. What could this be? The entire area appears to be made out of stone and there lies an unlit torch on the wall. All of this looks very foreign to the Sweetboots home. Where's the pink? }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41655}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41657}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41657}{0}{}{Dungeon Entrance (s,u)}{ }{     This is the entrance to Vinnie's dungeon. It doesn't look very cheerful.  There's no pink wallpaper.  There's no B-52's. You feel like crying.  The dampness seeps further into your bones and you don't feel very well.  The stairway leads back up and the corridor continues south. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41656}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41658}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41658}{0}{}{Corridor bend (e,n)}{ }{            Somehow, you've managed to get used to the dreariness of this place.  You don't feel quite as ill as before. Not a bad looking room really, just needs a coat of paint (pink, of course), but otherwise it seems pretty well furnished and -from what you've seen of Vinnie- done to his style. Look at all that exercise equipment! Tun-gai Hirroshima can usually be found here too.  He and Vinnie have an agreement.  If Tun-gai leaves Vinnie alone, Vinnie won't kill him, and Tun-gai can use his exercise equipment.  It stands to reason. It's perfectly logical.  The corridor continues east and you can see a set of stairs to the north. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41657}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41659}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41659}{0}{}{Torture chamber (w)}{ }{      Odd.  The room is filled with devices of torture. Literally filled with them!  Yet that's not the odd part.  After all, you were expecting something like this.  The strange thing is, this room does not bear the touch of Vinnie. Indeed, it appears that Vinnie has not visited this place for a very long time. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41658}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41660}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {41657}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41661}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {41657}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41662}{0}{}{A broom closet (w)}{ }{      You have just entered a broom closet. True, it's a big broom closet, but a broom closet nonetheless. Looking around, it does not surprise you to see several brooms. Eerily, these brooms, lining all four walls, seem to be quite animated and give you a chilling feeling similar to the first time you saw 'The Sorceror's Apprentice' in the Disney classic, 'Fantasia.' }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {22557}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41663}{0}{}{stairway down (d,e)}{ }{     Well, it comes as no great surprise that you find the top of a staircase at the top of the stairs. You still feel very bad about stepping on that beautiful carpet though. Oh well, time enough for penance later. Another hallway seems to pick up again to the east. }{Sweetboots' House}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {41664}{0}{}{Horror (s,w)}{ }{           This room looks substantially different from how you last saw it, the once neatly ordered and maintained room has been replaced by what you can only describe as absolute horror.  The boring-grey cement walls are now stained and dripping with blood, barely an inch is left untouched by the sickening gore.  The floor is a mixture of bloody, dismembered bodies and mangled lab equipment, all jumbled together in a grizzly display.  Live cables torn from their sockets buzz and spark, burning flesh and anything else they come in contact with, filling the air with a sickening stench, almost as horrifying as the scene before you.  The lights flicker on and off overhead, teasing you with moments of darkness, moments in which you shudder involuntarily at the possibility of becoming part of this pseudo-reality horror. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41665}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41666}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41665}{0}{}{Main test room (n,w,s)}{ }{        The evidence of slaughter and destruction is much less apparent here, this room must have been deserted when the intruders entered.  Bloody footprints lead from the torn-open north door, leading both south and west.  Several desks appear to have been knocked over, while the remaining upright ones did not escape some mistreatment, as large chunks can be seen torn out of them. Faint blood-splatters can be seen all over the walls, hard to see on the already blackened tiles.  Fortunately the smell here is not as bad, but that ever-present hint of death still lingers ominously. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41664}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41668}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41669}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41666}{0}{}{Barracks room (w,e)}{ }{          More death and carnage awaits you here, the slaughter having continued unabated into this room.  This was obviously a barracks of some kind, and judging by the twisted, mangled remains of the bunk-beds strewn about the room, home to roughly twenty people.  As with the room outside, blood and gore cover everything\; severed human limbs and innards are strewn about the area like abstract art.  While the stench here is not as bad, it is still strong and overpowering, and also surprisingly fresh.  The few blood-covered fluorescent lights that remain hanging from the ceiling, cast the room into a mass of deep shadows\; shadows that could be hiding horrors that your imagination is working overtime at producing. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41664}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41667}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41667}{0}{}{Armoury (e)}{ }{        This must be the armoury for the lab's security forces, as the walls are lined from floor to ceiling with glass windowed cabinets, housing an impressive array of machine guns, pistols, and hand-to-hand combat weapons. The floor here is covered with a thin black carpet, unstained by the blood which paints the barracks room to the east.  All the cabinets are closed and locked, every weapon appearing to be present in its rack, untouched. The attack on the lab must have been sudden, as it appears no one even got near a weapon before being torn to shreds. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41666}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41668}{0}{}{The lab's computer room (s,e)}{ }{            Shredded bodies of dead scientists litter the room, their limbs that still happen to be attached twisted and bent at odd angles, like they are posing for some morbid, abstract artist.  The tiled walls and floor are covered with blood, huge streaking splatters decorating the walls, while large pools cover the entire floor.  Smashed desks and computer equipment lie strewn about the room, with large claw-like gouges clearly visible on some of the desktops and larger items.  The fluorescent lights in the ceiling are dark, power to them having been cut somehow, leaving only the light from the two adjoining rooms to see by.  Shadows lurk in the far corners of the room, possibly hiding horrors which you dread to even imagine.  A strong animal smell is present here, mingling with that of the bloodied bodies to fill you with a strong feeling of foreboding. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41665}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41670}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41669}{0}{}{Storage Room (n)}{ }{         This room is huge, filled with row upon row of steel shelving, which line the walls and form aisles in the centre of the room.  Sitting on the shelves are thousands of boxes, varying in size, shape and condition.  Various pieces of equipment which would look more at home in an alien spacecraft can also be seen on the shelves, their dusty coating indicating their lack of use. The bloody footprints which can be seen leading into this room end here, as ended the creator of them, in a grizzly and horrific manner.  Torn to pieces and with an unmistakable, half-eaten look, the poor scientist has definitely taken their last footstep. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41665}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41670}{0}{}{The lab's recreation room (s,n)}{ }{             What was once the recreation room for the scientists in this lab, is now their open grave.  At least two bodies are scattered throughout the room, literally torn apart and hurled with great force\; the large splatters of gore on the walls are testament to this.  Several blood-soaked lounges lie torn and shredded on the floor, huge claw-like marks visible in their fabric. The table which once stood in the centre of the room now lies broken in two, each of its four legs sheared off and covered with gouges.  Coffee and sugar mingle with blood as they spill out from the broken, upside-down coffee machine which now rests in the corner of the room.  Strange tracks are visible on the blood-covered floor tiles, partially obscured, but certainly not human in their origin.  The fluorescent lights in this part of the lab appear to have escaped mistreatment, shedding light on a scene that should remain hidden from view forever. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41668}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41671}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41671}{0}{}{Laboratory main entrance (n)}{ }{          The stench of death and blood is not as strong here, as this room has been spared from the bloody soaking that other areas of the lab received.  A single body lies face down on the floor tiles, a huge gouge ripped into its back by a blow which must have had a lot of force behind it.  Half of the corpse's left leg appears to be missing, severed just above the knee, the thighbone visible as it protrudes from the stump.  The main door to lab on the south wall of this room appears to have been locked from the inside, perhaps by the scientist who lies here now, just before he was mauled from behind.  The fluorescent lights overhead flicker and buzz, struggling to cope with the unstable power running through the lab. }{Alternate Laboratory}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41670}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41672}{0}{}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {41673}{0}{<238>}{At the base of a cliff (s,se,e,sw)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{        Immediately in front of you to the north is the vertical face of a huge cliff, rising upwards out of the plains for at least six hundred feet.  The land at its base is rocky and rough, the plants and grass finding it hard to grow in its shadow.  The large mountain range to the west meets with the cliff, forming an impassable barrier to the northwest.  Clouds roll through the blue skies overhead, while the faint breeze that blows past you brings the sounds and smells of numerous animals.  A rich grassland can be seen stretching off to the southeast, as far as the eye can see. }{Prehistoric Earth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
