R {41675}{0}{<228>}{Grassy plains and rolling hills (ne,se,sw,nw,n,e,s,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{           This area is dominated by a large rock formation that protrudes from the ground.  It appears to be about twenty feet high, with jagged surfaces and peaks.  The grass can be seen growing all around it, and in some places on the rock small patches grow also.  The air is still and quiet here, the rock breaking the wind and blocking the sound.  You can spot several colourful birds perched on top of rock, their song being heard faintly in the background.  Sunlight shines down upon you, which glints off the rock's faces, while white clouds roll across the sky, casting their long shadows on the plains below.  Far to the north the face of a large cliff is visible, while to the west you can see a huge mountain range.  A great lake with sparkling waters lies off to your east, and a forest lies to your south. }{Prehistoric Earth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
