R {41677}{0}{<238>}{At the base of a huge cliff (e,se,ne,s)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{        A huge mountain range blocks your way west, its rocky faces steep and bare of plants and animals.  The grassy plains that can be seen to the east give way to rocky ground here, the soil becoming less rich and more volcanic as you head westwards.  Several large bones can be seen protruding from the ground here, their size indicating that it must have been a very large animal. The mountain peaks are obscured by clouds, making it hard to estimate their height.  The occasional sounds of falling rocks and movement cause you to jump, the sight of those large bones offering little comfort. }{Prehistoric Earth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
