R {41684}{0}{<238>}{On a small ledge (enter,d)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{         You stand on a small ledge, about fifty feet above the ground below.  From here can see all across the land, from the cliff to the north, to the lake to the east, and to the forest to the south.  The mountains rise behind you to the west, their soaring snow covered peaks blocking any view in that direction.  Looking down, you can now see several massive creatures wandering the plains, the very sight of them chilling your blood despite the warm sunlight.  There appears to be a cave leading into the mountainside here,  Krat     Reboot: 7.1 days [00:00:01]  Controller: None  which a curious adventurer could enter. }{Prehistoric Earth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
