R {41706}{0}{}{A narrow creek (sw,ne,w)}{ }{        Bright moonlight casts a red tint over your surroundings, creating an eerie effect as it reflects off the slow moving waters of the creek.  Red clouds roll by high overhead, obscuring the three moons which shine brightly in the night sky.  Squat trees with thick trunks, sparse branches, and round leaves grow along the creek's banks, their roots visible as they reach down towards the water.  The air smells clean and crisp, with just a hint of crushed grass.  The sound of splashing water can be heard coming from the northeast. }{Red Creek}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
