R {41707}{0}{}{A small creek with steep banks (ne,sw,nw,n,w)}{ }{         Moonlight reflects off the water flowing through the creek, bathing the area in dancing light which has an almost hypnotic effect.  Short trees with very few branches grow along the banks of the creek, their roots visible as they reach towards the water.  Growing in amongst the trees is a type of grass, about two feet high with cylindrical blades which appear to be quite stiff and spike-like.  Clouds roll by overhead, partially obscuring the stars and moons shining in the night sky.  Just above the trickling sounds of the creek, you can hear small rustling sounds, as though something small is moving through the grass nearby. }{Red Creek}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
