R {41725}{0}{}{A small creek with steep banks (nw,n,w,ne)}{ }{       A cool breeze brushes past you along the creek, carrying the faint smell of crushed grass and a stronger, sweeter smell that you cannot identify.  The entire area is bathed in dancing red light, created as the moonlight reflects off the water's surface.  Trees grow along the edges of both of the creek's banks, their sparse, twisted branches and thick, short trunks giving them a slightly sinister appearance.  Spider webs hang from the trees, layers upon layers of silken threads filling the air like curtains. }{Red Creek}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
