R {41726}{0}{}{In a creek (e)}{ }{       The creek you are in runs westwards towards a large rock formation, its banks growing steeper as it cuts deeper into the earth.  Following the path of the water, a line of trees grows on top of each bank, their stunted and broad trunks sprouting branches at odd angles.  Red moonlight sparkles as it reflects off the water's surface, painting the area in a beautiful display of morphing patterns and random shades.  The water at the base of the rock formation seems to glow, the colour and hue changing constantly. }{Red Creek}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41725}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41727}{0}{}{Edge of a large pond (ne,sw,nw,e,w)}{ }{        The northern creek bank is quite low here, causing some of the creek water to spill out into a large pond, about twenty feet in diameter.  Shining bright red as if in mirror to the moons above you, the pond's water reflects their light, throwing shadows in shades of red about the area. Tall conical-shaped grass grows all around the pond, right up to the very edge of the water, creating the impression that it was cut out, rather than natural.  The stubby trees continue to grow along the edge of the creek, following the banks as it winds its way to the southwest. }{Red Creek}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41725}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41710}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
