E {41716}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41728}{0}{}{A shallow creek (n,w,ne)}{ }{       Short trees with broad trunks line the high banks, following the creek as it heads westwards.  Moonlight, cast down from the three red moons in the sky above you reflects off the creek water, creating bright sparkles and casting a myriad of dancing shadows about the area.  A light breeze brings with it the sounds of running water, which mingles with the rustling of the tree leaves as it caresses them gently.  To the west, the creek looks like it widens slightly. }{Red Creek}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
