R {41729}{0}{}{Inside the alien ship (out)}{ }{          The interior of the ship looks even more elaborate and colorful than its dull exterior.  Every inch of the interior is covered with either buttons, display panels, or some writing.  There are what appears to be four seats in the main control area of the ship, each one having an attachment that you guess is placed over the head of the seat's occupant.  The air in here is cool, and slightly misty, a faint smell hanging in the air.  The lights flash on and off, seemingly randomly, while the display panels show what you presume to be writing in the alien's language.  There are two doors in the craft, one through which you entered, and one that is on the far wall of this section of the craft, which appears to be firmly closed. }{Prehistoric Earth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
