R {41767}{0}{}{A Discharge Pipe (u)}{ }{         You carefully make your way down the elbow joint and the pipe finally straightens out.  Unfortunately, this looks like the end of the road.  An immense grate blocks any further movement to the east. The scent of evil is now truly overwhelming.  The pipe and grate are covered with a thick green scum that reflects off your light source.  The trickle of water running through the pipe is also a deep, verdant green. The pipe takes a turn up here. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
