R {41855}{0}{}{A Discharge Pipe (u,n)}{ }{      You break through the hole and find yourself back at the elbow joint of the pipe.  A massive grate blocks access to the west.  The scent of evil is now truly overwhelming.  The pipe and grate are covered with a thick green scum that reflects off your light source.  But the ground here is sandy and dry. The pipe takes a turn up here.  The hole you came from is to the north. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41856}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {41854}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41856}{0}{}{A Discharge Pipe (d)}{ }{         As you climb up the pipe the stench of evil grows even greater. As you reach the top of the elbow joint your eyes blink frenetically to adjust to the strong sunlight entering through another large grate to the east.  As your eyes adjust, you see that it opens out into a gulley, probably in Rattler Park. You recoil in shock!  Before you is the nastiest, biggest-looking king of the snakes you have ever seen.  Glinting on the ground is a key.  You crow in triumph and move towards the key but the king slips his coils around it.  Beware!  Your life is in danger!!!  RUN!!!! }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
