R {41860}{0}{}{Foul's Altar (w)}{ }{    Your light is swallowed up by an overpowering darkness.  The darkest darkness you have ever known.  A terrible mockery of the JW church is vaguely visible.  The mantlepiece has been subtly transformed.  Horrific shapes grace the walls. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {34945}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41861}{0}{}{County Park Egress Road (s,n)}{ }{      You are on a narrow, rutted, and rather muddy, decrepit, and downright unpleasant little road.  To the south you can hear a loud disagreeable noise which is obviously emanating from the Army surplus tent now too horribly visible.  To the north you can make out Oak Street, one of the main drags of the Lytton County seat.  All in all, a truly and all-encompassingly awful place to be. }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
