R {41898}{0}{}{A Dry Gulley (e)}{ }{      A small, dry gulley.  The creek bed continues to the east and west. On all other sides you see the same dry thickets and shabby-looking pine trees that seem to be this park's stock in trade.  A discharge pipe is visible here. You find the source of the sobbing.  A small girl is lying here, her face pale and drawn.  She is holding her leg! }{The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
