R {41899}{0}{}{Reception area (n,w,e)}{ }{      Dominating the center of this modern office is a large desk  cluttered with papers and empty pizza delivery boxes. Nestled, almost forgotten, amidst the chaos is a small computer. Closed doors in the east and north walls break the monotony of the  standard paintings and potted plants that seem to inhabit every modern office. }{Chaos Candy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
