R {41900}{0}{}{Executive boardroom (s)}{ }{      A heavy cloud of cigar smoke makes you cough and choke as you glance around the boardroom of the factory.  It's far too hazy to make out anything clearly except for the large table and chairs placed in the center of the room.  Scattered on top of the table are playing cards with a pile of coins in the center of the table.  Obviously someone's been playing poker in here. }{Chaos Candy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41899}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41901}{0}{}{The Don's office (w)}{ }{      This is a small executive-type office, the kind of room that you associate with the managers of small companies. A large angled spot lamp provides the only illumination in this room since the blinds covering the large window behind the boss's desk have been drawn shut. The heavy smell of italian food mixed with cigar smoke lingers in the air, causing you to cough momentarily.  }{Chaos Candy Store}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {41899}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {41902}{0}{}{-=  In a tree  =- (d)}{ }{     -=  In a tree  =- You find yourself up in a tree.  There isn't much to see up here except for some leaves and branches.  You can look at and see most of the surrounding area though, and certainly you don't want to look down if you are scared of heights. }{Winnie the Pooh}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
