R {42056}{0}{}{Apartment Entry (w)}{ }{    You are in the cramped entry of Butch's apartment.  There is a book shelf, a coat rack, and a heating unit imbedded into the plain white wall.  A lamp stands on an end table.  There is a door to the east that is closed.  A hallway goes off to the west. }{Pulp Fiction}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
