R {42057}{0}{}{Intersecting Halls (e,s,w)}{ }{    You have reached a section of the hallway where there are several doors and doorways.  There is a doorway to the south, a doorway to the north, and an open door to the west.  The hall also leads to the east from here. }{Pulp Fiction}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
