R {42058}{0}{}{Kitchen (n)}{ }{     You are in a kitchen in Butch's apartment.  The room is little more than a narrow passage with a counter on one side that holds an oven and a double sink.  A small refrigerator stands on the other side.  Over the counter are some cabinets.  There is an open doorway to the north. }{Pulp Fiction}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42057}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42059}{0}{}{Butch's Bedroom (e)}{ }{    This is Butch's bedroom, sparsely furnished with a bed and a nightstand, a bookshelf and a small chest of drawers.  Framed photos hang on the walls, next to boxing medals and trophies.  An open doorway leads east back into the hallway. }{Pulp Fiction}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42057}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42060}{0}{}{Butch's Bathroom (s)}{ }{    This is a tiny bathroom with a toilet, a sink, a towel bar, and a bathtub with a shower.  It may not be big and fancy but it serves its purpose.  To the south is an open doorway that leads back into the hallway. }{Pulp Fiction}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
