R {42063}{0}{}{The Ervins' Sex Parlor (physics,chemistry)}{}{      Your jaw drops.  This 'room', really just a hole in the fabric of space, is filled with a variety of sexual aids!  A harness hangs from the ceiling. Various whips, prods, and shackles hang on the walls.  The smell of sex is thick in the air. It would appear that, using their vast knowledge of chemistry and physics, the Ervins, WLC's happiest couple, have created this secret place. So, this is where they spend their 'conference hours'.  }{Walled Lake Central High School}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
