R {42065}{0}{}{At the base of a Vallenwood (leave,ascend)}{ }{         Before you stands one of the legendary Vallenwood trees,  defense and home to the people of Solace. A wide ramp is cut into the side of the tree, winding around the trunk forty feet into the air, ending in a rather large building built into the tree itself. The town of Solace surrounds you, the only city in the Realms to have been built in the treetops  by human settlers. The catwalks sway high above your head,  providing the means to get from one tree to another without ever touching the ground. }{Inn of the last Home}{inn_of_the_last_home}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42067}{ascend}{ascend}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {21392}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

