R {42067}{0}{}{On a ramp (descend,ascend)}{ }{        You are about halfway up the ramp, with the town spread out behind you. The view is breathtaking, the fertile valley before you spreading out in a verdant green carpet. The Traveler's Highway stretches out beneath you like a dusty yellow ribbon, leading north through the Plains of Abassinia, and south to the forests of Qualinost. The sounds of hearty laughter and shouts  for ale come from above you, filling the air with the sounds of companionship and camaraderie, the obvious signs of a good inn. }{Inn of the last Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42068}{descend}{descend}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42069}{ascend}{ascend}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

