R {42069}{0}{}{On a ramp (descend,enter)}{ }{       The platform on which you stand is really the top of a branch that was smoothed and flattened to create a front stoop. A  railing was erected to prevent those that have had 'one too many' from falling to their deaths. The inn itself is built into the trunk of the tree, using branches for supports. Light and sound spill out of the large windows, the common room unable to hold the noise. }{Inn of the last Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42070}{descend}{descend}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
