R {42071}{0}{}{Inn of the Last Home (out,n,w,e)}{ }{          The walls and floor of the common room were lovingly carved from the tree, with extra construction provided where needed. The whole effect is rather cozy, with irregularities in the  walls creating little nooks and crannies suitable for  conversations of a more private nature. To the north, the bar  fills up one wall, serving food as well as drink. To the east, the young people of Solace gather to flirt and be seen by the members of the opposite sex while the elders of the village  enjoy a bite and a bit of gossip before the fire to the west. All in all, the atmosphere is comfortable and welcoming. }{Inn of the last Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
