R {42072}{0}{}{On a ramp (descend,enter)}{ }{       The platform on which you stand is really the top of a branch that was smoothed and flattened to create a front stoop. A  railing was erected to prevent those that have had 'one too many' from falling to their deaths. The inn itself is built into the trunk of the tree, using branches for supports. Light and sound spill out of the large windows, the common room unable to hold the noise. }{Inn of the last Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {42073}{0}{}{Inn of the Last Home (s)}{ }{        The back portion of the room is lit by a couple of lanterns hung to augment the firelight. Barrels of ale and bottles of various and sundry other types of alcohol sit behind the bar, with a door leading to the cellars, and another to the kitchen. Plates of steaming potatoes sit on the bar, waiting to be collected and passed out to the various patrons of the inn.  There is a menu on the back wall. Otik stands behind the bar with a friendly smile, waiting for your order. }{Inn of the last Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42071}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42074}{0}{}{Inn of the Last Home (e)}{ }{         The western part of the room is mostly lit by the fireplace.  one or two lamps hang unlit from the ceiling, unneeded with so much light already available. The tables on this side of the  room are arranged to so that the patrons sitting at them will be warm and comfortable. Solace's older generation fills this side of the room\; merchants, housewives, village elders, they all gather at the end of their day for a few hours of  rest and relaxation before retiring to their homes. A young barmaid is here taking orders. }{Inn of the last Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42071}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42075}{0}{}{Inn of the Last Home (w)}{ }{     This part of the common room is partly partitioned off by a  section of wall, making it a perfect place for the youngsters of the town to congregate.  Lanterns hanging from the wall  provide a dim light to augment the firelight. A young man sits here playing a flute. }{Inn of the last Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42071}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42076}{0}{}{The Enchanged Kingdom (s,leave)}{ }{       There's not much to see from here.  A beautiful, verdant, and very lush forest grows behind a small house and on both sides of this path.  The forest appears too thick to pass through. The house to the south, on the other hand, stands wide open with doors agape.  Despite the open welcoming doors something -- perhaps the shadow covering the face of the building -- gives the impression of something amiss. }{The Enchanged Kingdom}{enchanged_kingdom}{}{}{1.000}{1}
