R {42096}{0}{}{A Chaotic Wood (w,e,s)}{ }{         You are standing in a chaotic wood.  The sky is overcast and dark with what seem to be purple clouds roiling angrily above you.  The branches of the twisted trees reach painfully toward the angry clouds, jagged fingers of wood outstretched in mournful pleading.  The trees themselves are chaotically twisted, some appearing to be in the process of vomiting their inner parts while swallowing their bark within.  There is a twisting path here that almost appears to be alive, a subtle vibration running through it.  Around you, purple and ochre grasses sway this way and that. }{Chaotic Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
