R {42128}{0}{}{Inside of the sock (u,out,d)}{ }{      This is a warm, humid place.  The air is thick with the musty odor of dirty feet.  You are encircled on all sides by a cotton-knit material somewhat reminiscent of a sock.  The fabric is soft and loose.  This space would be quite confining were there a foot or a leg in here.  Small bits of lint are visible\; they are stuck to the fabric.  There is a small tear in the fabric. }{The big red shoe}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
