R {42129}{0}{}{A somewhat tighter space (u,d)}{ }{    The cotton-knit walls begin to draw closer and tighter here, leaving a little less room to maneuver.  Above, a dim light filters through the gaps in the cotton weave, making it easier to see the fairly empty surroundings. }{The big red shoe}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42128}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
