R {42130}{0}{}{Home of the toes (u)}{ }{      You find yourself in a homey cave-like area made from what seems to be a white cotton-knit (which might otherwise be known as a sock).  There are oddly shaped pieces of furniture scattered about, looking as though they were made for rather short, stubby creatures.  There is a small round rug at the foot of a soft, fluffy arm chair.  A strong odor permeates the room. }{The big red shoe}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42128}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42131}{0}{}{The elastic band (d)}{ }{     The cotton-knit walls draw closer and tighter here, leaving you with little room to maneuver.  You inadvertently brush up against the cotton wall and it gives way slightly.  A dim light filters through the gaps in the cotton weave, making it easier to see your fairly empty surroundings. }{The big red shoe}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42129}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42132}{0}{}{Inside a shed (out)}{ }{    It looks like everything has been cleaned out of here.  The construction workers must have had time enough to take what ever was in here before they left.  Empty shelves gather dust.  The only thing left is a plastic chair, but I'd just ignore that. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
