R {42133}{0}{}{A Dense Forest (nw,ne)}{ }{      Trees tower above you for what seems like miles.  Seedlings and saplings bide their time in the shade waiting for a canopy tree to fall, these young trees will one day inherit the sunlight they need to succeed to canopy status themselves.  The acid needles litter on the forest floor supporting herbs such as clintonia and rose twisted-stalk. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
