R {42137}{0}{}{A Clearing (nw,e,sw)}{ }{    The monchies have cleared out most of the trees in this area.  The stumps that remain seem to form a V leading to the east.  Some small seedlings still survive and are growing between the stumps.  You're not sure, but whatever is beyond those trees cannot be good. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
