R {42138}{0}{}{A grove (w)}{ }{    The trees have come to a circle in this once peaceful grove.  A deer has been slain and its half eaten carcass lies rotting in the sun.  All around you there are signs of a struggle, not just the deer, some other confrontation took place here. }{Ashridge Acres}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
