R {42139}{0}{}{Sin City, baby! (sw,se,ne,nw,n,w,e)}{ }{        Depravity, Corruption and Perversion swirl past and ooze into your body from the surrounding city.  The metropolis rises above you like a hulking beast, ready to engulf unwary visitors with its sinful gaze.  Buildings and streets head off in all directions, and you can almost feel them tempting, teasing and enticing you towards them.  What unspeakable acts are being performed all around you?  Though you can't imagine why, you could try to 'redeem' yourself here if you wished to leave. }{Sin City}{sin_city}{}{}{1000.000}{1}
