R {42140}{0}{}{In a student apartment. (sw,ne)}{ }{      This place is truly disgusting.  There are empty pizza boxes and drink containers all over the floor.  You can barely see the sofa under all the rubbish lying around, though it seems someone has made sure the television is visible.  Got to have your priorities right.  Off towards the southwest lies the kitchen, though you don't know if you want to visit it, given the state of this room. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42148}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42141}{0}{}{Inside a bank in Sin City. (nw)}{ }{      Walking into this bank, you begin to feel at home.  This is what it's all about, money.  Everyone here knows it, it's why they work here.  It's not about love, or duty, or honor.  It's about the cash.  The people behind the counters look smug in the knowledge that they handle more money in a day than you would in a lifetime.  Set into the side wall, you can see the vault, strangely unguarded. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
