R {42142}{0}{}{A pockmarked street in Sin City. (ne,sw)}{ }{      The street you are walking down is covered in holes of all sizes.  You find yourself getting angry about this, though you are not sure why.  The buildings on each side don't have any entrances from here, and towards the northeast you can see a large open space of some kind.  Damnit, why don't people tell you what is going on around here?  You feel like punching something. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42153}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42143}{0}{}{Outside a shop in Sin City. (nw,n,se)}{ }{     Wandering along this street, your stomach starts to rumble.  Maybe that shop over there has some pie.  I bet they have good stuff in there.  Maybe you should check, they might have some chocolate, you'd like that.  And something salty, some chips perhaps.  Yeah, do it.  You wonder what is for dinner. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
