R {42144}{0}{}{Just inside a mirror store. (n,s)}{ }{       As you enter this store, you are amazed at the number of mirrors lining the walls.  Everywhere you look you can see reflections of yourself looking back, not that that's a bad thing, because you're hot, but it is a little disconcerting.  The shop continues to the north, where you assume there will be more mirrors on display, but why rush?  There is plenty of time to stop and fix your hair, you might even like to pose a little. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42154}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42145}{0}{}{At a pumping club in Sin City (w,e)}{ }{       You push your way through a throng of people, and into a club.  This place is really pumping, with great music coming from speakers in all directions, spinning lights, and plenty of drink and hot people.  This is obviously THE place to be in Sin City.  Bumping up against all these scantily clad people is getting you a little hot under the collar, perhaps you should make your way over to the bar area and have a drink.  You never know, you might get lucky. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42147}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42146}{0}{}{Outside a house in Sin City. (w)}{ }{       At the end of this street in Sin City, you find that a beautiful house stands before you, teasing you with its presence.  Of all the houses in the world, this is the house you want.  You feel something tingling in the back of your mind, something beginning to build, to grow.  Staring at the house, you realize you want it.  No, dammit, you DESERVE it.  You've worked harder than whoever owns it, and they probably don't even appreciate it. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
