R {42147}{0}{}{At the bar of The Itch club. (e)}{ }{     You finally manage to make it to the bar, and find it almost as packed as the dance area.  People here are standing around in small groups, making plans to do a whole other kind of dance.  The bar looks unattended, but there is plenty of flesh peeking out from peoples' skimpy clothing to keep you occupied. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42145}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42148}{0}{}{In a dirty, disgusting kitchen. (ne)}{ }{     This isn't as bad as you thought.  Sure, there are piles of dishes so high that some of them are scraping the ceiling, but who doesn't get the urge to leave the dishes every now and then.  The bench-tops are barely visible, but the little you can see is an attractive beige color. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42140}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42149}{0}{}{Inside a church in Sin City, how odd. (n)}{ }{    You have somehow found your way into a church.  Looking around, you can see that it looks like a perfectly normal church, with pews, crosses and a nice big altar.  The sounds of the city outside seem to penetrate even here. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42139}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42150}{0}{}{Inside a bank vault! (nw)}{ }{     Excellent, you are inside the bank vault!  Just being here is giving you a rush.  This is what it's all about.  You look around, and find hundreds of lock-boxes lining the walls, sadly with much more effective-looking locks than the vault door.  Maybe that's why it wasn't guarded very closely.  Still, just being here is thrill enough. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42141}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42151}{0}{}{Inside a house in Sin City. (w)}{ }{          The inside of the house is one huge room!  It's like a giant studio apartment, with class.  In the center of the room is a swimming pool (heated), surrounded with tropical ferns.  Over to your right is where you would expect a kitchen, but obviously the owners just order in, or eat out all the time, as in place of a kitchen is another swimming pool (heated).  Bastards.  Back against the far wall you see the BIGGEST home entertainment system ever.  Your vision starts to blur, and you start to shake a little.  Off to the left is a great big bed that looks extremely comfortable, maybe you should have a lie down for a bit? }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42146}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

