R {42153}{0}{}{A deserted battlefield. (sw)}{ }{    Now this is more like it, a battlefield.  This is where stuff gets done, no more of this sitting around talking about things.  Get out there and whoop some ass, you know you want to.  In fact, I bet you're just dying to.  Sadly, you are all alone here.  Damn.  }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42142}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42154}{0}{}{At the back of a mirror store. (s)}{ }{    The whole back of this shop is dominated by one giant mirror!  This thing is massive, allowing even an elephant room to admire itself.  Seeing you are here, you may as well take a look at your reflection.  Like anyone could stop you. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
