R {42155}{0}{}{A dead-end street in Sin City. (se)}{ }{   The street comes to an end here, with nothing particularly interesting to see.  You are near the outskirts of the city, but can still hear the sounds of this odd city emanating from the southeast. }{Sin City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
