R {42186}{0}{}{PG's Cellar (Freezer) (trapdoor,n)}{ }{           You've entered a large, white corridor which is very, very cold. Although the air is freezing, you can smell that something is not right here. Hanging all around you are man-sized bags through which strange bodies can be seen. Most appear to be male, but you cannot be sure as they are deformed and mutilated. Some of them have unusually large heads or long arms. Some of them have no arms or legs, but strange protrusions instead. Something very disturbing has happened with all the people in these bags. Something VERY disturbing. Some of the bags are opened and it looks like parts of the bodies in those bags have been removed. Why are there deformed bodies in the cellar of a restaurant and why are they cut to pieces?  }{PG}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
