R {42196}{0}{}{First Hole Tee (n)}{ }{       Spooky Pines Golf Course - You are standing on an eerie golf course that appears to be floating within a massive void.  Peering down at the tee box you notice the grass is not of a greenish hue, instead it seems to be of the various colors of a rainbow.  Strange gnarled trees line the fairway, which run right up to the green.  To your left a glowing red ball washer smiles at you, revealing a golf ball within its mechanism. }{Spooky Pines}{spooky_pines}{}{}{1.000}{1}
