R {42197}{0}{}{First Hole Fairway (n,s)}{ }{      Twisted looming trees line this fairway, which run right up to the green that lies about 200 yards away.  Deep shadows flicker upon the surface of the grass, as a flock of flying golf shoes soar high above your head.  Brilliant cascading light vibrates out of the pin, casting a haunting glow across the grass on the green.  Glowing unsteadily, the pin flag waves at you. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
