R {42198}{0}{}{First Hole Green (e,s)}{ }{     The radiant light presses around you as you continue to walk around the green.  Slender blades of singing grass rise up between the sand traps that encircle the edge of the green.  The sand traps are densely carpeted with dirt-speckled white golf balls, and the balls seem to be having a conversation about natural philosophy. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
