R {42199}{0}{}{Second Hole Tee (e,w)}{ }{      Stumbling about the tee to a freaky golf course, you are surrounded by towering gnarled trees.  Hollow screams and other haunting noises occasionally bellow out from nowhere, swooping down to tie their shoe laces, several pairs of flying golf shoes seem to be enjoying this insanity.  The fairway is glowing, and the grass screams under your feet as you step on it. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
