R {42200}{0}{}{Second Hole Fairway (e,w)}{ }{      Rotting away on the ground are a few scattered divots.  Judging by the amount of decay the turf has been torn up for several weeks at least. Decaying, the divots are writing out their last will and testament, their tears of fear shuddering in the breeze.  Their surface, shrouded by layers of faded grass, stands brave, as a maggot wearing plaid retreats between the brownish blades. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
