R {42201}{0}{}{Second Hole Green (s,w)}{ }{      Light radiates across this supernatural green, staved off only by the smiling pin flag.  Several sand traps have been placed tight against the green and you smile inwardly at the thought of the golf club members chipping their ball into them.  This roughly circular green has a slight pitch, and the hole is in a heated debate with the flag about how one would make the shot. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
