R {42202}{0}{}{Third Hole Tee (s,n)}{ }{      Rainbow colored wisps of grass sing show tunes as you step onto the tee, the effect is slightly hampered by the trees dancing in their tutus.  Looking down you notice a golf tee trying to commit suicide, as it intends to escape the torture of being hit with a driver.  The misty fairway runs right up to the base of the green, almost as if it intends to dance a polka with the animated pin flag. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
