R {42203}{0}{}{Third Hole fairway (s,n)}{ }{      Surrounded by animated trees and plants, every direction you turn seems to lead deeper into bizarreness.  Each step you take is frightening as the concept of reality no longer applies.  The normal sights and sounds of the world no longer surround you as you walk beneath the looming void.  The same sounds can be alarming or hysterical depending on the frame of one's mind. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
