R {42204}{0}{}{Third Hole Green (s,n)}{ }{     Blurry outlines of faint apparitions are swiftly putting as the pin flag winks in your direction.  So unpredictable is the pitch of the green, that an angry ball sprouts legs and walks away.  Peering down into the hole you notice an advance civilization of golf tees, obviously cowering from their nemesis, the driving wood. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
