R {42205}{0}{}{Fourth Hole Tee (e,n)}{ }{     Gently the tee caresses your foot, each stroke a plea for mercy with a delicate style.  Stretching from fairway to green, the gnarled trees pirouette gracefully to the sounds of the melodic grass.  A red ball washer shimmers in the background, occasionally emitting a foul smell into the misty darkness of the looming void. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
