R {42206}{0}{}{Fourth Hole Fairway (e,w)}{ }{      A sparkling water hazard floats into the air, hovering above the fairway that stretches out before you.  Golden fish cascade down onto the grass and form a theater group, as the fish begin to preform King Richard III.  A legion of golf clubs march up into the void, causing their surface to twinkle like stars that lend a surreal air to this golf course. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
