R {42207}{0}{}{Fourth Hole Green (e,w)}{ }{       A brilliant red pin flag sways in the breeze, bowing to you as you step onto the green.  The sparkling white grains of sand glance at you, as they begin to rake themselves within the traps that edge the green. Violently a chipping wedge chases a ball across the grass, the flag tripping the club as the ball begins to scream.  An eerie glow twinkles from within the hole, as the ball jumps into it, to take cover from the insanity of this scene. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
