R {42208}{0}{}{Fifth Hole Tee (n,w)}{ }{     A faint breeze brushes lightly against your face, once again bringing with it a sense of calmness.  As you lift your head you are unable to discern whether it is dusk or dawn, as the vast blackness of the void obstructs the natural world.  The multicolored grass screams with each footfall, and the spooky sound echoes about the fairway. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
