R {42209}{0}{}{Fifth Hole Fairway (n,s)}{ }{     Continuing down the fairway, you are once again struck by the bizarreness of this freaky golf course.  The trees continue to dance a ballet, and all you can see in every direction are their pink tutus.  Some balls on the fairway in front of you seem overcome with emotion, as the trees gracefully perform Swan Lake. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
