R {42210}{0}{}{Fifth Hole Green (n,s)}{ }{        Standing just outside of the green, you see the breathtaking sight of an apparition and flag trying to share a bottle of whiskey.  The ghostly figure is wearing tacky powder-blue polyester slacks, and a plaid windbreaker.  Unfortunately the flag is not able to indulge in the drinking of the spirits, as it does not have any hands to grip the bottle with.  Peering at this spooky sight, you realize that these abominations are indifferent to your presence, as the specter works diligently trying to help the flag to drink. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
