R {42211}{0}{}{Sixth Hole Tee (s,n)}{ }{      Radiant multicolored light dashes out from out of the giant void above, casting a spooky glimmer across the surface of the fairway.  Slender stems of sprouting grass rise up between the sand traps that dominate the green in the distance.  Wisps of faint streaky specters are constantly battling each other for par, as their lurking vapor seems to sweep about the fairway in a state of confusion. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
