R {42212}{0}{}{Sixth Hole Fairway (e,s)}{ }{      The edge of an eerie green lies directly in front of you, covered in places with bloody, decaying groundhog remains.  The grass of the fairway is black with residue, as the craters left behind by exploded land mines stretch across the war torn grass.  Thick swarms of well dressed maggots have cocktails, while crawling into position for the scrumptious groundhog buffet. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
