R {42213}{0}{}{Sixth Hole Green (w,e)}{ }{      You have stumbled onto a gruesome scene, covering the green are the bloody remains of some poor groundhog.  The grass has been singed to their roots in places,  while the sand in the hazard have been displaced from their bunker during what must have been a fearsome explosion.  The flag is still in its regular place and is gesturing to you, as if it has something to say. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
