R {42214}{0}{}{Seventh Hole Tee  (w,e)}{ }{       You are walking along a war torn tee that looks out over a twisting fairway.  All around you the innards of a groundhog convulse in pools of congealing blood, and the urge to quicken your pace pulses in the spooky gloom, but trees are still performing and could smash you underfoot.  It seems rudeness could easily thwart you in this dangerous place.  The grass under your feet weeps as you move slowly onward into the sheer madness of this place. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
