R {42215}{0}{}{Seventh Hole Fairway (s,w)}{ }{     The bright-hued multicolored grass screams with every footfall, and the horrifying carnage scattered about the past sections of the course are no longer present.  A faint breeze brushes lightly against your face, as a flock of flying golf shoes gracefully glides by, once again bringing with them a sense of calmness. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
