R {42216}{0}{}{Seventh Hole Green (s,n)}{ }{        The spooky golf course looms around you, a freaky habitation for ghosts. You glimpse spirits of golfers on the green, half-seen, polyester fading, moaning and decaying.  Towering walls of tutu wearing trees leap out of the ground, covered in places with pink fairy like wings and smooth bark. The trees scissor-kick almost out of sight above you, and you can hear the flag cheering for an encore.  Although they remain unseen, you can hear the sounds of phantoms wailing on the breeze.  Krat     Reboot: 5.3 days [00:00:01]  Controller: None  }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
