R {42219}{0}{}{Eighth Hole Green (s,n)}{ }{     Hollow shrieks and other noises occasionally disturb the green encircling you.  Faint streaky apparitions fly through the air, an eternity of playing golf, these poor souls are now lost.  Living golf bags can be glimpsed in the shadows, carefully guarding their clubs against those who may come into contact with them. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
