R {42220}{0}{}{Ninth Hole Tee (w,n)}{ }{       Multicolored blades of grass form themselves into an orchestra, the violins causing the surface to look like a vast expanse of chewable multivitamins. The effect is greatly hampered by the trees that are doing a burlesque act. You are standing on the tee of the ninth hole, shimmering wisps of disembodied souls are playing golf along the fairway.  Looking down you notice a golf ball conducting the grass with his newly sprouted appendages. The grass expertly performing Rachmaninov's symphony No. 1 in D Minor. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
