R {42221}{0}{}{Ninth Hole Fairway (w,e)}{ }{       Rounding the bottom of the fairway the trees are completely nude, as the grass has completed their performance of Rachmaninov's symphony No. 1 in D Minor.  A sense of foreboding pervades this chaotic golf course, as flashes of electrical energy spark up the haunting void overhead.  Brown shingles of barks are strewn all over the fairway, the result of the trees perverse striptease.  The bark quickly sprouts legs and runs back onto the trees. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
