R {42222}{0}{}{Ninth Hole Green (w,e)}{ }{         A spooky green in vivid colors.  A haze rising slowly from the hole and casting a transparent radiant shroud over everything within eyesight. Lit up by glowing specters, the fog gives the impression at one moment of panic, boundless fear, at the next an immense sea of liquid air.  The air is thick and sparkling.  Reality is still distorted.  A step from the animated flag which stands in the center of the green a little golf ball is gleaming.  A snoring putter, covered from blade to shaft with protoplasm, is lying under the flag sleeping.  A ghostly golfer doing his best to awaken it by tapping on it while it rests. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
