R {42224}{0}{}{Tenth Hole Fairway (w,e)}{ }{       This is a wide fairway.  The massive pink trees seem to radiate a candy floss sheen, their surface reflecting the glowing haze with a sparkling gleam.  A warm wind screams upward into the looming void, while casting fragments of freshly cut grass trembling into the air.  Gentle, the grass strikes your face, each blade weeping with a delicate style.  And as they flicker upon their final resting place, silence stretches on. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
