R {42226}{0}{}{Eleventh Hole Tee (s,n)}{ }{        Set back a short distance from the previous green to the north, this is nothing more than a freaky situation.  The curving fairway changes its pitch constantly, leaving this tee off unplayable to any mortal golfer.  Mid-way across the fairway you randomly catch a flitting glimpse of a brilliantly shining water hazard.  The water trickles upwards into the void, but collects in a pool beneath your feet. Looking into the pool, the water appears metallic and uninviting. Fortunately, its dense composition allows you to float on top of it. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
