R {42228}{0}{}{Eleventh Hole Green (w,n)}{ }{       The lustering-hued multicolored green echoes every footfall, and the sadistic sounds of wailing phantoms drift into the area from the golf course ahead.  The heavy branches of massive pirouetting trees creak well dancing, and the occasional falling leaf screams for a paramedic as it tumbles to the ground.  The bizarreness of the course has an almost palpable presence as you travel, and you make sure to leave no trace of your presence. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
