R {42229}{0}{}{Twelfth Hole Tee (e,w)}{ }{      The overly obnoxious trees have withdrawn from the tee slightly, allowing easier passage and less confusion.  Surrounded by grass, each step looks the same as the last one as the brilliantly shining flora blur together. The ground here isn't an ideal place to sit down due to the aggressive nature of the grass, but if you're looking to take a pause and catch your breath, this would be a safe spot. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
