R {42230}{0}{}{Twelfth Hole Fairway (e,w)}{ }{       The cracking sounds of swinging clubs echo down the fairway, each sound accompanied by soaring ball screaming 'FORE'.  Over time, the sprinkler system has evolved into a biped, leaving empty muddy channels as it got up and walked away.  The short grass bites at you with each footfall, leaving teeth marks on unprotected surfaces.  Walking down the fairway is tedious at best, as the ground is uneven, causing you to stumble at unexpected times. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
