R {42234}{0}{}{Thirteenth Hole Green (se,nw)}{ }{      Several bunkers have been placed tight against the green and you giggle inwardly at the thought of golfers putting their ball into them. Brilliant light flickers about this roughly circular green, as the slender blades of singing grass rise up between the sand traps.  The bunkers are densely carpeted with sparkling crystalline like grains of sand, and the grains wink at you as they begin to rake themselves. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
