R {42235}{0}{}{Fourteenth Hole Tee (se,w)}{ }{      Looking down you notice a tee gently crying, as it mourns his wife who is broken in two.  Gently the tee caresses you, each stroke a plea for mercy.  Stretching from fairway to green, the dancing trees pirouette gracefully to the sounds of the jamming grass.  A red ball washer shimmers in the background, occasionally emitting a foul smell into the darkness of the vast looming void. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
