R {42236}{0}{}{Fourteenth Hole Fairway (e,w)}{ }{      This is a narrow fairway.  The dancing pink trees seem to radiate a candy apple sheen, their surfaces reflecting the glowing fog with a waning gleam.  A cool wind rushes upward into the towering void, while casting divots forcefully into the air.  Frightening wails and deep spine tingling moans echo throughout the fairway, creating a spooky atmosphere. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
