R {42237}{0}{}{Fourteenth Hole Green (e,sw)}{ }{     Cascading light presses around you as you step onto the green.  Stalky blades of composing grass rise up between the water traps that encircle the edge of the green.  The water hazard is densely populated with dirt-speckled white golf balls, who seem to be bathing themselves to become clean. }{Spooky Pines}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
