R {42251}{0}{}{Stranger's treehouse (n)}{ }{        This appears to be some sort of storage area for the treehouse.  Large crates fill the room and the floor is littered with empty boxes. Cobwebs line the ceiling and the smell of rotten beer can be smelled everywhere.  It looks like Stranger never had time to clean this place.  Who knows, maybe there is a coin or two in here.  }{Stranger's Treehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
