R {42252}{0}{}{A secret lab (u)}{ }{      A small dimly lit room beneath the ground.  A band of light around the upper portion of the metal walls provides the only illumination.  Small tables are spaced about the room.  Small plants and intricate glass work cover the tables thoroughly.  Vents spaced about the walls exchange the air within the room regularly.  A small ladder leads back up.   }{Greenhouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
