R {42415}{0}{}{EMA Garage (n,e,s)}{ }{       The grey tiled floor has a bit more dirt on it than it does closer to the doorway to the north. The work that's done in the bays nearby tends to leave dust and debris no matter how often someone sweeps up. The walls are covered in metal shelving units, each of them stretching from floor to ceiling. Each of them is stocked full with various items necessary for the garage to accomplish its task of keeping the agency's equipment in top condition. }{EMA Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
