R {42416}{0}{}{EMA Garage (s,w)}{ }{      The tiled floor has grease spots all over it. It looks like the bulldozer sitting in this bay is currently being repaired. Tools lie on the floor in between the grease spots, waiting to be used by the mechanic that is assigned this job. Along the outside wall of the bay is a tall stand that holds monitoring equipment. It seems to be used for tracking engine performance. }{EMA Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
