R {42420}{0}{}{EMA Garage (n,e,w)}{ }{      This work bay is currently occupied by a long blue hazmat truck. The truck takes up nearly the entire bay, with only a few feet of tile showing on either side of the floor surrounding it. The truck doesn't appear to have anything wrong with it. Perhaps it just needs to be resupplied. The rolling doors on the side of the truck are closed so further investigation isn't possible. }{EMA Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
