R {42421}{0}{}{EMA Garage (s,e,w)}{ }{       The tiled floor has muddy tracks all over it. Sitting at the end of these tracks is one of the coolest vehicles you've ever seen. Known as an excavator, this gargantuan machine sits on track wheels that resemble those of a tank. Riding atop these tracks is a small carriage for the driver, a long casing for the engine, and a huge crane arm that ends in a shovel that's bigger than you are! You can't help but be reminded of those toy trucks so many kids play with. Fun! }{EMA Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
