R {42422}{0}{}{EMA Garage (n,e,w)}{ }{       Sitting in this work bay is a small truck known as a sweeper. It's usually out in the city cleaning the streets, but today it's in the garage for repairs. A panel has been removed on the back of vehicle, showing some of the inner workings of the machine. On the tiled floor below are various tools that a mechanic has probably been using to fix whatever the problem is. The repair job doesn't seem to be finished yet. }{EMA Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
