R {42445}{0}{}{Welcome to Subway! (sw,ne,w,e)}{ }{      The smell of mayonnaise and bell pepper creeps up your nose as you enter this fine dining establishment. Strangely placed patterns of yellows, greens, and browns decorate the walls. A self-service soda dispenser lies directly ahead of you, with customer seating to west, and the long line to get some food extends east. You can leave this filth pit by going southwest. }{Subway Sandwich Shop}{subway_shop}{}{}{1.000}{1}
