R {42447}{0}{}{Consume (sw,s)}{ }{            Finally. After waiting for countless dull, painful minutes,  you arrive at the counter. Steeped in grime, the counter's sneeze  guard almost completely blocks what actual "fixin's(tm)" are  available for your future sandwich. Behind the counter, you notice  the ovens and warmers, chock full of something that may or may  not be fresh bread, the greasy microwave, and the full, rusty sink. Here you can place your order for a hot (or cold) lump of damp,  rubbery food product, slapped together by incompetent help, served  with what passes for care. This, of course, forces one to assume  that someone is manning the store. To find out what's available,  read the menu. Whoever is on shift should be able to help you -  emphasis on 'should'. }{Subway Sandwich Shop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42445}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42449}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42448}{0}{}{Seating (e)}{ }{         This is the reason why people get their food to go. Four booths are placed haphazardly around the room\; they obviously haven't been washed in aeons, a condition shared fully with the floor, which appears to be under the impression that when you walk on it, it should take every opportunity to walk back. The windows, which time has seen fit to lovingly dip in filth, act to block the harsh view of Manhattan, which, aesthetically, is the kindest thing the Fates could have visited upon you. Aside, of course, from the exit to this section, which is east. }{Subway Sandwich Shop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42445}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42449}{0}{}{The Wait (n,w)}{ }{       The smell of mayonnaise and bell pepper is daintily masked by the musky stench of human sweat. Here lies the wait, where you avoid eye contact, unfairly judge the opposite sex, and make bad conversation with even worse people, just to get a lousy sandwich. While you wait, you can stare idly at unappetizing chips and ancient cookies. You can back out of the line if you've lost your appetite, or you can bravely weather the tide of humanity and shove forward north. }{Subway Sandwich Shop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
