R {42475}{0}{<228>}{Mantis Swamp (s,n)}{<228>; ;<088>}{      The ground is damp and plush with long grass, stands of reeds and all sorts of bushes and shrubs. Cypress trees sprout from all directions and vines hang from the branches, twisting around everything within reach. Surprisingly, even in this polluted haze, some type of white flower blossoms from the vines, adding a touch of beauty to this awful place. }{Mantis Swamp}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42474}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
