R {42483}{0}{}{Lost City (jump)}{ }{    You've managed to get beyond the electric field and find yourself next to the food processor.  But it makes no difference, as the field still covers the entire pile of food.  Looks like you'll have to head back out of here. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
