R {42485}{0}{}{Lost City (sw,n)}{ }{   You have entered what seems to be the entrance into a hidden area which looks to be the headquarters of a gang.  You can make out an opening in the metal to the north and to the southwest, but nothing else. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {24302}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42486}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42486}{0}{}{Lost City (n,s)}{ }{      A tight path through the rubble walls, you have to be careful to keep from brushing up against anything.  A burning barrel to the north lights up the area just enough so you can see.  The rats scurry about and the slipshod area of girders above you make you wonder if they might not fall at any moment.  Still, they've stayed up this long, so they'll probably stay up through almost anything, right? }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42485}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42487}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42487}{0}{}{Lost City (n,s,w,e)}{ }{     A large intersection in the Bloods hideout, you wonder how they've kept it so well hidden from the rest of the people down here.  Small paths lead out all around you and a large fire burns in a barrel here to provide light.  Strange shadows flicker along the rubble walls as you look about, and you wonder if there might be something lurking about ready to attack. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
