E {42490}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42488}{0}{}{Lost City (s)}{ }{       You guess this is the sleeping quarters of the gang.  There are rags and half-torn sheets all over the place, and some carry the most disgusting stains you could imagine.  The air is very stale here and you have a strong urge to get out.  The barrel south from here is providing too much light as far as your concerned.  You have a queasy feeling in your stomach and a lump stops halfway up your throat.  But, beyond anything, you know this place is sicker than you want to imagine. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42487}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42489}{0}{}{Lost City (n,sw,e)}{ }{    You come up against the rubble wall, and can smell an extremely foul stench from the southwest.  A small path leads to the north and the barrel to the east provides light to see.  The ground is cluttered with rock and metal, and you can't even make out any dirt. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42487}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
