E {42492}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42490}{0}{}{Lost City (w)}{ }{    Nothing more here than the usual piles of wreckage, but hey, you've come to expect that down here.  You can't make out anything unusual beyond the funky shadows that the flames from the barrel throw along the walls, which look warm from the heat of the blaze. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42487}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42491}{0}{}{Lost City (n,s)}{ }{    You see a collection of foodstuffs all around, the gang's supply no doubt.  A security field lies around it and keeps you from getting to it.  Still, at least now you know they have food around here.  The gang probably barters it off for services and such too. }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42489}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42491}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42492}{0}{}{Lost City (ne)}{ }{     It smells putrid here, and no wonder, you immediately notice the huge pile of shit and urine in this area.  Obviously the gang felt a need for a private outarea of sorts.  You wretch at the sight and only make matters worse by adding the stench and sight of your puke to the pile. You seriously want to get out of here and fast! }{Lost City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42489}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

