R {42494}{0}{}{Secret Room (e)}{ }{      You are in a small dimly lit room.  Unlike the other rooms, this one is lit by a small fluorescence light built into the wall.  The ground is littered with old foodstuffs packaging.  A dirty and worn sleeping bag lies in the middle of the pile, along with a filthy pillow.  The smell of human sweat lingers heavily in the air, as well as the overpowering musk of fear.  A small doorway leads back out. }{Weather Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {565}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42495}{0}{}{Small stairway (d,out)}{ }{      You have stepped into a small room. The walls and the floor are made of steel. There's dust everywere and you get a feeling no one has been in here for a long time. A small stairwell  leads down underground. From the look of this room, this must be some kind of back door or emergency exit to some large  underground complex. }{Swede Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
