R {42496}{0}{}{Corridor (n,u)}{ }{     You stand at the bottom of a small stairwell. An underground tunnel formed as a pipe leads in the north direction. You notice a huge door at the end of the tunnel. Arrows are painted on the floor pointing south towards the stairwell. Obviously this is some kind of emergency exit. You  see broken lamps that flicker in the darkness. }{Swede Research Center}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
