R {42679}{0}{<238>}{An Underground Tunnel (se,nw)}{<238>] [<088>}{      You're crawl through the narrow gap and enter a small hollowed out area ... RATS!  You've disturbed a small haven of the beasts, and most of them scuttle out to the southeast.  A few of the larger ones remain behind and eye you cautiously.  The water has made the ground slick with moisture and a soft green moss ... it's very slippery and you'd hate to lose your balance with so many rodents around! }{Genlab}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {931}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42680}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42680}{0}{<238>}{An Underground Tunnel (se,nw)}{<238>] [<088>}{      You continue along the narrow tunnel, sloshing water and sending the small rodents flying.  The squeaking of the furry creatures sends a shiver up your spine.  You feel continuous movement in the water -- against your legs! -- and are repulsed by the thought that one of the smaller ones could be crawling up a pant leg ... shivering you steel yourself and continue, moving slowly across the slippery ground. }{Genlab}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42679}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42681}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42681}{0}{<238>}{An Underground Tunnel (nw)}{<238>] [<088>}{      You've stumbled into a small hollowed out area in the tunnel, and are horrified as you splash into a knee high pool of water and send RIPPLES of dark shapes from you as mice and rats scurry around the room!  The amount of squeaking is almost deafening!  You have entered a den of giant rodents!  Looking to the side of the cave you see a small ledge just above the water level. }{Genlab}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
