R {42685}{0}{}{An Underground Tunnel (e,w)}{ }{     You're finally at the object of your search, or so you hope!  To the east lies a large steel door, covered in dust so that you can barely make out the stenciled letters.  Beside it lies a small metal panel, with a faintly glowing display.  The passageway has opened up here, and the ceiling of the tunnel slants up to a height above the range of your lights. }{Genlab}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
