R {42686}{0}{}{A Genetics Lab (n,s,w,e)}{ }{       You've entered the main room of the lab.  The first thing to catch your attention is the huge window along the east wall.  Glancing though it you see a huge array of biological tubes, mixing machines, and electronic devices beyond.  Next to the window is a computer terminal, and an archway to enter the room.  On the south wall is another archway, with the stenciled letters `CRYO LAB' in a scientific-looking font.  The north wall is unadorned, except for an opening located in the center of the wall. }{Genlab}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
