R {42793}{0}{<178>}{Further up the mountain. (s,n)}{<178>. ,<088>}{      As you continue on the path north you notice that it gains more altitude and that you are getting closer and closer to the top of the mountain. However the altitude also means an even colder climate. With the freezing wind whipping all around you and everything you carry completely soaked you can't imagine a worse situation. The trailing path continues in a northern - southern direction. }{Mountain Path}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
