R {42795}{0}{<178>}{Just above a storm. (e,sw)}{<178>. ,<088>}{       Standing just above the dark storm cloud, you've reached a calm, icy canyon. It seems to stretch far off to the east snaking its way between the jagged mountain tops. Everywhere you look, you see vegetation completely encased in ice and the bright sun shining from above make the area literally explode in a cascade of brilliant colors. As you look down to the southwest you see the dark clouds and you are happy you made it through in one piece. }{Mountain Path}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42794}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
