R {42796}{0}{<238>}{At a canyon fork (ne,w,e)}{<238>.^.<088>}{        Following the canyon path you come upon something that looks like a road fork. The main canyon continues to lead from east to west. However, a small side path branches off to the northeast. Looking further ahead you notice that the small path ends in a cavern of some kind. The winter landscape engulfs the deep canyon making it seem like it was cloaked in a blanket made from the finest cotton. Here and there a lonely tree peeks up and its icy branches reflect the bright sunlight beautifully. }{Mountain Path}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42795}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42797}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
