R {42797}{0}{<248>}{Inside an ice cave (sw)}{<248>% %<088>}{           As you enter the shady interior of the cavern, your eyes fight to adjust from the bright light outside. After a little while, the haziness vanishes and you can make out details. The inside of the cavern seem to be completely covered with ice. You think you can see dark rock underneath but with the thick layer of ice covering it, you are not sure. Looking up you see large and potentially dangerous icicles hanging down from the ceiling. In the center of the cavern you see a very lifelike statue, almost as if a real person was frozen solid. Turning around, your eyes are temporary blinded by the immense light coming from the outside. A small fireplace seems to be in front of the statue. }{Mountain Path}{westersea_icecave}{}{}{1.000}{1}
