R {42914}{0}{}{Valley of the Gods (n,s)}{ }{     You enter the finest orchard in the valley, where crops produce a surplus of fruits and vegetables. Their products are never damaged, and they are always ripe and fresh. You realize that every fruit and vegetable imaginable is in this field, and that under the watchful eyes of Ceres, they will forever survive. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
