R {42920}{0}{}{Valley of the Gods (n,s)}{ }{     You are on the edge of a spice and herb field, enclosed in a small white fence. The fence serves as protection, to keep the delicate plants from being trampled. The scent of the herbs and spices are strong, almost overpowering. Looking around, you see that very few of the plants are familiar. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
