R {42921}{0}{}{Valley of the Gods (e,w,s)}{ }{     This is a small alcove, sitting off the grassy plains of the valley. A judge's stand sits in the center of the room, with a throne-like chair directly behind it. Two long tables face the stand, one on the right and one on the left. A jury's booth rests flush against the right wall. There are rows of chairs behind the tables. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
