R {42926}{0}{}{Palace Courtyard (s)}{ }{     You are in the middle of a beautiful courtyard. The gardens are beautiful and romantic, like something out of an epic poem. Before you looms an elegant palace that emits a soft, white, glowing hue. A fountain is here bubbling softly. The gentle music of a harp delights you.  The south exit is blocked by a door. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
