R {42927}{0}{}{The Foyer (n,e)}{ }{     You enter a huge, elegant foyer. The floor is ivory marble, and the walls are pale ivory with gold trimmings of angels, swans, and doves. Beautiful cathedral ceilings display marvelous architecture.  The room is bare of furniture, except for a polished table of pine wood. You hear music in the distance. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
