R {42931}{0}{}{Valley of the Gods (w)}{ }{    The grassy plain is cooler. You are on the edge of the northern part of the cliff, that overlooks the great River Ocean. A small pond sits in the middle of the field, halfway covered by a huge weeping willow. It is very peaceful here. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
