R {42932}{0}{<088>}{In a cool pond}{ }{The water is cool and refreshing. As your eyes adjust to the dim lighting, you focus on the bottom of the pond. There are treasures everywhere! Small tropical fish are swimming about, and other sealife such as starfish and aquatic plants speckle the floor. You realize that you aren't having any trouble with your breathing in here. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
