R {42933}{0}{}{Mercury's Study (e,w)}{ }{    This is where Mercury likes to get away and do the tasks he is assigned by Jupiter. There is a desk here, and it looks very neat and organized. On the back part of the wall, there is a small, gold perch. Resting on the perch is a dove. Two chairs sit facing the desk. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
