R {42934}{0}{}{Main Dining Room (e,w)}{ }{     This is the room where the gods come to feast every day on the celestial foods they adore. The room is dimly lit by the soft glow of candles. In the center of the room is an enormous table. Twenty chairs are arranged around it.  Lovely flowers are arranged in a beautiful centerpiece, and their sweet, gentle fragrance fills the room. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
