R {42935}{0}{}{Art Gallery (n,w,e)}{ }{    Paintings, sculptures, and ancient pottery that were lost over decades have been collected and stored in this room. At one time these art pieces were forgotten, but they were saved by the Muses, who brought them here for safe keeping. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
