R {42936}{0}{}{Altar Room (e,s)}{ }{     When mortals offer gifts to the gods, this is the room that they are received in. The room is pure of decoration, except for a few tasteful flower arrangements. A beautiful altar of gray and white marble sits in the center of the room. The only light is the soft glow of the candles. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
