R {42937}{0}{}{The Parlor (e,w)}{ }{    The gods come here to relax and sit together to chat about their work and play. There are several couches in the room, and fine little tables. You notice that the ceiling is made entirely of glass. From here, it seems you can touch the heavens. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
