R {42938}{0}{}{Battle Chamber (e,w)}{ }{    This is the room where the gods can come to spar and play. There are pieces of armour and weapons hanging from the wall. They are actually the history of the gods. Almost every item in here is special and holds some special memory for its owner. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
