R {42939}{0}{}{Banquet Hall (n,w)}{ }{    This is a large ballroom for formal occasions. The gods rarely participate in such public affairs, but the room is representative of the traditions of song, laughter and dance. The Graces are usually found here, when working on a project. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42938}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
