R {42940}{0}{}{Bath House (w)}{ }{    This is where the gods come to bathe, powder and perfume themselves. There is a large, round porcelain tub here, fragrance soaps and perfumes. The shelves are lined with fluffy towels. There is a small toilet here and a wash basin. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42937}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42941}{0}{}{Venus' Love Chamber (n,s)}{ }{     This is a plush room, with walls of red velvet and floors of ivory marble. Couches and chairs of pink silk are arranged carefully to surround her bed of satin and lace sheets. This is her private little world. You notice a puddle of blood in one corner of the room. It seems very out of place here. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
