R {42942}{0}{}{The Library (s,n)}{ }{   The gods take great pleasure in literature, and this small room is filled with books, both historical and modern. There are a few desks in the room as well as a couch. You notice a door to the north. }{Myth Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
