R {42944}{0}{}{Global Merc Barracks (w,e)}{ }{    A wide aisle travels down the centre of this spacious room. On either side of it are rows of bunks and footlockers, they continue in a similar manner further to the west. Identical weapons racks have been placed in the middle of each wall. }{Global Merc(Detroit)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
