R {42945}{0}{}{Global Merc Barracks (s,e)}{ }{     The wide aisle into this room from the eastern section of the barracks makes a turn southward to a metal door about half of the way into this room. The rows of bunks on the north and south sides extend from that point eastward into the next room, while off to the western side there is a strange device and a weapons rack. }{Global Merc(Detroit)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
