R {42946}{0}{}{A Fragrant Clearing (n)}{ }{    The fresh, peaceful smell of wild roses cascades over you. Rosebushes surround this little clearing, rising up to all but cover the cold impersonal first floor walls around you. Overlooking the pond in the centre is a little bench imbedded in the west rosebush. }{Global Merc(Detroit)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
