R {42948}{0}{}{Mission simulations workroom (s,w)}{ }{     The east wall of this room is dominated by a huge screen.  Just beside the screen, you can see a voice access panel.  While the screen is displaying nothing at the moment, you think that it could be used to show images of almost anything.  A hallway leads south to a large, open room and west to the stairs down to the first floor. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
