R {42949}{0}{}{Data interception workstation (s,e)}{ }{     Situated at the turning point of a hallway running east and south, this room is equipped with a Paradigm interface and a Sonybishi Pentad.  Three chairs all face the Pentad and you can see that some sort of data retrieval is going on.  To the east, you can see the landing and to the south you notice more computer equipment. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
