R {42950}{0}{}{A guard alcove (n)}{ }{     This tiny alcove has no desk or chair, just a padded mat lying on the carpeted floor.  While there is a fluorescent light fixed to the ceiling, it is currently off and the room is lit only by the light from the landing to the north.  Nothing else catches your eye in this bare room. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
