R {42951}{0}{}{Monitoring room (se,n)}{ }{    This small room has three monitors in a bank above a short desk.  The desk lies next to the southern wall and is fronted by a single chair.  A short hallway leads north to a room filled with computer equipment and a longer hallway leads southeast. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
