R {42953}{0}{}{A communal bunk room on the second floor (e,w)}{ }{      This medium sized room has four double bunks.  All of the bunks have been neatly made and each has two footlockers beside it.  The room is wood paneled and painted white.  Grey carpet covers the floor and light comes from the fluorescent bulb on the ceiling.  To the east, the room continues and contains another four bunks.  West is a long hallway. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42952}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42956}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42954}{0}{}{An armoury, empty of guns (e)}{ }{      This small room is obviously an armoury.  A workbench lies along the west wall.  Several barrels have been stored underneath the workbench and two empty racks hang on the north wall.  The room is lit by a single, fluorescent light and the floor is tiled.  Discarded tools litter the workbench but there is nothing being worked on at the moment. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42952}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42955}{0}{}{A large training room (sw,n)}{A}{     You immediately notice that this room has no carpet.  However, a large mat almost covers the wooden floor and appears to be thick enough to cushion a falling body.  Several fluorescent lights illuminate the training area.  A short hallway leads north to a quiet room and another short hallway goes southwest. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42952}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42948}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42956}{0}{}{A communal bunk room on the second floor (n,w)}{ }{      This medium sized room has four double bunks.  All of the bunks have been neatly made and each has two footlockers beside it.  The room is wood paneled and painted white.  Grey carpet covers the floor and light comes from the fluorescent bulb on the ceiling.  West, the bunk room continues and a short hallway leads north into what appears to be a private bedroom. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42953}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {42957}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42957}{0}{}{The main bedroom (s)}{ }{       While the plush, grey carpet and pale blue walls are exactly similar to the rooms outside, something about this room gives you a strong impression that a female sleeps here.  Perhaps it's the subtle fragrance or the floral pattern on the quilt covering the double bed.  Whatever it is, this room seems more personal than the rest of the rooms in this building.  A large dresser with a mirror stands against the eastern wall. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
