R {42958}{0}{}{A small storage closet (s)}{ }{     This room is not very big at all, you can almost touch two walls with your outstretched hands.  You can see three barrels stacked together near the western wall and an armour rack near the eastern wall.  A large button on the south wall is next to the door you entered by and the room is lit by a single, fluorescent light. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42957}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

