R {42960}{0}{}{A well-lit basement corridor (n)}{ }{    The walls of this corridor are made entirely of polished metal and the floor is thickly carpeted in blue.  Fluorescent lights are mounted on the ceiling and you can see a button at the southern end of the corridor. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {42961}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42961}{0}{}{Monitoring room in the basement (ne,nw,s)}{ }{     Like the other rooms in this basement, this room is completely walled in polished metal.  A single, fluorescent light is fixed to the ceiling and it illuminates a desk with a bank of three monitors.  A short corridor runs south and this room opens up to the northeast and northwest. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
