R {42962}{0}{}{A spartan bedchamber (w,sw)}{ }{    This must be the most empty bedroom you've ever seen.  It is simply carpeted floor with a pallet in one corner surrounded by blank walls of polished metal.  The room opens southwest and west and you feel almost overwhelmed by this much space. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
