E {42965}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {42963}{0}{}{A small, communications alcove (e,se)}{ }{     This room is very small and is almost entirely filled by the bulky, encrypted communications equipment in the northwest corner.  The walls and ceiling are made of polished metal and the room is lit by a single, fluorescent light.  You can see that the room opens out to the east and southeast. }{Silicon Wraiths HQ}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
