R {42966}{0}{}{Security Monitor Room (e)}{ }{       This room is barely large enough for one person to move around.  A bank of 9 monitors dominates the north wall of this cramped room.  Mounted on the wall below the monitors is a rectangular box made of black metal.  Facing the monitors are two plastic chairs that look intensely uncomfortable.  The walls are made of synthstone and the floor is covered in the same carpet as the foyer.  Fluorescent light shines down from the ceiling. }{European Robotics - Survey, Design and Development Office}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
