R {42967}{0}{<238>}{Belle Isle (s,w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{    This is the monkey house. It's very worn down and covered with monkey droppings. There are weeds growing out of the walls and floor. There are many dead trees and bars that the monkeys use for exercise. }{Detroit - Belle Isle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
