R {42978}{0}{}{Inside the COMSTAR Satellite (airlock,d)}{ }{    Standing just below the airlock leading to the shuttlebay, you can peer down the main tube and see for the entire length of the small station.  The tube itself is very narrow, and only about as long as a small house.  Farther  down the tube you can see several main terminal access panels glowing faintly. }{Weather Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
