R {42980}{0}{}{Inside the COMSTAR Satellite (d,u)}{ }{    This area is illuminated by many dials and readouts.  There is a computer console here, with a keyboard and several monitors.  A dim panel above the workstation reads 'Main Console'.  Farther up the tube you can make out the airlock, and down below you can see some stored equipment. }{Weather Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
