R {42981}{0}{}{Inside the COMSTAR Satellite (u)}{ }{     You have reached the bottom of the tube that runs the length of the satellite.  It seems this area is used to store extra equipment.  The lighting here is very dim, and there are no signs or labels on the walls. In the center of what could be called the floor is a pile of metal boxes, apparently containing spare parts. }{Weather Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
