R {42991}{0}{<238>}{Den of the Predators (out,se,sw,s)}{<238># ]<088>}{      This is obviously where the predators dwell when they are not out hunting people. A thick mist hovers about your ankles. This place, however, does not look like your normal cave. It is more like the inside of a space ship. The walls are not rock but shiny, reinforced metal. The light in the rooms seems to come from iridescent stones embedded in the walls. }{NASTAR}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
