R {42996}{0}{}{Sleeping quarters (n)}{ }{   This is where the predators sleep when they are not out hunting down humans for fun. There are 8 sleeping pods on each side of the room. All of them seem to be empty however. }{NASTAR}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
