R {42998}{0}{}{A tool room (s,n)}{ }{     This is obviously where the tools required to fix the ship are kept, when they are not in use. Various tools of high quality are neatly organized on the walls. There is a box of scrap metal that lies on the floor in the corner. There is a tremendous hum coming from the south. }{NASTAR}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
