R {42999}{0}{}{The Engine Room (n)}{ }{This is the room where the engine is located that drives this massive ship. It is quite large, and rather hot, almost glowing a faint red. The engine, occupies about three quarters of the room and is mostly sunk down beneath the floor on which you now stand.}{NASTAR}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
