R {43036}{0}{}{Throne Room (ne,nw,s)}{ }{       This is the throne room of the stronghold.  In this room the lord of the keep holds audience.  For some reason, however, this room has a palpable feel of pervasive evil, almost as if it was cursed.  Darkness seems to hang in the corners and spider webs drape a large dais.  Upon the dais there is some rubble. Small passages lead off to the northeast and northwest. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
