R {43117}{0}{}{Throne Room (nw,ne,s)}{ }{       This is the throne room of the stronghold.  In this room the lord of the keep holds audience.  For some reason, however, this room has a palpable feel of pervasive evil, almost as if it was cursed.  Darkness seems to hang in the corners and spider webs drape a large dais.  Upon the dais there is some rubble. Small passages lead off to the northeast and northwest. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43115}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43120}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43121}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43118}{0}{}{Antechamber (e)}{ }{     You currently stand in the antechamber for the hall of audience.  This is where people come to prepare themselves right before they have a royal audience. A plain chair rests against one wall, and a small hearth lies against another wall. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43115}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43119}{0}{}{Grand Hall (w)}{ }{    This is the grand hall of the stronghold.  A large hearth stands upon the east wall, and a large throne rests upon a dais near the north wall.  The south wall is entirely covered by a huge tapestry. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43115}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43120}{0}{}{Bottom of Staircase (u,se)}{ }{   You stand at the base of a large tower.  The walls are made of solid marble, and a large staircase rises upward into the higher levels of the tower. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
