R {43123}{0}{}{Top of the Tower (d)}{ }{    This spacious chamber fills the entire top of the tower. It's about 30 feet across, and taller than that, as the ceiling angles upward to a point.  A staircase in the center of the floor leads downwards. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
