R {43291}{0}{}{Approach to the Black Stronghold (se,nw)}{ }{          The path here widens to about twenty feet across, and the forest in this area has been cut back an additional twelve feet from the sides of the trail.  To the northwest, a large stronghold rises above the woods, thrusting twin towers over one hundred feet high.  The stone of the stronghold seems to be some sort of glorious black marble, which glistens in the brillance of the sun. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43290}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
