R {43292}{0}{}{Black Stronghold (n,se)}{ }{      Directly to the north stands a magnificent stronghold.  The stones of its construction appear to be hard black marble, and the lowered drawbridge is made of solid oak.  The way into the keep seems to be clear since the portcullis is  raised. Twin towers thrust high into the sky, and a large banner is flying from one of the towers. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
