R {43298}{0}{}{Room of the Undead (w)}{ }{      This large room is littered with rotting body parts, and a thick stench fills the warm air.  The dirt floor is crawling with insects and the walls are hidden under a thick slime of rotting matter.  In addition, a tattered tapestry hangs from one end of the room, apparently not yet decayed. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
