R {43375}{0}{}{Antechamber (e)}{ }{    You are standing in a fairly small room.  All of the walls, the floor, and the ceiling are covered in a thick layer of ice.  The ice is opaque white, and hides all features of the small room. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
