R {43376}{0}{}{Grand Hall (w)}{ }{      This room looks as if it might once have been used for a mess hall, since there is a large table and several chairs here.  The entire room, however, is now covered with a thick layer of frost and ice.  A chill hangs in the air, and your breath fogs as you exhale with each passing breath. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
