R {43432}{0}{}{Entrance Hall (n,w,e,s)}{ }{    This was formerly the entrance chamber of the keep, yet now the chamber lies in ruins.  The walls look badly scorched, and the floor is lined with smoking embers. In fact, this whole room has a very burned look to it. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
