R {43434}{0}{}{Room of Slag (nw,ne,s)}{ }{     This whole room looks as if the hottest fires of hell have blazed within it, burning wood and melting stone.  The walls and floor have been melted into a mass of slag, and all other features that may once have existed in this room have been  vaporized. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
