R {43435}{0}{}{Ruined Antechamber (e)}{ }{      At one time this was an audience chamber of grand proportions, yet now the furniture lies burned and broken upon the floor. In fact, the whole room looks as if a great blaze has swept through it, burning the wood and singing stone.  The only remaining feature of the room is a small chimney leading up through the ceiling. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
