R {43436}{0}{}{Cracked Hall (w)}{ }{    This appears to have once been a grand hall of some sort, yet it is now cracked in half.  The floor has cracked apart and has revealed a fiery stream of lava flowing underneath the castle.  The rest of the room has been melted into slag. }{Portal of Life v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
