R {43450}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{        You stand within a valley, an endless grassland that stretches out for what seems an eternity.  The horizon is broken only by massive mountains, their tremendous snow capped peaks shine in the flickering moonlight.  Light and shadow seem reversed, and the looming sky flashes with bolts of lightning.  As you move through the damp grass, a steady wind howls through the blades, making hearing difficult.  In addition, this gale seems to blow at you from all sides, stinging you with debris and choking you with pollen. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35448}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43451}{0}{<268>}{River Inlet (se,s,e,n)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{         Faint streaky pillows of storm clouds are swiftly spinning like floating shrouds.  So wayward is the wind to the inlet, it sends luminescent water droplets careening into the mist.  The lurking vapor sweeps about the inlet, as glowing droplets and darkness swirl around each other in constant battle.  This dank and dark bank has the smell of damp earth lingering in the air, an the eerie quiet is broken up by the hushed sounds of crickets singing along the inlet banks.  Sounds of rushing water echoing in the distance are the only indication, that the inlet point lies ahead. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35437}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35438}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43452}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43453}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43452}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (w,sw,s,n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{         Travel through the grasslands is unpleasant, regardless of the weather. Even the soft rain can be disheartening, as it hisses through the long blades, bending them slightly under the pressure.  The long blades of grass are hypnotizing as they blow back and forth in the wind.  Peering at the grassland floor, a mist is rising slowly from the grass and casting an opaque veil over everything within eyesight.  The haze is damp and chilly, its surface glowing with beads of water droplets. Swirling and twisting in the wind, the fog gives the impression at one moment of panic, boundless fear, at the next an immense grey wall. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35437}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43451}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43454}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {35438}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43453}{0}{<268>}{Right Point (s,e)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{          You're standing on a narrow jagged point littered with tiny pools of water, inhabiting its rocky pockmarked surface.  Raging rapids roll swiftly over the far end of this point, as it reaches slightly into the Chapel River.  As you look across the river, you notice that the force of the rapids continues to halt passage to the other side.  An indigo glow flickers over the tiny pools, as waning moonbeams fade in and out of view through the patchy cloud cover.  The cascading waters spastically explode as the river flows for miles in each direction, almost as if it intends to charge up the face of the looming mountains. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43451}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43454}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43454}{0}{<268>}{Chapel River bank (w,s)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{        Set back a short distance from the inlet point to the west, the soft-hued grey-brown pebble beach echos every foot step.  Wet with slime, water splashes vigorously against the shore, causing you to stumble slightly.  The tiny dark rocks on the beach seem to radiate a oily gleam, their surface reflecting the moonlight.  Gently the light caresses the rapids rolling swiftly down the river, and you notice that the awesome force of the water prevents passage across the river. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43453}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43452}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43455}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (e,w)}{<228>. ^<088>}{        Walking amongst the wet stalks of grass is tiresome at best.  Droplets of rain splash down onto the fields, as the beads of drizzle glow from reflecting fragments of moonlight.  The crashing sound of thunder looms high above this damp open valley, staved off only by a few flashes of chain lightning.  Looking down at the grassland floor, a mist is rising ominously from the grass and casting an opaque veil over everything within eyesight.  The haze is damp and chilly, and any further travel means walking through it. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35435}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43461}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43456}{0}{<228>}{Grassland Path (n,e)}{<228>, .<088>}{       Traveling along the trail through the damp fields, you notice a difference between the grass growing here and to the east.  To the east the open fields are far less dense allowing a traveler to wander about freely.  The valley grass grows almost to the river's edge up ahead in the distance, it's almost as if the grass is angry at the river for disrupting its progress north. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35445}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43458}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43457}{0}{<228>}{Chapel Grasslands (s)}{<228>, `<088>}{      The ominous sound of thunder looms high above this damp open valley, staved off only by a few flashes of chain lightning.  Walking amongst the wet blades of grass is tiresome at best, as droplets of rain splash down onto you.  Looking down at the grassland floor, a mist is rising from the stalks and casting an opaque veil over everything within eyesight. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35445}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43458}{0}{<238>}{Grassland Path (n,s)}{<238>. .<088>}{         A small trail continues to curve through the grassy valley, the blades too thick to allow passage off the path, except perhaps for the smallest of animals. Looking over the thick foliage, you notice the remnants of small wooden planks here, that spread out to the north.  From the current point you cannot see what may lie across the river, as a gloomy haze stands prominently to the north obscuring any view  in that direction. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43456}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43459}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43459}{0}{<238>}{A Ferry Dock (s,board)}{<238>|||<088>}{            Loud wooden thumps resonate over the river as your feet make contact with the small ferry dock below you.  Off to the side, the river does not look particularly inviting, and it might be best to avoid falling in.  Droplets of drizzle cover the wooden planks, causing the surface to appear oily in the flickering moonlight.  Radiant white light flashes out of the looming sky, casting a haunting glow across the surface of the calm water.  A set of shallow hills juts out from the banks that lie across the river, and one could begin to appreciate the great size and natural beauty of this region. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43458}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
