R {43466}{0}{<228>}{A Willow Tree (nw)}{<228>( *<088>}{       Radiant white light dashes out of the giant misty sky, casting an eerie glimmer across the outline of a monstrous willow tree.  Slashing wisps of phantom like branches are looming in the waning moonlight, the wind causing them to weep tears of rain.  Thick moss creeps its way up the roots of the tree on the western side.  The ground is densely carpeted with silver-speckled deep green leaves, and a flickering glow shines outward from a large hole in the tree. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
