R {43467}{0}{<268>}{Rocky Shore (sw)}{<268>~ ~<088>}{        The shore is quite rocky here, being in close proximity to the mountains rising directly out of the clouds to the east of you. The shore you're standing on is composed of a little sand and lots of rounded gravel, which the river is gradually wearing away to create more sand.  The rapids crash against a few boulders that lie directly in front of you, raising a booming sound as the air is displaced.  Looking out over the river, the current stands like a sentinel warning approaching travellers of its deadly force. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43465}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43468}{0}{<238>}{A Dilapidated Bridge (bridge,se)}{<238>===<088>}{        This once mighty wooden bridge spanned the Chapel river connecting it with the vast misty shores looming in the distance.  Raging rapids pound against its groaning structure, as cascading waters spastically explode across its surface.  Brilliant flashes of lightning streak out of the sky, casting a ominous glow upon the hordes of insects feasting on the rotting wood.  As you peer across the river you realize that the force of the currents would make it impossible to swim to the other side. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
