R {43470}{0}{<238>}{Nightshade Pub (out)}{<238>[P]<088>}{           Nightshade Pub - You've found your way to what seems to be a pub inside of a tree.  The trunk is small, with mostly bark covered walls and a scuffed wooden floor that has a matting of willow leaves to soak up spills.  It is warmed and lit by candles that are placed on the tables that dot the room.  On the wall behind the bar hangs a huge mirror with some writing on it, to the right of the bar a group of loitering patrons sit at some tables next to the back wall.  The animal bone bar is stained with a lustering dark hue and has several black swans engraved within it.  The back of the bar contains a cauldron as well as several bottles of various types of intoxicating herbs. }{Chapel Field}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
