R {43481}{0}{}{Fruit Grove (s,ne)}{ }{     The hum of bees fills the air, as does the sweet scent of ripening fruit.  Interspersed among the usual forest trees are strawberry plants, blueberry bushes, apple, pear, and peach trees - all heavy with summertime bounty.  Rocky outcroppings form natural seats, a perfect place to relax and enjoy the day. }{Unicorns}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
