R {43579}{0}{<148>}{Landsdrop's End (w)}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{            You are standing on a broad mesa with a shimmering mist- created rainbow arching up into the sky!  Landrider has come to an abrupt end creating the most awesome waterfall you have ever seen or even imagined as it plummets off of Landsdrop and falls thousands of feet to the defiled lands below.  Glistening with landsweat, a massive monolith rears up into the air here.   Your mind reels with the assault on all your senses.  The throb of falling water, the roaring sound of water, all combine to leave you shaken and awestruck before the majesty of the Land!  But a stink and miasmic haze pour from the broken monolith, staining the sight and weighing your already leaden feet. }{The Land}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
