R {43675}{0}{}{A crop circle! (w)}{ }{    You are in a crop circle in the middle of a huge field of barley!  This whole area feels wrong, and you get a strange urge to leave right away.  All the barley within the circle has been trampled flat, but it wasn't made by aliens, unless they leave hoof-prints. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43674}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43676}{0}{}{In a cowhouse (exit)}{ }{      A single large room makes up this well-kept cowhouse, a bovine's needs are obviously much more simple than a human's.  There is a clean layer of hay on the floor, and the room is lit by beams of sunlight coming in through the windows.  The door back out to the street stands in the middle of the northern wall, opposite a small kitchenette.  The room is otherwise unadorned, but very clean. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30708}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43677}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {43678}{0}{}{A disgusting cowhouse (exit)}{ }{      A foul stench fills the disgusting room of this cowhouse, so thick it is almost visible as it hangs in the air like a cruel beast.  The floor is totally hidden beneath months of accumulated rubbish, making for treacherous walking conditions.  The windows are open, but no breeze manages to make it past the mounds of rubbish outside to clear the house of its stink. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30718}{exit}{exit}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43679}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {43680}{0}{}{The west side of a parade ground (e,s,n,ne,se)}{ }{     Trees line the parade ground here, stretching north and south along the eastern edge of the field.  Nestled amongst the trees far off to the north are the gates leading back to Cowville proper, whereas far to the south there are some military-looking buildings painted in black and white. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
