R {43681}{0}{}{The north side of a parade ground (s,w,e,sw,se)}{ }{      Thick trees line the edge of the parade ground, casting a narrow line of shade along this portion of the grass.  The rest of the field extends south from here, providing plenty of space for marching drills and exercises.  Lining the eastern side of the parade ground are a few black and white buildings, though you cannot determine their purpose from here. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
