R {43682}{0}{}{The middle of a parade ground (s,e,w,n,nw,ne,se,sw)}{ }{      Boring, flat parade ground stretches out in all directions, making plenty of room for maneuvers.  Out here in the middle of the field, there is a sense of loneliness and isolation, perfect for breaking in those new recruits.  Far off to the west and north, trees can be seen casting a thin line of shade along the edges of the field, and off to east and south a few military buildings are visible. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
