R {43684}{0}{}{The south side of a parade ground (e,w,nw,n,ne)}{ }{    The parade ground stretches openly to the north, giving all the CowPat recruits plenty of room to practice their marching and drills.  Buildings line the southern edge of the field, though there doesn't appear to be a way in from here. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
