R {43685}{0}{}{Inside the Cowptains Office (n)}{ }{     The middle of the office is filled with an imposing desk, behind which is a basic, but functional, chair.  The top of the desk is almost completely bare, only a few small piles of paper, arranged with fanatical precision, mar the otherwise empty surface.  The walls are covered with maps, complete with little black and white push-pins. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43683}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43686}{0}{}{The southeast corner of a parade ground (w,se,nw,n)}{ }{    A large building with double doors dominates the southeastern corner of the parade ground.  Strange and disturbing smells waft out from between the doors, both enticing and at the same time repulsive.  Above the doors is a large bell, and a crudely-painted sign. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43684}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
