R {43687}{0}{}{The east side of a parade ground (s,e,w,n,nw,sw)}{ }{     The parade ground stretches out westwards, providing ample room for marching practice and endless sets of push-ups.  There is a gap between the buildings to the east, which seems to lead into the trees beyond.  From somewhere beyond the buildings, off to the southeast, you can hear the occasional scream of pain, or bellow of orders. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
