R {43699}{0}{}{South of a clump of trees (e,s,w,nw,sw,se,ne)}{ }{    A clump of tall, sparse-looking trees lies to the north, their shade and shelter beckoning invitingly.  Standing like the final group of defeated soldiers on a battlefield, they await their inevitable surrender to the grassy fields. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
