R {43714}{0}{}{A corner of nowhere (w,nw,n)}{ }{      The seemingly endless fields do indeed come to an end, abrupt and mind-boggling.  Absolute nothingness extends as far as you can see to the east and south, a massive void of grey emptiness.  By some strange trick of the eye, the nothingness was not visible when you were further away from the edge, almost as if the fields only now decided they should come to an end. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
