R {43745}{0}{}{The corner of a field (se)}{ }{      More than anywhere else in the field, the green, lush grass is hidden by gibbets of gore and flesh, leaving what few blades are visible dyed red by blood.  There is a strange throne, constructed of old, yellowing bones, sitting right on the brink of the drop into nothingness. The baby Cow King is pawing at the ground with his huge hooves. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
