R {43747}{0}{}{Warehouse loft (d)}{ }{     The barely accessible nature and the dark atmosphere could almost fool someone into thinking this was a forgotten loft, were it not for the complete lack of dust and cobwebs.  The low ceiling is lined with exposed roof beams and on the far wall, underneath the window, are several large and unmarked boxes. }{Cowville Moofia}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
