R {43750}{0}{}{A Sandy Beach (s,e,sw,se,board)}{<afa>B<088>}{       The brilliant white sand is hot underfoot, and is mussed with a countless number of hoof-prints.  Obviously this island is a popular holiday destination.  The crystal-clear ocean stretches endlessly to the northwest, reflecting the bright sun in a million tiny sparkles, and to the southeast, beyond the gently sloping sands, you can make out a lush green rainforest.  A small bell is mounted on a pole that has been driven into the sand. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
