R {43751}{0}{}{A brilliant beach (e,w,n,ne,sw)}{ }{      Hoof-prints muss the sandy beach, evidence of both native islanders and foreign visitors to the island.  Despite the prints, the beach is absolutely gorgeous, as picturesque a sight as you are ever likely to see.  The hot sand is met by a dense line of rainforest to the south, the interior of which looks cool and damp.  The sands slope gently down towards the ocean to the north. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
