R {43755}{0}{}{In the Ocean (d,shore)}{ }{      You are somewhere in the ocean just off the Isle of Cows - the currents are very strong, disorientating you by dragging you under the water then swirling you around.  You don't seem to be getting any further away from shore, and with a bit of effort could probably make it to land.  The sandy ocean floor drops away sharply beneath you, disappearing into darkness. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
