R {43756}{0}{}{Deep in the Ocean (d,u)}{ }{     With ocean currents dragging you every which way, you really have no idea where you are.  Thankfully you can still see the surface up above you, and could make your way towards it without too much difficulty.  The dark depths of the ocean drop away beneath you, making it impossible to see the bottom. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
