R {43758}{0}{}{Deep in the Dark Ocean (u)}{ }{      It is extremely dark at the bottom of the ocean, and your light illuminates strange shapes half-buried in the sandy ocean floor.  The shapes are darker than the ocean around them, some looming out of the white sand to tower above you.  The ocean is slightly lighter in colour high above you, so you can still make out which way to go if you want to head towards the surface. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
