R {43762}{0}{}{A confusing underwater ruin (s,n)}{ }{      The walls around you are slowly crumbling away, but there is still enough of a shell standing to make swimming through the ancient building difficult.  Small particles float in the water, drifting to and fro and making it more difficult to see.  Strange burbling sounds ripple through the building, echoing off the walls.  You think you could squeeze through gaps in the stone to the north and to the south. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
