R {43763}{0}{}{Deep in some underwater ruins (u,s)}{ }{     The building all around is confusing, its walls all looking the same in the darkness of the ocean.  Tiny blemishes in the stone reflect your light, making the walls sparkle.  The water shifts behind you, but when you swivel around there is nothing there.  You think you could squeeze through gaps in the stone to the south and above you. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
