R {43764}{0}{}{Sunken ruins (e,n)}{ }{      Its purpose lost in the ocean of time, as well as the ocean of water, the crumbling building all around you is now slowly turning to ruins.  Tiny blemishes in the stone reflect your light, making the walls sparkle.  Strange burbling sounds ripple through the building, echoing off the walls.  You think you could squeeze through gaps in the stone to the north and to the east. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43762}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43765}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43765}{0}{}{Maze-like ruins (w,e)}{ }{     The building all around is confusing, its walls all looking the same in the darkness of the ocean.  Your light bounces off the dark stone, casting strange shadows in the water.  It may prove to be easier to get into the building than to find your way out again.  You think you could squeeze through gaps in the stone to the east and to the west. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
