R {43937}{0}{}{A dense forest (e,s,ne,se,sw)}{ }{       Trees stretch upwards, forming a thick canopy overhead which shades the smaller plants.  Though it is nice and cooling for you after the heat of the beach, the other plants must struggle without a direct source of light.  Breaking through the forest, the steep rocky slope of a mountain lies to the northwest, far too sheer to consider making your way up.  The shady interior of the forest continues away from the mountain to the southeast. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
