R {43938}{0}{}{Inside a hut (exit)}{ }{     The hut is just as plain on the inside as it was on the outside, with a sandy floor and walls made from palm fronds.  It is dry and quiet though, which are probably the main things in island life.  The floor is scuffed with hoof-prints and larger indentations which might be from somebody sleeping. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
