R {43944}{0}{}{A precarious mountain path (w,e)}{ }{     Curving smoothly around and up the mountain, the path is well-worn despite being narrow and somewhat dangerous.  Generations of native cows must have worn this trail smooth with their hooves as they trudge up the mountain to pay homage to their deity.  Not too far below you can see the path drop into the forest. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43934}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43945}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43945}{0}{}{A precarious mountain path (w,se)}{ }{    The path up the mountain appears rather crude, formed by constant use rather than by any plan.  It serves its purpose, however, and leads all the way from the base of the mountain to the highest peak.  The path cuves downward towards the lush green forest to the west. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43944}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43946}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43946}{0}{}{A spiralling mountain path (nw,s)}{ }{     Rising from the center of the island, the cone-shaped mountain of solid rock dominates the landscape.  The path used by the natives on their daily ascent winds around the mountainside, slowly climbing towards the peak.  The path curves quite sharply here, allowing you to only see a small distance up to the south and down to the northwest. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43945}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43947}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43947}{0}{}{A cramped mountain path (n,s)}{ }{      Exposed to the relentless heat of the sun, the smooth rock of the mountain reflects some of the warmth, catching you in the middle.  Winding up the mountainside, a path has been formed by years of native cows climbing the mountain daily.  The path straightens and widens slightly here, allowing enough room for two cows travelling in opposite directions to pass each other. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43946}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43948}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43948}{0}{}{A precarious mountain path (n,sw)}{ }{      Curving smoothly around and up the mountain, the path is well-worn despite being narrow and somewhat dangerous.  Generations of native cows must have worn this trail smooth with their hooves as they trudge up the mountain to pay homage to their deity.  The path curves around a large boulder protruding from the mountain, leaving very little room to move. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43947}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43949}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43949}{0}{}{A breathtaking mountain path (ne,w)}{ }{     Curving smoothly around and up the mountain, the path is well-worn despite being narrow and somewhat dangerous.  Generations of native cows must have worn this trail smooth with their hooves as they trudge up the mountain to pay homage to their deity.  The curving path is steep here, but has been pitted over time so as to almost form steps. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43948}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43950}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43950}{0}{}{A slender mountain path (e,w)}{ }{      Rising from the center of the island, the cone-shaped mountain of solid rock dominates the landscape.  The path used by the natives on their daily ascent winds around the mountainside, slowly climbing towards the peak.  The path flattens slightly, becoming almost horizontal for this short period, before once again beginning its ascent to the west. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43949}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43951}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43951}{0}{}{A narrow mountain path (e,nw)}{ }{      Rising from the center of the island, the cone-shaped mountain of solid rock dominates the landscape.  The path used by the natives on their daily ascent winds around the mountainside, slowly climbing towards the peak.  A sharp curve in the path leads you up the mountain to the northwest, or you can see the path flatten slightly to the east. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43950}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43952}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43952}{0}{}{A slender mountain path (se,n)}{ }{      Exposed to the relentless heat of the sun, the smooth rock of the mountain reflects some of the warmth, catching you in the middle.  Winding up the mountainside, a path has been formed by years of native cows climbing the mountain daily.  The path here has partially crumbled away, leaving only the narrowest of trails to continue upwards. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43951}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43953}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43953}{0}{}{A tapering mountain path (s,ne,n)}{ }{      Other than the crude path leading upwards, the rock of the mountain is plain and featureless.  Stretching into the sky from the middle of the island leaves the whole mountain exposed to the weather, which over time has scrubbed the surface smooth.  The path forks here, continuing upwards to the northeast, downwards to the south, or leading towards a lookout to the north. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43952}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43954}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43955}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43954}{0}{}{A thin mountain path (sw,e)}{ }{      Baking in the hot sun, the mountain rises out of the forest and towers over the island.  Being such a dominant feature of the landscape, it is not hard to see why the natives focus much of their life around the mountain.  The spiral of the path tightens towards the summit of the mountain, meaning you can see only a short distance down the path to the southwest, and even less up the path to the east. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43953}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43956}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43955}{0}{}{A thin mountain path (s)}{ }{      Curving smoothly around and up the mountain, the path is well-worn despite being narrow and somewhat dangerous.  Generations of native cows must have worn this trail smooth with their hooves as they trudge up the mountain to pay homage to their deity.  The path opens into a small rest area here, where weary cows obviously rest from their climb. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43953}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43956}{0}{}{A thin mountain path (w,se,e)}{ }{    Walking up the mountain reveals a wonderful view of the Isle of Cows, the green forest below and the sparkling blue ocean beyond.  The path branches here, another rest area lying to the east, while the path continues up the mountain to the southeast. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43954}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43957}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43958}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43957}{0}{}{A tapering mountain path (sw,s,nw)}{ }{     Walking up the mountain reveals a wonderful view of the Isle of Cows, the green forest below and the sparkling blue ocean beyond.  The summit seems very close, as the spiral of the path draws inwards towards the top.  A natural rockfall has created a small open area to the south. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43956}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43959}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43960}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43958}{0}{}{A treacherous mountain path (w)}{ }{    The path slowly winds its way up the steep mountainside, spiralling around the cone-shaped mountain.  A small rest area lies between two boulders, allowing for the faithful to catch a breath before continuing their climb. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43956}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43959}{0}{}{A slender mountain path (ne,w,nw)}{ }{      Exposed to the relentless heat of the sun, the smooth rock of the mountain reflects some of the warmth, catching you in the middle.  Winding up the mountainside, a path has been formed by years of native cows climbing the mountain daily.  The path gets very steep as it climbs towards the summit to the northwest, and a final rest area lies to the west. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43957}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43961}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43962}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43960}{0}{}{A cramped mountain path (n)}{ }{     Exposed to the relentless heat of the sun, the smooth rock of the mountain reflects some of the warmth, catching you in the middle.  Winding up the mountainside, a path has been formed by years of native cows climbing the mountain daily.  Formed by a natural rockfall, this section of path is a dead-end, but allows for a picturesque view. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43957}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43961}{0}{}{A treacherous mountain path (e)}{ }{    The path slowly winds its way up the steep mountainside, spiralling around the cone-shaped mountain.  The last rest area before the final climb to the summit, the path here widens onto a small, circular outcrop. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43959}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43962}{0}{}{A precarious mountain path (se,e)}{ }{     The path slowly winds its way up the steep mountainside, spiralling around the cone-shaped mountain.  A set of wide, steep stairs leads upwards to the mountaintop, their center worn through decades of use.  On either side of the base of the stairs, a large brazier filled with flames fill the air with a pungent aroma. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43959}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43963}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43963}{0}{}{On a Mountaintop (w)}{ }{     The peak of the mountain has been worn away, leaving a large circular area of flat stone.  You can see for miles in all directions, out over the slopes of the mountain, over the lush green forest and sparkling white beach to the endless blue ocean.  All around the circumference have been placed an array of large carved udders. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43962}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43964}{0}{}{A dark cave (e,w)}{ }{      The cave is painfully narrow, barely wide enough to scoot through sideways.  A small crevice to the east lets in a pathetic amount of light that is almost overcome by the cloying darkness but lets you just make out the almost unnaturally smooth rock.  The cave might widen slightly to the west, but it might just be a trick of the darkness. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43893}{e}{e}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43965}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43965}{0}{}{A dark cave (e,sw)}{ }{     The cave is quite narrow, pushing in from both sides as well as above. Thankfully the walls and ceiling are perfectly smooth, allowing you to push your way through without worrying about injuring yourself.  The darkness is overwhelming and complete, and feels like it could be hiding anything beyond the small area you can see. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43964}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43966}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43966}{0}{}{A dark cave (s,ne,nw)}{ }{     The cave branches in three directions, leading south, northwest and northeast.  Every direction is pitch black, and although there are muffled sounds bouncing off the rock walls, it is impossible to tell where they emanate from.  A breeze ruffles past you as it emerges from the northeast and disappears south. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43965}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43967}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43968}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43967}{0}{}{A dark cave (s,n)}{ }{     A cool breeze filters through the cave, indicating there must be more than one way out.  No natural light makes it this far into the cave, plunging the entire place into complete darkness which could hide almost anything.  There is plenty of room to move around, but the cave narrows to the north indicating it might be harder to progress. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43966}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43970}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43968}{0}{}{A dark cave (sw,se)}{ }{     The cave is filled with echoes, and a strange red glow seems to emanate from the southwest.  It feels warm here too, the stone that was cold throughout most of the dark cave is hot to the touch.  Complete darkness and the normal coolness of the cave lies to the southeast, where the caves open up slightly. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43966}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43969}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43969}{0}{}{A dark cave (ne)}{ }{      Blood-red light flickers from a large oval portal in the smooth stone floor of the cave, revealing a disturbing and horrifying place.  Images of torture and death cover the walls painted in dripping and dried blood.  Assaulting your ears are strained and harsh voices that tear at your heartstrings as they cry out in pain and suffering.  It seems as if hell itself lies beyond the portal. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43968}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {43971}{jump into portal}{jump into portal}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
