R {43970}{0}{}{A dark cave (n,s)}{ }{     The light from the hidden entrance to the cave quickly fades, leaving the deeper portions of the cave bathed in shadow.  The hard stone of the mountain has been worn smooth on the walls, floor and ceiling of the cave, but it impossible to tell if it is cow-made or a natural occurrence.  The cave extends further into the mountain to the north. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43967}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {43971}{0}{}{Hell of the Unbelievers}{ }{}{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
