R {44018}{0}{}{The office of Dr. Fred (e)}{ }{     You are in a doctor's office, specifically the office of the eminent psychiatrist and logics expert Dr. Fred. There is a desk here, and several bookshelves. There is also a large padded leather chair for the doctor, and a couch in the corner for the patient. The room is lighted with track lighting from above. }{Cloud City}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
