R {44173}{0}{}{In a cave (s,w)}{ }{      Stalactites and stalagmites are scattered across the floor and ceiling. Water drips from the tips of the stalactites to the ground below. Bats can be seen hanging up in the darkest areas of the ceiling. Bat guano covers the floor, waiting to be stepped in by the unwary adventurer. Small rodents scurry about, investigating the guano and scavenging for food dropped by the bats. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
