R {44175}{0}{}{In a cave (w,e)}{ }{      A misty moisture fills the air giving this part of the cave an eerie feeling. The moisture is coming from small puddles of stagnant water that have formed. The moisture has lead to the growth of mushrooms and other vegetation on the ground. Small insects crawl back and forth across the ground. The cave walls themselves are slightly softer from the moisture they have absorbed. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
