R {44200}{0}{}{Wilderness (s,n)}{ }{     The path bulges around a large ancient tree that sits in a clearing. No weeds or plants grow within an eight foot diameter of the tree, cut off by an invisible barrier. Large foot prints are tracked all around the base of the tree, and patches of thick hair have been shed in various places. A mystical energy surrounds this place. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
