R {44281}{0}{}{Countess's chambers (n)}{ }{      You have finally arrived at the bottom of the giant underground structure. This chamber has some significance to the owner of the tower, as two large standers hold giant family crests in the corners of the room. A large chest sits in the middle of the room. A doorway leads back out into the winding hallways of the maze that brought you here. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44280}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44282}{0}{}{In a cave (sw,n)}{ }{      Stalactites and stalagmites are scattered across the floor and ceiling. Water drips from the tips of the stalactites to the ground below. Bats can be seen hanging up in the darkest areas of the ceiling. Bat guano covers the floor, waiting to be stepped in by the unwary adventurer. Small rodents scurry about, investigating the guano and scavenging for food dropped by the bats. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44180}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44283}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44283}{0}{}{In a cave (nw,s)}{ }{      A misty moisture fills the air giving this part of the cave an eerie feeling. The moisture is coming from small puddles of stagnant water that have formed. The moisture has lead to the growth of mushrooms and other vegetation on the ground. Small insects crawl back and forth across the ground. The cave walls themselves are slightly softer from the moisture they have absorbed. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
