R {44293}{0}{}{In a cave (n,e)}{ }{       Roots hang down from overhead, grasping for dirt that isn't there. The walls are rippled, as if a giant earth worm had created the tunnel. A layer of dust in the air twinkles in the light. Small bugs dart from one side of the tunnel to the other, sometimes being intercepted half way by a hungry spider. The walls are covered with cracks, some fairly deep. The air is completely still, devoid of any breeze that could have made it this deep. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
