R {44348}{0}{}{A small laboratory (u)}{ }{       You find yourself in a small square room.  The walls and floor are painted white and are very clean.  This appears to be some sort of a research lab.  Counters line the walls around the room with cabinets above and below them.  Flasks, graduated cylinders, and glass tubing clutter the counter tops.  A table situated in the middle of the room has a rather large box on it.  A small desk is set off to one side, cluttered with papers and pens.  On the south wall is a ladder. }{Laboratory Maze}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44350}{u d}{u d}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {19408}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

