R {44351}{0}{}{Hockey Hall of Fame (ne)}{ }{       You've somehow managed to land yourself in the Hockey Hall of Fame. How do you know this? Well maybe it's the big sign in front of you that says "Welcome to the Hockey Hall of Fame". The walls are adorned with tons of hockey memorabilia. All of it is labeled with little plaques that tell the history of each item. Now the only question is, once you are done absorbing this vast vault of hockey knowledge, how do you get back where you came from? }{Hockey Hall of Fame}{hockey_hall_of_fame}{}{}{1.000}{1}
