R {44556}{0}{}{Bedchamber (nw)}{ }{      The merchant's bedchamber.  And you thought the rest of the house was overdone. You have never seen anything like this, the bed is obviously made out of wood, except you can't see any wood because of the excessive amount of wealth  adorning it. There is a bright silver mirror on the east wall as large as a  barge, which looks a little suspicious. And on the east wall you see a bar  with many extremely expensive and heavy robes hanging from it. }{Rich Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44554}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44560}{push mirror}{push mirror}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44560}{e}{push mirror}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44557}{0}{}{A cluttered study (w)}{ }{        You entered what is obviously a study.  On the east end you see a large  oak desk.  As with the rest of the house gold is not infrequent.  There are  gold lamps, gold picture frames, even the carpet is gold in this room.  You  shake your head in disbelief as your mind reminds you of your visit to the  other side of Wayhaven.  It is astounding that a man can display such things, while not a mile across town babies are starving in the gutter. It absolutely disgusts you. You feel a strong need to liberate some of this man's wealth. For his own good, of course... }{Rich Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44554}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44558}{0}{}{A very messy kitchen (s)}{ }{     This is the kitchen where you see pots and pans needing washing in the sink and plates warming on the fire waiting for the pheasant to be done.  Fresh  baked bread stands cooling from its time in the oven.  Whoever does this cooking must have worked hard as you see the massive amount of food that is  prepared. }{Rich Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44554}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

