R {44560}{0}{}{A dark and dank storeroom (w)}{ }{    As you step behind the mirror you enter a room that is a little disappointing  considering the rest of the house.  Lying on the floor are several chests and  barrels lying against each wall.  A solitary weapons rack stands in the  center of the room. }{Rich Mansion}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
