R {44576}{0}{}{Top of a hill (w)}{ }{     From up here you can see the entire camp. Tents and camp fires are scattered in front of you as far as the eye can see. You stand appears on a sturdily built platform on the edge of an extremely large hill. The air up here is quite thin and occasionally an extremely cold breeze passes through chilling you to the bone. }{Longshadow Camp}{kill captain for key}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {9014}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44577}{0}{}{Ryogi-Pei Docks (e)}{ }{     This is the end point of a long dock which heads inland towards a small building.  The building is dwarfed by a large city wall that rises up at the shoreline.  Foreboding cliffs make the possibility of ships docking anywhere else on this part of the island impossible.  The ferry you arrived on is waiting here for you to board it. }{Ryogi-Pei Docks}{ryogi_pei}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44578}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44578}{0}{}{Ryogi-Pei Docks (e,w)}{ }{     Small waves make lapping sounds against the dock that runs out from the city walls.  A little farther to the east is a small building that the dock runs into. Foreboding cliffs rise up from the shoreline which make the possibility of ships docking anywhere else on this part of the island impossible. }{Ryogi-Pei Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44577}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44579}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44579}{0}{}{Ryogi-Pei Docks (e,w)}{ }{     You are now quite near the small building that the dock runs into.  The building is a bustle of activity as fishermen and laborers carry equipment and cargo in and out of it.  Some of the cargo is stamped with a fancy seal which gives you the impression that the building ahead must be some form of port authority. }{Ryogi-Pei Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44578}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44580}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44580}{0}{}{The Port Authority (e,w)}{ }{                 **  Ryogi-Pei Port Authority  ** Upon entering the building you are greeted by a hustle and bustle  of activity.  Around you, men in workman's garb move packages from  the dock side of the building out a door on the city side.  All  of the action is overseen by a plump looking official in bright  orange robes who stands behind a counter reading a tally sheet.  }{Ryogi-Pei Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44579}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44581}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44581}{0}{}{Ryogi-Pei Checkpoint (s,w,n)}{ }{    A long line of citizens moves through a checkpoint here where gate guards check them for contraband and to ensure that only those authorized by the government are allowed entry.  To the west lies the port authority and a path runs north/south along the city walls. }{Ryogi-Pei Docks}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44580}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
