R {44586}{0}{<228>}{In a forgotten sewer (e,s,n)}{<228>= =<088>}{      It would seem you've stumbled into an older part of this long abandoned sewer. It seems that the further east you go the less familiar this place is getting. In fact, the walls look like they are going to give way at any moment. The smell is putrid, and you feel like you are going to suffocate as the air is so much thinner here. There appears to be a hole in the western wall. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
