R {44587}{0}{<228>}{In a forgotten sewer (w,s,e,n)}{<228>= =<088>}{    The air is thinner here, which makes it more difficult to breathe. The ground is littered with decayed leaves and twigs and various other bits of decomposing paper. The tunnel opens up in all directions, making it seem like and endless maze of twists and turns. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
