R {44588}{0}{<228>}{In a forgotten sewer (s,e,n)}{<228>= =<088>}{     The ground is uneven and causes you to lose your balance as you try and trudge your way through this old abandoned sewer. Trying to grasp the walls for support only causes debris to fall down on you. What is holding this place up exactly? Lets just hope you are long gone when it does decide to collapse. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
