R {44589}{0}{<228>}{In a forgotten sewer (e,s)}{<228>= =<088>}{     Walking through this old decrepit sewer, the smell of sulfur is especially strong in this area. Having only two openings seems to trap the smell and the lack of air flow keeps it from moving around. There's a distinct lack of vermin in this area\; even they can't stand the smell. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44586}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44590}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44590}{0}{<228>}{In a forgotten sewer (s,w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{     These tunnels are endless as you wander further through them. Strange sounds and the relentless stench is making it harder to trudge on. Whatever lives down here obviously has no problem living in these conditions, after all, it's probably them that are responsible for all this. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44589}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
