R {44591}{0}{<228>}{In a forgotten sewer (s,w,e)}{<228>= =<088>}{    The walls are full of slime, which upon closer inspection seem to be eating through the stone. No wonder this place is ready to cave-in. The ground feels warm to the touch and the dirt is not as firm here. Small insect tracks show that this sewer is still vibrant with life. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
