R {44640}{0}{<228>}{Queen of the Blob's Lair (w)}{<228>= =<088>}{        This room is like no other you've seen. It's hollowed out like the rest, but looks like something out of a science experiment. Attached to the walls are little baby blobs, no bigger than the size of a baseball. These things seem to just sit there and pulsate. Green slime covers every surface, causing steam to rise everywhere. Standing before you in the middle of the room, this blob puts the size of the other blobs to shame. This naturally must be the queen who does not appear to be happy that you are here. }{Forgotten sewers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
