R {44689}{0}{}{Public School Conspiracy (s)}{ }{      Here, the madness has become more nefarious.  You stand before the most dreaded institution of a young person's life ... the public education system.  Teachers here are underpaid and overworked.  Off in the distance you can barely make out the administrators embezzling away.  Of course the public schools are in on it ... it has to start somewhere. }{Illuminati Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
