R {44696}{0}{}{Underneath The Branch Davidian Complex (u)}{ }{     You are in a school bus buried underneath the Branch Davidian Complex and finally face to face with the madness that sparked the controversy.  There are elves running everywhere, building toys and making lists.  This is crazy!  Off in the back you see a large sleigh with twelve reindeer harnessed to it. }{Illuminati Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
