R {44697}{0}{}{Inner Sanctum (portal)}{ }{        You have stepped out into another dimension!  Weird, never-before-seen colors with names like GanGreen and UltraViolent shimmer in and out of existence around you.  Completely absurd things are wandering by with no order or structure.  In the middle of space, you notice a huge golden apple with something clearly engraved on it.  Flanking the apple are two silver seals, lifting the apple off the invisible plane that appears to serve as a floor here.  There is a shimmering portal behind you. }{Illuminati Pyramid}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
