R {44853}{0}{<238>}{** Inside the Banyan Tree ** (u,out)}{<238># ]<088>}{          You're actually standing inside the Banyan Tree. You find the inside of the tree is even larger than it looks from the outside. Roots twine all around you, circling you and twisting upwards as well as deep into the ground at your feet. Green shoots rise into the air above you carrying water and other nutrients throughout the tree's system. Soft wood pulp squishes under your feet and fresh young bark grows on the walls, not yet exposed to the weather and elements outside that will toughen it over time. A natural staircase is formed along one of these bark walls that you can climb up if you wish to explore the tree further. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15476}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {15476}{n}{out}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44854}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44854}{0}{}{** Inside the Banyan Tree ** (d,u)}{ }{         The inside of the tree is a little darker at this height. The walls are thicker, the bark tougher and drier. You're standing on a platform grown naturally from the roots of the tree as they grew so entwined that they formed a mass of living tissue thick enough to support your weight. The green shoots from below are more of a yellowish color here, still working their way up to the top of the tree, carrying needed nutrients to every portion of the tree's system. The staircase you arrived on leads back down below and it continues up above as well. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44853}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44855}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44855}{0}{}{** Inside the Banyan Tree ** (d)}{ }{        You've reached the top of the Banyan Tree. Magical lights sparkle in the air, dancing on the slight breeze that wafts through the room. The twisting roots that wind throughout the tree gather here, combining to form a huge living space that resembles a blossoming flower. Sap drips from the walls, its sweet fragrance filling the room. The yellow shoots climbing up the walls glow, giving off a phosphorescent light. Magical energy seems to hum along the floor as if it were statically charged. The staircase winds back down from the corner of the room. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44854}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44856}{0}{<108>}{** A Hidden Pit ** (u)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{        This dark pit seems to have been dug out of the mountain to trap unsuspecting travelers. It's dominated by a set of large wooden spikes that have been drilled down into the stone, pointed towards the opening up top. They look quite deadly for anyone that might have the misfortune of landing on them from above. It's a miracle you are even alive to see this place! The floor and walls of the pit are made from the same black stone that the mountain consists of. It isn't so deep you couldn't climb back up out of it if you so desired. }{Isle of Ao}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15475}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
