R {44898}{0}{<118>}{^\;^ Char's Lair ^\;^ (se)}{<118>` ^<088>}{       Light flickers against the black rock of this cavern, radiating from the flames that ring the pile of treasure sitting in the center of the room. The treasure is piled like a mountain of coins, heirlooms, and trinkets, all of them glittering brightly, tempting the eye and the mind with the siren call of wealth and greed. This is the underground lair of the Fire Dragon, Char, and all who come across it should shudder in fear and exhilaration. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
