R {44899}{0}{<278>}{^\;^ Midnight Key Entrance ^\;^ (enter)}{<278>.@.<088>}{         This rocky platform is the only dry land you are able to reach. You are surrounded by the waters of Sapphyre Bay, leaving this small key the lone spot of black on an otherwise crystal blue horizon. Off in the distance to the west, you can see the hazy shore of the Isle of Ao. Seagulls occasionally fly high overhead, screeching their plaintive cries while they search the waters and rock for sustenance. Before you, a gaping hole in the rock seems to lead underground, beneath the bay and into darkness. It looks like this cave mouth is the only exit. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
