R {44924}{0}{<148>}{^\;^ Lixvius's Lair ^\;^ (nw)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{       Water sloshes along the edges of the island of treasure piled high before you. Rising out of the murky water like a golden mountain, the treasure is piled high and deep. This is the hoard of Lixvius, Sea Dragon of Ao. The treasure glitters prettily in your light, tempting you despite the inherent danger in stealing from dragons. This underground trove has lain hidden for centuries. You'd be wise to avoid temptation and escape while you still can. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
