R {44925}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Entrance to the Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (s)}{<248># #<088>}{       You've discovered a hidden cavern buried beneath the Isle of Ao. The air is dry and smells of decay. The stench is likely a result of the bones that litter the floor of this cave. The bones lie in piles alongside the rough hewn walls of rock that enclose this space as well as in the center of the room where a pit has been dug. The pit is almost completely full of skeletal remains. A passage leads away from this cavern and deeper into the Labyrinth to the south. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
