R {44942}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (n,s,e)}{<248># #<088>}{       This passage leads between a large cavern to the north and a series of smaller caves that veer off both to the east and the south. It is very dark in this cavern, you can barely see your hand before your face despite your light source. The rock of these caves is inky black and sharp corners along the walls present possible hazards everywhere you turn. The floor of this passage is bumpy and seems to slope up a bit as you travel southward. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44941}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
