R {44943}{0}{}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{       You've found a hidden platform that serves as a landing for a steep staircase that rises above you into the darkness. The stairs are very wide and smooth. They are obviously hand-carved, but by whom, you have no idea. The howl of the wind is very loud in this underground cavern. It is emanating from somewhere up above you beyond the stairs. The force of this downdraft almost knocks you off your feet, buffeting you back against the rock walls. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
