R {44944}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (s,d)}{<248># #<088>}{      You're standing in a dark cavern that slopes steeply upward to the south. A strong wind blows in the opposite direction, making any uphill progress even more difficult. The walls of this cave are smooth and a deep ebony in color. The ceiling is high above you, nothing but a black cloak of mystery. A wide stone staircase leads back down to the landing whence you entered this set of passages. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44943}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44945}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44945}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (n,e)}{<248># #<088>}{      As you continue your uphill climb in this set of passages, the caves get lighter, the source of the light somewhere further to the east. The wind pounds against you, insistent on preventing you from reaching your goal. Your legs begin to tire from the effort and your eyes sting from the now constant barrage of grit that flies at you from whatever lies at the top of this rising tunnel. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44944}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
