R {44946}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (sw,w)}{<248># #<088>}{       The wind is nearly a maelstrom in this chamber, grit flying through the air at speeds that make it dangerous to remain still for very long. The light is even brighter to the southwest, almost blinding after spending so much time wandering the darkness of the Labyrinth. The air also smells fresher, as if you've finally found a route out of the accursed depths of this maze. Use caution, while light might be just around the corner, so might one of the Labyrinth's dragons. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44945}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44947}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44947}{0}{<268>}{^\;^ Nimbus's Lair ^\;^ (ne)}{<268>. .<088>}{          You stand at the edge of a large valley hidden between the massive peaks of the mountains of Ao. The sun blazes down upon you, high up in the cloudless sky that stretches above the black tips of the mountain range. This valley is the lair of the Sky Dragon, a hiding place far from the reach of any of the isle's denizens. The mountains that hide this place are far too steep and dangerous for creatures to reach this dale via land. The only means of access appear to be flight or the mouth of the tunnel you just came from. Piles of golden treasure lie on the floor of the valley, obviously the trove belonging to the dragon. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44946}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44948}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (d)}{<248># #<088>}{       You stand on a rocky precipice overlooking a steep drop. Below the drop is a vast sea of lava, a red blanket that covers the underground chamber in a deadly stew of molten rock and fire. It looks like you might be able to slip off the drop to a small set of stepping stones that rise from the lava and head deeper into the sea, but caution is advised. One misstep would likely prove deadly. There appear to be no other exits. Behind you is nothing but a solid wall of rock. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44949}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44949}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (s)}{<248># #<088>}{       You stand precariously balanced on a small set of stepping stones that rise just high enough out of the surrounding lava to keep you from being burned to a cinder. A rock ledge rises above you to the north but there appears to be no way for you to reach it from this low vantage point. More stepping stones dot the sea of molten lava off to the south. You might be wise to follow those stones carefully. A step in the wrong direction would lead to a gruesome death. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44948}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44950}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {44950}{0}{<248>}{^\;^ Dragon Labyrinth ^\;^ (w,n)}{<248># #<088>}{       The lava surrounding you boils and pops. Its heat is so intense, you have to squint just so your eyes don't cook in their sockets. The glassy stepping stones beneath your feet are all that separate you from a gruesome death. The stones lead further to the north as well as around a sharp bend in the cavern to the west. The rocky wall of the cavern prevents you from seeing what lies on the other side of the bend, so caution is advised. }{Dragon Labyrinth}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44949}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {44951}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

