R {44953}{0}{}{The Den of Norgrith Manor (e)}{ }{     This is a nice den where one can sit down and relax.  There are several couches in the room all of which look very comfortable.  There is a brick fireplace on the north wall which seems unused at the moment.  Various art decorates the walls, making this a very nice place to relax. }{Norgrith Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
