R {44954}{0}{}{Norgrith Manor (e,sw,n)}{ }{      You are in a narrow, dark hallway.  The only light source are the few oil lamps fixed to the walls.  The dark oak walls are quite old and appear to be cracked with age, and the floor creaks beneath you as you step on the wood panels.  Ahead to the north you see what appears to be a library.  The hall splits here and to the east you can see the dining room. }{Norgrith Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
