R {44968}{0}{}{Dining Room of Norgrith Manor (n,w)}{ }{      This is the dining room, and is certainly the biggest room in the manor that you have been in.  There is a large dining table in the center of the room that is at least thirteen feet in length.  Above the table hangs a beautiful crystal chandelier.  There are several oil lamps that hang from the walls giving the room a soft light, and a nice atmosphere in which to eat a meal. }{Norgrith Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
