R {44970}{0}{}{Library of Norgrith Manor (w,s)}{ }{        The collection of books contained in this library is enormous.  The entire north wall of the room is shelved with ancient books and this is only one half of the collection. To the west you see the other half of the library and the books seemed to be divided by subject.  There is a small ladder that rolls on wheels that enables one to reach the top books.  At the east end of the room there is a comfortable looking chair with a small table beside it.  Above the chair there is a small iridescent globe that gives off a faint light. }{Norgrith Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
