R {44971}{0}{}{Kitchen of Norgrith Manor (s)}{ }{      The first thing that catches your eye in the kitchen of this old manor is the large stove on the north end of the room.  There is also a small table at the east end of the room.  Several cabinets filled with dishes and fine china line the west wall. It is significantly hotter in this room than in the other rooms you have been in, presumably from the stove which is radiating quite a bit of heat. }{Norgrith Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
