R {45052}{0}{}{At a beautiful fountain (s)}{ }{      You seem to have reached what looks like the goal of this complicated hedge maze.  The main thing that catches your eye is a beautiful stone fountain at the center of this large open area.  The grass around it seems particularly green and less worn than in other parts of the maze and the area is better lit, almost as if the sunlight has been focused here.  }{Norgrith Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45051}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45053}{0}{}{The Foyer (ne,e,leave,n)}{ }{        This entry foyer to a large commercial building extends a fair distance to the east.  The concrete wall to the west is white, with only a few marks gracing its surface.  In the wall to the south, dirty glass panes, though shattered, prevent the outside breezes from stirring the air.  At one point, the hardwood floor was probably cleaned and buffed daily, but it has since become scarred and cracked. The glass door to the south is hanging closed, but it is barely on its hinges.  A set of elevators can be seen off to the north. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45054}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45055}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45057}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {2048}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45054}{0}{}{A Well-Lit Hallway (sw,s,e,w)}{ }{    The hallway heads east and narrows to the west.  You can see the open foyer off to the south.  The hallways here are brightly lit so you can see down them a bit as you walk along.  The walls and floors, though, seem to be in rotten shape. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45053}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
