E {45057}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45055}{0}{}{The Foyer (w,nw,n)}{ }{      This foyer is the entrance to a large commercial building.   A dull, lifeless hardwood floor probably once greeted visitors with a very different impression.  Now, it compliments the scarred white wall to the east and the shattered glass panes to the south.  The door to the south hangs slightly open, allowing a gentle breeze to occasionally slip through.  A well lit hallway can be seen to the north. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45053}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45057}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45054}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45056}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {45057}{0}{}{A Well-Lit Hallway (se,s,e,w)}{ }{     The hallway continues east and west.  The excellent lighting allows for a clear view in both directions.  The wall and floors seem to be in terrible shape though.  A closed elevator sits in the north wall, a destroyed wall panel next to it.  A foyer opens up to the south, it looks like an exit to the building. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45053}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45055}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
