E {45059}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45058}{0}{}{A Well-Lit Hallway (s,w,e)}{ }{    The hallway heads east and west.  The walls and floors seem to be in a sad condition, scarred and gouged.  One of the overhead lights is flickering rapidly.  An office lies to the south through a empty door frame. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45054}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
