R {45059}{0}{}{A Well-Lit Hallway (s,e,w)}{ }{    The hallway heads east and west.  You can see it stretch off quite a distance in either direction. The walls and floors are not in good shape, they are scarred with gouges.  An office lies to the south through an empty, cracked, wooden door frame. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45057}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
