R {45060}{0}{}{A Secretary's Office (n,w)}{ }{      This office looks to have been thoroughly trashed.  A large metal desk is thrown on its side and rests next to the far wall.  A scorched blue desk chair is sitting in the center of the floor.  A dark blue berber carpet covers the concrete floor wherever it has not been torn or burned away.  An empty door frame to the north leads out into the hallway and the office continues to the west. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45059}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45062}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45061}{0}{}{A Corner in a Well-Lit Hallway (n,e)}{ }{     The hallway heads north and east.  You can see far down the hall in either direction  due to the fluorescent lighting.  To the west and south the white wall, with its char marks and gouges, forms the outside corner of the hall, while to the east a glass wall picks up at the inside corner. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45059}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45066}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45062}{0}{}{A Secretary's Office (w,e)}{ }{     This portion of the office looks to at some point have been the work space for a secretary.  A chair-level shelf is against one wall. Next to the shelf is a black metal filing cabinet.  The cabinet is on its side and yellowed papers spill out of it.  The dark blue berber carpet continues to the east, but to the west the flooring changes. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45060}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45063}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45063}{0}{}{The Secretary's Break Room (n,e)}{ }{       The vinyl floor is torn and ragged in many places in this room.  There is a counter on the far wall, above which is mounted a small cabinet.  A small metal sink is set into the counter.  Next to the counter a white refrigerator is leaning at an angle, propped against the wall next to it.  Several mostly unrecognizable objects sit on the counter. There appears to be carpeted offices both to the east and north of here. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45062}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45064}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45064}{0}{}{A Secretary's Office (s,n)}{ }{     This is the rear half of a secretary's office.  The floor is almost completely covered in old yellowed papers.  A blue berber carpet is visible on the floor in the few places that the papers do not conceal. The office continues to the north and a vinyl floor picks up to the south. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
