R {45099}{0}{}{West side of throne (s,e)}{ }{      Sand blows in the holes, where blocks once were, from the walls in this place.  You brush the sand off your body and look around for something worth the trip into this lonely keep.  A large throne catches your attention to your east.  A large figure sits upon the throne, its chest heaving up and down as it breathes the dusty air.  It wouldn't be wise to disturb it unless you feel ready to take it on. }{Desert Keep}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
