R {45100}{0}{<108>}{A barren corridor (n)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{       Lit torches line the east and west walls of this corridor making it easier for you to see where you are going.  You try to remove one of the torches for a souvenir, but they are stuck tightly in their sconces.  Above the torches, tiny spiders wait patiently on their cobwebs for a wandering insect to feed their empty stomachs.  This place has been deserted for many years but the torches are still lit.  Magic must watch over this keep.  A recent cave-in blocks passage to the south. }{Desert Keep}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
