R {45101}{0}{<138>}{East corner of throne room (w,s,n)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{           You are at the east end of a larger room of the keep.  Pieces of rotten wood from a table lay on the ground here.  Also a bashed in chest lies in ruin on the east wall.  You glance in it for some left over treasure but it looks like someone beat you to it.  This part of the keep isn't in as good a condition as the rest.  The walls here are falling apart leaving holes which let in light from the outside.  This area seems alive with movement. A spirit seems to be sharing the same room with you.  The spirit's image is that of the upper portion of its beast like body when it was alive.  The only things that stand out from the spirit are the glowing red eyes floating in the position its eye sockets once were. }{Desert Keep}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
