R {45102}{0}{}{The Master's Throne (w,e,s)}{ }{          In this room sits a large throne of the master of the keep.  The throne makes the room seem a lot smaller than it really is because of its massiveness.  The gold-plated throne has jewels, which sparkle from the rays of light that sneak in from the outside, forged into it. This throne is worthy of any master. An even larger beast sits upon the throne.  Its lizard-like body and rotted hands make you jump back.  The robe it wears covers most of his green colored body but from the scales on his face you know that this isn't your ordinary monster.  It has awaited your arrival and leaps forward to attack. }{Desert Keep}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
