R {45104}{0}{}{East side of throne (w,s)}{ }{      The heat of the desert is much stronger in the keep.  The smell of rotting flesh is the dominant smell of this area.  Broken glass and skulls litter the floors of the keep.  Moaning and screaming fill your ears from the spirits that roam around here.  You know the perfect solution to shut them up for good.  The master of the keep's throne is to the west. }{Desert Keep}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
