R {45105}{0}{<278>}{A spiral staircase (e,d)}{<278>.@.<088>}{      You are standing on a spiral staircase which leads down to a secret part of the keep.  The wall behind you has closed shut, blocking your exit. There are a few metal sconces attached to the walls but all the torches are missing.  Looking down, the staircase turns to the left blocking your sight to the bottom of the stairs.  You feel a slight draft coming from the bottom of the staircase and you hear the sound of the sucking of air. }{Desert Keep}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
