R {45106}{0}{}{Portal entrance (portal,u)}{ }{         Your eyes burn with pain as you reach the bottom of the stairs.  The burning sensation is from a large portal which is sucking in all the air from the room like a vacuum.  The room itself is bare with not one speck of dust.  The portal is located along the east wall of the room. The portal is a black hole which fluctuates as it tries to draw in everything it can. The portal has a slight tug against your body but it isn't enough to pull you in. A large entity is here, staring at you with its flaming blue eyes as it releases its magic upon its enemy. }{Desert Keep}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
