R {45113}{0}{}{Confine area of boulders (se)}{ }{         You are in a very confined area of rocks and boulders.  The boulders surround you from all sides but to the southeast, where two rocks meet, a narrow crawl space near the ground can be seen.  The rays of the sun are blocked out here most of the time but the sun does let some sunlight in when the sun is directly over this arrangement of rocks. A sandling has made its home here, protected by the solitude the boulders provide.  Since the sandling is the only thing here, you must be trespassing on its territory. }{Rock Pile}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
