R {45130}{0}{<238>}{A grassy hillside (se,leave)}{<238>. .<088>}{        You are standing on a small path which leads down the hillside in a southeasterly direction into a beautiful valley with lush grass and flowers growing everywhere.  From this location you cannot see the vast plains which surround this hidden valley. The hairs on the back of your neck tingle with the sensation that you are being watched. While the landscape is amazing and the air seems fresh, you can't help wondering why you have such a strong feeling of mischief and malice emanating from this place. }{Boggart Vale}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
