R {45163}{0}{}{A dark intersection (out,n,e,w)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{      Dust and stale air chokes you in this dark hall.  You appear to be at an intersection of sorts.  This ancient structure radiates magic from the very walls.  All around you dust is several inches thick coating everything in sight.  Small halls lead off to the east and west while a towering archway lies before you.  It looks as though you could climb up the south wall to get back out. }{Aiden's Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
