R {45164}{0}{<268>}{A long, dark hall (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{     The long hall stretches before you leaving you increasingly apprehensive. The darkness seems to permeate your very soul as you make your way through this structure.  Rather plain in its decoration, this hall was obviously made to be more functional than anything else.  To the north, an impending sense of pure evil and to the south your only escape. }{Aiden's Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
