R {45165}{0}{}{A small antechamber (w)}{ }{      This small room is almost completely barren with exception to the dust. Each footfall in the ancient chamber leaves a deep footprint in the powdery soot.  The walls are made out of an interlocking pattern of large stone blocks held together with crumbling mortar.  Anything else that may have been in this room would have been completely buried under the aeons of dust. }{Aiden's Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45163}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45166}{0}{}{A small antechamber (e)}{ }{      This small room is almost completely barren with exception to the dust. Each footfall in this ancient chamber leaves a deep footprint in the powdery soot.  The ceiling is very low and blackened from the torches that were once used when this old crypt was first constructed.  Anything else that may have been in this room would have been completely buried under the eons of dust. }{Aiden's Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45163}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45167}{0}{<248>}{The end of the crypt (s)}{<248>. <178>+<088>}{     This magically darkened room appears to be the final resting place of someone of great importance.  It seems rather odd that someone demanding such a burial would have such an utterly plain tomb.  All the walls are completely barren and the only other ornamentation is a solitary throne against the back wall. }{Aiden's Crypt}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
