R {45247}{0}{}{Beneath the Lightning Sand (u)}{ }{       How curious! It appears you've been sucked underneath the lightning sand and into a hidden pit beneath the surface of the swamp. It's a good thing you had that handy ring or you'd have perished for certain! This pit is plain enough. The walls and floor are nothing but packed sand. The ceiling is sand as well, although it looks loose enough that you could go back up to the surface if you tried. Oh well, not much to see, but at least you've got your health. }{The Princess Bride}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
