R {45248}{0}{}{A Noisy Battleground (n,s,w,e,teleport)}{ }{   Shrapnel is buried into a small mound, and the mound is covered in blood.  Flashes of light pop in and out of your view as the ships overhead do battle.   }{Kayos Wars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
