R {45249}{0}{}{Inside a CRASHING SPACESHIP (n)}{ }{     The ship is crashing!  Stars race by as the ship plummets to the planet below.  You can see the planet below getting larger, faster -- TOO FAST.  Flames lick the walls and the heat is unbearable.  A screaming siren assaults your ears, but whatever it was warning is either obvious or way, way, way too late.   }{Kayos Wars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45248}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45250}{0}{}{Inside a CRASHING SPACESHIP (w,e)}{ }{        The ship is crashing!  You can see the planet below getting larger, faster -- TOO FAST.  Flames lick the walls and the heat is unbearable. A rushing wind rips past you as the ship's atmosphere empties out into vacuum, but you can't see where the breach occurred.  The panels along the wall are a smooth glossy black, smudged with blood and dirt.  A screaming siren assaults your ears, but whatever it was warning is either obvious or way, way, way too late.  The ship shudders and rolls awkwardly, forcing you to catch your balance.   }{Kayos Wars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
