R {45254}{0}{}{On the Bridge of a CRASHING SPACESHIP (w)}{ }{     The air whips about you violently, spewing out into the vacuum of space.  The hull has been ripped open and the ship's atmosphere is blowing quickly out a hole the size of a command console.  Fire rampages along the walls of the bridge, and glass and cabling is everywhere.  YOU'RE GOING DOWN!!! }{Kayos Wars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
