R {45263}{0}{}{antechamber (room,ne)}{ }{        The room you are in seems to be a small antechamber off of the main tomb. Breathing is very difficult as the dust here is thick from centuries of age. Your vision is also obscured from the intense mist.  You scan the chamber and see that the walls are made of sandstone, centuries old.  Blocks are scattered in the room, some forming rough objects.  There is a strong feeling of darkness here and your skin crawls from the silence.  Nothing makes a sound besides the beating of your heart.  Anything could happen. There is a small room leading farther away from the main chamber. }{Epic}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
