R {45328}{0}{}{Engulfed in shadow (north,west)}{11}{      So much darkness, so much evil, this room overpowers your senses and leaves you disoriented.  Whether you have been here for hours or days, or even years, begins to become harder to tell as your memory is assaulted by the lack of anything tangible.  You bump into solid objects that are no longer there when you try to push them aside.  Clearly this world is inhabited by some massive force of evil. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
