R {45426}{0}{}{Antietam National Battlefield Visitor Center (shop,e,w)}{ }{      Numerous exhibits populate the Visitor Center.  Glass cases are filled with relics from the battle.  Along several walls are oil murals depicting battle scenes.  A long low black counter is near the entrance\; on it are several racks of brochures and pamphlets.  A sign above the doors reminds visitors that no relic hunting is permitted.  Off to the side you see the obligatory gift shop. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
