R {45428}{0}{}{Outside of the Visitor Center (n,enter,s,e)}{ }{        The mostly flat, grassy land affords a clear view of several major landmarks on Antietam Battlefield.  Immediately to the north you see the white outline of a single-story building\; behind it you can make out the edges of a cornfield.  The ground dips slightly east towards a low wooden fence.  The town of Sharpsburg is situated south.  Behind you is the Visitor Center\; you may enter it through glass doors. Walking about is a group of tourists led by a National Park Service ranger. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
