R {45433}{0}{}{Sharpsburg (n,w,e)}{ }{     Sharpsburg appears like any other small town in rural America.  Not even a stop light adorns the main road through Sharpsburg.  A row of homes can be seen stretching west up the hill\; another hill lies to the east.  To the north, around a bend in the road, you can see a single-story stone building. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
