R {45436}{0}{}{General Lee's Headquarters (e)}{ }{    Along the western outskirts of town sits a plot of undeveloped land between two homes.  A black sign marks this site as the headquarters for General Robert E. Lee.  Near the back corner is a stone monument approximately chest high\; a bronze plaque adorns the front. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
