R {45437}{0}{}{Antietam National Cemetery (n,w,s)}{ }{     At the top of a hill, directly east of Sharpsburg, is Antietam National Cemetery.  Small stone blocks mark the soldiers underneath and are arranged in tidy rows.  Boonsboro Pike borders the cemetery along the north\; it runs west into Sharpsburg and northeast towards Antietam Creek. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
