R {45439}{0}{}{Otto Farm (e,n)}{ }{     At the end of a long ravine is the Otto Homestead.  The home itself is a wooden frame white house with a porch stretching the length of the building's front.  Numerous windows provide views for the home's residents to gaze upon two steep hills behind the home.  A road runs east past the house to a stone arch bridge. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
