R {45440}{0}{}{Burnside Bridge (w,e)}{ }{    This stone bridge crosses Antietam Creek and has barely changed since the battle over a hundred years ago.  East of the bridge is a small grassy field, surrounded by a grove of maple trees.  Across the bridge to the west are a series of bluffs overlooking the bridge. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
