R {45441}{0}{}{Burnside Bridge Road (w,n)}{ }{     Two lanes of modern-day asphalt wind their way across the Maryland countryside.  Cars and trucks zoom past, disregarding the posted speed limit.  The road runs north past an apple orchard.  To the west is a dense line of trees\; you see an opening through which you could squeeze. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
