R {45445}{0}{}{Observation Tower (d)}{ }{     You stand at the top of a stone observation tower, eighty-five feet above the countryside.  The clear summer sky grants a nearly endless view of the battlefield.  Endless farmlands stretch in all directions\; far in the distance you can see South Mountain.  At the base of the tower you see various tour groups lingering about. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
