R {45448}{0}{}{Boonsboro Pike (n,w,s)}{ }{     The occasional tree breaks up the otherwise monotony of the farmlands east of Antietam Creek.  Boonsboro Pike cuts across the landscape and winds its way downhill until crossing a bridge to the west.  A rocky outcropping is visible to the north, while an apple orchard is to the south. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
