R {45449}{0}{}{Eastern Bank of Antietam Creek (s,n)}{ }{    The waters of Antietam Creek flow south around some exposed limestone. The ground here gently rises to the north to a grassy hill\; a red brick house sits on top of the hill.  To the south you see a vast expanse of farmland. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
