R {45452}{0}{}{East Woods (n,w,s,e)}{ }{      The East Woods have been thinned by human activity over the years, as local farmers have cut down the trees to expand their respective farms.  The ground is a bit higher here than the surrounding.  Smoketown Road runs north past some maple trees and then southwest down a hill.  Immediately to the west is a large cornfield\; to the south is a wheat field.  More farms can be found downhill to the east. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
