R {45453}{0}{}{Mumma Cemetery (leave)}{ }{     A stone wall encircles the Mumma Family Cemetery.  A few dozen gravestones mark the remains of ancestors of the Mumma family.  The recently deceased have markers in excellent conditions, whereas older grave markers are worn smooth and covered with lichen.  A pair of pine trees dominate one side of the cemetery. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45444}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45454}{0}{}{Western Bank of Antietam Creek (w,n)}{ }{    You stand along the western banks of Antietam Creek.  The water looks too deep and is flowing too rapidly to cross here safely.  To the south a modern highway bridge crosses the creek.  Hills both to the north and west lead to farmlands. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
