E {45458}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45457}{0}{}{The Cornfield (n,w,s,e)}{ }{     The corn is both tall and very thick, the plants' dark green leaves covering your head and stems blocking your view in all directions. Similar conditions existed during the battle, when both Union and Confederate troops rushed blindly forward only to find the wrong end of a cannon barrel. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
