R {45458}{0}{}{North Woods (s,e)}{ }{     What was once the North Woods is now scrubland.  Over time locals fell the trees for use as lumber and firewood, leaving just a few scraggly ones behind.  In recent years volunteers have been restoring the area by planting saplings.  South here is an immense cornfield\; more trees may be found to the east. }{Antietam Battlefield}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45456}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
