R {45465}{0}{}{The Guard's Office (n)}{ }{     This appears to be the office and general hangout for HTC Terminal guards. You can see pictures of Houston on the shiny metal walls, and there are a few desks and comfortable chairs here and there. This room looks just as well polished and new as all the others in the terminal. It looks like someone really wants this expansion project to succeed. }{HTC Northern Expansion Terminal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {14829}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45466}{0}{}{A corridor leading to an underground bunker (e,w)}{ }{    The walls of this corridor are made entirely of polished metal and there is a thick, rubber mat running down the centre of the floor.  Fluorescent lights are mounted on the ceiling and you can see a button at the eastern end of the corridor. }{Underground Bunker}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {15058}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45467}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
