R {45467}{0}{}{A spacious, well-equipped workshop (n,s,e)}{ }{     A central worktable dominates this room and you can see that some sort of construction is underway on its surface.  Aside from that, the entire room is lined with metal and fluorescent lights are fixed to the ceiling.  To your east, a hallway leads outside while short passages lead north and south respectively. }{Underground Bunker}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45466}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45468}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45469}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45468}{0}{}{A utilitarian bedroom (s)}{ }{   This room is almost bare, except for the double bed against one wall.  Like elsewhere in this bunker, the walls, floor and ceiling are all made of metal.  You can see a passage leading south to a workshop. }{Underground Bunker}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45467}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45469}{0}{}{A small, communications alcove in an underground bunker (n)}{ }{    This room is very small and is almost entirely filled by the bulky, encrypted communications equipment in the northwest corner.  The walls and ceiling are made of polished metal and the room is lit by a single, fluorescent light.  You can see a workshop to the north. }{Underground Bunker}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45467}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

