R {45490}{0}{<278>}{The courtyard (n,s,e)}{<278>- -<088>}{    You stand within a courtyard of sorts. This perfectly manicured and bordered grass quadrangle is overlooked on three sides by the base's buildings. The building to the west resembles a power-station, the eastern building a barracks and to the north lies the ops center. }{Satellite Tracking Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
