R {45501}{0}{<248>}{The telemetry suite (w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{    This small room is packed with computer banks. Three rows stretch the length of the room, leaving only space for maintenance access. It's seriously cold in here, cold and dry. Human comfort is definitely secondary to the machine. }{Satellite Tracking Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45496}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45502}{0}{<248>}{The communications suite (n,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{     This must be the communications hub of the base. The room is starkly lit by a formidable wall of monitors and alive with sound and motion\; a veritable kaleidoscope of images. A transmission station, burdened with communication equipment, draws your attention. A doorway to the north leads outside. To the east, the operations suite. }{Satellite Tracking Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45496}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45503}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45503}{0}{<278>}{Between the antennae (e,s,w)}{<278>- -<088>}{   You stand on an elevated, grassy area between two large parabolic antennae. The wall of the command center is to your south and to the north a steep drop over the northern lip of the basin.  }{Satellite Tracking Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
