R {45504}{0}{}{The acquisition antenna (w)}{ }{   This area is completely dominated by a large, spherical radome. With the black wall to your south and the drop to your north, you're left with very little room to maneuver. }{Satellite Tracking Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45503}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45505}{0}{}{The main antenna (e)}{ }{  The path widens here and opens into a small plateau. A massive antenna radome stands here, precariously flanked by steep drops.  }{Satellite Tracking Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
