R {45549}{0}{}{Hall of Reflection (n,w,e,s)}{ }{      Dread feelings of despair overcome you here.  This was once the hall of honor for the stronghold.  The monks had converted it to a silent path for reflection and meditation, but now it lay in complete ruins. Broken statues line the west wall and shattered glass and wooden furniture litter the floor.  Everything is covered by a black soot as if a great fire ripped through the hall. }{Epic}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
