R {45550}{0}{}{Armory (n,sw,e,s)}{ }{     This room was the armory for the ancient stronghold.  This room was kept in order by the Monks of Philos though.  All weapons and armours had been removed, though the iron forge still stands in one corner, dark and cold for ages.  Nothing remains in this room save broken shards of wood and bits of glass.  Black soot covers everything. }{Epic}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
