R {45560}{0}{<268>}{Meditation Chambers (e)}{<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>}{        You stand in the center of a quiet room.  It looks as though this was some sort of meditation chambers for the monks.  Definitely sacred ground, you feel a holy presence in this room.  Even though the entire monastery has been overrun with a horrifying curse, this room stays peaceful and secure. The room is completely unadorned by any form of aesthetic decoration and exudes a calmness, even in the midst of the horror elsewhere in the compound. There is a single item of note in this room.  On the floor, formed of rusted iron, lies a large pentagram.  You feel great power radiating from the symbol. }{Epic}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
