R {45572}{0}{<238>}{Jorbin Gruffelmonger's house of curiosities (out)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        Knick knacks range from top to bottom in this fairly small but cosy house. Foreign objects from around the world have been gathered here and carefully put on display for potential customers. The aroma in here reminds you of a mix between a bakery and an inn and a quick look at the exquisite spices displayed on the wooden top explains why. Dusty windows allow some of the bright daylight to seep through but it's clear that whoever owns this house is not one of the tidier persons you've ever come across. }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_curios}{}{}{1.000}{1}
