R {45604}{0}{<278>}{A red crystalline platform (blue,stairs,violet)}{<278>.@.<088>}{              A red crystalline platform. You are standing in an ENORMOUS cavern, carved out of the solid rock, or perhaps crystal. The only thing that supports you in this space is a broad column of red crystal. Six other coloured columns are present in the cavern: orange, yellow, green, blue, violet and white. Other than these columns, there appears to be no surface to stand upon - the cavern seems to have no bottom! You get vertigo from looking down into the depths below. Above you, the cavern walls taper to an opening. Sunlight streams in from above. A set of clear crystal stairs leads back to the entry tunnel. On the platform surface, there is a glowing violet crystal embedded in the centre of a silver motif. There are bridges to the blue column by a bright red beam of light, and the violet column by a bright violet beam of light. The beams are broad, and look sturdy enough to walk upon. }{Temple of Light}{temple_of_light_puzzle}{}{}{1.000}{1}
