R {45611}{0}{<178>}{In a garden (e,n)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{          You are overpowered by the scents of honeysuckle and various exotic plants. The grass pastures seem to extend into infinity.  Overhead you can see three moons and thousands of stars.  You feel so safe and secure here.  Rain falls intermittently washing, showering the thousands of blossoming flowers. Lightning flashes in the sky causing a brilliant yellowish - gold aura.  You feel a shiver course through your chest as the rain beats down on your head, and the lightning flashes, and the winged goddess Asrael smiles down upon you.  As you look around you see many black rose bushes.  You might be able to pick them. A marble statue. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
