R {45618}{0}{}{Roadway (n,bushes)}{ }{       You are walking along a narrow stretch of road that is surrounded by the trees and other forms of plantlife that dwell in the surrounding forest. Birds, insects, and other forms of life can be heard in the far regions. As you walk down this path, you feel as if a thousand pairs of eyes are looking at you. Though this should alarm you, you feel a warm glow surround your entire body.  A sense of calmness sweeps over you.  The bushes that brought you here are just as pretty on this side as the other. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
