R {45625}{0}{<178>}{A small garden (nw,e)}{<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>}{    You are walking along a cobblestone path.  The road is paved with huge brown bricks.  It causes pain to shoot through your legs.  It seems quite unbearable to walk.  The road is garnished with red, blue and yellow tulips.  You hear the melodies of many chirping birds nearby. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
