R {45627}{0}{}{Corridor of Trees (s,n)}{ }{     As you walk along the path into the heart of the forest, you notice that it begins to darken. The weave of the branches produces a rooflike structure overhead. As you walk further into this strange dwelling, sounds of laughter can be hear faintly echoing along what now has become a corridor into the curious abode. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45618}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45628}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45628}{0}{<238>}{Entrance to Enchanted Forest (s,n)}{<238>|@|<088>}{          You have arrived at the base of a huge tree. This tree is entangled with the roots of neighboring trees. By the look of things, it seems the trees in this forest all feed on this one Grandfather tree. The trunk of the tree is approximately twenty five yards in diameter and what seems to be an archway can be seen in the middle of base. The sounds of laughter seems to be coming from inside this massive structure. Overhead, what seems to be shimmering lights flying near the distant roof, constantly flutter about. Thousands upon thousands of these shimmering lights criss cross across your eyes. They are  flying so fast, they only appear as a blur to you. North leads you into the Grandfather tree. South lead back to the roadway. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45627}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45629}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45629}{0}{}{Archway into Grandfather Tree (s,n)}{ }{     You have entered the Archway and is now inside the Grandfather Tree. As you walk through the Archway, you see many groups of shimmering creatures walking about, socializing, and just plain having fun. You think to yourself, 'These must be pixies, and I have found their home!'. If you weren't so dazzled by their presence, you might have concluded that you were right. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45628}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45630}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45630}{0}{}{Center of Tree (sw,se,ne,nw,n,e,s,w)}{ }{       This is the center of the Grandfather Tree. From here, you may continue in all directions to many parts of the Tree. Though it doesn't look it from the outside, the Tree is ENORMOUS! It must be enchanted for it to seem this much bigger on the inside. On all four corners of the room, you see stairs leading up to the second level. There are archways that lead further into many parts of the tree on the north, east, and west directions. South leads back outside. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
