R {45635}{0}{}{North Center (n,e,w,s)}{ }{   You are north of the center of the Tree. This is a hallway that continues deeper into the Tree. You see many rooms to the east and west of you. Further along, you smell the aroma of freshly baked bread. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
