R {45636}{0}{}{East Center (n,w,e)}{ }{     This is the east center of the Tree. By the smell of it, you are near the kitchen. You hear the sounds of clanking pots and pans to the east of you and you guessed right\; a swinging door to the east of you is marked 'Kitchen'. To the north, you see a long table that seems to be able to fit fifty people. That must be the Dining Hall. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
