R {45637}{0}{}{West Center (w,e)}{ }{   You are west of the center of the Tree. This is a hallway that leads to a bright area where sounds of laughter and joy can be heard from the many doorways leading from the hallway. By the sounds of it, most of the voices are drunk. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
