R {45640}{0}{}{NE corner of 2nd floor (d,w,s)}{ }{    You have reached the top of the stairs. This is a balcony which lets you see the center of the Tree with a birdseye view. The second floor is squarish in shape and you see other balconies on the far corners. This and the other balconies have stairs leading down back to the center of the Tree. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
