R {45641}{0}{}{Tran's room (w)}{ }{      This is the room of Tran. The room is beautifully decorated with numerous silk tapestries and pink curtains on the windows. Silk adorns the bed and a beautiful oaken desk rests next to the window. A table with a lantern in the middle is covered with a lace table cloth, and the chairs are padded for extra comfort. At first glance in this room, you can immediately tell this is the  room of a woman. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45635}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45642}{0}{}{An empty bedroom (e)}{ }{   You are in an empty bedroom. The usual furniture such as a bed, table, chair, and a lantern can be seen scattered around this small but comfortable looking room. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45635}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45643}{0}{}{In Front of Bakery (s,n)}{ }{   You are at the end of the hallway. In front of you is a door marked 'Bakery'. Obviously, the smell of bread and the sounds of machinery originate from behind this door. This bakery provides food for all the pixies of the land. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45638}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
