E {45638}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45645}{0}{}{Ren Ar's room (e)}{ }{     This is the room of the legendary pixie, Ren Ar. It has been said that Ren Ar is the son of Mother Earth, conceived to balance out the forces of good and evil. His main goal in life is to kill evil wherever it may be found. The room looks quite ordinary. There is a bookshelf in the far wall, a table with a simple candle in the middle, two chairs, and a bed. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45638}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45646}{0}{}{The Bakery (s)}{ }{    As you walk into the room, a full blast of hot air almost knocks you off your feet. The floor is covered with flour, and tiny footsteps tell you that the pixies frequent this room in search of nourishment. There is a large machine right in front of you. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
