R {45648}{0}{}{The Kitchen (n,w)}{ }{        This is the kitchen where all the food served fit for a king is made. Your sense of smell has been temporarily deactivated due to the different smells mixed into the atmosphere. This kitchen is so spotless that it glints light around the room. Two sweepers are working constantly clearing every scrap of food or dirt that falls to the floor. Two chefs work nonstop making the most delicious foods ever imagined. Five stoves burn to the wee hours cooking the food and simmering leftovers so that late workers can enjoy a midnight snack. Your mother would think she's in heaven if she was in this kitchen. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
