R {45650}{0}{}{Dining Hall (s,n)}{ }{     This is the Dining hall where dinner is eaten. A long banquet table can be seen in the center of the room. Three candelabras, one on the near side of the table, one on the center, and one on the far side, lights up the entire room with a romantic glow. Silverware set for fifty people are neatly placed in front of each chair. This setting makes you hungry for some nourishment. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45636}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45633}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45651}{0}{}{Pantry (s)}{ }{     This is the pantry.  This is where all the cooking utensils and dry food are kept. By the looks of things, the chefs keep a mighty good order of things. Cans of food, cooking utensils, and bags of ingredients are lined up in perfect order.  The shelves are full and everything is clean as a whistle.  It's a shame to search this room and mess everything up. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
