R {45658}{0}{}{The Barracks (s)}{ }{      This is the barracks where the pixie guards live. They are a peaceful bunch and enjoy the fruits of labour. In fact, that's not the only fruit they love, judging by the way most of the guards are intoxicated or otherwise drunk as a monkey in a wine barrel. Depending on the time of day, there could be any number of guards drinking and fraternizing in these barracks, which consists of two rows of beds, a large round table with a lamp, and some chairs. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
