R {45666}{0}{}{North Wing (n,e,w)}{ }{    This is the north wing of the second floor. There is a crimson curtain here that hinders you from seeing what's north of you. To the west is the west balcony, and the the east is the east balcony. Sounds of men in conversation can be heard behind the curtain. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
