R {45667}{0}{}{East Wing (n,s,e)}{ }{    This is the East Wing of the second floor. Here, you hear chants and prayers said from the east corridor. The east corridor is dark and dim and smells as if it has not been used for ages. However, that cannot be true, since the voices seem to originate from that direction. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
