R {45668}{0}{}{Throne Hall (s,n)}{ }{      This is the hallway that leads to the throne room. You are lucky you have a pass. You show the pass to two pixies guarding the curtain, and you are ushered in. As you walk down the hallway, you see many beautiful paintings hanging on the side walls, most of which are portraits with inscriptions on the foot of the paintings. As you read the inscriptions, you realize you are looking at the portraits of long dead pixie kings. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
