R {45674}{0}{}{ Further along East Corridor (n,w,e,s)}{ }{    This is the east corridor. The chanting is louder, now that you move further into the corridor. To the north and south of you, are small rooms that seem to be some sort of confession booths. Further down, you see faint candle lights twinkling from what you can now see is a chapel. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
