R {45675}{0}{}{South Confession Booth (n)}{ }{    This is a confession booth where anyone who have sinned can come and pray to have their sins wiped away. You can also confess your sins here, for a price. To have your sins wiped away, Type 'confess' and the priest will do all the  rest. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
