R {45676}{0}{}{The Priest's Booth (s)}{ }{  This is the booth where the priest sits and hears the confessions of the sinners. Naturally, if the priest is not here, you are not be able to confess. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45674}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45677}{0}{}{Tree Chapel (w)}{ }{      This is a chapel. As you enter, you see many pixies kneeling in solemn prayers to their god. Pews are set up to the left and right of you, and most of them are filled with worshippers. The ceiling is domed, and pictures of seraphim and cherubs hang overhead. However, as you look closely, they aren't really merely pictures, but pixies who have the ability to stay in-flight and pray at the same time. An altar can be seen directly in front of you. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45674}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45678}{0}{}{The Priest's Booth (n)}{ }{  This is the booth where the priest sits and hears the confessions of the sinners. Naturally, if the priest is not here, you are not be able to confess. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45674}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45679}{0}{}{West Wing (s,e,w)}{ }{   This is a southern hall of the second floor. You hear jingling from the south as if someone was playing around with some coins. The south leads down to a dead end. The sounds can't be coming from there, could it? }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
