R {45680}{0}{}{Dead End (n)}{ }{    This hallway ends in a dead end.  The sounds of coins dropping and being picked up can be heard loudest in this room, however.  The stone walls here are quite cracked and crumbling, probably letting the sound through from another room nearby. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
