R {45682}{0}{}{Hallway to Throne Room (s,n)}{ }{       The hallway continues north to the Throne Room. You can almost see the room from here, and you can certainly hear people talking in the room. You anxiously anticipate the meeting of the king and you wonder what he will say or do to you. The paintings on the wall continue down the hall. Finally, you reach two sturdy doors. When the guards see you, they immediately open the doors to let you in. However, while walking into the Throne room, you see the last portrait empty. Maybe you should LOOK at the frame!!! }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
