E {45683}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45683}{0}{<138>}{The Throne Room (s)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{    This is the luxurious pixie throne room.  The lush red carpet flows all the way to the room's doorway and leads up to the throne of the king. Bright lights glare on the clean, scrubbed floor, creating an aura of majesty you couldn't find anywhere else in the palace. }{Temple of Drackonus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
