R {45706}{0}{<238>}{The Tower of Vindaes (w,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{                      -=< The Maiden of Metal >=- Just north of the entrance to the Tower is a statue of a large woman. Made all of metal, she stands ten feet high and is quite shapely despite her size. A mane of gold hair frames her smiling face\; she looks at you, wherever you go. Around her neck is a pendant of silver with a fist-sized ruby hanging at her collarbone. To the west is the stairwell. }{Tower of Vindaes}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
