R {45708}{0}{<248>}{Abode (n,s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{      This cozy room appears to be the home for a small family of dwarves. Two alcoves have been cut into the western wall to house beds. The southern end of the room has been set up for dining, with a short, wooden table and four chairs, while the north end has been fashioned into a sitting area with a couch and several chairs. Several lanterns are placed around the room, each emitting a soft, blue glow. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
