R {45758}{0}{<238>}{Hideaway (w)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{       From this cavity in the rock emanates a stench so foul it overwhelms your sense of smell to the point of nausea. If it weren't for the pile upon pile of filthy junk, a person could almost stand upright in this cramped space. This is, despite the utterly repugnant conditions and lack of distinction between sofa and commode, some sort of home for someone or something. What they might possibly want with all this rubbish is beyond your comprehension. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45759}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

