R {45760}{0}{<228>}{Muck (u,e)}{<228>; ;<088>}{     Loose gravel and sediment balance precariously here on one side of the steep slope, while on the other side the stream rushes down a trench dug by the water and exposing the rock below.  The angle seems to level off some further down the crevice, where the walls become solid rock rather than the mixture of stone and dirt threatening to collapse on you here. }{Crevice in the Hills}{crevice_in_the_hills}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45762}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
