R {45772}{0}{<238>}{Aloft (d,e,ledge)}{<238># ]<088>}{      You are high above a small valley, surrounded by cliffs on three sides.  The cliffs rise further above you, beyond your range of motion.  To the east the valley opens to the hills of Fantasy.  The gaping maw of a cave lies in the cliff to the west, and you could easily land upon the ledge there.  Also nearby is a large nest, resting precariously on a narrow shelf. }{Loft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
