R {45775}{0}{<238>}{Ledge (e,w)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{      You find yourself upon a wide rock ledge, before the mouth of a cave.  The ledge juts out slightly from the cliff face, hiding the opening from below.  The surface is wide and flat, and the ceiling of the cave arches high above your head and continues to do so as it runs west, into the mountainside.  The view from this height is dizzying, and an unassisted fall could possibly mean death. }{Loft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
