R {45780}{0}{<218>}{Skull (out)}{<218>~ .<088>}{      The space inside the skull is rather cramped, forcing you to stoop slightly in order to move around.  Some bedding covers the ground on one side, and a makeshift table sits across from it.  The cavity is smaller than the outside might indicate, as the smooth bone must be thick indeed.  Flames in the eye sockets cast a bit of light on the interior, but it is still somewhat dim. }{Loft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
