R {45784}{0}{<248>}{Mill (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{       You have entered a very large room which was built for several purposes. At the north end of the room is a small kitchen, with a stove and other implements for cooking. Into the west wall is carved a sizable baking oven, whose flue leads up into the rock. Further south, beyond a couple of wooden tables, are several large bins and a pair of millstones connected to a series of gears. As in the room to the north, the lanterns here emit a soft, blue glow. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
