R {45790}{0}{}{Death's Chamber (out)}{ }{      A dark room lighted with a dark light that seems to defy darkness not so much by actually illuminating the room as by being a dark point in less-dark surroundings. In the strange light (dark?) you can see a centrally-placed desk covered with books and diagrams.  The walls are covered with bookshelves filled with dark tomes bound in leather that gleam with strange runes. }{Abandoned Drow Temple}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
