R {45859}{0}{}{A Dark Crypt (u,s)}{ }{      A dank crypt nestled deep beneath the ancient tower.  Even though it is empty, a lethal stench of death still hangs in the chilled air.  As you glance around you notice that the walls are honeycombed, each seems big enough to hold a decent sized corpse. You decide that the chamber must have been used by the old inhabitants to store their spare corpses until their adventures were in need of them. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
