R {45861}{0}{}{Dark Stairwell (s,d,u)}{ }{      You have come to the second floor landing in the abandoned tower.  The landing is empty and surrounded by an inky black granite wall.  Several dried drips of blood stain the block walls and floor of the stairwell.  You also notice there are scorch marks on the granite, probably from the powerful spells of the previous occupants who battled here. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
