R {45872}{0}{}{A Dark Chamber (w,e)}{ }{      Desks, tables, and bookshelves lie toppled over, their contents strewn across the floor.  Blood has been splattered onto the walls and has dried up into grotesque patterns.  The chamber may have once been used to educate and advance the ancient necromancers further along in their dark arts.  Now it lays in shambles, destroyed by whatever battle took place in these dark and dreary halls. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
