R {45884}{0}{<248>}{A Dilapidated Shrine (e)}{<248>.<118>@<248>.<088>}{      As you enter the shrine your attention is drawn to a towering statue of Lyrra, the Duchess of Vampires and Domina of Night.  Her arms are held outward in an eternal embrace of the night and she wears a long flowing gown.  An old dusty altar stands in the center of the room in front of the Duchess.  The shrine appears to have been empty for a while and has fallen into disrepair. }{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
