R {45890}{0}{}{Base of a Cliff (crevice)}{ }{       Looking upwards, you can see Schloss Mordenheim perched like a vulture on the lip of a 140-foot cliff, overlooking the stormy waters of the Sea of Sorrows.  Angry waves crash against the rocks around you and sea birds circle overhead, sending their eerie shrieks into the gloomy air. In the distance, a low island is barely visible. Beyond that, the sea is obscured by mist.  The water appears to have eroded a small crevice into the side of the cliff. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
