R {45938}{0}{<248>}{Aviary stables (s)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{         You stand within the dark stables of Der'Thalas' aviary.  Once this place was a wonderous home of beautiful gryphons, now it lies in ruin. Burnt feathers line the cold stone floor like a frayed blanket.  On the walls, broken shelves like shattered, spilling their contents onto the dusty floor.  A strong, musty smell lingers here.  Is it simply the odor of the stables, or is it something more?  You cannot be sure. Dark cries can be heard outside, and shadows move across the entrance. If there are still gryphons here in this dark place, pity the soul that comes face to face with one. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
