R {45947}{0}{}{Stone path (s,e,staircase)}{ }{          You stand on the high, upper battlements on the eastern edge of Der'Thalas Keep.  The night wind blows about you fiercely here, almost buffeting you over the edge and into the dark forest below.  Looming high above you to the north and west are the twisted crags of the Valadak mountains.  Looking out over the southern edge, you can see the vastness of the haunted forest.  South of here, a stone path snakes its way up the side of the vaulted mountain, guarded by a black gate that seems to have been charred by some great fire.  A circular staircase is also here on the battlement, twisting its way into the darkness of the keep below. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
