R {45959}{0}{}{The Bottom of a Stairwell (u,e)}{ }{     A gray solid concrete stairwell.  The floor and walls are all unpainted, uncovered concrete.  A stairwell leads up from here.  A black, metal hand rail runs up the stairway, the paint is flaking off. The large metal door in the east wall is dented in, but somehow remains on its hinges. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45067}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45961}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45960}{0}{}{A Well-Lit Hallway (s,w,n)}{ }{     The hallway continues both north and south.  The west wall and floor are in no better condition, still torn and damaged.  The glass wall continues to demarcate the east side of the hallway.  Some sort of store room lies to the west through another empty and cracked door frame.  Off in the distance, you hear some sort of mechanical whir. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45067}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45962}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
