R {45961}{0}{}{A Stairwell (d,e)}{ }{     A gray, solid concrete stairwell.  The floor and walls are all unpainted, uncovered concrete.  The air is cold and musty.  A stairway leads down from here.  A black, metal handrail runs down the stairway, and the paint is flaking off.  There is an open doorway to the east from which there seems to be some activity. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45959}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49463}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45962}{0}{}{The Records Waiting Room (n,e)}{ }{     Several brown couches are pushed into the center of this room.  The cloth covering the couches is torn and covered in dust.  Scattered about are several piles of wood and glass that may have once been other furniture or fixtures.  What looks like an office is to the north, the hallway is to the east. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45960}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45964}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45963}{0}{}{A Corner in a Well-Lit Hallway (s,e)}{ }{     The hallway bends around to the south and east.  There are some doors farther down the hall in both directions.  A small amount of sunlight peeks through the panes of the glass wall.  The concrete walls and floor are in terrible shape.  An occasional murmur of speaking catches your ear. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45960}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45968}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45964}{0}{}{The Records Office (s,n)}{ }{     A wooden desk lies in two pieces in the center of the room.  Faded papers have fallen to the ground and cover the blue carpet near the broken desk.  The walls are covered in a once decorative, now mostly shredded wallpaper.  There appears to be a room full of computers to the north, and maybe a waiting room to the south. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45962}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45965}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45965}{0}{}{A Data Entry Room (s,e)}{ }{      Four destroyed computer terminals are mounted on four small metal desks.  The desks appear to be bolted to the walls.  Each terminal seems to have the key components:  a monitor, a CPU, and a keyboard\; it is pretty obvious they do not work since every one of them has the glass of the monitor crushed in.  To the south lies what appears to be an office, to the east, another computer room. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45964}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45966}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45966}{0}{}{The Electronic Records Storage Room (w,e)}{ }{    The white tiled floor is raised.  The ceiling is a drop ceiling.   You can feel a slight rush of air somehow being forced past you.  Two very large mainframes fill this room, each has char marks covering its gray case.  Both computers are sitting quietly, clearly shut off }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45965}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45967}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45967}{0}{}{The Paper Records Storage Room (s,w)}{ }{     Burned and charred papers, cabinets and other now unrecognizable pieces of furniture fill this room.  Nothing at all seems remotely salvageable.  Soot even covers the ceiling.  The burn damage seems to have somehow been contained, because it does not extend to the computer room to the west, or out into the hall to the south. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45966}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {45968}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {45968}{0}{}{A Well-Lit Hallway (n,w,e)}{ }{    The hallway continues on east and west.  The war torn concrete and glass walls are no different here, but a storage room lies to the north through a broken door frame.  A red fire alarm panel is mounted next to the door frame. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45963}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49446}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
