R {45972}{0}{}{In a Church (front,out)}{ }{   The inside of the church is beautiful but still simple. Many pews face the front of the church where the priest usually stands. Beautiful stained-glass windows line the walls and candles burn endlessly. }{Heaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
