R {46220}{0}{}{<*<*Deathly Quiet Glen*>*> (ne,nw,n,w,e)}{ }{      The air is perfectly still within this gloomy forest glen.  It is so quiet that the lack of sound becomes ominous.  You hear your heart beating loudly.  The trees here are caliginous and dead, and all is draped in a layer of white spider webs.  The webs are so thick that they not only dampen all sound, but block out the sun leaving the room dimly lit and dressed in a ghastly white cloak. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
