R {46229}{0}{}{<*<*Darkened Stream*>*> (s,e,n,nw,se,sw,ne)}{ }{      A dense growth of trees and thorny vines press up against a steep stream bed.  The more you move the more you get pushed towards the icy stream.  Dark shapes flutter above your head, and you see jaws snapping in the turbid water.  As you try to move away thorns rip into your flesh.  The light from the sun is muted by the thick brush all around you. The stream runs from north to south. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
