R {46230}{0}{}{<*<*A Shrub Covered Hill*>*> (se,sw,ne,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{     The forest gives way to a small hill here with a single Bush at its peak.  A thick black viscous goo seeps from the base of the shrub and seems to kill everything around it.  The area smells strongly of pig manure.  The cries of ignored children blow about on a miasma of war. Everything about this hill makes you want to run in terror. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
