R {46231}{0}{}{<*<*A Seemingly Pleasant Pond*>*> (s,w,e,n,nw,se,ne)}{ }{        Long vines swing down from several weeping willow trees that surround a pleasant looking pond.  The depths are hidden by lily pads in full bloom along with a layer of duckweed.  Ripples occasionally move the floating plants around the surface of the water.  The area around the pond looks inviting to sit and rest, as it is completely clear and clean.  Surprisingly, you don't hear any birds or see any of the normal woodland wildlife you'd expect around a fresh water-source. Small creeks extend to the north and the south from the pond. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
