R {46236}{0}{}{<*<*A Mushroom Circle*>*> (se,sw,nw,n,s,w,e)}{ }{         You've stumbled into a circle of bulbous mushrooms.  The air seems highly charged and you catch glimmers of light out of the corner of your eye. The wind blows against a pile of hollow logs as they resonate in an oddly musical rhythm. The clearing is filled with a heady scent that leaves you feeling dizzy and intoxicated.  You swear that you can hear the sound of bells on a warm zephyr.  The trees surrounding the mushrooms grow at odd angles and their leaves are brilliantly colored in hues of blue, red, purple and pink. Something strange is going on here. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
