R {46262}{0}{<268>}{In a Corridor (n,w)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{      The hallway has a sharp corner here with one direction leading west toward the entrance and the other heading north to a bunch of doorways. A small passage leads up to the top of one of the towers but otherwise this section of the castle is quite plain. There are no paintings or decoration unlike the other parts of the castle and there isn't even a rug on the floor here. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
