R {46263}{0}{<268>}{Storage Room (n,e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{      Large wooden, iron framed barrels are packed in rows and stacked in columns all across the back wall. Two giant kegs stand in one corner, and a guard lies passed out in front of one. Crates full of arrows, bolts, swords and other weapons for the defense of the castle stack one of the side walls, and the other has food supplies to help resist long sieges. To the west lies the stables. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
