R {46264}{0}{<138>}{Great Hall (s)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{        You stand in the castle's great hall. The room is quite magnificent, even though it has been damaged severely. A large oak table runs along the back wall where the castle's elite once ate dinner. Many other tables are aligned in rows in other parts of the room to seat a large audience. The walls are decorated with banners and paintings and the floor has a large red rug on it. A giant chandelier extends from the ceiling over an open area in the center of the room which was probably used for audiences and dancing. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
