R {46265}{0}{<268>}{In a hallway (n,s)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{     Three open doors line the east wall of this hallway, a stairway lies to the north and to the south the hallway curves west. Above each doorway there is a sign explaining what lies through that door. There is a table on the west wall with a to scale replica model of the country the castle is in. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
