R {46266}{0}{<278>}{At A Grand Staircase (stairs,s)}{<278>.@.<088>}{      A lavish staircase spans the width of the hallway, covered in a luxurious regal carpet. Small alcoves are embedded into the wall all along the length of the stairway. To the south three doors line the east wall, and to the north, up the stairway, the stairs turn sharply, reverse direction and continue to ascend. A large lighting fixture hangs down over the landing where the stairs turn southward. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
