R {46267}{0}{<278>}{Top Of A Staircase (stairs,w)}{<278>.@.<088>}{       A grand staircase leads into a regal hallway with doors all along its southern wall. A banister runs from the staircase toward the east wall, overlooking the bend in the staircase where it turns back southward as it heads to the first floor. A chain hangs down from the ceiling to support a large light fixture that is suspend over the landing halfway up the staircase. A red carpet runs all the way to the end of the hallway to the west. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
