R {46271}{0}{}{In a Prison (stairs)}{ }{      Three large iron cells makeup this dark and damp prison. Each cell has a giant metal door and a large chain lock hangs between the bars to prevent them from being opened. A wooden chair lies against one of the walls, it is toppled over and lying on the ground. The air is very musty and stale down below the earth, contradicting the fresh scent of air that wafts in occasionally from the staircase leading out. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
