R {46274}{0}{}{In A Prison Cell (out)}{ }{      This small prison cell is very spartan. A small pile of rags sits in one corner, a makeshift bed, while a skeleton of some poor soul lies in the middle of the cell. Chains, ending in metal cuffs, dangle down from a hoop on the wall. Thick iron bars make up one of the cell walls where the door leading out of this cell is located, while the other walls are made from ancient stone bricks. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
