R {46276}{0}{}{In A Dungeon Cell (hole,out)}{ }{      This cramped and dark prison cell is in a state of incredible dis-repair. The most obvious example of this is a gaping hole in the middle of the room. Apart from that, the walls are molded, the floor is covered in dirt and cobwebs stretch across most of the corners of the ceiling. A few bones lie on the right side of the room, and some moldy lumps lie on the other side. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
