R {46277}{0}{}{In A Torture Chamber (out)}{ }{         A unpleasant looking device is the focal point of this room. It stands directly in the center of the room with straps and a wheel sticking out in various directions. Old dried blood is smeared across the machine, the floor and the walls. There are also some odd stains in one corner of the room. The ceiling lies high above and the light does not penetrate the darkness that hides it. Extremely large spider webs are strewn high in the air between sections of wall, and they continue up into the darkness above. Every so often a clicking noise emanates from high above. A strong smell of ichor permeates the room. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
