R {46279}{0}{<268>}{In a hallway (s,n)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{     A long stone hallway stretches before you leading north and south. Three doors line the west wall leading into various rooms and a fourth door is on the east wall. Lamps, paintings, mirrors and a carpet serve as the decoration for this space. A table with a vase leans against one wall while a tall urn, and a large plant are on the other side. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
