R {46281}{0}{<248>}{In the Stables (e)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{     The stables are constructed from various stalls for horses lined up in a row. Giant doors for riding the horses away from the castle dominates one of the walls. Horseshoes, hammers and other tools associated with horses are hanging from hooks or in piles on the floor. The smell of excrement is very strong. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46279}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46282}{0}{<248>}{Servants Quarters (e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{      The servants quarters consists of bed after bed after bed, each having a small chest at the foot and a shelf above their headboard. This place has been completely cleared out. The servants must have had the good judgement to predict that the impending attack would not be repelled and flew the coup along with all their possessions. All that remains is the things that were bolted to the floor. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46279}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46283}{0}{<248>}{In the Pantry (se)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{     The pantry is a mess! Ripped open bags of flour clutter the floor, sacks of rotting fruit and vegetables sit on a counters, and spices and salts are spilled all over the room. Tracks of tiny animals can be seen among the various powdery substances found everywhere. A large cupboard with its door broken off dominates the far wall. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46279}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46284}{0}{}{Atop a turret (d)}{ }{       Giant stone blocks circle around the top of the tower providing a barrier between attacking projectiles and the defenders who could crouch behind them. This turret is also setup to support a large siege weapon to hurl death and destruction down upon attacking troops. Small gaps in the stone blocks allow archers to fire down with minimal exposure to enemy fire. The crystal clear blue sky extends infinitely into the distance on this pleasant summer day. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
