R {46286}{0}{<268>}{Hallway (e)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{      The hallway runs from east to west and comes to an end at a large globe suspended on an interesting device. The entire royal family for hundreds of years back is portrayed in pictures that hang on the north wall, while two doors line the south wall, one to the southwest and one directly south. A large lantern is perched on the wall casting long shadows on the walls. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
