R {46421}{0}{}{Utter blackness (south,east,north)}{ }{       The way you came from seems lost in darkness and you can only hope that it still exists.  You are unable to tell if you are enclosed by walls, a floor and ceiling, or if you are just floating in the nether. You lose your footing momentarily as a shadowy face materializes inches from your's, but then is gone as quickly as it came.  Your despair at being in this place grows by the minute as you wonder if you will ever see the light of day. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
