R {46422}{0}{}{Utter blackness (north,south)}{ }{       You have moved into a new patch of darkness, but it is impossible to tell if you really came from where you thought you did.  At first you feel like the shadows have wrapped you in a blanket, but then it begins to close in on you, crushing your body.  At points the shadows almost feel viscous and you have to wade through them.  Even if you retraced your steps, you would find yourself taking some completely new path each time. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
