R {46429}{0}{}{Eternal darkness (south)}{ }{       So much darkness, so much evil, this room overpowers your senses and leaves you disoriented.  You are unable to tell if you are enclosed by walls, a floor and ceiling, or if you are just floating in the nether. Living shadows in the distance are either moving toward you, or away from you. You hope its the latter.  This prison of darkness has not been visited by a creature such as yourself for thousands of years, and for good reason. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
