R {46436}{0}{}{Darkness (southeast,northwest)}{ }{      You slide from one swirling mass of darkness to the next as you move forward.  Dancing shadows move all around you, and yet somehow manage to catch your eye despite the presence of so many other shadows.  You lose your footing momentarily as a shadowy face materializes inches from your's, but then is gone as quickly as it came.  The shifting world around you causes this place to be very confusing. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
