R {46437}{0}{}{Swimming in shadow (southeast,southwest,north)}{ }{      Your mind is buffeted with darkness as you enter the room.  Dancing shadows move all around you, and yet somehow manage to catch your eye despite the presence of so many other shadows.  Something rushes toward you at an incredible speed, but when it is about to hit you it just vanishes.  The room almost seems to reel in pain from the presence of your light. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
