R {46441}{0}{}{Shadow (north,south)}{ }{     You feel disoriented as you walk further through the shadows.  Dancing shadows move all around you, and yet somehow manage to catch your eye despite the presence of so many other shadows.  At points the shadows almost feel viscous and you have to wade through them.  The shifting world around you causes this place to be very confusing. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
