R {46442}{0}{}{Among the dark things (north,west)}{ }{     When you entered this room, you weren't even sure that you really moved anywhere.  You get a sinking feeling like the floor beneath you is gone and you are falling, but just as suddenly it's gone.  You bump into solid objects that are no longer there when you try to push them aside.  Only a miracle will help you explore this realm. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
