E {46443}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46443}{0}{}{Engulfed in shadow (east,west)}{ }{       Your location looks indistinguishable from all the other places in the shadow realm.  Whether you have been here for hours or days, or even years, begins to become harder to tell as your memory is assaulted by the lack of anything tangible.  Neither your breath, your body temperature, nor your light manage to drift more then foot or two from you before being consumed by the blackness.  Turning back now would be a wise choice. You may not get another chance. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
