E {46444}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46444}{0}{}{Shadow (east,north)}{ }{       When you entered this room, you weren't even sure that you really moved anywhere.  At first you feel like the shadows have wrapped you in a blanket, but then it begins to close in on you, crushing your body.  You lose your footing momentarily as a shadowy face materializes inches from your's, but then is gone as quickly as it came.  The shifting world around you causes this place to be very confusing. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46443}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
