R {46445}{0}{}{A swirling shadow (south,despair)}{ }{       You have moved into a new patch of darkness, but it is impossible to tell if you really came from where you thought you did.  The floor beneath you is completely black and yet somehow you manage not to fall through it.  A large form moves nearby, but you can't tell if it was moving toward you or away from you.  This prison of darkness has not been visited by a creature such as yourself for thousands of years, and for good reason. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
