R {46446}{0}{}{The lair of the beast (out)}{ }{       You find yourself in a lair of some kind. There are splotches of shadow all over the place and after a few minutes it occurs to you that they are dead shadow demons. Whoever lives here doesn't appreciate intrusions of any kind. There also appear to be a number of bones that most assuredly did not belong to shadow demons since you can easily see them. Other then those few details the room is otherwise outlined in blackness. }{Mystic Seal - Shadow Prison}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
