R {46450}{0}{<148>}{Broken Matrix (s)}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{        Set into the wall of the tunnel here is an intricate matrix of blue crystals.  The central crystal of the matrix sports a spiderweb of fine cracks\; blue dust and small chunks of crystal litter the floor of the passage.  Two orbs of light float in midair, unsupported by any visible means, above the shattered matrix.  The warding runes here pulse and flare like those everywhere else, but the runes nearest the matrix seem to have burnt out.  You get a strong feeling that you're being watched here. }{Mystic Seal}{seal_illithid_enclave}{}{}{1.000}{1}
