R {46451}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (nexus,u)}{ }{        You've entered a bizarre chamber of jagged ledges, twisting pillars, glowing lights, and weird blistered surfaces. The walls, floor, and ceiling here, as well as everything attached to them, seem to be made of a strange gray substance. The bubbles and pock marks adorning everything, along with the various strange protrusions, make this place look organic. The buzzing in your head is very loud now, and the feeling that something is watching you is stronger than ever. A swirling nexus of energy floats serenely in mid-air here. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
