R {46454}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (e,w,n,d)}{ }{       Glowing orbs of radiant light are housed along the ceiling of this twisted chamber, illuminating a whirlwind of ledges, pillars, and corridors. Most of what would otherwise be the floor drops away in a gigantic hole. Over this expanse, two pillars curve together to form a misshapen archway many meters across. A strange odor floats in the air, a sharp-biting scent that reminds you of the mages' tents in Wayhaven. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
