R {46455}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (u,w)}{ }{       This twisted chamber rises tall and thin, like the inside of a demented tower or spire, into the air. A ledge just over your head faces upside-down, as if the denizens of this place were hedging their bets against occasional reversals of gravity. Your head throbs with a buzz of thought-energy that tickles your mind without opening itself to its secrets. Orbs of light float in place about the room, impassively illuminating the scene. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46454}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
