R {46456}{0}{}{Expansive chamber (n,e)}{ }{       This chamber is roughly a cube, although its surface is ornamented irregularly with crazy pillars, alcoves, and protrusions. From somewhere, the steady glow of the illuminating orbs fills the room. The floor is more or less level here. Just above its approximate center floats a large black cauldron, from which wisps of steam curl. The cauldron is heated by eldritch blue flames that seem to have no physical source. The air is thick with the musk of incense. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46454}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46459}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46457}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (w,s,n)}{ }{       A large flat platform rises from the floor here. It's the only expansive flat surface you've seen thus far in here. Leg irons are attached to its side at regular intervals, lying empty as though awaiting the arrival of a slave army. In the center of the platform rests a chair of some sort, a spiked iron throne with a hemispherical head cap, but nobody sits in it. The room feels empty, as though there were once many creatures here, but now they have gone somewhere else. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
