R {46458}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (nw,d)}{ }{      This bubble-like room is pierced with a circular shaft descending down into the floor. Three ledges overhang the opening to the shaft, inclined slightly downward as if to give people standing on them a feeling of vertigo. A ring of orbs of light floats near the ceiling, illuminating the chamber with a cool white light. It's very humid in here, and it smells faintly of incense. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46455}{d}{.fly;d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
