R {46459}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (s,e)}{ }{       This bubble-like room looks as though someone started with a normal spherical room and gave it an advanced form of leprosy. The blistered walls are cluttered with angles and ledges, the uneven floor divided into platforms and ornamented with helical pillars soaring up to the ceiling. The feeling that you are being watched has been your constant companion in this place, but it's stronger now, as if you were growing close to its source. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
