R {46460}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (ne,s,u)}{ }{       Rows of metal cages hang from protrusions and ledges along the walls of this soaring, twisted room, dangling and swaying slightly. The smell of incense is overpowered here by the smells of urine, vomit, and other human effluents, telling of recent occupation of the cages. At the moment, almost all of the cage doors are open, the cages themselves empty save for rags and the remains of scant meals. A faint whimper is audible from one of the cages hanging high on the wall. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46457}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
