R {46461}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (sw)}{ }{      Fragile gray spires rise from the ground here, reaching all the way to the ceiling above.  Wrought metal gates are attached to some of the spires, forming a set of pens obviously meant for keeping large creatures.  Judging by the thinness of the spires and bars, the creatures stay in place more from mental docility than from an actual inability to break free.  A wide corridor leads southwest. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46460}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46462}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (s,nw,n,d)}{ }{        You're at the top of a tall shaft that plunges down into the shell-like ground. There's no floor here, although a mess of horizontal pillars and ledges leave you no shortage of places to stand. Stretched out along the walls of the shaft below you are rows of iron cages, each large enough to hold a human. The cages look from here to be all empty\; in fact, most of them are hanging open. Your thoughts buzz with an undercurrent of nearby mental activity. It feels strangely as though someone else's mind is spilling over into yours. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46460}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46463}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
