R {46463}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (sw,se,n,u)}{ }{        The walls of this chamber are festooned with what appear to be sarcophagi built of the same gray material as the walls and floor. Some of them are open, revealing man-sized chambers set into the walls. Others are closed, perhaps even occupied. With a shudder of revulsion, you realize the illithids *live* in the chambers. Perhaps they sleep there, if illithids sleep. Openings in the abscessed walls lead north and southeast, while a vertical shaft leads upward. Low in the wall, a shaft leads southwest. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
