R {46464}{0}{}{In front of a large Structure (se)}{ }{      The twisting ledges lead you to a giant structure that towers up into the darkness. Two massive doors bar entry and there is no way you could get them open from the outside. A large sign stands in front of the door. The surface of the building is somewhat curved as it juts out of the surrounding walls providing a semi-circle look. How deep this building extends is anyone's guess. }{Mindflayer Arena}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
