R {46465}{0}{}{Cluttered alcove (s)}{ }{      This gray alcove is apparently used to store all manner of items and supplies. Barrels and boxes on the floor and ledges hold knickknacks and whatnots, while thingamajigs hang from the various protrusions along the blistered gray walls. Note carefully, however: there are no whatchamacallits to be found here. To the south, the alcove opens onto a vertical shaft. Hope you remembered your wings. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
