R {46468}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (ne)}{ }{        This vile chamber looks like some sort of futuristic medical laboratory for mad wizards. A briny vat in the center of the room holds dozens of human corpses in various states of decay. Most of them appear to have had their heads split open. It stinks unmercifully, filling the air with a choking rotting reek. Spaced around the walls are tanks filled with translucent blue fluid. Pale shapes float in the tanks. Pipes crisscross the room, running from the vat to the tanks and into the walls.0m }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
