R {46469}{0}{}{A twisted, evil enclave (d)}{ }{       This capacious, roughly spherical chamber is dominated by a tank of brine and gray matter that takes up most of the floor and rises two meters into the air. The mental buzz that has beset you ever since you neared this enclave almost overcomes you, and you realize the source of the interference is the tank. It's warm and wet in here, and the air smells of salt. Ledges ring the walls. A wide shaft in the floor leads back down. }{Mystic Seal - Illithid Enclave}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46463}{d}{.fly;d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46470}{0}{<278>}{A misty passage (out)}{<278>*  <088>}{          Enshrouded by thick tendrils of icy vapor, the passage is all but impossible to make out clearly.  The cold is so extreme that it seeps into even the most insulated material.  When the chill is combined with the humidity in the air, all present are in danger of being sheathed by a layer of frost.  Although it is nearly impossible to see the ground through the mist, touch confirms it's perilously slick.  The echo of crashing water rebounds through here, rising to such intensity that most other sounds are lost in its wake.  It's impossible to tell through the cloud of vapor which ways you can go\; you'll have to navigate blind. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
