R {46482}{0}{}{In an old mansion (e,s,n,se,sw)}{ }{     As you enter the hallway you immediately notice a broken table half leaning against the eastern wall. Beneath it you spot a tangled mass of red fabric which covers the long since worn down wooden floor. Smaller rooms branch out from this dark hallway into other parts of the mansion. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
