R {46483}{0}{}{In an old mansion (e,w)}{ }{      A small chandelier lies in the dead centre of the small hallway. It has long since fallen from the ceiling and broken pieces of metal cover most of the room. A broken window is set in the wall which allows some of the daylight to shine through. A large wooden door covers the eastern exit while the open corridor continues off in a western direction. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
