R {46484}{0}{}{In an old mansion (s,n)}{ }{      The main hallway continues deeper into the large mansion. Remains of what you can only guess used to be furniture lie on the worn floor boards. Hanging above you is a rusty chandelier. It's a small miracle that it is still hanging considering the state of the house. Some kind of red textile covers the floor but most of it has been ripped into pieces. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
