R {46485}{0}{}{At a foyer of an old mansion (s)}{ }{       You're standing in the foyer of a very large mansion. The floor consists of worn old wooden boards that at one point were probably very impressive and beautiful. Stone walls surround the dark hallway and you see remnants of wooden panel mounted against it. In the middle of the hallway is some kind of red fabric. Once, there was most likely a door here but time has run its course and it has long since collapsed, effectively preventing you from leaving this way. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
