R {46486}{0}{}{In an old mansion (u,nw)}{ }{    This part of the hallway seems to be a lot narrower than the initial one in the foyer. It ends by a wooden stairway leading up to the upper floor of the mansion. The once beautiful wooden paneled floor has long since been worn out and are now cracked and at some parts broken.  }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
