R {46487}{0}{<238>}{In an old and dusty library (w)}{<238>"""<088>}{      This was once a magnificent library. Several broken bookshelves, which have long since toppled under the weight of the books, cover large portions of the floor. The centre of the room consists of an old broken chair with a small worn down desk next to it. You notice no apparent light source in the room yet it feels like the room is cloaked in an eerie light and you have no problem seeing. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
