R {46488}{0}{}{On the upper floor of an old mansion (d,n)}{ }{    Large chunks of flaked off paint litter the wooden floor. As you look around, it's clear that age has taken its toll on this once magnificent furnished manor. A small wooden staircase leading down to the bottom floor has been cramped into the southern corner. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
