R {46497}{0}{}{In a cluttered room (s)}{ }{     Wooden debris covers the entire floor of this room. Clearly it's the sign of large furniture that has rotted and fallen apart over to the course of time. A particular large pile lies along the eastern wall which draws your attention. There is a fairly sizable window mounted in the northern wall. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46496}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46498}{0}{}{On the upper floor of an old mansion (w,n)}{ }{     A large window set in the eastern wall dominates this small end of the hallway. It has long since been broken and shards of glass litter both the window frame as well as part of the old floor. An odd looking heap of rubble rests directly below the window. Once it might have resembled something but has crumbled during the course of time. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46494}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46499}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46499}{0}{}{In a broken down utility room (s)}{ }{     Broken rusty pipes litter the dusty marble floor and as you enter the room you almost trip upon them. At one point, this might have been some kind of utility room but any real trace of its purpose has long since vanished. There are no windows in any of the walls and the only exit out is back through the door which you came. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
