R {46506}{0}{}{Building Entrance (n)}{ }{     A thick layer of dust covers everything within sight, while the floor is marred by a tide of plaster-mixed rubble. The illumination here is poor, making it difficult to see clearly. The only source of light are thin rays of sunlight that sneak in between the cracks in the walls. You could leave if you want to.  }{Kareless Kanga's}{kareless_kanga}{}{}{1.000}{1}
