R {46507}{0}{<248>}{Your private room in Purgatory (out)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{          This is your very own room in Purgatory.  It's yours for as long  as you want to use it.  As long as you stay here, no one can  disturb you unless you bring them inside with you.  And, as long as  you have the key, you can come and go as you please.  The only  thing left to do is to 'decorate' this place to your liking.   Purgatory is currently offering 'elegant' and 'naughty' decor for  the private rooms.  Simply 'decorate <style>' to reset this  description to the one you choose.  You may also switch between the  two as you like by simply decorating again.  If you have any  suggestions for other styles, use the 'idea' command in this room. }{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
