R {46515}{0}{}{Inside an Aviary (path)}{<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>}{      A small, grassy clearing about twenty feet in diameter, as near as you can figure, you are somewhere around the middle of the aviary. A low marble bench rests on the southern side, cunningly placed  to offer shade and privacy to guests that wish to sit. The small mountain is visible off to the west, with the path you entered by barely visible to the north. }{Askar's Aviary}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
