R {46516}{0}{}{Inside an Aviary (d)}{ }{        Standing on top of the mountain, the aviary stretches out beneath you in all its splendor. Sunlight, bright and hot, pours down upon your head, giving the aviary the feeling of a summer's day at  noon. The top of the mountain seems to be covered with a various assortment of sticks, twigs, down feathers, and mud, with the  sides higher than the bottom, making a bowl-like shape. Your knees begin to tremble as you realize you are standing in the middle of a nest.  A very large nest.. for a very large bird. }{Askar's Aviary}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
