R {46537}{0}{<238>}{An ancient tower (n,s)}{<238>|@|<088>}{         You stand at the entrance to an ancient tower.  Looking at the age of the stonework and the outstanding craftsmanship, there is no question that a powerful lord had this tower built.  The huge stones that form the walls of the tower bear the marks of many centuries, giving you the feeling that this tower is perhaps the oldest thing around, with the exception of the dirt perhaps.  The surrounding mist obscures the top of the tower, making it difficult to see how tall it actually is.  The door to the tower has long since rotted away, allowing you to pass freely into the tower proper. }{Ralintaro's Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
