R {46538}{0}{<238>}{An ancient tower (w,s,e,n)}{<238>] [<088>}{       You stand just inside of the immense tower.  The air is quite cool and carries a musty smell.  Small swirls of dust kick up as you move your feet, indicating that it has been quite some time since someone passed this way.  The open entrance to the tower lies to the south, the doors having long since rotted away.  You can feel a sensation of terror welling up from your stomach as you look around this ancient room.  A dusty chandelier hangs down from the ceiling. }{Ralintaro's Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
