E {46538}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46541}{0}{<238>}{An ancient tower (w,s)}{<238>] [<088>}{      The room around you appears to be a sitting room of sorts, or at least it was.  Remnants of couches and chairs lie about, covered by dust.  Fragile looking tables sit next to the couches as end tables.  The remains of what once must have been a grand staircase rise precariously toward the ceiling.  The remnants of once grand tapestries hang on the walls. }{Ralintaro's Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46538}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
