R {46542}{0}{<238>}{An ancient tower (e)}{<238>] [<088>}{     This room is strikingly different from all of the other rooms of the tower that you have seen.  While the other rooms are old and musty, covered with dust, this room is sparkling clean.  The stone walls look new and strong and the ceiling soars proudly above you.  There is a strange symbol drawn on the floor here. }{Ralintaro's Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46541}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {46543}{0}{<238>}{An ancient tower (se)}{<238>] [<088>}{    This dusty room seems to have once served as a library of sorts.  Crumbling scrolls lie carefully stacked on the decaying shelves.  There is an extremely comfortable looking chair here that shows no signs of the surrounding decay. }{Ralintaro's Tower}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
