R {46546}{0}{}{Trail to the ruins (n,se)}{<238>. .<088>}{        This hidden trail leads through the dark and unnaturally silent woods.  Massive sickly trees surround you.  The darkness and dead silence in this part of the forest is more than a little creepy. A cool breeze carrying the scent of incense with it blows through this area, causing you to shiver.  The dirt path leads north.  Up ahead you can vaguely make out ruins of some sort, and a bright unnatural orange light.  There is something sinister about this part of the otherwise beautiful woods. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
