R {46547}{0}{<248>}{Druid shrine (s)}{<248>.<118>@<248>.<088>}{        Orange light blazes forth from a campfire ahead, signaling the end of this trail.  Strangely the campfire is unaffected by the constant downpour of rain from the dark clouds above, which eclipse the sun.  Light blazes forth from the campfire, dimly illuminating shattered monolithic blocks of granite.  Rubble lies where once there stood an ancient temple.  The trees of the forest are held at bay from the ruins in a fifty foot radius, as if by magic. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
