R {46548}{0}{<238>}{Oak's treetop (d)}{<238># ]<088>}{       Golden sunlight seeps in through gaps and cracks in the leafy treetop, dimly illuminating the inner capitulum of this ancient oak.  A sea of green leaves, and small round acorns cover the thick branches of this tree.   The thick bark of the tree's lower branches melds together creating a solid floor for you to stand upon.  Dying leaves fall from the oak, slowly drifting down to the ground below.  A gentle breeze carries the smell of violets into the treetop. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
