R {46564}{0}{}{Zalasta's quarters (s)}{ }{           This must be a very strange room, because by your own reckoning you should now be standing in mid-air outside the tower. Maybe you are in a pocket dimension. You're not quite sure. The room is richly decorated, and seems to be the personal quarters of the owner of the tower. Everything is neat and tidy. There are hundreds of books in the bookcase on the south wall, surrounding the portal which appears to be the only way out of here.  There is a large comfortable looking bed on the west side, and a huge window that looks out to the city to the north. In the eastern portion of the room is a huge semicircular desk upon which lies a book and some quills and other writing materials. }{Wayhaven}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
