R {46574}{0}{}{A brightly lit, sterile hallway (e,s,n)}{ }{      The harsh illumination and rigorous, clinical cleanliness of the laboratory complex assaults your senses.  The almost cylindrical hall runs north to south, accompanied by the pipes that are attached to the ceiling.  Looking down, you can see your reflection in the highly specular floor, made particularly vivid by the bright lights on the ceiling.  There is a secured door to the east. }{Drexler Nanolabs, Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
