R {46576}{0}{}{A brightly lit, sterile Hallway (w,s,n)}{ }{       The inhospitably sterile hallway stretches on quite a ways to the north and to the south.  The ever-present metallic pipes run along the top of the ceiling.  You find your eyes being drawn to them continually on account of the sharp contrast they provide with the stark white walls.  You idly wonder what sort of equipment it takes to keep everything in the laboratory complex so incredibly clean and free of dust.  There is a strong secured door to the west. }{Drexler Nanolabs, Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
