R {46578}{0}{}{A brightly lit, sterile Hallway (w,s,n)}{ }{        Contrasting sharply with the dead silence of the rest of the hall, a soft whisper of a hum can be heard.  You follow the sound to its source, a series of small vents in the western wall which much serve as air recirculators and purifiers.  This must be the machine that keeps even the dust out of the air.  Your eye catches the glint off of the metallic pipes that follow the ceiling, drawing your attention.  As you turn around, you see a heavy secured door set into the west wall. }{Drexler Nanolabs, Inc.}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
