R {46711}{0}{}{Top of Shabby Tower (d)}{ }{         You have reached the second story of this shabby old tower. The room is rather drafty, with a biting chill that seeps into your bones despite the fact that it is warm outside the tower.  There is nothing of interest in this top floor of this rather shabby tower.  A small stone stairway leads downwards to the first floor. }{Portal of Life v3.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
