R {46713}{0}{}{Village Common Room (e)}{ }{           This is the village common room.  Whenever the members of the village or the families of the nearby farms feel like getting together to talk about changes in the village or prices for the local market, this is where they do it.  The room is a large straw building with a large stone hearth at one end.  The floor is strewn with straw as well, and the place has a very comfortable feel to it. }{Portal of Life v3.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
