R {46838}{0}{}{Entrance Hall (d,n,s,e,w)}{ }{    Pallid black soot stains the walls, and human skulls litter the floor.  There is a picture on one wall, painted with dark blood.  You smell a putrid odor coming from the east, and a strange foreboding emanates from the west. }{Portal of Life v3.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
