R {46981}{0}{}{Entrance Hall (w,e,s,n)}{ }{     This is the main entrance hall for the stronghold. Large tapestries hang from the ceilings and passages lead off in each of the cardinal directions.  The floor is made of sturdy granite, and the ceiling appears to be made of some beautiful sparkling stone which you've not seen before. }{Portal of Life v3.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
