R {46986}{0}{}{Bottom of Staircase (u,sw)}{ }{   You stand at the base of a large tower.  The walls are made of solid marble, and a large staircase rises upward into the higher levels of the tower. }{Portal of Life v3.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
