R {47250}{0}{}{Colossus (u,d)}{ }{       You are walking along a steeply sloping incline, cut into the Great Colossus by the force that broke it in twain.  The mist pours down from further up, rushing by your feet on its way down into the Land.  Tinged a sickening green, the whole ledge reeks of power abused and wasted. A massively powerful and tragic male figure stands wrapped tightly by a foul emerald-green light.  You flinch! }{The Land v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
