R {47251}{0}{}{Colossus (d)}{ }{         You are at the end of a long, extended, sloping ledge that protrudes from the top of the Colossus and high into the air above the Land.  To the east you can see the fall of of Landrider into the depths below.  Clean roiling mists prevent any view of the foul lands beyond.  A foul haze billows from the apparition at the end of the ledge. A beautiful woman holding a staff stands before you, caught in a web of emerald-green and horribly foul light.  A dank and awful mist boils off of the perverted staff she holds. }{The Land v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
