R {47317}{0}{}{Subterranean Maze (s,d)}{1}{       This cramped space is completely enclosed with smooth stone walls, except for a set of stone doors.  It's cold and musty.  Dust cakes the walls and floor, and cobwebs adorn the ceiling.  A shaft in the center of the floor leads straight down into darkness.  You can hear rushing water below.  A stone lever painted red juts out of the west wall\; an identical blue lever juts out of the east wall.  A passageway leads south here, across from the twin stone portals in the north wall. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
