R {47318}{0}{<238>}{Subterranean Plank Maze (w,e,jump)}{<238>|||<088>}{         You stand on a cold grey stone platform in the cavernous subterranean plank maze of Qiao Hou's forgotten temple.  Around you, dozens of identical platforms rise out of the still dark water.  Fanglike stone walls jut up from the corners of your platform, leaving openings at the cardinal compass directions.  At each opening, a socket in the floor will hold one end of a plank bridge. The empty northern socket faces toward a platform 10 meters away. The southern opening looks out over empty water. A 20 meter plank bridges the gap to the east. A stone bridge leads out of the maze to the west. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
