R {47320}{0}{<238>}{Subterranean Plank Maze (w,jump)}{<238>|||<088>}{         You stand on a cold grey stone platform in the cavernous subterranean plank maze of Qiao Hou's forgotten temple.  Around you, dozens of identical platforms rise out of the still dark water.  Fanglike stone walls jut up from the corners of your platform, leaving openings at the cardinal compass directions.  At each opening, a socket in the floor will hold one end of a plank bridge. The empty northern socket faces toward a platform 10 meters away. The empty southern socket faces toward a platform 20 meters away. The empty eastern socket faces toward a platform 30 meters away. A 20 meter plank bridges the gap to the west. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
