R {47321}{513}{}{Below the plank maze (u)}{ }{    Icy cold leeches your life away every second you spend in the dark water. The pillars of the plank maze, taunting titans of perplexity, loom overhead. Recesses in the westernmost pillar form a ladder leading back up\; it looks like your only escape from a miserable hypothermic death. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1000.000}{1}
E {47318}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {47322}{0}{<248>}{Subterranean Maze (n,s)}{.}{     You've stumbled into a gray stone corridor in a maze.  The walls are made of plain gray stone, worked flat and smooth.  The corridor is perfectly square.  If it weren't for gravity, you'd have a hard time telling which way was up.  Darkness beckons you from the edges of the corridor.  A faint smell of decay pervades the area. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
