R {47500}{0}{}{Subterranean Maze (se,d)}{9}{      Cobwebs and dirt cover the stone walls, floor, and ceiling of this tiny chamber.  The still air is cold and stagnant, smelling faintly of death.  A hole in the floor drops down into darkness.  You can hear rushing water from somewhere below.  A stone lever painted teal juts out of the west wall.  Stone portals are set into the north and south walls. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
