R {47502}{0}{}{Subterranean Maze (se,n,d)}{10}{        This small chamber is about eight feet square, and made of stone.  Dust cakes the walls and floor\; the ceiling is hidden beneath an impressive layer of cobwebs.  It's cold enough to make your breath mist as you exhale.  An uncovered hole in the middle of the floor leads down into the darkness.  A stone lever painted gold juts out of the west wall.  Twin stone portals are set into the south wall.  A stone door in the north wall bears a mazelike pattern carved in bas-relief onto its face. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
