R {47503}{0}{<248>}{Subterranean Maze (d,s)}{<248>.<118>@<248>.<088>}{        The gray stone of the chambers through which you just passed gives way to black and white marble.  You are in a chamber about half a dozen paces square, and easily tall enough for you to stand.  The marble is carved into a three-dimensional maze covering floor, walls, ceiling, and the unadorned rectangular marble altar in front of you.  The effect is to make you wonder if you've stumbled into the innards of some mathematical zebra.  The maze pattern is only slightly obscured by the prodigious coat of dust covering everything. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
