R {47507}{0}{<248>}{Subterranean Maze (w)}{|}{     You're in a musty, twisting plain gray stone corridor, somewhere in a maze in a forgotten temple.  The square corridor is remarkable only in its plainness.  Clearly, the builders wanted it to be easy to get lost here.  The corridor stretches off into the cold darkness.  A faint smell of decay pervades the area. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
