R {47508}{0}{<248>}{Subterranean Maze (e)}{|}{     The soundless gray corridors continue to contort themselves in an indecipherable maze.  The walls, floor, and ceiling are indistinguishable, each made of square blocks of smooth gray stone.  The corridor continues along into cold, impenetrable darkness.  A faint smell of decay pervades the area. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
