R {47599}{0}{}{A rubble strewn corridor (doors,e)}{ }{       You find yourself standing at the eastern end of a ruined corridor near an ancient set of elevator doors. The corridor between here and a nearby junction is strewn with numerous small pieces of debris liberally coated in a layer of grime. Large colonies of mold have sprouted on the damp  walls, and in small damp patches on the floor. The air whilst breathable carries a fetid dank odour that does naught to persuade you that this place is little more than a tomb. }{Ruined Bunker}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
