R {47617}{0}{}{Newbie Lore:Page 5 (page6,page4)}{ }{             	Chapter 3: Character Core Commands Let's start off with the core commands available to you that will become second nature the longer you play.  Over the next couple of pages, we will discuss the very basics that will allow you to interact with your environment. 'Look' and 'examine' are two commands that are instrumental to playing here.  Both allow you to get a closer look at an object on the ground or in your inventory, an NPC (monster) within a room, or even a noun written into a room description. For example: let's imagine that this room describes a 'tree' just a few feet away. To inspect the tree individually, you would have to type 'examine tree' (or 'exa tree'). See if you can spot it, and then continue to the next page. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
