R {47640}{0}{}{Newbie Lore:Page 14 (page15,page13)}{ }{                    	Chapter 5: Character Advancement Now, before we set you up against a foe, we will first have to get you equipped with some armour and a weapon.  If you do not already have any, type 'equip'.  You will be given some free equipment. There are many different types of armour you may wear.  Types range from a main body piece, a shield, gloves, boots and so forth.  Type 'eq' to see the list of available slots.  If you are wearing any of the types listed, they will be shown within that list. To wear armour, you need to simply type 'wear name' (where name is the object you wish to put on).  You may also alternatively type 'wear all'. This will automatically make you wear whatever types of armour you currently have available within your inventory.  To remove any armour pieces to attempt to wear another, simply type 'remove name', or 'remove all' respectively. Wielding a weapon is much the same.  You need only to type 'wield name'. You can only wield one weapon at a time.  There are some weapons that require the use of both hands, thus preventing you from the use of a shield. Continue to the next page for the last bit of combat advice.  You are nearly finished with this newbie tutorial! }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
