R {47643}{0}{}{Newbie Lore:Page 16 (page17,page15)}{ }{                     	Chapter 6: Character Quests One of the last topics to discuss is 'Questing'.  Quests are story lines or puzzles the wizards of 3k have put together and given to players to solve.  Each one is unique, and each one offers a reward.  Questing with your character may often unlock the secrets to many areas, and many items you will find throughout the Realms.  You also gain 'quest points' for your successful efforts. Earning enough quest points will allow you to become a high mortal of 3k. These are noted questers within the realm who have conquered many trials and puzzles.  They are also granted many mythical abilities for achieving such a high status. To see a list of available quests, type 'questlist'.  Each quest listed has an index number.  To see the starting clues on where you might begin to unlock its secrets, type 'questlist #' (where # is the index # shown). Each quest is graded on three scales, and the quest point reward is often determined by how high they rate upon them.  All quests are optional except for one\; Newbie Academy.  Why don't you see if you can find it on the list and see what it entails? Lastly, whether or not you choose to partake in quests, you must understand the rules that govern them.  Type 'help quests' before you continue on. }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
