R {47645}{0}{}{Newbie Lore:Page 17 (leave,page16)}{ }{                     	Chapter 7: Character Conduct While we try to provide visitors and players alike an atmosphere of relaxation and enjoyment, we do have stipulations on various gaming aesthetics and conduct of our players.  We only ask that you read and abide by them.  They are only in place to provide the best possible environment for players of every caliber and fairness across the board.  The following items describe help files you should familiarize yourself with. 1. Second characters are allowed here on Three Kingdoms, but only    if you qualify for them.  Please read 'help seconds'. 2. Keeping a valid email is imperative.  Type 'help email' to show    you how you can set and change your email.  If it is in our    'invalid' listings, please type 'help register'.  We will be    willing to work with you. 3. Finally, general rules regarding game play can be seen by typing    'help rules'. We hope you will enjoy your stay with us.  Please also read the help files on the 'bug', 'qbug', 'idea' and 'typo' commands.  These utility commands will help us provide the best quality gaming experience that we can.  We look forward to your input.  Now, go enjoy yourself! }{Newbieland}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
