R {47685}{0}{}{A mech graveyard (leave,sw,nw)}{ }{      Before you lies a mountain made of the shattered bodies of hundreds of mechs.  The parts from all the mechs litter the ground in every direction.  Through some of the cockpits you can vaguely make out the rotting forms of the pilots of these massive technological monoliths.  You begin to ponder about what could have reduced such a great army to this pile of scrap. }{Codename: Kodiak}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
