R {47864}{0}{<248>}{Level advancement room (n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{           		Adventurers Advancement Room Here is where brave adventurers come to advance their stats and levels.  You may also learn about the various quests available to you here and 3 Kingdoms, and other various information which may be useful to you in your adventuring. A small old man, acting as scribe, sits at a desk at the far end of the room, recording all events of consequence. There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short] }{Town of Woonsocket}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
