R {47878}{0}{}{In front of a throne (ne,s,nw)}{ }{     Entering the room, your main focus is drawn to the throne.  The throne rests high above the floor with steps leading to the zenith.  A large painting hangs on the wall behind it while two small gargoyle statues flank the sides.  There are archways behind the the throne to the left and right that lead elsewhere. }{Town of Woonsocket}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
