R {47879}{0}{}{Royal Sitting Room (w,sw)}{ }{     You stand inside the royal sitting room.  This room is reserved for only the most respected guests of the King.  Judging by the layers of dust, this room has not been used in quite some time.  A large red velvet couch anchors the room.  A oval table adorned with an empty vase sits between the couch and additional sitting chairs. }{Town of Woonsocket}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
