R {48262}{0}{}{A wide asphalt road. (return,n)}{ }{    You suddenly find yourself on a wide asphalt road.  To the north appears to be a lot of commotion.  It is difficult to tell what it might be all about from this distance.  Perhaps you should go and take a closer look. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
