R {48264}{0}{}{A wide asphalt road. (n,s)}{ }{    As you continue up the road you can see a bunch of trucks gathered in a very small area.  Many of them have what look to be satellite dishes mounted on top of them.  The din grows in volume as you draw closer. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
