R {48265}{0}{}{Studio A (s,n)}{ }{      You have come to a VERY large building. A sign on it proclaims: 'Studio A'.  This is apparently the main TV recording and broadcast studio, and they seem to be gearing up for some major event.  There are TV trucks and technicians all over the place.  To the north is the entrance to the building where you can see several limousines sitting. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {48264}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48266}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {48266}{0}{}{Studio Entrance (n,s)}{ }{      This is the entrance to Studio A.  There are several limousines and numerous overdressed celebrities wandering around here mingling. After all, what else do celebrities do?  There is a poster on the wall proclaiming: 'MTV MUSIC FESTIVAL!' Guess you know what all the commotion is about.  The door men appear to be too busy drooling over Cher.  Perhaps you could sneak in. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {48265}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {48267}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {48267}{0}{}{Studio Lobby (s,w)}{ }{   This is the main lobby of Studio A.  You can hear the commotion of the show that is about to begin.  People are moving through the door to the west. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
