R {48268}{0}{}{Main studio (e,w,n)}{ }{    This is the rear-eastern corner of the hall.  As you look around, you can see people shuffling about trying to find their seats.  A brightly lit stage has been set up at the front of the chamber and a podium set upon it.  The camera crews are making ready to the west. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
