R {48269}{0}{}{Main studio (e,w,n)}{ }{   You are at the rear-center of the hall.  All around you are tons of high-tech camera equipment and wire.  Careful you don't trip because our insurance policy hasn't come through yet. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
