R {48273}{0}{}{Stage Platform (nw,d)}{ }{       You are standing on the main stage platform.  As you look out toward the back of the room you can see the audience slowly beginning to  filter in.  The MC must have quite a view of the crowd from up here! Of course this would also be right in the firing line if someone decided to start throwing rotten tomatoes.  You can see a faint light coming from behind the curtain to the northwest.  Maybe you should check it out. }{MTV Studios}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
