R {48334}{0}{}{A Small Dusty Keep (s)}{ }{       This was once the Chief Armsman's office\; as is evidenced by  large desk in the center of the room. Empty racks that probably once held weapons and armour cover the walls, along with a banner that presumably once belonged to the keep's Leige Lord. Dust, as elsewhere in the castle, covers everything thickly. This, along with the foul stench of the air, tells you that no one  has entered this room in a long time. }{Undead Keep (Newbie)}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
