R {48336}{0}{}{Outside a Cathedral (enter,hole)}{ }{      You stand in a rubble-strewn alley, framed on both sides by the brickwork exteriors of the buildings to the east and west. Before you is the entrance to a cathedral, now in an obvious state of disrepair. One bell tower has collapsed into a pile of rubble which nearly blocks the alleyway, and the other tower leans precariously against the buttresses supporting it. }{Newbie Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
