R {48337}{0}{}{Vestibule (leave,n)}{ }{     You stand inside the entrance vestibule of a ruined cathedral. Light rain falls through gaping holes in the ceiling, while sodden frescoes and plaster filter the water into pastel streaks of paint, running to the floor like bloodstains. Rubble and trash cover the ground, making it hard to maneuver. To the north, the cathedral continues. }{Newbie Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
