R {48341}{0}{}{Cathedral (s,n)}{ }{      The cathedral is in slightly better condition here.  The roof is complete, if decaying, and it is relatively dry. Some attempt has been made to clear the smashed pews into a barricade of sorts. In between the barricades, fires have been lit inside metal barrels, providing warmth and light to the surrounding area. It looks like someone lives in this part of the church. }{Newbie Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
