R {48342}{0}{}{A Ruined Cathedral (e,w,s,n)}{ }{     You stand near the altar of the cathedral. Above you hangs the remnant of a statue of the crucified Christ, now smashed and broken. The tabernacle has been removed from where it usually stands, and in its place is a circle marked in spray paint. There are alcoves to the east and west, and you can hear chanting to the north. }{Newbie Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
