R {48343}{0}{}{Alcove (w)}{ }{    You are inside an alcove off the main axis of the cathedral. This part of the ceiling has come crashing down upon the floor, obliterating the flagstones under tons of rubble. There is only one exit: back the way you came. }{Newbie Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {48342}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {48344}{0}{}{Alcove (e)}{ }{     You are inside an alcove off the main axis of the cathedral. Piles of rubbish are stacked against the far wall, exuding a gruesome stench. A small table has been set on a block of sandstone, and several makeshift stools are arranged around it. To the east, you can hear the sound of chanting. }{Newbie Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {48342}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {48345}{0}{}{A Welded Throne (s)}{ }{         You stand at the northernmost part of the church. Before you is a great circular hole where once a massive lead-light hung. In its place stands a gigantic throne constructed from sheet metal, structural beams and car parts. The backrest is made from an AV-4 jet turbine, and rises into the air like a rust-ridden pillar, covered with spraypainted slogans. All around stand benches and makeshift seating, arranged in a circle much like a post-apocalyptic auditorium. There is the smell of blood in the air, and the atmosphere is charged with fear and rage. }{Newbie Cathedral}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
