R {48418}{0}{}{The top of a tower (d)}{ }{    You reach the top of the stairs at last. A cold wind blows from the north and your eyes start to water because of it. Your position at the top of the tower gives you an excellent view of the surrounding area. Try looking in a particular direction to see what you can see. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
