R {48419}{0}{}{Elven Headquarters (s)}{ }{    This appears to have been a common house, with one notable exception.  All the furniture, even the stove, is made out of some sort of wood.  Now the house has been converted into a command centre with maps on the walls,  and a large table full of papers in the centre of the room. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
