R {48420}{0}{}{Elven town (n,w)}{ }{      The residential area you are now in appears to end here, and the well maintained foliage above your head seems to become a bit more wild, and less maintained.  There are fewer elves here in this part of the village, but those you see appear to be in a hurry. To the north you can see a path between the trees, and to the west is the centre of the town. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
