R {48425}{0}{}{Supply Room (e,s,w)}{ }{   The branches overhead spread out to form a large room filled with elven soldiers of every type.  Strewn about the room are packs and provisions, weapons and armour. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
