R {48427}{0}{}{Elven hospital (e)}{ }{       This is clearly a hospital, and judging by the haggard look of the staff, and the number of wounded, it would appear that this town is having trouble of some sort, and lots of it.  There  are casualties everywhere, lying on benches, sitting in chairs, and even strewn about the ground.  The healers seem to be extremely busy dealing with the wounded and dead, as they have large dark circles under their eyes. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
