R {48430}{0}{}{A wide open field (s)}{ }{     The ground here is soaked with water. Every step you take makes a squishing noise. Hope you don't have to sneak up on anything. There are short, thorny bushes all along the banks of the river that flows west of here. You catch a glimpse, out of the corner of your eye, of movement in the bushes. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
