R {48431}{0}{}{A wide open field (n,s)}{ }{    The smell of death pervades the area. You can smell evil near. You can see patches of dead plant life as well. The wind is totally calm and the river to the west is quietly flowing northward. The plants that are alive look sick and droopy. A chill runs down your spine. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
