R {48432}{0}{}{A wide open field (n)}{ }{   You have to climb a slight hill to get here but once at the top you realize what caused all of the death and decay to the north. Corpses line the river bank here. The grass is dead or dying everywhere you look. }{Lothlarian}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
