R {48433}{0}{}{A dark blue vault (s)}{ }{   The walls of this vault are dark, dark blue.  Whether of stone or of metal, it is difficult to tell.  In the south wall there is a rectangular opening, framed by a silvery molding. }{Newbie Hell}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
