R {48434}{0}{}{Stetstar Station (out)}{ }{      You're in an airlock in a gleaming metal space station.  Spacesuits are secured to the aluminum wall with fasteners.  The outer airlock door leads out of the station.  It might lead out into space, or back to the land from whence you came.  Panels on the walls display a dizzying array of blinking lights and incomprehensible controls.  The door into the station is closed, with no obvious way to open it. }{Stetstar Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
