R {48440}{0}{}{Stetstar Station (aft,port)}{ }{      At a bend in the corridor sits a disabled service robot.  Its plaintive beeping reverberates faintly down the hallways of the space station.  An electrical switchbox in front of the robot is opened, revealing a tangle of wires, circuit breakers, transistor arrays, and chips.  Down the aft hallway, an open doorway leads to some other room. }{Stetstar Station}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
