R {48456}{0}{}{Mansion Grounds (ne,e,w,nw,n)}{ }{      The lawns must be kept up by an ethereal groundsman\; because even though you can't see anyone living around, the lawns are neatly groomed.  Even the edges around the antique sundial are immaculately well-kept.  An ominous black iron fence stretches across the south end of the yard.  The entrance to the mansion has to be around here somewhere, that is, if you can find it before something finds you. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
