R {48467}{0}{}{Stairway (e,u)}{ }{      The old stairway has definitely seen better days.  Even thinking about taking a step makes the old wood creak.  Spider webs are strewn up and down the railing.  Unfortunately, this appears to be the only way to move onward through the mansion.  You're not sure when the last time someone used these stairs was, but you're sure it will not be the safest of experiences. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
