R {48468}{0}{}{Hallway (e,d,nw)}{ }{     Sparing no expense, someone has decorated this hallway for some grand celebration\; unfortunately, the decorations have long since rotted and crumble at the slightest touch.  A suit of armour stands vigil over another long hallway to the east.  Warm air billows in from the northwest. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
