R {48469}{0}{}{Endless Hall (w)}{ }{     You cannot figure out where this hallway ends.  The highly polished wood paneling seems to reflect off itself, making it look like a never ending hallway of candles.  Somehow you know that if you were to turn west you would be able to make it out of here, but there seems to be more to this room that you can put your finger on. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
