R {48470}{0}{}{Greenhouse (w,se)}{ }{     The humidity in this room is almost suffocating.  Once beautiful poinsettias have now begun to wilt from the excess moisture.  A soft gnawing can be heard in the background, although it's almost impossible to place where it's coming from.  A long pine box lies amongst the flowers trying to escape detection. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
