R {48472}{0}{}{Abrupt Corner (w,s)}{ }{     The house reaches an abrupt corner here, connecting the short dim hallway to your south with a much darker room to the west.  The room is unnervingly featureless, with only a tall grandfather clock to boast. Other than that, plain wooden walls are all the room has to offer. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
