R {48473}{0}{}{Seance Room (e,ne)}{ }{        The room is devoid of surrounding light, with only candles lit in the center of the room setting the tone for provided vision. Centered in the circle of candles is a crystal ball, with the head of a woman quite intent on keeping her focus on her chanting. Behind her, a pentagram is carved into the wall. Surrounding the ceiling, floating on their own, are several cards with unusual characters making up their faces. They bob in the air, and glow with a mysterious color making them visible in the dim light. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
