R {48478}{0}{}{Southern Attic (nw,stairs)}{ }{       It's a little dusty up here, people with asthma, smoking problems, chronic bronchitis or heart problems would be best to move on.  Not to mention that the damp moldy air probably just encroaches on these problems.  Most other people shouldn't have a problem surviving in this room.  Of course, the ceiling doesn't look as strong as it used to and is likely to collapse.  Hopefully, the walls are stronger than they look and will be able to hold the ceiling up a bit longer. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
