R {48481}{0}{}{Roof (slide,d)}{ }{      You can barely keep your balance up here, the strong winds push you over the edge of the roof towards the open graveyard directly north of you.  You reach out for the lightning rod and are able to maintain your balance for a moment.  You begin to slide again and are grateful that one of the tree's fingers was there to push you back to safety.  Your only chance is to slide off the roof and hope for the best. }{Browning Estate}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
