R {48490}{0}{}{Village of New Pinnacle (n)}{ }{      This cheery wood domicile seems to be the only structure in the village left completely undamaged by the invading orcs.  An iron furnace takes up the center of the room.  Rope strung from its chimney pipe to the walls holds up cloth partitions dividing the house into crude rooms.  Some cots have been set up in the partitioned parts of the house.  A scorched oak desk sits near the door. }{New Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
