R {48491}{0}{}{Village of New Pinnacle (s)}{ }{        The village of New Pinnacle is being rebuilt here, rising phoenix-like from its own ashes via the strong wills and strong backs of its inhabitants.  No bodies, blood, or debris litter the road.  The burnt-out hulks of cottages have been cleared, and two new houses stand nearby.  One looks livable.  The other still lacks doors and part of its roof.  All around, you spot villagers teaming up to plant crops, gather construction materials, or haul water.  The percussive bang of a hammer echoes off a large pile of stones beside you. }{New Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
