R {48494}{0}{}{In a dusty study (n)}{ }{         You're in a hidden study. Dust covers most of the walls and cobwebs hang down from the ceiling. There is a large desk pushed up against the southern wall with strange vials and flasks on it. A half broken chair is resting in one of the corners. Over the floor, and all the furniture, is a massive amount of papers. Even though most of the room's interior is covered with dust, there is not a single speck on the desk or the vials. It's as if someone was working on something here quite recently.  Krat     Reboot: 19:59 [00:00:01]  Controller: patrol  }{The City of Westersea}{westersea_alchemy}{}{}{1.000}{1}
