R {48495}{0}{}{Temple of Qiao Hou (w)}{ }{         The inner sanctum of the temple is a small stone chamber, perhaps three meters square.  In the center of the room, a peculiar stone sculpture of sorts rises from the floor.  It doesn't seem to depict anything in particular\; its abstract shapes jumble together to form a mass of geometric solids.  The dusty stone floor has been fabricated into concentric rings surrounding the central sculpture.  The whole room is eerie, silent, motionless.  Judging by the dust covering everything, nobody has disturbed this chamber for centuries. }{Temple of Qiao Hou}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {47491}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {48496}{0}{}{Inside the Symbaern crypt (out,d)}{ }{      Looted and sacked by the army of darkness that destroyed this fair city, the interior of this tomb stands silent and empty, slowly filling with the odor of rot and mildew from the tomb's decaying walls. Drawing you towards them is the top of a flight of stone steps that lead down into the actual crypt. For some they could be a stairway to riches, for others less careful, they will surely be a stairway to hell. }{Symbearn Crypt}{symbearn_crypt}{}{}{1.000}{1}
