R {48576}{0}{}{Larissa's Kitchen (s)}{ }{          Entering the kitchen of Larissa's house, your senses are immediately assaulted by the bright green linoleum floor.  The floor is so bright, the room barely needs any other form of lighting.  Although there are fluorescent lights overhead.  A dual sink sits in the middle of the kitchen counter.  In the middle of the room is a kitchen table with a couple of chairs.  A pantry, refrigerator, and stove complete the kitchen's major items, just like you would expect from any standard kitchen.  The kitchen sink sits just below a window that overlooks the backyard.  The counter runs across the entire back of the kitchen, ending at a backdoor in the corner. }{Larissa's Funhouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {48574}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {48577}{0}{}{Larissa's closet (out)}{ }{        A closet.  Like any other, but then again, maybe like no other.  A rod for hanging items sits just under a top shelf upon which sit many boxes.  A few coats and a sweater hang here, ready to keep someone warm. Is it cold?  Not really?  Then again, that's a matter of opinion, and where one might be cold, another may not be.  Well, just in case, there are coats here.  A vacuum cleaner sits in the corner of the closet, ready to clean up the world.  Who knows what skeletons can exist in the closet of this funny house. }{Larissa's Funhouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
