R {48623}{0}{<238>}{<*<*A weedy gravel path*>*> (tower,gate)}{<238>. .<088>}{         The path moves on in front of you, a ghastly mix of white stones, pink marble, and vibrant green weeds.  The colors clash is a discordant harmony of nature overtaking the meddling of man.  The path curves around decrepit planters and raggedy looking bushes before it eventually comes to the front of a tower.  On either side of the path lies a garden that looks more like exhumed graves and moist rotting earth.  The sickly sweet smell of rotting flesh occasionally assaults your senses but dissipates as quickly as it hits you. The gate which you entered from looms behind you. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
