R {48624}{0}{<278>}{<*<*Tower Foyer*>*> (leave,stairs)}{<278>.@.<088>}{       This room has been completely stripped of its original interior. It is now totally devoid of any furnishings, though the floor is still highly polished marble parquet.  Many doorways line the hall but as you check them they're all locked and barricaded from the other side.  You'll have to find another way in.  The only other noticeable feature left is an iron spiral staircase that juts up into the ceiling.  The stench of decay and chemicals here is overpowering. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
