R {48627}{0}{}{<*<*Necromancer's Lair*>*> (stairs)}{ }{         Black velvet curtains block out all outside light and the sickly smell from downstairs is totally absent.  A cool breeze comes from nowhere and gently plays with your hair.  The only piece of furniture in the room is a large four post bed, with an attached side-table.  There are several vases and urns around the room\; each is filled with brilliantly colored roses.  This room seems quite different from the rest of this estate.  In the center of the room is a pedestal that looks just big enough to hold a book.  Around the stand is a pentagram carved into the floor.  Some kind of demonic magic must go on in here. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
