R {49226}{0}{<238>}{Trail in the darkness. (s,n)}{<238>. .<088>}{     You are walking along a pitch black trail. You do not know where you are, or what surrounds you. You look to the north and see the graveyard far away. Looking to the south, you can see some kind of light shining. It is almost as if you are in a tunnel but you are not sure. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {7370}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49227}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49227}{0}{<228>}{A clearing in the dark. (n)}{<228>. ^<088>}{     Dazzled, you stumble out into a wide open clearing. Bright light shines from all around and it makes your eyes water. You shield your eyes and glance swiftly about the area. The only thing you can make out is a chest of some kind in the back. The path ends here and the only way to go now would be to turn back the way you came. }{Elven Graveyard}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49226}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49228}{0}{}{A cavern under an old well (nw,u)}{ }{       You've reached something that resembles an old cave. It is very dark and the only light that is visible to you is vague rays of light coming from the old well in the ceiling. Despite the age of the well, there is still about one foot of water here and your clothes are starting to get soaked. Peering around, you notice that the northwestern part of the cave is above the murky water and you can see shapes resembling furniture. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {4740}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49229}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49229}{0}{}{Northwestern part of an old Cavern (se)}{ }{       You are standing in the northwestern part of an old cavern. The ground is relatively dry and partly covered by a thin layer of  dust. Old furniture is standing against the northwestern wall. As you walk into this dark corner, you stumble over a small chest on the floor. You can see a old hatch in the ceiling and you might be able to leave through it (if you can get it open.) }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49228}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49230}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49230}{0}{<238>}{An abandoned house (d)}{<238>"""<088>}{       You climb your way up from the hatch in the floor and look around. Books and shelves cover the whole room and you realize that this house has to be some kind of old library. Two windows are in the southern wall but you can see no way out from this room except the hatch from which you came. Shelves with books cover all the other walls, but it looks like time has done its work and many of them are rotten and unreadable. }{Forest Trail}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49229}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49231}{0}{<138>}{Elegant Marble Temple (leave)}{<138>[ ]<088>}{          The interior walls, floor and ceiling of this ancient temple are made of elegant white marble.  Giant pillars of granite are used to support the immense weight of the roof above.  A very decayed red carpet is laid out across the marble floor.  It's sprawled across the masterfully chiseled marble staircase, up to the crystal altar and back towards the rusted iron double-doors.  Giant musty cobwebs hang from the ceiling's rafters. Criss-crossed and dangling, they tie the pillars together in a web of tangled beauty.  A mound of dirt is wedged in between the iron doors, but mysteriously it's unable to pass beyond a few inches of the temple's interior walls. }{Enchanted Spring}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46547}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46547}{leave}{leave}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {46547}{s}{leave}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49232}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {49233}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (n,s)}{ }{     This seems to be a foyer to a dark and ancient tower.  Something about the tower is unwelcoming.  You feel somewhat like a rat crawling into a snake's cage.  A narrow corridor leads north, while a set of great brass doors lead back out to an infernal landscape.  From here you can see the bridge outside in some detail. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {46560}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49234}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49234}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (n,s)}{ }{     This narrow corridor is lined with murder holes in the ceiling.  They run the entire length of the corridor, so that there's no place you can stand without exposing yourself to potential attacks from above.  The corridor is open at its north and south ends.  Other than some odd burn marks on the floor, it's empty. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49233}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49235}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49235}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (u,s)}{ }{     The corridor empties out into a smallish chamber.  A stone staircase against one wall leads upward.  Against the other walls are propped practice dummies made of cloth and straw.  Most of them have been slashed to bits.  Straw and dismembered parts litter the floor.  Through the windows, you see fire spurt and dance outside. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49234}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49236}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49236}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (d,s)}{ }{      A long corridor leads south from here, running deeper into the tower.  A straight stone staircase near the north wall drops down into the floor, offering egress to a lower level.  The walls are lined with narrow windows through which you see rocky cliffs blazing away.  It's stiflingly hot in here, making sweat roll off your face and splatter onto the dark cobblestones under your feet. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49235}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49237}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49237}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (n,w,e,s)}{ }{      This junction of corridors is empty except for murder holes lining the floor, and two metal barrels against one wall.  The holes are about three inches wide, so that you can walk across the floor without worrying too much about turning your ankle in one.  Firelight filters in through windows at the ends of the four corridors.  It's fairly dim at the junction. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49236}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49238}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49239}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49240}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49238}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (e)}{ }{     The cobblestones are cracked and shattered in this small chamber. There are large gouges in the walls. Manacles and leg irons line the walls, but most of them are snapped. Sundered links of iron chains lie wedged between the cobblestones. Something very large was once kept here... kept unsuccessfully. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49237}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49239}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (w)}{ }{      The sharp smell of incense wafts down the corridor.  At its terminus, four smouldering brass braziers are arranged around a glowing red pentagram inscribed in the black cobblestone floor.  Outside, the flames jump and roar, sending an orange glow and waves of heat through the windows.  Smoke clouds the air.  The dark walls are spattered with blood. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49237}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49240}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (u,n)}{ }{     A stone staircase here leads up further into the tower.  Orange light filtering through the narrow windows casts dancing shadows over the crumbling steps.  The floor is very uneven here, forcing you to walk carefully to avoid tripping.  You wipe your brow to keep sweat from rolling into your eyes. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49237}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49241}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49241}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (d,n)}{ }{     A crumbling staircase leads down to a lower level of the black tower.  Twin flames burn, unsupported and seemingly without a source, on either side of a corridor heading north into the tower.  Heat pours from them, making it even more unbearably hot.  Odd grunts and calls echo in through the windows. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49240}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49242}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49242}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (n,w,e,s)}{ }{      A pile of rotting body parts oozes blood across the black floor in the center of this noisome chamber.  Most of the dismembered parts look bestial or demonic, but a few distinctly human heads stare glassy-eyed from the gruesome pyramid.  A cloud of flies blankets the pile, feasting.  Maggots crunch under your feet.  Grunting echoes down the nearby corridors. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49241}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49243}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49244}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49245}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49243}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (u,s)}{ }{     Another narrow stone staircase climbs upward here, flanked by slitlike windows through which you can see the hellish cliffs outside and hear the shrill cries of some unthinkable creatures outside the tower.  Rubble covers the floor at the base of the stairs.  Waves of heat roll down the staircase, making it hard to breathe. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49242}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49246}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49244}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (e)}{ }{     Chains hang from the stone lintels of the corridor here.  Upon the chains are sharp hooks, from which hang the corpses of gray-skinned demons.  Another demon corpse is impaled upon a spear thrust into the stone wall.  Blood forms a dry crimson river along the cobblestone floor and streaks the walls.  The bloated corpses stink of decay. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49242}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49245}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (w)}{ }{      From the narrow windows of this chamber, you can see fire roaring against the cliffs that surround the black tower.  It's impossible to tell from here how high up you are.  Heat gusts in through the windows, making you want to shield your eyes and mouth to keep them from being burned.  It's as if the whole tower were an oven, and you are being baked. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49242}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49246}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (d,s)}{ }{      The staircase opens up into a wider, taller chamber than on lower floors of the black tower.  Waves of heat blast you from the south, even roaring out the windows to the hellish outside.  The cobblestones rumble and quake as something nearby shakes them violently.  You feel as though you're nearing a source of great evil.  A great crack runs through the stone beams of the ceiling. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49243}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49247}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49247}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (e,n)}{ }{       Flames roar and crackle over the blasted stone floor of this chamber.  Sparks and soot dance up to the ceiling on blasts of hot air that roll away down the corridor to the north and through an archway to the east.  The archway leads out onto a balcony that overlooks the hellish landscape surrounding the black tower.  You can't stand in one place for long, as the cobblestones under your feet are so hot that they burn you through your shoes. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49246}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49248}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49248}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (sw,w)}{ }{       You're on a balcony on the outside of a twisted black tower in the center of a hellish pit of fire.  Far below you, you see a thin stone bridge leading out over the flaming chasm.  Looking up, you see that there are a few more stories of the tower still overhead.  An archway to the west leads back into the tower.  Waves of hot air blast out from the archway.  A narrow ledge climbs along the outside of the tower to the southwest. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49247}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49249}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49249}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (nw,ne)}{ }{        Shimmying along a narrow ledge high along the outside of the twisted black tower, you can see a hellish landscape of the flaming chasm and cliffs of flame spread out below you.  It would be quite a vista if it weren't so strikingly evil and immediately dangerous to your safety.  One slip here and you'd have a long fall down to the waiting flames.  Far below you, you can make out the bridge that brought you to this tower.  The sweltering heat causes sweat to roll into your eyes and collect on your palms, making you doubly nervous about falling. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49248}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49250}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49250}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (se,u)}{ }{     The narrow ledge climbs to another balcony on the west side of the black tower.  You're relieved to be off the perilous climb and find a wide solid floor underfoot.  The cliffs of the pit stretch out around the tower.  At their base is a chasm of dancing flames.  A stone staircase climbs from the balcony straight into the tower. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49249}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49251}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49251}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (u,d)}{ }{       You're on a cramped landing on a long stone staircase.  A straight staircase descends steeply to the west back out onto a balcony.  Climbing upward from the landing is a spiral staircase.  Its crumbling stone steps are plain and free of dust.  A nearly palpable sense of dread grips you as you place one foot on the first stair upward.  There's something wholly and soul-suckingly evil at the top of the staircase.  You can feel it with every ounce of your mortal being. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49250}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49252}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49252}{0}{}{Tower of the Infernal Prince (d)}{ }{       The chamber atop the black tower is ringed with windows looking out on a hellish landscape of fire.  The chamber is wide, circular, and mostly empty.  A single dead incubus lies, head severed from its body, on the cobblestone floor.  Near the still corpse is another magic flame, burning in midair above the dark floor.  An oppressive presence of evil fills the room - the taint of the residence of a being of extreme evil. }{Mystic Seal - Tower of Infernal Prince}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49251}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49253}{0}{<148>}{A Shadowy Tunnel}{<118>)<138>)<148>)<088>}{}{Mystic Seal}{seal_caldera_of_antken}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31783}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49254}{touch matrix}{touch matrix}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49254}{0}{}{Path along a hellpit (nexus,nw)}{ }{          Flames periodically burst out of the gaping pit set into the soot-covered ground.  Noxious green fumes waft from it, along with the strong stench of sulfur.  Twisting and jutting at odd angles, the passage gives the impression of being thoughtlessly burrowed.  It is almost intolerably hot - so hot that the searing heat blisters bare flesh in a matter of moments.  The environment barely seems habitable, and the air is so compressed that walking through it is like wading through liquid.  Charred bone and chunks of grey rock lay stewn about, precariously littering the path.  A nexus of swirling orange light hovers in midair here, unaffected by the pyrotechnics of the lava pit. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{caldera_of_the_antken}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49255}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49253}{nexus}{nexus}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49255}{0}{}{Path along a hellpit (d,se)}{ }{       Putrid green fumes drift through the passage and form a sort of pea-soup mist.  Sulfurous flames burst into life through gaps in the walls and floor, causing the heat to hold steady at a temperature easily high enough to boil water.  The passageway narrows and plunges downward into the ground.  With visibility so limited by the mist, sight can determine little more about the details of this most inhospitable area. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49254}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49256}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49256}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (se,u)}{ }{       This expanse is little more than a twisting passage, burrowed through a brittle igneous rock.  Searing heat furls the open space, pressing in upon you so noticeably that it only barely falls short of constriction.  Soot coats the ground in thick layers and drifts chokingly through the air.  The stench of sulfur crushes other scents. Debris and rubble litter the path, mostly gray rock, with a bit of charred bone added as if for contrasting color. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49255}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49257}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49257}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (e,nw)}{ }{      The passageway ducks, twists, and curves around mountainous boulders of basalt, plunging deeper into the ground.  It's sizzlingly hot here. Sweat pours from your torso in rivulets to splat and drip on the soot-covered ground.  A sulfurous green haze floats in the thick air.  You can feel the skin of your face begin to blister, although you're not sure if it's from the heat or the green fumes. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49256}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49258}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49258}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (ne,w)}{ }{      It seems to grow hotter as you descend through the burrowed passageway.  The outlines of boulders and walls quiver through the hazy air.  Soot and sulfurous green fumes float through the air, forcing you to cover your mouth with your shirt sleeve to breathe without collapsing in a coughing fit.  Your skin burns even underneath a thick sheen of sweat. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49257}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49259}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49259}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (n,sw)}{ }{     Slime and ichor coat the ground here as the passageway widens.  There aren't quite so many boulders here to awkwardly duck around, but it's not easy going by any means.  The passageway slopes downward to the north, vanishing into the green haze.  The air stinks of brimstone.  Bones and molted skin litter one side of the passageway. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49258}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49260}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49260}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (nw,s)}{ }{       The passageway necks down considerably here as a nearly impassable pile of boulders blocks most of its diameter.  To the northwest, the tunnel twists downward, plunging deeper into the ground.  To the south, it climbs back toward the surface.  It seems to grow hotter the deeper you travel.  Your mouth is parched from loss of liquid, and running your dry tongue over your lips doesn't make them feel any better. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49259}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49261}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49261}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (w,se,e)}{ }{     The tunnel finally levels out here and passes west into a glowing orange chamber.  Blasts of heat waft from the opening, blistering your skin and singing your eyebrows.  Bones and broken bits of rock litter the ground, and everything is covered with a thick layer of black soot.  A horrible low rumble vibrates the walls and ground. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49260}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49262}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49263}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49262}{0}{}{A boiling caldera (e)}{ }{        A lake of magma fills most of the surface of this gigantic chamber.  The rock ceiling is lost amid smoke, green haze, and blasts of flame, high overhead.  Large rocks and gobbets of lava rain from above as the volcanic lake belches and spits its boiling contents into the noxious air.  It's searingly, unbearably hot\; you're in agony from the blasts of heat swirling about this caldera.  The ground rumbles and shakes with each eruption, nearly causing you to lose your footing and stumble into the simmering lake. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49261}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49263}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (ne,w,se)}{ }{       Twisting and turning at distorted angles, the passage takes many sharp turns as it continues both west and northeast.  The noxious haze coating the air has an acidic quality to it, and the nasty smell connected to it is enough to make nearly anyone gag.  Glistening patches of slime cover the ground in spots, but in most cases avoids the rocks piled across the tunnel's length.  It is extraordinarily hot, and grows even worse toward the west. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49261}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49264}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49265}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49264}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (e,sw)}{ }{       Charred bone and molted skin litter the ground, and more often than not lay covered in glistening puddles of slime.  A green haze drifts throughout the passage, befouling it with a truly disgusting smell.  Rubble is piled across the length of this place, and although it impedes movement at times, it otherwise seems neatly stacked out of the way.  The temperature is staggeringly high, and grows all the worse toward the southwest. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49263}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49266}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49265}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (e,nw)}{ }{      Dripping along the distorted rubble that lines the walls, a pool of bubbling slime congeals into the center of this passage.  Incredibly intense heat blasts forth from both of the connecting passages\; it makes this space feel akin to being stuck between two roaring furnaces.  A green haze floats through the superheated air\; its acidic nature manages to sizzle even the specks of soot that float into it. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49263}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49269}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49266}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (ne,w)}{ }{      Hellish heat furls the hazy air of this expansive tunnel.  It billows out from the northeast, and grows even hotter than the searing temperature located along the west.  The slime that trails the tunnel comes to an end here, but the piled rubble continues undeterred.  Bits of bone and what looks to be pieces of exoskeletons litter the ground. Mixed in among them are bits of molted skin. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49264}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49267}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49267}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (n,sw)}{ }{       An eerie red glow creeps from the northern expanse.  It filters through the green fumes, but unfortunately does nothing to diminish the haze's noxious smell.  Rubble spans the length of this passage.  Its contents are mostly igneous rock, but charred bone, molted skin, and bits of exoskeleton are scattered about as well.  The temperature increases steadily along the north, and does not seem to be far from the point where combustible materials will ignite. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49266}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49268}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49268}{0}{}{A boiling caldera (s)}{ }{        A gigantic pool of magma collects along much of the chamber.  Its inception appears to be due to the steady flow of magma pouring out of a crater in the eastern wall.  The rock ceiling is lost amid smoke, green haze, and the blur of searing heat.  Piles of rubble are scattered around the room, creating levees against the sluggish lava's flow.  It is unbearably hot, and no matter your level of defense, incredibly dangerous here.  The eastern passage is impassable due to the heat and solid flows of lava. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49267}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49269}{0}{}{A soot-filled expanse (w)}{ }{        Rubble fills this passage so completely that it is a challenge to navigate its confines unimpeded.  Bones lay scattered along the entire length of the cleared space, cracked and burnt.  Not a scrap of tissue is detectable on their bleached surfaces.  The superheated air feels intolerably warm, and even that element of the environment hardly compares to the acidic green mist that crisps everything it contacts.  Hostile emotions are bound to this place, and their intensity boils over whenever the ground rumbles and shakes. }{Mystic Seal - Caldera of the Antken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49265}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49270}{0}{<108>}{A Shadowy Tunnel (w)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{      A giant matrix of glowing blue crystals covers the wall of this cramped dead end passage.  To the west, a wall of shadow lurks.  Behind it is the rest of the labyrinth.  The red light flaring from the runes of warding glints off the blue crystals, but fails to penetrate through the wall of shadow.  Your mind buzzes with the presence of arcane power here. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31769}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49271}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {49272}{0}{<108>}{Hidden alcove (e)}{<108>[ ]<088>}{      A gigantic matrix of blue crystals covers the wall of the corridor here.  The crystals are fit together intricately, like an oversized jigsaw puzzle.  A cool blue glow pulses weakly from the matrix, competing with the pulses of red light from the warding runes covering the walls.  Shadow creeps in upon the matrix.  You can almost feel its anger at the impinging light. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31805}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49273}{0}{}{Forgotten Shrine (n)}{ }{      This tall, narrow space houses a four-meter stone statue of a human.  The statue's features have crumbled with age, but you can still make out most of its decidedly male face.  Its jaw is square and set suggesting righteous determination.  One hand holds what probably used to be a sword\; the other points out into the hallway.  A columned hallway leads away to the north. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31825}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49274}{0}{<248>}{Hidden Alcove (out)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{    You've found refuge in a small alcove in the rock wall above the raging stream.  Ice careens down the stream, blowing itself into smithereens against the rock walls.  You can relax for a bit here in your little hidden perch. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
