R {49275}{0}{<248>}{Hidden Alcove (out)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{    You're perched in a small alcove set into the rock wall of a mysterious cavern.  Just below you, a raging stream careens past.  Chunks of ice bob through the current, smashing into the rock walls.  It's good to be up out of the chilly water and tiring current. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
