R {49297}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (e)}{<238>. ^<088>}{     In amongst the heavy destruction, ex-buildings that have been hammered to fragments wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is heartening to see that small trees have taken root.  Strolling quietly through the piles of rubble, you pause to examine yet another piece of rubble. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
