R {49298}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (s,w)}{<238>, `<088>}{      Stepping quietly through the rubble you listen for signs of life and hardly surprising, you detect none at all.  Any living thing with any common sense avoids this place.  In the heaped rubble, shattered and torn remnants of buildings hide both treasures beyond the imagination and unimaginable death.  It is deadly quiet.  Small weeds poking through the waste rock and wood. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49297}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {49299}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49299}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (n)}{<238>, `<088>}{       In amongst the heavy destruction, ex-buildings that have been hammered to fragments wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is difficult to see your footing, as small creeping vines and grasses run over the waste rocks and timbers.  The rubble is a result of explosions and wild magic used when the city was sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago.  Only the fool-hardy explore here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49298}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {31406}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49300}{0}{<228>}{Mantis Swamp (n,e,s)}{<228>; ;<088>}{      The muck is thick and stagnant. Your feet are sucked deeper into the bog with every step, making the fear of getting sucked underneath it more and more of a reality. Insects hover over the water in dark clouds of living, buzzing filth. The stench rising from the bubbling sludge is enough to make your eyes water and your stomach to clench in disgust. }{Mantis Swamp 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
