R {49301}{0}{<228>}{Mantis Swamp (se,w)}{<228>; ;<088>}{    The ground is noticeably firmer than the surrounding swamp. While water still pools here and there, the majority of the ground is merely damp and covered in scrub brush and weeds. Reeds grow in abundance and vines cover the trees in a myriad of colors and designs. }{Mantis Swamp 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
