R {49302}{0}{<228>}{Deep in Mantis Swamp (n)}{<228>; ;<088>}{      Wading even deeper into the bog, the water is now chest deep. Strange sounds emanate from all directions and you think you can feel movement underneath the water's surface. Just imagining what might live down there, crawling over your feet and slithering around your waist is enough to make your skin break out in goose bumps. Maybe you should leave this place while you still can? }{Mantis Swamp 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49300}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

