R {49304}{0}{<228>}{Mantis Swamp (s,nw)}{<228>; ;<088>}{     The ground is damp but firm. Long grass grows in thick patches around the stands of reeds and bunches of thorny bushes and shrubs. Cypress trees grow from the moist earth, their branches drooping over the vegetation and their trunks dark brown and shadowed in the hazy murk of this place. }{Mantis Swamp 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
