R {49311}{0}{}{Hope (return)}{ }{        Wispy fog drifts around you as you try to get your bearings in this strangest of places. You have trouble focusing on things and feel a bit out of control, as if in a dream, but you feel no fear. Your body is numb and immobile, and you drift with the wind over tight rolling hills and fields of grain. Closer to the spirit world than to reality, you can barely perceive someone approach through the mist, look upon you with kindness, then drift away. Hope has been bestowed upon you, but you know you must return. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {45708}{return}{return}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49312}{0}{}{Border House Yard (s,ne,n)}{ }{       This area has seen heavy use as travelers entering and leaving the kingdom passed through here and trampled every living thing.  To the west side of the yard is an impassable forest\; a short rail fence blocks the east side.  Just beyond the fence is a long cliff dropping down to pounding surf.  There is a very large door with a deep rutted path leading to it toward the north, a smaller door with a very complex locking mechanism to the northeast, and a single road leading to the south. }{The Enchanged Kingdom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
