R {49422}{0}{}{Shipping and Receiving Office (n,e)}{ }{     A tall, white desk sits in the center of the room.  The wall behind the desk is dotted with empty cubby holes.  The vinyl flooring is torn and ripped, showing the bare concrete underneath.  Otherwise, the office is stark.  The hallway is to the north through an empty door frame, and the office opens up to the east. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
