R {49423}{0}{}{A Corner in a Well-Lit Hallway (n,w)}{ }{    The hallway bends north and west.  You can see far down both directions of the hall.  The fluorescent lighting makes the scars on the concrete wall and tiled floor stand out.  A cracked glass wall starts here on the west side of the hallway. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
