R {49424}{0}{}{Storage Area (w,e)}{ }{     Huge metal shelves, many of which are twisted and deformed, create several rows of storage space.  None of them have anything on them except dust.  The floor is bare concrete, with lots of scars and gouges marring it.  The storage area seems to continue to the east, but there appears to be an office to the west. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
