R {49425}{0}{}{Storage Area (n,w)}{B}{     The huge metal shelves cover the walls and come to a corner to the southeast.  A crushed brown box sits on one of the shelves, which otherwise hold nothing but dust.  The cold concrete floor follows the curve of the walls and extends the storage area to both the north and west. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
