R {49426}{0}{}{Storage Area (s,n)}{ }{     Twisted and deformed metal shelves sit against the walls of this room, they reach all the way to the ceiling.  They are all covered in dust.  The floor is bare concrete, with lots of scarring and scrapes.  The storage area seems to continue to the south and open up to an empty room to the north. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
