R {49427}{0}{}{Receiving Bay (s,w)}{ }{      The walls and floors of this bay are all bare concrete.  It is completely empty, only dust can be seen resting on the floor.  There is a huge metal door making up most of the east wall.  It is basically a huge garage door.  A smaller door would have sat in the empty door frame to the west.  To the south a large room filled with shelving can be seen. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
