R {49437}{0}{}{A Corner in a Well-Lit Hallway (s,w)}{ }{    The glass wall and concrete wall both come to corners here, bending the route of the hallway west and south.  The concrete wall and floor are scratched and charred in places.  The quiet sounds of distant talking are just barely audible. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
