R {49438}{0}{}{A Storage Room (n,w)}{ }{     A narrow path through what looks to be hundreds of wooden crates winds through this room.  The crates are stacked to the ceiling and seem to cover every inch of the floor except for a small space that allows passage deeper into the storage areas.  The door frame into the hallway is to the west, and the path heads north. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
