R {49439}{0}{}{An Endless Storage Room (s,n)}{ }{    A path through an endless sea of wooden crates runs north and south.  The stacks of crates make it difficult to see, they stretch to the ceiling.  To both the north and south there appears to be nothing but more and more crates. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
