R {49440}{0}{}{An Endless Storage Room (s,w)}{ }{     There appears to be no end to the monotony.  More wooden crates cramp the narrow path between them.  The only thing different about this section of the storage area is the path makes a turn here, allowing you to move west and south.  All that can be seen in either direction are more crates stacked to the ceiling. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
