R {49442}{0}{}{A Storage Room (s,e)}{ }{     This storage room is difficult to even stand in.  Wooden crates are taking up almost every inch of it.  They are stacked from the floor to the ceiling, leaving only a small path to the east.  The hallway lies to the south and looks quite roomy in comparison.  You can squeeze further into the storage area to the east. }{Kilton Research, Inc. v2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
