R {49608}{0}{}{Hosea Auces's Bike Shop (w)}{ }{      Hosea Auces's Bike Shop The work area is littered with bikes in all stages of repair.  Greasy tools lie on the cement floor.  An unshaded lightbulb flickers from the ceiling above.  A few posters of scantily clad women hang on the wall.  A pair of beady red eyes peers out from a hole in the wall. }{Mega-Tokyo Bike Shop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
