R {49609}{0}{}{Hosea Auces's Bike Shop (e)}{ }{      Hosea Auces's Bike Shop The storage area is full of stacked cardboard boxes.  The boxes are dry and falling apart.  Wood shelves hang from the walls.  A long counter is against the west wall.  On the counter are several cans of grease, some rags and various bike parts. A rusty metal fan also sits on the counter, slowly turning. }{Mega-Tokyo Bike Shop}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
