R {49628}{0}{}{Library of Raynaud (n,s)}{ }{       The sensation that you are walking through a historical monument that has not been seen by human eyes for centuries completely overwhelms you.  Past the door to the south, a tall hallway leads north.  The walls tower on either side of you.  They are dusty and filled with cobwebs.  The library is dead quiet, but the magic within is almost palpable.  Somewhere within these halls, lies the answer to destroying the angeldemons, as well as the False God who created them. }{Balooga Falls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
