R {49695}{0}{<238>}{A Burnt-out Building (nw,w)}{<238>. ^<088>}{      The walls and roof of this structure have all but disappeared, leaving only blackened and charred stumps. Between you and the floor there is a layer of at least foot thick and clear ice\; the fire must have melted the snow and when the fire died out the resulting water froze. There is a ruined doorway off to the northwest and a blackened hole westward. }{Global Merc Training Theatre}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
