R {49696}{0}{<238>}{A Burnt-out Building (se,u)}{<238>, `<088>}{     Here and there you can see spots where a raging fire has consumed the room. For the most part, the walls remain standing, as does the roof but no items remain except a ladder that has been warped in the fire and a frozen layer of ice on the floor. Light is streaming in from an open hatch in the roof and the doorway to the southeast. }{Global Merc Training Theatre}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
