R {49697}{0}{}{An Observation Tower (d)}{ }{      This once must have been an observation tower\; each side of its octagonal shape consists of a short wall and large window. Well, at least they did before the windows were blown out by what ever caused that blast mark where the northwest wall was. It looks like there is a plaque with some markings on the floor beside the hatchway and ladder that leads back down out of here. }{Global Merc Training Theatre}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
