R {49699}{0}{}{An Orange Bathroom (ne)}{ }{    With a toilet and shower, your observation powers quickly lead you to believe that this is the bathroom.  Instead of a sink there is a water trough, and like the main room of the apartment, it is completely done in bright fluorescent oranges. }{Oj Cow}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
