R {49702}{0}{}{Cave (w)}{ }{    You have reached the end of a large, smelly cave.  Skeletons of both humans and animals alike are strewn about the floor.  Whatever beast resides in this underground abode is certainly not of the gentle persuasion. }{Troll Den}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49700}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {49703}{0}{}{Icelands (n,s,w)}{ }{       Icelands You find yourself backtracking around a treacherous snowdrift.  The wind moans like a dying soul.  You are on a flat plain covered in snow, broken by glaciers.  Further to the west and south you see that the land of ice continues.  Ice-covered mountains arise to the northwest, and a sheer wall of ice lies to the east.  The wall of ice looks unclimbable, but a large cave has been dug into the steep wall. }{Snowbeast Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {49704}{0}{}{Before An Altar (u)}{ }{         This room is some sort of unholy sanctuary to a dark god carved right into the earth. A large blood-stained altar sits in the center of the room, and rows upon rows of candles sit against the cave wall and demonic symbols are painted in red liquid on the floor. A rope ladder against one of the walls leads up out of this hole. The shape of this room is not naturally formed and it was dug by a tool far more sophisticated then a shovel. Every surface of the walls and ceiling are carved as smoothly as if giant razor sliced them. There is something strange about one of the walls in particular. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
