R {49706}{0}{}{In A Lair (sw,se)}{ }{         This room is a simple, old-fashioned study. A fireplace with a bearskin lain before it is on one wall, a couch and a reading lamp against another. A chair sits behind a desk near the fireplace with various papers in tidy piles. This location is a stark contrast to the earthen cave that lead here, wherever here is. The floor and walls are made from simple red bricks, and they exude a warmth thats very peculiar. The room has a cozy feel that is diminished by the stark reality of who this place belongs to. A hallway forks to the southwest and the southeast. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
