R {49707}{0}{}{At A Crypt (ne)}{ }{      The quaint wooden hallway that leads here ends abruptly at a massive stone wall. The floor next to the stone wall is sunken down and a few wooden steps descend to meet it. There is no seam between the stone and the wood. The two materials seems to blend together at their joint. The only mark on the giant stone wall is the outline of the door that sits embedded in it. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
