R {49708}{0}{}{Focus Chamber (nw)}{ }{     This room pulses with energy. Great magical forces have been gathered into a nexus of power. This room has arched walls that meet at a point directly above the center of the room. Magic surges down the spines of the wall into the floor below and conduits have been built to draw that energy toward a contraption in the center of the room. }{3Kraft Castle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
