R {49710}{0}{}{<*<*A Sunny Meadow*>*> (sw,s,w)}{ }{      The sun filters down through the branches of the forest around you creating dappled patterns of shadow and light which playfully dance on the forest floor.  A treeless incline full of tall grasses and vividly colored wildflowers offers respite from the dangers of the treacherous forest all around you.  A dust-devil spins playfully on the open field tossing leaves and flowers in a bright display of nature's beauty. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
