R {49711}{0}{}{<*<*A Massive Tree*>*> (sw,nw,n,s,w)}{ }{      A MASSIVE tree grows before you reaching high into the air.  The base of the trunk dwarfs any building you've ever seen.  This tree must be thousands of years old.  You could easily build a house on just one of the branches of this behemoth.  As you walk around the titanic base you see burn scars and axe marks, but nothing yet in its long history has been able to end this tree's long life. }{3Kraft}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
