R {49764}{0}{<238>}{Backstage At The Krusty the Clown Show (w)}{<238>|||<088>}{         A hush envelops you as you hide behind the heavy red curtain.  Broken crates decorate this intermediate storage area, and the silence around you is made more powerful considering you heard for yourself the deafening screeches of children that pierce the air of the Krusty the Clown show's audience.  You could pass through a part in the curtain to the west. }{Simpsons}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
