R {49938}{0}{<228>}{A pleasant glade (se)}{<228>. ^<088>}{       This small clearing is tucked into a narrow valley on the edge of a small pond, evidently collected runoff from the hills that flank it on either side.  The thick wall of trees end close to the water, leaving a pleasant ten foot bank all around the pond.  Even the harsh wind is blocked by the circle of trees, leaving this spot fairly quiet.  Several different varieties of flowers grow in this surprisingly idyllic spot, and the water of the pond is relatively clear. }{Forest}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
