R {49939}{0}{<148>}{Swimming in a pond (out)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{      You have dropped all your belongings you could and dove into this beautiful pool of water.  You feel slow, cold currents and slimy little fish tickling your toes.  You see storm clouds churning above, but they don't seem to be of any bother now.  The water is relatively warm, and you are having a wonderful time.  You can see a few rocks at the bottom of the pond, poking harmlessly out of the sand and muck. }{Forest Pond}{ravenloft_forest_pond}{}{}{1.000}{1}
