R {49943}{0}{<238>}{hidden path (w)}{<238>. .<088>}{     Shadowy whispering can be heard in the underbrush.  Shadows flutter just out of your vision, filling your mind with fear and caution.  Darkness engulfs you.  The silvery moon shines down upon the spirits of the elven dead.  Another elven house resides in a tree north of here. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
