R {49944}{0}{<238>}{hidden path (w,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{     Evil resides here, spirits of the dead surround you.  You are not alone in these dark woods.  Black spirits of the dead grow ever closer, hungry for your warm flesh.  An eerie moaning can be heard somewhere in the far distance of this dark and evil wood.  Towering toward the black sky, an elven housetree hovers ominously northeast. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
