R {49945}{0}{<238>}{hidden path (s,e)}{<238>. .<088>}{    Black trees, thick as night, surround you here.  The trees weep blood here.  Black sap runs down the branches, falling like the tears of broken honor.  An eerie moaning can be heard somewhere in the far distance of this dark and evil wood. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
