R {49946}{0}{<238>}{hidden path (n)}{<238>(<148>~<238>)<088>}{    Rivulets of fear ooze down your spine, chilling your soul.  Flickers of black shadows lap upon your soul.  You seek shelter, but know that within these dark woods, the only shelter is oblivion.  In the dark sky above you, the pale moon shines down upon your death. }{Der'Thalas}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
