R {49948}{0}{<238>}{A Woodsman's Hut (enter,s)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{        The forest opens into a small clearing, where a large stump lies testament to the fall of an ancient tree. Shafts of light from the canopy far above reveal a small hut which has been erected in place of the fallen tree, no doubt hewn from the tree itself. Smoke billows from a small stone chimney set into the side of the hut, and the door stands open. The clearing continues south towards a small pool, surrounded on all  sides by the scattered shade of the forest. In all other directions, rocky cliff formations block your egress. }{Woodsman's Hut}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
