R {49982}{0}{}{Movie Spoiler Room (d)}{ }{             The irrepressible squink of your shoes shuffling down the sticky aisle tells you that you've stumbled across the 3K's popular movie theatre.  In days gone by, thousands were entertained by the latest in feature films, in full Dolby surround sound.  Although no longer in operation, the theatre has become a shrine to moviegoers, housing none other than the 3K Movie Spoilers Board.  It is here that the movies of the outer worlds are panned and lauded, made and broken, simply by the words of our discerning 3K cinema fanatics. In an effort to preserve the hushed atmosphere of a typical movie theatre, speaking and emoting in this room is discouraged.  If you wish to partake in the latest movie gossip, and don't mind that you may receive a spoiler to a movie you've been dying to see, just type 'spoilmenow' and post away! }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
