R {50000}{0}{<088>}{The Dungeon of the Archons}{40}{A deep dark dungeon buried in the depths of Pinnacle. This is where the Archons of 3-Kingdoms punish the new Wizards who abuse their powers, or break some other rule. Of course, some have been known to torture unsuspecting souls for eternity down here. Human remains are strewn about the floor of this place, giving the dungeon an undeniable aura of finality. On the west wall, there are a few sets of manacles, one with a skeleton still in them! On the northern wall, various implements of torture are hanging, rusty and in poor condition. A table with leather straps for immobilizing victims sits in the center of the room. About a foot above your head a grate can be seen, maybe leading to your freedom.}{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
