R {50007}{0}{}{Betwixt and Between (sw,d)}{11}{       You feel yourself falling and hit the cold stone floor hard. It appears you're in a tomb, long forgotten by living hands. The reek of rotting flesh fills your nostrils and seems to cling to you like an evil mist. Haphazardly heaped in one corner of the room is a pile of corpses, dead eyes staring forever into eternity. You shudder and look away from the horrifying sight, only to find yourself somewhere completely different. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
