R {50010}{0}{<148>}{[\x7B>- A pool of water -<\x7D] (onward,return)}{<148>~ ~<088>}{         [\x7B>- A pool of water -<\x7D] As you tread water, you gaze about in wonder at the sheer scale of the cavern.  Turning in a slow circle, you start to ponder why in the name of the gods you thought going for a swim was a good idea.  Your arms seem like they are made of lead, and you're barely halfway across the pool.  The water around you is still beyond the ripples you've made.  The light is poor, but you can still see clearly enough that it's obvious you have two choices, press on or turn back and hope to survive. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
