R {50045}{0}{}{A large open meadow (ne,s,climb)}{34}{         The grass in the meadow blows gently in the breeze and the sun shines down brightly from a cloud free sky. At the bottom of the meadow an old wooden fence stops a nearby herd of cows from escaping. A cool stream emerges from under the fence and comes to an end in a small clear pond in the shade of a large oak tree. The many hoof prints that surround the pond indicate that the shade and water make it a welcoming place for the nearby grazing cattle. On the other side of the tree is a circle of stones which looks like it should have a fire burning in it except there isn't any wood. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
