R {50052}{0}{}{A garden paradise (e,n)}{ }{         You stand within rows of vegetables that travel on as far as the eye can see in all directions. The sky overhead is a breathtakingly, almost impossibly deep blue, and the bright and warming sun is unassailed by clouds. The sounds of nature, carried to your ears on a refreshing breeze, almost resemble an invitation to take a well-deserved rest\; the smell of the fresh and fertile earth rising to your nose seems to echo that sentiment. Feelings of peace, contentment and acceptance seem to envelop the area, threatening to push the memories of your brief incarceration with Ana out of your mind. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
