R {50072}{0}{}{The Moment of Realization (d,ne)}{44}{              The nightstand in the corner is as you remember it\; your oft-read copy of 'Rich Dad, Poor Dad' lies on top of a stack of various other ill-fated reading conquests, all dog-eared at around the half-way point.  A cup sits next to the book stack, containing whatever liquid it was that you intended to drink the night before\; perhaps it was water.  The pajama pants you did not have time to fold this morning lie crumpled in the corner by your closet.  On the entertainment center, you see your wallet that was forgotten in your mad rush to make it to work on time this morning.  The ceiling fan slowly spins, circulating the dust that no one has taken time to clean from its blades.  The comforter on the bed has been thrown back... Under the sheets, the love of your life quietly lies in the bed, breathing silently in hopes that you may not look over.  Next to your love, lies your love's lover. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
