R {50100}{0}{}{Expansive Tide Pools (w)}{ }{       A wide stretch of rocks crumbled onto a sandbar stretches out across the water.  Footing is a bit precarious here, due to the slippery rocks, and the occasional waves breaking over the top of the rocks.  There's many tide pools scattered across the rocks, teeming with sea creatures.  The sky is a gorgeous clear blue. The main beach is back to the west, and the ocean surrounds all other sides. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
