R {50106}{0}{}{-\x7B* the alley behind Club Fabrique *\x7D- (door,se,sw)}{74}{        You are in the alley which runs behind the legendary Club Fabrique, one of the most exclusive clubs in London.  The dark sky is humid, yet alive with the shimmer of frenzied urban nightlife.  From the chaotic sounds of loud crowds and even louder techno coming through the walls, it is safe to assume that the party inside must be raging.  The building is massive, with a simple brick facade, and looks to be much older than anybody inside it could possibly be.  Small concrete steps lead up to an unmarked door, which is presumably the back entrance to the club. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
