R {50112}{0}{}{A child's bedroom (s)}{ }{          A child's bedroom To the west is a small closet full of various stuffed animals. A green and purple child's table stands against the wall.  A television set and VCR sits on top of the table.  A large, sliding window covers most of the north wall.  Next to the window is a multi-colored bookshelf full of books and video tapes.  On the east wall stands a brown dresser and a small bed with several blankets and pillows.  Posters and pictures adorn every wall in the room.  A tall green lamp stands in a corner.  The door out is to the south. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
