R {50113}{0}{}{Gumshoe Office (nw,u)}{52}{          A small office of the sort most often found in hard-boiled detective movies - frosted glass door, hat stand, pretentious oak desk with an old mechanical typewriter. A grimy window sheds a pittance of light on the unhappy potted plant squatting on top of the filing cabinet against one wall. The opposite wall appears to be made entirely of clipped-out newspaper articles and magazine stories, taped, stapled, and in some cases, nailed atop one another. White document boxes are stacked haphazardly against the back wall, threatening to tumble over onto the floor. A ceiling fan slowly rotates, barely stirring the close, still air. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
