R {50129}{0}{}{Tower of Dreams (d)}{ }{       You have reached the top of this small tower. A smoldering fire crackles and burns in a nearby fireplace, illuminating the room in a soft orange glow. The light from the fire casts dancing  shadows on the floor. The shadows seem to have a life of their own, morphing into images of black cities and dancing angels and demons. A small rocking chair rests quietly in a corner beside an old, brown oak desk. }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
