R {50130}{0}{}{Firehouse Dorm (s,u)}{59}{         You have entered a large, open room.  Looking around, you see that it is poorly decorated with a bad paint job and sub-par carpeting on the floor.  You see a few beds and nightstands placed several feet apart.  You think you're in a fire house dorm room!  You remember a room like this on a tour of the fire department you took when you were a kid.  There is a bed and nightstand near the brass pole that appear to be the Captain's.  His light is on and it looks like someone wrote down the address of a fire.  You get the impression that you are a fire fighter!  You better grab your clothes and get down to the engine! }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
