R {50132}{0}{}{The Ancient Ruins of an Office (d,n)}{83}{       You enter the remains of a small office through a crack in the wall.  The room is a square seven or eight paces wide with walls, ceiling, and floor made from a smooth white substance you can't quite identify.  Scattered across the floor are a number of barely recognizable rusted metal items and fragments of petrified wood.  Floating about chest high in the center of the room is a small metallic orb with a ghostly disembodied head overlaying it.                                         }{Museum}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
