R {50360}{0}{<248>}{Mayor's Chambers (s,exit,w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{       This large room is brightly lit with several floor lamps and has a large recliner and sofa.  The carpet is extremely plush and comfortable to walk on.  An oval shaped coffee table consisting of a large glass surface resting on a stainless steel structure sits in front of the couch, and holds several dirty dishes.  A small doorway is in the south wall, and the room extends to a recreational center just to the west. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
