R {50361}{0}{<248>}{Mayor's Chambers (n,door)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{      A large four post bed dominates this bed chamber.  Sitting upon a pedestal, the bed is easily half again the size of a normal bed.  The foot and head boards are made of brass, and the bed has an emerald green comforter and pillows.  The walls are decorated with ancient Japanese artifacts, and a mural.  A large dresser and end tables match the bed, and a small closet door is in the eastern wall. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
