R {50362}{0}{<248>}{Mayor's Chambers (s,n,e)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{       This spacious room is filled with plush carpeting and theater style in ground seating.  The chairs are extremely plush and form a semicircle around a huge holo-projector entertainment center.   Within each corner of this recreation center is a large speaker system and olfactory projectors.  The north wall is dominated by a large sliding glass door, leading to a balcony.  A small doorway is also in the southern wall. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
