R {50363}{0}{<248>}{Mayor's Chambers (door)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{      This large closet is lined on each side with hangers full of clothing.  A bright ceiling light provides adequate lighting although many of the corners are dark and shadowy.  Upon the far wall is a series of box-like shelves, each box containing a pair of shoes.  The carpeting is snowflake white, matching the adjacent bedroom.  At the base of the shelves, upon the floor is a large box. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
