R {50364}{0}{<248>}{Mayor's Chambers (w,n)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{       This large dining room is dominated by a cherry wood table that extends nearly end to end across the room.  A dozen finely crafted wooden chairs sit equidistant around the table.  At each chair is a placemat and silverware, as if ready to serve a large banquet.  A small chandelier hangs above the table and the walls are lined with artwork.  Through the northern doorway is the mayor's recreation room, and the kitchen entrance is in the southern end of the west wall. }{Mega-Tokyo}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
