R {50627}{0}{}{Prison (s,n)}{ }{         You are in a very large and wicked room.  The walls are lined with sculptures of demons and devils from all the planes involved in unspeakable acts of death and destruction.  Your stomach churns at the sight of some of them and your soul weeps for the receivers of those acts. Crucified before the northern door is a hulking figure of enormous proportions.  You've never seen a humanoid beast as powerful looking as the one before you.  He has been crucified upon a cross of raw evil and his energy has been drawn from him.  You think that nothing could free this 'man' and he blocks your only passage onward. }{A Rastafan Area}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
