R {50801}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (s,nw)}{<238>, `<088>}{    Strolling quietly through the piles of rubble, you pause to examine yet another piece of rubble.  It is heartening to see that small trees have taken root.  Deep in the rubble leveled buildings and foundations pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
