R {50802}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (s,n)}{<238>, .<088>}{     You watch the high towers in the distance for signs of predators as you proceed cautiously through the rubble.  In amongst the heavy destruction, blasted bits and pieces of former buildings wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is impossible to see hidden foes, as low shrubs blanket the rubble. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
