R {50809}{0}{}{A dark corner of the fourth floor (u,s)}{ }{         A ladder leads up the north wall, a very unsturdy ladder at that. At the roof it leads through a small opening to a slightly brighter place. This fourth floor appears to have been almost completely deserted for quite some time.  The extremely thin, papery white wallpaper is covered with dust and is peeling in an unsightly way.   The hall continues to the south. }{Whorehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
