R {50811}{0}{}{The fourth floor (n)}{ }{             This floor rattles your nerves slightly.  You wonder why access to it is so limited...the walls appear to be untouched since the hotel was first built over a century ago.  Peeling off-white wallpaper with powder blue stripes recall a time of innocence.  Before you to the east is a door that changes your views however.  It is a block of gold metal that looks like a wall of impenetrable stained titanium.  This could not have been here when the hotel was first built. }{Whorehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50809}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

