R {50913}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (w,e)}{<238>. ^<088>}{      In amongst the heavy destruction, shattered and torn remnants of buildings wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is very hard to see for any distance, as thick shrubs obscure the rocky wasteland.  The rubble is a result of explosions and wild magic used when the city was sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago.  Only the fool-hardy explore here.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {31015}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50914}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
