E {31000}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {50914}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (e)}{<238>, .<088>}{     In the heaped rubble, smashed and burnt pieces of homes and shops hide both treasures beyond the imagination and unimaginable death.  It is like some alien park, where the grasses have started to over-grow the smashed pieces.  The piles of rubble are all that remains of the buildings in this area.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50913}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {50915}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (w,e)}{<238>, .<088>}{   It is impossible to see hidden foes, as low shrubs blanket the rubble.  Deep in the rubble ex-buildings that have been hammered to fragments pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50913}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {50916}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {50916}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (w,ne)}{<238>. ^<088>}{  As you make your way through the rubble you notice some signs of recent traffic. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
