R {50917}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (sw,nw)}{<238>, .<088>}{  A small movement in a group of shrubs in the distance catches your eye.  You pause in the middle of the destruction. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
