R {50918}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (se,n)}{<238>. ^<088>}{   It is deadly quiet.  Small weeds poking through the waste rock and wood. Deep in the rubble leveled buildings and foundations pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
