R {50920}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (w,e)}{<238>. ^<088>}{   It is heartening to see that small trees have taken root.  Just off to the side of the rubble, the detritus of demolished buildings pay silent testimony to the dreadful devastation that took place here.   }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
