R {50922}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (w)}{<238>, .<088>}{      A small movement in a group of shrubs in the distance catches your eye.  You pause in the middle of the destruction.  In amongst the heavy destruction, ex-buildings that have been hammered to fragments wait patiently for the original inhabitants to return and repair the devastated mess.  It is difficult to see your footing, as small creeping vines and grasses run over the waste rocks and timbers. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {50920}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {50923}{0}{<238>}{-^- Rubble -^- (w,e)}{<238>, .<088>}{      In the heaped rubble, smashed and burnt pieces of homes and shops hide both treasures beyond the imagination and unimaginable death.  It is deadly quiet.  Small weeds poking through the waste rock and wood.  The rubble is a result of explosions and wild magic used when the city was sacked by the goblin-kin over 600 years ago.  Only the fool-hardy explore here. }{Murus Faralain 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
