R {50968}{0}{}{The Inner Circle of Pandaemonium (ne,s,w)}{ }{           You tread where few mortals have, the great hall of Pandaemonium. It was here that the rebellious angels were cast down to. It was here that the great leader of that rebellion, the Dark Angel himself, decided to build a fortress. And you have penetrated the outer defenses and stand within its unholy walls. Diamonds and rubies glisten in the walls of the cavern, as the wealth of the underworld has been collected to decorate this vast hall. To the west and northeast are gem-studded passageways leading on around the inner sanctum. To the north is an entrance to that sanctum, a place of great evil and terrible danger. Mere mortals were not meant to challenge the power of the Dark One in his own abode. }{Pandaemonium 2.0}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
