R {51133}{0}{<238>}{A small cellar (u)}{<238>|@|<088>}{       Through the trapdoor above, you can see just the hint of light and the outline of a rotting stairway.  This room is very musty, and reeks of disuse.  Cobwebs hang in all corners, and the chittering of a rat you cannot see can be heard from inside one of the walls.  There's another sound as well coming from beyond a thick oak door on the east wall, though to which you cannot pin a source.  You can climb back through the trapdoor above you if you so wish. }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
