R {51135}{0}{}{Victor Mordenheim's Secret Laboratory (w)}{ }{        Wow! You have stumbled across the top-secret laboratory of Victor Mordenheim!  Many laboratory tables are lined up along the walls of the room, and you can see what appear to be robot husks lying on several of them that demand closer attention.  It is bright here, light glaring down from the ceiling.  A long metal rod rises up through the ceiling, connected to a strange device with a large dial upon it.  You better not let Victor catch you in here, it's doubtful that he is amenable to strangers... }{Mordenheim's Manor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
