R {51139}{0}{}{A dirt road (s,n)}{ }{        The road is dirt, packed by many travelers, and formed by rain and sun into a hardened mud that is almost as strong as stone.  A thick and somewhat spooky forest presses against the west edge of the road.  To the east, a short broken fence encloses a field of thin trees.  Beyond those trees one can just make out the sound of crashing surf.  The road, itself, eschews both the forest and the field, and with single minded (single mindless actually since it's an anthropomorphism) determination goes approximately north and south. }{The Enchanged Kingdom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
