R {51149}{0}{<138>}{On a sandy island (e,w,s,n)}{<138>, `<088>}{      Standing in the centre of the island you have a clear view of your surroundings. However, as you look around you notice little that actually stands out. If you were a person who enjoyed the motion of things, such as a bustling city, this surely would be absolute hell. However, after years of adventuring this is indeed a nice change of pace. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
