R {51176}{0}{}{Inside a dusty old attic (out)}{ }{       You're standing in a long forgotten attic. It's cluttered with a myriad of boxes and other miscellaneous items. A relatively thin layer of dust covers everything and as you move around it clings to your body and clothes. There are no windows here besides the one from which you came so the lighting is limited at best. At the eastern end of the spacious room is a small circle and for some reason it hasn't been covered with the normal clutter. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
