R {51178}{0}{}{Somewhere, somehow, sometime (out)}{ }{      Trapped between the flows of time you see everything that occurred during your life. You see your birth, your first step, as well as the death of your loved ones. The images repeat themselves over and over and you quickly realize what a horrifying place this is. Spending any amount of time here would surely drive the most intelligent person mad. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51176}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51179}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {51180}{0}{}{Before the eastern gate of Westersea (surrender)}{ }{      You're standing just in front of the eastern gate of Westersea. Before you, stretching on into the far distance to the east is Nakolla Vah Gels army. You are both shocked and amazed over the amount of followers he's raised in such a short time. The city of Westersea lies behind you to the west and you feel that you fight this battle with the support of the whole of Westersea. }{The City of Westersea}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
