R {51375}{0}{}{Under the rock slab in the hobgoblinzes lair (s,w)}{ }{    You are standing in a cramped little chamber beneath a slab of rock.  Above you is the hole through which you arrived, and to the west you can hear some low muttering.  A strange smell floats in the still air which your nose indicates to come from the south. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
