R {51376}{0}{}{A smelly, disgusting room in the hobgoblinzes lair (n)}{ }{   This place really does smell horrendous!  The walls are covered in a putrid odoured slime, and the floor is alive with squirming parasites.  For some reason you feel compelled to move toward the exit! }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
