R {51377}{0}{}{A guards chamber in the hobgoblinzes lair (e,w)}{ }{   The passage opens out to a slightly more spacious area.  Along the sides, piles of mossy boulders indicate a construction technique other than digging has been used to clear another chamber to the west. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
