R {51378}{0}{}{An arcane chamber in the hobgoblinzes lair (e)}{ }{     You are in a dim chamber blasted directly out of the earth by powerful sorcery.  The air is dry and sulphurous, filled with strange and heady scents that suffuse the mind and blur your vision.  You can sense the presence of arcane wards, guarding something that radiates an even more powerful aura. }{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51377}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51379}{0}{}{In a nightmarish submerged maze (nexus,d,w,s,u,e)}{ }{     Walls of black, terrible water crush you from every direction.  Terror besets your heart as you suddenly realize you are deep undersea.  The sea here is black, except for the glow of the nexus, which floats in place like a mystic anchor in the current.  Little is visible outside the radius of dim light emitted by the nexus. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
