R {51907}{0}{}{Swimming through a tunnel (u,d)}{ }{      The current blasts upward through the tunnel here, forcing you to push off the walls and swim downward with all your strength to avoid being propelled back out of the tunnel.  The rock walls close around you to within inches, making you feel claustrophobic.  The tunnel continues down into the inky blackness.  The sound of the current rushing past your ears is all you can hear. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
