R {51915}{0}{}{Spelunking far under the ocean surface (w,e)}{ }{    You are swimming through a natural, columned chamber of a cave far under the surface of the ocean.  Rock columns loom about you, faintly visible through the dark water.  The floor of the chamber is caked with mud.  An irregular clicking is audible through the water. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51914}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51922}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51916}{0}{}{Spelunking far under the ocean surface (e,n)}{ }{     The waterlogged cave twists here, heading north and east into the gloom.  The ceiling is low here.  You don't have much space to swim between the mud and the rock.  The water around you is freezing and very dark.  As you swim along, mud churns up from below you with each stroke.  A faint noise echoes through the cave. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51914}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
