R {51940}{0}{}{In a nightmarish submerged maze (n,w,e)}{ }{     In a nightmarish submerged maze You find yourself floating in a hellish undersea maze.  Currents buffet you as the denizens of this evil place flee past you in terror.  The murky water chills your bones.  To the north, east and west you barely detect that the deep sea continues.   }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
