R {51941}{0}{}{In a nightmarish submerged maze (e,w)}{ }{     In a nightmarish submerged maze Somewhere below you, the rubble-strewn ocean floor waits to claim your corpse.  The dark, crushingly heavy water reaches into you to suck away your warmth.  You are deep under the ocean's surface, in the foul lair of some beast.  To the west you sort of see that the deep sea continues. }{Mystic Seal}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51700}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
