R {51945}{0}{}{In a watery tunnel (u,d)}{ }{    A steady current flows downward in this tunnel, forcing you to swim mightily to make progress, or even stay in place.  The rock walls of the tunnel are worn smooth from the passage of the current.  The water is dark and very cold. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51885}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
