E {51955}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51951}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (se,ne,e)}{ }{          For a location so exotic, this place sure is boring.  There's nothing but cool, clear water in every direction.  You float in place, as though this plane isn't sure which way you ought to sink.  The water is surprisingly light for how deep underwater you must be, considering there's no surface visible in any direction.  You can see for hundreds of meters through the diffusely lit water.  Off in one direction, a sort of hole in the fabric of space is slowly draining water.  It's like an ant trying to remove all the sand on a beach one grain at a time.  In another direction, a bulky structure looms near the edge of your vision. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51950}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51952}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
