R {51952}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (n,sw,s,se)}{ }{      You're swimming in what must be the largest volume of water in all of existence.  There's nothing but water in every direction, save for some sort of conch structure floating, unsupported, in what you entirely arbitrarily have labeled north.  A weak current pushes softly in the opposite direction, toward a drain of some sort you can just pick out in the distance. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
