R {51953}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (n,nw,ne)}{ }{     Pure blue water surrounds you everywhere you look.  You float, unable to tell which way is up.  Off in one direction you make out a portal of some sort.  Beyond that, the vague outline of a bulky structure looms through the blue.  It's very wet here - a hydrophobe's nightmare. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51950}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51955}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51951}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51954}{0}{}{In a watery tunnel (d,portal)}{ }{       You've managed to swim to the apex of the tunnel.  The current flows from a dimly glowing portal of some sort, pushing you downward.  The portal looks like a ragged rip in the water, as though the cavern had been painted on a three-dimensional canvas, and someone had come and poked a small hole in it.  It's perhaps an armspan across, and glows very dimly pale blue.  The tunnel ends here\; there's nowhere to go but down. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {51955}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (w,sw,nw)}{ }{         You're swimming through a seemingly limitless volume of clear, cool water.  Direction in this place is completely arbitrary, since there's nothing to distinguish up from down or north from south.  The only definite distinction is wet from dry, and there's none of the latter here!  Off in one direction, a drain of some sort seems to be sucking water into itself, but where the water goes is anyone's guess.  You can feel a slight current here as water flows languidly in the direction of this drain.  Off in another direction, the outline of some large bulk looms through the liquid. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51950}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51953}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51952}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51956}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (w,s,conch,e)}{ }{      You're swimming before a gigantic conch shell floating amid an unthinkable volume of fresh water.  Beings made of water flit in and out of the conch's pearly yonic aperture - a pedestrian traffic of elementals.  This place must be significant to them.  Tilting your head around, you discern no other features within the limits of your vision. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51952}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
