R {51957}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (e)}{ }{     You've swum to the majestic spiral end of the conch structure.  It floats before you, stationary in the infinite expanse of clear blue water.  The conch's outer surface spirals gracefully to a point at the center.  Small horns of shell jut from the edges and top of the conch. There's nothing else nearby except for water in every direction. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51956}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51958}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (out)}{ }{         You spiral your way into the conch shell, reaching a wide chamber in the center after a dizzying length of turning.  The shell walls sparkle from the glow of the water.  The chamber tapers on one end to a great spiraled dome\; the other end tapers to a point.  Elementals swim around the chamber in lazy spirals.  Even with the conch innards to use as a directional reference, you're disoriented by the motion.  A structure of shell and pearl is affixed to one wall of the chamber.  It's not clear if it's a throne or a cage, but the structure is certainly the center of attention for the watery swimmers. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51956}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51956}{s}{out}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51959}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (e,w)}{ }{     The gigantic conch tapers to a rough point here.  In one direction the structure spreads to a girth many times wider than you are tall\; in every other direction you see naught but water.  Peering into the blank wet distance gives you intense vertigo, and a sudden feeling you ought to be drowning, or crushed under the pressure. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51956}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51960}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51960}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (e,w)}{ }{    You're swimming through a featureless expanse of water.  There's no surface or sea floor visible, and it's hard to tell which way is up.  About a two-minute swim in one direction is a giant conch structure.  Its long pointy end juts accusingly in your direction. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {51959}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {51961}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {51961}{0}{}{Elemental plane of water (w)}{D}{     You've swum a long way from the conch, through a stretch of cool, clear water.  Finally you happen upon a spiny structure floating placidly amid the gentle current.  It's the size of a manor house.  The spines are about as long as you are tall.  There doesn't appear to be anything else about. }{Mystic Seal - Lair of the Kraken}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
