R {51984}{0}{}{A classroom (w,s)}{ }{       Chaos reigns.  Loud popping sounds break through the shouting, screaming, and laughing at random but frequent intervals.  Crazed students charge around the room or cluster in bunches around some bit of mayhem or another. An acrid stench of smoke rises up from one side of the room where a certain loud group of students seem to be incinerating something.  A young teacher shouts and screams to bring order to the bedlam but he is unable to be heard in the tumult. }{The Enchanged Kingdom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
