R {51985}{0}{}{A classroom (n)}{ }{      This classroom is cool and dimly lit.  The shades are drawn over the southward facing windows and a bluish light is cast across the room.  The northern wall of the room, except for the door, is covered by a glyphboard for displaying lessons and pictures.  It's blank now.  Toward the west wall is a teacher's desk\; The center of the room is full of student desks\; Book cabinets cover the eastern wall except where an oak armoire stands. }{The Enchanged Kingdom}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
