R {51997}{0}{}{Stairs up in a crypt (w,out)}{ }{      No sunlight penetrates into the gloomy crypt that continues off into the darkness for an unknown distance. The air is completely still, and layers of dust, undisturbed for countless years cover the ground. A staircase climbs up in front of you and you are unable to see where it leads. The light from torches on the wall flickers and plays games with your shadow. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
