R {52036}{0}{<133> <088>}{At the Cairn Stones (s)}{ }{     The clearing is dominated by a ring of giant standing monoliths, arranged in a pentacle around a clearing and various small boulders are scattered on the fringes. The center of the clearing is scarred from some unknown heat source, and the surrounding grass is singed. The air and ground are bristling with energy. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52034}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {52037}{0}{}{Wilderness (w,ne)}{ }{     You are on a path in the wilderness. A fence runs alongside you for a ways and then turns away from the path and heads off into the distance. Trees near the fence have been cut down to the stump, and a farm house lies off in the distance. Signs of human habitation are non-existent, as the farmers and villagers have long since fled. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
