R {52117}{0}{}{The Inner cloister (d,w)}{ }{     You are standing in the center of a courtyard. Arched gateways lead back towards the monastery entrance, and forward deeper into the darkness of this forbidding place. The brick floor borders a large square patch of grass in the center of the clearing. Long, razor sharp quills are intermixed with the grass blades. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
