R {52118}{0}{}{At a set of stairs (n,u)}{ }{     A set of stairs runs up, and towards an escape from this place. Scratch marks mar the steps all the way down, and disappear into the depths of the catacombs. The walls have a ledge built into them where row upon row of skulls have been set, some twisted mind's form of home decor. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
