R {52122}{0}{}{A throne room (s)}{ }{     This room is really two large rooms connected together. The first room contains a giant pit in the center. The second room is a throne room of some kind. Both rooms are littered with various unpleasant objects, including spiked heads, impaled victims and dead bodies. The sense that a great evil dwells here emanates from all around. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52121}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {52123}{0}{}{Wilderness (se,n)}{ }{     You are on a path in the wilderness. A fence runs alongside you for a ways and then turns away from the path and heads off into the distance. Trees near the fence have been cut down to the stump, and a farm house lies off in the distance. Signs of human habitation are non-existent, as the farmers and villagers have long since fled. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
