R {52125}{0}{}{Wilderness (n,s)}{ }{     You are on a path in the wilderness. The grass along the sides of the path is dead and it slowly returns to a dull green further away from the path. A burnt down house lies in the distance, and a sense of gloom comes over you as you walk along the path. There is a clearing with something in the middle. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
