R {52126}{0}{}{At a ruined tower (s)}{A}{      The path terminates abruptly at the foundation of a large tower. The tower itself is somewhat ruined and a large door barely hangs on to the few remaining hinges. Inside the doorway you see a wooden ladder rising out of a hole in the stone floor. The tower apparently rests on a large underground structure. Crows perch atop the tower parapets that remain standing. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
