R {52127}{0}{}{At a staircase (n,out)}{ }{        A winding staircase is carved from the bedrock forming a tunnel leading upwards. The entrance to the tunnel of stairs is arched, and the only light is emitted by two torches that flank the opening. The first five steps are visible, but a bend in the staircase obscures the rest. The staircase and tunnel that surrounds the arc is composed of cold, grey-black stone. The edges of the steps are chipped and worn away. Coldness emanates from the foot of the staircase, as if something within the tunnel is breathing wisps of icy breath. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
