R {52164}{0}{}{At a staircase down (d,s)}{ }{    You are at the top of a set of small stairs. They take you deeper into the tower's cellar, which continues on at the base. The stone bricks around you are well kept and shows no sign of decay. It appears that this staircase was created after structure was already complete. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
