R {52166}{0}{}{In a dungeon (sw,e)}{ }{      The walls of the catacomb are closer together and give the sense that you are slowly being entombed, doomed to spend your remaining existence in this place. A ledge runs down either side of the walls, and on it rest skulls. The skeleton of some unfortunate victim leans against the wall, his soul trapped forever. A weapon rack lies in the middle of the room. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
