R {52172}{0}{}{Countess's chambers (e)}{ }{      You have finally arrived at the bottom of the giant underground structure. This chamber has some significance to the owner of the tower, as two large standers hold giant family crests in the corners of the room. A large chest sits in the middle of the room. A doorway leads back out into the winding hallways of the maze that brought you here. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
