R {52173}{0}{}{Wilderness (w,e)}{ }{     You are on a path in the wilderness. A fence runs alongside you for a ways and then turns away from the path and heads off into the distance. Trees near the fence have been cut down to the stump, and a farm house lies off in the distance. Signs of human habitation are non-existent, as the farmers and villagers have long since fled. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
