R {52175}{0}{}{At a cave (e,cave)}{A}{       The path comes to a halt at the mouth of a tunnel in the ground. Trees ring the tunnel, and passage deeper into the wilderness in impossible. The clearing that the tunnel entrance sits in appears very ancient, and an invisible line has been drawn, which no tree has attempted to cross. The interior of the tunnel is dim but still visible, lit by some unknown source somewhere inside. The tunnel emits a feeling of great evil. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
