R {52176}{0}{}{Den of evil entrance (n,s,w,e,out)}{ }{     Scores of tracks lead in and out of the tunnel, and various skeletal remains are arranged at the mouth of the cave to look ominous. Sharp pointed sticks have been placed in the roof of the cave, near the entrance, to appear as teeth to some great monster. A sense of great evil emanates from everything around you. }{Diablo2}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
