R {52339}{0}{}{The Figurehead (aft)}{ }{     You cling somewhat precariously to the prow of the galleon. Looking below you the ocean churns happily, whilst in front of you is the large figurehead of the galleon.  It is quite peaceful here, and the sounds of seabirds and the throbbing seas make you quite relaxed and cheerful.  }{Thistlebeard's Galleon}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
