R {52341}{0}{}{Passage Behind a Waterfall (waterfall)}{ }{       Brilliant black light vibrates out of the cavern walls, casting a haunting glow across the surface of many stalagmites and stalactites within this cave.  Glowing unsteadily, the jagged walls narrow slightly, diminishing the size of this passage up ahead.  A chilling wind howls upward into the darkness, while casting fragments of dust into the air.  Strangely, the source of the gusts do not originate from outside this passage, as the waterfall trickles undisturbed. }{Chapel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
