R {52406}{0}{<108>}{Darkness}{<108>[ ]<088>}{            Darkness looms in this damp open hall, staved off only by a few waning torches.  Several dark wood benches have been placed tight against the walls and you smile inwardly at the thought of the Silent Knife members protecting their backs in this manner.  The sound of running water echoing in the distance is the only distraction that marks this subterranean hall.  This roughly circular hall has one passage leading off of it, east. The curving corridor blocks out light from the room in its direction, leaving it dark and gaping.  Originally this chamber appears to have been a shelter from attacks during the Mage Wars, but obviously it's no longer being used for this purpose. }{Chapel}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52405}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {52407}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

