R {52429}{0}{<238>}{Gallery (n,e)}{<238>"""<088>}{      This rather long hallway leads south through the royal gallery.  Paintings of ancestors, the palace, the King's horses, and the beautiful Atlantean landscapes cover all the walls.  Velvet covered chairs and chaise lounges line the hallway for visitors to sit and admire all the great works of art. There are two large crystal doors to the east and to the north is the main hallway. }{Atlantis}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
