R {52430}{0}{<278>}{Small Hallway (s,u)}{<278>.@.<088>}{    This is the small hallway which ends at the base of the spiral staircase and continues south through an archway toward the main hallway of the palace.  The walls are decorated with paintings and family portraits. }{Atlantis}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
