 [00:00:02]  Controller: None Deadman: 0 You cannot go north. > With his free hand, the man traces strange symbols in the tray of blood.    You cannot go up. >  Krat     Reboot: 3.2 days [00:00:01]  Controller: None Deadman: 0 You cannot go up. >  Krat     Reboot: 3.2 days [00:00:02]  Controller: None Deadman: 0    HP  4922/2455  SP  2089/2089  Chi  510 / 512  Peace  408 / 413 AE 14 [25%] Method: Crane    Crits: On    Stun: On    Hide: OFF  G2N: 37571089    Chi Focus: Thought    AE: 14/25%  CB: ! The man's finger moves around the tray of blood.                             Krat     Reboot: 3.2 days [00:00:03]  Controller: None Deadman: 0 =S=The hollow of a branch (or 'strange things are happening her=S=      ---*---   The hollow of a giant branch, this large room sounds of low moans and strange, unidentified organic noises.  A network of vines and wood are clustered together towards the back of the room, beyond which the room tapers to a long, narrow point.  To the northeast, a large nest of thorny brambles might present difficulty in continuing in that direction. }{Spire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
