R {52590}{0}{}{The large hollow of a branch (w)}{ }{     The walls of this room are red and rough, very un-bark-like.  Whether or not it is even wood is a prominent issue at this time.  In the center of the room is a contraption constructed of metal and wood and vines, tied to which a hybrid beast suffers.  The room tapers to a nook far to the southeast, and tapers to a hole on the west surface. }{Spire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52587}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {52592}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {52591}{0}{}{On a platform, beneath a ceiling of blood (d)}{ }{            You have made it to the very apex of this extremely unusual spire.  You are standing on a wooden platform which is suspended in a manner completely unknown to you.  The walls are all within arm's span around you, fleshy and alive, gently pulsating with life...you can see the outlines of thin, spidery veins forming countless labyrinths within its surface.  Above you is a ceiling of liquid blood, coursing around in spite of gravity...it sloshes around, creating the sound of water in a tub through the silence and darkness. The sense of immediacy that had been tickling your nerves in this upper region of the spire is at its most dense here...you feel as though there is a greater purpose to ascending those suspect steps, and that many have passed this route before you and have gone on to see greater, more beautiful things. }{Spire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52589}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {52594}{volunteer}{volunteer}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {52592}{0}{}{The corner of the room (nw)}{ }{    This is the tip of the room...you are nestled in the corner, huddled like a broken cat after having been thrown back here by a sapient vine.  The walls here are sticky, in a peculiar way, perhaps saturated with some form of sap. }{Spire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52590}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {52593}{0}{}{A room inside a giant branch, inside which a poplar lies (e)}{ }{     This giant, hollow branch is home to a long poplar lying on its back in the center of the room.  The presence of a tree within a (seeming) tree is an unusual one, yet the poplar being here seems oddly appropriate.  Its roots are exposed and its branches scarce of leaves.  The room tapers to a point to the west, and a hole to the east leads back out to the main spire. }{Spire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52576}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {52594}{0}{}{Under an infinitely black sky and low, red clouds}{ }{}{Spire}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {52595}{0}{}{Dark Chapel (stairs)}{ }{       You stand in what appears to be an abandoned chapel far beneath the city of Pinnacle.  The air here is musty and you feel the coldness of evil and darkness surrounding your very soul.  The room is very unadorned, save a jet black marble dais sitting peacefully in the center.  A small black sphere hovers above the altar, floating gently in the stale air.  An intense feeling of absolute dread radiates from the entire room, sending waves of revulsion through your very soul. }{Pinnacle}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {95}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {95}{u}{stairs}{16}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

