R {52623}{0}{}{The Martian Landscape}{ }{You lie on the martian stone, not feeling a whole lot of anything. Like a total idiot you tried to brave the Martian landscape without the protection that is essential for survival on this hell hole of a planet.  Perhaps if you'd been wearing an environmental suit you wouldn't now be lying here choking on your own tongue and feeling your eyes turn  to puddles of goo.  Maybe next time you'll take the proper precautions?}{Mars}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

