R {52626}{0}{}{Inside a Chamber}{ }{To your eye, the chamber in which you find yourself seems perfectly round, with very smooth, dark stone walls and a low ceiling.  Furnishings consist of merely a rug and two leather chairs.  The atmosphere seems to carry an extra pressure and warmth, as if you were a long way underground.  A sudden panic grips you as you finally realize there are no exits.  If things go badly, you may NEVER get out.}{Fantasy}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
