R {52996}{0}{}{A clearing in the grass.}{ }{The small patch of soil you stand on is surrounded by large green blades of grass. The rich brown soil is soft and moist underfoot. Mostly the blades are in large impenetrable clumps. Light filters down through the swaying tips of the blades of grass. A small gap exists to the east which looks like it would allow passage through the grass.}{The Magic Fungus}{magic_fungus}{}{}{1000.000}{1}
