E {52997}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {52997}{0}{}{In front of a fungus (w)}{ }{        You stand in front of a rather large fungus. Blades of grass push up from the ground and surround the fungus in a ceremonial ring. The fungus stands proud in the centre of this ring absorbing the sunny rays that beam down from the heavens onto its stem. The stem of the fungus is bent in the middle yet the head still sits level with the ground. At the bend you can make out a scratch. Around the scratch the stem of the fungus has started to bruise and turn yellow. Apart from the stain the fungus looks almost good enough to eat. }{The Magic Fungus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {52996}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
