R {52998}{0}{}{On top of the fungus (se,ne)}{ }{      You have climbed to the top of the fungus. Down below is where you were standing just moments before. Small footprints on the ground lead to the stalk of the fungus. The tips of the blades of grass are visible from here. All around you is a sea of green dotted with other fungus heads every now and then. It looks like you could walk around the head of the fungus if you wanted. }{The Magic Fungus}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
