R {53012}{0}{}{Aimless}{ }{A swirl of colours, around and around, circle the stone platform.  Etched upon the ancient rock, glyphs of power separate Aimless from the world, though where it exists is better left unexplored.  Nothing but colour and stone are visible, with no way out.}{Night of Colour}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {16376}{touch orange}{touch orange}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53013}{0}{}{A strange, secretive place (e)}{ }{      You stand in a dense copse of trees hidden from Main Street.  It is strangely quiet here, as if the trees manage to absorb all sound from the town.  You can see a little of the sky through the branches of the trees, and it is blue and sunny.  None of the sunlight seems to reach down and warm this spot, however.  The trees thicken to the north, west and south making them impassable. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {30703}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53014}{w}{pull handle}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53014}{0}{}{A secret bunker! (w,e)}{ }{       You are in a hidden, secret bunker that was hidden among the trees of CowVille!  It is a small room and is packed with all sorts of equipment, leaving very little room for actually moving around.  The door out to the east looks like a normal door from this side and there is another similar door leading westwards.  What sort of thing is going on in CowVille that would require all this equipment and secrecy? }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53013}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53015}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53015}{0}{}{A concrete square among the trees (enter,e)}{ }{     You find yourself on a square of concrete in the middle of a great forest of trees.  To the east you can make out a doorway into a hidden building, though you only know it is there because you have come through it already.  Off in the distance, barely audible, you can hear the sounds of CowVille. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53014}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53016}{enter}{enter}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
