R {53016}{0}{}{Inside a rocket (exit)}{ }{    The inside of the rocket is quite small, but everything shines brightly and looks new.  The control panel for the rocket seems quite simple, with a single control labelled "launch".  It must run on a preset course, though where it will take you is anybody's guess. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
