R {53018}{0}{}{On the Moo-n, man! (enter)}{ }{        You're on the Moo-n!  Somehow it doesn't quite seem what you expected, perhaps because it only seems to be a few hundred feet above the ground, or perhaps because you can breathe perfectly normally here.  In any case, it's still pretty exciting to be here and you can see the whole of CowVille in miniature below you (or is that above you?).  The rest of the moo-n looks pretty much the same as this area, so you feel no urge to explore, just to admire the view.  There is a similar square of concrete here, with a post next to it. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
