R {53020}{0}{}{A Hidden Arena (s)}{ }{     A secret arena hidden just inside the trees at the edge of the CowPat training ground.  It looks like the special forces unit, C.R.A.P., uses this as place to test their skills.  Presently Chad, Chip, Flash, Butch, Casey and Mike are standing back from the edge of the arena waiting for a challenge. }{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {43690}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53021}{0}{}{Vacuo's Stomach}{ }{You are in the acidic, putrid stomach of Vacuo, the most vile and disgusting of the angeldemons. It looks like there's no way out, until someone gets this bloated evil thing killed.}{Balooga Falls}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}

R {53022}{0}{}{A bedroom (s)}{ }{     A long room stretches out before you.  Twelve beds, six on each side of the room, with cupboards in between, fill the large room.  A story dances along the woven rug that runs the length of the room.  Enormous windows fill the west wall, and tapestries the east.  Firelight glows from the fireplace at the end of the hall. }{Twelve Princesses}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {49964}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53023}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53023}{0}{}{A road leading to a castle (leave,road)}{ }{       A road winds through the gently rolling, grassy hills to the castle protecting the town.  The town is strangely quiet, as everyone is out working in the fields.  Bright sunlight gently caresses and warms your face.  Birds sing from the line of trees along the pathway, seemingly  Krat     Reboot:  9:39 [00:00:04]  Controller: None Deadman: 0 welcoming you to this place.  The distinctive sounds of livestock can be heard in the distance. }{Twelve Princesses}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
