R {53026}{0}{<238>}{Passage (nw,ne)}{<238>] [<088>}{      Though resembling the tunnel to the northeast in construction, this passage is significantly more narrow. It is eerily quiet here, and even the sounds you make as you pass through seem to be muffled and distorted. It seems as if there is no echoing off of the walls. To the northwest, a set of stairs carved from the floor begins and the passage curves upward, spiraling out of sight. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
