R {53027}{0}{<238>}{Spiral (e,se)}{<238>] [<088>}{    A short distance up the spiral flight, the stairs continue to twist out of sight above you. A small recess in the wall reveals two carved figures with arms clasped in a cordial embrace. The bottom of the flight is in view, but is nearly obscured in darkness. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
