R {53029}{0}{<238>}{Landing (w,ne)}{<238>] [<088>}{     Natural light streams in from an open doorway to the west, the brightness making it difficult to view the room that lies therein. The spiral stairway curves downward from this landing to the northeast and out of sight. On the south wall another recess again reveals two figures, this time in apparent air combat. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
