R {53030}{0}{<238>}{Lookout (e)}{<238>^ ^<088>}{         The view from this alcove, apparently high up in a cliff wall, is simply breathtaking. An expansive valley surrounded by enormous and nearly vertical cliffs spreads out before you. From this height you can see a small village centralized in the valley, just to the south of which is a dense forest that extends to the southern cliffs. A river or stream snakes through the valley in a westerly fashion, disappearing into what appears to be a canyon shrouded in mist. The northern part of the valley is populated by a few sparse trees and a small lake lies northwest of the village. }{Tunnels of the Rohm Giddor}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
