R {53043}{0}{}{On a branch (e)}{ }{       Perched on the branch, you imagine that you look quite silly, but more to the point, the way the branch is swaying is scaring you witless. The leaves obscure your view preventing you from seeing just how far you really are above the ground. There isn't something quite right about this part of the tree. Nailed into the branch are five tiny, pointy pegs, as though some poor innocent animal had been nailed to the branch. To the east is the relative safety of the trunk }{Evil Squirrel Tree}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
