R {53044}{0}{}{On a branch (w)}{ }{     The first thing which strikes you here is what looks like a trophy case at the far end of the branch with a collection of small skulls inside. All around green leaves shake and rustle in the wind making you decidedly uneasy and nervous.  To the west the branch leads back to the relative safety of the trunk. }{Evil Squirrel Tree}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {44649}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53045}{0}{}{A nest (d)}{ }{   Nestled between three branches sits a bird's nest. It is made of straw and twigs, and is nearly perfectly round. It is also quite large, which is pretty obvious since you are standing in it. }{The Dragonbone Chair}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
