R {53142}{0}{<238>}{-= On a secret path =- (s,n)}{<238>|@|<088>}{        -= On a secret path =- To the south is a clear view of the way you came in.  The illusion that blocks this path was only a one way illusion.  Just ahead of here along the path is a large wooden door, about six feet in diameter.  The door rests in the side of a hill, most likely the dwelling of Talbo the Hobbit.  The path is lined with impassable trees, thick with vegetation, the trees are so close together that a squirrel would even have a hard time squeezing through them. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
