R {53143}{0}{<268>}{-= Inside the home =- (ne,n,s,se)}{<268>[ ]<088>}{         -= Inside the home =- The inside of the home looks quite spacious, but feels cramped.  There is only one wall in the center that runs the length of the house, and of course the walls on the perimeter.  The ceiling is only about seven feet high, but the boards used to build the house run lengthwise giving the illusion of space.  Wall sconces hang in key intersections of the house which provides the light to this home.  A small table rests near the entrance which is void of any objects.  There are three pegs on the wall behind the door which has one coat hanging from it. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
