R {53144}{0}{<248>}{-= In the kitchen =- (ne,sw,se)}{<248>.<018>#<248>.<088>}{           -= In the kitchen =- This kitchen is possibly almost as big as the rest of the house.  The room is a round domed meeting hall.  A large table that seats about twenty people extends from the entrance towards the northeast bedroom.  Most of the chairs are stacked in the corner as they aren't really needed, there isn't a meeting right now.  Two black iron stoves sit against the wall waiting to cook a feast.  A counter sits in between the stoves which is more than ten feet long, and has more than a dozen drawers in it.  The top of the counter doesn't have anything on it right now.  A large metal pillar thicker than a cow extends up from beneath the floor, and disappears out of sight through the ceiling. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
