R {53147}{0}{<248>}{-= In the bedroom =- (sw,w)}{<248>[ ]<088>}{        -= In the bedroom =- Nestled into the hill, this small room serves as a bedroom.  The roof is lower than the rest of the house, and the entire room is smaller as well.  There is a bed of hay in the far corner covered with a heavy blanket.  Next to the bed, just out of arms' reach is a small wooden crate, with an unlit candle.  The room is very dim, almost completely dark, the only light in this room is coming from the wall sconces from the rooms to the west and southwest. }{Talbo's Forest Home}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
