R {53155}{0}{}{Pit Lord's Den (d)}{ }{         You are in the Pit Lord's den.  All around you you see nothing but lifeless corpses.  To the pit lord it looks like a sunday brunch feast. The stench in here is awful and it takes all your courage to stop from ending over and spilling your guts.  Hundreds of flies buzz around stealing what little meat they can from the corpses.  There are only two places where there is no corpse and one is where the pit lord is standing and the other is where you stand.  I'm sure the pit lord would love to fill your empty spot with your corpse.  Looking over the edge you can make out the huge pit that you had to cross to get to here. }{Hellpit}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
