R {53163}{0}{}{Everywhere (ladder)}{ }{      Around you lies everything you have ever seen, everything you have ever hoped to have seen, everything you will ever see, everything you will hope to see, everything you have ever seen without even seeing it, and everything you did not even know was possible to see.  Your vision is holding a ladder which leads down into a red darkness. }{A Spectral Warehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
