R {53165}{0}{}{Inside Your Matter}{ }{Beneath a dark ceiling of flesh waiteth you, surrounded by these brooding maroon caverns that conduct their own experi- ments upon themselves, daring you to conduct your own.  The lines of your own figure are blurred here, and strange shapes around you shiver as if discontent with your eyes.}{A Spectral Warehouse}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
