R {53190}{0}{}{A darkened entry hall (s,n)}{ }{       The darkness about you is complete, blending with the ebon walls  to form an uncertain boundary of blackness.  The glassy floor seems  to be made of obsidian with a fathomless depth to its eerie darkness.  Sconces of blackened iron reach their clawed hands from the walls at  intervals, yet the torches are strangely missing.  This unnatural  hall sends shivers down your spine and is giving you serious doubts  as to the wisdom of venturing further. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
