R {53192}{0}{}{A dark hall (n,s)}{ }{      The shadowy walls of the hall seem to writhe and twist in the  inky darkness, as if the tower itself was alive.  Shivers run  along your spine as you venture onward, searching the ebon depths  of the tower, a place no mortal has breached for centuries and  lived to tell the tale.  Just ahead you can make out the silhouette  of a stairwell leading upwards into the twisted tower. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53190}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53193}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53193}{0}{}{A winding stair (stairs,s)}{ }{     A tall winding stair leading upwards into the dark tower.  The  wide stairs wrap around a wide central pillar which seems to  rise into the dark blackness of the citadel.  The ebon walls  are seamlessly formed, almost as if they were formed from a single  giant block of black stone. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53192}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53194}{stairs}{stairs}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53194}{0}{}{A winding stair (u,s,d)}{ }{       The wide stairs meld seamlessly with the landing for this  floor of the twisted tower.  The stairs spiral both upwards  and downwards from here, though in each direction the darkness  swallows everything in its gentle embrace.  The ebon stone of  the walls glints softly in the muted torchlight from down the  hall to the south, creating a strange luminescent glow in the  stone. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53195}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53196}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53193}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53195}{0}{}{A winding stair (u,d)}{ }{     The seamless steps seem to grow from the very stone of the tower as you ascend them in the gloomy darkness.  The stairs spiral both  upwards and downwards from here, though in each direction the  darkness swallows everything in its gentle embrace.  The ebon stone of the walls glints softly in the muted light you bring with you. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53194}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53199}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53196}{0}{}{A dimly lit hall (n,s)}{ }{      The hall about you seems to absorb the meager light given off by  the flickering torches held every few feet in twisted sconces.  The  ebon stonework isn't quite as perfect here, showing small seams and  cracks in the walls and floor.  You give a silent note of thanks to  the powers above for these small imperfections\; the depth perception  they provide is well worth the loss of the eerie beauty. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53194}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
