R {53198}{0}{}{A dimly lit hall (n)}{ }{    The prison corridor comes to an end here.  The torches seem to be  more plentiful in this part of the hall, casting an almost warm  glow about the wide hall.  The cells lining each side still seem to  be empty of occupants. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
