R {53199}{0}{}{A winding stair (u,d)}{ }{      The wide stairs meld seamlessly with the landing for this  floor of the twisted tower.  The stairs spiral both upwards  and downwards from here, though in each direction the darkness  swallows everything in its gentle embrace.  The light you carry seems to be sucked in and stored by the dark ebony stone of the tower's walls. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53195}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53200}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53200}{0}{}{The top of the tower (d)}{ }{        You've come to the top of the twisted tower.  Torches ring the  massive vaulted chamber, casting flickering shadows into the  farthest corners of the hall.  The ebon walls are pierced at this  height by large windows, giving you a view of the desolate city  about you.  A chill breeze caresses your neck, sending shivers down  your spine.  You are overcome with a sense of apprehension, nearly  overwhelmed by the pulsing sense of power held here at the pinnacle  of the tower. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
