R {53203}{0}{}{SW Tencho (n,u)}{ }{     You have climbed down into a short tunnel.  Looking out of the mouth of the tunnel you can see a long and windy dirt road leading up the side of a ridge to the forecourt gate of the castle you'd kept seeing on your journey to and around the village.  You get the idea that you are nearing the end of your quest. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {35341}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
