R {53204}{0}{}{The Courtyard (s,n)}{ }{      You've wandered into the outer courtyard of the immense mountain fortress of the Emperor, Shao Khan.  This is the beginning of  the fabled Mortal Kombat.  Those who would defend their world from the conquest of the Emperor must run the gauntlet to reach the very heart of the castle, and face the greatest of Shao Khan's  warriors along the way. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53203}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53205}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53205}{0}{}{Hall of Champions (n,s)}{ }{     You stand now in the Hall of Champions, here are statues of  previous champions and other known champions, such as Sonya  Blade, Johnny Cage, Liu Kang and the rest. A life-sized statue  of Goro dominates the center of the row. This room is the second  battleground of the Tournament. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53204}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53206}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53206}{0}{}{Palace Gates (n,s)}{ }{     You stand now outside the gates of the Great Palace. The grotesquely carved walls rise up a part of the mountainside to protect those within and remind those without that they stand in the shadow of  the Emperor's evil.  You have done an excellent job reaching this  far, but be warned, it's about to get worse! }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53205}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53207}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53207}{0}{}{Throne Room (n,s)}{ }{      You've found your way to a strange throne room.  A monstrous  cavern surrounds you with the kombat run leading through it from exits in the north and south.  The cavern is decorated  lavishly, speaking of wealth and power.  But other pressing  matters urge you on, across the pit to the north and further  up the gauntlet Shao Khan has set before you. }{Mortal Kombat}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
