R {53211}{0}{}{Gym (e,s,w)}{ }{        Across the wide open space of this room, various pieces of dust covered gym equipment are spread about. Old faded mats of different colors are neatly rolled up in each corner. Dozens of jump-ropes and rotted, torn boxing gloves are attached to hooks on the left and right walls. Barbells are stacked on racks that stand against the wall. Dominating the center of the room stands a rusted, well worn trampoline. Decorating this room, championship banners hang from numerous angles from the ceiling.  }{Kareless Kanga's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
