R {53212}{0}{}{Arena (w)}{ }{      A boxing ring is located in the center of the dust covered floor of this room. Off to the right there is a speed bag hanging from a rusty swivel attached to the wall. Extra gloves hang tattered and torn from their hooks. The floor is heavily coated in a thick layer of dust. The air in this room is damp and cold. A musty smell lingers in the air making this room dismal.  }{Kareless Kanga's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
E {53211}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53213}{0}{}{Arena (e)}{ }{       You have wandered into an old fighting arena. Small and mostly barren, this room has very little to look at. Dust covers the stone walls, leaving them marked a dull grey coloring. Cobwebs hang from the ceiling littering the stale air with their musty strands. A large boxing ring is just barely visible through the gloomy patches of darkness. The cold cement floor beneath your feet is cracked and uneven.  }{Kareless Kanga's}{}{}{}{1.000}{1}
