R {53246}{0}{}{Traversing the Darkness (w,e)}{ }{You have found your way to another descending passageway. The darkness continues through this area and as you look around, you realize that you have stumbled upon the source of the dampness you have experienced throughout the passageways that lead to this point. The fire brightens the room and warms the environment around you.}{Banshee's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
