R {53247}{0}{}{Fifth level of the Banshee Lair (s,u)}{ }{You find yourself surrounded by walls that appear to be metalic. There are no markings, fixtures, or notable landmarks to be found. You have limited options - retreat from where you came or continue south to see what awaits you.}{Banshee's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
