R {53249}{0}{}{Another curve in the passage (ne,w)}{ }{The darkness continues through this area of the passageway as you approach a curve toward the west. The passage comes to an abrupt end to your east, leaving you little choice on your next steps. The area remains dark and damp here.}{Banshee's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
