R {53251}{0}{}{Maelstorm of Magical Energies (w,e)}{ }{The magical forces around you are overwhelming. You can feel the power and even see ripples of colorful light and energy floating through the air. The being that cast these spells is obviously protecting something of great value.}{Banshee's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53250}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
