R {53252}{0}{}{In a Hallway (w,e)}{ }{You find yourself wandering down a hallway and see what looks like a library further down the hall. The magical forces continue to strengthen as you continue your adventure.}{Banshee's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53250}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53253}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53253}{0}{}{In a Massive Library (e)}{ }{You've reached a dead end in the passage and arrived in what appears to be a massive library. There are shelves of books against every wall, reaching well beyond your reach. This must be the private study for the mistress of this lair. You wonder what secrets this grand library much harbour.}{Banshee's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53252}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53254}{0}{}{The Banshee's Cove (w)}{ }{You find yourself in the Banshee's private cove. This area has clearly been tucked away from all living beings to provide her with the only means of relief from her eternal torture - being away from all living beings. There is no sign of a bed, a chair, or anything that one might expect to find in a living quarters. You can see a small desk with books scattered across it, but not much more.}{Banshee's Lair}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53251}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53255}{0}{}{A darkened stairwell (u,d)}{ }{You stand on a long spiraling stairway leading downwards from  the mausoleum.  The cool stone glistens with condensation as you  journey further into the darkness beneath the earth.  You begin to  wonder what could possibly be down in the depths, beneath tons of  stone and earth.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {10407}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53256}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53256}{0}{}{The bottom of the stairs (u,n)}{ }{You feel that you've finally come to the end of the long stair. The circular walls of stone close completely about you, broken only by the spiraling stair leading upwards and a rune encrusted archway directly across from the foot of the stair.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53255}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53257}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53275}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53257}{0}{}{A small antechamber (n,s)}{ }{The dark stone which the stairwell was constructed of are combined here with a milky white stone which seems to radiate an inner light. Strange patterns of the stone adorn the walls, providing the only light in the chamber, an eerie flowing illumination, as if seen through rippling water.  Three small steps lead up from the floor into an archway in the north wall.  A second glance about the room shows you that there are tiers of stone rising from the floor, mirroring the stairs and melding seamlessly with the walls.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53256}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53258}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53258}{0}{}{The inner sanctum (s)}{ }{Immediately as you step over the threshold and into the room, you are assaulted by the sheer power residing here.  The very air seems to shimmer with it and the stones pulse in their effort to contain it.  This is the inner sanctum of the progenitors, the first who trod the path of necromancy and have given their souls to the guild so that others might share in their power.  The dark stones common here beneath the guild halls make up the walls and floor of this chamber deep within the earth.  A single band of the strange white stone rings the chamber near the rough stone ceiling, casting their eerie down from that height.  As your sense come to terms with this most ancient place of power, you notice that the only thing in the chamber is the ancient fountain and the platinum chalice on the small pedestal within it.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53257}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53259}{0}{}{Byron's Treetop Gambling Emporium (d)}{ }{                  CHING CHING CHING CHING!!!  Bells and whistles blare in your face as you enter the treehouse.  There are people playing any and every game you can think of, all crammed into a room the size of a large kitchen.  Slot machines, poker, blackjack,  roulette - you name it, Byron's Treetop Casino has it.  This place reeks of desperation and bad times gone worse.  In the corner you see a familiar old woman bumping rails off a stripper's bare ass on the bar. Wait a second...Grandma?}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {152}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53260}{0}{}{The Coatroom (door,w)}{ }{     Where the fuck is that smell coming from.  The walls are lined with cinder blocks and there is a fine tiger skin rug on the floor.  Covering the entire back wall is a coat rack full of white bahama suits.  Some of them seem a little worn while others are spattered with a sticky red substance.  In the corner there is a dented frying pan and a coil of rope.  Looking closer, there appears to be the outline of a door beneath the rug.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {152}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
