R {53262}{0}{}{The Grinder (nw,u,sw,d,e)}{ }{     Where the fuck is that smell coming from.  The walls are lined with cinder blocks and there is a fine tiger skin rug on the floor.  Covering the entire back wall is a coat rack full of white bahama suits.  Some of them seem a little worn while others are spattered with a sticky red substance.  In the corner there is a dented frying pan and a coil of rope.  Looking closer, there appears to be the outline of a door beneath the rug.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
