R {53263}{0}{}{The Executioner's Chamber (se)}{ }{     An overbearing odor of death and gore surrounds you.  As you look around this dark room you can see limbs and organs slowly being sucked into the large steel grinder in the middle of the room.  Below your feet is a conveyor belt which you stand upon that is soaked in the same blood and guts that are being fed to the grinder.  You wonder how long you have left until you meet the same fate.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53262}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53264}{0}{}{The SlaughterHouse (ne)}{ }{     There are a series of chairs lined up in the middle of the room.  They are each adorned with thick black straps on both the armrests and legs of the chairs.  Taking a closer look, you can see bits of flesh ingrained into the wood.  Chances are they're either from intense scratching and struggling--or a large object pulverized the flesh into the actual wood.  In the corner is a blood soaked cart piled high with bodies, it looks like there is room for a few more.  Lucky you.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53262}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53265}{0}{}{>>> Byron's Forge <<< (u)}{ }{    A putrid smell lingers in the air as you see the byproducts of the grinder being slowly churned in a large bloody vat in the middle of the room.  In the top corner there is a peculiar looking machine with a stone mold in the shape of a massive, somewhat human looking body.  Further down the conveyor belt you can see what appears to be completed bodies laying on their backs slowly being transported into a different room.  Whatever is going on here, you feel like this is one puzzle that is better left unsolved.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53262}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53266}{0}{}{The Assembly Line (w)}{ }{     You gaze around and turn pale at the sight of the instruments dangling from the walls.  Axes, scythes, bonesaws, mallets, and big nasty knives just to name a few.  In addition, there is a workbench with a massive  butcher, laughing maniacally, who is being showered in blood as he tears through corpse after corpse and tosses their limbs onto the conveyor belt.  You had best hope he doesn't see you in here.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53262}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53267}{0}{}{A dark and quiet wilderness (nw,d)}{ }{Tendrils of mist creep out from the darkness to curl about you.   The shadowy forest seems to close in about you, low branches  tugging at your clothes as you wander between the ancient trees.   Dark shapes flit by through the darkness, teasing your senses.   Warily you continue your way through the forest.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
