R {53269}{0}{}{Necromancer Werebeast Room (se,s)}{ }{This alcove is the private area for all werebeasts in the Necromancers' Guild.  The place smells of the forest and of dark and powerful scents.  The trees around you radiate power and portray a feeling of strength and intensity.  Many a beast travels through this place, discussing their ideas and views. The moonlight is bright here, calling forth the strength that resides deep within your soul.  The presence of the ancient spirits feels close as you can almost sense their power surrounding you.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
