R {53270}{0}{}{The Center of the Beast (n)}{ }{You come forth into a clearing within the forest.  Placed in the middle of the clearing sits a small stone well.  As you approach the well, the water ripples and the visions of the different werebeast forms appear upon the surface of the water.  As you concentrate on the appearing forms a voice fills your head telling you that this is the place where you can choose the beastly nature of your future form.  The true power of the beast lies within the soul, for each form is only your appearance.  Choose carefully though, for once chosen, there is no turning back on the beast that will inhabit your soul.  To choose your were-form, type 'choose <form>' where <form> is either wolf, tiger, jaguar, bear, panther, (tasmanian) devil, coyote, lion or fox.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53269}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53271}{0}{}{A shadowed wood (sw)}{ }{A worn path winds through the forest before you.  The starlit  trail leads into the shadow of a great stand of oak trees far ahead. You glance about to find soft tufts of grass shining faintly with  an early dew.  The stars above twinkle at you mockingly from their  heavenly perch, lighting your way as they look down upon your world.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53269}{ne}{path}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53272}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53272}{0}{}{A shadowed wood (ne,w)}{ }{You stand before a grove of towering oaks.  The ancient trees  stand as a barrier to the glen beyond.  The small trail winds its  way through the barrier of living wood.  The forest is strangely  quiet here, setting you at ease.  The soft moonlight streams down  through the leaves above, lighting your way along the path.}{Necromancers}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
