R {53322}{0}{}{Amongst the rubble. (out,n)}{ }{Bottom of the Staircase. The pieces of rubble are somewhat smaller and getting around is a little easier. The perimeter wall is almost complete here, composed from large stones which fit together seamlessly. This is probably not a good place to hang around\; suspended above you is the only remaining section of the ceiling and you can only but wonder how stable it really is. A spiral staircase winds its way up through the ceiling and looks passable. You can also follow the walls around to the east or west, and a small path leads off south through the debris towards the exit.}{Mage Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
