R {53324}{0}{}{Bottom of the Tower of the Black Pearl (out,u)}{ }{Bottom of the Tower of the Black Pearl. This room is small and dark. The walls are painted in a glistening blackness that reveals nothing. The layout of the room is one of great defensibility, anyone defending this area would be able to do so almost effortlessly. A narrow spiraling staircase leads up to the level above.}{Mage Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
