R {53325}{0}{}{Tunnel (n,stairs)}{ }{The walls and ceiling of this tunnel have been hewn out of the surrounding rock. The floor is a grated steel walkway that has been set into the rock floor. A string of worklights have been mounted on each side of the passage where the wall meets ceiling. A steep set of crystal stairs climbs into an empty, inky darkness that reach to a metal platform that appears to be hanging in the middle of nowhere. Reality seems to shift where the darkness ends and the tunnel begins.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
