R {53326}{0}{}{Main Junction (n,s,w,e)}{ }{This appears to be the main junction for this underground base. The walls and ceiling are made of a solid metal plating and the floor is grated steel. The south tunnel is hewn out of the surrounding rock and ascends slightly. The west and east tunnels are made of metal plating and the north opens up into a large room. Above each tunnel words have been painted to describe where each of them lead and everything is well lit.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
