R {53329}{0}{}{Psicorps Entrance (d)}{ }{Inky darkness surrounds the fluid metal platform that you are standing on. Ghostly landscape images fade in and out in the darkness. A set of crystal stairs wander down into what appears to be a tunnel.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
