R {53335}{0}{}{Debriefing Room (w)}{ }{Rows of chairs with small arm desks are set stadium style in this room. A overhead projector is focused on a screen in the center of the north wall while whiteboards fill up the rest of the space. A podium sits off to one side of the screen. It is here that soldiers debrief their missions in order to improve their tactical and logistical skills.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
