R {53336}{0}{}{Mess Hall (s,w,e)}{ }{Rows of wooden tables with metal legs fill this brightly lit room. Plastic formed chairs with metal legs sit around the rows of tables. A serving line runs along the north wall. A few vending machines line the east wall, leaving enough room for a doorway into the root to the east.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
