R {53337}{0}{}{Trophy Room (s,n)}{ }{This is the trophy room.  Psicorps who have captured the ears of a fallen enemy will be recorded in this room for all to see.  Do not consider it vanity, but instead, glory for the corps!  To see the trophies collected so far this boot type 'show', you can specify the granularity of the range with an argument to show, such as 'show 5' if you're a wuss like Krank.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53336}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
