R {53338}{0}{}{The PCX (se,ne,w)}{ }{The PsiCorp EXchange is operated by the Marine Corps Community Services. Various items are for sale here, oddly instead of just the standard fare of personal items, weapons, armor and ammo are also sold here. A large cage occupies the east wall and there is a half-gate opening from where the quartermaster dispense purchased merchandise.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
