R {53339}{0}{}{Common Storage Room (nw)}{ }{Tall metal shelves line the walls of this huge room. Rows of shelving units fill the rest of the room. Lights track down the aisles and movable step ladders have been provided to reach the top shelves.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
