R {53340}{0}{}{Exceptional Storage Room (sw,e)}{ }{A large cage occupies most of the room. A single half-gate splits the cage. Various weapons, armors and miscellaneous items can be seen on the vast shelving in the cage. A desk sits just inside the half-gate and it has a computer monitor on top.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
