R {53341}{0}{}{Defense Funding (w)}{ }{Posters adorn all the walls of this small room. Overhead lights focus their beams upon each of them. A TV screen hangs from the ceiling just above a small box on the floor.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53340}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53342}{0}{}{Psionic Battle Arena (n)}{ }{This room is dark except for a single light shining down on a table in the middle with two chairs facing each other.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
