R {53343}{0}{}{Training Room (sw,nw,w,e)}{ }{This large room is a very busy room. Recruits wander around training and increasing their abilities on various physical and mental devices. The sounds of physical and mental stress echo through the hallways on the west side. A small table sits near the entrance.  There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short]}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
