R {53344}{0}{}{Physical Training Room (ne)}{ }{Several treadmills, speed bags and weight machines occupy this room. A boxing ring sits dead center. The sound of physical stress and the clink of metal on metal fill the air along with the musky smell of sweat and blood.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53343}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53345}{0}{}{Mental Training Room (se)}{ }{This room is filled with chairs that have harnesses for headrests. The lights in the room have been dimmed, however, active chairs have a small, blue glow to their harnesses. Strange, almost grunting noises can be heard from time to time.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53343}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53346}{0}{}{Implant Clinic (e)}{ }{This rooms contains shelves on every wall. Each of the shelves contain psicrystals for the psionic implant module. The room is dimly lit and there is padding everywhere which dampens any noise.}{Psicorps Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53343}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

