R {53348}{0}{}{An outcropping of rock in the desert (d,n)}{ }{A large group of rocks breaks the surface of the monotonous sands of the desert.  Fremen can be seen leaving from the crag through a split that runs the height of the rocks.  The wind whips around picking sand which blasts against your stillsuit.  Large dunes can be seen all around, and a flat, smooth surface of sand lies to the north.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
