R {53349}{0}{}{Inside Sietch Tabr (se,sw,u,n,w)}{ }{You find yourself standing in the entryway to Sietch Tabr, a city in its own right, below the arid desert sands.  Moisture can be felt in the air, as a reminder that you are no longer in grips of the arid desert atmosphere.  The walls are made of stone, not man-made but not entirely natural either.  The cavern you now stand in splits off in various directions, winding out to the other branches of this vast sietch and its inhabitants.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
