E {53382}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53353}{0}{}{A winding passage (nw,e)}{ }{The passage bends gently so that it runs east and northwest.  A light from the outside can be seen coming from the east, where familiar smells from the sietch come from the northwest.  The walls of the passage have been run down by the passings of many fremen along this corridor.  The ground is also worn smooth, and there is very little sand from what you can see.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53349}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53354}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53354}{0}{}{A passage within the sietch (se,w,n)}{ }{The passage splits into three directions from here.  It moves to the north, west and southeast.  Air, carrying moisture can be felt drifting through the tunnels here.  To the north you can see the path takes a turn, as does the path to the west.  A softly glowing light can be discerned from either direction.  To the southeast you hear the normal sounds of the sietch coming from a bend in the passageway in that direction.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53353}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53355}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
