R {53355}{0}{}{A turning passageway (n,e)}{ }{The passageway takes a turn here, creating a north-east path within these rock tunnels.  You can smell the familiar scents of a fremen sietch, including the spice.  As you inhale you pause to notice a yali off to the north from here.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53354}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
