R {53356}{0}{}{A bend in the passage (s,w)}{ }{The rock hewn tunnel takes a turn to the west from here, where it leads to a fremen yali.  The solid rock walls have been made smooth by both the passage of time and fremen walking these underground paths.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
