R {53357}{0}{}{The yali of the Reverend Mother Jessica (nw,s,e)}{<cfa>J<088>}{You are in the yali of the Reverend Mother Jessica, mother of Muad'Dib.  The room is decorated with tapestries and rugs of exquisite design and detail, depicting many different eras of the fremen histories.  Glowglobes light up the yali with a soft yellow glow, illuminating the desk and seats that lay spread around the room.  There are a few jars on a shelf off to the side, and a single mirror on a bureau on one side.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
