R {53361}{0}{}{At the edge of a large cavern (sw,nw,w,n)}{ }{A vast cavern stretches out to the west.  It must be at least six hundred meters from edge to edge, and the ceiling lies so far above you that you can not see it despite the glowglobes that illuminate this gargantuan hall.  In the center of the cavern, off to the west, you can see fremen milling about, talking about the days events.  The cavern has a slightly oval shape and it looks like you could fit an army in here.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53359}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53362}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53363}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53364}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53362}{0}{}{At the edge of a vast cavern (e,w,n,nw,ne)}{ }{An immense cavern, more than five hundred meters across, lies to the north of you.  It seems to be a gathering place of some sort, with fremen wandering to and fro, talking and chatting with each other.  Off to the east you see a tunnel leading slightly downward.  Echoes fill your ears, and you notice that the ceiling can't be seen because it's so high above.  Glowglobes hover around different locations throughout the cavern, providing light where it is needed.  You hear the murmur of many voices coming from the west.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53361}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53364}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53365}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53370}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53371}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53363}{0}{}{At the north side of a large hall (sw,se,n,s)}{ }{To the south of you lies a vast cavern, over five hundred meters across.  The size of the hall overwhelms you as you survey your surroundings.  You can imagine several legions of armed soldiers fitting in this space with ease.  The ceiling can't be seen despite many glowglobes drifing around above you.  In the center, groups of fremen seem to be congregating and talking with each other.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53361}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53364}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53365}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53366}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53364}{0}{}{In the middle of the cavern (n,s,w,e)}{ }{This is the center of the immense cavern.  The walls are very distant here, and you still cannot see the ceiling.  Fremen walk around freely here, discussing pressing issues and idle gossip as well.  Some come here to post a quick note on the main board in the center and then go on about their way.  The ground is worn extremely smooth from the vast numbers of fremen who have tread here in the past.  A dry breeze brushes against the hair of your skin sending a small chill down your spine.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53361}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53363}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53362}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53365}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53365}{0}{}{On the outer rim of a large cavern (sw,e,se,ne)}{ }{Looking to the east, you see a vast cavern which stretches more than five hundred meters across.  Fremen can be seen milling about the center of the cavern, talking and mingling with each other.  This cavern seems to be a central location for the sietch, and it could certainly serve as a gathering area for large amounts of people.  The wall to the west is smooth, with a small passageway leading around to the southwest.  The ceiling at the edge here begins to disappear high up above the glowglobes, which drift around the room aimlessly.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53364}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53363}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53369}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53362}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53366}{0}{}{A sloping tunnel (sw,s,out)}{ }{The tunnel slopes gently upward to the north and stretches off farther than the limits of your vision.  Another passage can be seen to the southwest.  The walls here aren't as well-worn as those of the rest of sietch, indicating that this is a path less travelled by the fremen.  A solitary glowglobe sits here, providing luminescence for the area around you.  In the distance to the south, you see a very large cavern.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53363}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53367}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53368}{out}{out}{0}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53367}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53366}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53368}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {53369}{0}{}{A small shop selling fremen goods (ne)}{ }{A small shop has sprung up in this area of the tunnel, providing a variety of different fremen items for sale.  There are some rugs and tapestries hanging of a few of the walls, and the smell of the store carries the scent of new items.  There is a sign, above a small stone counter, displaying the items that are for sale in this shop.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53365}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53370}{0}{}{The sietch common arsenal (w)}{ }{All types of equipment adorn the room, from armour to weapons to even handkerchiefs. This is a collection of fremen common equipment, overseen by the Shadout Goerl.  There is a counter here where fremen can borrow and donate equipment to the arsenal. The rocky walls glow with the bright white light that emanates from the glowglobes that light this area up.  A few fremen hang around idly discussing how and where they found their current horde of equipment.  There is a big sign on the wall.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53362}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53371}{0}{}{An underground bar (e)}{ }{As you enter this room, you notice the sedate atmosphere and sounds of quiet voices.  You find yourself relaxing, finally having found a place where you are not constantly being jostled and pushed.  This is quite a contrast to the busy streets of the bazaar in the city of Arrakeen.  Many fremen are relaxing and enjoying a bit of R and R.  There's a sign behind a rock counter, where a man wipes glasses clean.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53362}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53372}{0}{}{A passageway deep in the sietch (sw,se)}{ }{The passage takes a turn here, giving it almost a u-shape.  An odd light illuminates the area around you, allowing you to see that you are not in the normal type of tunnel or passage.  The walls are further apart here, and the ceiling is further above your head, allowing for more people, or perhaps something larger to travel through these tunnels.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53360}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53373}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53373}{0}{}{A curving tunnel (sw,nw)}{ }{The passage takes a turn here, creating an elbow-shapped curve.  It leads to the northwest and the southwest from here.  An odd light fills the tunnel with an eerie kind of glow.  You notice that the passageways here are different than those of the rest of the sietch, somewhat foreign even.  The walls are not smooth like most, but still are made from the same rock that is the sietch.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53372}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53374}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53572}{se}{hide;enter}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53374}{0}{}{A rocky stairway (d,ne)}{ }{This passage ends at the head of a rocky stairway, carved out of the stone.  The stairs descend down into a lower level, from which you can feel more moisture than in the upper levels.  The walls are illuminated by a glowglobe that hangs above you, humming almost quietly in the air.  You can hear some echoes coming from below, but you can't make out the sounds for what they are.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53373}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53375}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53375}{0}{}{Ancient stone stairs (u,s)}{ }{You are at the bottom of a set of ancient stone stairs, seemingly a natural formation within the sietch.  The walls are still a little bit rough, despite the use of these stairs over the years.  You can hear water dripping off in the distance, and the moisture in the air is noticeably greater here.  To the south you notice a soft glow coming from down the passage in that direction.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53374}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53376}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53376}{0}{}{Ancient stone stairs (n)}{ }{You stand before a vast lake of water deep under the sietch.  The entire sietch has taken ages to collect this water, and it is guarded by the watermaster for the sietch, who is never absent from the lake area.  The water stretches so far that you can not see the other side of the cave, despite the best efforts of the glowglobe drifting above your head.  The air is very moist here, saturated with water, and you can even hear the droplets of some water off in the distance.  There are some runes to one side of you, next to a rack of water containers.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53375}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53377}{0}{}{The yali of Akkar (n,s,w)}{<cfa>A<088>}{Inside this fremen yali, you can see only the bare essentials.  A small wooden table sits in the middle with a half dozen seat pillows around it.  The walls have only a few of the tapestries and fremen rugs that you see in other yalis within the sietch.  Akkar, being a zensunni philosopher has made sure that the layout of the room causes one to pause and then reflect upon the surroundings.  The yali looks comfortable overall, and you think that anyone could feel at home here.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53350}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53379}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53380}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53378}{0}{}{A passage with a bend in it (n,e)}{ }{The passageway bends here, leading north and east.  The smell of dry, musty stone reaches your nostrils, making you feel at home within these caverns.  The walls have been worn smooth from the many different fremen who have passed this way over the years.  To the north, you can see the path that leads back to the main entryway for the sietch.  To the east, the passage takes another turn, and a soft glow can be seen around the bend.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53350}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53379}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53379}{0}{}{A corner within the sietch (n,w)}{ }{The path leads north and west from here, creating an elbow-like shape in the tunnel.  The walls are worn smooth from the years of fremen passing by.  You can still see jagged edges here and there jutting out from the rock.  To the north you see a fremen yali with glowglobes creating a soft glow around it.  To the west you notice the passage turns to the north eventually.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53378}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53377}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53380}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53377}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53381}{0}{}{A large area filled with battle equipment (s)}{ }{From the looks of it, you're standing in the middle of a large battle training room.  Fremen come here to hone their skills to the maximum.  The most prominent thing in the room is the trainer in the middle of the room.  The walls have been marred by something that creates gouges and deep slices.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53352}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53382}{0}{}{A branching passageway (ne,w,n)}{ }{The passage branches off into three different directions.  To the west lies the hall that leads to the main cavern and the rest of the sietch.  The northeast you can see a yali, and to the north there's a glow emanating from that path.  You can hear some harsh voices coming from the north and northeast.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53352}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53383}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53384}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53383}{0}{}{The yali of Otheym, Fedaykin Commando (sw,n,w)}{<cfa>O<088>}{This is the yali of the legendary Otheym, one of the most devout of the Fedaykin commandos as well as one of the first.  Many different tools, designed for training the deadly Fedaykin, can be seen in this yali.  Glowglobes light up the area for you to see, and you notice some of the beautiful, yet disturbingly morbid tapestries which line some of the walls of the yali.  A small table sits against one side of the yali with some of the teachings of Muad'Dib strewn amongst other hand-written notes.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53382}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53385}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53384}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53384}{0}{}{A turn in the tunnel (s,e)}{ }{The tunnel runs south and east from here, creating an elbow-shaped turn.  The walls are made from solid rock and have seen a lot of wear during their time.  Smooth spots are frequently visible along the bend of the wall, as well as some still-jagged pieces of stone jutting out. To the east you can see the soft glow of light, and to the south the tunnel appears to split further along.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53382}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53383}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53385}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53383}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53386}{0}{}{A Cosy Closet (e)}{ }{A Cosy Closet. This is a small alcove set to one side of the main entrance hall to the guild rooms. There is a small magical box here which appears to be able to contain a tremendous amount of equipment. By placing items in the box, Mages can store things for their later use or for assisting other members of the guild.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53284}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53387}{0}{}{A Dusty Alcove (w)}{ }{A Dusty Alcove. There are two alcoves set to the sides of the main entrance hall, this one and another symmetrically opposite. There is a small box here which serves as a place to store disjunction items collected by mages all over the Three Kingdoms.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53284}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53388}{0}{<118>}{}{ }{}{}{}{}{}{1.000}{}

R {53389}{0}{}{Harthearvorin's Shop (s)}{ }{Harthearvorin's Shop. This is the Mages Guild main shop and Guild bank.  It sells things a mage might find useful and also serves as a place where you may donate money for less fortunate mages. There is a total of 2126040339 coins in storage. Type 'list' to see what is available. You can also type: buy <#> <item>, like: buy 12 7 to buy 12 of #7. You can 'donate' or 'withdraw' money.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53284}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53390}{0}{}{Inside the main guild room (u,d,n,w,e)}{ }{In a magnificent hall. You have stepped into a magnificent shining hall. Above you at a great height is a domed ceiling. The floor is made out of thousands of small stone tiles, each of them sparkling with a magical shine. At the center of the room is a onyx brazier holding a strange blue flame which seems to respond to your movement. The granite walls surrounding the hall are inset with many white pillars reaching to support the dome above. In the northern end of the hall you see a pure white stair leading up to the levels above you, and beyond that what appears to be the entrance to a shop. There are two small alcoves to the east and west.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53284}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53391}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53392}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53393}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53394}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53391}{0}{}{The Library and Observatory (d)}{ }{The Library and Observatory. Magnificent hardwood bookshelves line the walls. Volumes and volumes of collected knowledge, more than you can easily count. Some of the books describe the most fantastic beasts as recalled by mages after their adventures in the realms, some seem so incredible the stories are hard to believe. Other books describe recipes for incantations, or simply the historical recollections of the world. In the center of the room is a huge telescope.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53390}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53392}{0}{}{Deep inside the mage guild (s,w)}{ }{Deep inside the mage guild. As you enter this quiet study your nostrils are filled with the scent of burning wood. You hear it crackle and as your eyes adjust themselves to the dim light, you see an old fireplace in the northeast corner of the room. It sheds flickering light across the room, making everything dance in the light of its flames. The walls are covered with books of all different kinds and you recognize a lot of them from when you were first taught the art of magic. None of the books appear to be of great value and you realize that this is just a small study. A small stairway leads up to the west to what appears to be a small balcony. As you gaze at it, you see faint daylight, but you will have to move closer in order to make anything out. The floor is covered by a red velvet carpet and it strikes you as slightly odd considering the main guild room was in white marble. Standing in the southwestern corner is a big comfortable chair.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53390}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53395}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53393}{0}{}{Swirling Vapors (e)}{ }{Swirling Vapors. You stand on the edge of the world, behind you the warmth of the mage tower and in front of a mass of swirling vapors and clouds from another world or other dimension. Clearly a tremendous spell has been cast to bring this link into existance. Now and again, small objects such as pebbles and stones are flung from the vapors and clatter to the floor. You wonder if this room is part of the construction of the wonderful telekinesis or secure shelter spells, linking this existence with another plane.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53390}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53394}{0}{}{The Bright Sunroom (w)}{ }{The Bright Sunroom. The walls of this room radiate a bright white light, almost as if you were sitting in the very center of the sun itself. The glow is also warm, and beads of perspiration begin to form on your forehead. In the exact center of the room, someone has placed a large journal, in which mages scribble messages to one another. Painted on the north wall is a lovely mural of a peaceful town. A number of huge couches and an ornate rocking chair are placed around the room, and give it a comfortable feeling. This is a nice place to relax and chat with friends.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53390}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53395}{0}{}{On a small balcony (e)}{ }{As you step out from the darkness in the study, your body is engulfed in warm and bright sunlight. For a moment your eyes becomes watery but in seconds your sight returns to normal. The balcony is made out of white marble and feels warm at your touch. You gaze at the wonderful view that is before you and it is truly breathtaking. To the east you see the small staircase leading back down into the tower itself.}{$area}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53392}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53396}{0}{}{Top of the Tower of the Platinum Star}{ }{You are in the inner sanctum of the Platinum Star. You can rest here if you desire, or leave items for your other School members. No one but other members of your school can get here. A small spiral staircase winds down through the floor to the level below.}{Mage Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53316}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53397}{0}{}{Top of the Tower of the Tyrian Vines (d)}{ }{Top of the Tower of the Tyrian Vines. You are in the inner sanctum of the Tyrian Vines. You can rest here if you desire, or leave items for your other School members. No one but other members of your school can get here. A small spiral staircase winds down through the floor to the level below.}{Mage Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53318}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

