R {53402}{0}{}{Top of the Tower of the Black Pearl (d)}{ }{Top of the Tower of the Black Pearl. You are in the inner sanctum of the Black Pearl. You can rest here if you desire, or leave items for your other School members. No one but other members of your school can get here. A small spiral staircase winds down through the floor to the level below.}{Mage Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53324}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

