E {53461}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53463}{0}{}{A confusing underwater ruin}{ }{The water is calm within the ancient stone walls of the some sort of building.  Small particles float in the water, drifting to and fro and making it more difficult to see.  The water shifts behind you, but when you swivel around there is nothing there.  You think you could squeeze through gaps in the stone to the north and to the south.}{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
