R {53466}{0}{}{A confusing underwater ruin}{ }{The cold, stone walls seem to be very close here, pushing in on you and making it hard to find your way.  Small particles float in the water, drifting to and fro and making it more difficult to see.  It is hard to tell up from down, let alone determine which way you came from.  You think you could squeeze through gaps in the stone to the south and above you.}{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
