R {53467}{0}{}{Deep in some underwater ruins (u,d,e,out)}{<faa>O<088>}{The walls around you are slowly crumbling away, but there is still enough of a shell standing to make swimming through the ancient building difficult.  Small particles float in the water, drifting to and fro and making it more difficult to see.  You think you see something dart past a small hole in the wall, but it is gone before you can focus on it.  You think you could squeeze through gaps in the stone to the east, above you and below you.  There is a large fissure in the stone leading back into the ocean, which might be a good idea before you get lost in this building.}{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
