R {53469}{0}{}{Deep in some underwater ruins (out,d)}{ }{The walls around you are slowly crumbling away, but there is still enough of a shell standing to make swimming through the ancient building difficult.  Tiny blemishes in the stone reflect your light, making the walls sparkle.  Strange burbling sounds ripple through the building, echoing off the walls.  You think you could squeeze through a gap in the stone below you.  A large fissure, similar to the one where you entered the building, has formed in the stone here, allowing you an escape route.  It is too dark to see what lies beyond, however.}{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
