R {53471}{0}{}{The Sunken City of Cowtopia (u,n,s,e,w)}{ }{What was once the center of the great city of Cowtopia is now nothing more than a mess of ruined buildings lying buried in the sand.  Far above, you can see the dome arcing up to its apex, covered in cracks.  The ruins stretch out across the ocean floor in all directions.}{CowVille}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
