R {53500}{0}{}{Near the edge of a forest (e,w)}{<ffc>Y<088>}{Still dark and stormy, your travels have brought you to the edge of the forest. No longer the straight and narrow path, you must choose to travel north or return east. Further to the north lies the base of the mountain, and it looks like the rain is clearing up to the east.}{Forest of Charms}{kill squirrel}{}{}{1.000}{}
