R {53501}{0}{}{The southwest edge of a forest (e,n)}{ }{You've reached the western side of the forest. The storm is still underway, but you feel it mustn't be too much longer until you're clear of it. Raindrops puddle and collect onto the nearby drooping leaves. If you were thirsty, you could simply sip the rain. The path continues north, or you can return south from whence you came.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
