R {53502}{0}{}{The edge of a forest (s,n)}{ }{You've reached the northwestern edge of the forest. The storm is letting up, thankfully, and before you stands a beautiful mountain. The climb looks steep and treacherous though, with jagged and uneven rocks lying ahead as your only path up the mountain.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
