R {53503}{0}{}{The northwest edge of a forest, at the base of a mountain (s,e)}{ }{Despite traversing the jagged and uneven rocks upon the mountain path, you're still quite taken aback by the beautiful scenery that surrounds you. The rain has subsided, and the trees are a glorious teal color, with the dark blue sky in the distance distracting you each time you happen to glance up. Glancing at the rocks beneath your feet, they shift and roll with every step you take.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
