R {53504}{0}{}{Climbing a mountain, near the edge of a forest (w,e)}{ }{Still traveling on this mountain, the uneven path underfoot threatens to trip you. It would be terrible to fall and twist your ankle at this point. As your potential demise creeps into your thoughts, you begin to keep an eye out for a sturdy stick in case it may help keep your balance.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
