E {53505}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53505}{0}{}{Still climbing a mountain (w,e)}{ }{The terrain underfoot is becoming smaller rocks, you surmise it's probably due to gravity. The mountain itself is quite tall, rather quiet, and a sense of peace washes over you. With the peak of the mountain in sight, and your confidence on the rise for nearly completing such a feat, you realize your pace is quickening.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53504}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53506}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53506}{0}{}{Near the top of a mountain (w,e)}{<cff>B<088>}{Climbing to the top of this mountain was quite the arduous journey, but you've made it! You pause to take a look at your surroundings, turning to face each direction, and allow the feeling of peace and tranquility to wash over you while marveling at the beautiful colors of the forest, sky, and the ground below. The bright moon, filling the sky above with a soft luminescent glow.}{Forest of Charms}{snatch moon}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53505}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53483}{e}{slide down}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53507}{0}{}{Glimmering clearing (s,portal)}{ }{The air shimmers with ethereal light as you enter a vast clearing. Tiny specks of iridescent dust dance in the gentle breeze, casting a soft glow upon the landscape. Vibrant flowers sway in harmony with the melody of the wind, their petals painted in hues unseen in the mortal realm. Trees, adorned with sparkling leaves of spun gold and silver, whisper secrets to the passing breeze.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53495}{n}{portal}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53508}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53508}{0}{}{Glimmering clearing (s,portal)}{ }{As you traverse the path, you find yourself immersed in a realm of wonders. The ground beneath your feet feels alive, carpeted with plush moss that springs back with each step. Above, a canopy of shimmering leaves creates a kaleidoscope of color, their hues shifting with the gentle ebb and flow of magic. The air is alive with the soft hum of faerie wings, as unseen creatures flit from flower to flower, tending to their enchanting creations.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53507}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53509}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53509}{0}{}{A path through a realm of wonders (se,n)}{ }{You stumble upon a hidden glen, nestled within the faerie realm. Tall grasses sway in silent invitation, their emerald blades woven with threads of spun silver. Sunlight filters through the dense foliage above, casting dappled patterns of light and shadow upon the forest floor. The air is filled with the sweet scent of blossoms, mingled with the faintest hint of magic, as if the very essence of enchantment lingers in every breath.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53508}{nw}{nw}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53510}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53510}{0}{}{A hidden glen beckons with whispered promises (e,nw)}{ }{Before you lies a tranquil pond, its surface mirror-smooth and clear as crystal. Around its edges, delicate flowers bloom in a riot of colors, their vibrant petals dipping gracefully into the water below. The pond, reflecting the verdant beauty of the surrounding forest, captures the surreal landscape in its shimmering depths. Ethereal creatures flit about, their iridescent wings leaving trails of sparkling light in their wake.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53509}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53511}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53511}{0}{}{A tranquil pond (ne,w)}{ }{Within this enchanted grove, whispers of magic fill the air like an intoxicating perfume. Trees, their trunks adorned with delicate ribbons of silver and gold, stand sentinel over the lush undergrowth. The ground is carpeted with a tapestry of wildflowers, each bloom pulsing with vibrant energy. Sunbeams filter through the dense foliage above, casting a warm, golden glow upon the enchanted scene.}{Forest of Charms}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53510}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53512}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53512}{0}{}{Enchanted grove (n,sw)}{ }{As you step into this realm of dreams, a sense of wonder washes over you like a gentle tide. Trees, their branches entwined with shimmering strands of spun silver, reach toward the sky in silent supplication. The ground beneath your feet is soft and yielding, carpeted with a layer of plush moss that cushions each step. Fairies, their wings aglow with soft, iridescent light, flit about in a graceful ballet, weaving intricate patterns in the air.}{Forest of Charms}{kill thorn guardian}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53511}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53513}{0}{}{The northeast edge of a forest (w,s)}{<fcf>P<088>}{Such a fun little escapade and adventure you've found! The sound of the rushing waterfall, or milkfall, from the ledge that you're currently standing underneath is almost deafening, but the thrill of the exploration makes it all worthwhile. The area is very similar to the rivers edge you were just at, rocks lie here and there with a few boulders closer to the damp rock face. One large boulder is propped against the southeastern side of the ledge.}{Forest of Charms}{sr rocks 2x (1st is bag, 2nd is charm)}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53488}{ne}{ne}{3}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53490}{se}{se}{6}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53514}{0}{}{Wickwood Forest (n)}{ }{The trail appears to dead-end between the mountains, where the mountainside walls are smooth and unadorned. The only way forward is to travel northeast and explore a different path.}{Stonemaze Pass}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
