R {53569}{0}{}{Temple hall of Elements (e,n,w,s)}{ }{You walk further along up the temple corridor.  You have the strange feeling that someone is watching your every move but you cannot be all that positive of it.  Voices sound out from the north but you see only the corridor wall.  A magical mist looms overhead just below the ceiling, and you feel the power pulsating from it.}{Elemental Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
