R {53570}{0}{}{Temple hall of Elements (e,n,w,s)}{ }{The walls of the hall are made from solid stone.  Energy mists swirl about your head on the ceiling of the room.  Only the sound of silence can be heard in the hallway.  You marvel at the pure divine beauty of the temple hallway.  Mystical runes and etchings are engraved into the walls that glow with a magical aura.  They provide the only visible light that you can see in the room.}{Elemental Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53569}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53571}{0}{}{Temple hall of Elements (e,n,w,s)}{ }{The corridor ends here with only a northern and western exit.  The serene environment around you is quiet, and the silence is golden.  The walls of the hallway have many runes and markings scribed up along them, and they glow with a magical blue aura that provides light for the room.  The mists again are above your head enshrouding the full view of the ceiling.  You wonder why this mist seems to be everywhere you go.}{Elemental Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53568}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53572}{0}{}{Windtrap Shaft (out)}{ }{You find yourself standing at the edge of a vast dark shaft which sinks vertically down into shadows beneath your feet. This must be the main air passage leading from the guild windtraps on the surface to the sietch's water condensor array. The air in this place feels thick with moisture and is being drawn inexorably downward into the gaping void below. The rock walls feel smooth, slippery and damp and quite cold to the touch. You spot a very narrow ledge leading south around the edge of the shaft into the darkness.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53373}{nw}{out}{9}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53573}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53573}{0}{}{Forgotten Tunnel (n)}{ }{You are standing in a short section of tunnel heading southwest away from the air shaft. At some point the ceiling has collapsed a short distance from where you're standing, leaving this small section cut off from whatever lies further to the southwest.  The rock rubble evidently spilled down over a large pile of all manner of boxes, crates, containers and discarded equipment, all of which are now scattered across the room.}{Fremen Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53572}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53574}{0}{}{Jedi Guild Room (s)}{ }{You've entered the Academy gymnasium.  All sorts of equipment fills the room for you to hurt your body on in an attempt to improve your strength, stamina and quickness.  Jedi often visit this room to relax from the rigors of their Force training with the simplicity of lifting weight or other exercise.  There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short]}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19777}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53575}{0}{}{The Academy Armory (w)}{ }{A spacious room smelling of oiled leather, metal polish and the faint wisp of a portable furnace used in mending armour and other weapons.  Decorative armours from ancient civilizations hang from the walls and ceiling, leaving little doubt in your mind as to this room's use.  A small counter separates the front of the armoury from the storage area.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19777}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53576}{0}{}{Second Floor of the Academy (e,s,w,u,d,n)}{ }{A small shop tucked into the southern portion of the pyramid. This little establishment is run by the Academy to provide its  members with some of their needs when traveling the worlds of the  New Republic.  A small sign hangs above the counter which has a  list of items the shop stocks.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19777}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53577}{0}{}{Third floor of the Academy (e,w,s,n,d,u)}{ }{Arriving on the third floor of the pyramid, you find yourself in a strangely silent area.  The stone floors are bare, but the walls are hidden behind banners taken from the old days of the republic as well as key pennants of the rebellion.  Several halls lead off this center hub, and you know that all of them lead to the quarters of the Jedi masters of the Academy.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19777}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53578}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53579}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {53580}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53578}{0}{}{Third floor of the Academy (e,w,s,n,d,u)}{ }{You've wandered into the library of the Jedi Academy.  The chamber is far larger than you would have guessed from the other rooms on this level, extending around the perimeter of the pyramid, between other chambers and the outer walls.  Several tables and chairs make the room seem more comfortable than the stone of the temple normally allows for.  The walls are covered with scroll and tome laden shelves.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53577}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53579}{0}{}{A quiet chamber (w)}{ }{This chamber was once a place of quiet reflection for the Jedi. Now it sits abandoned, serving no purpose other than to collect dust. Some still come to sit here and relax in the silence, but the old ways of purging the Dark Sides influence through meditation are no longer practiced here.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53577}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53580}{0}{}{The top of the temple (d)}{ }{You stand atop the giant pyramid, basking in the sunlight under the glow of the planet Yavin high above you.  The tops of the jungle trees stretch out like a green carpet from the small clearing about the academy.  A small altar rises from the smooth stone near the front face of the temple to greet the gas giant as it rises in the morning over the moon's horizon.  A small stairwell leads back into the temple.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {53577}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53581}{0}{}{Light Board Room (n)}{ }{Down here, below the main training levels of the Academy are the barracks where the students live and sleep when not busy at their studies.  Because of the busy regimen of Academy life, many students find it hard to keep up with all the activities of their friends and fellow students.  To help them keep in touch with other Jedi, a bulletin board has been put up at the bottom of the stairs where all Jedi's may check for messages after a days work, or just before beginning their studies for the day.}{Jedi}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {19778}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {53582}{0}{}{Threshold of Destiny (e,w,light,leave)}{ }{You find yourself standing in a grand vestibule, a junction between two opposing forces that shape the destiny of the zodiac. To the northeast, an illuminated passage beckons. The walls are adorned with symbols of honor and valor, and a faint hymn of triumph echoes from beyond. To the southwest, a corridor shrouded in shadows and an icy chill is blocked by a shimmering force field.}{Celestial Zodiacs}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
