R {53583}{0}{}{Shrine of Celestial Grace (w)}{ }{You stand within a beautiful shrine dedicated to Aeonos, the god of light and mercy. Energy flows through every inch of the chamber, the crystalline walls glimmer with starlight, and celestial ley lines hum peacefully. Here, the souls of the fallen celestials may be offered in exchange for favor, granting redemption to those who seek it. At the center hovers a radiant pedestal, surrounded by bright light that warms the soul. A shimmering note rests on its surface.}{Celestial Zodiacs}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
