R {53584}{0}{}{Shrine of Celestial Eclipse (e)}{ }{You enter a shadowed shrine, the walls glitter faintly with broken starlight, intertwined with ley lines shifting like living shadows. Here, the souls of those slain by hatred and malice may be offered in exchange for power, granting a closer step towards corruption with those who seek it. At the heart of the chamber floats a darkened pedestal, its eerie glow intensifying as you approach. A blackened note rests on its surface.}{Celestial Zodiacs}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
