R {53997}{0}{}{}{ }{The interior of Charley's features a bright, functional, fast-food aesthetic with limited, shared seating. The primary visual element is the open grill, where the made-to-order cheesesteaks are prepared in full view of the customer, adding a sense of freshness and activity. A cashier waits behind a sign and cash register, ready to take your money.}{Chaos Mall Food Court}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
