R {53998}{0}{}{}{ }{Above the pretzel logo is a sign that reads, 'Hot, Fresh, and Handmade.' A promise of everything you might look for in an oversized pretzel purchased at a shopping mall. Above that, a display case, featuring a row of presumably hot, fresh, and handmade wares. Unfortunately, the employees have disappeared into the greedy gullet of some bourgeoisie asshat. Either that, or they've simply quit. Or called in sick.}{Chaos Mall Food Court}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
