R {54078}{0}{}{Before a grand marble archway (s,n)}{ }{A grand marble archway leads into the Crab Queen's domain. The scent of brine and incense permeates the air. Tiny crabs skitter sideways beneath the threshold. On the breeze you can hear the ebb and flow of the tide along the shore. Dare you venture further?}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {14039}{s}{s}{4}{1}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {54079}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54079}{0}{}{In a narrow courtyard (s,n)}{ }{You're in a narrow courtyard, the floor and walls hewn of marble. The scent of brine fades as the smell of incense overpowers the area. The breeze is hardly present in here, as if stifled by all the marble. To the south stands the grand marble archway that leads back out, the tiny crabs venturing no further than the threshold to the courtyard. At the center of the courtyard stands a red, man-sized statue in the shape of a defiant-looking crab. You could venture north to go further inside.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54078}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {54080}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54080}{0}{}{Approaching the pit (e,w,s,n)}{ }{You're in a narrow courtyard, the floor and walls hewn of marble. The scent of brine fades as the smell of incense overpowers the area. The breeze is hardly present in here, as if stifled by all the marble. To the south stands the grand marble archway that leads back out, the tiny crabs venturing no further than the threshold to the courtyard. At the center of the courtyard stands a red, man-sized statue in the shape of a defiant-looking crab. You could venture north to go further inside.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
