R {54081}{0}{}{Approaching the pit (e,w,s,n)}{ }{A majestic stairwell has been extracted from a gigantic plinth of solid marble. Marble! The steps, the floor, the walls, all of it... marble! Geez. Footsteps clack in here like hollow-shelled crab legs. Leading up, the stairwell is wide enough for at least three humans - or one human-sized crab - to ascend abreast each other.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54080}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {54088}{u}{u}{16}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54082}{0}{}{The Chamber of Preparation (e)}{ }{The Chamber of Preparation might better be described as the Chamber of Disappointment, for everything about this space seems less opulent than the surrounding area. The marble seems less polished, the two torches abutting the entryway providing sparse if functional lighting. A squat ceiling seems designed to keep visitors of this square-shaped chamber humbly bowing low, or crawling about on all fours, if they wish to access what meager spoils lay within. Speaking of spoils, a pile of ceremonial garb and strange crab-themed decorations litters the center of the space. You might consider sifting through and seeing what you want to keep.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54080}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54083}{0}{}{Inside the pit (s,n,nw,ne)}{ }{You're at the south end of an arena of sorts. Half-filled stands rise up around the perimeter, fashioned from giant blocks of solid marble (of course). A densely packed layer of sand covers the extent of the arena floor, reminding you of nothing so much as a play lot for toddlers. But there's no children here, only the occasional awkward contestant ready to vie for special favor. The smell of air-dried ocean wafts up from the sand, an unpleasant mixture of salt and dead sea matter. You half expect to see dead crabs littering the floor, but no! The only visible blemish upon the flat, packed sand is a confusing mess of human-sized prints.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54080}{s}{s}{4}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {54084}{n}{n}{1}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
