R {54088}{0}{}{At the crest of a majestic stairwell (w,d)}{ }{At the crest of the majestic marble stairwell, one is afforded a spectacular view of a tiered, open-air coliseum. Spectators gather, seated or standing on tiered steps. To the west is an elevated viewing platform where some aristocratic sorts have gathered to watch whatever festivities may be planned.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54081}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {54089}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54089}{0}{}{An opulent platform overlooking the pit (e,corridor)}{ }{This opulent platform overlooks the arena pit where all of the contestants crabwalk for the favor of the Crab Queen, and ostensibly whatever gods are watching as well. The centerpiece of the platform is a lounge chaise sofa covered in soft cushions and jewel-encrusted pillows. A small semi-circle of sycophants rings the sofa and its regal occupant, though all are notably careful not to obstruct the view of the action. Further back from the sofa and sycophants, abandoned goblets litter the wine-stained marble floor. Further back still, servants scuttle to and fro from a narrow service corridor, bearing plates of finger foods and freshly-filled goblets of wine.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54088}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
