R {54095}{0}{}{}{ }{The corridor slopes downward, then flattens out inside a cool, dimly lit room that resembles a cellar. Reinforcing that impression are the rows of barrels stacked alongside the east and west walls, each of which contain various foodstuffs. The occasional servant wanders in and out, studiously ignoring anything and anybody who might interfere with their tasks, most of which seem to be centered on a long counter at the south end of the room.}{Marble Plinths}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
