R {54102}{0}{}{A cold, sterile elevator (w)}{ }{You stand in a cold, sterile elevator. The walls are covered with stainless steel panels that give off a hazy reflection of your form lit by the ultra-white flourescent lighting. On the wall next to the door is a touch screen panel showing a directory listing with which floors the various departments of the Cybernetic Research Corporation are on.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
