R {54103}{0}{}{C.R.C. Enrollment Operations (e)}{ }{The basement level of the Cybernetic Research Corporation compound is home to the Enrollment Operations department. This is where people can come to gain more information about becoming a Cyborg, and ultimately, if they decide to embark on this journey of transformation, and if the C.R.C. sees them as a fit candidate, they can do so. The room itself is very cold and sterile, with stainless steel walls and furniture. Sitting in the center is a small touch-screen terminal that should provide all the information a candidate needs about becoming a Cyborg. If for some reason you wish to leave the guild, you will need to type 'I wish to quit the cyborgs.'. Be warned, this could prove fatal.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54102}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

