R {54105}{0}{}{C.R.C. Operating Room (e)}{ }{This the the O.R. within the Cybernetic Research Corporation. It doesn't look like a conventional hospital operating room, rather a portion of it greatly resembles an assembly factory. Large robotic arms are stationed at the four corners of the operating table to assist the surgeon with the installation of implants. The usual medical monitors are also present, as well as monitors for electronics and computer diagnostics. This is where it all takes place, the blending of man and machine.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54104}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

