R {54107}{0}{}{Cyborg Advancement Room}{ }{This is the Training department of the C.R.C. where cyborgs come to both train their meat bodies and their meat minds. There is a section of gym equipment to work on muscle strength, and speed, and also a section with research terminals to study various methods of increasing intelligence and knowledge.  There's a small placard here. Commands: advance [level,str,con,int,wis,dex,cha]           cost, tally, required, questansi,           list [name -or- # -or- short]}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
