R {54109}{0}{}{C.R.C. Maintenance Department (e)}{ }{You've stepped out of the elevator into the Maintenance Department. This is a sparkling clean room that's walls are covered with racks of tools and various other instruments. In the center of the room stands a glowing super power conduit.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
