R {54111}{0}{}{C.R.C. Communications Department (e)}{ }{The C.R.C. communications department houses all the equipment used for connecting those with a S.I.N.C. installed to the researchers and each other. There is also a message terminal here so that cyborgs can post information that others will find useful or interesting.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
