R {54113}{0}{}{C.R.C. Finance Department (e)}{ }{This is the C.R.C. Finance Department. This is where matters of funding your future implants are dealt with. It is a small office area with several terminals to aid in exchanging Pinnacle Bank Coins to Cyborg Credits, the currency used by the C.R.C. to fund new implants.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
