R {54117}{0}{}{C.R.C. R&D Department (e)}{<cfb>7-RD<088>}{You've stepped out of the elevator and into the C.R.C. Research and Development Department, easily the most hustling and bustling of all the floors at the C.R.C. The floor is alive with scientists, doctors, and engineers running back and forth with bleeding-edge cybernetic creations. This is where a cyborg should come for info on the latest and greatest in the world of cybernetics. It is also a great place to pitch an idea to one of the scientists in the R&D department. In fact there seems to be a message terminal set up in one corner for just that purpose. A small door leads north.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
