R {54125}{0}{}{The roof of the Cybernetic Research Corporation (e)}{<cfb>R<088>}{You are standing on the roof of the the C.R.C. skyscraper. From up here you can see all of Pinnacle. This is clearly the tallest building in the town. It actually sticks out like a sore thumb since it looks like it belongs in a large metropolitan area, rather than a small town. There is a deployment pad here next to a transport terminal.}{Cyborg Guild}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
