R {54158}{0}{}{A Secret Lagoon (e)}{ }{A secure lagoon in the midst of a rainforest. A waterfall is seen here. You feel tempted to enter the warm waters of the lagoon and take a dip. A large tree grows east of here. The sun shines brightly upon the ground. You are surrounded by bushes of roses which grow wild. You feel at peace inside the lagoon. The sounds of exotic birds can be heard admist the trees. You wish to sooth yourself within the waters that are here. You are wafted by the scent of flowers which grow all around you. by the scent of flowers which grow all around you.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54143}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54159}{0}{}{}{ }{A magnificent garden. An abundance amount of life which grows within the room. Every type of flower that exist in the world grows here. The spirit of your heart leaps into new boundries as you feel the enchantment by the aroma that surrounds you. the warmth of the sun shines brightly upon you. Your feet nestle themselves within the grass. A light echoes through here. Walk in the garden and you will see. The heart beats within my chest, Lay your hand upon me and rest that love will search you  soon. shining brightly as the pale moon in the night. To awaken to see the dew on the ground. Knowing the beauty I have found. Even my heart can't resist.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54143}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54160}{0}{}{Inside a Squirrel Tree (w,d)}{ }{You've found your way to the higher top of the tree where fuzzy things happen. No matter how many zany things appear inside this little home, you feel compelled to the smile at the furry mammals that occupy it. Some of  them seem to smile you and others seem to want to hug you fuzzily. Inside this room you feel safe and warm. There's a stockpile of acorns in the east corner of the room.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54144}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {54163}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54161}{0}{}{A room full of bouncing Squirrels (w)}{ }{You are inside a room that is full of zany and squirrely things. A strange box lies in the center of the room. You find yourself compelled to bounce around like a little fuzzy varmant. Balls of fluffiness zing past you and zing behind you. Many of furballs seem to have lost their way inside the tree. You can't imagine why all these squirrels are acting so screwy. You feel yourself to be squirrely as well and bounce around}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54144}{w}{w}{8}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54162}{0}{}{Inside a Squirrel Nest (e)}{ }{There is warmth and comfort as you enter the room here. A soft essence of roses fill the room. A large bed lies in the middle of the room. Soft, blue, satin sheets cover the bed. There are all types of rose pedals which cover the bed. It seems that there is a mood that was to be set here. You feel more at ease with the soft fire that burns in the fireplace. You feel your heart wanting to lay on the bed and begin to snuggle the fuzziness. A large dresser is along side the bed. A soft glow emits from the candle. An erotic aroma fills the room. You feel compelled to remove your clothing and lay on the bed.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54144}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

R {54163}{0}{}{Aloft inside a Squirrel Tree (e)}{ }{A fuzzy squirrel room that is filled with fluffy fuzzies. A warm light is brewing through the room. A calm breeze blows through here grasping you. A humming sound is heard echoing through the valley. A part of tranquility fills the area. There is a dream that drifts in and out. This appears to be a dream where a large tree can be seen in a valley. A white picket fence surrounds the tree. There are flowers that bloom in the field. A rose with bright red pedals grows here. Fuzziness is everywhere.}{Pinnacle's Residential Complex}{}{}{}{1.000}{}
E {54160}{e}{e}{2}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

